      "company_summary": "ABB is a global technology leader specializing in electrification and automation solutions that enhance the productivity, efficiency, and sustainability of various industries. With a focus on sectors such as buildings and construction, food and beverage, shipping, oil and gas, and power generation, ABB offers a comprehensive range of products and services, including integrated automation, digital technologies, motors and drives, and renewable energy solutions. The company is committed to driving decarbonization and resource efficiency, enabling its customers to outperform in an increasingly demanding market.",
