      "polished_summary": "Schneider Electric is a global leader in energy management and automation, dedicated to electrifying, automating, and digitalizing industries, businesses, and homes. With a workforce of 160,000 employees and over 100 global innovation hubs, the company focuses on delivering advanced energy management solutions and industrial automation technologies to drive sustainability and efficiency across various sectors. Its commitment to innovation is exemplified by partnerships that enhance energy efficiency and support the transition to a net-zero future.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Schneider Electric is a global leader in energy management and automation, providing advanced energy management solutions and industrial automation technologies that are directly applicable to Cyber-Physical Systems Security. Their focus on electrifying and automating industries aligns with the security needs of cyber-physical systems.",
