      "company_function": "cybersecurity & specialized vendor",
      "company_summary": "Cisco Systems is a leading technology company that specializes in networking, cybersecurity, and cloud solutions, providing innovative products and services designed to enhance IT infrastructure and operations. With a focus on AI-driven technologies, such as AI networking and hybrid mesh firewalls, Cisco serves a diverse clientele, including 99% of the Fortune 500 and over 1 million customers globally, helping them modernize their data centers and create resilient workplaces. The company's offerings are tailored to meet the demands of enterprises, service providers, and hyperscalers, ensuring secure and efficient operations across various environments.",
