      "company_summary": "Claroty is a leading cybersecurity company specializing in the protection of cyber-physical systems across diverse sectors, including industrial, healthcare, public sector, and commercial organizations. Its core offerings include the Claroty xDome platform for comprehensive security management, Continuous Threat Detection for real-time monitoring, and tailored services like Healthcare Secure Access, all designed to enhance visibility, secure remote access, and ensure operational safety in critical environments.",
