tudies ][94] [ On-Demand Webinars ][95] [ Videos ][96] [ Glossary\n][97]\nPodcasts, Articles, & Videos\n[ [Nexus Connect X logo]\nVisit our Nexus Website\n][98]\nFeatured Content\n\n#### Life, uninterrupted.\n\n][99] [\n\n#### Claroty Named a Leader in 2026 Gartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for CPS Protection Platforms\n\n][100] [ [Featured image for our Guide: The Guide to Building Operational Resilience in Healthcare\nEnvironments]\n\n#### The Guide to Building Operational Resilience in Healthcare Environments\n\n][101] [ [Featured image for our report: Resolving the CPS Identity Crisis]\n\n#### Resolving the CPS Identity Crisis\n\n][102]\n* [Company][103]\nAbout Us\n][104] [\nCareers\n][105] [\nLeadership\n][106] [\nNewsroom\n][107] [\nxCel Enablement & Training\n][108] [\nTrust Center\n][109] [\nEvents\n][110] [\nEnvironmental, Social, and Governance Policies\n][111] [\nContact Us\n][112]\n[ Toggle Search ][113] Menu\n\n# Contact Us\n\n[ Contact Sales ][114]\n[ For Customers ][115]\n[ For Partners ][116]\n[ For Security ][117]\n\n## Contact Sales:\n\n## For Customers:\n\n#### Need Customer Support?\n\nIf you are a current customer that needs support, please see our Customer Support Policy.\n\n[ Customer Support Policy ][118]\n\n## For Partners:\n\n#### Interested in becoming a Claroty Partner or are an existing partner that needs support?\n\nIf you are already a Claroty Partner, log into the Partner Portal and choose the \"Help\" option from\nthe \"More\" section in the navigation.\n\n[ Become a Partner ][119] [ Partner Support ][120]\n\n## For Security:\n\n#### Report a Security Vulnerability with a Claroty Product or Service\n\nIf you're a Claroty customer, please visit the Support Portal and submit a new case. If you're a\nthird-party researcher, please send details to: [psirt@claroty.com][121] [[PGP public key][122]].\nSomeone will be in touch with you within two business days.\n\n### Claroty HQ:\n\n1 Pennsylvania Plaza,\nSuite 1625\nNew York, NY 10119\n\nSee other offices below:\n\n**Claroty, Inc. \u2013 Corporate HQ**\n1 Pennsylvania Plaza,\nSuite 1625\nNew York, NY 10119\n\n[ View Openings ][123]\n\n**Claroty UK Limited**\nShell Mex House\n80 Strand\nLondon WC2R 0DT\n\n[ View Openings ][124]\n\n**Claroty LTD**\n\n3 Tozeret Haaretz St.\nBuilding East, Floors 09-13\nTel Aviv-Yafo, 6789102\nIsrael\n\n[ View Openings ][125]\n\n**Claroty Pte. Ltd. APJ HQ**\n18 Cross Street, Cross Street exchange, #12-03\n048423, Singapore\n\n[ View Openings ][126]\n\n**Claroty KR**\n431 Teheran-ro\nGangnam-gu\nSeoul, South Korea\n\n[ View Openings ][127]\n\n## Claroty Demo\n\nReady to Secure Your CPS Environment?\n\n[ Request a Demo ][128]\nSolutions\n* [Claroty xDome Platform][129]\n* [Industrial Cybersecurity][130]\n* [Healthcare Cybersecurity][131]\n* [Commercial Cybersecurity][132]\n* [Public Sector Cybersecurity][133]\nThreat Research\n* [Team82 Home][134]\n* [Vulnerability Disclosure Dashboard][135]\n* [Research][136]\n* [PGP Key][137]\nPartners\n* [Partners][138]\n* [Technology Alliance Partners][139]\n* [Channel Partners][140]\n* [Become a Partner][141]\n* [Partner Login][142]\nResources\n* [Resource Library][143]\n* [Blog][144]\n* [White Papers][145]\n* [Reports][146]\n* [Case Studies][147]\n* [Datasheets][148]\n* [Integration Briefs][149]\n* [Videos][150]\n* [Claroty Nexus][151]\nCompany\n* [About Us][152]\n* [Careers][153]\n* [Leadership][154]\n* [Newsroom][155]\n* [xCel Enablement & Training][156]\n* [Trust Center][157]\n* [Customer Experience][158]\n* [Events][159]\n* [Environmental, Social, and Governance Policies][160]\n* [Contact Us][161]\n[ [Claroty] ][162]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Claroty. All rights reserved.\n\n[ LinkedIn ][163] [ Twitter ][164] [ YouTube ][165] [ Facebook ][166]\n[Terms & Conditions][167] / [Privacy Policy][168]\n[Claroty] Close Menu\n* [Platform][169]\n[The Claroty Platform][170] [Claroty CPS Protection Program][171] [Claire, the AI Security\nAgent][172] [Asset Inventory][173] [Exposure Management][174] [Net