            "url": "https://claroty.com/about",
            "text": "[The Claroty Mission: We are on a mission to secure the cyber-physical systems of connected\norganizations.]\n[ Toggle Search ][1]\n\nLanguage\n[ English ][2] [ Deutsch ][3] [ Espa\u00f1ol ][4] [ Fran\u00e7ais ][5] [ Italiano ][6] [ Portugu\u00eas ][7] [\n\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e ][8] [ \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 ][9] [ \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587 ][10]\n[Request a Demo][11]\n[ [Claroty] ][12]\n* [Platform][13]\nThe Claroty Platform\n[ Explore The Claroty Platform ][14] [ Claroty CPS Protection Program ][15] [ Claire, the AI\nSecurity Agent ][16]\n[ Asset Inventory ][17] [ Exposure Management ][18] [ Network Protection ][19] [ Secure Access\n][20] [ Threat Detection ][21] [ Operational Efficiency ][22]\nDiscovery Methods\n[ Claroty Edge ][23] [ Passive Monitoring ][24] [ Safe Queries ][25] [ Project File Analysis ][26]\n[ Ecosystem Enrichment ][27]\nIntegrations\n[ View All Integrations ][28]\n* [Industries][29]\nIndustrial\n][30]\nPlatform\nClaroty xDome\n][31] [\nClaroty xDome Secure Access\n][32] [\nClaroty Continuous Threat Detection (CTD)\n][33]\nOutcomes\n[ Cyber Resilience ][34] [ Operational Resilience ][35]\nVerticals\n[ View All Verticals ][36]\nRegulations\n[ View All Regulations ][37]\nCommercial\n][38]\nPlatform\nClaroty xDome\n][39] [\nClaroty xDome Secure Access\n][40] [\nClaroty Continuous Threat Detection (CTD)\n][41]\nOutcomes\n[ Cyber Resilience ][42] [ Operational Resilience ][43]\nVerticals\n[ Commercial Buildings ][44] [ Data Centers ][45] [ Hospitality ][46] [ Retail ][47]\nHealthcare\n][48]\nPlatform\nClaroty xDome\n][49] [\nHealthcare Secure Access\n][50]\nOutcomes\n[ Cyber Resilience ][51] [ Operational Resilience ][52]\nFeatured Content\n[ [Featured image for our Guide: The Guide to Building Operational Resilience in Healthcare\nEnvironments]\n\n#### The Guide to Building Operational Resilience in Healthcare Environments\n\n][53]\n* [Public Sector][54]\nPublic Sector\n][55]\nPlatform\nContinuous Threat Detection (CTD)\n][56] [\nClaroty xDome Secure Access\n][57] [\nClaroty xDome for Government\n][58]\nU.S. Federal Government\n][59]\nSectors\n[ Defense ][60] [ Civilian ][61] [ Healthcare ][62] [ Tribal ][63]\nState, Local, and Education (SLED)\n][64]\nSectors\n[ Energy ][65] [ Water/Wastewater ][66] [ Transportation ][67] [ Public Safety ][68]\n* [Customers][69]\nFor Customers\nClaroty Customer Experience\nAccelerating your CPS cybersecurity journey.\n][70] [\nCustomer Case Studies\nHow customers secure their critical operations with Claroty.\n][71] [\nClaroty xCel Academy\nEnablement and training for customers.\n][72]\nFeatured Case Studies\n[ [Featured image for our Case Study: Claroty xDome Drives Business Value and Enhanced Exposure\nManagement at Ohio State University Wexner Medical Center]\n\n#### Claroty xDome Drives Business Value and Enhanced Exposure Management at Ohio State University\n#### Wexner Medical Center\n\n][73] [ [By partnering with Claroty and implementing its purpose-built healthcare solution,\nClaroty xDome for Healthcare, PHSA and FHA were able to quickly fill the immediate gaps in device\ndiscovery, tracking, and risk management.]\n\n#### Provincial Health Services Authority and Fraser Health Authority Boost Cybersecurity\n#### Processes and Compliance with Claroty xDome\n\n][74] [ [In partnership with Claroty, Phlow implemented a tailored CPS security infrastructure.\nPhlow now has a robust security layout, providing rigorous network visibility, real-time\nmonitoring, and instantaneous threat detection.]\n\n#### Phlow Leverages Claroty Technologies for Unparalleled Cyber-Physical System Protection\n\n][75]\n* [Partners][76]\nTechnology Alliance Partners\n][77] [\nChannel Partners\n][78] [\nPartner Login\n][79]\n* [Threat Research][80]\nTeam82 Home\n][81] [\nThreat Intelligence\n][82] [\nVulnerability Disclosure Dashboard\n][83] [\nResearch\n][84] [\nTalks\n][85] [\nPGP Key\n][86]\n* [Resources][87]\nResources\nResource Library\n][88]\n[ Blog ][89] [ Reports ][90] [ White Papers ][91] [ Datasheets & Solution Overviews ][92] [\nIntegration Briefs ][93] [ Case Studies ][94] [ On-Demand Webinars ][95] [ Videos ][96] [ Glossary\n][97]\nPodcasts, Articles, & Videos\n[ [Nexus Connect X logo]\nVisit our Nexus Website\n][98]\nFeatured Content\n\n#### Life, uninterrupted.\n\n][99] [\n\n#### Claroty Named a Leader in 2026 Gartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for CPS Protection Platforms\n\n][100] [ [Featured image for our Guide: The Guide to Building Operational Resilience in Healthcare\nEnvironments]\n\n#### The Guide to Building Operational Resilience in Healthcare Environments\n\n][101] [ [Featured image for our report: Resolving the CPS Identity Crisis]\n\n#### Resolving the CPS Identity Crisis\n\n][102]\n* [Company][103]\nAbout Us\n][104] [\nCareers\n][105] [\nLeadership\n][106] [\nNewsroom\n][107] [\nxCel Enablement & Training\n][108] [\nTrust Center\n][109] [\nEvents\n][110] [\nEnvironmental, Social, and Governance Policies\n][111] [\nContact Us\n][112]\n[ Toggle Search ][113] Menu\n\n# We envision a future where the cyber and physical worlds safely connect.\n\n## Our Mission\n\nTo secure the cyber-physical systems that underpin our lives.\n\n## What We Do\n\nWe empower industrial, healthcare, public sector, and commercial organizations to secure all\ncyber-physical systems in their environments: the Extended Internet of Things (XioT).\n\n[Claroty \u2013 Industrial Cybersecurity Solution]\n\n### Claroty\n### Industrial\n\nControl, monitor, and protect your industrial control systems and XIoT assets with unmatched\nprotocol coverage and purpose-built cybersecurity technology.\n\n[ Learn More ][114]\n[Claroty \u2013 IoMT Healthcare Device Cybersecurity Solution]\n\n### Claroty\n### Healthcare\n\nEnsure safe and reliable patient care while leveraging the benefits of medical device\ninterconnectivity with comprehensive monitoring and risk management.\n\n[ Learn More ][115]\n[Claroty \u2013 Commercial Cybersecurity Solution]\n\n### Claroty\n### Commercial\n\nSafely connect BMS and other \u201csmart\u201d cyber-physical systems serving real estate properties, retail\nlocations, data centers, and other commercial facilities.\n\n[ Learn More ][116]\n[Claroty \u2013 Public Sector Cybersecurity Solution]\n\n### Claroty\n### Public Sector\n\nControl, monitor and protect the nation\u2019s defense systems, space, utilities, port, transit, building\nmanagement, and other public sector systems.\n\n[ Learn More ][117]\n\n## Awards and Accolades\n\nLeader in The Forrester Wave\u2122:\nIoT Security Solutions, Q3 2025\nGreat Place to Work\nApril 2025\nFortune\u2019s Top 50\nCybersecurity Companies of 2025\n2025 CRN\nIoT 50\nSVDG\nNatSec100\nForbes\nCloud 100 2025\nDeloitte\nFast 500 2025\n2026 CRN\nSecurity 100\nSC Awards Europe 2025\nBest IoT/IIoT Security Solution\nACS Awards\nThreat Detection Product of the Year\n\n## Our Core Values\n\n### Customer Obsession\n\nWe take an outside-in approach in everything we do, orienting our ideas, actions, and behaviors\naround our customer business problems and the outcomes they strive to achieve.\n\n[An icon of three hexagons.]\n\n### Integrity\n\nWe hold ourselves and each other to the highest standards of professionalism, ethics, and integrity.\nWe lead with trust and assume the best and positive intentions of each other in every situation.\n\n### Strive for Excellence\n\nWe\u2019re all in each and every day. We dedicate ourselves to each other, our customers, and our\npartners. We are bold, take risks, celebrate our wins, and treat failures as opportunities for\ngrowth.\n\n### People First\n\nWhile we have a serious and tough mission, we put each other ahead of work, knowing that if we care\nfor each other, the results will follow. We\u2019re all on the same team, on the same journey.\n\n## Meet Our Investors\n\n[Background Image]\n\n## Come Work With Us\n\nWe are looking to hire individuals who embody our core values: People First, Customer Obsession,\nStrive for Excellence, and Integrity. Claroty is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to\nfostering a diverse and inclusive work environment for all.\n\n[ View Current Openings ][118]\nSolutions\n* [Claroty xDome Platform][119]\n* [Industrial Cybersecurity][120]\n* [Healthcare Cybersecurity][121]\n* [Commercial Cybersecurity][122]\n* [Public Sector Cybersecurity][123]\nThreat Research\n* [Team82 Home][124]\n* [Vulnerability Disclosure Dashboard][125]\n* [Research][126]\n* [PGP Key][127]\nPartners\n* [Partners][128]\n* [Technology Alliance Partners][129]\n* [Channel Partners][130]\n* [Become a Partner][131]\n* [Partner Login][132]\nResources\n* [Resource Library][133]\n* [Blog][134]\n* [White Papers][135]\n* [Reports][136]\n* [Case Studies][137]\n* [Datasheets][138]\n* [Integration Briefs][139]\n* [Videos][140]\n* [Claroty Nexus][141]\nCompany\n* [About Us][142]\n* [Careers][143]\n* [Leadership][144]\n* [Newsroom][145]\n* [xCel Enablement & Training][146]\n* [Trust Center][147]\n* [Customer Experience][148]\n* [Events][149]\n* [Environmental, Social, and Governance Policies][150]\n* [Contact Us][151]\n[ [Claroty] ][152]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Claroty. All rights reserved.\n\n[ LinkedIn ][153] [ Twitter ][154] [ YouTube ][155] [ Facebook ][156]\n[Terms & Conditions][157] / [Privacy Policy][158]\n[Claroty] Close Menu\n* [Platform][159]\n[The Claroty Platform][160] [Claroty CPS Protection Program][161] [Claire, the AI Security\nAgent][162] [Asset Inventory][163] [Exposure Management][164] [Network Protection][165] [Secure\nAccess][166] [Threat Detection][167] [Operational Efficiency][168] [Integrations][169]\n* [Industries][170]\n[Industrial Home][171] [Industrial Verticals][172] [Healthcare Home][173] [Commercial Home][174]\n[Commercial Verticals][175]\n* [Public Sector][176]\n[Public Sector Home][177] [Federal Government Home][178] [SLED Home][179]\n* [Customers][180]\n[Customer Experience][181] [Case Studies][182] [xCel Enablement & Training for Customers][183]\n* [Partners][184]\n[P