n[OT Expertise, AI-Activated][80]\nAI trained on a decade of OT expertise and frontline intelligence.\n\n[Learn More][81]\n* SERVICES\n* PROACTIVE SERVICES\n* [OT Cyber Assessment Evaluate & evolve architecture][82]\n* [Red Team Services Identify vulnerabilities][83]\n* [OT Tabletop Exercises Scenarios to evaluate response][84]\n* Reactive Services\n* [Incident Response OT experts responding to your worst day][85]\n[ [Introducing Ember AI to the Dragos Platform] ][86]\n[OT Expertise, AI-Activated][87]\nAI trained on a decade of OT expertise and frontline intelligence.\n\n[Learn More][88]\n* INSIGHTS\n* FUNDAMENTALS\n* [Understanding xOT The Next Era of OT Defense][89]\n* [OT Cybersecurity Basics Build a stronger OT security strategy][90]\n* [5 Critical Controls SANS ICS framework for defense][91]\n* [AI for OT Security Enhance OT Visibility with AI][92]\n* THREATS\n* [Monitoring Threat Groups Know your adversary][93]\n* [Year in Review Report 9th annual threat report][94]\n* REGULATIONS\n* [OT Compliance NIS2, CAF v4, SOCI/SONS, TSA, & more][95]\n* [NERC CIP Dragos Alignment][96]\n* [INSM Compliance Path for NERC-CIP-015][97]\n* [Industrial Risk Management Quantifying OT risk and dependencies][98]\n[ [Introducing Ember AI to the Dragos Platform] ][99]\n[OT Expertise, AI-Activated][100]\nAI trained on a decade of OT expertise and frontline intelligence.\n\n[Learn More][101]\n* RESOURCES\n* RESOURCES\n* [**RESOURCES**][102]\n* [Threat Reports][103]\n* [Whitepapers][104]\n* [Datasheets][105]\n* [Solution Briefs][106]\n* [Case Studies][107]\n* [Blog][108]\n* [Webinars][109]\n* [Dragos Industrial Security Conference][110]\n* COMMUNITY\n* [**COMMUNITY**][111]\n* [OT-CERT Program][112]\n* [Community Defense Program][113]\n* ACADEMY\n* [**DRAGOS ACADEMY**][114]\n* [On-Demand Training][115]\n[ [Introducing Ember AI to the Dragos Platform] ][116]\n[OT Expertise, AI-Activated][117]\nAI trained on a decade of OT expertise and frontline intelligence.\n\n[Learn More][118]\n* COMPANY\n* ABOUT\n* [About Dragos Safeguarding civilization][119]\n* [Leadership Experts in defense][120]\n* [Newsroom Up-to-date cyber news][121]\n* [Careers Current job openings][122]\n* EVENTS\n* [Event Calendar Connect in person][123]\n* [Dragos Industrial Security Conference Register for DISC 2026][124]\n* [Dragos Forums NAM, EMEA, & APJ][125]\n* PARTNERS\n* [Partner Ecosystem Technology, Alliance, & GTM][126]\n* [Technology Integrations][127]\n[ [Introducing Ember AI to the Dragos Platform] ][128]\n[OT Expertise, AI-Activated][129]\nAI trained on a decade of OT expertise and frontline intelligence.\n\n[Learn More][130]\n[Contact Us][131]\n[Login][132]\nSearch Query Submit Search\nShow Search\nAccenture fueling Dragos to build the most complete xOT cybersecurity platform. [Read the full story\nfrom Robert M. Lee][133]\nClose\n\n# About Dragos: The Leader in OT Cybersecurity\n\nOur Mission\n* > To safeguard civilization from those trying to disrupt the industrial infrastructure we depend\n> on every day.\n[VIEW OUR LEADERSHIP][134]\nWhat We Do\nWe make the industry\u2019s most intelligent and intuitive cybersecurity platform for Operational\nTechnology (OT). Customers gain visibility, monitoring, and threat management for the OT, IT, and\nIoT assets within industrial environments, powered by continuous insights from Dragos\u2019s threat\nintelligence and services team.\nTechnology and Services to Defend Your OT Infrastructure\n[ ][135]\n[Dragos Platform][136]\nThe most advanced industrial cybersecurity software to help you protect against, detect and respond\nto cyber threats.\nAugust 7, 2025 05:01 PM\n[ ][137]\n[Threat Intelligence][138]\nActionable threat intelligence and defensive recommendations focused on global threats to industrial\ncontrol systems and operational technology.\nAugust 8, 2025 11:58 AM\n[ ][139]\n[Professional Services][140]\nProactive and responsive services to support and become an extension of your team to better prepare\nfor, combat, and respond to industrial cyber threats.\nAugust 8, 2025 01:37 PM\n[ ][141]\n[Collective Defense][142]\nNeighborhood Keeper is the largest anonymized information-sharing network to allow opt-in\nparticipants to leverage community-wide OT intelligence on assets, threats, and vulnerabilities.\nAugust 8, 2025 12:01 PM\nDragos OT-CERT\nDedicated to addressing the OT security gap that exists in industrial infrastructure with free\ncybersecurity resources and support.\nAwards & Recognition\n* [award-logo-crn-security-100-2025.png]\n* [award-logo-deloitte-fast-500-2024.png]\n* [award-logo-cybersecurity-breakthrough-awards-badge-2024.png]\n* [award-logo-cyber-security-excellence-2024.png]\n* [award-logo-sc-awards-trust-2023.png]\n* [award-logo-global-infosec-awards-2023.png]\n* [award-logo-sc-awards-europe-2023.png]\nOur mission to protect civilization drives everything we do.\nDragos was founded by [cybersecurity experts][143] trusted across governments and industries to\ninvestigate and respond to history\u2019s most significant cyber attacks on industrial control systems.\nDragos brings unmatched real-world experience to every challenge.\n2015\nInvestigated and analyzed the first successful cyber attack on the power grid in Ukraine.\nDecember\n2016\nAnalyzed CRASHOVERRIDE malware responsible for the second Ukraine electric grid cyber attack.\nApril\nDragos was founded. Dragos Platform, Threat Intelligence, and Professional Services launched.\nDecember\n2017\nAnalyzed the TRISIS malware responsible for the petrochemical facility attack in the Middle East.\nNovember\nDragos opens its new global headquarters in Hanover, MD, with hands-on training facilities and\nmultiple ICS cyber ranges to simulate various threat scenarios across industries.\nNovember\n2018\nDragos CEO and co-founder Robert M. Lee testifies before Congress on the security and resiliency of\ncritical energy infrastructure in the U.S.\nMarch\nDragos launches Neighborhood Keeper, now the largest anonymized information-sharing network used by\nthe broader OT and intelligence community.\nOctober\n2019\nDragos expands U.S. operations with new Houston office to answer high demand for industrial\ncybersecurity in energy and manufacturing.\nMarch\n2020\nOT Watch launches to offer advanced threat hunting service to help customers escalate critical\nevents on the Dragos Platform with a team of OT cybersecurity practitioners.\nApril\n2021\nDragos expands globally into Australia, New Zealand, the United Kingdom, Middle East, and the\nEuropean Union to meet growing industrial cybersecurity demands.\n2022\nDragos launches OT-CERT to provide free OT cybersecurity resources for the industrial cyber\ncommunity and bolster threat and vulnerability coordination.\nJune\nCVE Authority recognizes Dragos as a Numbering Authority for Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures\n(CVEs).\nSeptember\n2023\nDragos and Aramco sign MOU regarding protection of critical infrastructure in Saudi Arabia, creating\na path for a local hardware facility and OT cyber training academy.\nNovember\nCommunity Defense Program (CDP) launches to deliver free industrial cybersecurity technology to\nwater, electric, and natural gas providers with under $100M in revenue in the U.S.\nDecember\n2024\nRobert M. Lee testifies before Congress to heighten awareness of cyber threats to water and\nwastewater facilities and steps to secure OT/ICS.\nFebruary\nDragos launches Public Sector subsidiary to address OT cybersecurity challenges in the government,\nincluding U.S. federal agencies.\nOctober\n2025\nDragos and Singapore\u2019s Digital and Intelligence Service sign MOU to jointly develop advanced\ncybersecurity capabilities and facilitate two-way information sharing about cyber threats.\nJanuary\nDragos expands its Community Defense Program to qualifying water, electric, and natural gas\nproviders in Canada.\nMarch\nRobert M. Lee testifies to Congress on the global threat to critical infrastructure 15 years after\nStuxnet.\nJuly\n[ [CTA Pattern Background Dot Mesh] ][144]\n[See the Dragos Platform in Action][145]\nTake the next step to protect your ICS environment now with a free demo.\n[REQUEST A PLATFORM DEMO][146]\n[ [Dragos, Inc Logo] ][147]\nDragos safeguards civilization by protecting critical industrial infrastructure from cyber threats.\nPrivately held and headquartered in"
