      "key_products": "Dragos Platform, Dragos EmberAI, OT Cyber Assessment, Red Team Services, Incident Response",
      "polished_summary": "Dragos is dedicated to safeguarding critical industrial infrastructure from cyber threats, ensuring the safety and reliability of essential services. The company offers advanced cybersecurity solutions, including the Dragos Platform for threat detection and response, AI-activated expertise through Dragos EmberAI, and proactive services like OT Cyber Assessment and Red Team Services, all tailored for industrial organizations across sectors such as oil and gas, manufacturing, and public utilities.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Dragos is highly relevant to the Cyber-Physical Systems Security market as it provides advanced cybersecurity solutions specifically designed for industrial environments. Their products, such as the Dragos Platform and services like OT Cyber Assessment and Incident Response, directly address the security needs of operational technology (OT) systems.",
