      "polished_summary": "Fortinet is a leading cybersecurity company that specializes in providing advanced security solutions, including next-generation firewalls, AI-powered security services, and secure networking products. Its comprehensive platform addresses the needs of various markets, offering services such as secure SD-WAN, cloud security, and operational technology protection to help organizations safeguard their networks and data against evolving threats. With a focus on innovation, Fortinet empowers enterprises to enhance their security posture through integrated and scalable solutions.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Fortinet is a leading cybersecurity company that develops products specifically for Cyber-Physical Systems Security, including advanced security solutions for operational technology and secure networking products. Their offerings such as Modernized OT Security and Ruggedized Products directly address the security needs of cyber-physical systems.",
