      "company_function": "cybersecurity & specialized vendor",
      "company_summary": "IBM is a leading technology company that integrates software, consulting, and infrastructure to address critical business challenges. Its core offerings include IBM Cloud, an extensive suite of cloud computing services; IBM Watson, an AI platform for developing intelligent applications; and IBM Consulting, which provides expert guidance to enhance organizational operations. Targeting businesses of all sizes across various industries such as financial services, healthcare, and telecommunications, IBM is committed to embedding AI and improving efficiency in hybrid cloud environments.",
      "operational_presence": "Markets mentioned on website: Singapore, India",
