      "company_function": "cybersecurity & specialized vendor",
      "company_summary": "McAfee is a leading cybersecurity company that provides comprehensive protection solutions for individuals and families, including privacy, identity, and device security. Their core offerings encompass a range of products such as antivirus software, virtual private networks (VPNs), identity monitoring, and family protection plans, catering to the needs of both personal users and families seeking to safeguard their digital lives. With a commitment to enhancing online safety, McAfee also offers free tools and resources to help users maintain their security and privacy.",
