ms or getting a virus on my device\n[card icon]\nNot having control of where my personal information is online\n[card icon]\nSomeone gaining unauthorized access to my financial accounts\n[card icon]\nBeing covered and getting assistance if my identity is stolen\nPlease select all that apply.\nBack Next Submit\nThank you! Based on your selections we recommend the following:\nTop Recommendation\nAlternate Plan\nMcAfee Essential\nEssential device, identity, and online privacy protection for 1 adult\n* Antivirus (5 devices) [help]\n* VPN [help]\n* McAfee Scam Protection [help]\n* Identity monitoring and alerts [help]\nMcAfee+ Premium Family\nCore device, identity, and online privacy protection for up to 6 family members (2 adults, 4\nchildren under 18)\n* Antivirus (unlimited devices*) [help]\n* Personal Data Cleanup (scans only) for 2 adults [help]\n* Online Account Cleanup (scans only) for 2 adults [help]\n* Identity monitoring and alerts [help]\nMcAfee+ Advanced Individual\nAll-in-one online protection for your personal info, finances, and peace of mind\n* Award-winning Antivirus [help]\n* Personal info removal [help]\n* Online account removal [help]\n* Identity monitoring & alerts, including up to **$1M** identity theft coverage [help]\n* Bank & credit card transaction monitoring [help]\n* Credit monitoring for one bureau & monthly score updates [help]\nMcAfee+ Advanced Family\nAll-in-one online protection for your family's personal info, finances, and peace of mind.\nProtections available for up to 6 family members (2 adults, 4 children under 18)\n* Award-winning Antivirus [help]\n* Personal info removal for 2 adults [help]\n* Online account removal for 2 adults [help]\n* Identity monitoring & alerts, including up to **$1M** identity theft coverage [help]\n* Bank & credit card transaction monitoring for 2 adults [help]\n* Credit monitoring for one bureau & monthly score updates for 2 adults [help]\nMcAfee+ Ultimate Individual\nOur most complete device, identity theft, and online privacy protection, including a call with a\nMcAfee expert to help get you set up.\n* Antivirus (unlimited devices*) [help]\n* Personal Data Cleanup (full-service) [help]\n* Online Account Cleanup (full-service) [help]\n* Identity monitoring & alerts, including up to **$2M** identity theft coverage [help]\n* Transaction monitoring: bank and credit card, 401K, and investments [help]\n* Credit monitoring: 3-bureau and daily score updates [help]\n* McAfee Assist: Live call with an expert to set up your service [help]\nMcAfee+ Ultimate Family\nOur most advanced device, identity theft, and online privacy protection for up to up to 2 adults, 4\nchildren (under 18)\n* Antivirus (unlimited devices*) [help]\n* Personal Data Cleanup (full-service) for 2 adults [help]\n* Online Account Cleanup (full-service) for 2 adults [help]\n* Identity monitoring & alerts, including up to **$2M** identity theft coverage [help]\n* Transaction monitoring: bank and credit card, 401K, and investments for 2 adults [help]\n* Credit monitoring: 3-bureau, daily updates for 2 adults [help]\n* McAfee Assist: Live call with an expert to set up your service [help]\n[mcafee plus] [mcafee]\nUltimate\nAdvanced\nPremium\nEssential\n{{digitalData.offers[digitalData.helpMeWidget.recommendedPlan.TopRecommended].finalPrice}}* /yr\n{{digitalData.offers[digitalData.helpMeWidget.recommendedPlan.TopRecommended].retailPrice}}\nSave\n{{digitalData.offers[digitalData.helpMeWidget.recommendedPlan.TopRecommended].discountAmountAfterCas\nhback}}\nBuy\nTop Recommended Plan\n[mcafee plus] [mcafee]\nUltimate\nUltimate Family\nAdvanced\nAdvanced Family\nPremium Family\nEssential\n{{digitalData.offers[digitalData.helpMeWidget.recommendedPlan.TopRecommended].finalPrice}}* /yr\n{{digitalData.offers[digitalData.helpMeWidget.recommendedPlan.TopRecommended].retailPrice}}\nSave\n{{digitalData.offers[digitalData.helpMeWidget.recommendedPlan.TopRecommended].discountAmountAfterCas\nhback}}\nProtection with our core security features for **5 devices** [help]\nVPN [help]\nMcAfee Scam Protection [help]\nIdentity monitoring and alerts [help]\nProtection with our core security features for **1 device** [help]\nVPN **(1 license)** [help]\nMcAfee Scam Protection [help]\nIdentity monitoring and alerts [help]\nUnlimited device* protection, along with our core security features including McAfee Scam Protection\n**for up to 6 family members** [help]\n**Scans-only** Personal Data Cleanup and **scans-only** Online Account Cleanup **(2 adults)** [help]\nIdentity monitoring and alerts (up to 6 family members) [help]\nUnlimited device* protection along with our core security features including McAfee Scam Protection\n**for 1 adult** [help]\nPersonal info & online account removal [help]\nBank account and credit card transaction monitoring and alerts [help]\nIdentity monitoring & alerts, including up to **$1M** identity theft coverage [help]\nUnlimited device* protection along with our core security features including McAfee Scam Protection\n**for up to 6 family members** [help]\nPersonal info & online account remov"
