      "polished_summary": "Microsoft Corporation is a leading technology company that offers a wide range of products and services, including Microsoft 365, Azure cloud solutions, and Windows operating systems. Its core offerings cater to individuals, businesses, educational institutions, and government entities, providing innovative tools such as Microsoft Teams, Word, Excel, and advanced AI solutions like Microsoft 365 Copilot. With a commitment to empowering users through technology, Microsoft serves diverse markets globally, enhancing productivity and collaboration across various sectors.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Microsoft Corporation provides a range of security solutions through its Azure cloud platform and Microsoft Security offerings, which are relevant to Cyber-Physical Systems Security. Their products like Microsoft 365 and Azure include features that enhance security for cyber-physical systems.",
