            "url": "https://www.nozominetworks.com/company/careers",
            "text": "A Note to our Customers and Partners in the Middle East\n[More Information][1]\nAcademy\n][2][\nLabs\n][3][\nCareers\n][4][\nPartner Login\n][5][\nSupport\n][6]\n[[Nozomi logo]][7]\nPlatform\n\n### Platform Overview\n\nOur industrial cybersecurity solutions deliver unmatched asset intelligence, threat detection and\nAI-driven insights.\n\nLearn more\n][8]\nMANAGERS\nVantage\nCloud\n][9][\nCentral Management Console\nOn-prem\n][10]\nSENSORS\nGuardian\nNetwork\n][11][\nGuardian Air\nWireless\n][12][\nArc\nEndpoint\n][13][\nArc Embedded\nEndpoint\n][14]\nENHANCEMENTS\nVantage IQ\n][15][\nAsset Intelligence\n][16][\nThreat Intelligence\n][17][\nSmart Polling\n][18][\nTI Expansion Pack\nPowered by Mandiant\n][19][\nIntegrations\n][20]\n\n### Professional Services\n\nOT and IoT security expertise that speeds solution deployment and maximizes value\n\nLearn more\n][21]\nSolutions\nBUSINESS NEED\nAsset Inventory Management\n][22][\nThreat Detection & Response\n][23][\nContinuous Network Monitoring\n][24][\nVulnerability Management\n][25][\nRisk Management\n][26][\nIoT Security\n][27][\nData Center Cybersecurity\n][28][\nBuilding Automation System\nCybersecurity\n][29]\nINDUSTRY\nAirports\n][30][\nElectric Utilities\n][31][\nHealthcare\n][32][\nManufacturing\n][33][\nMaritime\n][34][\nMining\n][35][\nOil & Gas\n][36]\nPharmaceutical\n][37][\nRail\n][38][\nRetail\n][39][\nSmart Cities\n][40][\nStadiums & Arenas\n][41][\nWater &\nWastewater\n][42]\n[Icon of a government building with three columns, a triangular roof, and a blue flag on top.]\nPUBLIC SECTOR\nFederal Government\n][43]\nState & Local\n][44]\nCOMPLIANCE\nDoW ZT for OT\n][45][\nISA/IEC 62443 Standards\n][46][\nNERC CIP\n][47][\nNERC CIP-015\n][48][\nNIS2 Directive\n][49][\nSEC Cybersecurity Rules\n][50][\nTSA Security Directives\n][51]\nPartners\n\n### Why Partner with Us\n\nOur global partner network deploys OT & IoT cybersecurity solutions for customers around the world.\n\nLearn more\n][52]\n\n### Our Partners\n\nExplore all Nozomi Networks partners\n\nLearn more\n][53]\n\n### Find a Partner\n\nFind a certified Nozomi Networks partner in your country.\n\nLearn more\n][54]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nLog into the Nozomi Networks partner portal.\n\nLog In\n][55]\nResources\n\n### Resource Library\n\nBrowse OT & IoT security research, guides, videos and more from the Nozomi Networks team.\n\nView Resources\n][56]\nRESOURCES\nCase Studies\n][57][\nContent Packs\n][58][\nData Sheets\n][59][\nOT Cyber FAQs\n][60][\nGuides\n][61][\nResearch Reports\n][62]\nSolution Briefs\n][63][\nVideos\n][64][\nWebinars\n][65][\nWhite Papers\n][66][\nTrust Center\n][67]\n\n### Customer Hub\n\nExplore our latest customer resources, including webinars, how-to videos, content packs and more.\n\nView Hub\n][68]\nBlog\n][69]\nCompany\n\n### About Nozomi Networks\n\nWe keep critical infrastructure and operational technology cyber resilient.\n\nLearn more\n][70]\nLeadership Team\n][71][\nEvents\n][72][\nNewsroom\n][73]\nCareers\n][74][\nCustomer Stories\n][75][\nContact Us\n][76]\n[Request Demo][77]\n\n# 100% Nozomi\n\nBuilt for those who want career-defining work, not just a career\n\n[View Open Positions][78]\n\n## More Than Just a Workplace\n\nWe're a community driven by passion, innovation, and relentless ambition. We exist to help our\nclients minimize risks and maximize resilience. But we can only do that if we create a company that\nallows exceptional professionals to anticipate change, make decisions quickly, and their own\ncareers.\n\nWe are 100% Nozomi. We are the synergy of exceptional people and a pioneering company.\n\n## Minimize Barriers.\n## Maximize Opportunities.\n\nWe open doors for those with an unyielding passion for progress. We remove barriers to change,\neliminate obstacles to realizing your potential, and work together to drive innovation and set\nindustry standards.\n\n[Transparency]\n\n## Transparency + Integrity = **Trust**\n\nTransparency + Integrity = Trust\nWe\u2019re all in the same boat, rowing in the same direction. We enable our employees by providing\naccess to all the information needed to remove roadblocks and get the job done.\n[frugality]\n\n## **Frugality**\n\nFrugality\nMoney generated goes directly into making world class products and enabling our customers. We don\u2019t\nspend \u2026 we invest where it counts.\n[one team]\n\n## We **Don't Give Up**\n\nWe Don't Give Up\nWe\u2019re on a marathon (maybe even an ultra marathon), not a sprint. Every step forward, no matter how\nbig or small, counts.\n[don't give up]\n\n## We Are **One Team**\n\nWe Are One Team\nEach of us is equivalent to an army of wicked-smart, autonomous decision makers who operate as one\nhighly-connected team.\n[This is our passion]\n\n## This is Our **Passion**\n\nThis is Our Passion\n\u201cChoose a job that you love and you will never have to work a day in your life.\u201d Our work matters,\nso bring passion and enthusiasm to your role!\n[Customer obsessed]\n\n## We're **Customer Obsessed**\n\nWe're Customer Obsessed\nTech is foundational, but keeping customers happy is existential. Every touchpoint is an opportunity\nto turn customers into raving fans.\n\n*\"At Nozomi Networks, I found a place where technical skills meld with passion and a powerful push\nto do better, all in a very friendly, inclusive and safe place. I found a place where every day is a\nlearning day, a continued journey toward discovering new knowledge. It\u2019s impossible to get bored.\nThis is Nozomi and our product is the result of what we do.\u201d*\n\n## What makes a great Nozomier? It's the commitment to being 100% you.\n\n## Never walking away from great ideas.\n\n## Never settling for second-best.\n\n## Never feeling anonymous.\n\n## Never giving less.\n\n## Create your Own Path\n\nWe encourage you to intensively build in areas that align with your long-term career goals. The\npace, dynamism, and focus here are unmatched. We play a crucial role in leading the global security\ncommunity and setting standards for others to follow.\n\n## Innovation is in our DNA\n\n## Tackling the biggest OT & IoT security challenges\n\n## Working with the most innovative teams\n\n## Bringing the 'no fear, no blame' attitude\n\n## Our Growth Mindset\n\nRising to the challenge\nRelentless innovation\nVisible impact\n\n### Rising to the challenge\n\nWe continue to develop solutions that scale \u2013 while at the same time, giving the most talented,\ndedicated people in our industry sector an unparalleled opportunity to accelerate their career with\nus.\n\n### **Relentless innovation**\n\nThere is a pace, dynamism and focus to the way we work which you will not find elsewhere. We\u2019re\nplaying an instrumental role in leading the global security community and setting the standards for\nothers to follow.\n\n### **Visible impact**\n\nThe people who thrive here are those who set goals, bring aspirations and have a relentless desire\nto always achieve more. We never stop looking for the next step - for our clients, for our\norganization, for ourselves in our own careers.\n\n[Nozomi employees]\n\n## We Can't Wait to Meet You\n\nWe know that the quality and drive of our team is what defines us, so we strive to hire extremely\ntalented people and then help them succeed.\n\nHelp us build the future of OT and IoT cybersecurity. Check out our open positions and apply today.\n\n[View Open Positions][79]\n\n## Benefits For a Balanced Life\n\nWe\u2019re proud of the diversity across our company, and recognize that there\u2019s no on-size-fits-all\nsolution. We continue to work towards offering flexible benefits that meet the needs of Nozomiers\naround the globe.\n\nDistributed Working\n\nSome positions are so critical, they need to be campus-based. For others, a seamless digital\nexperience with leading tools and tech allows Nozomiers to work from where ever they want.\n\nWhoo Hoo Rewards\n\nWe are committed to supporting your growth and well-being with benefits designed to empower you.\nFrom health coverage and wellness resources to flexible work options, continuous learning, and\nretirement planning, we invest in what matters most: your success, health, and future.\n\nRecharge Those Batteries\n\nWe know downtime is important, so we offer unrivalled time off to allow you to rest and get revved\nup to go again! Everyone gets a flexible schedule to incentivize a healthy life balance.\n\nThe Power of Community\n\nBuilding internal communities is another way for us to connect, celebrate diversity and be part of\nsomething special. If you\u2019re a foodie, a fitty, or an animal lover, we\u2019ve got a group just for you.\n\n## Getting to Know One Another\n\nSo, you found a role you\u2019re a perfect fit for and submitted your application. What\u2019s next? Our six\nstep interview process is designed to help us get to know one other.\n\nSTEP ONE\n\n### Reviewing your application\n\nOur recruitment team starts by reviewing your application. If your expertise matches the role and\nrequirements, they will progress to team review and get back in touch.\n\nSTEP TWO\n\n### **Video Call**\n\nNext, you\u2019ll be invited to a video call with a Talent Acquisition specialist to discuss the role,\nyour skillset and career aspirations, and Nozomi Networks\u2019 culture. This is a two-way conversation\nwhich we think is important just as much for you as it is us. If all parties agree it\u2019s a good\nmatch, we\u2019ll progress forward.\n\nSTEP THREE\n\n### **Virtual or In-person Interview**\n\nYou\u2019ll be invited to a virtual or in-person interview with the Hiring Manager to discuss your\nexperience in more detail, as well as the day-to day responsibilities. Both parties have the\nopportunity to get to know one another, to ensure the role is a great fit.\n\nSTEP FOUR\n\n### Tech Test\n\nIf you\u2019re a technical genius, there\u2019s likely to be a tech test somewhere around here!\n\nSTEP FIVE\n\n### Peer and Senior Team Interviews\n\nWe hope that at this point, you can see that there\u2019s something magical about the culture at Nozomi\nNetworks. To enable you, as well as us, to get an even better insight, we\u2019ll arrange interviews with\na couple of peers/senior team members that you\u2019ll be working with either directly or indirectly, to\nreally get to know us.\n\nSTEP SIX\n\n### **Executive Team Interviews**\n\nFinal interviews with our executive team give you the opportunity to learn what makes Nozomi\nNetworks such a special place to work, and do one last cultural pillar fit.\n\n## Stay Connected\n\n## Join us\n\nExplore open roles that match your interests and skills.\n\n[View Open Positions][80]\n\n## Connect\n\nConnect with us on social media platforms.\n\n[X.com][81][LinkedIn][82][YouTube][83]\n\n## Stay in touch\n\nDon't see an open position for you? Sign up to receive alerts about future openings.\n\n[Register for Job Alerts][84]\n\n## Open Positions\n\nNo items found.\n**Filter By**\nAll Departments\nThank you! Your submission has been received!\nOops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.\n\nLoading prospect post...\n\n[Text Link][85]\nThis is some text inside of a div block.\n[Text Link][86]\n\n## Department\n\n[View our Privacy Policy][87]\n\n## Subscribe\n\n][88][\n\n## LinkedIn\n\n][89][\n\n## Demo\n\n][90]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n[Platform Overview][91][Vantage][92][Central Management Console][93][Guardian][94][Guardian\nAir][95][Arc][96][Asset Intelligence][97][Threat Intelligence][98][Smart\nPolling][99][Integrations][100][PSIRT][101]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Professional Services][102][Designated Engineer][103][Fast Track Services][104][Health Check\nService][105][Optimization Service][106]\n\n### Solutions: Business needs\n\n[Threat Detection & Response][107][Continuous Network Monitoring][108][Asset Inventory\nManagement][109][Risk & Vulnerability Management][110][IoT Security][111][Data Center\nCybersecurity][112]\n\n### Solutions: Compliance\n\n[DoW ZT for OT][113][ISA/IEC 62443 Standards ][114][NERC CIP][115][NIS2 Directive][116][SEC\nCybersecurity Rules][117][TSA Security Directives][118]\n\n### Solutions: Industry\n\n[Airports][119][Electric Utilities][120][Healthcare][121][Federal\nGovernment][122][Manufacturing][123][Maritime][124][Mining][125][Oil &\nGas][126][Pharmaceutical][127][Rail][128][Retail][129][Smart Cities][130][Water & Wastewater][131]\n\n### Learn\n\n[Academy][132][Careers][133][Company][134][Customer Stories][135][Contact\nUs][136][Partners][137][Resources][138][Labs][139][Legal][140][Trust Center][141]\n[[LinkedIn logo]][142]\n\u00a9 2026 Nozomi Networks Inc. All Rights Reser"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://www.nozominetworks.com/case-studies",
            "text": "A Note to our Customers and Partners in the Middle East\n[More Information][1]\nAcademy\n][2][\nLabs\n][3][\nCareers\n][4][\nPartner Login\n][5][\nSupport\n][6]\n[[Nozomi logo]][7]\nPlatform\n\n### Platform Overview\n\nOur industrial cybersecurity solutions deliver unmatched asset intelligence, threat detection and\nAI-driven insights.\n\nLearn more\n][8]\nMANAGERS\nVantage\nCloud\n][9][\nCentral Management Console\nOn-prem\n][10]\nSENSORS\nGuardian\nNetwork\n][11][\nGuardian Air\nWireless\n][12][\nArc\nEndpoint\n][13][\nArc Embedded\nEndpoint\n][14]\nENHANCEMENTS\nVantage IQ\n][15][\nAsset Intelligence\n][16][\nThreat Intelligence\n][17][\nSmart Polling\n][18][\nTI Expansion Pack\nPowered by Mandiant\n][19][\nIntegrations\n][20]\n\n### Professional Services\n\nOT and IoT security expertise that speeds solution deployment and maximizes value\n\nLearn more\n][21]\nSolutions\nBUSINESS NEED\nAsset Inventory Management\n][22][\nThreat Detection & Response\n][23][\nContinuous Network Monitoring\n][24][\nVulnerability Management\n][25][\nRisk Management\n][26][\nIoT Security\n][27][\nData Center Cybersecurity\n][28][\nBuilding Automation System\nCybersecurity\n][29]\nINDUSTRY\nAirports\n][30][\nElectric Utilities\n][31][\nHealthcare\n][32][\nManufacturing\n][33][\nMaritime\n][34][\nMining\n][35][\nOil & Gas\n][36]\nPharmaceutical\n][37][\nRail\n][38][\nRetail\n][39][\nSmart Cities\n][40][\nStadiums & Arenas\n][41][\nWater &\nWastewater\n][42]\n[Icon of a government building with three columns, a triangular roof, and a blue flag on top.]\nPUBLIC SECTOR\nFederal Government\n][43]\nState & Local\n][44]\nCOMPLIANCE\nDoW ZT for OT\n][45][\nISA/IEC 62443 Standards\n][46][\nNERC CIP\n][47][\nNERC CIP-015\n][48][\nNIS2 Directive\n][49][\nSEC Cybersecurity Rules\n][50][\nTSA Security Directives\n][51]\nPartners\n\n### Why Partner with Us\n\nOur global partner network deploys OT & IoT cybersecurity solutions for customers around the world.\n\nLearn more\n][52]\n\n### Our Partners\n\nExplore all Nozomi Networks partners\n\nLearn more\n][53]\n\n### Find a Partner\n\nFind a certified Nozomi Networks partner in your country.\n\nLearn more\n][54]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nLog into the Nozomi Networks partner portal.\n\nLog In\n][55]\nResources\n\n### Resource Library\n\nBrowse OT & IoT security research, guides, videos and more from the Nozomi Networks team.\n\nView Resources\n][56]\nRESOURCES\nCase Studies\n][57][\nContent Packs\n][58][\nData Sheets\n][59][\nOT Cyber FAQs\n][60][\nGuides\n][61][\nResearch Reports\n][62]\nSolution Briefs\n][63][\nVideos\n][64][\nWebinars\n][65][\nWhite Papers\n][66][\nTrust Center\n][67]\n\n### Customer Hub\n\nExplore our latest customer resources, including webinars, how-to videos, content packs and more.\n\nView Hub\n][68]\nBlog\n][69]\nCompany\n\n### About Nozomi Networks\n\nWe keep critical infrastructure and operational technology cyber resilient.\n\nLearn more\n][70]\nLeadership Team\n][71][\nEvents\n][72][\nNewsroom\n][73]\nCareers\n][74][\nCustomer Stories\n][75][\nContact Us\n][76]\n[Request Demo][77]\n\n# Case Studies\n\nFilter by Industry\nCheckbox 2\nAirports\nCheckbox 2\nBuilding Automation\nCheckbox 2\nData Centers\nCheckbox 2\nElectric Utilities\nCheckbox 2\nFederal Government\nCheckbox 2\nHealthcare\nCheckbox 2\nManufacturing\nCheckbox 2\nMaritime\nCheckbox 2\nMining\nCheckbox 2\nOil & Gas\nCheckbox 2\nPharmaceutical\nCheckbox 2\nRail\nCheckbox 2\nRetail\nCheckbox 2\nSmart Cities\nCheckbox 2\nStadiums & Arenas\nCheckbox 2\nTransportation & Logistics\nCheckbox 2\nWater & Wastewater\nThank you! Your submission has been received!\nOops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.\nFilter by Language\nAllFrenchGermanItalianJapaneseKoreanMalayPortugueseSpanish\nThank you! Your submission has been received!\nOops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.\n[See All Resources][78]\n[[Prairie\u2019s Edge Casino Resort Strengthens Cyber Resilience Without Disrupting Operations]][79]\nCase Studies\n\n## Prairie\u2019s Edge Casino Resort Strengthens Cyber Resilience Without Disrupting Operations\n\n][80]\n[[The Valencian Health Department Improves Security and Protection]][81]\nCase Studies\n\n## The Valencian Health Department Improves Security and Protection\n\n][82]\n[[Konkuk University Hospital Strengthens Their Security and Collaboration]][83]\nCase Studies\n\n## Konkuk University Hospital Strengthens Their Security and Collaboration\n\n][84]\n[[DEWA Relies on Nozomi Networks to Ensure World-class Delivery of Electricity and Water Utility\nServices]][85]\nCase Studies\n\n## DEWA Relies on Nozomi Networks to Ensure World-class Delivery of Electricity and Water Utility\n## Services\n\n][86]\n[[Protecting the 2024 Paris Olympics Critical Infrastructure from Cyber Threats]][87]\nCase Studies\n\n## Protecting the 2024 Paris Olympics Critical Infrastructure from Cyber Threats\n\n][88]\n[[Keysight Turns to Nozomi Networks to Strengthen Its Production Line Defenses]][89]\nCase Studies\n\n## Keysight Turns to Nozomi Networks to Strengthen Its Production Line Defenses\n\n][90]\n[[National Gas Distributor Achieves Pipeline Visibility]][91]\nCase Studies\n\n## National Gas Distributor Achieves Pipeline Visibility\n\n][92]\n[[Top Five Global Airport Improves Visibility and Security]][93]\nCase Studies\n\n## Top Five Global Airport Improves Visibility and Security\n\n][94]\n[[European Heating Supply Company Monitors Over 200 Sites With a Single Device]][95]\nCase Studies\n\n## European Heating Supply Company Monitors Over 200 Sites With a Single Device\n\n][96]\n[[Leading Medical Technology Provider Gains Deep Visibility into Its Manufacturing Processes]][97]\nCase Studies\n\n## Leading Medical Technology Provider Gains Deep Visibility into Its Manufacturing Processes\n\n][98]\n[[Global Pharma Expands OT Visibility and Strengthens Security]][99]\nCase Studies\n\n## Global Pharma Expands OT Visibility and Strengthens Security\n\n][100]\n[[Trustpower Safeguards New Zealand\u2019s Power and Telecoms Network]][101]\nCase Studies\n\n## Trustpower Safeguards New Zealand\u2019s Power and Telecoms Network\n\n][102]\n[[Enel Secures Global Power Generation Network]][103]\nCase Studies\n\n## Enel Secures Global Power Generation Network\n\n][104]\n[[Vermont Electric Improves ICS Cybersecurity]][105]\nCase Studies\n\n## Vermont Electric Improves ICS Cybersecurity\n\n][106]\n[[Oil & Gas Producer Deploys Global ICS Security Program]][107]\nCase Studies\n\n## Oil & Gas Producer Deploys Global ICS Security Program\n\n][108]\n[[OT Visibility for Oil & Gas Environments]][109]\nCase Studies\n\n## OT Visibility for Oil & Gas Environments\n\n][110]\n[[Resolvendo a quest\u00e3o da seguran\u00e7a cibern\u00e9tica para sistemas de gerenciamento de edif\u00edcios]][111]\nCase Studies\n\n## Resolvendo a quest\u00e3o da seguran\u00e7a cibern\u00e9tica para sistemas de gerenciamento de edif\u00edcios\n\n][112]\n[[Um dos principais aeroportos do mundo melhora a visibilidade e a seguran\u00e7a]][113]\nCase Studies\n\n## Um dos principais aeroportos do mundo melhora a visibilidade e a seguran\u00e7a\n\n][114]\n[[Prote\u00e7\u00e3o de uma rede global de gera\u00e7\u00e3o de energia]][115]\nCase Studies\n\n## Prote\u00e7\u00e3o de uma rede global de gera\u00e7\u00e3o de energia\n\n][116]\n[[Aeroportos: Em paz com os desafios da seguran\u00e7a cibern\u00e9tica]][117]\nCase Studies\n\n## Aeroportos: Em paz com os desafios da seguran\u00e7a cibern\u00e9tica\n\n][118]\n[[\ucd5c\uc0c1\uc704 5\uac1c\uc758 \uae00\ub85c\ubc8c \uacf5\ud56d \uc758 \uac00\uc2dc\uc131 \ubc0f \ubcf4\uc548 \ud5a5\uc0c1]][119]\nCase Studies\n\n## \ucd5c\uc0c1\uc704 5\uac1c\uc758 \uae00\ub85c\ubc8c \uacf5\ud56d \uc758 \uac00\uc2dc\uc131 \ubc0f \ubcf4\uc548 \ud5a5\uc0c1\n\n][120]\n[[Trustpower\u306f\u3001\u904b\u7528\u30a8\u30b3\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u5168\u4f53\u3092\u30ab\u30d0\u30fc\u3059\u308b \u5b8c\u5168\u306a\u30b3\u30f3\u30c6\u30ad\u30b9\u30c8\u8a8d\u8b58\u3092\u5b9f\u73fe\u53ef\u80fd\u306b]][121]\nCase Studies\n\n## Trustpower\u306f\u3001\u904b\u7528\u30a8\u30b3\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u5168\u4f53\u3092\u30ab\u30d0\u30fc\u3059\u308b \u5b8c\u5168\u306a\u30b3\u30f3\u30c6\u30ad\u30b9\u30c8\u8a8d\u8b58\u3092\u5b9f\u73fe\u53ef\u80fd\u306b\n\n][122]\n[[\u4e16\u754c\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7 5 \u306e\u7a7a\u6e2f\u3067\u53ef\u8996 \u6027\u3068\u30bb\u30ad\u30e5\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3\u3092\u5411\u4e0a]][123]\nCase Studies\n\n## \u4e16\u754c\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7 5 \u306e\u7a7a\u6e2f\u3067\u53ef\u8996 \u6027\u3068\u30bb\u30ad\u30e5\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3\u3092\u5411\u4e0a\n\n][124]\n[[\u30b0\u30ed\u30fc\u30d0\u30eb\u767a\u96fb\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8 \u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u306e\u4fdd\u8b77]][125]\nCase Studies\n\n## \u30b0\u30ed\u30fc\u30d0\u30eb\u767a\u96fb\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8 \u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u306e\u4fdd\u8b77\n\n][126]\n[[Messa in sicurezza di una rete globale per la produzione di energia]][127]\nCase Studies\n\n## Messa in sicurezza di una rete globale per la produzione di energia\n\n][128]\n[[L\u2019un des cinq principaux a\u00e9roports au monde am\u00e9liore la visibilit\u00e9 et la s\u00e9curit\u00e9]][129]\nCase Studies\n\n## L\u2019un des cinq principaux a\u00e9roports au monde am\u00e9liore la visibilit\u00e9 et la s\u00e9curit\u00e9\n\n][130]\n[[Un producteur de p\u00e9trole et de gaz d\u00e9ploie un programme de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 ICS dans le monde\nentier]][131]\nCase Studies\n\n## Un producteur de p\u00e9trole et de gaz d\u00e9ploie un programme de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 ICS dans le monde entier\n\n][132]\n[[Un leader des technologies m\u00e9dicales b\u00e9n\u00e9ficie d\u2019une visibilit\u00e9 approfondie sur ses processus de\nfabrication]][133]\nCase Studies\n\n## Un leader des technologies m\u00e9dicales b\u00e9n\u00e9ficie d\u2019une visibilit\u00e9 approfondie sur ses processus de\n## fabrication\n\n][134]\n[[Une entreprise pharmaceutique mondiale am\u00e9liore la visibilit\u00e9 et renforce la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 de ses\nenvironnements industriels]][135]\nCase Studies\n\n## Une entreprise pharmaceutique mondiale am\u00e9liore la visibilit\u00e9 et renforce la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 de ses\n## environnements industriels\n\n][136]\n[[S\u00e9curiser un r\u00e9seau de production d'\u00e9lectricit\u00e9 global]][137]\nCase Studies\n\n## S\u00e9curiser un r\u00e9seau de production d'\u00e9lectricit\u00e9 global\n\n][138]\n[[Ciberseguridad en entornos OT Caso de estudio en el sector Oil & Gas]][139]\nCase Studies\n\n## Ciberseguridad en entornos OT Caso de estudio en el sector Oil & Gas\n\n][140]\n[[Uno de los cinco principales aeropuertos a nivel global mejora la visibilidad y la seguridad\n]][141]\nCase Studies\n\n## Uno de los cinco principales aeropuertos a nivel global mejora la visibilidad y la seguridad\n\n][142]\n[[Compa\u00f1\u00eda de gas y petr\u00f3leo implementa un programa global de seguridad ICS]][143]\nCase Studies\n\n## Compa\u00f1\u00eda de gas y petr\u00f3leo implementa un programa global de seguridad ICS\n\n][144]\n[[Una empresa farmac\u00e9utica global ampl\u00eda su visibilidad OT y refuerza la seguridad]][145]\nCase Studies\n\n## Una empresa farmac\u00e9utica global ampl\u00eda su visibilidad OT y refuerza la seguridad\n\n][146]\n[[Asegurando una Red Global de Generaci\u00f3n de Energ\u00eda]][147]\nCase Studies\n\n## Asegurando una Red Global de Generaci\u00f3n de Energ\u00eda\n\n][148]\n[[Globaler Top-5 Flughafen verbessert Sichtbarkeit und Sicherheit]][149]\nCase Studies\n\n## Globaler Top-5 Flughafen verbessert Sichtbarkeit und Sicherheit\n\n][150]\n[[Globales ICS Security Programm eines \u00d6l- und Gasproduzenten]][151]\nCase Studies\n\n## Globales ICS Security Programm eines \u00d6l- und Gasproduzenten\n\n][152]\n[Load More][153]\n[View our Privacy Policy][154]\n\n## Subscribe\n\n][155][\n\n## LinkedIn\n\n][156][\n\n## Demo\n\n][157]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n[Platform Overview][158][Vantage][159][Central Management Console][160][Guardian][161][Guardian\nAir][162][Arc][163][Asset Intelligence][164][Threat Intelligence][165][Smart\nPolling][166][Integrations][167][PSIRT][168]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Professional Services][169][Designated Engineer][170][Fast Track Services][171][Health Check\nService][172][Optimization Service][173]\n\n### Solutions: Business needs\n\n[Threat Detection & Response][174][Continuous Network Monitoring][175][Asset Inventory\nManagement][176][Risk & Vulnerability Management][177][IoT Security][178][Data Center\nCybersecurity][179]\n\n### Solutions: Compliance\n\n[DoW ZT for OT][180][ISA/IEC 62443 Standards ][181][NERC CIP][182][NIS2 Directive][183][SEC\nCybersecurity Rules][184][TSA Security Directives][185]\n\n### Solutions: Industry\n\n[Airports][186][Electric Utilities][187][Healthcare][188][Federal\nGovernment][189][Manufacturing][190][Maritime][191][Mining][192][Oil &\nGas][193][Pharmaceutical][194][Rail][195][Retail][196][Smart Cities][197][Water & Wastewater][198]\n\n### Learn\n\n[Academy][199][Careers][200][Company][201][Customer Stories][202][Contact\nUs][203][Partners][204][Resources][205][Labs][206][Legal][207][Trust Center][208]\n[[LinkedIn logo]][209]\n\u00a9 2026 Nozomi Networks Inc. All Rights Reserved. [Privacy Notice][210] and Certifications. [System\nStatus][211].\n\n[1]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/blog/a-note-to-our-customers-and-partners-in-the-middle-east\n[2]: /academy\n[3]: /labs\n[4]: /company/careers\n[5]: https://partners.nozominetworks.com/English/\n[6]: /support\n[7]: /\n[8]: /platform\n[9]: /platform/vantage\n[10]: /platform/central-management-console\n[11]: /platform/guardian\n[12]: /platform/guardian-air\n[13]: /platform/arc\n[14]: /platform/arc-embedded\n[15]: /platform/vantage-iq\n[16]: /platform/asset-intelligence\n[17]: /platform/threat-intelligence\n[18]: /platform/smart-polling\n[19]: /platform/ti-expansion-pack-powered-by-mandiant\n[20]: /technology-alliance-ecosystem\n[21]: /professional-services\n[22]: /solutions/iot-ot-asset-inventory-"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://www.nozominetworks.com/company",
            "text": "A Note to our Customers and Partners in the Middle East\n[More Information][1]\nAcademy\n][2][\nLabs\n][3][\nCareers\n][4][\nPartner Login\n][5][\nSupport\n][6]\n[[Nozomi logo]][7]\nPlatform\n\n### Platform Overview\n\nOur industrial cybersecurity solutions deliver unmatched asset intelligence, threat detection and\nAI-driven insights.\n\nLearn more\n][8]\nMANAGERS\nVantage\nCloud\n][9][\nCentral Management Console\nOn-prem\n][10]\nSENSORS\nGuardian\nNetwork\n][11][\nGuardian Air\nWireless\n][12][\nArc\nEndpoint\n][13][\nArc Embedded\nEndpoint\n][14]\nENHANCEMENTS\nVantage IQ\n][15][\nAsset Intelligence\n][16][\nThreat Intelligence\n][17][\nSmart Polling\n][18][\nTI Expansion Pack\nPowered by Mandiant\n][19][\nIntegrations\n][20]\n\n### Professional Services\n\nOT and IoT security expertise that speeds solution deployment and maximizes value\n\nLearn more\n][21]\nSolutions\nBUSINESS NEED\nAsset Inventory Management\n][22][\nThreat Detection & Response\n][23][\nContinuous Network Monitoring\n][24][\nVulnerability Management\n][25][\nRisk Management\n][26][\nIoT Security\n][27][\nData Center Cybersecurity\n][28][\nBuilding Automation System\nCybersecurity\n][29]\nINDUSTRY\nAirports\n][30][\nElectric Utilities\n][31][\nHealthcare\n][32][\nManufacturing\n][33][\nMaritime\n][34][\nMining\n][35][\nOil & Gas\n][36]\nPharmaceutical\n][37][\nRail\n][38][\nRetail\n][39][\nSmart Cities\n][40][\nStadiums & Arenas\n][41][\nWater &\nWastewater\n][42]\n[Icon of a government building with three columns, a triangular roof, and a blue flag on top.]\nPUBLIC SECTOR\nFederal Government\n][43]\nState & Local\n][44]\nCOMPLIANCE\nDoW ZT for OT\n][45][\nISA/IEC 62443 Standards\n][46][\nNERC CIP\n][47][\nNERC CIP-015\n][48][\nNIS2 Directive\n][49][\nSEC Cybersecurity Rules\n][50][\nTSA Security Directives\n][51]\nPartners\n\n### Why Partner with Us\n\nOur global partner network deploys OT & IoT cybersecurity solutions for customers around the world.\n\nLearn more\n][52]\n\n### Our Partners\n\nExplore all Nozomi Networks partners\n\nLearn more\n][53]\n\n### Find a Partner\n\nFind a certified Nozomi Networks partner in your country.\n\nLearn more\n][54]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nLog into the Nozomi Networks partner portal.\n\nLog In\n][55]\nResources\n\n### Resource Library\n\nBrowse OT & IoT security research, guides, videos and more from the Nozomi Networks team.\n\nView Resources\n][56]\nRESOURCES\nCase Studies\n][57][\nContent Packs\n][58][\nData Sheets\n][59][\nOT Cyber FAQs\n][60][\nGuides\n][61][\nResearch Reports\n][62]\nSolution Briefs\n][63][\nVideos\n][64][\nWebinars\n][65][\nWhite Papers\n][66][\nTrust Center\n][67]\n\n### Customer Hub\n\nExplore our latest customer resources, including webinars, how-to videos, content packs and more.\n\nView Hub\n][68]\nBlog\n][69]\nCompany\n\n### About Nozomi Networks\n\nWe keep critical infrastructure and operational technology cyber resilient.\n\nLearn more\n][70]\nLeadership Team\n][71][\nEvents\n][72][\nNewsroom\n][73]\nCareers\n][74][\nCustomer Stories\n][75][\nContact Us\n][76]\n[Request Demo][77]\nAbout Nozomi Networks\n\n# We protect the world\u2019s critical infrastructure from cyber threats.\n\n[View Platform][78]\n\nNozomi Networks is the leader in OT & IoT security for critical infrastructure. Our platform\nuniquely combines network and endpoint visibility, threat detection, and AI-powered analysis for\nfast, effective incident response. Customers around the world rely on us to minimize risk and\ncomplexity while maximizing operational resilience.\n\nFrom day one, our solutions have been deeply rooted in addressing the complex requirements of\nindustrial and critical infrastructure environments. As OT converges with the vastly different\nworlds of IT and IoT, that experience has given us a unique understanding of the tools and processes\nassociated with the largest networks in the world. We\u2019ve earned a global reputation for unmatched\nservice, superior cyber and physical system visibility, advanced OT and IoT threat detection, and\nscalability across distributed environments.\nWe provide real-time asset visibility, threat detection and actionable intelligence that keeps you\nin control of your critical infrastructure.\n\n## **115**M+\n\nOT, IoT and IT Devices Monitored\n\n## 12K+\n\nInstallations Worldwide\n\n## 100%\n\nCustomer Retention\n\n## Securing the World\u2019s Largest Organizations\n\nThe world\u2019s leading enterprises rely on Nozomi Networks to help them anticipate, diagnose and\nrespond to security risks and operational process issues.\n\n## Airports\n\n][79][\n\n## Electric Utilities\n\n][80][\n\n## Healthcare\n\n][81][\n\n## Manufacturing\n\n][82][\n\n## Maritime\n\n][83][\n\n## Mining\n\n][84][\n\n## Oil & Gas\n\n][85][\n\n## Pharmaceutical\n\n][86][\n\n## Rail\n\n][87][\n\n## Retail\n\n][88][\n\n## Smart Cities\n\n][89][\n\n## Water & Wastewater\n\n][90]\n\n## Partnered with the Best\n\nNozomi Networks is backed by the industry\u2019s largest partner ecosystem. This includes global\nalliances with and strategic investments from the world\u2019s leading IT security companies, industrial\nautomation vendors and leading cloud providers.\n\nThousands of security and engineering professionals are Nozomi Networks-certified to deliver\nbest-in-class cybersecurity solutions that address your specific needs.\n\n[Schneider Electric logo]\nSchneider Electric\n[Mandiant logo]\nMandiant\n[ABB logo]\nABB\n[ABS logo]\nABS Group\n[Accenture logo]\nAccenture\n[Atos logo]\nAtos\n[BT logo]\nBritish Telecom\n[Emerson logo]\nEmerson\n[LS Electric logo]\nLS Electric\n[Siemens logo]\nSiemens\n[EY logo]\nErnst & Young\n[GE logo]\n[Hitachi logo]\nHitachi\n[Honeywell logo]\nHoneywell\n[IBM logo]\nIBM Security\n[Johnson Controls logo]\nJohnson Controls\n[Telefonica logo]\nTelefonica\n[View all partnerships][91]\n\n## We Are Setting the Security Standards for OT & IoT\n\nSince our inception, Nozomi Networks has played a leading role in organizations and industry groups\ndedicated to improving the security of critical infrastructure and industrial operations, including:\n\n[OTCC logo]\n[E-ISAC logo]\n[CVE logo]\n[CISA logo]\n[ISA GCA logo]\n[IEC logo]\n[Cyber Threat Alliance logo]\n[ETHOS logo]\n\n## Continuous Innovation in OT & IoT Security\n\n[Innovation timeline from October 2013 to September 2025 highlighting key milestones in ICS\nvisibility, threat detection, AI, SaaS-powered security, wireless sensors, and active threat\nresponse capabilities.]\n\n## Why Choose Us?\n\nNozomi Platform\n[Learn More][92]\nCustomer Testimonials\n[Learn More][93]\nAnalysts & Awards\n[Learn More][94]\nTrust Center\n[Learn More][95]\n[Nozomi Labs logo]\n\n## **An Outstanding Team of Security Researchers**\n\nOur Nozomi Networks Labs team is made up of highly respected threat hunters and security analysts\nwho are dedicated to reducing cyber risk for industrial and critical infrastructure organizations.\nThey responsibly disclose vulnerabilities and freely share their research findings and security\ntools with the global ICS security community.\n\n[Learn More][96]\n\n## Take the next step.\n\nDiscover how easy it is to identify and respond to cyber threats by automating your OT and IoT asset\ndiscovery, inventory, and management.\n\n[Request a Demo][97][Watch Demo][98]\n[View our Privacy Policy][99]\n\n## Subscribe\n\n][100][\n\n## LinkedIn\n\n][101][\n\n## Demo\n\n][102]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n[Platform Overview][103][Vantage][104][Central Management Console][105][Guardian][106][Guardian\nAir][107][Arc][108][Asset Intelligence][109][Threat Intelligence][110][Smart\nPolling][111][Integrations][112][PSIRT][113]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Professional Services][114][Designated Engineer][115][Fast Track Services][116][Health Check\nService][117][Optimization Service][118]\n\n### Solutions: Business needs\n\n[Threat Detection & Response][119][Continuous Network Monitoring][120][Asset Inventory\nManagement][121][Risk & Vulnerability Management][122][IoT Security][123][Data Center\nCybersecurity][124]\n\n### Solutions: Compliance\n\n[DoW ZT for OT][125][ISA/IEC 62443 Standards ][126][NERC CIP][127][NIS2 Directive][128][SEC\nCybersecurity Rules][129][TSA Security Directives][130]\n\n### Solutions: Industry\n\n[Airports][131][Electric Utilities][132][Healthcare][133][Federal\nGovernment][134][Manufacturing][135][Maritime][136][Mining][137][Oil &\nGas][138][Pharmaceutical][139][Rail][140][Retail][141][Smart Cities][142][Water & Wastewater][143]\n\n### Learn\n\n[Academy][144][Careers][145][Company][146][Customer Stories][147][Contact\nUs][148][Partners][149][Resources][150][Labs][151][Legal][152][Trust Center][153]\n[[LinkedIn logo]][154]\n\u00a9 2026 Nozomi Networks Inc. All Rights Reserved. [Privacy Notice][155] and Certifications. [System\nStatus][156].\n\n[1]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/blog/a-note-to-our-customers-and-partners-in-the-middle-east\n[2]: /academy\n[3]: /labs\n[4]: /company/careers\n[5]: https://partners.nozominetworks.com/English/\n[6]: /support\n[7]: /\n[8]: /platform\n[9]: /platform/vantage\n[10]: /platform/central-management-console\n[11]: /platform/guardian\n[12]: /platform/guardian-air\n[13]: /platform/arc\n[14]: /platform/arc-embedded\n[15]: /platform/vantage-iq\n[16]: /platform/asset-intelligence\n[17]: /platform/threat-intelligence\n[18]: /platform/smart-polling\n[19]: /platform/ti-expansion-pack-powered-by-mandiant\n[20]: /technology-alliance-ecosystem\n[21]: /professional-services\n[22]: /solutions/iot-ot-asset-inventory-management\n[23]: /solutions/threat-detection-and-response\n[24]: /solutions/iot-ot-network-monitoring\n[25]: /solutions/iot-ot-vulnerability-management\n[26]: /solutions/ot-risk-management\n[27]: /solutions/iot-security\n[28]: /solutions/data-center-cybersecurity\n[29]: /solutions/building-automation-system-cybersecurity\n[30]: /industries/airport-cybersecurity\n[31]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[32]: /industries/healthcare-cybersecurity\n[33]: /industries/manufacturing-cybersecurity\n[34]: /industries/maritime-cybersecurity\n[35]: /industries/mining-cybersecurity\n[36]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[37]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[38]: /industries/rail-cybersecurity\n[39]: /industries/retail-cybersecurity\n[40]: /industries/smart-cities-cybersecurity\n[41]: /industries/stadiums-arenas\n[42]: /industries/water-wastewater-cybersecurity\n[43]: /industries/federal-government\n[44]: /industries/state-local-government\n[45]: /compliance/dow-zt-for-ot\n[46]: /compliance/isa-iec-62443-standards\n[47]: /compliance/nerc-cip\n[48]: /compliance/nerc-cip-015\n[49]: /compliance/nis2-directive-compliance\n[50]: /compliance/sec-cybersecurity-rules\n[51]: /compliance/tsa-security-directives\n[52]: /partners\n[53]: /partners#our-partners\n[54]: /partners/find-a-partner\n[55]: https://partners.nozominetworks.com/English/\n[56]: /resources\n[57]: /customer-stories\n[58]: /content-packs\n[59]: /data-sheets\n[60]: /ot-cybersecurity-faqs\n[61]: /guides\n[62]: /research-reports\n[63]: /solution-briefs\n[64]: /videos\n[65]: /webinars\n[66]: /white-papers\n[67]: /trust-center\n[68]: /customer-resources\n[69]: /blog\n[70]: /company\n[71]: /company/leadership\n[72]: /events\n[73]: /company/newsroom\n[74]: /company/careers\n[75]: /customer-stories\n[76]: /company/contact-us\n[77]: /demo\n[78]: /platform\n[79]: /industries/airport-cybersecurity\n[80]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[81]: /industries/healthcare-cybersecurity\n[82]: /industries/manufacturing-cybersecurity\n[83]: /industries/maritime-cybersecurity\n[84]: /industries/mining-cybersecurity\n[85]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[86]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[87]: /industries/rail-cybersecurity\n[88]: /industries/retail-cybersecurity\n[89]: /industries/smart-cities-cybersecurity\n[90]: /industries/water-wastewater-cybersecurity\n[91]: /partners\n[92]: /platform\n[93]: /customer-testimonials\n[