            "text": "A Note to our Customers and Partners in the Middle East\n[More Information][1]\nAcademy\n][2][\nLabs\n][3][\nCareers\n][4][\nPartner Login\n][5][\nSupport\n][6]\n[[Nozomi logo]][7]\nPlatform\n\n### Platform Overview\n\nOur industrial cybersecurity solutions deliver unmatched asset intelligence, threat detection and\nAI-driven insights.\n\nLearn more\n][8]\nMANAGERS\nVantage\nCloud\n][9][\nCentral Management Console\nOn-prem\n][10]\nSENSORS\nGuardian\nNetwork\n][11][\nGuardian Air\nWireless\n][12][\nArc\nEndpoint\n][13][\nArc Embedded\nEndpoint\n][14]\nENHANCEMENTS\nVantage IQ\n][15][\nAsset Intelligence\n][16][\nThreat Intelligence\n][17][\nSmart Polling\n][18][\nTI Expansion Pack\nPowered by Mandiant\n][19][\nIntegrations\n][20]\n\n### Professional Services\n\nOT and IoT security expertise that speeds solution deployment and maximizes value\n\nLearn more\n][21]\nSolutions\nBUSINESS NEED\nAsset Inventory Management\n][22][\nThreat Detection & Response\n][23][\nContinuous Network Monitoring\n][24][\nVulnerability Management\n][25][\nRisk Management\n][26][\nIoT Security\n][27][\nData Center Cybersecurity\n][28][\nBuilding Automation System\nCybersecurity\n][29]\nINDUSTRY\nAirports\n][30][\nElectric Utilities\n][31][\nHealthcare\n][32][\nManufacturing\n][33][\nMaritime\n][34][\nMining\n][35][\nOil & Gas\n][36]\nPharmaceutical\n][37][\nRail\n][38][\nRetail\n][39][\nSmart Cities\n][40][\nStadiums & Arenas\n][41][\nWater &\nWastewater\n][42]\n[Icon of a government building with three columns, a triangular roof, and a blue flag on top.]\nPUBLIC SECTOR\nFederal Government\n][43]\nState & Local\n][44]\nCOMPLIANCE\nDoW ZT for OT\n][45][\nISA/IEC 62443 Standards\n][46][\nNERC CIP\n][47][\nNERC CIP-015\n][48][\nNIS2 Directive\n][49][\nSEC Cybersecurity Rules\n][50][\nTSA Security Directives\n][51]\nPartners\n\n### Why Partner with Us\n\nOur global partner network deploys OT & IoT cybersecurity solutions for customers around the world.\n\nLearn more\n][52]\n\n### Our Partners\n\nExplore all Nozomi Networks partners\n\nLearn more\n][53]\n\n### Find a Partner\n\nFind a certified Nozomi Networks partner in your country.\n\nLearn more\n][54]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nLog into the Nozomi Networks partner portal.\n\nLog In\n][55]\nResources\n\n### Resource Library\n\nBrowse OT & IoT security research, guides, videos and more from the Nozomi Networks team.\n\nView Resources\n][56]\nRESOURCES\nCase Studies\n][57][\nContent Packs\n][58][\nData Sheets\n][59][\nOT Cyber FAQs\n][60][\nGuides\n][61][\nResearch Reports\n][62]\nSolution Briefs\n][63][\nVideos\n][64][\nWebinars\n][65][\nWhite Papers\n][66][\nTrust Center\n][67]\n\n### Customer Hub\n\nExplore our latest customer resources, including webinars, how-to videos, content packs and more.\n\nView Hub\n][68]\nBlog\n][69]\nCompany\n\n### About Nozomi Networks\n\nWe keep critical infrastructure and operational technology cyber resilient.\n\nLearn more\n][70]\nLeadership Team\n][71][\nEvents\n][72][\nNewsroom\n][73]\nCareers\n][74][\nCustomer Stories\n][75][\nContact Us\n][76]\n[Request Demo][77]\n\n# How Can We Help You?\n\nReady to discuss how Nozomi Networks OT & IoT security solutions can help you anticipate problems,\ndiagnose threats and respond quickly?\n\nWe have sales offices in Australia, Canada, Germany, Italy, Japan, Korea, the Netherlands, Saudi\nArabia, Singapore, Switzerland, United Arab Emirates, United Kingdom and the United States.\n\n## Need Support?\n\nWant to find answers, access helpful resources or create a case?\n\n[Login to Portal][78]\n\n## Our Headquarters\n\nUnited States\n\n575 Market Street, Suite 3650\n\nSan Francisco, CA 94105\n\n+1 800 314 6114\n\n[Location Details][79]\nEurope\n\nVia Maria Ghioldi-Schweizer 2,\n\n6850 Mendrisio, Switzerland\n\n+41 (0)91 647 04 06\n\n[Location Details][80]\n\n## Field Offices\n\nCanada\n330 5th Avenue SW\nSuite 1800, Calgary\nAB T2P 0L4\n+1 587 393 6463\n[Location Details][81]\nDenmark\nStrandvejen 60\n2900 Hellerup\nDanmark\n+45 8882 5750\n[Location Details][82]\nItaly\nViale Certosa, 218\n20156 Milan\nItaly\n\n[Location Details][83]\nSaudi Arabia\nNovotel Business Park\nTower 2, 1st Floor, Unit No. 43\nDammam, 6140-32232\nSaudi Arabia\n+966 13 845 2678\n[Location Details][84]\nSingapore\nLevel 19 & 20, Tower 2,\nOne Raffles Place,\nSingapore 048616\n+65 6808 5609\n[Location Details][85]\nSouth Korea\nWorld Trade Center 30F\nTrade Tower, 511 Young Dong St,\nGangnam-gu, Seoul 06164,\nRepublic of Korea\n+82 02 6007 2940\n[Location Details][86]\nUAE\nDIC Building 9\n3rd floor, Office 301\nDubai, United Arab Emirates\n+971 4 584 7419\n[Location Details][87]\n[View our Privacy Policy][88]\n\n## Subscribe\n\n][89][\n\n## LinkedIn\n\n][90][\n\n## Demo\n\n][91]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n[Platform Overview][92][Vantage][93][Central Management Console][94][Guardian][95][Guardian\nAir][96][Arc][97][Asset Intelligence][98][Threat Intelligence][99][Smart\nPolling][100][Integrations][101][PSIRT][102]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Professional Services][103][Designated Engineer][104][Fast Track Services][105][Health Check\nService][106][Optimization Service][107]\n\n### Solutions: Business needs\n\n[Threat Detection & Response][108][Continuous Network Monitoring][109][Asset Inventory\nManagement][110][Risk & Vulnerability Management][111][IoT Security][112][Data Center\nCybersecurity][113]\n\n### Solutions: Compliance\n\n[DoW ZT for OT][114][ISA/IEC 62443 Standards ][115][NERC CIP][116][NIS2 Directive][117][SEC\nCybersecurity Rules][118][TSA Security Directives][119]\n\n### Solutions: Industry\n\n[Airports][120][Electric Utilities][121][Healthcare][122][Federal\nGovernment][123][Manufacturing][124][Maritime][125][Mining][126][Oil &\nGas][127][Pharmaceutical][128][Rail][129][Retail][130][Smart Cities][131][Water & Wastewater][132]\n\n### Learn\n\n[Academy][133][Careers][134][Company][135][Customer Stories][136][Contact\nUs][137][Partners][138][Resources][139][Labs][140][Legal][141][Trust Center