            "url": "https://www.nozominetworks.com/solutions/data-center-cybersecurity",
            "text": "A Note to our Customers and Partners in the Middle East\n[More Information][1]\nAcademy\n][2][\nLabs\n][3][\nCareers\n][4][\nPartner Login\n][5][\nSupport\n][6]\n[[Nozomi logo]][7]\nPlatform\n\n### Platform Overview\n\nOur industrial cybersecurity solutions deliver unmatched asset intelligence, threat detection and\nAI-driven insights.\n\nLearn more\n][8]\nMANAGERS\nVantage\nCloud\n][9][\nCentral Management Console\nOn-prem\n][10]\nSENSORS\nGuardian\nNetwork\n][11][\nGuardian Air\nWireless\n][12][\nArc\nEndpoint\n][13][\nArc Embedded\nEndpoint\n][14]\nENHANCEMENTS\nVantage IQ\n][15][\nAsset Intelligence\n][16][\nThreat Intelligence\n][17][\nSmart Polling\n][18][\nTI Expansion Pack\nPowered by Mandiant\n][19][\nIntegrations\n][20]\n\n### Professional Services\n\nOT and IoT security expertise that speeds solution deployment and maximizes value\n\nLearn more\n][21]\nSolutions\nBUSINESS NEED\nAsset Inventory Management\n][22][\nThreat Detection & Response\n][23][\nContinuous Network Monitoring\n][24][\nVulnerability Management\n][25][\nRisk Management\n][26][\nIoT Security\n][27][\nData Center Cybersecurity\n][28][\nBuilding Automation System\nCybersecurity\n][29]\nINDUSTRY\nAirports\n][30][\nElectric Utilities\n][31][\nHealthcare\n][32][\nManufacturing\n][33][\nMaritime\n][34][\nMining\n][35][\nOil & Gas\n][36]\nPharmaceutical\n][37][\nRail\n][38][\nRetail\n][39][\nSmart Cities\n][40][\nStadiums & Arenas\n][41][\nWater &\nWastewater\n][42]\n[Icon of a government building with three columns, a triangular roof, and a blue flag on top.]\nPUBLIC SECTOR\nFederal Government\n][43]\nState & Local\n][44]\nCOMPLIANCE\nDoW ZT for OT\n][45][\nISA/IEC 62443 Standards\n][46][\nNERC CIP\n][47][\nNERC CIP-015\n][48][\nNIS2 Directive\n][49][\nSEC Cybersecurity Rules\n][50][\nTSA Security Directives\n][51]\nPartners\n\n### Why Partner with Us\n\nOur global partner network deploys OT & IoT cybersecurity solutions for customers around the world.\n\nLearn more\n][52]\n\n### Our Partners\n\nExplore all Nozomi Networks partners\n\nLearn more\n][53]\n\n### Find a Partner\n\nFind a certified Nozomi Networks partner in your country.\n\nLearn more\n][54]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nLog into the Nozomi Networks partner portal.\n\nLog In\n][55]\nResources\n\n### Resource Library\n\nBrowse OT & IoT security research, guides, videos and more from the Nozomi Networks team.\n\nView Resources\n][56]\nRESOURCES\nCase Studies\n][57][\nContent Packs\n][58][\nData Sheets\n][59][\nOT Cyber FAQs\n][60][\nGuides\n][61][\nResearch Reports\n][62]\nSolution Briefs\n][63][\nVideos\n][64][\nWebinars\n][65][\nWhite Papers\n][66][\nTrust Center\n][67]\n\n### Customer Hub\n\nExplore our latest customer resources, including webinars, how-to videos, content packs and more.\n\nView Hub\n][68]\nBlog\n][69]\nCompany\n\n### About Nozomi Networks\n\nWe keep critical infrastructure and operational technology cyber resilient.\n\nLearn more\n][70]\nLeadership Team\n][71][\nEvents\n][72][\nNewsroom\n][73]\nCareers\n][74][\nCustomer Stories\n][75][\nContact Us\n][76]\n[Request Demo][77]\n\nINDUSTRY\n\n# Cyber-physical Security for Data Centers\n\nData center construction is booming, driven by cloud migration and the surge in AI workloads that\ndemand massive compute power, storage space, and network bandwidth. Their business criticality makes\nthem high-value targets for threat actors, but cybersecurity priorities focus on IT. Meanwhile, the\nbuilding management, physical security and other systems that control power and cooling remain a\nblind spot.\n\n**Increasingly connected, remotely serviced and internet exposed, OT and IoT assets and networks\nthat undergird the data center provide access points and attack paths that bypass IT controls. All\nmust be secured.**\n\n[Request a Demo][78][View Platform][79]\n[Data center with rows of glowing blue-lit server racks.]\n\nThe Nozomi Networks platform enables data center administrators to gain visibility into their\ninfrastructure and quickly diagnose threats and anomalies. It provides actionable intelligence to\nallow quick response to critical OT and IoT security breaches and operational anomalies and keep the\ndata center running smoothly.\n\n## The Connected Data Center\n\nFrom chillers and power generators to CCTVs and building automation, cyber physical systems are\ncrucial to ensuring an optimal computing and storage environment inside data centers.\n\n## Top Cyber-physical Risks for Data Centers\n\n**Internet-Exposed DCIMs **\n\nThe DCIM integrates IT and facility management systems to monitor power, cooling, server racks and\nenvironmental sensors. Because it sits in a gray zone it\u2019s often overlooked \u2013 and often exposed to\nthe internet.\n\n**Precision Cooling Systems**\n\nWhether related to a cyberattack or malfunction, a cooling system outage would lead to a rapid\ntemperature increase, allowing just 15-20 minutes to shut down servers before they\u2019re damaged beyond\nrepair.\n\n**Exploitable OT/IoT Devices**\n\nAssets like CCTV cameras and temperature sensors use stripped-down OSs and minimal encryption or\nauthentication, enabling hackers to bypass perimeter controls to gain initial access and pivot.\n\n**Remote Third-party Vendors**\n\nDozens of vendors have remote access to OT and IoT systems throughout the data center. On any given\nday, there\u2019s a steady stream of technicians logging into the network for maintenance, with scant\nsecurity.\n\n## Securing the Substations that\n## Power AI\n\nTo ensure a continuous and stable energy supply, hyperscale, colo and other large data centers\nincreasingly operate their own [substations][80]. They, too, must be secured in compliance with\nstrict cyber regulations for electric utilities such as [NERC CIP][81] in North America.\n\nCybersecurity requires visibility across the system of systems. The power plant, backup power,\ncooling and physical access systems each have potential for misuse that could affect data center and\ngrid stability.\n\n- World Economic Forum\n\n## Regulatory Compliance for Critical Infrastructure\n\nDesignated as critical infrastructure around the globe, data centers must comply with strict\nregional and country-specific cybersecurity regulations not just for IT but also OT and IoT systems.\n\nThe Nozomi platform helps data center operators meet dozens of such mandates and demonstrate\ncompliance.\n\n## Benefits of Our Cybersecurity Solution for Data Centers\n\nThe [Nozomi platform][82] helps data centers comply with and meet uptime guarantees by providing a\ncomplete, accurate inventory of OT and IoT assets, risk-based vulnerability management, continuous\nthreat and anomaly detection, and AI-powered SOC assistance to keep analysts focused on what matters\nmost.\n\n**Gain context** with unparalleled asset visibility and vulnerability management built on the\nbroadest range of wired, wireless and endpoint sensors with AI-enriched profiles.\n\nLearn More\n[Learn more link]][83]\n\n**Prevent incidents from becoming outages **with continuous signature-based threat detection based\non OT- and IoT-specific intelligence and AI-powered, behavior-based anomaly detection and fluency in\n200+ OT and IoT protocols\n\nLearn More\n[Learn more link]][84]\n\n**Prioritize remediation efforts **so SOC teams never miss a critical issue with an AI engine that\ncontinuously identifies, analyzes, correlates and prioritizes issues across your environment,\nfocusing attention on the threats with the greatest impact.\n\nLearn More\n[Learn more link]][85]\n\n## Related Resources\n\nWEBINAR\n\n### Cyber-physical Security for Data Centers: The Critical Infrastructure That Powers AI\n\n][86]\nBLOG\n\n### Securing Building Management Systems from Cybersecurity Threats\n\n][87]\nEBOOK\n\n### Cyber-physical Security for Data Centers\n\n][88]\nSOLUTION PAGE\n\n### Cybersecurity & Reliability for Electric Utilities\n\n][89]\n\n## Take the next step.\n\nDiscover how easy it is to identify and respond to cyber threats by automating your OT and IoT asset\ndiscovery, inventory, and management.\n\n[Request a Demo][90][Watch Demo][91]\n[View our Privacy Policy][92]\n\n## Subscribe\n\n][93][\n\n## LinkedIn\n\n][94][\n\n## Demo\n\n][95]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n[Platform Overview][96][Vantage][97][Central Management Console][98][Guardian][99][Guardian\nAir][100][Arc][101][Asset Intelligence][102][Threat Intelligence][103][Smart\nPolling][104][Integrations][105][PSIRT][106]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Professional Services][107][Designated Engineer][108][Fast Track Services][109][Health Check\nService][110][Optimization Service][111]\n\n### Solutions: Business needs\n\n[Threat Detection & Response][112][Continuous Network Monitoring][113][Asset Inventory\nManagement][114][Risk & Vulnerability Management][115][IoT Security][116][Data Center\nCybersecurity][117]\n\n### Solutions: Compliance\n\n[DoW ZT for OT][118][ISA/IEC 62443 Standards ][119][NERC CIP][120][NIS2 Directive][121][SEC\nCybersecurity Rules][122][TSA Security Directives][123]\n\n### Solutions: Industry\n\n[Airports][124][Electric Utilities][125][Healthcare][126][Federal\nGovernment][127][Manufacturing][128][Maritime][129][Mining][130][Oil &\nGas][131][Pharmaceutical][132][Rail][133][Retail][134][Smart Cities][135][Water & Wastewater][136]\n\n### Learn\n\n[Academy][137][Careers][138][Company][139][Customer Stories][140][Contact\nUs][141][Partners][142][Resources][143][Labs][144][Legal][145][Trust Center][146]\n[[LinkedIn logo]][147]\n\u00a9 2026 Nozomi Networks Inc. All Rights Reserved. [Privacy Notice][148] and Certifications. [System\nStatus][149].\n\n[1]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/blog/a-note-to-our-customers-and-partners-in-the-middle-east\n[2]: /academy\n[3]: /labs\n[4]: /company/careers\n[5]: https://partners.nozominetworks.com/English/\n[6]: /support\n[7]: /\n[8]: /platform\n[9]: /platform/vantage\n[10]: /platform/central-management-console\n[11]: /platform/guardian\n[12]: /platform/guardian-air\n[13]: /platform/arc\n[14]: /platform/arc-embedded\n[15]: /platform/vantage-iq\n[16]: /platform/asset-intelligence\n[17]: /platform/threat-intelligence\n[18]: /platform/smart-polling\n[19]: /platform/ti-expansion-pack-powered-by-mandiant\n[20]: /technology-alliance-ecosystem\n[21]: /professional-services\n[22]: /solutions/iot-ot-asset-inventory-management\n[23]: /solutions/threat-detection-and-response\n[24]: /solutions/iot-ot-network-monitoring\n[25]: /solutions/iot-ot-vulnerability-management\n[26]: /solutions/ot-risk-management\n[27]: /solutions/iot-security\n[28]: /solutions/data-center-cybersecurity\n[29]: /solutions/building-automation-system-cybersecurity\n[30]: /industries/airport-cybersecurity\n[31]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[32]: /industries/healthcare-cybersecurity\n[33]: /industries/manufacturing-cybersecurity\n[34]: /industries/maritime-cybersecurity\n[35]: /industries/mining-cybersecurity\n[36]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[37]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[38]: /industries/rail-cybersecurity\n[39]: /industries/retail-cybersecurity\n[40]: /industries/smart-cities-cybersecurity\n[41]: /industries/stadiums-arenas\n[42]: /industries/water-wastewater-cybersecurity\n[43]: /industries/federal-government\n[44]: /industries/state-local-government\n[45]: /compliance/dow-zt-for-ot\n[46]: /compliance/isa-iec-62443-standards\n[47]: /compliance/nerc-cip\n[48]: /compliance/nerc-cip-015\n[49]: /compliance/nis2-directive-compliance\n[50]: /compliance/sec-cybersecurity-rules\n[51]: /compliance/tsa-security-directives\n[52]: /partners\n[53]: /partners#our-partners\n[54]: /partners/find-a-partner\n[55]: https://partners.nozominetworks.com/English/\n[56]: /resources\n[57]: /customer-stories\n[58]: /content-packs\n[59]: /data-sheets\n[60]: /ot-cybersecurity-faqs\n[61]: /guides\n[62]: /research-reports\n[63]: /solution-briefs\n[64]: /videos\n[65]: /webinars\n[66]: /white-papers\n[67]: /trust-center\n[68]: /customer-resources\n[69]: /blog\n[70]: /company\n[71]: /company/leadership\n[72]: /events\n[73]: /company/newsroom\n[74]: /company/careers\n[75]: /customer-stories\n[76]: /company/contact-us\n[77]: /demo\n[78]: /demo\n[79]: /platform\n[80]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[81]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/compliance/nerc-cip\n[82]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/platform\n[83]: /solutions/iot-ot-asset-inventory-management\n[84]: /solutions/ot-risk-management\n[85]: /platform/vantage-iq\n[86]"
