            "text": "A Note to our Customers and Partners in the Middle East\n[More Information][1]\nAcademy\n][2][\nLabs\n][3][\nCareers\n][4][\nPartner Login\n][5][\nSupport\n][6]\n[[Nozomi logo]][7]\nPlatform\n\n### Platform Overview\n\nOur industrial cybersecurity solutions deliver unmatched asset intelligence, threat detection and\nAI-driven insights.\n\nLearn more\n][8]\nMANAGERS\nVantage\nCloud\n][9][\nCentral Management Console\nOn-prem\n][10]\nSENSORS\nGuardian\nNetwork\n][11][\nGuardian Air\nWireless\n][12][\nArc\nEndpoint\n][13][\nArc Embedded\nEndpoint\n][14]\nENHANCEMENTS\nVantage IQ\n][15][\nAsset Intelligence\n][16][\nThreat Intelligence\n][17][\nSmart Polling\n][18][\nTI Expansion Pack\nPowered by Mandiant\n][19][\nIntegrations\n][20]\n\n### Professional Services\n\nOT and IoT security expertise that speeds solution deployment and maximizes value\n\nLearn more\n][21]\nSolutions\nBUSINESS NEED\nAsset Inventory Management\n][22][\nThreat Detection & Response\n][23][\nContinuous Network Monitoring\n][24][\nVulnerability Management\n][25][\nRisk Management\n][26][\nIoT Security\n][27][\nData Center Cybersecurity\n][28][\nBuilding Automation System\nCybersecurity\n][29]\nINDUSTRY\nAirports\n][30][\nElectric Utilities\n][31][\nHealthcare\n][32][\nManufacturing\n][33][\nMaritime\n][34][\nMining\n][35][\nOil & Gas\n][36]\nPharmaceutical\n][37][\nRail\n][38][\nRetail\n][39][\nSmart Cities\n][40][\nStadiums & Arenas\n][41][\nWater &\nWastewater\n][42]\n[Icon of a government building with three columns, a triangular roof, and a blue flag on top.]\nPUBLIC SECTOR\nFederal Government\n][43]\nState & Local\n][44]\nCOMPLIANCE\nDoW ZT for OT\n][45][\nISA/IEC 62443 Standards\n][46][\nNERC CIP\n][47][\nNERC CIP-015\n][48][\nNIS2 Directive\n][49][\nSEC Cybersecurity Rules\n][50][\nTSA Security Directives\n][51]\nPartners\n\n### Why Partner with Us\n\nOur global partner network deploys OT & IoT cybersecurity solutions for customers around the world.\n\nLearn more\n][52]\n\n### Our Partners\n\nExplore all Nozomi Networks partners\n\nLearn more\n][53]\n\n### Find a Partner\n\nFind a certified Nozomi Networks partner in your country.\n\nLearn more\n][54]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nLog into the Nozomi Networks partner portal.\n\nLog In\n][55]\nResources\n\n### Resource Library\n\nBrowse OT & IoT security research, guides, videos and more from the Nozomi Networks team.\n\nView Resources\n][56]\nRESOURCES\nCase Studies\n][57][\nContent Packs\n][58][\nData Sheets\n][59][\nOT Cyber FAQs\n][60][\nGuides\n][61][\nResearch Reports\n][62]\nSolution Briefs\n][63][\nVideos\n][64][\nWebinars\n][65][\nWhite Papers\n][66][\nTrust Center\n][67]\n\n### Customer Hub\n\nExplore our latest customer resources, including webinars, how-to videos, content packs and more.\n\nView Hub\n][68]\nBlog\n][69]\nCompany\n\n### About Nozomi Networks\n\nWe keep critical infrastructure and operational technology cyber resilient.\n\nLearn more\n][70]\nLeadership Team\n][71][\nEvents\n][72][\nNewsroom\n][73]\nCareers\n][74][\nCustomer Stories\n][75][\nContact Us\n][76]\n[Request Demo][77]\n\n#### SOLUTION\n\n# OT Network Monitoring for Critical Infrastructure & Industrial Operators\n\n[Request a Demo][78]\nTHE CHALLENGE\n\n## Effectively Monitoring OT Networks for Threats & Anomalies\n\nNetwork monitoring is the process of capturing network traffic data, usually via a SPAN port or\nnetwork TAP in industrial environments, to analyze it for security and operational anomalies. A good\nnetwork monitoring solution offers a comprehensive network topology map with actionable security and\noperational insights from the data.\n\nTo spot and troubleshoot networking and communication issues that threaten both cybersecurity and\nreliability, you need real-time visibility into your assets, connections, communications, protocols\nand more.\n\nTHE SOLUTION\n\n## Nozomi Networks\u2019 OT\n## Network Monitoring\n\nPinpoint the cyber and operational anomalies that matter most\n\nAccess AI-powered insights to prevent anomalies from impacting operations\n\nContinuously monitor your assets and networks for changes\n\nScale OT network monitoring across multiple plants, sites and teams\n\n## OT Network Monitoring for Tomorrow\u2019s Operations\n\nOur OT network monitoring technology features:\nDeep Packet Inspection\nAI/ML Engine\nDashboards\nDeep Packet Inspection\n\nOur comprehensive deep packet inspection covers a wide range of industrial, IoT and IT protocols.\n\n[Learn more][79]\n[Nozomi network map screenshot]\nAI/ML Engine\n\nQuickly uncover and prioritize the risks that matter to keep your systems reliable and secure.\n\n[Learn How][80]\n[Vantage IQ AI screenshot]\nDashboards to Keep You Focused\n\nDashboards, query capabilities, playbooks and forensic tools to help coordinate remediation efforts\nacross teams.\n\n[View Demo][81]\n[Vantage dashboard]\n\n## Related Resources\n\n[[Nozomi Networks branding with text 'What's So Great About The Graph' and a blurred network graph\nvisualization in the background.]][82]\nVIDEO\n\n### What\u2019s So Great About the Graph?\n\n[Watch][83]\n[[Close-up of an industrial control panel with illuminated green indicator lights and connected blue\nnetwork cables.]][84]\nBLOG\n\n### Guide to ICS Cybersecurity\n\n[Read][85]\n[[Nozomi Networks logo and text on blue background reading 'Mapping Guide ISA/IEC 62443 Standards\nCompliance with the Nozomi Networks Platform' next to an industrial facility with large storage\ntanks and structures.]][86]\nGUIDE\n\n### Applying ISA/IEC 62443 Standards with Nozomi Networks\n\n[Read][87]\nPRODUCT\n\n### Vantage IQ\n\n[Read][88]\n\n## Take the next step.\n\nDiscover how easy it is to identify and respond to cyber threats by automating your OT and IoT asset\ndiscovery, inventory, and management.\n\n[Request a Demo][89][Watch Demo][90]\n[View our Privacy Policy][91]\n\n## Subscribe\n\n][92][\n\n## LinkedIn\n\n][93][\n\n## Demo\n\n][94]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n[Platform Overview][95][Vantage][96][Central Management Console][97][Guardian][98][Guardian\nAir][99][Arc][100][Asset Intelligence][101][Threat Intelligence][102][Smart\nPolling][103][Integrations][104][PSIRT][105]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Professional Services][106][Designated Engineer][107][Fast Track Services][108][Health Check\nService][109][Optimization Service][110]\n\n### Solutions: Business needs\n\n[Threat Detection & Response][111][Continuous Network Monitoring][112][Asset Inventory\nManagement][113][Risk & Vulnerability Management][114][IoT Security][115][Data Center\nCybersecurity][116]\n\n### Solutions: Compliance\n\n[DoW ZT for OT][117][ISA/IEC 62443 Standards ][118][NERC CIP][119][NIS2 Directive][120][SEC\nCybersecurity Rules][121][TSA Security Directives][122]\n\n### Solutions: Industry\n\n[Airports][123][Electric Utilities][124][Healthcare][125][Federal\nGovernment][126][Manufacturing][127][Maritime][128][Mining][129][Oil &\nGas][130][Pharmaceutical][131][Rail][132][Retail][133][Smart Cities][134][Water & Wastewater][135]\n\n### Learn\n\n[Academy][136][Careers][137][Company][138][Customer Stories][139][Contact\nUs][140][Partners][141][Resources][142][Labs][143][Legal][144][Trust Center][145]\n[[LinkedIn logo]][146]\n\u00a9 2026 Nozomi Networks Inc. All Rights Reserved. [Privacy Notice][147] and Certifications. [System\nStatus][148].\n\n[1]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/blog/a-note-to-our-customers-and-partners-in-the-middle-east\n[2]: /academy\n[3]: /labs\n[4]: /company/careers\n[5]: https://partners.nozominetworks.com/English/\n[6]: /support\n[7]: /\n[8]: /platform\n[9]: /platform/vantage\n[10]: /platform/central-management-console\n[11]: /platform/guardian\n[12]: /platform/guardian-air\n[13]: /platform/arc\n[14]: /platform/arc-embedded\n[15]: /platform/vantage-iq\n[16]: /platform/asset-intelligence\n[17]: /platform/threat-intelligence\n[18]: /platform/smart-polling\n[19]: /platform/ti-expansion-pack-powered-by-mandiant\n[20]: /technology-alliance-ecosystem\n[21]: /p