            "text": "A Note to our Customers and Partners in the Middle East\n[More Information][1]\nAcademy\n][2][\nLabs\n][3][\nCareers\n][4][\nPartner Login\n][5][\nSupport\n][6]\n[[Nozomi logo]][7]\nPlatform\n\n### Platform Overview\n\nOur industrial cybersecurity solutions deliver unmatched asset intelligence, threat detection and\nAI-driven insights.\n\nLearn more\n][8]\nMANAGERS\nVantage\nCloud\n][9][\nCentral Management Console\nOn-prem\n][10]\nSENSORS\nGuardian\nNetwork\n][11][\nGuardian Air\nWireless\n][12][\nArc\nEndpoint\n][13][\nArc Embedded\nEndpoint\n][14]\nENHANCEMENTS\nVantage IQ\n][15][\nAsset Intelligence\n][16][\nThreat Intelligence\n][17][\nSmart Polling\n][18][\nTI Expansion Pack\nPowered by Mandiant\n][19][\nIntegrations\n][20]\n\n### Professional Services\n\nOT and IoT security expertise that speeds solution deployment and maximizes value\n\nLearn more\n][21]\nSolutions\nBUSINESS NEED\nAsset Inventory Management\n][22][\nThreat Detection & Response\n][23][\nContinuous Network Monitoring\n][24][\nVulnerability Management\n][25][\nRisk Management\n][26][\nIoT Security\n][27][\nData Center Cybersecurity\n][28][\nBuilding Automation System\nCybersecurity\n][29]\nINDUSTRY\nAirports\n][30][\nElectric Utilities\n][31][\nHealthcare\n][32][\nManufacturing\n][33][\nMaritime\n][34][\nMining\n][35][\nOil & Gas\n][36]\nPharmaceutical\n][37][\nRail\n][38][\nRetail\n][39][\nSmart Cities\n][40][\nStadiums & Arenas\n][41][\nWater &\nWastewater\n][42]\n[Icon of a government building with three columns, a triangular roof, and a blue flag on top.]\nPUBLIC SECTOR\nFederal Government\n][43]\nState & Local\n][44]\nCOMPLIANCE\nDoW ZT for OT\n][45][\nISA/IEC 62443 Standards\n][46][\nNERC CIP\n][47][\nNERC CIP-015\n][48][\nNIS2 Directive\n][49][\nSEC Cybersecurity Rules\n][50][\nTSA Security Directives\n][51]\nPartners\n\n### Why Partner with Us\n\nOur global partner network deploys OT & IoT cybersecurity solutions for customers around the world.\n\nLearn more\n][52]\n\n### Our Partners\n\nExplore all Nozomi Networks partners\n\nLearn more\n][53]\n\n### Find a Partner\n\nFind a certified Nozomi Networks partner in your country.\n\nLearn more\n][54]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nLog into the Nozomi Networks partner portal.\n\nLog In\n][55]\nResources\n\n### Resource Library\n\nBrowse OT & IoT security research, guides, videos and more from the Nozomi Networks team.\n\nView Resources\n][56]\nRESOURCES\nCase Studies\n][57][\nContent Packs\n][58][\nData Sheets\n][59][\nOT Cyber FAQs\n][60][\nGuides\n][61][\nResearch Reports\n][62]\nSolution Briefs\n][63][\nVideos\n][64][\nWebinars\n][65][\nWhite Papers\n][66][\nTrust Center\n][67]\n\n### Customer Hub\n\nExplore our latest customer resources, including webinars, how-to videos, content packs and more.\n\nView Hub\n][68]\nBlog\n][69]\nCompany\n\n### About Nozomi Networks\n\nWe keep critical infrastructure and operational technology cyber resilient.\n\nLearn more\n][70]\nLeadership Team\n][71][\nEvents\n][72][\nNewsroom\n][73]\nCareers\n][74][\nCustomer Stories\n][75][\nContact Us\n][76]\n[Request Demo][77]\n\n#### SOLUTION\n\n# Vulnerability Management for OT & IoT Devices\n\n[Request a Demo][78]\nTHE CHALLENGE\n\n## Managing OT/IoT Cyber Risks in Industrial Environments\n\nIndustrial networks can contain hundreds or even thousands of OT and IoT devices from a variety of\nvendors, many of which are insecure by design \u2013 lacking authentication, encryption and other\nsecurity standards. Identifying and prioritizing critical vulnerabilities in OT & IoT devices is an\nimportant component of any risk management process.\n\nTHE SOLUTION\n\n## Nozomi Networks\u2019 OT & IoT Vulnerability Management\n\nIdentify and prioritize high- risk vulnerabilities in all your OT & IoT devices\n\nContinuously monitor your assets to quickly detect new vulnerabilities\n\nReduce the time to respond for high-priority vulnerabilities with actionable intelligence\n\nScale vulnerability management across your entire industrial or critical infrastructure environment\n\n## Why Nozomi Networks for OT/IoT Vulnerability Management?\n\nNozomi Networks platform automatically identifies and scores open OT and IoT vulnerabilities in your\ndevices. Using NIST\u2019s NVD (National Vulnerability Database) for standardized naming, description and\nscoring, it rapidly determines which devices are at risk and helps you respond with actionable\nintelligence.\n\nTo help your security team prioritize high-level exposure points, our solution displays all\nvulnerabilities by vendor, severity level and more in a dedicated view. Plus, it offers drilldown on\neach vulnerability for deeper troubleshooting and remediation assistance.\n\nUnlike other solutions on the market, our platform uses a [variety of methods][79] to collect\nvulnerability information, including network monitoring, endpoint monitoring and smart polling, to\nprovide continuous visibility into all your assets and their vulnerabilities, even when they aren\u2019t\nactively communicating.\n\n[View Platform][80]\n\n# Nozomi Networks Platform: Vulnerabilities & Workbooks Tour\n\n[Launch Product Tour][81]\n[[Nozomi Networks Vantage dashboard showing alerts, vulnerabilities, sites status, and asset\nmonitoring counts for IT, IoT, and OT with a world map and a welcome tour popup.]][82]\n\n## For the best viewing experience of the demo, please use a laptop or desktop computer.\n\n[Request a Custom Demo][83]\n\n## Related Resources\n\n[[Nozomi Networks branding with text 'What's So Great About The Graph' and a blurred network graph\nvisualization in the background.]][84]\nVIDEO\n\n### What\u2019s So Great About the Graph?\n\n[Watch][85]\nPRODUCT\n\n### Vantage, SaaS Powered OT & IoT Security\n\n[Read][86]\n[[Close-up of an industrial control panel with illuminated green indicator lights and connected blue\nnetwork cables.]][87]\nGUIDE\n\n### Guide to ICS Cybersecurity\n\n[Read][88]\n[[Arc Product Overview Thumb]][89]\nPRODUCT\n\n### Nozomi Arc, Endpoint Monitoring for Operational Technology\n\n[Read][90]\n\n## Take the next step.\n\nDiscover how easy it is to identify and respond to cyber threats by automating your OT and IoT asset\ndiscovery, inventory, and management.\n\n[Request a Demo][91][Watch Demo][92]\n[View our Privacy Policy][93]\n\n## Subscribe\n\n][94][\n\n## LinkedIn\n\n][95][\n\n## Demo\n\n][96]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n[Platform Overview][97][Vantage][98][Central Management Console][99][Guardian][100][Guardian\nAir][101][Arc][102][Asset Intelligence][103][Threat Intelligence][104][Smart\nPolling][105][Integrations][106][PSIRT][107]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Professional Services][108][Designated Engineer][109][Fast Track Services][110][Health Check\nService][111][Optimization Service][112]\n\n### Solutions: Business needs\n\n[Threat Detection & Response][113][Continuous Network Monitoring][114][Asset Inventory\nManagement][115][Risk & Vulnerability Management][116][IoT Security][117][Data Center\nCybersecurity][118]\n\n### Solutions: Compliance\n\n[DoW ZT for OT][119][ISA/IEC 62443 Standards ][120][NERC CIP][121][NIS2 Directive][122][SEC\nCybersecurity Rules][123][TSA Security Directives][124]\n\n### Solutions: Industry\n\n[Airports][125][Electric Utilities][126][Healthcare][127][Federal\nGovernment][128][Manufacturing][129][Maritime][130][Mining][131][Oil &\nGas][132][Pharmaceutical][133][Rail][134][Retail][135][Smart Cities][136][Water & Wastewater][137]\n\n### Learn\n\n[Academy][138][Careers][139][Company][140][Customer Stories][141][Contact\nUs][142][Partners][143][Resources][144][Labs][145][Legal][146][Trust Center][147]\n[[LinkedIn logo]][148]\n\u00a9 2026 Nozomi Networks Inc. All Rights Reserved. [Privacy Notice][149] and Certifications. [System\nStatus][150].\n\n[1]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/blog/a-note-to-our-customers-and-partners-in-the-middle-east\n[2]: /academy\n[3]: /labs\n[4]: /company/careers\n[5]: https://partners.nozominetworks.com/English/\n[6]: /support\n[7]: