            "text": "A Note to our Customers and Partners in the Middle East\n[More Information][1]\nAcademy\n][2][\nLabs\n][3][\nCareers\n][4][\nPartner Login\n][5][\nSupport\n][6]\n[[Nozomi logo]][7]\nPlatform\n\n### Platform Overview\n\nOur industrial cybersecurity solutions deliver unmatched asset intelligence, threat detection and\nAI-driven insights.\n\nLearn more\n][8]\nMANAGERS\nVantage\nCloud\n][9][\nCentral Management Console\nOn-prem\n][10]\nSENSORS\nGuardian\nNetwork\n][11][\nGuardian Air\nWireless\n][12][\nArc\nEndpoint\n][13][\nArc Embedded\nEndpoint\n][14]\nENHANCEMENTS\nVantage IQ\n][15][\nAsset Intelligence\n][16][\nThreat Intelligence\n][17][\nSmart Polling\n][18][\nTI Expansion Pack\nPowered by Mandiant\n][19][\nIntegrations\n][20]\n\n### Professional Services\n\nOT and IoT security expertise that speeds solution deployment and maximizes value\n\nLearn more\n][21]\nSolutions\nBUSINESS NEED\nAsset Inventory Management\n][22][\nThreat Detection & Response\n][23][\nContinuous Network Monitoring\n][24][\nVulnerability Management\n][25][\nRisk Management\n][26][\nIoT Security\n][27][\nData Center Cybersecurity\n][28][\nBuilding Automation System\nCybersecurity\n][29]\nINDUSTRY\nAirports\n][30][\nElectric Utilities\n][31][\nHealthcare\n][32][\nManufacturing\n][33][\nMaritime\n][34][\nMining\n][35][\nOil & Gas\n][36]\nPharmaceutical\n][37][\nRail\n][38][\nRetail\n][39][\nSmart Cities\n][40][\nStadiums & Arenas\n][41][\nWater &\nWastewater\n][42]\n[Icon of a government building with three columns, a triangular roof, and a blue flag on top.]\nPUBLIC SECTOR\nFederal Government\n][43]\nState & Local\n][44]\nCOMPLIANCE\nDoW ZT for OT\n][45][\nISA/IEC 62443 Standards\n][46][\nNERC CIP\n][47][\nNERC CIP-015\n][48][\nNIS2 Directive\n][49][\nSEC Cybersecurity Rules\n][50][\nTSA Security Directives\n][51]\nPartners\n\n### Why Partner with Us\n\nOur global partner network deploys OT & IoT cybersecurity solutions for customers around the world.\n\nLearn more\n][52]\n\n### Our Partners\n\nExplore all Nozomi Networks partners\n\nLearn more\n][53]\n\n### Find a Partner\n\nFind a certified Nozomi Networks partner in your country.\n\nLearn more\n][54]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nLog into the Nozomi Networks partner portal.\n\nLog In\n][55]\nResources\n\n### Resource Library\n\nBrowse OT & IoT security research, guides, videos and more from the Nozomi Networks team.\n\nView Resources\n][56]\nRESOURCES\nCase Studies\n][57][\nContent Packs\n][58][\nData Sheets\n][59][\nOT Cyber FAQs\n][60][\nGuides\n][61][\nResearch Reports\n][62]\nSolution Briefs\n][63][\nVideos\n][64][\nWebinars\n][65][\nWhite Papers\n][66][\nTrust Center\n][67]\n\n### Customer Hub\n\nExplore our latest customer resources, including webinars, how-to videos, content packs and more.\n\nView Hub\n][68]\nBlog\n][69]\nCompany\n\n### About Nozomi Networks\n\nWe keep critical infrastructure and operational technology cyber resilient.\n\nLearn more\n][70]\nLeadership Team\n][71][\nEvents\n][72][\nNewsroom\n][73]\nCareers\n][74][\nCustomer Stories\n][75][\nContact Us\n][76]\n[Request Demo][77]\n\n#### SOLUTION\n\n# IoT Device Security & Visibility\n\n[Request a Demo][78]\nTHE CHALLENGE\n\n## Visibility & Security for IoT Devices\n\nThe widespread use of Internet of Things (IoT) devices creates unique IoT security challenges for\nbusinesses. These devices are typically unmanaged, connected across business applications and\nnetworks and have minimal built-in security controls for their lightweight operating systems.\nBecause of this, they are inherently difficult to segment to prevent the spread of malware. Having a\nstrong IoT security strategy is critically important for businesses today.\n\nTHE SOLUTION\n\n## IoT Visibility & Security from Nozomi Networks\n\nIdentify all your connected devices, including both OT & IoT devices\n\nContinuously monitor your IoT devices to detect changes that could increase cyber or operational\nrisk\n\nPinpoint the cyber risks that matter most to keep your business resilient\n\nScale IoT asset management across your entire infrastructure\n\n## Why Choose Nozomi Networks for IoT Security?\n\nNozomi Networks\u2019 IoT visibility and security solution automates device discovery and management,\ndetects threats and anomalies and offers guided remediations to reduce MTTR.\n\n## Relationships\n\nWe truly value our customers and take pride in having the industry\u2019s highest customer retention\nrate. But don\u2019t take our word for it. Read why our customers rank us #1 on Gartner Peer Reviews\n[here.][79]\n\n## Leading with AI\n\nOur technology comes with an inherent knowledge of OT and IoT systems and uses its neural network to\nlearn about your unique environments to prioritize the risks that matter most for your business.\n\n## Reduced Time to Resilience\n\nChange how you deploy IoT security, with options for passive, agentless and active data collection\nmethods to get your operations resilient, faster.\n\n## IoT Expertise\n\nOur solution was created for complex environments with a variety of IT, IoT and OT systems, and some\nof the largest global companies trust us to keep their IoT devices secure.\n\n[Customer Testimonials][80]\n\n## Related Resources\n\n[[Nozomi Networks branding with text 'What's So Great About The Graph' and a blurred network graph\nvisualization in the background.]][81]\nVIDEO\n\n### What\u2019s So Great About the Graph?\n\n[Watch][82]\nPRODUCT\n\n### Vantage, SaaS Powered OT & IoT Security\n\n[Read][83]\n[[Digital padlock icon hovering over a microchip circuit board, symbolizing cybersecurity and data\nprotection.]][84]\nGUIDE\n\n### Guide to ICS Cybersecurity\n\n[Read][85]\n[[Text 'Executive brief Closing IoT security gaps in your operations' with a mosaic of connected\nblue-toned images including a robotic hand and a person clasping hands.]][86]\nGUIDE\n\n### Closing IoT Security Gaps in Your Operations\n\n[Read][87]\n\n## Take the next step.\n\nDiscover how easy it is to identify and respond to cyber threats by automating your OT and IoT asset\ndiscovery, inventory, and management.\n\n[Request a Demo][88][Watch Demo][89]\n[View our Privacy Policy][90]\n\n## Subscribe\n\n][91][\n\n## LinkedIn\n\n][92][\n\n## Demo\n\n][93]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n[Platform Overview][94][Vantage][95][Central Management Console][96][Guardian][97][Guardian\nAir][98][Arc][99][Asset Intelligence][100][Threat Intelligence][101][Smart\nPolling][102][Integrations][103][PSIRT][104]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Professional Services][105][Designated Engineer][106][Fast Track Services][107][Health Check\nService][108][Optimization Service][109]\n\n### Solutions: Business needs\n\n[Threat Detection & Response][110][Continuous Network Monitoring][111][Asset Inventory\nManagement][112][Risk & Vulnerability Management][113][IoT Security][114][Data Center\nCybersecurity][115]\n\n### Solutions: Compliance\n\n[DoW ZT for OT][116][ISA/IEC 62443 Standards ][117][NERC CIP][118][NIS2 Directive][119][SEC\nCybersecurity Rules][120][TSA Security Directives][121]\n\n### Solutions: Industry\n\n[Airports][122][Electric Utilities][123][Healthcare][124][Federal\nGovernment][125][Manufacturing][126][Maritime][127][Mining][128][Oil &\nGas][129][Pharmaceutical][130][Rail][131][Retail][132][Smart Cities][133][Water & Wastewater][134]\n\n### Learn\n\n[Academy][135][Careers][136][Company][137][Customer Stories][138][Contact\nUs][139][Partners][140][Resources][141][Labs][142][Legal][143][Trust Center][144]\n[[LinkedIn logo]][145]\n\u00a9 2026 Nozomi Networks Inc. All Rights Reserved. [Privacy Notice][146] and Certifications. [System\nStatus][147].\n\n[1]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/blog/a-note-to-our-customers-and-partners-in-the-middle-east\n[2]: /academy\n[3]: /labs\n[4]: /company/careers\n[5]: https://partners.nozominetworks.com/English/\n[6]: /support\n[7]: /\n[8]: /platform\n[9]: /platform/vantage\n[10]: /platform/central-management-console\n[11]: /platform/guardian\n[12]: /platform/guard