etworks' Julie Rosenberg, Sara Verri and Laura Perek Recognized in CRN Women of the\nChannel Awards 2026 ]\nMay 4, 2026\n\n## Nozomi Networks' Julie Rosenberg, Sara Verri and Laura Perek Recognized in CRN Women of the\n## Channel Awards 2026\n\n[Read More][82]\n[Nozomi Networks Receives 2025 IoT Excellence Award from IoT Evolution World ]\nMarch 30, 2026\n\n## Nozomi Networks Receives 2025 IoT Excellence Award from IoT Evolution World\n\n[Read More][83]\n[Nozomi Networks Named Winner of the Coveted Global InfoSec Awards during RSAC Conference 2026]\nMarch 27, 2026\n\n## Nozomi Networks Named Winner of the Coveted Global InfoSec Awards during RSAC Conference 2026\n\n[Read More][84]\n[Nozomi Networks Recognized in the 2026 Gartner\u00ae Critical Capabilities Report for CPS Protection\nPlatforms]\nMarch 16, 2026\n\n## Nozomi Networks Recognized in the 2026 Gartner\u00ae Critical Capabilities Report for CPS Protection\n## Platforms\n\n[Read More][85]\n[Nozomi Networks Named a Leader for 2nd Consecutive Year in the 2026 Gartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for\nCPS Protection Platforms ]\nMarch 9, 2026\n\n## Nozomi Networks Named a Leader for 2nd Consecutive Year in the 2026 Gartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for\n## CPS Protection Platforms\n\n[Read More][86]\n[Nozomi Networks Labs Report Finds 70% of Ransomware Activity Concentrated Against English-Speaking\nCountries ]\nFebruary 19, 2026\n\n## Nozomi Networks Labs Report Finds 70% of Ransomware Activity Concentrated Against\n## English-Speaking Countries\n\n[Read More][87]\n[Nozomi Networks Honored with Prestigious CRN Awards for 2026 ]\nFebruary 17, 2026\n\n## Nozomi Networks Honored with Prestigious CRN Awards for 2026\n\n[Read More][88]\n[Nozomi Networks Enters Next Phase of Growth as Mitsubishi Electric Completes Acquisition]\nJanuary 28, 2026\n\n## Nozomi Networks Enters Next Phase of Growth as Mitsubishi Electric Completes Acquisition\n\n[Read More][89]\n[Nozomi Networks Unleashes Vantage IQ: The World\u2019s Firs