            "text": "A Note to our Customers and Partners in the Middle East\n[More Information][1]\nAcademy\n][2][\nLabs\n][3][\nCareers\n][4][\nPartner Login\n][5][\nSupport\n][6]\n[[Nozomi logo]][7]\nPlatform\n\n### Platform Overview\n\nOur industrial cybersecurity solutions deliver unmatched asset intelligence, threat detection and\nAI-driven insights.\n\nLearn more\n][8]\nMANAGERS\nVantage\nCloud\n][9][\nCentral Management Console\nOn-prem\n][10]\nSENSORS\nGuardian\nNetwork\n][11][\nGuardian Air\nWireless\n][12][\nArc\nEndpoint\n][13][\nArc Embedded\nEndpoint\n][14]\nENHANCEMENTS\nVantage IQ\n][15][\nAsset Intelligence\n][16][\nThreat Intelligence\n][17][\nSmart Polling\n][18][\nTI Expansion Pack\nPowered by Mandiant\n][19][\nIntegrations\n][20]\n\n### Professional Services\n\nOT and IoT security expertise that speeds solution deployment and maximizes value\n\nLearn more\n][21]\nSolutions\nBUSINESS NEED\nAsset Inventory Management\n][22][\nThreat Detection & Response\n][23][\nContinuous Network Monitoring\n][24][\nVulnerability Management\n][25][\nRisk Management\n][26][\nIoT Security\n][27][\nData Center Cybersecurity\n][28][\nBuilding Automation System\nCybersecurity\n][29]\nINDUSTRY\nAirports\n][30][\nElectric Utilities\n][31][\nHealthcare\n][32][\nManufacturing\n][33][\nMaritime\n][34][\nMining\n][35][\nOil & Gas\n][36]\nPharmaceutical\n][37][\nRail\n][38][\nRetail\n][39][\nSmart Cities\n][40][\nStadiums & Arenas\n][41][\nWater &\nWastewater\n][42]\n[Icon of a government building with three columns, a triangular roof, and a blue flag on top.]\nPUBLIC SECTOR\nFederal Government\n][43]\nState & Local\n][44]\nCOMPLIANCE\nDoW ZT for OT\n][45][\nISA/IEC 62443 Standards\n][46][\nNERC CIP\n][47][\nNERC CIP-015\n][48][\nNIS2 Directive\n][49][\nSEC Cybersecurity Rules\n][50][\nTSA Security Directives\n][51]\nPartners\n\n### Why Partner with Us\n\nOur global partner network deploys OT & IoT cybersecurity solutions for customers around the world.\n\nLearn more\n][52]\n\n### Our Partners\n\nExplore all Nozomi Networks partners\n\nLearn more\n][53]\n\n### Find a Partner\n\nFind a certified Nozomi Networks partner in your country.\n\nLearn more\n][54]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nLog into the Nozomi Networks partner portal.\n\nLog In\n][55]\nResources\n\n### Resource Library\n\nBrowse OT & IoT security research, guides, videos and more from the Nozomi Networks team.\n\nView Resources\n][56]\nRESOURCES\nCase Studies\n][57][\nContent Packs\n][58][\nData Sheets\n][59][\nOT Cyber FAQs\n][60][\nGuides\n][61][\nResearch Reports\n][62]\nSolution Briefs\n][63][\nVideos\n][64][\nWebinars\n][65][\nWhite Papers\n][66][\nTrust Center\n][67]\n\n### Customer Hub\n\nExplore our latest customer resources, including webinars, how-to videos, content packs and more.\n\nView Hub\n][68]\nBlog\n][69]\nCompany\n\n### About Nozomi Networks\n\nWe keep critical infrastructure and operational technology cyber resilient.\n\nLearn more\n][70]\nLeadership Team\n][71][\nEvents\n][72][\nNewsroom\n][73]\nCareers\n][74][\nCustomer Stories\n][75][\nContact Us\n][76]\n[Request Demo][77]\n\nSOLUTION\n\n# Threat Detection & Response for Critical Infrastructure and Industrial Security Teams\n\n[Request a Demo][78]\nTHE CHALLENGE\n\n## Preventing Cyber Threats from Impacting Uptime\n\nThreat detection is the practice of analyzing both asset and network information to identify\nmalicious or anomalous activity that could impact operational continuity. Critical infrastructure\nand industrial security teams need a centralized threat detection and response solution that was\nbuilt for OT systems and provides contextual insights about risks to align response efforts.\n\nTHE SOLUTION\n\n## Nozomi Networks\u2019 Threat Detection & Response\n\nPinpoint the cyber and operational risks that matter most\n\nAccess AI-powered insights that help you prevent events from becoming impacts\n\nContinuously monitor your assets and networks for threats\n\nScale threat detection and response across your entire operational infrastructure\n\n## Threat Detection & Response for Tomorrow\u2019s Operations\n\nNozomi Networks\u2019 AI-powered monitoring and prevention technology immediately baselines and profiles\nevery device and its behavior to quickly pinpoint the security threats and process anomalies that\nmatter most. Guided remediation Playbooks keep your team focused to prevent events from becoming\nimpacts.\n\nUnlike other solutions on the market, our platform detects threats on both the network and\nendpoints, giving a 360-degree view of the cyber risk landscape in operational technology systems.\nOur Threat Intelligence feed delivers continuous intelligence to stay on top of emerging threats and\nreduce your mean-time-to-detect (MTTD).\n\n[Learn more][79]\n\n### Nozomi Networks detects a wide range of risks, including:\n\nAssets with vulnerabilities\nBad configurations (NTP/DNS/DHCP, etc.)\nCleartext or weak passwords\nBad configurations (NTP/DNS/DHCP, etc.)\nCorrupted OT packets\nDevice state change\nIP conflicts\nNew connections to the enterprise network\nNew connections to the Internet\nNew communications\nNew nodes\nPolicy violations\nNew remote access\nOpen ports on assets\nNon-responsive asset\nUnauthorized cross level communication\nUnencrypted communications\n\n## Related Resources\n\n[[Episode 07 titled 'Filling in the OT Security Blanks with Endpoint Monitoring' with cartoon avatar\nof Marty, The OT Guy, on a blue background.]][80]\nVIDEO\n\n### Filling in the Security Blanks with OT Endpoint Monitoring\n\n[Watch][81]\n[[Arc Product Overview Thumb]][82]\nPRODUCT\n\n### Nozomi Arc, Industrial Endpoint Detection & Response\n\n[Read][83]\n[[Ethos Intelligence Sharing Association logo with a colorful hexagonal pinwheel graphic.]][84]\nBLOG\n\n### ETHOS Open-Source Initiative: Emerging Threat Open Sharing Platform\n\n[Read][85]\nPRODUCT\n\n### Vantage IQ\n\n[Read][86]\n\n## Take the next step.\n\nDiscover how easy it is to identify and respond to cyber threats by automating your OT and IoT asset\ndiscovery, inventory, and management.\n\n[Request a Demo][87][Watch Demo][88]\n[View our Privacy Policy][89]\n\n## Subscribe\n\n][90][\n\n## LinkedIn\n\n][91][\n\n## Demo\n\n][92]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n[Platform Overview][93][Vantage][94][Central Management Console][95][Guardian][96][Guardian\nAir][97][Arc][98][Asset Intelligence][99][Threat Intelligence][100][Smart\nPolling][101][Integrations][102][PSIRT][103]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Professional Services][104][Designated Engineer][105][Fast Track Services][106][Health Check\nService][107][Optimization Service][108]\n\n### Solutions: Business needs\n\n[Threat Detection & Response][109][Continuous Network Monitoring][110][Asset Inventory\nManagement][111][Risk & Vulnerability Management][112][IoT Security][113][Data Center\nCybersecurity][114]\n\n### Solutions: Compliance\n\n[DoW ZT for OT][115][ISA/IEC 62443 Standards ][116][NERC CIP][117][NIS2 Directive][118][SEC\nCybersecurity Rules][119][TSA Security Directives][120]\n\n### Solutions: Industry\n\n[Airports][121][Electric Utilities][122][Healthcare][123][Federal\nGovernment][124][Manufacturing][125][Maritime][126][Mining][127][Oil &\nGas][128][Pharmaceutical][129][Rail][130][Retail][131][Smart Cities][132][Water & Wastewater][133]\n\n### Learn\n\n[Academy][134][Careers][135][Company][136][Customer Stories][137][Contact\nUs][138][Partners][139][Resources][140][Labs][141][Legal][142][Trust Center][143]\n[[LinkedIn logo]][144]\n\u00a9 2026 Nozomi Networks Inc. All Rights Reserved. [Privacy Notice][145] and Certifications. [System\nStatus][146].\n\n[1]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/blog/a-note-to-our-customers-and-partners-in-the-middle-east\n[2]: /academy\n[3]: /labs\n[4]: /company/careers\n[5]: https://partners.nozominetworks.com/English/\n[6]: /support\n[7]: /\n[8]: /platform\n[9]: /platform/vantage\n[10]: /platform/central-management-console\n[11]: /platform/guardian\n[12]: /platform/guardian-air\n[13]: /platform/arc\n[14]: /platform/arc-embedded\n[15]: /platform/vantage-iq\n[16]: /platform/asset-intelligence\n[17]: /platform/threat-intelligence\n[18]: /platform/smart-polling\n[19]: /platform/ti-expansion-pack-powered-by-mandiant\n[20]: /technology-alliance-ecosystem\n[21]: /professional-services\n[22]: /solutions/iot-ot-asset-inventory-management\n[23]: /solutions/threat-detection-and-response\n[24]: /solutions/iot-ot-network-monitoring\n[25]: /solutions/iot-ot-vulnerability-management\n[26]: /solutions/ot-risk-management\n[27]: /solutions/iot-security\n[28]: /solutions/data-center-cybersecurity\n[29]: /solutions/building-automation-system-cybersecurity\n[30]: /industries/airport-cybersecurity\n[31]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[32]: /industries/healthcare-cybersecurity\n[33]: /industries/manufacturing-cybersecurity\n[34]: /industries/maritime-cybersecurity\n[35]: /industries/mining-cybersecurity\n[36]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[37]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[38]: /industries/rail-cybersecurity\n[39]: /industries/retail-cybersecurity\n[40]: /industries/smart-cities-cybersecurity\n[41]: /industries/stadiums-arenas\n[42]: /industries/water-wastewater-cybersecurity\n[43]: /industries/federal-government\n[44]: /industries/state-local-government\n[45]: /compliance/dow-zt-for-ot\n[46]: /compliance/isa-iec-62443-standards\n[47]: /compliance/nerc-cip\n[48]: /compliance/nerc-cip-015\n[49]: /compliance/nis2-directive-compliance\n[50]: /compliance/sec-cybersecurity-rules\n[51]: /compliance/tsa-security-directives\n[52]: /partners\n[53]: /partners#our-partners\n[54]: /partners/find-a-partner\n[55]: https://partners.nozominetworks.com/English/\n[56]: /resources\n[57]: /customer-stories\n[58]: /content-packs\n[59]: /data-sheets\n[60]: /ot-cybersecurity-faqs\n[61]: /guides\n[62]: /research-reports\n[63]: /solution-briefs\n[64]: /videos\n[65]: /webinars\n[66]: /white-papers\n[67]: /trust-center\n[68]: /customer-resources\n[69]: /blog\n[70]: /company\n[71]: /company/leadership\n[72]: /events\n[73]: /company/newsroom\n[74]: /company/careers\n[75]: /customer-stories\n[76]: /company/contact-us\n[77]: /demo\n[78]: #\n[79]: /platform/vantage\n[80]: /resources/filling-in-the-ot-security-blanks-with-endpoint-monitoring\n[81]: /resources/filling-in-the-ot-security-blanks-with-endpoint-monitoring\n[82]: /platform/arc\n[83]: /platform/arc\n[84]: /blog/ethos-emerging-threat-open-sharing-platform\n[85]: /blog/ethos-emerging-threat-open-sharing-platform\n[86]: /platform/vantage-iq\n[87]: /demo\n[88]: /resources/nozomi-networks-platform-demo\n[89]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/legal/privacy-policy\n[90]: #\n[91]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/nozomi-networks-sa\n[92]: /demo\n[93]: /platform\n[94]: /platform/vantage\n[95]: /platform/central-management-console\n[96]: /platform/guardian\n[97]: /platform/guardian-air\n[98]: /platform/arc\n[99]: /platform/asset-intelligence\n[100]: /platform/threat-intelligence\n[101]: /platform/smart-polling\n[102]: /technology-alliance-ecosystem\n[103]: https://security.nozominetworks.com/\n[104]: /professional-services\n[105]: /professional-services/designated-engineer\n[106]: /professional-services/fast-track-service-packages\n[107]: /professional-services/health-check-service\n[108]: /professional-services/optimization-service\n[109]: /solutions/threat-detection-and-response\n[110]: /solutions/iot-ot-network-monitoring\n[111]: /solutions/iot-ot-asset-inventory-management\n[112]: /solutions/iot-ot-vulnerability-management\n[113]: /solutions/iot-security\n[114]: /solutions/data-center-cybersecurity\n[115]: /compliance/dow-zt-for-ot\n[116]: /compliance/isa-iec-62443-standards\n[117]: /compliance/nerc-cip\n[118]: /compliance/nis2-directive-compliance\n[119]: /compliance/sec-cybersecurity-rules\n[120]: /compliance/tsa-security-directives\n[121]: /industries/airport-cybersecurity\n[122]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[123]: /industries/healthcare-cybersecurity\n[124]: /industries/federal-government\n[125]: /industries/manufacturing-cybersecurity\n[126]: /industries/maritime-cybersecurity\n[127]: /industries/mining-cybersecurity\n[128]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[129]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[130]: /industries/rail-cybersecurity\n[131]: /industries/retail-cybersecurity\n[132]: /industries/smart-cities-cybersecurity\n[133]: /industries/water-wastewater-cybersecurity\n[134]: /academy\n[135]: /company/careers\n[136]: /company\n[137]: /customer-stories\n[138]: /company/contac"
