            "text": "A Note to our Customers and Partners in the Middle East\n[More Information][1]\nAcademy\n][2][\nLabs\n][3][\nCareers\n][4][\nPartner Login\n][5][\nSupport\n][6]\n[[Nozomi logo]][7]\nPlatform\n\n### Platform Overview\n\nOur industrial cybersecurity solutions deliver unmatched asset intelligence, threat detection and\nAI-driven insights.\n\nLearn more\n][8]\nMANAGERS\nVantage\nCloud\n][9][\nCentral Management Console\nOn-prem\n][10]\nSENSORS\nGuardian\nNetwork\n][11][\nGuardian Air\nWireless\n][12][\nArc\nEndpoint\n][13][\nArc Embedded\nEndpoint\n][14]\nENHANCEMENTS\nVantage IQ\n][15][\nAsset Intelligence\n][16][\nThreat Intelligence\n][17][\nSmart Polling\n][18][\nTI Expansion Pack\nPowered by Mandiant\n][19][\nIntegrations\n][20]\n\n### Professional Services\n\nOT and IoT security expertise that speeds solution deployment and maximizes value\n\nLearn more\n][21]\nSolutions\nBUSINESS NEED\nAsset Inventory Management\n][22][\nThreat Detection & Response\n][23][\nContinuous Network Monitoring\n][24][\nVulnerability Management\n][25][\nRisk Management\n][26][\nIoT Security\n][27][\nData Center Cybersecurity\n][28][\nBuilding Automation System\nCybersecurity\n][29]\nINDUSTRY\nAirports\n][30][\nElectric Utilities\n][31][\nHealthcare\n][32][\nManufacturing\n][33][\nMaritime\n][34][\nMining\n][35][\nOil & Gas\n][36]\nPharmaceutical\n][37][\nRail\n][38][\nRetail\n][39][\nSmart Cities\n][40][\nStadiums & Arenas\n][41][\nWater &\nWastewater\n][42]\n[Icon of a government building with three columns, a triangular roof, and a blue flag on top.]\nPUBLIC SECTOR\nFederal Government\n][43]\nState & Local\n][44]\nCOMPLIANCE\nDoW ZT for OT\n][45][\nISA/IEC 62443 Standards\n][46][\nNERC CIP\n][47][\nNERC CIP-015\n][48][\nNIS2 Directive\n][49][\nSEC Cybersecurity Rules\n][50][\nTSA Security Directives\n][51]\nPartners\n\n### Why Partner with Us\n\nOur global partner network deploys OT & IoT cybersecurity solutions for customers around the world.\n\nLearn more\n][52]\n\n### Our Partners\n\nExplore all Nozomi Networks partners\n\nLearn more\n][53]\n\n### Find a Partner\n\nFind a certified Nozomi Networks partner in your country.\n\nLearn more\n][54]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nLog into the Nozomi Networks partner portal.\n\nLog In\n][55]\nResources\n\n### Resource Library\n\nBrowse OT & IoT security research, guides, videos and more from the Nozomi Networks team.\n\nView Resources\n][56]\nRESOURCES\nCase Studies\n][57][\nContent Packs\n][58][\nData Sheets\n][59][\nOT Cyber FAQs\n][60][\nGuides\n][61][\nResearch Reports\n][62]\nSolution Briefs\n][63][\nVideos\n][64][\nWebinars\n][65][\nWhite Papers\n][66][\nTrust Center\n][67]\n\n### Customer Hub\n\nExplore our latest customer resources, including webinars, how-to videos, content packs and more.\n\nView Hub\n][68]\nBlog\n][69]\nCompany\n\n### About Nozomi Networks\n\nWe keep critical infrastructure and operational technology cyber resilient.\n\nLearn more\n][70]\nLeadership Team\n][71][\nEvents\n][72][\nNewsroom\n][73]\nCareers\n][74][\nCustomer Stories\n][75][\nContact Us\n][76]\n[Request Demo][77]\n\n#### SOLUTION\n\n# Risk Management for Complex OT/IoT Environments\n\nNation-state actors, hacktivists, ransomware groups and malicious insiders... all know that global\nindustrial environments and critical infrastructure make ideal targets. As OT/IoT assets account for\nan increasing percentage of total enterprise risk, so, too, must attention focus on reducing that\nrisk.\n\n[Request a Demo \u2192][78]\n[Animated diagram showing risk management process using neural networks with arrows connecting data,\nneural network model, risk assessment, and risk mitigations.]\n\nThe Nozomi Networks platform identifies, assesses, mitigates and monitors risk in your environment.\nIt helps operators and SOC teams collaborate to prioritize efforts and take the most impactful\nactions to reduce risk and increase resilience.\n\n## The Four Steps to Continuous OT/IoT Cyber Risk Management\n\nThe Nozomi Networks platform simplifies each phase in the cyber risk management cycle.\n\n**Risk Identification**\n\nComprehensive asset inventory, full network communication visibility and AI-driven threat detection\n\n**Risk Assessment**\n\nMulti-factor, AI-driven risk scoring, fully customizable to reflect how your organization calculates\nrisk\n\n**Risk Mitigation**\n\nAI-driven insights to prioritize remediation, with incident response guidance and integrations for\nautomated policy enforcement\n\n**Risk Monitoring**\n\nExecutive dashboards to monitor risk reduction, with industry benchmarks and threat intelligence to\ntrack emerging threats\n\n[[Dashboards showing IT and OT asset statistics, including asset types, vendors, protocols,\noperating systems, firmware versions, risk levels, lifecycles, vulnerabilities with CVE and KEV\ncounts, and risk distributions.]][79]\nSTEP 1\n\n## Risk Identification\n\nRisk identification starts with a [complete asset inventory and visibility][80] achieved through a\nvariety of endpoint-to-air sensors, active and passive discovery techniques, protocol fluency and\nthird-party connectors to enhance asset profiles. Vulnerability prioritization based on criticality\nand AI-driven cyberattack and anomaly detection completes the risk picture.\n\nSTEP 2\n\n## Risk Assessment\n\nSee how each asset and related entity (sensor, zone, site, enterprise) in your environment is\nassigned a risk score based on six weighted factors, all fully customizable based on your\npreferences. (2:30 min)\n\n[[Two screenshots of Nozomi Networks Vantage interface showing Asset Risk remediation steps for\nsoftware, communication, and hardware, and an Integrations settings page with options like Chronicle\nSIEM, Cisco Meraki, and CrowdStrike EDR.]][81]\nSTEP 3\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n\nLeverage AI/ML-driven recommendations to remediate software, communications and hardware,\nprioritized based on risk reduction impact. Customize detailed playbooks to guide manual incident\nresponse and automate policy enforcement where practical via limitless integrations.\n\nSTEP 4\n\n## Risk Monitoring\n\nProperly configured asset risk scores enable you to accurately monitor changes over time and assess\nhow individual asset risk contributes to higher-level risk \u2014 and take measures to reduce it.\nRegional and industry-specific risk monitoring with actionable insights helps you shrink that risk\neven more.\n\n[[Dashboard showing threat intelligence with pie charts of targeted industries, countries, and\nmalware types, detailed malware profiles, and a world map of targeted countries.]][82]\n\n## Take the next step.\n\nDiscover how easy it is to identify and respond to cyber threats by automating your OT and IoT asset\ndiscovery, inventory, and management.\n\n[Request a Demo][83][Watch Demo][84]\n[View our Privacy Policy][85]\n\n## Subscribe\n\n][86][\n\n## LinkedIn\n\n][87][\n\n## Demo\n\n][88]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n[Platform Overview][89][Vantage][90][Central Management Console][91][Guardian][92][Guardian\nAir][93][Arc][94][Asset Intelligence][95][Threat Intelligence][96][Smart\nPolling][97][Integrations][98][PSIRT][99]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Professional Services][100][Designated Engineer][101][Fast Track Services][102][Health Check\nService][103][Optimization Service][104]\n\n### Solutions: Business needs\n\n[Threat Detection & Response][105][Continuous Network Monitoring][106][Asset Inventory\nManagement][107][Risk & Vulnerability Management][108][IoT Security][109][Data Center\nCybersecurity][110]\n\n### Solutions: Compliance\n\n[DoW ZT for OT][111][ISA/IEC 62443 Standards ][112][NERC CIP][113][NIS2 Directive][114][SEC\nCybersecurity Rules][115][TSA Security Directives][116]\n\n### Solutions: Industry\n\n[Airports][117][Electric Utilities][118][Healthcare][119][Federal\nGovernment][120][Manufacturing][121][Maritime][122][Mining][123][Oil &\nGas][124][Pharmaceutical][125][Rail][126][Retail][127][Smart Cities][128][Water & Wastewater][129]\n\n### Learn\n\n[Academy][130][Careers][131][Company][132][Customer Stories][133][Contact\nUs][134][Partners][135][Resources][136][Labs][137][Legal][138][Trust Center][139]\n[[LinkedIn logo]][140]\n\u00a9 2026 Nozomi Networks Inc. All Rights Reserved. [Privacy Notice][141] and Certifications. [System\nStatus][142].\n\n[1]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/blog/a-note-to-our-customers-and-partners-in-the-middle-east\n[2]: /academy\n[3]: /labs\n[4]: /company/careers\n[5]: https://partners.nozominetworks.com/English/\n[6]: /support\n[7]: /\n[8]: /platform\n[9]: /platform/vantage\n[10]: /platform/central-management-console\n[11]: /platform/guardian\n[12]: /platform/guardian-air\n[13]: /platform/arc\n[14]: /platform/arc-embedded\n[15]: /platform/vantage-iq\n[16]: /platform/asset-intelligence\n[17]: /platform/threat-intelligence\n[18]: /platform/smart-polling\n[19]: /platform/ti-expansion-pack-powered-by-mandiant\n[20]: /technology-alliance-ecosystem\n[21]: /professional-services\n[22]: /solutions/iot-ot-asset-inventory-management\n[23]: /solutions/threat-detection-and-response\n[24]: /solutions/iot-ot-network-monitoring\n[25]: /solutions/iot-ot-vulnerability-management\n[26]: /solutions/ot-risk-management\n[27]: /solutions/iot-security\n[28]: /solutions/data-center-cybersecurity\n[29]: /solutions/building-automation-system-cybersecurity\n[30]: /industries/airport-cybersecurity\n[31]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[32]: /industries/healthcare-cybersecurity\n[33]: /industries/manufacturing-cybersecurity\n[34]: /industries/maritime-cybersecurity\n[35]: /industries/mining-cybersecurity\n[36]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[37]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[38]: /industries/rail-cybersecurity\n[39]: /industries/retail-cybersecurity\n[40]: /industries/smart-cities-cybersecurity\n[41]: /industries/stadiums-arenas\n[42]: /industries/water-wastewater-cybersecurity\n[43]: /industries/federal-government\n[44]: /industries/state-local-gover