            "url": "https://nozominetworks.com/company",
            "text": "A Note to our Customers and Partners in the Middle East\n[More Information][1]\nAcademy\n][2][\nLabs\n][3][\nCareers\n][4][\nPartner Login\n][5][\nSupport\n][6]\n[[Nozomi logo]][7]\nPlatform\n\n### Platform Overview\n\nOur industrial cybersecurity solutions deliver unmatched asset intelligence, threat detection and\nAI-driven insights.\n\nLearn more\n][8]\nMANAGERS\nVantage\nCloud\n][9][\nCentral Management Console\nOn-prem\n][10]\nSENSORS\nGuardian\nNetwork\n][11][\nGuardian Air\nWireless\n][12][\nArc\nEndpoint\n][13][\nArc Embedded\nEndpoint\n][14]\nENHANCEMENTS\nVantage IQ\n][15][\nAsset Intelligence\n][16][\nThreat Intelligence\n][17][\nSmart Polling\n][18][\nTI Expansion Pack\nPowered by Mandiant\n][19][\nIntegrations\n][20]\n\n### Professional Services\n\nOT and IoT security expertise that speeds solution deployment and maximizes value\n\nLearn more\n][21]\nSolutions\nBUSINESS NEED\nAsset Inventory Management\n][22][\nThreat Detection & Response\n][23][\nContinuous Network Monitoring\n][24][\nVulnerability Management\n][25][\nRisk Management\n][26][\nIoT Security\n][27][\nData Center Cybersecurity\n][28][\nBuilding Automation System\nCybersecurity\n][29]\nINDUSTRY\nAirports\n][30][\nElectric Utilities\n][31][\nHealthcare\n][32][\nManufacturing\n][33][\nMaritime\n][34][\nMining\n][35][\nOil & Gas\n][36]\nPharmaceutical\n][37][\nRail\n][38][\nRetail\n][39][\nSmart Cities\n][40][\nStadiums & Arenas\n][41][\nWater &\nWastewater\n][42]\n[Icon of a government building with three columns, a triangular roof, and a blue flag on top.]\nPUBLIC SECTOR\nFederal Government\n][43]\nState & Local\n][44]\nCOMPLIANCE\nDoW ZT for OT\n][45][\nISA/IEC 62443 Standards\n][46][\nNERC CIP\n][47][\nNERC CIP-015\n][48][\nNIS2 Directive\n][49][\nSEC Cybersecurity Rules\n][50][\nTSA Security Directives\n][51]\nPartners\n\n### Why Partner with Us\n\nOur global partner network deploys OT & IoT cybersecurity solutions for customers around the world.\n\nLearn more\n][52]\n\n### Our Partners\n\nExplore all Nozomi Networks partners\n\nLearn more\n][53]\n\n### Find a Partner\n\nFind a certified Nozomi Networks partner in your country.\n\nLearn more\n][54]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nLog into the Nozomi Networks partner portal.\n\nLog In\n][55]\nResources\n\n### Resource Library\n\nBrowse OT & IoT security research, guides, videos and more from the Nozomi Networks team.\n\nView Resources\n][56]\nRESOURCES\nCase Studies\n][57][\nContent Packs\n][58][\nData Sheets\n][59][\nOT Cyber FAQs\n][60][\nGuides\n][61][\nResearch Reports\n][62]\nSolution Briefs\n][63][\nVideos\n][64][\nWebinars\n][65][\nWhite Papers\n][66][\nTrust Center\n][67]\n\n### Customer Hub\n\nExplore our latest customer resources, including webinars, how-to videos, content packs and more.\n\nView Hub\n][68]\nBlog\n][69]\nCompany\n\n### About Nozomi Networks\n\nWe keep critical infrastructure and operational technology cyber resilient.\n\nLearn more\n][70]\nLeadership Team\n][71][\nEvents\n][72][\nNewsroom\n][73]\nCareers\n][74][\nCustomer Stories\n][75][\nContact Us\n][76]\n[Request Demo][77]\nAbout Nozomi Networks\n\n# We protect the world\u2019s critical infrastructure from cyber threats.\n\n[View Platform][78]\n\nNozomi Networks is the leader in OT & IoT security for critical infrastructure. Our platform\nuniquely combines network and endpoint visibility, threat detection, and AI-powered analysis for\nfast, effective incident response. Customers around the world rely on us to minimize risk and\ncomplexity while maximizing operational resilience.\n\nFrom day one, our solutions have been deeply rooted in addressing the complex requirements of\nindustrial and critical infrastructure environments. As OT converges with the vastly different\nworlds of IT and IoT, that experience has given us a unique understanding of the tools and processes\nassociated with the largest networks in the world. We\u2019ve earned a global reputation for unmatched\nservice, superior cyber and physical system visibility, advanced OT and IoT threat detection, and\nscalability across distributed environments.\nWe provide real-time asset visibility, threat detection and actionable intelligence that keeps you\nin control of your critical infrastructure.\n\n## **115**M+\n\nOT, IoT and IT Devices Monitored\n\n## 12K+\n\nInstallations Worldwide\n\n## 100%\n\nCustomer Retention\n\n## Securing the World\u2019s Largest Organizations\n\nThe world\u2019s leading enterprises rely on Nozomi Networks to help them anticipate, diagnose and\nrespond to security risks and operational process issues.\n\n## Airports\n\n][79][\n\n## Electric Utilities\n\n][80][\n\n## Healthcare\n\n][81][\n\n## Manufacturing\n\n][82][\n\n## Maritime\n\n][83][\n\n## Mining\n\n][84][\n\n## Oil & Gas\n\n][85][\n\n## Pharmaceutical\n\n][86][\n\n## Rail\n\n][87][\n\n## Retail\n\n][88][\n\n## Smart Cities\n\n][89][\n\n## Water & Wastewater\n\n][90]\n\n## Partnered with the Best\n\nNozomi Networks is backed by the industry\u2019s largest partner ecosystem. This includes global\nalliances with and strategic investments from the world\u2019s leading IT security companies, industrial\nautomation vendors and leading cloud providers.\n\nThousands of security and engineering professionals are Nozomi Networks-certified to deliver\nbest-in-class cybersecurity solutions that address your specific needs.\n\n[Schneider Electric logo]\nSchneider Electric\n[Mandiant logo]\nMandiant\n[ABB logo]\nABB\n[ABS logo]\nABS Group\n[Accenture logo]\nAccenture\n[Atos logo]\nAtos\n[BT logo]\nBritish Telecom\n[Emerson logo]\nEmerson\n[LS Electric logo]\nLS Electric\n[Siemens logo]\nSiemens\n[EY logo]\nErnst & Young\n[GE logo]\n[Hitachi logo]\nHitachi\n[Honeywell logo]\nHoneywell\n[IBM logo]\nIBM Security\n[Johnson Controls logo]\nJohnson Controls\n[Telefonica logo]\nTelefonica\n[View all partnerships][91]\n\n## We Are Setting the Security Standards for OT & IoT\n\nSince our inception, Nozomi Networks has played a leading role in organizations and industry groups\ndedicated to improving the security of critical infrastructure and industrial operations, including:\n\n[OTCC logo]\n[E-ISAC logo]\n[CVE logo]\n[CISA logo]\n[ISA GCA logo]\n[IEC logo]\n[Cyber Threat Alliance logo]\n[ETHOS logo]\n\n## Continuous Innovation in OT & IoT Security\n\n[Innovation timeline from October 2013 to September 2025 highlighting key milestones in ICS\nvisibility, threat detection, AI, SaaS-powered security, wireless sensors, and active threat\nresponse capabilities.]\n\n## Why Choose Us?\n\nNozomi Platform\n[Learn More][92]\nCustomer Testimonials\n[Learn More][93]\nAnalysts & Awards\n[Learn More][94]\nTrust Center\n[Learn More][95]\n[Nozomi Labs logo]\n\n## **An Outstanding Team of Security Researchers**\n\nOur Nozomi Networks Labs team is made up of highly respected threat hunters and security analysts\nwho are dedicated to reducing cyber risk for industrial and critical infrastructure organizations.\nThey responsibly disclose vulnerabilities and freely share their research findings and security\ntools with the global ICS security community.\n\n[Learn More][96]\n\n## Take the next step.\n\nDiscover how easy it is to identify and respond to cyber threats by automating your OT and IoT asset\ndiscovery, inventory, and management.\n\n[Request a Demo][97][Watch Demo][98]\n[View our Privacy Policy][99]\n\n## Subscribe\n\n][100][\n\n## LinkedIn\n\n][101][\n\n## Demo\n\n][102]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n[Platform Overview][103][Vantage][104][Central Management Console][105][Guardian][106][Guardian\nAir][107][Arc][108][Asset Intelligence][109][Threat Intelligence][110][Smart\nPolling][111][Integrations][112][PSIRT][113]\n\n### Professional Services\n\n[Professional Services][114][Designated Engineer][115][Fast Track Services][116][Health Check\nService][117][Optimization Service][118]\n\n### Solutions: Business needs\n\n[Threat Detection & Response][119][Continuous Network Monitoring][120][Asset Inventory\nManagement][121][Risk & Vulnerability Management][122][IoT Security][123][Data Center\nCybersecurity][124]\n\n### Solutions: Compliance\n\n[DoW ZT for OT][125][ISA/IEC 62443 Standards ][126][NERC CIP][127][NIS2 Directive][128][SEC\nCybersecurity Rules][129][TSA Security Directives][130]\n\n### Solutions: Industry\n\n[Airports][131][Electric Utilities][132][Healthcare][133][Federal\nGovernment][134][Manufacturing][135][Maritime][136][Mining][137][Oil &\nGas][138][Pharmaceutical][139][Rail][140][Retail][141][Smart Cities][142][Water & Wastewater][143]\n\n### Learn\n\n[Academy][144][Careers][145][Company][146][Customer Stories][147][Contact\nUs][148][Partners][149][Resources][150][Labs][151][Legal][152][Trust Center][153]\n[[LinkedIn logo]][154]\n\u00a9 2026 Nozomi Networks Inc. All Rights Reserved. [Privacy Notice][155] and Certifications. [System\nStatus][156].\n\n[1]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/blog/a-note-to-our-customers-and-partners-in-the-middle-east\n[2]: /academy\n[3]: /labs\n[4]: /company/careers\n[5]: https://partners.nozominetworks.com/English/\n[6]: /support\n[7]: /\n[8]: /platform\n[9]: /platform/vantage\n[10]: /platform/central-management-console\n[11]: /platform/guardian\n[12]: /platform/guardian-air\n[13]: /platform/arc\n[14]: /platform/arc-embedded\n[15]: /platform/vantage-iq\n[16]: /platform/asset-intelligence\n[17]: /platform/threat-intelligence\n[18]: /platform/smart-polling\n[19]: /platform/ti-expansion-pack-powered-by-mandiant\n[20]: /technology-alliance-ecosystem\n[21]: /professional-services\n[22]: /solutions/iot-ot-asset-inventory-management\n[23]: /solutions/threat-detection-and-response\n[24]: /solutions/iot-ot-network-monitoring\n[25]: /solutions/iot-ot-vulnerability-management\n[26]: /solutions/ot-risk-management\n[27]: /solutions/iot-security\n[28]: /solutions/data-center-cybersecurity\n[29]: /solutions/building-automation-system-cybersecurity\n[30]: /industries/airport-cybersecurity\n[31]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[32]: /industries/healthcare-cybersecurity\n[33]: /industries/manufacturing-cybersecurity\n[34]: /industries/maritime-cybersecurity\n[35]: /industries/mining-cybersecurity\n[36]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[37]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[38]: /industries/rail-cybersecurity\n[39]: /industries/retail-cybersecurity\n[40]: /industries/smart-cities-cybersecurity\n[41]: /industries/stadiums-arenas\n[42]: /industries/water-wastewater-cybersecurity\n[43]: /industries/federal-government\n[44]: /industries/state-local-government\n[45]: /compliance/dow-zt-for-ot\n[46]: /compliance/isa-iec-62443-standards\n[47]: /compliance/nerc-cip\n[48]: /compliance/nerc-cip-015\n[49]: /compliance/nis2-directive-compliance\n[50]: /compliance/sec-cybersecurity-rules\n[51]: /compliance/tsa-security-directives\n[52]: /partners\n[53]: /partners#our-partners\n[54]: /partners/find-a-partner\n[55]: https://partners.nozominetworks.com/English/\n[56]: /resources\n[57]: /customer-stories\n[58]: /content-packs\n[59]: /data-sheets\n[60]: /ot-cybersecurity-faqs\n[61]: /guides\n[62]: /research-reports\n[63]: /solution-briefs\n[64]: /videos\n[65]: /webinars\n[66]: /white-papers\n[67]: /trust-center\n[68]: /customer-resources\n[69]: /blog\n[70]: /company\n[71]: /company/leadership\n[72]: /events\n[73]: /company/newsroom\n[74]: /company/careers\n[75]: /customer-stories\n[76]: /company/contact-us\n[77]: /demo\n[78]: /platform\n[79]: /industries/airport-cybersecurity\n[80]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[81]: /industries/healthcare-cybersecurity\n[82]: /industries/manufacturing-cybersecurity\n[83]: /industries/maritime-cybersecurity\n[84]: /industries/mining-cybersecurity\n[85]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[86]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[87]: /industries/rail-cybersecurity\n[88]: /industries/retail-cybersecurity\n[89]: /industries/smart-cities-cybersecurity\n[90]: /industries/water-wastewater-cybersecurity\n[91]: /partners\n[92]: /platform\n[93]: /customer-testimonials\n[94]: /company/analysts-awards\n[95]: /trust-center\n[96]: /labs\n[97]: /demo\n[98]: /resources/nozomi-networks-platform-demo\n[99]: https://www.nozominetworks.com/legal/privacy-policy\n[100]: #\n[101]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/nozomi-networks-sa\n[102]: /demo\n[103]: /platform\n[104]: /platform/vantage\n[105]: /platform/central-management-console\n[106]: /platform/guardian\n[107]: /platform/guardian-air\n[108]: /platform/arc\n[109]: /platform/asset-intelligence\n[110]: /platform/threat-intelligence\n[111]: /platform/smart-polling\n[112]: /technology-alliance-ecosystem\n[113]: https://security.nozomin"
