      "key_products": "Vantage, Guardian, Arc",
      "polished_summary": "Nozomi Networks is a leader in operational technology (OT) and Internet of Things (IoT) security, dedicated to safeguarding critical infrastructure from cyber threats. The company offers a range of advanced cybersecurity solutions, including the Vantage platform for comprehensive monitoring, Guardian for network security, and Arc for endpoint protection, all designed to enhance asset intelligence and threat detection for industrial organizations and critical infrastructure providers. With a focus on delivering AI-driven insights and tailored consulting services, Nozomi Networks empowers organizations to effectively manage and secure their operational environments.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Nozomi Networks develops advanced cybersecurity solutions specifically for operational technology (OT) and Internet of Things (IoT) environments, which are critical components of cyber-physical systems security. Their products, such as the Vantage platform, Guardian, and Arc, are designed to enhance security and threat detection in critical infrastructure, making them a key player in this market.",
