        "crawl_text": "SANTA CLARA, Calif. [\nIntroducing Idira, the next-generation identity security platform.\n][1]\n* [Sign In][2]\n  * [Customer][3]\n  * [Partner][4]\n  * [Employee][5]\n  * [Login to download][6]\n  * [Join us to become a member][7]\n* [EN][8]\n* [[magnifying glass search icon to open search field]][9]\n* [ Contact Us][10]\n* [ What's New][11]\n* [ Get Support][12]\n* [ Under Attack?][13]\n[[Palo Alto Networks logo]][14][magnifying glass search icon]\n* [Products][15]\n* [Solutions][16]\n* [Services][17]\n* [Partners][18]\n* [Company][19]\n* [More][20]\n* [Sign In][21]\n  Sign In\n  * [Customer][22]\n  * [Partner][23]\n  * [Employee][24]\n  * [Login to download][25]\n  * [Join us to become a member][26]\n* [EN][27]\n  Language\n* [Contact Us][28]\n* [What's New][29]\n* [Get support][30]\n* [Under Attack?][31]\n* [Demos and Trials][32]\n\n# Control the chaos.\n# Secure every identity.\n\n## Introducing Idira^{\u00ae}, the next-generation identity security\n## platform that secures every identity for the AI enterprise.\n* [ Discover Idira][33]\n* [ Read the launch blog][34]\n\n## RECOMMENDED\n\n[\n[Gartner for EPP]\n\n### A 4X Gartner^{\u00ae} Magic Quadrant^{\u2122} Leader in EPP\n\nSee the AI edge\n][35]\n[\n[Acquisition of Portkey]\n\n### Palo Alto Networks Completes Acquisition of Portkey to Secure AI Agents\n\nRead the Press Release\n][36]\n[\n[Frontier AI]\n\n### Combat Risks from Frontier AI Models\n\nWatch on demand\n][37]\n[\n[Fight AI with AI]\n\n### Fight AI with AI\n\nSee what's possible\n][38]\n[\n\n### Introducing Prisma AIRS 3.0\n\nRead the blog\n][39]\n[\n\n### Defining the future of AI and quantum\n\nWatch now\n][40]\n[\n\n### Attacks are happening 4x faster. Are you ready?\n\nGet the Unit 42 IR Report\n][41]\n[\n\n### Unit 42 MSIAM 2.0 is here: The 24/7 managed SOC.\n\nSee what's new\n][42]\nWhy Palo Alto Networks?PlatformsSolutionsProven SuccessEngage with Us\n[ Why Palo Alto Networks? ][43]\n[ Platforms ][44]\n[ Solutions ][4