tion, Automation and Response\nKuppingerCole Leadership Compass Report for Attack Surface Management\nA Supply Chain Security Leader in the GigaOm Radar 2024 report\n\n### Next-Generation Identity Security\n\nIdira secures every identity for the enterprise - human, machine and agentic - with a unified\ncontrol plane that discovers risk, applies privilege dynamically, and governs the full lifecycle\nfrom first access to final session.\n10 K\nCustomers\n55%\nOF THE FORTUNE 500\n[ Explore Identity Security ][57]\nSee all\n[\nMagic Quadrant ^{\u00ae} for Privileged Access Management, 2025\n][58]\nThe Forrester Wave\u2122: Privileged Identity Management, 2025\nLeadership Compass: Access Management, 2025\nLeadership Compass: Identity Threat Detection & Response, 2025\n2025 Frost Radar\u2122. Key & Secrets Management\nLeadership Compass: Passwordless Authentication for Enterprises, 2026\nLeadership Compass: Passwordless Authentication B2C, 2026\nLeadership Compass: Enterprise Secrets Management, 2025\nLeadership Compass: Privileged Access Management, 2025\nRadar for Privileged Access Management, 2025\nTrusted by the best\n\n## Intelligence-driven.\n## Response-ready.\n\n[ Threat Intel & Incident Response ][59]\nSERVICES\nThreat Intel &\nIncident Response\nUnit 42\u2019s world-renowned threat researchers, elite incident responders and expert security\nconsultants will guide you with a threat-informed approach before, during and after an incident.\n1 K+\nMATTERS PER YEAR\n24 / 7 / 365\nincident response\n[ Explore Unit 42 ][60]\n200+\nthreat researchers\n30 M\nmalware samples analyzed per day\n1 K+\nincident response engagements a year\n150+\ntrusted partner of law firms\nTrusted by the best\n\n## Secure whatever,\n## whenever, wherever \u2014\n## with less complexity.\n\n[ Secure Your AI ecosystem ][61][ Secure your network ][62][ Secure your cloud ][63][ Secure Your\nIdentities ][64][ Automate your SOC ][65][ Threat intel and incident response services ][66][\nSolutions by industry ][67]\n* [ Secure AI apps, agents, models, and data at every step ][68]\n* [ Secure the use of GenAI applications in the enterprise ][69]\n* [ Secure the whole enterprise consistently ][70]\n* [ Apply AI inline to prevent evasive threats ][71]\n* [ Simplify network security operations ][72]\n* [ Adopt Zero Trust across the network ][73]\n* [ Reduce complexity with AI-powered SASE ][74]\n* [ Secure work on any device ][75]\n* [ The future of real-time cloud, today ][76]\n* [ Stop risks at the source ][77]\n* [ Rapidly prioritize and remediate risks across any cloud ][78]\n* [ Prevent cloud attacks in real-time ][79]\n* [ Detect, investigate and respond to threats across enterprise and cloud ][80]\n* [ Close the access gaps attackers walk through ][81]\n* [ Secure machine identities at the scale AI demands ][82]\n* [ Secure agentic identities to accelerate AI innovation ][83]\n* [ Discover and govern every entitlement ][84]\n* [ Eliminate standing privilege ][85]\n* [ Reign in security operations with one platform ][86]\n* [ Accelerate threat detection and response ][87]\n* [ Deliver security at speed and scale with automation ][88]\n* [ Secure and shrink your attack surface ][89]\n* [ Let our experts be an extension of your team ][90]\n* [ Every second counts when responding to an attack ][91]\n* [ Move from reactive to proactive ][92]\n* [ Make our experience your experience ][93]\n* [ Get world-class threat intelligence ][94]\n* [ Public sector ][95]\n* [ Financial services ][96]\n* [ Manufacturing ][97]\n* [ Healthcare ][98]\n* [ Small & medium business solutions ][99]\n\n## Our customers are securing their digital transformation\n\n[See testimonials ][100]\nYour browser does not support HTML5 video. [ View video][101]\nVolume Play\n\n## Trusted by the best\n\n## Here for you.\n## Here for what\u2019s next.\n\nExecutives\nSpecialists\nPartners\nCustomers\n\n### Ignite on Tour\n\nMeet decision-makers, experts and practitioners for a day of hands-on learning, strategy building\nand networking.\n\n[ Attend our global roadshow ][102]\n\n### Executive Briefing Center\n\nGet a customized plan to see how our platforms, threat intelligence and expert services help you\nsecure the way forward.\n\n[ Plan a collaborative discussion ][103]\n\n### Under Attack? We\u2019re Here.\n\nUnit 42^{\u00ae} Incident Response explains the breach, works with you to contain and remedy it, and gets\nyou back to business.\n\n[ Our experts are standing by ][104]\n\n### AI-powered security platforms\n\nExpert advice and insights for using AI-powered solutions to streamline your security posture and\nmitigate risk.\n\n[ Get expert insights ][105]\n\n### Product Demo Center\n\nVisit the demo center to see solution experts walk you through our comprehensive cybersecurity\nportfolio in action.\n\n[ Take our products for a spin ][106]\n\n### Future-proof your Security\n\nMeet the trusted, proven and awarded products that make a positive difference in your security and\nbusiness outcomes.\n\n[ Get to know our products ][107]\n\n### Events Around the World\n\nBrowse all scheduled global events by cybersecurity technology interest, industry, region, use case\nand more.\n\n[ Join us in person or online ][108]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nDon\u2019t try to tackle security challenges alone. Tap into the world\u2019s most interoperable cloud and AI\nsecurity platform.\n\n[ Log into our partner interface ][109]\n\n### Become a Partner\n\nBe part of a global community of world-class innovators committed to making security breaches a\nthing of the past.\n\n[ Apply to our partner community ][110]\n\n### Managed Services Program\n\nProvide managed security services that reduce cost, increase average revenue per customer and\nmaximize market reach.\n\n[ Experience specialized tech ][111]\n\n### Customer Login\n\nSecurity, performance and ease of use: Three qualities our customers like most about our\ncybersecurity products.\n\n[ Sign in ][112]\n\n### Education and Training\n\nExpand your wisdom and skills with world-class training, certification and accreditation, including\ndigital learning.\n\n[ Learn from security experts ][113]\n\n### Customer Success Tools\n\nGuidance, oversight and 24/7 support from cybersecurity experts to help expedite your setup and\ninitial configuration.\n\n[ Make the most of our resources ][114]\n\n## Staying ahead demands\n## perspectives you can trust.\n\n[ View all ][115]\n[\nARTICLE\n\n### Securing Your AI-Powered Network Transformation: A Guide for C-Suite Leaders\n\n][116]\n[\nARTICLE\n\n### A New Era of Cybersecurity with AI\n\n][117]\n[\nARTICLE\n\n### When It Comes to Cyber Resilience and AI, B"
