      "polished_summary": "Palo Alto Networks is a leading cybersecurity company that specializes in providing advanced security solutions powered by artificial intelligence. Its core offerings include the next-generation identity security platform, Idira, as well as comprehensive network security, security operations, and cloud security services designed to protect organizations against sophisticated threats. Targeting enterprises across various sectors, Palo Alto Networks aims to empower businesses to harness AI-ready infrastructure while ensuring secure growth and innovation.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Palo Alto Networks develops advanced cybersecurity solutions specifically designed for protecting cyber-physical systems. Their products, such as the Idira identity security platform and Strata network security platform, directly address security needs in the cyber-physical systems domain.",
