id with colorful\npixel blocks.]\nStoryBosch Tech Compass 2026\nWhat do people expect from innovation?\n][74]\n[\n[Row of people with scenes of work, mobility, cycling, warehouses, and industrial equipment.]\nFor tomorrow. Today.\nBosch annual report 2025\n][75]\n[\n[Person in a lab coat holding a pipette under blue lighting; face partially obscured by graphic\noverlays.]\nTopic\nInnovation\n][76]\nClose\n\nSelect a language\n\nEnglish Deutsch\n[Find your local website][77]\n\n# [In the valley of the sun][78]\n\n[\n[Person standing in front of a large technical unit outdoors.]\n][79]\n[\n[Sandeep C D, a man with dark hair in a motorcycle outfit looking confidently at the camera.]\n\n## Tradition meets technology\n\n][80]\n[About us][81]\n[Our open positions][82]\n[Get in touch][83]\n\n## Our products for your home\n\n[Show all products][84]\n[\n[Bosch products for home appliances]\n\nHome appliances\n\n][85] [\n[Power tools for private customers from Bosch ]\n\nPower tools\n\n][86] [\n[Garden tools from Bosch]\n\nGarden tools\n\n][87] [\n[Measuring tools from Bosch]\n\nMeasuring tools\n\n][88] [\n[Cleaning tools from Bosch]\n\nCleaning tools\n\n][89] [\n[Bosch products for heating, cooling, and well-being]\n\nHeating, cooling, and well-being\n\n][90] [\n[Bosch solutions for your smart home]\n\nSmart Home\n\n][91]\n\n## Our solutions for business clients\n\n[\n\n### Mobility\n\nExplore our complete portfolio of mobility solutions\n][92]\n[\n\n### Industry and trades\n\nDiscover our products and services for industry and trades\n][93]\n\n## Explore our stories\n\n[Explore all stories][94]\n\n## Our featured topics\n\nBosch develops innovations that provide solutions to the major challenges of our time. How? It\u2019s all\nexplained in our featured topics.\n\n[\n[A person in a lab coat holding a pipette under blue lighting; face partially obscured by graphic\noverlays.]\n\n### Innovation\n\nShaping the future\n\n][95]\n[\n[A vehicle display showing the large text \u201cSOFTWARE-DRIVEN MOBILITY\u201d]\n\n### Software-driven mobility\n\nThe car of the future is personalized\n\n][96]\n[\n[A woman steps through the letters \"AI\"]\n\n### Artificial intelligence\n\nAI for a better future\n\n][97]\n[\n[A father plays with his child in a modern bathroom while the mother looks on.]\n\n### Energy efficiency\n\nSaving energy at home is easier than you think\n\n][98]\n[\n[Various hydrogen applications can be seen in molecules. These include a mobile fuel cell in a\ntruck, hydrogen electrolysis and stationary fuel cells.]\n\n### Hydrogen\n\nEnergy of the future\n\n][99]\n[\n[Wood artist Adam Detre stands surrounded by trees behind a Bosch GCM 18V-305 GDC Professional\ncordless crosscut and miter saw, carefully aligning a long piece of wood.]\n\n### Battery technology\n\nMore than just a means of storing energy\n\n][100]\n[\n[A hand holds a tiny sensor on his fingertip.]\n\n### MEMS-sensors\n\nMicro-Electro-Mechanical Systems\n\n][101]\n[\n[A woman charges an electric vehicle Xiaomi SU7 at a charging station]\n\n### Electrification\n\nElectricity drives us\n\n][102]\n\n## Bosch on social media\n\nFollow us for the latest information about the company.\n\n## Bosch customer service\n\nYou need service or support? Our customer support is here for you whenever you need it.\n[To contact overview][103]\n[\nWork LikeABosch \u2014 Apply now.\nBosch Global Careers\n][104]\n[\nBecome a business partner.\nPurchasing and logistics\n][105]\nInvented for life\n* [General contact info][106]\n* [Questions and answers][107]\n* [Product security (PSIRT)][108]\n* [Innovations, patents, and licenses][109]\n* [Purchasing and logistics][110]\n* [Corporate information][111]\n* [Legal notice][112]\n* [Data protection notice (Privacy Policy)][113]\n* [Accessibility][114]\n* [ Privacy settings ][115]\n\u00a9 Robert Bosch GmbH 2026, all rights reserved\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products-and-services/\n[3]: /products-and-services/mobility/\n[4]: /products-and-services/at-home/\n[5]: /products-and-services/industry-and-trades/\n[6]: /stories/\n[7]: /stories/topics/\n[8]: /stories/topics/innovation/\n[9]: /stories/topics/software-driven-mobility/\n[10]: /stories/topics/ai-for-a-better-future-at-bosch/\n[11]: /stories/topics/energy-efficiency-at-home/\n[12]: /stories/topics/hydrogen-energy/\n[13]: /stories/topics/battery-technology/\n[14]: /stories/topics/mems-micro-electro-mechanical-systems/\n[15]: /stories/topics/electrification/\n[16]: /stories/tag.html?tag=a2c2649a-aa37-4a64-8f44-0dfdde7b389b\n[17]: /research/research-blog/\n[18]: /st"
