            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\nProducts and services Company Careers\n* Products and services\n  * Main Navigation\n  * Products and services\n  * [ Overview ][2]\n  * [Mobility][3]\n  * [At home][4]\n  * [Industry and trades][5]\n* Stories\n  * Main Navigation\n  * Stories\n  * [ Overview ][6]\n  * Featured topics\n    * Main Navigation\n    * Stories Overview\n    * Featured topics\n    * [ Overview ][7]\n    * [ Innovation ][8]\n    * [ Software-driven mobility ][9]\n    * [ Artificial intelligence ][10]\n    * [ Energy efficiency at home ][11]\n    * [ Hydrogen \u2014 energy for the future ][12]\n    * [ Battery Technology ][13]\n    * [ MEMS Micro-Electro-Mechanical Systems ][14]\n    * [ Electrification ][15]\n  * [CEO Blog][16]\n  * [Research Blog][17]\n  * [History Blog][18]\n  * LikeABosch\n    * Main Navigation\n    * Stories Overview\n    * LikeABosch\n    * [ Overview ][19]\n    * [ Work LikeABosch ][20]\n  Latest featured topic\n  [\n  [Person in a lab coat holding a pipette under blue lighting; face partially obscured by graphic\n  overlays.]\n  Topic\n  Innovation\n  ][21]\n  Latest stories\n* Company\n  * Main Navigation\n  * Company\n  * [ Overview ][22]\n  * [Leadership][23]\n  * [Annual report][24]\n  * [Facts and figures][25]\n  * [Investor relations][26]\n  * [Compliance][27]\n  * Our history\n    * Main Navigation\n    * Company Overview\n    * Our history\n    * [ Overview ][28]\n    * [ A journey through our history ][29]\n    * [ Company founder Robert Bosch ][30]\n    * [ Videos about Bosch History ][31]\n    * [ History Blog ][32]\n  * Supply chain\n    * Main Navigation\n    * Company Overview\n    * Supply chain\n    * [ Overview ][33]\n    * [ Purchasing ][34]\n    * [ Logistics ][35]\n    * [ Information for business partners ][36]\n  Latest CEO blog\n  [\n  [Bosch CEO Dr. Stefan Hartung talks about robotics, with a robotic arm in a factory hall shown\n  next to him in a graphic overlay.]\n  Blog postCEO blog\n  The third major revolution\n  ][37]\n  History stories\n* Sustainability\n  * Main Navigation\n  * Sustainability\n  * [ Overview ][38]\n  * [Responsible corporate governance][39]\n  * [Product responsibility][40]\n  * [Sustainable supply chains][41]\n  * [Environment][42]\n  * Associates\n    * Main Navigation\n    * Sustainability Overview\n    * Associates\n    * [ Overview ][43]\n    * [ Diversity, equity, and inclusion ][44]\n  * [Society][45]\n  * [Sustainability reports and figures][46]\n  Sustainability stories\n* Research\n  * Main Navigation\n  * Research\n  * [ Overview ][47]\n  * [News][48]\n  * [Research Stories][49]\n  * [Research Blog][50]\n  * Research Fields\n    * Main Navigation\n    * Research Overview\n    * Research Fields\n    * [ Overview ][51]\n    * [ Automation ][52]\n    * [ Digitalization and connectivity ][53]\n    * [ Artificial intelligence ][54]\n    * [ Electrification ][55]\n    * [ Climate action and sustainability ][56]\n    * [ Healthcare ][57]\n  * [Research Publications][58]\n  * About Bosch Research\n    * Main Navigation\n    * Research Overview\n    * About Bosch Research\n    * [ Overview ][59]\n    * [ Working at Bosch Research ][60]\n    * [ Our research experts ][61]\n    * [ Research locations ][62]\n  * [Bosch Center for Artificial Intelligence][63]\n  Research stories\n* Careers\n  * Main Navigation\n  * Careers\n  * [ Overview ][64]\n  * Why Bosch\n    * Main Navigation\n    * Careers Overview\n    * Why Bosch\n    * [ Overview ][65]\n    * [ Benefits ][66]\n    * [ Diversity, equity, and inclusion ][67]\n    * [ Associate stories ][68]\n  * [Career opportunities][69]\n  * [ Job offers ][70]\n  * [Fields of work][71]\n  Career stories\n* [ Press ][72]\n* [Contact][73]\nTop reads\n[\n[A person stands in a futuristic light environment. Parts of the image are overlaid with colorful\npixel blocks.]\nStoryBosch Tech Compass 2026\nWhat do people expect from innovation?\n][74]\n[\n[Row of people with scenes of work, mobility, cycling, warehouses, and industrial equipment.]\nFor tomorrow. Today.\nBosch annual report 2025\n][75]\n[\n[Person in a lab coat holding a pipette under blue lighting; face partially obscured by graphic\noverlays.]\nTopic\nInnovation\n][76]\nClose\n\nSelect a language\n\nEnglish Deutsch\n[Find your local website][77]\n\n# [In the valley of the sun][78]\n\n[\n[Person standing in front of a large technical unit outdoors.]\n][79]\n[\n[Sandeep C D, a man with dark hair in a motorcycle outfit looking confidently at the camera.]\n\n## Tradition meets technology\n\n][80]\n[About us][81]\n[Our open positions][82]\n[Get in touch][83]\n\n## Our products for your home\n\n[Show all products][84]\n[\n[Bosch products for home appliances]\n\nHome appliances\n\n][85] [\n[Power tools for private customers from Bosch ]\n\nPower tools\n\n][86] [\n[Garden tools from Bosch]\n\nGarden tools\n\n][87] [\n[Measuring tools from Bosch]\n\nMeasuring tools\n\n][88] [\n[Cleaning tools from Bosch]\n\nCleaning tools\n\n][89] [\n[Bosch products for heating, cooling, and well-being]\n\nHeating, cooling, and well-being\n\n][90] [\n[Bosch solutions for your smart home]\n\nSmart Home\n\n][91]\n\n## Our solutions for business clients\n\n[\n\n### Mobility\n\nExplore our complete portfolio of mobility solutions\n][92]\n[\n\n### Industry and trades\n\nDiscover our products and services for industry and trades\n][93]\n\n## Explore our stories\n\n[Explore all stories][94]\n\n## Our featured topics\n\nBosch develops innovations that provide solutions to the major challenges of our time. How? It\u2019s all\nexplained in our featured topics.\n\n[\n[A person in a lab coat holding a pipette under blue lighting; face partially obscured by graphic\noverlays.]\n\n### Innovation\n\nShaping the future\n\n][95]\n[\n[A vehicle display showing the large text \u201cSOFTWARE-DRIVEN MOBILITY\u201d]\n\n### Software-driven mobility\n\nThe car of the future is personalized\n\n][96]\n[\n[A woman steps through the letters \"AI\"]\n\n### Artificial intelligence\n\nAI for a better future\n\n][97]\n[\n[A father plays with his child in a modern bathroom while the mother looks on.]\n\n### Energy efficiency\n\nSaving energy at home is easier than you think\n\n][98]\n[\n[Various hydrogen applications can be seen in molecules. These include a mobile fuel cell in a\ntruck, hydrogen electrolysis and stationary fuel cells.]\n\n### Hydrogen\n\nEnergy of the future\n\n][99]\n[\n[Wood artist Adam Detre stands surrounded by trees behind a Bosch GCM 18V-305 GDC Professional\ncordless crosscut and miter saw, carefully aligning a long piece of wood.]\n\n### Battery technology\n\nMore than just a means of storing energy\n\n][100]\n[\n[A hand holds a tiny sensor on his fingertip.]\n\n### MEMS-sensors\n\nMicro-Electro-Mechanical Systems\n\n][101]\n[\n[A woman charges an electric vehicle Xiaomi SU7 at a charging station]\n\n### Electrification\n\nElectricity drives us\n\n][102]\n\n## Bosch on social media\n\nFollow us for the latest information about the company.\n\n## Bosch customer service\n\nYou need service or support? Our customer support is here for you whenever you need it.\n[To contact overview][103]\n[\nWork LikeABosch \u2014 Apply now.\nBosch Global Careers\n][104]\n[\nBecome a business partner.\nPurchasing and logistics\n][105]\nInvented for life\n* [General contact info][106]\n* [Questions and answers][107]\n* [Product security (PSIRT)][108]\n* [Innovations, patents, and licenses][109]\n* [Purchasing and logistics][110]\n* [Corporate information][111]\n* [Legal notice][112]\n* [Data protection notice (Privacy Policy)][113]\n* [Accessibility][114]\n* [ Privacy settings ][115]\n\u00a9 Robert Bosch GmbH 2026, all rights reserved\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: /products-and-services/\n[3]: /products-and-services/mobility/\n[4]: /products-and-services/at-home/\n[5]: /products-and-services/industry-and-trades/\n[6]: /stories/\n[7]: /stories/topics/\n[8]: /stories/topics/innovation/\n[9]: /stories/topics/software-driven-mobility/\n[10]: /stories/topics/ai-for-a-better-future-at-bosch/\n[11]: /stories/topics/energy-efficiency-at-home/\n[12]: /stories/topics/hydrogen-energy/\n[13]: /stories/topics/battery-technology/\n[14]: /stories/topics/mems-micro-electro-mechanical-systems/\n[15]: /stories/topics/electrification/\n[16]: /stories/tag.html?tag=a2c2649a-aa37-4a64-8f44-0dfdde7b389b\n[17]: /research/research-blog/\n[18]: /stories/history-blog/\n[19]: /stories/like-a-bosch/\n[20]: /careers/\n[21]: /stories/topics/innovation/\n[22]: /company/\n[23]: /company/leadership/\n[24]: /company/annual-report/\n[25]: /company/facts-and-figures/\n[26]: /company/investor-relations/\n[27]: /company/compliance/\n[28]: /company/our-history/\n[29]: /company/our-history/#company-history\n[30]: /company/our-history/#robert-bosch\n[31]: /company/our-history/videos-about-bosch-history/\n[32]: /stories/history-blog/\n[33]: /company/supply-chain/\n[34]: /company/supply-chain/purchasing/\n[35]: /company/supply-chain/logistics/\n[36]: /company/supply-chain/information-for-business-partners/\n[37]: /stories/ai-strategic-partnerships-bcw/\n[38]: /sustainability/\n[39]: /sustainability/responsibility/\n[40]: /sustainability/sustainable-products/\n[41]: /sustainability/sustainable-supply-chains/\n[42]: /sustainability/environment/\n[43]: /sustainability/associates/\n[44]: /sustainability/associates/diversity-equity-inclusion/\n[45]: /sustainability/society/\n[46]: /sustainability/sustainability-reports-and-figures/\n[47]: /research/\n[48]: /research/news/\n[49]: /research/research-stories/\n[50]: /research/research-blog/\n[51]: /research/research-fields/\n[52]: /research/research-fields/automation/\n[53]: /research/research-fields/digitalization-and-connectivity/\n[54]: /research/research-fields/artificial-intelligence/\n[55]: /research/research-fields/electrification/\n[56]: /research/research-fields/climate-action-and-sustainability/\n[57]: /research/research-fields/healthcare/\n[58]: /research/research-publications/\n[59]: /research/about-bosch-research/\n[60]: /research/about-bosch-research/working-at-bosch-research/\n[61]: /research/about-bosch-research/our-research-experts/\n[62]: /research/about-bosch-research/research-locations/\n[63]: /research/bcai/\n[64]: /careers/\n[65]: /careers/why-bosch/\n[66]: /careers/why-bosch/benefits/\n[67]: /sustainability/associates/diversity-equity-inclusion/\n[68]: /careers/why-bosch/associate-stories/\n[69]: /careers/career-opportunities/\n[70]: https://jobs.bosch.com/en/\n[71]: /careers/fields-of-work/\n[72]: https://www.bosch-presse.de/pressportal/de/en/\n[73]: /contact/\n[74]: /stories/technology-report-tech-compass-2026/\n[75]: /company/annual-report/\n[76]: /stories/topics/innovation/\n[77]: /websites-worldwide/\n[78]: /stories/bosch-climate-technology-phoenix/\n[79]: /stories/bosch-climate-technology-phoenix/\n[80]: /stories/india-growth-market-technology-software-mobility/\n[81]: /company/\n[82]: https://jobs.bosch.com/en/\n[83]: /contact/\n[84]: /products-and-services/at-home/\n[85]: /products-and-services/at-home/#home-appliances\n[86]: /products-and-services/at-home/#power-tools\n[87]: /products-and-services/at-home/#garden-tools\n[88]: /products-and-services/at-home/#measuring-tools\n[89]: /products-and-services/at-home/#cleaning-tools\n[90]: /products-and-services/at-home/#heating-cooling-and-well-being\n[91]: /products-and-services/at-home/#smart-home\n[92]: /products-and-services/mobility/\n[93]: /products-and-services/industry-and-trades/\n[94]: /stories/\n[95]: /stories/topics/innovation/\n[96]: /stories/topics/software-driven-mobility/\n[97]: /stories/topics/ai-for-a-better-future-at-bosch/\n[98]: /stories/topics/energy-efficiency-at-home/\n[99]: /stories/topics/hydrogen-energy/\n[100]: /stories/topics/battery-technology/\n[101]: /stories/topics/mems-micro-electro-mechanical-systems/\n[102]: /stories/topics/electrification/\n[103]: /contact/\n[104]: https://jobs.bosch.com/en/\n[105]: /company/supply-chain/\n[106]: /contact/\n[107]: /faq/\n[108]: https://psirt.bosch.com/\n[109]: /licenses-and-patents/\n[110]: /company/supply-chain/\n[111]: /corporate-information/?prevent-auto-open-privacy-settings=1\n[112]: /legal-notice/?prevent-auto-open-privacy-settings=1\n[113]: /data-protection-notice/?prevent-auto-open-privacy-settings=1\n[114]: /accessibility-information/?prevent-auto-open-privacy-settings=1\n[115]: #"
