      "company_function": "",
      "company_summary": "Siemens is a leading technology company dedicated to transforming industries, infrastructure, transport, and healthcare, impacting the daily lives of billions. With a comprehensive suite of products, including Siemens Digital Industries Software for manufacturing digital transformation and Siemens Mobility Solutions for enhancing transport infrastructure, the company serves a diverse range of sectors such as manufacturing, healthcare, and transportation. Additionally, Siemens offers expert consulting and maintenance services to optimize operations and support its customers effectively.",
      "operational_presence": "Not stated on website",
      "data_sources": "discovery=phase1_seed | enrichment=smart_crawl | page=https://siemens.com/about",
