            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n1. [Home][2]\n2. [Company][3]\n3. About us\n[Man in an office overlooking a cityscape of skyscrapers looks at his phone.]\n\n# About us\n\nOur technology accelerates customer transformations with industrial AI, boosting efficiency in\nfactories, enhancing city livability and promoting sustainable transport solutions.\n\n**Our purpose**\n\n## Transform the everyday, for everyone\n\nBy combining the real and the digital worlds, we can help accelerate both digitalization and\nsustainability - so our customers around the world can become more competitive, resilient and\nsustainable.\n\n**Strategy**\nall\n\n### Driven by purpose\n\nWe create technology to transform the everyday, for everyone. That is our purpose. Our strategy is\nhow we fulfill this purpose \u2013 creating long-term value that extends well beyond business outcomes\nfor the benefit of society.\n\n][4]\n**Transform the everyday**\nall\n\n### A real impact for billions of people\n\nWe create technology to transform the everyday, for everyone. From smart factories to sustainable\ncities, through digital transformation, automation and electrification, we turn everyday moments\ninto extraordinary possibilities.\n\n][5]\n**Innovation**\nall\n\n### Research & innovation\n\nWe believe that many technologies that help solve global challenges like climate change already\nexist today. We utilize our Siemens company core technologies in all businesses.\n\n][6]\n**History**\nall\n\n### A strong history since 1847\n\nFrom a workshop in a back courtyard in Berlin to a global corporation: Few technology companies can\nlook back on such a long, successful history as Siemens can.\n\n][7]\n**Company presentation**\n\n## We are a leading technology company\n\n[Siemens Flag with building view ]\n\nExplore our purpose, strategy, and the ONE Tech company program. This comprehensive slide deck also\nprovides detailed insights into key facts and figures, as well as an overview of our diverse\nbusinesses and services.\n\n[Download presentation][8]\n**Our impact**\n\n## Creating positive change together\n\nToday, our technologies are everywhere\u2014empowering customers, inspiring employees, and shaping the\nworld we want to live in.\n\n**90%**\n\n### 90% of our business enables positive sustainability impact\n\nfor our customers\n\n**694**\n\n### 694 million metric tons of CO\u2082e\n\navoided by customers cumulatively as of 2025\n\n**47.9**\n\n### 47.9 million \u20ac total community investment in fiscal 2025\n\n**58,000**\n\n### 58,000 hours spent by our people in volunteer projects\n\n**438**\n\n### 438 million \u20ac invested in employee education and training\n\n**Governance**\n\n## Demonstrating responsible business practices\n\nWe foster a culture of trust, adhere to ethical standards, and handle data with care. With our\ngovernance we apply state-of-the-art systems for effective and responsible business conduct.\n\n[See leadership team][9]\n[Group of people around an open laptop.]\n****\nall\n\n### Compliance and ethics\n\nCompliance forms the basis for all our decisions and activities, and it is the key to integrity when\nconducting business.\n\n][10]\n[Young woman on a stool with an open laptop in front of a chalkboard.]\n****\nall\n\n### Supply chain management\n\nWe prioritize sustainability in our supply chain and promotes environmental and social\nresponsibility as well as responsible sourcing.\n\n][11]\n[Computer screens displaying colorful graphs and data visualizations in a dark room with glowing\nblue light.]\n****\nall\n\n### Cybersecurity & data privacy\n\nWe believe that data protection is an integral part of responsible business conduct. Our primary\nobjective is to maintain strong data protection and a high level of cybersecurity for the company\nand all our stakeholders.\n\n][12]\n[Three people arranging content on a layout prototype.]\n****\nall\n\n### Human rights\n\nRespecting human rights along the entire value chain is a central element of integrity and\nresponsible corporate governance for us.\n\n][13]\n[Young man leaning against a wall.]\n****\nall\n\n### Responsible AI\n\nFor us, responsible AI means counteracting undesirable effects, and carefully balancing them against\npotential opportunities. To institutionalize this effort, we established a Generative AI Governance\ntask force.\n\n][14]\n[Woman and man engage in conversation. ]\n****\nall\n\n### Empowered regional teams\n\nWe combine global standards with local market expertise. In over 200 countries. Those include\nregional headquarters, innovation hubs, and manufacturing facilities in Europe, Americas,\nAsia-Pacific, as well as Middle East & Africa.\n\n**Our achievements**\n\n## Recognized around the world\n\n**#82**\n\n### #82 Time Magazine\n\nOne of TIME and Statista's World\u2019s Best Companies for 2025\n\n**#44**\n\n### #44 World's Best Employers\n\nOne of the top global companies to work for in the 2025 Forbes ranking.\n\n**#48**\n\n### #48 Best Global Brands\n\nImproved by 2 ranks in the global Interbrand ranking 2025.\n\n**social responsibility**\n\n## Contributing to people & society\n\nWe foster diversity, equity, inclusion and community development to create a sense of belonging. At\nthe same time we enable people to stay resilient and relevant in a permanently changing environment.\n\n[Two women having a conversation with a man.]\n****\nall\n\n### Careers at Siemens\n\nWe succeed when our people succeed. That\u2019s why we support our people through various programs and\ninitiatives, no matter what position they are in or what their level of expertise looks like.\n\n][15]\n[Shoes in front of a rainbow painted on asphalt.]\n****\nall\n\n### Belonging at Siemens\n\nWe champion our diverse teams, equitable opportunities and an inclusive workplace to spark\ninnovation and create a strong sense of belonging.\n\n][16]\n[Aerial view of a crowded urban street with pedestrians walking between buildings in a city center.]\n****\nall\n\n### Corporate citizenship\n\nWith our corporate citizenship initiatives we aim to empower people and societies. Our approach\nfocuses primarily on giving back to the societies what locally matters the most.\n\n][17]\n[Woman jogging on pavement. ]\n****\nall\n\n### Health & safety\n\nWe are committed to creating a healthy and safe work environment. We do so by maintaining and\nenhancing the resilience, adaptability, and well-being of our people.\n\n][18]\n[White lettering on black background - ]\n\n### WE Stand for values\n\nRespect. Tolerance. Openness. Diversity. These are the cornerstone vlaues that. have guided our\nsuccess and will continue to strengthen us into the future. In alliance with over 30 prominent\nGerman companies, we collectively employ 1.7 million diverse individuals across Germany, all\nstanding together for a unified Europe. Our shared commitment counters populism and supports an\nopen, diverse society as the foundation of our prosperity.\n\n[Learn more about WE STAND][19]\n\n## Programs & initiatives\n\n[Lettering on white background - \"Siemens Caring Hands e.V.\".]\n****\nall\n\n### Siemens Caring Hands\n\nLearn more about Siemens Caring Hands.\n\n][20]\n[White lettering on a grayscale photo of a hopscotch chalk drawing on asphalt.]\n****\nall\n\n### Siemens Foundation\n\nLearn more about the Siemens Foundation.\n\n][21]\n[Three people sitting on a bench in front of a wall full of black and white photos of people's\nfaces.]\n****\nall\n\n### Partnerships & sponsoring\n\nLearn more about partnerships and our sponsoring activities.\n\n][22]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://www.siemens.com/en-us/\n[3]: /en-us/company/\n[4]: /en-us/company/about/strategy/\n[5]: /en-us/company/about/strategy/technology-to-transform-the-everyday/\n[6]: /en-us/company/innovation/\n[7]: /en-us/company/history-heritage/\n[8]: https://assets.new.siemens.com/siemens/assets/api/uuid:47b698f0-77ae-4517-81bc-810ee5378f23/sie\nmens-company-presentation.pdf\n[9]: /en-us/company/leadership/\n[10]: /en-us/company/compliance/\n[11]: /en-us/company/about/supply-chain-management/\n[12]: /en-us/company/digital-transformation/cybersecurity/\n[13]: /en-us/company/about/social-commitments/human-rights/\n[14]: /en-us/company/artificial-intelligence/\n[15]: /en-us/company/jobs/\n[16]: /en-us/company/about/social-commitments/belonging/\n[17]: /en-us/company/about/social-commitments/corporate-citizenship/\n[18]: /en-us/company/about/social-commitments/health-safety/\n[19]: https://www.westandforvalues.com/\n[20]: https://siemens-caring-hands.org/en/\n[21]: https://www.siemens-stiftung.org/en/\n[22]: /en-us/company/about/partnerships/"
          },
          {
            "url": "https://siemens.com/company",
            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n1. [Home][2]\n2. Company\n[A person wearing a headset smiles while working at a computer in an office setting.]\n\n# Company\n\nWe are a leading technology company - focused on industry, infrastructure, transport, and healthcare\n- that transforms the everyday of billions of people.\n\n## Global key figures\n\n**318K**\n\n### 318K employees worldwide\n\nare transforming the everyday with us [1, 2][3]\n\n[Jobs and careers][4]\n**78,9**\n\n### 78,9 B\u20ac revenue in fiscal 2025\n\n6% increase on a comparable basis [1][5]\n\n[Key financial figures][6]\n**Top 10**\n\n### Top 10 software company\n\nwith a strong digital portfolio [1][7]\n\n[Learn more about digital transformation][8]\n**>90 %**\n\n### >90 % of our business\n\nenables positive **sustainability impact** for customers [1][9]\n\n[Sustainability][10]\n\n## Investor relations\n\n[Siemens HQ, Munich, Germany]\n\nHere investors can find up-to-date information and services regarding financial results and\npublications. Learn more about our Siemens shares, bonds, and rating. The financial calendar\nprovides an overview of current key dates and events.\n\n[Explore investor relations][11]\n[Woman looking up from her tablet device and smiling.]\n\n### What we do\n\nCombining the real and the digital worlds like no other, we help customers around the world to\nbecome more competitive, resilient and sustainable.\n\n[About Siemens][12]\n\n## Industries and businesses\n\nEverything we do pays into our goals to reduce carbon emissions and digitalize a wide range of\nsectors and industries.\n\n[Top view of a group of city planners reviewing a scale model of a subdivision.]\n\n### Industries\n\nOur technology empowers customers to transform the industries that form the backbone of economies.\n\n[Explore all industries][13]\n[Young man and woman walking across cement steps looking at a mobile device together.]\n\n### Businesses & Services\n\nCreating technology with purpose, our businesses combine the real and digital worlds unlike any\nother.\n\n[Explore our businesses and services][14]\n\n## Strategic topics\n\nEmpowering customers to accelerate their digital and sustainability transformation.\n\n[Two men discussing amongst themselves in front of a lap top.]\n\n### Digital Transformation\n\nDigitalization and automating processes saves companies resources and increases efficiency.\n\n[Learn more about digital transformation][15]\n[Young man riding a bicycle to work.]\n\n### Sustainability\n\nWe enable our customers and partners, through technology with purpose, to accelerate their\nsustainable transformation.\n\n[Learn more about sustainability][16]\n\n## Recommended\n\n### About Siemens\n* [Strategy][17]\n* [Businesses][18]\n* [Leadership][19]\n* [History][20]\n\n### Governance\n* [Compliance][21]\n* [Government Affairs][22]\n* [Supply Chain][23]\n\n### Explore more\n* [Partners][24]\n* [Belonging at Siemens][25]\n* [Fairs and Events][26]\n* [Stories][27]\n\n### Footnotes\n1. As of September 30, 2025\n2. Continuing operations\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://www.siemens.com/en-us/\n[3]: /en-us/company/#3yYSzyexyhoXyxISRkJ9bK\n[4]: /en-us/company/jobs/\n[5]: /en-us/company/#3yYSzyexyhoXyxISRkJ9bK\n[6]: /en-us/company/investor-relations/financial-results/\n[7]: /en-us/company/#3yYSzyexyhoXyxISRkJ9bK\n[8]: /en-us/company/digital-transformation/\n[9]: https://preview.siemens.com/en-us/company/#3yYSzyexyhoXyxISRkJ9bK\n[10]: /en-us/company/sustainability/\n[11]: /en-us/company/investor-relations/\n[12]: /en-us/company/about/\n[13]: /en-us/industries/\n[14]: /en-us/company/about/businesses/\n[15]: /en-us/company/digital-transformation/\n[16]: /en-us/company/sustainability/\n[17]: /en-us/company/about/strategy/\n[18]: /en-us/company/about/businesses/\n[19]: /en-us/company/leadership/management/\n[20]: /en-us/company/history-heritage/\n[21]: /en-us/company/compliance/\n[22]: /en-us/company/about/government-affairs/\n[23]: /en-us/company/about/supply-chain-management/\n[24]: /en-us/partners/\n[25]: /en-us/company/about/social-commitments/belonging/\n[26]: /en-us/events/\n[27]: /en-us/company/insights/"
          },
