            "url": "https://siemens.com/contact",
            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n1. [Home][2]\n2. Contact us\n\n# Contacts\n\nConnect quickly by seeing lists of contacts. Or, submit your information and receive a reply.\n\n[Contact us][3]\n\n## Contact us\n\n****\nall\n\n### Press team\n\nContact our press team.\n\n][4]\n****\nall\n\n### Investor relations\n\nContacts for investors\n\n][5]\n****\nall\n\n### Industry analyst relations\n\nContacts for analysts\n\n][6]\n****\nall\n\n### Careers and jobs\n\nJobs at Siemens\n\n][7]\n****\nall\n\n### Consumer products\n\nConsumer products\n\n][8]\n****\nall\n\n### Whistleblowing\n\nWhistleblowing and reporting channels\n\n][9]\n\n## Contact us\n\n#### Siemens Customer Care Center (English or German language)\n\n[+49 89 38035491][10]*\n\n#### Siemens Software (Engineering/PLM/Chip Design/Semiconductor)\n\n[+1 512 2873494][11]*\n\n*Charges vary depending on service provider and country/region\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://www.siemens.com/en-us/\n[3]: /en-us/contact/#6k5BgoQXknmBmRozANZQ1q\n[4]: /en-us/contact/press-contacts/\n[5]: /en-us/company/investor-relations/\n[6]: /en-us/contact/industry-analyst-relations/\n[7]: /en-us/company/jobs/\n[8]: /en-us/content/consumer-products/\n[9]: /en-us/whistleblowing/\n[10]: tel:+498938035491\n[11]: tel:15122873494"
