      "polished_summary": "Trend Micro is a leading cybersecurity company specializing in AI-driven solutions that empower organizations to navigate and thrive in an evolving digital landscape. With a diverse portfolio that includes TrendAI\u2122, TXOne Networks, and VicOne, the company provides comprehensive security for various sectors, including industrial systems, connected vehicles, and personal digital environments. Committed to innovation and corporate social responsibility, Trend Micro aims to eliminate risks and inspire confidence across its global client base.",
