  ][78]\n  [\n  Invoice Management\n  ][79]\n  [\n  Case Management\n  ][80]\n  [\n  Saved Carts\n  ][81]\n  [\n  Address Book\n  ][82]\n  [\n  Legacy myTransactions\n  ][83]\n  [\n  Price Agreement\n  ][84]\n  [\n  Wishlist\n  ][85]\n  [\n  Advanced Search\n  ][86]\n  [\n  Preferred Business Entity\n  ][87]\n  [\n  SIGN OUT\n  ][88]\n* [ ][89]\n  Global\n  * Africa\n    * * [Algeria - English ][90]\n    * * [Egypt - English ][91]\n    * * [Kenya - English ][92]\n    * * [Morocco - English ][93]\n    * * [Nigeria - English ][94]\n    * * [South Africa - English ][95]\n    * * [Tunisia - English ][96]\n  * Asia Pacific\n    * * [Australia - English ][97]\n    * * [China - Chinese ][98]\n    * * [India - English ][99]\n    * * [Indonesia - English ][100]\n    * * [Japan - Japanese][101]\n    * * [Republic of Korea - Korean][102]\n    * * [Malaysia - English ][103]\n    * * [New Zealand - English ][104]\n    * * [Philippines - English ][105]\n    * * [Singapore - English ][106]\n    * * [Thailand - English ][107]\n    * * [Vietnam - English ][108]\n  * Europe\n    * * [Germany - German][109]\n    * * [France - French ][110]\n    * * [Italy - Italian][111]\n    * * [Turkey - English ][112]\n    * * [United Kingdom - English ][113]\n    * * [Netherlands - English ][114]\n    * * [Spain - English ][115]\n  * Latin America\n    * * [Brazil - Portuguese ][116]\n    * * [Mexico - Spanish ][117]\n  * Middle East\n    * * [Egypt - English ][118]\n    * * [Saudi Arabia - English ][119]\n    * * [United Arab Emirates - English ][120]\n  * North America\n    * * [Canada - English ][121]\n      * [Canada - French ][122]\n    * * [United States - English ][123]\n* |\n* [Partners][124]\n* |\nSearch\n\nYou are browsing the product catalog for\n\nYou are viewing the overview and resources for\n\nSearch By\nProducts Part Numbers Product/Part General Content\n/content/sps/au/en/search-results.html\n\n# Every Degree Matters\n\nEnhanced safety, reliability and sustainability across thermal processes and industries are made\neasy with our comprehensive portfolio of thermal solutions.\n\n[\nLearn More\n][125]\n\n# Unlock Superior Performance\n\nIn demanding industrial and transportation environments, precision and durability are required.\nHoneywell MICRO SWITCH NGC Series Miniature Limit Switches offer a cutting-edge solution for\napplications where space is tight, conditions are extreme, and reliability is critical.\n\n[\nLearn more\n][126]\nPrevious Next\n\n\n\n**Contact an expert now**\n\nFrom digitalization to optimization with AI, Honeywell uses automation to meet you where you are now\nandhelp you go further.\n\n[ Contact Us ][127]\n\n\n**Get started with myAutomation**\n\nWe're making it easier for you to shop and search for products, manage your orders, and request\ndigital support for your Integrated Journey.\n\n[ Join us ][128]\n\n### Discover Our Latest Industrial Automation Solutions\n\n\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\nDiscover our comprehensive range of industrial automation solutions designed to optimize efficiency,\nenhance precision, and drive productivity.\n\n[\n][129]\n[\n][130]\n\n**CURRENT SENSORS**\n\n##### [**CSSV1500 Series**][131]\n\nCurrent measurement for battery management systems in electrified vehicles.\n\n[\n][132]\n[\n][133]\n\n**MOBILE COMPUTER**\n\n##### [**CT70**][134]\n\nUltra-rugged, ultra-reliable, 5G connected device for enterprise customers that need a future-ready\ndevice.\n\n[\n][135]\n[\n][136]\n\n**MULTI-GAS**\n\n##### [**OmniPoint**][137]**\n##### **\n\nThe OmniPoint\u2122 transmitter is a comprehensive gas detection solution for\u00a0hazardous locations.\n\n[\n][138]\n[\n][139]\n\n**REMOTE TERMINAL UNITS**\n\n##### [**ControlEdge\u2122 RTU**][140]\n\nA powerful, modular and scalable controller capable of all remote automation and control\napplications.\n\n[\n][141]\n[\n][142]\n\n**ELECTRICITY**\n\n##### [**A4CI**][143]\n\nDelivering real-time data insights and edge intelligence for today\u2019s metering needs.\n\n[\n][144]\n[\n][145]\n\n**SINGLE BURNERS**\n\n##### [**ThermAir**][146]\n\nIdeal on heaters, textile ovens and in situations where the fuel is highly variable.\n\n### Leading the Way in Digitalization\n\n\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\nTechnology is evolving and changing at a faster pace. As a thought leader in the industry, let\nHoneywell Industrial Automation be your partner in your digitalization journey.\n\n[ [CSSV1500 Series] ][147]\n[ [CSSV1500 Series] ][148]\n\n**Electrification**\n\n\nAchieve your decarbonization goals with energy management solutions and innovative technologies.\n\n[ [CSSV1500 Series] ][149]\n[ [CSSV1500 Series] ][150]\n\n[**Integrated Health, Safety & Security**][151]\n\nSecure your data and operations with cybersecurity solutions that will ensure your business\ncontinuity plans.\n\n[ [CSSV1500 Series] ][152]\n[ [CSSV1500 Series] ][153]\n\n**Intelligent\nOperations**\n\nDiscover our best in class technology to support your digitalization goals and improve safety,\nreliability, and efficiency.\n\n[ [CSSV1500 Series] ][154]\n[ [CSSV1500 Series] ][155]\n\n[**Digital Workforce & Supply Chain**][156]\n\nEmbrace digital technology to redefine your supply chain from manual labor to dynamic, cutting-edge\nsolutions.\n\n### Explore Our Offerings By Industry\n\n\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\nHoneywell Industrial Automation has a complete portfolio of products, software, solutions, and\nservices to support your needs. As experts in automation and digitalization, we want to partner with\nyou to help you achieve your business goals.\n* [Aerospace][157]\n* [Commercial Buildings][158]\n* [Energy][159]\n* [Government and Public Sector][160]\n* [Healthcare][161]\n* [Life Sciences][162]\n* [Manufacturing][163]\n* [Logistics and Warehouses][164]\n* [Retail][165]\n* [Utilities][166]\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Aerospace**\n\n\nWe create safer, healthier, more comfortable and sustainable air travel with one of the industry\u2019s\nbroadest and most innovative offering portfolios.\n\n[ Learn more ][167]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Commercial Buildings\n**\n\nSafety from the ground up. Equipment failure is never an option especially on high-risk work sites.\n\n\n[ Learn more ][168]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Energy\n**\n\nWe have the engineering expertise, sustainability commitment and solutions to help you drive a more\nsustainable future.\n\n[ Learn more ][169]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Government and Public Sector**\n\n\nWe have been helping government and public sector entities for over 30 years, from military\ndeployment operations to on-going support for public services.\n\n[ learn more ][170]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Healthcare\n**\n\nWe have the technologies to help both healthcare providers and medical equipment manufacturers shape\nthe future of their organizations.\n\n[ learn more ][171]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Life Sciences**\n\n\nWe support life sciences with tools for biotechnology and medical devices, enhancing product\nquality, safety, and compliance in healthcare.\n\n[ learn more ][172]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Manufacturing\n**\n\nOur focus is on ensuring a safe working environment, achieving stable production levels, adhering to\nquality standards, and reducing energy consumption.\n\n[ learn more ][173]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Logistics and Warehouses**\n\n\nFrom mobility devices to facility management software and warehouse execution systems, we\u2019re ready\nto help you create a safer, more productive workplace.\n\n[ learn more ][174]\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Retail\n**\n\nFrom the storefront to the distribution center and across the supply chain, our retail solutions\nbring together people, assets, and merchandise in powerful new ways.\n\n[ learn more ][175]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Utilities\n**\n\nWe have a diverse set of solutions that address the needs of utilities across each area of the\nutility value chain.\n\n\n[ learn more ][176]\n\n\n\n\nAerospace\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Aerospace**\n\n\nWe create safer, healthier, more comfortable and sustainable air travel with one of the industry\u2019s\nbroadest and most innovative offering portfolios.\n\n[ Learn more ][177]\n\n\n\n\nCommercial Buildings\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Commercial Buildings\n**\n\nSafety from the ground up. Equipment failure is never an option especially on high-risk work sites.\n\n\n[ Learn more ][178]\n\n\n\n\nEnergy\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Energy\n**\n\nWe have the engineering expertise, sustainability commitment and solutions to help you drive a more\nsustainable future.\n\n[ Learn more ][179]\n\n\n\n\nGovernment and Public Sector\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Government and Public Sector**\n\n\nWe have been helping government and public sector entities for over 30 years, from military\ndeployment operations to on-going support for public services.\n\n[ learn more ][180]\n\n\n\n\nHealthcare\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Healthcare\n**\n\nWe have the technologies to help both healthcare providers and medical equipment manufacturers shape\nthe future of their organizations.\n\n[ learn more ][181]\n\n\n\n\nLife Sciences\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Life Sciences**\n\n\nWe support life sciences with tools for biotechnology and medical devices, enhancing product\nqualit"
