* [\n  \n  NI SystemLink\n  \n  ][94]\n* [\n  \n  Academic & Research\n  \n  ][95]\n* [\n  \n  Aerospace & Defense\n  \n  ][96]\n* [\n  \n  Automotive & Transportation\n  \n  ][97]\n* [\n  \n  Chemical\n  \n  ][98]\n* [\n  \n  Data Centers\n  \n  ][99]\n* [\n  \n  Electronics & Semiconductors\n  \n  ][100]\n* [\n  \n  Factory Automation\n  \n  ][101]\n* [\n  \n  Food & Beverage\n  \n  ][102]\n* [\n  \n  Life Sciences\n  \n  ][103]\n* [\n  \n  Marine\n  \n  ][104]\n* [\n  \n  Mining\n  \n  ][105]\n* [\n  \n  Oil & Gas\n  \n  ][106]\n* [\n  \n  Packaging\n  \n  ][107]\n* [\n  \n  Power\n  \n  ][108]\n* [\n  \n  Pulp & Paper\n  \n  ][109]\n* [\n  \n  Water & Wastewater\n  \n  ][110]\n* [\n  \n  Contact Us\n  \n  ][111]\n* [\n  \n  Education Services & Training\n  \n  ][112]\n* [\n  \n  Lifecycle Services\n  \n  ][113]\n* [\n  \n  MyTraining\n  \n  ][114]\n* [\n  \n  Security Notifications\n  \n  ][115]\n* [\n  \n  Software & Drivers\n  \n  ][116]\n* [\n  \n  Project Services\n  \n  ][117]\n\n[\n\nAbout Us\n\n][118][\n\nCareers\n\n][119][\n\nExpertise\n\n][120][\n\nInvestors\n\n][121][\n\nNews & Events\n\n][122][\n\nSustainability\n\n][123]\n* [\n  \n  Awards & Recognition\n  \n  ][124]\n* [\n  \n  History\n  \n  ][125]\n* [\n  \n  Integrity & Ethics\n  \n  ][126]\n* [\n  \n  Leadership\n  \n  ][127]\n* [\n  \n  Our Brands\n  \n  ][128]\n* [\n  \n  Our Purpose, Causes & Values\n  \n  ][129]\n* [\n  \n  Ventures\n  \n  ][130]\n* [\n  \n  Explore All Opportunities\n  \n  ][131]\n* [\n  \n  Life at Emerson\n  \n  ][132]\n* [\n  \n  Students & Graduate Opportunities\n  \n  ][133]\n* [\n  \n  Boundless Automation\n  \n  ][134]\n* [\n  \n  Cybersecurity\n  \n  ][135]\n* [\n  \n  Hydrogen Value Chain\n  \n  ][136]\n* [\n  \n  Industrial Sustainability\n  \n  ][137]\n* [\n  \n  Lithium Value Chain\n  \n  ][138]\n* [\n  \n  Operational Excellence\n  \n  ][139]\n* [\n  \n  Original Equipment Manufacturer (OEM)\n  \n  ][140]\n* [\n  \n  Events & Presentations\n  \n  ][141]\n* [\n  \n  Financial News\n  \n  ][142]\n* [\n  \n  Financials\n  \n  ][143]\n[ Email Alerts][144]\n* [\n  \n  Resources\n  \n  ][145]\n* [\n  \n  Stock Info\n  \n  ][146]\n[ Information Request][147]\n* [\n  \n  Emerson Exchange\n  \n  ][148]\n* [\n  \n  Innovation Stories\n  \n  ][149]\n* [\n  \n  Media Resources\n  \n  ][150]\n* [\n  \n  Newsroom\n  \n  ][151]\n* [\n  \n  Integrity & Responsible Sourcing\n  \n  ][152]\n* [\n  \n  Our People\n  \n  ][153]\n* [\n  \n  Planet\n  \n  ][154]\n[\n[Contact Us]\n\nContact Us\n\n][155]\n[\n[Our Brands]\n\nOur Brands\n\n][156]\nYour browser does not support the video tag.\n\n# Automation Solutions for High-Stakes Operations\n\nEmerson\u2019s automation solutions help you unlock critical data, optimize your existing systems and\nprotect the investments you\u2019ve already made.\n\n## Emerson's Automation Solutions Optimize Performance\n\nEmerson empowers you to modernize business operations at your pace, drive optimal performance and\ndeliver long-term operational excellence.\n\n[icon]\n\n##### Unrivaled Industrial Software\n\nFrom control systems to industrial software, our advanced automation solutions power connected\noperations and improve performance where it matters most.\n\n[icon]\n\n##### Global Support Network\n\nEmerson\u2019s global support and local experts offer deep market knowledge that minimizes business\ndisruption and keeps industrial operations running.\u00a0\n\n[icon]\n\n##### Proven Industry Expertise\n\nEmerson brings decades of technical expertise and industry insight to solve the world\u2019s most complex\noperational challenges.\n\n[icon]\n\n##### Legacy of Innovations\n\nBuilt on 135+ years of innovation, Emerson technologies and solutions are shaping the future of\nindustrial automation.\n\n## Our Industrial Technology\n\nEmerson\u2019s automation software and sustainable solutions empower enterprise-wide performance and\nefficiency.\u00a0\n\n[\n[Automation Systems]\n\n##### Automation Systems\n\nAdvanced systems, software, analytics and industrial AI solutions harness data to boost business\nperformance.\n\nExplore Automation Systems\n][157]\n[\n[Discrete Automation]\n\n##### Discrete Automation\n\nIndustrial and factory technologies provide automation and software to enhance performance,\nproductivity and sustainability.\n\nExplore Discrete Automation\n][158]\n[\n[Final Control]\n\n##### Final Control\n\nValves, digital valve controllers, actuators, regulators and software to help industries excel in\nthe most demanding conditions.\n\nExplore Final Control\n][159]\n[\n[Measurement Instrumentation]\n\n##### Measurement Instrumentation\n\nSecure, wireless measurement and analytical instrumentation that provides real-time, reliable data\nfor the world\u2019s most essential applications.\n\nExplore Measurement Instrumentation\n][160]\n[\n[Test & Measurement]\n\n##### Test & Measurement\n\nUnlock insights, reduce complexity and drive innovation with our AI-powered, integrated hardware and\nsoftware test platform.\n\nExplore Test & Measurement\n][161]\n[\n[Safety & Productivity]\n\n##### Safety & Productivity\n\nEmpowering mechanical, electrical and plumbing pros with reliable tools, connected equipment and\nsoftware technologies.\n\nExplore Safety & Productivity\n][162]\n\n## Serving Essential Industries\n\nAs an industrial automation leader, Emerson provides technologies and software for mission-critical\nsectors, driving innovation, safety and economic resilience. Emerson is proud to serve these\nindustries whose products and services make up the backbone of the global economy.\n\n## \u00a0\n\n[Learn More][163]\nPOWER\n\n##### Powering a Resilient and Sustainable Future\n\nEmerson applies automation technologies, software and expertise to help utilities excel in today\u2019s\ncomplex energy environment.\n\nLIQUIFIED NATURAL GAS\nLIFE SCIENCES\nCHEMICAL\nMINING\n\n**FEATURED EMERSON INSIGHTS**\n\n## Navigating Today\u2019s Industrial Landscape\n\n[\n[Peter Zornio: Four Foundations for the Data-Driven AI Era]\nEXECUTIVE SPOTLIGHT\n\n##### Peter Zornio: Four Foundations for the Data-Driven AI Era\n\nIndustrial automation is undergoing transformation as manufacturers prioritize data analytics and AI\nto drive operational excellence. Four foundational pillars \u2013 software-defined automation, industrial\ndata fabrics, advanced analytics and intrinsic cybersecurity \u2013 are critical for unlocking business\nvalue and competitive advantage in the modern manufacturing landscape.\n\nRead More\n][164]\n[\n[Fallback image]\nAUTOMATION IN ACTION\n\n##### Chevron Boosts Refinery Performance with Emerson and Microsoft Cloud Solution\n\nRead More\n][165]\n[\n[Scalable Transformation]\nINNOVATION\n\n##### Emerson Introduces NI Nigel AI Advisor\n\nWatch Webinar\n][166]\n[\n[Fallback image]\nPERSPECTIVES\n\n##### Advancing Life Sciences with Automation: The Key to Faster, Safer and More Sustainable Drug\n##### Delivery\n\nRead More\n][167]\n[Our global organization of problem-solvers is guided by a singular Purpose: We drive innovation\nthat makes the world healthier, safer, smarter and more sustainable.]\n\n## Explore Emerson\n\nTake a closer look at our work and why we do it.\n\n### What Makes Us Emerson\n\nWe build advanced automation that runs the world, but our people and purpose set us apart.\n\n[Get to Know Us][168]\n\n### Where Careers Have Real Impact\n\nWe\u2019re makers, thinkers and doers \u2013 solving real problems in the industries that keep the world\nrunning.\n\n[Join Our Team][169]\n\n### Emerson in the News\n\nFrom industry breakthroughs to company milestones, explore the latest news shaping Emerson and the\nnext era of industrial automation.\n\n[See Our Latest News][170]\n[Fallback image]\nGlobal automation leader engineering the autonomous future.\n\nGo Boldly.\u2122\n\nCONNECT WITH US\n[\n[Fallback image]\n][171][\n[Fallback image]\n][172][\n[Fallback image]\n][173][\n[Fallback image]\n][174]\n* Company\n* [About Us][175]\n* [Company History][176]\n* [Our Purpose][177]\n* [Awards & Recognition][178]\n* [Leadership][179]\n* [Investors][180]\n* [Sustainability][181]\n* [Contact Us][182]\n* News and Events\n* [Newsroom][183]\n* [Innovation Stories][184]\n* [Automation Experts Blog][185]\n* [Emerson Exchange][186]\n* Careers\n* [Emerson Careers][187]\n* [Job Search][188]\n* [Student & Graduate Opportunities][189]\n* Our Business\n* [Automation Systems][190]\n* [Discrete Automation][191]\n* [Final Control][192]\n* [Measurement Instrumentation][193]\n* [Test & Measurement][194]\n\nEmerson.\u00a0Go Boldly.\u2122\n\n\u00a92026\u00a0\n\nEmerson Electric Co. All rights reserved.\n\n[Privacy Notice][195]|[Cookies][196]|[Terms of\nUse][197]|[Imprint][198]|[Accessibility][199]|[Communication Preferences][200]|[Report a\nVulnerability][201]|[Do Not Sell My Personal Information][202]|[Transparency In Governance Machine\nReadable Files][203]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: /en/corporate\n[3]: /en/corporate/contact-us\n[4]: /en/automation-systems\n[5]: https://discreteautomation.emerson.com/\n[6]: /en/final-control\n[7]: /en/measurement-instrumentation\n[8]: /en/corporate/"
          }
