        "crawl_text": "[Zero-Day Summer: The Mythos Fallout and the Era of Autonomous Attacks \u2014 Watch Now][1]\n[\n][2]\nPlatform\n\nplatform\n\n[\nImmersive One Platform\n][3][\nProve Cyber Resilience\n][4][\nImproving Cyber Readiness\n][5][\nReporting Cyber Readiness\n][6][\nPrograms\n][7]\n\nCapabilities\n\n[\nHands-On Labs\n][8][\nApplication Security Training\n][9][\nCyber Crisis Simulation\n][10][\nResilience Score & Reporting\n][11][\nCyber Range Exercise\n][12]\n[\nCyber Drills\n][13][\nWorkforce Exercises\n][14][\nCyber Ranges\n][15][\nDynamic Threat Range\n][16]\nWant to try our platform? \u2014\n[\nRequest a Demo\n][17]\n[\nExplore the AI Hub\n][18]\nSolutions\n\nby role\n\n[\nOperational Technology\n][19][\nSecure Your SDLC\n][20][\nFinancial Services\n][21][\nRed Team Training\n][22]\n[\nBlue Team Training\n][23][\nFor All Employees\n][24][\nFor Developers\n][25][\nAI Hands-On Labs\n][26]\n\nby use case\n\n[\nCompliance\n][27][\nUpskilling Teams\n][28][\nImproving Cyber Resilience\n][29][\nAI Hub\n][30][\nPartnerships\n][31][\nTech Partners & Integrations\n][32]\nWant to try our platform? \u2014\n[\nRequest a Demo\n][33]\n[\n[MITRE ATT&CK framework table showing stages with color-coded cyberattack techniques and coverage\nkey.]\nExplore the Platform\n][34]\nResources\n\nTHOUGHT LEADERSHIP\n\n[\nBlogs\n][35][\nWebinars\n][36][\nEvents\n][37][\neBooks & Reports\n][38][\nCase Study\n][39][\nThe Resilience Room\n][40][\nAll Resources\n][41]\n\nSupport & Community\n\n[\nCommunity\n][42][\nCyber Million\n][43][\nHelp Centre\n][44][\nNews Room\n][45][\nContact Us\n][46][\nLegal & Compliance\n][47]\n\nTechnical Resources\n\n[\nData Sheets\n][48][\nGlossary\n][49][\nBattle Threat Cards\n][50][\nCybersecurity Essentials\n][51]\nWant to try our platform? \u2014\n[\nRequest a Demo\n][52]\nCompany\n\nabout us\n\n[\nOur Story\n][53][\nLeadership & Investors\n][54][\nCareers\n][55]\n[\nAwards & Accolades\n][56][\nCyber Million\n][57]\nWant to try our platform? \u2014\n[\nRequest a Demo\n][58]\nBlogs\n[\nImmersive Blogs\nThe latest news, insights form the world of cyber resilience.\n][59]\n[\nContainer 7\nFor technical research, threat intelligence, and expert-led insight.\n][60]\n[\nWhat\u2019s New\nFor the latest platform releases, insights and seminars.\n][61]\n[\nBattle Threat Cards\nUnlike most trading cards, these threats are real.\n][62]\nWant to try our platform? \u2014\n[\nRequest a Demo\n][63]\nSearch\nWhat are you looking for?\n[\n\nImmersive One\n\n][64][\n\nAppSec\n\n][65][\n\nHands-On Labs\n\n][66][\n\nCyber Drills\n\n][67]\n[Request a Demo][68][Sign In][69]\n[\n][70]\nWhat are you looking for?\n[\n\nImmersive One\n\n][71][\n\nAppSec\n\n][72][\n\nHands-On Labs\n\n][73][\n\nCyber Drills\n\n][74]\n[Sign In][75][Request a Demo][76]\n\n# Prove your business can move at AI speed.\n\nImmersive is the cyber proving ground for the AI enterprise. We help organizations prove their\npeople, AI agents and leadership decisions are ready for a world where AI is used inside the\nbusiness \u2014 and against it.\n\n[\nExplore AI at Immersive\n][77][Request a Demo][78]\nWave Leader 2026\n[\nReport\n\n### Immersive Named a Leader - The Forrester Wave\u2122 2026\n\nRead the Report\n][79]\n[\nWhats new blog\n\n### Goal-Aligned Resilience Pathways: The Fastest Path to Provable Cyber Readiness\n\nLearn More\n][80]\n[\ntei report\n\n### The Forrester Total Economic Impact for Immersive One\n\nLearn More\n][81]\n\n## Prove the capabilities behind AI transformation with our Immersive Labs.\n\nStart with hands-on scenarios that show where people, teams and agents are ready, and where the\nbusiness needs evidence before AI risk reaches the boardroom.\n\n[\n45 mins\n\n### AI: Prompt Injection\n### Attacks\n\nTry Lab\n][82]\n[\n30 mins\n\n### Threat Actors:\n### Salt Typhoon\n\nTry Lab\n][83]\n[\n20 mins\n\n### Introduction to Incident\n### Response: Ep.5\n\nTry Lab\n][84]\n[\n20 mins\n\n### CTI First Principles:\n### Ep.4\n\nTry Lab\n][85]\