      "polished_summary": "Johnson Controls is a global leader in building technology and energy solutions, specializing in HVAC equipment, building automation, fire suppression, and security systems. The company offers a diverse range of products and services under well-known brands such as YORK, Tyco, and Metasys, targeting various markets including commercial, industrial, and residential sectors worldwide. With a commitment to sustainability and innovation, Johnson Controls aims to enhance the efficiency and safety of buildings while improving occupant comfort.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Johnson Controls manufactures and develops security systems and building automation solutions, which are integral to Cyber-Physical Systems Security. Their offerings include specialized products for security and fire detection, making them a relevant participant in this market.",
