icons-navigation-l]\n  \n  #### [Our story][69]\n  \n  [Read about Secomea][70]\n  \n  [career-icon]\n  \n  #### [Working at Secomea][71]\n  \n  [Explore our open positions][72]\n  \n  [icon]\n  \n  #### [Contact us][73]\n  \n  [Get help or connect with us][74]\n* Mobile\n  Close Mobile Open Mobile\n  [ Book a meeting ][75]\n  [ Sign in ][76]\n[EN][77]\nEN\n[ DE ][78] [ FR ][79] [ IT ][80]\n[ Book a demo ][81]\n\n# Secure Remote Access built for OT. Approved by IT.\n\nProtect your operational environment and cut downtime with Secomea \u2013 the trusted platform for secure\nand effortless collaboration between manufacturers and machine vendors.\n\n[ Watch a demo ][82]\nHow we help you\n\n## Made for OT. Trusted by IT.\n\n### Plug-and-play, ready to scale. Quick to deploy and easy to manage, with minimal lift from IT.\n\nConnect to any ICS equipment (PLC, HMI, SCADA, DCS), manage user access, and control remote sessions\nin real time.\n\n### Simplify remote access management, achieve\n### global oversight, and maintain local control.\n\nBased on Zero Trust principles and IEC 62443-certified, Secomea is custom-made to protect industrial\nsystems and networks.\n\n### The all-in-one solution to remotely access, monitor, and protect your operational environments\n\nSecomea includes all the softw [EN][1]\nEN\n[ DE ][2] [ FR ][3] [ IT ][4]\n* Platform\n  Close Platform Open Platform\n  \n  ### [PLATFORM][5]\n  \n  [icon]\n  \n  #### [Secomea Prime][6]\n  \n  [Your all-in-one Secure Remote Access solution for OT][7]\n  \n  ### PRODUCT DEMO\n  \n  [**Secomea Product Demo**][8]\n  \n  [See how easy Secure Remote Access can be \u2013 whenever it suits you.][9]\n  \n  [ Watch on demand ][10]\n  \n  ### Access\n  \n  [icon]\n  \n  #### [Remote access][11]\n  \n  [Access OT assets from any place, with any device][12]\n  \n  [icon]\n  \n  #### [On the factory floor][13]\n  \n  [Connect your operational environments seamlessly][14]\n  \n  #### [Gateways & accessories][15]\n  \n  [Ha