            "text": "Skip to main content\n][1]\n* PRODUCTS\nAgentic SOC Platform Overview\nUnifies threat intelligence, security data, and agentic AI into a single platform, enabling SOC\nand CTI teams to collaborate seamlessly. Teams gain context and AI-guided workflows to detect\nhidden threats, prioritize high-risk incidents, and respond faster.\n[Agentic SOC Platform Overview][2]\nAgentic SOC Platform Overview\nProducts\n* Unified Security Data Lake\nComplete visibility, AI-guided insights, and unified workflows to detect, investigate, and\nrespond at machine speed.\n[Unified Security Data Lake][3]\nUnified Security Data Lake\n* ThreatStream Next-Gen\nThe industry\u2019s leading threat intelligence platform (TIP) that provides curated access to the\nworld\u2019s largest repository of curated threat intelligence.\n[ThreatStream Next-Gen][4]\nThreatStream Next-Gen\n* Agentic AI\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[Agentic AI][5]\nAgentic AI\nUse Cases\n* Compliance\nAll-in-one ETL, SIEM, XDR, UEBA, and SOAR for blazing fast threat detection, investigation, and\nresponse.\n[Compliance][6]\nCompliance\n* Threat Detection\nThe industry\u2019s leading threat intelligence platform (TIP) that provides curated access to the\nworld\u2019s largest repository of curated threat intelligence.\n[Threat Detection][7]\nThreat Detection\n* Investigation and Response\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[Investigation and Response][8]\nInvestigation and Response\n* Threat Hunting\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[Threat Hunting][9]\nThreat Hunting\n* Threat Analysis\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[Threat Analysis][10]\nThreat Analysis\n* Intelligence Distribution\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[Intelligence Distribution][11]\nIntelligence Distribution\nCapabilities\n* Threat Intelligence (TIP)\nAll-in-one ETL, SIEM, XDR, UEBA, and SOAR for blazing fast threat detection, investigation, and\nresponse.\n[Threat Intelligence (TIP)][12]\nThreat Intelligence (TIP)\n* SIEM\nThe industry\u2019s leading threat intelligence platform (TIP) that provides curated access to the\nworld\u2019s largest repository of curated threat intelligence.\n[SIEM][13]\nSIEM\n* Agentic AI\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[Agentic AI][14]\nAgentic AI\n* SOAR\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[SOAR][15]\nSOAR\n* XDR\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[XDR][16]\nXDR\n* USE CASES\nUnified Security Data lake\n* Compliance\nAll-in-one ETL, SIEM, XDR, UEBA, and SOAR for blazing fast threat detection, investigation, and\nresponse.\n[Compliance][17]\nCompliance\n* Threat Detection\nThe industry\u2019s leading threat intelligence platform (TIP) that provides curated access to the\nworld\u2019s largest repository of curated threat intelligence.\n[Threat Detection][18]\nThreat Detection\n* Investigation and Response\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[Investigation and Response][19]\nInvestigation and Response\n* Threat Hunting\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[Threat Hunting][20]\nThreat Hunting\nThreatStream Next-Gen\n* Threat Detection\nThe industry\u2019s leading threat intelligence platform (TIP) that provides curated access to the\nworld\u2019s largest repository of curated threat intelligence.\n[Threat Detection][21]\nThreat Detection\n* Investigation and Response\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[Investigation and Response][22]\nInvestigation and Response\n* Threat Hunting\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[Threat Hunting][23]\nThreat Hunting\n* Threat Analysis\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[Threat Analysis][24]\nThreat Analysis\n* Intelligence Distribution\nAdvanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\nthreats in their tracks.\n[Intelligence Distribution][25]\nIntelligence Distribution\nAgentic AI\n* Reason and Act\nAll-in-one ETL, SIEM, XDR, UEBA, and SOAR for blazing fast threat detection, investigation, and\nresponse.\n[Reason and Act][26]\nReason and Act\n* Model Context Protocol\nThe industry\u2019s leading threat intelligence platform (TIP) that provides curated access to the\nworld\u2019s largest repository of curated threat intelligence.\n[Model Context Protocol][27]\nModel Context Protocol\n* Marketplace\nThe Anomali Marketplace\nA unique cybersecurity marketplace providing instant access to a growing catalog of threat\nintelligence providers, integration partners, and threat analysis tools.\n[The Anomali Marketplace][28]\nThe Anomali Marketplace\n* Threat Intelligence Feeds\nTrial and purchase threat intelligence feeds from Anomali partners \u2013 find the right intelligence\nfor your organization, industry, geography, and more.\n[Threat Intelligence Feeds][29]\nThreat Intelligence Feeds\n* Threat Analysis Tools and Enrichments\nGain the tools to pivot quickly from one piece of information to look up other sources of data\nto get a complete picture of a threat \u2013 all one click away.\n[Threat Analysis Tools and Enrichments][30]\nThreat Analysis Tools and Enrichments\n* Security System Partners\nTrial and purchase threat intelligence feeds from Anomali partners \u2013 find the right intelligence\nfor your organization, industry, geography, and more.\n[Security System Partners][31]\nSecurity System Partners\n* SDKs\nGain the tools to pivot quickly from one piece of information to look up other sources of data\nto get a complete picture of a threat \u2013 all one click away.\n[SDKs][32]\nSDKs\n* RESOURCES\nExplore Resources\nDive into the latest cybersecurity and threat intelligence news, tips, and insights through our\nlibrary of articles, webinars, datasheets, industry reports, case studies, and more.\n[Explore Resources][33]\nExplore Resources\nGlobal InfoSec Awards\nAnomali scores triple win for SIEM, SecOps, and TIP\nSIEM Optimization\nOptimize SIEM with an intelligence-native approach built for speed, scale, and action.\nSTAXX\nYour free STIX/TAXII solution\nExplore\n* Blog\nTrial and purchase threat intelligence feeds from Anomali partners \u2013 find the right intelligence\nfor your organization, industry, geography, and more.\n[Blog][34]\nBlog\n* Case Studies\nTrial and purchase threat intelligence feeds from Anomali partners \u2013 find the right intelligence\nfor your organization, industry, geography, and more.\n[Case Studies][35]\nCase Studies\n* Glossary\nTrial and purchase threat intelligence feeds from Anomali partners \u2013 find the right intelligence\nfor your organization, industry, geography, and more.\n[Glossary][36]\nGlossary\nEngage\n* Webinars\nTrial and purchase threat intelligence feeds from Anomali partners \u2013 find the right intelligence\nfor your organization, industry, geography, and more.\n[Webinars][37]\nWebinars\n* Events\nTrial and purchase threat intelligence feeds from Anomali partners \u2013 find the right intelligence\nfor your organization, industry, geography, and 