      "polished_summary": "Belden is a leading provider of high-performance networking and connectivity solutions, specializing in a diverse range of products including cables, audio systems, and fiber optics. The company serves various industries such as automotive manufacturing, healthcare, energy, and broadcasting, offering innovative solutions that enhance network visibility, resilience, and interoperability. With a focus on digital transformation, Belden's expertise supports organizations in achieving IT/OT convergence and optimizing their operational capabilities.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Belden manufactures and provides high-performance networking and connectivity solutions, including cables and systems that are essential for Cyber-Physical Systems Security. Their focus on IT/OT convergence and network resilience aligns with the security needs of cyber-physical systems.",
