      "company_summary": "Convergint is a global service-based organization specializing in the design, installation, and servicing of integrated security systems and technology solutions across various industries. The company offers a comprehensive range of products, including access control, video surveillance, intrusion detection, and fire safety systems, along with consulting, installation, and maintenance services tailored to enhance security programs for organizations of all sizes. With a commitment to protecting people, the planet, and purpose, Convergint serves clients seeking innovative and reliable security solutions.",
