lex Multisite Operations\n\n[ August 9, 2024April 29, 2026 ][144]\n\nby [Green Line Creative][145]\n\n[Illustration of multiple pins connecting different locations in a city]\n\nGlobal and enterprise accounts require consistent delivery to ensure the safety and security of all\nfacilities. Convergint leverages a programmatic approach for implementing scalable, sustainable\nsolutions. Program governance facilitates successful standardization for complex, multisite\nengagements.\n\n[Infographic representing governance for multisite engagements]\n\n[Download Infographic in Greater Detail][146]\n\n### Contact Us\n\nContact Convergint today to discover how their program management can enhance global and enterprise\noperations\u2019 safety, security, and efficiency.\n\n[Contact Us][147]\n\nPosted in [Services][148]\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][149]\n\n**Explore**\n\n[Who we are][150]\n[What we do][151]\n[Who we serve][152]\n[How we do it][153]\n[Where we operate][154]\n\n[ ][155] [ ][156] [ ][157] [ ][158] [ ][159]\n\n[Careers][160]\n[Contact][161]\n[Locations][162]\n\n[News & Insights][163]\n[Our Values & Beliefs][164]\n\n[iCare Standard Customer Portal][165]\n[iCare Federal Customer Portal][166]\n[Pay Your Invoice][167]\n\n[Terms of Use][168]\n[Privacy][169]\n[Cookie Policy][170]\n[Online Reporting][171]\n[Compliance][172]\n[Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][173]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Convergint Technologies LLC, All Rights Reserved. Convergint\u00ae and the stylized \u2018i\u2019 are\nregistered trademarks of Convergint in the U.S. and abroad.\nOklahoma Alarm Locksmith License #AC1750\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][174]\n\n**Explore**\n\n[Who we are][175]\n[What we do][176]\n[Who we serve][177]\n[How we do it][178]\n[Where we operate][179]\n\n[ ][180] [ ][181] [ ][182] [ ][183] [ ][184]\n\n[Careers][185]\n[Contact][186]\n[Locations][187]\n\n[News & Insights][188]\n[Our Values & Beliefs][189]\n\n[iCare Standard Customer Portal][190]\n[Pay Your Invoice][191]\n\n[Terms of Use][192