            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\n[Careers][2] [Contact][3]\n\n[Careers][4] [Contact][5]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][6] [Contact][7]\n\n[Karriere][8] [Kontakte][9]\n\n[Careers][10] [Contact][11]\n\n[Urat][12] [Yhteystiedot][13]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][14] [Contact][15]\n\n[Karriere][16] [Kontakt][17]\n\n[Careers][18] [Contact][19]\n\n[Careers][20] [Contact][21]\n\n[Karriere][22] [Kontakt][23]\n\n[Kariera][24] [Kontakt][25]\n\n[Cariere][26] [Contact][27]\n\n[Carreras][28] [Contacto][29]\n\n[Karri\u00e4rer][30] [Kontakta][31]\n\n[Karriere][32] [Kontakt][33]\n\n[Careers][34] [Contact][35]\n\n[Carreras][36] [Contacto][37]\n\n[Carreiras][38] [Contato][39]\n\n[Carreras][40] [Contacto][41]\n\n[Carreras][42] [Contacto][43]\n\n[Carreras][44] [Contacto][45]\n\n[Carreras][46] [Contacto][47]\n\n[Carreras][48] [Contacto][49]\n\n[Carreras][50] [Contacto][51]\n\n[Careers][52] [Contact][53]\n\n[\u0627\u0644\u0648\u0638\u0627\u0626\u0641][54] [\u0627\u062a\u0635\u0627\u0644][55]\n\n[Careers][56] [Contact][57]\n\n[Careers][58] [Contact][59]\n\n[Careers][60] [Contact][61]\n\n[\u0e2d\u0e32\u0e0a\u0e35\u0e1e][62] [\u0e15\u0e34\u0e14\u0e15\u0e48\u0e2d][63]\n\n[\u8077\u6daf\u767c\u5c55][64] [\u63a5\u89f8][65]\n\n[Careers][66] [Contact][67]\n\n[Careers][68] [Contact][69]\n\n[S\u1ef1 nghi\u1ec7p][70] [Li\u00ean h\u1ec7][71]\n\n[Karier][72] [Kontak][73]\n\n[Kerjaya][74] [Kenalan][75]\n\n[Mga Karera][76] [Makipag-ugnayan][77]\n\n[\u30ad\u30e3\u30ea\u30a2][78] [\u63a5\u89e6][79]\n\n[\uacbd\ub825][80] [\uc5f0\ub77d\ud558\ub2e4][81]\n\n[Careers][82] [Contact][83]\n\n[ Home[convergint logo]][84]\n][85]\n* [Who we are][86]\n* [History][87]\n* Leadership\n* [Executive Leadership][88]\n* [Board of Managers][89]\n* [Culture Committee][90]\n* [Company news][91]\n* [Why we do it][92]\n* [Social responsibility][93]\n* [Step Up for Schools][94]\n* [Sustainability][95]\n* [Acquisitions][96]\n* [What we do][97]\n* [Systems][98]\n* [Access Control][99]\n* [Video Surveillance][100]\n* [Intrusion Detection Systems][101]\n* [Fire & Life Safety Systems][102]\n* [Communications][103]\n* [Advanced Threat Detection][104]\n* [Security Operations Centers][105]\n* [Physical Security][106]\n* [Services][107]\n* [Consulting & Advisory][108]\n* [Assessments & Site Surveys][109]\n* [Engineering & Estimating][110]\n* [Installation & Integration][111]\n* [Project & Program Management][112]\n* [Professional Services][113]\n* [Remote Services][114]\n* [Maintenance][115]\n* [Who we serve][116]\n* [Industries][117]\n* [Aviation / Transportation][118]\n* [Data Centers][119]\n* [Government / Public Sector][120]\n* [Critical Infrastructure][121]\n* [Utilities][122]\n* [Medical / Hospital / Healthcare][123]\n* [Biopharmaceutical / Laboratory / Research][124]\n* [Education][125]\n* [Financial Institutions][126]\n* [Corporate Enterprise][127]\n* [Real Estate][128]\n* [Hospitality / Entertainment][129]\n* [Manufacturing][130]\n* [Retail][131]\n* [Customer stories][132]\n* [How we do it][133]\n* [Our approach][134]\n* [Technology partners][135]\n* [Our perspective][136]\n* [Where we operate][137]\n* [U.S. Locations][138]\n* [North America][139]\n* [Latin America][140]\n* [Europe][141]\n* [Middle East / Africa][142]\n* [Asia Pacific][143]\n\n# Culture first since day one.\n\nFrom a single vision in 2001 to a global community of colleagues today, Convergint\u2019s story is\ndefined by people, purpose, and progress. Every milestone reflects our belief that when we put\npeople first, extraordinary things happen. What began as a values-driven mission has grown into a\nworldwide commitment to service, innovation, and partnership that continues to shape our future.\n\n### 2001\n### Founded on values.\n\n[Group of Convergint staff]\n\nConvergint is born with a simple belief: put people first, and everything else will follow. From the\nvery beginning, our culture of service and values-driven leadership set us apart.\n\n### 2003\n### First Convergint Technology Center (CTC).\n\n[Convergint building in snow]\n\nWe opened our first CTC, blending global expertise with local service. This model becomes the\nbackbone of how we grow.\n\n### 2010\n### Expanding our global footprint.\n\n[Convergint employees in the ocean]\n\nConvergint grows rapidly across North America, Europe, and Asia Pacific building trusted\npartnerships with customers across industries.\n\n### 2013\n### Culture recognized.\n\n[Happy Convergint employees]\n\nConvergint is recognized as one of the best places to work, reinforcing that our people-first\nculture is our greatest differentiator.\n\n### 2017\n### Accelerating growth.\n\n[Convergint office building]\n\nWith strategic acquisitions and new CTCs around the world, Convergint strengthens its ability to\nserve multinational and enterprise customers at scale.\n\n### 2020\n### Service beyond security.\n\n[Convergint employees volunteering]\n\nAmid global challenges, colleagues rally to support communities through Convergint Social\nResponsibility Day, living out our values in action.\n\n### 2025\n### Leading in technology modernization.\n\n[Employee in a mechanical room]\n\nToday, Convergint is at the forefront of helping organizations modernize their security operations\nthrough integrating physical and digital systems, advancing cloud and AI adoption, and creating\nsafer, smarter, more resilient enterprises.\n\n### The future \u2013\n### service as our constant, technology as our path forward.\n\n[Happy Convergint worker]\n\nAs we grow, our commitment remains the same: serving customers, colleagues, and communities with\ncare, integrity, and purpose.\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][144]\n\n**Explore**\n\n[Who we are][145]\n[What we do][146]\n[Who we serve][147]\n[How we do it][148]\n[Where we operate][149]\n\n[ ][150] [ ][151] [ ][152] [ ][153] [ ][154]\n\n[Careers][155]\n[Contact][156]\n[Locations][157]\n\n[News & Insights][158]\n[Our Values & Beliefs][159]\n\n[iCare Standard Customer Portal][160]\n[iCare Federal Customer Portal][161]\n[Pay Your Invoice][16