            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\n[Careers][2] [Contact][3]\n\n[Careers][4] [Contact][5]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][6] [Contact][7]\n\n[Karriere][8] [Kontakte][9]\n\n[Careers][10] [Contact][11]\n\n[Urat][12] [Yhteystiedot][13]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][14] [Contact][15]\n\n[Karriere][16] [Kontakt][17]\n\n[Careers][18] [Contact][19]\n\n[Careers][20] [Contact][21]\n\n[Karriere][22] [Kontakt][23]\n\n[Kariera][24] [Kontakt][25]\n\n[Cariere][26] [Contact][27]\n\n[Carreras][28] [Contacto][29]\n\n[Karri\u00e4rer][30] [Kontakta][31]\n\n[Karriere][32] [Kontakt][33]\n\n[Careers][34] [Contact][35]\n\n[Carreras][36] [Contacto][37]\n\n[Carreiras][38] [Contato][39]\n\n[Carreras][40] [Contacto][41]\n\n[Carreras][42] [Contacto][43]\n\n[Carreras][44] [Contacto][45]\n\n[Carreras][46] [Contacto][47]\n\n[Carreras][48] [Contacto][49]\n\n[Carreras][50] [Contacto][51]\n\n[Careers][52] [Contact][53]\n\n[\u0627\u0644\u0648\u0638\u0627\u0626\u0641][54] [\u0627\u062a\u0635\u0627\u0644][55]\n\n[Careers][56] [Contact][57]\n\n[Careers][58] [Contact][59]\n\n[Careers][60] [Contact][61]\n\n[\u0e2d\u0e32\u0e0a\u0e35\u0e1e][62] [\u0e15\u0e34\u0e14\u0e15\u0e48\u0e2d][63]\n\n[\u8077\u6daf\u767c\u5c55][64] [\u63a5\u89f8][65]\n\n[Careers][66] [Contact][67]\n\n[Careers][68] [Contact][69]\n\n[S\u1ef1 nghi\u1ec7p][70] [Li\u00ean h\u1ec7][71]\n\n[Karier][72] [Kontak][73]\n\n[Kerjaya][74] [Kenalan][75]\n\n[Mga Karera][76] [Makipag-ugnayan][77]\n\n[\u30ad\u30e3\u30ea\u30a2][78] [\u63a5\u89e6][79]\n\n[\uacbd\ub825][80] [\uc5f0\ub77d\ud558\ub2e4][81]\n\n[Careers][82] [Contact][83]\n\n[ Home[convergint logo]][84]\n][85]\n* [Who we are][86]\n* [History][87]\n* Leadership\n* [Executive Leadership][88]\n* [Board of Managers][89]\n* [Culture Committee][90]\n* [Company news][91]\n* [Why we do it][92]\n* [Social responsibility][93]\n* [Step Up for Schools][94]\n* [Sustainability][95]\n* [Acquisitions][96]\n* [What we do][97]\n* [Systems][98]\n* [Access Control][99]\n* [Video Surveillance][100]\n* [Intrusion Detection Systems][101]\n* [Fire & Life Safety Systems][102]\n* [Communications][103]\n* [Advanced Threat Detection][104]\n* [Security Operations Centers][105]\n* [Physical Security][106]\n* [Services][107]\n* [Consulting & Advisory][108]\n* [Assessments & Site Surveys][109]\n* [Engineering & Estimating][110]\n* [Installation & Integration][111]\n* [Project & Program Management][112]\n* [Professional Services][113]\n* [Remote Services][114]\n* [Maintenance][115]\n* [Who we serve][116]\n* [Industries][117]\n* [Aviation / Transportation][118]\n* [Data Centers][119]\n* [Government / Public Sector][120]\n* [Critical Infrastructure][121]\n* [Utilities][122]\n* [Medical / Hospital / Healthcare][123]\n* [Biopharmaceutical / Laboratory / Research][124]\n* [Education][125]\n* [Financial Institutions][126]\n* [Corporate Enterprise][127]\n* [Real Estate][128]\n* [Hospitality / Entertainment][129]\n* [Manufacturing][130]\n* [Retail][131]\n* [Customer stories][132]\n* [How we do it][133]\n* [Our approach][134]\n* [Technology partners][135]\n* [Our perspective][136]\n* [Where we operate][137]\n* [U.S. Locations][138]\n* [North America][139]\n* [Latin America][140]\n* [Europe][141]\n* [Middle East / Africa][142]\n* [Asia Pacific][143]\n\n# A day of service.\n# A year of impact.\n\nEach year, we pause our business operations across the globe to serve our communities. Convergint\nSocial Responsibility Day is our company-wide day of giving, an annual tradition that unites more\nthan 11,000 colleagues in acts of service, compassion, and connection.\n\nWhat began as a single day in 2002 has grown into a worldwide movement. From revitalizing community\nspaces and repairing schools to enhancing security for local nonprofits, our colleagues contribute\nthousands of volunteer hours, strengthening communities and living our values in action.\n\n### Service in action.\n\n## 2025 Highlights.\n\n### Colleagues, family & friends volunteered.\n\n### Countries volunteered.\n\n### STEP-Up for schools projects.\n\n### Organizations assisted.\n\n### Hours of service.\n\n### In labor and materials donated.\n\nEach project tells a story of teamwork, gratitude, and genuine care for our communities. Whether\nrebuilding playgrounds, upgrading security at shelters, or supporting families in need, every act of\nservice reflects our shared belief that when we give our time, we gain something far greater:\npurpose.\n\n### Driven by purpose.\n### Guided by values.\n\n## Our Values & Beliefs are the foundation of everything we do.\n\nThey guide how we treat our customers, our colleagues, and our communities. Social Responsibility\nDay is one part of how we live those values, together.\n\n## How we lead.\n\nOur work is rooted in a commitment to creating a safer, more inclusive, and more sustainable\nworld\u2014for our customers, partners, and communities. At Convergint, service is a daily\nresponsibility, guided by clear Values and Beliefs that define how we lead, collaborate, and deliver\nmeaningful outcomes.\n\n[Our Values & Beliefs][144]\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][145]\n\n**Explore**\n\n[Who we are][146]\n[What we do][147]\n[Who we serve][148]\n[How we do it][149]\n[Where we operate][150]\n\n[ ][151] [ ][152] [ ][153] [ ][154] [ ][155]\n\n[Careers][156]\n[Contact][157]\n[Locations][158]\n\n[News & Insights][159]\n[Our Values & Beliefs][160]\n\n[iCare Standard Customer Portal][161]\n[iCare Federal Customer Portal][162]\n[Pay Your Invoice][163]\n\n[Terms of Use][164]\n[Privacy][165]\n[Cookie Policy][166]\n[Online Reporting][167]\n[Compliance][168]\n[Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][169]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Convergint Technologies LLC, All Rights Reserved. Convergint\u00ae and the stylized \u2018i\u2019 are\nregistered trademarks of Convergint in the U.S. and abroad.\nOklahoma Alarm Locksmith License #AC1750\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][170]\n\n**Explore**\n\n[Who we are][171]\n[What we do][172]\n[Who we serve][173]\n[How we do it][174]\n[Where we operate][175]\n\n[ ][176] [ ][177] [ ][