            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\n[Careers][2] [Contact][3]\n\n[Careers][4] [Contact][5]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][6] [Contact][7]\n\n[Karriere][8] [Kontakte][9]\n\n[Careers][10] [Contact][11]\n\n[Urat][12] [Yhteystiedot][13]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][14] [Contact][15]\n\n[Karriere][16] [Kontakt][17]\n\n[Careers][18] [Contact][19]\n\n[Careers][20] [Contact][21]\n\n[Karriere][22] [Kontakt][23]\n\n[Kariera][24] [Kontakt][25]\n\n[Cariere][26] [Contact][27]\n\n[Carreras][28] [Contacto][29]\n\n[Karri\u00e4rer][30] [Kontakta][31]\n\n[Karriere][32] [Kontakt][33]\n\n[Careers][34] [Contact][35]\n\n[Carreras][36] [Contacto][37]\n\n[Carreiras][38] [Contato][39]\n\n[Carreras][40] [Contacto][41]\n\n[Carreras][42] [Contacto][43]\n\n[Carreras][44] [Contacto][45]\n\n[Carreras][46] [Contacto][47]\n\n[Carreras][48] [Contacto][49]\n\n[Carreras][50] [Contacto][51]\n\n[Careers][52] [Contact][53]\n\n[\u0627\u0644\u0648\u0638\u0627\u0626\u0641][54] [\u0627\u062a\u0635\u0627\u0644][55]\n\n[Careers][56] [Contact][57]\n\n[Careers][58] [Contact][59]\n\n[Careers][60] [Contact][61]\n\n[\u0e2d\u0e32\u0e0a\u0e35\u0e1e][62] [\u0e15\u0e34\u0e14\u0e15\u0e48\u0e2d][63]\n\n[\u8077\u6daf\u767c\u5c55][64] [\u63a5\u89f8][65]\n\n[Careers][66] [Contact][67]\n\n[Careers][68] [Contact][69]\n\n[S\u1ef1 nghi\u1ec7p][70] [Li\u00ean h\u1ec7][71]\n\n[Karier][72] [Kontak][73]\n\n[Kerjaya][74] [Kenalan][75]\n\n[Mga Karera][76] [Makipag-ugnayan][77]\n\n[\u30ad\u30e3\u30ea\u30a2][78] [\u63a5\u89e6][79]\n\n[\uacbd\ub825][80] [\uc5f0\ub77d\ud558\ub2e4][81]\n\n[Careers][82] [Contact][83]\n\n[ Home[convergint logo]][84]\n][85]\n* [Who we are][86]\n* [History][87]\n* Leadership\n* [Executive Leadership][88]\n* [Board of Managers][89]\n* [Culture Committee][90]\n* [Company news][91]\n* [Why we do it][92]\n* [Social responsibility][93]\n* [Step Up for Schools][94]\n* [Sustainability][95]\n* [Acquisitions][96]\n* [What we do][97]\n* [Systems][98]\n* [Access Control][99]\n* [Video Surveillance][100]\n* [Intrusion Detection Systems][101]\n* [Fire & Life Safety Systems][102]\n* [Communications][103]\n* [Advanced Threat Detection][104]\n* [Security Operations Centers][105]\n* [Physical Security][106]\n* [Services][107]\n* [Consulting & Advisory][108]\n* [Assessments & Site Surveys][109]\n* [Engineering & Estimating][110]\n* [Installation & Integration][111]\n* [Project & Program Management][112]\n* [Professional Services][113]\n* [Remote Services][114]\n* [Maintenance][115]\n* [Who we serve][116]\n* [Industries][117]\n* [Aviation / Transportation][118]\n* [Data Centers][119]\n* [Government / Public Sector][120]\n* [Critical Infrastructure][121]\n* [Utilities][122]\n* [Medical / Hospital / Healthcare][123]\n* [Biopharmaceutical / Laboratory / Research][124]\n* [Education][125]\n* [Financial Institutions][126]\n* [Corporate Enterprise][127]\n* [Real Estate][128]\n* [Hospitality / Entertainment][129]\n* [Manufacturing][130]\n* [Retail][131]\n* [Customer stories][132]\n* [How we do it][133]\n* [Our approach][134]\n* [Technology partners][135]\n* [Our perspective][136]\n* [Where we operate][137]\n* [U.S. Locations][138]\n* [North America][139]\n* [Latin America][140]\n* [Europe][141]\n* [Middle East / Africa][142]\n* [Asia Pacific][143]\n\n##### Assessment & Site Surveys:\n\n# Build certainty before architecting an intelligent ecosystem.\n\nConvergint assessments and site surveys establish a clear, defensible understanding of your current\nenvironment. We document conditions, identify risk, and surface opportunities so decisions are\ngrounded in reality, not assumptions.\n\n[Request an assessment][144]\n\n### Leverage predictive insights before investing.\n\n## Establish a trusted baseline across facilities, systems, and operations.\n\nModernization efforts often stall due to incomplete data or unknown constraints. Our structured\nassessments capture what\u2019s deployed, what\u2019s working, and what needs attention, giving leaders the\nclarity needed to prioritize and fund improvements with confidence.\n\n### How we work.\n\n#### Field-validated insight.\n\nOur teams assess real-world conditions on site, accounting for environment, operations, and\ninfrastructure realities.\n\n#### Standardized methodologies.\n\nProven assessment frameworks ensure consistent outcomes across sites, regions, and programs.\n\n#### Actionable documentation.\n\nFindings are translated into clear recommendations that support design, budgeting, and execution.\n\n#### Risk and readiness visibility.\n\nAssessments surface gaps before they become incidents or derail projects.\n\n#### People first: Trusted advisors.\n\nOur teams work collaboratively with yours, ensuring findings are understood, aligned, and usable.\n\n[Our approach][145]\n\n### What we deliver.\n\n[Two workers at a solar farm]\n\n##### Current-State Inventory & Condition Review\n\nComprehensive documentation of devices, infrastructure, and system health.\n\n[City graphic with heat signature]\n\n##### Risk & Coverage Analysis\n\nIdentification of gaps impacting safety, compliance, and operational continuity.\n\n[Worker using a calculator]\n\n##### Site Readiness & Constraints\n\nValidation of power, network, space, and environmental considerations.\n\n[Co-workers analyzing charts on a large monitor]\n\n##### Findings & Prioritized Recommendations\n\nClear next steps that feed design, budgeting, and phased modernization plans.\n\n[Engineering & Estimating][146]\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][147]\n\n**Explore**\n\n[Who we are][148]\n[What we do][149]\n[Who we serve][150]\n[How we do it][151]\n[Where we operate][152]\n\n[ ][153] [ ][154] [ ][155] [ ][156] [ ][157]\n\n[Careers][158]\n[Contact][159]\n[Locations][160]\n\n[News & Insights][161]\n[Our Values & Beliefs][162]\n\n[iCare Standard Customer Portal][163]\n[iCare Federal Customer Portal][164]\n[Pay Your Invoice][165]\n\n[Terms of Use][166]\n[Privacy][167]\n[Cookie Policy][168]\n[Online Reporting][169]\n[Compliance][170]\n[Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][171]