            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\n[Careers][2] [Contact][3]\n\n[Careers][4] [Contact][5]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][6] [Contact][7]\n\n[Karriere][8] [Kontakte][9]\n\n[Careers][10] [Contact][11]\n\n[Urat][12] [Yhteystiedot][13]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][14] [Contact][15]\n\n[Karriere][16] [Kontakt][17]\n\n[Careers][18] [Contact][19]\n\n[Careers][20] [Contact][21]\n\n[Karriere][22] [Kontakt][23]\n\n[Kariera][24] [Kontakt][25]\n\n[Cariere][26] [Contact][27]\n\n[Carreras][28] [Contacto][29]\n\n[Karri\u00e4rer][30] [Kontakta][31]\n\n[Karriere][32] [Kontakt][33]\n\n[Careers][34] [Contact][35]\n\n[Carreras][36] [Contacto][37]\n\n[Carreiras][38] [Contato][39]\n\n[Carreras][40] [Contacto][41]\n\n[Carreras][42] [Contacto][43]\n\n[Carreras][44] [Contacto][45]\n\n[Carreras][46] [Contacto][47]\n\n[Carreras][48] [Contacto][49]\n\n[Carreras][50] [Contacto][51]\n\n[Careers][52] [Contact][53]\n\n[\u0627\u0644\u0648\u0638\u0627\u0626\u0641][54] [\u0627\u062a\u0635\u0627\u0644][55]\n\n[Careers][56] [Contact][57]\n\n[Careers][58] [Contact][59]\n\n[Careers][60] [Contact][61]\n\n[\u0e2d\u0e32\u0e0a\u0e35\u0e1e][62] [\u0e15\u0e34\u0e14\u0e15\u0e48\u0e2d][63]\n\n[\u8077\u6daf\u767c\u5c55][64] [\u63a5\u89f8][65]\n\n[Careers][66] [Contact][67]\n\n[Careers][68] [Contact][69]\n\n[S\u1ef1 nghi\u1ec7p][70] [Li\u00ean h\u1ec7][71]\n\n[Karier][72] [Kontak][73]\n\n[Kerjaya][74] [Kenalan][75]\n\n[Mga Karera][76] [Makipag-ugnayan][77]\n\n[\u30ad\u30e3\u30ea\u30a2][78] [\u63a5\u89e6][79]\n\n[\uacbd\ub825][80] [\uc5f0\ub77d\ud558\ub2e4][81]\n\n[Careers][82] [Contact][83]\n\n[ Home[convergint logo]][84]\n][85]\n* [Who we are][86]\n* [History][87]\n* Leadership\n* [Executive Leadership][88]\n* [Board of Managers][89]\n* [Culture Committee][90]\n* [Company news][91]\n* [Why we do it][92]\n* [Social responsibility][93]\n* [Step Up for Schools][94]\n* [Sustainability][95]\n* [Acquisitions][96]\n* [What we do][97]\n* [Systems][98]\n* [Access Control][99]\n* [Video Surveillance][100]\n* [Intrusion Detection Systems][101]\n* [Fire & Life Safety Systems][102]\n* [Communications][103]\n* [Advanced Threat Detection][104]\n* [Security Operations Centers][105]\n* [Physical Security][106]\n* [Services][107]\n* [Consulting & Advisory][108]\n* [Assessments & Site Surveys][109]\n* [Engineering & Estimating][110]\n* [Installation & Integration][111]\n* [Project & Program Management][112]\n* [Professional Services][113]\n* [Remote Services][114]\n* [Maintenance][115]\n* [Who we serve][116]\n* [Industries][117]\n* [Aviation / Transportation][118]\n* [Data Centers][119]\n* [Government / Public Sector][120]\n* [Critical Infrastructure][121]\n* [Utilities][122]\n* [Medical / Hospital / Healthcare][123]\n* [Biopharmaceutical / Laboratory / Research][124]\n* [Education][125]\n* [Financial Institutions][126]\n* [Corporate Enterprise][127]\n* [Real Estate][128]\n* [Hospitality / Entertainment][129]\n* [Manufacturing][130]\n* [Retail][131]\n* [Customer stories][132]\n* [How we do it][133]\n* [Our approach][134]\n* [Technology partners][135]\n* [Our perspective][136]\n* [Where we operate][137]\n* [U.S. Locations][138]\n* [North America][139]\n* [Latin America][140]\n* [Europe][141]\n* [Middle East / Africa][142]\n* [Asia Pacific][143]\n\n##### Engineering & Estimating:\n\n# Design with confidence. Plan with precision.\n\nConvergint engineering helps transform requirements into build-ready designs and accurate estimates.\nWe reduce ambiguity early so programs execute predictably, on scope, and on budget.\n\n[Ready to connect][144]\n\n### Protect scope, schedule, and outcomes.\n\n## Turn strategy into designs that can be executed at scale.\n\nInaccurate assumptions and incomplete engineering drive change orders and delays. Our disciplined\napproach ensures designs and estimates reflect real environments, operational needs, and long-term\nservice considerations.\n\n### How we work.\n\n#### Build-ready documentation.\n\nHigh-fidelity engineering packages designed to accelerate installation, simplify testing, and\nempower lifecycle support.\n\n#### Accurate, defensible estimating.\n\nData-backed cost modeling and assumption frameworks that drive faster approvals and reduce\nsurprises.\n\n#### Standards with flexibility.\n\nMaintain global brand consistency while adapting local regulations and technical requirements.\n\n#### Future adaptive engineering.\n\nPrioritizing maintainability, modular scalability, and seamless future modernization.\n\n#### Client centered, strategy driven.\n\nEngineers collaborate closely with delivery teams and stakeholders.\n\n[Our approach][145]\n\n### Engineering that enables predictable delivery.\n\n[Analytic reports]\n\n##### System Architecture & Standards\n\nScalable designs that reduce complexity across multi-site environments.\n\n[Four construction workers looking at design plans.]\n\n##### Implementation-Ready Engineering\n\nDrawings and specifications aligned to real-world execution.\n\n[Man using a tablet with graph effects]\n\n##### Program Estimating & Phasing\n\nCost models built for enterprise rollouts and long-term planning.\n\n[Two co-workers talking in a conference room.]\n\n##### Design Review & Validation\n\nRisk reduction through disciplined review and alignment.\n\n[Explore consulting services][146]\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][147]\n\n**Explore**\n\n[Who we are][148]\n[What we do][149]\n[Who we serve][150]\n[How we do it][151]\n[Where we operate][152]\n\n[ ][153] [ ][154] [ ][155] [ ][156] [ ][157]\n\n[Careers][158]\n[Contact][159]\n[Locations][160]\n\n[News & Insights][161]\n[Our Values & Beliefs][162]\n\n[iCare Standard Customer Portal][163]\n[iCare Federal Customer Portal][164]\n[Pay Your Invoice][165]\n\n[Terms of Use][166]\n[Privacy][167]\n[Cookie Policy][168]\n[Online Reporting][169]\n[Compliance][170]\n[Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][171]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Convergint Technologies LLC, All Rights Reserved. Convergint\u00ae and the stylized \u2018i\u2019 are\nregistered trademarks of Convergint in t