            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\n[Careers][2] [Contact][3]\n\n[Careers][4] [Contact][5]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][6] [Contact][7]\n\n[Karriere][8] [Kontakte][9]\n\n[Careers][10] [Contact][11]\n\n[Urat][12] [Yhteystiedot][13]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][14] [Contact][15]\n\n[Karriere][16] [Kontakt][17]\n\n[Careers][18] [Contact][19]\n\n[Careers][20] [Contact][21]\n\n[Karriere][22] [Kontakt][23]\n\n[Kariera][24] [Kontakt][25]\n\n[Cariere][26] [Contact][27]\n\n[Carreras][28] [Contacto][29]\n\n[Karri\u00e4rer][30] [Kontakta][31]\n\n[Karriere][32] [Kontakt][33]\n\n[Careers][34] [Contact][35]\n\n[Carreras][36] [Contacto][37]\n\n[Carreiras][38] [Contato][39]\n\n[Carreras][40] [Contacto][41]\n\n[Carreras][42] [Contacto][43]\n\n[Carreras][44] [Contacto][45]\n\n[Carreras][46] [Contacto][47]\n\n[Carreras][48] [Contacto][49]\n\n[Carreras][50] [Contacto][51]\n\n[Careers][52] [Contact][53]\n\n[\u0627\u0644\u0648\u0638\u0627\u0626\u0641][54] [\u0627\u062a\u0635\u0627\u0644][55]\n\n[Careers][56] [Contact][57]\n\n[Careers][58] [Contact][59]\n\n[Careers][60] [Contact][61]\n\n[\u0e2d\u0e32\u0e0a\u0e35\u0e1e][62] [\u0e15\u0e34\u0e14\u0e15\u0e48\u0e2d][63]\n\n[\u8077\u6daf\u767c\u5c55][64] [\u63a5\u89f8][65]\n\n[Careers][66] [Contact][67]\n\n[Careers][68] [Contact][69]\n\n[S\u1ef1 nghi\u1ec7p][70] [Li\u00ean h\u1ec7][71]\n\n[Karier][72] [Kontak][73]\n\n[Kerjaya][74] [Kenalan][75]\n\n[Mga Karera][76] [Makipag-ugnayan][77]\n\n[\u30ad\u30e3\u30ea\u30a2][78] [\u63a5\u89e6][79]\n\n[\uacbd\ub825][80] [\uc5f0\ub77d\ud558\ub2e4][81]\n\n[Careers][82] [Contact][83]\n\n[ Home[convergint logo]][84]\n][85]\n* [Who we are][86]\n* [History][87]\n* Leadership\n* [Executive Leadership][88]\n* [Board of Managers][89]\n* [Culture Committee][90]\n* [Company news][91]\n* [Why we do it][92]\n* [Social responsibility][93]\n* [Step Up for Schools][94]\n* [Sustainability][95]\n* [Acquisitions][96]\n* [What we do][97]\n* [Systems][98]\n* [Access Control][99]\n* [Video Surveillance][100]\n* [Intrusion Detection Systems][101]\n* [Fire & Life Safety Systems][102]\n* [Communications][103]\n* [Advanced Threat Detection][104]\n* [Security Operations Centers][105]\n* [Physical Security][106]\n* [Services][107]\n* [Consulting & Advisory][108]\n* [Assessments & Site Surveys][109]\n* [Engineering & Estimating][110]\n* [Installation & Integration][111]\n* [Project & Program Management][112]\n* [Professional Services][113]\n* [Remote Services][114]\n* [Maintenance][115]\n* [Who we serve][116]\n* [Industries][117]\n* [Aviation / Transportation][118]\n* [Data Centers][119]\n* [Government / Public Sector][120]\n* [Critical Infrastructure][121]\n* [Utilities][122]\n* [Medical / Hospital / Healthcare][123]\n* [Biopharmaceutical / Laboratory / Research][124]\n* [Education][125]\n* [Financial Institutions][126]\n* [Corporate Enterprise][127]\n* [Real Estate][128]\n* [Hospitality / Entertainment][129]\n* [Manufacturing][130]\n* [Retail][131]\n* [Customer stories][132]\n* [How we do it][133]\n* [Our approach][134]\n* [Technology partners][135]\n* [Our perspective][136]\n* [Where we operate][137]\n* [U.S. Locations][138]\n* [North America][139]\n* [Latin America][140]\n* [Europe][141]\n* [Middle East / Africa][142]\n* [Asia Pacific][143]\n\n# A global day of service.\n# A lasting commitment to safer communities.\n\nFor 25 years, Convergint Social Responsibility Day has brought colleagues, families, and partners\ntogether in service to the communities where we live and work. Each year, we pause business\noperations worldwide so colleagues can give back through volunteer projects that support schools,\nfamilies, local organizations, and community spaces.\n\nFor more than two decades, this annual day of service has reflected who we are: a people-first\norganization committed to making the world a safer, stronger, and more secure place.\n\n### 2026 Impact\n\n## A milestone year of service across the globe.\n\n### Colleagues, family & friends volunteered.\n\n### Countries volunteered.\n\n### STEP-Up for schools projects.\n\n### Organizations assisted.\n\n### Hours of service.\n\n### In labor and materials donated.\n\nEach project tells a story of teamwork, gratitude, and genuine care for our communities. Whether\nrebuilding playgrounds, upgrading security at shelters, or supporting families in need, every act of\nservice reflects our shared belief that when we give our time, we gain something far greater:\npurpose.\n\n### Local service.\n### Global purpose.\n\n## Every project begins with the needs of the community\n\nEach initiative is shaped by the people and organizations closest to the work. Around the world, our\ncolleagues partner with schools, local organizations and community groups to identify where their\ntime and resources can make the greatest difference.\n\nThe result is a global day of service with deeply local impact, built on relationships, colleague\nleadership, and a shared commitment to helping communities become safer and more resilient.\n\n#### CSRD 2026 1\n\n[ [Two colleagues planting a tree] ][144]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 2\n\n[ [Two women crafting] ][145]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 3\n\n[ [A colleague carrying a tree branch] ][146]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 4\n\n[ [A group of colleagues smiling together] ][147]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 5\n\n[ [Two men preparing food] ][148]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 6\n\n[ [A group of colleagues picking up leaves] ][149]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 7\n\n[ [A man sanding a wooden fence] ][150]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 8\n\n[ [A man loading boxes onto a pallet] ][151]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 9\n\n[ [A woman digging with a tool] ][152]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 10\n\n[ [Two colleagues feeding animals] ][153]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 11\n\n[ [A man painting a small fence] ][154]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 12\n\n[ [A group of colleagues preparing to bake] ][155]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 13\n\n[ [Two men cleaning up a playground] ][156]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 14\n\n[ [A man painting the side of a house] ][157]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 15\n\n[ [Two women painting a wall] ][158]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 16\n\n[ [Two colleagues installing a cable] ][159]\n\n#### CSRD 2026 17\n\n[ [Two men crafting] ][160]\n\n### Driven by purpose.\n### Guided by values.\n\n## Our Values & Beliefs are the foundation of everything we do.\n\nThey guide how we treat our customers, our colleagues, and our communities. Social Responsibility\nDay is one part of how we live those values, together.\n\n## How we lead.\n\nOur work is rooted in a commitment to creating a safer, more inclusive, and more sustainable\nworld\u2014for our customers, partners, and communities. At Convergint, service is a daily\nresponsibility, guided by clear Values and Beliefs that define how we lead, collaborate, and deliver\nmeaningful outcomes.\n\n[Our Values & Beliefs][161]\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][162]\n\n**Explore**\n\n[Who we are][163]\n[What we do][164]\n[Who we serve][165]\n[How we do it][166]\n[Where we operate][167]\n\n[ ][168] [ ][169] [ ][170] [ ][171] [ ][172]\n\n[Careers][173]\n[Contact][174]\n[Locations][175]\n\n[News & Insights][176]\n[Our Values & Beliefs][177]\n\n[iCare Standard Customer Portal][178]\n[iCare Federal Customer Portal][179]\n[Pay Your Invoice][180]\n\n[Terms of Use][181]\n[Privacy][182]\n[Cookie Policy][183]\n[Online Reporting][184]\n[Compliance][185]\n[Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][186]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Convergint Technologies LLC, All Rights Reserved. Convergint\u00ae and the stylized \u2018i\u2019 are\nregistered trademarks of Convergint in the U.S. and abroad.\nOklahoma Alarm Locksmith License #AC1750\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][187]\n\n**Explore**\n\n[Who we are][188]\n[What we do][189]\n[Who we serve][190]\n[How we do it][191]\n[Where we operate][192]\n\n[ ][193] [ ][194] [ ][195] [ ][196] [ ][197]\n\n[Careers][198]\n[Contact][199]\n[Locations][200]\n\n[News & Insights][201]\n[Our Values & Beliefs][202]\n\n[iCare Standard Customer Portal][203]\n[Pay Your Invoice][204]\n\n[Terms of Use][205]\n[Privacy][206]\n[Cookie Policy][207]\n[Online Reporting][208]\n[Compliance][209]\n[Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][210]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Convergint Technologies LLC, All Rights Reserved. Convergint\u00ae and the stylized \u2018i\u2019 are\nregistered trademarks of Convergint in the U.S. and abroad.\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][211]\n\n**Ontdekken**\n\n[Wie wij zijn][212]\n[Wat wij doen][213]\n[Wie wij bedienen][214]\n[Hoe we het doen][215]\n[Waar wij actief zijn][216]\n\n[ ][217] [ ][218] [ ][219] [ ][220] [ ][221]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][222]\n[Contact][223]\n[Locaties][224]\n\n[Nieuws en inzichten][225]\n\n[iCare klantenportaal][226]\n[Betaal uw factuur][227]\n\n[Gebruiksvoorwaarden][228]\n[Privacy][229]\n[Cookiebeleid][230]\n[Online rapportage][231]\n[Naleving][232]\n[Verkoop of deel mijn persoonlijke gegevens niet][233]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Convergint Technologies LLC, alle rechten voorbehouden. Convergint\u00ae en de gestileerde 'i'\nzijn geregistreerde handelsmerken van Convergint in de VS en daarbuiten.\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][234]\n\n**Udforske**\n\n[Hvem vi er][235]\n[Hvad vi g\u00f8r][236]\n[Industrier][237]\n[S\u00e5dan g\u00f8r vi det][238]\n[Hvor vi opererer][239]\n\n[ ][240] [ ][241] [ ][242] [ ][243] [ ][244]\n\n[Karriere][245]\n[Kontakte][246]\n[Hvor vi opererer][247]\n\n[Nyheder og indsigt][248]\n[Vores v\u00e6rdier og overbevisninger][249]\n\n[iCare Kundeportal][250]\n[Betal din faktura][251]\n\n[Brugsbetingelser][252]\n[Privatliv][253]\n[Cookiepolitik][254]\n[Onlinerapportering][255]\n[Overholdelse][256]\n[S\u00e6lg eller del ikke mine personlige oplysninger][257]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Convergint Technologies LLC, Alle rettigheder forbeholdes. Convergint\u00ae og det stiliserede 'i'\ner registrerede varem\u00e6rker tilh\u00f8rende Convergint i USA og i udlandet.\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][258]\n\n**Tutkia**\n\n[Keit\u00e4 me olemme][259]\n[Mit\u00e4 teemme][260]\n[Ket\u00e4 palvelemme][261]\n[Miten me sen teemme][262]\n[Miss\u00e4 toimimme][263]\n\n[ ][264] [ ][265] [ ][266] [ ][267] [ ][268]\n\n[Urat][269]\n[Yhteystiedot][270]\n[Toimipisteet][271]\n\n[Uutise