en Daten nicht verkaufen oder weitergeben][329]\n[Impressum][330]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Convergint Technologies LLC, Alle Rechte vorbehalten. Convergint\u00ae und das stilisierte \u201ei\u201c\nsind eingetragene Marken von Convergint in den USA und im Ausland.\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][331]\n\n**Explore**\n\n[Who we are][332]\n[What we do][333]\n[Who we serve][334]\n[How we do it][335]\n[Where we operate][336]\n\n[ ][337] [ ][338] [ ][339] [ ][340] [ ][341]\n\n[Careers][342]\n[Contact][343]\n[Locations][344]\n\n[News & Insights][345]\n[Our Values & Beliefs][346]\n\n[iCare Standard Customer Portal][347]\n[Pay Your Invoice][348]\n\n[Terms of Use][349]\n[Privacy][350]\n[Cookie Policy][351]\n[Online Reporting][352]\n[Compliance][353]\n[Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][354]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Convergint Technologies LLC, All Rights Reserved. Convergint\u00ae and the stylized \u2018i\u2019 are\nregistered trademarks of Convergint in the U.S. and abroad.\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][355]\n\n**Explore**\n\n[Who we are][356]\n[What we do][357]\n[Who we serve][358]\n[How we do it][359]\n[Where we operate][360]\n\n[ ][361] [ ][362] [ ][363] [ ][364] [ ][365]\n\n[Careers][366]\n[Contact]"
