            "url": "https://convergint.com/company",
            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n\n[Careers][2] [Contact][3]\n\n[Careers][4] [Contact][5]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][6] [Contact][7]\n\n[Karriere][8] [Kontakte][9]\n\n[Careers][10] [Contact][11]\n\n[Urat][12] [Yhteystiedot][13]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][14] [Contact][15]\n\n[Karriere][16] [Kontakt][17]\n\n[Careers][18] [Contact][19]\n\n[Careers][20] [Contact][21]\n\n[Karriere][22] [Kontakt][23]\n\n[Kariera][24] [Kontakt][25]\n\n[Cariere][26] [Contact][27]\n\n[Carreras][28] [Contacto][29]\n\n[Karri\u00e4rer][30] [Kontakta][31]\n\n[Karriere][32] [Kontakt][33]\n\n[Careers][34] [Contact][35]\n\n[Carreras][36] [Contacto][37]\n\n[Carreiras][38] [Contato][39]\n\n[Carreras][40] [Contacto][41]\n\n[Carreras][42] [Contacto][43]\n\n[Carreras][44] [Contacto][45]\n\n[Carreras][46] [Contacto][47]\n\n[Carreras][48] [Contacto][49]\n\n[Carreras][50] [Contacto][51]\n\n[Careers][52] [Contact][53]\n\n[\u0627\u0644\u0648\u0638\u0627\u0626\u0641][54] [\u0627\u062a\u0635\u0627\u0644][55]\n\n[Careers][56] [Contact][57]\n\n[Careers][58] [Contact][59]\n\n[Careers][60] [Contact][61]\n\n[\u0e2d\u0e32\u0e0a\u0e35\u0e1e][62] [\u0e15\u0e34\u0e14\u0e15\u0e48\u0e2d][63]\n\n[\u8077\u6daf\u767c\u5c55][64] [\u63a5\u89f8][65]\n\n[Careers][66] [Contact][67]\n\n[Careers][68] [Contact][69]\n\n[S\u1ef1 nghi\u1ec7p][70] [Li\u00ean h\u1ec7][71]\n\n[Karier][72] [Kontak][73]\n\n[Kerjaya][74] [Kenalan][75]\n\n[Mga Karera][76] [Makipag-ugnayan][77]\n\n[\u30ad\u30e3\u30ea\u30a2][78] [\u63a5\u89e6][79]\n\n[\uacbd\ub825][80] [\uc5f0\ub77d\ud558\ub2e4][81]\n\n[Careers][82] [Contact][83]\n\n[ Home[convergint logo]][84]\n][85]\n* [Who we are][86]\n* [History][87]\n* Leadership\n* [Executive Leadership][88]\n* [Board of Managers][89]\n* [Culture Committee][90]\n* [Company news][91]\n* [Why we do it][92]\n* [Social responsibility][93]\n* [Step Up for Schools][94]\n* [Sustainability][95]\n* [Acquisitions][96]\n* [What we do][97]\n* [Systems][98]\n* [Access Control][99]\n* [Video Surveillance][100]\n* [Intrusion Detection Systems][101]\n* [Fire & Life Safety Systems][102]\n* [Communications][103]\n* [Advanced Threat Detection][104]\n* [Security Operations Centers][105]\n* [Physical Security][106]\n* [Services][107]\n* [Consulting & Advisory][108]\n* [Assessments & Site Surveys][109]\n* [Engineering & Estimating][110]\n* [Installation & Integration][111]\n* [Project & Program Management][112]\n* [Professional Services][113]\n* [Remote Services][114]\n* [Maintenance][115]\n* [Who we serve][116]\n* [Industries][117]\n* [Aviation / Transportation][118]\n* [Data Centers][119]\n* [Government / Public Sector][120]\n* [Critical Infrastructure][121]\n* [Utilities][122]\n* [Medical / Hospital / Healthcare][123]\n* [Biopharmaceutical / Laboratory / Research][124]\n* [Education][125]\n* [Financial Institutions][126]\n* [Corporate Enterprise][127]\n* [Real Estate][128]\n* [Hospitality / Entertainment][129]\n* [Manufacturing][130]\n* [Retail][131]\n* [Customer stories][132]\n* [How we do it][133]\n* [Our approach][134]\n* [Technology partners][135]\n* [Our perspective][136]\n* [Where we operate][137]\n* [U.S. Locations][138]\n* [North America][139]\n* [Latin America][140]\n* [Europe][141]\n* [Middle East / Africa][142]\n* [Asia Pacific][143]\n\n# People first. Always.\n\nConvergint was founded on a simple promise: service before all else. Today, thousands of colleagues\naround the world live that promise every day designing and delivering security solutions that\nprotect people, assets, and reputations. We\u2019re more than just integrators, we\u2019re architects of\nclarity in a world of complexity.\n\n[More][144]\n\n#### Built on values.\n#### Driven by culture.\n\nConvergint\u2019s greatest differentiator is our people. We are a values-driven organization that invests\nin colleagues, fosters inclusion, and serves communities, all while helping customers see around the\ncorner to tomorrow\u2019s opportunities.\n\n[Our Values & Beliefs][145]\n\n#### Beyond\n#### technology.\n\nWe don\u2019t just integrate systems; we integrate with your business. From advanced video and access\ncontrol to fire, life safety, and unified platforms, our approach focuses on thoughtful design,\ndisciplined implementation, and long-term support so you can operate with confidence today and into\nthe future.\n\n[Our approach][146]\n\n#### Global scale,\n#### delivered locally.\n\nWith hundreds of Convergint Technology Centers worldwide, we bring global expertise with a personal\ntouch meeting customers where they are, and tailoring every solution to their unique needs.\n\n[Where we operate][147]\n\n### History.\n\n## Convergint was founded in 2001 with a simple but powerful idea: put people first, and success\n## will follow.\n\nWhat began as a small team with a shared vision has grown into a global, service-driven organization\nsupporting customers around the world.\n\n[Learn more][148]\n\n### Our people.\n\n#### Executive Leadership.\n\nAt Convergint, our leaders share a common purpose: to be our customers\u2019 best service provider.\nThrough thoughtful leadership and industry insight, they help customers stay safe, connected, and\nprepared for the future. Grounded in our Values & Beliefs and driven by a strong, service-oriented\nculture, this executive team brings decades of experience and a shared commitment to guiding\ncolleagues and customers with integrity, care, and vision.\n\n[Learn more][149]\n\n#### Board of Managers.\n\nOur Board of Managers plays a vital role in shaping a customer focused, people-first strategy. Their\nleadership reinforces our culture of service, ensuring that every decision supports stronger\npartnerships, long-term stakeholder value, and meaningful outcomes for those we serve.\n\n[Learn more][150]\n\n#### Culture Committee.\n\nOur values inform our everyday actions. Convergint\u2019s Culture Committee helps ensure our people-first\nvalues remain at the center of how we operate. Through initiatives focused on community service,\ninclusion, and colleague engagement, the committee supports a strong, connected culture as we\ncontinue to grow globally.\n\n[Learn more][151]\n\n### Our certifications\n### & credentials.\n\n## Setting the global standard for safety, quality, and compliance.\n\nTrust is built on more than relationships, it\u2019s earned through accountability, compliance, and\ncontinuous dedication to safety. Our local credentials and certifications reflect our commitment to\ndelivering the highest standards of quality and integrity across every location, across every\nindustry, and for every customer we serve.\n\n### Company news.\n\n[[reflection of a worker with a hard hat at sunset]][152]\n\n### [Convergint Oceania Ensures the Confidentiality and Integrity of Information, Successfully\n### Attains the ISO 27001 Accreditation][153]\n\n[[Early detection in every environment.]][154]\n\n### [New Convergint Study Reveals Critical Need for Increased Collaboration Between Physical\n### Security and Information Technology Teams][155]\n\n### [Convergint Highlights its Colleague-Centric Culture with the Lugo\u2019s Legacy Award][156]\n\n[Explore more news][157]\n\n### Acquisitions.\n\n## We are actively seeking like-minded companies to join Convergint Nation.\n\nConvergint\u2019s rapid growth in recent years has been driven by a combination of organic expansion and\na disciplined acquisition strategy. We continue to seek opportunities around the globe to expand our\nmarket presence and enhance the services we deliver to customers.\n\n[Learn more][158]\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][159]\n\n**Explore**\n\n[Who we are][160]\n[What we do][161]\n[Who we serve][162]\n[How we do it][163]\n[Where we operate][164]\n\n[ ][165] [ ][166] [ ][167] [ ][168] [ ][169]\n\n[Careers][170]\n[Contact][171]\n[Locations][172]\n\n[News & Insights][173]\n[Our Values & Beliefs][174]\n\n[iCare Standard Customer Portal][175]\n[iCare Federal Customer Portal][176]\n[Pay Your Invoice][177]\n\n[Terms of Use][178]\n[Privacy][179]\n[Cookie Policy][180]\n[Online Reporting][181]\n[Compliance][182]\n[Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][183]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Convergint Technologies LLC, All Rights Reserved. Convergint\u00ae and the stylized \u2018i\u2019 are\nregistered trademarks of Convergint in the U.S. and abroad.\nOklahoma Alarm Locksmith License #AC1750\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][184]\n\n**Explore**\n\n[Who we are][185]\n[What we do][186]\n[Who we serve][187]\n[How we do it][188]\n[Where we operate][189]\n\n[ ][190] [ ][191] [ ][192] [ ][193] [ ][194]\n\n[Careers][195]\n[Contact][196]\n[Locations][197]\n\n[News & Insights][198]\n[Our Values & Beliefs][199]\n\n[iCare Standard Customer Portal][200]\n[Pay Your Invoice][201]\n\n[Terms of Use][202]\n[Privacy][203]\n[Cookie Policy][204]\n[Online Reporting][205]\n[Compliance][206]\n[Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][207]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Convergint Technologies LLC, All Rights Reserved. Convergint\u00ae and the stylized \u2018i\u2019 are\nregistered trademarks of Convergint in the U.S. and abroad.\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][208]\n\n**Ontdekken**\n\n[Wie wij zijn][209]\n[Wat wij doen][210]\n[Wie wij bedienen][211]\n[Hoe we het doen][212]\n[Waar wij actief zijn][213]\n\n[ ][214] [ ][215] [ ][216] [ ][217] [ ][218]\n\n[Carri\u00e8res][219]\n[Contact][220]\n[Locaties][221]\n\n[Nieuws en inzichten][222]\n\n[iCare klantenportaal][223]\n[Betaal uw factuur][224]\n\n[Gebruiksvoorwaarden][225]\n[Privacy][226]\n[Cookiebeleid][227]\n[Online rapportage][228]\n[Naleving][229]\n[Verkoop of deel mijn persoonlijke gegevens niet][230]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Convergint Technologies LLC, alle rechten voorbehouden. Convergint\u00ae en de gestileerde 'i'\nzijn geregistreerde handelsmerken van Convergint in de VS en daarbuiten.\n\n[[Convergint Logo]][231]\n\n**Udforske**\n\n[Hvem vi er][232]\n[Hvad vi g\u00f8r][233]\n[Industrier][234]\n[S\u00e5dan g\u00f8r vi det][235]\n[Hvor vi opererer][236]\n\n[ ][237] [ ][238] [ ][239] [ ][240] [ ][241]\n\n[Karriere][242]\n[Kontakte][243]\n[Hvor vi o