      "polished_summary": "Convergint is a global service-based organization specializing in the design, installation, and servicing of integrated security systems and technology solutions across various industries. The company offers a comprehensive range of products, including access control, video surveillance, intrusion detection, and fire safety systems, along with consulting, installation, and maintenance services tailored to enhance security programs for organizations of all sizes. With a commitment to protecting people, the planet, and purpose, Convergint serves clients seeking innovative and reliable security solutions.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Convergint specializes in integrated security systems, including access control, video surveillance, and intrusion detection, which are directly relevant to Cyber-Physical Systems Security. They provide design, installation, and maintenance services tailored to enhance security programs, making them a significant player in this market.",
