      "polished_summary": "Rapid7 is a leading cybersecurity company that offers an integrated platform designed to enhance security operations through AI-driven solutions. Its core services include Managed Detection and Response (MDR), Exposure Management, Attack Surface Management, and Vulnerability Management, catering to organizations seeking to strengthen their defenses against evolving cyber threats. With a focus on preemptive security and continuous risk assessment, Rapid7 empowers businesses to protect their digital environments effectively.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Rapid7 provides a range of cybersecurity services and products that directly address the needs of Cyber-Physical Systems Security, including Managed Detection and Response (MDR), Vulnerability Management, and Threat Intelligence. Their focus on enhancing security operations through AI-driven solutions aligns well with the target market.",
