      "polished_summary": "Rapiscan Systems is a global leader in security screening products and solutions, specializing in advanced threat detection technologies. The company offers a comprehensive range of products, including baggage and parcel inspection systems, people screening solutions, and cargo and vehicle inspection technologies, catering to diverse markets such as aviation, law enforcement, defense, and critical infrastructure. With a focus on maximizing operational success and safety, Rapiscan Systems is dedicated to providing innovative security solutions that meet the evolving needs of its clients.",
