e Cybersecurity Platform\n\n# Take Control of Every Threat\n\nSophos unites unmatched threat intelligence, adaptive AI, and human expertise in an open platform to\nstop attacks before they strike \u2014 giving you the clarity and confidence to stay ahead of every\nthreat.\n\n[Free trial][134]\n[Start demo][135]\n[Sophos Central]\n[\n\nSOPHOS MDR\n\n## World\u2019s largest Agentic SOC\n\nAI speed. Human judgment. Fully managed, 24/7 detection and response for the agentic era.\n\n][136][\n\nSOPHOS ENDPOINT\n\n## AI-era attacks stop here\n\nMatches AI velocity, automatically blocking the techniques at the heart of attacks.\n\n][137][\n\nIDENTITY SECURITY\n\n## The State of Identity Security 2026\n\nDiscover the causes and consequences of identity breaches from 5,000 IT leaders.\n\n][138]\nYour browser does not support the video tag.\n\nAdaptive AI-Native Cybersecurity Platform\n\n# Take Control of Every Threat\n\nSophos unites unmatched threat intelligence, adaptive AI, and human expertise in an open platform to\nstop attacks before they strike \u2014 giving you the clarity and confidence to stay ahead of every\nthreat.\n\n[Free trial][139]\n[Start demo][140]\n[\n\nSOPHOS MDR\n\n## World\u2019s largest Agentic SOC\n\nAI speed. Human judgment. Fully managed, 24/7 detection and response for the agentic era.\n\n][141][\n\nSOPHOS ENDPOINT\n\n## AI-era attacks stop here\n\nMatches AI velocity, automatically blocking the techniques at the heart of attacks.\n\n][142][\n\nIDENTITY SECURITY\n\n## The State of Identity Security 2026\n\nDiscover the causes and consequences of identity breaches from 5,000 IT leaders.\n\n][143]\n[Sophos Central]\n\n## Defeat cyberattacks\n\nSophos delivers adaptive, AI-powered cybersecurity \u2014 backed by real experts \u2014 so organizations can\nstay secure, resilient, and free to grow without compromise.\n\nEmpower your organization \u2014 from small businesses to global enterprises \u2014 with scalable solutions\nand expert support tailored to you.\n\nGet 24/7 protection through expert-led managed detection and response (MDR) services, helping\norganizations detect and respond to threats in real time.\n\nSimplify your cybersecurity with an open, integrated platform that adapts to any infrastructure,\nmaximizing existing investments.\n\nLeading security professionals recommend Sophos\n\n[Leading Security Professional - IDC]\n[Logo2]\n[Logo3]\n[Logo4]\n[Logo5]\n[Logo6]\n[Logo7]\n[Logo 8]\n[Logo 9]\n[Leading Security Professional - IDC]\n[Logo2]\n[Logo3]\n[Logo4]\n[Logo5]\n[Logo6]\n[Logo7]\n[Logo 8]\n[Logo 9]\n[Leading Security Professional - IDC]\n[Logo2]\n[Logo3]\n[Logo4]\n[Logo5]\n[Logo6]\n[Logo7]\n[Logo 8]\n[Logo 9]\n[Leading Security Professional - IDC]\n[Logo2]\n[Logo3]\n[Logo4]\n[Logo5]\n[Logo6]\n[Logo7]\n[Logo 8]\n[Logo 9]\n[Leading Security Professional - IDC]\n[Logo2]\n[Logo3]\n[Logo4]\n[Logo5]\n[Logo6]\n[Logo7]\n[Logo 8]\n[Logo 9]\n[Leading Security Professional - IDC]\n[Logo2]\n[Logo3]\n[Logo4]\n[Logo5]\n[Logo6]\n[Logo7]\n[Logo 8]\n[Logo 9]\n\n## Sophos advantage in cybersecurity\n\n[Home - Cards icon 1]\n\n### Prevention\n\nSophos\u2019 approach blocks more threats upfront to minimize risk and reduce investigation and response\ntime.\n\n[Home - cards icon 2]\n\n### Trust\n\nThe only vendor named Gartner\u00ae Customers\u2019 choice for endpoint, firewalls, mobile threats, and MDR,\nwith 600K+ customers worldwide.\n\n[Home - cards icon 3]\n\n### Platform\n\nSophos products include 100+ integrations with other third-party solutions, plus services that are\nhighly customizable to your needs.\n\n[Home - Floating Images with Parallax - Image 4]\n[Home - Floating Images with Parallax - Image 5]\n[Home - Floating Images with Parallax - Image 1]\n[Home - Floating Images with Parallax - Image 2]\n[Home - Floating Images with Parallax - Image 3]\n\n## Stop threats before\n## they strike\n\nSophos takes a prevention\u2011first approach to security by stopping threats earlier \u2014 blocking\nransomware, phishing, and credential\u2011based attacks before they spread \u2014 so teams can reduce noise\nand stay focused on what matters.\n\n[Contact a Sophos expert today][144]\n\n## Adaptive AI-native cybersecurity platform\n\nSophos Central delivers unrivalled protection for customers and enhances the power of defenders.\nDynamic defenses, battle-proven AI, and an open, integration-rich ecosystem come together in the\nlargest AI-native platform in the industry.\n\n[Home page - focus scroll 01]\n[Sophos Attack Simulation]\n[Sophos Integrations]\n\n### Dynamic Defenses\n\nProtection is updated based on real-time inputs while adaptive defenses automatically respond to\nthreats.\n\n[About Sophos Central][145]\n\n### Battle-proven AI\n\n50+ GenAI an"
