reat Exposure Management][116]\n[Accelerate M&A and Divestitures][117]\nIndustry & Market Solutions\n[Healthcare][118]\n[Banking & Financial Services][119]\n[Manufacturing][120]\n[Education][121]\n[Australia Government][122]\n[China Government][123]\n[US Public Sector][124]\n[US Federal Government][125]\n[US State & Local Government][126]\n[APJ Mid-Market / Commercial][127]\nPartners\n[Explore Our Partners][128]\n[Become a Partner][129]\n[Partner Portal][130]\nTechnology Partners\n[Explore Technology Partners][131]\n[Microsoft][132]\n[CrowdStrike][133]\n[AWS][134]\n[Okta][135]\n[Rubrik][136]\n[SAP][137]\n\n##### Resource Center\n\n[Resource Library][138]\n[Blog][139]\n[Customer Success Stories][140]\n[Webinars][141]\n[Zpedia][142]\n\n##### Events & Trainings\n\n[Upcoming Events][143]\n[Zenith Live][144]\n[Zscaler Cyber Academy][145]\n\n##### Security Research & Services\n\n[ThreatLabz Analytics][146]\n[Security Advisory Updates][147]\n\n##### Tools\n\n[Security Preview][148]\n[Security and Risk Assessment][149]\n[Disclose a Vulnerability][150]\n[Executive Insights App][151]\n[Ransomware Protection ROI Calculator][152]\n\n##### Community & Support\n\n[Customer Success Center][153]\n[Zenith Community][154]\n[Zscaler Help Portal][155]\nResource Center\n[Resource Library][156]\n[Blog][157]\n[Customer Success Stories][158]\n[Webinars][159]\n[Zpedia][160]\nEvents & Trainings\n[Upcoming Events][161]\n[Zenith Live][162]\n[Zscaler Cyber Academy][163]\nSecurity Research & Services\n[ThreatLabz Analytics][164]\n[Security Advisory Updates][165]\nTools\n[Security Preview][166]\n[Security and Risk Assessment][167]\n[Disclose a Vulnerability][168]\n[Executive Insights App][169]\n[Ransomware Protection ROI Calculator][170]\nCommunity & Support\n[Customer Success Center][171]\n[Zenith Community][172]\n[Zscaler Help Portal][173]\n[About Zscaler\n][174]\n\nDiscover how it began and where it\u2019s going\n\n[Partners\n][175]\n\nMeet our partners and explore system integrators and technology alliances\n\n[News & Announcements\n][176]\n\nStay up to date with the latest news\n\n[Leadership Team\n][177]\n\nMeet our management team\n\n[Partner Integrations\n][178]\n\nExplore our technology partner integrations\n\n[Investor Relations\n][179]\n\nSee news, stock information, and quarterly reports\n\n[Careers\n][180]\n\nJoin our mission\n\n[Compliance\n][181]\n\nUnderstand our adherence to rigorous standards\n\n[Press Center\n][182]\n\nFind everything you need to cover Zscaler\n\n[Culture\n][183]\n\nOur values, leadership principles, and ways of working\n\n[Zenith Ventures\n][184]\n\nLearn about our strategic startup investments\n\n[Corporate Responsibility\n][185]\n\nLearn about our approach\n\n[Home][186]\n[Take a product tour][187][Request a demo][188]\n[racing-innovation-meets-zero-trust]\n[racing-innovation-meets-zero-trust]\n[racing-innovation-meets-zero-trust]\n[zscaler-aramco-global-partner-logo]\n\n# Racing innovation meets\u00a0\n\n# Zero Trust\n\nAston Martin Aramco Formula One\u2122 Team and Zscaler are\u00a0\n\nset to achieve new speed and performance records together\n\n[Read More][189]\nZenith Live 2026 Recap\n\nKeynotes, product announcements, and customer highlights. See the biggest announcements and\ntakeaways from the premier AI cybersecurity event.\n\n[Read More][190]\n[zenith-live-26-recap-large]\n\nExclusive Webinar\n\nFortiBleed: Why a Firewall-based Model is Still a Liability\n\nJoin Zscaler leaders for an urgent breakdown of what the largest firewall credential compromise of\n2026 means for every organization still relying on firewall-based perimeter security.\n\n[Register Now(opens in a new tab)][191]\n[FortiBleed: Why a Firewall-based Model is Still a Liability]\n\n## The Zscaler Platform\n\nThe cybersecurity platform for the AI Age - built on Zero Trust to protect users, workloads,\nbranches and devices through the world\u2019s largest inline security cloud.\n\n[zscaler-platform-platform-diagram]\n\n##### Data Security\n\nSecure data everywhere, with comprehensive visibility and controls across all channels.\n\n##### AI Security\n\nEmbrace AI with confidence using Zscaler AI Protect, a unified solution to secure AI at scale.\n\n##### Agentic SecOps\n\nDraw on insights from the world\u2019s largest inline security cloud and third-party sources to assess\nrisk and detect and contain breaches.\n\n[Learn more][192]\n[ThreatLabz 2026 Phishing and Initial Access Report][ThreatLabz 2026 Phishing and Initial Access\nReport]\n\n## ThreatLabz 2026 Phishing and Initial Access Report\n\nPhishing is getting quieter and more dangerous. Although volume is down ~20% YoY, AI is accelerating\ntargeted lures and initial access.\n\n\u00a0\n\nZscaler ThreatLabz uncovered how attackers are now moving beyond the inbox; by probing exposed\nattack surfaces, validating stolen credentials, and executing account takeover inside encrypted\ntraffic.\n\n[Get the full report][193]\n\n## Accelerate Your AI Initiatives\n\n[ai-asset-management]\n\n##### AI Asset Management\n\nDiscover your full AI footprint and risks\n\n[secure-access-to-ai-apps]\n\n##### Secure Access to AI Apps\n\nEnsure the safe and responsible use of \u00a0AI applications\n\n[secure-a-apps-&-infrastructure]\n\n##### Secure AI Apps & Infrastructure\n\nHarden AI systems and prompts and enforce runtime protection\n\n[Learn More][194]\n\n## The most trusted AI Security Platform\n\n40%\n\n### of Global 2000 companies use Zscaler\n\n[See our customers][195]\n\n500B+\n\n### transactions secured daily by Zscaler\n\n[See the data][196]\n\n>75\n\n### Net Promoter Score\n\n[See case studies][197]\n[\n[gartner-logo]\n\nLeader in Gartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for SSE\n\n][198]\n[\n[microsoft-logo]\n\n2022 Zero Trust Champion of the Year\n\n][199]\n[\n[nist-logo]\n\nSelected by the National Cybersecurity Center of Excellence\n\n][200]\n[\n[fortune-logo]\n\nBest Places to Work in Technology\n\n][201]\n[See more news and press][202]\n\n## Empowering leading organizations around the world\n\n### T-Mobile deploys Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange within its operations in just 3 months\n\nWatch the video\nManufacturing360,000 employees192 countries\n\n### Siemens kick-starts digital transformation by becoming a true zero trust enterprise\n\n[Read the customer story][203]\nTransportation Services80,000+ employees350+ locations worldwide\n\n### United Airlines detects and blocks evolving threats with Zscaler\n\n[Read the customer story][204]\n\n### Full AI traffic visibility and access control with tailored policies, empowering productivity\n### See\n\n[See the full story][205]\n[zscaler-customer-t-mobile]\n[t-mobile-logo]\nWatch the video\n[siemens main]\n[siemens white]\n[United Main]\n[United white]\n[zscaler-csutomer-borgwarner]\n[borgwarner-logo]\nNaN/04\n[t-mobile-logo]\n[Siemens gray]\n[United gray]\n[borgwarner-logo]\n\n#### Hear from our customers on how they reclaim capital & reduce risk with zero trust architecture\n\n[See the infographic][206]\n\n## Secure, simplify, and transform your enterprise with zero trust\n\n[superior-protection]\n\n##### Achieve superior protection\n\nStop cyberattacks, prevent data loss, and securely embrace AI\n\n[agility-and-productivity]\n\n##### Increase agility and productivity\n\nAccelerate branch deployments, cloud adoption, and M&A time to value\n\n[cost-and-complexity]\n\n##### Reduce costs and complexity\n\nEliminate firewalls and point products, and slash infrastructure spend\n\nnews and events\n\n## Latest events and announcements\n\n[Zenith Live 2026 Recap]\n\nZenith Live 2026 Recap\n\n[Read More][207]\n[threatlabz-phishing-initial-access-report]\n\nINDUSTRY REPORT\n\nThreatLabz 2026 Phishing and Initial Access Report\n\n[Get the full report][208]\n[Zscaler Is Proud to be Part of Project Glasswing]\n\nNews and Announcements\n\nZscaler Is Proud to be Part of Project Glasswing: AI Can\u2019t Breach What It Can\u2019t Find\n\n[Read the Announcement][209]\n[Zscaler and OpenAI Partner to Advance the Next Era of Cybersecurity]\n\nNews and Announcements\n\nZscaler and OpenAI Partner to Advance the Next Era of Cybersecurity\n\n[Read the Announcement][210]\n[thumb-news-events-vpn-risk-report]\n\nINDUSTRY REPORT\n\nZscaler ThreatLabz 2026 VPN Risk Report with Cybersecurity Insiders\n\n[Get the full report][211]\n[ThreatLabz 2026 AI Security Report]\n\nIndustry Report\n\nThreatLabz 2026 AI Security Report\n\n[Get the full report][212]\n[gartner-customer-choice-for-sse]\n\nIndustry Report\n\nZscaler is a 2025 Customers\u2019 Choice in the Gartner\u00ae Peer Insights\u2122\ufe0f \u201cVoice of the Customer\u201d for\nSecurity Service Edge\n\n[Get the full report"
