      "polished_summary": "Zscaler is a leading cloud security company that specializes in providing secure access to applications and data through its Zero Trust architecture. Its core offerings include Secure Internet Access (ZIA) and Secure Private Access (ZPA), designed to protect users and workloads across various environments, including cloud, IoT, and operational technology. Targeting industries such as healthcare, finance, and government, Zscaler empowers organizations to enhance security while enabling seamless connectivity and operational efficiency.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Zscaler provides specialized security services for Cyber-Physical Systems through its Zero Trust architecture, particularly in securing IoT and operational technology (OT) devices. Their products like Secure IoT/OT and Secure Private Access are directly applicable to the Cyber-Physical Systems Security market.",
