ng AI ][64]\n* [Hiring journey ][65]\n* [Pro tips ][66]\n* [Contact Us][67]\n* [Careers][68]\n* [Locations][69]\n* [\nlinkedin\n][70]\n* [\nfacebook\n][71]\n* [\ninstagram\n][72]\nSearch\n][73]\nIndia\n\nCurrent Country: United States\n* Default (English)\n* All COUNTRIES & LANGUAGES\n* [Argentina (Spanish)][74]\n* [Australia (English)][75]\n* [Austria (German) ][76]\n* [Belgium (English)][77]\n* [Brazil (Portuguese)][78]\n* [Bulgaria (English)][79]\n* [Canada (English)][80]\n* [Canada (French) ][81]\n* [Chile (Spanish)][82]\n* [China/Hong Kong SAR (English)][83]\n* [China/Mainland (Chinese)][84]\n* [China/Mainland (English)][85]\n* [Colombia (Spanish)][86]\n* [Costa Rica (English)][87]\n* [Czech Republic (English)][88]\n* [Denmark (English)][89]\n* [Finland (English)][90]\n* [France (French)][91]\n* [Germany (German)][92]\n* [Greece (English)][93]\n* [Hungary (English)][94]\n* [India (English)][95]\n* [Indonesia (English)][96]\n* [Ireland (English)][97]\n* [Israel (English)][98]\n* [Italy (Italian)][99]\n* [Japan (Japanese)][100]\n* [Latvia (English)][101]\n* [Luxembourg (English)][102]\n* [Malaysia (English)][103]\n* [Mauritius (English)][104]\n* [Mexico (Spanish)][105]\n* [Morocco (English)][106]\n* [Netherlands (English)][107]\n* [New Zealand (English)][108]\n* [Norway (English)][109]\n* [Philippines (English)][110]\n* [Poland (English)][111]\n* [Poland (Polish)][112]\n* [Portugal (Portuguese)][113]\n* [Romania (English)][114]\n* [Saudi Arabia (English)][115]\n* [Singapore (English)][116]\n* [Slovakia (English)][117]\n* [South Africa (English)][118]\n* [Spain (Spanish)][119]\n* [Sweden (English)][120]\n* [Switzerland (English)][121]\n* [Thailand (English)][122]\n* [UAE (English)][123]\n* [United Kingdom (English)][124]\n* [USA (English)][125]\n\n[Who we are][126]\n[ Commitments ][127] [ Locations ][128] [ Awards ][129] [ Leadership ][130]\nExpand Menu\n[Commitments][131] [Locations][132] [Awards][133] [Leadership][134]\n\n# Accenture in India\n\n## Every day, the people of Accenture embrace change and create value for all our stakeholders, in\n## every part of the world\u2014we call it 360\u00b0 value.\n\n## Creating positive change\n\n### We\u2019re committed to creating positive change around the world and ensuring we act as responsible\n### business leaders for our people, our clients, and the communities we call home.\n\n### Delivering 360 value\n\nExplore the value we deliver to our clients, people, shareholders, partners and communities.\n\nLearn more\n][135]\n\n### Code of business ethics\n\nAt Accenture, our people care deeply about doing the right thing. Together, we have proven that we\ncan succeed\u2014providing value to our clients and shareholders and opportunities for our people\u2014while\nbeing a powerful force for good. Our shared commitment to operating with the highest ethical\nstandards and making a positive difference in everything we do is what makes Accenture special.\n\nLearn more\n][136]\n\n### Innovation\n\nInnovation at Accenture is a mindset\u2014hardwired into everything we do. Discover how we connect tech,\ntalent, and bold thinking to create real, lasting value through our innovation lifecycle.\n\nLearn more\n][137]\n\n### Sustainability\n\nWe help our clients advance their environmental, social and governance goals by connecting\nsustainability to their transformations; operate our business with a strong commitment to the\nenvironment, ethics and human rights; and work to create value in communities around the world.\n\nFind out more\n][138]\n\n### Inclusion and Diversity\n\nWe hire and develop people who have different backgrounds, different perspectives, and different\nlived experiences. These differences ensure that we have and attract the cognitive diversity to\ndeliver a variety of perspectives, observations, and insights which are essential to drive the\ninnovation needed to reinvent.\n\nFind out more\n][139]\n\n### Responsible AI\n\nPowerful AI tools like generative AI bring unprecedented opportunities as well as new risks. We help\nclients to take intentional actions to design, deploy and use AI to create value and build trust.\n\nLearn more\n][140]\n\n### Transparent workforce reporting\n\nWe build trust with transparency. We\u2019re shining a lot of light on how far we\u2019ve come and identifying\nwhere we need to continue taking action.\n\nSee our latest India workforce report\n][141]\n\n### Corporate Citizenship\n\nAs a responsible [Corporate Citizen][142] we\u2019re committed to creating positive change around the\nworld for our people, our clients, and the communities we call home. Working alongside our not for\nprofit and other industry partners we innovate for society and shape responsible businesses. We\nsupport and empower our local marginalized workforce through our Skills to Succeed initiative and\nprepare them to navigate their livelihood journeys. In 2020, our Skills to Succeed program surpassed\nthe goal of equipping more than three million people with the skills to get a job or build a\nbusiness.\n\nFind out more\n][143]\n\n## Making reinvention real for our clients\n\nReinvention Services brings together the full breadth of Accenture, enabling us to solve your most\ncomplex problems and deliver reinvention at greater scale and impact.\n\nLearn more\n][144]\n\n799k\n\nAccenture employees worldwide\n\n9,000+\n\nclients served across more than 120 countries\n\n350+\n\npartners in our ecosystem\n\n## Office and operations in 49 countries and 200+ cities\n\nSee all locations\n][145]\n* [\nBengaluru\n][146]\n* [\n[Accenture]\nChennai\n][147]\n* [\nDelhi NCR\n][148]\n* [\nHyderabad\n][149]\n* [\nKolkata\n][150]\n* [\nMumbai\n][151]\n* [\nPune\n][152]\nSee all locations\n][153]\n\n## We\u2019re recognized for the value we create together\n\nToggle awards card detail view\n\n### We drive reinvention with innovation and human ingenuity.\n\nWe are celebrating Accenture being one of Fortune\u2019s World\u2019s Most Admired Companies, TIME\u2019s World\u2019s\nBest Companies and Kantar BrandZ\u2019s Most Valuable Global Brands; and our Chair and CEO Julie Sweet\nbeing named one of the TIME100 World\u2019s Most Influential People.\n\nLearn more\n][154]\nToggle awards card detail view\n\n### We service our clients, customers and employees with excellence.\n\nWe are recognized as one of the best-managed companies by The Wall Street Journal, for the ninth\nyear in a row.\n\nLearn more\n][155]\nToggle awards card detail view\n\n### We create exceptional experiences for our people.\n\nWe are No. 4 on the Great Place To Work\u00ae World\u2019s Best Workplaces\u2122 list, which is based on feedback\nfrom our people; and we earned a top spot on the Forbes World\u2019s Best Management Consulting Firms\nlist.\n\nLearn more\n][156]\n\n## Leading with vision and experience\n\n### Julie Sweet\n\nChair & CEO\n\nLinkedIn\n][157]\n\n### Mauro Macchi\n\nCEO \u2013 Europe, Middle East and Africa (EMEA)\n\nLinkedIn\n][158]\n\n### John Walsh\n\nCEO of the Americas and Market Unit Lead \u2013 US\n\nLinkedIn\n][159]\n\n### Atsushi Egawa\n\nChairman of Accenture Japan and Co-CEO of Asia Pacific\n\nLinkedIn\n][160]\n\n### Ryoji Sekido\n\nCo-CEO of Asia Pacific and CEO of Asia Oceania\n\nLinkedIn\n][161]\n\n## Like this content?\n\n### Stay ahead of change by downloading the Accenture Foresight App.\n\n## Let there be change\n* [Preference Center][162]\n* [Careers][163]\n* [About Us][164]\n* [Contact Us][165]\n* [Locations][166]\n* [Sitemap][167]\n* [Privacy Statement][168]\n* [Terms & Conditions][169]\n* [Cookie Policy/Settings][170]\n* [Accessibility Statement][171]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Accenture. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: #footer\n[3]: /in-en\n[4]: /in-en\n[5]: /in-en/services\n[6]: /in-en/services/ai-data\n[7]: /in-en/services/cloud\n[8]: /in-en/services/customer-service\n[9]: /in-en/services/cybersecurity\n[10]: /in-en/services/digital-engineering-manufacturing\n[11]: /in-en/services/ecosystem-partners\n[12]: /in-en/services/emerging-technology\n[13]: /in-en/services/finance-risk\n[14]: /in-en/services/infrastructure-capital-projects\n[15]: /in-en/services/learning\n[16]: /in-en/services/managed-services\n[17]: /in-en/services/marketing-experience\n[18]: /in-en/services/metaverse\n[19]: /in-en/services/sales-commerce\n[20]: /in-en/services/strategy\n[21]: /in-en/services/supply-chain\n[22]: /in-en/services/sustainability\n[23]: /in-en/services/talent-organization\n[24]: /in-en/services/technology-transformation\n[25]: /in-en/industries/aerospace-defense\n[26]: /in-en/industries/automotive\n[27]: /in-en/industries/banking\n[28]: /in-en/industries/capital-markets\n[29]: /in-en/industries/chemicals\n[30]: /in-en/industries/communications-media\n[31]: /in-en/industries/consumer-goods-services\n[32]: /in-en/industries/energy\n[33]: /in-en/industries/health\n[34]: /in-en/industries/high-tech\n[35]: /in-en/industries/industrial-equipment\n[36]: /in-en/industries/insurance\n[37]: /in-en/industries/life-sciences\n[38]: /in-en/industries/natural-resources\n[39]: /in-en/industries/public-service\n[40]: /in-en/industries/private-equity\n[41]: /in-en/industries/retail\n[42]: /in-en/industries/software-platforms\n[43]: /in-en/industries/travel\n[44]: /in-en/industries/utilities\n[45]: /in-en/insights\n[46]: /in-en/about/company-index\n[47]: /in-en/about/reinvention-services\n[48]: /in-en/about/leadership\n[49]: /in-en/about/location\n[50]: /in-en/about/company/integrated-reporting\n[51]: /in-en/about/corporate-sustainability\n[52]: /in-en/about/awards-recognition\n[53]: /in-en/about/company/industry-analyst\n[54]: https://newsroom.accenture.com/\n[55]: https://investor.accenture.com/\n[56]: https://investor.accenture.com/corporate-governance/board-of-directors\n[57]: /in-en/careers\n[58]: /in-en/careers/jobsearch\n[59]: /in-en/careers/explore-careers/career-areas\n[60]: /in-en/careers/life-at-accenture/working-here\n[61]: /in-en/careers/local/benefits\n[62]: /in-en/careers/life-at-accenture/work-environment\n[63]: /in-en/blogs/blogs-careers\n[64]: /in-en/careers/explore-careers/area-of-interest/ai-usage-job-search\n[65]: /in-en/careers/explore-careers/area-of-interest/journey-to-accenture\n[66]: /in-en/careers/explore-careers/area-of-interest/pro-tips\n[67]: /in-en/about/contact-us\n[68]: /in-en/careers\n[69]: /in-en/about/location\n[70]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/accenture\n[71]: https://www.facebook.com/accenture\n[72]: https://www.instagram.com/accenture/\n[73]: /in-en/search\n[74]: /ar-es\n[75]: /au-en\n[76]: /at-de\n[77]: /be-en\n[78]: /br-pt\n[79]: /bg-en\n[80]: /c"
