            "url": "https://accenture.com/company",
            "text": "[Skip to main content][1] [Skip to footer][2]\nMenu\n[ [Accenture] ][3] [\n[Accenture]\n][4]\nClose Menu\n* What we do\nBack\nWhat we do\n][5]\nCapabilities Capabilities\n* [Artificial Intelligence and Data ][6]\n* [Cloud ][7]\n* [Customer Service ][8]\n* [Cybersecurity ][9]\n* [Digital Engineering and Manufacturing ][10]\n* [Ecosystem Partners ][11]\n* [Emerging Technology ][12]\n* [Finance and Risk Management ][13]\n* [Infrastructure and Capital Projects ][14]\n* [Learning ][15]\n* [Managed Services ][16]\n* [Marketing and Experience ][17]\n* [Metaverse ][18]\n* [Sales and Commerce ][19]\n* [Strategy ][20]\n* [Supply Chain ][21]\n* [Sustainability ][22]\n* [Talent and Organization ][23]\n* [Technology Transformation ][24]\nIndustries Industries\n* [Aerospace and Defense ][25]\n* [Automotive ][26]\n* [Banking ][27]\n* [Capital Markets ][28]\n* [Chemicals ][29]\n* [Communications and Media ][30]\n* [Consumer Goods and Services ][31]\n* [Energy ][32]\n* [Health ][33]\n* [High Tech ][34]\n* [Industrial ][35]\n* [Insurance ][36]\n* [Life Sciences ][37]\n* [Natural Resources ][38]\n* [Public Service ][39]\n* [Private Equity ][40]\n* [Retail ][41]\n* [Software and Platforms ][42]\n* [Travel ][43]\n* [US Federal Government ][44]\n* [Utilities ][45]\n* [\nWhat we think\n][46]\n* Who we are\nBack\nAbout Accenture\n][47]\nOur organization Our organization\n* [Reinvention Services ][48]\n* [Leaders ][49]\n* [Locations ][50]\n* [360\u00b0 Value Report ][51]\n* [Corporate Sustainability ][52]\nAwards & rankings Awards & rankings\n* [Awards and Recognition ][53]\n* [Industry Analyst Recognition ][54]\nMedia & Investors Media & Investors\n* [Media Relations ][55]\n* [Investor Relations ][56]\n* [Board of Directors ][57]\n* Careers\nBack\nCareers homepage\n][58]\nFind a job Find a job\n* [Search for jobs ][59]\n* [Career areas ][60]\nLife at Accenture Life at Accenture\n* [Working here ][61]\n* [Benefits ][62]\n* [Work environment ][63]\n* [Careers blog ][64]\nHow we hire How we hire\n* [Using AI ][65]\n* [Hiring journey ][66]\n* [Pro tips ][67]\n* [Contact Us][68]\n* [Careers][69]\n* [Locations][70]\n* [\nlinkedin\n][71]\n* [\nfacebook\n][72]\n* [\ninstagram\n][73]\nSearch\n][74]\nUSA\n\nCurrent Country: United States\n* Default (English)\n* All COUNTRIES & LANGUAGES\n* [Argentina (Spanish)][75]\n* [Australia (English)][76]\n* [Austria (German) ][77]\n* [Belgium (English)][78]\n* [Brazil (Portuguese)][79]\n* [Bulgaria (English)][80]\n* [Canada (English)][81]\n* [Canada (French) ][82]\n* [Chile (Spanish)][83]\n* [China/Hong Kong SAR (English)][84]\n* [China/Mainland (Chinese)][85]\n* [China/Mainland (English)][86]\n* [Colombia (Spanish)][87]\n* [Costa Rica (English)][88]\n* [Czech Republic (English)][89]\n* [Denmark (English)][90]\n* [Finland (English)][91]\n* [France (French)][92]\n* [Germany (German)][93]\n* [Greece (English)][94]\n* [Hungary (English)][95]\n* [India (English)][96]\n* [Indonesia (English)][97]\n* [Ireland (English)][98]\n* [Israel (English)][99]\n* [Italy (Italian)][100]\n* [Japan (Japanese)][101]\n* [Latvia (English)][102]\n* [Luxembourg (English)][103]\n* [Malaysia (English)][104]\n* [Mauritius (English)][105]\n* [Mexico (Spanish)][106]\n* [Morocco (English)][107]\n* [Netherlands (English)][108]\n* [New Zealand (English)][109]\n* [Norway (English)][110]\n* [Philippines (English)][111]\n* [Poland (English)][112]\n* [Poland (Polish)][113]\n* [Portugal (Portuguese)][114]\n* [Romania (English)][115]\n* [Saudi Arabia (English)][116]\n* [Singapore (English)][117]\n* [Slovakia (English)][118]\n* [South Africa (English)][119]\n* [Spain (Spanish)][120]\n* [Sweden (English)][121]\n* [Switzerland (English)][122]\n* [Thailand (English)][123]\n* [UAE (English)][124]\n* [United Kingdom (English)][125]\n* [USA (English)][126]\n\n[Who we are][127]\n[ Commitments ][128] [ Locations ][129] [ Awards ][130] [ Leadership ][131]\nExpand Menu\n[Commitments][132] [Locations][133] [Awards][134] [Leadership][135]\n\n# Accenture in the United States\n\n## Every day, the people of Accenture embrace change and create value for all our stakeholders, in\n## every part of the world\u2014we call it 360\u00b0 value.\n\n## Creating positive change\n\n### We\u2019re committed to creating positive change around the world and ensuring we act as responsible\n### business leaders for our people, our clients, and the communities we call home.\n\n### Delivering 360 value\n\nExplore the value we deliver to our clients, people, shareholders, partners and communities.\n\nLearn more\n][136]\n\n### Code of business ethics\n\nAt Accenture, our people care deeply about doing the right thing. Together, we have proven that we\ncan succeed\u2014providing value to our clients and shareholders and opportunities for our people\u2014while\nbeing a powerful force for good. Our shared commitment to operating with the highest ethical\nstandards and making a positive difference in everything we do is what makes Accenture special.\n\nLearn more\n][137]\n\n### Innovation\n\nInnovation at Accenture is a mindset\u2014hardwired into everything we do. Discover how we connect tech,\ntalent, and bold thinking to create real, lasting value through our innovation lifecycle.\n\nLearn more\n][138]\n\n### Sustainability\n\nWe help our clients advance their environmental, social and governance goals by connecting\nsustainability to their transformations; operate our business with a strong commitment to the\nenvironment, ethics and human rights; and work to create value in communities around the world.\n\nFind out more\n][139]\n\n### Inclusion and Diversity\n\nWe hire and develop people who have different backgrounds, different perspectives, and different\nlived experiences. These differences ensure that we have and attract the cognitive diversity to\ndeliver a variety of perspectives, observations, and insights which are essential to drive the\ninnovation needed to reinvent.\n\nFind out more\n][140]\n\n### Responsible AI\n\nPowerful AI tools like generative AI bring unprecedented opportunities as well as new risks. We help\nclients to take intentional actions to design, deploy and use AI to create value and build trust.\n\nLearn more\n][141]\n\n### Transparent workforce reporting\n\nWe share our workforce demographics because we believe transparency builds trust. We appreciate all\nour people for the innovation, insight and incredible talent they bring to their work.\n\nSee our latest US workforce report\n][142]\n\n### Apprenticeship\n\nOur Apprenticeship program is one way we\u2019re building a more inclusive workforce\u2014one that will\nadvance economic mobility, innovation, and a more sustainable and equitable future for all.\n\nFind out more\n][143]\n\n## Making reinvention real for our clients\n\nReinvention Services brings together the full breadth of Accenture, enabling us to solve your most\ncomplex problems and deliver reinvention at greater scale and impact.\n\nLearn more\n][144]\n\n799k\n\nAccenture employees worldwide\n\n9,000+\n\nclients served across more than 120 countries\n\n350+\n\npartners in our ecosystem\n\n## Office and operations in 52 countries and 200+ cities\n\nSee all locations\n][145]\n* [\nNew York\n][146]\n* [\nDublin\n][147]\n* [\nMilan\n][148]\n* [\nTokyo\n][149]\n* [\nMunich\n][150]\n* [\nS\u00e3o Paulo\n][151]\n* [\nBengaluru\n][152]\nSee all locations\n][153]\n\n## We\u2019re recognized for the value we create together\n\nToggle awards card detail view\n\n### We drive reinvention with innovation and human ingenuity.\n\nWe are celebrating Accenture being one of Fortune\u2019s World\u2019s Most Admired Companies, TIME\u2019s World\u2019s\nBest Companies and Kantar BrandZ\u2019s Most Valuable Global Brands; and our Chair and CEO Julie Sweet\nbeing named one of the TIME100 World\u2019s Most Influential People.\n\nLearn more\n][154]\nToggle awards card detail view\n\n### We service our clients, customers and employees with excellence.\n\nWe are recognized as one of the best-managed companies by The Wall Street Journal, for the ninth\nyear in a row.\n\nLearn more\n][155]\nToggle awards card detail view\n\n### We create exceptional experiences for our people.\n\nWe are No. 4 on the Great Place To Work\u00ae World\u2019s Best Workplaces\u2122 list, which is based on feedback\nfrom our people; and we earned a top spot on the Forbes World\u2019s Best Management Consulting Firms\nlist.\n\nLearn more\n][156]\n\n## Leading with vision and experience\n\n### Julie Sweet\n\nChair & CEO\n\nLinkedIn\n][157]\n\n### Mauro Macchi\n\nCEO \u2013 Europe, Middle East and Africa (EMEA)\n\nLinkedIn\n][158]\n\n### John Walsh\n\nCEO of the Americas and Market Unit Lead \u2013 US\n\nLinkedIn\n][159]\n\n### Atsushi Egawa\n\nChairman of Accenture Japan and Co-CEO of Asia Pacific\n\nLinkedIn\n][160]\n\n### Ryoji Sekido\n\nCo-CEO of Asia Pacific and CEO of Asia Oceania\n\nLinkedIn\n][161]\n\n## Like this content?\n\n### Stay ahead of change by downloading the Accenture Foresight App.\n\n## Let there be change\n* [Preference Center][162]\n* [Careers][163]\n* [About Us][164]\n* [Contact Us][165]\n* [Locations][166]\n* [Sitemap][167]\n* [Privacy Statement][168]\n* [Terms & Conditions][169]\n* [Cookie Policy/Settings][170]\n* [Accessibility Statement][171]\n* [Do Not Sell/Share My Personal Information][172]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Accenture. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: #footer\n[3]: /us-en\n[4]: /us-en\n[5]: /us-en/services\n[6]: /us-en/services/ai-data\n[7]: /us-en/services/cloud\n[8]: /us-en/services/customer-service\n[9]: /us-en/services/cybersecurity\n[10]: /us-en/services/digital-engineering-manufacturing\n[11]: /us-en/services/ecosystem-partners\n[12]: /us-en/services/emerging-technology\n[13]: /us-en/services/finance-risk\n[14]: /us-en/services/infrastructure-capital-projects\n[15]: /us-en/services/learning\n[16]: /us-en/services/managed-services\n[17]: /us-en/services/marketing-experience\n[18]: /us-en/services/metaverse\n[19]: /us-en/services/sales-commerce\n[20]: /us-en/services/strategy\n[21]: /us-en/services/supply-chain\n[22]: /us-en/services/sustainability\n[23]: /us-en/services/talent-organization\n[24]: /us-en/services/technology-transformation\n[25]: /us-en/industries/aerospace-defense\n[26]: /us-en/industries/automotive\n[27]: /us-en/industries/banking\n[28]: /us-en/industries/capital-markets\n[29]: /us-en/industries/chemicals\n[30]: /us-en/industries/communications-media\n[31]: /us-en/industries/consumer-goods-services\n[32]: /us-en/industries/energy\n[33]: /us-en/industries/health\n[34]: /us-en/industries/high-tech\n[35]: /us-en/industries/industrial-equipment\n[36]: /us-en/industries/insurance\n[37]: /us-en/industries/life-sciences\n[38]: /us-en/industries/natural-resources\n[39]: /us-en/industries/public-service\n[40]: /us-en/industries/private-equity\n[41]: /us-en/industries/retail\n[42]: /us-en/industries/software-platforms\n[43]: /us-en/industries/travel\n[44]: /us-en/industries/accenture-federal-services\n[45]: /us-en/industries/utilities\n[46]: /us-en/insights\n[47]: /us-en/about/company-index\n[48]: /us-en/about/reinvention-services\n[49]: /us-en/about/leadership\n[50]: /us-en/about/location\n[51]: /us-en/about/company/integrated-reporting\n[52]: /us-en/about/corporate-sustainability\n[53]: /us-en/about/awards-recognition\n[54]: /us-en/about/company/industry-analyst\n[55]: https://newsroom.accenture.com/\n[56]: https://investor.accenture.com/\n[57]: https://investor.accenture.com/corporate-governance/board-of-directors\n[58]: /us-en/careers\n[59]: /us-en/careers/jobsearch\n[60]: /us-en/careers/explore-careers/career-areas\n[61]: /us-en/careers/life-at-accenture/working-here\n[62]: /us-en/careers/local/benefits\n[63]: /us-en/careers/life-at-accenture/work-environment\n[64]: /us-en/blogs/blogs-careers\n[65]: /us-en/careers/explore-careers/area-of-interest/ai-usage-job-search\n[66]: /us-en/careers/explore-careers/area-of-interest/journey-to-accenture\n[67]: /us-en/careers/explore-careers/area-of-interest/pro-tips\n[68]: /us-en/about/contact-us\n[69]: /us-en/careers\n[70]: /us-en/about/location\n[71]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/accenture\n[72]: https://www.facebook.com/accenture\n[73]: https://www.instagram.com/accenture/\n[74]: /us-en/search\n[75]: /ar-es\n[76]: /au-en\n[77]: /at-de\n[78]: /be-en\n[79]: /br-pt\n[80]: /bg-en\n[81]: /ca-en\n[82]: /ca-fr\n[83]: /cl-es\n[84]: /hk-en\n[85]: https://www.accenture.cn/cn-zh\n[86]: /cn-en\n[87]: /co-es\n[88]: /cr-en\n[89]: /cz-en\n[90]: /dk-en\n[91]: /fi-en\n[92]: /fr-fr\n[93]: /de-de\n[94]: /gr-en\n[95]: /hu-en\n[96]: /in-en\n[97]: /id-en\n[98]: /"
