            "text": "[Skip to main content][1] [Skip to footer][2]\nMenu\n[ [Accenture] ][3] [\n[Accenture]\n][4]\nClose Menu\n* What we do\nBack\nWhat we do\n][5]\nCapabilities Capabilities\n* [Artificial Intelligence and Data ][6]\n* [Cloud ][7]\n* [Customer Service ][8]\n* [Cybersecurity ][9]\n* [Digital Engineering and Manufacturing ][10]\n* [Ecosystem Partners ][11]\n* [Emerging Technology ][12]\n* [Finance and Risk Management ][13]\n* [Infrastructure and Capital Projects ][14]\n* [Learning ][15]\n* [Managed Services ][16]\n* [Marketing and Experience ][17]\n* [Metaverse ][18]\n* [Sales and Commerce ][19]\n* [Strategy ][20]\n* [Supply Chain ][21]\n* [Sustainability ][22]\n* [Talent and Organization ][23]\n* [Technology Transformation ][24]\nIndustries Industries\n* [Aerospace and Defense ][25]\n* [Automotive ][26]\n* [Banking ][27]\n* [Capital Markets ][28]\n* [Chemicals ][29]\n* [Communications and Media ][30]\n* [Consumer Goods and Services ][31]\n* [Energy ][32]\n* [Health ][33]\n* [High Tech ][34]\n* [Industrial ][35]\n* [Insurance ][36]\n* [Life Sciences ][37]\n* [Natural Resources ][38]\n* [Public Service ][39]\n* [Private Equity ][40]\n* [Retail ][41]\n* [Software and Platforms ][42]\n* [Travel ][43]\n* [Utilities ][44]\n* [\nWhat we think\n][45]\n* Who we are\nBack\nAbout Accenture\n][46]\nOur organization Our organization\n* [Reinvention Services ][47]\n* [Leaders ][48]\n* [Locations ][49]\n* [360\u00b0 Value Report ][50]\n* [Corporate Sustainability ][51]\nAwards & rankings Awards & rankings\n* [Awards and Recognition ][52]\n* [Industry Analyst Recognition ][53]\nMedia & Investors Media & Investors\n* [Media Relations ][54]\n* [Investor Relations ][55]\n* [Board of Directors ][56]\n* Careers\nBack\nCareers homepage\n][57]\nFind a job Find a job\n* [Search for jobs ][58]\n* [Career areas ][59]\nLife at Accenture Life at Accenture\n* [Working here ][60]\n* [Benefits ][61]\n* [Work environment ][62]\n* [Careers blog ][63]\nHow we hire How we hire\n* [Using AI ][64]\n* [Hiring journey ][65]\n* [Pro tips ][66]\n* [Contact Us][67]\n* [Careers][68]\n* [Locations][69]\n* [\nlinkedin\n][70]\n* [\nfacebook\n][71]\n* [\ninstagram\n][72]\nSearch\n][73]\nIndia\n\nCurrent Country: United States\n* Default (English)\n* All COUNTRIES & LANGUAGES\n* [Argentina (Spanish)][74]\n* [Australia (English)][75]\n* [Austria (German) ][76]\n* [Belgium (English)][77]\n* [Brazil (Portuguese)][78]\n* [Bulgaria (English)][79]\n* [Canada (English)][80]\n* [Canada (French) ][81]\n* [Chile (Spanish)][82]\n* [China/Hong Kong SAR (English)][83]\n* [China/Mainland (Chinese)][84]\n* [China/Mainland (English)][85]\n* [Colombia (Spanish)][86]\n* [Costa Rica (English)][87]\n* [Czech Republic (English)][88]\n* [Denmark (English)][89]\n* [Finland (English)][90]\n* [France (French)][91]\n* [Germany (German)][92]\n* [Greece (English)][93]\n* [Hungary (English)][94]\n* [India (English)][95]\n* [Indonesia (English)][96]\n* [Ireland (English)][97]\n* [Israel (English)][98]\n* [Italy (Italian)][99]\n* [Japan (Japanese)][100]\n* [Latvia (English)][101]\n* [Luxembourg (English)][102]\n* [Malaysia (English)][103]\n* [Mauritius (English)][104]\n* [Mexico (Spanish)][105]\n* [Morocco (English)][106]\n* [Netherlands (English)][107]\n* [New Zealand (English)][108]\n* [Norway (English)][109]\n* [Philippines (English)][110]\n* [Poland (English)][111]\n* [Poland (Polish)][112]\n* [Portugal (Portuguese)][113]\n* [Romania (English)][114]\n* [Saudi Arabia (English)][115]\n* [Singapore (English)][116]\n* [Slovakia (English)][117]\n* [South Africa (English)][118]\n* [Spain (Spanish)][119]\n* [Sweden (English)][120]\n* [Switzerland (English)][121]\n* [Thailand (English)][122]\n* [UAE (English)][123]\n* [United Kingdom (English)][124]\n* [USA (English)][125]\n\n# How can we help?\n\n### Clients\n\nAre you a new or current client interested in exploring potential business opportunities with\nAccenture?\n\nSend us a message\n][126]\n\n### Job seekers\n\nReady for new career opportunities? Explore [our current job openings][127] and learn how you can\nprepare for [your first day at Accenture][128].\n\nAccenture Careers\n][129]\n\n### Ecosystem partners\n\nLearn more about Accenture\u2019s ecosystem partner network, how we work with our partners and any\nupcoming events and initiatives.\n\nAccenture Ecosystem Partners\n][130]\n\n### Investors\n\nView prior earnings releases, earnings call replays, transcripts, shareholder resources and other\nupdates about our performance.\n\nAccenture Investor Relations\n][131]\n\n### Media\n\nFind the latest announcements, press releases, photos, videos, audio, press kits, PR contacts in\nyour region and more.\n\nAccenture Newsroom\n][132]\n\n### Suppliers\n\nAccess information like supplier requirements, onboarding processes, invoicing and what to expect\nwhen doing business with us.\n\nAccenture Suppliers\n][133]\n\n### Former employees\n\nStay connected with your fellow Accenture alumni through events, networking opportunities and shared\nresources.\n\nAccenture Alumni Network\n][134]\n\n### Current employees\n\nFind all internal company-related information on the [Accenture Portal][135]. Log all additional\ntech support issues on [Accenture Support][136].\n\nAccenture Support\n][137]\n\n## Need something else?\n\nInquiry Type*\nSelect a value\nNew or current client - I want to discuss new business opportunities and proposal requests (RFI or\nRFP).\nJob seeker - I have a question about job applications or working at Accenture.\nEcosystem partner - I want to explore ecosystem partnership opportunities with Accenture.\nInvestor - I want to contact Investor Relations.\nMedia - I have a media or press-related question, including requests for interviews and official\ninformation.\nSupplier or vendor - I need help with invoices, payments, contracts, registration or other issues.\nFormer employee - I no longer work at Accenture and need support.\nOther - I need help with something not listed above.\n\nThis field is required\n\n### About You\n\nFirst name*\nLast name*\nEmail address*\nPhone Number (Please include country code)\nCompany/Organization*\nYour role/function\nCountry/Region*\nSelect a value\nArgentina\nAustralia\nAustria\nBelgium\nBrazil\nBulgaria\nCanada\nChile\nChina Hong Kong S.A.R\nChina Mainland\nColombia\nCosta Rica\nCzech Republic\nDenmark\nFinland\nFrance\nGermany\nGreece\nHungary\nIndia\nIndonesia\nIreland\nIsrael\nItaly\nJapan\nLatvia\nLuxembourg\nMalaysia\nMauritius\nMexico\nMorocco\nNetherlands\nNew Zealand\nNorway\nOther\nPhilippines\nPoland\nPortugal\nRomania\nSaudi Arabia\nSingapore\nSlovakia\nSouth Africa\nSpain\nSweden\nSwitzerland\nThailand\nUnited Arab Emirates\nUnited Kingdom\nUnited States\n\nThis field is required. Please select your country or region.\n\nHow can we help you?*\n\nI agree to the use or processing of my personal information by Accenture for the purpose of\nfulfilling this request and in accordance with [Accenture\u2019s Privacy Statement][138]\n\nThis field is required and must not be blank.\n\nSubmit\nYour form has been submitted.\nDismiss\nSomething went wrong. Please try again later.\nDismiss\n\n## More ways to get in touch\n\nCall us\nUS and Canada: 1 (877) 889-9009 International: 1 (216) 672-0266\nVisit us\nWe serve clients around the globe, with 700+ office locations in over 150 countries.\nFind office locations\n][139]\n\n## Like this content?\n\n### Stay ahead of change by downloading the Accenture Foresight App.\n\n## Let there be change\n* [Preference Center][140]\n* [Careers][141]\n* [About Us][142]\n* [Contact Us][143]\n* [Locations][144]\n* [Sitemap][145]\n* [Privacy Statement][146]\n* [Terms & Conditions][147]\n* [Cookie Policy/Settings][148]\n* [Accessibility Statement][149]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Accenture. All Rights Reserved.\n\n### Send a message\n\nFirst name*\nLast name*\nEmail address*\n\n### Your Message\n\nHow can we help you?*\n\nI agree to the use or processing of my personal information by Accenture for the purpose of\nfulfilling this request and in accordance with [Accenture\u2019s Privacy Statement][150]\n\nThis field is required and must not be blank.\n\nCancel\nSend message\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: #footer\n[3]: /in-en\n[4]: /in-en\n[5]: /in-en/services\n[6]: /in-en/services/ai-data\n[7]: /in-en/services/cloud\n[8]: /in-en/services/customer-service\n[9]: /in-en/services/cybersecurity\n[10]: /in-en/services/digital-engineering-manufacturing\n[11]: /in-en/services/ecosystem-partners\n[12]: /in-en/services/emerging-technology\n[13]: /in-en/services/finance-risk\n[14]: /in-en/services/infrastructure-capital-projects\n[15]: /in-en/services/learning\n[16]: /in-en/services/managed-services\n[17]: /in-en/services/marketing-experience\n[18]: /in-en/services/metaverse\n[19]: /in-en/services/sales-commerce\n[20]: /in-en/services/strategy\n[21]: /in-en/services/supply-chain\n[22]: /in-en/services/sustainability\n[23]: /in-en/services/talent-organization\n[24]: /in-en/services/technology-transformation\n[25]: /in-en/industries/aerospace-defense\n[26]: /in-en/industries/automotive\n[27]: /in-en/industries/banking\n[28]: /in-en/industries/capital-markets\n[29]: /in-en/industries/chemicals\n[30]: /in-en/industries/communications-media\n[31]: /in-en/industries/consumer-goods-services\n[32]: /in-en/industries/energy\n[33]: /in-en/industries/health\n[34]: /in-en/industries/high-tech\n[35]: /in-en/industries/industrial-equipment\n[36]: /in-en/industries/insurance\n[37]: /in-en/industries/life-sciences\n[38]: /in-en/industries/natural-resources\n[39]: /in-en/industries/public-service\n[40]: /in-en/industries/private-equity\n[41]: /in-en/industries/retail\n[42]: /in-en/industries/software-platforms\n[43]: /in-en/industries/travel\n[44]: /in-en/industries/utilities\n[45]: /in-en/insights\n[46]: /in-en/about/company-index\n[47]: /in-en/about/reinvention-services\n[48]: /in-en/about/leadership\n[49]: /in-en/about/location\n[50]: /in-en/about/company/integrated-reporting\n[51]: /in-en/about/cor