      "key_products": "AwareX, PhishX, LMSX, PolicyX, GameX",
      "polished_summary": "CyberX is a leading Arab cybersecurity company dedicated to enhancing digital awareness and improving organizational behavior through integrated solutions. Its core offerings include a range of platforms such as AwareX for cybersecurity training, LMSX for educational management, and PhishX for phishing simulations, all designed to empower organizations in various industries to strengthen their cybersecurity posture and ensure compliance. With a focus on delivering comprehensive tools for training, policy management, and secure communication, CyberX targets organizations seeking to elevate their cybersecurity awareness and resilience.",
      "audit_reasoning": "CyberX provides specialized cybersecurity training and awareness platforms, such as AwareX and PhishX, which are directly relevant to enhancing cybersecurity in organizations. Their focus on integrated solutions for training and policy management aligns with the needs of the Cyber-Physical Systems Security market.",
