][324]\n* [ Impact Every Day ][325]\n* [ Job search ][326]\n* GLOBAL - EN\n* [ Let's Connect ][327]\n* GLOBAL - EN\n[ Main Menu ][328]\n\nSelect your location\n\nClear\n\nNo results found\n\nWelcome to Deloitte\nIf we have selected the wrong experience for you, please change it above.\n* [Who we are ][329]\n* [Governance ][330]\n* [Network, brands & alliances ][331]\n[ Print ][332]\n[ Share ][333]\n\n# About the Deloitte organization\n\n[ Print ][334]\n[ Share ][335]\n\n\u201cDeloitte\u201d is the brand under which over 470,000 dedicated people in independent firms throughout\nthe world come together to provide a broad range of leading professional services to select clients.\nThese firms are members of Deloitte Touche Tohmatsu Limited, a private company limited by guarantee\nincorporated in England and Wales (\u201cDTTL,\u201d also referred to as \u201cDeloitte Global\u201d). DTTL, these\nmember firms and each of their respective related entities form the \u201cDeloitte organization.\u201d Each\nDTTL member firm and/or its related entities provide services in particular geographic areas and is\nsubject to the laws and professional regulations of the particular country or countries in which it\noperates. Each DTTL member firm is structured in accordance with national laws, regulations,\ncustomary practice, and other factors, and may secure the provision of professional services in its\nrespective territories through related entities. Not every DTTL member firm or its related entities\nprovide all services, and certain services may not be available to attest clients under the rules\nand regulations of public accounting. DTTL, and each DTTL member firm and each of its related\nentities, are legally separate and independent entities, which cannot obligate or bind each other in\nrespect of third parties. DTTL and each DTTL member firm, and their respective related entities, are\nliable only for their own acts and omissions, and not those of each other. The Deloitte organization\nis a global network of independent firms and not a partnership or a single firm. DTTL does not\nprovide services to clients.\n\n### Let's connect\n* [Get in touch ][336]\n* [Explore careers ][337]\n* [View locations ][338]\n* [Learn about Deloitte ][339]\n\n#### Services\n* [Assurance ][340]\n* [Audit ][341]\n* [Business Process Solutions ][342]\n* [Customer ][343]\n* [Cyber ][344]\n* [Deloitte Private ][345]\n* [Engineering, AI & Data ][346]\n* [Enterprise Technology & Performance ][347]\n* [Global Employer Services ][348]\n* [Human Capital ][349]\n* [Legal ][350]\n* [Ri"
