      "polished_summary": "Hitachi, Ltd. is a leading global provider of innovative solutions in the fields of air conditioning, heating, and domestic hot water systems. The company offers a diverse range of products, including room AC units, multi-zone systems, air-to-water heat pumps, and advanced IoT applications, catering to both residential and commercial markets. With a strong focus on technological advancement and sustainability, Hitachi aims to enhance comfort and efficiency in homes and businesses worldwide.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Hitachi, Ltd. primarily focuses on air conditioning and heating systems, which do not directly relate to Cyber-Physical Systems Security. Their products are more aligned with HVAC solutions rather than security systems for cyber-physical environments.",
