        "crawl_text": "Tenable, Inc. Columbia, Maryland, USA Dublin, Ireland Sydney, Australia Auckland, New Zealand Hong Kong Jakarta, Indonesia Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia Melbourne, Australia Mumbai, India Seoul, South Korea Shanghai, China USA Ireland Australia New Zealand Hong Kong Indonesia Malaysia India South Korea China North America EMEA APAC Tenable serves over 44,000 customers worldwide, including 65% of the Fortune 500 and 50% of the Global 2000. Tenable covers over 336,000 CVEs and processes 1.7 trillion unique exposure data points per year. Tenable is recognized as a leader in Exposure Management, providing comprehensive solutions for managing cyber risk. * [Skip to Main Navigation][1]\n* [Skip to Main Content][2]\n* [Skip to Footer][3]\n[ Tenable ][4] [\nPlatform ][5]\nSolutions\nWhy Tenable\nResources\nCompany [\nPricing ][6]\n[ contact_icon ][7]\n[ English ][8] [ Deutsch ][9] [ Fran\u00e7ais (France) ][10] [ Espa\u00f1ol (Am\u00e9rica Latina) ][11] [ Portugu\u00eas\n(Brasil) ][12] [ Italiano ][13]\n[ \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587 ][14] [ \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587 ][15] [ \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e ][16] [ \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 ][17] [ \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 ][18]\n[ Tenable Product Login\n][19] [ Community & Support\n][20]\n[ Buy ][21] [ Try ][22]\n\n#### Exposure Management\n\n][23]\nManage cyber risk with one platform to find, prioritize and eliminate exposures across your attack\nsurface.\n[ Find out more\n][24]\nAI Security ][25] [\nCloud Security ][26] [\nOT Security ][27] [\nVulnerability Management ][28] [\nHexa AI ][29]\nIdentity Security ][30] [\nPatch Management ][31] [\nAttack Surface Management ][32] [\nWeb App Scanning ][33] [\nSecurity Tool Connectors ][34] [ View all products\n][35]\n\n#### Explore By Use Case\n\nSecure AI\n][36] [\nSecure OT/IoT\n][37] [\nExposure Management\n][38] [\nCloud Security\n][39] [\nCompliance\n][40] [\nVulnerability Management\n][41] [\nAsset Inventory\n][42] [\nHighly Secure Environments\n][43] [\nSecure Data Centers\n][44] [\nZero-Trust\n][45]\n\n#### Explore By Industry\n\n[ Financial Services\n][46] [ Energy\n][47] [ Healthcare\n][48] [ Technology\n][49] [ Education\n][50] [ Government Defense\n][51] [ Retail\n][52]\n[ Why choose Tenable\n][53] [ Industry recognition\n][54] [ Customer stories\n][55] [ Tenable vs competitors\n][56]\nReport\n\n###### Tenable is the one clear leader in Exposure Management\n\n[ See why\n][57]\n[ Resource library\n][58] [ Exposure management resources\n][59] [ Blog\n][60] [ Research center\n][61]\n[ Training and certification\n][62] [ Cybersecurity guide\n][63] [ Customer stories\n][64] [ Find a partner\n][65]\nResources\n\n#### Exposure management\n#### resource center\n\n###### Accelerate your exposure management strategy with practical resources and tools.\n\n[ Explore\n][66]\n[ About Tenable\n][67] [ Leadership\n][68] [ Investor relations\n][69] [ Tenable ventures\n][70] [ Awards and recognition\n][71]\n[ Media room\n][72] [ Careers\n][73] [ Engagement and inclusion\n][74] [ Exposure Management Leadership Council\n][75]\nPlatform\nSolutions\nWhy Tenable\nResources\nCompany [\nPricing ][76]\n[ contact_icon ][77]\n[ English ][78] [ Deutsch ][79] [ Fran\u00e7ais (France) ][80] [ Espa\u00f1ol (Am\u00e9rica Latina) ][81] [\nPortugu\u00eas (Brasil) ][82] [ Italiano ][83]\n[ \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587 ][84] [ \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587 ][85] [ \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e ][86] [ \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 ][87] [ \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 ][88]\n[ Tenable Product Login\n][89] [ Community & Support\n][90]\n[ Buy ][91] [ Try ][92]\nPlatform\nExposure Management ][93] [\nAI Security ][94] [\nCloud Security ][95] [\nOT Security ][96] [\nVulnerability Management ][97] [\nHexa AI ][98] [\nIdentity Security ][99] [\nPatch Management ][100] [\nAttack Surface Management ][101] [\nWeb App Scanning ][102] [\nSecurity Tool Connectors ][103] [ View all products\n][104]\nSolutions\n\n#### Explore By Use Case\n\n[ Secure AI\n][105] [ Secure OT/IoT\n][106] [ Exposure Management\n][107] [ Cloud Security\n][108] [ Compliance\n][109] [ Vulnerability Management\n][110] [ Asset Inventory\n][111] [ Highly Secure Environments\n][112] [ Secure Data Centers\n][113] [ Zero-Trust\n][114]\n\n#### Explore By Industry\n\n[ Financial Services\n][115] [ Energy\n][116] [ Healthcare\n][117] [ Technology\n][118] [ Education\n][119] [ Government Defense\n][120] [ Retail\n][121]\nWhy Tenable\n[ Why choose Tenable\n][122] [ Industry recognition\n][123] [ Customer stories\n][124] [ Tenable vs competitors\n][125]\nReport\n\n###### Tenable is the one clear leader in Exposure Management\n\n[ See why\n][126]\nResources\n[ Resource library\n][127] [ Exposure management resources\n][128] [ Blog\n][129] [ Research center\n][130] [ Training and certification\n][131] [ Cybersecurity guide\n][132] [ Customer stories\n][133] [ Find a partner\n][134]\nResources\n\n#### Exposure management\n#### resource center\n\n###### Accelerate your exposure management strategy with practical resources and tools.\n\n[ Explore\n][135]\nCompany\n[ About Tenable\n][136] [ Leadership\n][137] [ Investor relations\n][138] [ Tenable ventures\n][139] [ Awards and recognition\n][140] [ Media room\n][141] [ Careers\n][142] [ Engagement and inclusion\n][143] [ Exposure Management Leadership Council\n][144]\n[ ][145]\n* [Customers][146]\n* TB Consulting\nCase study\n\n# TB Consulting [TB Consulting]\n\nAs a CISO, your goal is to understand the risk and communicate with confidence that you have the\ninformation needed to identify and mitigate vulnerabilities. Tenable One reduces time to value by\nconsolidating point solutions on a single pane of glass.\n\n[ Download the case study ][147]\nPrimary product used\n\n## Tenable One\n\n### The world\u2019s leading AI-powered exposure management platform\n\nTenable One radically unifies security visibility, insight and action across the attack surface,\nequipping modern organizations to isolate and eradicate priority cyber exposures from IT\ninfrastructure to cloud environments to critical infrastructure and everywhere in between.\n\n[ Explore this product ][148] [ Request a demo ][149]\n**Industry:** IT Consulting - MSSP\n**Location:** North America\n\n## TB Consulting creates measurable value for clients with Tenable One\n\n*\u201cYou mean I\u2019ve been stressing about our risk stance for months and now it\u2019s all right here in this\nreport?\u201d* That was the reaction when TB Consulting provided a client\u2019s CIO with a holistic view of\nall assets, vulnerabilities and cyber risk across the company\u2019s attack surface.\n\nWith cybersecurity teams under siege and often overwhelmed by a tidal wave of potential threats, [TB\nConsulting][150] (TBC) brings enterprise-level solutions to its clients, helping them identify\nvulnerabilities and manage risk across an increasingly complex threat landscape.\n\n### Key business needs\n\nManaging risk means knowing what you have. Time-consuming manual processes were the norm for TBC\nengineers working to establish a concise view of each client\u2019s attack surface. *\u201cHow do we get\nvisibility into the cloud?\u201d \u201cWhat about accounting for all of the endpoints?\u201d What\u2019s most\nvulnerable?\u201d \u201cHow do we tie everything back to risk?\u201d*\n\nThese questions and more had to be answered before engineers could commence analysis and remediation\nefforts. Three quarters of every hour were spent on administrative tasks like writing scripts,\ndealing with 500-column spreadsheets and culling through volumes of raw data.\n\nThat\u2019s when the team implemented the Tenable One Exposure Management Platform, which combines the\nbroadest vulnerability coverage spanning IT assets, cloud resources, containers, web apps and\nidentity systems, and adds comprehensive analytics to prioritize actions and communicate cyber risk.\n\nAn important part of TBC\u2019s workflow and xTDR, its expanded threat detection and response solution,\n[Tenable One][151] provides an unprecedented level of visibility across the modern attack surface.\nTBC engineers help guide their clients\u2019 efforts to prevent likely attacks through predictive and\nprioritized exposure management and accurately communicate cyber risk to support optimal business\nperformance. TBC has documented as much as a 10-fold increase in the number of assets tracked,\nensuring that engineers and clients no longer have to juggle spreadsheets while still asking, *\u201cWhat\nam I missing?\u201d*.\n\n\u201cOrganizations moving to hybrid and multi-cloud environments often struggle to integrate and\nconsolidate costly point tools and improve visibility and control across an ever-growing attack\nsurface. As an MSSP, our clients look to TBC to help ease these pains,\u201d says Marcos Saiz, CISO of\nTBC. \u201cTenable One is a single consolidation point for managing exposure, including vulnerabilities,\nmisconfigurations and privileges, that is cost effective and synergistic with our business model.\u201d\n\nTBC has also improved its own efficiency, reducing by 75% the time spent on manual tasks and\nenabling its skilled engineering team to spend more time helping clients focus on critical\nremediation tasks.\n\n### TBC reduces data gathering by 75%\n\nFrom cloud visibility to endpoints and eve * [Skip to Main Navigation][1]\n* [Skip to Main Content][2]\n* [Skip to Footer][3]\n[ Tenable ][4] [\nPlatform ][5]\nSolutions\nWhy Tenable\nResources\nCompany [\nPricing ][6]\n[ contact_icon ][7]\n[ English ][8] [ Deutsch ][9] [ Fran\u00e7ais (France) ][10] [ Espa\u00f1ol (Am\u00e9rica Latina) ][11] [ Portugu\u00eas\n(Brasil) ][12] [ Italiano ][13]\n[ \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587 ][14] [ \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587 ][15] [ \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e ][16] [ \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 ][17] [ \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 ][18]\n[ Tenable Product Login\n][19] [ Community & Support\n][20]\n[ Buy ][21] [ Try ][22]\n\n#### Exposure Management\n\n][23]\nManage cyber risk with one platform to find, prioritize and eliminate exposures across your attack\nsurface.\n[ Find out more\n][24]\nAI Security ][25] [\nCloud Security ][26] [\nOT Security ][27] [\nVulnerability Management ][28] [\nHexa AI ][29]\nIdentity Security ][30] [\nPatch Management ][31] [\nAttack Surface Management ][32] [\nWeb App Scanning ][33] [\nSecurity Tool Connectors ][34] [ View all products\n][35]\n\n#### Explore By Use Case\n\nSecure AI\n][36] [\nSecure OT/IoT\n][37] [\nExposure Management\n][38] [\nCloud Security\n][39] [\nCompliance\n][40] [\nVulnerability Management\n][41] [\nAsset Inventory\n][42] [\nHighly Secure Environments\n][43] [\nSecure Data Centers\n][44] [\nZero-Trust\n][45]\n\n#### Explore By Industry\n\n[ Financial Services\n][46] [ Energy\n][47] [ Healthcare\n][48] [ Technology\n][49] [ Education\n][50] [ Government Defense\n][51] [ Retail\n][52]\n[ Why choose Tenable\n][53] [ Industry recognition\n][54] [ Customer stories\n][55] [ Tenable vs competitors\n][56]\nReport\n\n###### Tenable is the one clear leader in Exposure Management\n\n[ See why\n][57]\n[ Resource library\n][58] [ Exposure management resources\n][59] [ Blog\n][60] [ Research center\n][61]\n[ Training and certification\n][62] [ Cybersecurity guide\n][63] [ Customer stories\n][64] [ Find a partner\n][65]\nResources\n\n#### Exposure management\n#### resource center\n\n###### Accelerate your exposure management strategy with practical resources and tools.\n\n[ Explore\n][66]\n[ About Tenable\n][67] [ Leadership\n][68] [ Investor relations\n][69] [ Tenable ventures\n][70] [ Awards and recognition\n][71]\n[ Media room\n][72] [ Careers\n][73] [ Engagement and inclusion\n][74] [ Exposure Management Leadership Council\n][75]\nPlatform\nSolutions\nWhy Tenable\nResources\nCompany [\nPricing ][76]\n[ contact_icon ][77]\n[ English ][78] [ Deutsch ][79] [ Fran\u00e7ais (France) ][80] [ Espa\u00f1ol (Am\u00e9rica Latina) ][81] [\nPortugu\u00eas (Brasil) ][82] [ Italiano ][83]\n[ \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u65