ources\n\n#### Exposure management\n#### resource center\n\n###### Accelerate your exposure management strategy with practical resources and tools.\n\n[ Explore\n][66]\n[ About Tenable\n][67] [ Leadership\n][68] [ Investor relations\n][69] [ Tenable ventures\n][70] [ Awards and recognition\n][71]\n[ Media room\n][72] [ Careers\n][73] [ Engagement and inclusion\n][74] [ Exposure Management Leadership Council\n][75]\nPlatform\nSolutions\nWhy Tenable\nResources\nCompany [\nPricing ][76]\n[ contact_icon ][77]\n[ English ][78] [ Deutsch ][79] [ Fran\u00e7ais (France) ][80] [ Espa\u00f1ol (Am\u00e9rica Latina) ][81] [\nPortugu\u00eas (Brasil) ][82] [ Italiano ][83]\n[ \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587 ][84] [ \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587 ][85] [ \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e ][86] [ \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 ][87] [ \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 ][88]\n[ Tenable Product Login\n][89] [ Community & Support\n][90]\n[ Buy ][91] [ Try ][92]\nPlatform\nExposure Management ][93] [\nAI Security ][94] [\nCloud Security ][95] [\nOT Security ][96] [\nVulnerability Management ][97] [\nHexa AI ][98] [\nIdentity Security ][99] [\nPatch Management ][100] [\nAttack Surface Management ][101] [\nWeb App Scanning ][102] [\nSecurity Tool Connectors ][103] [ View all products\n][104]\nSolutions\n\n#### Explore By Use Case\n\n[ Secure AI\n][105] [ Secure OT/IoT\n][106] [ Exposure Management\n][107] [ Cloud Security\n][108] [ Compliance\n][109] [ Vulnerability Management\n][110] [ Asset Inventory\n][111] [ Highly Secure Environments\n][112] [ Secure Data Centers\n][113] [ Zero-Trust\n][114]\n\n#### Explore By Industry\n\n[ Financial Services\n][115] [ Energy\n][116] [ Healthcare\n][117] [ Technology\n][118] [ Education\n][119] [ Government Defense\n][120] [ Retail\n][121]\nWhy Tenable\n[ Why choose Tenable\n][122] [ Industry recognition\n][123] [ Customer stories\n][124] [ Tenable vs competitors\n][125]\nReport\n\n###### Tenable is the one clear leader in Exposure Management\n\n[ See why\n][126]\nResources\n[ Resource library\n][127] [ Exposure management resources\n][128] [ Blog\n][129] [ Research center\n][130] [ Training and certification\n][131] [ Cybersecurity guide\n][132] [ Customer stories\n][133] [ Find a partner\n][134]\nResources\n\n#### Exposure management\n#### resource center\n\n###### Accelerate your exposure management strategy with practical resources and tools.\n\n[ Explore\n][135]\nCompany\n[ About Tenable\n][136] [ Leadership\n][137] [ Investor relations\n][138] [ Tenable ventures\n][139] [ Awards and recognition\n][140] [ Media room\n][141] [ Careers\n][142] [ Engagement and inclusion\n][143] [ Exposure Management Leadership Council\n][144]\n[ ][145]\n* [Customers][146]\n* Aidoc\nCase study\n\n# Aidoc [Aidoc]\n\nTenable Cloud Security] goes beyond permissions visibility to reveal IAM risk context that informs\nour busy DevOps team, facilitating their efforts in mitigating risk and minimizing disruption.\n\n[ Download the case study ][147]\nPrimary product used\n\n## Tenable Cloud Security\n\n### The actionable cloud security platform\n\nReduce risk by rapidly exposing and closing priority security gaps caused by misconfigurations,\nrisky entitlements and vulnerabilities\u2013in one powerful cloud native application protection platform\n(CNAPP).\n\n[ Explore this product ][148] [ Request a demo ][149]\n\n## Aidoc simplifies IAM Risk Management tasks and streamlines remediation with Tenable Cloud\n## Security\n\n### The Challenge\n\nFounded in early 2016, Aidoc offers an AI medical diagnostics SaaS platform that is \u201calways on.\u201d The\nsolution and its development run on AWS. The devops team handles the organization\u2019s cloud security.\nThe team knew that its IAM permissions configurations were potentially an ongoing security threat\ndue to the complexity and opaqueness of public cloud environments. With many things on its plate,\nthe devops team was always looking for time saving ways to better monitor and remediate access risk,\nincluding by right-sizing policies.\n\n### The Solution\n\nUpon reviewing Tenable Cloud Security, Guy Reiner, co-founder and VP of R&D at Aidoc, was enthused.\nAfter a simple set up, he saw Tenable rapidly detect multiple excessive permissions and inactive\nroles in the Aidoc cloud infrastructure \u2014 and knew these to be fertile ground for threat actors. The\nTenable proof of concept also showed how such potential risks could be easily remediated, and how\nthe entitlements management platform could help Aidoc govern third party access and privileged\nidentities, and trace any access flaws or resource vulnerabilities to their root cause.\n\nAt first concerned about bringing Tenable to his team\u2019s attention so as not to burden it \u201cwith one\nmore management tool,\u201d Guy eventually chose to let the team do its own due diligence. The Aidoc\ndevops team quickly found the Tenable platform made many of its IAM risk management tasks easier\nand, in presenting a visual mapping of all its cloud identities and permissions, proved considerably\nmore informative than the AWS console. Ultimately, the team drove Aidoc\u2019s decision to adopt Tenable\nCloud Security.\n\nDigging deeper, the devops team found they could effectively use the Tenable platform, via its\nFindings view, as an actionable roadmap for prioritizing its IAM and other configuration risks. The\nview delineates risks by criticality and scope, helping Aidoc decide which risks to tackle first and\nwhich to address progressively over time to proactively reduce its attack surface.\n\nSaid Reiner, \u201c[Tenable] goes beyond permissions visibility to reveal IAM risk context that informs\nour busy devops team, facilitating their efforts in mitigating risk and minimizing disruption. We\u2019re\nnext setting our sights on implementing the least privilege policies that [Tenable] generates from\nactual use \u2014 that kind of automation is right up there with devops best practice by enabling us to\nremediate at scale and shift left to harden net-needed access into our infrastructure.\u201d\n\n**[Back to Top ][150]**\n\n* Tenable Cloud Security\n\n## Related customer case studies\n\n#### [North American Healthcare SaaS Company][151]\n\n[Read case study][152]\n\n#### [Complete Genomics][153]\n\n[Read case study][154]\n\n#### [IntelyCare][155]\n\n[Read case study][156]\n\n[**Explore all case studies \u203a**][157]\n\n][158]\n\n## Your exposure ends here\n\n### Partners\n* [Become a partner][159]\n* [Find a partner][160]\n* [Partner portal][161]\n* [Partner programs][162]\n\n### Resources\n* [Services][163]\n* [Technical support][164]\n* [Training and certifications][165]\n* [Product documentation][166]\n* [Customer community][167]\n* [Tenable Trust][168]\n\n### Company\n* [About us][169]\n* [Executive team][170]\n* [Newsroom][171]\n* [Investor relations][172]\n\n### Connect\n* [Contact us][173]\n* [Try our product][174]\n* [Chat with sales][175]\n* [Meet us at an event][176]\n* [Join us][177]\n* [Privacy policy][178]\n* [ Do not sell/share my personal information][179]\n* [Legal][180]\n* [508 compliance][181]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Tenable\u00ae, Inc. All rights reserved\n\nTenable One\n\n#### Request a demo\n\nThe world\u2019s leading AI-powered exposure management platform.\n\n##### Thank You\n\nThank you for your interest in Tenable One.\nA representative will be in touch soon.\n\n**Debug:\n** Form ID: 7469\nForm Name: one-eval\nForm Class: c-form form-panel__global-form c-form--mkto js-mkto-no-css js-form-hanging-label\nc-form--hide-comments\nForm Wrapper ID: one-eval-form-wrapper\nConfirmation Class: one-eval-confirmform-modal\nSimulate Success\n\nTenable One Cloud Exposure\n\n#### Request a demo\n\nClose cloud exposure with the actionable cloud security platform.\n\n##### Thank You\n\nThank you for your interest in Tenable One Cloud Exposure.\nA representative will be in touch soon.\n\n**Debug:\n** Form ID: 10155\nForm Name: tenable-cs\nForm Class: c-form form-panel__global-form c-form--