            "text": "* [Skip to Main Navigation][1]\n* [Skip to Main Content][2]\n* [Skip to Footer][3]\n[ Tenable ][4] [\nPlatform ][5]\nSolutions\nWhy Tenable\nResources\nCompany [\nPricing ][6]\n[ contact_icon ][7]\n[ English ][8] [ Deutsch ][9] [ Fran\u00e7ais (France) ][10] [ Espa\u00f1ol (Am\u00e9rica Latina) ][11] [ Portugu\u00eas\n(Brasil) ][12] [ Italiano ][13]\n[ \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587 ][14] [ \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587 ][15] [ \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e ][16] [ \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 ][17] [ \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 ][18]\n[ Tenable Product Login\n][19] [ Community & Support\n][20]\n[ Buy ][21] [ Try ][22]\n\n#### Exposure Management\n\n][23]\nManage cyber risk with one platform to find, prioritize and eliminate exposures across your attack\nsurface.\n[ Find out more\n][24]\nAI Security ][25] [\nCloud Security ][26] [\nOT Security ][27] [\nVulnerability Management ][28] [\nHexa AI ][29]\nIdentity Security ][30] [\nPatch Management ][31] [\nAttack Surface Management ][32] [\nWeb App Scanning ][33] [\nSecurity Tool Connectors ][34] [ View all products\n][35]\n\n#### Explore By Use Case\n\nSecure AI\n][36] [\nSecure OT/IoT\n][37] [\nExposure Management\n][38] [\nCloud Security\n][39] [\nCompliance\n][40] [\nVulnerability Management\n][41] [\nAsset Inventory\n][42] [\nHighly Secure Environments\n][43] [\nSecure Data Centers\n][44] [\nZero-Trust\n][45]\n\n#### Explore By Industry\n\n[ Financial Services\n][46] [ Energy\n][47] [ Healthcare\n][48] [ Technology\n][49] [ Education\n][50] [ Government Defense\n][51] [ Retail\n][52]\n[ Why choose Tenable\n][53] [ Industry recognition\n][54] [ Customer stories\n][55] [ Tenable vs competitors\n][56]\nReport\n\n###### Tenable is the one clear leader in Exposure Management\n\n[ See why\n][57]\n[ Resource library\n][58] [ Exposure management resources\n][59] [ Blog\n][60] [ Research center\n][61]\n[ Training and certification\n][62] [ Cybersecurity guide\n][63] [ Customer stories\n][64] [ Find a partner\n][65]\nResources\n\n#### Exposure management\n#### resource center\n\n###### Accelerate your exposure management strategy with practical resources and tools.\n\n[ Explore\n][66]\n[ About Tenable\n][67] [ Leadership\n][68] [ Investor relations\n][69] [ Tenable ventures\n][70] [ Awards and recognition\n][71]\n[ Media room\n][72] [ Careers\n][73] [ Engagement and inclusion\n][74] [ Exposure Management Leadership Council\n][75]\nPlatform\nSolutions\nWhy Tenable\nResources\nCompany [\nPricing ][76]\n[ contact_icon ][77]\n[ English ][78] [ Deutsch ][79] [ Fran\u00e7ais (France) ][80] [ Espa\u00f1ol (Am\u00e9rica Latina) ][81] [\nPortugu\u00eas (Brasil) ][82] [ Italiano ][83]\n[ \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587 ][84] [ \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587 ][85] [ \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e ][86] [ \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 ][87] [ \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 ][88]\n[ Tenable Product Login\n][89] [ Community & Support\n][90]\n[ Buy ][91] [ Try ][92]\nPlatform\nExposure Management ][93] [\nAI Security ][94] [\nCloud Security ][95] [\nOT Security ][96] [\nVulnerability Management ][97] [\nHexa AI ][98] [\nIdentity Security ][99] [\nPatch Management ][100] [\nAttack Surface Management ][101] [\nWeb App Scanning ][102] [\nSecurity Tool Connectors ][103] [ View all products\n][104]\nSolutions\n\n#### Explore By Use Case\n\n[ Secure AI\n][105] [ Secure OT/IoT\n][106] [ Exposure Management\n][107] [ Cloud Security\n][108] [ Compliance\n][109] [ Vulnerability Management\n][110] [ Asset Inventory\n][111] [ Highly Secure Environments\n][112] [ Secure Data Centers\n][113] [ Zero-Trust\n][114]\n\n#### Explore By Industry\n\n[ Financial Services\n][115] [ Energy\n][116] [ Healthcare\n][117] [ Technology\n][118] [ Education\n][119] [ Government Defense\n][120] [ Retail\n][121]\nWhy Tenable\n[ Why choose Tenable\n][122] [ Industry recognition\n][123] [ Customer stories\n][124] [ Tenable vs competitors\n][125]\nReport\n\n###### Tenable is the one clear leader in Exposure Management\n\n[ See why\n][126]\nResources\n[ Resource library\n][127] [ Exposure management resources\n][128] [ Blog\n][129] [ Research center\n][130] [ Training and certification\n][131] [ Cybersecurity guide\n][132] [ Customer stories\n][133] [ Find a partner\n][134]\nResources\n\n#### Exposure management\n#### resource center\n\n###### Accelerate your exposure management strategy with practical resources and tools.\n\n[ Explore\n][135]\nCompany\n[ About Tenable\n][136] [ Leadership\n][137] [ Investor relations\n][138] [ Tenable ventures\n][139] [ Awards and recognition\n][140] [ Media room\n][141] [ Careers\n][142] [ Engagement and inclusion\n][143] [ Exposure Management Leadership Council\n][144]\n[ ][145]\n\n# Contact\n# Tenable\n\nWe want to hear from you! To learn how Tenable products can help you proactively address and manage\nyour cyber risk, complete the form shown here.\n\n#### Contact a sales representative\n\n#### Thank you for your submission\n\nWe will be in touch soon!\n\n**Debug:\n** Form ID: 1746\nForm Name: contact-us\nForm Class: c-form c-form--mkto js-mkto-no-css js-form-hanging-label c-form--compact\nForm Wrapper ID: contact-us-form-wrapper\nConfirmation Class: contact-us-confirmform-modal\nSimulate Success\n\n##### More ways to connect\n\n[ Become a partner\n][146] [ Support for current customers\n][147] [ Report a vulnerability\n][148]\n[ Explore careers\n][149] [ Media inquiries\n][150]\n\n## Tenable locations\n\n### Tenable headquarters\n\n[Columbia, USA World headquarters]\n\n#### Columbia, USA\n#### World headquarters\n\n6100 Merriweather Drive\n12th Floor\nColumbia, MD 21044\nNorth America: [+1 (410) 872-0555][151]\n[Get directions][152]\n[DublinEMEA headquarters]\n\n#### Dublin\n#### EMEA headquarters\n\n81b Campshires\nSir John Rogerson's Quay\nDublin 2, Ireland\n[Get directions][153]\n[SydneyAPAC headquarters]\n\n#### Sydney\n#### APAC headquarters\n\nSuite 21.01, Level 21,\n111 Pacific Highway,\nNorth Sydney NSW 2060\n[[email protected]][154]\n[Get directions][155]\n\n### Americas\n\n[Columbia, USA World headquarters]\n\n#### Columbia, USA\n#### World headquarters\n\n6100 Merriweather Drive\n12th Floor\nColumbia, MD 21044\nNorth America: [+1 (410) 872-0555][156]\n[Get directions][157]\n[Brazil]\n\n#### Brazil\n\nAvenida das Na\u00e7\u00f5es Unidas, 12901\nCentro Empresarial Na\u00e7\u00f5es Unidas (CENU)\nTorre Norte\n[Get directions][158]\n[Canada]\n\n#### Canada\n\n44 Chipman Hill, Suite 1000\nSaint John NB, E2L 2A9\n[Get directions][159]\n\n### EMEA\n\n[DublinEMEA headquarters]\n\n#### Dublin\n#### EMEA headquarters\n\n81b Campshires\nSir John Rogerson's Quay\nDublin 2, Ireland\n[Get directions][160]\n[Amsterdam]\n\n#### Amsterdam\n\nBeechavenue 54-62, Het Poortgebouw, 1119 PW\nSchiphol-Rijk, Netherlands\n[Get directions][161]\n[Dubai]\n\n#### Dubai\n\nOffice 3501-3504\nJBC3 Tower\nCluster Y, JLT\nDubai, UAE\n[Get directions][162]\n[German entity]\n\n#### German entity\n\n[[email protected]][163]\n[+49 (0) 89 3803 6443][164]\n[London]\n\n#### London\n\nThird Floor\n5 Pine Trees Business Park\nChertsey Lane\nStaines-Upon-Thames\nTW18 3HR\nUnited Kingdom\n[+44 (0)330 808 4684][165]\n[Get directions][166]\n[Paris]\n\n#### Paris\n\n26 rue de Montholon\n75009 Paris, France\n[[email protected]][167]\n[+33 184 88 54 23][168]\n[Get directions][169]\n[Tel Aviv]\n\n#### Tel Aviv\n\nLandmark TLV, Tower A,\n2 Leonardo Da Vinci St.\nTel Aviv-Yafo, Israel\n[Get directions][170]\n\n### APAC\n\n[SydneyAPAC headquarters]\n\n#### Sydney\n#### APAC headquarters\n\nSuite 21.01, Level 21,\n111 Pacific Highway,\nNorth Sydney NSW 2060\n[[email protected]][171]\n[Get directions][172]\n[Auckland]\n\n#### Auckland\n\nLevel 12, 55 Shortland Street,\nAuckland, 1010,\nNew Zealand\n[Get directions][173]\n[Hong Kong]\n\n#### Hong Kong\n\nLee Garden Three\n1 Sunning Road\nCauseway Bay, Hong Kong\n[[email protected]][174]\n[[email protected]][175]\n[Get directions][176]\n[Jakarta]\n\n#### Jakarta\n\nOffice 33-140\nJalan HR Rasuna Said Kav C22\nKaret Kuningan\nKecamatan