      "key_products": "Tenable One, Tenable Cloud Security, Tenable Security Center",
      "polished_summary": "Indegy is a leading cybersecurity company specializing in managing cyber risk and exposure across diverse environments. Its core offerings include Tenable One, a comprehensive AI-powered exposure management platform, and Tenable Cloud Security, which addresses security gaps in cloud infrastructures. Targeting industries such as financial services, healthcare, and technology, Indegy provides organizations with the tools needed to enhance their security posture and effectively manage vulnerabilities.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Indegy, through its parent company Tenable, provides specialized cybersecurity solutions that focus on exposure management, vulnerability management, and security for cyber-physical systems, particularly in cloud and operational technology environments. Their products like Tenable One and Tenable Cloud Security are directly applicable to managing cyber risks in cyber-physical systems.",
      "audit_score": 4,
