wing the overview and resources for\n\n/content/honeywellbt/us/en/search.html\ntitle\nsubtitle\nTransformation in progress: The site may have intermittent functionality as we focus on our\ntransition to Honeywell Technologies.\n\n# Honeywell Named\n# A Leader in\n# Cybersecurity Services\n\nHoneywell has been named a leader in the first ever Omdia OT Managed Cybersecurity Services report.\n\n[\nDownload Report\n][156]\n\n## Delivering Mega Results on Mega Trends\n\n###### Honeywell has been at the center of industrial innovation for over a hundred years. Now,\n###### we\u2019re bringing a digital-first, outcome-based approach to the next generation of megatrends.\n\n[\n][157]\n[\n][158]\n\n[AUTOMATION][159]\n\n###### **We\u2019re ushering in the next generation in automation tech.\n###### **\n\n[\n][160]\n[\n][161]\n\n[ENERGY TRANSITION][162]\n\n###### **Stay ahead of global demand for cleaner, smarter, more available energy.\n###### **\n\n[\n][163]\n[\n][164]\n\n[AVIATION][165]\n\n###### **From airports to outer space, we\u2019re using digital solutions to revolutionize aviation.\n###### **\n\n## What We Do\n* [Aerospace][166]\n* [Commercial Buildings][167]\n* [Data Centers][168]\n* [Defense][169]\n* [Healthcare][170]\n* [Life Sciences][171]\n* [Manufacturing][172]\n* [Oil & Gas][173]\n* [Retail][174]\n* [Utilities][175]\n* [Warehouse and Logistics][176]\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Aerospace**\n\nWe create safer, healthier, more comfortable, and sustainable air travel with one of the industry\u2019s\nbroadest and most innovative offering portfolios spanning airport takeoff to landing.\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT AEROSPACE**\u00a0\u2794][177]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Commercial Buildings**\n\nCommercial building owners and operators use our hardware, software and analytics to help create\nsafer, more efficient and productive facilities. Our solutions and services improve the occupant\nexperience and are used in more than 10 million buildings worldwide.\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT COMMERCIAL BUILDINGS** \u2794][178]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Data Centers**\n\nWith our experience in top-tier data centers, Honeywell helps operators meet challenges in\naccelerating the build of a standardized global fleet. Our proven solutions help optimize facility\nuptime, improve efficiency, reduce carbon footprint and help protect workers, data and assets.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT DATA CENTERS** \u2794][179]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Defense**\n\nWe are revolutionizing the modernization of defense through cutting-edge techno"
