donesian][107]\n    * * [Japan - Japanese][108]\n    * * [Malaysia - English ][109]\n    * * [Republic of Korea - Korean][110]\n    * * [Philippines - English ][111]\n    * * [Singapore - English ][112]\n    * * [Thailand - English ][113]\n    * * [Vietnam - Vietnamese][114]\n  * Europe\n    * * [Austria - German][115]\n    * * [Belgium - French ][116]\n    * * [Belgium - Dutch][117]\n    * * [Bulgaria - Bulgarian][118]\n    * * [Czech Republic - English ][119]\n    * * [Denmark - Danish][120]\n    * * [Finland - Finnish][121]\n    * * [France - French ][122]\n    * * [Germany - German][123]\n    * * [Hungary - Hungarian][124]\n    * * [Italy - Italian][125]\n    * * [Netherlands - Dutch][126]\n    * * [Norway - Norwegian][127]\n    * * [Poland - Polish][128]\n    * * [Romania - English ][129]\n    * * [Slovakia - Slovak][130]\n    * * [Switzerland - French ][131]\n    * * [Switzerland - German][132]\n    * * [Turkey - Turkish][133]\n    * * [United Kingdom - English ][134]\n  * Latin America\n    * * [Brazil - Portuguese ][135]\n    * * [Mexico - Spanish ][136]\n  * Middle East\n    * * [Egypt - English ][137]\n    * * [Iraq - English ][138]\n    * * [Kuwait - English ][139]\n    * * [Oman - English ][140]\n    * * [Qatar - English ][141]\n    * * [Saudi Arabia - Arabic][142]\n    * * [Saudi Arabia - English ][143]\n    * * [United Arab Emirates - Arabic][144]\n    * * [United Arab Emirates - English ][145]\n  * North America\n    * * [Canada - English ][146]\n    * * [Canada - French ][147]\n    * * [United States - English ][148]\n* |\n* [ BUSINESSES ][149]\n  BUSINESSES\n  * [ Aerospace Technologies ][150]\n  * [ Industrial Automation ][151]\n  * [ Building Automation ][152]\n  * [ Process Automation ][153]\n  * [ Process Technology ][154]\n* |\n* [Contact][155]\n* |\nSearch\n\nYou are browsing the product catalog for\n\nYou are viewing the overview and resources for\n\n/content/honeywellbt/us/en/search.html\ntitle\nsubtitle\nTransformation in progress: The site may have intermittent functionality as we focus on our\ntransition to Honeywell Technologies.\n\n# Honeywell Named\n# A Leader in\n# Cybersecurity Services\n\nHoneywell has been named a leader in the first ever Omdia OT Managed Cybersecurity Services report.\n\n[\nDownload Report\n][156]\n\n## Delivering Mega Results on Mega Trends\n\n###### Honeywell has been at the center of industrial innovation for over a hundred years. Now,\n###### we\u2019re bringing a digital-first, outcome-based approach to the next generation of megatrends.\n\n[\n][157]\n[\n][158]\n\n[AUTOMATION][159]\n\n###### **We\u2019re ushering in the next generation in automation tech.\n###### **\n\n[\n][160]\n[\n][161]\n\n[ENERGY TRANSITION][162]\n\n###### **Stay ahead of global demand for cleaner, smarter, more available energy.\n###### **\n\n[\n][163]\n[\n][164]\n\n[AVIATION][165]\n\n###### **From airports to outer space, we\u2019re using digital solutions to revolutionize aviation.\n###### **\n\n## What We Do\n* [Aerospace][166]\n* [Commercial Buildings][167]\n* [Data Centers][168]\n* [Defense][169]\n* [Healthcare][170]\n* [Life Sciences][171]\n* [Manufacturing][172]\n* [Oil & Gas][173]\n* [Retail][174]\n* [Utilities][175]\n* [Warehouse and Logistics][176]\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Aerospace**\n\nWe create safer, healthier, more comfortable, and sustainable air travel with one of the industry\u2019s\nbroadest and most innovative offering portfolios spanning airport takeoff to landing.\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT AEROSPACE**\u00a0\u2794][177]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Commercial Buildings**\n\nCommercial building owners and operators use our hardware, software and analytics to help create\nsafer, more efficient and productive facilities. Our solutions and services improve the occupant\nexperience and are used in more than 10 million buildings worldwide.\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT COMMERCIAL BUILDINGS** \u2794][178]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Data Centers**\n\nWith our experience in top-tier data centers, Honeywell helps operators meet challenges in\naccelerating the build of a standardized global fleet. Our proven solutions help optimize facility\nuptime, improve efficiency, reduce carbon footprint and help protect workers, data and assets.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT DATA CENTERS** \u2794][179]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Defense**\n\nWe are revolutionizing the modernization of defense through cutting-edge technology, advanced\nsystems integration, and enhanced cybersecurity, and helping keep military operations across the\nglobe mission-ready.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT DEFENSE** \u2794][180]\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n**Healthcare**\n\nWe develop innovative solutions that can help healthcare organizations simplify day-to-day tasks,\noptimize processes and keep buildings and clinicians safe. Our sensing technologies enhance the\naccuracy, longevity and stability of today\u2019s medical equipment and our packaging and propellant\ntechnologies improve medication delivery. Together, we can help you deliver better patient outcomes,\nincrease efficiency and productivity and minimize infection risks for clinicians and patients.\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT HEALTHCARE** \u2794][181]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Life Sciences**\n\nHoneywell solutions help life sciences organizations boost quality and operational excellence,\nenable compliance and accelerate the path to life-changing discoveries.\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT LIFE SCIENCES** \u2794][182]\n\n\n\n\n**Manufacturing**\n\nWith our automation solutions focused on increased transparency and greater process controls, our\ncustomers in aerospace, oil and gas, healthcare and other industries feel more empowered to get to\nmarket faster, improve cost savings and enjoy more reliable quality control. Discover the actionable\ndigital insights that are helping manufacturers uncover and adjust to hidden costs and\ninefficiencies in their processes.\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT MANUFACTURING**\u00a0\u2794][183]\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Oil & Gas**\n\nWe simplify the complex for your industrial plants. Our technology and software solutions can help\nyou reach operational and energy efficiency goals, reduce operating costs and provide better insight\ninto your carbon impact.\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT OIL & GAS**\u00a0\u2794][184]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Retail**\n\nWith decades of experience and deep domain expertise, Honeywell supports retail customers in making\ntheir operations more efficient, productive and agile. We provide a comprehensive suite of\nproductivity tools, software and hardware solutions for retail.\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT RETAIL**\u00a0\u2794][185]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Utilities**\n\nThe new energy world is upon us, and rapidly accelerating. Our utility solutions and technologies\nhelp reduce CO2 emissions, increase the energy grid\u2019s lifetime and foster energy equity. We\u2019re\nhelping create resilient and sustainable operations for today, tomorrow, and beyond.\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT UTILITIES**\u00a0\u2794][186]\n\n\n\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Warehouse & Logistics**\n\nOur technologies and services enable and streamline Distribution Center operations ranging from\nreceiving and storage to picking, packing and shipping. The broad range of worker productivity tools\nhelp solve challenges from the warehouse through last-mile delivery.\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT WAREHOUSE & LOGISTICS** \u2794][187]\n\n\n\n\nAerospace\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Aerospace**\n\nWe create safer, healthier, more comfortable, and sustainable air travel with one of the industry\u2019s\nbroadest and most innovative offering portfolios spanning airport takeoff to landing.\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT AEROSPACE**\u00a0\u2794][188]\n\n\n\n\nCommercial Buildings\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Commercial Buildings**\n\nCommercial building owners and operators use our hardware, software and analytics to help create\nsafer, more efficient and productive facilities. Our solutions and services improve the occupant\nexperience and are used in more than 10 million buildings worldwide.\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT COMMERCIAL BUILDINGS** \u2794][189]\n\n\n\n\nData Centers\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Data Centers**\n\nWith our experience in top-tier data centers, Honeywell helps operators meet challenges in\naccelerating the build of a standardized global fleet. Our proven solutions help optimize facility\nuptime, improve efficiency, reduce carbon footprint and help protect workers, data and assets.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT DATA CENTERS** \u2794][190]\n\n\n\n\nDefense\n\n\n\u00a0\n\n**Defense**\n\nWe are revolutionizing the modernization of defense through cutting-edge technology, advanced\nsystems integration, and enhanced cybersecurity, and helping keep military operations across the\nglobe mission-ready.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[**LEARN ABOUT DEFENSE** \u2794][191]\n\n\n\n\nHealthcare\n\n\n\n\n**Heal"
