      "polished_summary": "SCADAfence specializes in operational technology (OT) cybersecurity, providing solutions that enhance the security and efficiency of critical infrastructure across various industries. Their offerings cater to sectors such as aerospace, healthcare, manufacturing, and utilities, with a global presence that spans North America, Europe, Asia Pacific, Latin America, the Middle East, and Africa. By focusing on automation and energy transition, SCADAfence aims to support businesses in navigating the complexities of modern industrial environments.",
      "audit_reasoning": "SCADAfence specializes in operational technology (OT) cybersecurity, which is directly relevant to Cyber-Physical Systems Security. Their solutions enhance the security of critical infrastructure across various industries, indicating a strong focus on this market.",
