            "text": "][1]\n* [Platform][2]\n* * * [Overview][3]\n* [Risk Mitigation][4]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][5]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][6]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][7]\n* [Threat and Response][8]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][9]\n* * * [Configuration Control][10]\n* [IoT Patching][11]\n* [Operational Efficiency][12]\n* [Risk Modeling][13]\n* [Integrations][14]\n* [Industries][15]\n* * * [Energy and Utilities][16]\n* [Financial Services][17]\n* [Government][18]\n* [Healthcare][19]\n* [Higher Education][20]\n* [Hospitality][21]\n* [Life Sciences][22]\n* [Manufacturing][23]\n* [Retail][24]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][25]\n* [Solutions][26]\n* * * #### Connected Device Visibility\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][27]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][28]\n* * #### Vulnerability Detection And Mitigation\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][29]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][30]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][31]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][32]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][33]\n* * #### IoMT\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][34]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][35]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][36]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][37]\n* * #### IT, IoT and OT\n* [OT Security][38]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][39]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][40]\n* [Asimily for IT][41]\n* * #### Compliance and Regulation\n* [CMMC][42]\n* [Cyberscope][43]\n* [DORA][44]\n* [FDA][45]\n* [HIPAA][46]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][47]\n* [NERC CIP][48]\n* [NIS2][49]\n* [NIST CSF 2.0][50]\n* [PCI-DSS][51]\n* [Zero Trust][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* * * [All Resources][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [FAQ][56]\n* [Press][57]\n* [Glossary][58]\n* [About Us][59]\n* * * [About Asimily][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Partners][62]\n* [Leadership][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n* [Request Demo][65]\n* [EN][66]\n* [DE][67]\n[ Request Demo ][68]\n\n# The Next-Generation Cyber Asset and Exposure Management Platform\n\n[ Risk Mitigation ][69] [ Inventory and Visibility ][70] [ Vulnerability Prioritization ][71] [\nThreat and Response ][72] [ Governance, Risk, and Compliance ][73]\n\nComplete Risk Mitigation for Any Danger\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n\nDivert Attacks\n\nGet simple guidance to protect cyber assets from malicious traffic via segmentation or\nmicrosegmentation\n\nBlock Exploits\n\nUse clear recommendations to mitigate attack vectors outside of segmentation and patching\n\nAccelerate Patches\n\nGet comprehensive asset management \u2013 including IoT password management and IoT patching with a click\nof a button.\n\n[ Discover Risk Mitigation ][74]\n\nUnderstand Every Connected Device, Vulnerability, and Status\n\n## Inventory and Visibility\n\nAutomated, Accurate Inventory\n\nGain a complete repository of IT, IoT, OT, and IoMT devices while finding \u201cunmanaged\u201d devices\n\nEnrich Your Data with Device Details\n\nHave all your devices\u2019 details, assembled in one place\n\nSafe, Powerful Data Collection\n\nProtect devices during data gathering by using any of passive, protocol-based, API-based, or\ncombinations, including via integrations\n\n[ Discover Inventory & Visibility ][75]\n\nBring Order to Vulnerability Chaos\n\n## Vulnerability Prioritization\n\nPrioritize the Highest Risks\n\nIdentify the top 2% riskiest devices in the environment for immediate risk reduction\n\nKnow Risks Faster\n\nShorten exposure windows with continuous detection of new vulnerabilities\n\nModel Risk ROI Before Doing Work\n\nSee Risk ROI for any given action before deploying resources with Risk Simulator\n\nShorter To-Do List\n\nBy knowing which vulnerabilities are less risky for you, get time back to focus on riskier issues.\n\n[ Discover Vulnerability Prioritization ][76]\n\nGo from Threat to Resolution Faster and Safer\n\n## Threat and Response\n\nDetect Anomalies\n\nUse rules to spot IT, IoT, OT, or IoMT that deviate from allowable activity.\n\nMonitor Device Behavior\n\nWith simple pull-downs, augment threat detection with guardrails for your devices triggering alerts\nor actions\n\nSimplify Incident Response\n\nCapture packets for anything you want to investigate on your network, reducing incident response\ntime and expense.\n\n[ Threat & Response Capabilities ][77]\n[Stock graphic of an indicator icon over a circuitboard]\n\nGovernance, Risk, and Compliance\n\n## Governance, Risk, and Compliance\n\nProactive Risk Avoidance\n\nPrevent risk before purchasing with risk modeling and device hardening guidance\n\nConfiguration Control\n\nTake snapshots of every device which can be used for recovery, including for ransomware\n\nDetect Configuration Drift\n\nReceive alerts due to drift in device configurations and scroll through their timelines to detect\ncauses\n\nDevice Hardening\n\nGain access to crowdsourced data on the most secure configurations known for individual devices\n\n[ Unlock GRC ][78]\n\n## Protecting Your Industry\u2019s Unique Devices\n\n### Healthcare\n\nAsimily provides the necessary tools to identify and address IoT vulnerabilities in healthcare,\nensuring the protection of patient data without interrupting the delivery of critical care.\n\n[ Discover More ][79]\n\n### Manufacturing\n\nIn an industry that relies heavily on IoT devices to drive automation, efficiency, and connectivity,\nAsimly can help. By ensuring the security of IoT devices, manufacturers can safeguard their\nintellectual property, prevent production disruptions, and maintain the trust of their customers and\npartners.\n\n[ Discover More ][80]\n\n### Higher Education\n\nEducational institutions depend on interconnected devices to facilitate learning, research, and\ncampus operations. Protect sensitive student and faculty data, maintain operational integrity, and\nfoster a secure, productive academic environment with Asimily.\n\n[ Discover More ][81]\n\n### Government\n\nAsimily equips government entities worldwide with the necessary tools to secure their IoT devices,\nprotect critical infrastructure, and ensure data privacy. Defend against cyber threats and uphold\npublic trust by proactively mitigating vulnerabilities.\n\n[ Discover More ][82]\n\n### Life Sciences\n\nWhere delicate research, development, and data exchange are ongoing, securing your IoT devices is a\ntop priority. Proactively manage and mitigate vulnerabilities, reducing the risk of theft or loss of\ncritical research and development efforts.\n\n[ Discover More ][83]\n\n### Reduce Vulnerabilities 10x Faster with Half the Resources\n\n[ Schedule a Demo ][84]\n\n#### Our Gartner Peer Insights Reviews\n\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 4976678] ][85]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 511214] ][86]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4925308] ][87]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959932] ][88]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959378] ][89]\n[Previous slide]\n[Next slide]\n\n### Frequently asked questions\n\nWhat is an IoMT Security Solution?\n\nAn IoMT security solution is a software platform that provides cybersecurity capabilities focused on\nIoMT \u2013 the Internet of Medical Things, which are network connected medical devices. Those\ncapabilities typically include safely creating an inventory of devices, managing security\nvulnerability information, providing risk mitigation guidance, and assisting with incident response\nprocesses.\n\nWhat is an IoT Security Solution?\n\nAn IoT security solution is a software platform that provides cybersecurity capabilities focused on\nIoT \u2013 the Internet of Things, which are network connected devices. Those capabilities typically\ninclude providing risk mitigation guidance, safely creating an inventory of devices, managing\nsecurity vulnerability information, deploying patches, and assisting with incident response\nprocesses.\n\nHow can you mitigate risk IoT, OT, and IoMT?\n\nOverall risk \u2013 from incidents and vulnerabilities \u2013 is typically mitigated in two ways: hardening\nyour attack surface and shortening the life of attacks that get past your perimeter. A risk\nmitigation platform that has both of those functions can significantly reduce the risk of connected\nIoT, OT, and IoMT while still allowing them to function.\n\nWhy do organizations choose Asimily for IoT, OT, & IoMT security?\n\nOrganizations have told Asimily that they are most impressed by its attention to service, its broad\nsoftware capabilities and commitment to rapid risk reduction by any means necessary. Unique\ncapabilities such as packet capture, targeted attack prevention (using the MITRE ATT&CK Framework as\na guide, not just a classifier), Configuration Control and many others are also frequently cited.\n* Platform\n* [Overview][90]\n* [Risk Mitigation][91]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][92]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][93]\n* [Threat and Response][94]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][95]\n* [IoT Patching][96]\n* [Configuration Control][97]\n* [Risk Modeling][98]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][99]\n* [Operational Efficiency][100]\n* [Integrations][101]\n* Industries\n* [Energy and Utilities][102]\n* [Financial Services][103]\n* [Government][104]\n* [Healthcare][105]\n* [Higher Education][106]\n* [Hospitality][107]\n* [Life Sciences][108]\n* [Manufacturing][109]\n* [Retail][110]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][111]\n* Solutions\n* column1\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][112]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][113]\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][114]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][115]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][116]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][117]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][118]\n* column2\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][119]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][120]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][121]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][122]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][123]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][124]\n* [Asimily for IT][125]\n* [IoT Security][126]\n* [OT Security][127]\n* [Medical Devices][128]\n* column3\n* [CMMC][129]\n* [Cyberscope][130]\n* [DORA][131]\n* [FDA][132]\n* [HIPAA][133]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][134]\n* [NERC CIP][135]\n* [NIS2][136]\n* [PCI-DSS][137]\n* [Zero Trust][138]\n* two columns\n* Resources\n* [All Resources][139]\n* [Blog][140]\n* [FAQ][141]\n* [Glossary][142]\n* About Us\n* [About Asimily][143]\n* [Careers][144]\n* [Leadership][145]\n* [Partners][146]\n* [Contact Us][147]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Asimily All Rights Reserved.\n\n[ Privacy Policy ][148]\n[ Product Security ][149]\n\n[1]: https://asimily.com\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[4]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[5]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[6]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[7]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[8]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[9]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[10]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[11]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[12]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[13]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-modeling/\n[14]: https://asimily.com/product/integrations/\n[15]: #\n[16]: https://asimily.com/industries/energy-utilities/\n[17]: https://asimily.com/industries/financial-services/\n[18]: https://asimily.com/industries/government/\n[19]: https://asimily.com/industries/healthcare/\n[20]: https://asimily.com/industries/higher-education/\n[21]: https://asimily.com/industries/hospitality-iot-security/\n[22]: https://asimily.com/industries/life-sciences/\n[23]: https://asimily.com/industries/manufacturing/\n[24]: https://asimily.com/industries/retail/\n[25]: https://asimily.com/industries/transportation/\n[26]: #\n[27]: https://asimily.com/solutions/automated-iot-visibility-deep-categorization/\n[28]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-detail-enrichment/\n[29]: https://asimily.com/solutions/continuous-iot-vulnerability-detection/\n[30]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-based-iot-vulnerability-prioritization/\n[31]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-prioritization-by-risk/\n[32]: https://asimily.com/solutions/efficient-security-risk-mitigation-workflows/\n[33]: https://asimily.com/solutions/network-segmentation-and-microsegmentation/\n[34]: https://asimily.com/solutions/fda-recalls-and-security-advi"
