            "url": "https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/",
            "text": "][1]\n* [Platform][2]\n* * * [Overview][3]\n* [Risk Mitigation][4]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][5]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][6]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][7]\n* [Threat and Response][8]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][9]\n* * * [Configuration Control][10]\n* [IoT Patching][11]\n* [Operational Efficiency][12]\n* [Risk Modeling][13]\n* [Integrations][14]\n* [Industries][15]\n* * * [Energy and Utilities][16]\n* [Financial Services][17]\n* [Government][18]\n* [Healthcare][19]\n* [Higher Education][20]\n* [Hospitality][21]\n* [Life Sciences][22]\n* [Manufacturing][23]\n* [Retail][24]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][25]\n* [Solutions][26]\n* * * #### Connected Device Visibility\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][27]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][28]\n* * #### Vulnerability Detection And Mitigation\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][29]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][30]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][31]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][32]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][33]\n* * #### IoMT\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][34]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][35]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][36]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][37]\n* * #### IT, IoT and OT\n* [OT Security][38]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][39]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][40]\n* [Asimily for IT][41]\n* * #### Compliance and Regulation\n* [CMMC][42]\n* [Cyberscope][43]\n* [DORA][44]\n* [FDA][45]\n* [HIPAA][46]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][47]\n* [NERC CIP][48]\n* [NIS2][49]\n* [NIST CSF 2.0][50]\n* [PCI-DSS][51]\n* [Zero Trust][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* * * [All Resources][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [FAQ][56]\n* [Press][57]\n* [Glossary][58]\n* [About Us][59]\n* * * [About Asimily][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Partners][62]\n* [Leadership][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n* [Request Demo][65]\n* [EN][66]\n* [DE][67]\n[ Request Demo ][68]\n* [Product][69]\n* Vulnerability Prioritization\n\n# Find out Which Vulnerabilities Matter the Most (and the Least)\n\nBy focusing on your *truly* risky vulnerabilities and devices, become safer and faster.\n\n[ Request a Demo ][70]\n\nReduce Device Cyber Risk\n\n#### Vulnerabilities Ranked by Exploitability Risk and Danger\n\nWith Asimily\u2019s detailed Likelihood and Impact analyses, vulnerabilities and devices get ranked,\nshowing you the most critical changes needed to reduce risk. This helps avoid activity that doesn\u2019t\nreduce the biggest risks.\n\n[ Get in Touch ][71]\n\nPrioritize Faster, Leave Attackers Behind\n\n## Always Know the Next and Best Action to Take\n\n### Model Risk Reduction, Save Effort\n\nSee Risk ROI for any given action with Risk Simulator \u2013 save time for your scarce cybersecurity\nresources.\n\n### Gain Efficiency with Device and Vulnerability-Level Analyses\n\nAsimily\u2019s AI/ML + NLP technology plus Asimily Labs\u2019 analyses highlight the most important IT, IoT,\nIoMT, and OT devices and vulnerabilities to prioritize \u2013 giving you dramatically less work to\nperform while slashing true risk down to size.\n\n### Get Better, Efficient Fixes\n\nNavigating the complexities of device vulnerability mitigation can be overwhelming. Asimily provides\nyou with ranked, simple, fix instructions and utilization data. Use those insights to remove the\nriskiest problems faster.\n\n### Reduce Risk\n\nAsimily understands that demonstrating your organization\u2019s defense is essential. Get a clear risk\nscore from 0-100, allowing you to assess your security against peers and track progress over time.\n\n### Model Changes that Reduce Risk\n\nAsimily helps you optimize team time by showing you the impact of different mitigation strategies\nbefore starting any work. Tackle the most important vulnerabilities first.\n\n### Use Network Configuration to Measure Real Risk\n\nAsimily evaluates each new vulnerability and customizes the risk level for each individual device,\nconsidering the vulnerability, importance, network, and configuration factors. Reduce real risk; not\ntheoretical risk based on vuln data alone.\n\n### Secure Every IoT Device.\n### Automatically.\n\nCyber threats move fast \u2014 so should you. Asimily gives instant inventory and smart, prioritized risk\nmitigation insights for every IoT, OT, and IoMT device \u2014 so you can take action before threats\nstrike.\n\n[ Schedule a Demo ][72]\n\n#### Our Gartner Peer Insights Reviews\n\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 4976678] ][73]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 511214] ][74]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4925308] ][75]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959932] ][76]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959378] ][77]\n[Previous slide]\n[Next slide]\n\n## Protecting Your Industry\u2019s Unique Devices\n\n### Healthcare\n\nAsimily provides the necessary tools to identify and address IoT vulnerabilities in healthcare,\nensuring the protection of patient data without interrupting the delivery of critical care.\n\n[ Discover More ][78]\n\n### Manufacturing\n\nIn an industry that relies heavily on IoT devices to drive automation, efficiency, and connectivity,\nAsimly can help. By ensuring the security of IoT devices, manufacturers can safeguard their\nintellectual property, prevent production disruptions, and maintain the trust of their customers and\npartners.\n\n[ Discover More ][79]\n\n### Higher Education\n\nEducational institutions depend on interconnected devices to facilitate learning, research, and\ncampus operations. Protect sensitive student and faculty data, maintain operational integrity, and\nfoster a secure, productive academic environment with Asimily.\n\n[ Discover More ][80]\n\n### Government\n\nAsimily equips government entities worldwide with the necessary tools to secure their IoT devices,\nprotect critical infrastructure, and ensure data privacy. Defend against cyber threats and uphold\npublic trust by proactively mitigating vulnerabilities.\n\n[ Discover More ][81]\n\n### Life Sciences\n\nWhere delicate research, development, and data exchange are ongoing, securing your IoT devices is a\ntop priority. Proactively manage and mitigate vulnerabilities, reducing the risk of theft or loss of\ncritical research and development efforts.\n\n[ Discover More ][82]\n\n### Frequently asked questions\n\nWhat are the common types of IoT device vulnerabilities?\n\nCommon types of IoT device vulnerabilities include weak or default passwords, outdated firmware or\nsoftware, insufficient authentication mechanisms, insecure data transfer and storage, lack of device\nmanagement, and poor physical security.\n\nHow can these vulnerabilities impact my organization?\n\nIoT device vulnerabilities can have significant consequences for your organization. They can lead to\ndata breaches, unauthorized access to systems, disruption of operations, compromised privacy,\nfinancial losses, reputational damage, and even physical harm in certain cases.\n\nWhy is vulnerability prioritization important?\n\nMost organizations struggle to keep up with the sheer volume of cybersecurity jobs to be done.\nHardening due to new vulnerabilities, seeing if a vulnerability is relevant, investigating\nanomalies, and keeping up with regulatory requirements take up significant time. As a result,\nprioritizing the riskiest vulnerabilities to address first becomes essential to mitigate risk.\n\nWhat are the key steps in effective vulnerability prioritization and management?\n\nEffective vulnerability prioritization requires understanding which vulnerabilities even apply to\nyour environment. Then it has to be assessed in the context of your devices. Is the vulnerability\nrisky or not? The same vulnerability could be risky if it is known to be exploited in the wild,\ntrivial to execute, or present on critical devices. Numerous other factors enter into the analysis.\nA simple way to group these considerations is assessing the Impact and Likelihood of an exploit due\nto an unmitigated vulnerability.\n\nWhat happens if I don\u2019t prioritize my vulnerabilities well?\n\nAttackers have scale, time and professionalism on their side. They\u2019ll get a jump on less prepared\norganizations who will eliminate less risky issues before more risky issues. This expands\nvulnerability windows and increases the likelihood of a successful attack \u2013 in general and against\ndevices.\n* Platform\n* [Overview][83]\n* [Risk Mitigation][84]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][85]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][86]\n* [Threat and Response][87]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][88]\n* [IoT Patching][89]\n* [Configuration Control][90]\n* [Risk Modeling][91]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][92]\n* [Operational Efficiency][93]\n* [Integrations][94]\n* Industries\n* [Energy and Utilities][95]\n* [Financial Services][96]\n* [Government][97]\n* [Healthcare][98]\n* [Higher Education][99]\n* [Hospitality][100]\n* [Life Sciences][101]\n* [Manufacturing][102]\n* [Retail][103]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][104]\n* Solutions\n* column1\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][105]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][106]\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][107]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][108]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][109]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][110]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][111]\n* column2\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][112]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][113]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][114]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][115]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][116]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][117]\n* [Asimily for IT][118]\n* [IoT Security][119]\n* [OT Security][120]\n* [Medical Devices][121]\n* column3\n* [CMMC][122]\n* [Cyberscope][123]\n* [DORA][124]\n* [FDA][125]\n* [HIPAA][126]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][127]\n* [NERC CIP][128]\n* [NIS2][129]\n* [PCI-DSS][130]\n* [Zero Trust][131]\n* two columns\n* Resources\n* [All Resources][132]\n* [Blog][133]\n* [FAQ][134]\n* [Glossary][135]\n* About Us\n* [About Asimily][136]\n* [Careers][137]\n* [Leadership][138]\n* [Partners][139]\n* [Contact Us][140]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Asimily All Rights Reserved.\n\n[ Privacy Policy ][141]\n[ Product Security ][142]\n\n[1]: https://asimily.com\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[4]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[5]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[6]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[7]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[8]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[9]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[10]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[11]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[12]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[13]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-modeling/\n[14]: https://asimily.com/product/integrations/\n[15]: #\n[16]: https://asimily.com/industries/energy-utilities/\n[17]: https://asimily.com/industries/financial-services/\n[18]: https://asimily.com/industries/government/\n[19]: https://asimily.com/industries/healthcare/\n[20]: https://asimily.com/industries/higher-education/\n[21]: https://asimily.com/industries/hospitality-iot-security/\n[22]: https://asimily.com/industries/life-sciences/\n[23]: https://asimily.com/industries/manufacturing/\n[24]: https://asimily.com/industries/retail/\n[25]: https://asimily.com/industries/transportation/\n[26]: #\n[27]: https://asimily.com/solutions/automated-iot-visibility-deep-categorization/\n[28]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-detail-enrichment/\n[29]: https://asimily.com/solutions/continuous-iot-vulnerability-detection/\n[30]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-based-iot-vulnerability-prioritization/\n[31]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-prioritization-by-risk/\n[32]: https://asimily.com/solutions/efficient-security-risk-mitigation-workflows/\n[33]: https://asimily.com/solutions/network-segmentation-and-microsegmentation/\n[34]: https://asimily.com/solutions/fda-recalls-and-security-advisories/\n[35]: https://asimily.com/solutions/medical-device-utilization/\n[36]: https://asimily.com/solutions/pre-purchase-security-risk-avoidance/\n[37]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-reduction-services/\n[38]: https://asimily.com/solutions/ot-security/\n[39]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-ri"
