            "text": "][1]\n* [Platform][2]\n* * * [Overview][3]\n* [Risk Mitigation][4]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][5]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][6]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][7]\n* [Threat and Response][8]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][9]\n* * * [Configuration Control][10]\n* [IoT Patching][11]\n* [Operational Efficiency][12]\n* [Risk Modeling][13]\n* [Integrations][14]\n* [Industries][15]\n* * * [Energy and Utilities][16]\n* [Financial Services][17]\n* [Government][18]\n* [Healthcare][19]\n* [Higher Education][20]\n* [Hospitality][21]\n* [Life Sciences][22]\n* [Manufacturing][23]\n* [Retail][24]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][25]\n* [Solutions][26]\n* * * #### Connected Device Visibility\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][27]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][28]\n* * #### Vulnerability Detection And Mitigation\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][29]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][30]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][31]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][32]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][33]\n* * #### IoMT\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][34]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][35]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][36]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][37]\n* * #### IT, IoT and OT\n* [OT Security][38]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][39]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][40]\n* [Asimily for IT][41]\n* * #### Compliance and Regulation\n* [CMMC][42]\n* [Cyberscope][43]\n* [DORA][44]\n* [FDA][45]\n* [HIPAA][46]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][47]\n* [NERC CIP][48]\n* [NIS2][49]\n* [NIST CSF 2.0][50]\n* [PCI-DSS][51]\n* [Zero Trust][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* * * [All Resources][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [FAQ][56]\n* [Press][57]\n* [Glossary][58]\n* [About Us][59]\n* * * [About Asimily][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Partners][62]\n* [Leadership][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n* [Request Demo][65]\n* [EN][66]\n* [DE][67]\n[ Request Demo ][68]\n* [Product][69]\n* Risk Modeling\n\n# Forecast Risks to Better Avoid Them\n\nModel and Simulate Changes to Risk for any Action\n\n[ Request a Demo ][70]\n\nModel and simulate risk\n\n#### Unleash the Power of Certainty\n\nWith Asimily, foresight becomes your greatest ally. Envision, predict, and act with unparalleled\nconfidence, and unlock a new era of proactive risk mitigation.\n\n[ Get in Touch ][71]\n\nModel and Simulate Risks Before Any Action\n\n## Avoid Risk From the Start\n\n### Simulate Device Risk Scenarios\n\nCalculate the least risk associated with a device before configuration and connection.\n\n### Avoid Buying Risky Devices\n\nAvoid installing risky device configurations by knowing the safest one. Asimily manages and shares\nthe most secure, active configurations of devices across our customer set, so you can be as safe as\nthe safest.\n\n### Get Time Back for Your Team\n\nWith Risk Simulation, potential changes to devices and networks to mitigate vulnerabilities can be\ntried out, virtually. See how Risk Scores change without lifting a finger; pick the best risk\nreduction for your team\u2019s available time.\n\n### Benchmark Your Risk\n\nRisk Scores are calculated automatically for your organization, your peers, and for each device. See\nprogress over time, and how you rank relative to similar institutions.\n\n[IoT Device Security]\n\n## Model Risks to Demonstrate Better Compliance\n\n### Pre-Purchase Risk Modeling\n\nWith an extensive database of devices, see the risk that comes with any purchase of a networked\ndevice. Work with teams to get the safest device that meets organizational needs with data in hand.\n\n### Simulate Risks to Plan Work Better\n\nWith a simple click of a button, see the risk reduction that comes from any of Asimily\u2019s hundreds of\ntargeted remediation guidance steps. Pick your tasks based on the time cost and risk reduction to\nwork efficiently.\n\n### Avoid Hidden Security Costs\n\nSome devices come with hidden secrets and poor security. Less safe versions of devices can require\nupgrades, configurations and segmentation to reduce risk. Know before you buy to plan better.\n\n### Avoid Unsafe Configurations\n\nSee the safest known operating configuration for your devices, based on functioning installations\nacross the Asimily customer base, avoiding trial and error that others have done before you.\n\n### Secure Every IoT Device.\n### Automatically.\n\nCyber threats move fast \u2014 so should you. Asimily gives instant inventory and smart, prioritized risk\nmitigation insights for every IoT, OT, and IoMT device \u2014 so you can take action before threats\nstrike.\n\n[ Schedule a Demo ][72]\n\n#### Our Gartner Peer Insights Reviews\n\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 4976678] ][73]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 511214] ][74]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4925308] ][75]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959932] ][76]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959378] ][77]\n[Previous slide]\n[Next slide]\n\n## Protecting Your Industry\u2019s Unique Devices\n\n### Healthcare\n\nAsimily provides the necessary tools to identify and address IoT vulnerabilities in healthcare,\nensuring the protection of patient data without interrupting the delivery of critical care.\n\n[ Discover More ][78]\n\n### Manufacturing\n\nIn an industry that relies heavily on IoT devices to drive automation, efficiency, and connectivity,\nAsimly can help. By ensuring the security of IoT devices, manufacturers can safeguard their\nintellectual property, prevent production disruptions, and maintain the trust of their customers and\npartners.\n\n[ Discover More ][79]\n\n### Higher Education\n\nEducational institutions depend on interconnected devices to facilitate learning, research, and\ncampus operations. Protect sensitive student and faculty data, maintain operational integrity, and\nfoster a secure, productive academic environment with Asimily.\n\n[ Discover More ][80]\n\n### Government\n\nAsimily equips government entities worldwide with the necessary tools to secure their IoT devices,\nprotect critical infrastructure, and ensure data privacy. Defend against cyber threats and uphold\npublic trust by proactively mitigating vulnerabilities.\n\n[ Discover More ][81]\n\n### Life Sciences\n\nWhere delicate research, development, and data exchange are ongoing, securing your IoT devices is a\ntop priority. Proactively manage and mitigate vulnerabilities, reducing the risk of theft or loss of\ncritical research and development efforts.\n\n[ Discover More ][82]\n\n### Frequently asked questions\n\nWhat is predictive risk modeling for devices?\n\nIoT Risk modeling is a set of capabilities that allow an organization to see the risk associated\nwith networked devices. It also includes changes in risk, associated with specific actions. The risk\nis calculated without needing to make real-world changes.\n\nWhy is risk modeling important?\n\nIt\u2019s like a spreadsheet for risk. Organizations can see what scenarios of devices and remediation\nlead to what level of risk. It allows many hypothetical situations to be considered, before taking\nreal-world action to achieve one of them.\n\nWhat are the key components of risk modeling?\n\nRisk modeling has three major components \u2013 device risk scores, remediation risk simulation, and\noverall organizational risk.\n\nWhat are the benefits to my organization of risk modeling?\n\nBy adopting a proactive risk management approach, you can address vulnerabilities, make informed\nrisk mitigation decisions, and maintain a strong security posture. This will ultimately result in\nreduced downtime, enhanced data protection, and improved overall resilience.\n\nCan risk modeling save me money?\n\nYes, by being able to have a complete picture of devices and the work needed to secure them, a\nsignificant hidden cost can be reduced. This lets organizations buy secure devices from the start.\nFurther, high-effort tasks can be compared to low-effort tasks, to pick the most efficient risk\nreduction possible.\n\nCan I use risk management for my specific industry?\n\nAbsolutely! Asimily\u2019s risk modeling is designed to cater to various industries, including\nhealthcare, life sciences, higher education, and more. Our platform\u2019s adaptive capabilities allow it\nto address the unique cybersecurity challenges of different sectors, ensuring you stay ahead of\nthreats regardless of your industry.\n* Platform\n* [Overview][83]\n* [Risk Mitigation][84]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][85]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][86]\n* [Threat and Response][87]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][88]\n* [IoT Patching][89]\n* [Configuration Control][90]\n* [Risk Modeling][91]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][92]\n* [Operational Efficiency][93]\n* [Integrations][94]\n* Industries\n* [Energy and Utilities][95]\n* [Financial Services][96]\n* [Government][97]\n* [Healthcare][98]\n* [Higher Education][99]\n* [Hospitality][100]\n* [Life Sciences][101]\n* [Manufacturing][102]\n* [Retail][103]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][104]\n* Solutions\n* column1\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][105]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][106]\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][107]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][108]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][109]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][110]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][111]\n* column2\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][112]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][113]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][114]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][115]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][116]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][117]\n* [Asimily for IT][118]\n* [IoT Security][119]\n* [OT Security][120]\n* [Medical Devices][121]\n* column3\n* [CMMC][122]\n* [Cyberscope][123]\n* [DORA][124]\n* [FDA][125]\n* [HIPAA][126]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][127]\n* [NERC CIP][128]\n* [NIS2][129]\n* [PCI-DSS][130]\n* [Zero Trust][131]\n* two columns\n* Resources\n* [All Resources][132]\n* [Blog][133]\n* [FAQ][134]\n* [Glossary][135]\n* About Us\n* [About Asimily][136]\n* [Careers][137]\n* [Leadership][138]\n* [Partners][139]\n* [Contact Us][140]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Asimily All Rights Reserved.\n\n[ Privacy Policy ][141]\n[ Product Security ][142]\n\n[1]: https://asimily.com\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[4]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[5]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[6]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[7]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[8]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[9]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[10]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[11]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[12]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[13]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-modeling/\n[14]: https://asimily.com/product/integrations/\n[15]: #\n[16]: https://asimily.com/industries/energy-utilities/\n[17]: https://asimily.com/industries/financial-services/\n[18]: https://asimily.com/industries/government/\n[19]: https://asimily.com/industries/healthcare/\n[20]: https://asimily.com/industries/higher-education/\n[21]: https://asimily.com/industries/hospitality-iot-security/\n[22]: https://asimily.com/industries/life-sciences/\n[23]: https://asimily.com/industries/manufacturing/\n[24]: https://asimily.com/industries/retail/\n[25]: https://asimily.com/industries/transportation/\n[26]: #\n[27]: https://asimily.com/solutions/automated-iot-visibility-deep-categorization/\n[28]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-detail-enrichment/\n[29]: https://asimily.com/solutions/continuous-iot-vulnerability-detection/\n[30]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-based-iot-vulnerability-prioritization/\n[31]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-prioritization-by-risk/\n[32]: https://asimily.com/solutions/efficient-security-risk-mitigation-workflows/\n[33]: https://asimily.com/solutions/network-segmentation-and-microsegmentation/\n[34]: https://asimily.com/solutions/fda-recalls-and-security-advisories/\n[35]: https://asimily.com/solutions/medical-device-utilization/\n[36]: https://asimily.com/solutions/pre-purchase-security-risk-avoidance/\n[37]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-reduction-services/\n[38]: https://asimily.com/solutions/ot-security/\n[39]: https://asimily.com/solu"
