            "text": "][1]\n* [Platform][2]\n* * * [Overview][3]\n* [Risk Mitigation][4]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][5]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][6]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][7]\n* [Threat and Response][8]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][9]\n* * * [Configuration Control][10]\n* [IoT Patching][11]\n* [Operational Efficiency][12]\n* [Risk Modeling][13]\n* [Integrations][14]\n* [Industries][15]\n* * * [Energy and Utilities][16]\n* [Financial Services][17]\n* [Government][18]\n* [Healthcare][19]\n* [Higher Education][20]\n* [Hospitality][21]\n* [Life Sciences][22]\n* [Manufacturing][23]\n* [Retail][24]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][25]\n* [Solutions][26]\n* * * #### Connected Device Visibility\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][27]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][28]\n* * #### Vulnerability Detection And Mitigation\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][29]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][30]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][31]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][32]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][33]\n* * #### IoMT\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][34]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][35]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][36]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][37]\n* * #### IT, IoT and OT\n* [OT Security][38]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][39]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][40]\n* [Asimily for IT][41]\n* * #### Compliance and Regulation\n* [CMMC][42]\n* [Cyberscope][43]\n* [DORA][44]\n* [FDA][45]\n* [HIPAA][46]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][47]\n* [NERC CIP][48]\n* [NIS2][49]\n* [NIST CSF 2.0][50]\n* [PCI-DSS][51]\n* [Zero Trust][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* * * [All Resources][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [FAQ][56]\n* [Press][57]\n* [Glossary][58]\n* [About Us][59]\n* * * [About Asimily][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Partners][62]\n* [Leadership][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n* [Request Demo][65]\n* [EN][66]\n* [DE][67]\n[ Request Demo ][68]\n* [Product][69]\n* Integrations\n\n# APIs and Integrations For a Single Pane On Device Security\n\nIntegrate with your workflows and stack with Asimily integrations and API.\n\n[APIs and Integrations]\n\n### NAC Systems Integrations\n\nAsimily\u2019s integration with NAC systems provides critical context, such as device classifications and\nrisk scores, to enable automated segmentation based on device type and enhance policy enforcement.\n\n[Cisco (Kenna) logo]\n[Arista logo]\n[Palo Alto Networks logo 2024]\n\n### CMMS & CMDB Systems Integrations\n\nAsimily integrates bidirectionally with CMMS and CMDB systems, ensuring the synchronization of\ndevice data. Keep these systems up-to-date when device attributes change for a single pane.\nAdditionally, Asimily can automatically create work orders for issues such as anomalies and\nvulnerabilities, depending on the integration target\u2019s support.\n\n[WaveWare logo]\n[accruent]\n[TruAsset logo]\n[Trimedx logo]\n\n### Vulnerability Scanner Integrations\n\nBy integrating with Vulnerability Scanner systems, Asimily enhances its vulnerability and OS\nidentification capabilities. Filter out inapplicable and lower-risk Common Vulnerabilities and\nExposures (CVEs) from scan results, improving the efficacy and efficiency of vulnerability\nmanagement.\n\n[Cisco (Kenna) logo]\n\n### DHCP/IPAM Systems Integrations\n\nImprove device classification, vulnerability assignment, and overall device management as devices\nmove across the network by integrating with DHCP and IPAM systems.\n\n### SIEM and SOC Systems Integrations\n\nSend anomaly event data to SIEMs/SOCs in standard syslog format directly from Asimily, providing\nvaluable context and enhancing incident response capabilities.\n\n[Crowdstrike logo]\n[Palo Alto Networks logo 2024]\n\n### IAM Integrations\n\nIdentity and Access Management (IAM) is a framework of policies, processes, and technologies that\nenable organizations to manage digital identities and control user access to critical corporate\ninformation.\n\n### EDR and Threat Intelligence\n\nAsimily incorporates over 100 sources of Threats, including these.\n\n[Cisco (Kenna) logo]\n[Crowdstrike logo]\n[Palo Alto Networks logo 2024]\n\n### RTLS\n\nAsimily works with RTLS (Real Time Location Systems) to help find portable equipment wherever it may\nroam.\n\n[Cisco (Kenna) logo]\n\n### Marketplace Listings\n\nAsimily integrates with key technology partners through marketplace apps to enable seamless\nintegration across your security stack.\n\n### Additional Integrations and Partners\n\nAsimily works with a wide variety of other partners and data providers, including these.\n\n[Cisco (Kenna) logo]\n[Crowdstrike logo]\n[Matillion logo]\n[Axonius logo]\n\n### Is your tool not on the list?\n\nIf you have specific integration requirements or would like to explore integrations beyond the ones\nlisted above, please contact our team.\n\n[ Contact Us ][70]\n\n#### Our Gartner Peer Insights Reviews\n\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 4976678] ][71]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 511214] ][72]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4925308] ][73]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959932] ][74]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959378] ][75]\n[Previous slide]\n[Next slide]\n* Platform\n* [Overview][76]\n* [Risk Mitigation][77]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][78]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][79]\n* [Threat and Response][80]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][81]\n* [IoT Patching][82]\n* [Configuration Control][83]\n* [Risk Modeling][84]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][85]\n* [Operational Efficiency][86]\n* [Integrations][87]\n* Industries\n* [Energy and Utilities][88]\n* [Financial Services][89]\n* [Government][90]\n* [Healthcare][91]\n* [Higher Education][92]\n* [Hospitality][93]\n* [Life Sciences][94]\n* [Manufacturing][95]\n* [Retail][96]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][97]\n* Solutions\n* column1\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][98]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][99]\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][100]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][101]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][102]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][103]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][104]\n* column2\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][105]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][106]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][107]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][108]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][109]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][110]\n* [Asimily for IT][111]\n* [IoT Security][112]\n* [OT Security][113]\n* [Medical Devices][114]\n* column3\n* [CMMC][115]\n* [Cyberscope][116]\n* [DORA][117]\n* [FDA][118]\n* [HIPAA][119]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][120]\n* [NERC CIP][121]\n* [NIS2][122]\n* [PCI-DSS][123]\n* [Zero Trust][124]\n* two columns\n* Resources\n* [All Resources][125]\n* [Blog][126]\n* [FAQ][127]\n* [Glossary][128]\n* About Us\n* [About Asimily][129]\n* [Careers][130]\n* [Leadership][131]\n* [Partners][132]\n* [Contact Us][133]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Asimily All Rights Reserved.\n\n[ Privacy Policy ][134]\n[ Product Security ][135]\n\n[1]: https://asimily.com\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[4]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[5]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[6]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[7]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[8]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[9]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[10]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[11]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[12]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[13]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-modeling/\n[14]: https://asimily.com/product/integrations/\n[15]: #\n[16]: https://asimily.com/industries/energy-utilities/\n[17]: https://asimily.com/industries/financial-services/\n[18]: https://asimily.com/industries/government/\n[19]: https://asimily.com/industries/healthcare/\n[20]: https://asimily.com/industries/higher-education/\n[21]: https://asimily.com/industries/hospitality-iot-security/\n[22]: https://asimily.com/industries/life-sciences/\n[23]: https://asimily.com/industries/manufacturing/\n[24]: https://asimily.com/industries/retail/\n[25]: https://asimily.com/industries/transportation/\n[26]: #\n[27]: https://asimily.com/solutions/automated-iot-visibility-deep-categorization/\n[28]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-detail-enrichment/\n[29]: https://asimily.com/solutions/continuous-iot-vulnerability-detection/\n[30]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-based-iot-vulnerability-prioritization/\n[31]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-prioritization-by-risk/\n[32]: https://asimily.com/solutions/efficient-security-risk-mitigation-workflows/\n[33]: https://asimily.com/solutions/network-segmentation-and-microsegmentation/\n[34]: https://asimily.com/solutions/fda-recalls-and-security-advisories/\n[35]: https://asimily.com/solutions/medical-device-utilization/\n[36]: https://asimily.com/solutions/pre-purchase-security-risk-avoidance/\n[37]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-reduction-services/\n[38]: https://asimily.com/solutions/ot-security/\n[39]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-risk-simulator/\n[40]: https://asimily.com/solutions/incident-response-readiness-with-packet-capture/\n[41]: https://asimily.com/solutions/it-capabilities/\n[42]: https://asimily.com/compliance-cmmc/\n[43]: https://asimily.com/compliance-cyberscope/\n[44]: https://asimily.com/compliance-dora/\n[45]: https://asimily.com/compliance-fda/\n[46]: https://asimily.com/compliance-hipaa/\n[47]: https://asimily.com/compliance-mitre-attack-framework/\n[48]: https://asimily.com/compliance-nerc-cip/\n[49]: https://asimily.com/compliance-nis2-directive/\n[50]: https://asimily.com/compliance-nist-csf/\n[51]: https://asimily.com/compliance-pci-dss/\n[52]: https://asimily.com/compliance-zero-trust-security-framework/\n[53]: #\n[54]: https://asimily.com/resources/\n[55]: h