            "text": "][1]\n* [Platform][2]\n* * * [Overview][3]\n* [Risk Mitigation][4]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][5]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][6]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][7]\n* [Threat and Response][8]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][9]\n* * * [Configuration Control][10]\n* [IoT Patching][11]\n* [Operational Efficiency][12]\n* [Risk Modeling][13]\n* [Integrations][14]\n* [Industries][15]\n* * * [Energy and Utilities][16]\n* [Financial Services][17]\n* [Government][18]\n* [Healthcare][19]\n* [Higher Education][20]\n* [Hospitality][21]\n* [Life Sciences][22]\n* [Manufacturing][23]\n* [Retail][24]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][25]\n* [Solutions][26]\n* * * #### Connected Device Visibility\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][27]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][28]\n* * #### Vulnerability Detection And Mitigation\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][29]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][30]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][31]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][32]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][33]\n* * #### IoMT\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][34]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][35]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][36]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][37]\n* * #### IT, IoT and OT\n* [OT Security][38]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][39]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][40]\n* [Asimily for IT][41]\n* * #### Compliance and Regulation\n* [CMMC][42]\n* [Cyberscope][43]\n* [DORA][44]\n* [FDA][45]\n* [HIPAA][46]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][47]\n* [NERC CIP][48]\n* [NIS2][49]\n* [NIST CSF 2.0][50]\n* [PCI-DSS][51]\n* [Zero Trust][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* * * [All Resources][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [FAQ][56]\n* [Press][57]\n* [Glossary][58]\n* [About Us][59]\n* * * [About Asimily][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Partners][62]\n* [Leadership][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n* [Request Demo][65]\n* [EN][66]\n* [DE][67]\n[ Request Demo ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* Solutions \u2013 Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization\n\nKnow Every IoT/OT Device\n\n# Automated IoT Visibility and Deep Categorization\n\nSafely find the IoT devices on your network. Know all there is to know about each one to bolster\nyour defenses, avoid surprises and efficiently operate them. Enjoy a continuously updated and\naccurate inventory.\n\n[ Get a Demo ][70]\n[Automated Visibility and Deep Categorization]\n\nSecurity Plans Always Start with Visibility\n\n### Avoid IoT Visibility Pitfalls\n\n###### Stale Data\n\nContinuous monitoring leads to a constantly up-to-date inventory, for operational, efficiency, and\nregulatory use of your inventory.\n\n###### Missing Context\n\nSee baseline data and changes over time, to see how configurations are changing.\n\n###### Shadow IT\n\nAvoid Shadow IT with rapid reporting on unexpected devices, so you can quickly act on them.\n\n### How to Choose the Right\n### IoT Security Solution in 2026\n\nProtecting the growing IoT architecture\nin a complicated security environment\n\n[ Get The Whitepaper ][71]\n\nSafe, Comprehensive, Categorized\n\n## Asimily\u2019s Approach to IoT/OT inventory\n\nOur customers gain a continuously updated list of the IoT/OT devices on their networks, based on\nsafe network traffic analysis. Accurate data populates rapidly with Asimily\u2019s combination of machine\nlearning and packet inspection to confidently identify IoT/OT devices. Other data sources can be\nused to augment network traffic analysis, for an even richer understanding of IoT/OT. Each device\u2019s\nrecord is enriched with device metadata. Basic data on adjacent IT is also collected for\ncompleteness.\n\n### Safe\n\nMultiple techniques help generate an accurate device inventory, especially passive network\nmonitoring. IoT/OT devices can fail when actively scanned, even using manufacturer APIs. Asimily\nrelies on the safest techniques to maximize uptime.\n\n### Comprehensive\n\nIn addition to tried-and-true network monitoring, Asimily can integrate other customer data sources,\nincluding agent-based data. This shrinks the unmonitored device inventory as small as possible.\n\n### Categorized\n\nGet useful information along with your inventory. Asimily fingerprints any new devices rapidly, even\nbefore deployment to avoid adding risk to your environment. Each device is logically categorized to\naid with security operations.\n\n### Real-time Accuracy and Smart Categorization\n\nAn accurate, classified inventory is an important first step to solving every other security\nproblem. By combining multiple techniques and data sources, Asimily uses numerous innovative\ncutting-edge techniques, some patented, to provide the best inventory possible.\n\n[ Dive Deeper ][72]\n[IoT Device Inventory Needs Real-time Accuracy and Smart Categorization]\n\n### The Power of a Comprehensive IoT Inventory\n\nThe lack of a formal IoT asset inventory creates security blind spots that can lead to data\nbreaches. With a formal inventory that includes fewer analyzed IoT devices, organizations can reduce\nadministrative costs and security risks while more effectively managing their IT budgets with\ndata-driven insights that identify necessary technology investments.\n\n[ Discover How ][73]\n[The Power of a Comprehensive IoT Inventory]\n\n#### Our Gartner Peer Insights Reviews\n\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 4976678] ][74]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 511214] ][75]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4925308] ][76]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959932] ][77]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959378] ][78]\n[Previous slide]\n[Next slide]\n* Platform\n* [Overview][79]\n* [Risk Mitigation][80]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][81]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][82]\n* [Threat and Response][83]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][84]\n* [IoT Patching][85]\n* [Configuration Control][86]\n* [Risk Modeling][87]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][88]\n* [Operational Efficiency][89]\n* [Integrations][90]\n* Industries\n* [Energy and Utilities][91]\n* [Financial Services][92]\n* [Government][93]\n* [Healthcare][94]\n* [Higher Education][95]\n* [Hospitality][96]\n* [Life Sciences][97]\n* [Manufacturing][98]\n* [Retail][99]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][100]\n* Solutions\n* column1\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][101]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][102]\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][103]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][104]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][105]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][106]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][107]\n* column2\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][108]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][109]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][110]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][111]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][112]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][113]\n* [Asimily for IT][114]\n* [IoT Security][115]\n* [OT Security][116]\n* [Medical Devices][117]\n* column3\n* [CMMC][118]\n* [Cyberscope][119]\n* [DORA][120]\n* [FDA][121]\n* [HIPAA][122]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][123]\n* [NERC CIP][124]\n* [NIS2][125]\n* [PCI-DSS][126]\n* [Zero Trust][127]\n* two columns\n* Resources\n* [All Resources][128]\n* [Blog][129]\n* [FAQ][130]\n* [Glossary][131]\n* About Us\n* [About Asimily][132]\n* [Careers][133]\n* [Leadership][134]\n* [Partners][135]\n* [Contact Us][136]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Asimily All Rights Reserved.\n\n[ Privacy Policy ][137]\n[ Product Security ][138]\n\n[1]: https://asimily.com\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[4]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[5]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[6]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[7]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[8]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[9]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[10]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[11]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[12]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[13]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-modeling/\n[14]: https://asimily.com/product/integrations/\n[15]: #\n[16]: https://asimily.com/industries/energy-utilities/\n[17]: https://asimily.com/industries/financial-services/\n[18]: https://asimily.com/industries/government/\n[19]: https://asimily.com/industries/healthcare/\n[20]: https://asimily.com/industries/higher-education/\n[21]: https://asimily.com/industries/hospitality-iot-security/\n[22]: https://asimily.com/industries/life-sciences/\n[23]: https://asimily.com/industries/manufacturing/\n[24]: https://asimily.com/industries/retail/\n[25]: https://asimily.com/industries/transportation/\n[26]: #\n[27]: https://asimily.com/solutions/automated-iot-visibility-deep-categorization/\n[28]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-detail-enrichment/\n[29]: https://asimily.com/solutions/continuous-iot-vulnerability-detection/\n[30]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-based-iot-vulnerability-prioritization/\n[31]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-prioritization-by-risk/\n[32]: https://asimily.com/solutions/efficient-security-risk-mitigation-workflows/\n[33]: https://asimily.com/solutions/network-segmentation-and-microsegmentation/\n[34]: https://asimily.com/solutions/fda-recalls-and-security-advisories/\n[35]: https://asimily.com/solutions/medical-device-utilization/\n[36]: https://asimily.com/solutions/pre-purchase-security-risk-avoidance/\n[37]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-reduction-services/\n[38]: https://asimily.com/solutions/ot-security/\n[39]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-risk-simulator/\n[40]: https://asimily.com/solutions/incident-response-readiness-with-packet-capture/\n[41]: https://asimily.com/solutions/it-capabilities/\n[42]: https://asimily.com/compliance-cmmc/\n[43]: https://asimily.com/compliance-cyberscope/\n[44]: https://asimily.com/compliance-dora/\n[45]: https://asimily.com/compliance-fda/\n[46]: https://asimily.com/compliance-hipaa/\n[47]: https://asimily.com/compliance-mitre-attack-framework/\n[48]: https://asimily.com/compliance-nerc-cip/\n[49]: https://asimily.com/compliance-nis2-directive/\n[50]: https://asimily.com/compliance-nist-csf/\n[51]: https://asimily.com/compliance-pci-dss/\n[52]: https://asimily.com/compliance-zero-trust-security-framework/\n[53]: #\n[54]: https://asimily.com/resources/\n[55]: https://asimily.com/blog/\n[56]: https://asimily.com/resources/faq/\n[57]: https://asimily.com/press/\n[58]: https://asimily.com/resources/glossary/\n[59]: #\n[60]: https://asimily.com/about-us/\n[61]: https://asimily.com/about-us/careers/\n[62]: https://asimily.com/about-us/partners/\n[63]: https://asimily.com/about-us/leadership/\n[64]: https://asimily.com/contact-us/\n[65]: https://asimily.com/request-a-demo/\n[66]: #weglot_switcher\n[67]: https://asimily.com/de/solutions/automated-iot-visibility-deep-categorization/\n[68]: https://asimily.com/request-a-demo/?utm_source=header&utm_medium=requestdemoCTA\n[69]: https://asimily.com/solutions/\n[70]: https://asimily.com/ransomware-attack-defense/\n[71]: https://asimily.com/how-to-choose-the-right-iomt-security-solution-2026/\n[72]: https://asimily.com/blog/iot-device-inventory-needs-real-time-accuracy/\n[73]: https://asimily.com/blog/harness-the-power-of-iot-with-accurate-inventory/\n[74]: https://gtnr.io/zbH4YrPMB\n[75]: https://gtnr.io/Q5IfCllF6\n[76]: https://gtnr.io/MwH8p7Hjf\n[77]: https://gtnr.io/HUFAfi6ha\n[78]: https://gtnr.io/B2BrW6Zto\n[79]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[80]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[81]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[82]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[83]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[84]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[85]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[86]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[87]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-modeling/\n[88]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[89]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[90]: https://asimily.com/product/integrations/\n[91]: https://asimily.com/industries/energy-utilities/\n[92]: https://asimily.com/industries/financial-services/\n[93]: https://asimily.com/industries/government/\n[94]: https://asimily.com/industries/healthcare"
