reers/\n[62]: https://asimily.com/about-us/partners/\n[63]: https://asimily.com/about-us/leadership/\n[64]: https://asimily.com/contact-us/\n[65]: https://asimily.com/request-a-demo/\n[66]: #weglot_switcher\n[67]: https://asimily.com/de/solutions/continuous-iot-vulnerability-detection/\n[68]: https://asimily.com/request-a-demo/?utm_source=header&utm_medium=requestdemoCTA\n[69]: https://asimily.com/how-to-choose-the-right-iomt-security-solution-2026/\n[70]: https://asimily.com/blog/necessity-of-continuous-vulnerability-detection/\n[71]: https://asimily.com/blog/why-is-shadow-it-a-major-security-challenge/\n[72]: https://gtnr.io/zbH4YrPMB\n[73]: https://gtnr.io/Q5IfCllF6\n[74]: https://gtnr.io/MwH8p7Hjf\n[75]: https://gtnr.io/HUFAfi6ha\n[76]: https://gtnr.io/B2BrW6Zto\n[77]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[78]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[79]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[80]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[81]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[82]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[83]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[84]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[85]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-modeling/\n[86]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[87]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[88]: https://asimily.com/product/integrations/\n[89]: https://asimily.com/industries/energy-utilities/\n[90]: https://asimily.com/industries/financial-services/\n[91]: https://asimily.com/industries/government/\n[92]: https://asimily.com/industries/healthcare/\n[93]: https://asimily.com/industries/higher-education/\n[94]: https://asimily.com/industries/hospitality-iot-security/\n[95]: https://asimily.com/industries/life-sciences/\n[96]: https://asimily.com/industries/manufacturing/\n[97]: https://asimily.com/industries/retail/\n[98]: https://asimily.com/industries/transportation/\n[99]: https://asimily.com/solutions/automated-iot-visibility-deep-categorization/\n[100]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-detail-enrichment/\n[101]: https://asimily.com/solutions/continuous-iot-vulnerability-detection/\n[102]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-based-iot-vulnerability-prioritization/\n[103]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-prioritization-by-risk/\n[104]: https://asimily.com"
