            "text": "][1]\n* [Platform][2]\n* * * [Overview][3]\n* [Risk Mitigation][4]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][5]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][6]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][7]\n* [Threat and Response][8]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][9]\n* * * [Configuration Control][10]\n* [IoT Patching][11]\n* [Operational Efficiency][12]\n* [Risk Modeling][13]\n* [Integrations][14]\n* [Industries][15]\n* * * [Energy and Utilities][16]\n* [Financial Services][17]\n* [Government][18]\n* [Healthcare][19]\n* [Higher Education][20]\n* [Hospitality][21]\n* [Life Sciences][22]\n* [Manufacturing][23]\n* [Retail][24]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][25]\n* [Solutions][26]\n* * * #### Connected Device Visibility\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][27]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][28]\n* * #### Vulnerability Detection And Mitigation\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][29]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][30]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][31]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][32]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][33]\n* * #### IoMT\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][34]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][35]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][36]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][37]\n* * #### IT, IoT and OT\n* [OT Security][38]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][39]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][40]\n* [Asimily for IT][41]\n* * #### Compliance and Regulation\n* [CMMC][42]\n* [Cyberscope][43]\n* [DORA][44]\n* [FDA][45]\n* [HIPAA][46]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][47]\n* [NERC CIP][48]\n* [NIS2][49]\n* [NIST CSF 2.0][50]\n* [PCI-DSS][51]\n* [Zero Trust][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* * * [All Resources][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [FAQ][56]\n* [Press][57]\n* [Glossary][58]\n* [About Us][59]\n* * * [About Asimily][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Partners][62]\n* [Leadership][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n* [Request Demo][65]\n* [EN][66]\n* [DE][67]\n[ Request Demo ][68]\n\nProtect your Networked Cyber Assets\n\n# Asimily Enables Smart Segmentation\n\nThe Asimily Platform transforms network segmentation from a manual task into a continuous,\nintelligence-driven, risk-aware process while leveraging an organization\u2019s existing tools.\n\n[ Get a Demo ][69]\n[IoT Defensible Perimeter | Asimily]\n\nCreate and Maintain Operationally Safe Networks\n\n### Transform Data into Actionable Segmentation Policies\n\n###### Targeted Segmentation\n\nBy bringing together vulnerabilities, device criticality, configuration data, and threat\nintelligence alongside Asimily\u2019s device data flows and proprietary research, organizations gain a\nclear picture of where segmentation will deliver the greatest security impact. Because Asimily maps\nattack paths to pinpoint which devices and connections meaningfully contribute to risk exposure,\nsegmentation efforts can be focused precisely on neutralizing those vectors \u2014 driving real risk\nreduction rather than surface-level fixes.\n\n###### Guided Policy Creation\n\nOnce Asimily establishes legitimate communication baselines and generates least-privileged\nsegmentation policies grounded in real traffic patterns, organizations can leverage Asimily\u2019s guided\nsegmentation policy capability to translate those recommendations directly into discretionary access\ncontrol lists (DACLs) and security group ACLs (SGACLs), such as those managed through Cisco ISE.\nNetwork security tools handle policy enforcement, authentication, and authorization. Asimily ensures\nwhat gets enforced is actually right.\n\n###### Intelligent Orchestration & Enforcement\n\nOnce policies are approved, Asimily orchestrates enforcement through network security tools via API\nintegration, removing the need for manual intervention. This automation ensures consistent policy\ndeployment across the entire network while enabling organizations to adapt seamlessly as conditions\nchange, whether that means new devices coming online, application updates, or shifting communication\npatterns.\n\n### Unlock the Full Potential of Network Segmentation\n\nDiscover Asimily\u2019s integration with NAC and firewall tools for safe, incremental microsegmentation\nand targeted segmentation\n\n[ View the Solution Brief ][70]\n\nAnalyze, Create, Validate\n\n## Asimily\u2019s Approach to Network Segmentation & Microsegmentation\n\nAsimily\u2019s philosophy centers on defending against exploitation, not simply cataloging\nvulnerabilities. That means providing straightforward, actionable ways to break attack chains,\ninformed by deep analysis of each vulnerability. Microsegmentation and Targeted Segmentation are of\nseveral methods Asimily offers to achieve fast, meaningful risk reduction.\n\n### Analyze\n\nThe Asimily Platform automatically reduces exposures present on the riskiest cyber assets by\nidentifying, prioritizing, and mitigating threats.\n\n### Create\n\nThe Asimily Platform\u2019s Smart Policy Management feature enables intelligent orchestration and\ncreation of network segmentation policies in order to ensure critical cyber assets are secure and\nimpact to the network is minimal.\n\n### Validate\n\nThe Asimily Platform has a Policy Simulation feature, where users can see the impact of policy\nimplementation prior to active deployment.\n\n### How Asimily Enables Smart Segmentation: Operationalizing Zero Trust Initiatives\n\nYour network isn\u2019t static. Your network segmentation tool shouldn\u2019t be either. Learn how Asimily was\nbuilt for the modern organization and why Asimily is the needed intelligence layer in your\nsegmentation project.\n\n[ Learn More ][71]\n\n### Why Nearly 80% of Segmentation Projects Fail to Operationalize\n\nMany organizations seek out segmentation as a first line of defense against cyberattacks. But when\nthose projects are never implemented (or implemented incorrectly), organizations lose the benefits\nsegmentation offers. Learn why segmentation is easier said than done, and what do about it.\n\n[ Discover Why ][72]\n\n#### Our Gartner Peer Insights Reviews\n\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 4976678] ][73]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 511214] ][74]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4925308] ][75]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959932] ][76]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959378] ][77]\n[Previous slide]\n[Next slide]\n* Platform\n* [Overview][78]\n* [Risk Mitigation][79]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][80]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][81]\n* [Threat and Response][82]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][83]\n* [IoT Patching][84]\n* [Configuration Control][85]\n* [Risk Modeling][86]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][87]\n* [Operational Efficiency][88]\n* [Integrations][89]\n* Industries\n* [Energy and Utilities][90]\n* [Financial Services][91]\n* [Government][92]\n* [Healthcare][93]\n* [Higher Education][94]\n* [Hospitality][95]\n* [Life Sciences][96]\n* [Manufacturing][97]\n* [Retail][98]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][99]\n* Solutions\n* column1\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][100]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][101]\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][102]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][103]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][104]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][105]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][106]\n* column2\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][107]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][108]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][109]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][110]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][111]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][112]\n* [Asimily for IT][113]\n* [IoT Security][114]\n* [OT Security][115]\n* [Medical Devices][116]\n* column3\n* [CMMC][117]\n* [Cyberscope][118]\n* [DORA][119]\n* [FDA][120]\n* [HIPAA][121]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][122]\n* [NERC CIP][123]\n* [NIS2][124]\n* [PCI-DSS][125]\n* [Zero Trust][126]\n* two columns\n* Resources\n* [All Resources][127]\n* [Blog][128]\n* [FAQ][129]\n* [Glossary][130]\n* About Us\n* [About Asimily][131