s/\n[72]: https://asimily.com/blog/why-nearly-80-of-segmentation-projects-fail-to-operationalize/\n[73]: https://gtnr.io/zbH4YrPMB\n[74]: https://gtnr.io/Q5IfCllF6\n[75]: https://gtnr.io/MwH8p7Hjf\n[76]: https://gtnr.io/HUFAfi6ha\n[77]: https://gtnr.io/B2BrW6Zto\n[78]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[79]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[80]: https://asimily.com/product/invent"
