            "text": "][1]\n* [Platform][2]\n* * * [Overview][3]\n* [Risk Mitigation][4]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][5]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][6]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][7]\n* [Threat and Response][8]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][9]\n* * * [Configuration Control][10]\n* [IoT Patching][11]\n* [Operational Efficiency][12]\n* [Risk Modeling][13]\n* [Integrations][14]\n* [Industries][15]\n* * * [Energy and Utilities][16]\n* [Financial Services][17]\n* [Government][18]\n* [Healthcare][19]\n* [Higher Education][20]\n* [Hospitality][21]\n* [Life Sciences][22]\n* [Manufacturing][23]\n* [Retail][24]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][25]\n* [Solutions][26]\n* * * #### Connected Device Visibility\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][27]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][28]\n* * #### Vulnerability Detection And Mitigation\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][29]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][30]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][31]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][32]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][33]\n* * #### IoMT\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][34]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][35]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][36]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][37]\n* * #### IT, IoT and OT\n* [OT Security][38]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][39]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][40]\n* [Asimily for IT][41]\n* * #### Compliance and Regulation\n* [CMMC][42]\n* [Cyberscope][43]\n* [DORA][44]\n* [FDA][45]\n* [HIPAA][46]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][47]\n* [NERC CIP][48]\n* [NIS2][49]\n* [NIST CSF 2.0][50]\n* [PCI-DSS][51]\n* [Zero Trust][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* * * [All Resources][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [FAQ][56]\n* [Press][57]\n* [Glossary][58]\n* [About Us][59]\n* * * [About Asimily][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Partners][62]\n* [Leadership][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n* [Request Demo][65]\n* [EN][66]\n* [DE][67]\n[ Request Demo ][68]\n* [Solutions][69]\n* Solutions \u2013 Risk Reduction Services\n\nCatalyze Risk Reduction\n\n# Customized Program + Technical Management\n\nCreate a best-in-class IoMT cybersecurity program rapidly built from a combination of innovative\ntechnology, expert guidance, field experience, and proactive collaboration.\n\n[ Request Consultation ][70]\n\nRisk Reduction through Innovative Technology & Customized Strategies\n\n### Asimily Risk Reduction Services Help You Scale Fast\n\n###### Accelerate Operationalization\n\nBlend product management, implementation experience, and data analytics to ensure seamless\nimplementation, from phased rollout to scaling ongoing initiatives, including customized dashboards\ntailored to your risk reduction needs.\n\n###### Build in-Product Collaboration\n\nSwiftly address risky devices\u2019 cybersecurity challenges by incorporating industry best practices for\ntechnology and process. Onsite HTM/CE/Biomed staff will be trained for product use, efficient\nprotection of IoMT, and better reporting for compliance and other needs.\n\n###### Proactively Remediate Risk\n\nUtilize infrastructure, cybersecurity, and clinical operational experience to deliver evidence-based\nrecommendations that facilitate risk reduction measures at the device and network levels.\n\nSecure Better, Faster\n\n## One-Stop Shop for Reducing Risk\n\nTap into over two decades of cybersecurity, biomedical engineering, clinical engineering, design &\ndevelopment, and analytics experience to facilitate IoMT risk reduction.\n\n### IoMT Program Design\n\nLeverage our expertise to design your IoMT cybersecurity transformation office \u2013 complete with a gap\nassessment, management action plan, executive & operational strategy, and more.\n\n### Enhance Training & Awareness\n\nLeverage tailor-made workshops and training to enhance skills, and knowledge to foster cohesive\nadoption across your organization.\n\n### Integrated Support & Coordination\n\nPrepare your team with vetted best practices and exercises that ensure cyber hygiene across the\nlifecycle of IoMT in your organization.\n\n#### Leading Healthcare CISOs Trust Asimily\u2019s Risk Reduction Services\n\nChief Information Security Officer (CISO)\n\nLarge Health System, East Coast USA\n\n\u201cAsimily Services has improved our outcomes without overwhelming our teams.\u201d\n\nIS Manager\n\nMedium-size Health System, Northeast USA\n\n\u201cWe knew we needed to improve but didnt know where to start! Asimily Services\u2019 personalized\nassessment helped prioritize improvements and work through our siloed processes.\u201d\n\nChief Information Security Officer (CISO)\n\nLarge health system, West Coast USA\n\n\u201cWe need these years of experience to guide us on what devices to fix and how to fix. We are\nimproving our mitigation strategies through people, process, and technology consolidation.\u201d\n\n[Previous slide]\n[Next slide]\n\n### Flawless Program Implementation is Crucial to IoMT Security\n\nA purpose-built IoMT platform can significantly increase visibility into connected devices and\nintegrate into an HDO\u2019s existing tech stack. However, effective and correct implementation is\ncrucial to making the most out of this investment.\n\n[ See Why ][71]\n[stock photo of a person wearing scrubs with a stethoscope pressing on an ipad with icons floating\nabove]\n\n### The Cost of Upgrading Connected IoMT Devices\n\nUpgrading or replacing vulnerable IoMT devices to avoid the operational disruption of a cyber attack\nmight be tempting, but can be a financially and operationally cumbersome endeavor. Learn how to\nfuture-proof your devices and secure the entire device lifecycle.\n\n[ Learn More ][72]\n[Stock photo of a patient in an MRI machine with a technician pressing buttons.]\n* Platform\n* [Overview][73]\n* [Risk Mitigation][74]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][75]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][76]\n* [Threat and Response][77]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][78]\n* [IoT Patching][79]\n* [Configuration Control][80]\n* [Risk Modeling][81]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][82]\n* [Operational Efficiency][83]\n* [Integrations][84]\n* Industries\n* [Energy and Utilities][85]\n* [Financial Services][86]\n* [Government][87]\n* [Healthcare][88]\n* [Higher Education][89]\n* [Hospitality][90]\n* [Life Sciences][91]\n* [Manufacturing][92]\n* [Retail][93]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][94]\n* Solutions\n* column1\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][95]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][96]\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][97]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][98]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][99]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][100]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][101]\n* column2\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][102]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][103]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][104]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][105]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][106]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][107]\n* [Asimily for IT][108]\n* [IoT Security][109]\n* [OT Security][110]\n* [Medical Devices][111]\n* column3\n* [CMMC][112]\n* [Cyberscope][113]\n* [DORA][114]\n* [FDA][115]\n* [HIPAA][116]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][117]\n* [NERC CIP][118]\n* [NIS2][119]\n* [PCI-DSS][120]\n* [Zero Trust][121]\n* two columns\n* Resources\n* [All Resources][122]\n* [Blog][123]\n* [FAQ][124]\n* [Glossary][125]\n* About Us\n* [About Asimily][126]\n* [Careers][127]\n* [Leadership][128]\n* [Partners][129]\n* [Contact Us][130]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Asimily All Rights Reserved.\n\n[ Privacy Policy ][131]\n[ Product Security ][132]\n\n[1]: https://asimily.com\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[4]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[5]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[6]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[7]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[8]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[9]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-complianc