://asimily.com/compliance-dora/\n[45]: https://asimily.com/compliance-fda/\n[46]: https://asimily.com/compliance-hipaa/\n[47]: https://asimily.com/compliance-mitre-attack-framework/\n[48]: https://asimily.com/compliance-nerc-cip/\n[49]: https://asimily.com/compliance-nis2-directive/\n[50]: https://asimily.com/compliance-nist-csf/\n[51]: https://asimily.com/compliance-pci-dss/\n[52]: https://asimily.com/compliance-zero-trust-security-framework/\n[53]: #\n[54]: https://asimily.com/resources/\n[55]: https://asimily.com/blog/\n[56]: https://asimily.com/resources/faq/\n[57]: https://asimily.com/press/\n[58]: https://asimily.com/resources/glossary/\n[59]: #\n[60]: https://asimily.com/about-us/\n[61]: https://asimily.com/about-us/careers/\n[62]: https://asimily.com/about-us/partners/\n[63]: https://asimily.com/about-us/leadership/\n[64]: https://asimily.com/contact-us/\n[65]: https://asimily.com/request-a-demo/\n[66]: #weglot_switcher\n[67]: https://asimily.com/de/solutions/risk-reduction-services/\n[68]: https://asimily.com/request-a-demo/?utm_source=header&utm_medium=requestdemoCTA\n[69]: https://asimily.com/solutions/\n[70]: https://asimily.com/request-a-demo/\n[71]: https://asimily.com/blog/flawless-program-implementation-is-crucial-to-iomt-security/\n[72]: https://asimily.com/blog/the-cost-of-upgrading-connected-iomt-devices/\n[73]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[74]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[75]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[76]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[77]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[78]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[79]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[80]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[81]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-modeling/\n[82]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[83]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[84]: https://asimily.com/product/integrations/\n[85]: https://asimily.com/industries/energy-utilities/\n[86]: https://asimily.com/industries/financial-services/\n[87]: https://asimily.com/industries/government/\n[88]: https://asimily.com/industries/healthcare/\n[89]: https://asimily.com/industries/higher-education/\n[90]: https://asimily.com/industries/hospitality-iot-security/\n[91]: https://asimily.com/industries/life-sciences/\n[92]: https://asimily.com"
