            "url": "https://asimily.com/solutions/it-capabilities/",
            "text": "][1]\n* [Platform][2]\n* * * [Overview][3]\n* [Risk Mitigation][4]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][5]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][6]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][7]\n* [Threat and Response][8]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][9]\n* * * [Configuration Control][10]\n* [IoT Patching][11]\n* [Operational Efficiency][12]\n* [Risk Modeling][13]\n* [Integrations][14]\n* [Industries][15]\n* * * [Energy and Utilities][16]\n* [Financial Services][17]\n* [Government][18]\n* [Healthcare][19]\n* [Higher Education][20]\n* [Hospitality][21]\n* [Life Sciences][22]\n* [Manufacturing][23]\n* [Retail][24]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][25]\n* [Solutions][26]\n* * * #### Connected Device Visibility\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][27]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][28]\n* * #### Vulnerability Detection And Mitigation\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][29]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][30]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][31]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][32]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][33]\n* * #### IoMT\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][34]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][35]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][36]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][37]\n* * #### IT, IoT and OT\n* [OT Security][38]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][39]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][40]\n* [Asimily for IT][41]\n* * #### Compliance and Regulation\n* [CMMC][42]\n* [Cyberscope][43]\n* [DORA][44]\n* [FDA][45]\n* [HIPAA][46]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][47]\n* [NERC CIP][48]\n* [NIS2][49]\n* [NIST CSF 2.0][50]\n* [PCI-DSS][51]\n* [Zero Trust][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* * * [All Resources][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [FAQ][56]\n* [Press][57]\n* [Glossary][58]\n* [About Us][59]\n* * * [About Asimily][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Partners][62]\n* [Leadership][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n* [Request Demo][65]\n* [EN][66]\n* [DE][67]\n[ Request Demo ][68]\n\nUnified Cybersecurity for Every Asset\n\n# Secure Both Device and IT Environments with One Platform\n\n**Normalize and secure data across all solutions with a single source of truth for all IT devices\nand connected devices****.**\n\n[ Request a demo ][69]\n\nExtended Coverage Without Complexity\n\n## How Asimily Supports IT Security Within Its Broader Platform\n\n### Efficient Risk Mitigation\n\nAsimily uses multiple techniques to detect and stop attacks against IT and connected devices. We\nprovide guidance on the best network change or configuration change to stop vulnerabilities from\nbecoming exploits.\n\n### Seamless Inventory and Visibility\n\nAsimily detects, inventories, and classifies what\u2019s on your entire network normalized to a single\nsource of truth across IoT, OT, IoMT, and IT devices.\n\n### Behavior-Based Threat Detection\n\nAsimily threat detection is both behavior and signature-based. Whether the potentially compromised\nasset is a device or standard IT, Asimily\u2019s detection and other capabilities (such as packet\ncapture) help detect threats\n\n## Core IT Security, Built Into the Platform\n\nAsimily supports asset inventory, helps avoid shadow IT, pass IT compliance audits, provide basic\nvulnerability detection and vulnerability prioritization, aid incident responders and mitigate\nrisks.\n\n## Get Built-In Basic IT Protection with Asimily\n\nFrom inventory and detection to incident response and compliance, Asimily equips you with the core\nprotections needed for mixed environments\u2014so you can secure more with less effort.\n\n[ Request a demo ][70]\n* Platform\n* [Overview][71]\n* [Risk Mitigation][72]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][73]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][74]\n* [Threat and Response][75]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][76]\n* [IoT Patching][77]\n* [Configuration Control][78]\n* [Risk Modeling][79]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][80]\n* [Operational Efficiency][81]\n* [Integrations][82]\n* Industries\n* [Energy and Utilities][83]\n* [Financial Services][84]\n* [Government][85]\n* [Healthcare][86]\n* [Higher Education][87]\n* [Hospitality][88]\n* [Life Sciences][89]\n* [Manufacturing][90]\n* [Retail][91]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][92]\n* Solutions\n* column1\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][93]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][94]\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][95]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][96]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][97]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][98]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][99]\n* column2\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][100]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][101]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][102]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][103]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][104]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][105]\n* [Asimily for IT][106]\n* [IoT Security][107]\n* [OT Security][108]\n* [Medical Devices][109]\n* column3\n* [CMMC][110]\n* [Cyberscope][111]\n* [DORA][112]\n* [FDA][113]\n* [HIPAA][114]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][115]\n* [NERC CIP][116]\n* [NIS2][117]\n* [PCI-DSS][118]\n* [Zero Trust][119]\n* two columns\n* Resources\n* [All Resources][120]\n* [Blog][121]\n* [FAQ][122]\n* [Glossary][123]\n* About Us\n* [About Asimily][124]\n* [Careers][125]\n* [Leadership][126]\n* [Partners][127]\n* [Contact Us][128]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Asimily All Rights Reserved.\n\n[ Privacy Policy ][129]\n[ Product Security ][130]\n\n[1]: https://asimily.com\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[4]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[5]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[6]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[7]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[8]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[9]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[10]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[11]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[12]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[13]: https://asimi