            "url": "https://asimily.com/about-us/",
            "text": "][1]\n* [Platform][2]\n* * * [Overview][3]\n* [Risk Mitigation][4]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][5]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][6]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][7]\n* [Threat and Response][8]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][9]\n* * * [Configuration Control][10]\n* [IoT Patching][11]\n* [Operational Efficiency][12]\n* [Risk Modeling][13]\n* [Integrations][14]\n* [Industries][15]\n* * * [Energy and Utilities][16]\n* [Financial Services][17]\n* [Government][18]\n* [Healthcare][19]\n* [Higher Education][20]\n* [Hospitality][21]\n* [Life Sciences][22]\n* [Manufacturing][23]\n* [Retail][24]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][25]\n* [Solutions][26]\n* * * #### Connected Device Visibility\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][27]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][28]\n* * #### Vulnerability Detection And Mitigation\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][29]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][30]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][31]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][32]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][33]\n* * #### IoMT\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][34]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][35]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][36]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][37]\n* * #### IT, IoT and OT\n* [OT Security][38]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][39]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][40]\n* [Asimily for IT][41]\n* * #### Compliance and Regulation\n* [CMMC][42]\n* [Cyberscope][43]\n* [DORA][44]\n* [FDA][45]\n* [HIPAA][46]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][47]\n* [NERC CIP][48]\n* [NIS2][49]\n* [NIST CSF 2.0][50]\n* [PCI-DSS][51]\n* [Zero Trust][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* * * [All Resources][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [FAQ][56]\n* [Press][57]\n* [Glossary][58]\n* [About Us][59]\n* * * [About Asimily][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Partners][62]\n* [Leadership][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n* [Request Demo][65]\n* [EN][66]\n* [DE][67]\n[ Request Demo ][68]\n\n# Gain Confidence in All of Your Security\n\nEvery connected device is a new door for attackers. Unlike traditional IT \u2013 IoT, OT, and IoMT need\nprotection built for fragile, mission-critical systems.\n\nWATCH VIDEO\n\n## At Asimily, we believe that\n\nYou can\u2019t close every vulnerability, but you can reduce real business risk across IT, IoT, IoMT, and\n\nActionable insight requires more than data \u2014 it takes customer context and technology working\ntogether\n\nOrganizations need multiple tactics and workflows depending on the device and context to reduce risk\nquickly, not just one technique\n\nAsimily offers the best platform for managing a device\u2019s entire security lifecycle \u2013 from\npre-purchase through decommission \u2013 at a fair price\n\nFor 9 years we\u2019ve been working to protect the devices that are increasingly dominating what used to\nbe a computer-centric Internet. When we saw this problem emerging, we knew that \u201cstandard\u201d responses\nfrom the cybersecurity industry weren\u2019t going to be successful. We resolved to not repeat the sins\nof the past and do what we thought would truly solve the OT, IoT, and IoMT security issues for\nbeleaguered defenders around the world.\n\nSHANKAR SOMASUNDARAM\nFounder & CEO\n\n### Our Story\n\nAfter starting and leading the IoT security business at Symantec, growing it to over a billion IoT\ndevices secured, Shankar Somasundaram observed that healthcare organizations were being targeted by\nIoT solutions designed for a generalist IT audience that didn\u2019t cater to the constraints of medical\ndevices or the needs of the clinical environment. He founded Asimily to service the unique IoT\nsecurity needs of the healthcare market and launched the product with Hithesh Nama, who joined as\nCo-founder of Asimily. After launch and initial trials, Asimily landed some of the most prominent\nnames in healthcare as customers and design partners.\n\n### Asimily Today\n\nSince then we have grown, working with thousands of healthcare sites, and are trusted by some of the\nlargest and most prestigious healthcare organizations globally. Our team brings deep\ninterdisciplinary expertise in healthcare, cyber-security, networking, and analytics, and we are\nbacked by top leaders in the security and healthcare industries, such as the ex-CEO of Symantec and\nCISOs from leading organizations. Our pioneering approach and loyal customer base have earned us\nrecent awards from Gartner, Business Intelligence, and others.\n\nJoin our team\n\n### Career Opportunities\n\nIf you\u2019re passionate about technology, customer-obsessed and growth-driven, we want you! Be a part\nof a high-growth team committed to driving cutting-edge cybersecurity innovation and building a more\nsecure future or environment. Asimily is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to fostering\na diverse and inclusive work environment for all.\n\n[ View Opportunities ][69]\n* Platform\n* [Overview][70]\n* [Risk Mitigation][71]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][72]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][73]\n* [Threat and Response][74]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][75]\n* [IoT Patching][76]\n* [Configuration Control][77]\n* [Risk Modeling][78]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][79]\n* [Operational Efficiency][80]\n* [Integrations][81]\n* Industries\n* [Energy and Utilities][82]\n* [Financial Services][83]\n* [Government][84]\n* [Healthcare][85]\n* [Higher Education][86]\n* [Hospitality][87]\n* [Life Sciences][88]\n* [Manufacturing][89]\n* [Retail][90]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][91]\n* Solutions\n* column1\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][92]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][93]\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][94]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][95]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][96]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][97]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][98]\n* column2\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][99]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][100]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][101]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][102]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][103]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][104]\n* [Asimily for IT][105]\n* [IoT Security][106]\n* [OT Security][107]\n* [Medical Devices][108]\n* column3\n* [CMMC][109]\n* [Cyberscope][110]\n* [DORA][111]\n* [FDA][112]\n* [HIPAA][113]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][114]\n* [NERC CIP][115]\n* [NIS2][116]\n* [PCI-DSS][117]\n* [Zero Trust][118]\n* two columns\n* Resources\n* [All Resources][119]\n* [Blog][120]\n* [FAQ][121]\n* [Glossary][122]\n* About Us\n* [About Asimily][123]\n* [Careers][124]\n* [Leadership][125]\n* [Partners][126]\n* [Contact Us][127]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Asimily All Rights Reserved.\n\n[ Privacy Policy ][128]\n[ Product Security ][129]\n\n[1]: https://asimily.com\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[4]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[5]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[6]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[7]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[8]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[9]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[10]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[11]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[12]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[13]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-modeling/\n[14]: https://asimily.com/product/integrations/\n[15]: #\n[16]: https://asimily.com/industries/energy-utilities/\n[17]: https://asimily.com/industries/financial-services/\n[18]: https://asimily.com/industries/government/\n[19]: https://asimily.com/industries/healthcare/\n[20]: https://asimily.com/industries/higher-education/\n[21]: https://asimily.com/industries/hospitality-iot-security/\n[22]: https://asimily.com/industries/life-sciences/\n[23]: https://asimily.com/industries/manufacturing/\n[24]: https://asimily.com/industries/retail/\n[25]: https://asimily.com/industries/transportation/\n[26]: #\n[27]: https:/