]: https://asimily.com/contact-us/\n[65]: https://asimily.com/request-a-demo/\n[66]: #weglot_switcher\n[67]: https://asimily.com/de/about-us/\n[68]: https://asimily.com/request-a-demo/?utm_source=header&utm_medium=requestdemoCTA\n[69]: https://asimily.com/about-us/careers/\n[70]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[71]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[72]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[73]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[74]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[75]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[76]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[77]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[78]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-modeling/\n[79]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[80]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[81]: https://asimily.com/product/integrations/\n[82]: https://asimily.com/industries/energy-utilities/\n[83]: https://asimily.com/industries/financial-services/\n[84]: https://asimily.com/industries/government/\n[85]: https://asimily.com/industries/healthcare/\n[86]: https://asimily.com/industries/higher-education/\n[87]: https://asimily.com/industries/hospitality-iot-security/\n[88]: https://asimily.com/industries/life-sciences/\n[89]: https://asimily.com/industries/manufacturing/\n[90]: https://asimily.com/industries/retail/\n[91]: https://asimily.com/industries/transportation/\n[92]: https://asimily.com/solutions/automated-iot-visibility-deep-categorization/\n[93]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-detail-enrichment/\n[94]: https://asimily.com/solutions/continuous-iot-vulnerability-detection/\n[95]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-based-iot-vulnerability-prioritization/\n[96]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-prioritization-by-risk/\n[97]: https://asimily.com/solutions/efficient-security-risk-mitigation-workflows/\n[98]: https://asimily.com/solutions/network-segmentation-an