            "text": "][1]\n* [Platform][2]\n* * * [Overview][3]\n* [Risk Mitigation][4]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][5]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][6]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][7]\n* [Threat and Response][8]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][9]\n* * * [Configuration Control][10]\n* [IoT Patching][11]\n* [Operational Efficiency][12]\n* [Risk Modeling][13]\n* [Integrations][14]\n* [Industries][15]\n* * * [Energy and Utilities][16]\n* [Financial Services][17]\n* [Government][18]\n* [Healthcare][19]\n* [Higher Education][20]\n* [Hospitality][21]\n* [Life Sciences][22]\n* [Manufacturing][23]\n* [Retail][24]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][25]\n* [Solutions][26]\n* * * #### Connected Device Visibility\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][27]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][28]\n* * #### Vulnerability Detection And Mitigation\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][29]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][30]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][31]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][32]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][33]\n* * #### IoMT\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][34]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][35]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][36]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][37]\n* * #### IT, IoT and OT\n* [OT Security][38]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][39]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][40]\n* [Asimily for IT][41]\n* * #### Compliance and Regulation\n* [CMMC][42]\n* [Cyberscope][43]\n* [DORA][44]\n* [FDA][45]\n* [HIPAA][46]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][47]\n* [NERC CIP][48]\n* [NIS2][49]\n* [NIST CSF 2.0][50]\n* [PCI-DSS][51]\n* [Zero Trust][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* * * [All Resources][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [FAQ][56]\n* [Press][57]\n* [Glossary][58]\n* [About Us][59]\n* * * [About Asimily][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Partners][62]\n* [Leadership][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n* [Request Demo][65]\n* [EN][66]\n* [DE][67]\n[ Request Demo ][68]\n\n# Grow with Asimily!\n\nBe a part of a high-growth team committed to driving cutting-edge cybersecurity innovation.\n\nIf you\u2019re passionate about technology, customer-obsessed and growth-driven, **we want you**!\n\n[ Current Job Openings ][69]\n\nValues\n\n### Our mission is to secure connected devices for a safer world.\n\nAsimily is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive work\nenvironment for all.\n\n###### Our Core Values\n\nTransparency, ownership, trust, humility. A diverse, lively, innovative workplace. People-first\nmindset, stellar experience. Customer-obsessed dream team!\n\n###### Transparency\n\nWe will be open, honest, and straightforward about our business operations with our customers,\nemployees, partners, investors, and vendors.\n\n###### Customer First\n\nThe impact we make for our customers drives us. With the customer in mind, we make customer-centric\ndecisions, build products, and proactively deliver the right support.\n\n###### Respect\n\nWe believe that every situation is a learning opportunity. We will listen actively, pay attention to\nthe details and be respectful of everyone.\n\n###### Ownership\n\nWe are self-driven and take ownership and initiatives proactively, toward our goals. We work as a\nteam and are respectful to all.\n\n###### Innovation\n\nWe are not just problem solvers but problem spotters. We are not afraid to challenge the status quo\nand are here to make an impact.\n\nAwards and Accolades\n\n### Our Hard Work Shows\n\nAsimily is ranked No. 170 Inc. 5000 list of the fastest-growing private companies in America and is\nhonored recently to receive the following innovation awards:\n\n[ ][70]\n[ [Asimily Named Winner of IoT Evolution\u2019s IIoT Product of the Year] ][71]\n[ [Deloitte's 2023 Technology Fast 500] ][72]\n[ [Forbes Americas Best Startup Employers 2024 Badge] ][73]\n[ [Asimily Wins Global Infosec\u2019s Most Innovative Healthcare IoT Solution] ][74]\n[ ][75]\n[ ][76]\n[ [The Cybersecurity Excellence 2024 Awards has honored Asimily as the winner of three categories:\nHealthcare Security, Manufacturing Security, and IoT Security.] ][77]\n[ ][78]\n[ ][79]\n\n### Join Our Team!\n\nDepartment:\n\nAll Departments Software Development Customer Success\n\nLocation:\n\nWorld Wide Australia India Remote US West\n\n##### Software Development\n\nOpen positions in our software team.\n\nSr. Software Engineer \u2013 UI Development\n\nIndia\n\nWe\u2019re looking for an experienced senior software engineer focused on UI to join our team.\nFull Time\n][80] [\n\nSenior Software Engineer\n\nIndia\n\nWe\u2019re looking for a full-stack software engineer to join our team.\nFull Time\n][81]\n\n##### Customer Success\n\nOpen positions in our CX team.\n\nTechnical Customer Success Manager \u2013 US West\n\nRemote\n\nWe\u2019re looking for an US West based technical customer success manager to join our team.\nFull Time\n][82] [\n\nCustomer Success Manager \u2013 APJ\n\nAustralia\n\nWe\u2019re looking for an Australian-based customer success manager to join our team.\nFull Time\n][83]\n\nNo job openings have been found with the selected search criteria. Please refine your search.\n* Platform\n* [Overview][84]\n* [Risk Mitigation][85]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][86]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][87]\n* [Threat and Response][88]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][89]\n* [IoT Patching][90]\n* [Configuration Control][91]\n* [Risk Modeling][92]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][93]\n* [Operational Efficiency][94]\n* [Integrations][95]\n* Industries\n* [Energy and Utilities][96]\n* [Financial Services][97]\n* [Government][98]\n* [Healthcare][99]\n* [Higher Education][100]\n* [Hospitality][101]\n* [Life Sciences][102]\n* [Manufacturing][103]\n* [Retail][104]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][105]\n* Solutions\n* column1\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][106]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][107]\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][108]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Priorit