            "text": "][1]\n* [Platform][2]\n* * * [Overview][3]\n* [Risk Mitigation][4]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][5]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][6]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][7]\n* [Threat and Response][8]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][9]\n* * * [Configuration Control][10]\n* [IoT Patching][11]\n* [Operational Efficiency][12]\n* [Risk Modeling][13]\n* [Integrations][14]\n* [Industries][15]\n* * * [Energy and Utilities][16]\n* [Financial Services][17]\n* [Government][18]\n* [Healthcare][19]\n* [Higher Education][20]\n* [Hospitality][21]\n* [Life Sciences][22]\n* [Manufacturing][23]\n* [Retail][24]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][25]\n* [Solutions][26]\n* * * #### Connected Device Visibility\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][27]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][28]\n* * #### Vulnerability Detection And Mitigation\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][29]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][30]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][31]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][32]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][33]\n* * #### IoMT\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][34]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][35]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][36]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][37]\n* * #### IT, IoT and OT\n* [OT Security][38]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][39]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][40]\n* [Asimily for IT][41]\n* * #### Compliance and Regulation\n* [CMMC][42]\n* [Cyberscope][43]\n* [DORA][44]\n* [FDA][45]\n* [HIPAA][46]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][47]\n* [NERC CIP][48]\n* [NIS2][49]\n* [NIST CSF 2.0][50]\n* [PCI-DSS][51]\n* [Zero Trust][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* * * [All Resources][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [FAQ][56]\n* [Press][57]\n* [Glossary][58]\n* [About Us][59]\n* * * [About Asimily][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Partners][62]\n* [Leadership][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n* [Request Demo][65]\n* [EN][66]\n* [DE][67]\n[ Request Demo ][68]\n\n# Meet Our Leadership Team\n\nOur forward-looking leadership team is made up of dedicated, focused and experienced executives.\nWorking with each other and with our employees worldwide, their expertise in Healthcare Technology\nManagement, Cybersecurity, Networking, and Analytics come together to make a difference for all our\nstakeholders \u2013 patients, healthcare providers, enterprise organizations, employees, investors and\ncommunities around the globe.\n\n[ About Us ][69]\n\nShankar Somasundaram\n\nFounder & CEO\n\nConsti Fernandes\n\nSVP, Engineering\n\n[Hithesh Nama]\n\nHithesh Nama\n\nChief Architect\n\nKenan Frager\n\nVP, Marketing\n\nPriyanka Upendra\n\nVP, Services\n\nBob Bayliss\n\nHead of Customer Success\n\nJoin our team\n\n### Career Opportunities\n\nIf you\u2019re passionate about technology, customer-obsessed and growth-driven, we want you! Be a part\nof a high-growth team committed to driving cutting-edge cybersecurity innovation and building a more\nsecure future or environment. Asimily is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to fostering\na diverse and inclusive work environment for all.\n\n[ View Opportunities ][70]\n* Platform\n* [Overview][71]\n* [Risk Mitigation][72]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][73]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][74]\n* [Threat and Response][75]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][76]\n* [IoT Patching][77]\n* [Configuration Control][78]\n* [Risk Modeling][79]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][80]\n* [Operational Efficiency][81]\n* [Integrations][82]\n* Industries\n* [Energy and Utilities][83]\n* [Financial Services][84]\n* [Government][85]\n* [Healthcare][86]\n* [Higher Education][87]\n* [Hospitality][88]\n* [Life Sciences][89]\n* [Manufacturing][90]\n* [Retail][91]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][92]\n* Solutions\n* column1\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][93]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][94]\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][95]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][96]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][97]\n*