            "text": "][1]\n* [Platform][2]\n* * * [Overview][3]\n* [Risk Mitigation][4]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][5]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][6]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][7]\n* [Threat and Response][8]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][9]\n* * * [Configuration Control][10]\n* [IoT Patching][11]\n* [Operational Efficiency][12]\n* [Risk Modeling][13]\n* [Integrations][14]\n* [Industries][15]\n* * * [Energy and Utilities][16]\n* [Financial Services][17]\n* [Government][18]\n* [Healthcare][19]\n* [Higher Education][20]\n* [Hospitality][21]\n* [Life Sciences][22]\n* [Manufacturing][23]\n* [Retail][24]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][25]\n* [Solutions][26]\n* * * #### Connected Device Visibility\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][27]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][28]\n* * #### Vulnerability Detection And Mitigation\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][29]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][30]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][31]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][32]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][33]\n* * #### IoMT\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][34]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][35]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][36]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][37]\n* * #### IT, IoT and OT\n* [OT Security][38]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][39]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][40]\n* [Asimily for IT][41]\n* * #### Compliance and Regulation\n* [CMMC][42]\n* [Cyberscope][43]\n* [DORA][44]\n* [FDA][45]\n* [HIPAA][46]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][47]\n* [NERC CIP][48]\n* [NIS2][49]\n* [NIST CSF 2.0][50]\n* [PCI-DSS][51]\n* [Zero Trust][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* * * [All Resources][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [FAQ][56]\n* [Press][57]\n* [Glossary][58]\n* [About Us][59]\n* * * [About Asimily][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Partners][62]\n* [Leadership][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n* [Request Demo][65]\n* [EN][66]\n* [DE][67]\n[ Request Demo ][68]\n\n# Contact Us\n\nGlobal Corporate Email | info@asimily.com\nPhone | 1-833-274-6459\nUS Location | 440 N Wolfe Road, Sunnyvale, CA 94085, USA\nMiddle East Email | mea@asimily.com\nEurope Email | europe@asimily.com\nSupport | support@asimily.com\n\nIf you believe you\u2019ve discovered a potential vulnerability, please let us know by emailing us at\nsecurity@asimily.com\n\n###### Speak With Asimily\n\nName(Required)\nFirst Last\nCompany Name(Required)\nJob Title(Required)\nPhone Number(Required)\nEmail(Required)\nMessage(Required)\nEmail\nThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.\n\n## Why Asimily?\n\n### Security for Your Cyber Assets\n\nKeep the devices you depend on up and operational. Do it all through a single dashboard, with\nactionable information ready for anyone who needs to know.\n\n[ Learn More ][69]\n\n### Better Defend Your Organization\n\nTo threat actors, all connected devices are simply attack vectors. Asimily helps end the IoT and\nIoMT security deficit by defending all devices in the organization.\n\n[ Learn More ][70]\n\n### Reduce Operating Costs\n\nExpand your security without expanding staff. With the largest knowledgebase of devices and\nprotocols, vulnerability research and manufacturer documents, tackle the growing IoT cybersecurity\nchallenge while minimizing the staff and budget required to do it manually.\n\n[ Learn More ][71]\n\n### Ensure Compliance with Standards\n\nAchieve regulatory compliance with industry best practices for risk reduction for devices.\n\n[ Learn More ][72]\n[ Schedule Demo ][73]\n\n### Reduce Device Vulnerabilities 10x Faster\n\nMitigate vulnerabilities efficiently with pinpoint fixes that remove the biggest risk. Asimily\nanalyses of exploitability yields quick fixes, not big projects..\n\n[ Learn More ][74]\n\n### Fast Forensics For Any Incident, Anywhere\n\nGet easy, centralized packet capture when incidents occur. Set device behavior rules to spot\nconcerning anomalies.\n\n[ Learn More ][75]\n\n### Act Confidently for Every Device\u2019s Lifecycle\n\nModel device risk pre-install, not while on the network. See the risk reduction of your work, before\nyou get to work.\n\n[ Learn More ][76]\n\n### Secure Every IoT Device.\n### Automatically.\n\nCyber threats move fast \u2014 so should you. Asimily gives instant inventory and smart, prioritized risk\nmitigation insights for every IoT, OT, and IoMT device \u2014 so you can take action before threats\nstrike.\n\n[ Schedule a Demo ][77]\n* Platform\n* [Overview][78]\n* [Risk Mitigation][79]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][80]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][81]\n* [Threat and Response][82]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][83]\n* [IoT Patching][84]\n* [Configuration Control][85]\n* [Risk Modeling][86]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][87]\n* [Operational Efficiency][88]\n* [Integrations][89]\n* Industries\n* [Energy and Utilities][90]\n* [Financial Services][91]\n* [Government][92]\n* [Healthcare][93]\n* [Higher Education][94]\n* [Hospitality][95]\n* [Life Sciences][96]\n* [Manufacturing][97]\n* [Retail][98]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][99]\n* Solutions\n* column1\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][100]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][101]\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][102]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][103]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][104]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][105]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][106]\n* column2\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][107]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][108]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][109]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][110]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][111]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][112]\n* [Asimily for IT][113]\n* [IoT Security][114]\n* [OT Security][115]\n* [Medical Devices][116]\n* column3\n* [CMMC][117]\n* [Cyberscope][118]\n* [DORA][119]\n* [FDA][120]\n* [HIPAA][121]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][122]\n* [NERC CIP][123]\n* [NIS2][124]\n* [PCI-DSS][125]\n* [Zero Trust][126]\n* two columns\n* Resources\n* [All Resources][127]\n* [Blog][128]\n* [FAQ][129]\n* [Glossary][130]\n* About Us\n* [About Asimily][131]\n* [Careers][132]\n* [Leadership][133]\n* [Partners][134]\n* [Contact Us][135]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Asimily All Rights Reserved.\n\n[ Privacy Policy ][136]\n[ Product Security ][137]\n\n[1]: https://asimily.com\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[4]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[5]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[6]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[7]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[8]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[9]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[10]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[11]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[12]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[13]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-modeling/\n[14]: https://asimily.com/product/integrations/\n[15]: #\n[16]: https://asimily.com/industries/energy-utilities/\n[17]: https://asimily.com/industries/financial-services/\n[18]: https://asimily.com/industries/government/\n[19]: https://asimily.com/industries/healthcare/\n[20]: https://asimily.com/industries/higher-education/\n[21]: https://asimily.com/industries/hospitality-iot-security/\n[22]: https://asimily.com/industries/life-sciences/\n[23]: https://asimily.com/industries/manufacturing/\n[24]: https://asimily.com/industries/retail/\n[25]: https://asimily.com/industries/transportation/\n[26]: #\n[27]: https://asimily.com/solutions/automated-iot-visibility-deep-categorization/\n[28]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-detail-enrichment/\n[29]: https://asimily.com/solutions/continuous-iot-vulnerability-detection/\n[30]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-based-iot-vulnerability-prioritization/\n[31]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-prioritization-by-risk/\n[32]: https://asimily.com/solutions/efficient-security-risk-mitigation-workflows/\n[33]: https://asimily.com/solutions/network-segmentation-and-microsegmentation/\n[34]: https://asimily.com/solutions/fda-recalls-and-security-advisories/\n[35]: https://asimily.com/solutions/medical-device-utilization/\n[36]: https://asimily.com/solutions/pre-purchase-security-risk-avoidance/\n[37]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-reduction-services/\n[38]: https://asimily.com/solutions/ot-security/\n[39]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-risk-simulator/\n[40]: https://asimily.com/solutions/incident-response-readiness-with-packet-capture/\n[41]: https://asimily.com/solutions/it-capabilities/\n[42]: https://asimily.com/compliance-cmmc/\n[43]: https://asimily.com/compliance-cyberscope/\n[44]: https://asimily.com/compliance-dora/\n[45]: https://asimily.com/compliance-fda/\n[46]: https://asimily.com/compliance-hipaa/\n[47]: https://asimily.com/compliance-mitre-attack-framework/\n[48]: https://asimily.com/compliance-nerc-cip/\n[49]: https://asimily.com/compliance-nis2-directive/\n[50]: https://asimily.com/compliance-nist-csf/\n[51]: https://asimily.com/compliance-pci-dss/\n[52]: https://asimily.com/compliance-zero-trust-security-framework/\n[53]: #\n[54]: https://asimily.com/resources/\n[55]: https://asimily.com/blog/\n[56]: https://asimily.com/resources/faq/\n[57]: https://asimily.com/press/\n[58]: https://asimily.com/resources/glossary/\n[59]: #\n[60]: https://asimily.com/about-us/\n[61]: https://asimily.com/about-us/careers/\n[62]: https://asimily.com/about-us/partners/\n[63]: https://asimily.com/about-us/leadership/\n[64]: https://asimily.com/contact-us/\n[65]: https://asimily.com/request-a-demo/\n[66]: #weglot_switcher\n[67]: https://asimily.com/de/contact-us/\n[68]: https://asimily.com/request-a-demo/?utm_source=header&utm_medium=requestdemoCTA\n[69]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[70]: https://asimily.com/product/\n[71]: https://asimily.com/product/\n[72]: https://asimily.com/product/\n[73]: /request-a-demo/\n[74]: /product/vulnerability-mitigation/\n[75]: /product/threat-detection-and-incident-response/\n[76]: /product/risk-modeling/\n[77]: https://asimily.com/request-a-demo/\n[78]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[79]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[80]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[81]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[82]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[83]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[84]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[85]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[86]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-modeling/\n[87]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[88]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[89]: https://asimily.com/product/integrations/\n[90]: https://asimily.com/industries/energy-utilities/\n[91]: https://asimily.com/industries/financial-services/\n[92]: https://asimily.com/industries/government/\n[93]: https://asimily.com/industries/healthcare/\n[94]: https://asimily.com/industries/higher-education/\n[95]: https://asimily.com/industries/hospitality-iot-security/\n[96]: https://asimily.com/industries/life-sciences/\n[97]: https://asimily.com/industries/manufacturing/\n[98]: https://asimily.com/industries/retail/\n[99]: https://asimily.com/industries/transportation/\n[100]: https://asimily.com/solutions/automated-iot-visibility-deep-categorization/\n[101]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-detail-enrichment/\n[102]: https://asimily.com/solutions/continuous-iot-vulnerability-detection/\n[103]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-based-iot-vulnerability-prioritization/\n[104]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-device-prioritization-by-risk/\n[105]: https://asimily.com/solutions/efficient-security-risk-mitigation-workflows/\n[106]: https://asimily.com/solutions/network-segmentation-and-microsegmentation/\n[107]: https://asimily.com/solutions/fda-recalls-and-security-advisories/\n[108]: https://asimily.com/solutions/medical-device-utilization/\n[109]: https://asimily.com/solutions/pre-purchase-security-risk-avoidance/\n[110]: https://asimily.com/solutions/risk-reduction-services/\n[111]: https://asimily.com/solutions/iot-risk-simulator/\n[112]: https://asimily.com/solutions/incident-response-readiness-with-packet-capture/\n[113]: https://asimily.com/solutions/it-capabilities/\n[114]: https://asimily."
