            "text": "][1]\n* [Platform][2]\n* * * [Overview][3]\n* [Risk Mitigation][4]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][5]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][6]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][7]\n* [Threat and Response][8]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][9]\n* * * [Configuration Control][10]\n* [IoT Patching][11]\n* [Operational Efficiency][12]\n* [Risk Modeling][13]\n* [Integrations][14]\n* [Industries][15]\n* * * [Energy and Utilities][16]\n* [Financial Services][17]\n* [Government][18]\n* [Healthcare][19]\n* [Higher Education][20]\n* [Hospitality][21]\n* [Life Sciences][22]\n* [Manufacturing][23]\n* [Retail][24]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][25]\n* [Solutions][26]\n* * * #### Connected Device Visibility\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][27]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][28]\n* * #### Vulnerability Detection And Mitigation\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][29]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][30]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][31]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][32]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][33]\n* * #### IoMT\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][34]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][35]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][36]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][37]\n* * #### IT, IoT and OT\n* [OT Security][38]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][39]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][40]\n* [Asimily for IT][41]\n* * #### Compliance and Regulation\n* [CMMC][42]\n* [Cyberscope][43]\n* [DORA][44]\n* [FDA][45]\n* [HIPAA][46]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][47]\n* [NERC CIP][48]\n* [NIS2][49]\n* [NIST CSF 2.0][50]\n* [PCI-DSS][51]\n* [Zero Trust][52]\n* [Resources][53]\n* * * [All Resources][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [FAQ][56]\n* [Press][57]\n* [Glossary][58]\n* [About Us][59]\n* * * [About Asimily][60]\n* [Careers][61]\n* [Partners][62]\n* [Leadership][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n* [Request Demo][65]\n* [EN][66]\n* [DE][67]\n[ Request Demo ][68]\n* [Product][69]\n* Threat and Response\n\n# Stop Attacks in their Tracks\n\nYour Platform to Detect, Alert and Respond to Threats\n\nThreat and Response\n\n#### Identify and Respond to Threats in Real Time\n\nKeep devices up and running safely. Constantly monitor for anomalous IoT, OT, and IoMT behavior.\nLaunch appropriate protective actions from alerts to quarantining.\n\n[ Get in Touch ][70]\n\nMake Exploits Difficult for Adversaries\n\n## Protection Against Active Attacks\n\n### Detect Threats\n\nWith limited onboard security measures, your devices are easy targets for adversaries. With 100+\nsources including EPSS and KEV, Asimily quickly detects threats so action can be taken.\n\n### Halt Infiltration Early\n\nReceive alerts or quarantine anomalous devices automatically to reduce the damage from successful\ninfiltration. Use pre-populated rules from Asimily Labs\u2019 threat analysis and make your own policies\nusing a simple, wizard-based rule generator.\n\n### Capture Packets\n\nMake the hardest part of incident response easier with instant packet capture for any monitored\ndevice. Arm your incident responders with what they need for forensic analysis of devices.\n\n### Reduce Incident Response Time and Cost\n\nWith a centralized platform and device timelines, quickly access and understand the true story\nbehind anomalies. Save time and money for your internal or contracted incident response.\n\n### Isolate Threats to Protect Your Network\n\nProviding isolation protects assets from compromise during an attack. Asimily provides a single\nplace to block services or ports, quarantine devices or segment compromised devices away from other\nassets.\n\n## Prevent Propagation Across your Networks\n\n### 24/7 Protection\n\nKeep the devices you depend on up and operational. Do it all through a single dashboard, with\nactionable information ready for anyone who needs to know\n\n### Uncompromised Performance\n\nWith Asimily\u2019s proactive detection and integrated incident response aids, you can minimize damage\nfrom attacks that get through your perimeter while keeping device uptime as high as possible.\n\n### Detect More than Threats\n\nAsimily goes beyond traditional threat detection to provide comprehensive insights into your IoT\necosystem, including identification of active threats, FDA recalls, and any activity that deviates\nfrom the norm.\n\n### Workflows\n\nEvery organization has its own systems and processes in place. Asimily works in harmony with your\ncurrent software and workflows to enhance your security measures. Along with integrations and a\nrobust API, concerns such as misconfigurations, wandering devices, and accidental resets can be\ndetected faster.\n\n### Secure Every IoT Device.\n### Automatically.\n\nCyber threats move fast \u2014 so should you. Asimily gives instant inventory and smart, prioritized risk\nmitigation insights for every IoT, OT, and IoMT device \u2014 so you can take action before threats\nstrike.\n\n[ Schedule a Demo ][71]\n\n#### Our Gartner Peer Insights Reviews\n\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 4976678] ][72]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Peer Insights Review 511214] ][73]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4925308] ][74]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959932] ][75]\n[ [Asimily 5 Star Gartner Review 4959378] ][76]\n[Previous slide]\n[Next slide]\n\n## Protecting Your Industry\u2019s Unique Devices\n\n### Healthcare\n\nAsimily provides the necessary tools to identify and address IoT vulnerabilities in healthcare,\nensuring the protection of patient data without interrupting the delivery of critical care.\n\n[ Discover More ][77]\n\n### Manufacturing\n\nIn an industry that relies heavily on IoT devices to drive automation, efficiency, and connectivity,\nAsimly can help. By ensuring the security of IoT devices, manufacturers can safeguard their\nintellectual property, prevent production disruptions, and maintain the trust of their customers and\npartners.\n\n[ Discover More ][78]\n\n### Higher Education\n\nEducational institutions depend on interconnected devices to facilitate learning, research, and\ncampus operations. Protect sensitive student and faculty data, maintain operational integrity, and\nfoster a secure, productive academic environment with Asimily.\n\n[ Discover More ][79]\n\n### Government\n\nAsimily equips government entities worldwide with the necessary tools to secure their IoT devices,\nprotect critical infrastructure, and ensure data privacy. Defend against cyber threats and uphold\npublic trust by proactively mitigating vulnerabilities.\n\n[ Discover More ][80]\n\n### Life Sciences\n\nWhere delicate research, development, and data exchange are ongoing, securing your IoT devices is a\ntop priority. Proactively manage and mitigate vulnerabilities, reducing the risk of theft or loss of\ncritical research and development efforts.\n\n[ Discover More ][81]\n\n### Frequently asked questions\n\nWhat is threat and response?\n\nThreat and response refers to a related set of capabilities and actions for when there may be an\nintrusion taking place on your facilities. IoT, OT, and IoMT acting strangely can be detected and\ntrigger any of the appropriate responses. Typically that\u2019s packet capture to get forensic data,\nescalation to incident responders, device quarantining, and alerting.\n\nWhy are threat detection and incident response important?\n\nThreat detection and incident response are crucial because they helps organizations identify and\nmitigate security breaches before they cause significant damage. By detecting and responding to\nthreats in a timely manner, businesses can protect sensitive data, maintain operational continuity,\nand safeguard their reputation.\n\nWhat does a software platform do that can aid my threat and response capabilities?\n\nWith access to network traffic and a policy engine, anomalous behavior can be detected. Those rules\nmust be regularly updated to keep up with adversarial tradecraft.\n\nCan threat detection and incident response solutions be customized to fit specific industries?\n\nYes, threat detection and incident response solutions can be customized to cater to the specific\nneeds and regulations of various industries. Different sectors may have unique security requirements\nand compliance standards, and a tailored solution can address those specific challenges effectively.\nA key component is the ability to create rules without requiring programming skill, to ease\ncreation, maintenance and industry-specific customization.\n\nWhat is the difference between endpoint detection and response (EDR) and TDR?\n\nEDR focuses on detecting and responding to threats at the endpoint level, while TDR takes a holistic\napproach by monitoring and responding to threats across the entire network infrastructure. EDR\nsolutions primarily deal with threats targeting individual devices, while TDR solutions provide a\nmore comprehensive view of network-wide security threats.\n\nDoes Asimily provide actual incident response in the form of services or on-site personnel?\n\nNo. Asimily provides a software platform to aid the incident response process. We partner with\nnumerous organizations who have this capability and are able to provide referrals.\n* Platform\n* [Overview][82]\n* [Risk Mitigation][83]\n* [Inventory and Visibility][84]\n* [Vulnerability Prioritization][85]\n* [Threat and Response][86]\n* [Segmentation Orchestration][87]\n* [IoT Patching][88]\n* [Configuration Control][89]\n* [Risk Modeling][90]\n* [Governance, Risk, and Compliance][91]\n* [Operational Efficiency][92]\n* [Integrations][93]\n* Industries\n* [Energy and Utilities][94]\n* [Financial Services][95]\n* [Government][96]\n* [Healthcare][97]\n* [Higher Education][98]\n* [Hospitality][99]\n* [Life Sciences][100]\n* [Manufacturing][101]\n* [Retail][102]\n* [Transportation and Logistics][103]\n* Solutions\n* column1\n* [Automated IoT Visibility And Deep Categorization][104]\n* [IoT Device Detail Enrichment][105]\n* [Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection][106]\n* [Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization][107]\n* [Device Prioritization by Risk][108]\n* [Efficient Mitigation Workflows][109]\n* [Network Segmentation and Microsegmentation][110]\n* column2\n* [FDA Recalls and Security Advisories][111]\n* [Medical Device Utilization][112]\n* [IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance][113]\n* [Risk Reduction Services][114]\n* [IoT Risk Simulator][115]\n* [Incident Response Readiness with Packet Capture][116]\n* [Asimily for IT][117]\n* [IoT Security][118]\n* [OT Security][119]\n* [Medical Devices][120]\n* column3\n* [CMMC][121]\n* [Cyberscope][122]\n* [DORA][123]\n* [FDA][124]\n* [HIPAA][125]\n* [MITRE ATT&CK][126]\n* [NERC CIP][127]\n* [NIS2][128]\n* [PCI-DSS][129]\n* [Zero Trust][130]\n* two columns\n* Resources\n* [All Resources][131]\n* [Blog][132]\n* [FAQ][133]\n* [Glossary][134]\n* About Us\n* [About Asimily][135]\n* [Careers][136]\n* [Leadership][137]\n* [Partners][138]\n* [Contact Us][139]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Asimily All Rights Reserved.\n\n[ Privacy Policy ][140]\n[ Product Security ][141]\n\n[1]: https://asimily.com\n[2]: #\n[3]: https://asimily.com/product/overview/\n[4]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-mitigation/\n[5]: https://asimily.com/product/segmentation-orchestration/\n[6]: https://asimily.com/product/inventory-visibility/\n[7]: https://asimily.com/product/vulnerability-prioritization/\n[8]: https://asimily.com/product/threat-response/\n[9]: https://asimily.com/product/governance-risk-compliance/\n[10]: https://asimily.com/product/configuration-control/\n[11]: https://asimily.com/product/iot-patching/\n[12]: https://asimily.com/product/operational-efficiency/\n[13]: https://asimily.com/product/risk-modeling/\n[14]: https://asimily.com/product/integrations/\n[15]: #\n[16]: https://asimily.com/industries/energy-utilities/\n[17]: https://asimily.com/industries/financial-services/\n[18]: https://asimily.com/industries/government/\n[19]: https://asimily.com/industries/healthcare/\n[20]: https://asimily.com/industries/higher-education/\n[21]: https://asimily.com/industries/hospitality-iot-security/\n[22]: https://asimily.com/industries/life-sciences/\n[23]: https://asimily.com/industries/manufacturing/\n[24]: https://asimily.com/industries/retail/\n[25]: https://asimily.com/industries/transportation/\n[26]: #\n[27]: https://asimily.com/solutions/automated-iot-visibility-deep-categorization/\n[28]: ht"
