      "key_products": "Cyber Asset & Exposure Management Platform, Continuous IoT Vulnerability Detection, IoMT Pre-Purchase Risk Avoidance, Incident Response Readiness, Risk-based IoT Vulnerability Prioritization",
      "polished_summary": "Asimily is a cybersecurity company specializing in risk management for Internet of Things (IoT), Operational Technology (OT), and Internet of Medical Things (IoMT) devices. Their comprehensive platform offers solutions for risk mitigation, vulnerability detection, and compliance management, catering to organizations that rely on connected devices to enhance security and operational efficiency. Key products include automated IoT visibility, threat detection and response, and governance tools, all designed to address the unique challenges of managing and securing diverse device ecosystems.",
