e\u2019s agentic AI engine, Titan evolves beyond traditional detection \u2014 enabling\nautonomous analysis, adaptive learning, and intelligent response without manual input.\n\n## Core Features & Capabilities\n\nUnified Protection, Intelligent Automation\n\n### Next-Gen Antivirus (NGAV)\n\nBlocks [ransomware][151], zero-day threats, and polymorphic malware.\n\n### Behavioral Detection\n\nIdentifies malicious activity before execution.\n\n### Threat Intelligence Integration\n\nEnriched by Cyble Vision for real-time global context.\n\n### Forensic Visibility\n\nFull endpoint telemetry and event correlation for investigations.\n\n### Cross-Platform Coverage\n\nSupports Windows,"
