 your network.\n* **Where the traffic** is originating from.\n* **Which bots** are involved in the attacks.\n* **Command-and-Control (C2) **structures and threat actors (TAs) behind the botnet attacks.\n\n##### See Cyble Vision in Action\n\n## Try BotShield for Free!\n\nWe\u2019re excited to offer an exclusive free trial of our BotShield module from October 4, 2024 to\nNovember 30, 2024 . This limited-time opportunity allows you to experience BotShield\u2019s full\ncapabilities and understand how it can deliver unmatched protection against automated threats.\n\n[ Schedule Free Demo 1 Platform | 8+ capabilities | 70+ Use Cases ][150]\nNeed Assistance?\nIf you have any questi"
