ort:**[Europe Threat Landscape Report\n2025][135] **Report:**[APAC Cyber Threat Landscape Report 2025][136] **Report:**[North America Cyber\nThreat Landscape Report 2025][137] **Report:**[META Threat Landscape Report 2025][138]\n**Recognition:**[Cyble Recognized as 2026 Gartner\u00ae Peer Insights\u2122 Strong Performer][139]\n**Recognition:**[Cyble Recognized in Gartner\u00ae Hype Cycle\u2122 2025][140] **Recognition:**[Cyble Named in\nGartner\u00ae Hype Cycle\u2122 for Managed IT Services 2025][141]\n**Report:**[Global Cybersecurity Report 2025][142] **Report:**[Europe Threat Landscape Report\n2025][143] **Report:**[APAC Cyber Threat Landscape Report 2025][144] **Report:**[North America Cyber\nThreat Landscape Report 2025][145] **Report:**[META Threat Landscape Report 2025][146]\n**Recognition:**[Cyble Recognized as 2026 Gartner\u00ae Peer Insights\u2122 Strong Performer][147]\n**Recognition:**[Cyble Recognized in Gartner\u00ae Hype Cycle\u2122 2025][148] **Recognition:**[Cyble Named in\nGartner\u00ae Hype Cycle\u2122 for Managed IT Services 2025][149]\n\n# Bridging Cybersecurity and Business Value Through Cyber Risk Quantification\n\n## Quantify, Prioritize, and Protect\u2014Intelligently.\n\nWith global cybercrime costs expected to reach $10.5 trillion by 2025, organizations need more than\nvisibility\u2014they need strategy. Built on advanced CRQ capabilities, Cyble translates cyber risk into\nfinancial impact, empowering executives to make informed, profit-focused decisions.\n\nDefend smarter. Invest wiser. Communicate risk in the language your board understands.\n\n[ Request a Demo ][150]\n\n## What is CRQ?\n\nCyble Cyber Risk Quantification (CRQ) is a cloud-native SaaS platform that bridges the gap between\ncybersecurity performance and business outcomes.By combining real-time threat intelligence, asset\nvisibility, and predictive analytics, CRQ enables organizations to:\n* Measure cyber risks in financial terms,\n* Calculate Return on Security Investment (RoSI), and\n* Align security decisions with enterprise value.\n\nCyble CRQ empowers CISOs to justify security spend, demonstrate impact, and achieve continuous cyber\nresilience through intelligent, autonomous risk modeling.\n\n## Core Features & Capabilities\n\n### Enterprise & Asset-Level Risk Quantification\n\nGet a 360\u00b0 view of risk exposure across business units, assets, and infrastructure.\n\n### Financial Risk Modeling & RoSI\n\nTranslate complex cyber risk data into monetary impact metrics and calculate RoSI to identify the\nmost cost-effective controls.\n\n### Operational Efficiency Metrics\n\nMeasure and optimize MTTD, MTTN, MTTR, FPR, and IRR t"
