raud before fraudulent transactions can take place or escalate\n* Suspicious Domains\nCyble Suspicious Domain tool offers the ability to scan a website or domain for potential security\nthreats or unusual behaviour. This tool allows you to proactively monitor and assess the safety of\na website or domain, providing you with valuable insights into any potential risks and enabling\nyou to take action to protect your organization's assets and reputation.\n* Risk Management\nEnsure adherence to company policies by all employees and executives through monitoring of\ninternal and external communication platforms.\n* Fake Mobile Apps Detection\n"
