se-built for\nmodern cybersecurity. Unlike legacy tools with retrofitted automation, Blaze AI\u2019s autonomous agents\nhunt, correlate, and neutralize threats before they can cause damage, predicting attack patterns\nmonths in advance and resolving incidents up to 60% faster.\n\nPowered by Cyble\u2019s global threat intelligence infrastructure \u2014 spanning billions of indexed\nwebpages, hundreds of billions of [dark web][154] records, and millions of threat indicators \u2014 the\nplatform gives organizations deep visibility into attacker behavior, exposed assets, and emerging\ncyber risks across the open, deep, and dark web.\n\n## Our Story\n\nThis timeline showcases how a colleg"
