      "key_products": "Agentic AI-Powered Unified Cybersecurity Platform, Cyble Titan Endpoint Security, Cyble Blaze AI, Cyble Vision For Enterprise, Cyble Hawk Federal Bodies",
      "polished_summary": "Cyble is an AI Native Threat Intelligence Company that specializes in advanced cybersecurity solutions designed to protect organizations from a wide range of cyber threats. Its core offerings include a suite of products such as the Agentic AI-Powered Unified Cybersecurity Platform, Cyble Blaze AI for rapid threat detection, and Cyble Titan Endpoint Security, catering to diverse sectors including healthcare, financial services, and retail. By leveraging actionable threat intelligence and autonomous response capabilities, Cyble aims to enhance the cybersecurity posture of enterprises and federal agencies alike.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Cyble develops advanced cybersecurity solutions specifically designed to protect organizations from cyber threats, including products like the Agentic AI-Powered Unified Cybersecurity Platform and Cyble Titan Endpoint Security, which are directly applicable to Cyber-Physical Systems Security.",
