        "crawl_text": "Cyolo LTD Global InfoSec Award for 'Most Innovative Secure Remote Access' Global InfoSec Award for 'Publisher's Choice OT Security' Infrastructure-agnostic deployment No need for major infrastructure changes Focus on privileged access security Decentralized architecture for maximum adaptability Not specified Cyolo Releases Powerful New Capabilities to Redefine Secure Remote Access for OT Enhancing security and productivity in remote access for OT environments Decentralized architecture for operational agility Recognized as a leader in secure remote access for cyber-physical systems and operational technology. Remote Privileged Access for OT and Cyber-Physical Systems | Cyolo\n\nGartner\u00ae releases first-ever Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\nGet the guide\n\nProduct\n\nSolutions\n\nBy Challenge\n\nRemote Privileged Access for OT/ICS\n\nSecure Third-Party Access\n\nIT/OT Alignment\n\nRegulatory Compliance\n\nBy Industry\n\nManufacturing\n\nEnergy & Utilities\n\nAI Data Centers\n\nAll Industries\n\nPartners\n\nPartner Program\n\nPartner Ecosystem\n\nTechnology Integrations\n\nBecome a Partner\n\nResources\n\nResources\n\nSee All Resources\n\nNews\n\nPress Releases\n\nUpcoming Events\n\nThird Party Reports\n\nCase Studies\n\nAt a Glances\n\nDatasheet\n\nWhite Papers\n\nVideos\n\nFeatured content\n\nPress Release\n\nCyolo Releases Powerful New Capabilities to Redefine Secure Remote Access for OT\n\nBlog\n\nWhy VPNs Are a Poor Fit for Vendor Access in OT Manufacturing Environments\n\nWhite Paper\n\nThe Paradox of Third-Party OT Access: The Surprising Benefits of Trusting Vendors Less\n\nThird Party Report\n\n2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\nBlog\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Us\n\nCareers\n\nSupport\n\nToggle Search\n\nEng\n\nSpa\n\nFre\n\nIta\n\nEng\n\nSpa\n\nFre\n\nIta\n\nGet a Demo\n\nClose Menu\n\nProduct\n\nSolutions\n\nRemote Privileged Access for OT/ICS\n\nThird-Party Secure Access\n\nIT/OT Alignment\n\nRegulatory Compliance\n\nManufacturing\n\nEnergy & Utilities\n\nData Centers\n\nAll Industries\n\nPartners\n\nPartner Program\n\nPartner Ecosystem\n\nTechnology Integrations\n\nBecome a Partner\n\nResources\n\nNews\n\nPress Releases\n\nThird-Party Reports\n\nCase Studies\n\nAt a Glances\n\nDatasheets\n\nWhite Papers\n\nVideos\n\nBlog\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Us\n\nCareers\n\nSupport\n\nSearch\nToggle Search\n\np]:max-w-[600px]\">\n\nTake Control of Remote OT Access Without Disrupting Operations\nConnect third-party vendors, remote workers, and privileged employees to critical assets in a way that\u2019s secure, safe, and surprisingly simple.\n\nSee product overview\n\nGet a demo\n\nCyolo provides secure remote access with full visibility and control over every connection \u2014 from start to finish.\n\nMaximize uptime and efficiency with an easy-to-use access solution that can be deployed in any environment and integrates seamlessly with both modern and legacy infrastructure.\n\nFacilitate agentless third-party remote access\nSafely connect third-party vendors to OT environments for enhanced productivity without needing to use VPNs or jump boxes.\n\nProvide OEM access for fast, secure support\nEnsure rapid, secure, and safe support and maintenance of diagnostics (M&amp;D) for OT systems.\n\nControl privileged access to critical systems\nSecure, monitor, and control privileged connections to mission-critical assets, whether on-prem or remote.\n\nAchieve regulatory compliance\nImplement access control, supervision, session recording, segmentation, and other requirements of industry and/or regional compliance mandates.\n\nSee how Cyolo secures OT access\n\nDiscover the remote access solution that changes the equation.\n\nMost traditional access solutions force organizations to choose between stronger security, user productivity, and operational agility. Cyolo rewrites the equation by improving all three.\n\nGreater operational agility\n\nGet up and running quickly without infrastructure changes, operational disruptions, or downtime\n\nDeploy in any environment, from cloud-connected to fully offline\n\nScale across sites, teams, and vendors without added complexity\n\nGreater productivity\n\nConnect employees and third-party vendors fast \u2014 no agents needed\n\nSimplify secure access without changing how people work\n\nEnable remote collaboration, troubleshooting, and training from anywhere\n\nGreater security\n\nReduce risk with identity-based, Zero-Trust access \u2014 including to legacy systems\n\nTrack, control, and audit every session with complete accountability\n\nEliminate the risks of shared accounts and exposed credentials\n\nCyolo delivers the only secure remote access solution that\u2019s built for OT and backed by IT .\n\nJust because it\u2019s made for OT doesn\u2019t mean IT won\u2019t love it.\nCyolo delivers secure remote access that maximizes uptime and boosts efficiency \u2014 while giving IT unmatched visibility, control, and zero-trust protection.\n\nWhy OT & IT agree on Cyolo\n\nCase Study\nTata Chemicals provides secure remote access for employees, contractors, and vendors with Cyolo\n&quot;We use Cyolo to grant and to monitor vendor/contractor access to our internal systems, data, PLCs, all those kind of things that they need to access. One of the nice things about Cyolo is that we can record sessions, [and] we can ask for manager approval in order to allow those people in. Everyone knows when they&#039;re accessing any of our resources, and it&#039;s all approved. Those features have made Cyolo a gamechanger for us.&quot;\nMcKay Smith, IT Manager, Tata Chemicals\n\nSee all case studies\n\nCyolo is Recognized by Industry Experts\n\nMay 2026\n\np]:m-0\">\n\nCyolo Named a Sample Vendor for CPS Secure Remote Access in the 2026 Gartner\u00ae Hype Cycle for CPS Security\n\nMarch 2026\n\np]:m-0\">\n\nCyolo Named Winner of the Global InfoSec Award for &quot;Most Innovative Secure Remote Access&quot;\n\nMarch 2026\n\np]:m-0\">\n\nCyolo Named Winner of the Global InfoSec Award for &quot;Publisher&#039;s Choice OT Security&quot;\n\nFebruary 2026\n\np]:m-0\">\n\nCyolo Listed as a Representative Vendor in the 2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\nAugust 2025\n\np]:m-0\">\n\nCyolo Named by Gartner\u00ae in the &#039;How to Implement Secure Remote Access in the CPS Environment&#039; report\n\nAugust 2025\n\np]:m-0\">\n\nCyolo Recognized as a Sample Vendor in the 2025 Gartner\u00ae Hype Cycle\u2122 for Zero-Trust Technology\n\nJuly 2025\n\np]:m-0\">\n\nCyolo Listed as a Sample Vendor in the 2025 Gartner\u00ae Hype Cycle\u2122 for Cyber-Physical Systems Security\n\nJune 2025\n\np]:m-0\">\n\nCyolo Named by Gartner\u00ae in the &#039;How to Secure Remote Privileged Access With RPAM Tools&#039; report\n\nJuly 2024\n\np]:m-0\">\n\nCyolo Listed as a Sample Vendor in the 2024 Gartner\u00ae Hype Cycle\u2122 for Cyber-Physical Systems Security\n\nApril 2024\n\np]:m-0\">\n\nCyolo Recognized in the Gartner\u00ae Innovation Insight: CPS Secure Remote Access Solutions\n\nDec 2023\n\np]:m-0\">\n\nCyolo Named by Gartner\u00ae in the \u2018Securing Remote Privileged Access Management Through RPAM Tools&#039; report\n\nAug 2023\n\np]:m-0\">\n\nCyolo Listed as a Representative Vendor in the Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for Zero Trust Network Access\n\nPrevious\n\nNext\n\nDiscover Cyolo PRO for yourself.\nSchedule a personalized demo and see how we can help solve your toughest access and connectivity challenges without disrupting operations or replacing existing infrastructure.\n\nGet a demo\n\nCyolo provides secure remote privileged access for cyber-physical systems and OT. Our solution enables industrial enterprises to connect employees and third-party vendors to critical assets in a way that's secure, safe, and surprisingly simple.\n\nGet in Touch: Contact Us\n\nProduct\n\nProduct Overview\n\nIndustrial Remote Privileged Access\n\nThird Party Secure Access\n\nIndustries\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Us\n\nCareers\n\nPartners\n\nResources\n\nBlog\n\nPress Releases\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Cyolo LTD. All rights reserved.\n\nCyolo Privacy Policy\n\nCookie Policy\n\nVulnerability Disclosure Policy Gartner\u00ae releases first-ever Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access -\n[ Get the guide ][1]\n[ Product ][2]\n[ Solutions ][3]\n\n### By Challenge\n\nRemote Privileged Access for OT/ICS\n][4] [\nSecure Third-Party Access\n][5] [\nIT/OT Alignment\n][6] [\nRegulatory Compliance\n][7]\n\n### By Industry\n\nManufacturing\n][8] [\nEnergy & Utilities\n][9] [\nAI Data Centers\n][10] [\nAll Industries\n][11]\n[ Partners ][12]\nPartner Program\n][13] [\nPartner Ecosystem\n][14] [\nTechnology Integrations\n][15] [\nBecome a Partner\n][16]\n[ Resources ][17]\n\n### Resources\n\n[ See All Resources ][18]\nNews\n][19] [\nPress Releases\n][20] [\nUpcoming Events\n][21] [\nThird Party Reports\n][22] [\nCase Studies\n][23] [\nAt a Glances\n][24] [\nDatasheet\n][25] [\nWhite Papers\n][26] [\nVideos\n][27]\n\n### Featured content\n\nPress Release\n\n#### Cyolo Releases Powerful New Capabilities to Redefine Secure Remote Access for OT\n\n][28] [\nBlog\n\n#### Why VPNs Are a Poor Fit for Vendor Access in OT Manufacturing Environments\n\n][29] [\nWhite Paper\n\n#### The Paradox of Third-Party OT Access: The Surprising Benefits of Trusting Vendors Less\n\n][30] [\nThird Party Report\n\n#### 2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\n][31]\n[ Blog ][32]\n[ Company ][33]\nAbout Us\n][34] [\nCareers\n][35]\n[ Support ][36]\n[ Toggle Search ][37]\n[united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng\n[germany-flag.svg flag] De\n[spain-flag.svg flag] Spa\n[france-flag.svg flag] Fre\n[italy-flag.svg flag] Ita\n[ [united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng ][38] [ [germany-flag.svg flag] De ][39] [ [spain-flag.svg flag]\nSpa ][40] [ [france-flag.svg flag] Fre ][41] [ [italy-flag.svg flag] Ita ][42]\n[ Get a Demo ][43]\nClose Menu\n[ Product ][44]\n[ Solutions ][45]\n[ Remote Privileged Access for OT/ICS ][46] [ Third-Party Secure Access ][47] [ IT/OT Alignment\n][48] [ Regulatory Compliance ][49] [ Manufacturing ][50] [ Energy & Utilities ][51] [ Data Centers\n][52] [ All Industries ][53]\n[ Partners ][54]\n[ Partner Program ][55] [ Partner Ecosystem ][56] [ Technology Integrations ][57] [ Become a Partner\n][58]\n[ Resources ][59]\n[ News ][60] [ Press Releases ][61] [ Third-Party Reports ][62] [ Case Studies ][63] [ At a Glances\n][64] [ Datasheets ][65] [ White Papers ][66] [ Videos ][67]\n[ Blog ][68]\n[ Company ][69]\n[ About Us ][70] [ Careers ][71]\n[ Support ][72] [ Search Toggle Search ][73]\n\n# Maximize Uptime with Secure Remote Access to Critical Assets\n\nCyolo PRO (Privileged Remote Operations) is a lightweight, infrastructure-agnostic remote access\nsolution that brings identity-based authentication, zero-trust connectivity, and crucial visibility\nand oversight capabilities to OT/CPS environments.\n\n[ Get a Demo ][74] [ Cyolo PRO at a glance ][75]\n\n###### INNOVATION ANNOUNCEMENT\n\n### Cyolo PRO v7.0 adds new features \u2014 including session intelligence & OT asset discovery \u2014 to\n### amplify visibility and control across OT environments.\n\n[ See what's new ][76]\n\n## Let's Secure Remote Privileged Access Together.\n\n## What makes Cyolo PRO different from legacy Secure Remote Access (SRA)?\n\n##### ADAPTABLE DEPLOYMENT\n\n#### Deploy in any environment \u2013 on-prem, offline or cloud-connected\n\nWhile most SRA solutions are designed either for the cloud or for isolation, **Cyolo PRO is built to\nenable maximum deployment flexibility**. A single solution that provides secure remote access to\non-prem, air-gapped, or cloud-connected environments, Cyolo PRO accommodates the varied, evolving\nneeds of the modern industrial enterprise.\n\n##### IDENTITY MODERNIZATION WITHOUT NETWORK CHANGES\n\n#### Add modern identity authentication to legacy systems\n\nWith no infrastructure changes needed, **Cyolo PRO brings modern, identity-based authentication\n(including MFA), credentials vaulting, password rotation, and other security best practices to\nlegacy OT systems **\u2013 including but not limited to EoL/EoS Windows and Linux and dated PLCs and\nHMIs.\n\n##### GRANULAR ACCESS, CONNECTIVITY, AND OVERSIGHT CONTROLS\n\n#### Control users\u2019 access and actions policies with ease\n\n**Cyolo PRO offers a wide range of granular controls** to help admins seamlessly manage what users\ncan and cannot do during a session. Policies are set per application or user and include parameters\nsuch as time and geo-location. Additional oversight controls include Just-in-Time (JIT) access,\nsupervised access, session recording, and more.\n\n##### AGENTLES"
      },
