          {
            "url": "https://cyolo.io/product",
            "text": "Gartner\u00ae releases first-ever Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access -\n[ Get the guide ][1]\n[ Product ][2]\n[ Solutions ][3]\n\n### By Challenge\n\nRemote Privileged Access for OT/ICS\n][4] [\nSecure Third-Party Access\n][5] [\nIT/OT Alignment\n][6] [\nRegulatory Compliance\n][7]\n\n### By Industry\n\nManufacturing\n][8] [\nEnergy & Utilities\n][9] [\nAI Data Centers\n][10] [\nAll Industries\n][11]\n[ Partners ][12]\nPartner Program\n][13] [\nPartner Ecosystem\n][14] [\nTechnology Integrations\n][15] [\nBecome a Partner\n][16]\n[ Resources ][17]\n\n### Resources\n\n[ See All Resources ][18]\nNews\n][19] [\nPress Releases\n][20] [\nUpcoming Events\n][21] [\nThird Party Reports\n][22] [\nCase Studies\n][23] [\nAt a Glances\n][24] [\nDatasheet\n][25] [\nWhite Papers\n][26] [\nVideos\n][27]\n\n### Featured content\n\nPress Release\n\n#### Cyolo Releases Powerful New Capabilities to Redefine Secure Remote Access for OT\n\n][28] [\nBlog\n\n#### Why VPNs Are a Poor Fit for Vendor Access in OT Manufacturing Environments\n\n][29] [\nWhite Paper\n\n#### The Paradox of Third-Party OT Access: The Surprising Benefits of Trusting Vendors Less\n\n][30] [\nThird Party Report\n\n#### 2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\n][31]\n[ Blog ][32]\n[ Company ][33]\nAbout Us\n][34] [\nCareers\n][35]\n[ Support ][36]\n[ Toggle Search ][37]\n[united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng\n[germany-flag.svg flag] De\n[spain-flag.svg flag] Spa\n[france-flag.svg flag] Fre\n[italy-flag.svg flag] Ita\n[ [united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng ][38] [ [germany-flag.svg flag] De ][39] [ [spain-flag.svg flag]\nSpa ][40] [ [france-flag.svg flag] Fre ][41] [ [italy-flag.svg flag] Ita ][42]\n[ Get a Demo ][43]\nClose Menu\n[ Product ][44]\n[ Solutions ][45]\n[ Remote Privileged Access for OT/ICS ][46] [ Third-Party Secure Access ][47] [ IT/OT Alignment\n][48] [ Regulatory Compliance ][49] [ Manufacturing ][50] [ Energy & Utilities ][51] [ Data Centers\n][52] [ All Industries ][53]\n[ Partners ][54]\n[ Partner Program ][55] [ Partner Ecosystem ][56] [ Technology Integrations ][57] [ Become a Partner\n][58]\n[ Resources ][59]\n[ News ][60] [ Press Releases ][61] [ Third-Party Reports ][62] [ Case Studies ][63] [ At a Glances\n][64] [ Datasheets ][65] [ White Papers ][66] [ Videos ][67]\n[ Blog ][68]\n[ Company ][69]\n[ About Us ][70] [ Careers ][71]\n[ Support ][72] [ Search Toggle Search ][73]\n\n# Maximize Uptime with Secure Remote Access to Critical Assets\n\nCyolo PRO (Privileged Remote Operations) is a lightweight, infrastructure-agnostic remote access\nsolution that brings identity-based authentication, zero-trust connectivity, and crucial visibility\nand oversight capabilities to OT/CPS environments.\n\n[ Get a Demo ][74] [ Cyolo PRO at a glance ][75]\n\n###### INNOVATION ANNOUNCEMENT\n\n### Cyolo PRO v7.0 adds new features \u2014 including session intelligence & OT asset discovery \u2014 to\n### amplify visibility and control across OT environments.\n\n[ See what's new ][76]\n\n## Let's Secure Remote Privileged Access Together.\n\n## What makes Cyolo PRO different from legacy Secure Remote Access (SRA)?\n\n##### ADAPTABLE DEPLOYMENT\n\n#### Deploy in any environment \u2013 on-prem, offline or cloud-connected\n\nWhile most SRA solutions are designed either for the cloud or for isolation, **Cyolo PRO is built to\nenable maximum deployment flexibility**. A single solution that provides secure remote access to\non-prem, air-gapped, or cloud-connected environments, Cyolo PRO accommodates the varied, evolving\nneeds of the modern industrial enterprise.\n\n##### IDENTITY MODERNIZATION WITHOUT NETWORK CHANGES\n\n#### Add modern identity authentication to legacy systems\n\nWith no infrastructure changes needed, **Cyolo PRO brings modern, identity-based authentication\n(including MFA), credentials vaulting, password rotation, and other security best practices to\nlegacy OT systems **\u2013 including but not limited to EoL/EoS Windows and Linux and dated PLCs and\nHMIs.\n\n##### GRANULAR ACCESS, CONNECTIVITY, AND OVERSIGHT CONTROLS\n\n#### Control users\u2019 access and actions policies with ease\n\n**Cyolo PRO offers a wide range of granular controls** to help admins seamlessly manage what users\ncan and cannot do during a session. Policies are set per application or user and include parameters\nsuch as time and geo-location. Additional oversight controls include Just-in-Time (JIT) access,\nsupervised access, session recording, and more.\n\n##### AGENTLESS REMOTE ACCESS\n\n#### Connect third-party vendors and contractors without agents\n\nThird-party collaborations help keep operations running smoothly, but vendors and other external\nusers may be hesitant to download agents onto their personal devices. **As an agentless solution\nwith no downloads required, Cyolo PRO makes it easy to extend secure remote access to third\nparties,** who can begin working immediately from a web browser or locally installed applications\nsuch as RDP, SSH, TIA Portal, FactoryTalk, and Studio 5000.\n\n##### STANDARD ACCESS, FLEXIBLE MANAGEMENT\n\n#### Deliver a common experience across hundreds of sites\n\n**Cyolo PRO\u2019s decentralized architecture enables multi-tenancy**, which means a single instance of\nsoftware can serve multiple client organizations (tenants), with each tenant having its own isolated\ndata and configurations. In practice, this allows organizations not just to easily deploy and manage\naccess across numerous global sites but also to choose between centralized management or site-based\nlocal control in accordance with their specific security requirements.\n\n##### ZERO TRUST WITHOUT VENDOR TRUST\n\n#### Keep all sensitive data inside the customer\u2019s trusted boundaries\n\n**Cyolo PRO adheres fully to the zero-trust security framework and the principle of least privilege.\n**The solution's decentralized architecture allows customers to keep all credentials, keys,\npolicies, and other secrets inside their trusted boundaries at all times, giving them total control\nover their data and eliminating a potential supply chain risk.\n\n## Learn how Cyolo PRO can secure access to your OT systems and assets\n\n[ Get a Demo ][77]\n\n##### How It Works\n\n## Cyolo PRO\u2019s Decentralized Architecture Ensures Maximum Adaptability\n\nCyolo PRO is composed of two distinct components: the** IDAC (ID Access Controller)** and a\n**Gateway**. The IDAC serves as the \u201cbrain,\u201d while the Gateway can be placed either on-prem or\non-cloud, depending on the organization\u2019s needs.\n\nWith its decentralized architecture and lightweight, Docker-based deployment, Cyolo PRO is able to\nseamlessly adapt to any existing infrastructure. This flexibility allows organizations to mitigate\nsecurity risks while also improving operational agility and enhancing user experience \u2013 all at the\nlowest cost of change and the lowest total costs of ownership.\n\nIsolated Environments Connected Environments\n\n### See how Cyolo PRO adapts to your existing infrastructure\n\nCyolo PRO integrates smoothly with other security solutions, including any identity provider (IdP),\nsecurity information and event management (SIEM), security orchestration and response (SOAR), IT\nservice management (ITSM) platform, and more.\n\n[ Get a Demo ][78]\n\n##### Case Study\n\n### How Rapac Energy Solved OT Security Challenges with Cyolo\n\nA leading power plant operator, Rapac Energy, needed to provide secure access to their OT and SCADA\nsystems to external suppliers, global support teams, and customers. The company previously used a\nVPN, but access was slow and employees were frustrated. The new solution had to provide multiple\nsecurity features that comply with stringent regulatory and internal requirements.\n\nRapac Energy looked to Cyolo to solve these challenges. The entire implementation process took only\none day \u2014 the shortest implementation Rapac Energy had ever experienced.\n\n\u201cNo solution gives me so much control and security like Cyolo. It\u2019s everything I need in one\nsolution.\u201d\n\n***- Shlomo Kamilyan, CIO, Rapac Energy ***\n\n[ Read the case study ][79] [ More case studies ][80]\nMore Resources\n[See All Resources][81]\nAt a Glance\n\n#### SANS Institute Product Briefing: Cyolo PRO\n\nRead More\n][82] [\nDatasheet\n\n#### Enable Privileged Remote Access with Cyolo PRO\n\nRead More\n][83] [\nAt a Glance\n\n#### Intelligent Supervision for OT: Revolutionizing Remote Access with AI-Powered Supervision\n\nRead More\n][84]\n\n## Discover Cyolo PRO for yourself.\n\nSchedule a personalized demo and see how we can help solve your toughest access and connectivity\nchallenges without disrupting operations or replacing existing infrastructure.\n\n[ Schedule a demo ][85]\nCyolo provides secure remote privileged access for cyber-physical systems and OT. Our solution\nenables industrial enterprises to connect employees and third-party vendors to critical assets in a\nway that's secure, safe, and surprisingly simple.\n\nGet in Touch: [**Contact Us**][86]\n\n###### [Product][87]\n\n[Product Overview][88]\n[Industrial Remote Privileged Access][89]\n[Third Party Secure Access][90]\n[Industries][91]\n\n###### [Company][92]\n\n[About Us][93]\n[Careers][94]\n[Partners][95]\n\n###### [Resources][96]\n\n[Blog][97]\n[Press Releases][98]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Cyolo LTD. All rights reserved.\n[Cyolo Privacy Policy][99] [Cookie Policy][100] [Vulnerability Disclosure Policy][101]\n\n[1]: https://cyolo.io/third-party-reports/gartner-market-guide-for-cps-secure-remote-access-2026\n[2]: /product\n[3]: #\n[4]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[5]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[6]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[7]: /regulatory-compliance\n[8]: /industries/manufacturing\n[9]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[10]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[11]: /industries\n[12]: #\n[13]: /partners-program\n[14]: /partner-ecosystem\n[15]: /technology-integrations\n[16]: /become-a-partner\n[17]: /resources\n[18]: /resources\n[19]: /news\n[20]: /press-releases\n[21]: /events\n[22]: /third-party-reports\n[23]: /case-studies\n[24]: /at-a-glance\n[25]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[26]: /white-papers\n[27]: /videos\n[28]: /press-releases/cyolo-releases-powerful-new-capabilities-to-redefine-secure-remote-access-for-\n[29]: /blog/why-vpns-are-a-poor-fit-for-vendor-access-in-ot-manufacturing-environments\n[30]: /white-papers/how-to-take-control-of-third-party-ot-access\n[31]: /third-party-reports/gartner-market-guide-for-cps-secure-remote-access-2026\n[32]: /blog\n[33]: /company\n[34]: /company\n[35]: /careers\n[36]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[37]: /search\n[38]: /\n[39]: /de\n[40]: /sp\n[41]: /fr\n[42]: /it\n[43]: /demo\n[44]: /product\n[45]: #\n[46]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[47]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[48]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[49]: /regulatory-compliance\n[50]: /industries/manufacturing\n[51]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[52]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[53]: /industries\n[54]: #\n[55]: /partners-program\n[56]: /partner-ecosystem\n[57]: /technology-integrations\n[58]: /become-a-partner\n[59]: /resources\n[60]: /news\n[61]: /press-releases\n[62]: /third-party-reports\n[63]: /case-studies\n[64]: /at-a-glance\n[65]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[66]: /white-papers\n[67]: /videos\n[68]: /blog\n[69]: /company\n[70]: /company\n[71]: /careers\n[72]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[73]: /search\n[74]: /demo\n[75]: https://info.cyolo.io/hubfs/At-A-Glances/AAG_Cyolo%20PRO%20-%20the%20SRA%20solution%20for%20OT\n.pdf\n[76]: https://cyolo.io/press-releases/cyolo-releases-powerful-new-capabilities-to-redefine-secure-re\nmote-access-for-ot\n[77]: /demo\n[78]: /demo\n[79]: /case-studies/how-rapac-energy-secures-scada-ot\n[80]: /case-studies\n[81]: /resources\n[82]: https://info.cyolo.io/hubfs/7608544/At-A-Glances/SANS%20Institute%20Product%20Briefing%20on%20\nCyolo.pdf\n[83]: https://7608544.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/7608544/Datasheets/Datasheet_Cyolo%20PRO.\npdf\n[84]: /at-a-glance/cyolo-pro-intelligent-supervision-for-ot\n[85]: /demo\n[86]: https://cyolo.io/contact-us\n[87]: /product\n[88]: /product\n[89]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[90]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[91]: /industries\n[92]: /company\n[93]: /company\n[94]: /careers\n[95]: /partners-program\n[96]: /resources\n[97]: /blog\n[98"
