          {
            "url": "https://cyolo.io/company",
            "text": "New research challenges assumptions about security & productivity -\n[ Read the report ][1]\n[ Product ][2]\n[ Solutions ][3]\n\n### By Challenge\n\nRemote Privileged Access for OT/ICS\n][4] [\nSecure Third-Party Access\n][5] [\nIT/OT Alignment\n][6] [\nRegulatory Compliance\n][7]\n\n### By Industry\n\nManufacturing\n][8] [\nEnergy & Utilities\n][9] [\nAI Data Centers\n][10] [\nAll Industries\n][11]\n[ Partners ][12]\nPartner Program\n][13] [\nPartner Ecosystem\n][14] [\nTechnology Integrations\n][15] [\nBecome a Partner\n][16]\n[ Resources ][17]\n\n### Resources\n\n[ See All Resources ][18]\nNews\n][19] [\nPress Releases\n][20] [\nUpcoming Events\n][21] [\nThird Party Reports\n][22] [\nCase Studies\n][23] [\nAt a Glances\n][24] [\nDatasheet\n][25] [\nWhite Papers\n][26] [\nVideos\n][27]\n\n### Featured content\n\nPress Release\n\n#### Cyolo Releases Powerful New Capabilities to Redefine Secure Remote Access for OT\n\n][28] [\nBlog\n\n#### Why VPNs Are a Poor Fit for Vendor Access in OT Manufacturing Environments\n\n][29] [\nWhite Paper\n\n#### The Paradox of Third-Party OT Access: The Surprising Benefits of Trusting Vendors Less\n\n][30] [\nThird Party Report\n\n#### 2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\n][31]\n[ Blog ][32]\n[ Company ][33]\nAbout Us\n][34] [\nCareers\n][35]\n[ Support ][36]\n[ Toggle Search ][37]\n[united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng\n[germany-flag.svg flag] De\n[spain-flag.svg flag] Spa\n[france-flag.svg flag] Fre\n[italy-flag.svg flag] Ita\n[ [united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng ][38] [ [germany-flag.svg flag] De ][39] [ [spain-flag.svg flag]\nSpa ][40] [ [france-flag.svg flag] Fre ][41] [ [italy-flag.svg flag] Ita ][42]\n[ Get a Demo ][43]\nClose Menu\n[ Product ][44]\n[ Solutions ][45]\n[ Remote Privileged Access for OT/ICS ][46] [ Third-Party Secure Access ][47] [ IT/OT Alignment\n][48] [ Regulatory Compliance ][49] [ Manufacturing ][50] [ Energy & Utilities ][51] [ Data Centers\n][52] [ All Industries ][53]\n[ Partners ][54]\n[ Partner Program ][55] [ Partner Ecosystem ][56] [ Technology Integrations ][57] [ Become a Partner\n][58]\n[ Resources ][59]\n[ News ][60] [ Press Releases ][61] [ Third-Party Reports ][62] [ Case Studies ][63] [ At a Glances\n][64] [ Datasheets ][65] [ White Papers ][66] [ Videos ][67]\n[ Blog ][68]\n[ Company ][69]\n[ About Us ][70] [ Careers ][71]\n[ Support ][72] [ Search Toggle Search ][73]\n\n# Unusually Easy Secure Remote Access for OT\n\nAt Cyolo, we make securely connecting privileged users to critical OT assets surprisingly simple.\nThat means bad actors can do a lot less \u2013 and your employees and third-party partners can do exactly\nwhat they need to do.\n\n##### Our Mission\n\n## **Enable secure remote access that drives your business instead of draining your energy**\n\n**Almog Apirion, our CEO and co-founder, calls himself a \u2018recovering CISO.\u2019 **\n\nIn that role, he saw first-hand how difficult it is to wrestle with tools that make remote access\ncomplicated, slow, and inconvenient \u2013 all in the name of keeping the company secure. This was\nfrustrating, especially because most of the tools he came across didn\u2019t even meet his security\nstandards.\n\nSo, instead of settling for what existing solutions could do, Almog set out to create something that\ndid what he wanted them to do:\n* Improve operational agility for admins, supervisors, and operators.\n* Enhance productivity for all users.\n* Keep every session secure from start to finish.\n\nThen he assembled a team of experts and visionaries to turn that wishlist into a reality. And\ntogether, they built Cyolo.\n\n## The Cyolo team started by asking some tough questions.\n\n#### Does security have to be so cumbersome?\n\nOr have we just learned to expect nothing better? Sure, workarounds, multiple logins, and clunky\ntech stacks are normal \u2014 but should they be?\n\n#### Should your vendor force you to migrate to the cloud or make other major infrastructure\n#### changes?\n\nYou\u2019ve spent years designing your security stack. You have better things to do than rebuild it just\nto meet a vendor\u2019s needs. Shouldn\u2019t your remote access solution work with your existing\ninfrastructure, instead of forcing you to rip it all out and start from scratch?\n\n#### Different users and devices pose different levels of risk. So, why do we treat them all the\n#### same?\n\nPrivileged accounts typically make up around 10% of users but are responsible for the vast majority\nof risk. So why not focus on them, instead of wasting resources applying rigid restrictions to\neveryone?\n\n#### Does your security vendor really need access to all your secrets?\n\nHanding over your passwords and encryption keys to a vendor only creates another weak link in your\nsecurity. Shouldn\u2019t your secrets stay secret from everyone \u2013 including your vendor?\n\n#### The world is decentralized. Why aren\u2019t our access solutions?\n\nYour OT systems and operations are distributed across an increasingly wide area. Doesn't it make\nsense to use a remote access solution that\u2019s similarly decentralized? It's the best way to increase\nuptime, improve performance, and remove the risk of a single point of compromise.\n\n### Facing a difficult challenge helped us build a solution that's easy to use **\u2014 **and better in\n### every way.\n\n## Our leadership team keeps us on the path to perfection.\n\n#### Almog Apirion\n\nCEO, Co-founder\n\n[ Linkedin Link ][74]\n\n#### Dedi Yarkoni\n\nCTO, Co-founder\n\n[ Linkedin Link ][75]\n\n#### Eran Shmuely\n\nChief Architect, Co-founder\n\n[ Linkedin Link ][76]\n\n#### Joe O\u2019Donnell\n\nChief Strategy Officer (CSO)\n\n[ Linkedin Link ][77]\n\n#### Gal Gonen\n\nChief Financial Officer (CFO)\n\n[ Linkedin Link ][78]\n\n#### Asa Kedar\n\nChief Customer Officer (CCO)\n\n[ Linkedin Link ][79]\n\n#### Mark Edge\n\nVP of Global Sales\n\n[ Linkedin Link ][80]\n\n#### Michelle Levy\n\nVP of Marketing\n\n[ Linkedin Link ][81]\n\n#### Jonathan Yellin\n\nVP of R&D\n\n[ Linkedin Link ][82]\n[Michael Langer]\n\n#### Michael Langer\n\nVP of Product\n\n[ Linkedin Link ][83]\n\n#### Max Berman\n\nVP of Customer Success\n\n[ Linkedin Link ][84]\n\n#### Tali Goren\n\nVP of Human Resources\n\n[ Linkedin Link ][85]\n\n#### Ian Cuthbertson\n\nVP of Global System Engineering\n\n[ Linkedin Link ][86]\n\n## Our customers experience the Cyolo difference every day.\n\nRapac Energy, a leading power plant operator, needed to provide secure access to their OT and SCADA\nsystems for external suppliers, global support teams, and customers. The company previously used a\nVPN, but access was slow and employees were frustrated.\n\nThe new solution had to include multiple security features that comply with stringent regulatory\nrequirements and internal policies.\n\nNow, with Cyolo, Rapac is succeeding to ensure business continuity while also achieving the highest\nlevel of security for its critical systems.\n\n### \u201cNo solution gives me so much control and security like Cyolo. It\u2019s everything I need in one\n### solution.\u201d\n\n***- Shlomo Kamilyan, CIO, Rapac Energy ***\n\n[ Read the full case study ][87] [ See all case studies ][88]\n\n##### Investors\n\n## Our investors trust us to continuously push the industry forward\n\nLearn More About Cyolo\n[See All Resources][89]\nAt a Glance\n\n#### Cyolo PRO: The Secure Remote Privileged Access Solution for OT/ICS/CPS\n\nRead More\n][90] [\nCase Study\n\n#### Video: Why Tata Chemicals Calls the Cyolo Remote Access Solution a Gamechanger\n\nRead More\n][91] [\nWhite Paper\n\n#### The Paradox of Third-Party OT Access: The Surprising Benefits of Trusting Vendors Less\n\nYou depend on third-party vendors to perform crucial tasks that help keep operations running\nsmoothly. But can you monitor exactly what they're doing inside your critical environments? In this\nwhite paper, you\u2019ll discover how connectivity and oversight controls let you manage your third-party\npartners \u2014 without slowing them down or harming their user experience. In fact, trusting third\nparties less can actually help you achieve a lot more. Find out how!\n\nRead More\n][92]\n\n## Discover Cyolo PRO for yourself.\n\nSchedule a personalized demo and see how we can help solve your toughest access and connectivity\nchallenges without disrupting operations or replacing existing infrastructure.\n\n[ Get a demo ][93]\nCyolo provides secure remote privileged access for cyber-physical systems and OT. Our solution\nenables industrial enterprises to connect employees and third-party vendors to critical assets in a\nway that's secure, safe, and surprisingly simple.\n\nGet in Touch: [**Contact Us**][94]\n\n###### [Product][95]\n\n[Product Overview][96]\n[Industrial Remote Privileged Access][97]\n[Third Party Secure Access][98]\n[Industries][99]\n\n###### [Company][100]\n\n[About Us][101]\n[Careers][102]\n[Partners][103]\n\n###### [Resources][104]\n\n[Blog][105]\n[Press Releases][106]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Cyolo LTD. All rights reserved.\n[Cyolo Privacy Policy][107] [Cookie Policy][108] [Vulnerability Disclosure Policy][109]\n\n[1]: https://cyolo.io/third-party-reports/can-cybersecurity-drive-growth-role-of-sra-manufacturing\n[2]: /product\n[3]: #\n[4]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[5]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[6]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[7]: /regulatory-compliance\n[8]: /industries/manufacturing\n[9]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[10]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[11]: /industries\n[12]: #\n[13]: /partners-program\n[14]: /partner-ecosystem\n[15]: /technology-integrations\n[16]: /become-a-partner\n[17]: /resources\n[18]: /resources\n[19]: /news\n[20]: /press-releases\n[21]: /events\n[22]: /third-party-reports\n[23]: /case-studies\n[24]: /at-a-glance\n[25]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[26]: /white-papers\n[27]: /videos\n[28]: /press-releases/cyolo-releases-powerful-new-capabilities-to-redefine-secure-remote-access-for-\n[29]: /blog/why-vpns-are-a-poor-fit-for-vendor-access-in-ot-manufacturing-environments\n[30]: /white-papers/how-to-take-control-of-third-party-ot-access\n[31]: /third-party-reports/gartner-market-guide-for-cps-secure-remote-access-2026\n[32]: /blog\n[33]: /company\n[34]: /company\n[35]: /careers\n[36]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[37]: /search\n[38]: /\n[39]: /de\n[40]: /sp\n[41]: /fr\n[42]: /it\n[43]: /demo\n[44]: /product\n[45]: #\n[46]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[47]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[48]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[49]: /regulatory-compliance\n[50]: /industries/manufacturing\n[51]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[52]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[53]: /industries\n[54]: #\n[55]: /partners-program\n[56]: /partner-ecosystem\n[57]: /technology-integrations\n[58]: /become-a-partner\n[59]: /resources\n[60]: /news\n[61]: /press-releases\n[62]: /third-party-reports\n[63]: /case-studies\n[64]: /at-a-glance\n[65]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[66]: /white-papers\n[67]: /videos\n[68]: /blog\n[69]: /company\n[70]: /company\n[71]: /careers\n[72]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[73]: /search\n[74]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/almog-apirion-19884533/\n[75]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/dedi-y-a3371b1a6/\n[76]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/eran-shmuely-a068ba182/\n[77]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/jodo/\n[78]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/galgonen/\n[79]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/asa-kedar/\n[80]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/marktedge/\n[81]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/michellemogelsonlevy/\n[82]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/yyellin/\n[83]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/michael-langer-214649/\n[84]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/max-avi-berman-3785313/\n[85]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/tali-goren-53575b85/\n[86]: https://www.linkedin.com/in/icuthbertson/\n[87]: https://cyolo.io/case-studies/how-rapac-energy-secures-scada-ot\n[88]: https://cyolo.io/case-studies\n[89]: /resources\n[90]: /at-a-glance/cyolo-pro-modernized-secure-remote-access-for-ot\n[91]: /case-studies/video-tata-chemicals-secure-remote-access\n[92]: /white-papers/how-to-take-control-of-third-party-ot-access\n[93]: /demo\n[94]: https://cyolo.io/contact-us\n[95]: /product\n[96]: /product\n[97]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[98]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[99]: /industries\n[100]: /company\n[101]: /company\n[102]: /careers\n[103]: /partners-program\n[104]: /resources\n[105]: /blog\n[106]: /press-releases\n[107]: /privacy-policy\n[108]: /c"
