            "text": "[ Product ][1]\n[ Solutions ][2]\n\n### By Challenge\n\nRemote Privileged Access for OT/ICS\n][3] [\nSecure Third-Party Access\n][4] [\nIT/OT Alignment\n][5] [\nRegulatory Compliance\n][6]\n\n### By Industry\n\nManufacturing\n][7] [\nEnergy & Utilities\n][8] [\nAI Data Centers\n][9] [\nAll Industries\n][10]\n[ Partners ][11]\nPartner Program\n][12] [\nPartner Ecosystem\n][13] [\nTechnology Integrations\n][14] [\nBecome a Partner\n][15]\n[ Resources ][16]\n\n### Resources\n\n[ See All Resources ][17]\nNews\n][18] [\nPress Releases\n][19] [\nUpcoming Events\n][20] [\nThird Party Reports\n][21] [\nCase Studies\n][22] [\nAt a Glances\n][23] [\nDatasheet\n][24] [\nWhite Papers\n][25] [\nVideos\n][26]\n\n### Featured content\n\nPress Release\n\n#### Cyolo Releases Powerful New Capabilities to Redefine Secure Remote Access for OT\n\n][27] [\nBlog\n\n#### Why VPNs Are a Poor Fit for Vendor Access in OT Manufacturing Environments\n\n][28] [\nWhite Paper\n\n#### The Paradox of Third-Party OT Access: The Surprising Benefits of Trusting Vendors Less\n\n][29] [\nThird Party Report\n\n#### 2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\n][30]\n[ Blog ][31]\n[ Company ][32]\nAbout Us\n][33] [\nCareers\n][34]\n[ Support ][35]\n[ Toggle Search ][36]\n[united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng\n[germany-flag.svg flag] De\n[spain-flag.svg flag] Spa\n[france-flag.svg flag] Fre\n[italy-flag.svg flag] Ita\n[ [united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng ][37] [ [germany-flag.svg flag] De ][38] [ [spain-flag.svg flag]\nSpa ][39] [ [france-flag.svg flag] Fre ][40] [ [italy-flag.svg flag] Ita ][41]\n[ Get a Demo ][42]\nClose Menu\n[ Product ][43]\n[ Solutions ][44]\n[ Remote Privileged Access for OT/ICS ][45] [ Third-Party Secure Access ][46] [ IT/OT Alignment\n][47] [ Regulatory Compliance ][48] [ Manufacturing ][49] [ Energy & Utilities ][50] [ Data Centers\n][51] [ All Industries ][52]\n[ Partners ][53]\n[ Partner Program ][54] [ Partner Ecosystem ][55] [ Technology Integrations ][56] [ Become a Partner\n][57]\n[ Resources ][58]\n[ News ][59] [ Press Releases ][60] [ Third-Party Reports ][61] [ Case Studies ][62] [ At a Glances\n][63] [ Datasheets ][64] [ White Papers ][65] [ Videos ][66]\n[ Blog ][67]\n[ Company ][68]\n[ About Us ][69] [ Careers ][70]\n[ Support ][71] [ Search Toggle Search ][72]\n\n##### Contact Us\n\n# Have questions or want more information?\n# Let's connect!\n\nPlease share your questions or concerns, and a member of the Cyolo team will respond within 1\nbusiness day.\n\nWant to see the Cyolo PRO advanced secure remote access solution in action?\n\n[ Schedule a demo ][73]\n\n#### Fill out the form below to submit a message to us.\n\nPrevious\n\n> Cyolo had everything we needed in one solution. The security features met all our access\n> requirements, such as two-factor authentication before entering the network and auditing and\n> sesson recording once inside the network. Cyolo gave us all the control and security that we\n> needed in just one solution, plus it was a fast and simple implementation.\n> Shlomo Kamilyan\n> CIO, Rapac Energy\n\n> We use Cyolo to grant and to monitor vendor/contractor access to our internal systems, data, PLCs,\n> all those kind of things that they need to access. One of the nice things about Cyolo is that we\n> can record sessions, [and] we can ask for manager approval in order to allow those people in.\n> Everyone knows when they're accessing any of our resources, and it's all approved. Those features\n> have made Cyolo a gamechanger for us.\n> McKay Smith\n> IT Manager, Tata Chemicals\n\n> Deployment [of Cyolo] took just an hour, and our users immediately experienced better speed,\n> operational efficiency and saw business agility supported with a simplified IT infrastructure at\n> the heart of the shift. With our attack surface shrinking, and a projected \u00a31 million in annual\n> cost-savings, we\u2019re moving full speed ahead with acquisitions and growth with secure\n> identity-based access and connectivity.\n> Jason Ozin\n> Group Information Security Officer, PIB Group\n\nNext\n\n##### Product Demo\n\n## See how the Cyolo PRO remote access solution works.\n\nEnsuring secure remote access to on-prem, isolated, and cloud-connected OT environments is easier\nthan you think. See for yourself.\n\n[ Request a Demo ][74]\nCyolo provides secure remote privileged access for cyber-physical systems and OT. Our solution\nenables industrial enterprises to connect employees and third-party vendors to critical assets in a\nway that's secure, safe, and surprisingly simple.\n\nGet in Touch: [**Contact Us**][75]\n\n###### [Product][76]\n\n[Product Overview][77]\n[Industrial Remote Privileged Access][78]\n[Third Party Secure Access][79]\n[Industries][80]\n\n###### [Company][81]\n\n[About Us][82]\n[Careers][83]\n[Partners][84]\n\n###### [Resources][85]\n\n[Blog][86]\n[Press Releases][87]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Cyolo LTD. All rights reserved.\n[Cyolo Privacy Policy][88] [Cookie Policy][89] [Vulnerability Disclosure Policy][90]\n\n[1]: /product\n[2]: #\n[3]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[4]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[5]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[6]: /regulatory-compliance\n[7]: /industries/manufacturing\n[8]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[9]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[10]: /industries\n[11]: #\n[12]: /partners-program\n[13]: /partner-ecosystem\n[14]: /technology-integrations\n[15]: /become-a-partner\n[16]: /resources\n[17]: /resources\n[18]: /news\n[19]: /press-releases\n[20]: /events\n[21]: /third-party-reports\n[22]: /case-studies\n[23]: /at-a-glance\n[24]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[25]: /white-papers\n[26]: /videos\n[27]: /press-releases/cyolo-releases-powerful-new-capabilities-to-redefine-secure-remote-access-for-\n[28]: /blog/why-vpns-are-a-poor-fit-for-vendor-access-in-ot-manufacturing-environments\n[29]: /white-papers/how-to-take-control-of-third-party-ot-access\n[30]: /third-party-reports/gartner-market-guide-for-cps-secure-remote-access-2026\n[31]: /blog\n[32]: /company\n[33]: /company\n[34]: /careers\n[35]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[36]: /search\n[37]: /\n[38]: /de\n[39]: /sp\n[40]: /fr\n[41]: /it\n[42]: /demo\n[43]: /product\n[44]: #\n[45]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[46]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[47]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[48]: /regulatory-compliance\n[49]: /industries/manufacturing\n[50]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[51]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[52]: /industries\n[53]: #\n[54]: /partners-program\n[55]: /partner-ecosystem\n[56]: /technology-integrations\n[57]: /become-a-partner\n[58]: /resources\n[59]: /news\n[60]: /press-releases\n[61]: /third-party-reports\n[62]: /case-studies\n[63]: /at-a-glance\n[64]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[65]: /white-papers\n[66]: /videos\n[67]: /blog\n[68]: /company\n[69]: /company\n[70]: /careers\n[71]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[72]: /search\n[73]: /demo\n[74]: /demo\n[75]: https://cyolo.io/contact-us\n[76]: /product\n[77]: /product\n[78]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[79]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[80]: /industries\n[81]: /company\n[82]: /company\n[83]: /careers\n[84]: /partners-program\n[85]: /resources\n[86]: /blog\n[87]: /press-releases\n[88]: /privacy-policy\n[89]: /cookie-policy\n[90]: /vulnerability-disclosure"
