            "url": "https://cyolo.io/case-studies/how-a-smart-energy-leader-ensures-secure-access",
            "text": "[ Product ][1]\n[ Solutions ][2]\n\n### By Challenge\n\nRemote Privileged Access for OT/ICS\n][3] [\nSecure Third-Party Access\n][4] [\nIT/OT Alignment\n][5] [\nRegulatory Compliance\n][6]\n\n### By Industry\n\nManufacturing\n][7] [\nEnergy & Utilities\n][8] [\nAI Data Centers\n][9] [\nAll Industries\n][10]\n[ Partners ][11]\nPartner Program\n][12] [\nPartner Ecosystem\n][13] [\nTechnology Integrations\n][14] [\nBecome a Partner\n][15]\n[ Resources ][16]\n\n### Resources\n\n[ See All Resources ][17]\nNews\n][18] [\nPress Releases\n][19] [\nUpcoming Events\n][20] [\nThird Party Reports\n][21] [\nCase Studies\n][22] [\nAt a Glances\n][23] [\nDatasheet\n][24] [\nWhite Papers\n][25] [\nVideos\n][26]\n\n### Featured content\n\nPress Release\n\n#### Cyolo Releases Powerful New Capabilities to Redefine Secure Remote Access for OT\n\n][27] [\nBlog\n\n#### Why VPNs Are a Poor Fit for Vendor Access in OT Manufacturing Environments\n\n][28] [\nWhite Paper\n\n#### The Paradox of Third-Party OT Access: The Surprising Benefits of Trusting Vendors Less\n\n][29] [\nThird Party Report\n\n#### 2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\n][30]\n[ Blog ][31]\n[ Company ][32]\nAbout Us\n][33] [\nCareers\n][34]\n[ Support ][35]\n[ Toggle Search ][36]\n[united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng\n[germany-flag.svg flag] De\n[spain-flag.svg flag] Spa\n[france-flag.svg flag] Fre\n[italy-flag.svg flag] Ita\n[ [united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng ][37] [ [germany-flag.svg flag] De ][38] [ [spain-flag.svg flag]\nSpa ][39] [ [france-flag.svg flag] Fre ][40] [ [italy-flag.svg flag] Ita ][41]\n[ Get a Demo ][42]\nClose Menu\n[ Product ][43]\n[ Solutions ][44]\n[ Remote Privileged Access for OT/ICS ][45] [ Third-Party Secure Access ][46] [ IT/OT Alignment\n][47] [ Regulatory Compliance ][48] [ Manufacturing ][49] [ Energy & Utilities ][50] [ Data Centers\n][51] [ All Industries ][52]\n[ Partners ][53]\n[ Partner Program ][54] [ Partner Ecosystem ][55] [ Technology Integrations ][56] [ Become a Partner\n][57]\n[ Resources ][58]\n[ News ][59] [ Press Releases ][60] [ Third-Party Reports ][61] [ Case Studies ][62] [ At a Glances\n][63] [ Datasheets ][64] [ White Papers ][65] [ Videos ][66]\n[ Blog ][67]\n[ Company ][68]\n[ About Us ][69] [ Careers ][70]\n[ Support ][71] [ Search Toggle Search ][72]\nCase Study\n][73]\n3 min read\n\n# How a Smart Energy Leader Ensures Secure Access to Over 150 Systems for Over 2000 Diverse Users\n\n[ Download as PDF ][74]\n[ Download as PDF ][75]\n[ Secure Remote Connectivity to Leverage Productivity ][76] [ Encrypted, Secure, Seamless Access for\nAll \u2014 From Any Device ][77] [ Global Implementation - 2000 Users, Over 150 Systems ][78]\n\n## Secure Remote Connectivity to Leverage Productivity\n\nA global leader in the field of smart energy was looking for a better secure remote access solution\nto provide access to a sensitive and internal application and to replace the existing virtual\nprivate network (VPN). It was crucial that the new solution would ensure access for employees as\nwell as third-party vendors, all without exposing the network and its assets to increased risk.\n\nTo improve productivity and more effectively leverage their remote workforce, the company wanted to\nenable their customer service and sales teams to securely access internal applications from\nanywhere, using any device \u2014 including unmanaged devices.\n\nThe required secure access solution had to include encryption, to address privacy concerns, and to\nensure easy implementation with minimal impact on users and business operations.\n\n### Challenges\n* Improve secure access for remote users\n* No encryption available\n* Internal access only\n\n### Requirements\n* A secure access solution for both on-site and remote users\n* Must secure managed and unmanaged devices\n* Simple and risk-free implementation\n* Enhanced security\n\n### Solution\n* Secure access for remote employees, partners, and suppliers - from any device\n* End-to-end encryption\n* Multi-factor authentication (MFA) and single sign-on (SSO)\n* Unique privileged access management (PAM) rights\n* Session recording and supervised access\n* Full integration with active directory\n* Contextual data to improve forensics and investigations\n* 10 minutes implementation and configuration process\n\n### Outcome\n* Global implementation\n* Secure access to over 150 systems\n* ~2000 diverse users\n* Complete visibility and control of access and usage\n* Improved user experience\n\n## Encrypted, Secure, Seamless Access for All \u2014 From Any Device\n\nCyolo was ultimately chosen to provide the company\u2019s mobile and remote workforce with safe and\nsecure access to sensitive and internal applications, replacing its existing VPN. Following a 10\nminute implementation and configuration process, the internal application system was published\nthrough the Cyolo broker, enabling access for all approved users without exposing the organizational\nnetwork.\n\nThe [Cyolo PRO (Privileged Remote Operations) access solution][79] was designed to enhance not just\nsecurity but also user experience, enabling smooth self-service user enrollment and user login.\nCyolo PRO integrated fully and seamlessly with the company\u2019s active directory, which automatically\nset the access authorizations. In addition, Cyolo PRO enforces multi-factor authentication (MFA) and\nduring onboarding, users are prompted with an MFA requirement. Following this verification, access\nis granted with a single sign-on (SSO) process.\n\nTo ensure secure external access, Cyolo PRO includes a protection layer that prevents malicious\nactors from exploiting any vulnerabilities to access data and reduces the risk of cyber-attacks.\nZero-trust access based on user and device identity also evaluates other factors that provide\ncontext to ensure dynamic, risk- based, accurate access. Cyolo PRO ensures security, agility and\nproductivity, without compromising business needs and without inconveniencing or imposing on users.\n\nCyolo PRO provides end-to-end encryption and at no stage is any data visible or stored on Cyolo\u2019s\ncloud broker. Instead, all sensitive data remains secure within the enterprise network. In addition,\nCyolo PRO extended unique privileged access management (PAM) rights to the company's administrators,\nwhile ensuring that sensitive data and assets remain safe, even in the case of a compromised admin\naccount. As remote work became the norm, the company expanded its use of Cyolo PRO to provide secure\nremote access for employees, partners and suppliers, including some using unmanaged devices.\n\n## Global Implementation - 2000 Users, Over 150 Systems\n\nCyolo PRO is currently deployed globally, providing ~2000 on-site and remote users, including\npartners and third parties, with fully encrypted secure access to over 150 applications and servers.\nAdmins have complete visibility and control, which they did not previously have. They also have the\nability to monitor every user and device that accesses their systems with real-time alerts. When an\nanomaly or threat is identified, the company havs all the data and tools needed to conduct\ncontext-based forensics and a fast response. As a global leader in its industry, the company has\nquickly and securely adapted its business to the new remote work model, reducing the risk of cyber\nthreats and maintaining business agility.\n\n### \u201cCyolo helped us to quickly adapt to a new reality of a remote workforce, with a hassle-free,\n### speedy global implementation. With diverse users, including third parties, we were able to\n### ensure productivity and maintain business continuity, without compromising our security.\u201d\n\n*- Company's CISO*\n\nMore Case Studies\n[See All Case Studies][80]\nCase Study\n\n#### How Lillehammer Municipality Improved the Security of its Water and Wastewater Operations\n\nRead More\n][81] [\n[Manufacturing facility producing chocolate]\nCase Study\n\n#### A Global Food Manufacturer\u2019s Journey to Scalable, Secure Remote Access\n\nRead More\n][82] [\n[Woman working on laptop in an automotive assembly plant]\nCase Study\n\n#### Modernizing Secure Remote Access for a Global Automotive Manufacturer\n\nRead More\n][83]\n\n##### Product Demo\n\n## See how the Cyolo PRO remote access solution works.\n\nEnsuring secure remote access to on-prem, isolated, and cloud-connected OT environments is easier\nthan you think. See for yourself.\n\n[ Request a Demo ][84]\nCyolo provides secure remote privileged access for cyber-physical systems and OT. Our solution\nenables industrial enterprises to connect employees and third-party vendors to critical assets in a\nway that's secure, safe, and surprisingly simple.\n\nGet in Touch: [**Contact Us**][85]\n\n###### [Product][86]\n\n[Product Overview][87]\n[Industrial Remote Privileged Access][88]\n[Third Party Secure Access][89]\n[Industries][90]\n\n###### [Company][91]\n\n[About Us][92]\n[Careers][93]\n[Partners][94]\n\n###### [Resources][95]\n\n[Blog][96]\n[Press Releases][97]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Cyolo LTD. All rights reserved.\n[Cyolo Privacy Policy][98] [Cookie Policy][99] [Vulnerability Disclosure Policy][100]\n\n[1]: /product\n[2]: #\n[3]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[4]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[5]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[6]: /regulatory-compliance\n[7]: /industries/manufacturing\n[8]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[9]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[10]: /industries\n[11]: #\n[12]: /partners-program\n[13]: /partner-ecosystem\n[14]: /technology-integrations\n[15]: /become-a-partner\n[16]: /resources\n[17]: /resources\n[18]: /news\n[19]: /press-releases\n[20]: /events\n[21]: /third-party-reports\n[22]: /case-studies\n[23]: /at-a-glance\n[24]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[25]: /white-papers\n[26]: /videos\n[27]: /press-releases/cyolo-releases-powerful-new-capabilities-to-redefine-secure-remote-access-for-\n[28]: /blog/why-vpns-are-a-poor-fit-for-vendor-access-in-ot-manufacturing-environments\n[29]: /white-papers/how-to-take-control-of-third-party-ot-access\n[30]: /third-party-reports/gartner-market-guide-for-cps-secure-remote-access-2026\n[31]: /blog\n[32]: /company\n[33]: /company\n[34]: /careers\n[35]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[36]: /search\n[37]: /\n[38]: /de\n[39]: /sp\n[40]: /fr\n[41]: /it\n[42]: /demo\n[43]: /product\n[44]: #\n[45]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[46]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[47]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[48]: /regulatory-compliance\n[49]: /industries/manufacturing\n[50]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[51]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[52]: /industries\n[53]: #\n[54]: /partners-program\n[55]: /partner-ecosystem\n[56]: /technology-integrations\n[57]: /become-a-partner\n[58]: /resources\n[59]: /news\n[60]: /press-releases\n[61]: /third-party-reports\n[62]: /case-studies\n[63]: /at-a-glance\n[64]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[65]: /white-papers\n[66]: /videos\n[67]: /blog\n[68]: /company\n[69]: /company\n[70]: /careers\n[71]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[72]: /search\n[73]: /case-studies\n[74]: https://f.hubspotusercontent40.net/hubfs/7608544/Case%20Studies/Cyolo%20Case%20Study%20Smart%2\n0Energy%20(1).pdf\n[75]: https://f.hubspotusercontent40.net/hubfs/7608544/Case%20Studies/Cyolo%20Case%20Study%20Smart%2\n0Energy%20(1).pdf\n[76]: #secure-remote-connectivity-to-leverage-productivity\n[77]: #encrypted-secure-seamless-access-for-all-from-any-device\n[78]: #global-implementation-2000-users-over-150-systems\n[79]: https://cyolo.io/product\n[80]: /case-studies\n[81]: /case-studies/how-lillehammer-municipality-improved-the-security-of-its-water-and-wastewater-o\nperations\n[82]: /case-studies/global-food-manufacturers-journey-to-scalable-secure-remote-access\n[83]: /case-studies/modernizing-secure-remote-access-for-a-global-automotive-manufacturer\n[84]: /demo\n[85]: https://cyolo.io/contact-us\n[86]: /product\n[87]: /product\n[88]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[89]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[90]: /industries\n[91]: /company\n[92]: /company\n[93]: /careers\n[94]: /partners-program\n[95]: /resources\n[96]: /blog\n[97]: /press-releases\n[98]: /privacy-policy\n[99]: /cookie-policy\n[100]: /vulnerability-disclosure"
