            "url": "https://cyolo.io/case-studies/how-italian-manufacturer-maddalena-modernized-secure-remote-access-while-cutting-costs-by-70",
            "text": "[ Product ][1]\n[ Solutions ][2]\n\n### By Challenge\n\nRemote Privileged Access for OT/ICS\n][3] [\nSecure Third-Party Access\n][4] [\nIT/OT Alignment\n][5] [\nRegulatory Compliance\n][6]\n\n### By Industry\n\nManufacturing\n][7] [\nEnergy & Utilities\n][8] [\nAI Data Centers\n][9] [\nAll Industries\n][10]\n[ Partners ][11]\nPartner Program\n][12] [\nPartner Ecosystem\n][13] [\nTechnology Integrations\n][14] [\nBecome a Partner\n][15]\n[ Resources ][16]\n\n### Resources\n\n[ See All Resources ][17]\nNews\n][18] [\nPress Releases\n][19] [\nUpcoming Events\n][20] [\nThird Party Reports\n][21] [\nCase Studies\n][22] [\nAt a Glances\n][23] [\nDatasheet\n][24] [\nWhite Papers\n][25] [\nVideos\n][26]\n\n### Featured content\n\nPress Release\n\n#### Cyolo Releases Powerful New Capabilities to Redefine Secure Remote Access for OT\n\n][27] [\nBlog\n\n#### Why VPNs Are a Poor Fit for Vendor Access in OT Manufacturing Environments\n\n][28] [\nWhite Paper\n\n#### The Paradox of Third-Party OT Access: The Surprising Benefits of Trusting Vendors Less\n\n][29] [\nThird Party Report\n\n#### 2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\n][30]\n[ Blog ][31]\n[ Company ][32]\nAbout Us\n][33] [\nCareers\n][34]\n[ Support ][35]\n[ Toggle Search ][36]\n[united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng\n[germany-flag.svg flag] De\n[spain-flag.svg flag] Spa\n[france-flag.svg flag] Fre\n[italy-flag.svg flag] Ita\n[ [united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng ][37] [ [germany-flag.svg flag] De ][38] [ [spain-flag.svg flag]\nSpa ][39] [ [france-flag.svg flag] Fre ][40] [ [italy-flag.svg flag] Ita ][41]\n[ Get a Demo ][42]\nClose Menu\n[ Product ][43]\n[ Solutions ][44]\n[ Remote Privileged Access for OT/ICS ][45] [ Third-Party Secure Access ][46] [ IT/OT Alignment\n][47] [ Regulatory Compliance ][48] [ Manufacturing ][49] [ Energy & Utilities ][50] [ Data Centers\n][51] [ All Industries ][52]\n[ Partners ][53]\n[ Partner Program ][54] [ Partner Ecosystem ][55] [ Technology Integrations ][56] [ Become a Partner\n][57]\n[ Resources ][58]\n[ News ][59] [ Press Releases ][60] [ Third-Party Reports ][61] [ Case Studies ][62] [ At a Glances\n][63] [ Datasheets ][64] [ White Papers ][65] [ Videos ][66]\n[ Blog ][67]\n[ Company ][68]\n[ About Us ][69] [ Careers ][70]\n[ Support ][71] [ Search Toggle Search ][72]\nCase Study\n][73]\n4 min read\n\n# How Italian Manufacturer Maddalena Modernized Secure Remote Access While Cutting Costs by 70%\n\n[ Download as PDF ][74]\n[ Download as PDF ][75]\n[ Transforming Remote Access at One of Europe\u2019s Leading Industrial Manufacturers ][76] [ The\nChallenge: Fragmented Access, Rising Costs, Limited Visibility ][77] [ The Goal: Enable Flexible,\nSecure Access for a Growing Ecosystem of Users ][78] [ The Cyolo Solution: Secured Identity-Based\nAccess with Full Visibility and Control ][79] [ Results: 70% Cost Savings, 100% Boost in IT\nProductivity, Instant Vendor Access ][80] [ Why Cyolo: Better Security, Enhanced Operational\nAgility, Improved Productivity ][81] [ A New Standard for Secure Industrial Access ][82] [ About\nCyolo ][83]\n\n## Transforming Remote Access at One of Europe\u2019s Leading Industrial Manufacturers\n\nMaddalena S.p.A., a century-old European leader in smart metering solutions for water and thermal\nenergy, set out to modernize and secure its remote access infrastructure as part of a broader\ndigital transformation strategy.\n\nWith critical operations reliant on third-party vendors and remote users, the company faced growing\nchallenges around credentials management, access visibility, and operational inefficiencies. High\ncosts and the limitations of their prior privileged access management (PAM) system hindered\nflexibility and productivity.\n\nTo address these issues, Maddalena partnered with cybersecurity innovator Cyolo and implementation\npartner Factor-y to deploy a modern secure access solution designed to both meet current operational\nneeds and support future growth.\n\n## The Challenge: Fragmented Access, Rising Costs, Limited Visibility\n\nMaddalena\u2019s previous access infrastructure relied heavily on manual processes and outdated tooling.\nThe traditional PAM solution in use was rigid, difficult to manage, and ultimately underutilized by\ninternal teams.\n\nKey concerns included:\n* Excessive time required to configure and manage temporary access\n* No centralized visibility into access sessions\n* High operational risk from unmanaged credentials\n* Poor vendor user experience\n* Disproportionate costs relative to usage\n\nThe company had previously deployed another solution that failed to meet expectations. That platform\nlacked the flexibility required for day-to-day operations and provided minimal support. According to\nAntonio Taverna, IT Specialist at Maddalena, \u201cHad we been forced to accept the initial cost of a\nstandard enterprise solution, we wouldn\u2019t have even started the project.\u201d\n\n## The Goal: Enable Flexible, Secure Access for a Growing Ecosystem of Users\n\nMaddalena\u2019s IT team defined three key outcomes:\n* Centralize and automate remote access and vendor onboarding\n* Improve visibility and control over third-party connections\n* Reduce operational risk, improve user experience, and cut costs\n\nIn addition, the solution had to support seamless scalability as the company modernized its\ninfrastructure and operations and also to ensure continued compliance with ISO 27001 and the NIS2\nDirective.\n\n## The Cyolo Solution: Secured Identity-Based Access with Full Visibility and Control\n\nCyolo partnered with Factor-y to implement secure remote access rooted in an identity-based\narchitecture.\n\nKey components of the deployment included:\n* Identity-based access control tied to Microsoft Entra ID.\n* Fine-grained policy enforcement by role, time, location, and system\n* Real-time session visibility and audit trails\n* Single sign-on (SSO) and multi-factor authentication (MFA) for both internal and external users\n* Secure, self-service workflows for temporary vendor access\n\nThe [Cyolo PRO (Privileged Remote Operations) solution][84] gave Maddalena the ability to provision\nand revoke access in minutes, without compromising on security or requiring complex manual\nprocesses.\n\n## Results: 70% Cost Savings, 100% Boost in IT Productivity, Instant Vendor Access\n\nThe impact of adopting Cyolo PRO was immediate and measurable:\n* 100% increase in IT team productivity through centralized access workflows\n* 80% reduction in time to configure temporary access\n* 70% drop in operational costs for remote access\n* 100% improvement in perceived IT support quality (internal & vendor)\n* Drastic reduction in onboarding time \u2014 from days to minutes\n* Full control and visibility over all access sessions\n\n### \u201cThis solution fully met our expectations. We gained security, flexibility, and economic\n### sustainability \u2014 all within a single platform.\u201d\n\n- Antonio Taverna, IT Specialist\n\n## Why Cyolo: Better Security, Enhanced Operational Agility, Improved Productivity\n\nCyolo PRO\u2019s unique decentralized architecture gave Maddalena a flexible platform with no vendor\nlock-in, no shared infrastructure risks, and no compromises on speed or user experience. Unlike\ntraditional remote access tools, Cyolo PRO offers a true zero-trust model where no credentials or\nsessions are stored in the cloud or with the vendor.\n\nFactor-y, acting as both consultant and integration partner, helped bridge Maddalena\u2019s business\nneeds with Cyolo\u2019s modern security capabilities. Together, they delivered a new model of access\ngovernance that combines:\n* Flexibility and self-service\n* Regulatory readiness and full auditability\n* A scalable framework for future growth\n\n## A New Standard for Secure Industrial Access\n\nMaddalena is now positioned for the future, with secure remote access that enables both IT and OT\nuse cases, seamless onboarding of vendors, and full visibility across all access events.\n\nWith Cyolo, Maddalena has laid the foundation for a more secure and scalable digital future.\n\n## About Cyolo\n\nCyolo provides secure remote privileged access for cyber-physical systems (CPS). Our solution\nenables industrial enterprises to simply connect employees and third-party vendors to critical\nassets.\n\nCyolo delivers improved security, productivity, and operational agility \u2013 without compromise.\n\nTo learn more, [request a demo][85].\n\nMore Case Studies\n[See All Case Studies][86]\nCase Study\n\n#### Video: Why Tata Chemicals Calls the Cyolo Remote Access Solution a Gamechanger\n\nRead More\n][87] [\nCase Study\n\n#### How Rapac Energy Saved Weeks of Work Securing Its OT & SCADA Systems With Cyolo\n\nRead More\n][88] [\nCase Study\n\n#### How a Smart Energy Leader Ensures Secure Access to Over 150 Systems for Over 2000 Diverse Users\n\nRead More\n][89]\n\n##### Product Demo\n\n## See how the Cyolo PRO remote access solution works.\n\nEnsuring secure remote access to on-prem, isolated, and cloud-connected OT environments is easier\nthan you think. See for yourself.\n\n[ Request a Demo ][90]\nCyolo provides secure remote privileged access for cyber-physical systems and OT. Our solution\nenables industrial enterprises to connect employees and third-party vendors to critical assets in a\nway that's secure, safe, and surprisingly simple.\n\nGet in Touch: [**Contact Us**][91]\n\n###### [Product][92]\n\n[Product Overview][93]\n[Industrial Remote Privileged Access][94]\n[Third Party Secure Access][95]\n[Industries][96]\n\n###### [Company][97]\n\n[About Us][98]\n[Careers][99]\n[Partners][100]\n\n###### [Resources][101]\n\n[Blog][102]\n[Press Releases][103]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Cyolo LTD. All rights reserved.\n[Cyolo Privacy Policy][104] [Cookie Policy][105] [Vulnerability Disclosure Policy][106]\n\n[1]: /product\n[2]: #\n[3]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[4]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[5]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[6]: /regulatory-compliance\n[7]: /industries/manufacturing\n[8]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[9]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[10]: /industries\n[11]: #\n[12]: /partners-program\n[13]: /partner-ecosystem\n[14]: /technology-integrations\n[15]: /become-a-partner\n[16]: /resources\n[17]: /resources\n[18]: /news\n[19]: /press-releases\n[20]: /events\n[21]: /third-party-reports\n[22]: /case-studies\n[23]: /at-a-glance\n[24]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[25]: /white-papers\n[26]: /videos\n[27]: /press-releases/cyolo-releases-powerful-new-capabilities-to-redefine-secure-remote-access-for-\n[28]: /blog/why-vpns-are-a-poor-fit-for-vendor-access-in-ot-manufacturing-environments\n[29]: /white-papers/how-to-take-control-of-third-party-ot-access\n[30]: /third-party-reports/gartner-market-guide-for-cps-secure-remote-access-2026\n[31]: /blog\n[32]: /company\n[33]: /company\n[34]: /careers\n[35]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[36]: /search\n[37]: /\n[38]: /de\n[39]: /sp\n[40]: /fr\n[41]: /it\n[42]: /demo\n[43]: /product\n[44]: #\n[45]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[46]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[47]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[48]: /regulatory-compliance\n[49]: /industries/manufacturing\n[50]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[51]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[52]: /industries\n[53]: #\n[54]: /partners-program\n[55]: /partner-ecosystem\n[56]: /technology-integrations\n[57]: /become-a-partner\n[58]: /resources\n[59]: /news\n[60]: /press-releases\n[61]: /third-party-reports\n[62]: /case-studies\n[63]: /at-a-glance\n[64]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[65]: /white-papers\n[66]: /videos\n[67]: /blog\n[68]: /company\n[69]: /company\n[70]: /careers\n[71]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[72]: /search\n[73]: /case-studies\n[74]: https://info.cyolo.io/hubfs/Case%20Studies/How%20Maddalena%20Modernized%20Secure%20Remote%20Ac\ncess%20While%20Cutting%20Costs.pdf\n[75]: https://info.cyolo.io/hubfs/Case%20Studies/How%20Maddalena%20Modernized%20Secure%20Remote%20Ac\ncess%20While%20Cutting%20Costs.pdf\n[76]: #transforming-remote-access-at-one-of-europes-leading-industrial-manufacturers\n[77]: #the-challenge-fragmented-access-rising-costs-limited-visibility\n[78]: #the-goal-enable-flexible-secure-access-for-a-growing-ecosystem-of-users\n[79]: #the-cyolo-solution-secured-identity-based-access-with-full-visibility-and-control\n[80]: #r"
