            "text": "[ Product ][1]\n[ Solutions ][2]\n\n### By Challenge\n\nRemote Privileged Access for OT/ICS\n][3] [\nSecure Third-Party Access\n][4] [\nIT/OT Alignment\n][5] [\nRegulatory Compliance\n][6]\n\n### By Industry\n\nManufacturing\n][7] [\nEnergy & Utilities\n][8] [\nAI Data Centers\n][9] [\nAll Industries\n][10]\n[ Partners ][11]\nPartner Program\n][12] [\nPartner Ecosystem\n][13] [\nTechnology Integrations\n][14] [\nBecome a Partner\n][15]\n[ Resources ][16]\n\n### Resources\n\n[ See All Resources ][17]\nNews\n][18] [\nPress Releases\n][19] [\nUpcoming Events\n][20] [\nThird Party Reports\n][21] [\nCase Studies\n][22] [\nAt a Glances\n][23] [\nDatasheet\n][24] [\nWhite Papers\n][25] [\nVideos\n][26]\n\n### Featured content\n\nPress Release\n\n#### Cyolo Releases Powerful New Capabilities to Redefine Secure Remote Access for OT\n\n][27] [\nBlog\n\n#### Why VPNs Are a Poor Fit for Vendor Access in OT Manufacturing Environments\n\n][28] [\nWhite Paper\n\n#### The Paradox of Third-Party OT Access: The Surprising Benefits of Trusting Vendors Less\n\n][29] [\nThird Party Report\n\n#### 2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\n][30]\n[ Blog ][31]\n[ Company ][32]\nAbout Us\n][33] [\nCareers\n][34]\n[ Support ][35]\n[ Toggle Search ][36]\n[united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng\n[germany-flag.svg flag] De\n[spain-flag.svg flag] Spa\n[france-flag.svg flag] Fre\n[italy-flag.svg flag] Ita\n[ [united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng ][37] [ [germany-flag.svg flag] De ][38] [ [spain-flag.svg flag]\nSpa ][39] [ [france-flag.svg flag] Fre ][40] [ [italy-flag.svg flag] Ita ][41]\n[ Get a Demo ][42]\nClose Menu\n[ Product ][43]\n[ Solutions ][44]\n[ Remote Privileged Access for OT/ICS ][45] [ Third-Party Secure Access ][46] [ IT/OT Alignment\n][47] [ Regulatory Compliance ][48] [ Manufacturing ][49] [ Energy & Utilities ][50] [ Data Centers\n][51] [ All Industries ][52]\n[ Partners ][53]\n[ Partner Program ][54] [ Partner Ecosystem ][55] [ Technology Integrations ][56] [ Become a Partner\n][57]\n[ Resources ][58]\n[ News ][59] [ Press Releases ][60] [ Third-Party Reports ][61] [ Case Studies ][62] [ At a Glances\n][63] [ Datasheets ][64] [ White Papers ][65] [ Videos ][66]\n[ Blog ][67]\n[ Company ][68]\n[ About Us ][69] [ Careers ][70]\n[ Support ][71] [ Search Toggle Search ][72]\nCase Study\n][73]\n2 min read\n\n# Video: How Tata Chemicals Securely Connects Third-Party Vendors to Critical OT Resources\n\nTata Chemicals is a trona ore mining and processing company based in southwest Wyoming. The Tata\nteam turned to Cyolo to help ensure that external vendors and contractors could remotely access\ncritical operational technology (OT) without increasing the risk of a data breach.\n\nWatch this short case study video to discover how Tata Chemicals uses the [Cyolo PRO remote access\nsolution][74] to securely grant and oversee third-party access to internal systems, programmable\nlogic controllers (PLCs), and other sensitive systems and equipment.\n\n### Video Transcript\n\n**McKay Smith, IT Manager, Tata Chemicals: **So, one of the primary focuses that we had was on\nsecuring external access into our networks and making sure that we don't have a data breach from an\noutside source. We use Cyolo to help us with that through remote access. We can ensure that we have\nzero trust access as well as multi-factor authentication, and that has helped us secure a big hole\nthat we had.\n\nSo we use Cyolo to grant and to monitor vendor [and] contractor access to our internal systems,\ndata, PLCs, all those kind of things that they need to access. And one of the nice things about\nCyolo is that we can record sessions, we can ask for manager approval in order to allow those people\nin. Everyone knows when they're accessing any of our resources and it's all approved. Those features\nhave made Cyolo a gamechanger for us.\n\n**Gibson Mark, Senior Systems Administrator, Tata Chemicals:** Cyolo allows us to limit access to\nboth internal and third party users through the policies and connections within the platform itself.\nSo we're able to very easily restrict users or groups of users to the specific systems, ports, and\nprotocols that they need to access without having to set up a bunch of complex firewall rules or\nroutes or application filters. It gives us a single place to manage all of these connections within\nthe Cyolo platform itself.\n\nThe importance of authentication and access control is critical in in any organization. It's the\nfirst line of defense, so to speak, to the sensitive systems and data in your organization. So to be\nable to properly secure that with our environment is something that we're very happy to be able to\ndo with Cyolo.\n\n### Discover the Benefits of Cyolo PRO (Privileged Remote Operations)\n\n[ Watch the video ][75]\n\n## Subscribe to Our Newsletter\n\nMore Case Studies\n[See All Case Studies][76]\nCase Study\n\n#### How Lillehammer Municipality Improved the Security of its Water and Wastewater Operations\n\nRead More\n][77] [\n[Manufacturing facility producing chocolate]\nCase Study\n\n#### A Global Food Manufacturer\u2019s Journey to Scalable, Secure Remote Access\n\nRead More\n][78] [\n[Woman working on laptop in an automotive assembly plant]\nCase Study\n\n#### Modernizing Secure Remote Access for a Global Automotive Manufacturer\n\nRead More\n][79]\n\n##### Product Demo\n\n## See how the Cyolo PRO remote access solution works.\n\nEnsuring secure remote access to on-prem, isolated, and cloud-connected OT environments is easier\nthan you think. See for yourself.\n\n[ Request a Demo ][80]\nCyolo provides secure remote privileged access for cyber-physical systems and OT. Our solution\nenables industrial enterprises to connect employees and third-party vendors to critical assets in a\nway that's secure, safe, and surprisingly simple.\n\nGet in Touch: [**Contact Us**][81]\n\n###### [Product][82]\n\n[Product Overview][83]\n[Industrial Remote Privileged Access][84]\n[Third Party Secure Access][85]\n[Industries][86]\n\n###### [Company][87]\n\n[About Us][88]\n[Careers][89]\n[Partners][90]\n\n###### [Resources][91]\n\n[Blog][92]\n[Press Releases][93]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Cyolo LTD. All rights reserved.\n[Cyolo Privacy Policy][94] [Cookie Policy][95] [Vulnerability Disclosure Policy][96]\n\n[1]: /product\n[2]: #\n[3]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[4]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[5]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[6]: /regulatory-compliance\n[7]: /industries/manufacturing\n[8]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[9]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[10]: /industries\n[11]: #\n[12]: /partners-program\n[13]: /partner-ecosystem\n[14]: /technology-integrations\n[15]: /become-a-partner\n[16]: /resources\n[17]: /resources\n[18]: /news\n[19]: /press-releases\n[20]: /events\n[21]: /third-party-reports\n[22]: /case-studies\n[23]: /at-a-glance\n[24]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[25]: /white-papers\n[26]: /videos\n[27]: /press-releases/cyolo-releases-powerful-new-capabilities-to-redefine-secure-remote-access-for-\n[28]: /blog/why-vpns-are-a-poor-fit-for-vendor-access-in-ot-manufacturing-environments\n[29]: /white-papers/how-to-take-control-of-third-party-ot-access\n[30]: /third-party-reports/gartner-market-guide-for-cps-secure-remote-access-2026\n[31]: /blog\n[32]: /company\n[33]: /company\n[34]: /careers\n[35]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[36]: /search\n[37]: /\n[38]: /de\n[39]: /sp\n[40]: /fr\n[41]: /it\n[42]: /demo\n[43]: /product\n[44]: #\n[45]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[46]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[47]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[48]: /regulatory-compliance\n[49]: /industries/manufacturing\n[50]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[51]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[52]: /industries\n[53]: #\n[54]: /partners-program\n[55]: /partner-ecosystem\n[56]: /technology-integrations\n[57]: /become-a-partner\n[58]: /resources\n[59]: /news\n[60]: /press-releases\n[61]: /third-party-reports\n[62]: /case-studies\n[63]: /at-a-glance\n[64]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[65]: /white-papers\n[66]: /videos\n[67]: /blog\n[68]: /company\n[69]: /company\n[70]: /careers\n[71]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[72]: /search\n[73]: /case-studies\n[74]: https://cyolo.io/product\n[75]: /videos/cyolo-pro-lets-simplify-remote-privileged-access-together\n[76]: /case-studies\n[77]: /case-studies/how-lillehammer-municipality-improved-the-security-of-its-water-and-wastewater-o\nperations\n[78]: /case-studies/global-food-manufacturers-journey-to-scalable-secure-remote-access\n[79]: /case-studies/modernizing-secure-remote-access-for-a-global-automotive-manufacturer\n[80]: /demo\n[81]: https://cyolo.io/contact-us\n[82]: /product\n[83]: /product\n[84]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[85]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[86]: /industries\n[87]: /company\n[88]: /company\n[89]: /careers\n[90]: /partners-program\n[91]: /resources\n[92]: /blog\n[93]: /press-releases\n[94]: /privacy-policy\n[95]: /cookie-policy\n[96]: /vulnerability-disclosure"
