            "url": "https://cyolo.io/case-studies/tata-chemicals-secure-remote-access-employees-vendors",
            "text": "[ Product ][1]\n[ Solutions ][2]\n\n### By Challenge\n\nRemote Privileged Access for OT/ICS\n][3] [\nSecure Third-Party Access\n][4] [\nIT/OT Alignment\n][5] [\nRegulatory Compliance\n][6]\n\n### By Industry\n\nManufacturing\n][7] [\nEnergy & Utilities\n][8] [\nAI Data Centers\n][9] [\nAll Industries\n][10]\n[ Partners ][11]\nPartner Program\n][12] [\nPartner Ecosystem\n][13] [\nTechnology Integrations\n][14] [\nBecome a Partner\n][15]\n[ Resources ][16]\n\n### Resources\n\n[ See All Resources ][17]\nNews\n][18] [\nPress Releases\n][19] [\nUpcoming Events\n][20] [\nThird Party Reports\n][21] [\nCase Studies\n][22] [\nAt a Glances\n][23] [\nDatasheet\n][24] [\nWhite Papers\n][25] [\nVideos\n][26]\n\n### Featured content\n\nPress Release\n\n#### Cyolo Releases Powerful New Capabilities to Redefine Secure Remote Access for OT\n\n][27] [\nBlog\n\n#### Why VPNs Are a Poor Fit for Vendor Access in OT Manufacturing Environments\n\n][28] [\nWhite Paper\n\n#### The Paradox of Third-Party OT Access: The Surprising Benefits of Trusting Vendors Less\n\n][29] [\nThird Party Report\n\n#### 2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\n][30]\n[ Blog ][31]\n[ Company ][32]\nAbout Us\n][33] [\nCareers\n][34]\n[ Support ][35]\n[ Toggle Search ][36]\n[united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng\n[germany-flag.svg flag] De\n[spain-flag.svg flag] Spa\n[france-flag.svg flag] Fre\n[italy-flag.svg flag] Ita\n[ [united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng ][37] [ [germany-flag.svg flag] De ][38] [ [spain-flag.svg flag]\nSpa ][39] [ [france-flag.svg flag] Fre ][40] [ [italy-flag.svg flag] Ita ][41]\n[ Get a Demo ][42]\nClose Menu\n[ Product ][43]\n[ Solutions ][44]\n[ Remote Privileged Access for OT/ICS ][45] [ Third-Party Secure Access ][46] [ IT/OT Alignment\n][47] [ Regulatory Compliance ][48] [ Manufacturing ][49] [ Energy & Utilities ][50] [ Data Centers\n][51] [ All Industries ][52]\n[ Partners ][53]\n[ Partner Program ][54] [ Partner Ecosystem ][55] [ Technology Integrations ][56] [ Become a Partner\n][57]\n[ Resources ][58]\n[ News ][59] [ Press Releases ][60] [ Third-Party Reports ][61] [ Case Studies ][62] [ At a Glances\n][63] [ Datasheets ][64] [ White Papers ][65] [ Videos ][66]\n[ Blog ][67]\n[ Company ][68]\n[ About Us ][69] [ Careers ][70]\n[ Support ][71] [ Search Toggle Search ][72]\nCase Study\n][73]\n3 min read\n\n# Video: How Tata Chemicals Strengthens Access and Authentication Controls for All Types of Users\n\nLooking to enforce access and authentication controls for employees as well as third-party vendors,\ntechnicians, and contractors?\n\nThis short case study video explores how the team at Tata Chemicals, a mining and processing company\nlocated in rural Wyoming, is augmenting their VPN with secure remote access from Cyolo \u2014 and\nachieving fantastic results in terms of both security and productivity.\n\n### Video Transcript\n\n**McKay Smith, IT Manager, Tata Chemicals:** As we have worked through mitigating risk in our\ncybersecurity roadmap, Cyolo has helped us take care of remote access and ensuring that anyone that\naccesses our networks is working within the framework that we have set up \u2014 and Cyolo has helped us\ndo that.\n\n**Gibson Mark, Senior Systems Administrator, Tata Chemicals**: Before, we were relying primarily on\nour Cisco AnyConnect VPN for remote access. And it was functional for that purpose, but it was a lot\nof overhead to maintain and to keep those connections secure, especially when dealing with remote\naccess for vendors, where you would have to set up a unique policy and account and an ACL for every\nsingle type of remote access concerning a vendor. It was just a lot of overhead and maintenance, and\nit took a lot of effort to keep that secure over a long period of time.\n\n**Smith:** So, first and foremost, it was MFA, which we use in conjunction with our VPN to ensure\nthat there's multi-factor authentication for remote access. Furthermore, they implemented zero-trust\naccess to allow access into our OT networks as well. And that was implemented at the DMZ level and\nhelped secure access to OT networks for vendors and employees as well.\n\n**Mark:** Tata Chemicals has benefited a great deal from Cyolo\u2019s platform. We're able to more easily\nprovide remote access to systems to both to internal users and external users. The management\noverhead of all of these remote access connections has been greatly reduced. The ease of use of the\nremote access has been increased for both third party individuals and for our internal employees as\nwell. The adoption rates of these secure remote access methods has gone up substantially since we\nimplemented Cyolo, so it's worked very well for us.\n\n**Smith:** The ultimate result is that we now are able to have secure remote access for employees,\ncontractors,and vendors. We know when they come into our networks, we know what they're going to\naccess, we can go back and review those sessions and determine if they're doing what we authorized\nthem to do. And so now we have confidence that all those different groups are accessing when, where\nand what we've really outlined in that agreement.\n\n[ Cyolo Named in 2024 Gartner\u00ae Hype Cycle\u2122 for Cyber-Physical Systems Security ][74]\n\n## Subscribe to Our Newsletter\n\nMore Case Studies\n[See All Case Studies][75]\nCase Study\n\n#### How Lillehammer Municipality Improved the Security of its Water and Wastewater Operations\n\nRead More\n][76] [\n[Manufacturing facility producing chocolate]\nCase Study\n\n#### A Global Food Manufacturer\u2019s Journey to Scalable, Secure Remote Access\n\nRead More\n][77] [\n[Woman working on laptop in an automotive assembly plant]\nCase Study\n\n#### Modernizing Secure Remote Access for a Global Automotive Manufacturer\n\nRead More\n][78]\n\n##### Product Demo\n\n## See how the Cyolo PRO remote access solution works.\n\nEnsuring secure remote access to on-prem, isolated, and cloud-connected OT environments is easier\nthan you think. See for yourself.\n\n[ Request a Demo ][79]\nCyolo provides secure remote privileged access for cyber-physical systems and OT. Our solution\nenables industrial enterprises to connect employees and third-party vendors to critical assets in a\nway that's secure, safe, and surprisingly simple.\n\nGet in Touch: [**Contact Us**][80]\n\n###### [Product][81]\n\n[Product Overview][82]\n[Industrial Remote Privileged Access][83]\n[Third Party Secure Access][84]\n[Industries][85]\n\n###### [Company][86]\n\n[About Us][87]\n[Careers][88]\n[Partners][89]\n\n###### [Resources][90]\n\n[Blog][91]\n[Press Releases][92]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Cyolo LTD. All rights reserved.\n[Cyolo Privacy Policy][93] [Cookie Policy][94] [Vulnerability Disclosure Policy][95]\n\n[1]: /product\n[2]: #\n[3]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[4]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[5]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[6]: /regulatory-compliance\n[7]: /industries/manufacturing\n[8]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[9]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[10]: /industries\n[11]: #\n[12]: /partners-program\n[13]: /partner-ecosystem\n[14]: /technology-integrations\n[15]: /become-a-partner\n[16]: /resources\n[17]: /resources\n[18]: /news\n[19]: /press-releases\n[20]: /events\n[21]: /third-party-reports\n[22]: /case-studies\n[23]: /at-a-glance\n[24]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[25]: /white-papers\n[26]: /videos\n[27]: /press-releases/cyolo-releases-powerful-new-capabilities-to-redefine-secure-remote-access-for-\n[28]: /blog/why-vpns-are-a-poor-fit-for-vendor-access-in-ot-manufacturing-environments\n[29]: /white-papers/how-to-take-control-of-third-party-ot-access\n[30]: /third-party-reports/gartner-market-guide-for-cps-secure-remote-access-2026\n[31]: /blog\n[32]: /company\n[33]: /company\n[34]: /careers\n[35]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[36]: /search\n[37]: /\n[38]: /de\n[39]: /sp\n[40]: /fr\n[41]: /it\n[42]: /demo\n[43]: /product\n[44]: #\n[45]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[46]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[47]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[48]: /regulatory-compliance\n[49]: /industries/manufacturing\n[50]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[51]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[52]: /industries\n[53]: #\n[54]: /partners-program\n[55]: /partner-ecosystem\n[56]: /technology-integrations\n[57]: /become-a-partner\n[58]: /resources\n[59]: /news\n[60]: /press-releases\n[61]: /third-party-reports\n[62]: /case-studies\n[63]: /at-a-glance\n[64]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[65]: /white-papers\n[66]: /videos\n[67]: /blog\n[68]: /company\n[69]: /company\n[70]: /careers\n[71]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[72]: /search\n[73]: /case-studies\n[74]: /third-party-reports/2025-gartner-hype-cycle-cyber-physical-systems-security\n[75]: /case-studies\n[76]: /case-studies/how-lillehammer-municipality-improved-the-security-of-its-water-and-wastewater-o\nperations\n[77]: /case-studies/global-food-manufacturers-journey-to-scalable-secure-remote-access\n[78]: /case-studies/modernizing-secure-remote-access-for-a-global-automotive-manufacturer\n[79]: /demo\n[80]: https://cyolo.io/contact-us\n[81]: /product\n[82]: /product\n[83]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[84]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[85]: /industries\n[86]: /company\n[87]: /company\n[88]: /careers\n[89]: /partners-program\n[90]: /resources\n[91]: /blog\n[92]: /press-releases\n[93]: /privacy-policy\n[94]: /cookie-policy\n[95]: /vulnerability-disclosure"
