            "text": "[ Product ][1]\n[ Solutions ][2]\n\n### By Challenge\n\nRemote Privileged Access for OT/ICS\n][3] [\nSecure Third-Party Access\n][4] [\nIT/OT Alignment\n][5] [\nRegulatory Compliance\n][6]\n\n### By Industry\n\nManufacturing\n][7] [\nEnergy & Utilities\n][8] [\nAI Data Centers\n][9] [\nAll Industries\n][10]\n[ Partners ][11]\nPartner Program\n][12] [\nPartner Ecosystem\n][13] [\nTechnology Integrations\n][14] [\nBecome a Partner\n][15]\n[ Resources ][16]\n\n### Resources\n\n[ See All Resources ][17]\nNews\n][18] [\nPress Releases\n][19] [\nUpcoming Events\n][20] [\nThird Party Reports\n][21] [\nCase Studies\n][22] [\nAt a Glances\n][23] [\nDatasheet\n][24] [\nWhite Papers\n][25] [\nVideos\n][26]\n\n### Featured content\n\nPress Release\n\n#### Cyolo Releases Powerful New Capabilities to Redefine Secure Remote Access for OT\n\n][27] [\nBlog\n\n#### Why VPNs Are a Poor Fit for Vendor Access in OT Manufacturing Environments\n\n][28] [\nWhite Paper\n\n#### The Paradox of Third-Party OT Access: The Surprising Benefits of Trusting Vendors Less\n\n][29] [\nThird Party Report\n\n#### 2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\n][30]\n[ Blog ][31]\n[ Company ][32]\nAbout Us\n][33] [\nCareers\n][34]\n[ Support ][35]\n[ Toggle Search ][36]\n[united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng\n[germany-flag.svg flag] De\n[spain-flag.svg flag] Spa\n[france-flag.svg flag] Fre\n[italy-flag.svg flag] Ita\n[ [united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng ][37] [ [germany-flag.svg flag] De ][38] [ [spain-flag.svg flag]\nSpa ][39] [ [france-flag.svg flag] Fre ][40] [ [italy-flag.svg flag] Ita ][41]\n[ Get a Demo ][42]\nClose Menu\n[ Product ][43]\n[ Solutions ][44]\n[ Remote Privileged Access for OT/ICS ][45] [ Third-Party Secure Access ][46] [ IT/OT Alignment\n][47] [ Regulatory Compliance ][48] [ Manufacturing ][49] [ Energy & Utilities ][50] [ Data Centers\n][51] [ All Industries ][52]\n[ Partners ][53]\n[ Partner Program ][54] [ Partner Ecosystem ][55] [ Technology Integrations ][56] [ Become a Partner\n][57]\n[ Resources ][58]\n[ News ][59] [ Press Releases ][60] [ Third-Party Reports ][61] [ Case Studies ][62] [ At a Glances\n][63] [ Datasheets ][64] [ White Papers ][65] [ Videos ][66]\n[ Blog ][67]\n[ Company ][68]\n[ About Us ][69] [ Careers ][70]\n[ Support ][71] [ Search Toggle Search ][72]\nCase Study\n][73]\n3 min read\n\n# Video: Why Tata Chemicals Calls the Cyolo Remote Access Solution a Gamechanger\n\nTata Chemicals is a trona ore mining and processing company based in southwest Wyoming. Tata\noperates OT and IT networks and must ensure secure remote access to both for employees as well as\nexternal users.\n\nThis case study video examines why the Tata team chose the [Cyolo PRO remote access solution][74]\nand highlights the features IT Manager McKay Smith describes as \"a gamechanger.\"\n\n### Video Transcript\n\n**McKay Smith, IT Manager, Tata Chemicals:** Part of the reason that we engaged Cyolo was to work\nthrough a cybersecurity roadmap. We have a number of use cases that are maybe a little bit outside\nthe box, especially in an industrial environment. We have OT networks, which are operational\ntechnology networks, as well as IT networks. Cyolo worked with us to allow access for not only\nemployees but vendors into both of those networks, which is unique in a lot of cases.\n\nUp front we discussed our use cases with Cyolo and prioritized those. One of the primary focuses\nthat we had was on securing external access into our networks and making sure that we don't have a\ndata breach from an outside source. And we use Cyolo to help us with that.\n\n**Gibson Mark, Senior Systems Administrator, Tata Chemicals**: The main features that we were\nneeding require MFA for specific applications through the Cyolo web portal, as well as requiring MFA\nto access systems between different security zones. So, from IT to OT, for example, that access is\nnow controlled and logged and requires MFA so that if a user's credential is compromised, they can't\njump between the security zones via that remote access, it's controlled via Cyolo.\n\n**Smith:** We use Cyolo to grant and to monitor vendor/contractor access to our internal systems,\ndata, PLCs, all those kind of things that they need to access. One of the nice things about Cyolo is\nthat we can record sessions, [and] we can ask for manager approval in order to allow those people\nin. Everyone knows when they're accessing any of our resources, and it's all approved. Those\nfeatures have made Cyolo a gamechanger for us.\n\nThe ultimate result is that we now are able to have secure remote access for employees, contractors,\nand vendors. We know when they come into our networks, we know what they're going to access, we can\ngo back and review those sessions and determine if they're doing what we authorized them to do. And\nso now we have confidence that all those different groups are accessing when, where and what we've\nreally outlined in that agreement.\n\nIf you're a business looking to improve your network security, I would recommend that you consider\nthe many use cases that you might be considering now and down the road. Cyolo was able to handle\npretty much all of our use cases and saved us a lot of time and effort.\n\n## Subscribe to Our Newsletter\n\nMore Case Studies\n[See All Case Studies][75]\nCase Study\n\n#### How Lillehammer Municipality Improved the Security of its Water and Wastewater Operations\n\nRead More\n][76] [\n[Manufacturing facility producing chocolate]\nCase Study\n\n#### A Global Food Manufacturer\u2019s Journey to Scalable, Secure Remote Access\n\nRead More\n][77] [\n[Woman working on laptop in an automotive assembly plant]\nCase Study\n\n#### Modernizing Secure Remote Access for a Global Automotive Manufacturer\n\nRead More\n][78]\n\n##### Product Demo\n\n## See how the Cyolo PRO remote access solution works.\n\nEnsuring secure remote access to on-prem, isolated, and cloud-connected OT environments is easier\nthan you think. See for yourself.\n\n[ Request a Demo ][79]\nCyolo provides secure remote privileged access for cyber-physical systems and OT. Our solution\nenables industrial enterprises to connect employees and third-party vendors to critical assets in a\nway that's secure, safe, and surprisingly simple.\n\nGet in Touch: [**Contact Us**][80]\n\n###### [Product][81]\n\n[Product Overview][82]\n[Industrial Remote Privileged Access][83]\n[Third Party Secure Access][84]\n[Industries][85]\n\n###### [Company][86]\n\n[About Us][87]\n[Careers][88]\n[Partners][89]\n\n###### [Resources][90]\n\n[Blog][91]\n[Press Releases][92]\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Cyolo LTD. All rights reserved.\n[Cyolo Privacy Policy][93] [Cookie Policy][94] [Vulnerability Disclosure Policy][95]\n\n[1]: /product\n[2]: #\n[3]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[4]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[5]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[6]: /regulatory-compliance\n[7]: /industries/manufacturing\n[8]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[9]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[10]: /industries\n[11]: #\n[12]: /partners-program\n[13]: /partner-ecosystem\n[14]: /technology-integrations\n[15]: /become-a-partner\n[16]: /resources\n[17]: /resources\n[18]: /news\n[19]: /press-releases\n[20]: /events\n[21]: /third-party-reports\n[22]: /case-studies\n[23]: /at-a-glance\n[24]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[25]: /white-papers\n[26]: /videos\n[27]: /press-releases/cyolo-releases-powerful-new-capabilities-to-redefine-secure-remote-access-for-\n[28]: /blog/why-vpns-are-a-poor-fit-for-vendor-access-in-ot-manufacturing-environments\n[29]: /white-papers/how-to-take-control-of-third-party-ot-access\n[30]: /third-party-reports/gartner-market-guide-for-cps-secure-remote-access-2026\n[31]: /blog\n[32]: /company\n[33]: /company\n[34]: /careers\n[35]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[36]: /search\n[37]: /\n[38]: /de\n[39]: /sp\n[40]: /fr\n[41]: /it\n[42]: /demo\n[43]: /product\n[44]: #\n[45]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[46]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[47]: /sra-built-for-ot-backed-by-it\n[48]: /regulatory-compliance\n[49]: /industries/manufacturing\n[50]: /industries/energy-utilities\n[51]: /industries/ai-data-centers\n[52]: /industries\n[53]: #\n[54]: /partners-program\n[55]: /partner-ecosystem\n[56]: /technology-integrations\n[57]: /become-a-partner\n[58]: /resources\n[59]: /news\n[60]: /press-releases\n[61]: /third-party-reports\n[62]: /case-studies\n[63]: /at-a-glance\n[64]: /datasheets/enable-privileged-remote-access-with-cyolo-pro\n[65]: /white-papers\n[66]: /videos\n[67]: /blog\n[68]: /company\n[69]: /company\n[70]: /careers\n[71]: https://support.cyolo.io/hc/en-us\n[72]: /search\n[73]: /case-studies\n[74]: /product\n[75]: /case-studies\n[76]: /case-studies/how-lillehammer-municipality-improved-the-security-of-its-water-and-wastewater-o\nperations\n[77]: /case-studies/global-food-manufacturers-journey-to-scalable-secure-remote-access\n[78]: /case-studies/modernizing-secure-remote-access-for-a-global-automotive-manufacturer\n[79]: /demo\n[80]: https://cyolo.io/contact-us\n[81]: /product\n[82]: /product\n[83]: /remote-privileged-access-for-ot-ics\n[84]: /safely-manage-3rd-party-access\n[85]: /industries\n[86]: /company\n[87]: /company\n[88]: /careers\n[89]: /partners-program\n[90]: /resources\n[91]: /blog\n[92]: /press-releases\n[93]: /privacy-policy\n[94]: /cookie-policy\n[95]: /vulnerability-disclosure"
