      "key_products": "Cyolo PRO, Cyolo PRO for Privileged Remote Operations",
      "polished_summary": "Cyolo specializes in providing secure remote privileged access solutions for cyber-physical systems and operational technology (OT) environments, catering primarily to industrial enterprises. Their flagship products, including Cyolo PRO and Cyolo PRO for Privileged Remote Operations, offer features such as identity-based authentication, zero-trust connectivity, and end-to-end encryption, ensuring safe and efficient access for employees and third-party vendors. With a focus on industries such as manufacturing, energy, and AI data centers, Cyolo enhances security and user experience in critical operational settings.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Cyolo specializes in secure remote privileged access solutions specifically designed for cyber-physical systems and operational technology environments. Their products, such as Cyolo PRO, directly address security needs in industries like manufacturing and energy, making them a relevant participant in the target market.",
      "audit_score": 5,
