            "text": "**New Omdia Research ** \u2022 The State of Microsegmentation \u2022 **Read the Report**\n\n][1]\n[[elisity_logo]][2]\n* [ Platform ][3]\n* [ Solutions\n][4]\n\n[Materials_fill] Use Case\n* [ Network Asset Discovery ][5]\n* [ Network Visibility ][6]\n* [ IoT Segmentation ][7]\n* [ OT Segmentation ][8]\n* [ IoMT Security ][9]\n* [ Agentic AI Security ][10]\n* [ Zero Trust Microsegmentation ][11]\n* [ Network Segmentation Compliance ][12]\n* [ Block Lateral Movement - Ransomware & Malware ][13]\n\nIndustry\n* [ Healthcare Institutions ][14]\n* [ Manufacturing & Industrial Organizations ][15]\n* [ BioTech + Pharmaceuticals ][16]\n* [ Commercial Enterprise ][17]\n\n[Resource-Icon]\n\nOmdia Survey: 90% of Organizations Are Falling Behind on Microsegmentation. Are You?\n\n[Elisity-Omdia-Report-2026-Featured-NewsThumbail (1)]\n[banner-BG-main]\n[Learn More ][18]\n* [ Resources\n][19]\n\n[Mortarboard_fill] Resources\n* [ Blog ][20]\n* [ Solution Briefs ][21]\n* [ Video ][22]\n* [ White Papers ][23]\n* [ Case Studies ][24]\n* [ Integrations ][25]\n* [ Support ][26]\n* [ Elisity Academy ][27]\n* [ Partners ][28]\n\n[Frame 2147216567] Featured Resource\n* [ Access the Gartner\u00ae Cool Vendors\u2122 in Cyber-Physical Systems Security 2025 Report ][29]\n\n[Resource-Icon]\n\nOmdia Survey: 90% of Organizations Are Falling Behind on Microsegmentation. Are You?\n\n[Elisity-Omdia-Report-2026-Featured-NewsThumbail (1)]\n[banner-BG-main]\n[Learn More ][30]\n* [ Company\n][31]\n\n[Chat_search_fill] Company\n* [ About Us ][32]\n* [ Leadership Team ][33]\n* [ Partners ][34]\n* [ Press Coverage ][35]\n* [ News ][36]\n* [ Awards ][37]\n* [ Events ][38]\n* [ SOC 2 Compliance ][39]\n* [ Careers ][40]\n* [ Contact Us ][41]\n\n[Resource-Icon]\n\nOmdia Survey: 90% of Organizations Are Falling Behind on Microsegmentation. Are You?\n\n[Elisity-Omdia-Report-2026-Featured-NewsThumbail (1)]\n[banner-BG-main]\n[Learn More ][42]\n[close search]\n\n## Elisity Site Search\n\n[search icon]\n[ Schedule Demo ][43]\n\n# company\n\n## Founded\n\nSince 2018, Elisity has been helping companies redefine security and access in a world transformed\nby cloud, mobility, and connected devices. The team has been designing, building, marketing and\nselling products in the network and security space for over 25 years.\n\nRounding out the Elisity team, the company has a world renowned Board of Directors and an equally\nstrong Board of Advisors. These industry visionaries have funded, built, and led companies in all\nareas of technology.\n\n## Vision\n\nWe are redefining enterprise security and access by untangling security from underlying network\nconstructs.\n\nElisity unleashes the power of the switching infrastructure that organizations have already in\nplace, and leverages the identity and telemetry sources they already use, so they can quickly gain\nvisibility into all network assets, managed and unmanaged, and apply microsegmentation to secure\ntheir environments against lateral movement of malicious network traffic.\n\n## Expertise\n\nLed by industry veterans from Cisco, Palo Alto Networks, McAfee, and Viptela, the executive\nleadership team is leading Elisity into a new era of cybersecurity, catering to the evolving needs\nof digital enterprises in a cloud-first and remote-work world.\n\n* Founded\n* Vision\n* Leadership\n* Founded\n* Vision\n* Leadership\n\n[ Scroll ][44]\n\nVision\n\n## Redefining enterprise security and access by untangling security from underlying network\n## constructs.\n\nLeading the Way\n\n## Meet the Leadership Team\n\n## SOC 2 Compliance\n\nElisity completed its SOC 2 (System and Organization Control 2) examination by the American\nInstitute of Certified Public Accountants (AICPA).\n\n[21972-312_SOC_NonCPA]\nHave a question?\n[ Contact Us ][45]\n\nWhy Elisity?\n\nElisity is a leap forward in network segmentation architecture. We enable CISOs to lead the\nenterprise effort to achieve Zero Trust maturity, proactively prevent security risks, and reduce\nnetwork policy management complexity.\n\n[Gartner Cool Vendors in Cyber-Physical Systems Security 2025 badge]\n\nElisity Named a Cool Vendor in the Gartner\u00ae Cool Vendors\u2122 in Cyber-Physical Systems Security 2025\n* [ [LinkedIn-Logo-Vector] ][46]\n* [ [Youtube-Logo-SVG] ][47]\n* [ [X-Logo] ][48]\n* Industries\n* [Clinical Healthcare][49]\n* [Industrial Networks][50]\n* [Enterprise Networks][51]\n* Resources\n* [Support][52]\n* [Knowledge Base][53]\n* [Videos][54]\n* [White Papers][55]\n* [Blog][56]\n* [Solution Briefs][57]\n* Company\n* [About Us][58]\n* [Leadership Team][59]\n* [Partners][60]\n* [News][61]\n* [Events][62]\n* [SOC 2 Compliance][63]\n* [Careers][64]\n* [Contact Us][65]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2026 Elisity, Inc. All rights reserved\n* [Privacy Policy][66]\n* [Sitemap][67]\n* [Customer Terms of Service][68]\n\n[1]: https://www.elisity.com/omdia-microsegmentation-report?hsLang=en\n[2]: https://www.elisity.com/?hsLang=en\n[3]: https://www.elisity.com/platform?hsLang=en\n[4]:\n[5]: https://www.elisity.com/network-asset-discovery-for-microsegmentation?hsLang=en\n[6]: https://www.elisity.com/network-visibility-and-microsegmentation?hsLang=en\n[7]: https://www.elisity.com/simplifying-iot-segmentation-for-enterprises?hsLang=en\n[8]: https://www.elisity.com/ot-segmentation-enhance-ot-network-security?hsLang=en\n[9]: https://www.elisity.com/iomt-security-protecting-medical-devices?hsLang=en\n[10]: https://www.elisity.com/ai-security-microsegmentation-for-agentic-ai-threats?hsLang=en\n[11]: https://www.elisity.com/zero-trust-microsegmentation-enhance-your-security?hsLang=en\n[12]: https://www.elisity.com/network-segmentation-compliance-best-practices?hsLang=en\n[13]: https://www.elisity.com/block-lateral-movement-with-microsegmentation?hsLang=en\n[14]: https://www.elisity.com/solutions/healthcare?hsLang=en\n[15]: https://www.elisity.com/solutions/industrial?hsLang=en\n[16]: https://www.elisity.com/pharmaceutical-network-segmentation-platform-zero-trust-ot-security-el\nisity?hsLang=en\n[17]: https://www.elisity.com/solutions/enterprise?hsLang=en\n[18]: https://www.elisity.com/omdia-microsegmentation-report?hsLang=en\n[19]: https://www.elisity.com/resource-center?hsLang=en\n[20]: https://www.elisity.com/blog?hsLang=en\n[21]: https://www.elisity.com/resources?hsLang=en#filter=solution-brief\n[22]: https://www.elisity.com/resources?hsLang=en#filter=video\n[23]: https://www.elisity.com/resources?hsLang=en#filter=white-paper\n[24]: https://www.elisity.com/resources?hsLang=en\n[25]: https://www.elisity.com/integrations-overview?hsLang=en\n[26]: https://support.elisity.com/hc/en-us\n[27]: https://www.elisity.com/elisity-academy-training-certifications?hsLang=en\n[28]: https://www.elisity.com/partners?hsLang=en\n[29]: https://www.elisity.com/gartner-cool-vendors-in-cyber-physical-systems-security-2025?hsLang=en\n[30]: https://www.elisity.com/omdia-microsegmentation-report?hsLang=en\n[31]: https://www.elisity.com/company\n[32]: https://www.elisity.com/company\n[33]: https://www.elisity.com/company?hsLang=en#leadership\n[34]: https://www.elisity.com/partners?hsLang=en\n[35]: https://www.elisity.com/in-the-news?hsLang=en\n[36]: https://www.elisity.com/news?hsLang=en\n[37]: https://www.elisity.com/elisity-awards-recognition?hsLang=en\n[38]: https://www.elisity.com/news-events?hsLang=en\n[39]: https://www.elisity.com/company?hsLang=en#soc-2-compliance\n[40]: https://www.elisity.com/careers?hsLang=en\n[41]: https://www.elisity.com/contact-us?hsLang=en\n[42]: https://www.elisity.com/omdia-microsegmentation-report?hsLang=en\n[43]: https://www.elisity.com/demo-request?hsLang=en\n[44]: #vision\n[45]: https://www.elisity.com/contact-us?hsLang=en\n[46]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/elisity-inc/\n[47]: https://www.youtube.com/@elisityinc.6782\n[48]: https://x.com/elisityinc\n[49]: https://www.elisity.com/solutions/healthcare?hsLang=en\n[50]: https://www.elisity.com/solutions/industrial?hsLang=en\n[51]: https://www.elisity.com/solutions/enterprise?hsLang=en\n[52]: https://support.elisity.com/\n[53]: https://support.elisity.com/\n[54]: https://elisity.com/resources?hsLang=en#filter=video\n[55]: https://elisity.com/resources?hsLang=en#filter=white-paper\n[56]: https://www.elisity.com/blog?hsLang=en\n[57]: https://elisity.com/resources?hsLang=en#filter=solution-brief\n[58]: https://www.elisity.com/company?hsLang=en\n[59]: https://elisity.com/company?hsLang=en#leadership-team\n[60]: https://www.elisity.com/partners?hsLang=en\n[61]: https://www.elisity.com/news?hsLang=en\n[62]: https://www.elisity.com/news-events?hsLang=en\n[63]: https://elisity.com/company?hsLang=en#soc-2-compliance\n[64]: https://www.elisity.com/careers?hsLang=en\n[65]: https://www.elisity.com/contact-us?hsLang=en\n[66]: https://www.elisity.com/privacy-policy?hsLang=en\n[67]: https://www.elisity.com/sitemap.xml?hsLang=en\n[68]: https://www.elisity.com/customer-terms-of-service?hsLang=en"
