            "text": "**New Omdia Research ** \u2022 The State of Microsegmentation \u2022 **Read the Report**\n\n][1]\n[[elisity_logo]][2]\n* [ Platform ][3]\n* [ Solutions\n][4]\n\n[Materials_fill] Use Case\n* [ Network Asset Discovery ][5]\n* [ Network Visibility ][6]\n* [ IoT Segmentation ][7]\n* [ OT Segmentation ][8]\n* [ IoMT Security ][9]\n* [ Agentic AI Security ][10]\n* [ Zero Trust Microsegmentation ][11]\n* [ Network Segmentation Compliance ][12]\n* [ Block Lateral Movement - Ransomware & Malware ][13]\n\nIndustry\n* [ Healthcare Institutions ][14]\n* [ Manufacturing & Industrial Organizations ][15]\n* [ BioTech + Pharmaceuticals ][16]\n* [ Commercial Enterprise ][17]\n\n[Resource-Icon]\n\nOmdia Survey: 90% of Organizations Are Falling Behind on Microsegmentation. Are You?\n\n[Elisity-Omdia-Report-2026-Featured-NewsThumbail (1)]\n[banner-BG-main]\n[Learn More ][18]\n* [ Resources\n][19]\n\n[Mortarboard_fill] Resources\n* [ Blog ][20]\n* [ Solution Briefs ][21]\n* [ Video ][22]\n* [ White Papers ][23]\n* [ Case Studies ][24]\n* [ Integrations ][25]\n* [ Support ][26]\n* [ Elisity Academy ][27]\n* [ Partners ][28]\n\n[Frame 2147216567] Featured Resource\n* [ Access the Gartner\u00ae Cool Vendors\u2122 in Cyber-Physical Systems Security 2025 Report ][29]\n\n[Resource-Icon]\n\nOmdia Survey: 90% of Organizations Are Falling Behind on Microsegmentation. Are You?\n\n[Elisity-Omdia-Report-2026-Featured-NewsThumbail (1)]\n[banner-BG-main]\n[Learn More ][30]\n* [ Company\n][31]\n\n[Chat_search_fill] Company\n* [ About Us ][32]\n* [ Leadership Team ][33]\n* [ Partners ][34]\n* [ Press Coverage ][35]\n* [ News ][36]\n* [ Awards ][37]\n* [ Events ][38]\n* [ SOC 2 Compliance ][39]\n* [ Careers ][40]\n* [ Contact Us ][41]\n\n[Resource-Icon]\n\nOmdia Survey: 90% of Organizations Are Falling Behind on Microsegmentation. Are You?\n\n[Elisity-Omdia-Report-2026-Featured-NewsThumbail (1)]\n[banner-BG-main]\n[Learn More ][42]\n[close search]\n\n## Elisity Site Search\n\n[search icon]\n[ Schedule Demo ][43]\n\n# Contact Us\n\n### **Headquarters**\n\n6203 San Ignacio Ave\nSuite #110\nSan Jose, CA 95119\n\n**EMEA\n**Elisity Sp. z o.o.\nAleje Ujazdowskie 41 00-540 Warsaw, Poland\n\n**APAC\n**ELISITY INDIA PRIVATE LIMITED\nNo 25, 2nd Floor, 8th Main, Vasanthnagar, BANGALORE, Bangalore, Karnataka, India, 560052**\n\n### Contact Support\n\nPlease submit a support request ticket:\n\n[ CONTACT SUPPORT ][44]\n\n### Contact Us\n\n#### Fast Deployment\n\nSeamless implementation with zero operational disruption with Virtual Edge.\nFast Deployment\n\n#### Complete Visibility\n\nAchieve comprehensive monitoring with and begin building your IdentityGraph\u2122.\nComplete Visibility\n\n#### Intelligent Classification\n\nUse Learning Mode for intelligent classification.\nIntelligent Classification\n\n#### Policy Simulation\n\nBuild confidence in policy distribution with Simulation Mode.\nPolicy Simulation\n\n#### Rapid Expansion\n\nRoll-out policies in phases for continuous refinement.\nRapid Expansion\n\n> \u201cElisity has surpassed all our expectations. We had it deployed at two of our sites in less than\n> an hour, and by the next day, we were confidently implementing policies. This speed and\n> effectiveness are unprecedented, making Elisity an indispensable part of our network security\n> strategy.\u201d\n\n[user-tie-1]\n\n##### Max E.\n\nChief Information Security Officer\n\n> \u201cElisity's solution is a game-changer. Its intelligent asset classification and visibility have\n> allowed us to monitor our network in ways we couldn't have imagined. Our patient care security is\n> stronger than ever.\u201d\n\n[user-tie-1]\n\n##### Steve G.\n\nChief Information Officer\n\nWhy Elisity?\n\nElisity is a leap forward in network segmentation architecture. We enable CISOs to lead the\nenterprise effort to achieve Zero Trust maturity, proactively prevent security risks, and reduce\nnetwork policy management complexity.\n\n[Gartner Cool Vendors in Cyber-Physical Systems Security 2025 badge]\n\nElisity Named a Cool Vendor in the Gartner\u00ae Cool Vendors\u2122 in Cyber-Physical Systems Security 2025\n* [ [LinkedIn-Logo-Vector] ][45]\n* [ [Youtube-Logo-SVG] ][46]\n* [ [X-Logo] ][47]\n* Industries\n* [Clinical Healthcare][48]\n* [Industrial Networks][49]\n* [Enterprise Networks][50]\n* Resources\n* [Support][51]\n* [Knowledge Base][52]\n* [Videos][53]\n* [White Papers][54]\n* [Blog][55]\n* [Solution Briefs][56]\n* Company\n* [About Us][57]\n* [Leadership Team][58]\n* [Partners][59]\n* [News][60]\n* [Events][61]\n* [SOC 2 Compliance][62]\n* [Careers][63]\n* [Contact Us][64]\n\n\u00a9 Copyright 2026 Elisity, Inc. All rights reserved\n* [Privacy Policy][65]\n* [Sitemap][66]\n* [Customer Terms of Service][67]\n\n[1]: https://www.elisity.com/omdia-microsegmentation-report?hsLang=en\n[2]: https://www.elisity.com/?hsLang=en\n[3]: https://www.elisity.com/platform?hsLang=en\n[4]:\n[5]: https://www.elisity.com/network-asset-discovery-for-microsegmentation?hsLang=en\n[6]: https://www.elisity.com/network-visibility-and-microsegmentation?hsLang=en\n[7]: https://www.elisity.com/simplifying-iot-segmentation-for-enterprises?hsLang=en\n[8]: https://www.elisity.com/ot-segmentation-enhance-ot-network-security?hsLang=en\n[9]: https://www.elisity.com/iomt-security-protecting-medical-devices?hsLang=en\n[10]: https://www.elisity.com/ai-security-microsegmentation-for-agentic-ai-threats?hsLang=en\n[11]: https://www.elisity.com/zero-trust-microsegmentation-enhance-your-security?hsLang=en\n[12]: https://www.elisity.com/network-segmentation-compliance-best-practices?hsLang=en\n[13]: https://www.elisity.com/block-lateral-movement-with-microsegmentation?hsLang=en\n[14]: https://www.elisity.com/solutions/healthcare?hsLang=en\n[15]: https://www.elisity.com/solutions/industrial?hsLang=en\n[16]: https://www.elisity.com/pharmaceutical-network-segmentation-platform-zero-trust-ot-security-el\nisity?hsLang=en\n[17]: https://www.elisity.com/solutions/enterprise