      "key_products": "IdentityGraph\u2122, Zero Trust Microsegmentation, IoT Segmentation, OT Segmentation, Network Asset Discovery",
      "polished_summary": "Elisity is a cybersecurity company specializing in identity-based microsegmentation solutions that enhance network security for enterprises. Its core offerings, including the IdentityGraph\u2122 and Zero Trust Microsegmentation, provide comprehensive visibility, context-aware policies, and seamless integration to protect against lateral movement of threats. Targeting sectors such as healthcare, manufacturing, and biotech, Elisity empowers organizations to achieve Zero Trust maturity while securing their networks against evolving cyber threats.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Elisity specializes in identity-based microsegmentation solutions that enhance cybersecurity specifically for cyber-physical systems. Their products, such as the IdentityGraph\u2122 and Zero Trust Microsegmentation, are designed to protect industrial control systems and IoT environments, making them a direct participant in the Cyber-Physical Systems Security market.",
