ficer\n[Glitch effect]\n\n## Board Members\n\n[[Linkedin green icon]][181]\n\n### Chris Bisnett\n\nChief Technology Officer & Cofounder\n[[Linkedin green icon]][182]\n\n### Chris Comparato\n\nFormer CEO & Chairman at Toast\n[Linkedin green icon]\n\n### Jai Das\n\nPresident & Partner at Sapphire Ventures\n[[Linkedin green icon]][183]\n\n### Kyle Hanslovan\n\nCEO & Cofounder\n[[Linkedin green icon]][184]\n\n### Alex Kurland\n\nPartner at Meritech Capital\n\n## Investors\n\n## Huntress is Hiring!\n\nJoin the team that's bringing cybersecurity to the 99%\n\n[Explore Career Opportunities][185]\nPlatform\n[Huntress Managed Security Platform][186][Managed EDR][187][Managed EDR for macOS][188][Managed EDR\nfor Linux][189][Managed ITDR][190][Managed SIEM][191][Managed Security Awareness\nTraining][192][Managed ISPM][193][Managed ESPM][194][Book a Demo][195]\nSolutions\n[Phishing][196][Compliance][197][Business Email\nCompromise][198][Education][199][Finance][200][Healthcare][201][Manufacturing][202][State & Local\nGovernment][203]\nWhy Huntress?\n[Managed Service Providers][204][Resellers][205][IT & Security Teams][206][24/7 SOC][207][Case\nStudies][208]\nResources\n[Blog][209][Resource Center][210][Cybersecurity 101][211][Upcoming Events][212][Support\nDocumentation][213]\nAbout\n[Our Company][214][Leadership][215][News & Press][216][Careers][217][Contact Us][218]\n[[Huntress white logo]][219]\n\n**Protecting 250k+ customers **like you with enterprise-grade protection.\n\n[Privacy Policy][220][Cookie Policy][221][Terms of Use][222]Cookie Consent\n[[Linkedin icon]][223][[Twitter X icon]][224][[YouTube icon]][225][[Instagram icon]][226]\n\u00a9 2025 Huntress All Rights Reserved.\n\n## Join the Hunt\n\nGet insider access to Huntress tradecraft, killer events, and the freshest blog updates.\n\n[1]: /security-topics/unwanted-interruptions\n[2]: https://huntress.io/\n[3]: https://support.huntress.io/hc/en-us\n[4]: /blog\n[5]: /contact-us\n[6]: /\n[7]: /platform\n[8]: /platform/ma