      "key_products": "Managed EDR, Managed ITDR, Managed SIEM, Managed Security Awareness Training Software, Managed ESPM",
      "polished_summary": "Huntress is a cybersecurity company dedicated to providing managed security services that protect businesses from cyber threats, ensuring enterprise-level security for organizations across various industries, including education, healthcare, and financial services. Their core offerings include Managed EDR for endpoint visibility, Managed ITDR for identity protection, Managed SIEM for threat response, and security awareness training, all designed to empower teams and enhance security posture.",
