nPress Release\n\nInter-Con Security Awarded Entire U.S. Security Contract for General Motors\n\nLearn more\n\nKey Services\n\nExperts in an Extensive Array of Security Services\n\nLearn more\n\nCareers\n\nInterested in Joining Our Team?\n\nLearn more\n\nInter-Con is recognized as one of the fastest-growing companies\n\nInter-Con has nearly tripled in size over the past several years to become one of the largest and fastest-growing physical security companies in the world. Inter-Con is a family-owned, certified Minority Business Enterprise and employs over 40,000 employees across North and South America, and Africa.&nbsp;\n\nOur dedicated services model places high-caliber security directly within our clients\u2019 environments, delivering unmatched precision in building, enhancing, and sustaining robust security programs. We further provide:\n\nScalable, customizable, and comprehensive security solutions delivered at cost-effective rates.\n\nEnhanced employee engagement, which drives industry-leading retention rates.\n\nBest-in-class technology serving as a force multiplier for our security teams.\n\nProven transition expertise that mitigates risk and ensures seamless implementation of new security programs.\n\nLearn More\n\nSecurity Careers &#8211; Join Our Team!\n\nWe offer a wide variety of exciting security jobs across the United States and abroad. We offer candidates:\n\nA winning, inclusive culture.\n\nExtremely competitive compensation.\n\nFor full-time positions, we offer medical, dental, and vision coverage, life insurance, and 401K.\n\nFor part-time positions, we offer benefits including vision, dental, and additional options such as life insurance, legal plans, SoFi financial loans, and an employer-sponsored retirement plan (may vary by contract and post).&nbsp;\n\nPart-time and flexible schedules (through our IConIQ Security Management System).\n\nDaily Pay solutions.\n\nEmpowering career development and training programs.\n\nApply Now\n\nCareers\n\nThe Inter-Con Path\n\nSeeking a career in security?&nbsp; Explore our many security job openings.\n\nBegin Here\n\nOur Security Services\n\nInter-Con provides a wide array of exceptional security solutions to meet client needs.\n\nWhether you are seeking unarmed or armed guards, surveillance, executive protection, or other specialty services, we will tailor a security program that\u2019s right for your business.\n\nLearn More\n\nIndustry Expertise\n\nInter-Con is proud to provide security solutions to clients in both the public and private security sectors, delivering tailored expertise that safeguards people, property, and critical infrastructure.&nbsp;\n\nLearn More\n\nSecurity Training&nbsp;\n\nAt Inter-Con, we leverage the market\u2019s best trainers, tools, expertise, and technology to craft highly effective security training programs that reduce costs for our clients. Our expansive Peacemaker National Training Center facility boasts some of the best training and shooting ranges in the world as well as hosts numerous nationally recognized skill-based competitions.\n\nLearn More\n\nHow Can Inter-Con Serve You?\n\nWork With Us\n\nAre You Interested in Joining the Inter-Con Family?\n\nJoin Our Team\n\nShare Icon\n\nShare Icon\n\nShare Icon\n\nSecurity Services\nIndustries\nInnovation\nCompany\nNews &amp; Media\nCareers\n\nPrivacy\nClimate Risk Assessment\n\n\u00a9 2026 Inter-Con Security Systems, Inc (\u201cInter-Con\u201d). All rights reserved. INTER-CON SECURITY\u00ae and INTER-CON SECURITY\u00ae Logo are registered trademarks of Inter-Con. ICONIQ\u2122 is a trademark of Inter-Con. [[Inter-Con Security]][1]\n* [Security Services][2]\n* [Security Guards][3]\n* [Executive Protection][4]\n* [K-9 Security][5]\n* [Off-Duty Officers][6]\n* [Event Security][7]\n* [Fire Life Safety & Emergency Response][8]\n* [High-Value Asset Protection][9]\n* [Intelligence and Investigatory Solutions][10]\n* [Screening & Access Controls][11]\n* [Security Operations Center][12]\n* [Technology][13]\n* [Value Added Training][14]\n* [Parking Enforcement][15]\n* [International Operations][16]\n* [Industries][17]\n* [Aviation][18]\n* [Commercial Real Estate & Facilities][19]\n* [Construction / Infrastructure][20]\n* [Education][21]\n* [Energy and Utilities][22]\n* [Entertainment][23]\n* [Faith-Based Organizations][24]\n* [Family Business / High Net Worth Individuals][25]\n* [Financial Services / Banking / Insurance][26]\n* [Government (Local, State and Federal)][27]\n* [Healthcare][28]\n* [Logistics][29]\n* [Manufacturing][30]\n* [Mass Transit][31]\n* [Museums / Galleries / Libraries][32]\n* [Non-Profit Organizations][33]\n* [Residential / HOA][34]\n* [Retail][35]\n* [Technology][36]\n* [About Us][37]\n* [Core Values][38]\n* [Corporate Team][39]\n* [Global Footprint][40]\n* [News & Media][41]\n* [Blog][42]\n* [News][43]\n* [Press Release][44]\n* [Careers][45]\n* [Join Us][46]\n* [Apply Now][47]\n* [Contact us][48]\n* [Apply Now][49]\nMenu\n\n# History\n\n## Inter-Con is the world\u2019s leading provider of premier security services.\n\nInter-Con Security was founded in 1973 by U.S. Army Veteran and retired LAPD Detective Lt. Enrique\n\u201cHank\u201d and, his wife, Bertha Hernandez. From their kitchen table, the two invested their life\nsavings into Inter-Con, with the ambition of building a new type of security company. Inter-Con\nwould distinguish itself by providing security services to clients whose threat profiles exceeded\nthe capabilities of traditional \u201cguarding\u201d companies.\n\nNow in its third generation of Hernandez-family leadership, Inter-Con employs a highly diverse\nworkforce of over 40,000 employees across North and South America, and Africa, with sustained\noperational growth. Inter-Con provides tailored security services to Fortune 500 companies, public\nutilities, ultra-high net worth individuals, non-profit organizations, as well as federal, state,\nand local governments around the world.\n\nWe attribute our steady expansion to Inter-Con\u2019s value of long-term partnerships over short-term\nprofits, a focus enabled by our privately-held ownership. Our stable foundation, constructed over 50\nyears of successful security program design and implementation, allows us to remain true to our core\ntenets and to support those of our clients. As a family-owned and operated business, Inter-Con is\nunwaveringly committed to providing best-in-class quality of service, in line with our founding\nprinciples.\n\n> *For fifty years, Inter-Con\u2019s guiding principles have remained constant\u2013 treat our clients as\n> partners, our team as family, and security as our passion.*\n\n\u2013Henry Hernandez, President & CEO\n\n## How Can Inter-Con Serve You?\n\n[Work With Us ][50]\n\n## Are You Interested in Joining the Inter-Con Family?\n\n[Join Our Team ][51]\n* [ Share Icon][52]\n* [ Share Icon][53]\n* [ Share Icon][54]\n* [Security Services][55]\n* [Industries][56]\n* [Innovation][57]\n* [Company][58]\n* [News & Media][59]\n* [Careers][60]\n* [Privacy][61]\n* [Climate Risk Assessment][62]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Inter-Con Security Systems, Inc (\u201cInter-Con\u201d). All rights reserved. INTER-CON SECURITY\u00ae and\nINTER-CON SECURITY\u00ae Logo are registered trademarks of Inter-Con. ICONIQ\u2122 is a trademark of\nInter-Con.\n\n[1]: https://icsecurity.com/\n[2]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/\n[3]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/security-guards/\n[4]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/executive-protection/\n[5]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/k9/\n[6]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/off-duty-officers/\n[7]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/event-security/\n[8]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/fire-life-safety-emergency-response/\n[9]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/high-value-asset-hva/\n[10]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/intelligence-and-investigatory-solutions/\n[11]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/screening-access-controls/\n[12]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/security-operation-centers/\n[13]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/technology/\n[14]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/value-added-training/\n[15]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/parking-enforcement/\n[16]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/international-operations/\n[17]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/\n[18]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/aviation/\n[19]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/commercial-real-estate/\n[20]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/infrastructure-construction/\n[21]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/education/\n[22]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/energy-and-utilities/\n[23]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/entertainment/\n[24]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/faith-based-organizations/\n[25]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/family-business-high-net-worth-individuals/\n[26]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/financial-services/\n[27]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/government-local-state-and-federal/\n[28]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/healthcare/\n[29]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/logistics/\n[30]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/manufacturing/\n[31]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/mass-transit/\n[32]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/museums-and-monuments/\n[33]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/non-profit/\n[34]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/residential-hoa/\n[35]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/retail/\n[36]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/technology/\n[37]: https://icsecurity.com/company/history/\n[38]: https://icsecurity.com/company/core-values/\n[39]: https://icsecurity.com/company/corporate-team/\n[40]: https://icsecurity.com/company/global-footprint/\n[41]: https://icsecurity.com/news-media/\n[42]: https://icsecurity.com/news-media/blog/\n[43]: https://icsecurity.com/news-media/news/\n[44]: https://icsecurity.com/news-media/press-release/\n[45]: https://icsecurity.com/careers/\n[46]: https://icsecurity.com/careers/join-us/\n[47]: https://icsecurity.my.site.com/quickapply\n[48]: https://icsecurity.com/contact-us/\n[49]: https://icsecurity.my.site.com/quickapply\n[50]: https://icsecurity.com/contact-us/\n[51]: https://icsecurity.com/careers/join-us/\n[52]: https://www.facebook.com/INTERCONINC/\n[53]: https://www.instagram.com/interconsecurity/\n[54]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/interconsecurity/\n[55]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/\n[56]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/\n[57]: https://icsecurity.com/innova"
