            "url": "https://icsecurity.com/company/corporate-team/",
            "text": "[[Inter-Con Security]][1]\n* [Security Services][2]\n* [Security Guards][3]\n* [Executive Protection][4]\n* [K-9 Security][5]\n* [Off-Duty Officers][6]\n* [Event Security][7]\n* [Fire Life Safety & Emergency Response][8]\n* [High-Value Asset Protection][9]\n* [Intelligence and Investigatory Solutions][10]\n* [Screening & Access Controls][11]\n* [Security Operations Center][12]\n* [Technology][13]\n* [Value Added Training][14]\n* [Parking Enforcement][15]\n* [International Operations][16]\n* [Industries][17]\n* [Aviation][18]\n* [Commercial Real Estate & Facilities][19]\n* [Construction / Infrastructure][20]\n* [Education][21]\n* [Energy and Utilities][22]\n* [Entertainment][23]\n* [Faith-Based Organizations][24]\n* [Family Business / High Net Worth Individuals][25]\n* [Financial Services / Banking / Insurance][26]\n* [Government (Local, State and Federal)][27]\n* [Healthcare][28]\n* [Logistics][29]\n* [Manufacturing][30]\n* [Mass Transit][31]\n* [Museums / Galleries / Libraries][32]\n* [Non-Profit Organizations][33]\n* [Residential / HOA][34]\n* [Retail][35]\n* [Technology][36]\n* [About Us][37]\n* [Core Values][38]\n* [Corporate Team][39]\n* [Global Footprint][40]\n* [News & Media][41]\n* [Blog][42]\n* [News][43]\n* [Press Release][44]\n* [Careers][45]\n* [Join Us][46]\n* [Apply Now][47]\n* [Contact us][48]\n* [Apply Now][49]\nMenu\n\n# Corporate Team\n\n## Inter-Con\u2019s award-winning security programs stem from building a strong internal leadership team\n## to recruit, train, and direct our customized operations so our officers are providing the\n## best-in-class service our clients have come to expect.\n\nBy virtue of Inter-Con\u2019s unique, dedicated services model, we ensure that our Account Management\nTeams include executive leadership to foster consistency and optimal transparency in services.\nThrough this model, we have developed innovative and resilient partnerships spanning decades.\n\n## Leadership Team\n\n### Henry Hernandez\n\n##### President & CEO\n\nHenry Hernandez is Inter-Con\u2019s President and CEO. He leads the company\u2019s overall strategy and\noperations, having previously overseen Inter-Con\u2019s International Operations before assuming his\ncurrent role. Prior to joining Inter-Con, Mr. Hernandez practiced law as an associate at Sullivan &\nCromwell LLP in New York, advising on private equity and commercial real estate transactions, and\nserved as a Judicial Law Clerk to Judge Kim McLane Wardlaw on the Ninth Circuit Court of Appeals.\nMr. Hernandez holds a bachelor\u2019s degree from Harvard College and a JD from Harvard Law School, and\nis a licensed attorney in both New York and California.\n\n### Brian Faulkner\n\n##### Chief Technology Officer\n\nBrian Faulkner is Inter-Con\u2019s Chief Technology Officer. He oversees all technology solutions the\ncompany implements and delivers for clients across the United States. Prior to joining Inter-Con,\nMr. Faulkner held a technology leadership role at Samsung, where he managed mobile commerce\ninfrastructure as part of the company\u2019s connected-device strategy. Before his corporate career, he\nserved for ten years as a Major in the U.S. Army. Mr. Faulkner holds an M.B.A. from the Thunderbird\nSchool of Global Management.\n\n### Natalie N. Griffiths\n\n##### Chief Compliance Officer\n\nNatalie N. Griffiths is Inter-Con\u2019s Chief Compliance Officer. She oversees the company\u2019s compliance\nand Human Resources compliance functions. Ms. Griffiths has held several roles of increasing\nresponsibility throughout her tenure at Inter-Con. Prior to joining the company, she was an\nassociate attorney in the employment law group at Jones Day. Ms. Griffiths holds a B.S. in Business\nAdministration from the University of Southern California\u2019s Marshall School of Business and a JD\nfrom Loyola Law School, Los Angeles.\n\n### Kevin Hernandez\n\n##### Chief Strategy Officer\n\nKevin Hernandez is Inter-Con\u2019s Chief Strategy Officer. He oversees the company\u2019s Pricing and\nContract Administration functions. Prior to joining Inter-Con, Mr. Hernandez was a management\nconsultant at Bain & Company, where he specialized in the Private Equity and Aerospace & Defense\npractices. Mr. Hernandez holds a bachelor\u2019s degree from Harvard College and an MBA from Harvard\nBusiness School.\n\n[David Oken]\n\n### David Oken\n\n##### Chief People Officer\n\nDavid Oken is Inter-Con\u2019s Chief People Officer. He is responsible for all aspects of talent\nacquisition and retention strategy across the company\u2019s global workforce. Mr. Oken joined Inter-Con\nin 2021 as Vice President of Corporate Talent and progressed through roles of increasing\nresponsibility before being named to the Executive Leadership Team, a tenure that has coincided with\none of the most significant growth periods in Inter-Con\u2019s history. Prior to joining Inter-Con, Mr.\nOken served as Director of Client Services at Vaco, a national talent solutions and recruiting firm.\nHe holds a Bachelor of Arts in Psychology from the University of San Diego and is a graduate of UCLA\nAnderson\u2019s Executive Education program.\n\n### Robert Ray\n\n##### Chief Legal Officer\n\nRobert Ray is Inter-Con\u2019s General Counsel and Corporate Secretary. He oversees the company\u2019s Legal,\nCompliance, and Risk Management functions. Prior to joining Inter-Con, Mr. Ray held roles of\nincreasing responsibility at Polaris, Inc. (NYSE: PII), including serving as General Counsel of its\nTransamerican Auto Parts Global Business Unit. Mr. Ray holds a bachelor\u2019s degree from Boston College\nand a JD from the University of California, Berkeley.\n\n### Richard Stack\n\n##### Chief Operating Officer\n\nRichard Stack is Inter-Con\u2019s Chief Operating Officer. He brings over 29 years of experience in the\nsecurity industry, having managed programs across all sectors for clients including the U.S.\nGovernment, state and local governments, Fortune 500 companies, and ultra-high net worth\nindividuals. Prior to joining Inter-Con, Mr. Stack served as a Military Policeman in the U.S. Marine\nCorps. He holds a B.S. in Management and Leadership.\n\n### Michael Xu\n\n##### Chief Financial Officer\n\nMichael Xu is Inter-Con\u2019s Chief Financial Officer. He is responsible for strengthening the company\u2019s\nfinancial oversight and supporting its continued strategic growth. Prior to joining Inter-Con, Mr.\nXu served as CFO at VXI Global Solutions, ResultsCX, and Foundever Americas, building a strong track\nrecord of financial leadership across large-scale service organizations. Mr. Xu holds a degree in\nBusiness Economics from UCLA and is a licensed CPA.\n\n## How Can Inter-Con Serve You?\n\n[Work With Us ][50]\n\n## Are You Interested in Joining the Inter-Con Family?\n\n[Join Our Team ][51]\n* [ Share Icon][52]\n* [ Share Icon][53]\n* [ Share Icon][54]\n* [Security Services][55]\n* [Industries][56]\n* [Innovation][57]\n* [Company][58]\n* [News & Media][59]\n* [Careers][60]\n* [Privacy][61]\n* [Climate Risk Assessment][62]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Inter-Con Security Systems, Inc (\u201cInter-Con\u201d). All rights reserved. INTER-CON SECURITY\u00ae and\nINTER-CON SECURITY\u00ae Logo are registered trademarks of Inter-Con. ICONIQ\u2122 is a trademark of\nInter-Con.\n\n[1]: https://icsecurity.com/\n[2]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/\n[3]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/security-guards/\n[4]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/executive-protection/\n[5]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/k9/\n[6]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/off-duty-officers/\n[7]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/event-security/\n[8]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/fire-life-safety-emergency-response/\n[9]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/high-value-asset-hva/\n[10]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/intelligence-and-investigatory-solutions/\n[11]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/screening-access-controls/\n[12]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/security-operation-centers/\n[13]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/technology/\n[14]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/value-added-training/\n[15]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/parking-enforcement/\n[16]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/international-operations/\n[17]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/\n[18]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/aviation/\n[19]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/commercial-real-estate/\n[20]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/infrastructure-construction/\n[21]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/education/\n[22]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/energy-and-utilities/\n[23]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/entertainment/\n[24]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/faith-based-organizations/\n[25]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/family-business-high-net-worth-individuals/\n[26]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/financial-services/\n[27]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/government-local-state-and-federal/\n[28]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/healthcare/\n[29]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/logistics/\n[30]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/manufacturing/\n[31]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/mass-transit/\n[32]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/museums-and-monuments/\n[33]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/non-profit/\n[34]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/residential-hoa/\n[35]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/retail/\n[36]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/technology/\n[37]: https://icsecurity.com/company/history/\n[38]: https://icsecurity.com/company/core-values/\n[39]: https://icsecurity.com/company/corporate-team/\n[40]: https://icsecurity.com/company/global-footprint/\n[41]: https://icsecurity.com/news-media/\n[42]: https://icsecurity.com/news-media/blog/\n[43]: https://icsecurity.com/news-media/news/\n[44]: https://icsecurity.com/news-media/press-release/\n[45]: https://icsecurity.com/careers/\n[46]: https://icsecurity.com/careers/join-us/\n[47]: https://icsecurity.my.site.com/quickapply\n[48]: https://icsecurity.com/contact-us/\n[49]: https://icsecurity.my.site.com/quickapply\n[50]: https://icsecurity.com/contact-us/\n[51]: https://icsecurity.com/careers/join-us/\n[52]: https://www.facebook.com/INTERCONINC/\n[53]: https://www.instagram.com/interconsecurity/\n[54]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/interconsecurity/\n[55]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/\n[56]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/\n[57]: https://icsecurity.com/innovation/\n[58]: https://icsecurity.com/company/history/\n[59]: https://icsecurity.com/news-media/\n[60]: https://icsecurity.com/careers/\n[61]: https://icsecurity.com/privacy-policy/\n[62]: https://icsecurity.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Inter-Con-TCFD-Report-12.12.2025.pdf"
