            "text": "[[Inter-Con Security]][1]\n* [Security Services][2]\n* [Security Guards][3]\n* [Executive Protection][4]\n* [K-9 Security][5]\n* [Off-Duty Officers][6]\n* [Event Security][7]\n* [Fire Life Safety & Emergency Response][8]\n* [High-Value Asset Protection][9]\n* [Intelligence and Investigatory Solutions][10]\n* [Screening & Access Controls][11]\n* [Security Operations Center][12]\n* [Technology][13]\n* [Value Added Training][14]\n* [Parking Enforcement][15]\n* [International Operations][16]\n* [Industries][17]\n* [Aviation][18]\n* [Commercial Real Estate & Facilities][19]\n* [Construction / Infrastructure][20]\n* [Education][21]\n* [Energy and Utilities][22]\n* [Entertainment][23]\n* [Faith-Based Organizations][24]\n* [Family Business / High Net Worth Individuals][25]\n* [Financial Services / Banking / Insurance][26]\n* [Government (Local, State and Federal)][27]\n* [Healthcare][28]\n* [Logistics][29]\n* [Manufacturing][30]\n* [Mass Transit][31]\n* [Museums / Galleries / Libraries][32]\n* [Non-Profit Organizations][33]\n* [Residential / HOA][34]\n* [Retail][35]\n* [Technology][36]\n* [About Us][37]\n* [Core Values][38]\n* [Corporate Team][39]\n* [Global Footprint][40]\n* [News & Media][41]\n* [Blog][42]\n* [News][43]\n* [Press Release][44]\n* [Careers][45]\n* [Join Us][46]\n* [Apply Now][47]\n* [Contact us][48]\n* [Apply Now][49]\nMenu\n\n# Global Footprint\n\n## A Security Partner Capable of Securing Multinational Operations\n\nWhether it is a diplomatic mission, a Fortune 500 company, or a ultra-high-net-worth estate,\nInter-Con has the experience and infrastructure to provide our signature high-touch security\nservices for any client, at scale.\n\nWe currently maintain a growing network of permanent offices throughout the Americas and Africa.\n\nPlease contact us to learn more about our international service capabilities.\n\n### North America\n\nCanada\n\n407 McGill Street, Suite 700\nMontreal, Quebec H2Y 2G3\n\n[visit map][50]\n\nMexico\n\nLago