      "is_seed": false,
      "company_function": "manufacturer",
      "company_summary": "Industrial Defender specializes in cybersecurity and compliance solutions tailored for operational technology (OT) environments, primarily serving critical infrastructure sectors. Their comprehensive offerings include the Industrial Defender Platform, vulnerability management, and security event monitoring, all designed to enhance asset management, risk assessment, and compliance reporting for organizations facing unique cybersecurity challenges in OT settings.",
      "operational_presence": "Headquartered outside of Boston, MA, we are a US-based company.",
      "data_sources": "discovery=ddgs_bing | enrichment=smart_crawl | page=https://www.industrialdefender.com/solutions/ot-asset-management",
      "_crawl": {
        "founded_year": 2000,
        "headquarters": "Boston, MA, USA",
        "contact_address": "225 Foxborough Blvd, Suite 202, Foxborough, MA 02035, United States of America",
        "offices": "",
        "manufacturing_locations": "",
        "regions_served": "",
        "countries": "United States",
        "ownership_parent": "",
        "company_type": "Private",
        "employee_count": "51-200",
        "revenue": "$10M",
        "key_numbers": "",
        "contact_person": "George Kalavantis",
        "contact_role": "Acting CEO / COO",
        "email": "info@industrialdefender.com",
        "phone": "+1 (877) 943-3363",
        "linkedin": "",
        "website": "https://www.industrialdefender.com",
        "industries": "Power; Oil & Gas; Water; Manufacturing; US Government",
        "products": "Industrial Defender Platform, OT Asset Management, Vulnerability Management, Security Event Monitoring, Compliance Reporting",
        "certifications": "",
        "distributors": "",
        "customers": "",
        "partnerships": "",
        "crawl_text": "Industrial Defender, Inc. U.S.-based company providing cybersecurity solutions. Global InfoSec Awards from Cyber Defense Magazine Cybersecurity Excellence Awards 99% customer renewal rate Comprehensive OT asset data management Focus on operational technology security Comprehensive visibility into OT environments Automated compliance reporting Risk-based vulnerability management Comprehensive OT asset data U.S.-based development and engineering NERC CIP NIST NIS Directive ISA/IEC standards NIS2 TSA Security Directives AESCSF IEC 62443 TSA Pipeline Security Directives Saudi OTCC Outside of Boston, MA, USA United States Industrial Defender has a 99% customer renewal rate, indicating strong customer satisfaction and loyalty. The company has been a pioneer in OT cybersecurity since its inception, focusing on the unique challenges of operational technology environments. Industrial Defender re-emerged as an independent, U.S.-owned company in 2020, reaffirming its commitment to OT cybersecurity. Expanding its platform capabilities to enhance cybersecurity and compliance for critical infrastructure organizations. Navigating the evolving regulatory landscape for cybersecurity in operational technology. Growing demand for OT cybersecurity solutions as industries increasingly recognize the importance of securing critical infrastructure. A leading provider of OT cybersecurity solutions, trusted by major industrial organizations and critical infrastructure operators. Increasing regulatory requirements for cybersecurity in critical infrastructure sectors. The growing threat landscape in operational technology environments. Webinar - CIP-015 Is Here: Paths to Compliance for Every Organization Register Today\n][1]\n[Support][2]\n\n### SOLUTIONS\n\n][3]\nOT Asset Management\n][4][\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][5][\nPolicy Compliance\n][6][\nVulnerability Management\n][7]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n][8]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][9][\nPhoenix for SMBs\n][10][\nServices\n][11][\nPartners\n][12]\n\n### INDUSTRIES\n\n][13]\nPower\n][14][\nOil & Gas\n][15][\nWater\n][16][\nManufacturing\n][17][\nUS Government\n][18][\nSee all\n][19]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\n][20]\nBlog\n][21][\nPodcast\n][22][\nResource Library\n][23][\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][24][\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][25][\nDeployment\n][26][\nFAQ\n][27]\n\n### COMPANY\n\n][28]\nAbout Us\n][29][\nHow We Compare\n][30][\nDeployment\n][31][\nTeam\n][32][\nEvents\n][33][\nPress\n][34][\nCareers\n][35][\nContact Us\n][36]\n\n### SUPPORT\n\n][37]\n\n### REQUEST DEMO\n\n][38]\nSOLUTIONS\n][39]\nOT Asset Management\n][40]\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][41]\nPolicy Compliance\n][42]\nVulnerability Management\n][43]\nPLATFORM\n][44]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][45]\nServices\n][46]\nPartners\n][47]\nINDUSTRIES\n][48]\nPower\n][49]\nOil & Gas\n][50]\nWater\n][51]\nManufacturing\n][52]\nUS Government\n][53]\nSee all\n][54]\nRESOURCES\n][55]\nBlog\n][56]\nPodcast\n][57]\nResource Library\n][58]\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][59]\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][60]\nFAQ\n][61]\nCOMPANY\n][62]\nAbout Us\n][63]\nHow We Compare\n][64]\nTeam\n][65]\nEvents\n][66]\nPress\n][67]\nCareers\n][68]\nContact Us\n][69]\n[Request Demo][70]\nOT Asset Management\n\n# OT Asset Management for Critical Infrastructure\n\nIdentify, monitor and manage your operational technology asset and security data at scale with a\nsingle platform.\n\n[Request Demo][71]\n\n## What is OT Asset Management (OTAM)?\n\nOT asset management goes beyond basic network visibility to deliver a true, continuously updated\ninventory of every device, system, and configuration in your industrial environment. Knowing that\nsomething is \u201con the network\u201d is not the same as knowing exactly what it is, how it is configured,\nand what risk it introduces. This accurate, detailed asset intelligence sets the stage for effective\nmonitoring, vulnerability management, and incident response, so when you see suspicious activity,\nyou know exactly what you are dealing with and how to take action.\n\nThe ability for organizations to properly and consistently identify and consistently manage data,\npersonnel, devices, systems, and facilities based on their relative importance to provide the\nfoundational capability to support an organizational cybersecurity program.\u201d ^{*}\n\n^{*}\nNIST 800-82 Special Publication, Revision 3, Guide to Operational Technology Security, Initial\nPublic Draft - NIST, April 2022\nOur Approach\n\n## **Why Choose OT Asset Management from Industrial Defender?**\n\nCreate an efficient configuration and change management process\nReduce MTTR\nEnable ongoing vulnerability and patch management\nSupport more comprehensive risk assessments and mitigations\nBuild a single source of truth for maintenance efficiency\nEstablish a backup and recovery foundation\nSolution Brief: OT Asset Management\n\nAsset management is one of the most undervalued activities in the operational technology space,\ndespite its critical importance to a strong cybersecurity program and regulatory compliance efforts.\nWe're here to change that.\n\n][72]\nDemo Video: OT Asset Management\n\nView this demo video to learn how our solution goes beyond asset visibility to enable you **to\nquickly onboard and decommission assets, analyze how your assets are changing over time, and create\nbaselines to monitor for anomalies.**\n\n][73]\nOur Approach\n\n## **Why Is OT Asset Management Important?**\n\nTo ensure the safety of their employees and the public, create an effective cybersecurity program,\nand prepare for future regulatory requirements, critical infrastructure organizations must build a\nfuture-proof foundation by identifying, monitoring and managing changes for every OT asset in their\ninfrastructure.\n\nSafety\n\nIn OT environments, digital assets impact the physical world. OT asset management helps ensure\nsafety if an unintended or unauthorized change occurs in a device or system.\n\nSecurity\n\nAccurate asset data and security baselines are the foundation of a strong cybersecurity program.\nHistorizing asset changes also provides a template for backup and recovery if an incident does\noccur.\n\nCompliance\n\nHaving an OT asset management foundation in place helps you prepare for future compliance\nregulations that could affect your industry.\n\nOur Approach\n\n## **An OT Asset Management Solution for the Future.**\n\nSecurity teams need an automated approach to identify, monitor and manage every asset and document\nappropriate changes. Industrial Defender provides a single source of truth for your asset base that\nincludes configuration and change management and enables a centralized cybersecurity program that\ncan include vulnerability and patch management, version control, security baselines, risk\nassessments, incident response and compliance reporting.\n\nFor effective OT asset management, teams need access to four sources of data: physical inspection\ninformation, passive monitoring methods, configuration analysis and active discovery techniques.\nIndustrial Defender leverages all four of these methods in one UI.\n\n## Learn More About OT Asset Management\n\nSolution Brief\nOT Asset Management\n\nAsset management is one of the most undervalued activities in the operational technology space,\ndespite its critical importance to a strong cybersecurity program and regulatory compliance efforts.\nWe're here to change that.\n\n[Read Solution Brief][74]\nSolution Brief\nOur Approach to Data Collection\n\nThe cornerstone of security and compliance in operational environments is reliable OT asset data.\nUnderstanding of your OT environment begins with an asset inventory. If that\u2019s limited to simply\nknowing what devices are present on your network, you need to go deeper.\n\n[Read Solution Brief][75]\nDemo Video\nOT Asset Management\n\nIndustrial Defender safely collects, monitors and manages your OT assets at scale using agent,\nagentless or passive data collection methods. View this demo video to learn how our solution goes\nbeyond asset visibility.\n\n[Watch Video][76]\nSpeak With an Expert\n\n## Demo Request\n\nSet up some time with one of our experts to see how our OT cyber risk management platform can help\nsolve your unique security needs. Our solution can help you with:\n\nAsset Visibility & Management\nVulnerability Management\nIT/OT Collaboration\nCompliance Reporting\n\n## Stay up to date.\n\nSign up for our newsletter to receive the latest Industrial Defender news & updates.\n\nPrivacy Policy\n][77]\n\n##### PRODUCTS\n\n[Industrial Defender Platform][78]\n\n##### SERVICES\n\n[Cyber Diligence Service][79][CopilOT\nService^{TM}][80][Commissioning][81][Support][82][Training][83][Sustain][84]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY TYPE\n\n[OT Asset Management][85][Vulnerability Management][86][Security Event Monitoring][87][Compliance\nReporting][88]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY FUNCTION\n\n[Security][89][Compliance][90][Operations][91][Executive][92]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY INDUSTRY\n\n[Building Automation][93][Chemical][94][Electric][95][Federal Government][96][Food &\nAgriculture][97][Maritime][98][Metals & Mining][99][Oil &\nGas][100][Pharmaceuticals][101][Rail][102][Water][103]\n\n##### RESOURCES\n\n[Resource Collection][104][Glossary][105][DefenderSphere][106][IT-OT Integration Lab][107][OT\nCybersecurity Risk Calculator][108][Innovations by ID][109][Glossary][110]\n\n##### COMPANY\n\n[About Us][111][How We Compare][112][Team][113][Events][114][Press][115][Careers][116][Contact\nUs][117]\n\n[1]: /resources/webinar-cip-015-is-here-paths-to-compliance-for-every-organization\n[2]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.industria\nldefender.com%2F&reauth=1\n[3]: #\n[4]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[5]: /solutions/configuration-change-management\n[6]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[7]: /solutions/vulnerability-managemen Webinar - CIP-015 Is Here: Paths to Compliance for Every Organization Register Today\n][1]\n[Support][2]\n\n### SOLUTIONS\n\n][3]\nOT Asset Management\n][4][\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][5][\nPolicy Compliance\n][6][\nVulnerability Management\n][7]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n][8]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][9][\nPhoenix for SMBs\n][10][\nServices\n][11][\nPartners\n][12]\n\n### INDUSTRIES\n\n][13]\nPower\n][14][\nOil & Gas\n][15][\nWater\n][16][\nManufacturing\n][17][\nUS Government\n][18][\nSee all\n][19]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\n][20]\nBlog\n][21][\nPodcast\n][22][\nResource Library\n][23][\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][24][\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][25][\nDeployment\n][26][\nFAQ\n][27]\n\n### COMPANY\n\n][28]\nAbout Us\n][29][\nHow We Compare\n][30][\nDeployment\n][31][\nTeam\n][32][\nEvents\n][33][\nPress\n][34][\nCareers\n][35][\nContact Us\n][36]\n\n### SUPPORT\n\n][37]\n\n### REQUEST DEMO\n\n][38]\nSOLUTIONS\n][39]\nOT Asset Management\n][40]\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][41]\nPolicy Compliance\n][42]\nVulnerability Management\n][43]\nPLATFORM\n][44]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][45]\nServices\n][46]\nPartners\n][47]\nINDUSTRIES\n][48]\nPower\n][49]\nOil & Gas\n][50]\nWater\n][51]\nManufacturing\n][52]\nUS Government\n][53]\nSee all\n][54]\nRESOURCES\n][55]\nBlog\n][56]\nPodcast\n][57]\nResource Library\n][58]\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][59]\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][60]\nFAQ\n][61]\nCOMPANY\n][62]\nAbout Us\n][63]\nHow We Compare\n][64]\nTeam\n][65]\nEvents\n][66]\nPress\n][67]\nCareers\n][68]\nContact Us\n][69]\n[Request Demo][70]\nVulnerability Management\n\n# **Identify, Prioritize, and Mitigate OT Vulnerabilities**\n\nWe recognize the unique design, context, and critical nature of OT, offering an operationally safe\nmethod for identifying and prioritizing vulnerabilities. AI/LLM-enhanced, Industrial Defender\nprovides an complete view of vulnerabilities across your OT environment and intelligently\nprioritizes remediation based on the potential impact to your environment.\n\n[Request Demo][71]\nOur Approach\n\n## **How Our Vulnerability Management Solution Supports Effective Risk Mitigations**\n\n**Complete Visibility**\n\nAccurate, in-depth view of your OT environment with vulnerability information integrated alongside\ncritical asset context \u2013 all within a centralized OT asset management platform.\n\n**Risk-Based Prioritization**\n\nPrioritize what matters most using threat intelligence, operational con"
