          {
            "url": "https://www.industrialdefender.com/solutions/vulnerability-management",
            "text": "Webinar - CIP-015 Is Here: Paths to Compliance for Every Organization Register Today\n][1]\n[Support][2]\n\n### SOLUTIONS\n\n][3]\nOT Asset Management\n][4][\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][5][\nPolicy Compliance\n][6][\nVulnerability Management\n][7]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n][8]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][9][\nPhoenix for SMBs\n][10][\nServices\n][11][\nPartners\n][12]\n\n### INDUSTRIES\n\n][13]\nPower\n][14][\nOil & Gas\n][15][\nWater\n][16][\nManufacturing\n][17][\nUS Government\n][18][\nSee all\n][19]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\n][20]\nBlog\n][21][\nPodcast\n][22][\nResource Library\n][23][\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][24][\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][25][\nDeployment\n][26][\nFAQ\n][27]\n\n### COMPANY\n\n][28]\nAbout Us\n][29][\nHow We Compare\n][30][\nDeployment\n][31][\nTeam\n][32][\nEvents\n][33][\nPress\n][34][\nCareers\n][35][\nContact Us\n][36]\n\n### SUPPORT\n\n][37]\n\n### REQUEST DEMO\n\n][38]\nSOLUTIONS\n][39]\nOT Asset Management\n][40]\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][41]\nPolicy Compliance\n][42]\nVulnerability Management\n][43]\nPLATFORM\n][44]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][45]\nServices\n][46]\nPartners\n][47]\nINDUSTRIES\n][48]\nPower\n][49]\nOil & Gas\n][50]\nWater\n][51]\nManufacturing\n][52]\nUS Government\n][53]\nSee all\n][54]\nRESOURCES\n][55]\nBlog\n][56]\nPodcast\n][57]\nResource Library\n][58]\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][59]\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][60]\nFAQ\n][61]\nCOMPANY\n][62]\nAbout Us\n][63]\nHow We Compare\n][64]\nTeam\n][65]\nEvents\n][66]\nPress\n][67]\nCareers\n][68]\nContact Us\n][69]\n[Request Demo][70]\nVulnerability Management\n\n# **Identify, Prioritize, and Mitigate OT Vulnerabilities**\n\nWe recognize the unique design, context, and critical nature of OT, offering an operationally safe\nmethod for identifying and prioritizing vulnerabilities. AI/LLM-enhanced, Industrial Defender\nprovides an complete view of vulnerabilities across your OT environment and intelligently\nprioritizes remediation based on the potential impact to your environment.\n\n[Request Demo][71]\nOur Approach\n\n## **How Our Vulnerability Management Solution Supports Effective Risk Mitigations**\n\n**Complete Visibility**\n\nAccurate, in-depth view of your OT environment with vulnerability information integrated alongside\ncritical asset context \u2013 all within a centralized OT asset management platform.\n\n**Risk-Based Prioritization**\n\nPrioritize what matters most using threat intelligence, operational context, and AI/LLM-enriched\nanalysis to surface the most impactful risks in your environment.\n\n**Patch & Mitigation Tracking**\n\nTrack patch availability, monitor mitigation efforts, and stay ahead of new validated updates\u2014so you\nalways know what\u2019s been addressed and what still needs action.\n\n**Continuous Monitoring**\n\nMaintain a real-time view of your environment and closely monitor unpatchable assets for signs of\ncompromise, unauthorized changes, or suspicious behavior.\n\nSolution Brief: OT Asset Management\n\nAsset management is one of the most undervalued activities in the operational technology space,\ndespite its critical importance to a strong cybersecurity program and regulatory compliance efforts.\nWe're here to change that.\n\n][72]\nDemo Video: OT Asset Management\n\nView this demo video to learn how our solution goes beyond asset visibility to enable you **to\nquickly onboard and decommission assets, analyze how your assets are changing over time, and create\nbaselines to monitor for anomalies.**\n\n][73]\nOur Approach\n\n# **An OT-First Approach to Vulnerability Management**\n\nYou can\u2019t scan OT systems the way you scan IT\u2014doing so risks disrupting operations, safety, or both.\n\nThat\u2019s why Industrial Defender takes a different approach. Because we specialize in complete,\naccurate visibility\u2014collected in an OT-safe manner\u2014we can help you identify vulnerabilities across\nyour environment without introducing risk of traditional vulnerability scanning.\n\nAI-enabled, Industrial Defender enables swift identification and prioritization of vulnerabilities,\nproviding an accurate, complete view across your OT environment while ensuring remediation efforts\nare focused where they matter most.\n\nOur Approach\n\n## **Risk-Based Vulnerability Management**\n\nIndustrial Defender enables **risk-based vulnerability management** by prioritizing remediation\nefforts based on the risk factors specific to your environment. This includes correlating\ntraditional severity scores (such as CVSS), external threat intelligence, and the business\nimportance of each asset\u2014factoring in its role and operational context. Prioritization leverages\ndata from multiple sources: real-world exploitability, human insight into the asset\u2019s operational\ncontext, and AI/LLM-powered analysis, which also supports the automated creation of workflow\npackages for vulnerabilities known to be actively exploited.\n\nSolution Brief: OT Asset Management\n\nAsset management is one of the most undervalued activities in the operational technology space,\ndespite its critical importance to a strong cybersecurity program and regulatory compliance efforts.\nWe're here to change that.\n\n][74]\nDemo Video: OT Asset Management\n\nView this demo video to learn how our solution goes beyond asset visibility to enable you **to\nquickly onboard and decommission assets, analyze how your assets are changing over time, and create\nbaselines to monitor for anomalies.**\n\n][75]\n\n## Learn More About Vulnerability Management\n\nSolution Brief\n**Vulnerability Management for OT**\n\nWhen it comes to assessing vulnerabilities in ICS/OT operational environments, a different approach\nis needed than the ones used in traditional IT. Industrial Defender acknowledges the unique design,\ncontext, and critical nature of OT assets, offering an operationally safe method for identifying\nvulnerabilities.\n\n[View Resource][76]\nData Sheet\n**Risk Based Vulnerability Management for OT**\n\nReady to prioritize your vulnerabilities based on how they would actually impact your specific\norganization? Download our data sheet on how Industrial Defender\u2019s risk-based vulnerability\nmanagement solution, powered by threat intelligence and insights into your specific business\ncontext, streamlines your security strategy and strengthens your security posture.\n\n[View Resource][77]\nData Sheet\n**Intrusion Detection with Industrial Defender**\n\nAs operational technology (OT) and IT networks become more interconnected, the risk of cyber\nintrusion rises\u2014and so does the need for continuous monitoring. Intrusion Detection Systems (IDS)\noffer a non-intrusive way to detect unauthorized or malicious activity by monitoring mirrored\ntraffic in real time.\n\n[View Resource][78]\nSpeak With an Expert\n\n## Demo Request\n\nSet up some time with one of our experts to see how our OT cyber risk management platform can help\nsolve your unique security needs. Our solution can help you with:\n\nAsset Visibility & Management\nVulnerability Management\nIT/OT Collaboration\nCompliance Reporting\n\n## Stay up to date.\n\nSign up for our newsletter to receive the latest Industrial Defender news & updates.\n\nPrivacy Policy\n][79]\n\n##### PRODUCTS\n\n[Industrial Defender Platform][80]\n\n##### SERVICES\n\n[Cyber Diligence Service][81][CopilOT\nService^{TM}][82][Commissioning][83][Support][84][Training][85][Sustain][86]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY TYPE\n\n[OT Asset Management][87][Vulnerability Management][88][Security Event Monitoring][89][Compliance\nReporting][90]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY FUNCTION\n\n[Security][91][Compliance][92][Operations][93][Executive][94]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY INDUSTRY\n\n[Building Automation][95][Chemical][96][Electric][97][Federal Government][98][Food &\nAgriculture][99][Maritime][100][Metals & Mining][101][Oil &\nGas][102][Pharmaceuticals][103][Rail][104][Water][105]\n\n##### RESOURCES\n\n[Resource Collection][106][Glossary][107][DefenderSphere][108][IT-OT Integration Lab][109][OT\nCybersecurity Risk Calculator][110][Innovations by ID][111][Glossary][112]\n\n##### COMPANY\n\n[About Us][113][How We Compare][114][Team][115][Events][116][Press][117][Careers][118][Contact\nUs][119]\n\n[1]: /resources/webinar-cip-015-is-here-paths-to-compliance-for-every-organization\n[2]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.industria\nldefender.com%2F&reauth=1\n[3]: #\n[4]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[5]: /solutions/configuration-change-management\n[6]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[7]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[8]: #\n[9]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[10]: #\n[11]: /services\n[12]: /partners-old\n[13]: #\n[14]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[15]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[16]: /industries/water\n[17]: /industries/critical-manufacturing\n[18]: /industries/us-government\n[19]: /industries/all\n[20]: #\n[21]: /ics-cybersecurity-blog\n[22]: /podcast\n[23]: /resources\n[24]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[25]: /innovations\n[26]: /deployment\n[27]: /faq\n[28]: #\n[29]: /about-us\n[30]: /how-we-compare\n[31]: /deployment\n[32]: /team\n[33]: /events\n[34]: /press\n[35]: /careers\n[36]: /contact-us\n[37]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.industri\naldefender.com%2F&reauth=1\n[38]: /demo/demo-request\n[39]: /solutions\n[40]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[41]: /solutions/configuration-change-management\n[42]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[43]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[44]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[45]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[46]: /services\n[47]: /partners\n[48]: /industries/all\n[49]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[50]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[51]: /industries/water\n[52]: /industries/critical-manufacturing\n[53]: /industries/us-government\n[54]: /industries/all\n[55]: /resources\n[56]: /ics-cybersecurity-blog\n[57]: /podcast\n[58]: /resources\n[59]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[60]: /innovations\n[61]: /faq\n[62]: /about-us\n[63]: /about-us\n[64]: /how-we-compare\n[65]: /team\n[66]: /events\n[67]: /press\n[68]: /careers\n[69]: /contact-us\n[70]: /demo-request\n[71]: /demo-request\n[72]: #\n[73]: #\n[74]: #\n[75]: #\n[76]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/resources/solution-brief-vulnerability-management-for-ot\n[77]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/resources/data-sheet-risk-based-vulnerability-management-fo\nr-ot\n[78]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/resources/intrusion-detection-with-industrial-defender\n[79]: /privacy-policy\n[80]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[81]: /cyber-diligence-service\n[82]: /copilot-service\n[83]: /professional-services\n[84]: /professional-services\n[85]: /professional-services\n[86]: /professional-services\n[87]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[88]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[89]: /solutions/security-event-monitoring\n[90]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[91]: /function/security\n[92]: /function/compliance\n[93]: /function/operations\n[94]: /function/executive\n[95]: /industries/building-automation\n[96]: /industries/chemical-processing-cybersecurity\n[97]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[98]: /industries/federal-government\n[99]: /industries/food-agriculture\n[100]: /industries/maritime\n[101]: /industries/metals-mining\n[102]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[103]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[104]: /industries/rail\n[105]: /industries/water\n[106]: /resources\n[107]: /glossary\n[108]: /defendersphere-ics-vendors\n[109]: /it-ot-integration-lab\n[110]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[111]: /innovations\n[112]: /glossary\n[113]: /about-us\n[114]: /how-we-compare\n[115]: /team\n[116]: /events\n[117]: /press\n[118]: /careers\n[119]: /contact-us"
