            "url": "https://www.industrialdefender.com/solutions/security-event-monitoring",
            "text": "Webinar - CIP-015 Is Here: Paths to Compliance for Every Organization Register Today\n][1]\n[Support][2]\n\n### SOLUTIONS\n\n][3]\nOT Asset Management\n][4][\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][5][\nPolicy Compliance\n][6][\nVulnerability Management\n][7]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n][8]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][9][\nPhoenix for SMBs\n][10][\nServices\n][11][\nPartners\n][12]\n\n### INDUSTRIES\n\n][13]\nPower\n][14][\nOil & Gas\n][15][\nWater\n][16][\nManufacturing\n][17][\nUS Government\n][18][\nSee all\n][19]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\n][20]\nBlog\n][21][\nPodcast\n][22][\nResource Library\n][23][\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][24][\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][25][\nDeployment\n][26][\nFAQ\n][27]\n\n### COMPANY\n\n][28]\nAbout Us\n][29][\nHow We Compare\n][30][\nDeployment\n][31][\nTeam\n][32][\nEvents\n][33][\nPress\n][34][\nCareers\n][35][\nContact Us\n][36]\n\n### SUPPORT\n\n][37]\n\n### REQUEST DEMO\n\n][38]\nSOLUTIONS\n][39]\nOT Asset Management\n][40]\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][41]\nPolicy Compliance\n][42]\nVulnerability Management\n][43]\nPLATFORM\n][44]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][45]\nServices\n][46]\nPartners\n][47]\nINDUSTRIES\n][48]\nPower\n][49]\nOil & Gas\n][50]\nWater\n][51]\nManufacturing\n][52]\nUS Government\n][53]\nSee all\n][54]\nRESOURCES\n][55]\nBlog\n][56]\nPodcast\n][57]\nResource Library\n][58]\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][59]\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][60]\nFAQ\n][61]\nCOMPANY\n][62]\nAbout Us\n][63]\nHow We Compare\n][64]\nTeam\n][65]\nEvents\n][66]\nPress\n][67]\nCareers\n][68]\nContact Us\n][69]\n[Request Demo][70]\nSolution by Type: Security Event Monitoring\n\n# OT Cyber Threat Detection\n\nComprehensive OT cybersecurity monitoring and management for critical infrastructure\n\n[Learn More][71]\n\n## The Challenge\n\nDetecting and prioritizing cybersecurity threats to operational technology systems\n\n# How Our Solution Detects & Prioritizes Security & Operational Threats\n\n**Consolidate security data from multiple sources** to triage the events that matter most\n\n**Quickly detect any change **to your OT assets, including ports & services, users, software,\npatches and firewall rules\n\n**Monitor for network anomalies **to flag suspicious communication activity\n\n**Get the contextual data you really need, **including how important a device is, where it\u2019s located\nand who owns it\n\n**Share OT cybersecurity data** across the enterprise to improve communication and reduce MTTR\n\n**Access historical event logs** for all your OT devices to aid incident response\n\n## OT Machine Learning Powered by Splunk\n\n\u201cThe Industrial Defender for Splunk app centralizes machine learning and threat detection for OT\nenvironments to solve complex cybersecurity challenges with contextual endpoint and network data to\nquickly identify and mitigate potential cybersecurity issues like ransomware.\u201d\n\n[Watch now][72]\n\n## Detect Anomalous Activity with Industrial Defender & MITRE ATT&CK for ICS\n\n[[View Infographic]][73]\n\n## Request Your Demo\n\nTake a guided tour of the product with one of our knowledgeable staff members.\n\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n\n### **OT Asset Management**\n\n### **Vulnerability Management**\n\n### **IT/OT Collaboration**\n\n### **Compliance Reporting**\n\n# Explore More Resources\n\nNo items found.\n\n### Webinar: Managing OT Data\n\n[Read more][74]\n\n### Webinar: Why Do Ransomware Gangs Target Private Equity Portfolio Companies?\n\n[Read more][75]\n\n### Solution Brief: OT Machine Learning Powered by Splunk\n\n[Read more][76]\n\n## Stay up to date.\n\nSign up for our newsletter to receive the latest Industrial Defender news & updates.\n\nPrivacy Policy\n][77]\n\n##### PRODUCTS\n\n[Industrial Defender Platform][78]\n\n##### SERVICES\n\n[Cyber Diligence Service][79][CopilOT\nService^{TM}][80][Commissioning][81][Support][82][Training][83][Sustain][84]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY TYPE\n\n[OT Asset Management][85][Vulnerability Management][86][Security Event Monitoring][87][Compliance\nReporting][88]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY FUNCTION\n\n[Security][89][Compliance][90][Operations][91][Executive][92]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY INDUSTRY\n\n[Building Automation][93][Chemical][94][Electric][95][Federal Government][96][Food &\nAgriculture][97][Maritime][98][Metals & Mining][99][Oil &\nGas][100][Pharmaceuticals][101][Rail][102][Water][103]\n\n##### RESOURCES\n\n[Resource Collection][104][Glossary][105][DefenderSphere][106][IT-OT Integration Lab][107][OT\nCybersecurity Risk Calculator][108][Innovations by ID][109][Glossary][110]\n\n##### COMPANY\n\n[About Us][111][How We Compare][112][Team][113][Events][114][Press][115][Careers][116][Contact\nUs][117]\n\n[1]: /resources/webinar-cip-015-is-here-paths-to-compliance-for-every-organization\n[2]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.industria\nldefender.com%2F&reauth=1\n[3]: #\n[4]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[5]: /solutions/configuration-change-management\n[6]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[7]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[8]: #\n[9]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[10]: #\n[11]: /services\n[12]: /partners-old\n[13]: #\n[14]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[15]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[16]: /industries/water\n[17]: /industries/critical-manufacturing\n[18]: /industries/us-government\n[19]: /industries/all\n[20]: #\n[21]: /ics-cybersecurity-blog\n[22]: /podcast\n[23]: /resources\n[24]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[25]: /innovations\n[26]: /deployment\n[27]: /faq\n[28]: #\n[29]: /about-us\n[30]: /how-we-compare\n[31]: /deployment\n[32]: /team\n[33]: /events\n[34]: /press\n[35]: /careers\n[36]: /contact-us\n[37]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.industri\naldefender.com%2F&reauth=1\n[38]: /demo/demo-request\n[39]: /solutions\n[40]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[41]: /solutions/configuration-change-management\n[42]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[43]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[44]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[45]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[46]: /services\n[47]: /partners\n[48]: /industries/all\n[49]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[50]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[51]: /industries/water\n[52]: /industries/critical-manufacturing\n[53]: /industries/us-government\n[54]: /industries/all\n[55]: /resources\n[56]: /ics-cybersecurity-blog\n[57]: /podcast\n[58]: /resources\n[59]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[60]: /innovations\n[61]: /faq\n[62]: /about-us\n[63]: /about-us\n[64]: /how-we-compare\n[65]: /team\n[66]: /events\n[67]: /press\n[68]: /careers\n[69]: /contact-us\n[70]: /demo-request\n[71]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[72]: /demo/ot-machine-learning-video-demo\n[73]: https://cta-redirect.hubspot.com/cta/redirect/6940570/61e3de06-081e-4a58-b451-a755bc7eae2f\n[74]: /resources/webinar-managing-ot-data\n[75]: /resources/webinar-ransomware-private-equity\n[76]: /resources/solution-brief-splunk-otml\n[77]: /privacy-policy\n[78]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[79]: /cyber-diligence-service\n[80]: /copilot-service\n[81]: /professional-services\n[82]: /professional-services\n[83]: /professional-services\n[84]: /professional-services\n[85]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[86]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[87]: /solutions/security-event-monitoring\n[88]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[89]: /function/security\n[90]: /function/compliance\n[91]: /function/operations\n[92]: /function/executive\n[93]: /industries/building-automation\n[94]: /industries/chemical-processing-cybersecurity\n[95]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[96]: /industries/federal-government\n[97]: /industries/food-agriculture\n[98]: /industries/maritime\n[99]: /industries/metals-mining\n[100]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[101]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[102]: /industries/rail\n[103]: /industries/water\n[104]: /resources\n[105]: /glossary\n[106]: /defendersphere-ics-vendors\n[107]: /it-ot-integration-lab\n[108]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[109]: /innovations\n[110]: /glossary\n[111]: /about-us\n[112]: /how-we-compare\n[113]: /team\n[114]: /events\n[115]: /press\n[116]: /careers\n[117]: /contact-us"
