            "text": "Webinar - CIP-015 Is Here: Paths to Compliance for Every Organization Register Today\n][1]\n[Support][2]\n\n### SOLUTIONS\n\n][3]\nOT Asset Management\n][4][\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][5][\nPolicy Compliance\n][6][\nVulnerability Management\n][7]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n][8]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][9][\nPhoenix for SMBs\n][10][\nServices\n][11][\nPartners\n][12]\n\n### INDUSTRIES\n\n][13]\nPower\n][14][\nOil & Gas\n][15][\nWater\n][16][\nManufacturing\n][17][\nUS Government\n][18][\nSee all\n][19]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\n][20]\nBlog\n][21][\nPodcast\n][22][\nResource Library\n][23][\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][24][\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][25][\nDeployment\n][26][\nFAQ\n][27]\n\n### COMPANY\n\n][28]\nAbout Us\n][29][\nHow We Compare\n][30][\nDeployment\n][31][\nTeam\n][32][\nEvents\n][33][\nPress\n][34][\nCareers\n][35][\nContact Us\n][36]\n\n### SUPPORT\n\n][37]\n\n### REQUEST DEMO\n\n][38]\nSOLUTIONS\n][39]\nOT Asset Management\n][40]\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][41]\nPolicy Compliance\n][42]\nVulnerability Management\n][43]\nPLATFORM\n][44]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][45]\nServices\n][46]\nPartners\n][47]\nINDUSTRIES\n][48]\nPower\n][49]\nOil & Gas\n][50]\nWater\n][51]\nManufacturing\n][52]\nUS Government\n][53]\nSee all\n][54]\nRESOURCES\n][55]\nBlog\n][56]\nPodcast\n][57]\nResource Library\n][58]\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][59]\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][60]\nFAQ\n][61]\nCOMPANY\n][62]\nAbout Us\n][63]\nHow We Compare\n][64]\nTeam\n][65]\nEvents\n][66]\nPress\n][67]\nCareers\n][68]\nContact Us\n][69]\n[Request Demo][70]\nCompliance Reporting\n\n# Simplified Compliance Reporting for OT Environments\n\nAutomate manual compliance tasks with a suite of built-in policy management options and one-click\ncompliance reporting for dozens of international standards.\n\n[Request Demo][71]\nOur Approach\n\n## **Why Choose ID for Compliance Reporting?**\n\n**Provide the critical data **you need to prove compliance with your standard. You can even choose\nfrom a suite of built-in policies for users, assets and groups.\n**Prove compliance **with audit-ready compliance reporting and policy templates for all major\nindustry standards, including NERC CIP, NIST, the NIS Directive and ISA/IEC standards.\n**Share the right information with the right people **via our email, server share and SharePoint\nsubscription options.\nSolution Brief: OT Asset Management\n\nAsset management is one of the most undervalued activities in the operational technology space,\ndespite its critical importance to a strong cybersecurity program and regulatory compliance efforts.\nWe're here to change that.\n\n][72]\nDemo Video: OT Asset Management\n\nView this demo video to learn how our solution goes beyond asset visibility to enable you **to\nquickly onboard and decommission assets, analyze how your assets are changing over time, and create\nbaselines to monitor for anomalies.**\n\n][73]\nOur Approach\n\n## **Automate NERC CIP Compliance with Industrial Defender**\n\nIndustrial Defender has helped North American utilities automate their NERC Critical Infrastructure\nProtection (CIP) compliance management and reporting for over a decade. Compliance teams love our\nplatform because it saves them time, effort and money on their NERC CIP programs.\n\n[Learn more][74]\n\n## Learn More About OT Cybersecurity Compliance\n\nSolution Brief\n**Automated Compliance Reporting**\n\nIndustrial Defender helps teams establish and prove compliance with regulatory standards in complex\nindustrial environments. ID's Automated Compliance Reporting Solution helps OT cybersecurity teams\nautomatically identify, monitor and manage all operational technology assets, and automate\ncompliance reporting.\n\n[View Resource][75]\nCompliance Guide\n**The NERC CIP Standards**\n\nThe NERC CIP requirements were designed to ensure the security of North American bulk electric\nsystems (BES) and consist of 12 standards covering security management controls, personnel and\ntraining, system security management, electronic security perimeters, disaster recovery planning,\nand configuration change management.\n\n[View Resource][76]\nCompliance Guide\n**European NIS Directive**\n\nThe aim of the NIS Directive is to create a higher level of cybersecurity in Europe. The Directive\nsignificantly affects digital service providers (DSPs) and operators of essential services (OESs).\nOperators of essential services include any organisations whose operations would be greatly affected\nin the case of a security breach if they engage in critical societal or economic activities.\n\n[View Resource][77]\nSpeak With an Expert\n\n## Demo Request\n\nSet up some time with one of our experts to see how our OT cyber risk management platform can help\nsolve your unique security needs. Our solution can help you with:\n\nAsset Visibility & Management\nVulnerability Management\nIT/OT Collaboration\nCompliance Reporting\n\n## Stay up to date.\n\nSign up for our newsletter to receive the latest Industrial Defender news & updates.\n\nPrivacy Policy\n][78]\n\n##### PRODUCTS\n\n[Industrial Defender Platform][79]\n\n##### SERVICES\n\n[Cyber Diligence Service][80][CopilOT\nService^{TM}][81][Commissioning][82][Support][83][Training][84][Sustain][85]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY TYPE\n\n[OT Asset Management][86][Vulnerability Management][87][Security Event Monitoring][88][Compliance\nReporting][89]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY FUNCTION\n\n[Security][90][Compliance][91][Operations][92][Executive][93]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY INDUSTRY\n\n[Building Automation][94][Chemical][95][Electric][96][Federal Government][97][Food &\nAgriculture][98][Maritime][99][Metals & Mining][100][Oil &\nGas][101][Pharmaceuticals][102][Rail][103][Water][104]\n\n##### RESOURCES\n\n[Resource Collection][105][Glossary][106][DefenderSphere][107][IT-OT Integration Lab][108][OT\nCybersecurity Risk Calculator][109][Innovations by ID][110][Glossary][111]\n\n##### COMPANY\n\n[About Us][112][How We Compare][113][Team][114][Events][115][Press][116][Careers][117][Contact\nUs][118]\n\n[1]: /resources/webinar-cip-015-is-here-paths-to-compliance-for-every-organization\n[2]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.industria\nldefender.com%2F&reauth=1\n[3]: #\n[4]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[5]: /solutions/configuration-change-management\n[6]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[7]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[8]: #\n[9]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[10]: #\n[11]: /services\n[12]: /partners-old\n[13]: #\n[14]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[15]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[16]: /industries/water\n[17]: /industries/critical-manufacturing\n[18]: /industries/us-government\n[19]: /industries/all\n[20]: #\n[21]: /ics-cybersecurity-blog\n[22]: /podcast\n[23]: /resources\n[24]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[25]: /innovations\n[26]: /deployment\n[27]: /faq\n[28]: #\n[29]: /about-us\n[30]: /how-we-compare\n[31]: /deployment\n[32]: /team\n[33]: /events\n[34]: /press\n[35]: /careers\n[36]: /contact-us\n[37]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.industri\naldefender.com%2F&reauth=1\n[38]: /demo/demo-request\n[39]: /solutions\n[40]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[41]: /solutions/configuration-change-management\n[42]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[43]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[44]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[45]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[46]: /services\n[47]: /partners\n[48]: /industries/all\n[49]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[50]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[51]: /industries/water\n[52]: /industries/critical-manufacturing\n[53]: /industries/us-government\n[54]: /industries/all\n[55]: /resources\n[56]: /ics-cybersecurity-blog\n[57]: /podcast\n[58]: /resources\n[59]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[60]: /innovations\n[61]: /faq\n[62]: /about-us\n[63]: /about-us\n[64]: /how-we-compare\n[65]: /team\n[66]: /events\n[67]: /press\n[68]: /careers\n[69]: /contact-us\n[70]: /demo-request\n[71]: /demo-request\n[72]: #\n[73]: #\n[74]: /automate-nerc-cip-compliance\n[75]: /resources/automated-compliance-reporting-solution-brief\n[76]: /resources/compliance-guide-nerc-cip-standards\n[77]: /resources/nis-directive-compliance-reporting\n[78]: /privacy-policy\n[79]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[80]: /cyber-diligence-service\n[81]: /copilot-service\n[82]: /professional-services\n[83]: /professional-services\n[84]: /professional-services\n[85]: /professional-services\n[86]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[87]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[88]: /solutions/security-event-monitoring\n[89]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[90]: /function/security\n[91]: /function/compliance\n[92]: /function/operations\n[93]: /function/executive\n[94]: /industries/building-automation\n[95]: /industries/chemical-processing-cybersecurity\n[96]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[97]: /industries/federal-government\n[98]: /industries/food-agriculture\n[99]: /industries/maritime\n[100]: /industries/metals-mining\n[101]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[102]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[103]: /industries/rail\n[104]: /industries/water\n[105]: /resources\n[106]: /glossary\n[107]: /defendersphere-ics-vendors\n[108]: /it-ot-integration-lab\n[109]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[110]: /innovations\n[111]: /glossary\n[112]: /about-us\n[113]: /how-we-compare\n[114]: /team\n[115]: /events\n[116]: /press\n[117]: /careers\n[118]: /contact-us"
