canless, Cloud-Powered OT Vulnerability Management\n\nTurn your OT asset inventory into a risk-based vulnerability management program leveraging machine\nlearning and natural language processing.\n\n[Learn More][72]\nBuilding Defender\u2122\n\n# Proven Industrial Cybersecurity for Building Management Systems\n\nDetect and prevent cyberattacks on building management systems (BMS) with Building Defender\u2122.\n\n[Learn More][73]\nRTAP\n\n# A Powerful, Secure SCADA Solution for Mission-Critical Industries\n\nIndustrial Defender\u2019s RTAP solution delivers a truly powerful and secure SCADA solution to manage\nthe automation challenges of today\u2019s critical infrastructure industries.\n\n[Learn More][74]\n\n## Stay up to date.\n\nSign up for our newsletter to receive the latest Industrial Defender news & updates.\n\nPrivacy Policy\n][75]\n\n##### PRODUCTS\n\n[Industrial Defender Platform][76]\n\n##### SERVICES\n\n[Cyber Diligence Service][77][CopilOT\nService^{TM}][78][Commissioning][79][Support][80][Training][81][Sustain][82]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY TYPE\n\n[OT Asset Management][83][Vulnerability Management][84][Security Event Monitoring][85][Compliance\nReporting][86]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY FUNCTION\n\n[Security][87][Compliance][88][Operations][89][Executive][90]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY INDUSTRY\n\n[Building Automation][91][Chemical][92][Electric][93][Federal Government][94][Food &\nAgriculture][95][Maritime][96][Metals & Mining][97][Oil &\nGas][98][Pharmaceuticals][99][Rail][100][Water][101]\n\n##### RESOURCES\n\n[Resource Collection][102][Glossary][103][DefenderSphere][104][IT-OT Integration Lab][105][OT\nCybersecurity Risk Calculator][106][Innovations by ID][107][Glossary][108]\n\n##### COMPANY\n\n[About Us][109][How We Compare][110][Team][111][Events][112][Press][113][Careers][114][Contact\nUs][115]\n\n[1]: /resources/webinar-cip-015-is-here-paths-to-compliance-for-every-organization\n[2]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fs