            "url": "https://www.industrialdefender.com/services",
            "text": "Webinar - CIP-015 Is Here: Paths to Compliance for Every Organization Register Today\n][1]\n[Support][2]\n\n### SOLUTIONS\n\n][3]\nOT Asset Management\n][4][\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][5][\nPolicy Compliance\n][6][\nVulnerability Management\n][7]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n][8]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][9][\nPhoenix for SMBs\n][10][\nServices\n][11][\nPartners\n][12]\n\n### INDUSTRIES\n\n][13]\nPower\n][14][\nOil & Gas\n][15][\nWater\n][16][\nManufacturing\n][17][\nUS Government\n][18][\nSee all\n][19]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\n][20]\nBlog\n][21][\nPodcast\n][22][\nResource Library\n][23][\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][24][\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][25][\nDeployment\n][26][\nFAQ\n][27]\n\n### COMPANY\n\n][28]\nAbout Us\n][29][\nHow We Compare\n][30][\nDeployment\n][31][\nTeam\n][32][\nEvents\n][33][\nPress\n][34][\nCareers\n][35][\nContact Us\n][36]\n\n### SUPPORT\n\n][37]\n\n### REQUEST DEMO\n\n][38]\nSOLUTIONS\n][39]\nOT Asset Management\n][40]\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][41]\nPolicy Compliance\n][42]\nVulnerability Management\n][43]\nPLATFORM\n][44]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][45]\nServices\n][46]\nPartners\n][47]\nINDUSTRIES\n][48]\nPower\n][49]\nOil & Gas\n][50]\nWater\n][51]\nManufacturing\n][52]\nUS Government\n][53]\nSee all\n][54]\nRESOURCES\n][55]\nBlog\n][56]\nPodcast\n][57]\nResource Library\n][58]\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][59]\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][60]\nFAQ\n][61]\nCOMPANY\n][62]\nAbout Us\n][63]\nHow We Compare\n][64]\nTeam\n][65]\nEvents\n][66]\nPress\n][67]\nCareers\n][68]\nContact Us\n][69]\n[Request Demo][70]\nCopilOT Service\u2122\n\n# Industrial Defender CopilOT Service\u2122\n\nMaximize the value of your Industrial Defender deployment, while freeing up time to focus on\nstrategic initiatives.\n\n[Learn More][71]\nM&A Cyber Diligence\n\n# Industrial Defender M&A Cyber Diligence Service\n\nIdentify potential cybersecurity risks and remediation costs in a target acquisition with our rapid\nassessment methodology.\n\n[Learn More][72]\nProfessional Services\n\n# Industrial Defender Professional Services\n\nFrom consulting to design and implementation, monitoring, maintenance and training services, our\nteam of experienced experts deliver holistic cybersecurity programs to help maintain your cyber\ndefenses over time.\n\n[Learn More][73]\n\n## Stay up to date.\n\nSign up for our newsletter to receive the latest Industrial Defender news & updates.\n\nPrivacy Policy\n][74]\n\n##### PRODUCTS\n\n[Industrial Defender Platform][75]\n\n##### SERVICES\n\n[Cyber Diligence Service][76][CopilOT\nService^{TM}][77][Commissioning][78][Support][79][Training][80][Sustain][81]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY TYPE\n\n[OT Asset Management][82][Vulnerability Management][83][Security Event Monitoring][84][Compliance\nReporting][85]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY FUNCTION\n\n[Security][86][Compliance][87][Operations][88][Executive][89]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY INDUSTRY\n\n[Building Automation][90][Chemical][91][Electric][92][Federal Government][93][Food &\nAgriculture][94][Maritime][95][Metals & Mining][96][Oil &\nGas][97][Pharmaceuticals][98][Rail][99][Water][100]\n\n##### RESOURCES\n\n[Resource Collection][101][Glossary][102][DefenderSphere][103][IT-OT Integration Lab][104][OT\nCybersecurity Risk Calculator][105][Innovations by ID][106][Glossary][107]\n\n##### COMPANY\n\n[About Us][108][How We Compare][109][Team][110][Events][111][Press][112][Careers][113][Contact\nUs][114]\n\n[1]: /resources/webinar-cip-015-is-here-paths-to-compliance-for-every-organization\n[2]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.industria\nldefender.com%2F&reauth=1\n[3]: #\n[4]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[5]: /solutions/configuration-change-management\n[6]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[7]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[8]: #\n[9]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[10]: #\n[11]: /services\n[12]: /partners-old\n[13]: #\n[14]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[15]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[16]: /industries/water\n[17]: /industries/critical-manufacturing\n[18]: /industries/us-government\n[19]: /industries/all\n[20]: #\n[21]: /ics-cybersecurity-blog\n[22]: /podcast\n[23]: /resources\n[24]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[25]: /innovations\n[26]: /deployment\n[27]: /faq\n[28]: #\n[29]: /about-us\n[30]: /how-we-compare\n[31]: /deployment\n[32]: /team\n[33]: /events\n[34]: /press\n[35]: /careers\n[36]: /contact-us\n[37]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.industri\naldefender.com%2F&reauth=1\n[38]: /demo/demo-request\n[39]: /solutions\n[40]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[41]: /solutions/configuration-change-management\n[42]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[43]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[44]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[45]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[46]: /services\n[47]: /partners\n[48]: /industries/all\n[49]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[50]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[51]: /industries/water\n[52]: /industries/critical-manufacturing\n[53]: /industries/us-government\n[54]: /industries/all\n[55]: /resources\n[56]: /ics-cybersecurity-blog\n[57]: /podcast\n[58]: /resources\n[59]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[60]: /innovations\n[61]: /faq\n[62]: /about-us\n[63]: /about-us\n[64]: /how-we-compare\n[65]: /team\n[66]: /events\n[67]: /press\n[68]: /careers\n[69]: /contact-us\n[70]: /demo-request\n[71]: /copilot-service\n[72]: /cyber-diligence-service\n[73]: /professional-services\n[74]: /privacy-policy\n[75]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[76]: /cyber-diligence-service\n[77]: /copilot-service\n[78]: /professional-services\n[79]: /professional-services\n[80]: /professional-services\n[81]: /professional-services\n[82]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[83]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[84]: /solutions/security-event-monitoring\n[85]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[86]: /function/security\n[87]: /function/compliance\n[88]: /function/operations\n[89]: /function/executive\n[90]: /industries/building-automation\n[91]: /industries/chemical-processing-cybersecurity\n[92]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[93]: /industries/federal-government\n[94]: /industries/food-agriculture\n[95]: /industries/maritime\n[96]: /industries/metals-mining\n[97]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[98]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[99]: /industries/rail\n[100]: /industries/water\n[101]: /resources\n[102]: /glossary\n[103]: /defendersphere-ics-vendors\n[104]: /it-ot-integration-lab\n[105]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[106]: /innovations\n[107]: /glossary\n[108]: /about-us\n[109]: /how-we-compare\n[110]: /team\n[111]: /events\n[112]: /press\n[113]: /careers\n[114]: /contact-us"
