            "text": "Webinar - CIP-015 Is Here: Paths to Compliance for Every Organization Register Today\n][1]\n[Support][2]\n\n### SOLUTIONS\n\n][3]\nOT Asset Management\n][4][\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][5][\nPolicy Compliance\n][6][\nVulnerability Management\n][7]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n][8]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][9][\nPhoenix for SMBs\n][10][\nServices\n][11][\nPartners\n][12]\n\n### INDUSTRIES\n\n][13]\nPower\n][14][\nOil & Gas\n][15][\nWater\n][16][\nManufacturing\n][17][\nUS Government\n][18][\nSee all\n][19]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\n][20]\nBlog\n][21][\nPodcast\n][22][\nResource Library\n][23][\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][24][\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][25][\nDeployment\n][26][\nFAQ\n][27]\n\n### COMPANY\n\n][28]\nAbout Us\n][29][\nHow We Compare\n][30][\nDeployment\n][31][\nTeam\n][32][\nEvents\n][33][\nPress\n][34][\nCareers\n][35][\nContact Us\n][36]\n\n### SUPPORT\n\n][37]\n\n### REQUEST DEMO\n\n][38]\nSOLUTIONS\n][39]\nOT Asset Management\n][40]\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][41]\nPolicy Compliance\n][42]\nVulnerability Management\n][43]\nPLATFORM\n][44]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][45]\nServices\n][46]\nPartners\n][47]\nINDUSTRIES\n][48]\nPower\n][49]\nOil & Gas\n][50]\nWater\n][51]\nManufacturing\n][52]\nUS Government\n][53]\nSee all\n][54]\nRESOURCES\n][55]\nBlog\n][56]\nPodcast\n][57]\nResource Library\n][58]\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][59]\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][60]\nFAQ\n][61]\nCOMPANY\n][62]\nAbout Us\n][63]\nHow We Compare\n][64]\nTeam\n][65]\nEvents\n][66]\nPress\n][67]\nCareers\n][68]\nContact Us\n][69]\n[Request Demo][70]\n\n# Solutions By Type\n\nSolution by Type: Asset Management\n\n# **OT Asset Management for Critical Infrastructure**\n\nIdentify, monitor and manage your operational technology asset and security data at scale with a\nsingle platform.\n\n[Learn More][71]\nSolution by Type: Vulnerability Management\n\n# **Risk-Based OT Vulnerability Management**\n\nCombine accurate OT asset intelligence with the power of NIST\u2019s NVD, ICS-CERT alerts and VEX to\nexecute a risk-based vulnerability management program.\n\n[Learn More][72]\nSolution by Type: Security Event Monitoring\n\n# **OT Cyber Threat Detection**\n\nComprehensive OT cybersecurity monitoring and management for critical infrastructure.\n\n[Learn More][73]\nSolution by Type: Compliance Reporting\n\n# **Simplified Compliance Reporting for OT Environments**\n\nAutomate manual compliance tasks with a suite of built-in policy management options and one-click\ncompliance reporting for dozens of international standards.\n\n[Learn More][74]\n\n# Solutions By Function\n\nSolution by Function: Compliance\n\n# **Ensure Compliance with Regulatory Standards for Critical Infrastructure**\n\nCentralize your OT asset data and automate compliance with a suite of built-in reporting\ncapabilities for international regulations and standards.\n\n[Learn More][75]\nSolution by Function: Executive\n\n# **Manage Cyber Governance & Risk Across your OT Infrastructure**\n\nOur solution helps security executives holistically manage cyber risk inside their operational\ntechnology environments.\n\n[Learn More][76]\nSolution by Function: Operations\n\n# **OT Asset Visibility & Management in One Place**\n\nSafely collect, monitor and manage OT asset data at scale.\n\n[Learn More][77]\nSolution by Function: Security\n\n# **Reduce MTTR with Contextual OT Data**\n\nInvestigate the cybersecurity events that really matter with centralized security monitoring for OT\nassets and networks.\n\n[Learn More][78]\n\n# Solutions By Industry\n\nIndustry: Building Automation\n\n# **Industrial Cybersecurity for Building Management Systems**\n\nBuilding management systems (BMS) face an expanding cyber threat landscape. Facilities engineers and\nIT professionals must address critical vulnerabilities to prevent cyberattacks against the critical\nbusiness systems and people in their properties.\n\n[Learn More][79]\nIndustry: Chemical\n\n# **OT Cyber Risk Management for the Chemical Industry**\n\nChemical companies often struggle with limited visibility into and control of their heterogenous OT\nsystems.\n\n[Learn More][80]\nIndustry: Critical Manufacturing\n\n# **OT Cybersecurity for Critical Manufacturing**\n\nAs we move into Industry 4.0, manufacturers are investing in digitalization initiatives to improve\nefficiency, resulting in the need to invest in cybersecurity for their operational assets.\n\n[Learn More][81]\nIndustry: Electric\n\n# **Cybersecurity & Compliance Automation for Electric Utilities**\n\nElectric utilities face strict regulatory oversight, geographically dispersed infrastructure and\nincreasing pressure to protect their OT systems from escalating nation-state attacks.\n\n[Learn More][82]\nIndustry: Federal Government\n\n# **OT Cybersecurity & Compliance Automation for Federal Government Agencies**\n\nFederal agencies must protect the availability and safety of their operational technology\ninfrastructure to ensure national security.\n\n[Learn More][83]\nIndustry: Food & Agriculture\n\n# **Industrial Cybersecurity for Food & Agriculture Companies**\n\nFood and agriculture organizations are investing in digital transformation to improve efficiency and\nproduct quality, resulting in the need to invest in cybersecurity their operational assets.\n\n[Learn More][84]\nIndustry: Maritime\n\n# **OT Cybersecurity Management for the Maritime Industry**\n\nCybersecurity stakeholders in the maritime industry must address escalating safety and operational\nconcerns from the expanding cyberthreat landscape.\n\n[Learn More][85]\nIndustry: Metals & Mining\n\n# **OT Cybersecurity for the Metals & Mining Industry**\n\nThe mining industry is embracing digitalization to improve productivity, but the increased use of\nconnected assets requires enhanced visibility and awareness of operational systems.\n\n[Learn More][86]\nIndustry: Oil & Gas\n\n# **OT Cybersecurity & Risk Management for the Oil & Gas Industry**\n\nOil and gas companies must address the challenges of sprawling global infrastructure, severe safety\nhazards and the threat of nation-state cyberattacks.\n\n[Learn More][87]\nIndustry: Pharmaceuticals\n\n# **OT Cybersecurity for the Pharmaceutical Industry**\n\nPharmaceutical manufacturers have thousands of industrial attack vectors within their operational\ntechnology (OT) systems, lab facilities, and storage warehouses.\n\n[Learn More][88]\nIndustry: Rail\n\n# **OT Cybersecurity for the Rail Industry**\n\nRail transportation companies must address increasing cybersecurity threats to ensure the safety of\npeople and critical cargo shipments.\n\n[Learn More][89]\nIndustry: Water\n\n# **OT Cybersecurity Management for Water & Wastewater**\n\nWater and wastewater companies must protect the communities and industries they serve by addressing\nescalating cyberthreats which jeopardize the safety of the public and their continuous operations.\n\n[Learn More][90]\n\n## Stay up to date.\n\nSign up for our newsletter to receive the latest Industrial Defender news & updates.\n\nPrivacy Policy\n][91]\n\n##### PRODUCTS\n\n[Industrial Defender Platform][92]\n\n##### SERVICES\n\n[Cyber Diligence Service][93][CopilOT\nService^{TM}][94][Commissioning][95][Support][96][Training][97][Sustain][98]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY TYPE\n\n[OT Asset Management][99][Vulnerability Management][100][Security Event Monitoring][101][Compliance\nReporting][102]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY FUNCTION\n\n[Security][103][Compliance][104][Operations][105][Executive][106]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY INDUSTRY\n\n[Building Automation][107][Chemical][108][Electric][109][Federal Government][110][Food &\nAgriculture][111][Maritime][112][Metals & Mining][113][Oil &\nGas][114][Pharmaceuticals][115][Rail][116][Water][117]\n\n##### RESOURCES\n\n[Resource Collection][118][Glossary][119][DefenderSphere][120][IT-OT Integration Lab][121][OT\nCybersecurity Risk Calculator][122][Innovations by ID][123][Glossary][124]\n\n##### COMPANY\n\n[About Us][125][How We Compare][126][Team][127][Events][128][Press][129][Careers][130][Contact\nUs][131]\n\n[1]: /resources/webinar-cip-015-is-here-paths-to-compliance-for-every-organization\n[2]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.industria\nldefender.com%2F&reauth=1\n[3]: #\n[4]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[5]: /solutions/configuration-change-management\n[6]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[7]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[8]: #\n[9]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[10]: #\n[11]: /services\n[12]: /partners-old\n[13]: #\n[14]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[15]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[16]: /industries/water\n[17]: /industries/critical-manufacturing\n[18]: /industries/us-government\n[19]: /industries/all\n[20]: #\n[21]: /ics-cybersecurity-blog\n[22]: /podcast\n[23]: /resources\n[24]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[25]: /innovations\n[26]: /deployment\n[27]: /faq\n[28]: #\n[29]: /about-us\n[30]: /how-we-compare\n[31]: /deployment\n[32]: /team\n[33]: /events\n[34]: /press\n[35]: /careers\n[36]: /contact-us\n[37]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.industri\naldefender.com%2F&reauth=1\n[38]: /demo/demo-request\n[39]: /solutions\n[40]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[41]: /solutions/configuration-change-management\n[42]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[43]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[44]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[45]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[46]: /services\n[47]: /partners\n[48]: /industries/all\n[49]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[50]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[51]: /industries/water\n[52]: /industries/critical-manufacturing\n[53]: /industries/us-government\n[54]: /industries/all\n[55]: /resources\n[56]: /ics-cybersecurity-blog\n[57]: /podcast\n[58]: /resources\n[59]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[60]: /innovations\n[61]: /faq\n[62]: /about-us\n[63]: /about-us\n[64]: /how-we-compare\n[65]: /team\n[66]: /events\n[67]: /press\n[68]: /careers\n[69]: /contact-us\n[70]: /demo-request\n[71]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/solutions/ot-asset-management\n[72]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/solutions/vulnerability-management\n[73]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/solutions/security-event-monitoring\n[74]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/solutions/compliance-reporting\n[75]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/function/compliance\n[76]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/function/executive\n[77]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/function/operations\n[78]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/function/security\n[79]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/industries/building-automation\n[80]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/industries/chemical-processing-cybersecurity\n[81]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/industries/critical-manufacturing\n[82]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[83]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/industries/federal-government\n[84]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/industries/food-agriculture\n[85]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/industries/maritime\n[86]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/industries/metals-mining\n[87]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[88]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[89]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/industries/rail\n[90]: https://www.industrialdefender.com/industries/water\n[91]: /privacy-policy\n[92]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[93]: /cyber-diligence-service\n[94]: /copilot-service\n[95]: /professional-services\n[96]: /professional-services\n[97]: /professional-services\n[98]: /professional-services\n[99]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[100]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[101]: /solutions/security-event-monitoring\n[102]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[103]: /function/security\n[104]: /function/compliance\n[105]: /function/operations\n[106]: /function/executive\n[107]: /industries/building-automation\n[108]: /industries/chemical-processing-cybersecurity\n[109]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[110]: /industries/federal-government\n[111]: /industries/food-agriculture\n[112]: /industries/maritime\n[113]: /industries/metals-mining\n[114]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[115]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[116]: /industries/rail\n[117]: /industries/water\n"
