            "url": "https://www.industrialdefender.com/solutions/configuration-change-management",
            "text": "Webinar - CIP-015 Is Here: Paths to Compliance for Every Organization Register Today\n][1]\n[Support][2]\n\n### SOLUTIONS\n\n][3]\nOT Asset Management\n][4][\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][5][\nPolicy Compliance\n][6][\nVulnerability Management\n][7]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n][8]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][9][\nPhoenix for SMBs\n][10][\nServices\n][11][\nPartners\n][12]\n\n### INDUSTRIES\n\n][13]\nPower\n][14][\nOil & Gas\n][15][\nWater\n][16][\nManufacturing\n][17][\nUS Government\n][18][\nSee all\n][19]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\n][20]\nBlog\n][21][\nPodcast\n][22][\nResource Library\n][23][\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][24][\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][25][\nDeployment\n][26][\nFAQ\n][27]\n\n### COMPANY\n\n][28]\nAbout Us\n][29][\nHow We Compare\n][30][\nDeployment\n][31][\nTeam\n][32][\nEvents\n][33][\nPress\n][34][\nCareers\n][35][\nContact Us\n][36]\n\n### SUPPORT\n\n][37]\n\n### REQUEST DEMO\n\n][38]\nSOLUTIONS\n][39]\nOT Asset Management\n][40]\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][41]\nPolicy Compliance\n][42]\nVulnerability Management\n][43]\nPLATFORM\n][44]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][45]\nServices\n][46]\nPartners\n][47]\nINDUSTRIES\n][48]\nPower\n][49]\nOil & Gas\n][50]\nWater\n][51]\nManufacturing\n][52]\nUS Government\n][53]\nSee all\n][54]\nRESOURCES\n][55]\nBlog\n][56]\nPodcast\n][57]\nResource Library\n][58]\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][59]\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][60]\nFAQ\n][61]\nCOMPANY\n][62]\nAbout Us\n][63]\nHow We Compare\n][64]\nTeam\n][65]\nEvents\n][66]\nPress\n][67]\nCareers\n][68]\nContact Us\n][69]\n[Request Demo][70]\nConfiguration Change Management\n\n# **Configuration and Change Management in OT**\n\nProtecting operational technology (OT) systems not only requires knowing what devices you have\u2014it\ndemands knowing exactly how they\u2019re configured, what OS and software versions they\u2019re running, how\nthey change over time, and what those changes mean for security and compliance.\n\n[Request Demo][71]\nWhy Choose ID?\n\n## **How Our CCM Solutions Supports OT Security **\n\n**Deep, Accurate Configuration Visibility**\n\nComplete visibility into your OT environment with detailed insights into each asset\u2019s software,\nconfigurations, user accounts, and more.\n\n**Continuous Change Detection**\n\nTrack configuration changes across your OT environment to quickly identify risks to security or\ncompliance.\n\n**Baseline and Maintain Secure States**\n\nEstablish secure configuration baselines and ensure assets remain in their intended, compliant\nstates.\n\n**Comprehensive Historical Reporting**\n\nRich historical data to simplify compliance reporting and maintain long-term system integrity.\n\nSolution Brief: OT Asset Management\n\nAsset management is one of the most undervalued activities in the operational technology space,\ndespite its critical importance to a strong cybersecurity program and regulatory compliance efforts.\nWe're here to change that.\n\n][72]\nDemo Video: OT Asset Management\n\nView this demo video to learn how our solution goes beyond asset visibility to enable you **to\nquickly onboard and decommission assets, analyze how your assets are changing over time, and create\nbaselines to monitor for anomalies.**\n\n][73]\nOur Approach\n\n## **Why Is Deep Configuration Visibility Important?**\n\nEvery major cybersecurity framework, compliance driven or not, \u2014NIST, CIS Controls, NERC CIP,\nIEC/ISA 62443\u2014starts with a foundational requirement: understanding your assets, configurations, and\nrisks.\n\nNetwork visibility alone isn\u2019t enough. Many OT asset inventory tools stop at identifying devices on\nthe network\u2014missing the deeper configuration details essential for true security and compliance.\n\n**Detecting Changes In Your OT Environment**\n\nConfiguration settings define your system\u2019s security posture.Changes\u2014whether intentional,\naccidental, or malicious\u2014can open new attack paths, weaken defenses, and create compliance\ngaps.Industrial Defender provides continuous visibility and change detection, empowering you to stay\non top of new risks.\n\n**We deliver complete, real-time configuration data at the endpoint level:**\n* OS details\n* Software and patches\n* Ports and services\n* Firewall rules\n* User accounts\n* NICs\n* and more\nSolution Brief\n\n## **Configuration and Change Management for Operational Environments**\n\nRead our solution brief to learn more about maintaining system integrity, security, and compliance\nover time with Configuration and Change Management (CCM).\n\n[View Solution Brief][74]\nSpeak With an Expert\n\n## Demo Request\n\nSet up some time with one of our experts to see how our OT cyber risk management platform can help\nsolve your unique security needs. Our solution can help you with:\n\nAsset Visibility & Management\nVulnerability Management\nIT/OT Collaboration\nCompliance Reporting\n\n## Stay up to date.\n\nSign up for our newsletter to receive the latest Industrial Defender news & updates.\n\nPrivacy Policy\n][75]\n\n##### PRODUCTS\n\n[Industrial Defender Platform][76]\n\n##### SERVICES\n\n[Cyber Diligence Service][77][CopilOT\nService^{TM}][78][Commissioning][79][Support][80][Training][81][Sustain][82]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY TYPE\n\n[OT Asset Management][83][Vulnerability Management][84][Security Event Monitoring][85][Compliance\nReporting][86]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY FUNCTION\n\n[Security][87][Compliance][88][Operations][89][Executive][90]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY INDUSTRY\n\n[Building Automation][91][Chemical][92][Electric][93][Federal Government][94][Food &\nAgriculture][95][Maritime][96][Metals & Mining][97][Oil &\nGas][98][Pharmaceuticals][99][Rail][100][Water][101]\n\n##### RESOURCES\n\n[Resource Collection][102][Glossary][103][DefenderSphere][104][IT-OT Integration Lab][105][OT\nCybersecurity Risk Calculator][106][Innovations by ID][107][Glossary][108]\n\n##### COMPANY\n\n[About Us][109][How We Compare][110][Team][111][Events][112][Press][113][Careers][114][Contact\nUs][115]\n\n[1]: /resources/webinar-cip-015-is-here-paths-to-compliance-for-every-organization\n[2]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.industria\nldefender.com%2F&reauth=1\n[3]: #\n[4]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[5]: /solutions/configuration-change-management\n[6]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[7]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[8]: #\n[9]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[10]: #\n[11]: /services\n[12]: /partners-old\n[13]: #\n[14]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[15]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[16]: /industries/water\n[17]: /industries/critical-manufacturing\n[18]: /industries/us-government\n[19]: /industries/all\n[20]: #\n[21]: /ics-cybersecurity-blog\n[22]: /podcast\n[23]: /resources\n[24]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[25]: /innovations\n[26]: /deployment\n[27]: /faq\n[28]: #\n[29]: /about-us\n[30]: /how-we-compare\n[31]: /deployment\n[32]: /team\n[33]: /events\n[34]: /press\n[35]: /careers\n[36]: /contact-us\n[37]: https://support.industrialdefender.com/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsupport.industri\naldefender.com%2F&reauth=1\n[38]: /demo/demo-request\n[39]: /solutions\n[40]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[41]: /solutions/configuration-change-management\n[42]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[43]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[44]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[45]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[46]: /services\n[47]: /partners\n[48]: /industries/all\n[49]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[50]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[51]: /industries/water\n[52]: /industries/critical-manufacturing\n[53]: /industries/us-government\n[54]: /industries/all\n[55]: /resources\n[56]: /ics-cybersecurity-blog\n[57]: /podcast\n[58]: /resources\n[59]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[60]: /innovations\n[61]: /faq\n[62]: /about-us\n[63]: /about-us\n[64]: /how-we-compare\n[65]: /team\n[66]: /events\n[67]: /press\n[68]: /careers\n[69]: /contact-us\n[70]: /demo-request\n[71]: /demo-request\n[72]: #\n[73]: #\n[74]: https://cta-service-cms2.hubspot.com/ctas/v2/public/cs/c/?cta_guid=9dce0e16-30f7-40cd-ac83-3c2\nfac689baf&signature=AAH58kEI4mk-dOtKX6eDhTMM9psDq3E7dg&utm_referrer=https%3A%2F%2Findustrial-defende\nr-2022.webflow.io%2Fsolutions%2Fconfiguration-change-management&portal_id=6940570&placement_guid=3c7\nac802-590e-4794-971f-d3a3cf67b656&click=b03045bb-cc99-4e55-b834-75e8469e3c16&redirect_url=APefjpHA9q\nud6WkRvOrBhIcdTm1LndfUhTew3nxXD1fItSgw61s5fRkIjoBP_ji3vp6sRCv7IeUj587Dc3jILZWs9s9FaM2RyQ7ZLr9iw_AZno\nfuxhiwDOv3CI6o6DEI1S2VgiKFL-RDXc5qkEryHHeQSChwTjZ1eaRv1SU7OaCr39aEovWgWxTvI-Sg49mf-VEr_XfJ4-MY1S6iH3\nWfLiGllY1gilsnKAbCNEgzoAAGx3Psshqrs32ZGhZSpfwfgwoQFesjfGm_el2yx9GFgb-5eKck-Vizqu2R2fxA_vpQq9j43_0QTt\njMekoItDAtyH9c6W9rc6U_SkxPGNHMZWbiG4MtYK2btY9gIyZV4_5t3BVSRQoMrwRaz_AtZ3gyGnMW8MGt3nGy0iKhq_5jX8XCOn\nj9ZK_C5w&hsutk=ab06626ff2ef95b55f996b159899ac8b&canon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.industrialdefender.com%2Fsol\nutions%2Fconfiguration-change-management&ts=1768952974787&__hstc=17958374.ab06626ff2ef95b55f996b1598\n99ac8b.1768584018054.1768941938933.1768952532183.5&__hssc=17958374.3.1768952532183&__hsfp=99cfa6f655\n0c9f37651eeb26bccefcbf\n[75]: /privacy-policy\n[76]: /ot-cyber-risk-management\n[77]: /cyber-diligence-service\n[78]: /copilot-service\n[79]: /professional-services\n[80]: /professional-services\n[81]: /professional-services\n[82]: /professional-services\n[83]: /solutions/ot-asset-management\n[84]: /solutions/vulnerability-management\n[85]: /solutions/security-event-monitoring\n[86]: /solutions/compliance-reporting\n[87]: /function/security\n[88]: /function/compliance\n[89]: /function/operations\n[90]: /function/executive\n[91]: /industries/building-automation\n[92]: /industries/chemical-processing-cybersecurity\n[93]: /industries/electric-utilities-cybersecurity\n[94]: /industries/federal-government\n[95]: /industries/food-agriculture\n[96]: /industries/maritime\n[97]: /industries/metals-mining\n[98]: /industries/oil-gas-cybersecurity\n[99]: /industries/pharmaceutical-cybersecurity\n[100]: /industries/rail\n[101]: /industries/water\n[102]: /resources\n[103]: /glossary\n[104]: /defendersphere-ics-vendors\n[105]: /it-ot-integration-lab\n[106]: /risk-assessment-calculator\n[107]: /innovations\n[108]: /glossary\n[109]: /about-us\n[110]: /how-we-compare\n[111]: /team\n[112]: /events\n[113]: /press\n[114]: /careers\n[115]: /contact-us"
