            "text": "Webinar - CIP-015 Is Here: Paths to Compliance for Every Organization Register Today\n][1]\n[Support][2]\n\n### SOLUTIONS\n\n][3]\nOT Asset Management\n][4][\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][5][\nPolicy Compliance\n][6][\nVulnerability Management\n][7]\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n][8]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][9][\nPhoenix for SMBs\n][10][\nServices\n][11][\nPartners\n][12]\n\n### INDUSTRIES\n\n][13]\nPower\n][14][\nOil & Gas\n][15][\nWater\n][16][\nManufacturing\n][17][\nUS Government\n][18][\nSee all\n][19]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\n][20]\nBlog\n][21][\nPodcast\n][22][\nResource Library\n][23][\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][24][\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][25][\nDeployment\n][26][\nFAQ\n][27]\n\n### COMPANY\n\n][28]\nAbout Us\n][29][\nHow We Compare\n][30][\nDeployment\n][31][\nTeam\n][32][\nEvents\n][33][\nPress\n][34][\nCareers\n][35][\nContact Us\n][36]\n\n### SUPPORT\n\n][37]\n\n### REQUEST DEMO\n\n][38]\nSOLUTIONS\n][39]\nOT Asset Management\n][40]\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][41]\nPolicy Compliance\n][42]\nVulnerability Management\n][43]\nPLATFORM\n][44]\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][45]\nServices\n][46]\nPartners\n][47]\nINDUSTRIES\n][48]\nPower\n][49]\nOil & Gas\n][50]\nWater\n][51]\nManufacturing\n][52]\nUS Government\n][53]\nSee all\n][54]\nRESOURCES\n][55]\nBlog\n][56]\nPodcast\n][57]\nResource Library\n][58]\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][59]\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][60]\nFAQ\n][61]\nCOMPANY\n][62]\nAbout Us\n][63]\nHow We Compare\n][64]\nTeam\n][65]\nEvents\n][66]\nPress\n][67]\nCareers\n][68]\nContact Us\n][69]\n[Request Demo][70]\nLet\u2019s chat\n\n# Contact Us\n\nFor media & analyst inquiries please contact [rlapena@industrialdefender.com][71]\n\n#### Other ways to contact us:\n\n+1 (877) 943-3363 (Toll Free)\n+1 (617) 675-4206\ninfo@industrialdefender.com\n][72]\n225 Foxborough Blvd\nSuite 202\nFoxborough, MA 02035\nUnited States of America\n\n##### Stay Informed\n\nSign up for our newsletter and receive the latest on ICS cybersecurity, product updates and more.\n\n### What\u2019s happening at Industrial Defender\n\nFeatured\n\n## 3 Key Takeaways from Our 2022 State of OT Cybersecurity Research\n\nHere are the big takeaways from our proprietary research survey of the OT cybersecurity community on\ntoday\u2019s current priorities and barriers for security practitioners.\n[Read Post][73]\nBlog\nEvents\nPress\nWebinars\nCIP-015 Is Not a Fire Drill: Why \"Race to Comply\" Is the Wrong Strategy for INSM\n[Read More][74]\nKuwait\u2019s 2026 Cybersecurity Controls Signal a New Era for Industrial Cybersecurity\n[Read More][75]\nNIST Releases Pre-Draft Call for Updates to SP 800-82\n[Read More][76]\nIn NERC\u2019s New Roadmap, Low Impact is High Attention\n[Read More][77]\nWhat Is the UK Cyber Security and Resilience Bill (CSRB)?\n[Read More][78]\nCounting Down to the New Year with Industrial Defender\n[Read More][79]\nCISA & Partners Release \u201cPrinciples for the Secure Integration of Artificial Intelligence in\nOperational Technology (OT)\u201d\n[Read More][80]\nFERC\u2019s 2025 Lessons Learned: Direct Insights from Commission-Led CIP Audits\n[Read More][81]\nNo items found.\nApril 17, 2026\nIndustrial Defender and KYrON Announce Strategic Partnership to Strengthen Industrial Cybersecurity\nAcross France\n[See More][82]\nPress\nJanuary 8, 2026\nIndustrial Defender Announces Strategic Growth Investment to Accelerate OT and ICS Cybersecurity\nLeadership\n[See More][83]\nPress\nApril 28, 2025\nCyberKnight and Industrial Defender Unite to Enhance OT Security Resilience Across META\n[See More][84]\nPress\nApril 28, 2025\nIndustrial Defender Honored with Two Global InfoSec Awards from Cyber Defense Magazine\n[See More][85]\nIn The News\nMarch 30, 2025\nIndustrial Cybersecurity Market Outlook 2025: Focus on quantifying risk, embracing AI, building\noperational resilience\n[See More][86]\nPress\nMarch 26, 2025\nIndustrial Defender Recognized with Three Wins at 2025 Cybersecurity Excellence Awards\n[See More][87]\nPress\nFebruary 11, 2025\nIndustrial Defender Launches Platform 8.0, Elevating Risk Management Capabilities for Operational\nTechnology\n[See More][88]\nPress\nNovember 24, 2024\nFeatured: Delivering a Comprehensive Approach to Fortify ICS Architectures Against Rising Threats,\nPrepare for Recovery\n[See More][89]\nMastering NIS2 Compliance: Best Practices and Regulatory Readiness\n[Watch Webinar][90]\nWebinar: CIP-015 Is Here: Paths to Compliance for Every Organization\n[Watch Webinar][91]\nWebinar: Saudi OTCC: How to Comply with Operational Technology Cybersecurity Controls\n[Watch Webinar][92]\nNERC CIP: Top 5 Areas to Improve\n[Watch Webinar][93]\nIntegrated Data Collection Methods for OT Asset Management\n[Watch Webinar][94]\nImplementing INSM with Industrial Defender\n[Watch Webinar][95]\nWhy Historical Data Matters in OT Security & Compliance\n[Watch Webinar][96]\nWebinar: Defending Against Attackers who use AI as a Weapon\n[Watch Webinar][97]\n\n## Stay up to date.\n\nSign up for our newsletter to receive the latest Industrial Defender news & updates.\n\nPrivacy Policy\n][98]\n\n##### PRODUCTS\n\n[Industrial Defender Platform][99]\n\n##### SERVICES\n\n[Cyber Diligence Service][100][CopilOT\nService^{TM}][101][Commissioning][102][Support][103][Training][104][Sustain][105]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY TYPE\n\n[OT Asset Management][106][Vulnerability Management][107][Security Event Monitoring][108][Compliance\nReporting][109]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY FUNCTION\n\n[Security][110][Compliance][111][Operations][112][Executive][113]\n\n##### SOLUTION BY INDUSTRY\n\n[Building Automation][114][Chemical][115][Electric][116][Federal Government][117][Food &\nAgriculture][118][Maritime][119][Metals & Mining][120][Oil &\nGas][121][Pharmaceuticals][122][Rail][123][Water][124]\n\n##### RESOURCES\n\n[Resource Collection][125][Glossary][126][DefenderSphere][127][IT-OT Integration Lab][128][OT\nCybersecurit