      "key_products": "Industrial Defender Platform, OT Asset Management, Vulnerability Management, Security Event Monitoring, Compliance Reporting",
      "polished_summary": "Industrial Defender specializes in cybersecurity and compliance solutions tailored for operational technology (OT) environments, primarily serving critical infrastructure sectors. Their comprehensive offerings include the Industrial Defender Platform, vulnerability management, and security event monitoring, all designed to enhance asset management, risk assessment, and compliance reporting for organizations facing unique cybersecurity challenges in OT settings.",
