      "company_summary": "Network Intelligence is a leading cybersecurity firm that specializes in providing comprehensive solutions powered by artificial intelligence and human expertise. Their core services include governance, risk management, compliance, identity and access management, and advanced threat detection, catering to a diverse range of industries seeking to enhance their cybersecurity posture and ensure regulatory compliance. With a customer-centric approach, Network Intelligence employs its innovative ADVISE framework to assess, design, implement, sustain, and evolve cybersecurity strategies tailored to the unique needs of each client.",
