        "crawl_text": "[Skip to navigation][1] [Skip to content][2] [[Network Intelligence]Network Intelligence][3]\n\n##### Menu\n* [Practices][4]\n  * [Governance Risk & Compliance][5]\n  * [Governance Risk Management and Compliance][6]\n  * [Identity & Access Management][7]\n  * [Identity Access Management][8]\n  * [Integrated Threat Management][9]\n  * [IoT and OT][10]\n    * [Maturity Assessment][11]\n  * [Privacy Assurance][12]\n  * [Responsible AI][13]\n  * [Secure Digital Transformation][14]\n* [Services][15]\n  * [Strategic][16]\n    * [Cybersecurity Strategy Services][17]\n    * [Cloud Architecture Review][18]\n    * [SOC Maturity Assessment][19]\n    * [Cybersecurity Operating Model][20]\n    * [Compliance][21]\n    * [Risk Management][22]\n    * [Assurance & Audit][23]\n    * [Privacy Program Implementation][24]\n    * [HITRUST][25]\n    * [SOC Audit Services][26]\n    * [Payment Security Simplified][27]\n  * [Offensive][28]\n    * [Vulnerability Management][29]\n    * [Continuous Red Teaming][30]\n    * [Breach & Attack Simulation][31]\n    * [AI Model Testing][32]\n  * [Defensive][33]\n    * [Application Security][34]\n    * [Managed Detection and Response][35]\n    * [Privileged Identity Management][36]\n    * [Extended Detection and Response (XDR)][37]\n    * [Identity & Access Management][38]\n    * [Cybersecurity Mesh Architecture][39]\n    * [SOAR as a Service][40]\n    * [Secure Access Service Edge (SASE)][41]\n    * [Identity Threat Detection and Response Service][42]\n    * [Cloud Security Implementation][43]\n    * [DevSecOps \u2013 Shift Left][44]\n    * [Zero Trust Architecture][45]\n    * [SOC for OT Service][46]\n    * [Data Security][47]\n    * [Responsible AI][48]\n    * [Dark Web Monitoring][49]\n    * [Social Media Monitoring][50]\n    * [Brand Monitoring][51]\n* [Resources][52]\n  * [Case Studies][53]\n    * [Transforming Threat Exposure Management at a Leading Cybersecurity Provider][54]\n    * [Red Team Assessment That Exposed What Your SOC Missed. A Security Review That No One\n      Detected][55]\n    * [Transilience AI & Aucctus: SOC2 Compliance Case Study][56]\n    * [Bank Achieves PCI DSS Compliance, Strengthens Security Posture][57]\n    * [Achieving HIPAA and HITRUST compliance with Our MDR Services][58]\n  * [Whitepapers][59]\n  * [Blogs][60]\n  * [Newsletter][61]\n* [Partnerships][62]\n* [About Us][63]\n  * [Career][64]\n* [Contact Us][65]\n\n[ Talk to an Expert ][66]\n[ Transilience ][67] [ Talk to an Expert ][68]\n[ ][69]\n\n###### [Watch: Why Us][70]\n\n# Cybersecurity \u2013 Powered by AI, Delivered by Humans\n\n[ Explore how we help ][71]\n\nProtecting enterprises with intelligent cybersecurity:\nthe power of technology, the precision of human insight.\u00a0\n\n###### Case Studies:\n\n[ Transilience AI Powers Fully Automated SOC2 Compliance for Aucctus, Zero Intervention][72]\n\n[\u00a0Transforming Threat Exposure Management at a Leading Cybersecurity Provider][73]\n\n## Trusted by Industry Leaders\n\n[airtel]\n[fico]\n[fis]\n[amex]\n[tcs]\n[std-chtd]\n[saint-gobain]\n[capgemini]\n[jack-henry (1)]\n[western-union 1]\n[morg-stan]\n\n## ADVISE Framework\n\nA revolutionary, customer-centric approach to managing the entire lifecycle of cybersecurity\nposture, from discovery to evolution\n\n#### A\n\n#### D\n\n#### V\n\n#### I\n\n#### S\n\n#### E\n\n#### A\n\n#### Assess\n\nAI-powered evaluation of the current cybersecurity landscape and client vulnerabilities.\n\n#### D\n\n#### Design\n\nTailor-made, AI-informed cybersecurity strategies.\n\n#### V\n\n#### Visualise\n\nUse AI to offer an intricate view of potential threats and countermeasures.\n\n#### I\n\n#### Implement\n\nDeploy the devised strategies, leveraging AI for optimal results.\n\n#### S\n\n#### Sustain\n\nAI-backed mechanisms ensure continuous protection and timely updates.\n\n#### E\n\n#### Evolve\n\nAI helps us adapt rapidly to changing threats, keeping clients a step ahead.\n\n[ More about ADVISE ][74]\n\n## Services and Offers\n\nWe appreciate your trust greatly. Our clients choose us and our services because they know we are\nthe best. We offer complete cybersecurity to various organizations.\n\n[ Explore all Service [Skip to navigation][1] [Skip to content][2] [[Network Intelligence]Network Intelligence][3]\n\n##### Menu\n* [Practices][4]\n  * [Governance Risk & Compliance][5]\n  * [Governance Risk Management and Compliance][6]\n  * [Identity & Access Management][7]\n  * [Identity Access Management][8]\n  * [Integrated Threat Management][9]\n  * [IoT and OT][10]\n    * [Maturity Assessment][11]\n  * [Privacy Assurance][12]\n  * [Responsible AI][13]\n  * [Secure Digital Transformation][14]\n* [Services][15]\n  * [Strategic][16]\n    * [Cybersecurity Strategy Services][17]\n    * [Cloud Architecture Review][18]\n    * [SOC Maturity Assessment][19]\n    * [Cybersecurity Operating Model][20]\n    * [Compliance][21]\n    * [Risk Management][22]\n    * [Assurance & Audit][23]\n    * [Privacy Program Implementation][24]\n    * [HITRUST][25]\n    * [SOC Audit Services][26]\n    * [Payment Security Simplified][27]\n  * [Offensive][28]\n    * [Vulnerability Management][29]\n    * [Continuous Red Teaming][30]\n    * [Breach & Attack Simulation][31]\n    * [AI Model Testing][32]\n  * [Defensive][33]\n    * [Application Security][34]\n    * [Managed Detection and Response][35]\n    * [Privileged Identity Management][36]\n    * [Extended Detection and Response (XDR)][37]\n    * [Identity & Access Management][38]\n    * [Cybersecurity Mesh Architecture][39]\n    * [SOAR as a Service][40]\n    * [Secure Access Service Edge (SASE)][41]\n    * [Identity Threat Detection and Response Service][42]\n    * [Cloud Security Implementation][43]\n    * [DevSecOps \u2013 Shift Left][44]\n    * [Zero Trust Architecture][45]\n    * [SOC for OT Service][46]\n    * [Data Security][47]\n    * [Responsible AI][48]\n    * [Dark Web Monitoring][49]\n    * [Social Media Monitoring][50]\n    * [Brand Monitoring][51]\n* [Resources][52]\n  * [Case Studies][53]\n    * [Transforming Threat Exposure Management at a Leading Cybersecurity Provider][54]\n    * [Red Team Assessment That Exposed What Your SOC Missed. A Security Review That No One\n      Detected][55]\n    * [Transilience AI & Aucctus: SOC2 Compliance Case Study][56]\n    * [Bank Achieves PCI DSS Compliance, Strengthens Security Posture][57]\n    * [Achieving HIPAA and HITRUST compliance with Our MDR Services][58]\n  * [Whitepapers][59]\n  * [Blogs][60]\n  * [Newsletter][61]\n* [Partnerships][62]\n* [About Us][63]\n  * [Career][64]\n* [Contact Us][65]\n\n[ Talk to an Expert ][66]\n[ Transilience ][67] [ Talk to an Expert ][68]\n[ ][69]\n\n###### [Watch: Why Us][70]\n\n# Cybersecurity \u2013 Powered by AI, Delivered by Humans\n\n[ Explore how we help ][71]\n\nProtecting enterprises with intelligent cybersecurity:\nthe power of technology, the precision of human insight.\u00a0\n\n###### Case Studies:\n\n[ Transilience AI Powers Fully Automated SOC2 Compliance for Aucctus, Zero Intervention][72]\n\n[\u00a0Transforming Threat Exposure Management at a Leading Cybersecurity Provider][73]\n\n## Trusted by Industry Leaders\n\n[airtel]\n[fico]\n[fis]\n[amex]\n[tcs]\n[std-chtd]\n[saint-gobain]\n[capgemini]\n[jack-henry (1)]\n[western-union 1]\n[morg-stan]\n\n## ADVISE Framework\n\nA revolutionary, customer-centric approach to managing the entire lifecycle of cybersecurity\nposture, from discovery to evolution\n\n#### A\n\n#### D\n\n#### V\n\n#### I\n\n#### S\n\n#### E\n\n#### A\n\n#### Assess\n\nAI-powered evaluation of the current cybersecurity landscape and client vulnerabilities.\n\n#### D\n\n#### Design\n\nTailor-made, AI-informed cybersecurity strategies.\n\n#### V\n\n#### Visualise\n\nUse AI to offer an intricate view of potential threats and countermeasures.\n\n#### I\n\n#### Implement\n\nDeploy the devised strategies, leveraging AI for optimal results.\n\n#### S\n\n#### Sustain\n\nAI-backed mechanisms ensure continuous protection and timely updates.\n\n#### E\n\n#### Evolve\n\nAI helps us adapt rapidly to changing threats, keeping clients a step ahead.\n\n[ More about ADVISE ][74]\n\n## Services and Offers\n\nWe appreciate your trust greatly. Our clients choose us and our services because they know we are\nthe best. We offer complete cybersecurity to various organizations.\n\n[ Explore all Services ][75]\n\n### Advanced Detection and Response\n\nAdvanced SOC services for superior threat protection\n\n[Learn more ][76]\n\n### Governance Risk Management and Compliance\n\nComprehensive GRC for today's evolving threats\n\n[Learn more ][77]\n\n### Data Privacy and AI Security\n\nEnsuring ethical AI adoption with privacy focus\n\n[Learn more ][78]\n\n### Secure Digital Transformation\n\nInnovate faster with seamless digital transformation\n\n[Learn more ][79]\n\n## Industries We Serve\n\nOur AI capabilities have empowered us to serve diverse sectors with precision and expertise\n* Banks and Financial Services\n* Technology and Media\n* Oil and Power\n* Airlines\n* E-commerce\n* Retail\n* Healthcare\n\n### Banks and Financial Services\n\nBoost BFSI cybersecurity with AI-powered, compliance-driven solutions. Through proactive threat\nintelligence, MDR, GRC automation, and round-the-clock monitoring, we safeguard financial\ntransactions, stop fraud, and guarantee regulatory compliance.\n\n[ Learn More ][80]\n[ Read More ][81]\n[Financial]\n\n### Technology and Media\n\nSecure digital media and tech with AI-driven cybersecurity. We protect intellectual property,\nstreaming platforms, and user data with 24/7 monitoring, threat intelligence, compliance automation,\nand zero-trust security for uninterrupted digital innovation.\n\n[ Learn More ][82]\n[ Read More ][83]\n[Media & Tech]\n\n### Oil and Power\n\nSecure oil and gas operations with IT-OT cybersecurity. We protect critical infrastructure, prevent\ncyber threats, ensure compliance, and provide 24/7 monitoring, risk assessments, and predictive\nthreat intelligence for operational resilience.\n\n[ Learn More ][84]\n[ Read More ][85]\n[Oil & Power]\n\n### Airlines\n\nEnhance airline cybersecurity with AI-driven protection. We secure payment systems, passenger data,\nand flight operations with PCI DSS compliance, real-time threat detection, and vendor risk\nmanagement, ensuring seamless and disruption-free air travel.\n\n[ Learn More ][86]\n[ Read More ][87]\n[Airlines]\n\n### E-commerce\n\nSecure e-commerce with AI-driven cybersecurity. We protect payment systems, customer data, and\nsupply chains with PCI compliance, fraud prevention, bot mitigation, and 24/7 threat monitoring for\nseamless and secure online shopping experiences.\n\n[ Learn More ][88]\n[ Read More ][89]\n[ecommerce]\n\n### Retail\n\nSecure retail with AI-driven cybersecurity. We protect POS systems, digital storefronts, and\ncustomer data with PCI DSS compliance, fraud prevention, cloud security, and 24/7\nmonitoring\u2014ensuring trust, compliance, and uninterrupted business operations.\n\n[ Learn More ][90]\n[ Read More ][91]\n[Retail]\n\n### Healthcare\n\nProtect healthcare with cybersecurity powered by AI. With round-the-clock monitoring, threat\nintelligence, and HIPAA/HITRUST compliance, we safeguard EHRs, medical devices, and telehealth\nplatforms, guaranteeing patient safety, operational resilience, and regulatory compliance.\n\n[ Learn More ][92]\n[ Read More ][93]\n[hospital]\n\n## Our\n## Accreditations\n\n## A PCI:DSS Certified Organization\n\n[HITRUST][94]\n[PCI QSA ][95]\n[CSA Trusted ][96]\n[CREST Accredited ][97]\n[SWIFT CSP][98]\n\n## Our Partners\n\n[Tenable]\n[palo-alto]\n[sail-point]\n[accuknox]\n[checkmarx]\n[ibm-radar]\n[imperva]\n[syn-radar]\n[okta]\n[saviynt]\n\n## Trusted Voices\n\n> Network Intelligence (NI) has been our cyber security partner for several years, engaging in\n> regulatory audits, thematic assessments, PCI-DSS, security testing and incident management. Their\n> capability to understand the requirements of our business and the commitment to deliver the\n> expected result is commendable. I found the senior management of NI to be quite responsive, even\n> in scenarios where we did not have an official engagement. I wholeheartedly recommend NI for\n> reliable and comprehensive cybersecurity services and solutions.\n\n[Hardik Vashi]\n\n###### Hardik Vashi\n\nVP \u2013 Information Risk Management - Kotak Bank Ltd.\n\n> Network Intelligence clearly is a formidable name in IT and cybersecurity service provider. The\n> swift respon"
