ur SOC Missed. A Security Review That No One\n      Detected][55]\n    * [Transilience AI & Aucctus: SOC2 Compliance Case Study][56]\n    * [Bank Achieves PCI DSS Compliance, Strengthens Security Posture][57]\n    * [Achieving HIPAA and HITRUST compliance with Our MDR Services][58]\n  * [Whitepapers][59]\n  * [Blogs][60]\n  * [Newsletter][61]\n* [Partnerships][62]\n* [About Us][63]\n  * [Career][64]\n* [Contact Us][65]\n\n[ Talk to an Expert ][66]\n[ Transilience ][67] [ Talk to an Expert ][68]\n[ ][69]\n\n###### [Watch: Why Us][70]\n\n# Cybersecurity \u2013 Powered by AI, Delivered by Humans\n\n[ Explore how we help ][71]\n\nProtecting enterprises with intelligent cybersecurity:\nthe power of technology, the precision of human insight.\u00a0\n\n###### Case Studies:\n\n[ Transilience AI Powers Fully Automated SOC2 Compliance for Aucctus, Zero Intervention][72]\n\n[\u00a0Transforming Threat Exposure Management at a Leading Cybersecurity Provider][73]\n\n## Trusted by Industry Leaders\n\n[airtel]\n[fico]\n[fis]\n[amex]\n[tcs]\n[std-chtd]\n[saint-gobain]\n[capgemini]\n[jack-henry (1)]\n[western-union 1]\n[morg-stan]\n\n## ADVISE Framework\n\nA revolutionary, customer-centric approach to managing the entire lifecycle of cybersecurity\nposture, from discovery to evolution\n\n#### A\n\n#### D\n\n#### V\n\n#### I\n\n#### S\n\n#### E\n\n#### A\n\n#### Assess\n\nAI-powered evaluation of the current cybersecurity landscape and client vulnerabilities.\n\n#### D\n\n#### Design\n\nTailor-made, AI-informed cybersecurity strategies.\n\n#### V\n\n#### Visualise\n\nUse AI to offer an intricate view of potential threats and countermeasures.\n\n#### I\n\n#### Implement\n\nDeploy the devised strategies, leveraging AI for optimal results.\n\n#### S\n\n#### Sustain\n\nAI-backed mechanisms ensure continuous protection and timely updates.\n\n#### E\n\n#### Evolve\n\nAI helps us adapt rapidly to changing threats, keeping clients a step ahead.\n\n[ More about ADVISE ][74]\n\n## Services and Offers\n\nWe appreciate your trust greatly. Our clients choose us and our services because they know we are\nthe best. We offer complete cybersecurity to various organizations.\n\n[ Explore all Services ][75]\n\n### Advanced Detection and Response\n\nAdvanced SOC services for superior threat protection\n\n[Learn more ][76]\n\n### Governance Risk Management and Compliance\n\nComprehensive GRC for today's evolving threats\n\n[Learn more ][77]\n\n### Data Privacy and AI Security\n\nEnsuring ethical AI adoption with privacy focus\n\n[Learn more ][78]\n\n### Secure Digital Transformation\n\nInnovate faster with seamless digital transformation\n\n[Learn more ][79]\n\n## Industries We Serve\n\nOur AI capabilities have empowered us to serve diverse sectors with precision and expertise\n* Banks and Financial Services\n* Technology and Media\n* Oil and Power\n* Airlines\n* E-commerce\n* Retail\n* Healthcare\n\n### Banks and Financial Services\n\nBoost BFSI cybersecurity with AI-powered, compliance-driven solutions. Through proactive threat\nintelligence, MDR, GRC automation, and round-the-clock monitoring, we safeguard financial\ntransactions, stop fraud, and guarantee regulatory compliance.\n\n[ Learn More ][80]\n[ Read More ][81]\n[Financial]\n\n### Technology and Media\n\nSecure digital media and tech with AI-driven cybersecurity. We protect intellectual property,\nstreaming platforms, and user data with 24/7 monitoring, threat intelligence, compliance automation,\nand zero-trust security for uninterrupted digital innovation.\n\n[ Learn More ][82]\n[ Read More ][83]\n[Media & Tech]\n\n### Oil and Power\n\nSecure oil and gas operations with IT-OT cybersecurity. We protect critical infrastructure, prevent\ncyber threats, ensure compliance, and provide 24/7 monitoring, risk assessments, and predictive\nthreat intelligence for operational resilience.\n\n[ Learn More ][84]\n[ Read More ][85]\n[Oil & Power]\n\n### Airlines\n\nEnhance airline cybersecurity with AI-driven protection. We secure payment systems, passenger data,\nand flight operations with PCI DSS compliance, real-time threat detection, and vendor risk\nmanagement, ensuring seamless and disruption-free air travel.\n\n[ Learn More ][86]\n[ Read More ][87]\n[Airlines]\n\n### E-commerce\n\nSecure e-commerce with AI-driven cybersecurity. We protect payment systems, customer data, and\nsupply chains with PCI compliance, fraud prevention, bot mitigation, and 24/7 threat monitoring for\nseamless and secure online shopping experiences.\n\n[ Learn More ][88]\n[ Read More ][89]\n[ecommerce]\n\n### Retail\n\nSecure retail with AI-driven cybersecurity. We protect POS systems, digital storefronts, and\ncustomer data with PCI DSS compliance, fraud prevention, cloud security, and 24/7\nmonitoring\u2014ensuring trust, compliance, and uninterrupted business operations.\n\n[ Learn More ][90]\n[ Read More ][91]\n[Retail]\n\n### Healthcare\n\nProtect healthcare with cybersecurity powered by AI. With round-the-clock monitoring, threat\nintelligence, and HIPAA/HITRUST compliance, we safeguard EHRs, medical devices, and telehealth\nplatforms, guaranteeing patient safety, operational resilience, and regulatory compliance.\n\n[ Learn More ][92]\n[ Read More ][93]\n[hospital]\n\n## Our\n## Accreditations\n\n## A PCI:DSS Certified Organization\n\n[HITRUST][94]\n[PCI QSA ][95]\n[CSA Trusted ][96]\n[CREST Accredited ][97]\n[SWIFT CSP][98]\n\n## Our Partners\n\n[Tenable]\n[palo-alto]\n[sail-point]\n[accuknox]\n[checkmarx]\n[ibm-radar]\n[imperva]\n[syn-radar]\n[okta]\n[saviynt]\n\n## Trusted Voices\n\n> Network Intelligence (NI) has been our cyber security partner for several years, engaging in\n> regulatory audits, thematic assessments, PCI-DSS, security testing and incident management. Their\n> capability to understand the requirements of our business and the commitment to deliver the\n> expected result is commendable. I found the senior management of NI to be quite responsive, even\n> in scenarios where we did not have an official engagement. I wholeheartedly recommend NI for\n> reliable and comprehensive cybersecurity services and solutions.\n\n[Hardik Vashi]\n\n###### Hardik Vashi\n\nVP \u2013 Information Risk Management - Kotak Bank Ltd.\n\n> Network Intelligence clearly is a formidable name in IT and cybersecurity service provider. The\n> swift response when contacted, fast delivery of service and considerable flexibility in pricing\n> makes Network Intelligence an indispensable partner for any organization for whom cybersecurity is\n> mission critical. Whether you are looking for ISO security certifications, PCI DSS certification,\n> VAPT or other related cybersecurity requirements, I strongly believe Network Intelligence is that\n> name you can always rely on to deliver on time, in scope and with quality.\n\n[Fru Christian Bills]\n\n###### Fru C. Bills\n\nHead of Security & Risk Management - SADAD Electronic\n\n> Network Intelligence ensures our PCI security compliance with professionalism and precision. Their\n> tailored approach, from assessment to implementation, is commendable. The audit process reflects\n> their expertise and attention to detail, revealing areas for improved security. Their ongoing\n> post-audit support is invaluable, enhancing our overall security. I wholeheartedly endorse their\n> PCI audit services for businesses seeking robust data security.\n\n[Jennelyn Robledo]\n\n###### Jennelyn Robledo\n\nIT Technical Support Manager\n\n> Our journey with Network Intelligence began with an impressive sales process. Their commitment to\n> a partnership model and focus on detail caught our attention. As we navigate the dynamic\n> cybersecurity landscape, their innovative services continue to meet our evolving needs.\n\n[Abdulrhman Alarifi]\n\n###### Abdulrhman Alarifi\n\nCEO - One Single View\n\n> Starting our journey towards PCI DSS and ISO27001 certs in 2020, NI's unwavering support has been\n> crucial. Their availability and expertise aid compliance. NI's constant availability stands out. A\n> quick email leads to productive calls, addressing queries promptly. During the PCI DSS and\n> ISO27001 project, NI's presence was invaluable. Their precise approach ensured accurate\n> applications. With NI, we've achieved three years of hiccup-free PCI DSS recertification. Excited\n> to continue, their responsiveness and expertise resonate. Grateful for this partnership, embracing\n> a secure future.\n\n[JAMES AARON R. LACSAMANA]\n\n###### James Aaron R. Lacssamana\n\nHead of IT - Eastvantage\n\n> The CWASP training program provided by Network Intelligence has exceeded our expectations in every\n> aspect. The program's structure was well-paced and tailored to accommodate various learning\n> styles, ensuring that every participant could grasp and apply the concepts effectively. The\n> program's impact on our team has been profound. The program's effectiveness, coupled with the\n> professionalism & knowledge of the NI team, has solidified our trust in their training services.\n> We highly recommend Network Intelligence to any organization seeking to empower their workforce\n> with top-tier cybersecurity education.\n\n[Meraj Ul Qamar]\n\n###### Meraj Ul Qamar\n\nIndici Operations Manager - Valentia Technologies\n\n> Over the last five years or so, Network Intelligence has consistently delivered expert technical\n> assessments and compliance advisory services to Balance Hero. Their deep understanding of the\n> cybersecurity landscape & India based compliances is evident. Their proactive vulnerability\n> management has fortified our operations. They've become a crucial ally in our cybersecurity\n> journey at Balance Hero.\n\n[Sunil Kumar]\n\n###### Sunil Kumar\n\nAGM - IT & Security (CISA) - Balance Hero\n\n> We engaged the services of Network Intelligence to achieve PCI compliance and SOC 1 & S\ufeffOC 2 Type\n> II compliance, which is crucial for our client's needs. In just two months, we successfully\n> obtained PCI SAQ-D certification. Currently, we're finalizing SOC 1 & SOC 2 Type II compliance\n> with Network Intelligence's expert guidance. Their professionalism, rapid response, and assistance\n> overcoming obstacles have been exceptional. We're excited to continue working with them to\n> complete our certifications and strengthen our partnership.\n\n[Alexander S.G]\n\n###### Alexander S.G\n\nGroup Director of Solutions - Optimo Software\n\n> Having worked "
          }
        ]
