      "polished_summary": "Network Intelligence is a leading cybersecurity firm that specializes in providing comprehensive solutions powered by artificial intelligence and human expertise. Their core services include governance, risk management, compliance, identity and access management, and advanced threat detection, catering to a diverse range of industries seeking to enhance their cybersecurity posture and ensure regulatory compliance. With a customer-centric approach, Network Intelligence employs its innovative ADVISE framework to assess, design, implement, sustain, and evolve cybersecurity strategies tailored to the unique needs of each client.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Network Intelligence provides specialized cybersecurity services, including governance, risk management, compliance, and advanced threat detection, which are directly applicable to Cyber-Physical Systems Security. Their focus on IoT and OT security further aligns them with the target market.",
