        "crawl_text": "Seceon Inc. Compliant with industry standards USA India APAC Recognized in Gartner Peer Insights for SIEM 2026 Machine Learning Cloud Computing Unified platform reduces complexity AI-driven automation enhances efficiency Proactive security testing identifies gaps GDPR HIPAA PCI-DSS United States India United Arab Emirates South Africa Yemen Sri Lanka Bangladesh Nepal Australia Kuwait Mexico United States India United Arab Emirates South Africa Yemen Sri Lanka Bangladesh Nepal Australia Kuwait Mexico Afghanistan Albania Algeria USA India APAC Global Seceon has over 9,800 customers worldwide and 850 global MSSP partners. The company focuses on AI-driven cybersecurity solutions to simplify security operations and enhance cyber resilience. Expanding global presence in cybersecurity markets. Enhancing AI capabilities for better threat detection. Increasing competition in the cybersecurity space. Evolving cyber threats that require constant innovation. Growing demand for AI-driven cybersecurity solutions. Expansion into emerging markets. Leader in AI-driven cybersecurity solutions for enterprises and MSSPs. Increasing cyber threats driving demand for advanced security solutions. Partnerships with MSSPs to expand service offerings. Leader in Cybersecurity Solutions and Services in USA, India &amp; Threat Detection for Modern Enterprises | Seceon\n\nPlatform\nOTM Platform\naiSIEM\naiXDR\naiSIEM Cguard\naiSecurity360\nSolutions\nFeatured Use Cases\nAdvanced Threat Detection\nBruteforce Prevention\nCloud Security\nData exfiltration\nDNS Protection\nInsider Breache\nMalware Detection\nRansomware Detection\nVulnerability Exploits\nWeb Application Security\nPartner Led Services\nIndustries\nFinancial\nHealthcare\nGovernment\nUtilities\nManufacturing\nTechnology\nRetail\nWhy Seceon\nSeceon Compares\nWhy Customers Choose Seceon\nPartners\nMSP Partners\nMSSP Partners\nPortal Login\nSupport Login\nEnterprise\nCompany\nAbout Company\nLeadership\nCareers\nAwards\nNews &#038; Events\nSeceon News\nPress Releases\nWebinars And Videos\nEvents\nResources\nCompliance Report\nAnalyst Reports\nCase Study\nData Sheets\nWhitepapers\nBlogs\nContact Us\nBook An Appointment\n\nBook An Appointment\n\nPlatform\n\nCapabilities of OTM Platform\n\nExplore Seceon\u2019s OTM Platform \u2192\nExplore Data Connectors \u2192\nOther Connectors \u2192\nQuantify Your Security ROI with SecROI360 \u2192\n\naiSIEM\n\naiSIEM-CGuard\n\naiXDR-PMAX\n\naiSecurity Score 360\n\naiSecurity BI360\n\naiBAS360\n\naiSecOT360\n\naiCompliance CMX360\n\nSERA AI\n\nCapabilities of OTM Platform\n\nSecurity Posture &amp; Asset Management\n\nMonitor and manage your security assets efficiently.\n\nAnalytics &amp; Compliance Reporting\n\nGain insights and comply with regulations using analytics.\n\nContainer &amp; Database Security\n\nObtain complete visibility into your security environment.\n\nComprehensive Visibility\n\nSecure your containerized and database environments effectively.\n\nThreat Intelligence/Threat Hunting\n\nStay ahead of emerging threats with up-to-date intelligence.\n\nNetwork Detection &amp; Response (NDR)\n\nIdentify and mitigate threats within your network.\n\nIntrusion Detection System (IDS)\n\nDetect and prevent unauthorized access attempts.\n\nUEBA\n\nIdentify abnormal behavior that could indicate threats.\n\nComprehensive Network Security\n\nFocus on core protections that form the basis of your cybersecurity framework.\n\nCloud & SaaS Security\n\nProtect cloud environments and software-as-a-service applications.\n\nForensic Analysis & Threat Hunting\n\nInvestigate incidents and proactively search for threats.\n\nNG-SIEM\n\nMonitor intelligently with AI-enhanced Next-Gen SIEM.\n\nSOAR\n\nStreamline and automate your incident response processes.\n\nEndpoint Detection & Response (EDR)\n\nDetect and respond to threats targeting your endpoints.\n\nReal-Time Threat Containment\n\nInstantly neutralize threats as they emerge.\n\nDynamic Threat Containment\n\nAdapt and respond to evolving threats with agility.\n\nSolutions\n\nMenu with Icons\n\nFeatured Use Cases\n\nExplore Seceon's innovative solutions for advanced threat detection and cybersecurity challenges\n\nAdvanced threat detection\n\nBruteforce prevention\n\nCloud Security\n\nNetwork Detection and Response (NDR)\n\nData exfiltration\n\nDNS protection\n\nInsider and credential breaches\n\nMalware detection\n\nRansomware Detection\n\nVulnerability exploits\n\nWeb application security\n\nPartner Led Services\n\nEnhance your security strategy with Seceon's expert partner-led services and comprehensive support\n\nAdvisory services\n\nAttack surface monitoring\n\nAudit services\n\nBreach attack simulation services\n\nIncident response and forensics\n\nRed teaming services\n\nRisk management services\n\nVulnerability lifecycle management services\n\nIndustries\n\nFinancial\n\nHealthcare\n\nEducation\n\nGovernment\n\nUtilities\n\nManufacturing\n\nTelecom\n\nRetail\n\nPharmaceutical\n\nWhy Seceon\n\nWhy Seceon Menu\n\nWhy Seceon\n\nHow Seceon Compares\n\nDiscover the unique advantages that set Seceon apart in the cybersecurity landscape.\n\nWhy Customers Choose Seceon\n\nLearn why organizations trust Seceon for comprehensive threat detection and response.\n\nPartners\n\nPartners and Login\n\nPartners\n\nMSP Partners:\n\nBecome a partner to experience the best security services.\n\nMSSP Partners:\n\nSeceon is the ideal partner for your transition to MSSP.\n\nCGuard Login\n\nCGuard Global Login\n\nCGuard Europe Login\n\nCGuard Australia Login\n\nSupport Login\n\nSupport Portal Login\n\nEnterprise\nCompany\n\nCompany Information\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Company\n\nSeceon integrates data from logs, networks, clouds, and applications for security.\n\nLeadership\n\nMeet visionaries driving Seceon\u2019s mission to enhance cybersecurity with innovative solutions.\n\nCareers\n\nExplore opportunities to join Seceon\u2019s team and help transform cybersecurity.\n\nAwards\n\nRecognizing Seceon\u2019s excellence in cybersecurity innovation and achievements.\n\nNews & Events\nSeceon In The News\n\nStay updated with the latest announcements, partnerships, and advancements from Seceon. -->\n\nPress Releases\n\nOfficial statements and updates about Seceon\u2019s initiatives, products, and market presence.\n\nWebinars And Videos\n\nAccess insightful webinars and video content to learn more about Seceon\u2019s cybersecurity solutions.\n\nEvents\n\nJoin Seceon at upcoming industry events, conferences, and workshops around the globe.\n\nResources\n\nCompliance Report\n\nAnalysts recommend Seceon for advanced security.\n\nCase Study & One Pager Documents\n\nReal success stories using Seceon solutions.\n\nData Sheets & Solution Brief\n\nDetailed specifications of Seceon security products.\n\nWhitepapers\n\nResearch insights on modern cybersecurity practices.\n\nBlogs\n\nExpert tips and updates from Seceon.\n\nContact Us\n\nBook An Appointment\n\nResponsive Banner Design\n\n-->\n\nSmarter Cybersecurity Starts With One Unified AI Platform\n\nDetect threats earlier, automate response, and replace dozens of security tools with one cost effective platform.\n\nStart CGuard 30-Day Free Trial\n\nActive MSSP Partners\n\nTrillion\n\nEvents and Flows/day\n\nLive customers\n\nAwards\n\nSeceon Recognized in\n\nGartner \u00ae Peer Insights \u2122\n\nVoice of the Customer for SIEM 2026\n\nBased on verified peer reviews, this report reflects real-world performance across deployment, usability, and security operations, helping organizations make informed decisions with confidence.\n\nRead More\n\nPartnerships and Services\n\nStart Here: MSP/MSSP or Enterprise\n\nManaged Service Provider\n\nDeliver managed security services with Seceon\u2019s all-in-one platform.\n\nLearn More\n\nManaged Security Service Provider\n\nLeverage Seceon\u2019s AI-driven platform to offer multi-tenant, 24/7 SOC services.\n\nLearn More\n\nEnterprise\n\nStrengthen enterprise security with Seceon\u2019s unified platform.\n\nLearn More\n\nOne Platform, Any Industry\n\nOne Platform, Any Industry\n\nFinance\n\nProtect banking systems, transaction flows, and sensitive financial data from advanced cyber threats.\n\nLearn More\n\nEducation\n\nSecure campus networks, research environments, and student data across distributed infrastructures.\n\nLearn More\n\nHealthcare\n\nDefend clinical systems, medical devices, and patient data against ransomware and breaches.\n\nLearn More\n\nUtilities\n\nSafeguard critical infrastructure and OT environments powering essential services.\n\nLearn More\n\nManufacturing\n\nSecure industrial control systems, production lines, and connected factory networks.\n\nLearn More\n\nTelecom\n\nProtect carrier-grade infrastructure, network traffic, and subscriber data at scale.\n\nLearn More\n\nRetail\n\nSecure distributed stores, POS systems, and customer data across multiple locations.\n\nLearn More\n\nGovernment\n\nDefend public sector systems, citizen data, and mission-critical operations.\n\nLearn More\n\nPharmaceutical\n\nProtect drug research, intellectual property, and regulated manufacturing systems.\n\nLearn More\n\nSeceon Security Solutions - Section 1\n\nAgentic AI-Driven SOC That Thinks, Investigates,\nand Responds\n\nSeceon's Autonomous SOC continuously detects, correlates, investigates, and responds\nto threats in real time while reducing analyst workload and accelerating threat response.\n\nSeceon Rolling Messages\n\n9,800+ Customers. One Unified Platform.\n95% Fewer Alerts. 100% Real Threats. Zero Black Box.\n30-Day POV - See Threats &amp; Security Posture in 24 Hours.\nNo Sales Pitch. No Pressure. Just Run It and Compare.\nOne Platform Replaces Your Entire Security Stack.\n\n9,800+ Customers. One Unified Platform.\n95% Fewer * [Platform\n][1]\n* [OTM Platform\n][2]\n* [aiSIEM][3]\n* [aiXDR][4]\n* [aiSIEM Cguard][5]\n* [aiSecurity360][6]\n* [Solutions\n][7]\n* [Featured Use Cases\n][8]\n* [Advanced Threat Detection][9]\n* 