threat detection and response.\n\nPartners\n\nPartners and Login\n\nPartners\n\nMSP Partners:\n\nBecome a partner to experience the best security services.\n\nMSSP Partners:\n\nSeceon is the ideal partner for your transition to MSSP.\n\nCGuard Login\n\nCGuard Global Login\n\nCGuard Europe Login\n\nCGuard Australia Login\n\nSupport Login\n\nSupport Portal Login\n\nEnterprise\nCompany\n\nCompany Information\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Company\n\nSeceon integrates data from logs, networks, clouds, and applications for security.\n\nLeadership\n\nMeet visionaries driving Seceon\u2019s mission to enhance cybersecurity with innovative solutions.\n\nCareers\n\nExplore opportunities to join Seceon\u2019s team and help transform cybersecurity.\n\nAwards\n\nRecognizing Seceon\u2019s excellence in cybersecurity innovation and achievements.\n\nNews & Events\nSeceon In The News\n\nStay updated with the latest announcements, partnerships, and advancements from Seceon. -->\n\nPress Releases\n\nOfficial statements and updates about Seceon\u2019s initiatives, products, and market presence.\n\nWebinars And Videos\n\nAccess insightful webinars and video content to learn more about Seceon\u2019s cybersecurity solutions.\n\nEvents\n\nJoin Seceon at upcoming industry events, conferences, and workshops around the globe.\n\nResources\n\nCompliance Report\n\nAnalysts recommend Seceon for advanced security.\n\nCase Study & One Pager Documents\n\nReal success stories using Seceon solutions.\n\nData Sheets & Solution Brief\n\nDetailed specifications of Seceon security products.\n\nWhitepapers\n\nResearch insights on modern cybersecurity practices.\n\nBlogs\n\nExpert tips and updates from Seceon.\n\nContact Us\n\nBook An Appointment\n\nResponsive Banner Design\n\n-->\n\nSmarter Cybersecurity Starts With One Unified AI Platform\n\nDetect threats earlier, automate response, and replace dozens of security tools with one cost effective platform.\n\nStart CGuard 30-Day Free Trial\n\nActive MSSP Partners\n\nTrillion\n\nEvents and Flows/day\n\nLive customers\n\nAwards\n\nSeceon Recognized in\n\nGartner \u00ae Peer Insights \u2122\n\nVoice of the Customer for SIEM 2026\n\nBased on verified peer reviews, this report reflects real-world performance across deployment, usability, and security operations, helping organizations make informed decisions with confidence.\n\nRead More\n\nPartnerships and Services\n\nStart Here: MSP/MSSP or Enterprise\n\nManaged Service Provider\n\nDeliver managed security services with Seceon\u2019s all-in-one platform.\n\nLearn More\n\nManaged Security Service Provider\n\nLeverage Seceon\u2019s AI-driven platform to offer multi-tenant, 24/7 SOC services.\n\nLearn More\n\nEnterprise\n\nStrengthen enterprise security with Seceon\u2019s unified platform.\n\nLearn More\n\nOne Platform, Any Industry\n\nOne Platform, Any Industry\n\nFinance\n\nProtect banking systems, transaction flows, and sensitive financial data from advanced cyber threats.\n\nLearn More\n\nEducation\n\nSecure campus networks, research environments, and student data across distributed infrastructures.\n\nLearn More\n\nHealthcare\n\nDefend clinical systems, medical devices, and patient data against ransomware and breaches.\n\nLearn More\n\nUtilities\n\nSafeguard critical infrastructure and OT environments powering essential services.\n\nLearn More\n\nManufacturing\n\nSecure industrial control systems, production lines, and connected factory networks.\n\nLearn More\n\nTelecom\n\nProtect carrier-grade infrastructure, network traffic, and subscriber data at scale.\n\nLearn More\n\nRetail\n\nSecure distributed stores, POS systems, and customer data across multiple locations.\n\nLearn More\n\nGovernment\n\nDefend public sector systems, citizen data, and mission-critical operations.\n\nLearn More\n\nPharmaceutical\n\nProtect drug research, intellectual property, and regulated manufacturing systems.\n\nLearn More\n\nSeceon Security Solutions - Section 1\n\nAgentic AI-Driven SOC That Thinks, Investigates,\nand Responds\n\nSeceon's Autonomous SOC continuously detects, correlates, investigates, and responds\nto threats in real time while reducing analyst workload and accelerating threat response.\n\nSeceon Rolling Messages\n\n9,800+ Customers. One Unified Platform.\n95% Fewer Alerts. 100% Real Threats. Zero Black Box.\n30-Day POV - See Threats &amp; Security Posture in 24 Hours.\nNo Sales Pitch. No Pressure. Just Run It and Compare.\nOne Platform Replaces Your Entire Security Stack.\n\n9,800+ Customers. One Unified Platform.\n95% Fewer Alerts. 100% Real Threats. Zero Black Box.\n30-Day POV - See Threats &amp; Security Posture in 24 Hours.\nNo Sales Pitch. No Pressure. Just Run It and Compare.\nOne Platform Replaces Your Entire Security Stack.\n\nExperience Seceon's All-In-One Platform With Built-in Remediation\n\nSeceon integrates data from logs, identity management, networks, endpoints, clouds, and applications.\n\nOur analysis, powered by AI and ML, ensures real-time visibility, proactive threat detection,\n\nbuilt-in security posture monitoring, compliance reporting, and policy management.\n\nResponsive Image Map with Styled Tooltips\n\nClick to know more!\n\nOur Partners\n\nSeceon\u2019s Fab 5: The Core of Comprehensive Cybersecurity\n\nSeceon\u2019s Fab 5 combines five essential capabilities that work seamlessly to deliver proactive threat detection, automated response, deep visibility, and streamlined security management.\n\n-->\n\nInteractive Seceon Wheel\n\nOTM Platform\n\nSeceon\u2019s Open Threat Management (OTM) Platform delivers a smarter solution.\n\nBy eliminating the redundancy, frustration, and inefficiencies of siloed tools,\nSeceon ensures cost-effective protection, detection, and remediation\nproviding you with peace of mind in a single pane of glass.\n\nLower Total Cost of Ownership\n\nUp to 70% lower TCO and 60% SOC cost savings through one automated, all-in-one platform eliminating 20+ redundant tools.\n\nFast Deployment & Onboarding\n\nPrebuilt playbooks, connectors, and auto-tuning get you live in hours, cutting onboarding time by up to 70% and accelerating revenue and ROI.\n\nBoost Margins Up to 60%\n\nGo live in hours with multi-tenant management - build your own MSSP with 60%+ margins or resell partner services with 25% guaranteed profit.\n\nAsset-Based Licensing\n\nNo annual cost variance due to data growth - delivering up to 40% cost savings and 100% pricing predictability.\n\nOTM Platform\n\nLearn More\n\nComprehensive Threat Solutions: How Seceon Guards Against Attacks\n\nDiscover how Seceon\u2019s advanced solutions defend against a wide range\nof attacks and safeguard your organization\u2019s critical assets.\n\nRansomware Detection\n\nAI-powered ransomware detection with rapid automated response.\n\nKnow more!\n\nBrute Force Attack\n\nDetects and blocks suspicious login and password attack patterns.\n\nKnow more!\n\nData Breach\n\nMonitors activity and endpoints to reduce data breach impact.\n\nKnow more!\n\nInsiders & Credential Breaches\n\nDetects insider threats using advanced UEBA analytics.\n\nKnow more!\n\nVulnerability Exploits\n\nIdentifies exploit attempts, malware activity, and critical threats.\n\nKnow more!\n\nCloud Security\n\nSecures SaaS environments with seamless cloud integrations.\n\nKnow more!\n\nAwards and Recognition\n\nFrom Features to Function Live in Action\n\nExperience how Seceon's unified AI-driven cybersecurity platform operates in real-world environments through live demonstrations and expert-led sessions.\n\nExecutive interview\n\nAn executive overview of Seceon\u2019s unified security platform covering real time threat detection, AI driven correlation operational efficiency, and value for MSPs and MSSPs.\n\nAI-powered threat detection\n\nIntegrated SIEM, SOAR & XDR\n\nFull visibility across network, endpoint & cloud\n\nAutomated response, reduced complexity\n\nLearn how to strengthen security while lowering operational overhead.\n\nExplore More\n\nDon't Just Take Our Word For It: Hear From the Experts\n\nDiscover Seceon's real-world impact through our valued customers. Hear from industry leaders like the COO of\n\nLogically and CEO of Netgain about how our platform transformed their security operations, enabling\n\nfaster threat detection, agile responses, and protection from costly breaches.\n\nExperience the Seceon difference.\n\nKeith Johnson\n\nExecutive VP, Obviam\n\n\"Seceon\u2019s aiSIEM platform powers our 24x7 SOC and aiXDR360 Services, offering proactive defense to safeguard clients from attacks. Their innovation ensures efficient detection, response, and continuous security service value.\"\n\nMark Van Vuuren\n\nProduct Director, Corr-Serve\n\n\"We are pl"
