tics.\n\n#### [Container & Database Security][74]\n\nObtain complete visibility into your security environment.\n\n#### [Comprehensive Visibility][75]\n\nSecure your containerized and database environments effectively.\n\n#### [Threat Intelligence/Threat Hunting][76]\n\nStay ahead of emerging threats with up-to-date intelligence.\n\n#### [Network Detection & Response (NDR)][77]\n\nIdentify and mitigate threats within your network.\n\n#### [Intrusion Detection System (IDS)][78]\n\nDetect and prevent unauthorized access attempts.\n\n#### [UEBA][79]\n\nIdentify abnormal behavior that could indicate threats.\n\n#### [Comprehensive Network Security][80]\n\nFocus on core protections that form the basis of your cybersecurity framework.\n\n#### [Cloud & SaaS Security][81]\n\nProtect cloud environments and software-as-a-service applications.\n\n#### [Forensic Analysis & Threat Hunting][82]\n\nInvestigate incidents and proactively search for threats.\n\n#### [NG-SIEM][83]\n\nMonitor intelligently with AI-enhanced Next-Gen SIEM.\n\n#### [SOAR][84]\n\nStreamline and automate your incident response processes.\n\n#### [Endpoint Detection & Response (EDR)][85]\n\nDetect and respond to threats targeting your endpoints.\n\n#### [Real-Time Threat Containment][86]\n\nInstantly neutralize threats as they emerge.\n\n#### [Dynamic Threat Containment][87]\n\nAdapt and respond to evolving threats with agility.\n* [Solutions][88]\n* * * Menu with Icons\n\n### Featured Use Cases\n\nExplore Seceon's innovative solutions for advanced threat detection and cybersecurity\nchallenges\n* [Advanced threat detection][89]\n* [Bruteforce prevention][90]\n* [Cloud Security][91]\n* [Network Detection and Response (NDR)][92]\n* [Data exfiltration][93]\n* [DNS protection][94]\n* [Insider and credential breaches][95]\n* [Malware detection][96]\n* [Ransomware Detection][97]\n* [Vulnerability exploits][98]\n* [Web application security][99]\n\n### Partner Led Services\n\nEnhance your security strategy with Seceon's expert partner-led services and comprehensive\nsupport\n* [Advisory services][100]\n* [Attack surface monitoring][101]\n* [Audit services][102]\n* [Breach attack simulation services][103]\n* [Incident response and forensics][104]\n* [Red teaming services][105]\n* [Risk management services][106]\n* [Vulnerability lifecycle management services][107]\n\n### Industries\n* [ Financial][108]\n* [ Healthcare][109]\n* [ Education][110]\n* [ Government][111]\n* [ Utilities][112]\n* [ Manufacturing][113]\n* [ Telecom][114]\n* [ Retail][115]\n* [ Pharmaceutical][116]\n* [Why Seceon][117]\n* * * Why Seceon Menu\n\n## Why Seceon\n\n#### [How Seceon Compares][118]\n\nDiscover the unique advantages that set Seceon apart in the cybersecurity landscape.\n\n#### [Why Customers Choose Seceon][119]\n\nLearn why organizations trust Seceon for comprehensive threat detection and response.\n* [Partners][120]\n* * * Partners and Login\n\n### Partners\n\n#### [MSP Partners:][121]\n\nBecome a partner to experience the best security services.\n\n#### [MSSP Partners:][122]\n\nSeceon is the ideal partner for your transition to MSSP.\n\n### CGuard Login\n\n[ CGuard Global Login ][123]\n\n[ CGuard Europe Login ][124]\n\n[ CGuard Australia Login ][125]\n\n### Support Login\n\n[ Support Portal Login ][126]\n* [Enterprise][127]\n* [Company][128]\n* * * Company Information\n\n### Company\n\n#### [About Company][129]\n\nSeceon integrates data from logs, networks, clouds, and applications for security.\n\n#### [Leadership][130]\n\nMeet visionaries driving Seceon\u2019s mission to enhance cybersecurity with innovative\nsolutions.\n\n#### [Careers][131]\n\nExplore opportunities to join Seceon\u2019s team and help transform cybersecurity.\n\n#### [Awards][132]\n\nRecognizing Seceon\u2019s excellence in cybersecurity innovation and achievements.\n\n### News & Events\n\n#### [Press Releases][133]\n\nOfficial statements and updates about Seceon\u2019s initiatives, products, and market presence.\n\n#### [Webinars And Videos][134]\n\nAccess insightful webinars and video content to learn more about Seceon\u2019s cybersecurity\nsolutions.\n\n#### [Events][135]\n\nJoin Seceon at upcoming industry events, conferences, and workshops around the globe.\n\n### Resources\n\n#### [Compliance Report][136]\n\nAnalysts recommend Seceon for advanced security.\n\n#### [Case Study & One Pager Documents][137]\n\nReal success stories using Seceon solutions.\n\n#### [Data Sheets & Solution Brief][138]\n\nDetailed specifications of Seceon security products.\n\n#### [Whitepapers][139]\n\nResearch insights on modern cybersecurity practices.\n\n#### [Blogs][140]\n\nExpert tips and updates from Seceon.\n* [Contact Us][141]\n[Book An Appointment][142]\nOur Team and Advisory Board\n\n# Our Team and Advisory Board\n\nMeet the experts driving our vision forward\n\nLeadership Team\n\n# Leadership\n\n[Chandra Shekar Pandey]\n\n### Chandra Shekar Pandey\n\nFounder & CEO\n\nShow Profile\n\nChandra Pandey is the Founder & CEO of Seceon Inc., a visionary leader in AI-driven cybersecurity\nwith a mission to simplify and automate threat detection, response, and compliance for enterprises\nand MSSPs. With over 25 years of experience in networking, security, AI, and cloud computing,\nChandra has pioneered Seceon\u2019s Next-Gen AI-Security Platform, transforming the way organizations\ndetect, analyze, and mitigate cyber threats in real time. Prior to founding Seceon, he held key\nleadership roles at Juniper Networks, BTI Systems, and Lucent where he played a pivotal role in\ndeveloping cutting-edge security and networking solutions. Under his leadership, Seceon has emerged\nas a leader in AI-powered cybersecurity, delivering SIEM, SOAR, XDR, UEBA, NDR, and Threat\nIntelligence in a single unified platform. A strong advocate for proactive cybersecurity, Chandra\nregularly speaks at global security conferences and collaborates with industry leaders to drive\ninnovative AI-powered security solutions.\n\n[Smit Kadakia]\n\n### Smit Kadakia\n\nCo-Founder & Chief Data Scientist\n\nShow Profile\n\nSmit leads Seceon\u2019s Data Science and Machine Learning team, responsible for building advanced\nbehavioral anomaly detection solutions. He has extensive experience using data analytics to\ntransform businesses and SaaS platforms in the cloud domain.\n\n[Tom Ertel]\n\n### Tom Ertel\n\nSVP Technical Sales & Strategic Accounts\n\nShow Profile\n\nWith over 30 years of experience, Tom helps organizations protect their networks from evolving cyber\nthreats using Seceon\u2019s OTM platform. He brings leadership in technical sales and strategic account\nmanagement for key customers globally.\n\n[Waldek Mikolajczyk]\n\n### Waldek Mikolajczyk\n\nVP - Cybersecurity Solutions Architecture\n\nShow Profile\n\nWaldek is a networking and security veteran with 30+ years of experience in product architecture and\ndevelopment. He has held key roles in both startups and established companies, leading the\ndevelopment of seven innovative networking technologies.\n\nAdvisory Board\n\n# Advisory Board\n\n[Paul Crann]\n\n### Paul Crann\n\n[Dr. Nabil Bitar]\n\n### Dr. Nabil Bitar\n\n[Dr. Randy Paffenroth]\n\n### Dr. Randy Paffenroth\n\n[Dr. Prasant Mohapatra]\n\n### Dr. Prasant Mohapatra\n\n[Mota]\n\n### Ray Mota\n\n[Nick Moser]\n\n### Nick Moser\n\n[Naveen Rohatgi]\n\n### Naveen Rohatgi\n\n[Sunil K. Kotagiri]\n\n### Sunil K. Kotagiri\n\n### Contact Info\n* [ Hotline: Phone: +1 (978)-923-0040 ][143]\n* [ Email: info@seceon.com ][144]\n* Address: 238 Littleton Road, Suite #200, Westford, MA 01886, USA\n\n[[SOC2]][145] [[ISO]][146]\n\n### Partner Led Services\n* [Advisory Services][147]\n* [Attack Surface Monitoring][148]\n* [Breach Attack Simulation][149]\n* [Incident Response][150]\n* [Risk Management][151]\n\n### Use Cases\n* [Advanced Threat Detection][152]\n* [Bruteforce Prevention][153]\n* [Cloud Security][154]\n* [Insider & Credential Breaches][155]\n* [Ransomware Detection][156]\n\n### Quick L