tics.\n\n#### [Container & Database Security][74]\n\nObtain complete visibility into your security environment.\n\n#### [Comprehensive Visibility][75]\n\nSecure your containerized and database environments effectively.\n\n#### [Threat Intelligence/Threat Hunting][76]\n\nStay ahead of emerging threats with up-to-date intelligence.\n\n#### [Network Detection & Response (NDR)][77]\n\nIdentify and mitigate threats within your network.\n\n#### [Intrusion Detection System (IDS)][78]\n\nDetect and prevent unauthorized access attempts.\n\n#### [UEBA][79]\n\nIdentify abnormal behavior that could indicate threats.\n\n#### [Comprehensive Network Security][80]\n\nFocus on core protections that form the basis of your cybersecurity framework.\n\n#### [Cloud & SaaS Security][81]\n\nProtect cloud environments and software-as-a-service applications.\n\n#### [Forensic Analysis & Threat Hunting][82]\n\nInvestigate incidents and proactively search for threats.\n\n#### [NG-SIEM][83]\n\nMonitor intelligently with AI-enhanced Next-Gen SIEM.\n\n#### [SOAR][84]\n\nStreamline and automate your incident response processes.\n\n#### [Endpoint Detection & Response (EDR)][85]\n\nDetect and respond to threats targeting your endpoints.\n\n#### [Real-Time Threat Containment][86]\n\nInstantly neutralize threats as they emerge.\n\n#### [Dynamic Threat Containment][87]\n\nAdapt and respond to evolving threats with agility.\n* [Solutions][88]\n* * * Menu with Icons\n\n### Featured Use Cases\n\nExplore Seceon's innovative solutions for advanced threat detection and cybersecurity\nchallenges\n* [Advanced threat detection][89]\n* [Bruteforce prevention][90]\n* [Cloud Security][91]\n* [Network Detection and Response (NDR)][92]\n* [Data exfiltration][93]\n* [DNS protection][94]\n* [Insider and credential breaches][95]\n* [Malware detection][96]\n* [Ransomware Detection][97]\n* [Vulnerability exploits][98]\n* [Web application security][99]\n\n### Partner Led Services\n\nEnhance your security strategy with Seceon's expert partner-led services and comprehensive\nsupport\n* [Advisory services][100]\n* [Attack surface monitoring][101]\n* [Audit services][102]\n* [Breach attack simulation services][103]\n* [Incident response and forensics][104]\n* [Red teaming services][105]\n* [Risk management services][106]\n* [Vulnerability lifecycle management services][107]\n\n### Industries\n* [ Financial][108]\n* [ Healthcare][109]\n* [ Education][110]\n* [ Government][111]\n* [ Utilities][112]\n* [ Manufacturing][113]\n* [ Telecom][114]\n* [ Retail][115]\n* [ Pharmaceutical][116]\n* [Why Seceon][117]\n* * * Why Seceon Menu\n\n## Why Seceon\n\n#### [How Seceon Compares][118]\n\nDiscover the unique advantages that set Seceon apart in the cybersecurity landscape.\n\n#### [Why Customers Choose Seceon][119]\n\nLearn why organizations trust Seceon for comprehensive threat detection and response.\n* [Partners][120]\n* * * Partners and Login\n\n### Partners\n\n#### [MSP Partners:][121]\n\nBecome a partner to experience the best security services.\n\n#### [MSSP Partners:][122]\n\nSeceon is the ideal partner for your transition to MSSP.\n\n### CGuard Login\n\n[ CGuard Global Login ][123]\n\n[ CGuard Europe Login ][124]\n\n[ CGuard Australia Login ][125]\n\n### Support Login\n\n[ Support Portal Login ][126]\n* [Enterprise][127]\n* [Company][128]\n* * * Company Information\n\n### Company\n\n#### [About Company][129]\n\nSeceon integrates data from logs, networks, clouds, and applications for security.\n\n#### [Leadership][130]\n\nMeet visionaries driving Seceon\u2019s mission to enhance cybersecurity with innovative\nsolutions.\n\n#### [Careers][131]\n\nExplore opportunities to join Seceon\u2019s team and help transform cybersecurity.\n\n#### [Awards][132]\n\nRecognizing Seceon\u2019s excellence in cybersecurity innovation and achievements.\n\n### News & Events\n\n#### [Press Releases][133]\n\nOfficial statements and updates about Seceon\u2019s initiatives, products, and market presence.\n\n#### [Webinars And Videos][134]\n\nAccess insightful webinars and video content to learn more about Seceon\u2019s cybersecurity\nsolutions.\n\n#### [Events][135]\n\nJoin Seceon at upcoming industry events, conferences, and workshops around the globe.\n\n### Resources\n\n#### [Compliance Report][136]\n\nAnalysts recommend Seceon for advanced security.\n\n#### [Case Study & One Pager Documents][137]\n\nReal success stories using Seceon solutions.\n\n#### [Data Sheets & Solution Brief][138]\n\nDetailed specifications of Seceon security products.\n\n#### [Whitepapers][139]\n\nResearch insights on modern cybersecurity practices.\n\n#### [Blogs][140]\n\nExpert tips and updates from Seceon.\n* [Contact Us][141]\n[Book An Appointment][142]\nCareers\n\n# Empowering Businesses With\n# AI-driven Cybersecurity Solutions\n\nAbout Seceon\n\n## About Seceon\n\nFounded in 2015, Seceon was built to help organizations stay ahead of evolving cyber threats by\ncombining cybersecurity expertise with advanced AI innovation.\n\nToday, Seceon supports enterprises, MSPs, and MSSPs worldwide with a mission to simplify security\noperations, strengthen cyber resilience, and help organizations grow confidently in an increasingly\nconnected world.\n\n### 9800+\n\nCustomers Worldwide\n\n### 850+\n\nGlobal MSSP Partners\n\n### Millions\n\nAssets Protected\n\n### AI Powered\n\nSecurity Automation\nSeceon Platform Overview\n\n## Seceon Platform Overview\n\nSeceon helps businesses, MSPs, and MSSPs reduce cyber risks and simplify their security tools while\nimproving how quickly they detect and stop attacks.\n\n### AI-Powered Threat Detection\n\nSeceon leverages advanced artificial intelligence and machine learning to identify behavioral\nanomalies, detect sophisticated cyber threats, and provide real-time visibility across enterprise\nenvironments.\n\n### Proactive Security Testing\n\nSeceon continuously simulates real-world cyber attacks to identify security gaps before attackers\ncan exploit them. This helps organizations strengthen defenses and stay prepared against modern\nadvanced threats.\n\n### Automated Compliance\n\nSeceon provides native compliance support with automated monitoring and reporting, helping\norganizations easily meet regulatory requirements while maintaining continuous security compliance.\n\nThe platform collects data from networks, devices, cloud services, and applications. It analyzes\nthis information in real time to detect threats early and provide clear alerts for faster response.\n\nPartner Success\n\n## Partner Success\n\nOver 850+ partners deliver security services powered by Seceon, helping protect more than 9,800\norganizations worldwide with advanced threat detection, response, and compliance capabilities.\n\nOur Partners\n\n## Some of Our Partners\n\nOur Customers\n\n# Our Customers\n\nOrganizations around the world place their trust in Seceon to strengthen security operations while\ndriving business growth. By reducing security complexity, improving operational efficiency, and\nenabling partners to deliver high-margin services at scale, Seceon helps customers protect their\nenvironments while expanding services, improving profitability, and creating long-term value.\n\nGlobal Office Locations\n\n## Global office locations\n\n### Westford (HQ)\n\n238 Littleton Road\nSuite #200\nWestford, MA 01886\nUnited States\n\n### Varanasi\n\n1 Seceon Way\nVaranasi, Uttar Pradesh 221106\nIndia\n\n### Mumbai\n\n1039, 10th Floor\nIJMIMA, Mindspace\nMalad West, Mumbai 400064\nIndia\n\nSeceon aiSIEM-CGuard\n\n# 24/7 Access to Seceon\u2019s Cybersecurity Experts - Because Threats Don\u2019t Wait\n\nDo These Persistent Issues Impact Your Day-to-Day Operations?\n* Large number of failed logins from single/multiple IPs, internal or external, against a\nsingle/multiple usernames.\n* Failed logins from new geo locations or a new user device.\n* Large number of account lockouts.\n* High cost of integration, support and maintenance.\nSelect Country*United StatesIndiaUnited Arab EmiratesSouth AfricaYemenSri\nLankaBangladeshNepalAustraliaKuwaitMexicoAfghanistanAlbaniaAlgeriaAndorraAngolaAntigua and\nBarbudaArgentinaArmeniaAustriaAzerbaijanBahamasBahrainBarbadosBelarusBelgiumBelizeBeninBhutanBolivia\nBosnia and HerzegovinaBotswanaBrazilBruneiBulgariaBurkina FasoBurundiCambodiaCameroonCanadaCape\nVerdeCentral African RepublicChadChileChinaColombiaComorosCongo (Democratic Republic)Congo\n(Republic)Costa RicaCroatiaCubaCyprusCzech RepublicDenmarkDjiboutiDominicaDominican\nRepublicEcuadorEgyptEl SalvadorEquatorial GuineaEritreaEstoniaEswatini\n(Swaziland)EthiopiaFijiFinlandFranceGabonGambiaGeorgiaGermanyGhanaGreeceGrenadaGuatemalaGuineaGuinea\n-BissauGuyanaHaitiHondurasHungaryIcelandIndonesiaIranIraqIrelandIsraelItalyIvory\nCoastJamaicaJapanJordanKazakhstanKenyaKiribatiKorea (North)Korea\n(South)KosovoKyrgyzstanLaosLatviaLebanonLesothoLiberiaLibyaLiechtensteinLithuaniaLuxembourgMadagasca\nrMalawiMalaysiaMaldivesMaliMaltaMarshall\nIslandsMauritaniaMauritiusMicronesiaMoldovaMonacoMongoliaMontenegroMoroccoMozambiqueMyanmar\n(Burma)NamibiaNauruNetherlandsNew ZealandNicaraguaNigerNigeriaNorth\nMacedoniaNorwayOmanPakistanPalauPalestinePanamaPapua New\nGuineaParaguayPeruPhilippinesPolandPortugalQatarRomaniaRussiaRwandaSaint Kitts and NevisSaint\nLuciaSaint Vincent and the GrenadinesSamoaSan MarinoS\u00e3o Tom\u00e9 and Pr\u00edncipeSaudi\nArabiaSenegalSerbiaSeychellesSierra LeoneSingaporeSlovakiaSloveniaSolomon IslandsSomaliaSouth\nSudanSpainSudanSurinameSwedenSwitzerlandSyriaTaiwanTajikistanTanzaniaThailandTimor-LesteTogoTongaTri\nnidad and TobagoTunisiaTurkeyTurkmenistanTuvaluUgandaUkraineUnited\nKingdomUruguayUzbekistanVanuatuVatican CityVenezuelaVietnamZambiaZimbabwe\n[Terms][143] and [Privacy policy][144].\nSend Message\n\n### Contact Info\n* [ Hotline: Phone: +1 (978)-923-0040 ][145]\n* [ Email: info@seceon.com ][146]\n* Address: 238 Littleton Road, Suite #200, Westford, MA 01886, USA\n\n[[SOC2]][147] [[ISO]][148]\n\n### Partner Led Services\n* [Advisory Services][149]\n* [Attack Surface Monitoring][150]\n* [Breach Attack Simulation][151]\n* [Incident Response][152]\n* [Risk Management][153]\n\n### Use Cases\n* [Advanced Threat Detection][154]\n* [Bruteforce Prevention][155]\n* [Cloud Security][156]\n* [Insider & Credential Breaches][157]\n* [Ransomware Detection][158]\n\n### Quick Links\n* [About Us][159]\n* [Leadership][160]\n* [Careers][161]\n* [Awards][162]\n* [Contact Us][163]\n* [RSS][164]\n* [Subscription][165]\n\nCopyright @Seceon Inc 2026. All R"
