      "key_products": "OTM Platform, aiSIEM, aiXDR, aiSecurity360, aiSecurity Score 360",
      "polished_summary": "Seceon is a leader in AI-driven cybersecurity solutions, specializing in advanced threat detection and response capabilities tailored for enterprises and managed security service providers (MSSPs). Their core offerings include the OTM Platform, aiSIEM, aiXDR, and aiSecurity360, which provide comprehensive security assessments, real-time monitoring, and automated incident response to enhance organizational security posture. With a focus on delivering unified and intelligent security solutions, Seceon empowers businesses to effectively manage and mitigate cyber threats.",
