            "text": "[Skip to content][1]\n* [ Success Stories ][2]\n* [ About Us ][3]\n* [ Contact ][4]\n* [ Careers ][5]\n* [ Customer Portal ][6]\n* [Home][7]\n* [Services][8]\n* [IT Support (Outsourcing) Services][9]\n* [Cybersecurity Solutions & Services][10]\n* [Microsoft 365 Services][11]\n* [Cloud Solutions & Services][12]\n* [IT Infrastructure & System Integration Services][13]\n* [Managed Print Services][14]\n* [Physical Security Solutions and Services][15]\n* [IP Telephony Services][16]\n* [IT Financing Services][17]\n* [ServiceNow Platform Services][18]\n* [Clients][19]\n* [Partners][20]\n* [Awards][21]\n* [Media][22]\n* [News][23]\n* [Events][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n* [Home][26]\n* [Services][27]\n* [IT Support (Outsourcing) Services][28]\n* [Cybersecurity Solutions & Services][29]\n* [Microsoft 365 Services][30]\n* [Cloud Solutions & Services][31]\n* [IT Infrastructure & System Integration Services][32]\n* [Managed Print Services][33]\n* [Physical Security Solutions and Services][34]\n* [IP Telephony Services][35]\n* [IT Financing Services][36]\n* [ServiceNow Platform Services][37]\n* [Clients][38]\n* [Partners][39]\n* [Awards][40]\n* [Media][41]\n* [News][42]\n* [Events][43]\n* [Blog][44]\n* [Home][45]\n* [Services][46]\n* [IT Support (Outsourcing) Services][47]\n* [Cybersecurity Solutions & Services][48]\n* [Microsoft 365 Services][49]\n* [Cloud Solutions & Services][50]\n* [IT Infrastructure & System Integration Services][51]\n* [Managed Print Services][52]\n* [Physical Security Solutions and Services][53]\n* [IP Telephony Services][54]\n* [IT Financing Services][55]\n* [ServiceNow Platform Services][56]\n* [Clients][57]\n* [Partners][58]\n* [Awards][59]\n* [Media][60]\n* [News][61]\n* [Events][62]\n* [Blog][63]\n* [Home][64]\n* [Services][65]\n* [IT Support (Outsourcing) Services][66]\n* [Cybersecurity Solutions & Services][67]\n* [Microsoft 365 Services][68]\n* [Cloud Solutions & Services][69]\n* [IT Infrastructure & System Integration Services][70]\n* [Managed Print Services][71]\n* [Physical Security Solutions and Services][72]\n* [IP Telephony Services][73]\n* [IT Financing Services][74]\n* [ServiceNow Platform Services][75]\n* [Clients][76]\n* [Partners][77]\n* [Awards][78]\n* [Media][79]\n* [News][80]\n* [Events][81]\n* [Blog][82]\n* [ Success Stories ][83]\n* [ About Us ][84]\n* [ Contact ][85]\n* [ Careers ][86]\n\n## Pushing Boundaries\n\nWe are passionate about delivering intelligent solutions. We are committed to excellence. We care\nabout building relationships. We exceed expectations. Above all, we want to make the world a better\nplace.\n\n# About Adventus\n\n## Leader in ICT\n## Solutions & Services\n\nAdventus is an Information and Communications Technology (ICT) Solutions and Services Provider that\nhelps organizations bring about positive transformations to their businesses through the intelligent\napplications of innovative solutions and pertinent services. We believe strongly that the winners in\na globalized and ultra-competitive marketplace of today are defined by how they are able to\neffectively leverage technology to create competitive advantages and introduce business innovations.\nOur strong network of technology partners, excellent domain expertise and differentiated value\npropositions create enormous values for organizations that far exceed their expectations.\n\n## Building Future Ready IT Solutions for Smarter Businesses\n\n### We are different from the rest. We want to change the world.\n\nWe are driven by our belief that smarter businesses make the world a better place. And smarter\nbusinesses are ready for the future, today. At Adventus, we are obsessed with consistently\ndelivering intelligent IT solutions alongside impeccable services that propel businesses into the\nfuture.\n\n## Top Rated Service Provider\n\nThe strong foundation and brand equity of Adventus is built on excellent customer care. We take\nenormous pride in being rated by our customers as the top service provider and the most customer\nfocused organization in the industry. Emphasizing and iterating the importance of delivering quality\nservices to our customers is a daily routine at Adventus. Delighting our customers by always taking\nthe extra mile for them is a culture, if not, an obsession. At Adventus, we strive to overwhelm our\ncustomers with excellent services that really define who we are and why we are here.\n\n## Our Business Units\n\n### IT Support\n### Outsourcing Services\n\n][87]\n\n### Cybersecurity\n### Solutions & Services\n\n][88]\n\n### Cloud Solutions\n### & Services\n\n][89]\n\n### Microsoft 365 Solutions & Services\n\n][90]\n\n### IT Infrastructure\n### Solutions & Services\n\n][91]\n\n### Managed Print\n### Services\n\n][92]\n\n### Physical Security\n### Solutions & Services\n\n][93]\n\n### IP Telephony & Contact\n### Centre Solutions & Services\n\n][94]\n\n## Our Mission\n\nWe are on a mission to build long lasting relationships with our customers by delighting them with\nour innovative and customized value propositions complemented with our first-rate, high quality\nprofessional services.\n\n## Global Engagements 24x7\n\nA leading ICT solutions and services provider, serving clients around the globe, Adventus provides\nan extremely comprehensive range of impeccable ICT services round-the-clock; 24 hours a day, 7 days\na week, 365 days a year. Our wide range of first-rate ICT services cover everything a business needs\nfrom IT support, IT Infrastructure, Cybersecurity, Cloud, IP Telephony, Internet, Voice, Mobile,\nSurveillance (CCTV), Access Control (Door & Building) to Print Equipment (Copiers & Printers).\n\nSelect a country\n\n### [ Australia][95]\n\n### [China][96]\n\n### [India][97]\n\n### [Indonesia][98]\n\n### [Japan][99]\n\n### [Korea][100]\n\n### [Malaysia][101]\n\n### [Netherlands][102]\n\n### [New Zealand][103]\n\n### [Philippines][104]\n\n### [Singapore][105]\n\n### [Thailand][106]\n\n### [United Kingdom][107]\n\n### [United States][108]\n\n### [Vietnam][109]\n\n## Adventus Named\n## Best IT Services\n## Provider 9 Years\n## in a Row\n\nAdventus named Best IT Service Provider for 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025 and 2026.\nFind out why Adventus has consistently outperformed its competitors.\n\n[ Read More ][110]\n\n## Employer of Choice\n\nAdventus Nominated for\nHR Excellence Awards for 6 Years\n\n[ Read More ][111]\nAdventus Certified as Great Place to Work for 5 Years\n[ Read More ][112]\n\nAdventus Listed in\nBest Companies to Work for in Asia for 3 Years\n\n[ Read More ][113]\n\n## Outstanding Results & High Quality Services\n\nHear what our clients have to say about us\n\n[ Click here ][114]\n\n## Our Certifications\n\nWe are obsessed with consistently delivering outstanding results and services of the highest\nquality. We continuously invest our time and resources in acquiring the best management systems and\ndeveloping the finest work processes in achieving those goals.\n\n### [Excellent Quality Management][115]\n\nISO 9001\n\n### [Outstanding Business Continuity Management][116]\n\nISO 22301\n\n### [Stringent Information Security Management][117]\n\nISO 27001\n\n### [Excellent IT Service Management][118]\n\nISO 20000\n\n### [Robust Cybersecurity Standards][119]\n\nCyber Essentials Certified\n\n[ Linkedin-in ][120]\n* [ About us ][121]\n* [ Contact us ][122]\n* [ Careers ][123]\n* [ Clients ][124]\n* [ Partners ][125]\n* [ Awards ][126]\n* [ IT Support (Outsourcing) Services ][127]\n* [ Cybersecurity Solutions & Services ][128]\n* [ Microsoft 365 Services ][129]\n* [ Cloud Solutions & Services ][130]\n* [ IT Infrastructure Services ][131]\n* [ Managed Print Services ][132]\n* [ Physical Security Solutions & Services ][133]\n* [ IP Telephony Services ][134]\n* [ IT Financing Services ][135]\n* [ ServiceNow Platform Services ][136]\n* Contact Us\n\nSpeak to us about your IT Infrastructure needs\n\n[ Talk to us ][137]\n* SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT\n\nConsult with our Enterprise Account Managers and Specialists\n\n[ Let Us Know ][138]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Adventus Pte Ltd. All rights reserved.\n* [ Privacy Statement ][139]\n* [ Website Usage Terms & Conditions ][140]\n* [ Quality Policy ][141]\n\n#### Australia\n\nMain Line:\n\n[+61 2 8000 9050][142]\n\n### Sydney\n\n**Registered Address:**\nSuite 20.01, Level 20,\n133 Castlereagh Street,\nSydney NSW 2000, Australia\n\n#### China\n\n### Shanghai\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+86 21 6066 2182][143]\n\n**Office Address:**\nRoom 1601, No. 238 Jiangchangsan Road,\nJing\u2019an District, Shanghai 200442, China\n\n### Hong Kong\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+852 800 906 604][144]\n\n**Registered Address:**\nRegus 181 QRC, 7/F, Low Block, Grand Millennium Plaza, 181 Queen\u2019s Road Central, Central, Hong Kong\n\n**Logistics & Technical Centre:**\nLevel 10, Manning Industrial Building,\nUnit C08 No.116-118. How Ming St, Kwun Tong, Hong Kong\n\n### Taipei\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+886 2 7703 1119][145]\n\n**Office Address:**\n29F, No. 68, Sec. 5, Zhongxiao East Rd., Xinyi Dist., Taipei City 11065, Taiwan\n\n#### India\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+91 8071 279 958][146]\n\n**Registered Address:**\n6-B, 6TH Floor, B.D. Patel House,\nNaranpura Road, Ahmedabad,\nGujarat, India, 380014\n\n### Delhi\n\n**Office Address:**\nOld Mathura Road 2nd Floor, Elegance Building, District Centre,\nJasola, New Delhi, Delhi 110025, India\n\n### Mumbai\n\n**Office Address:**\nVN Purav Marg Unit No.9, 9th Floor, Corporate Park II, near Swastik Chambers,\nChembur, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400071, India\n\n### Pune\n\n**Office Address:**\nNaylor Road No.1 Level 8, Platinum Towers,\nPune, Maharashtra 411001, India\n\n### Bangalore\n\n**Office Address:**\nLevel 9, Raheja Towers, 26-27, Mahatma Gandhi Rd, Craig Park Layout,\nAshok Nagar, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560001, India\n\n#### Indonesia\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+62 21 5099 6891][147]\n\n### Jakarta\n\n**Office Address:**\nEquity Tower 37th Floor SCBD\nLot.9, Jl. Jend.Sudirman Kav 52-53\nJakarta 12190, Indonesia\n\n#### Japan\n\n### Tokyo\n\n**Customer Line: **\n[+81 50 5050 5700][148]\n\n#### Korea\n\n### Seoul\n\n**Customer Line: **\n[+82 2 3478 4122][149]\n\n#### Malaysia\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+60 3 7681 9900 ][150]\n| Fax: +60 3 7887 2339\n\n**Customer Line: **\n[+60 3 7681 9900][151]\n\n### Kuala Lumpur\n\n**Registered Address:**\nLevel 33, ILHAM Tower No.8, Jalan Binjai\n50450 Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia\n\n**Sales Office:**\n5th Floor, 13-5, Block F1, Jalan PJU 1/42\nDataran Prima, 47301 Petaling Jaya\nSelangor, Malaysia\n\n### Penang\n\n**Office:**\nUnit 1.01, Ground Floor, Menara Boustead\n39, Jalan Sultan Ahmad Shah\nGeorge Town, 10050 Penang, Malaysia\n\n#### Netherlands\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+31 20 225 3586][152]\n\n**Office Address:**\nHerengracht 280,\nAmsterdam, 1016 BX,\nNetherlands\n\n#### New Zealand\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+64 9 884 1310][153]\n\n### Auckland\n\n**Office Address:**\nLevel 5, 79 Queen Street,\nAuckland 1010, New Zealand\n\n#### Philippines\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+63 2 8555 1197][154]\n\n### Makati City\n\n**Sales Office:**\n12th Floor, Salcedo Tower,\n169 H.V. Dela Costa,\nBarangay Bel-Air, Makati City,\nMetro Manila, Philippines\n\n#### Singapore\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+65 6100 3301][155]\n\n**Registered Address:**\n460 Alexandra Road, mTower, #08-01,\nSingapore 119963\n\n**Logistics Centre:**\n514 Chai Chee Lane, #04-16,\nSingapore 469029\n\n#### Thailand\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+66 2 460 7501][156]\n\n### Bangkok\n\n**Office Address:**\n152 Chartered Square Building, 30th Floor,\nRoom No. 30-01, Unit TT-05 North Sathorn Road,\nSilom, Bang Rak, Bangkok 10500, Thailand\n\n#### United Kingdom\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+44 20 3675 9009][157]\n\n### London\n\n**Office Address:**\nSpaces, 98 Theobalds Rd,\nWC1X 8WB, London, United Kingdom\n\n#### United States\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+1 877 219 4501][158]\n\n### New York\n\n**Office Address:**\n424 West 33rd Street, Hudson Yards, Floors 7 \u2013 9,\nNew York City, NY, 10001, United States of America\n\n#### Vietnam\n\n**Main Line: **\n[+84 28 4458 1603][159]\n\n### Ho Chi Minh City\n\n**Office Address:**\nLevel 7, Me Linh Point Tower,\n2 Ngo Duc Ke Street, Ben Nghe Ward,\nDistrict 1, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam\n\n### Hanoi\n\n**Office Address:**\nDaeha Business Center, 16th floor, 360 Kim M\u00e3, Str,\nH\u00e0 N\u1ed9i, Vietnam\n\n[1]: #content\n[2]: /story/\n[3]: /about/\n[4]: /contact-us/\n[5]: /career/\n[6]: https://service.adventus.com/\n[7]: https://adventus.com/\n[8]: #\n[9]: https://adventus.com/it-support-outsourcing-services-singapore-helpdesk/\n[10]: https://adventus.com/cybersecurity/"
