      "key_products": "Cybersecurity Solutions, Physical Security Solutions, IT Infrastructure Services, Cloud Solutions",
      "polished_summary": "Adventus is a leading Information and Communications Technology (ICT) Solutions and Services Provider dedicated to transforming businesses through innovative IT solutions. Offering a comprehensive range of services\u2014including IT support, cybersecurity, cloud solutions, and managed print services\u2014Adventus caters to organizations of all sizes seeking to enhance their operational efficiency and security posture. With expertise across various industries, Adventus is committed to delivering future-ready IT solutions that empower smarter business practices.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Adventus provides cybersecurity solutions and physical security services, which are directly relevant to the Cyber-Physical Systems Security market. Their offerings include IT infrastructure, cybersecurity services, and physical security solutions, indicating a focus on securing cyber-physical systems.",
