            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Logo] [Arctiq-Logo-Default] ][2]\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][3]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][4]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][5]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][6]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][7]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][8]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][9]\n* [ ][10]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* [ Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][11]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][12]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][13]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][14]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][15]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][16]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][17]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][18]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][19]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][20]\n* [ Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ\nServices24x7 SOC & NOC** ][21]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][22]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][23]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][24]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][25]\n* [ See related resources ][26]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* [ About Us ][27]\n* [ Leadership Team ][28]\n* [ Careers ][29]\n* [ Locations ][30]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* [ Blog ][31]\n* [ Customer Stories ][32]\n* [ Resource Library ][33]\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n\n# Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure\n\nModern, resilient hybrid cloud infrastructure that powers performance, security, and AI readiness.\n\n[Talk to an Expert][76]\n[socs-north-america] Expert delivery capability across North America\n\n### At a Glance\n\nArctiq helps organizations modernize and operate hybrid cloud infrastructure that is secure,\nresilient, and built for continuous modernization. We design, implement, and manage platforms across\ndata center, cloud, and edge so workloads run reliably, scale when needed, and remain protected from\ndisruption.\n\nOur approach unifies compute, storage, virtualization, resilience, and automation into a single\noperating model. The result is infrastructure that supports hybrid cloud workloads, AI, cloud-native\napplications, and mission-critical systems without increasing complexity or cost \u2014 backed by\nprofessional and managed services.\n* [Outcomes][77]\n* [Solutions][78]\n* [Service^{IQ}][79]\n* [Partners][80]\n* [FAQs][81]\n\n## Outcomes\n\nModern hybrid environments must balance performance, resilience, cost control, and security across\ndata center, cloud, and edge. Arctiq delivers measurable outcomes that reduce operational friction\nwhile strengthening the foundation for modernization and AI adoption.\n\n[Icon Grpahic-Hyvrid Cloud Infrastructure]\n\n##### Operational resilience across hybrid environments\n\n##### Faster infrastructure delivery and modernization\n\n##### AI-ready and hybrid cloud-ready foundations\n\n##### Cost control and financial transparency\n\n##### Secure and compliant infrastructure by design\n\n##### Simplified operations and reduced complexity\n\n## Solutions\n\nOur hybrid cloud infrastructure solutions unify compute, storage, cloud platforms, resilience, and\nautomation into a modern operating model built for scalability, consistency, and long-term\nperformance. We help organizations modernize core platforms, establish secure cloud foundations, and\nautomate lifecycle management to ensure environments remain resilient, efficient, and ready to\nevolve.\n\n### Compute & Storage\n\nModernize and optimize core compute and storage platforms to support both traditional and modern\nworkloads while preparing hybrid cloud infrastructure for AI-driven and data-intensive demands. We\nhelp organizations improve performance, scalability, and efficiency through next-generation compute,\nhigh-performance storage, and AI-ready architectures designed to support data-intensive workloads,\naccelerated processing, and emerging generative and analytics use cases across hybrid environments.\n\n[Explore][82]\n\n### Virtualization & Private Cloud\n\nDesign and implement modern virtualization and private cloud platforms that deliver flexibility,\ngovernance, and control. Our approach enables consistent operations across on-premises and cloud\nenvironments while supporting application modernization, workload portability, and improved resource\nutilization.\n\n[Explore][83]\n\n### Resilience & Cyber Recovery\n\n#### (Backup, Disaster Recovery, Ransomware Recovery)\n\nProtect critical systems and data with integrated resilience strategies spanning backup, disaster\nrecovery, and cyber recovery. We design recovery architectures that enable rapid restoration,\nminimize downtime, and strengthen defenses against ransomware and operational disruption.\n\n[Explore][84]\n\n### Public Cloud Foundations & Workload Platforms\n\nEstablish secure, governed public cloud foundations that accelerate adoption and support modern\ncloud and hybrid workload platforms. From landing zones and governance frameworks to Kubernetes and\nmanaged services, we help organizations build scalable environments that enable innovation while\nmaintaining control and visibility.\n\n[Explore][85]\n\n### Infrastructure Automation & Lifecycle\n\nAutomate provisioning, configuration, and lifecycle management using Infrastructure as Code and\npolicy-based automation. Our automation frameworks improve consistency, reduce manual effort, and\nenable faster deployment and ongoing optimization across hybrid environments.\n\n[Explore][86]\n\n### Managed Hybrid Infrastructure Services\n\nDeliver continuous monitoring, optimization, and operational support across hybrid environments. Our\nmanaged services ensure infrastructure remains secure, performant, and cost-efficient while allowing\ninternal teams to focus on strategic initiatives.\n\n[Explore][87]\n\n## Service^{IQ}\n\nArctiq delivers hybrid cloud outcomes through the ServiceIQ lifecycle \u2014 from assessment to ongoing\nmanaged operations.\n\n[Explore Service IQ Methodology][88]\n[diagram-Insight IQ] [diagram-Design IQ] [diagram-Build IQ] [diagram-Optimize IQ] [diagram-Managed\nIQ]\n01 / 05\n[diagram-Insight IQ]\n\n## Insight^{IQ}\n\nHybrid readiness assessment, VMware cost and migration assessment, recoverability gap analysis, and\ncloud cost optimization workshops.\n\n[diagram-Design IQ]\n\n## Design^{IQ}\n\nHybrid cloud reference architecture, landing zone blueprint, resilience and cyber recovery design,\nand automation standards.\n\n[diagram-Build IQ]\n\n## Build^{IQ}\n\nPlatform modernization, cloud foundation implementation, backup/DR deployment, and\ninfrastructure-as-code enablement.\n\n[diagram-Optimize IQ]\n\n## Optimize^{IQ}\n\nPerformance tuning, capacity planning, FinOps optimization, and continuous compliance refinement.\n\n[diagram-Managed IQ]\n\n## Managed^{IQ}\n\n24\u00d77 infrastructure operations, lifecycle management, proactive optimization, and escalation\nsupport.\n\nPartners\n\n## Strategic Partnerships\n\n[DT_PlatinumPartner_Black]\n[HPE-logo-full-clr-pos-rgb (3)]\n[Nvidia_logo]\n[Nutanix logo]\n[Vmware logo]\n[red-hat]\n[rubrik]\n[NetApp-1]\n[Cohesity]\n[AWS]\n[microsoft-solutions-partner]\n[Google Cloud-2]\n[Cisco]\n\n## FAQs\n\nWhat is hybrid cloud infrastructure and why does it matter?\n\nHybrid cloud infrastructure connects on-premises, cloud, and edge environments into a unified\noperating model. It enables workload flexibility while maintaining consistent security, resilience,\nand governance.\n\nHow does Arctiq approach hybrid cloud infrastructure modernization?\n\nWe start with an assessment and roadmap, then design and implement modern architectures across\ncompute, storage, virtualization, resilience, and automation. We also provide managed services to\noperate and optimize platforms over time.\n\nCan you support both cloud and on-prem environments?\n\nYes. Arctiq specializes in hybrid environments that span data center, multi-cloud, and edge \u2014 with\nconsistent standards for security, visibility, and operational control.\n\nHow do you improve cyber resilience within hybrid cloud infrastructure?\n\nWe embed recovery design, immutable protection, segmentation, and governance into the infrastructure\narchitecture, and validate it through testing and recovery orchestration.\n\nHow do you control infrastructure costs in hybrid cloud environments?\n\nThrough FinOps-aligned governance, right-sizing, lifecycle planning, and utilization optimization \u2014\npaired with automation to reduce operational overhead.\n\nDo you provide ongoing operational support?\n\nYes. Our managed services teams provide monitoring, incident response, lifecycle management, and\ncontinuous optimization across hybrid environments.\n\n[ [Logo] ][89]\nStay informed about the latest technology trends and enterprise solutions\n\nBy subscribing, you agree to our privacy policy and consent to receive updates.\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][90]\n* [ [Youtube] ][91]\n* [COMPANY][92]\n* [About Us][93]\n* [Careers][94]\n* [Locations][95]\n* [SOLUTIONS][96]\n* [Hybrid Cloud\nInfrastructure][97]\n* [Network & Connected\nExperiences][98]\n* [Cybersecurit"
          },
