\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n\n# Enterprise Service Management\n\nModern enterprise service management that improves experience, efficiency, and accountability.\n\n[Talk to an Expert][76]\n[socs-north-america] Expert delivery capability across North America\n\n### At a Glance\n\nArctiq helps organizations modernize enterprise service management (ESM) across IT and the\nenterprise by unifying workflows, automation, and visibility. We implement and optimize ESM/ITSM\nplatforms that improve service delivery, streamline operations, and enhance user experience.\n\nBy integrating IT, operations, and business workflows into a cohesive model, Arctiq enables faster\nresolution, clearer ownership, and measurable service performance \u2014 supported by professional and\nmanaged services.\n* [Outcomes][77]\n* [Solutions][78]\n* [Service^{IQ}][79]\n* [Partners][80]\n* [FAQs][81]\n\n## Outcomes\n\nEnterprise service management extends beyond IT to improve enterprise-wide workflow efficiency,\ntransparency, and accountability. Arctiq delivers outcomes that enhance service delivery performance\nand employee experience.\n\n[Icon Grpahic-ESM]\n\n##### Faster incident and request resolution\n\n##### Clear service ownership and accountability\n\n##### Improved user and employee experience\n\n##### Automated workflows and reduced manual effort\n\n##### Real-time service visibility and reporting\n\n##### Scalable service delivery across the enterprise\n\n## Solutions\n\nOur enterprise service management solutions align platform modernization, workflow automation,\ncollaboration, and service visibility into a cohesive service delivery framework that improves\nefficiency, transparency, and user experience across the enterprise.\n\n### Platform, Automation & Integrations (Atlassian)\n\nModernize and optimize enterprise service platforms using Atlassian solutions as the foundation for\nscalable, integrated service delivery. We design and implement secure, well-governed environments\nthat unify workflows, enable automation, and connect systems across IT, development, and business\nteams to improve consistency and operational efficiency.\n\n[Explore][82]\n\n### Work Management & Dev Workflows (Jira)\n\nStreamline work management and development workflows through modern Jira-based frameworks that\nimprove planning, execution, and cross-team alignment. We design standardized workflows, governance\nmodels, and reporting structures that enable greater visibility into work, accelerate delivery, and\nsupport DevOps and agile operating models.\n\n[Explore][83]\n\n### Knowledge & Collaboration (Confluence)\n\nEnable effective knowledge sharing and collaboration through modern Confluence environments that\ncentralize documentation, improve transparency, and support continuous learning. We help\norganizations structure and govern knowledge assets, improve searchability and usability, and\nintegrate collaboration directly into service and development workflows.\n\n[Explore][84]\n\n### IT Service Management (Jira Service Management)\n\nModernize IT service management with streamlined processes, improved service experiences, and\ngreater operational visibility. We design and implement Jira Service Management environments that\nsupport incident, request, change, and problem management while enabling intuitive service catalogs,\nself-service capabilities, and actionable performance insights.\n\n[Explore][85]\n\n## Service^{IQ}\n\nServiceIQ aligns service management modernization from assessment through ongoing operational\nsupport.\n\n[Explore Service IQ Methodology][86]\n[diagram-Insight IQ] [diagram-Design IQ] [diagram-Build IQ] [diagram-Optimize IQ] [diagram-Managed\nIQ]\n01 / 05\n[diagram-Insight IQ]\n\n## Insight^{IQ}\n\nITSM/ESM maturity workshop, workflow mapping sessions, license and platform health\n\n[diagram-Design IQ]\n\n## Design^{IQ}\n\nService catalog and portal design, CMDB architecture, integration roadmap, and governance model\ndefinition.\n\n[diagram-Build IQ]\n\n## Build^{IQ}\n\nPlatform implementation and migration, workflow automation deployment, portal build, and integration\ndelivery.\n\n[diagram-Optimize IQ]\n\n## Optimize^{IQ}\n\nSLA tuning, process refinement, reporting and dashboarding improvements, and adoption optimization.\n\n[diagram-Managed IQ]\n\n## Managed^{IQ}\n\nManaged ESM services, ongoing administration, continuous improvement, and operational support.\n\nPartners\n\n## Enterprise Service Management\n\n[Atlassian-logo]\n[Jira-Service-Management-compact_attribution_light]\n[Jira-software]\n[confluence]\n\n## FAQs\n\nWhat is Enterprise Service Management (ESM)?\n\nESM applies service management principles beyond IT \u2014 standardizing workflows, visibility, and\naccountability across business functions to improve efficiency and experience.\n\nHow does ESM improve operational performance?\n\nIt reduces manual handoffs, improves routing and ownership, and provides consistent reporting so\nteams can meet SLAs and resolve issues faster.\n\nWhy Atlassian for ESM and ITSM?\n\nAtlassian platforms provide flexible workflow design, strong collaboration capabilities, and\nscalable service management features that can be extended across the enterprise.\n\nHow do you ensure adoption and long-term success?\n\nWe combine process design, portal experience improvements, training/enablement, and governance\nmodels \u2014 supported by ongoing optimization.\n\nCan you migrate from legacy ITSM tools?\n\nYes. We plan and execute migrations with phased cutovers, data mapping, and validation to maintain\ncontinuity while modernizing workflows.\n\nDo you provide ongoing platform support?\n\nYes. Our managed services include administration, configuration management, optimization, reporting,\nand continuous improvement.\n\n[ [Logo] ][87]\nStay informed about the latest technology trends and enterprise solutions\n\nBy subscribing, you agree to our privacy policy and consent to receive updates.\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][88]\n* [ [Youtube] ][89]\n* [COMPANY][90]\n* [About Us][91]\n* [Careers][92]\n* [Locations][93]\n* [SOLUTIONS][94]\n* [Hybrid Cloud\nInfrastructure][95]\n* [Network & Connected\nExperiences][96]\n* [Cybersecurity][97]\n* [Autonomous Operations & Intelligence][98]\n* [Data & AI][99]\n* [Enterprise Service\nManagement][100]\n* [SERVICES][101]\n* [Professional Methodology][102]\n* [Managed Services][103]\n* [Resource Management][104]\n* [Arctiq Capital][105]\n* [INDUSTRIES][106]\n* [Enterprise & Commercial][107]\n* [Government][108]\n* [Education][109]\n* [Healthcare][110]\n* [Utilities][111]\n* [Hospitality & Gaming][112]\n* [Tribal][113]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Arctiq, Inc. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][114]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][115]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://arctiq.com/?hsLang=en\n[3]:\n[4]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure\n[5]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/networking-and-connected-experiences\n[6]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/cybersecurity\n[7]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/autonomous-operations-intelligence\n[8]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/data-ai\n[9]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/enterprise-service-management\n[10]: https://arctiq.com/customer-stories/building-a-future-ready-data-platform-for-the-city-of-nort\nh-las-vegas\n[11]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq-methodology\n[12]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/insight\n[13]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/design\n[14]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/build\n[15]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/shift\n[16]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/enable\n[17]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/optimize\n[18]: https://arctiq.com/services/security-advisory-services\n[19]: https://arctiq.com/serv"
