\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n\n### Service\n\n# Assessments\n\nArctiq\u2019s InsightIQ Assessments focus on evaluating the current state of your IT environment,\nidentifying gaps, risks, and areas for improvement. These assessments provide actionable insights\nand recommendations to enhance performance, security, and compliance across various technology\ndomains.\n\n[Diagram - Service IQ - Insight IQ]\n[ServiceIQ-logo]\n[ [logo-Insight IQ-DARK] ][76]\n[ [logo-Design IQ-DARK] ][77]\n[ [logo-Build IQ-DARK] ][78]\n* [Security-assessments-icon] **Security Assessments**\n* [Infrastructure-assessments-icon] **Infrastructure & Network Assessments**\n* [Platform-engineering-icon] **Autonomous Ops, Data & AI, ESM Assessments**\n\n**Security Assessments**\n\nArctiq\u2019s InsightIQ Assessments focus on evaluating the current state of your IT environment,\nidentifying gaps, risks, and areas for improvement. These assessments provide actionable insights\nand recommendations to enhance performance, security, and compliance across various technology\ndomains.\n\n#### **Security Assessment**\n\nEvaluation of your organization's security posture, structured to uncover vulnerabilities, assess\nrisks, and enhance your defenses. We dive deep into your infrastructure, applications, and policies\nto identify gaps and provide actionable recommendations that align with your business objectives.\n\n#### **Vulnerability Assessment**\n\nConduct scans across various client environments to identify and prioritize vulnerabilities for\nremediation.\n\n#### **Penetration Test**\n\nExecute comprehensive testing across black box, web apps, network, endpoints, and insider threats to\nidentify security weaknesses.\n\n#### **Incident Response Planning and Assessment**\n\nEvaluate readiness for incidents, such as ransomware, through interviews and architectural reviews,\nproviding actionable recommendations.\n\n#### **GRC Assessment**\n\nConduct a gap analysis of governance and compliance frameworks, aligning with cyber insurance\nrequirements using vCISO tooling.\n\n#### **Identity Assessment**\n\nA thorough review of identity sources, privileged access and multi-factor authentication with\npractical security enhancement recommendations.\n\n#### **Endpoint and ZTNA Security Assessment**\n\nAnalyze current endpoint protection strategies, providing recommendations for threat detection and\nresponse at the endpoint and strategies for least privilege access by user and device.\n\n#### **Patch Management Assessment**\n\nAssess existing patching strategies, identify gaps, and suggest tools and processes to improve patch\nfrequency and security hygiene.\n\n**Infrastructure Assessments**\n\nArctiq\u2019s InsightIQ Assessments focus on evaluating the current state of your IT environment,\nidentifying gaps, risks, and areas for improvement. These assessments provide actionable insights\nand recommendations to enhance performance, security, and compliance across various technology\ndomains.\n\n#### **Network Assessment**\n\nEvaluate the current network infrastructure against industry-leading practices and provides a\nfindings report with recommendations.\n\n#### **Wireless Assessment & Site Surveys**\n\nConduct predictive and active/passive wireless surveys to evaluate current deployments and suggest\nimprovements.\n\n#### **Firewall Best Practices Assessment**\n\nReview firewall policies, traffic patterns, stakeholders and compliance needs, providing\nrecommendations for policy improvement.\n\n#### **Data Center Assessment**\n\nAssess servers, storage, and software assets, identifying inefficiencies, risks and optimization\nopportunities.\n\n#### **Cloud Assessment**\n\nAssess cloud adoption and business requirements, identifying scalability, cost savings, security or\nhybrid architecture gaps.\n\n#### **Hypervisor Assessment**\n\nCompare various hypervisor platforms to determine the best fit for virtualized workloads,\nconsidering existing and future requirements.\n\n* **VMware Virtualization Assessment:** Evaluate current VMware install base and recommend ways to\nleverage all VCF features, reduce licensing burden, or propose alternative hypervisor platforms.\n\n#### **Microsoft 365 Assessment**\n\nAnalyze Microsoft 365 or legacy workforce product deployments, recommending optimizations for\nproductivity and cost-efficiency.\n\n#### **Active Directory Assessment**\n\nAnalyze the structure, configurations, and trust relationships of existing Active Directory\nenvironments.\n\n**Platform Engineering**\n\nArctiq\u2019s InsightIQ Assessments focus on evaluating the current state of your IT environment,\nidentifying gaps, risks, and areas for improvement. These assessments provide actionable insights\nand recommendations to enhance performance, security, and compliance across various technology\ndomains.\n\n#### **DevOps Assessment**\n\nMeasure the manual labor that goes into the customer SDLC to identify opportunities to automate,\nreduce the toil, and improve throughput and drive real financial impact outcomes.\n\n#### **Data & AI Readiness Assessment**\n\nReview data pipelines, governance, and platform readiness to support analytics and AI initiatives.\n\n#### **AI Assessment**\n\nConduct workshops to assess AI needs, defining use cases and security considerations for AI\ndeployment.\n\n#### **HashiCorp Boundary and Vault Assessment**\n\nReview the current design and usage of secrets management and PAM solutions, recommending best\npractices.\n\n#### **Automation Assessment**\n\nAssess the current Terraform and Ansible deployments, documenting workflows and identifying areas\nfor improvement.\n\n#### **App Modernization Assessment**\n\nEvaluate readiness for containerization and container orchestration platforms and provide\nrecommendations on ideal container orchestration platform (on-prem, cloud, cloud).\n\n#### **Observability Assessment**\n\nDocument current state observability patterns, investigate sources of signal vs. noise, identify\nresponse gaps and present a roadmap for a business-aligned observability system.\n\n#### **AppSec Assessment**\n\nEvaluate static and dynamic application security testing, secure code analysis and provide findings\nand recommendations for better code security and quality.\n\n#### **Observability & AIOps Assessment**\n\nIdentify visibility gaps, alert noise, and operational inefficiencies with a roadmap for intelligent\noperations.\n\n#### **Enterprise Service Management Assessment**\n\nEvaluate ITSM/ESM processes, workflows, and platforms to improve service delivery and automation.\n[ [Logo] ][79]\nStay informed about the latest technology trends and enterprise solutions\n\nBy subscribing, you agree to our privacy policy and consent to receive updates.\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][80]\n* [ [Youtube] ][81]\n* [COMPANY][82]\n* [About Us][83]\n* [Careers][84]\n* [Locations][85]\n* [SOLUTIONS][86]\n* [Hybrid Cloud\nInfrastructure][87]\n* [Network & Connected\nExperiences][88]\n* [Cybersecurity][89]\n* [Autonomous Operations & Intelligence][90]\n* [Data & AI][91]\n* [Enterprise Service\nManagement][92]\n* [SERVICES][93]\n* [Professional Methodology][94]\n* [Managed Services][95]\n* [Resource Management][96]\n* [Arctiq Capital][97]\n* [INDUSTRIES][98]\n* [Enterprise & Commercial][99]\n* [Government][100]\n* [Education][101]\n* [Healthcare][102]\n* [Utilities][103]\n* [Hospitality & Gaming][104]\n* [Tribal][105]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Arctiq, Inc. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][106]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][107]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://arctiq.com/?hsLang=en\n[3]:\n[4]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure\n[5]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/networking-and-connected-experiences\n[6]: https://arc"
