            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Logo] [Arctiq-Logo-Default] ][2]\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][3]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][4]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][5]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][6]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][7]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][8]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][9]\n* [ ][10]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* [ Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][11]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][12]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][13]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][14]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][15]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][16]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][17]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][18]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][19]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][20]\n* [ Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ\nServices24x7 SOC & NOC** ][21]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][22]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][23]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][24]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][25]\n* [ See related resources ][26]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* [ About Us ][27]\n* [ Leadership Team ][28]\n* [ Careers ][29]\n* [ Locations ][30]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* [ Blog ][31]\n* [ Customer Stories ][32]\n* [ Resource Library ][33]\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n\n### Service\n\n# Migrations\n\nShiftIQ handles the complexities of migrating systems, platforms, or data to new environments.\nWhether it\u2019s migrating VMs to a new hypervisor, shifting security logging to a modern event manager,\nor pivoting work to an improved pipeline, this phase ensures that transitions are executed with\nprecision, minimizing downtime and ensuring data integrity.\n\n[Diagram - Service IQ - Shift IQ]\n[ServiceIQ-logo]\n[ [logo-Build IQ-DARK] ][76]\n[ [logo-Shift IQ-DARK] ][77]\n[ [logo-Enable IQ-DARK] ][78]\n* [Shift IQ-Security] **Security Migrations**\n* [Shift IQ-infra] **Cloud and Workload Migrations**\n* [Shift IQ-Engineering] **Infrastructure and Network Migrations**\n\n#### **We help you modernize your security infrastructure by migrating SIEM/SOAR platforms, IAM\n#### solutions, incident response tools, and surveillance systems to more advanced technologies.**\n\n#### **Event Management**\n\nMigrate legacy SIEM systems to new platforms, including data migration, rule translation and\nplaybook improvement (e.g. Splunk, Helix, Google SecOps, and Sentinel)\n\n#### **Endpoint Protection**\n\nTransition between Endpoint Detection & Response/Endpoint Protection suites, ensuring seamless\nintegration, policy transfer, and continuous endpoint protection.\n\n#### **Privileged Access Management**\n\nMigrate and consolidate Privileged Access Management (PAM) solutions, ensuring secure access\ncontrols, seamless integration, and minimal disruption to critical systems.\n\n#### **Transition your cloud environments and workloads to modern platforms, optimizing for\n#### scalability, performance, and flexibility, while ensuring business continuity.**\n\n#### **Migrate to Cloud**\n\nEmpower your workloads to thrive in the cloud with a targeted cloud-native approach. Leverage our\nexpertise in Kubernetes and containerization for a seamless transition. Experience unmatched\nperformance and scalability, ensuring your cloud infrastructure supports growth and agility.\n\n#### **Migrate from Cloud**\n\nChart a clear path back to on-premises. When circumstances dictate a strategic shift from the cloud,\nArctiq is prepared to reverse the tide. We handle compliance intricacies and optimize\ncost-effectiveness, assuring a smooth reintegration of your infrastructure without the sacrifice of\nquality or performance.\n\n#### **Microsoft 365 Migrations**\n\nMigrate from on-premises or other cloud workforce solutions to Microsoft 365, enhancing\ncollaboration, productivity, and leveraging the latest features and tools.\n\n#### **We manage the migration of critical infrastructure, including data centers, networks,\n#### wireless systems, hypervisors, VDI environments, unified communications, and Active Directory,\n#### ensuring smooth operations and minimal downtime.**\n\n#### **Network Migrations**\n\nReplace wired, wireless and WAN network infrastructure, including device configuration,\ninstallation, traffic rerouting, and performance optimization.\n\n#### **Firewall Migration**\n\nMigrate or replace firewalls, including rule set transfer, security policy updates, and traffic\ncutover.\n\n#### **Active Directory Migration**\n\nMigrate Active Directory to a new forest or domain, including user account transfer, group policy\nupdates, and domain trust configuration.\n\n#### **Unified Communications Migration**\n\nMigrate communications systems, including call flow design, user migration, and integration with\ncontact center, paging or other alerting tools.\n\n#### **Data Center Move**\n\nRelocate your physical data center, including equipment migration and business continuity planning.\n\n#### **Data Center Platforms Migration**\n\nMigrate datacenter platforms, including server, storage and data protection system transitions and\nhypervisor migrations.\n[ [Logo] ][79]\nStay informed about the latest technology trends and enterprise solutions\n\nBy subscribing, you agree to our privacy policy and consent to receive updates.\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][80]\n* [ [Youtube] ][81]\n* [COMPANY][82]\n* [About Us][83]\n* [Careers][84]\n* [Locations][85]\n* [SOLUTIONS][86]\n* [Hybrid Cloud\nInfrastructure][87]\n* [Network & Connected\nExperiences][88]\n* [Cybersecurity][89]\n* [Autonomous Operations & Intelligence][90]\n* [Data & AI][91]\n* [Enterprise Service\nManagement][92]\n* [SERVICES][93]\n* [Professional Methodology][94]\n* [Managed Services][95]\n* [Resource Management][96]\n* [Arctiq Capital][97]\n* [INDUSTRIES][98]\n* [Enterprise & Commercial][99]\n* [Government][100]\n* [Education][101]\n* [Healthcare][102]\n* [Utilities][103]\n* [Hospitality & Gaming][104]\n* [Tribal][105]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Arctiq, Inc. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][106]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][107]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://arctiq.com/?hsLang=en\n[3]:\n[4]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure\n[5]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/networking-and-connected-experiences\n[6]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/cybersecurity\n[7]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/autonomous-operations-intelligence\n[8]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/data-ai\n[9]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/enterprise-service-management\n[10]: https://arctiq.com/customer-stories/building-a-future-ready-data-platform-for-the-city-of-nort\nh-las-vegas\n[11]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq-methodology\n[12]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/insight\n[13]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/design\n[14]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/build\n[15]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/shift\n[16]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/enable\n[17]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/optimize\n[18]: https://arctiq.com/services/security-advisory-services\n[19]: https://arctiq.com/services/resource-management-services\n[20]: https://arctiq.com/services/arctiq-capital-services\n[21]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-services-overview\n[22]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure-managed-services\n[23]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/networking-connected-experiences-managed-services-arcti\n[24]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/cybersecurity-managed-services\n[25]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/managed-smartops\n[26]: https://arctiq.com/resources/resource-library\n[27]: https://arctiq.com/about-us\n[28]: https://arctiq.com/company/leadership-team\n[29]: https://arctiq.com/careers\n[30]: https://arctiq.com/company/locations\n[31]: https://arctiq.com/blog\n[32]: https://arctiq.com/customer-stories\n[33]: https://arctiq.com/resources/resource-library\n[34]: https://arctiq.com/upcoming-events\n[35]: https://arctiq.com/servtrax-portal-login\n[36]: https://arctiq.com/partners\n[37]: https://arctiq.com/government-contracts\n[38]:\n[39]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure\n[40]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/networking-and-connected-experiences\n[41]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/cybersecurity\n[42]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/autonomous-operations-intelligence\n[43]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/data-ai\n[44]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/enterprise-service-management\n[45]: https://arctiq.com/customer-stories/building-a-future-ready-data-platform-for-the-city-of-nort\nh-las-vegas\n[46]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq-methodology\n[47]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/insight\n[48]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/design\n[49]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/build\n[50]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/shift\n[51]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/enable\n[52]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/optimize\n[53]: https://arctiq.com/services/"
