\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n* [Services][76]\n* SAS\n\n# Security Advisory Services\n\n##### Strategically Prepare. Defend. Recover\n\nArctiq\u2019s Security Advisory Services help organizations build clarity, confidence, and resilience in\nthe face of rapidly evolving cyber threats. Our mission is to equip leaders with the insight,\nstructure, and readiness needed to reduce risk, modernize securely, and respond with precision when\nit matters most.\n\nPowered by deep expertise, threat-intelligence partnerships, and methodologies refined through\nreal-world operations, we guide organizations from intuition-based security to a data-driven,\nthreat-informed, business-aligned program.\n\n[Request a Consultation][77]\n[diagram-SAS-3 (1)]\n[Evaluate Risk & Develop Resilience]\n\n## Evaluate Risk & Develop Resilience\n\n### Security Strategy Assessment (SSA)\n\nA strategic imperative for organizations looking to grow securely. The SSA aligns cybersecurity with\nbusiness innovation and resilience through a structured workflow - current-state assessment,\ncollaborative workshops, strategy refinement, and executive-ready presentations - culminating in a\nclear, actionable roadmap that fuels long-term security maturity.\n\n### Crown Jewels Identification & Modeling\n\nThis program identifies the mission-critical assets that matter most to your organization. Through\nbusiness process reviews, impact mapping, classification, and failure mode analysis, Arctiq helps\nteams understand residual risk and build resilience plans that prioritize operational continuity.\n\n### Threat Modeling & Attack Path Remediation\n\nBy decomposing system architecture and identifying likely attacker pathways, threat modeling\nuncovers security gaps before adversaries exploit them. Our structured process delivers tailored\nrecommendations to strengthen controls, eliminate attack paths, and reduce material risk.\n\n### Flexible Advisory Retainer\n\nA modern, proactive support model offering on-demand access to cybersecurity and IT expertise. This\nretainer provides budgeting flexibility, rapid engagement, and cross-functional advisory support,\nensuring you receive the right guidance at the right time, without delaying momentum.\n\n[De-Risk Transformation]\n\n## De-Risk Transformation\n\n### Security Architecture & Blueprinting\n\nExpert guidance to design scalable, modern security frameworks that align with business goals. The\nblueprint prioritizes investments, eliminates redundancies, and drives cross-team collaboration,\nequipping organizations to build secure-by-design foundations for growth.\n\n### Integrated Cyber Response (iCR) Transformation\n\nA holistic approach that aligns detection, response, and recovery to business impact. iCR identifies\ncritical services, prioritizes response workflows, and ensures coordinated incident management,\nenabling fast, reliable, and repeatable response practices.\n\n### Threat Modeling & Attack Path Remediation\n\nBy decomposing system architecture and identifying likely attacker pathways, threat modeling\nuncovers security gaps before adversaries exploit them. Our structured process delivers tailored\nrecommendations to strengthen controls, eliminate attack paths, and reduce material risk.\n\n### AI Enabled Defense\n\nAccelerate detection, improve SOC efficiency, and scale defensive capabilities through AI and\nautomation. Arctiq\u2019s workflow assesses readiness, defines high-value use cases, and integrates AI\ninto SOC architecture to enable proactive, intelligence-driven defense.\n\n### Project Management & Master Remediation Program (MRP)\n\nA structured remediation governance model that aligns resources and investments to real threats. MRP\ndelivers transparent tracking, executive visibility, and accelerated resolution of security\ngaps\u2014driving measurable, timely risk reduction across the enterprise.\n\n[Prepare & Strategically Defend]\n\n## Prepare & Strategically Defend\n\n### Organizational Response Confidence Assessment (ORCA)\n\nA readiness assessment designed to evaluate an organization\u2019s ability to detect, respond, and\nrecover from cyber threats. ORCA examines plans, tooling, visibility, leadership roles, and\ncross-team coordination\u2014 delivering clear recommendations that strengthen confidence and\ndecision-making.\n\n### Executive & Technical Tabletop Exercises\n\nSimulated cyber incidents that test an organization\u2019s readiness and decision-making under pressure.\nThese sessions drive cross-functional collaboration, validate response plans, and reinforce\nregulatory confidence, helping reduce the impact of real-world breaches.\n\n### Security Operations Assessment (SOA)\n\nA comprehensive benchmark of SOC people, processes, and technologies against industry standards. The\nSOA includes workshops, documentation review, and maturity reporting\u2014culminating in a practical\nimprovement plan to strengthen detection and response capabilities.\n\n### Cyber Response Program Uplift\n\nEnhances incident response plans, SIEM analytics, and operational readiness. Uplift engagements\nrefine playbooks, improve detection logic, and leverage purple team validation to ensure defensive\ncontrols operate as intended during real attacks.\n\n### Purple Teaming & Penetration Testing\n\nCollaborative attack simulations that identify vulnerabilities while strengthening detection,\nresponse, and preventive controls. Aligned to business risk, these exercises provide real-time\ninsights that increase operational resilience and improve SOC performance.\n\n## Build a Security Program That\u2019s Ready for What\u2019s Next\n\n[Talk to an Arctiq Expert][78]\n[people-across-the-globe] Expert delivery capability\nacross North America\n[Skip to main content][79]\n[SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark]\n* [ Home ][80]\n* Show submenu for Work Work\n* [ About ][81]\n* Show submenu for Portfolio Portfolio\n* [ SentryOne ][82]\n* [ Baker ][83]\n* [ EZ Texting ][84]\n* [ Careers ][85]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* [ Lead genereation ][86]\n* [ Growth marketing ][87]\n* [ Website design ][88]\n* [ Blog ][89]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* [ Home ][90]\n* Show submenu for Work Work\n* Work\n* [ About ][91]\n* Show submenu for Portfolio Portfolio\n* Portfolio\n* [ SentryOne ][92]\n* [ Baker ][93]\n* [ EZ Texting ][94]\n* [ Careers ][95]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* [ Lead genereation ][96]\n* [ Growth marketing ][97]\n* [ Website design ][98]\n* [ Blog ][99]\n* [Get Started][100]\n[Get Started][101]\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][102]\n[ [Logo] ][103]\nStay informed about the latest technology trends and enterprise solutions\n\nBy subscribing, you agree to our privacy policy and consent to receive updates.\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][104]\n* [ [Youtube] ][105]\n* [COMPANY][106]\n* [About Us][107]\n* [Careers][108]\n* [Locations][109]\n* [SOLUTIONS][110]\n* [Hybrid Cloud\nInfrastructure][111]\n* [Network & Connected\nExperiences][112]\n* [Cybersecurity][113]\n* [Autonomous Operations & Intelligence][114]\n* [Data & AI][115]\n* [Enterprise Service\nManagement][116]\n* [SERVICES][117]\n* [Professional Methodology][118]\n* [Managed Services][119]\n* [Resource Management][120]\n* [Arctiq Capital][121]\n* [INDUSTRIES][122]\n* [Enterprise & Commercial][123]\n* [Government][124]\n* [Education][125]\n* [Healthcare][126]\n* [Utilities][127]\n* [Hospitality & Gaming][128]\n* [Tribal][129]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Arctiq, Inc. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][130]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][131]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://arctiq.com/?hsLang=en\n[3]:\n"
