\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n* [Services][76]\n* Managed IQ > Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure\n\n# Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services\n\n##### Resilient Infrastructure Operations for the Hybrid Enterprise\n\nModern infrastructure environments span data centers, cloud platforms, virtualized workloads, and\ndistributed endpoints. Managing these environments requires continuous monitoring, proactive\nmaintenance, and reliable recovery capabilities.\n\nArctiq\u2019s Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure ManagedIQ Services ensure critical infrastructure systems\nremain secure, optimized, and highly available.\n\nThrough proactive monitoring, automated maintenance, and operational support, our experts help\norganizations maintain resilient infrastructure environments while reducing operational complexity.\n\n[Request a Consultation][77]\n\n## Managed Infrastructure\n\nArctiq manages critical on-prem or cloud-based infrastructure on behalf of clients, providing\noperational oversight and ongoing system maintenance.\n\n**Services include:**\n* Infrastructure monitoring and alert response\n* Patching and configuration management\n* Moves, adds, and changes\n* Operational health monitoring and reporting\n\n## Backup as a Service and Managed Backup\n\nYour data is only as valuable as your ability to recover it. Arctiq provides full lifecycle\nmanagement of client backup and data protection environments, including policy governance, job\nmonitoring, recovery validation, and ongoing operational support, across platforms including\nCommvault, Zerto, Infinidat, and Cloudian.\n\nFor organizations looking to fully offload backup infrastructure, our Backup as a Service (BaaS)\noffering delivers a complete, air-gapped solution on an OpEx model with secure recovery targets\navailable across all major cloud providers and our Denver and Atlanta data centers.\n\n** Capabilities include: **\n* Backup management and monitoring\n* Data replication and storage management\n* Recovery planning and testing\n* Secure off-site storage with air-gapped recovery options\n* OpEx-based Backup as a Service (BaaS)\n\n## Managed Desktop Operations\n\nMaintain endpoint health and operational visibility across distributed user environments.\n\n**Services include:**\n* Remote monitoring and management of endpoints\n* Patch management and updates\n* Performance monitoring and alerting\n* Endpoint operational support\n\n## Disaster Recovery as a Service and Managed Disaster Recovery\n\nWhen a disaster hits, the plan you made six months ago is the only thing standing between you and\nchaos. Arctiq manages the full DR lifecycle on your behalf, from architecture and planning through\nfailover execution and post-recovery validation, so your team isn't figuring it out in the middle of\nan outage.\n\nWe work across your environment ahead of time to ensure recovery procedures are tested, documented,\nand ready to execute. When an event occurs, our engineers lead the response.\n\nFor organizations that want to fully offload their recovery infrastructure, our DR as a Service\n(DRaaS) offering provides managed failover targets hosted in our Denver and Atlanta data centers,\navailable on an OpEx model.\n\n** Capabilities include:**\n* DR planning and architecture support\n* Managed failover execution during recovery events\n* Validation of application and infrastructure functionality post-recovery\n* Rollback assistance following recovery operations\n* Hosted DR targets via DR as a Service (DRaaS)\n\n[resource-library]\n\n###### Explore Our Resource Library\n\nInsights and guidance to help you modernize, secure and scale with confidence\n\n[Browse Resources][78]\n\n## Build resilient infrastructure that\u2019s always ready. Let\u2019s get started.\n\n[Schedule a consultation today][79]\n[people-across-the-globe] Expert delivery capability across North America\n[security-posture]\n[Skip to main content][80]\n[SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark]\n* [ Home ][81]\n* Show submenu for Work Work\n* [ About ][82]\n* Show submenu for Portfolio Portfolio\n* [ SentryOne ][83]\n* [ Baker ][84]\n* [ EZ Texting ][85]\n* [ Careers ][86]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* [ Lead genereation ][87]\n* [ Growth marketing ][88]\n* [ Website design ][89]\n* [ Blog ][90]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* [ Home ][91]\n* Show submenu for Work Work\n* Work\n* [ About ][92]\n* Show submenu for Portfolio Portfolio\n* Portfolio\n* [ SentryOne ][93]\n* [ Baker ][94]\n* [ EZ Texting ][95]\n* [ Careers ][96]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* [ Lead genereation ][97]\n* [ Growth marketing ][98]\n* [ Website design ][99]\n* [ Blog ][100]\n* [Get Started][101]\n[Get Started][102]\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][103]\n[ [Logo] ][104]\nStay informed about the latest technology trends and enterprise solutions\n\nBy subscribing, you agree to our privacy policy and consent to receive updates.\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][105]\n* [ [Youtube] ][106]\n* [COMPANY][107]\n* [About Us][108]\n* [Careers][109]\n* [Locations][110]\n* [SOLUTIONS][111]\n* [Hybrid Cloud\nInfrastructure][112]\n* [Network & Connected\nExperiences][113]\n* [Cybersecurity][114]\n* [Autonomous Operations & Intelligence][115]\n* [Data & AI][116]\n* [Enterprise Service\nManagement][117]\n* [SERVICES][118]\n* [Professional Methodology][119]\n* [Managed Services][120]\n* [Resource Management][121]\n* [Arctiq Capital][122]\n* [INDUSTRIES][123]\n* [Enterprise & Commercial][124]\n* [Government][125]\n* [Education][126]\n* [Healthcare][127]\n* [Utilities][128]\n* [Hospitality & Gaming][129]\n* [Tribal][130]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Arctiq, Inc. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][131]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][132]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://arctiq.com/?hsLang=en\n[3]:\n[4]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure\n[5]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/networking-and-connected-experiences\n[6]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/cybersecurity\n[7]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/autonomous-operations-intelligence\n[8]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/data-ai\n[9]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/enterprise-service-management\n[10]: https://arctiq.com/customer-stories/building-a-future-ready-data-platform-for-the-city-of-nort\nh-las-vegas\n[11]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq-methodology\n[12]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/insight\n[13]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/design\n[14]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/build\n[15]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/shift\n[16]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/enable\n[17]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/optimize\n[18]: https://arctiq.com/services/security-advisory-services\n[19]: https://arctiq.com/services/resource-management-services\n[20]: https://arctiq.com/services/arctiq-capital-services\n[21]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-services-overview\n[22]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure-managed-services\n[23]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/networking-connected-experiences-managed-services-arcti\n[24]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/cybersecurity-managed-services\n[25]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/managed-smartops\n[26]: https://arctiq.com/resources/resource-library\n[27]