\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n* [Services][76]\n* Managed IQ > Cybersecurity\n\n# Cybersecurity Managed Services\n\n##### Continuous Security Operations for Modern Threat Environments\n\nCyber threats are evolving rapidly, and organizations require continuous monitoring, rapid response,\nand proactive exposure management to stay protected.\n\nArctiq\u2019s Cybersecurity ManagedIQ Services deliver advanced detection, response, and security program\nmanagement through our integrated security operations platform.\n\n##### Our experts provide 24x7 security monitoring, incident response, vulnerability management, and\n##### strategic guidance to help organizations strengthen their security posture and reduce risk.\n\n[Request a Consultation][77]\n\n## Managed Extended Detection and Response (MXDR)\n\nMXDR delivers integrated security monitoring and response across endpoints, identity platforms,\ncloud environments, and network infrastructure.\n\n**Capabilities include:**\n* Threat detection and alert monitoring\n* Incident investigation and response\n* Integration across identity, endpoint, and email security platforms\n* Continuous security posture monitoring\n\n## Managed SIEM Operations\n\nArctiq manages SIEM platforms on behalf of clients to ensure optimized monitoring and threat\ndetection.\n\n**Services include:**\n* SIEM platform management\n* Rule tuning and alert optimization\n* Security monitoring and investigation\n* Integration with security tools and telemetry sources\n\n**Supported Platforms**\n* Google Security Operations\n* Microsoft Sentinel\n* Cisco Splunk\n\n## Vulnerability and Attack Surface Management\n\nIdentify and remediate vulnerabilities before attackers can exploit them.\n\n**Capabilities include:**\n* Continuous vulnerability scanning\n* External attack surface monitoring\n* Exposure analysis and risk prioritization\n* Remediation guidance and validation\n\n## Patch Management as a Service\n\nEnsure systems remain protected through consistent patch management.\n\n**Services include:**\n* Automated patch deployment\n* Endpoint and server patch management\n* Compliance reporting and validation\n\n## Virtual CISO (vCISO)\n\nProvide executive-level security leadership without requiring a full-time internal CISO.\n\n**Services include:**\n* Security strategy development\n* Governance and risk management\n* Security program oversight\n* Compliance support and reporting\n\n[resource-library]\n\n###### Explore Our Resource Library\n\nInsights and guidance to help you modernize, secure and scale with confidence\n\n[Browse Resources][78]\n\n## Stay ahead of threats with continuous protection and expert response. Let\u2019s talk.\n\n[Schedule a consultation today][79]\n[people-across-the-globe] Expert delivery capability across North America\n[security-posture]\n[Skip to main content][80]\n[SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark]\n* [ Home ][81]\n* Show submenu for Work Work\n* [ About ][82]\n* Show submenu for Portfolio Portfolio\n* [ SentryOne ][83]\n* [ Baker ][84]\n* [ EZ Texting ][85]\n* [ Careers ][86]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* [ Lead genereation ][87]\n* [ Growth marketing ][88]\n* [ Website design ][89]\n* [ Blog ][90]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* [ Home ][91]\n* Show submenu for Work Work\n* Work\n* [ About ][92]\n* Show submenu for Portfolio Portfolio\n* Portfolio\n* [ Sent