\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n\n# About Us\n\nArctiq is a global systems integrator and managed service provider that helps organizations connect,\nprotect, and transform their digital enterprises. Arctiq enables organizations to bring their\nsystems together - infrastructure, network, security, data, and automation - into a unified,\nintelligent operating environment. We surface the relationships, patterns, and interdependencies\nthat were previously hidden inside siloed systems, turning fragmentation into cohesion, and\ncomplexity into meaningful outcomes.\n\nAugust 2023\n\n###### DynTek & rSolutions Merge\n\nGallant Capital Partners, a Los Angeles-based investment firm, completed a strategic growth\ninvestment in DynTek, Inc., a US-based professional IT services, cybersecurity, and risk management\norganization, and rSolutions Corporation, a Canadian-based cybersecurity firm. Both organizations\nunify under a single leadership structure and investment umbrella\n\nAugust 2023\n\n###### CEO Appointment\n\nPaul Kerr joins to serve as Chief Executive Officer to execute the combined strategic business\ngoals.\n\nNovember 2023\n\n###### Arctiq Acquisition\n\nDynTek, Inc. and rSolutions acquire Arctiq, a leading Cloud, DevOps, and Automation Solution\nIntegrator based in Canada.\n\nMarch 2024\n\n###### Consolidation Under a Single Brand\n\nDynTek, Inc., rSolutions Corporation, and Arctiq (Canada) consolidate under a single corporate\nstructure and a single brand, \u201cArctiq.\" Arctiq builds on decades of industry expertise and a\ncustomer-centric ethos to deliver exceptional value to clients across diverse industries.\n\nNovember 2024\n\n###### Summit Partners Acquisition\n\nSummit Partners, an IT consulting and value-added reseller firm headquartered in Las Vegas, Nevada,\njoins Arctiq.\n\nFebruary 2026\n\n###### Verinext Unites with Arctiq\n\nThe unified organization provides deeper expertise, expanded managed services, and greater delivery\ncapacity, helping customers scale and modernize while reducing risk and cost.\n\nMarch 2026\n\n###### Arctiq Acquires Shadow-Soft\n\nShadow-Soft, an Atlanta-based technology services firm, brings deep expertise in observability,\nautomation, and modern platform operations.\n\n### Architect A New Kind Of IT Company\n\nOur identity is shaped by deep technical\nexpertise, relentless commitment to\noutcomes for our clients, and a culture rooted in collaboration and innovation.\n\nOur capabilities set the foundation.\nOur people elevate the experience.\nOur values guide every interaction.\n\n[ [partner-excellence] ][76]\n\n###### Partner Excellence\n\n100+ partners with top-level certifications\n\n[View Partner Ecosystem][77]\n\n### Global Footprint\n\nExpansive coverage across\nthe United States, Canada and UAE\n\n[Explore Locations][78]\n[about-employees]\n\n### 600+\n\n**Employees**\nThroughout North America\n\n### 2500+\n\n**Customers**\nThroughout North America\n\n### 80+\n\n**Authorizations**\nFor government contract vehicles\n\n### 24x7x365\n\n**Dedicated\nSOCs/NOCs**\n\n[crn-badges-june-2026]\n\n#### Recognition\n\nWhat differentiates Arctiq is our engineering depth, strategic thinking, and disciplined execution\nto deliver measurable results for our clients.\n\n[about-img]\n\n## A Brand Built On Purpose\n\nArctiq was created from the merger of high-performing companies who believed that enterprises needed\na better type of partner, one capable of addressing security, infrastructure, cloud, automation, and\ndata challenges as a connected system rather than isolated initiatives.\n\nWE BELIEVE:\n\n[security-services]\n\n**Modernization must be secure.**\n\n[ai-governance-lifecycle]\n\n**Security must be intelligent. **\n\n[user-favorite]\n\n**People must be empowered.**\n\n[engineering-lifecycle-mgmt]\n\n**Intelligence must be operationalized. **\n\n[watson-openscale]\n\n**Outcomes must be measurable. **\n\n[chris-mcmillen]\n[icon-quote]\n\nClients come to us looking for a solution, but what they leave with is momentum. We help them break\ndown complexity, unlock performance, and move with speed and confidence in a world that won\u2019t slow\ndown.\n\n### Chris McMillen\n\nChief Revenue Officer, Arctiq\n\n## Core\n## Values\n\nThese values guide our behaviors, shape our culture, and define what it means to be part of Arctiq.\n\n##### Customer First\n\nWe immerse ourselves in our customers\u2019 environments so we can design solutions that reflect their\ngoals, not ours.\n\n##### One Team\n\nWe integrate our expertise the same way we integrate platforms: seamlessly, purposefully, and with\nshared accountability.\n\n##### Persevere\n\nWe stay engaged through complexity, uncovering solutions others overlook.\n\n##### Have Fun\n\nWe build an environment where creativity, connection, and momentum thrive.\n\n[core-values]\n\n## Our Why\n\nWe exist to help organizations navigate a world defined by complexity, cyber threats, skill\nshortages, data growth, and relentless change. We empower organizations to operate securely,\nintelligently, and efficiently, so they can innovate faster, serve customers better, and unlock the\nfull potential of their teams.\n\n[our-why-1]\n[About Us image gallery scroll-1]\n\n### Join Our Team\n\n###### Love working with cutting-edge technology?\n\nDiverse thinking results in better thinking. We\u2019re committed to building inclusive work environments\nthat encourage and respect diverse backgrounds, perspectives, talents, and experiences.\n\n[View Career Opportunities][79]\n[Skip to main content][80]\n[SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark]\n* [ Home ][81]\n* Show submenu for Work Work\n* [ About ][82]\n* Show submenu for Portfolio Portfolio\n* [ SentryOne ][83]\n* [ Baker ][84]\n* [ EZ Texting ][85]\n* [ Careers ][86]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* [ Lead genereation ][87]\n* [ Growth marketing ][88]\n* [ Website design ][89]\n* [ Blog ][90]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* [ Home ][91]\n* Show submenu for Work Work\n* Work\n* [ About ][92]\n* Show submenu for Portfolio Portfolio\n* Portfolio\n* [ SentryOne ][93]\n* [ Baker ][94]\n* [ EZ Texting ][95]\n* [ Careers ][96]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* [ Lead genereation ][97]\n* [ Growth marketing ][98]\n* [ Website design ][99]\n* [ Blog ][100]\n* [Get Started][101]\n[Get Started][102]\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][103]\n[ [Logo] ][104]\nStay informed about the latest technology trends and enterprise solutions\n\nBy subscribing, you agree to our privacy policy and consent to receive updates.\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][105]\n* [ [Youtube] ][106]\n* [COMPANY][107]\n* [About Us][108]\n* [Careers][109]\n* [Locations][110]\n* [SOLUTIONS][111]\n* [Hybrid Cloud\nInfrastructure][112]\n* [Network & Connected\nExperiences][113]\n* [Cybersecurity][114]\n* [Autonomous Operations & Intelligence][115]\n* [Data & AI][116]\n* [Enterprise Service\nManagement][117]\n* [SERVICES][118]\n* [Professional Methodology][119]\n* [Managed Services][120]\n* [Resource Management][121]\n* [Arctiq Capital][122]\n* [INDUSTRIES][123]\n* [Enterprise & Commercial][124]\n* [Government][125]\n* [Education][126]\n* [Healthcare][127]\n* [Utilities][128]\n* [Hospitality & Gaming][129]\n* [Tribal][130]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Arctiq, Inc. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][131]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][132]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://arctiq.com/?hsLang=en\n[3]:\n[4]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure\n[5]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/networking-and-connected-experiences\n[6]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/cybersecurity\n[7]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/autonomous-operations-intelligence\n[8]: https://arctiq.com"
