ices ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n\n# IT Expertise Across North America\n\n## Contact Us\n\n### Need to get in touch with our technical, sales or support teams? Drop us a line below and let us\n### know how we can help.\n\n####\n\n###\n\n### GLOBAL LOCATIONS\n\n**[View our locations][76] throughout the United States and Canada**\n\n### UNITED STATES HEADQUARTERS\n\n8 Cadillac Drive, Suite 250\nBrentwood, TN 37027\nPhone: (833) 3ARCTIQ\n**[go@arctiq.com][77]**\n\n### CANADIAN HEADQUARTERS\n\nVictory Building\n80 Richmond Street West, Suite 300\nToronto, ON M5H 2A4\nPhone: (833) 3ARCTIQ\n**[go@arctiq.com][78]**\n\n## How Can We Help?\n\n[ [Logo] ][79]\nStay informed about the latest technology trends and enterprise solutions\n\nBy subscribing, you agree to our privacy policy and consent to receive updates.\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][80]\n* [ [Youtube] ][81]\n* [COMPANY][82]\n* [About Us][83]\n* [Careers][84]\n* [Locations][85]\n* [SOLUTIONS][86]\n* [Hybrid Cloud\nInfrastructure][87]\n* [Network & Connected\nExperiences][88]\n* [Cybersecurity][89]\n* [Autonomous Operations & Intelligence][90]\n* [Data & AI][91]\n* [Enterprise Service\nManagement][92]\n* [SERVICES][93]\n* [Professional Methodology][94]\n* [Managed Services][95]\n* [Resource Management][96]\n* [Arctiq Capital][97]\n* [INDUSTRIES][98]\n* [Enterprise & Commercial][99]\n* [Government][100]\n* [Education][101]\n* [Healthcare][102]\n* [Utilit