\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n\nBlog\n\n][75]\nTags\n* [Education][76]\n* [Healthcare][77]\n* [Financial][78]\n* [Government][79]\n* [Hospitality & Gaming][80]\n* [Technology][81]\n* [Utilities][82]\nSearch\n* [Education][83]\n* [Healthcare][84]\n* [Financial][85]\n* [Government][86]\n* [Hospitality & Gaming][87]\n* [Technology][88]\n* [Utilities][89]\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][90]\n\n# Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas\n\n#### INDUSTRY\n\nGovernment\n\n*\"Arctiq\u2019s experience with complex cloud data architectures and their deep understanding of both\nAzure and Databricks allowed us to move confidently and efficiently.\"*\n\n**Nichole Malichky**\nData Architect, City of North Las Vegas\n\n[ [READ CASE STUDY] ][91]\n[Building a Future-Ready Data Platform]\n\nThe City of North Las Vegas set out to reimagine how it uses data to serve its citizens. Across\ndepartments\u2014from parks and recreation to public safety\u2014teams were relying on manual reports and\nsiloed databases. The\ndata existed, but it lived in different systems, was hard to access, and often out of date by the\ntime decisions were made. Forward-thinking internal champion, Nichole Malichky, Data Architect,\nbacked by City leadership,\nenvisioned a smarter future: one where the City could see its operations in real time, respond\nfaster to citizen needs, and plan investments based on data, not gut feel.\n\nShe just needed the right partner to help make that vision real.\n\nEnter Arctiq. After hearing about the City\u2019s ambitions through a trusted relationship, Arctiq\nquickly engaged its data and cloud engineering experts to explore options, outline a roadmap, and\nco-create a platform that could\ngrow with the City\u2019s evolving needs.\n\nWhat began as an exploratory conversation soon became a full-scale digital transformation\u2014the\ncreation of a secure, automated, and scalable platform that lays the groundwork for smarter\ndecision-making, operational agility,\nand better citizen outcomes.\n\n[ [READ CASE STUDY] ][92]\n\nWhat made this project so rewarding was Nichole\u2019s drive to not just build a platform, but to\nfundamentally shift how the City uses data. We weren\u2019t just delivering code\u2014we were helping lay the\ngroundwork for smarter decisions and long-term impact.\n\n**Eric Boszin\n**Data Lead, Arctiq\n\n## Explore More Customer Stories\n\n[Digital Transformation and Managed Security Services for a Large Union]\nEnterprise & Commercial\n\n##### Digital Transformation and Managed Security Services for a Large Union\n\nArctiq worked with this large, national union on a comprehensive cloud transformation strategy and\ndeployment. With the significant impact of the COVID-19 crisis, the union needed to stay fully\noperational to support its members. Arctiq was able to quickly standup key solutions \u2013 including\nTeams ...\n\n[Learn More][93]\n[Retail Security Transformation: Shifting to Proactive, Centralized MXDR Services]\nRetail\n\n##### Retail Security Transformation: Shifting to Proactive, Centralized MXDR Services\n\nThe Challenge A retail organization had previously maintained all security responsibilities in-house\nbut encountered challenges scaling and achieving a proactive security posture with their lean\nsecurity operations team. Following the appointment of a new CIO, their primary strategic goal\nbecame ...\n\n[Learn More][94]\n[Enabling End-to-End Cyber Resilience for a Global Digital Services Leader]\nHealthcare\n\n##### Enabling End-to-End Cyber Resilience for a Global Digital Services Leader\n\nA global healthcare organization faced growing complexity in managing data protection across a\ndiverse and hybrid IT environment. As their operations scaled, so did the volume and sensitivity of\nthe data they managed - ranging from internal operational systems to cloud-hosted applications and\n...\n\n[Learn More][95]\n[ [Logo] ][96]\nStay informed about the latest technology trends and enterprise solutions\n\nBy subscribing, you agree to our privacy policy and consent to receive updates.\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][97]\n* [ [Youtube] ][98]\n* [COMPANY][99]\n* [About Us][100]\n* [Careers][101]\n* [Locations][102]\n* [SOLUTIONS][103]\n* [Hybrid Cloud\nInfrastructure][104]\n* [Network & Connected\nExperiences][105]\n* [Cybersecurity][106]\n* [Autonomous Operations & Intelligence][107]\n* [Data & AI][108]\n* [Enterprise Service\nManagement][109]\n* [SERVICES][110]\n* [Professional Methodology][111]\n* [Managed Services][112]\n* [Resource Management][113]\n* [Arctiq Capital][114]\n* [INDUSTRIES][115]\n* [Enterprise & Commercial][116]\n* [Government][117]\n* [Education][118]\n* [Healthcare][119]\n* [Utilities][120]\n* [Hospitality & Gaming][121]\n* [Tribal][122]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Arctiq, Inc. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][123]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][124]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://arctiq.com/\n[3]:\n[4]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure\n[5]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/networking-and-connected-experiences\n[6]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/cybersecurity\n[7]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/autonomous-operations-intelligence\n[8]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/data-ai\n[9]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/enterprise-service-management\n[10]: https://arctiq.com/customer-stories/building-a-future-ready-data-platform-for-the-city-of-nort\nh-las-vegas\n[11]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq-methodology\n[12]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/insight\n[13]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/design\n[14]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/build\n[15]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/shift\n[16]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/enable\n[17]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/optimize\n[18]: https://arctiq.com/services/security-advisory-services\n[19]: https://arctiq.com/services/resource-management-services\n[20]: https://arctiq.com/services/arctiq-capital-services\n[21]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-services-overview\n[22]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure-managed-services\n[23]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/networking-connected-experiences-managed-services-arcti\n[24]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/cybersecurity-managed-services\n[25]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/managed-smartops\n[26]: https://arctiq.com/resources/resource-library\n[27]: https://arctiq.com/about-us\n[28]: https://arctiq.com/company/leadership-team\n[29]: https://arctiq.com/careers\n[30]: https://arctiq.com/company/locations\n[31]: https://arctiq.com/blog\n[32]: https://arctiq.com/customer-stories\n[33]: https://arctiq.com/resources/resource-library\n[34]: https://arctiq.com/upcoming-events\n[35]: https://arctiq.com/servtrax-portal-login\n[36]: https://arctiq.com/partners\n[37]: https://arctiq.com/government-contracts\n[38]:\n[39]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure\n[40]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/networking-and-connected-experiences\n[41]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/cybersecurity\n[42]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/autonomous-operations-intelligence\n[43]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/data-ai\n[44]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/enterprise-service-management\n[45]: https://arctiq.com/customer-stories/building-a-future-ready-data-platform-for-the-city-of-nort\nh-las-vegas\n[46]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq