            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Logo] [Arctiq-Logo-Default] ][2]\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][3]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][4]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][5]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][6]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][7]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][8]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][9]\n* [ ][10]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* [ Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][11]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][12]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][13]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][14]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][15]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][16]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][17]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][18]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][19]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][20]\n* [ Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ\nServices24x7 SOC & NOC** ][21]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][22]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][23]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][24]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][25]\n* [ See related resources ][26]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* [ About Us ][27]\n* [ Leadership Team ][28]\n* [ Careers ][29]\n* [ Locations ][30]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* [ Blog ][31]\n* [ Customer Stories ][32]\n* [ Resource Library ][33]\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n* [Services][76]\n* Managed IQ\n\n# Managed^{IQ} Services Overview\n\n##### Run Your Technology Operations with Confidence\n\nModern technology environments demand constant attention. Hybrid infrastructure, distributed\nnetworks, cloud platforms, and evolving cyber threats require continuous monitoring, expert\nmanagement, and rapid response.\n\n##### Arctiq\u2019s ManagedIQ Services provide the operational expertise, automation, and security\n##### oversight organizations need to run complex environments with confidence.\n#####\n#####\n##### Arctiq delivers fully managed services that monitor, manage, and optimize critical technology\n##### systems 24x7x365, delivered from Security Operations Centers & Network Operations Centers. Our\n##### experts extend your internal teams with specialized operational support across infrastructure,\n##### networking, and cybersecurity to ensure systems remain resilient, secure, and aligned with\n##### business objectives. Through proactive monitoring, advanced automation, and deep technical\n##### expertise, Arctiq\u2019s ManagedIQ Services allow organizations to reduce operational complexity\n##### while improving performance, security, and reliability.\n\n[Request a Consultation][77]\n[Service IQ-main]\n[Service IQ-main]\n\n## Managed^{IQ}\n\n#### Why Organizations Choose ManagedIQ\n\nMany organizations face growing challenges in maintaining modern IT environments:\n* Limited internal resources to manage complex infrastructure\n* Increasing security threats and compliance requirements\n* Expanding hybrid cloud and multi-platform architectures\n* Operational silos across infrastructure, networking, and security\n\nArctiq brings these disciplines together through an integrated managed services model that provides\ncontinuous visibility, operational support, and expert guidance.\n\n### **With Arctiq\u2019s ManagedIQ Services, organizations can:**\n\n###### Improve system uptime and operational resilience\n\n###### Strengthen cybersecurity posture and response capabilities\n\n###### Reduce internal operational burden\n\n###### Gain continuous monitoring and reporting\n\n###### Scale operations without increasing staffing requirements\n\n[core-values]\n\n## Integrated Managed Services Across the Enterprise\n\nArctiq provides managed services across core technology domains, supported by 24x7x365 SOC and NOC\ncapabilities that deliver continuous monitoring, rapid response, and expert operational management\nto ensure security, performance, and availability.\n\n### Cybersecurity Managed Services\n\nProtect critical systems and data with advanced threat detection, vulnerability management, and\nsecurity program leadership.\n\n**Capabilities include:**\n* Managed Extended Detection and Response (MXDR)\n* Managed SIEM Operations\n* Vulnerability and Attack Surface Management\n* Patch Management as a Service\n* Virtual CISO (vCISO) services\n\n[Read More][78]\n\n### Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services\n\nEnsure infrastructure, endpoints, data protection, and recovery environments remain secure,\nresilient, and operational.\n\n**Capabilities include:**\n* Managed Infrastructure\n* Backup as a Service and Managed Backup\n* Managed Desktop Monitoring and Management\n* Managed Disaster Recovery Planning and Execution\n* Disaster Recovery as a Service\n\n[Read More][79]\n\n### Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services\n\nMaintain reliable connectivity and high-performance networking environments with proactive\nmonitoring and operational management.\n\n**Capabilities include:**\n* Network Monitoring\n* Fully Managed Networking\n* Managed Carrier Services and Connectivity Management\n\n[Read More][80]\n\n### Managed SmartOps\n\nArctiq\u2019s Managed SmartOps is a bundled offering that covers end-to-end operational management to\nkeep systems stable, secure, and optimized.\n\n**Capabilities include:**\n* Full-stack visibility with managed alerts\n* Configuration, patching, and lifecycle management\n* Health reporting with a single owner for outcomes\n\n[Read More][81]\n\n## Continuous Operations. Continuous Improvement.\n\nArctiq\u2019s ManagedIQ Services are designed to deliver more than reactive support. Our services focus\non proactive operations and continuous improvement.\n\nThrough centralized monitoring, alert aggregation, and automation platforms, Arctiq provides\nreal-time visibility into system health and security posture while continuously optimizing\nperformance and resilience.\n\nOrganizations gain the advantage of a dedicated team of engineers, security analysts, and operations\nspecialists working as an extension of their internal teams.\n[Talk to an Arctiq Expert][82]\n[people-across-the-globe] Expert delivery capability across North America\n[CTA-ICON-CLOUD]\n[Skip to main content][83]\n[SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark]\n* [ Home ][84]\n* Show submenu for Work Work\n* [ About ][85]\n* Show submenu for Portfolio Portfolio\n* [ SentryOne ][86]\n* [ Baker ][87]\n* [ EZ Texting ][88]\n* [ Careers ][89]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* [ Lead genereation ][90]\n* [ Growth marketing ][91]\n* [ Website design ][92]\n* [ Blog ][93]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* [ Home ][94]\n* Show submenu for Work Work\n* Work\n* [ About ][95]\n* Show submenu for Portfolio Portfolio\n* Portfolio\n* [ SentryOne ][96]\n* [ Baker ][97]\n* [ EZ Texting ][98]\n* [ Careers ][99]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* [ Lead genereation ][100]\n* [ Growth marketing ][101]\n* [ Website design ][102]\n* [ Blog ][103]\n* [Get Started][104]\n[Get Started][105]\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][106]\n[ [Logo] ][107]\nStay informed about the latest technology trends and enterprise solutions\n\nBy subscribing, you agree to our privacy policy and consent to receive updates.\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][108]\n* [ [Youtube] ][109]\n* [COMPANY][110]\n* [About Us][111]\n* [Careers][112]\n* [Locations][113]\n* [SOLUTIONS][114]\n* [Hybrid Cloud\nInfrastructure][115]\n* [Network & Connected\nExperiences][116]\n* [Cybersecurity][117]\n* [Autonomous Operations & Intelligence][118]\n* [Data & AI][119]\n* [Enterprise Service\nManagement][120]\n* [SERVICES][121]\n* [Professional Methodology][122]\n* [Managed Services][123]\n* [Resource Management][124]\n* [Arctiq Capital][125]\n* [INDUSTRIES][126]\n* [Enterprise & Commercial][127]\n* [Government][128]\n* [Education][129]\n* [Healthcare][130]\n* [Utilities][131]\n* [Hospitality & Gaming][132]\n* [Tribal][133]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Arctiq, Inc. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][134]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][135]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://arctiq.com/?hsLang=en\n[3]:\n[4]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure\n[5]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/networking-and-connected-experiences\n[6]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/cybersecurity\n[7]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/autonomous-operations-intelligence\n[8]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/data-ai\n[9]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/enterprise-service-management\n[10]: https://arctiq.com/customer-stories/building-a-future-ready-data-platform-for-the-city-of-nort\nh-las-vegas\n[11]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq-methodology\n[12]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/insight\n[13]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/design\n[14]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/build\n[15]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/shift\n[16]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/enable\n[17]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/optimize\n[18]: https://arctiq.com/services/security-advisory-services\n[19]: "
