\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n* [Networking & Connected Experiences][76]\n* Networked Surveillance and Access Control\n\n# Networked Surveillance and Access Control\n\n##### Page Summary\n\nArctiq integrates surveillance, access control, and IoT technologies into secure, network native\narchitectures that provide centralized visibility and operational control across facilities.\n\n[Request a Consultation][77]\n\n## Core Offering Components\n\n###### Integrated Surveillance Architecture\n\nNetwork native surveillance platforms enable centralized monitoring, scalable deployment, and secure\nvideo transmission.\n\n###### Access Control Modernization\n\nIdentity aware access control systems integrate physical security with enterprise authentication and\npolicy frameworks.\n\n###### IoT and Smart Facility Connectivity\n\nConnected facility systems and sensors are securely integrated into network environments with\nappropriate segmentation.\n\n###### Network Segmentation for Physical Security Systems\n\nSegmentation isolates physical security traffic to reduce risk while maintaining performance and\nvisibility.\n\n###### Centralized Visibility and Monitoring\n\nUnified dashboards provide operational insight across surveillance, access control, and connected\ndevices.\n\n[resource-library]\n\n###### Explore Our Resource Library\n\nInsights and guidance to help you modernize, secure and scale with confidence\n\n[Browse Resources][78]\n* Arctiq provides expert-level assessment, architecture design, implementation, optimization, and\noperational support services for all networking platforms, helping organizations deploy and\noperate modern connectivity with confidence.\n\n## Technology & Ecosystem Partners\n\n[cisco logo]\n[Hpe-aruba-networking-logo]\n[Juniper_Networks-rgb-black]\n[Fortinet_logo.svg]\n[palo-alto]\n[dynatrace_web]\n[infoblox-logo]\n[Verkada-Logo-Horiz-Black-RGB (1)]\n\n## Why Choose Arctiq?\n* Converged networking and physical security expertise\n* Secure by design architecture aligned to zero trust principles\n* Scalable solutions for campuses and distributed environments\n* Lifecycle delivery through the ServiceIQ methodology\n\n[Arctiq]\n[ICON-GRAPHIC-1]\n\n## Target Outcomes\n* Improved facility safety and operational awareness\n* Centralized management across locations\n* Reduced infrastructure complexity\n* Enhanced compliance and audit readiness\n\n## FAQs\n\nHow is networked surveillance different from traditional systems?\n\nModern solutions integrate directly with enterprise networks for centralized visibility and\nscalability.\n\nCan physical security systems be protected from cyber threats?\n\nYes. Segmentation, identity controls, and secure architectures protect connected devices.\n\nDo you support multi site environments?\n\nYes. Solutions are designed for distributed campuses and facilities.\n\n## Ready to modernize surveillance and access control across your facilities?\n\n[Request a Consultation][79]\n[people-across-the-globe] Expert delivery capability\nacross North America\n[CTA-ICON-CLOUD]\n[Skip to main content][80]\n[SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark]\n* [ Home ][81]\n* Show submenu for Work Work\n* [ About ][82]\n* Show submenu for Portfolio Portfolio\n* [ SentryOne ][83]\n* [ Baker ][84]\n* [ EZ Texting ][85]\n* [ Careers ][86]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* [ Lead genereation ][87]\n