\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n* [Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure][76]\n* Compute & Storage\n\n# Compute & Storage\n\n##### Page Summary\n\nHybrid cloud compute and storage platforms provide the scalable infrastructure required to support\nmodern applications, analytics, and AI workloads. Arctiq evaluates existing infrastructure\nenvironments to identify capacity limitations and opportunities for modernization.\n\nOur architects design compute and storage platforms that support hybrid deployment models and\nevolving application demands. Implementation services deploy scalable infrastructure across data\ncenter and hybrid environments while integrating virtualization, networking, and resilience\nplatforms. Ongoing optimization ensures compute and storage resources remain aligned to workload\ngrowth, performance objectives, and operational efficiency.\n\n[Request a Consultation][77]\n\n## Core Offering Components\n\n###### Compute Platform Modernization\n\nDesign and deploy modern compute platforms that improve performance, scalability, and operational\nconsistency across data center and hybrid cloud environments.\n\n###### High-Performance & Software-Defined Storage\n\nImplement modern storage architectures that optimize throughput, resilience, and lifecycle\nmanagement for structured and unstructured workloads.\n\n###### AI-Ready Infrastructure Enablement\n\nPrepare infrastructure for AI and advanced analytics through GPU readiness, optimized data\npipelines, and scalable compute foundations.\n\n###### Hybrid Infrastructure Integration\n\nIntegrate compute and storage platforms across on-premises and cloud environments with consistent\noperational standards.\n\n###### Performance & Capacity Optimization\n\nContinuously analyze utilization, performance, and growth trends to ensure infrastructure remains\nefficient and scalable.\n\n[resource-library]\n\n###### Explore Our Resource Library\n\nInsights and guidance to help you modernize, secure and scale with confidence\n\n[Browse Resources][78]\n\n## Technology & Ecosystem Partners\n\n[dell logo]\n[This image is missing an alt tag]\n[Everpure logo]\n[Nvidia logo]\n[Nutanix logo]\n[This image is missing an alt tag]\n[Red_Hat_Logo_2019]\n\n## Why Choose Arctiq?\n* Hybrid-first infrastructure expertise\n* Performance-driven platform design\n* AI-ready infrastructure foundations\n* Integrated compute and data lifecycle strategy\n\n[Arctiq]\n[ICON-GRAPHIC-1]\n\n## Target Outcomes\n* Improved workload performance and scalability\n* AI-ready compute and storage environments\n* Reduced infrastructure complexity\n* Optimized utilization and lifecycle efficiency\n* Reliable hybrid platform operations\n\n## FAQs\n\nWhat workloads benefit most from modernization?\n\nBusiness-critical applications, analytics platforms, virtualization environments, and AI workloads\nbenefit from modern compute and storage architectures.\n\nCan modernization occur without downtime?\n\nYes. Migration and modernization approaches are designed to minimize disruption through phased\ndeployment and workload mobility.\n\nDoes this support hybrid environments?\n\nYes. Platforms are designed for consistent operation across on-premises and cloud environments.\n\n## Ready to modernize compute and storage platforms?\n\n[Request a Consultation][79]\n[people-across-the-globe] Expert delivery capability\nacross North America\n[CTA-ICON-CLOUD]\n[Skip 