            "text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Logo] [Arctiq-Logo-Default] ][2]\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][3]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][4]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][5]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][6]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][7]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][8]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][9]\n* [ ][10]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* [ Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][11]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][12]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][13]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][14]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][15]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][16]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][17]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][18]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][19]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][20]\n* [ Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ\nServices24x7 SOC & NOC** ][21]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][22]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][23]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][24]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][25]\n* [ See related resources ][26]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* [ About Us ][27]\n* [ Leadership Team ][28]\n* [ Careers ][29]\n* [ Locations ][30]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* [ Blog ][31]\n* [ Customer Stories ][32]\n* [ Resource Library ][33]\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n\n# Unified Communications as a Service\n\nOrganizations around the world are changing how they conduct business, from in-office to hybrid and\nfully remote models. Staying connected remains crucial for employees, partners and customers. While\nemail plays a role, teams collaborate through various tools like voice calls, web and video\nconferencing, voicemail, mobile apps, and instant messaging.\n\n[Connect With Us][76]\n\n### At Arctiq, we can assist you evaluate your existing Unified Communications solution and design a\n### tailored migration approach for your organization's needs adopting new cloud based technologies\n### like Webex Calling and Webex Contact Center.\n\n### [CISCO GOLD INTEGRATOR BLUE-2]\n\n[Event--endpoint-management]\n\n## Centralized and easy management\n\nTraditional on-premises PBX systems require training and expertise to operate. Cloud-based systems\nalleviate many of these challenges. Webex Calling offers a web-based portal, Control Hub, allowing\nyou to manage your phone system through a single pane of glass with a simplified interface.\n\n[Cloud-pak--for-business-automation]\n\n## Automatic Updates\n\nWith Webex Calling, your phone system is automatically updated as soon as new software is released.\nYour system is always running on the latest version, with regular checks for updates happening\nseamlessly in the background.\n\n[Encryption]\n\n## Data Encryption and Compliance\n\nThe platform provides end-to-end encryption to safeguard your business against potential threats.\nWebex Calling also complies with industry standards and regulations, such as HIPAA.\n\n[Continuous]\n\n## Business Continuity\n\nWebex Calling is hosted in the cloud and operates from secure, geographically distributed data\ncenters, in the event of a natural disaster or disruption in your physical locations, your calls can\nstill be routed to other phones or devices.\n\n[Saas--integration]\n\n## Flexibility & Integrations\n\nWhether you are ready to move your entire UC solution to the cloud, integrate your existing phone\nsystem or run a proof of concept we got you covered. Webex Calling supports hybrid models and\nintegration with Cisco CUCM and other On-Premises and cloud PBX systems.\n\n[ [Logo] ][77]\nStay informed about the latest technology trends and enterprise solutions\n\nBy subscribing, you agree to our privacy policy and consent to receive updates.\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][78]\n* [ [Youtube] ][79]\n* [COMPANY][80]\n* [About Us][81]\n* [Careers][82]\n* [Locations][83]\n* [SOLUTIONS][84]\n* [Hybrid Cloud\nInfrastructure][85]\n* [Network & Connected\nExperiences][86]\n* [Cybersecurity][87]\n* [Autonomous Operations & Intelligence][88]\n* [Data & AI][89]\n* [Enterprise Service\nManagement][90]\n* [SERVICES][91]\n* [Professional Methodology][92]\n* [Managed Services][93]\n* [Resource Management][94]\n* [Arctiq Capital][95]\n* [INDUSTRIES][96]\n* [Enterprise & Commercial][97]\n* [Government][98]\n* [Education][99]\n* [Healthcare][100]\n* [Utilities][101]\n* [Hospitality & Gaming][102]\n* [Tribal][103]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Arctiq, Inc. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][104]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][105]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://arctiq.com/?hsLang=en\n[3]:\n[4]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure\n[5]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/networking-and-connected-experiences\n[6]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/cybersecurity\n[7]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/autonomous-operations-intelligence\n[8]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/data-ai\n[9]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/enterprise-service-management\n[10]: https://arctiq.com/customer-stories/building-a-future-ready-data-platform-for-the-city-of-nort\nh-las-vegas\n[11]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq-methodology\n[12]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/insight\n[13]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/design\n[14]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/build\n[15]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/shift\n[16]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/enable\n[17]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/optimize\n[18]: https://arctiq.com/services/security-advisory-services\n[19]: https://arctiq.com/services/resource-management-services\n[20]: https://arctiq.com/services/arctiq-capital-services\n[21]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-services-overview\n[22]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure-managed-services\n[23]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/networking-connected-experiences-managed-services-arcti\n[24]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/cybersecurity-managed-services\n[25]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/managed-smartops\n[26]: https://arctiq.com/resources/resource-library\n[27]: https://arctiq.com/about-us\n[28]: https://arctiq.com/company/leadership-team\n[29]: https://arctiq.com/careers\n[30]: https://arctiq.com/company/locations\n[31]: https://arctiq.com/blog\n[32]: https://arctiq.com/customer-stories\n[33]: https://arctiq.com/resources/resource-library\n[34]: https://arctiq.com/upcoming-events\n[35]: https://arctiq.com/servtrax-portal-login\n[36]: https://arctiq.com/partners\n[37]: https://arctiq.com/government-contracts\n[38]:\n[39]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure\n[40]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/networking-and-connected-experiences\n[41]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/c