\n* [ Events ][34]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][35]\n* [ Partners ][36]\n* [ Government Contracts ][37]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* Show submenu for Solutions Solutions\n* Solutions\n* [ **Solutions That Deliver Outcomes** Explore how Arctiq helps organizations simplify\ncomplexity, secure their environments, and create real business value ][38]\n* [ [menu-infrastracture]**Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure**Resilient, AI-Ready Foundations ][39]\n* [ [networking]**Networking & Connected\nExperiences**Seamless, Secure Connectivity ][40]\n* [ [menu-cybersecurity]**Cybersecurity**Risk Reduction & Resilience ][41]\n* [ [menu-operations]**Autonomous Operations & Intelligence**Proactive, Self-Healing ][42]\n* [ [menu-data-ai]**Data & AI**Trusted Insights & Speed ][43]\n* [ [menu-esm]**Enterprise Service\nManagement**Velocity & Accountability ][44]\n* [ ][45]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* Show submenu for [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n[professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology**\n* [ [professional]**Professional Service^{IQ} Methodology** ][46]\n* [ Insight^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][47]\n* [ Design^{IQ}Strategy & Architecture > ][48]\n* [ Build^{IQ}Implementation & Deployment > ][49]\n* [ Shift^{IQ}Knowledge Transfer & Training > ][50]\n* [ Enable^{IQ}Continuous Improvement > ][51]\n* [ Optimize^{IQ}Assessments & Advisory > ][52]\n* [ [advisory]**Security Advisory Services** ][53]\n* [ [resources]**Resource Management Services** ][54]\n* [ [capital]**Arctiq Capital Services** ][55]\n* Show submenu for [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7\nSOC & NOC**\n* [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC**\n* [ [managed]**ManagedIQ Services24x7 SOC & NOC** ][56]\n* [ Hybrid Cloud Infrastructure Managed Services ][57]\n* [ Networking & Connected Experiences Managed Services ][58]\n* [ Cybersecurity Managed Services ][59]\n* [ Managed SmartOps ][60]\n* [ See related resources ][61]\n* Show submenu for Company Company\n* Company\n* [ About Us ][62]\n* [ Leadership Team ][63]\n* [ Careers ][64]\n* [ Locations ][65]\n* Show submenu for Resources Resources\n* Resources\n* [ Blog ][66]\n* [ Customer Stories ][67]\n* [ Resource Library ][68]\n* [ Events ][69]\n* [ ServTrax Portal ][70]\n* [ Partners ][71]\n* [ Government Contracts ][72]\n* Search\n* [Contact Us][73]\n[Contact Us][74]\nSearch\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][75]\n* [Networking & Connected Experiences][76]\n* Data & Voice Connectivity\n\n# Data & Voice Connectivity\n\n##### Page Summary\n\nArctiq helps organizations design, procure, and manage carrier connectivity including internet,\nMPLS, private circuits, SD-WAN, global network services, SIP trunking, and voice services. As more\nbusiness systems move to cloud platforms and SaaS services, connectivity has become a critical\nfoundation for performance, resiliency, and user experience.\n\nWithout intentional design, connectivity often becomes a best-effort service, with limited\nredundancy, inconsistent performance, and rising costs. Arctiq ensures carrier connectivity is\naligned with application requirements, business priorities, and long-term network architecture.\n\n[Request a Consultation][77]\n\n## Core Offering Components\n\n###### Carrier Strategy & Network Architecture\n\nEvaluate business requirements and design WAN architectures that align carrier connectivity with\napplication performance, resiliency, and cost objectives.\n\n###### Carrier Procurement & Competitive Sourcing\n\nSource and negotiate internet, MPLS, Ethernet, and private connectivity services across multiple\nproviders to ensure the best combination of performance, coverage, and pricing.\n\n###### Location-Based Carrier Analysis\n\nAssess regional carrier capabilities and availability to design connectivity that optimizes\nperformance and redundancy at each site.\n\n###### Global Connectivity Services\n\nSupport enterprise connectivity requirements across multiple regions and providers, ensuring\nconsistent performance and coverage for distributed organizations.\n\n###### Network Performance & SLA Monitoring\n\nContinuously monitor carrier performance and service levels to maintain reliability and proactively\naddress connectivity issues.\n\n###### Carrier Lifecycle Management\n\nManage renewals, service changes, escalations, and vendor relationships to simplify operations and\nreduce administrative overhead.\n\n[resource-library]\n\n###### Explore Our Resource Library\n\nInsights and guidance to help you modernize, secure and scale with confidence\n\n[Browse Resources][78]\n\n###### Carrier Reality\n* Carrier providers optimize for network capacity and stability, not necessarily your architecture\nor cost efficiency. An independent partner ensures connectivity is continuously aligned to\napplication performance, resiliency, and cost objectives.\n\n## Technology & Ecosystem Partners\n\n[cisco logo]\n[Fortinet_logo.svg]\n[Juniper_Networks-rgb-black]\n[Hpe-aruba-networking-logo]\n[palo-alto]\n\n## Why Choose Arctiq?\n* Carrier-neutral advisory and sourcing expertise\n* Deep relationships with global and regional carriers\n* Integrated network, cloud, and security architecture knowledge\n* Lifecycle execution through the ServiceIQ methodology\n\n[Arctiq]\n[ICON-GRAPHIC-1]\n\n## Target Outcomes\n* Reliable global connectivity aligned to application performance\n* Reduced carrier costs through competitive sourcing and optimization\n* Improved resiliency through intentional connectivity design\n* Simplified vendor management and operational oversight\n\n## FAQs\n\nWhy should organizations regularly review carrier services?\n\nCarrier capabilities, pricing, and local availability change frequently. Regular reviews ensure\nconnectivity remains aligned with application demands and business priorities.\n\nHow does carrier strategy impact cloud adoption?\n\nCloud platforms and SaaS applications depend on high-quality internet and private connectivity.\nProper carrier design improves performance, reliability, and user experience.\n\nHow does this integrate with SD-WAN?\n\nCarrier connectivity provides the underlying transport that SD-WAN platforms use to deliver\nintelligent routing, application optimization, and resiliency.\n\n## Ready to optimize your data and voice connectivity?\n\n[Request a Consultation][79]\n[people-across-the-globe] Expert delivery capability\nacross North America\n[CTA-ICON-CLOUD]\n[Skip to main content][80]\n[SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark] [SR Logo Dark]\n* [ Home ][81]\n* Show submenu for Work Work\n* [ About ][82]\n* Show submenu for Portfolio Portfolio\n* [ SentryOne ][83]\n* [ Baker ][84]\n* [ EZ Texting ][85]\n* [ Careers ][86]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* [ Lead genereation ][87]\n* [ Growth marketing ][88]\n* [ Website design ][89]\n* [ Blog ][90]\nOpen main navigation Close main navigation\n* [ Home ][91]\n* Show submenu for Work Work\n* Work\n* [ About ][92]\n* Show submenu for Portfolio Portfolio\n* Portfolio\n* [ SentryOne ][93]\n* [ Baker ][94]\n* [ EZ Texting ][95]\n* [ Careers ][96]\n* Show submenu for Services Services\n* Services\n* [ Lead genereation ][97]\n* [ Growth marketing ][98]\n* [ Website design ][99]\n* [ Blog ][100]\n* [Get Started][101]\n[Get Started][102]\n[ Customer Story Building a Future-Ready Data Platform for the City of North Las Vegas From Data\nSilos to Citywide Intelligence ][103]\n[ [Logo] ][104]\nStay informed about the latest technology trends and enterprise solutions\n\nBy subscribing, you agree to our privacy policy and consent to receive updates.\n* [ [LinkedIn] ][105]\n* [ [Youtube] ][106]\n* [COMPANY][107]\n* [About Us][108]\n* [Careers][109]\n* [Locations][110]\n* [SOLUTIONS][111]\n* [Hybrid Cloud\nInfrastructure][112]\n* [Network & Connected\nExperiences][113]\n* [Cybersecurity][114]\n* [Autonomous Operations & Intelligence][115]\n* [Data & AI][116]\n* [Enterprise Service\nManagement][117]\n* [SERVICES][118]\n* [Professional Methodology][119]\n* [Managed Services][120]\n* [Resource Management][121]\n* [Arctiq Capital][122]\n* [INDUSTRIES][123]\n* [Enterprise & Commercial][124]\n* [Government][125]\n* [Education][126]\n* [Healthcare][127]\n* [Utilities][128]\n* [Hospitality & Gaming][129]\n* [Tribal][130]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Arctiq, Inc. All rights reserved.\n* [Privacy Policy][131]\n* [Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information][132]\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: https://arctiq.com/?hsLang=en\n[3]:\n[4]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure\n[5]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/networking-and-connected-experiences\n[6]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/cybersecurity\n[7]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/autonomous-operations-intelligence\n[8]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/data-ai\n[9]: https://arctiq.com/solutions/enterprise-service-management\n[10]: https://arctiq.com/customer-stories/building-a-future-ready-data-platform-for-the-city-of-nort\nh-las-vegas\n[11]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq-methodology\n[12]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/insight\n[13]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/design\n[14]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/build\n[15]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/shift\n[16]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/enable\n[17]: https://arctiq.com/services/service-iq/optimize\n[18]: https://arctiq.com/services/security-advisory-services\n[19]: https://arctiq.com/services/resource-management-services\n[20]: https://arctiq.com/services/arctiq-capital-services\n[21]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-services-overview\n[22]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/hybrid-cloud-infrastructure-managed-services\n[23]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/networking-connected-experiences-managed-services-arcti\n[24]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/cybersecurity-managed-services\n[25]: https://arctiq.com/services/managed-iq/managed-smartops\n[26]: https://arctiq.com/resources/resource-library\n[27]: https://arctiq.com/about-us\n[28]: https://arctiq.com/company/leadership-team\n[29]: https://arctiq.com/careers\n[30]: https://arctiq.com/company/locations\n[31]: https://"
