      "key_products": "Cybersecurity Managed Services, Security Advisory Services, Vulnerability & Exposure Management, Integrated Surveillance Architecture, Privileged Access Management (PAM)",
      "polished_summary": "Arctiq specializes in simplifying complexity and enhancing security for organizations through innovative IT solutions and managed services. Their core offerings include hybrid cloud infrastructure, enterprise networking, cybersecurity, and data-driven intelligence, all designed to empower businesses to modernize their IT environments and drive real value. Targeting organizations across various sectors, Arctiq focuses on delivering outcomes that enhance operational efficiency and resilience in an increasingly digital landscape.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Arctiq provides cybersecurity services and managed services that enhance security for organizations, which is directly relevant to Cyber-Physical Systems Security. Their offerings include cybersecurity managed services and security advisory services, which are critical for protecting cyber-physical systems.",
