      "polished_summary": "Assembly Machinery is a leading manufacturer and supplier of automation equipment, specializing in assembly machinery and systems tailored for various industrial applications. The company offers a diverse range of products, including assembly equipment, automated storage systems, collaborative robots, and custom machinery, catering primarily to manufacturers across multiple sectors such as healthcare, logistics, and construction. With a focus on enhancing operational efficiency, Assembly Machinery provides innovative automation solutions designed to meet the unique needs of its clients.",
