            "text": "Base Automation &#8211; Welcome To Base Automation\n\nWelcome To Base Automation\n\nToggle navigation\n\nCall Us\n++91 8056273540\n\nToggle navigation\n\nHome\n\nServices\n\nControl Automation\n\nWeighing &#038; Batching Systems\n\nMES\n\nTraceability\n\nProduction Operations\n\nQuality Operations\n\nInventory Operations\n\nMaintenance Operations\n\nERP Integration\n\nUnified Namespace\n\nBusiness Intelligence\n\nCloud Data Enablement\n\nIndustry 4.0 Assessments\n\nIndustries\n\nTyre &#038; Rubber\n\nAutomotive\n\nAuto Components\n\nEV Battery\n\nLife Science \u2013 Pharma\n\nFood and Beverages\n\nConsumer Goods\n\nData Centers\n\nMetals\n\nChemicals &#038; Petrochemicals\n\nAbout Us\n\nCulture\n\nTeam\n\nPartners\n\nResources\n\nCareers\n\nEnquiry\n\nCase Studies\n\nDownload our brochures\nGet In Touch\n\nSuccessfully transforming the Industrial Manufacturing Business to achieve excellence for over 25 years!\n\n276, 2nd Main Road, Nehru Nagar,\n\nKottivakkam, OMR, Chennai \u2013 600096, India.\n\n: +91 8056273540\n\n( 91 8056273540)\n\nMonday - Friday\n\nSystems Integration\n\nInformation Solutions\nDigitally Transform, Thrive!\n\nI4.0 Consulting\n\nDriving Innovation for\nManufacturers Worldwide\n\nIndustrial Automation\n\nFOR SMARTER\nBUSINESS\nDECISIONS\n\nFUTURE-PROOF\nSOLUTIONS\nAutomated SCADA, MES, and\nIIoT solutions that collect\nand present real-time data\n\nEnergizing Automation \u2013 safely delivering\ndigitally-enabled solutions that optimize\nand sustain your operations.\n\nTECHNICAL\n\nINNOVATORS\n\nPROCESS\nEXPERTS,\n\nOffices Across the Globe\n\nYears of Automation Business\n\n120+\n\nTrained Engineers\n\n400+\n\nCustomers in India\n\n4000+\n\nSuccessful Projects Executed\n\nOffices Across the Globe\n\nYears of Automation Business\n\n120+\n\nTrained Engineers\n\n400+\n\nCustomers in India\n\n4000+\n\nSuccessful Projects Executed\n\nWHAT WE DO\n\nCONTROL AUTOMATION\n\nRegardless of the technology platform of your machine, or lack thereof.\n\nINFORMATION SYSTEMS\n\nCombining decades of our experience working on different OT and IT Technology platforms.\n\nINDUSTRY 4.0 CONSULTING\n\nWe help you with the digital maturity assessment of your factory and define an Industry 4.0 strategic roadmap.\n\nIndia | UAE | USA | UK\n\nWe are working together with our clients and partners to maintain production and delivery of products and medicines needed to keep our communities healthy.\n\nLike you, we are committed to keeping our employees safe.\n\nWe use advanced technologies to remotely deliver projects to ensure employee health &amp; safety, with increased efficiencies and lower costs.\n\nRead More\n\nAbout us\n\nOur Company Mission\n\nBASE Automation Technologies Pvt. Ltd. (BATPL) is an ISO 9001:2015 company, incorporated in the year 1995 in Chennai, India with a primary focus on providing Industrial Solutions to manufacturing industries through our Automation and Software services.\n\nBASE aims to be the best technology service provider and to be the catalyst in solving various challenges faced by the manufacturing industries through our technical and conceptual system integration expertise.\n\nRead More\n\nProfessional Team\n\nGroup Companies\n\nChallenge Accepted!\n\nOne of the common challenges faced by the manufacturers is keeping up with the fast-changing technology. Due to constant changes in hardware and software, the deployed control platforms and software elements become obsolete, or sometimes lead to compatibility issues. Those technologies need to be upgraded to ensure maintenance support, which in turn reduces the cost of downtime and inventory.\n\nAgility\n\nWe have a relentless focus on delivering valuable output each week. Instead of long processes, we consistently find and solve immediate problems, test, and adjust along the way.\n\nOut-of-the-box thinking\n\nStay ahead of the ever-changing customer requirements and business needs with flexible, intuitive, and scalable features that evolve alongside you.\n\nEliminating risks\n\nYou get a stable solution built using varied platform and tested in your own company!\n\nTechnology Expertise\n\n120 +\n\nCertified Engineers\n\n12 +\n\nCountries\n\n40 +\n\nHappy Clients\n\n40 +\n\nProject Completed\n\nCertified Engineers\n\nCountries\n\nHappy Clients\n\nCompleted\n\nCertified Engineers\n\nCountries\n\nHappy Clients\n\nCompleted\n\nwhat you get\n\nAvid Capabilities\n\nEnd-User to Enterprise Strategic Integration\n\nProcess Controls System Design\n\nIndustrial Processes and Process Control\n\nBatch Process Design and Implementation\n\nIIoT Integration/Smart Manufacturing Programs\n\nMES/MOM\n\nOT Infrastructure\n\nProcess Optimization/Advanced Analytics\n\nCondition Monitoring\n\nVision\n\nOur Customers\n\n276, 2nd Main Road, Nehru Nagar, Kottivakkam, OMR, Chennai \u2013 600096, India.\n\n+91 8056273540\n\nconsult@batpl.com\n\nAbout Us\n\nSuccessfully transforming the Industrial Manufacturing Business to achieve excellence for over 25 years!\n\nOur Solutions\n- Home\n\n- About Us\n\n- Contact Us\n\n- Careers\n\n- Privacy Policy\n\n- Disclaimer\n\nQuick Links\n- Automation\n\n- Industry\n\n- MES Modules\n\n- Tyre &#038; Rubber\n\nSocial Info\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 Base Automation. All Rights Reserved.\n\nDeveloped by : Cubic Designz\n\nGrandpashabet 8230\n\nGrandpashabet 8229\n\nHoliganbet 7608\n\nHoliganbet 7607\n\nJojobet 8185\n\nJojobet 8184\n\nGrandpashabet 8230\n\nGrandpashabet 8229\n\nHoliganbet 7608\n\nHoliganbet 7607\n\nJojobet 8185\n\nJojobet 8184\n\nGrandpashabet 8230\n\nGrandpashabet 8229\n\nHoliganbet 7608\n\nHoliganbet 7607\n\nJojobet 8185\n\nJojobet 8184\n\nGrandpashabet 8230\n\nGrandpashabet 8229\n\nHoliganbet 7608\n\nHoliganbet 7607\n\nJojobet 8185\n\nJojobet 8184\n\nGrandpashabet 8230\n\nGrandpashabet 8229\n\nHoliganbet 7608\n\nHoliganbet 7607\n\nJojobet 8185\n\nJojobet 8184\n\nGrandpashabet 8230\n\nGrandpashabet 8229\n\nHoliganbet 7608\n\nHoliganbet 7607\n\nJojobet 8185\n\nJojobet 818