            "text": "### Welcome To Base Automation\n\nToggle navigation\n[ [Base Automation] ][1]\n* **Call Us**\n[++91 8056273540][2]\nToggle navigation\n* [Home][3]\n* [Services][4]\n* [Control Automation][5]\n* [Weighing & Batching Systems][6]\n* [MES][7]\n* [Traceability][8]\n* [Production Operations][9]\n* [Quality Operations][10]\n* [Inventory Operations][11]\n* [Maintenance Operations][12]\n* [ERP Integration][13]\n* [Unified Namespace][14]\n* [Business Intelligence][15]\n* [Cloud Data Enablement][16]\n* [Industry 4.0 Assessments][17]\n* [Industries][18]\n* [Tyre & Rubber][19]\n* [Automotive][20]\n* [Auto Components][21]\n* [EV Battery][22]\n* [Life Science \u2013 Pharma][23]\n* [Food and Beverages][24]\n* [Consumer Goods][25]\n* [Data Centers][26]\n* [Metals][27]\n* [Chemicals & Petrochemicals][28]\n* [About Us][29]\n* [Culture][30]\n* [Team][31]\n* [Partners][32]\n* [Resources][33]\n* [Careers][34]\n* [Enquiry][35]\n* [Case Studies][36]\n* [Download our brochures][37]\n[Get In Touch][38]\n[\u00d7][39]\n[ [Base Automation] ][40]\n\nSuccessfully transforming the Industrial Manufacturing Business to achieve excellence for over 25\nyears!\n\n##### 276, 2nd Main Road, Nehru Nagar,\n\nKottivakkam, OMR, Chennai \u2013 600096, India.\n\n##### : +91 8056273540\n\n( 91 8056273540)\n\n##### Monday - Friday\n\n# About us\n\n[Home Base Automation][41] > About us\n\n### ABOUT US\n\n# We Have 25+ Years Of Experience in providing complex Industrial Automation solutions.\n\nBASE Automation Technologies Pvt Ltd BATPL is an ISO 9001:2015 company, incorporated in the year\n1995 in Chennai, India with a primary focus on providing Industrial Solutions to manufacturing\nindustries through our Automation and Software services. BASE aims to be the best technology service\nprovider and to be the catalyst in solving various challenges faced by the manufacturing industries\nthrough our technical and conceptual system integration expertise.\n\nBATPL take immense pride in being a distinguished member of the Control System Integrators\nAssociation (CSIA) and are delighted to announce that we have achieved CSIA certification. As a\nleading control system integration company in India, this certification further exemplifies our\ncommitment to delivering exceptional services and upholding the highest global industry standards\n\nOur business philosophy is \u201c**Concept to Reality\u201d **\u2013 we strive to be the best consultants to\nour customers by showcasing value benefits for their investments, by turning their \u201c**Ideas in to\nProfits\u201d**. Through our engagement with our supplier partners, we create a win-win partnership by\nutilizing their value propositions to fulfill our customer\u2019s expectations.\n\nHighly competent resources are the fundamental success driver for our business. We strive to be the\nbest in employee engagement by nurturing talented professionals by continuous training in new\ntechnologies and by being an equal opportunity employer.\n\nCertified Engineer\n+ 0\nWorldwide Clients\n+ 0\nProjects Completed\n+ 0\n\n## Our Vision\n\nVision\nMission\nValues\nVision\n\nTo be the best at identifying, qualifying and delivering information enabled engineering solutions\nand services that enhance our customers\u2019 bottom line and help them gain competitive advantage in\ntheir market.\n\nMission\n\nTo sustain our vision by constantly applying new technologies and best business practices through\ncontinuous education and learning.\n\nTo enhance and develop diversified markets which provide stability and adequate financial returns\nwhich allow us to achieve our vision through strategic partnerships with our principles and vendors.\n\nValues\n\nTo provide a pleasant nurturing and growth oriented environment which encourage our employees to be\nhighly productive and grow personally and professionally.\n\n## Company History\n\n## Our Strengths\n\n[img]\n\n##### Latest Technologies\n\nWe continuously strive to expand our expertise