      "company_summary": "C2A Security is an innovative provider of AI-based, context-driven product security orchestration solutions tailored for software-defined products in heavily regulated sectors such as healthcare, automotive, and industrial. Their comprehensive suite of offerings, including the EVSec Platform and various analysis and management tools, empowers organizations to effectively manage product security throughout the software development lifecycle, ensuring compliance and enhancing overall cybersecurity posture.",
