        "crawl_text": "C2A Security Ltd. Compliant with global cybersecurity standards such as FDA, ISA/IEC 62443, ISO/SAE 21434, UN R155. North America Europe Asia European Startup Prize for Mobility 2023 Smart Mobility Award for Best Collaboration of the Year 2024 MIH STARTUP AMBASSADOR 2022 AUTO CS CHINA 2022 CYBERSECURITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM 2022 AUTOMOTIVE CYBERSECURITY SOLUTIONS OF THE YEAR CES INNOVATION AWARDS 2022 HONOREE AI-driven contextual analysis Advanced security automation Automated compliance reporting Unique context-driven approach to product security Integration with existing workflows Focus on heavily regulated sectors FDA premarket & postmarket guidelines ISA/IEC 62443 ISO/SAE 21434 UN R155 Jerusalem, Israel Munich, Germany USA Israel Germany USA China Global C2A Security is positioned as a leader in product security for regulated industries. The company leverages AI to enhance cybersecurity processes and compliance. C2A Security's platform is designed to integrate seamlessly with existing workflows. C2A Security has expanded its offerings to include advanced AI-driven tools for threat intelligence and risk management. The company has formed partnerships with major players in the healthcare and automotive sectors. To enhance product security across the software development lifecycle. To automate compliance reporting and risk management processes. The rapidly evolving cybersecurity landscape poses ongoing challenges for product security. Regulatory compliance requirements are becoming increasingly stringent. Growing demand for cybersecurity solutions in the automotive and healthcare sectors. Expansion into new geographic markets. C2A Security is recognized as a pioneering force in the cybersecurity landscape, particularly for software-defined products in regulated industries. Increased regulatory scrutiny in cybersecurity. Rising demand for secure software development practices. C2A Security - The Only Risk-Driven DevSecOps Platform | C2A Security - The Only Risk-Driven DevSecOps Platform\n\nCareers Form\n\n&quot; &nbsp; &quot; indicates required fields\n\nFirst name* &nbsp;\n\nFirst\n\nLast name* &nbsp;\n\nFirst\n\nEmail* &nbsp;\n\nCell Phone* &nbsp;\n\nLinkedIn profile* &nbsp;\n\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form Position*\n\nAttach resume* &nbsp;\nMax. file size: 256 MB.\n\nAttach Cover letter\nMax. file size: 256 MB.\nUntitled\n\nI would like to receive updates from C2A Security. I can unsubscribe at any time.\nUsing your personal data &nbsp;\n\nI consent to the use of my personal information.\n\nWe're committed to protect your privacy. C2A Security uses the information you provide to us to contact you about our products and services. You may unsubscribe from these communications at any time. For information on how to unsubscribe, as well as our privacy practices and commitment to protecting your privacy, please review our Privacy Policy .\n\nOffice Administrator\n\nProducts\n\nEVSec Platform\n\nEVSec Analysis\n\nEVSec BOM &#038; Vulnerability Management\n\nEVSec Attacker\n\nEVSec Network &#038; Endpoint Protection\n\nEVSec SOC Enrichment &amp; Analytics\n\nEVSec AutoSynth AI\n\nUse Cases\n\nMedical and Healthcare\n\nIntegrations\n\nBlog\n\nCompany\n\nAbout\n\nEvents\n\nCareers\n\nContact\n\nSchedule a Demo\n\nProducts\n\nEVSec Platform\n\nEVSec Analysis\n\nEVSec BOM &#038; Vulnerability Management\n\nEVSec Attacker\n\nEVSec Network &#038; Endpoint Protection\n\nEVSec SOC Enrichment &amp; Analytics\n\nEVSec AutoSynth AI\n\nUse Cases\n\nMedical and Healthcare\n\nIntegrations\n\nBlog\n\nCompany\n\nAbout\n\nEvents\n\nCareers\n\nContact\n\nSchedule a Demo\n\nTransforming Product Security from\n\na Limitation to a Business Value Multiplier\n\nThe Only Context-based Product Security Orchestration Platform\n\nWatch our Webinar: From CVE Alert to Patient Risk\n\nAutomated Cybersecurity DevOps Platform\n\nFortify the Future of Cyber-Physical Systems &amp; Software Defined Products\n\nFortify the Future of Cyber-Physical Systems &amp; Software Defined Products\n\nAccelerate innovation while strengthening product security &#8211; transforming cybersecurity into a competitive advantage and unlocking greater business value.\n\nFrom embedded systems to cloud-connected devices &#8211;\nEnsure robust cybersecurity from design through deployment across sectors such as healthcare, manufacturing, critical infrastructure, mobility and more.\n\nMeet evolving regulations and manage software complexity &#8211; With enterprise-grade DevSecOps workflows that unify fragmented supply chains, reduce risk, and accelerate time to compliance.\n\nOne Platform for True Dynamic Risk Management\n\nContext can be achieved only via a holistic platform.\nThe complexity of managing software at scale and releasing secure and compliant products faster requires a comprehensive, risk-driven approach to balance between product security and the need to develop and operate software.\nAs industries increasingly deploy cyber-physical systems (CPS), security must be architected in from the very beginning to protect digital and physical assets across complex supply chains.\nC2A Security enables product security teams to embed Security-by-Design principles and scale cybersecurity across the entire software development lifecycle &#8211; from design to deployment &#8211; with automation, compliance, and complete visibility built in.\nEVSec is the only true, continuous, context-driven risk management platform across the entire product lifecycle.\n\nEnsure Regulatory Compliance\nMeet global cybersecurity standards such as the FDA premarket &amp; postmarket guidelines, ISA/IEC 62443, ISO/SAE 21434, UN R155 and more, while maintaining a full audit trail for seamless certification.\n\nAutomate Threat Modeling\nAutomatically, and continuously identify, prioritize and mitigate security vulnerabilities for every software product.\n\nStreamline Supply Chain Collaboration\nFoster collaboration between internal teams and vendors, delegate tasks with the click of a button, and break down communication silos for productive cybersecurity processes.\n\nEmpower Developers\nFree developers to focus on what matters - releasing new features via increased process efficiencies and integrating complementing products in the toolchain.\n\nLeverage Generative AI\nUnleash the power of Generative AI to\nexpedite threat intelligence and risk\nmanagement with a dedicated\ninfrastructure layer.\n\nFlooring the Pedal on Compliance and Software Innovation\n\n80%\n\nReduction of development costs\n\n200%\n\nIncrease in new product innovation\n\n75%\n\nFaster TARA process\n\nOur partners\n\n\u201cAt Elekta, we\u2019re committed to providing safe, resilient solutions to our customers. Our collaboration with C2A Security will enable us to integrate cybersecurity throughout our product portfolio, helping us meet compliance requirements while keeping our systems secure.\u201d\n\nJohn Chenoweth\n\nChief Product Security Officer, Elekta\n\n&#8220;We believe this integration with C2A Security will be a milestone in product cybersecurity automation and vulnerability management, aiming to better comply with UN Regulation No. 155, ISO/SAE 21434 standards, among others.&#8221;\n\nTin N.\n\nDirector\n\n&#8220;Thank you for this great product and your work!&#8221;\n\nJoachim Bozler\n\nSenior Security Expert\n\n&#8220;That&#8217;s a very cool risk management product you&#8217;ve got there, exactly what we need, and I haven&#8217;t seen that before.&#8221;\n\nAnonymous\n\n\u201cThis is a powerful tool for any company to have, and we\u2019re excited about the collaboration with C2A Security and the value it can bring to our customers.\u201d\n\nPiyush Karkare\u200b\n\nGlobal Director, Automotive Solutions\u200b\n\n&#8220;C2A Security shares the same vision as MIH, in offering a seamless and holistic approach to automotive cybersecurity over the entire lifecycle.&#8221;\n\nJack Cheng\n\nCEO\n\n&#8220;Fuzz testing, with C2A Security&#8217;s solution, enables early discovery of vulnerabilities hence reducing the time needed to deliver SW and products.&#8221;\n\nCosimo Senni Guidotti Magnani\n\nGlobal Product Cyber Security Manager\n\n\u201cWe want to apply our expertise in cybersecurity to the connected car sector, thanks to our global Automotive Security Test Center and to our collaboration with C2A Security, NTT DATA will be an international reference point to protect connected cars from cyber-attacks and ensure the drivers&#8217; safety.\u201d\n\nMarco Garelli\n\nHead of Automotive\n\n&#8220;We have deeply felt the growth of the intelligent connected vehicle business and cybersecurity is an indispensable part of the intelligent connected vehicle. The cooperation with C2A Security provides cybersecurity solutions for the whole lifecycle of connected vehicles in China. We look forward to expanding the cooperation globally and bringing the vehicle industry to a safer future.&#8221;\n\nWenguang Wu\n\nExecutive President\n\nC2A Security is the future of cybersecurity, and with their technologies to automate security, together, we will go further in monitoring, preventing risk, identifing and mitigating vulnerabilities.\n\nGeoffrey Bouquot\n\nGroup Chief Technology Officer &amp; Senior Vice President Strategy\n\nLearn More About Our DevSecOps Platform\n\nAnalysis\n\nEnsures adhering to regulations and standards with automated TARA\n\nBOM &amp; Vulnerability Management\n\nAutomates risk management, identifies and mitigates the impact of vulnerabilities\n\nAttacker\n\nSpeeds-up vulnerability detection by automating fuzz and pen testing\n\nNetwork &amp; Endpoint Protection\n\nSecures the mobility ecosystem through real-time on-board protection\n\nSOC Enrichment &amp; Analytics\n\nBridge the gap between the SOC and the product with an integrated event and analysis management module\n\nAutoSynth AI\n\nAccelerates threat intelligence and risk management with AutoSynth infrastructure layer\n\nAward Winning Solution\n\nEuropean Startup Prize for Mobility 2023\n\nMIH STARTUP AMBASSADOR 2022\n\nAUTO CS CHINA 2022 CYBERSECURITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM\n\n2022 AUTOMOTIVE CYBERSECURITY SOLUTIONS OF THE YEAR\n\nCES INNOVATION AWARDS 2022 HONOREE\n\nS ## Careers Form\n\n\" \" indicates required fields\n\nFirst name*\nFirst\nLast name*\nFirst\nEmail*\nCell Phone*\nLinkedIn profile*\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPosition*\nAttach resume*\nMax. file size: 256 MB.\nAttach Cover letter\nMax. file size: 256 MB.\nUntitled\nI would like to receive updates from C2A Security. I can unsubscribe at any time.\nUsing your personal data\nI consent to the use of my personal information.\n\nWe're committed to protect your privacy. C2A Security uses the information you provide to us to\ncontact you about our products and services. You may unsubscribe from these communications at any\ntime. For information on how to unsubscribe, as well as our privacy practices and commitment to\nprotecting your privacy, please review our [Privacy Policy ][1].\n\n## Office Administrator\n* Products\n* [EVSec Platform][2]\n* [EVSec Analysis][3]\n* [EVSec BOM & Vulnerability Management][4]\n* [EVSec Attacker][5]\n* [EVSec Network & Endpoint Protection][6]\n* [EVSec SOC Enrichment & Analytics][7]\n* [EVSec AutoSynth AI][8]\n* [Use Cases][9]\n* [Medical and Healthcare][10]\n* [Integrations][11]\n* [Blog][12]\n* Company\n* [About][13]\n* [Events][14]\n* [Careers][15]\n* [Contact][16]\n* [Schedule a Demo][17]\n* Products\n* [EVSec Platform][18]\n* [EVSec Analysis][19]\n* [EVSec BOM & Vulnerability Management][20]\n* [EVSec Attacker][21]\n* [EVSec Network & Endpoint Protection][22]\n* [EVSec SOC Enrichment & Analytics][23]\n* [EVSec AutoSynth AI][24]\n* [Use Cases][25]\n* [Medical and Healthcare][26]\n* [Integrations][27]\n* [Blog][28]\n* Company\n* [About][29]\n* [Events][30]\n* [Careers][31]\n* [Contact][32]\n* [Schedule a Demo][33]\n\n# Driving Innovation:\n\n# Paving the Way with Product Security Excellence\n\nPioneering the Context-Driven Approach towards Product Security in a Software-Defined World\n\n## From a Company-Wide Restraint to a Catalyst for Business Growth\n\nC2A Security is the only AI-based, context-driven product security orchestration platform that\naddresses the specific needs of software-defined products in heavily regulated sectors.\n\nFounded in 2016, C2A Security\u2019s customers and te"
