            "text": "## Careers Form\n\n\" \" indicates required fields\n\nFirst name*\nFirst\nLast name*\nFirst\nEmail*\nCell Phone*\nLinkedIn profile*\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPosition*\nAttach resume*\nMax. file size: 256 MB.\nAttach Cover letter\nMax. file size: 256 MB.\nUntitled\nI would like to receive updates from C2A Security. I can unsubscribe at any time.\nUsing your personal data\nI consent to the use of my personal information.\n\nWe're committed to protect your privacy. C2A Security uses the information you provide to us to\ncontact you about our products and services. You may unsubscribe from these communications at any\ntime. For information on how to unsubscribe, as well as our privacy practices and commitment to\nprotecting your privacy, please review our [Privacy Policy ][1].\n\n## Office Administrator\n* Products\n* [EVSec Platform][2]\n* [EVSec Analysis][3]\n* [EVSec BOM & Vulnerability Management][4]\n* [EVSec Attacker][5]\n* [EVSec Network & Endpoint Protection][6]\n* [EVSec SOC Enrichment & Analytics][7]\n* [EVSec AutoSynth AI][8]\n* [Use Cases][9]\n* [Medical and Healthcare][10]\n* [Integrations][11]\n* [Blog][12]\n* Company\n* [About][13]\n* [Events][14]\n* [Careers][15]\n* [Contact][16]\n* [Schedule a Demo][17]\n* Products\n* [EVSec Platform][18]\n* [EVSec Analysis][19]\n* [EVSec BOM & Vulnerability Management][20]\n* [EVSec Attacker][21]\n* [EVSec Network & Endpoint Protection][22]\n* [EVSec SOC Enrichment & Analytics][23]\n* [EVSec AutoSynth AI][24]\n* [Use Cases][25]\n* [Medical and Healthcare][26]\n* [Integrations][27]\n* [Blog][28]\n* Company\n* [About][29]\n* [Events][30]\n* [Careers][31]\n* [Contact][32]\n* [Schedule a Demo][33]\n\n## Driving Innovation:\n\n# Paving the Way with Product Security Excellence\n\n[Deloitte logo]\n\n### Germany\n\n(C2A Security GmbH) Munich, Germany\n\n### Israel\n\nRAD Building, 16 Hartom St., Jerusalem\n\n### USA\n\n+1-720-467-6563\n\n### China\n\nItbigtec Technology Co., Ltd. WeChat: 13533491614\n\n## Contact Us\n\n###### General Inquiries\n\n[ [email protected] ][34]\n\n###### Customer Support\n\n[ [email protected] ][35]\n\n###### Partner with C2A Security\n\n[ [email protected] ][36]\n\n###### Book a Demo\n\n[ [email protected] ][37]\n\n###### Career Opportunities\n\n[ [email protected] ][38]\n\n## Follow Us\n* [ LinkedIn ][39]\n* [ Twitter ][40]\n* [ Facebook ][41]\n\n###### General Inquiries\n\n[ [email protected] ][42]\n\n###### Customer Support\n\n[ [email protected] ][43]\n\n###### Partner with C2A Security\n\n[ [email protected] ][44]\n\n###### Book a Demo\n\n[ [email protected] ][45]\n\n###### Career Opportunities\n\n[ [email protected] ][46]\n\n## Follow Us\n* [ LinkedIn ][47]\n* [ Twitter ][48]\n* [ Facebook ][49]\n\n## Follow Us\n* [ LinkedIn ][50]\n* [ Twitter ][51]\n* [ Facebook ][52]\n\nJoin our newsletter\n* [ LinkedIn ][53]\n* [ Twitter ][54]\n* [ Facebook ][55]\n* \u00a9 2026 All rights reserved [**C2A-SEC LTD **][56]\n* [ Privacy Policy ][57]\n[ Facebook-f ][58] [ Linkedin ][59]\n\n#### Speaker Profile\n\nGeoffrey Mann\n\nSenior Physical Threat Analyst\n\nHealth-ISAC\n\n#### Speaker Profile\n\nJohn Auld\n\nCRO\n\nC2A Security\n\nJohn Auld serves as Chief Revenue Officer at C2A Security, where he leads the company\u2019s expansion\ninto healthcare following the strategic acquisition of Vigilant Ops. With 20 years of experience\nbringing together complementary technologies across regulated industries, John specializes in\nhelping manufacturers turn cybersecurity from a compliance burden into a competitive advantage. A\nmechanical engineer by training with deep expertise in product lifecycle management, John champions\nDynamic Risk Management as the bridge between component visibility and actionable intelligence. His\nmission: enable medical device manufacturers to innovate safely without sacrificing speed or patient\nsafety.\n\n#### Speaker Profile\n\nKen Zalevsky\n\nVP and GM, Medical Technology\n\nC2A Security\n\nKen Zalevsky brings over 20 years of medical device cybersecurity experience to his role at C2A\nSecurity, where he serves as VP and GM, Medical Technology, following the acquisition of Vigilant\nOps in October 2025. A former Bayer executive, Ken founded Vigilant Ops in 2019 after witnessing the\nconsequences of inadequate technical preparation in the healthcare industry. He is an active\ncontributor to CISA\u2019s SBOM working groups and a frequent speaker on software supply chain security.\nKen\u2019s mission: transform SBOM from a compliance checkbox into operational intelligence that keeps\npatients safe while streamlining regulatory processes.\n* Products\n* [EVSec Platform][60]\n* [EVSec Analysis][61]\n* [EVSec BOM & Vulnerability Management][62]\n* [EVSec Attacker][63]\n* [EVSec Network & Endpoint Protection][64]\n* [EVSec SOC Enrichment & Analytics][65]\n* [EVSec AutoSynth AI][66]\n* [Use Cases][67]\n* [Medical and Healthcare][68]\n* [Integrations][69]\n* [Blog][70]\n* Company\n* [About][71]\n* [Events][72]\n* [Careers][73]\n* [Contact][74]\n* [Schedule a Demo][75]\n* Products\n* [EVSec Platform][76]\n* [EVSec Analysis][77]\n* [EVSec BOM & Vulnerability Management][78]\n* [EVSec Attacker][79]\n* [EVSec Network & Endpoint Protection][80]\n* [EVSec SOC Enrichment & Analytics][81]\n* [EVSec AutoSynth AI][82]\n* [Use Cases][83]\n* [Medical and Healthcare][84]\n* [Integrations][85]\n* [Blog][86]\n* Company\n* [About][87]\n* [Events][88]\n* [Careers][89]\n* [Contact][90]\n* [Schedule a Demo][91]\n\n[1]: /privacy-policy/\n[2]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-platform/\n[3]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-analysis/\n[4]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-vulnerability-bom-mgmt/\n[5]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-attacker/\n[6]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-network-and-endpoint/\n[7]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-psoc-enrichment-analytics/\n[8]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-generative-ai/\n[9]: #\n[10]: https://c2a-sec.com/product-security-for-healthcare-and-medical-devices/\n[11]: https://c2a-sec.com/integrations/\n[12]: https://c2a-sec.com/blog/\n[13]: https://c2a-sec.com/about-us/\n[14]: https://c2a-sec.com/events/\n[15]: https://c2a-sec.com/careers/\n[16]: /contact-us\n[17]: https://c2a-sec.com/schedule-demo/\n[18]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-platform/\n[19]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-analysis/\n[20]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-vulnerability-bom-mgmt/\n[21]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-attacker/\n[22]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-network-and-endpoint/\n[23]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-psoc-enrichment-analytics/\n[24]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-generative-ai/\n[25]: #\n[26]: https://c2a-sec.com/product-security-for-healthcare-and-medical-devices/\n[27]: https://c2a-sec.com/integrations/\n[28]: https://c2a-sec.com/blog/\n[29]: https://c2a-sec.com/about-us/\n[30]: https://c2a-sec.com/events/\n[31]: https://c2a-sec.com/careers/\n[32]: /contact-us\n[33]: https://c2a-sec.com/schedule-demo/\n[34]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#3058555c5c5f705302511d4355531e535f5d\n[35]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#deadabaeaeb1acaa9ebdecbff3adbbbdf0bdb1b3\n[36]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#077766757369627574476435662a7462642964686a\n[37]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#3054555d5f1d4255414555434443705302511d4355531e535f5d\n[38]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d4bebbb6a794b7e6b5f9a7b1b7fab7bbb9\n[39]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/c2a-security\n[40]: https://twitter.com/i/flow/login?redirect_after_login=%2FC2A_Security\n[41]: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100089639169833\n[42]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#84ece1e8e8ebc4e7b6e5a9f7e1e7aae7ebe9\n[43]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#6615131616091412260554074b1503054805090b\n[44]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#80f0e1f2f4eee5f2f3c0e3b2e1adf3e5e3aee3efed\n[45]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1377767e7c3e6176626676606760537021723e6076703d707c7e\n[46]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#7d17121f0e3d1e4f1c500e181e531e1210\n[47]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/c2a-security\n[48]: https://twitter.com/i/flow/login?redirect_after_login=%2FC2A_Security\n[49]: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100089639169833\n[50]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/c2a-security\n[51]: https://twitter.com/i/flow/login?redirect_after_login=%2FC2A_Security\n[52]: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100089639169833\n[53]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/c2a-security\n[54]: https://twitter.com/i/flow/login?redirect_after_login=%2FC2A_Security\n[55]: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100089639169833\n[56]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#e38a8d858ca380d182ce908680cd808c8e\n[57]: https://c2a-sec.com/privacy-policy/\n[58]: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100089639169833\n[59]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/c2a-security\n[60]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-platform/\n[61]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-analysis/\n[62]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-vulnerability-bom-mgmt/\n[63]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-attacker/\n[64]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-network-and-endpoint/\n[65]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-psoc-enrichment-analytics/\n[66]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-generative-ai/\n[67]: #\n[68]: https://c2a-sec.com/product-security-for-healthcare-and-medical-devices/\n[69]: https://c2a-sec.com/integrations/\n[70]: https://c2a-sec.com/blog/\n[71]: https://c2a-sec.com/about-us/\n[72]: https://c2a-sec.com/events/\n[73]: https://c2a-sec.com/careers/\n[74]: /contact-us\n[75]: https://c2a-sec.com/schedule-demo/\n[76]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-platform/\n[77]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-analysis/\n[78]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-vulnerability-bom-mgmt/\n[79]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-attacker/\n[80]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-network-and-endpoint/\n[81]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-psoc-enrichment-analytics/\n[82]: https://c2a-sec.com/evsec-generative-ai/\n[83]: #\n[84]: https://c2a-sec.com/product-security-for-healthcare-and-medical-devices/\n[85]: https://c2a-sec.com/integrations/\n[86]: https://c2a-sec.com/blog/\n[87]: https://c2a-sec.com/about-us/\n[88]: https://c2a-sec.com/events/\n[89]: https://c2a-sec.com/careers/\n[90]: /contact-us\n[91]: https://c2a-sec.com/schedule-demo/"
