            "text": "Competitive Intelligence &amp; Monitoring | ChampSignal\n\nNavigation\nHome\nProduct\nCompetitor Monitoring\nChamp: AI Agent\nIntelligence Report\nCompetitor Finder API\nPricing\n\nHome\nProduct\nCompetitor Monitoring Track competitors across websites, emails, news, ads, and SEO. Get alerted only when it matters.\nChamp: AI Agent Ask any question about your competitors. Get instant answers backed by real data.\nIntelligence Report 22-page competitive analysis with pricing, features, SEO, ads, and reviews.\nCompetitor Finder API Find competitors for any company with a simple API call.\nPricing\n\nLight\n\nDark\n\nSystem Get Started For Free\n\nNEW Introducing Champ AI Agent\nGet the insights your competitors don't want you to have\nChampSignal is a competitive intelligence suite for early-stage B2B SaaS founders. Make sharper calls on pricing, positioning, and GTM.\n\nStart For Free Today\n\nFree 14-day trial\n1-minute setup\nInstant insights at signup\n\nThe alerts and summaries are genuinely\nuseful and help us respond to our competitors\nonly when it matters.\n\nEugene, Founder &amp; CTO at\nChainstack\n\nTracked across all platforms\nsvg]:size-full\"> svg]:size-full\"> svg]:size-full\"> siGoogleads svg]:size-full\"> svg]:size-full\"> siMeta svg]:size-full\"> siReddit svg]:size-full\"> svg]:size-full\"> siX\n\nWhy\n\nYou're Busy Building. Competitors Keep Moving.\nYou are busy building, selling, and talking to users. ChampSignal keeps you close to the market without manual tracking.\n\nSound familiar?\n\nAlerts everywhere, but 95% is noise\n\nCompetitors launch things before you even hear about it\n\nCan't afford a competitive intelligence analyst\n\nCompetitors you never heard of are stealing your customers\n\nAll the competitor context lives in your head\n\nChampSignal solves this\n\nOnly get notified when it actually matters\n\nSame-day alerts on important moves\n\nChamp AI does the analysis for you\n\nAutomatic competitor discovery\n\nOne place to check before you make the call\n\nThe Cost of Missing Competitor Moves\n\nLost Customers\nCompetitors undercut you on price while you weren't looking\n\nWasted Time\nHours spent manually checking websites and reading news\n\nReactive Strategy\nAlways playing catch-up instead of staying ahead\n\nMissed Opportunities\nFail to capitalize when competitors make mistakes\n\nWho ChampSignal Is Built For\n\nSolo Founders\nNeed competitor intel without losing a build day\n\nFounders Repositioning\nNeed help sharpening pricing, positioning, and launches\n\nFounders Running Sales\nNeed clear answers before demos and follow-ups\n\nSeed-Stage Founders\nNeed better market context without hiring an analyst\n\nHow It Works\n\nGet Started in 3 Simple Steps\nSet up once, then let ChampSignal watch your market while you keep building\n\nStep 1\nAdd Your Competitors\nEnter your website, or let us find the competitors you should watch.\n\nAuto-discover competitors you didn't know about\n\nSet up in under 60 seconds\n\nGet instant insights at signup\n\nStep 2\nWe Monitor and Analyze Everything\nWe track the moves that change pricing, messaging, launches, demand, and search visibility. Meanwhile, Champ learns the market around you.\n\n24/7 automated monitoring\n\nTrack websites, emails, news, socials, ads, and SEO\n\nChamp AI builds deep knowledge of each competitor\n\nHistorical data stored and searchable\n\nStep 3\nGet Alerts and Ask Champ Anything\nGet notified when competitors make important moves. Need deeper analysis? Ask Champ what it means before your next call, launch, or pricing decision.\n\nAI-filtered alerts, no noise\n\nEmail and Slack notifications\n\nCustomizable alert sensitivity\n\nAsk Champ for analysis, comparisons, or briefings\n\nShare insights with a cofounder or advisor\n\nGet Started\n\nCompetitive Intel for SaaS Founders\nSet up in 1 minute. See competitor moves before they hit your pricing, positioning, or pipeline.\n\nJoin hundreds of founders at early-stage SaaS\ncompanies who stay ahead of their competition\nwithout the busywork.\nStart a 14-day free trial Visit Live Demo\n\nBenefits\n\nEverything You Need to Stay Ahead\nFour tools built for founders who need clarity without the busywork\n\nCompetitor Monitoring\nNever Miss an Important Competitor Move\nWe track the competitors in your market across websites, emails, news, X, Reddit, ads, and SEO. When something changes that could hit your pricing, positioning, or pipeline, you'll know fast.\n\nWebsite changes: pricing, features, messaging\n\nNews, X, and Reddit mentions\n\nCompetitor newsletters and email campaigns\n\nSEO rankings, Google and Meta Ads\n\nAI-filtered alerts, no noise Learn more about Competitor Monitoring\n\nChamp AI Agent\nYour Personal Competitive Intelligence Analyst\nAsk Champ anything before a call, launch, pricing change, or homepage rewrite and get a real answer fast.\n\nAsk any question about any competitor\n\nCreate battlecards in seconds\n\nSpot trends and patterns over time\n\nGet positioning recommendations Learn more about Champ AI Agent\n\nCompetitive Intelligence Report\nComprehensive Competitive Landscape Analysis\nSkip the manual research. Get a comprehensive 22-page report built from 2+ hours of deep research across your top 10 competitors so you can make sharper pricing, positioning, and roadmap calls.\n\nDeep dive into 10 competitors\n\nPricing, features, and SEO analysis\n\n22-page PDF + CSV export\n\nOne-time purchase, no subscription Learn more about the Report\n\nResponse [\n\"hostname\" : \"sketch.com\" ,\n\"name\" : \"Sketch\" ,\n\"competitorType\" : \"DIRECT\" ,\n\"confidence\" : \"HIGH\" ,\n\"reason\" : \"Mac-native vector UI design tool for product teams\" ,\n\"shortDescription\" : \"Mac UI design tool\" ,\n\"description\" : \"Sketch is a Mac-native design tool for UI/UX teams with prototyping and developer handoff.\" ,\n\"sourceUrls\" : [ \"https://sketch.com\" ]\n\"hostname\" : \"penpot.app\" ,\n\"name\" : \"Penpot\" ,\n\"competitorType\" : \"DIRECT\" ,\n\"confidence\" : \"HIGH\" ,\n\"reason\" : \"Open-source browser-based design and prototyping platform\" ,\n\"shortDescription\" : \"Open-source design tool\" ,\n\"description\" : \"Penpot is a free, open-source UI design tool with real-time collaboration and code-friendly exports.\" ,\n\"sourceUrls\" : [ \"https://penpot.app\" ]\n\"hostname\" : \"miro.com\" ,\n\"name\" : \"Miro\" ,\n\"competitorType\" : \"INDIRECT\" ,\n\"confidence\" : \"MEDIUM\" ,\n\"reason\" : \"Visual collaboration workspace used for brainstorming and product discovery\" ,\n\"shortDescription\" : \"Visual collaboration platform\" ,\n\"description\" : \"Miro is a collaborative whiteboard platform used for brainstorming, diagramming, and workshops.\" ,\n\"sourceUrls\" : [ \"https://miro.com\" ]\n// ... more competitors\n\nCompetitor Finder API\nAutomate Competitor Discovery for Your Product\nBuilding a SaaS product that needs competitor data? Use our API to find competitors during onboarding or inside market-intel workflows without building it from scratch.\n\nOne endpoint, instant results\n\nPerfect for onboarding flows\n\nOptional business data enrichment\n\nPay as you go Learn more about the API\n\nFeatures\n\nAll-in-One Competitor Monitoring\nSee everything your competitors do online. Set up once, stay informed forever.\n\nWebsite Monitoring\nTrack competitors' websites for key changes like new pricing, features, or promotions.\n\nNews Monitoring\nTrack competitors across all news sources and coverage of current events.\n\nsiReddit\nReddit Monitoring\nMonitor Reddit posts and comments to find highly relevant conversations about your competitors.\n\nsiX\nX Monitoring\nTrack competitor posts, mentions, and engagement on X to stay on top of their strategy.\n\nEmail Tracker\nTrack competitor newsletters and marketing emails in one feed.\n\nAds Monitoring\nTrack competitor ads on Google and Meta to discover winning creatives.\n\nBacklinks Monitoring\nMonitor competitor backlinks to discover their link-building strategy and find new opportunities.\n\nKeywords Monitoring\nDiscover new high search volume, low difficulty keywords to get more traffic.\n\nChamp\nYour personal competitor intelligence analyst. Ask Champ anything about your competitors.\n\nBattlecards\nGenerate a battlecard for any competitor to see how they compare to your business.\n\nFind Your Best Positioning\nAnalyze competitor positioning to uncover market gaps and find your strongest value proposition.\n\nCompetitor Sentiment Analysis\nTrack competitor sentiment across news, reviews, and social media.\n\nAuto Competitor Discovery\nAutomatically discover new competitors on a daily basis as they emerge in your market.\n\nAI-Powered Signal Detection\nWe use AI and statistical analysis to filter out the noise and send you only meaningful alerts.\n\nActionable Insights\nGet actionable insights, recommended next steps, and playbooks for each alert you receive.\n\nEmail &amp; Slack Alerts\nReceive daily digests and instant alerts in email or Slack.\n\nTeam Links\nMake private links so a cofounder or small team can stay in sync.\n\nHistorical Timeline\nSee how competitors changed over time. Review past pricing, features, and messaging shifts.\n\nTestimonials\n\nWhat Founders Are Saying\nHear from founders who stopped wasting time on manual competitor tracking.\n\nEugene\nFounder &amp; CTO of Chainstack\n\nWe use ChampSignal to track the Web3 infrastructure competitive landscape across websites, ads, backlinks, and keyword rankings. The alerts and summaries are genuinely useful and help us respond to our competitors only when it matters.\n\nJosef\nFounder of UserSession\n\nIf you are in a competitive space, try ChampSignal! It will automatically track your competitors so you don't have to. One of the insights I was blown away by, was that it found the best converting ad of my competitor.\n\nPricing\n\nStraightforward Pricing for Founders\nStay close to your market in under 2 minutes/week.\n\nMonthly\n\nYearly (2 months off)\n\nFocused\n33 39 /month\nPerfect for founders in a focused market.\nIncludes\n\nMonitor up to 5 competitors daily\n\nUnlimited use of the Champ AI Agent\n\n30-day money-back guarantee\nStart your 14-day free trial\nCancel anytime. No questions asked!\n\nMost Popular\n\nCompetitive\n83 99 /month\nPerfect for founders in a competitive\nmarket.\nIncludes\n\nEverything in Focused\n\nMonitor up to 15 competitors daily\n\nPriority customer service\nStart your 14-day free trial\nCancel anytime. No questions asked!\n\nNeed something custom?\nCustom limits, dedicated support, and\ntailored onboarding for your workflow. Contact\n\nFAQs\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\nGot doubts? We've got answers. Here are some of the most common questions and answers.\n\nStill have questions? Our team is here to help! Contact us\n\nHow long does it take to set up?\n\nUnder 2 minutes. Add your website, and we'll automatically find your competitors and start tracking them. You get your first insights immediately at signup.\n\nHow is this different from Google Alerts?\n\nGoogle Alerts only catches news mentions. ChampSignal tracks websites, competitor newsletters, pricing changes, new features, ads, SEO, and social. Plus our AI filters noise so you only see what matters.\n\nIsn't this expensive compared to doing it manually?\n\nManual tracking costs founder hours every week. ChampSignal costs less than one hour of your time. And unlike you, we never miss anything.\n\nWhat if I have questions about a competitor?\n\nAsk Champ, our AI agent. It knows everything we've tracked about your competitive landscape and gives you fast answers, battlecards, and analysis before your next call or launch.\n\nCan I try it before committing?\n\nYes. Start a 14-day free trial and get full access to monitoring, alerts, and Champ from day one. Cancel anytime, and we offer a 30-day money-back guarantee.\n\nWhat if I want to cancel?\n\nCancel anytime from your dashboard. We also offer a 30-day refund if you're not satisfied.\n\nGet Started\n\nCompetitive Intel for SaaS Founders\nSet up in 1 minute. See competitor moves before they hit your pricing, positioning, or pipeline.\n\nJoin hundreds of founders at early-stage SaaS\ncompanies who stay ahead of their competition\nwithout the busywork.\nStart a 14-day free trial Visit Live Demo\n\nGet the insights your competitors don't want you to have. Book a 15-minute demo call\n\nNewsletter\nDiscounts, free tools, updates, an"
