      "key_products": "Competitor Monitoring; Champ: AI Agent; Intelligence Report; Competitor Finder API",
      "polished_summary": "Champsignal is a competitive intelligence suite tailored for early-stage B2B SaaS founders, offering a range of tools designed to monitor competitors and uncover valuable market insights. Its core products include Competitor Monitoring for tracking online activities, the AI-powered Champ: AI Agent for instant competitor analysis, comprehensive Intelligence Reports for in-depth competitive assessments, and the Competitor Finder API for automated discovery of competitors. By providing these insights, Champsignal empowers businesses to stay ahead in the competitive landscape.",
