            "text": "**\ud83d\ude80 **CloudSEK becomes first Indian origin cybersecurity company to receive investment from **US\nstate** fund\nRead more\n][1]\n\ud83d\ude80 CloudSEK Becomes First Indian Cybersecurity Firm to partner with The Private Office\nRead more\n][2]\n**\ud83d\ude80 **CloudSEK has raised **$19M Series B1 Round **\u2013 Powering the Future of Predictive\nCybersecurity\nRead more\n][3]\n[CloudSEK Logo]\n][4]\nProducts\nNexus AI\nAI Command center & Cyber Risk Quantification\n][5][\nXVigil\nDigital Risk protection\n][6][\nBeVigil\nAttack Surface monitoring\n][7][\nSVigil\nThird party Risk Monitoring\n][8][\nThreat Intelligence\nCyber Threat Intel, IAVs & More\n][9][\nBeVigil Community\nApplication Scanner\n][10][\nExposure\nCheck if your organisation's data is in a data breach\n][11][\nAIVigil\nAI Attack Surface Monitoring\n][12]\nSolutions\nCyber Threats Monitoring\nSurface, Deep, and Dark Web Monitoring\n][13][\nDeep and Dark Web Monitoring\nThreat Monitoring Across the Hidden Web\n][14][\nBrand Threats Monitoring\nProactive Brand Protection\n][15][\nInfrastructure Monitoring\nCatch Risks Before Attacks\n][16][\nPartner Secret Scanning\nAPI/secret Exposure Detection\n][17][\nBeVigil Jenkins CI\nBeVigil-CI secures your mobile app builds\n][18][\nBeVigil OSINT CLI\nUnified CLI/Python for BeVigil OSINT\n][19][\nBeVigil Asset Explorer\nThreat Monitoring Across the Hidden Web\n][20]\nResources\n\n#### Resources\n\nBlog\nStay updated with the latest cybersecurity news, insights, and industry trends\n][21][\nThreat Intelligence\nGet up and running on new threat reports and techniques\n][22][\nKnowledge Base\nBasics of Cybersecurity and see more definitions\n][23][\nWhitepapers & Reports\nThe content team broke their backs making these reports\n][24][\nCustomer stories\nLearn how our customers are making big changes. You have got good company!\n][25][\nCloudSEK Academy\nBe CloudSEK certified!\n][26]\n\n#### Company\n\nIntegrations\nWe are more connected than you know. Explore all Integrations\n][27][\nPartners\n100s of partners and one Shared goal; Secure future for all us\n][28][\nAbout us\nLearn about our story and our mission statement\n][29][\nLife at CloudSEK\nA sneak peek at the awesome life at CloudSEK\n][30][\nCareers\nWe're hiring!\nWe are in love with undeniable talent. Join our team!\n][31][\nEvents\nWe're hiring!\nExplore webinars, panels, and meetups powered by CloudSEK\n][32][\nLegal\nAll the boring but necessary legalese that legal made us add.\n][33][\nCompliance\nProven compliance with top security benchmarks.\n][34]\n\n#### Latest Whitepaper\n\n[CloudSEK: Global Threat Landscape Report 2025]\nAdversary Intelligence\n24 Mar 26\nCloudSEK: Global Threat Landscape Report 2025\n][35]\nFree Tools\nURL Analyser\nScan for malicious links and phishing threats\n][36][\nDeepfake Analyser\nSpot manipulated videos and deepfake scams\n][37][\nThreatLens\nA live feed of scams, phishing, and brand abuse\n][38][\nMobile App Analyser\nDetect security flaws in mobile apps\n][39][\nAsset Explorer\nGain insights on digital assets and subdomains\n][40][\nData Exposure Checker\nSee if your organization's data is on the Dark Web\n][41][\nBeVigil Asset Explorer\nThreat Monitoring Across the Hidden Web\n][42]\nLog in\n][43][\nSchedule a Demo\n][44]\nSchedule a Demo\n][45]\n\n# Contact us\n\nWe're here to help with any questions or concerns you may have. Please don't hesitate to reach out\nto us.\n\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddec Singapore\nCloudSEK Research Pte Ltd.\n160, Robinson Road, #19-08, SBF Center, Singapore - 068914\n\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 London, United Kingdom\nCloudSEK, 2 Kingdom Street,\n6th Floor London,\nW2 6BD - United Kingdom\n\ud83c\uddee\ud83c\uddf3 Bengaluru, India\nCloudSEK Information Security Pvt Ltd.\n16/1, Cambridge Rd, Halasuru, Cambridge Layout, Jogupalya, Bengaluru, Karnataka - 560008\n\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 Dover, United States\nCloudSEK Inc.\n8 The Green, Ste A, Dover, DE - 19901\nUnited States\nNameEmail AddressWhat do you want to talk aboutGeneral QueriesPress QueriesMarketing QueriesGuest\nposts/ Backlink requestComplaints / LegalWrite in detailI agree to CloudSEK [Privacy policy][46]\nThank you! Your submission has been received!\nOops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.\n[**\ud83d\udce7 General & Marketing: **[email protected]][47]\n[**\ud83d\udce7 Recruitments and Career**: [email protected]][48]\nHave any questions?\n\n### Frequently Asked Questions\n\nHow Can I Apply for Open Positions at CloudSEK?\n\nTo apply for open positions at CloudSEK, you have two primary options. Firstly, you can visit their\nofficial website at [cloudsek.com/openings][49]. This page regularly lists all the current job\nopenings, providing detailed descriptions of each role, the qualifications required, and the\napplication process. Alternatively, if you prefer a more direct approach or have specific inquiries,\nyou can send your application or questions to their dedicated email address:\n[[email protected]][50].\n\n- Visit [cloudsek.com/openings][51] for a list of current job openings.\n- Read detailed job descriptions and application processes are available on their website.\n- For direct inquiries or applications, email [[email protected]][52].\n\nDoes CloudSEK Accept Guest Posts or Collaborate on Blog Posts?\n\nAs of now, CloudSEK maintains a policy of exclusively publishing research and content created\ninternally. We do not accept guest posts for the blog or threat inteligence. This approach ensures\nthat all content on cloudsek.com is closely aligned with their expertise and quality standards. It's\na strategy that helps maintain the integrity and consistency of the information we provide.\n\nIs There a Possibility for Link Exchanges with CloudSEK?\n\nCloudSEK does not engage in link exchanges, especially on our main domain, cloudsek.com. This\ndecision aligns with their commitment to maintaining the quality and integrity of our website. By\navoiding link exchanges, CloudSEK ensures that all outbound and inbound links are relevant to our\ncontent and beneficial to the audience, thereby preserving the website's credibility and focus.\n\nWhere Can I Reach Out for HR Verifications at CloudSEK?\n\nFor any HR-related verifications, including employee verifications, CloudSEK has designated a\nspecific channel to ensure a streamlined and efficient process. You should direct your inquiries to\n[[email protected]][53].\n\nJoin our newsletter\nWe\u2019ll send you a nice letter once per week. No spam.\n[Untitled UI logotext][Logo]\n][54]\nProduct\nXVigil\n][55][\nBeVigil\n][56][\nSVigil\nNew\n][57][\nTutorials\n][58][\nPricing\n][59][\nReleases\n][60]\nCompany\nAbout us\n][61][\nCareers\n][62][\nPress\n][63][\nNews\n][64][\nMedia kit\n][65][\nContact\n][66]\nResources\nBlog\n][67][\nNewsletter\n][68][\nEvents\n][69][\nHelp centre\n][70][\nTutorials\n][71][\nSupport\n][72]\nUse Cases\nStartups\n][73][\nEnterprise\n][74][\nGovernment\n][75][\nSaaS\n][76][\nMarketplaces\n][77][\nEcommerce\n][78]\nSocial\nTwitter\n][79][\nLinkedIn\n][80][\nFacebook\n][81][\nGitHub\n][82][\nAngelList\n][83][\nDribbble\n][84]\n\u00a9 2077 Untitled UI\n[Privacy][85][GDPR][86][Disclosure of Vulnerability][87]\n][88][\n][89][\n][90][\n][91]\nProducts\nNexus AI\n][92][\nXVigil\n][93][\nBeVigil\n][94][\nSVigil\n][95][\nThreat Intelligence\n][96][\nCloudSEK Exposure\n][97][\nAIVigil\n][98]\nMobile App\n[[Google Play button to download App ]\n][99]\nSolutions\nCyber Threats Monitoring\n][100][\nDark Web Monitoring\n][101][\nBrand Threat Monitoring\n][102][\nInfra Threat Monitoring\n][103][\nPartners Secret Scanning\n][104][\nBeVigil Jenkins CI\n][105][\nBeVigil OSINT CLI\n][106][\nBeVigil Asset Explorer\n][107][\nTakedowns\n][108]\nResources\nBlogs and Articles\n][109][\nThreat Intelligence\n][110][\nWhitepapers and Reports\n][111][\nKnowledge Base\n][112][\nIntegrations\n][113]\nCommunity\nDiscord Community\n][114][\nStudent Challenge\n][115]\nCompany\nAbout us\n][116][\nCustomers\n][117][\nPartners\n][118][\nReferral Program\n][119][\nLife at CloudSEK\n][120][\nSecure Sips\n][121][\nCareers\n][122][\nAnnouncements\n][123][\nPress\n][124][\nContact Us\n][125]\n[[CloudSEK Logo]][126]\n][127][\n][128][[Linkedin Icon ]][129][\n][130]\n\nAt CloudSEK, we combine the power of Cyber Intelligence, Brand Monitoring, Attack Surface\nMonitoring, Infrastructure Monitoring and Supply Chain Intelligence to give context to our\ncustomers\u2019 digital risks.\n\nGDPR Policy\n][131][\nPrivacy\n][132][\nVulnerability Disclosure\n][133][\nDPA\n][134][\nCookies Policy\n][135][\nSitemap\n][136][\nLLM Info\n][137][\nEULA\n][138]\n\n[1]: https://www.cloudsek.com/ancmt/cloudsek-becomes-first-indian-origin-cybersecurity-company-to-re\nceive-investment-from-a-u-s-state-fund\n[2]: https://www.cloudsek.com/ancmt/cloudsek-becomes-first-active-indian-cybersecurity-firm-to-partn\ner-with-seed-group-a-company-of-the-private-office-of-sheikh-saeed-bin-ahmed-al-maktoum\n[3]: https://www.cloudsek.com/blog/cloudsek-raises-19-million-in-series-b1-funding-to-scale-predicti\nve-cybersecurity-platform\n[4]: /?r=0\n[5]: /nexus\n[6]: /xvigil\n[7]: /bevigil-enterprise\n[8]: /svigil\n[9]: /threat-intelligence\n[10]: https://bevigil.com/?Ref=cloudsek.com\n[11]: https://exposure.cloudsek.com/?Ref=cloudsek.com\n[12]: /aivigil\n[13]: /cyber-threats\n[14]: /cyber-threats/dark-web-monitoring\n[15]: /brand-monitor\n[16]: /bevigil-enterprise\n[17]: https://bevigil.com/bevigil-secrets-scanning-partner-program\n[18]: https://plugins.jenkins.io/bevigil-ci/\n[19]: https://github.com/Bevigil/BeVigil-OSINT-CLI\n[20]: https://bevigil.com/osint-api\n[21]: /blog\n[22]: /threatintelligence\n[23]: /knowledgebase\n[24]: /whitepapers-reports\n[25]: /customers\n[26]: /cloudsek-academy\n[27]: /integrations\n[28]: /partners\n[29]: /about-us\n[30]: /work-life\n[31]: /openings\n[32]: /events\n[33]: /privacy-policy\n[34]: /compliance\n[35]: /whitepapers-reports/cloudsek-global-threat