      "polished_summary": "CloudSEK is a leading cybersecurity company that harnesses artificial intelligence to deliver predictive cybersecurity solutions, specializing in digital risk protection and threat intelligence. Its core products, including Nexus AI, XVigil, BeVigil, SVigil, Threat Intelligence, and AIVigil, cater to organizations across various industries such as financial services, e-commerce, government, healthcare, and retail, empowering them to manage cyber risks and enhance their security posture effectively.",
