      "company_summary": "Consultivo is an ESG and Sustainability Consulting Firm that specializes in providing comprehensive solutions across various sectors, including Agri-Food, Construction, and Oil & Gas. The firm offers a range of services such as safety and environmental audits, ISO consulting, and training programs, targeting businesses and organizations seeking to enhance their compliance with environmental, social, and governance standards. With a focus on improving sustainability practices, Consultivo aims to empower clients to achieve their ESG goals effectively.",
