        "crawl_text": "Comprehensive Productivity Solutions 5th floor, Nirmal Plaza, Paud Rd, Above Federal Bank, Opp. Vanaz Company, Lokmanya Colony, Pune - 411038 CPS Pvt. Ltd. | Home\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nServices\n\nCase Studies\n\nContact Us\n\nPrevious\n\nNext\n\n20+ Years Of Operational & Manufacturing Consulting Experience .\n\nA Team Of LEAN&#174; Practioners .\n\nAs lean manufacturing and productivity consultants,\nwe help clients leverage operational excellence, enabling technologies,\nand lean processes to enhance process efficiency.\nWe build agile companies that can solve problems and respond to opportunities\nfaster than their peers, paving the way for sustainable, profitable growth.\n\nIn addition, many Lean trainings are provided to client employees for their\nholistic growth.\nIn addition, many Lean trainings are provided to client employees for their holistic growth.\nWe foster engagement from day one.\n\nAt CPS, Lean is in our DNA. We use lean tools like -\nIT, 5S, SMED, ECRS, MUDA analysis, WCM concept for conversion cost reduction.\nComplete transformation and continuous improvement are essential enablers to be competitive. We collaborate with our client and handhold\nimplementing lean solutions to make them Fit, fast and flexible for industry 4.0 readiness.\nBecause we believe in collaborative growth.\nWe provide sustainable solutions and work on close loop mechanism.\n\nOur Services\n\nOperational Excellence\n\nOperational excellence is a mindset that embraces certain principles and tools to create a culture of excellence within an organization. It means every employee can see, deliver and improve the flow of value to a customer.\n\nBusiness Process Management\n\nBusiness Process Management (BPM) is a discipline that uses various methods to discover, model, analyze, measure, improve and optimize business processes.\n\nContinuous Improvement\n\nContinuous improvement, sometimes called continual improvement, is the ongoing improvement of products, services or processes through incremental and breakthrough improvements.\n\nLean Training\n\nLean is a systematic approach to reduce or eliminate activities that don't add value to the process. It emphasizes removing wasteful steps in a process and taking the only value-added steps. The Lean method ensures high quality and customer satisfaction.\n\nDigitization\n\nDigitization is the process of converting information into a digital (i.e. computer-readable) format. The result is called digital representation or, more specifically, a digital image, for the object, and digital form, for the signal.\n\nTestimonials .\n\nDaimler India Commercial Vehicles Pvt. Ltd.\n\nLean implementation in the warehouse was very well conceptualized. The 'As Is' state of\noperations was well captured. 'To be' Processes were also tested and implemented. CPS team has achieved the project deliverables.\n\nKellogg India Pvt. Ltd.\n\nCPS team came on site, had detailed 1:1 with each person and understood the job\nprofile and perspective of all levels , which gave people also clarity and they supported CPS team to get right out put, so i will say the credit\ngoes to CPS team for explaining context in right manner for getting brilliant outputs\n\nOur Clients .\n\nAbout\n\nOperational Excellence is an indispensable aspect for gaining and sustaining competitive\nadvantage in today's dynamic market conditions \u2014 but it\u2019s also more challenging than ever.\n\nQuick links\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nServices\n\nCase Studies\n\nContact Us\n\nSubscribe Now!\n\nSubscribe\n\nDeveloped by Byte Warp [ [Your logo] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Services][4]\n* [Case Studies][5]\n* [Contact Us][6]\n\n## About Us\n1. [Home][7]\n2. About Us\n\n### About Us .\n\n**Operational excellence **is an indispensable aspect for gaining and sustaining competitive\nadvantage in today's dynamic market conditions \u2014 but it\u2019s also more challenging than ever.\n\nWe at **Comprehensive Productivity Solutions ** partner with clients at every level of their\norganization to drive transformational change\u2014and impact\u2014in key areas of operations management\nranging from procurement, service operations, and supply chain to manufacturing, project management,\nand end-to-end operational excellence.\n\nWith our experience of working with **150+ clients **in different verticals, CPS engages with client\nfor **150+ clients **execution of recommendations, to get actual cost saving reflections in EBIDTA.\n\n### Our Mission & Values .\n\n# Our Mission\n\nTap on the card to flip it\n\nShare our heterogeneous industry experience and capability, create more value to client with\ninnovative & apt solutions.\n\n# Our Vision\n\nTap on the card to flip it\n\nIndia\u2019s rapid progress to rise as a leading country with a developed economy by 2030\n\n### Our Core Team .\n\n** Managing Director**\n\n#### Mrs. Janhavi Gunde\n\n**Janhavi** has more than **20 years** of operational and consulting experience , in the areas of\n**Industrial Engineering and Manufacturing Engineering.**\n\n**Janhavi** has strong expertise in **handling Union while executing Lean projects.**\n\nShe has successfully led turn key projects in **esteem pharma and OEM industries. **Expert in **Lean\nmethodologies, work measurement techniques, Line balancing, benchmarking, OEE & loss analysis, cost\nanalysis, low-cost automation.**\n\nShe is also **a Corporate Trainer. Highly Motivated professional **with **strong Commercial acumen.\nSkilled in communicating & presenting Business case ** to Executives.\n\n** Managing Director**\n\n#### Mrs. Pallavi Patil\n\n**Pallavi** is a **Lean practitioner** with **13+ years of experience** in operations &\nmanufacturing excellence.\n\nHaving exposure to **75+ organizations in Manufacturing, Process, Service, E commerce industries.**\n\nStrong handholding expertise **in implementing lean concepts.**\n\n**Pallavi** is having niche competency in handling BPR projects. She has been **coordinating in\nBusiness Development activities & Lean Training. Expertise in driving continuous improvement and\nbenchmarking projects.** Led several projects in **work measurement, Lean Manufacturing, Line\nbalancing, capacity and resource planning & optimize utilisation, OEE, conversion cost reduction,\nmanpower optimisation.**\n\n###### About\n\nOperational Excellence is an indispensable aspect for gaining and sustaining competitive advantage\nin today's dynamic market conditions \u2014 but it\u2019s also more challenging than ever.\n\n###### Quick links\n* [Home][8]\n* [About Us][9]\n* [Services][10]\n* [Case Studies][11]\n* [Contact Us][12]\n\n###### Subscribe Now!\n\nSubscribe\n\nDeveloped by [ Byte Warp][13]\n\n#### Janhavi Gunde - Lean Practitioner\n\nExecuted project on Time & Motion Study concepts and its applied at clients to improve productivity\n**~30%.**\n\nSome of the prestigious clients are mentioned below :\n\nAuto mobile : TATA Motors (PVBU, CVBU, ERC, TML), Hero MotoCorp, Atlas Copco, Volvo Eicher.\n\nProcess and Pharmaceutical Industries : Century Birla group, Hindustan National Glass Industry Ltd.\n\nCipla Limited, Glenmark Pharmaceuticals, Zydus, Garware Wall Ropes.\n\nHeavy Engineering : Hyva Group , Schindler Group, Eimco India Pvt. Ltd\n\nWhite goods : Orient Electric, Havells India Limited , Alfanar (Riyad)\n\nAuto Ancillary : Badve Auto components, Badve Engineering, Associated Manufacturing, Tenneco,\nGabriel \u2013 Anand Group, SSS Springs\n\nService Industry : Thapar University, Reliance mart etc.\n\nClose\n\n[1]: #home\n[2]: home\n[3]: about\n[4]: services\n[5]: casestudies\n[6]: contact\n[7]: home\n[8]: home\n[9]: about\n[10]: services\n[11]: casestudies\n[12]: contact\n[13]: https://bytewarp.in/ [ [Your logo] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Services][4]\n* [Case Studies][5]\n* [Contact Us][6]\n\n## Services\n1. [Home][7]\n2. Services\n\n### Our Services .\n\nOur lean consulting services by **CPS **can assist you in achieving savings and ** increase profits\nby 25%** by eliminating waste and process improvements continuously on **journey to excellence. **We\nleverage **Lean tools for Operational Excellence** that will help:\n\n\u25b6 Reduction in conversion costs by 20%\n\n\u25b6 Improve Manpower productivity by 30%\n\n\u25b6 Reduction in NVA by 30%\n\n\u25b6 Improve Floor Space Index by 30%\n\n\u25b6 Inventory Optimization by 30%\n\nWe take traditional consulting a step further. Apart from giving only **Lean solution** we work\nalongside your team and implement so that you receive detailed instructions on where to go next, how\nlong it will take and what the ROI is. **Sustenance is our forte,** we take sustenance as one of\n**foremost priority in our Lean Model for achieving Operational Excellence.** This makes clients to\nretain the improvements carried out and move further to **achieve Breakthrough solutions.**\n\n### How does it help? .\n\nChanging for the better is **acceptable and effective when done in a systematic manner** rather than\nmaking drastic alterations to tried-and-tested ways of working overnight! **Implementing Lean** in\nmanufacturing facilities result in:\n\n\u25b6 Reduction of Idle time \u2013 both men and machines optimally utilized\n\n\u25b6 Reduction of Excess Inventory \u2013 bringing down holding costs\n\n\u25b6 Enhanced Quality of Deliverables\n\n\u25b6 Optimal capacity utilization\n\n\u25b6 Elimination of waste \u2013 time, effort and material\n\n\u25b6 Improved employee morale and productivity\n\n##### [Continuous Improvement][8]\n\nOngoing improvement of products, services & processes through breakthrough improvements\n\n##### [Read More][9]\n\n##### [Operational Excellence][10]\n\nEvery employee can see, deliver and improve the flow of value to a customer\n\n##### [Read More][11]\n\n##### [BPM][12]\n\nVarious methods to discover, model, analyze, measure, improve and optimize business processes\n\n##### [Read More][13]\n\n##### [Digitization][14]\n\nProcess of converting information into a digital (i.e. computer-readable) format\n\n##### [Read More][15]\n\n##### [Lean Training][16]\n\nSystematic approach to reduce or eliminate activities that don't add value to the process\n\n##### [Read More][17]\n\n#### Continuous Improvement\n\n\u25b6 The ongoing improvement of products, services or processes through practical, implementable\nsolutions and breakthrough improvements.\n\n\u25b6 Reducing Conversion Cost\n\n\u25b6 Higher Employee Engagement\n\n\u25b6 Improved Customer Service and Experience\n\n\u25b6 WCM\n\n#### Operational Excellence\n\nOur approach to Operational Excellence is more than just utilizing traditional 'Lean' management\ntechiques and 6 Sigma analysis. We use a range of methodologies and processes to help you achieve\nyour goal.\n\n\u25b6 Analyze\n\n\u25b6 Design\n\n\u25b6 Implement\n\n\u25b6 Sustain\n\n#### Business Process Management\n\nWe have developed an approach to Business Process Management, focusing on 6 different elements that\ntogether form a robust approach that delivers a tangible result.\n\n\u25b6 Documentation\n\n\u25b6 Ownership\n\n\u25b6 Governance\n\n\u25b6 Improvement\n\n\u25b6 Quality Management\n\n\u25b6 Continuous Improvement\n\n#### Lean Training\n\n\u25b6 Time and Motion Study\n\n\u25b6 TPM\n\n\u25b6 VSM\n\n\u25b6 SMED\n\n\u25b6 Ergonomics\n\n\u25b6 5S\n\n\u25b6 Kaizen\n\n\u25b6 OEE/OLE/OPE\n\n#### Digitization\n\n\u25b6 Handholding with client for implementation of Industy 4.0 environment\n\n\u25b6 Industrial IOT\n\n\u25b6 IOT analytics\n\n\u25b6 Robotic Process Automation RPA\n\n###### About\n\nOperational Excellence is an indispensable aspect for gaining and sustaining competitive advantage\nin today's dynamic market conditions \u2014 but it\u2019s also more challenging than ever.\n\n###### Quick links\n* [Home][18]\n* [About Us][19]\n* [Services][20]\n* [Case Studies][21]\n* [Contact Us][22]\n\n###### Subscribe Now!\n\nSubscribe\n\nDeveloped by [ Byte Warp][23]\n\n$(function () { $('.navbar-toggler').click(function () { $('body').toggleClass('noscroll'); }) });\n\n[1]: home\n[2]: home\n[3]: about\n[4]: services\n[5]: casestudies\n[6]: contact\n[7]: home\n[8]: #URL\n[9]: #\n[10]: #URL\n[11]: #\n[12]: #URL\n[13]: #\n[14]: #URL\n[15]: #\n[16]: #URL\n[17]: #\n[18]: home\n[19]: about\n[20]: services\n[21]: casestudies\n[22]: contact\n[23]: https://bytewarp.in/ [ [Your logo] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Services][4]\n* [Case Studies][5]\n* [Contact Us][6]\n\n## Contact\n1. [Home][7]\n2. Contact\n\n### Contact\n\n#### Everything Starts With A Hello!\n\nWe\u2019re here to answer any questions you may have and create an effective solution for your\ninstructional needs.\n\nCaptcha va"
