            "text": "CPS Pvt. Ltd. | Home\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nServices\n\nCase Studies\n\nContact Us\n\nPrevious\n\nNext\n\n20+ Years Of Operational & Manufacturing Consulting Experience .\n\nA Team Of LEAN&#174; Practioners .\n\nAs lean manufacturing and productivity consultants,\nwe help clients leverage operational excellence, enabling technologies,\nand lean processes to enhance process efficiency.\nWe build agile companies that can solve problems and respond to opportunities\nfaster than their peers, paving the way for sustainable, profitable growth.\n\nIn addition, many Lean trainings are provided to client employees for their\nholistic growth.\nIn addition, many Lean trainings are provided to client employees for their holistic growth.\nWe foster engagement from day one.\n\nAt CPS, Lean is in our DNA. We use lean tools like -\nIT, 5S, SMED, ECRS, MUDA analysis, WCM concept for conversion cost reduction.\nComplete transformation and continuous improvement are essential enablers to be competitive. We collaborate with our client and handhold\nimplementing lean solutions to make them Fit, fast and flexible for industry 4.0 readiness.\nBecause we believe in collaborative growth.\nWe provide sustainable solutions and work on close loop mechanism.\n\nOur Services\n\nOperational Excellence\n\nOperational excellence is a mindset that embraces certain principles and tools to create a culture of excellence within an organization. It means every employee can see, deliver and improve the flow of value to a customer.\n\nBusiness Process Management\n\nBusiness Process Management (BPM) is a discipline that uses various methods to discover, model, analyze, measure, improve and optimize business processes.\n\nContinuous Improvement\n\nContinuous improvement, sometimes called continual improvement, is the ongoing improvement of products, services or processes through incremental and breakthrough improvements.\n\nLean Training\n\nLean is a systematic approach to reduce or eliminate activities that don't add value to the process. It emphasizes removing wasteful steps in a process and taking the only value-added steps. The Lean method ensures high quality and customer satisfaction.\n\nDigitization\n\nDigitization is the process of converting information into a digital (i.e. computer-readable) format. The result is called digital representation or, more specifically, a digital image, for the object, and digital form, for the signal.\n\nTestimonials .\n\nDaimler India Commercial Vehicles Pvt. Ltd.\n\nLean implementation in the warehouse was very well conceptualized. The 'As Is' state of\noperations was well captured. 'To be' Processes were also tested and implemented. CPS team has achieved the project deliverables.\n\nKellogg India Pvt. Ltd.\n\nCPS team came on site, had detailed 1:1 with each person and understood the job\nprofile and perspective of all levels , which gave people also clarity and they supported CPS team to get right out put, so i will say the credit\ngoes to CPS team for explaining context in right manner for getting brilliant outputs\n\nOur Clients .\n\nAbout\n\nOperational Excellence is an indispensable aspect for gaining and sustaining competitive\nadvantage in today's dynamic market conditions \u2014 but it\u2019s also more challenging than ever.\n\nQuick links\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nServices\n\nCase Studies\n\nContact Us\n\nSubscribe Now!\n\nSubscribe\n\nDeveloped by Byte Warp"
