      "polished_summary": "CPS Pvt. Ltd. specializes in operational excellence and lean manufacturing consulting, offering a range of services including Business Process Management, Continuous Improvement, Lean Training, and Digitization. The company is dedicated to helping organizations across industries such as automotive, pharmaceuticals, and heavy engineering enhance process efficiency and achieve sustainable growth through tailored consulting and training solutions. With a focus on building agile companies, CPS Pvt. Ltd. empowers clients to foster a culture of excellence and optimize their operations.",
