            "text": "[ [CyberDB Cyber Security Companies] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About][3]\n* [Mission statement][4]\n* [Team][5]\n* [Purchase][6]\n* [Contact US][7]\n* [- - AI - -][8]\n* [AI Categories][9]\n* [AI Vendors][10]\n* [Cyber][11]\n* [Cyber Vendors][12]\n* [Cyber Categories][13]\n* [Cyber Statistics][14]\n* [Services][15]\n* [Investment][16]\n* [Technology Scouting][17]\n* [Product Strategy][18]\n* [Business Development and Marketing][19]\n* [Research][20]\n* [Enter DB][21]\n* [Cyber Vendors][22]\n* [AI Vendors][23]\n* [Blog][24]\n[ [CyberDB Cyber Security Companies][CyberDB Cyber Security Companies]][25]\n* [Home][26]\n* [About][27]\n* [Mission statement][28]\n* [Team][29]\n* [Purchase][30]\n* [Contact US][31]\n* [- - AI - -][32]\n* [AI Categories][33]\n* [AI Vendors][34]\n* [Cyber][35]\n* [Cyber Vendors][36]\n* [Cyber Categories][37]\n* [Cyber Statistics][38]\n* [Services][39]\n* [Investment][40]\n* [Technology Scouting][41]\n* [Product Strategy][42]\n* [Business Development and Marketing][43]\n* [Research][44]\n* [Enter DB][45]\n* [Cyber Vendors][46]\n* [AI Vendors][47]\n* [Blog][48]\n\n# REQUEST A DEMO\n\n### Sense how this powerful platform can help you in your day to day life\n\n[ Request a Demo ][49]\n\n### About Us\n\nThe CyberDB web-based research platform provides premium data, news, research and analysis on\nvendors and solutions of the global **Artificial Intelligence** and **Cyber Security** industries\nworldwide.\n\n* **Consulting Services** \u2013 Tailored to our customers\u2019 needs.\n* Cyber Security **seminars** that provide in-depth reviews of cyber security systems including\narchitecture, deployment and market information.\n* **Cyber Security Solutions Database** (on-line web software) \u2013 The most comprehensive and\nup-to-date Cyber industry database includes comprehensive info on vendors and products in the\ncyber industry. An easy and fast tool for CISO, VC\u2019s vendors and partners to locate the\ninformation needed to scout for technologies.\n* **Artificial Intelligence Solutions Database** (on-line web software) \u2013 The most comprehensive and\nup-to-date AI industry database includes comprehensive info on vendors and products in the AI\nindustry. An easy and fast tool for CTO, CIO, VC\u2019s, vendors and partners to locate the\ninformation needed to scout for technologies.\n* **Market Research Reports** \u2013 Both periodic market analysis reports as well as tailored researches\nfor specific segments, categories and geographies\n* Cyber Solutions **Evaluation** Services \u2013 Upon demand.\n\n### Management Team\n\n### Eli Chachak\n\nCo-Founder, CTO\n\nEli is founding partner of CyberDB. Prior to that Eli founded Stratechy, a Strategy Consulting firm\nspecialized in helping management teams of Hi-Tech vendors in Cyber product strategy, Turn-around\nroad-map as well as building and executing Go-to-market strategies. Among Stratechy\u2019s customers are\nleading corporates as Amdocs, Brother, Nice as well as tens of start-ups. Prior to Stratechy, Eli\nserved as VP Business development and Marketing at cVidya and ECtel.\n\nEli holds BSc. Computer Science and HTS-A Amsterdam, Netherlands and Executive MBA at Northwestern\nUniversity- Chicago and Tel-Aviv University\n\n### Ohad Kamer\n\nCo-Founder, CMO\n\nOhad is CyberDB's CMO, Co-Founder and a Board Member.\nOhad brings more than 2 decades of experience in the telecom industry.\nPrior is also Co-founder and CMO at Atrinet, Ohad held senior positions within Nokia Solutions and\nNetworks (NSN), including several years as the Head of Carrier Ethernet Transport (CET) Sales.\nOhad holds an Executive MBA from Bar Ilan University and a B.Sc in Electronic and Computer\nEngineering\n\n### Yotam Gutman\n\nVP Marketing\n\nYotam has over 10 years experience in sales and marketing roles with vendors in cyber, intelligence\nand defense security industries.\n\nYotam has successfully managed the marketing and Business development efforts of several\ncybersecurity startups where he planned and executed the launch of the brand, managed partners and\ndistribution channels and strategic alliances, media, analyst relations and customer acquisition.\n\n### Editors\n\n### Emilio Iasiello\n\nEditor\n\nEmilio Iasiello has more than 12 years\u2019 experience as a strategic cyber intelligence analyst,\nsupporting US government civilian and military intelligence organizations, as well as security\ncompanies in the private sector. He has delivered cyber threat presentations to domestic and\ninternational audiences and has published extensively in peer-reviewed journals.\n\nAll the opinions expressed are solely the author\u2019s own and do not necessarily reflect the official\npolicy, views, or positions of any other individual, organization, or agency.\n\n### Our Newsletter\n\nPlease leave your name and E-mail to subscribe\n\n### Contact US\n\n[ Contact US ][50]\n\n### Follow US\n\nGet connected with CyberDB in popular social networks\nCopyright \u00a9 2012\u20142026 All Rights Reserved. Email: info@cyberdb.co | [Terms Of Use][51] | [Privacy\nPolicy][52]\n\n[1]: https://www.cyberdb.co\n[2]: https://www.cyberdb.co/\n[3]: https://www.cyberdb.co/about/\n[4]: /about/#sidebarHolder\n[5]: /about/#team\n[6]: https://www.cyberdb.co/plans/\n[7]: https://www.cyberdb.co/contacts/\n[8]: https://www.cyberdb.co/database-ai/\n[9]: https://www.cyberdb.co/database/ai-categories-vendors/\n[10]: https://www.cyberdb.co/database/cyberdb-ai-vendors/\n[11]: https://www.cyberdb.co/database/\n[12]: https://www.cyberdb.co/database/cyberdb-cyber-vendors/\n[13]: https://www.cyberdb.co/database/cyberdb-cyber-categories/\n[14]: https://www.cyberdb.co/database/cyberdb-statistics/\n[15]: https://www.cyberdb.co/services/\n[16]: https://www.cyberdb.co/services/cyber-investment/\n[17]: https://www.cyberdb.co/services/cyber-technology-scouting/\n[18]: https://www.cyberdb.co/services/product-strategy/\n[19]: https://www.cyberdb.co/services/business-development/\