      "key_products": "Cyber Security Solutions Database, Market Research Reports, Cyber Solutions Evaluation Services",
      "polished_summary": "CyberDB is a web-based research platform that delivers premium data, news, research, and analysis focused on the global Artificial Intelligence and Cyber Security industries. Its core offerings include comprehensive online databases for Cyber Security and AI solutions, tailored market research reports, and consulting services, all designed to support professionals such as CISOs, CTOs, and venture capitalists in making informed decisions. Additionally, CyberDB provides specialized training through seminars aimed at enhancing knowledge in cyber security systems.",
