      "company_summary": "Cyberquess is a leading cybersecurity consulting provider in India, specializing in advanced security consulting, compliance services, and comprehensive threat protection. The company offers a range of services including Vulnerability Assessment & Penetration Testing, Red Team Assessments, and SOC as a Service, targeting organizations across various sectors, particularly those in regulated industries and enterprises requiring continuous security monitoring. With a focus on identifying vulnerabilities and enhancing security measures, Cyberquess delivers tailored solutions to meet the unique needs of its clients.",
