            "text": "Cyber Security Consulting Provider India | CyberQuess\n\nCyberQuess\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nCompliances\n\nPCI DSS\nPDPL\nIS Audit\nITGC AUDIT\nNESA\nSAR\nSAMA\nHIPPA\nGDPR\n\nISO 27001\n\nPCI DSS\n\nSOC as a Service\n\nSAMA\n\nHIPAA\n\nGDPR\n\nIS Audit\n\nISO/IEC\n\nDPDP\n\nSAR\n\nPDPL\n\nSOC 2 Compliance\n\nITGC AUDIT\n\nNESA\n\nSecurity Assessments\n\nRed Team Assessment\nNetwork Penetration Testing\nMobile Application Testing\nWeb Application Testing\nNetwork Architecture Review\nCloud Penetration Testing\nSource Code Review\n\nRed Team Assessment\n\nNetwork Penetration Testing\n\nMobile Application Testing\n\nWeb Application Testing\n\nNetwork Architecture Review\n\nCloud Penetration Testing\n\nSource Code Review\n\nDefensive Security\n\nPhishing Simulation\nSOC as a Service\n\nPhishing Simulation\n\nSOC as a Service\n\nRegion\n\nUSA\n\nUAE\n\nContact\n\nTop Cyber Security Service Provider in India\n\nIn the current threat landscape of cyberspace, CyberQuess is among the leading cyber security companies in India , providing the most advanced security consulting, compliance services, and end-to-end threat protection. Our clients in the BFSI, healthcare, telecommunications, and government sectors have trusted us and recognized us as one of the most reputable cybersecurity service providers in India .\nOur certified consultants assist enterprises in protecting their sensitive data from loss or theft, ensuring compliance, and managing changing risk profiles. CyberQuess is a preferred partner for cybersecurity consultant services in India and a trusted cyber security solutions company , consistently providing scalable, risk-based solutions that produce tangible results in security for our valued clients.\n\nBook a Consultation\n\nSecure your business\n\nComprehensive Cyber Security Consulting Services in India\n\nCyberQuess offers full-scale cybersecurity consultant services in India in line with your intended business vision. One of the leading cybersecurity companies in India , our services enable organizations to evolve from reactive defenses to proactive cyber resilience.\n\nVulnerability Assessment &amp; Penetration Testing (VAPT)\n\nWe offer full-featured and end-to-end vulnerability assessment and penetration testing in India to find the security weaknesses that a hacker will attempt to use against you. We thoroughly test cloud, mobile, network, and web applications for end-to-end coverage.\n\nRed Team Assessments\n\nWe perform adversarial red team assessments to mimic real-world attacks to find weaknesses in your defenses. As one of the best cybersecurity consultants in India, our highly skilled red team members will help evaluate, enhance, and test your threat response capability.\n\nManaged Cybersecurity Services (SOC)\n\nOur fully managed SOC delivers 24/7 threat detection, incident response, and monitoring. Trusted by many as leading SOC service providers in India, we help ensure business continuity with real-time protection.\n\nRegulatory Compliance &amp; Audit Readiness\n\nFrom ISO 27001\nto HIPAA\nand GDPR ,\nwe guide businesses through complex compliance requirements.\nAs a leader in risk and compliance cybersecurity in India,\nCyberQuess builds audit-ready frameworks aligned with your needs.\n\nLearn More\n\nWhy Businesses Trust CyberQuess for Cybersecurity in India?\n\nCyberQuess is not just a vendor; we are a long-term cybersecurity service provider in India . Our flexible and business-aligned approach truly sets us apart as the top cyber security service provider in India.\n\n100+ clients across India the UAE, and KSA\n\nStrong domain knowledge in BFSI, healthcare, telecom, and the public sector\n\nFlexible security solutions that greatly reduce breach risks and provide significant compliance help\n\nTools and frameworks: EDR, SOAR, SIEM\n\nBecause we deliver measurable, ethical results that stand out among cybersecurity services in India.\n\nExpert-Led Team of Certified CyberSecurity Consultants India\n\nAs one of the most trusted cybersecurity consulting companies in India , CyberQuess combines global certifications and practical knowledge. So, as a baseline, CyberQuess works with:\n\nCISSP, OSCP, CEH Certified resources\n\nEthical hacking and audit specialists\n\nCompliance knowledge for the specific sector\n\nStrategic frameworks backed by automation and analytics.\n\nThis knowledge base allows us to be the best-rated cyber security consultants in India .\n\nYour Security Matters\u2014Let\u2019s Build a Safer System Together\n\nBook a Consultation\n\nGlobal leader in cybersecurity\n\nWe use the power and scale of our pre-engineered cloud environment and platform.\n\nLearn More\n\nWhy Choose CyberQuess as Your CyberSecurity Consulting Partner?\n\nCybersecurity is a vital component in today\u2019s digitally dominant business world. CyberQuess is internationally recognized as one of the most dependable cybersecurity companies in India , providing sophisticated cybersecurity consulting and compliance services to organizations of all sizes.\n\nKey reasons to choose CyberQuess include:\nCompliance Services: ISO 27001 , PCI DSS, SOC as a Service, SAMA, HIPAA, GDPR , and other regulatory compliance consulting.\n\nSecurity Assessments: Red team assessment , network penetration testing, mobile and web application testing, and other vulnerability assessments.\n\nDefensive Security: SOC as a Service , phishing simulation, and continuous threat monitoring to detect and respond to cyber threats.\n\nStrategic Approach\n\nCyberQuess provides security strategies that are aligned with your KPIs. We are one of the leading cybersecurity companies in India. We have built a solid reputation of trust and technical expertise, together with results delivered.\n\nTrusted Resources &amp; Certified Cyber Security Consultants\n\nWe have a team of experts, specifically globally recognizable certified professionals (e.g., CISSP, OSCP, CEH), who have practical experience based around ethical hacking &amp; security assessments.\n\nProven Industry Success\n\nCyberQuess has conducted cybersecurity and compliance solutions for clients across BFSI, healthcare, fintech, SaaS, manufacturing, and government efficiently and effectively.\n\nData Privacy &amp; Compliance Experts\n\nIn the current regulatory landscape, it can be difficult to keep up with change, and that's where CyberQuess comes in. We have particular expertise in leading security and privacy standards.\n\nFlexible &amp; Scalable Security\n\nAt CyberQuess, we follow a risk-driven approach to cybersecurity. This indicates that our plans are tailored around your business risks, priorities, and growth path.\n\nIf you want a cybersecurity consultant in India that offers more than just compliance to a stated standard, look no further than CyberQuess. We do more than secure your business today; we prepare you for the threats of tomorrow.\n\nYears of Securing Businesses across diverse industries\n\nApplications Tested for security vulnerabilities\n\nNetworks Assessed for misconfigurations and threats\n\nOrganizations Made Compliance Ready\n\nFAQs\n\nWhat services does CyberQuess offer?\n\nCyberQuess provides a wide range of cybersecurity services including Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing (VAPT), Red Team Assessments, SOC as a Service, phishing simulation, compliance consulting, and managed cybersecurity solutions.\n\nWhy should businesses choose CyberQuess for cybersecurity consulting?\n\nCyberQuess combines certified cybersecurity professionals, advanced tools such as SIEM and SOAR, and risk-based security frameworks to help organizations build strong and scalable security infrastructures.\n\nWhat is VAPT and why is it important?\n\nVulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing (VAPT) identifies security weaknesses in systems, networks, and applications. It helps organizations detect vulnerabilities before hackers exploit them and strengthens overall cybersecurity defenses.\n\nWhat industries does CyberQuess serve?\n\nCyberQuess supports businesses across multiple industries including BFSI, healthcare, telecom, SaaS, manufacturing, and government sectors by providing tailored cybersecurity and compliance solutions.\n\nWhat compliance standards does CyberQuess support?\n\nCyberQuess provides consulting and implementation support for major security and privacy standards such as ISO 27001, PCI DSS, HIPAA, GDPR, and SOC compliance frameworks.\n\nReach out, we're here for you!\n\nWe attribute our advances in cloud security and compliance to the exceptional people who work here.\n\nCyberQuess offers advanced cybersecurity solutions such as VAPT, Red Teaming, and 24/7 threat monitoring. We focus on compliance and proactively embeds defenses using the capabilities of VAPT and Red Teaming, proactively position themselves to be secure, resilient, and audit ready.\n\nView Certificate\n\nServices\n\nSOC as a Service\n\nRed Team Assessment\n\nGDPR\n\nSOC 2 Compliance\n\nPDPL\n\nIS Audit\n\nITGC AUDIT\n\nSOC as a Service\n\nRed Team Assessment\n\nGDPR\n\nSOC 2 Compliance\n\nPDPL\n\nIS Audit\n\nITGC AUDIT\n\nQuick links\n\nAbout Us\n\nBlogs\n\nContact\n\nAbout Us\n\nBlogs\n\nContact\n\nHelp &amp; Support\n\n+91-9211544994\ncontactus@cyberquess.com\nINDIA\nA-92, Nambardar Estate, Taimoor Nagar, New Friends Colony, New Delhi , Delhi 110065\nK.S.A\nAl Muhammadiyah tower, 6398 Dhahran Rd, Al Aqrabiyah Dist, Building 3240, Al Khobar 34446, Saudi Arabia\nUAE\nBIN DASMAL BUILDING, AL Goze Industrial First, Dubai UAE\n\n\u00a9 2026 All Rights Reserved.\n\nWhatsApp us\n\nReach out, we're here for you!\n\nReach out, we're here for you!"
