            "text": "[CyberQuess][1]\n\n[ [Top Cyber Security Service Provider in India] ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* Compliances\n* [PCI DSS][5]\n* [PDPL][6]\n* [IS Audit][7]\n* [ITGC AUDIT][8]\n* [NESA][9]\n* [SAR][10]\n* [SAMA][11]\n* [HIPPA][12]\n* [GDPR][13]\n[ ISO 27001 ][14]\n[ PCI DSS ][15]\n[ SOC as a Service ][16]\n[ SAMA ][17]\n[ HIPAA ][18]\n[ GDPR ][19]\n[ IS Audit ][20]\n[ ISO/IEC ][21]\n[ DPDP ][22]\n[ SAR ][23]\n[ PDPL ][24]\n[ SOC 2 Compliance ][25]\n[ ITGC AUDIT ][26]\n[ NESA ][27]\n* Security Assessments\n* [Red Team Assessment][28]\n* [Network Penetration Testing][29]\n* [Mobile Application Testing][30]\n* [Web Application Testing][31]\n* [Network Architecture Review][32]\n* [Cloud Penetration Testing][33]\n* [Source Code Review][34]\n[ Red Team Assessment ][35]\n[ Network Penetration Testing ][36]\n[ Mobile Application Testing ][37]\n[ Web Application Testing ][38]\n[ Network Architecture Review ][39]\n[ Cloud Penetration Testing ][40]\n[ Source Code Review ][41]\n* Defensive Security\n* [Phishing Simulation][42]\n* [SOC as a Service][43]\n[ Phishing Simulation ][44]\n[ SOC as a Service ][45]\n* Region\n[[USA][USA]][46]\n\n### [USA][47]\n\n[[UAE][UAE]][48]\n\n### [UAE][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n\n# About Us\n\nA figurehead in robotic process automation\u2014has an extreme awareness of the difficulties and\ncomplexity which are associated with safeguarding infrastructure and data. CyberQuess provides\nstrong cybersecurity solutions that are very well suited to the changing demands of contemporary\nbusinesses by using their huge experience and technology. CyberQuess guarantees its clients the\nsafety of important information assets and the smooth functioning of digital infrastructures by\ncombining sophisticated threat detection, preventive techniques, and thorough risk management\nprocedures.\n\n## Security is a Journey, Not a Destination\n\nWe go beyond basic compliance to help your organization mature its overall security posture. We\nbelieve in building a strong foundation for security, not just relying on technology. Our goal is to\nempower you to maintain a secure environment at all levels, even with a reasonable budget.\n\n## Building Trust Through Excellence\n\nWe deliver security solutions to both consumers and businesses, fostering long-term relationships\nbased on mutual trust and exceptional service. We believe technology should be used to enhance, not\nreplace, a well-designed security program. Automation and continuous improvement are key to our\napproach.\n\n## Experience You Can Count On\n\nOur team boasts extensive experience across a wide range of information security services. From\npayment card industry (PCI) compliance to ISO 27001, SOC consulting, we have the expertise to help\nyou navigate complex security challenges. We offer industry-leading solutions for intrusion\ndetection, incident handling, forensics, regulatory compliance, penetration testing, and application\nassessments.\n[Top Cyber Security Service Provider in India][Top Cyber Security Service Provider in India]\n\n### Vision\n\n\"To pioneer a fortified digital landscape, safeguarding organizations and individuals against cyber\nthreats, thus fostering trust and resilience in the digital realm.\"\n\n[Top Cyber Security Service Provider in India][Top Cyber Security Service Provider in India]\n\n### Mission\n\n\"To pioneer a fortified digital landscape, safeguarding organizations and individuals against cyber\nthreats, thus fostering trust and resilience in the digital realm.\"\n\n## Provide Advanced Security for Advanced Threat\n\nWhen moving regulated workloads to the cloud, choosing services that ensure you can continuously\nmeet compliance requirements is imperative.\n\nYears of Securing Businesses across diverse industries\n0 +\nApplications Tested for security vulnerabilities\n0 +\nNetworks Assessed for misconfigurations and threats\n67 +\nOrganizations Made Compliance Ready\n0 +\n\n## Key People\n\n## Our Team Members\n\nAt CyberQuess, we combine extensive experience with cutting-edge solutions. Our team of accomplished\nsecurity professionals has developed a wide range of programs to address the unique needs of various\nclients.\n[images (2)][images (2)]\n][51]\n\n## [ Afaque Rahmani ][52]\n\nCEO\n\n[images (2)][images (2)]\n\n## Afaque Rahmani\n\nCEO\n\nAfaque brings over a decade of experience in consulting with a strong background in Cybersecurity\nand Robotic Process Automation (RPA). With an extensive tenure at Big Four firms, he has audited and\nconsulted for numerous Fortune 500 companies, specializing in creating robust security ecosystems.\nHis visionary leadership and deep industry insights drive our strategic initiatives and innovations,\nensuring we stay at the forefront of technology and security.\n* **Email:**[afaque.rahmani@roboquess.com][53]\n[images (2)][images (2)]\n][54]\n\n## [ Mohd Faraz ][55]\n\nCo-Founder\n\n[images (2)][images (2)]\n\n## Mohd Faraz\n\nCo-Founder\n\nFaraz, our Co-Founder and Chief Technology Officer, brings over a decade of specialized consulting\nexperience in Cybersecurity & RPA. With a distinguished career at Big Four firms, he has provided\nexpert auditing and consulting services to both Large, midsized to small enterprises. Focusing on\nbuilding resilient and secure technological environments, his deep technical expertise and\ninnovative vision are crucial in advancing our company's technology strategy and maintaining\ncutting-edge security standards.\n* **Email:**[mohd.faraz@roboquess.com][56]\n[images (2)][images (2)]\n][57]\n\n## [ Haaris Shamim ][58]\n\nManager\n\n[images (2)][images (2)]\n\n## Haaris Shamim\n\nManager\n\nHaaris, leads our Cyber Security Practice, and brings over a decade of expertise in business\ndevelopment and project delivery, with a strong focus on security compliances. He has a broad range\nof consulting experience, assisting organizations of all sizes in scaling their information security\nneeds. He has a proven track record in formulating strategic plans, setting up high-performing\nteams, and managing complex Information Security projects. Known for his results-driven approach,\nHaaris\u2019 technical knowledge and innovative vision are essential in advancing our company\u2019s strategic\ngoals and maintaining top-tier security standards.\n* **Email:**[haaris@cyberquess.com][59]\n[images (2)][images (2)]\n][60]\n\n## [ Sagar Saxena ][61]\n\nSenior Analyst\n\n[images (2)][images (2)]\n\n## Sagar Saxena\n\nSenior Analyst\n\nSagar brings extensive experience in project consulting, strategic planning, and operational\nexcellence. At CyberQuess, he specializes in leveraging cutting-edge tools and methodologies to\ntackle complex information security challenges, drive compliance, and deliver measurable results.\nWith a deep passion for cybersecurity and technology, Sagar is committed to safeguarding digital\nassets and enhancing organizational resilience in an ever-evolving threat landscape.\n* **Email:**[sagar.saxena@cyberquess.com][62]\n[user-female-icon][user-female-icon]\n][63]\n\n## [ Aqsa Rehman ][64]\n\n[user-female-icon][user-female-icon]\n\n## Aqsa Rehman\n\nAqsa leads our Human Resources department with a focus on talent acquisition and policy formation.\nWith extensive experience in identifying and recruiting top talent, she ensures that our\norganization attracts and retains the best professionals. Additionally, Sumaira is instrumental in\nshaping and implementing HR policies that foster a productive and inclusive workplace, driving our\ncompany's success through strategic human capital management.\n* **Email:**[aqsa.rehman@roboquess.com][65]\n\n## Reach out, we're here for you!\n\nWe attribute our advances in cloud security and compliance to the exceptional people who work here.\n\n[Top Cyber Security Service Provider in India]\n\n**CyberQuess offers advanced cybersecurity solutions such as VAPT, Red Teaming, and 24/7 threat\nmonitoring. We focus on compliance and proactively embeds defenses using the capabilities of VAPT\nand Red Teaming, proactively position themselves to be secure, resilient, and audit ready.**\n\n[ISO/IEC 27001:2022 Certified Company][ISO/IEC 27001:2022 Certified Company]\n\n[**View Certificate**][66]\n\n## Services\n* [SOC as a Service][67]\n* [Red Team Assessment][68]\n* [GDPR][69]\n* [SOC 2 Compliance][70]\n* [PDPL][71]\n* [IS Audit][72]\n* [ITGC AUDIT][73]\n* [SOC as a Service][74]\n* [Red Team Assessment][75]\n* [GDPR][76]\n* [SOC 2 Compliance][77]\n* [PDPL][78]\n* [IS Audit][79]\n* [ITGC AUDIT][80]\n\n## Quick links\n* [About Us][81]\n* [Blogs][82]\n* [Contact][83]\n* [About Us][84]\n* [Blogs][85]\n* [Contact][86]\n\n## Help & Support\n\n[+91-9211544994][87]\n[contactus@cyberquess.com][88]\n\n**INDIA**\n\nA-92, Nambardar Estate, Taimoor Nagar, New Friends Colony, New Delhi , Delhi 110065\n\n**K.S.A**\n\nAl Muhammadiyah tower, 6398 Dhahran Rd, Al Aqrabiyah Dist, Building 3240, Al Khobar 34446, Saudi\nArabia\n\n**UAE**\n\nBIN DASMAL BUILDING, AL Goze Industrial First, Dubai UAE\n\n\u00a9 2026 All Rights Reserved.\n\nWhatsApp us\n\n## Reach out, we're here for you!\n\n[1]: https://cyberquess.com/\n[2]: https://cyberquess.com\n[3]: https://cyberquess.com/\n[4]: https://cyberquess.com/about-us/\n[5]: https://cyberquess.com/pci-dss-compliance/\n[6]: https://cyberquess.com/pdpl/\n[7]: https://cyberquess.com/is-audit/\n[8]: https://cyberquess.com/itgc-audit/\n[9]: https://cyberquess.com/services/nesa/\n[10]: https://cyberquess.com/sar-audit/\n[11]: https://cyberquess.com/sama/\n[12]: https://cyberquess.com/services/hipaa/\n[13]: https://cyberquess.com/services/gdpr-compliance/\n[14]: https://cyberquess.com/services/iso-27001/\n[15]: https://cyberquess.com/pci-dss-compliance/\n[16]: https://cyberquess.com/services/soc-as-a-service/\n[17]: https://cyberquess.com/sama/\n[18]: https://cyberquess.com/services/hipaa/\n[19]: https://cyberquess.com/services/gdpr-compliance/\n[20]: https://cyberquess.com/i