            "url": "https://cyberquess.com/services/soc-as-a-service/",
            "text": "[CyberQuess][1]\n\n[ [Top Cyber Security Service Provider in India][Top Cyber Security Service Provider in India] ][2]\n* [Home][3]\n* [About Us][4]\n* Compliances\n* [PCI DSS][5]\n* [PDPL][6]\n* [IS Audit][7]\n* [ITGC AUDIT][8]\n* [NESA][9]\n* [SAR][10]\n* [SAMA][11]\n* [HIPPA][12]\n* [GDPR][13]\n[ ISO 27001 ][14]\n[ PCI DSS ][15]\n[ SOC as a Service ][16]\n[ SAMA ][17]\n[ HIPAA ][18]\n[ GDPR ][19]\n[ IS Audit ][20]\n[ ISO/IEC ][21]\n[ DPDP ][22]\n[ SAR ][23]\n[ PDPL ][24]\n[ SOC 2 Compliance ][25]\n[ ITGC AUDIT ][26]\n[ NESA ][27]\n* Security Assessments\n* [Red Team Assessment][28]\n* [Network Penetration Testing][29]\n* [Mobile Application Testing][30]\n* [Web Application Testing][31]\n* [Network Architecture Review][32]\n* [Cloud Penetration Testing][33]\n* [Source Code Review][34]\n[ Red Team Assessment ][35]\n[ Network Penetration Testing ][36]\n[ Mobile Application Testing ][37]\n[ Web Application Testing ][38]\n[ Network Architecture Review ][39]\n[ Cloud Penetration Testing ][40]\n[ Source Code Review ][41]\n* Defensive Security\n* [Phishing Simulation][42]\n* [SOC as a Service][43]\n[ Phishing Simulation ][44]\n[ SOC as a Service ][45]\n* Region\n[[USA][USA]][46]\n\n### [USA][47]\n\n[[UAE][UAE]][48]\n\n### [UAE][49]\n* [Contact][50]\n\n# India's Trusted SOC Service Providers: 24/7 Managed Security Operations\n\nIn 2024 alone, over 1.6 million cyberattacks targeted Indian businesses in the BFSI, healthcare, IT,\nand e-commerce sectors. Building an in-house Security Operations Center costs 2\u20134 crores per year\nfor infrastructure, tools, and analyst salaries. It does not take into account the talent shortage.\nBoth problems are eliminated by CyberQuess.\n\nAs a certified **SOC service provider in India**, we deliver enterprise-grade threat detection,\nincident response, and compliance reporting at a predictable monthly cost, with zero capital\ninvestment required. Our **managed SOC services in India** help organizations achieve 24/7 security\nmonitoring without the complexity of building an in-house SOC.\n\n[ Request a Quote Today! ][51]\n[ Secure your business ][52]\n\n## What Is SOC as a Service?\n\nUnlike a traditional Security Operations Center, which requires on-premises infrastructure and a\nfull-time analyst team, SOCaaS delivers the same capabilities through a cloud-delivered,\nsubscription-based model. Businesses increasingly rely on **SOC as a Service providers** to\nstrengthen threat detection, incident response, and security visibility.\n\n### Key capabilities delivered under a managed SOC model:\n* Continuous 24x7x365 monitoring of logs, alerts, and traffic patterns across cloud and on-premise\ninfrastructure\n* Machine learning and behavioral analytics combined with SIEM, EDR/XDR, and SOAR to detect threats\n* Measurement of Mean Time to Detect (MTTD) and Mean Time to Respond (MTTR) against agreed SLAs\n* Incident response: containment, eradication, and recovery with documented post-incident reports\n* Compliance-ready audit logs and reporting aligned to [ISO 27001][53], PCI DSS, [HIPAA][54], [GDPR\ncompliance][55], and India-specific mandates\n\n## Why is SOC Important?\n\nSOC has a critical function in developing cyber resilience because it is responsible for preventing\ndisruptions and ensuring that businesses are protected in the long term.\n\n[timely threat detection][timely threat detection]\n\n### Timely Threat Detection and Response\n\nA SOC will continuously analyze logs, alerts and traffic patterns, and it has the advantage of\neliminating or reducing reaction time with proactive monitoring. Each of these data points signifies\nthat our SOC can act before a situation becomes a breach.\n[rapid response][rapid response]\n\n### Rapid Incident Response\n\nIf a security event occurs, our analysts immediately assess severity, contain the threat, and\nrestore operations to reduce downtime and financial losses. This structured approach makes SOC\nservices in India essential for modern enterprises.\n[threat hunting][threat hunting]\n\n### Proactive Threat Hunting\n\nRather than waiting for alerts, our SOC teams actively search for hidden vulnerabilities. As one of\nthe trusted SOC as a Service Provider in India, CyberQuess ensures organizations remain one step\nahead of cybercriminals.\n[proactive detection capabilities][proactive detection capabilities]\n\n### Compliance & Regulatory Support\n\nSOC assist businesses to comply with strict regulatory frameworks, like ISO 27001, PCI DSS, HIPAA,\nand GDPR. With continuous monitoring and in-depth reporting, audits become easy and compliance is\nsimplified.\n\n## How CyberQuess SOC as a Service Works\n\nWith CyberQuess, organizations can have full protection within two weeks of onboarding. By building\non each step, there are no visibility gaps from day one. As an experienced **SOC as a Service\nvendor**, CyberQuess ensures seamless onboarding, rapid deployment, and continuous monitoring from\nthe start.\n\n**Discovery & Asset Mapping:** Our team conducts a full inventory of your servers, endpoints, cloud\nservices, network devices, and SaaS applications to establish complete visibility.\n\n**SIEM & Tool Integration:** We deploy log-collection agents and integrate your environment with our\nSOC platform, using SIEM (Splunk, Microsoft Sentinel, or IBM QRadar), EDR, and XDR tools.\n\n**Baseline & Rule Tuning:** We establish a behavioral baseline and configure detection rules to\nreduce false positives by filtering noise before alerts reach your team.\n\n**24/7 Monitoring & Threat Hunting:** Certified Tier 1, Tier 2, and Tier 3 analysts continuously\nmonitor your environment. A threat hunter actively searches for indicators of compromise (IOCs)\nbefore automated alerts fire.\n\n**When a threat is confirmed, our response team contains, eradicates, and recovers it.** Within the\nagreed SLA timeframe, you receive a severity-classified incident report with root-cause analysis and\nremediation recommendations.\n\n### In-House SOC vs. Managed SOC as a Service: Which Is Right for Your Business?\n\nMost Indian mid-market enterprises face a straightforward trade-off: build a SOC and absorb 18\u201324\nmonths of setup time and ongoing recruitment costs, or partner with a managed SOC-as-a-service\nprovider in India and achieve full coverage within days. The comparison below makes the decision\nclear.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nFactor \u2502In-House SOC \u2502Managed SOC as a Service\n\u2502 \u2502(CyberQuess)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nSetup Time \u250212\u201324 months \u25027\u201314 days onboarding\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250