managed by CyberQuess\nRisk \u2502in India \u2502\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nThreat \u2502Limited to internal feeds \u2502Global + India-specific threat intel\nIntelligence \u2502 \u2502feeds\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n## Why CyberQuess - best SOC services in India?\n\nCyberQuess is well-known as a SOC service provider in India, offering the most advanced, scalable\nand cost-effective security operations service.\n\nAlways Watching\nOur SOC analysts use leading SIEM tools to monitor your IT environment 24/7/365, making sure that\nreal-time threats are recognised.\nThreat Identification\nWe use machine learning, behavioral analytics, and threat intelligence to identify anomalies, and\nlift the curtain on concealed risks in your systems.\nResponse to Incidents\nWhen cyber incidents occur, our certified professionals mobilize immediately and utilize proven\ncontainment, eradication, and recovery tactics to help mitigate the impact of the incident.\nRegulatory Compliance\nCyberQuess provides reports that are compliant-ready with the required security standards of GDPR,\nHIPAA, PCI DSS, and ISO 27001 for your business.\nAccess to Professional Expertise\nBy partnering with CyberQuess, you collaborate with one of the leading SOC services companies in\nIndia, gaining access to skilled cybersecurity experts across multiple industries.\n\n## Advantages of Partnering With Cyberquess\n\nWhen you partner with CyberQuess, you are not just buying a monitoring service, you are choosing a\nreliable partner in your cyber defense for the long term!\n\nCosts Efficiency\nLeveraging a flexible SOC-as-a-service model, you can avoid all the excess costs for infrastructure\nand the inflexibility of allocating your security spend.\nEnhanced Security Posture\nContinuous monitoring and proactive detection improve your organization\u2019s overall defense\ncapabilities through reliable soc services in India.\nBusiness Continuity\nOur SOC service model minimizes the impact on your organization due to the fast incident response\ntimes we provide, enabling you to have near total continuity of your business operations.\nPeace of Mind\nBy outsourcing your SOC service to a SOC services company in India like CyberQuess, you are able to\nfocus on business expansion while we monitor and protect your IT ecosystem around the clock.\n\n### SOC Operating Models Offered by CyberQuess\n\nDifferent organizations have different risk profiles, budgets, and levels of internal security\nmaturity. CyberQuess offers three SOC delivery models so that SOC services in India can fit your\norganization, not the other way around.\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\