ting solutions. Along the 16+ years\nof journey we have served millions of clients across several industries from banking & finance, law,\nto businesses. Besides, our technical stack comes straight away from USA, South Korea, Israel, etc.\n\nBeing recognized as the most reliable forensics company in India and acknowledged by ISO\ncertification 27001, we have marked our footprints in the industry for keeping our clients as the\ntop priority and giving tailored services to all our clientele. Over the years we have continued to\nbuild and provide customer satisfaction plus customer retention as one of our greatest strengths. We\nhave a highly intelligent and creative team committed to providing their finest work on behalf of\nclients and partners supports our national community.\n\n## Our Vision\n\nECS was created as a result of two decade of experience in developing rock-solid cyber forensics\ncapabilities for many of the most important and grinded organizations worldwide, with a vison to\naddress some of the most challenging digital forensics challenges for businesses, banks and\ngovernment entities. ECS continues to stand out in providing professional cyber forensics solutions.\nWe concentrate even more energy and resources on building strong digital forensic and [**cyber\nsecurity**][57] foundations. Our motivation comes from giving our clients\u2019 aspirations top priority,\neven though we are driven to provide unbiased and forensic consulting.\n\n## Our Mission\n\nWe are constantly striving to enhance the quality of our work and services. We aim to serve with\npassion while upholding all the facets of our clients\u2019 diversity. Delivering Finest Digital\nForensics Solutions, Cyber Forensics assessment, Forensics and Consulting Solutions All Across The\nGlobe.\n\n[ECS vision][ECS vision]\n\n## Why ECS?\n\nECS has a squad of most talented and experienced cyber forensics experts in India.\n\nOur team is better able to focus work efforts on quality and efficiency by making sensible use of\nadvanced technologies and performance metrics. Besides, we provide high customer retention rates to\nprovide 100% integrity to our clientele.\n\nOur highly skilled workforce comes from a variety of backgrounds and brings frontline expertise on\nthe table. We employ world-class technology, telematics and skillset to provide top-notch cyber\nforensics abilities that safeguard your cyber data, infrastructure, clients and managers from\nfalling for vulnerabilities in the system.\n\nOur team focus on eradicating the challenges of our clients with digital forensics and cyber\nforensics solutions.\n\n## Founder\n\n[Vijay Mandora CMD][Vijay Mandora CMD]\n\n## Vijay Mandora\n\nCMD\n[Seema Mandora Director][Seema Mandora Director]\n\n## Seema Mandora\n\nDirector\n\n## Awards & Achievement\n\n[Asia Retail Excellence Award][Asia Retail Excellence Award]\n\n## Vijay Mandora\n\nAsia Retail Excellance Award Asia Retail Excellance Award to Vijay Mandora CMD of ECS Biztech Pvt\nLtd.\n[CRN Xcellence Award 2012][CRN Xcellence Award 2012]\n\n## ECS Biztech\n\nCRN Xcellence Award 2012 CRN Xcellence Award 2012 for Best Sub Distributor Advanced Market West\n[Mother Teresa Excellence Award][Mother Teresa Excellence Award]\n\n## Seema Mandora\n\nMother Teresa Excellence Award Mother Teresa Excellence Award for paisworthy services, excellent\nperfomance and memorable contribution for the overall progress of society\n[Women of Excellence Award 2022][Women of Excellence Award 2022]\n\n## Seema Mandora\n\nWomen of Excellence Award 2022 on Women\u2019s Day by EX Mayor Of Ahmedabad Meenakshi Patel\n[World Women Leadership Congress & Award by Shabana Azmi][World Women Leadership Congress & Award by\nShabana Azmi]\n\n## Seema Mandora\n\nWorld Women Leadership Congress & Award by Shabana Azmi\n[IGSP Award][IGSP Award]\n\n## Seema Mandora\n\nIGSP Award Indira Gandhi Seva Shree Puraskar for Outstanding Individual Achievements\n\n## Contact Us\n\n#### [Call us now on +91 89800 05006][58]\n\n[ contact now ][59]\n\n## What Makes Us Unique?\n\n## What Makes Us Unique?\n* Cost Effective and Efficient. We have begun a brand-new era of cost-effective and reliable smart\ntools through groundbreaking risk assessment and business-compliant data retrieval strategies.\n* Upskilling. We constantly invest in skills uplifting our forensics staff in order to provide\nclients with the exceptional assistance possible. With our diverse range ofdigital forensics\nsolutions, you can digitize your entire investigation.\n* Extensive Problem-Solving Experience. We deliver comprehensive IT solutions to our worldwide\ncustomers' technical hurdles.\n* Extremely High Flexibility. Our help desk is available 24 hours a day, seven days a week.\n* Thriving Future. Our inroads into digital forensic solutions and cyber forensic solutions have\ngranted us a competitive advantage that is now assisting us in defining the industry's green\nfuture.\n* Regular Client Reviews. Our primary focus is client satisfaction. As a result, we consciously\nguarantee that our client's requirements are satisfied.\n\n## Our Clients\n\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][60]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][61]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][62]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][63]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][64]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][65]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][66]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][67]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][68]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][69]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][70]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][71]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][72]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][73]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][74]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][75]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][76]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][77]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][78]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][79]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][80]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][81]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][82]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][83]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][84]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][85]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][86]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][87]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][88]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][89]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][90]\n[ [Partner Logo][Partner Logo] ][91]\n[ Know more ][92]\n\n## Hear From Our Customers\n\nI have been incredibly impressed with how you handle high-pressure cases and situations. Your\nability to maintain absolute accuracy while working under tight deadlines ensures our operations run\nsmoothly.\n\n[image][image]\n\n### Income Tax Department (ITD)\n\nBikaner - Rajasthan\n\nOur Bank needed an Information Technology Asset Management Solution. ECS team has implemented the\ncomplete solution with ease. I Must say ECS team support team is also very responsive and operates\n24\u00d77.\n\n[image][image]\n\n### Paresh Kelawala \u2013 AGM IT\n\nThe Varaccha Co-operative Bank Ltd.\n\nThe digital forensic engineer is well-versed with the data extraction of electronic devices and\ncompleted his work in a timely manner & in the best possible professional manner.\n\n[image][image]\n\n### Directorate of Revenue Intelligence (DRI)\n\nSurat - Gujarat\n\nIf you are looking for an easy solution without buying servers and moreover maintaining the complete\ninfrastructure in your office, ECS will certainly offer you a very simple, reliable, cost-effective\nand efficient solution.\n\n[image][image]\n\n### Chintan Shah \u2013 Director\n\nVeritas Insurance Services Pvt. Ltd.\n\nThe team was hardworking and competent. They managed the forensic affairs smoothly.\n\n[image][image]\n\n### Income Tax Department (ITD)\n\nBareilly - Uttar Pradesh\n\nECS is the most trusted IT partner for us!!\n\nECS offered us the most advance, secure, scalable & reliable options with flexible server\nconfiguration in their most advanced Tier 4 data center. Their 24*7*365 NOC is always very much\ncustomer friendly & dedicated to their solutions.\n\n[image][image]\n\n### Kuntal B. Parikh \u2013 CEO- IT Director\n\nCivic Infotech\n\nECS Infotech Pvt. Ltd. has successfully rendered their digital forensic services during the various\nrequirement of our department. Their team of experts delivered excellent digital forensic services.\nWe also appreciate professionalism, dedication and high-quality services delivered by ECS team,\nimportantly with in a stipulated time frame. We found their services satisfactorily.\n\n[image][image]\n\n### Enforcement Directorate (ED)\n\nIndore - Madhya Pradesh\n\nThe work done by the forensic team is commendable and the team completed the work ahead of schedule.\n\n[image][image]\n\n### Income Tax Department (ITD)\n\nBhilwara - Rajasthan\n\nECS team is professional, experience & has certified cybersecurity experts They provide\nenterprise-grade cybersecurity solutions with the best support.\n\nWe highly recommend ECS as a strong Cyber Security company. We are happy to have a long-term\nbusiness relationship.\n\n[image][image]\n\n### Mr. LR. Modhavadiya \u2013 HOD , IT Manager\n\nSaurashtra Cement\n\n## Case Study\n\n[ [blog image][blog image] ][93]\n\n### [ How Surat National Bank Strengthened Its Cyber Defenses with ECS Anti-Phishing & Anti-Rogue\n### Solution ][94]\n\nTABLE OF CONTENTS Client Overview Challenges Faced The ECS Anti-Phishing & Anti-Rogue Solution\nImpact and Results Client Testimonial Conclusion Client\n\n[ [blog image][blog image] ][95]\n\n### [ From Dead Device to Digital Evidence: Chip-Off Forensics in Action ][96]\n\nTABLE OF CONTENTS Overview Client Background Challenges Solution Delivered Outcome or Results\nConclusion Overview When standard data extraction techniques fail\n\n[ [blog image][blog image] ][97]\n\n### [ Clinical Research Organisation Secures Confidential Data with ECS\u2019 Advanced Email Security\n### Solutions ][98]\n\nCompany Overview The client, a globally renowned clinical research organisation, is a trusted\npartner to the pharmaceutical industry. Known for\n\n[ [blog image][blog image] ][99]\n\n### [ Banking on Cyber Safety: Prime Cooperative Bank\u2019s Success with Anti-Rogue Solution ][100]\n\nOverview Prime Cooperative Bank Surat partnered with us to implement a comprehensive Anti-Phishing\nand Anti-Rogue Solution, aimed at safeguarding its\n\n[ [blog image][blog image] ][101]\n\n### [ Inside the Threat Intelligen"
