\n\n[image][image]\n\n### Kuntal B. Parikh \u2013 CEO- IT Director\n\nCivic Infotech\n\nECS Infotech Pvt. Ltd. has successfully rendered their digital forensic services during the various\nrequirement of our department. Their team of experts delivered excellent digital forensic services.\nWe also appreciate professionalism, dedication and high-quality services delivered by ECS team,\nimportantly with in a stipulated time frame. We found their services satisfactorily.\n\n[image][image]\n\n### Enforcement Directorate (ED)\n\nIndore - Madhya Pradesh\n\nThe work done by the forensic team is commendable and the team completed the work ahead of schedule.\n\n[image][image]\n\n### Income Tax Department (ITD)\n\nBhilwara - Rajasthan\n\nECS team is professional, experience & has certified cybersecurity experts They provide\nenterprise-grade cybersecurity solutions with the best support.\n\nWe highly recommend ECS as a strong Cyber Security company. We are happy to have a long-term\nbusiness relationship.\n\n[image][image]\n\n### Mr. LR. Modhavadiya \u2013 HOD , IT Manager\n\nSaurashtra Cement\n\n## Case Study\n\n[ [blog image][blog image] ][93]\n\n### [ How Surat National Bank Strengthened Its Cyber Defenses with ECS Anti-Phishing & Anti-Rogue\n### Solution ][94]\n\nTABLE OF CONTENTS Client Overview Challenges Faced The ECS Anti-Phishing & Anti-Rogue Solution\nImpact and Results Client Testimonial Conclusion Client\n\n[ [blog image][blog image] ][95]\n\n### [ From Dead Device to Digital Evidence: Chip-Off Forensics in Action ][96]\n\nTABLE OF CONTENTS Overview Client Background Challenges Solution Delivered Outcome or Results\nConclusion Overview When standard data extraction techniques fail\n\n[ [blog image][blog image] ][97]\n\n### [ Clinical Research Organisation Secures Confidential Data with ECS\u2019 Advanced Email Security\n### Solutions ][98]\n\nCompany Overview The client, a globally renowned clinical research organisation, is a trusted\npartner to the pharmaceutical