      "polished_summary": "Ecsinfotech is a leading forensics company in India, specializing in digital and cyber forensics solutions. The company offers a range of services, including cyber intelligence, digital forensics, vulnerability assessments, and managed detection and response, catering primarily to corporate organizations, government agencies, and law enforcement. With a commitment to enhancing security frameworks and uncovering financial fraud, Ecsinfotech is dedicated to providing top-notch solutions across various sectors, including banking, finance, and law.",
