 Services\n  * [ Hedge Fund ][106]\n  * [ Family Office ][107]\n  * [ Fund Administration ][108]\n* Industries\n  Close Industries Open Industries\n  * [ Real Estate and Construction ][109]\n  * [ Travel and Hospitality ][110]\n  * [ E-commerce and Retail ][111]\n  * [ Legal Firm ][112]\n  * [ Manufacturing ][113]\n  * [ Chemical & Energy ][114]\n  * [ Healthcare & Pharma ][115]\n  * [ BFSI ][116]\n  * [ Logistics and Transportation ][117]\n  * [ Information & Communication Technology ][118]\n* Insights & Resources\n  Close Insights & Resources Open Insights & Resources\n  * [ Case Studies ][119]\n  * [ Blog ][120]\n  * [ eBooks ][121]\n  * [ Whitepapers & Reports ][122]\n  * [ Press Releases ][123]\n  * [ Articles ][124]\n* Company\n  Close Company Open Company\n  * [ About IBN ][125]\n  * Vision and Mission\n  * From the CEO\n  * [ Thought Leadership ][126]\n  * Awards and Recognition\n  * [ Client Stories ][127]\n  * History\nUnparalleled Digital Solutions for a Connected World\n\n# Setting the Standard for Cybersecurity Excellence\n\nRisk Assessment \u2022 Threat Detection \u2022 Compliance \u2022 Zero Trust \u2022 SOC\n\n24/7 Managed Cybersecurity: Anytime, Anywhere Protection for Your Digital Assets-Uniting\nPerformance, Protection, and Leadership\n\nContact Our Expert\nAccelerate Innovation with Cloud-First Agility\n\n## Cloud Services: Migration to Modernization, With You at Every Step\n\nMigration \u2022 Management \u2022 FinOps \u2022 DevSecOps \u2022 Kubernetes\n\nWe deliver scalable cloud solutions customized to your business goals. Experience agility,\nsecurity,and performance powered by partnership.\n\nContact Our Expert\nAutomate Intelligently, Operate Effortlessly\n\n## Robotic Process Automation for Smarter Workflows\n\nAutomation \u2022 Integration \u2022 Efficiency \u2022 Accuracy \u2022 Scalability\n\nDeploy intelligent automation with cognitive RPA and advanced analytics for real-time making.\nStreamline invoice management, align sales orders, and accelerate workflows for faster, accurate\npayment processing.\n\nContact Our Expert\nExpert Accounting, Delivered Remotely\n\n## Lead with Confidence in Outsource Accounting and Bookkeeping Services\n\nAccounting \u2022 Bookkeeping \u2022 Compliance \u2022 Reporting \u2022 Insights\n\nGlobal leader in remote bookkeeping and accounting, delivering 100% accuracy, efficiency, and growth\nfocused.\n\nContact Our Expert\n\nSetting the Standard for Cybersecurity Excellence\n\nRisk Assessment \u2022 Threat Detection \u2022 Compliance \u2022 Zero Trust \u2022 SOC\n\n24/7 Managed Cybersecurity: Anytime, Anywhere Protection for Your Digital Assets-Uniting\nPerformance, Protection, and Leadership\n\nContact Our Expert\n\u00a0\n\n## Navigate Our Core Strengths\n\n### Cybersecurity\n\nVAPT, SEIM, SOC, vCISO\n\n### Cloud\n\nAWS, Azure, Jio\n\n### Finance & Accounting\n\nBookkeeping, Payroll\n\n### Automation\n\nRPA, AP/AR\n\n### BPO\n\nHedge Fund, Civil Engg.\n\n## Proven Leadership\n\nWe lead not only with strategy, but with clarity of purpose and a commitment to excellence.\n\nGlobal Clients\n2.5 K+\nYears of Expertise\u00a0\n26 +\nCompliance Rate\n1000 %\nCloud uptime\n99.9 %\n\nOur Clients\n\n[Ephlux.webp]\n[abitach.webp]\n[Atlantic-data.webp]\n[Azuga.webp]\n[Cloud-Rewind.webp]\n[Demand-media.webp]\n[Digital-Zone.webp]\n[Docully.webp]\n[DOD-Technologies.webp][DOD-Technologies.webp]\n[EM6-Worldwide.webp][EM6-Worldwide.webp]\n[instem.webp][instem.webp]\n[Lattice.webp][Lattice.webp]\n[Maximeyes.webp][Maximeyes.webp]\n[MTX.webp][MTX.webp]\n[Tradesun.webp][Tradesun.webp]\n[Wassha.webp][Wassha.webp]\n[Aurionpro.webp][Aurionpro.webp]\n[British-Orient.webp][British-Orient.webp]\n[Chemito.webp][Chemito.webp]\n[Contata.webp][Contata.webp]\n[Isckon.webp][Isckon.webp]\n[Lenden.webp][Lenden.webp]\n[Mapmyindia.webp][Mapmyindia.webp]\n[Routematic.webp][Routematic.webp]\n[Wint.webp][Wint.webp]\n[LT.webp][LT.webp]\n[bike-bazaar.webp][bike-bazaar.webp]\n[askmia.webp][askmia.webp]\n[vsoftcorp.webp][vsoftcorp.webp]\n[orowealth.webp][orowealth.webp]\nProven Results\n\n## Success Stories & Impact Metrics\n\nReal results from real clients across industries with measurable outcomes.\n\n### 80%\n\nFaster Threat Detection\n\neal-time monitoring with 24/7 SOC reduces MTTD dramatically\n\n### 99%\n\nMigration Success Rate\n\nSeamless cloud transitions with near-zero downtime\n\n### 30% -50%\n\nCost Optimization\n\nMaximize ROI with FinOps and multi-cloud efficiency\n\n### 60%\n\nFewer Vulnerabilities\n\nContinuous VAPT, patching, and DevSecOps integration\n\n### Industry Recognition\n\n**SiliconIndia:** Top 25 Most Promising Cloud Companies\n**CIO Review:** Top 100 Cloud Migration & Solution Providers\n**Microsoft:** Solution Partner (Security & Azure)\n\n### Key Results\n\n80% Reduction in Breach Impact\n300% Faster Compliance Readiness\n95% Increase in Workflow Efficiency\n100% Improvement in Forecast Accuracy\n\n## What Our Clients Say\n\nTrusted by industry leaders\nVishal Tompe\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n@Senior IT Associate, Digitalzone\nAs one of our valued vendors, we would like to take this opportunity to thank you for your efforts\nand collaboration with us over the past year. We have conducted a thorough evaluation of your\nperformance and are pleased to inform you that based on our assessment, your overall performance has\nbeen good. We have assigned a rating of Grade A to your company. We value our partnership with you,\nand we believe that by working together, we can continue to achieve mutually beneficial results. We\nappreciate your attention to this matter and look forward to your continued support. Thank you for\nyour cooperation.\nSyed Muhammad Umair\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n@Senior Technical Manager, Ephlux\nAs one of our valued vendors, we would like to take this opportunity to thank you for your efforts\nand collaboration with us over the past year. We have conducted a thorough evaluation of your\nperformance and are pleased to inform you that based on our assessment, your overall performance has\nbeen good. We have assigned a rating of Grade A to your company. We value our partnership with you,\nand we believe that by working together, we can continue to achieve mutually beneficial results. We\nappreciate your attention to this matter and look forward to your continued support. Thank you for\nyour cooperation.\nHead\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\nIBN enabled me to move bookkeeping tasks off my own plate and focus time on other areas of my\nbusiness. They are knowledgable in QuickBooks Online and other cloud technology and have been\nresponsive to operational needs. They have grown wi"
