      "polished_summary": "IBNTech is a leading provider of comprehensive technology solutions, specializing in cybersecurity, cloud services, AI consulting, and financial management. With a strong focus on sectors such as real estate, healthcare, and manufacturing, the company offers a range of services including vulnerability assessments, managed security solutions, and SAP support to help organizations enhance their operational efficiency and security posture. Established in 1999 and certified with ISO standards, IBNTech is dedicated to delivering innovative and reliable solutions tailored to meet the unique needs of its clients.",
      "audit_reasoning": "IBNTech provides specialized cybersecurity services, including vulnerability assessments, managed security solutions, and compliance management, which are directly relevant to the Cyber-Physical Systems Security market. Their focus on enhancing security posture aligns with the needs of this sector.",
