            "text": "Engineering Journal IJOER | Open Access Journal\n\nSkip to main content\n\nInternational Journal of\nEngineering Research and Science\n\nISSN No.: 2395-6992 | R Impact Factor 4.12\n\nHome\n\nGuidelines for Authors\n\nBoard Members\n\nArchives\n\nSubmit Article\n\nRelated forms\n\nContact Us\n\nInternational Journal of Engineering Research and Science\n\n(Engineering Journal IJOER)\n\nDOI: 10.25125/engineering-journal\n\nJournal is Indexed in\n\nWorldCat |\nNeilit |\nScilit |\nMDPI |\nTyndale University |\nPublons |\nIndiana University |\nIndex Copernicus |\nView all indexing \u2192\n\nEngineering Journal: IJOER [ISSN: 2395-6992(O)]: is a peer-reviewed, open-access international journal. We uphold a strict plagiarism policy and are dedicated to publishing high-quality, innovative research in engineering. The journal serves as a platform for scientists, professors, engineers, and research scholars to share their research and innovations.\n\nAs a member of CrossRef USA, IJOER provides DOIs for published papers, facilitating better discoverability and citation. The journal is indexed by several prestigious databases , enhancing its visibility and influence in the scientific community.\n\nFrequency : Monthly (12 issues per year) \u2013 View current issue\n\nLanguage of Publication : English\n\nNature: Refereed/Peer-Reviewed Engineering Journal \u2013 Review policy\n\nYear of Commencement: 2015\n\nJournal Mission: To accelerate the dissemination of high-quality engineering research, foster interdisciplinary collaboration, and contribute to technological innovation worldwide through rigorous peer review and open access publishing.\n\n\ud83d\udcd6 Aim & Scope\n\u2696\ufe0f Ethics Policy\n\ud83d\udcdc Publication Ethics\n\nSubmit Research Article\n\nLatest Engineering Research\n\nSupporting Research and Innovation\n\nEngineering Journal: IJOER encourages submissions from researchers working in various branches of engineering, including (but not limited to): View all research areas \u2192\n\nComputer & IT\n\nInformation Technology\n\nComputer Science Engineering\n\nSoftware Engineering\n\nData Science & AI\n\nNetwork Security\n\nCloud Computing\n\nElectronics & Electrical\n\nElectronics & Communication\n\nElectrical Engineering\n\nVLSI Design\n\nPower Electronics\n\nEmbedded Systems\n\nSignal Processing\n\nMechanical & Civil\n\nMechanical Engineering\n\nCivil Engineering\n\nChemical Engineering\n\nThermal Engineering\n\nStructural Engineering\n\nFluid Mechanics\n\nSciences & Interdisciplinary\n\nPhysics\n\nChemistry\n\nMathematics\n\nBiomedical Engineering\n\nNanotechnology\n\nEnvironmental Engineering\n\nSpecialized Domains\n\nPlastics Engineering\n\nFood Technology\n\nTextile Engineering\n\nAerospace Engineering\n\nAgricultural Engineering\n\nAutomobile Engineering\n\nManagement & Others\n\nEngineering Management\n\nProject Management\n\nOperations Research\n\nSupply Chain\n\nQuality Engineering\n\nIndustrial Engineering\n\nView Complete Research Areas\n\nAdvantages of Publishing in IJOER\n\nGlobal Research Impact\n\nAs an open-access journal , your research receives immediate worldwide visibility without subscription barriers. Articles are accessible to researchers, engineers, and policymakers across 150+ countries, significantly increasing citation potential and research impact.\n\nPermanent DOI assignment\n\nCrossRef metadata deposit\n\nIndexing in major databases\n\nEfficient Publication Process\n\nOur efficient editorial workflow ensures timely publication. Average time from submission to first decision is 2-3 weeks, with 12 issues published annually. We maintain rigorous peer review while minimizing publication delays. Learn more \u2192\n\nDouble-blind peer review\n\n2-3 week initial decision\n\nMonthly publication schedule\n\nExpert Editorial Oversight\n\nOur international editorial board and reviewer board comprise distinguished engineering researchers and professionals from leading institutions worldwide. They ensure rigorous scientific standards and maintain the journal's commitment to publishing high-quality engineering research.\n\nInternational editorial board\n\nSubject-specific handling editors\n\nTechnical review when required\n\nEthical Publishing Standards\n\nIJOER adheres to the highest ethical standards in engineering publishing. We follow COPE guidelines , employ plagiarism detection software , and ensure compliance with international publication ethics.\n\nCOPE member journal\n\nPlagiarism screening\n\nEthical compliance check\n\nReady to Publish Your Engineering Research?\n\nJoin thousands of engineering researchers from 50+ countries who trust IJOER for quality publication and global visibility.\n\nSubmit Manuscript Now\n\nAuthor Guidelines\n\nWhy Publish with Us?\n\nAverage decision time: 2-3 weeks \u2022 APC information \u2022 Fee waiver available\n\nInternational Journal of Engineering Research and Science: Advancing Engineering Research\n\nAbout Our Engineering Journal\n\nThe International Journal of Engineering Research and Science (IJOER) stands as a premier platform for disseminating high-quality engineering research across diverse disciplines. Established in 2015 and published by AD Publications, our journal has quickly become a trusted resource for engineers, researchers, and academicians worldwide.\n\nAs a multidisciplinary engineering journal, IJOER bridges the gap between theoretical research and practical applications, facilitating the translation of scientific discoveries into technological innovations. Our commitment to open access ensures that vital engineering knowledge reaches practitioners, researchers, and policymakers without financial barriers.\n\nScope and Coverage\n\nIJOER publishes original research articles, comprehensive reviews, technical notes, and short communications across the entire spectrum of engineering and applied sciences. Our broad scope includes but is not limited to:\n\nEngineering Research: Novel findings from empirical studies\n\nApplied Sciences: Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics applications\n\nTechnical Innovations: New methods and technological advancements\n\nInterdisciplinary Research: Cross-domain engineering applications\n\nView full aim and scope \u2192\n\nEditorial Process\n\nIJOER maintains a rigorous editorial process to ensure the publication of scientifically valid and ethically sound research:\n\nInitial Screening: Editorial check for scope, format, and ethical compliance\n\nPeer Review: Double-blind review by at least two independent experts\n\nTechnical Review: Additional review for specialized content\n\nEditorial Decision: Final decision based on reviewer comments\n\nProduction: Professional copyediting, typesetting, and proofreading\n\nDetailed publication process \u2192\n\nJournal Information at a Glance\n\nScan Now\n\nPublication Frequency\n\n12 Issues Per Year\n\nMonthly publication schedule\n\nJournal Metrics\n\nR Impact Factor: 4.12\n\nIndex Copernicus Value: 82.45\n\nView citation reports \u2192\n\nISSN\n2395-6992\n\nLanguage\nEnglish\n\nAccess Model\nOpen Access\n\nLicense\nCC BY 4.0\n\nBegin Your Publishing Journey with IJOER Today\n\nJoin the global community of engineering researchers contributing to the advancement of technological knowledge.\n\nSubmit Your Research\n\nContact Editorial Office\n\nView FAQs\n\nBecome a Reviewer\n\nImpact Factor: 4.12\n\nTrack Your Article\nSpecial Issues\nJournal Indexing\nFAQs\nBlog\nResearch Area\nJournal policies\nProcess of Publication\n\nAcceptance Rate (By Year)\n\nYear\nPercentage\n\n2024 17.64%\n\n2023 9.64%\n\n2022 13.14%\n\n2021 14.26%\n\n2020 11.8%\n\n2019 16.3%\n\n2018 18.65%\n\n2017 15.9%\n\n2016 20.9%\n\n2015 22.5%\n\nContact Information\n\nAddress:\n12/421, MP Nagar ,\n\nBikaner ,\nRajasthan\n334004 ,\nINDIA\n\nFrequency: 12 issues per year\n\nEmail:\n\ninfo@ijoer.com\n\nAlternate Email:\n\ninfo.ijoer@gmail.com\n\nWebsite:\n\nhttps://ijoer.com\n\nJournal Policies\n\nJournal Ethics Policy\n\nOpen Access License Policy\n\nPatent Consent Policy\n\nPeer Review Policy\n\nPermission Policy\n\nTerms and Conditions\n\nOther Academic Journals\n\nInternational Journal of Environmental and Agriculture Research\n\nInternational Multispeciality Journal of Health\n\nJournal of Creative Research in English Literature & Culture\n\nThis work is licensed under a\n\nCreative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License\n\nCopyright &copy;\nEngineering Journal IJOER. All Rights Reserved (AD Publications)"
