            "text": "[ Skip to main content ][1]\n[ [Engineering Journal IJOER Logo] ][2]\n\nInternational Journal of\nEngineering Research and Science\n\nISSN No.: 2395-6992 | R Impact Factor 4.12\n* [ Home ][3]\n* [ Guidelines for Authors ][4]\n* [ Board Members ][5]\n* [ Archives ][6]\n* [ Submit Article ][7]\n* [ Related forms ][8]\n* [ Contact Us ][9]\n1. [Home][10]\n2. Contact Us\n\n# Contact Us \u2013 International Journal of Engineering Research and Science (IJOER)\n\n[Contact IJOER Editorial Team - Engineering Journal Support for Engineering Research & Technology\nPublication]\n\n##### Journal Overview\n\n**International Journal of Engineering Research and Science (IJOER)** [ISSN: 2395-6992] is a\npeer-reviewed, open-access international journal dedicated to advancing engineering research across\nall disciplines. Our editorial team provides comprehensive support for authors, reviewers, and\nreaders in engineering, technology, and applied sciences.\n\nConnect with our dedicated editorial team for assistance with manuscript submissions, peer review\nprocesses, publication ethics, indexing, and engineering research publication.\n\n## Send Us Your Research Inquiry\n\nFull Name: *\nPlease fill out this field.\nEmail Address: *\nPlease enter a valid email address.\nContact Number: *\nPlease enter a valid phone number. Format: +[country code]-[number] or just 10-digit number.\nExamples: +91-9876543210 or 9876543210\nInstitution/Organization:\nInquiry Type: Select the nature of your inquiry Manuscript Submission Peer Review Process\nPublication Ethics Journal Indexing Article Processing Charges (APC) Technical Support Editorial\nBoard Membership Become a Reviewer Other Inquiry\nDetailed Message: *\nPlease fill out this field.\nI confirm that I have provided accurate information and agree to receive communication from IJOER\nregarding my inquiry.\nYou must agree to the terms before submitting.\n**Note:** By submitting this form, you agree to our [privacy policy][11] and consent to receiving\ncommunications from IJOER.\n\n## Editorial Information\n\n### Editorial Office\n\n#### International Journal of Engineering Research and Science (IJOER)\n* **Publisher:** AD Publications\n* **Managing Editor:** Mr. Mukesh Arora\n* **ISSN:** 2395-6992\n* **Address:** 12/421, Mukta Prasad Colony, Bikaner, Rajasthan 334004, India\n* **Phone:** [+91-7665235235][12]\n* **Email:** [info@ijoer.com][13]\n\n### Response Information\n\n###### Response Time\n\nOur editorial team typically responds within **24-48 hours**. For urgent manuscript queries, please\ninclude \"URGENT\" in your email subject line.\n\n###### Submission Tips\n\nBefore contacting us, please review our [Author Guidelines][14] and [FAQ page][15] for common\nquestions about manuscript submission and the publication process.\n\n## Engineering Research Support Services\n\n#### Pre-Submission Assistance\n* Manuscript structure and formatting review (IMRaD format)\n* Engineering research methodology consultation\n* Literature review optimization for engineering research\n* Citation and reference guidance (IEEE, APA, Chicago, Vancouver)\n* Plagiarism check and ethical compliance verification\n* Technical terminology and clarity review\n\n#### Publication Process Support\n* Peer review status tracking (double-blind review)\n* Revision guidance with reviewer feedback integration\n* Publication ethics compliance (COPE guidelines)\n* Indexing and visibility enhancement (CrossRef, Google Scholar, Scopus)\n* DOI assignment and CrossRef metadata deposit\n* Open access licensing (CC BY 4.0) guidance\n\n## Journal Metrics & Indexing\n\n##### Impact Factor\n\n4.12\n\n##### Index Copernicus\n\n82.45\n\n##### h-index\n\nIndexed in: WorldCat, Scilit, Publons, Index Copernicus, NELITI, and more | [View all indexing\npartners \u2192][16]\n\n## Quick Links\n* [Submit Manuscript][17]\n* [Current Issue][18]\n* [Author Guidelines][19]\n* [Frequently Asked Questions][20]\n* [Editorial Board][21]\n* [Peer Review Policy][22]\n* [Publication Ethics][23]\n* [Track Your Article][24]\n\n[Impact Factor: 4.12][25]\n[Track Your Article][26] [Special Issues][27] [Journal Indexing][28] [FAQs][29] [Blog][30] [Research\nArea][31] [Journal policies][32] [Process of Publication][33]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nAcceptance Rate (By Year)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nYear \u2502Percentage\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2024 \u250217.64%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2023 \u25029.64%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2022 \u250213.14%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2021 \u250214.26%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2020 \u250211.8%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2019 \u250216.3%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2018 \u250218.65%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2017 \u250215.9%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2016 \u250220.9%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2015 \u250222.5%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n#### Quick Contact\n\n[ +91-7665235235 ][34] [ info@ijoer.com ][35] [ www.ijoer.com ][36] [ Submit Article ][37] [ Track\nArticle ][38]\n\n##### Response Timeline\n\n**General Inquiries:** 24-48 hours\n\n**Manuscript Queries:** 48-72 hours\n\n**Peer Review Status:** 2-3 weeks\n\n**Urgent Matters:** Mark \"URGENT\" in subject\n\n##### Editorial Office Hours\n\nMonday - Friday\n9:00 AM - 6:00 PM IST\nSaturday\n10:00 AM - 4:00 PM IST\nSunday & Holidays\nClosed\nIST (UTC+5:30)\n\n##### DOI Information\n\n**DOI Prefix:** 10.25125/engineering-journal\n\n**CrossRef Member:** Since 2015\n\nAll published articles receive a permanent DOI\n\n#### Contact Information\n\n**Address:** 12/421, MP Nagar,\nBikaner, Rajasthan 334004, INDIA\n\n**Frequency:** 12 issues per year\n\n**Email:** [ info@ijoer.com ][39]\n\n**Alternate Email:** [ info.ijoer@gmail.com ][40]\n\n**Website:** [ https://ijoer.com ][41]\n\n#### Journal Policies\n* [Journal Ethics Policy][42]\n* [Open Access License Policy][43]\n* [Patent Consent Policy][44]\n* [Peer Review Policy][45]\n* [Permission Policy][46]\n* [Terms and Conditions][47]\n\n#### Other Academic Journals\n* [International Journal of Environmental and Agriculture Research][48]\n* [International Multispeciality Journal of Health][49]\n* [Journal of Creative Research in English Literature & Culture][50]\n\n[ [Creative Commons License] ][51] This work is licensed under a [ Creative Commons Attribution 4.0\nInternational License ][52]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 Engineering Journal IJOER. All Rights Reserved (AD Publications)\n\n##### \u274c Error\n\nOkay\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: /\n[3]: /\n[4]: /author-guidelines\n[5]: /editorial-board\n[6]: /issue\n[7]: /submit-article\n[8]: /downloads\n[9]: /contact\n[10]: /\n[11]: /privacy-policy\n[12]: tel:+917665235235\n[13]: mailto:info@ijoer.com\n[14]: /author-guidelines\n[15]: /faq\n[16]: /journal-indexing\n[17]: /submit-article\n[18]: /issue\n[19]: /author-guidelines\n[20]: /faq\n[21]: /editorial-board\n[22]: /peer-review-policy\n[23]: /publication-ethics\n[24]: /track-article\n[25]: https://rootindexing.com/journal/international-journal-of-engineering-research-science--2/\n[26]: /track-article\n[27]: /special-issues\n[28]: /journal-indexing\n[29]: /faq\n[30]: /blog\n[31]: /research-area\n[32]: /journal-policy\n[33]: /publication-process\n[34]: tel:+917665235235\n[35]: mailto:info@ijoer.com\n[36]: https://ijoer.com/\n[37]: /submit-article\n[38]: /track-article\n[39]: mailto:info@ijoer.com?subject=IJOER Inquiry\n[40]: mailto:info.ijoer@gmail.com?subject=IJOER Inquiry\n[41]: https://ijoer.com\n[42]: /journal-ethics-policy\n[43]: /open-access-license\n[44]: /patent-consent\n[45]: /peer-review-policy\n[46]: /permission-policy\n[47]: /terms-and-conditions\n[48]: https://ijoear.com/\n[49]: https://imjhealth.org/\n[50]: https://jcrelc.com/\n[51]: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\n[52]: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
