            "url": "https://ijoer.com/about",
            "text": "[ Skip to main content ][1]\n[ [Engineering Journal IJOER Logo] ][2]\n\nInternational Journal of\nEngineering Research and Science\n\nISSN No.: 2395-6992 | R Impact Factor 4.12\n* [ Home ][3]\n* [ Guidelines for Authors ][4]\n* [ Board Members ][5]\n* [ Archives ][6]\n* [ Submit Article ][7]\n* [ Related forms ][8]\n* [ Contact Us ][9]\n1. [Home][10]\n2. About IJOER\n\n# About International Journal of Engineering Research and Science (IJOER)\n\n[About IJOER - International Journal of Engineering Research and Science]\n\n##### Journal Overview\n\n**The International Journal of Engineering Research and Science (IJOER)** is a leading open-access\nplatform for disseminating innovative research in engineering, technology, and applied sciences.\nEstablished in 2015, IJOER has become a trusted resource for engineers, researchers, and\nacademicians worldwide.\n\n## Our Mission and Purpose\n\n##### Core Mission Statement\n\n**IJOER** was founded to advance engineering research and promote technological innovation. We are\ndedicated to creating an interactive platform where researchers, engineers, and academicians can\nshare innovative findings that address global engineering challenges and contribute to technological\nadvancement.\n\n##### Academic Excellence\n\nWe publish high-quality research characterized by methodological rigor, technical significance, and\npractical relevance. The journal serves as a catalyst for engineering innovation by supporting\ninterdisciplinary research that advances technological frontiers. [View aim & scope \u2192][11]\n\n##### Global Accessibility\n\nThrough our [open-access publishing model][12], we ensure that quality engineering research reaches\nthe widest possible audience without geographical or institutional barriers. This approach supports\nour mission of democratizing access to cutting-edge technical knowledge.\n\n## Editorial Leadership\n\n##### Managing Editor\n\nChief Editor\n\n### Mr. Mukesh Arora\n\nM.Tech in Digital Communication\n6+ Years Research Experience\n\n###### Technical Expertise\n* Photonic Crystal Fiber\n* Image Processing\n* Sensors Technology\n* Wireless Networks\n* Digital Communication Systems\n\n###### Editorial Role\n* Overall editorial strategy & direction\n* Manuscript workflow management\n* Peer review coordination & oversight\n* Technical quality assurance\n* Publication ethics compliance\n* Final editorial decisions\n\n###### Connect\n\n##### Associate Editor\n\nEditorial Board Member\n\n### Dr. Kusum Gaur\n\nProfessor & Head, Community Medicine\nSawai Man Singh Medical College, Jaipur, India\n32+ Years Teaching Experience\n\n###### Academic Achievements\n* WHO Fellowship for IEC at Bangkok\n* Management Course from NIHFW, New Delhi\n* Author of \"Community Medicine: Practical Guide and Logbook\"\n* CME on \"Research Methodology & Biostatistics\"\n* CME on \"Ethics in Medical Research\"\n\n###### Expertise Areas\n* Biostatistics & Research Methodology\n* Health & Hospital Management\n* Scientific Writing & Publication Ethics\n* Interdisciplinary Research\n* Community Health Research\n\n###### Connect\n\n[ View Full Editorial Board ][13] [ Reviewer Board ][14]\n\n## Publisher Background\n\n**IJOER** is a peer-reviewed international journal published under the academic auspices of **AD\nPublications**, an organization renowned for its commitment to advancing engineering knowledge and\nfostering research excellence across multiple disciplines.\n\nBased in Bikaner, Rajasthan, the organization provides robust infrastructure and administrative\nsupport that enables the journal to maintain high publication standards and operational efficiency.\n[Contact publisher \u2192][15]\n\n##### Published By\n\n###### AD Publications\n\nBikaner, Rajasthan, India\n\nEst. 2015\n\n##### Global Network\n\nThe organization's extensive network of engineering institutions and research organizations\nworldwide enhances IJOER's international visibility and scholarly impact. This global reach\nfacilitates diverse perspectives and cross-cultural research approaches in engineering.\n\n##### Ethical Foundation\n\nOur publisher's commitment to [research ethics and integrity][16] provides a strong foundation for\nour editorial policies. This institutional support enables us to maintain rigorous [peer review\nstandards][17] while ensuring editorial independence.\n\n## Editorial Excellence\n\n##### Rigorous Editorial Standards\n\nIJOER maintains exceptional editorial standards through a distinguished international [editorial\nboard][18] and [reviewer board][19] comprising leading engineering researchers and professionals\nfrom top institutions worldwide. Our board members bring extensive technical expertise, research\nexperience, and industry knowledge that ensure comprehensive manuscript evaluation and valuable\nauthor feedback.\n\n###### Double-Blind Peer Review\n\nAll submissions undergo rigorous double-blind peer review, ensuring impartial evaluation without\ndisclosing author or reviewer identities. [Learn more \u2192][20]\n\n###### Multi-Stage Evaluation\n\nThree-tier review process: initial editorial screening, substantive expert review, and final\neditorial decision based on rigorous criteria including [plagiarism screening][21].\n\n###### Quality Metrics\n\nManuscripts evaluated for novelty, methodological rigor, technical contribution, and practical\nimpact across engineering disciplines.\n\n## Global Reach and Impact\n\n**IJOER** has established a strong international presence with contributors and readers across six\ncontinents. Our global diversity reflects our commitment to incorporating diverse perspectives and\ncross-cultural research approaches into engineering science.\n\nAuthors from more than **50 countries** have chosen IJOER as their preferred publication outlet,\ncreating a rich tapestry of international engineering scholarship that advances technological\nknowledge globally. [Why publish with IJOER \u2192][22]\n\n###### Global Statistics\n\n50+\n\nCountries Represented\n\nContinents Reached\n\n##### Open Access Impact\n\nOur [open-access policy][23] ensures maximum visibility for published research without subscription\nbarriers. This approach has resulted in impressive download statistics and citation impact across\nengineering disciplines.\n* Unrestricted global access to engineering research\n* Higher citation potential\n* Increased research visibility\n* Immediate worldwide dissemination\n\n##### Digital Preservation\n\nWe employ robust digital preservation strategies by archiving content with leading digital\nrepositories, ensuring perpetual access to published engineering research. Our commitment includes\nlong-term digital preservation through [PKP PN and other archives][24] and CrossRef DOI assignment\nfor all articles.\n\nCrossRef Member Digital Archiving\n\n#### Indexing and Discovery\n\nIJOER is actively indexed in major international engineering databases and abstracting services,\nensuring maximum discoverability of published research.\n\n**CrossRef** - DOI Registration Agency\n**Google Scholar** - Academic Search\n**WorldCat** - Library Database\n**Index Copernicus** - ICV 82.45\n**Scilit** - MDPI Database\n**BASE** - Bielefeld Academic Search\n**Publons** - Clarivate Reviewer Recognition\n**Scopus, Web of Science** - Applications in Progress\n[ View Full Indexing List ][25]\n\n## Contact Information\n\n##### Editorial Office\n\n**For all inquiries:**\n\n[info@ijoer.com][26]\n\n[info.ijoer@gmail.com][27]\n\n**Response Time:**\n\nWithin 48 hours on business days (Monday-Friday)\n\n**Phone Support:**\n\n[+91-7665235235][28] (Editorial Office)\n\n##### Online Resources\n\n**Submission Portal:**\n\n[/submit-article][29]\n\n**Author Guidelines:**\n\n[/author-guidelines][30]\n\n**Current Issue:**\n\n[/issue][31]\n\n**Track Manuscript:**\n\n[/track-article][32]\n\n[ Contact Editorial Office ][33]\n\n### Submit Manuscript\n\nJoin our global community of engineering researchers and contribute to technological advancement.\n\n[Submit Article][34]\n\n### View Current Issue\n\nExplore recently published engineering research and technical innovations.\n\n[Browse Articles][35]\n\n### Reviewer Guidelines\n\nJoin our reviewer community and contribute to maintaining research quality.\n\n[Become Reviewer][36]\n[Impact Factor: 4.12][37]\n[Track Your Article][38] [Special Issues][39] [Journal Indexing][40] [FAQs][41] [Blog][42] [Research\nArea][43] [Journal policies][44] [Process of Publication][45]\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nAcceptance Rate (By Year)\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nYear \u2502Percentage\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2024 \u250217.64%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2023 \u25029.64%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2022 \u250213.14%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2021 \u250214.26%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2020 \u250211.8%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2019 \u250216.3%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2018 \u250218.65%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2017 \u250215.9%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2016 \u250220.9%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u253c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n2015 \u250222.5%\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2534\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\n#### Journal at a Glance\n\n**ISSN:** 2395-6992\n**Established:** 2015\n**Publisher:** [AD Publications][46]\n**Access:** [Open Access][47]\n**Review:** [Double-Blind][48]\n**Frequency:** Monthly (12 issues/year)\n**CrossRef:** Member since 2015\n\n##### Meet Our Editorial Board\n\nOur international team of distinguished engineering experts ensures academic excellence and rigorous\npeer review.\n\n[View Board][49]\n\n#### Related Pages\n* [Aim & Scope][50]\n* [Editorial Board][51]\n* [Author Guidelines][52]\n* [Ethics Policy][53]\n* [Peer Review Process][54]\n* [Journal Ethics][55]\n* [Contact Information][56]\n\n##### Why Publish with IJOER?\n* \u2713 Open access with CC BY 4.0 license\n* \u2713 Permanent DOI for each article\n* \u2713 Rapid peer review (2-3 weeks)\n* \u2713 Global indexing & visibility\n* \u2713 No submission fees\n\n[Learn More][57]\n\n#### Contact Information\n\n**Address:** 12/421, MP Nagar,\nBikaner, Rajasthan 334004, INDIA\n\n**Frequency:** 12 issues per year\n\n**Email:** [ info@ijoer.com ][58]\n\n**Alternate Email:** [ info.ijoer@gmail.com ][59]\n\n**Website:** [ https://ijoer.com ][60]\n\n#### Journal Policies\n* [Journal Ethics Policy][61]\n* [Open Access License Policy][62]\n* [Patent Consent Policy][63]\n* [Peer Review Policy][64]\n* [Permission Policy][65]\n* [Terms and Conditions][66]\n\n#### Other Academic Journals\n* [International Journal of Environmental and Agriculture Research][67]\n* [International Multispeciality Journal of Health][68]\n* [Journal of Creative Research in English Literature & Culture][69]\n\n[ [Creative Commons License] ][70] This work is licensed under a [ Creative Commons Attribution 4.0\nInternational License ][71]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 Engineering Journal IJOER. All Rights Reserved (AD Publications)\n\n[1]: #main-content\n[2]: /\n[3]: /\n[4]: /author-guidelines\n[5]: /editorial-board\n[6]: /issue\n[7]: /submit-article\n[8]: /downloads\n[9]: /contact\n[10]: /\n[11]: /aim-and-scope\n[12]: /open-access-license\n[13]: /editorial-board\n[14]: /reviewer-board\n[15]: /contact\n[16]: /publication-ethics\n[17]: /peer-review-policy\n[18]: /editorial-board\n[19]: /reviewer-board\n[20]: /peer-review-policy\n[21]: /plagiarism-policy\n[22]: /why-publish\n[23]: /open-access-license\n[24]: /archiving-policy\n[25]: /journal-indexing\n[26]: mailto:info@ijoer.com\n[27]: mailto:info.ijoer@gmail.com\n[28]: tel:+917665235235\n[29]: /submit-article\n[30]: /author-guidelines\n[31]: /issue\n[32]: /track-article\n[33]: /contact\n[34]: /submit-article\n[35]: /issue\n[36]: /reviewer-guidelines\n[37]: https://rootindexing.com/journal/international-journal-of-engineering-research-science--2/\n[38]: /track-article\n[39]: /special-issues\n[40]: /journal-indexing\n[41]: /faq\n[42]: /blog\n[43]: /research-area\n[44]: /journal-policy\n[45]: /publication-process\n[46]: /contact\n[47]: /open-access-license\n[48]: /peer-review-policy\n[49]: /editorial-board\n[50]: /aim-and-scope\n[51]: /editorial-board\n[52]: /author-guidelines\n[53]: /publication-ethics\n[54]: /peer-review-policy\n[55]: /journal-ethics-policy\n[56]: /contact\n[57]: /why-publish\n[58]: mailto:info@ijoer.com?subject=IJOER Inquiry\n[59]: mailto:info.ijoer@gmail.com?subject=IJOER Inquiry\n[60]: https://ijoer.com\n[61]: