      "polished_summary": "Ijoer is a peer-reviewed, open-access international journal dedicated to advancing high-quality research in engineering and applied sciences. The journal offers a platform for publishing innovative research articles, reviews, and technical notes, supported by a rigorous double-blind peer review process. Targeting researchers, engineers, and academicians, Ijoer also provides indexing services to enhance the visibility and discoverability of published works in major databases.",
