      "polished_summary": "Industrialcybersec specializes in cyber security consulting and services, focusing on the protection of critical infrastructure across various sectors, including energy, transportation, manufacturing, and government. With extensive experience working with the US and UK governments, as well as global corporations, the company provides tailored security solutions to enhance operational integrity and safeguard assets against dynamic cyber threats.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Industrialcybersec provides specialized cyber security consulting and services focused on protecting critical infrastructure across various sectors, which directly aligns with the needs of the Cyber-Physical Systems Security market. Their expertise in SCADA and IT security further emphasizes their relevance.",
