            "text": "# [ Jal Automation [Jal Automation ] [Jal Automation ] ][1]\n\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Director Message][4]\n* [Our Connectivity][5]\n* [Products][6]\n* [Despensing Valves][7]\n* [Single Part Machines][8]\n* [Two Part Machines][9]\n* [Special Purpose Machines][10]\n* [Process][11]\n* [Careers][12]\n* [Contact Us][13]\n\nSearch for\n\n# Contact Us\n* [ Home ][14]\n* [ Contact Us ][15]\n\n##### Let\u2019s Get Started\n\n# Let's Talk\n\n## Make Enquiry\n\n### [ Phone ][16]\n\n[**+91 9371115571**][17]\n\n### [ Email ][18]\n\n[**enquiry@jalgroup.in**][19]\n\n### [ Address ][20]\n\nPlot No. -\"T\" 165/1/22, Priyadarshani Co-Op Society, Near MIDC Square, MIDC Square BHOSARI PUNE -\n411026, Maharashtra, India.\n\n## Contact Details.\n\nYour Name\nYour Phone Number\nYour Email\nSelect Product Dispensive ValvesSingle Part Dispensing ValvesTwo Part Dispensing ValvesSingle Part\nMachinesRTV silicon dispensing gunRTV silicon sealant dispenserRTV silicon dispensing with robotLED\nglue dispensing machineadhesive duct dispenseradhesive handle grip dispensergrease dispensing\nmachinedigital alpha dispenserliquid glue dispenserrotary table dispenseranaerobic adhesive\ndispensing machineoil filter paper rubber adhesive dispensing machinereservoir tanksTwo Part\nMachinesepoxy resin dispensing machine with conveyorsingle head with rotary table dispensing\nmachinedouble head with rotary table dispensing machinesingle head with x-y table dispensing\nmachinetwo head with x-y table dispensing machinefour head with x-y table epoxy dispensing\nmachinesingle piston & double piston suck back valvespecial purpose machinesasphalt potting\nmachineoil spraying machinefasteners & screws coating machinevacuum chamberfront fork oil filling\nmachineconveyorised heating ovenuv conveyor oveninfrared ovensbatch type ovenbelt and roller\nconveyorsdrum mixing systemvacuum sealing machineliquid mixing systemepoxy insulating powder & paint\ncoating machinedigital speedometer, reliability & endurance testing machinedigital speed sensor\ntestingkey ignition switch testingmulti head drilling & tapping machinechamfering machinepainting\nmachine with mixervacuum varnishing machineplanetary paste and powder mixersleeve & tube cutting\nmachinePVC tape dispenser\nYour Message (optional)\n* [ home ][21]\n* [ About us ][22]\n* [ products ][23]\n* [ process ][24]\n* [ Careers ][25]\n* [ Contact us ][26]\n\nAbout JAL Automations\n\nJAL Automation & Systems is a leading manufacturer and supplier of fluid dispensing systems and\nequipment. We specialize in advanced technology, production, and marketing of automated fluid\ndispensing solutions for diverse industries.\n\n[ Facebook ][27] Linkedin-in Whatsapp [ Youtube ][28]\n\nAddress\n\n[Plot No. -\"T\" 165/1/22, Priyadarshani Co-Op Society, Near MIDC Square, MIDC BHOSARI PUNE - 411026,\nMaharashtra, India.][29]\n\n### [ Mail Us ][30]\n\n[enquiry@jalgroup.in][31]\n\n### [ Call Us : ][32]\n\n[ +91 9371115571][33]\n\nOur Products\n* [ dispensive valves ][34]\n* [ single part machines ][35]\n* [ two part machines ][36]\n* [ special purpose machines ][37]\n* Ahmedabad\n* Bengaluru\n* Chennai\n* Faridabad\n* Hyderabad\n* Pune\n* Maharashtra\n* India\n* Noida\n* Gurgaon\n* Delhi\n* Punjab\n* Ludhiana\n* Chandigarh\n\n\u00a92025 Jal Automation. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: https://jalgroup.in/\n[2]: https://jalgroup.in/\n[3]: https://jalgroup.in/about-us/\n[4]: https://jalgroup.in/director-message/\n[5]: https://jalgroup.in/our-connectivity/\n[6]: https://jalgroup.in/products/\n[7]: https://jalgroup.in/despensing-valves/\n[8]: https://jalgroup.in/single-part-machines/\n[9]: https://jalgroup.in/two-part-machines/\n[10]: https://jalgroup.in/special-purpose-machines/\n[11]: https://jalgroup.in/process/\n[12]: https://jalgroup.in/careers/\n[13]: https://jalgroup.in/contact-us/\n[14]: https://jalgroup.in/\n[15]: #\n[16]: tel:+91%209371115571\n[17]: tel:+91 9371115571\n[18]: mailto:enquiry@jalgroup.in\n[19]: mailto:enquiry@jalgroup.in\n[20]: #\n[21]: https://jalgroup.in/\n[22]: https://jalgroup.in/about-us/\n[23]: https://jalgroup.in/products/\n[24]: https://jalgroup.in/process/\n[25]: https://jalgroup.in/careers/\n[26]: https://jalgroup.in/contact-us/\n[27]: https://www.facebook.com/people/JAL-Automation-Systems/100054368764789/#\n[28]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1FSpG_nwdaxmt7_4vDukwQ/videos\n[29]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/9agFA1doXJYez8Aa8\n[30]: mailto:enquiry@jalgroup.in\n[31]: mailto:enquiry@jalgroup.in\n[32]: tel:+91%209371115571\n[33]: tel:+91 9371115571\n[34]: https://jalgroup.in/despensing-valves/\n[35]: https://jalgroup.in/single-part-machines/\n[36]: https://jalgroup.in/two-part-machines/\n[37]: https://jalgroup.in/special-purpose-machines/"
