          {
            "url": "https://jalgroup.in/about",
            "text": "# [ Jal Automation [Jal Automation ] [Jal Automation ] ][1]\n\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Director Message][4]\n* [Our Connectivity][5]\n* [Products][6]\n* [Despensing Valves][7]\n* [Single Part Machines][8]\n* [Two Part Machines][9]\n* [Special Purpose Machines][10]\n* [Process][11]\n* [Careers][12]\n* [Contact Us][13]\n\nSearch for\n\n# About Us\n* [ Home ][14]\n* [ About Us ][15]\n\n### About Us\n\nJal Automation & Systems is one of the leading names in manufacture and supply of fluid dispensing\nsystems and equipment for all industries. JAL Automation & Systems is a highly professional company\nfocusing on the technology development, production & marketing of all automated fluid production\nequipments. With over more than 20 years of experience in the industry enabled the company to gain a\nwealth of expertise and knowledge in associated dispensing disciplines.JAL Automation has been\nbringing innovative Fluid Dispensing solutions for various industries with In house professional\nTechnical team comprising of R&D, Design & Production engineers. Customised products range from\nrobotics to dispensing units and also manufactures water treatment plants required in industrial as\nwell as for commercial purpose.\n\n### Founded by Mr. Sanjay D. Jadhav\n\nJAL Automation & Systems was founded by Mr. Sanjay Jadhav in 2004, Pune. The company began\noperations in fluid dispensing machine in 2004 with small manually operated machines.\n\n### Journey of automation started\n\nIn 2005, with an ambition to gain a competitive advantage through higher productivity, improved\nquality, and lower production costs. JAL Automation started its journey of automation with small\nautomated systems.\n\n### Focusing on Automation\n\nDedicated to provide all industries a cost-effective solution for the needs to dispense liquids and\npaste in a controlled manner. JAL automation started focusing on Automation with the help of its own\nin house technical team.\n\n### Worldwide coverage\n\nSSI member ship no.-270251102869-II ( Directorate of Industries ). Expanding the horizon of services\nto global market JAL automation started serving major companies along with MNC\u2019s in Automation\nfield. It succeeded to capture Automation market within very few years.\n\n0 +\n\nYears Company\u2019s Experience\n\n0 +\n\nProjects Completed\n\n0 +\n\nProfessional Employees\n\n### Our Vision & Mission\n\n## Vision\n\nEmpowering industry through innovative automation solutions,**\u201cJal Automation And\nSystems\u201d** envisions a future where seamless integration of cutting-edge technology enhances\nefficiency, reliability, and sustainability across global operations. With a commitment to impart\nexcellence and client-centric approach, we aim to lead the evolution of automation, ensuring\nsuperior quality and transformative impact in every project we undertake\n\n## Mission\n\n**Jal Automation & Systems**, With over 20 years of expertise, we are dedicated to continuous\ntechnological advancement and reach towards the extraterritorial scope , supported by our proficient\nin-house team of design, ,production, assembly and Management. We are committed to continuous\nrevolution, extends to manufacturing premium products, from robotics to dispensing units. Ensuring\nour solutions meet the changing Demand of our global clientele.\n\n### Our Journey Through the Years\n\n2004\n\n#### Founded by Mr. Sanjay Jadhav\n\nJAL Automation & Systems was founded by Mr. Sanjay Jadhav in 2004, Pune. The company began\noperations in fluid dispensing machine in 2004 with small manually operated machines.\n\n2005\n\n#### Journey of automation started\n\nIn 2005, with an ambition to gain a competitive advantage through higher productivity, improved\nquality, and lower production costs. JAL Automation started its journey of automation with small\nautomated systems.\n\n2006\n\n#### Focusing on Automation\n\nDedicated to provide all industries a cost-effective solution for the needs to dispense liquids and\npaste in a controlled manner. JAL automation started focusing on Automation with the help of its own\nin house technical team.\n\n2017\n\n#### World wide coverage\n\nSSI member ship no.-270251102869-II ( Directorate of Industries ) Expanding the horizon of services\nto global market JAL automation started serving major companies along with MNC\u2019s in Automation\nfield. It succeeded to capture Automation market within very few years.\n\n2019\n\n#### New Innovation\n\nScrew Pump Development, Export Machines (Overseas Deliveries), Bearing Grease Dispensing Automation\nTechnology\n\n2021\n\n#### Maintained Customer Commitments\n\nEnsured uninterrupted service and support through digital channels and remote assistance. Enabled\nkey operations to continue seamlessly while prioritizing employee safety.\n\n2025\n\n#### Upgraded systems\n\nTo allow easy modifications for different product requirements and production volumes. Enhanced\naccuracy and reliability by automating critical tasks.\n\n### Our Clients\n\n[c2]\n[c45]\n[c8]\n[c6]\n[c4]\n[c19]\n[c20]\n[c7]\n[c46]\n[c9]\n[c55]\n[c10]\n[c11]\n[c52]\n[c12]\n[c36]\n[c14]\n[c3]\n[c56]\n[c13]\n[c16]\n[c15]\n[c17]\n[c57]\n[c60]\n[c22]\n[c21]\n[c44]\n[c64]\n[c23]\n[c62]\n[c65]\n[c24]\n[c26]\n[c67]\n[c41]\n[c27]\n[c47]\n[c28]\n[c1]\n[c54]\n[c5]\n[c59]\n[c63]\n[c66]\n[c30]\n[c29]\n[c31]\n[c48]\n[c32]\n[c53]\n[c33]\n[c68]\n[c34]\n[c43]\n[c37]\n[c35]\n[c38]\n[c40]\n[c69]\n[c61]\n[c25]\n[c42]\n[c49]\n* [ home ][16]\n* [ About us ][17]\n* [ products ][18]\n* [ process ][19]\n* [ Careers ][20]\n* [ Contact us ][21]\n\nAbout JAL Automations\n\nJAL Automation & Systems is a leading manufacturer and supplier of fluid dispensing systems and\nequipment. We specialize in advanced technology, production, and marketing of automated fluid\ndispensing solutions for diverse industries.\n\n[ Facebook ][22] Linkedin-in Whatsapp [ Youtube ][23]\n\nAddress\n\n[Plot No. -\"T\" 165/1/22, Priyadarshani Co-Op Society, Near MIDC Square, MIDC BHOSARI PUNE - 411026,\nMaharashtra, India.][24]\n\n### [ Mail Us ][25]\n\n[enquiry@jalgroup.in][26]\n\n### [ Call Us : ][27]\n\n[ +91 9371115571][28]\n\nOur Products\n* [ dispensive valves ][29]\n* [ single part machines ][30]\n* [ two part machines ][31]\n* [ special purpose machines ][32]\n* Ahmedabad\n* Bengaluru\n* Chennai\n* Faridabad\n* Hyderabad\n* Pune\n* Maharashtra\n* India\n* Noida\n* Gurgaon\n* Delhi\n* Punjab\n* Ludhiana\n* Chandigarh\n\n\u00a92025 Jal Automation. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: https://jalgroup.in/\n[2]: https://jalgroup.in/\n[3]: https://jalgroup.in/about-us/\n[4]: https://jalgroup.in/director-message/\n[5]: https://jalgroup.in/our-connectivity/\n[6]: https://jalgroup.in/products/\n[7]: https://jalgroup.in/despensing-valves/\n[8]: https://jalgroup.in/single-part-machines/\n[9]: https://jalgroup.in/two-part-machines/\n[10]: https://jalgroup.in/special-purpose-machines/\n[11]: https://jalgroup.in/process/\n[12]: https://jalgroup.in/careers/\n[13]: https://jalgroup.in/contact-us/\n[14]: https://jalgroup.in/\n[15]: #\n[16]: https://jalgroup.in/\n[17]: https://jalgroup.in/about-us/\n[18]: https://jalgroup.in/products/\n[19]: https://jalgroup.in/process/\n[20]: https://jalgroup.in/careers/\n[21]: https://jalgroup.in/contact-us/\n[22]: https://www.facebook.com/people/JAL-Automation-Systems/100054368764789/#\n[23]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1FSpG_nwdaxmt7_4vDukwQ/videos\n[24]: https://maps.app.goo.gl/9agFA1doXJYez8Aa8\n[25]: mailto:enquiry@jalgroup.in\n[26]: mailto:enquiry@jalgroup.in\n[27]: tel:+91%209371115571\n[28]: tel:+91 9371115571\n[29]: https://jalgroup.in/despensing-valves/\n[30]: https://jalgroup.in/single-part-machines/\n[31]: https://jalgroup.in/two-part-machines/\n[32]: https://jalgroup.in/special-purpose-machines/"
