      "key_products": "Dispensing Valves; Single Part Machines; Two Part Machines; Special Purpose Machines",
      "polished_summary": "Jalgroup is a leading manufacturer and supplier of innovative fluid dispensing systems and equipment, catering to various industries with a focus on automation solutions. The company specializes in a range of products, including dispensing valves, single and two-part machines, and custom manufacturing equipment, while also offering consulting services aimed at optimizing manufacturing processes and enhancing operational efficiency for manufacturers.",
