      "key_products": "Security Consulting, Solution Design, Implementation Services",
      "polished_summary": "M3T Corporation is a veteran-owned small business specializing in professional security consulting, solution design, and implementation across both physical and cyber security domains. The company offers a range of services, including risk assessments, custom security solutions, and proactive maintenance, targeting diverse industries such as government, education, healthcare, corporate, and retail. With a commitment to enhancing security measures, M3T Corporation serves businesses and organizations seeking comprehensive security solutions tailored to their specific needs.",
