d external risks to the business.\n\n[ Read More ][83]\n\n## STRATEGIC SECURITY OFFERINGS\n\nFocus IS on long term-term security vision, business aligned strategy, and security roa Skip links\n* [ Skip to primary navigation][1]\n* [ Skip to content][2]\n\nWe Protect your Organization\u2019s Reputation, Financials, and Customers (RFC); and Confidentiality,\nIntegrity, and Availability (CIA) of your Valuable Business Data\n\n[ [SAARTH INFOSEC] [SAARTH INFOSEC]][3]\n\n### (+91) 845 912 2400 | 839 059 3233 | 909 671 2002\n\n### success@saarthinfosec.com\n* [Home][4]\n* [About Us][5]\n  * [Who We Are][6]\n  * [What We Do][7]\n  * [Leadership Team][8]\n  * [Our VMGV][9]\n  * [Strategic Associations][10]\n* [Strategic Security][11]\n  * [CISO as a Service (vCISO)][12]\n  * [DPO as a Service (vDPO)][13]\n  * [ISM as Service (vISM)][14]\n  * [Cloud Services (CS)][15]\n  * [Enterprise Application Services (EAS)][16]\n* [Standard Security][17]\n  * [IT Security][18]\n  * [Network Security][19]\n  * [Application Security][20]\n  * [Data Security][21]\n  * [Cyber Security][22]\n  * [VAPT][23]\n  * [Operations Security][24]\n  * [Human Resource Security][25]\n  * [Communications Security][26]\n  * [Digital Forensics][27]\n  * [Security Training][28]\n* [SIDCSF][29]\n* [Cyber Katta][30]\n  * [Blogs][31]\n  * [News][32]\n  * [Downloads][33]\n* [Partners][34]\n  * [Partner With Us][35]\n  * [Careers][36]\n* [Contact Us][37]\n  * [Get Cyber Secured][38]\n  * [For Demo/PoV][39]\n  * [For Quote/Pricing][40]\n\nToggle navigation [ [SAARTH INFOSEC] ][41]\n* [Home][42]\n* [About Us][43]\n  * [Who We Are][44]\n  * [What We Do][45]\n  * [Leadership Team][46]\n  * [Our VMGV][47]\n  * [Strategic Associations][48]\n* [Strategic Security][49]\n  * [CISO as a Service (vCISO)][50]\n  * [DPO as a Service (vDPO)][51]\n  * [ISM as Service (vISM)][52]\n  * [Cloud Services (CS)][53]\n  * [Enterprise Application Services (EAS)][54]\n* [Standard Security][55]\n  * [IT Security][56]\n  * [Network Security][57]\n  * [Application Security][58]\n  * [Data Security][59]\n  * [Cyber Security][60]\n  * [VAPT][61]\n  * [Operations Security][62]\n  * [Human Resource Security][63]\n  * [Communications Security][64]\n  * [Digital Forensics][65]\n  * [Security Training][66]\n* [SIDCSF][67]\n* [Cyber Katta][68]\n  * [Blogs][69]\n  * [News][70]\n  * [Downloads][71]\n* [Partners][72]\n  * [Partner With Us][73]\n  * [Careers][74]\n* [Contact Us][75]\n  * [Get Cyber Secured][76]\n  * [For Demo/PoV][77]\n  * [For Quote/Pricing][78]\nProtecting IT\nWhile you continue your focus on business growth; We\u2019ll focus on protecting IT from bad guys called\nhackers!\n[Get in Touch ][79] (+91) 845 912 2400 | 839 059 3233 Improving Business While you continue\nimproving your business capabilities; We\u2019ll focus on seamless and uninterrupted IT and Security\nOperations! [Get in Touch ][80] (+91) 845 912 2400 | 839 059 3233 Protecting CIA While you continue\nyour focus on creating, storing, and processing huge business information and data; We\u2019ll focus on\nprotecting IT\u2019s Confidentiality, Integrity, and Availability (CIA)!\n[Get in Touch ][81] (+91) 845 912 2400 | 839 059 3233 Manage and Controls Risks\nWhile you focus on your core business activities; We\u2019ll focus on improving cyber resilience to\nmanage risks to your business to an acceptable level! [Get in Touch ][82] (+91) 845 912 2400 | 839\n059 3233\n\n###### A \u2018Startup India\u2019 Recognized Company\n\n# SAARTH INFOSEC PRIVATE LIMITED\n\nWe are an information, data, cyber security, data privacy, and business resiliency company\nheadquartered at Pune. We are an invincible team of talented IT Security, Cyber Security, Data\nSecurity, Data Privacy, and IT Leaders and Professionals with solid experience in managing,\nimplementing, consulting, and advising practical and proven security solutions. Our expertise in\nsecurity operations, projects, programs, and portfolio of information security, cyber security, data\nsecurity, applications security, and connected products, enterprise applications and services\nenables and empowers our clients to combat against the internal and external risks to the business.\n\n[ Read More ][83]\n\n## STRATEGIC SECURITY OFFERINGS\n\nFocus IS on long term-term security vision, business aligned strategy, and security roadmap towards\nachieving industry benchmarked security maturity level\n\n## CISO as a Service\n\nAs an active part of the leadership team, our CISO will be a perfect connect between leadership and\nbusiness. Our CISO will play a key strategic role to identify and advise to address the security\ngovernance, risks, and compliance challenges, needs, and requirements at all levels of the business\norganization. Our CISO will devise internationally established security policies, standards,\nprocedures, and guidelines so that leadership team can focus on their core business attainments.\nPlease get in touch with us to know more about and avail our CISO as a Service offering.\n\n## DPO as a Service\n\nWith the growing need and focus on the individual\u2019s privacy rights, it is certainly imperative for\nbusiness organizations of certain size and breadth to have a Data Privacy Officer (DPO) appointed as\na permanent regular employee. We have made IT simpler for you so that you don\u2019t need to hire DPO.\nOur DPO as a Service can offer you data privacy services of international repute in line with the\nvarious compliance and regulatory requirements such as GDPR. Please get in touch with us to know\nmore about and avail our DPO as a Service offering.\n\n## ISM as a Service\n\nSecurity operations management is an as critical as any other business operations for the success of\nthe business. While most of IT staff in most of the organizations is focused on the day-to-day IT\noperations, security is somehow neglected or left behind which can be a costly affair. Our\nInformation Security Manager (ISM) can offer and assist you to protect your critical business\nassets, defend from internal and external threats, monitor and maintain the overall security posture\nof your business organization meeting the different mandatory compliance and audit requirements\nwhile managing and reducing risks to an acceptable level. Please get in touch with us to know more\nabout and avail our ISM as a Service offering.\n\n## STANDARD SECURITY OFFERINGS\n\nFocus IS on implementing, managing, maintaining, & improving security posture to achieve long-term\nsecurity vision, business aligned security results, & delivering security roadmap\n\n## IT Security\n\nIT environment is the biggest threat landscape encompassing multiple domains such as network,\ncompute, storage, applications, operations, access management, communications\u2026\n[More Details][84]\n\n## Application Security\n\nDifferent applications are the ways of communicating and interacting with the internal and external\ncustomers. Applications may be on premise, web hosted or hosted in the Cloud.\n[More Details][85]\n\n## Cyber Security\n\nApart from technology in place and management process controls, human resources are the one of the\nmajor contributors towards the beaches that took place.\n[More Details][86]\n\n## VAPT\n\nTo be sure that the various security controls in place are working and to discover the loopholes\nthat are present in the environment,Vulnerability Assessment (VA)\u2026\n[More Details][87]\n\n## Data Security\n\nData is the main business driver for most of the businesses worldwide in the Glocal(Global+Local)\ncompetitive market. Data breaches can lead businesses to shut-down its operations\u2026\n[More Details][88]\n\n## Cloud Security\n\nOperational expenditure and capital expenditures (OPEX and CAPEX) demand business to go on to cloud\nto reduce the budget on IT considerably. We can assist to perform an assessment\u2026\n[More Details][89]\n\n## Our clients praise us for great results.\n\n> We have availed SAARTH\u2019s strategic service offerings that have helped us to develop a security\n> vision, short, mid, and long-term security roadmap which we\u2019ll be working on to improve our\n> company\u2019s overall security posture.\n\n### A fastest growing software development company\n\n> SAARTH Team has enabled us to protect our web application by continuous vulnerability management\n> and protecting it from cyber attacks in real-time. Thank you SAARTH Team.\n\n### A leading media publishing company\n\n"
