      "polished_summary": "Saarthinfosec is a Pune-based company specializing in information security, cyber security, data privacy, and business resiliency. With a team of experienced IT and security professionals, the company offers a range of services including CISO as a Service, data security, and digital forensics, aimed at protecting organizations from internal and external risks while ensuring the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of their valuable business data. Saarthinfosec is dedicated to helping businesses enhance their cyber resilience and maintain uninterrupted IT operations.",
