      "company_summary": "Shieldworkz specializes in Operational Technology (OT) security, offering comprehensive Cyber-Physical System (CPS) security solutions tailored for critical infrastructure operators. Their core products include an advanced OT Security Platform, Media Scanning Solutions, and Patch Management Solutions, all designed to enhance asset visibility, threat management, and compliance within OT environments. With a focus on organizations operating in sectors such as utilities and transportation, Shieldworkz delivers robust cybersecurity services to safeguard vital infrastructure against evolving threats.",
