            "url": "https://shieldworkz.com",
            "text": "Leading OT Security Company | OT Cybersecurity Vendor \u2013 Shieldworkz\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\nSelect Language English\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\nSelect Language English\n\nWelcome to Shieldworkz, experts in OT Security for critical infrastructure\n\nDelivering Holistic\nCyber-Physical System (CPS) Security Solutions &amp; Services\n\nDelivering Holistic\nCyber-Physical System (CPS) Security Solutions &amp; Services\n\nWe deliver agentic-AI powered infrastructure protection through OT security solutions such as Network Detection and Response, backed by managed security services including in-depth risk assessments, compliance services, incident response, and expert consulting. When it comes to managing threats, lowering risk exposure, building new Security Operations Centers or offering SOC-as-a-Service, Shieldworkz delivers unmatched OT security value to your business.\n\nWe deliver agentic-AI powered infrastructure protection through OT security solutions such as Network Detection and Response, backed by managed security services including in-depth risk assessments, compliance services, incident response, and expert consulting. When it comes to managing threats, lowering risk exposure, building new Security Operations Centers or offering SOC-as-a-Service, Shieldworkz delivers unmatched OT security value to your business.\n\nGet Started\n\n')\">\n\n')\" data-framer-background-image-wrapper=\"true\">\n\nShieldworkz enhances your OT security defenses against\nthe most sophisticated threats\n\nShieldworkz enhances your OT security defenses against\nthe most sophisticated threats\n\nComprehensive ICS, OT &amp; IoT protection\nWe safeguard your cyber-physical systems with end-to-end security solutions and consulting services that reduce risk and ensure compliance with regulatory mandates, empowering you to run operations with confidence and control.\n\nShieldworkz enhances your OT security defenses against\nthe most sophisticated threats\n\nComprehensive ICS, OT &amp; IoT protection\nWe safeguard your cyber-physical systems with end-to-end security solutions and consulting services that reduce risk and ensure compliance with regulatory mandates, empowering you to run operations with confidence and control.\n\nShieldworkz enhances your OT security defenses against\nthe most sophisticated threats\n\nComprehensive ICS, OT &amp; IoT protection\nWe safeguard your cyber-physical systems with end-to-end security solutions and consulting services that reduce risk and ensure compliance with regulatory mandates, empowering you to run operations with confidence and control.\n\nConsulting Services\n\nOur IEC 62443, NIS2, NIST SP 800-82 and CISA-aligned OT security consulting offerings are designed to maximize uptime, boost asset visibility and strengthen infrastructure resilience.\n\nLearn More\n\nCPS Security Products\n\nOur OT security platform and other security solutions are uniquely engineered to defend your cyber-physical systems from external and internal threats and to keep operations running safely.\n\nLearn More\n\nRequest a demo\n\nWhy Shieldworkz\n\nSecure your operations with leading-edge Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS) security.\n\nAgentic AI-powered OT/ICS NDR platform that adapts to evolving threats\n\nAccurate asset inventory with highest level of visibility across classes\n\nContextual managed incident response services to neutralize threats\n\nRegulatory confidence to meet compliance mandates without guesswork\n\nScalable architecture that grows with your expanding OT footprint\n\n24/7 real-time monitoring and incident response for uninterrupted operations\n\nWhy Shieldworkz\n\nSecure your operations with leading-edge Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS) security.\n\nAgentic AI-powered OT/ICS NDR platform that adapts to evolving threats\n\nAccurate asset inventory with highest level of visibility across classes\n\nContextual managed incident response services to neutralize threats\n\nRegulatory confidence to meet compliance mandates without guesswork\n\nScalable architecture that grows with your expanding OT footprint\n\n24/7 real-time monitoring and incident response for uninterrupted operations\n\nWidest OT Security Coverage\n\nWidest OT Security Coverage\n\nShieldworkz\u2019s NDR platform maps and monitors every bit of your operational landscape, from legacy PLCs, Distributed Control Systems, HMIs&nbsp;and SCADA networks to modern IoT sensors and industrial routers. We continuously discover and fingerprint new assets, inspect traffic patterns, and flag anomalies, ensuring your entire OT infrastructure remains resilient against cyberattacks, hidden vulnerabilities, and insider risks.\n\nAI-Based Industrial Security\n\nAI-Based Industrial Security\n\nOur advanced machine learning models learn what \u201cnormal\u201d looks like in your facility, spotting subtle deviations accurately well before they escalate. By ingesting live data from PLCs, RTUs, and edge devices, Shieldworkz delivers predictive IEC 62443 and NIS2\u2013aligned risk assessments. Automated incident response and smart threat hunting keep your industrial environment secure and risk free.\n\nLowest Deployment Time\n\nLowest Deployment Time\n\nGo from zero to protected in hours, not weeks. Shieldworkz installs lightweight agents and passive sensors faster without interrupting operations. Automated asset discovery, agents AI supervision and prebuilt security profiles let you begin monitoring immediately, delivering faster time-to-value and ensuring your OT and IoT assets stay safe from day one.\n\nShieldworkz secures every layer of your\nindustrial ecosystem\n\nShieldworkz secures every bit of your industrial operations\n\nFrom legacy PLCs and SCADA systems to remote sites, sensors, controllers, assembly lines, and networking gear, we safeguard both physical and digital processes. No matter how complex your environment, whether you run edge IIoT deployments or traditional OT infrastructure, Shieldworkz delivers end-to-end protection to keep operations reliable and uninterrupted.\n\nPhysical and industrial processes&nbsp;\n\nIndustrial networking equipment\n\nRemote sites&nbsp;\n\nLegacy systems&nbsp;\n\nSCADA architectures\n\nIndustrial IoT Devices\n\nIndustrial Protocols\n\nICS Workstations\n\nProtecting OT environments globally\n\nBuilt for the biggest OT operators across verticals\n\nBuilt for the biggest OT operators across verticals\n\nAirports\n\nOil &amp; Gas\n\nManufacturing\n\nUtilities\n\nTransportation\n\nSmart Cities\n\nAirports\n\nOil &amp; Gas\n\nManufacturing\n\nUtilities\n\nTransportation\n\nSmart Cities\n\nIndustry Use Cases\n\nPower &amp; Utilities\n\nThe energy sector requires operations to run without interruption. Shieldworkz protects utilities by safeguarding their SCADA systems and remote substations and smart-grid components from ransomware attacks and supply-chain breaches and insider threats. Our AI-driven analytics perform continuous monitoring of transformer and substation telemetry data to identify potential issues before they cause outages. The combination of complete asset discovery with customized compliance reports enables power providers to meet IEC 62443 and NERC CIP standards while strengthening their grid resilience.\n\nManufacturing\n\nModern factories depend on interconnected PLCs together with robotics and assembly-line sensors. Shieldworkz protects both legacy control networks and new IIoT deployments by blocking malware from moving between production cells. The implementation of real-time anomaly detection through network segmentation helps us minimize unplanned downtime and protect intellectual property. Manufacturers obtain asset health visibility alongside critical equipment predictive risk scores and optimized incident response workflows which minimize disruptions.\n\nOil &amp; Gas\n\nThe combination of clandestine intrusions and targeted sabotage poses continuous cyber-physical threats to refineries pipelines and offshore platforms. The Shieldworkz platform creates detailed operational topology maps while implementing strict network segmentation rules between OT and IT layers. Our predictive IEC 62443 assessments and automated patch-validation routines keep SCADA and DCS environments hardened. The implementation of our solution enables oil &amp; gas operators to reduce significantly the chances of production interruptions and environmental accidents and safety-related incidents.\n\nDetect anomalies before they escalate\n\nAccelerate your Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS) security journey with Shieldworkz\n\nAssess\n\nBegin with a deep dive into your current state. Our specialists perform comprehensive risk and gap analyses across OT, ICS, and IoT layers, mapping every asset and network flow. By benchmarking against industry best practices, we pinpoint vulnerabilities and quantify potential impact, so you understand exactly where you stand.\n\nDefend\n\nSecure critical assets with precision-engineered defenses. Shieldworkz uses agentic AI-based posture calibration and monitoring to offer defense-in-depth. Every crown-jewel is protected by customized safeguards that neutralize threats and shrink the attack surface.\n\nControl\n\nMaintain continuous oversight through proactive calibration. Our platform monitors your security posture in real time, automatically tuning configurations and alert thresholds to align with operational changes. With policy enforcement, anomaly detection, and granular access controls, you keep systems in check without disrupting productivity.\n\nComply\n\nShieldworkz aligns your OT security program to NIST, IEC 62443, NERC CIP, and other mandates, streamlining audits, automating evidence collection, and delivering continuous and contexutual compliance reporting.\n\nAssess\n\nBegin with a deep dive into your current state. Our specialists perform comprehensive risk and gap analyses across OT, ICS, and IoT layers, mapping every asset and network flow. By benchmarking against industry best practices, we pinpoint vulnerabilities and quantify potential impact, so you understand exactly where you stand.\n\nDefend\n\nSecure critical assets with precision-engineered defenses. Shieldworkz uses agentic AI-based posture calibration and monitoring to offer defense-in-depth. Every crown-jewel is protected by customized safeguards that neutralize threats and shrink the attack surface.\n\nControl\n\nMaintain continuous oversight through proactive calibration. Our platform monitors your security posture in real time, automatically tuning configurations and alert thresholds to align with operational changes. With policy enforcement, anomaly detection, and granular access controls, you keep systems in check without disrupting productivity.\n\nComply\n\nShieldworkz aligns your OT security program to NIST, IEC 62443, NERC CIP, and other mandates, streamlining audits, automating evidence collection, and delivering continuous and contexutual compliance reporting.\n\nRequest a Free Assessment\n\nProtect OT systems proactively\n\nConnect with our OT security experts for a free in-depth consultation and readout.\n\nRequest a Free Assessment\n\nProtect OT systems proactively\n\nConnect with our OT security experts for a free in-depth consultation and readout.\n\nRequest a Free Assessment\n\nProtect OT systems proactively\n\nConnect with our OT security experts for a free in-depth consultation and readout.\n\nSchedule a Demo Today\n\n')\">\n\nAbout Us\n\nWe secure Operational Technology environments and protect businesses with best-in-class professional services and cyber security solutions.\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Us\n\nContact Us\n\nPartner Program\n\nCareers\n\nEvents\n\nFAQs\n\nResources\n\nBlog\n\nRegulatory Playbooks\n\nRemediation Guides\n\nReports\n\nE-Books\n\nCase Studies\n\nUse Cases\n\nNewsroom\n\nWebinars\n\nGlossary\n\nProducts\n\nOT Security Platform\n\nMedia Scan Solution\n\nPatch Management Solution\n\nServices\n\nOT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis\n\nManaged SOC Service\n\nOT Incident Response Retainer Service\n\nOT Vulnerability Assessment / Penetration Testing Service\n\nAll Services\n')\">\n\nUseful Links\n\nOT Security\n\nNIS2 Compliance\n\nNERC CIP Framework\n\nNetwork D"
