            "text": "[site-logo]\n][1]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][2]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[site-logo]\n][3]\n[site-logo]\n][4]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][5]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[bg-image]\n\n# About Us\n\nHome\n\n][6]\n\nAbout Us\n\n[bg-image]\n\n# About Us\n\nHome\n\n][7]\n\nAbout Us\n\nCore Values\n\n## The integrated\n## OT security solutions company\n\nShieldworkz was founded by top OT security experts with a mission to protect critical infrastructure\nthrough unmatched expertise and innovative solutions. Just like OT means a lot to you, it means the\nworld to us. We started our journey as an OT security company with an unmatched set of products and\nservices and evolved on the way to tackle emerging threats, risks and compliance challenges.\n\nShieldworkz OT security offerings include an NDR and vulnerability management product, an agentic\nAI-based OT Security suite and a host of services including managed SOC, IEC 62443-based risk and\ngap assessment, managed incident response, managed compliance for a range of security mandates and\nOT security maturity assessment services.\n\nWe are one of the first security vendors to integrate agentic AI as a compliance, posture\nmanagement, threat intelligence ingestion, asset management layer in our [OT security platform][8].\nThis simplifies OT cybersecurity monitoring and management and minimises your risk and threat\nexposure. When threat surfaces shrink and security decision making becomes easier, you get to do a\nlot more with your infrastructure. That\u2019s why we are here.\n\nEvery Shieldworkz service is built on a deep understanding of an organization\u2019s specific cyber risk\nexposure. This is made possible through the industry\u2019s most extensive OT and IoT cyber threat\nintelligence hub, supported by a worldwide research team.\n\nShieldworkz is just a call or a mail away. Don\u2019t forget to think of us when you think of OT\nsecurity.\n\nAt Shieldworkz, we look forward to hearing from you about your unique OT security journey.\n\nShieldworkz was founded by top OT security experts with a mission to protect critical infrastructure\nthrough unmatched expertise and innovative solutions. Just like OT means a lot to you, it means the\nworld to us. We started our journey as an OT security company with an unmatched set of products and\nservices and evolved on the way to tackle emerging threats, risks and compliance challenges.\n\nShieldworkz OT security offerings include an NDR and vulnerability management product, an agentic\nAI-based OT Security suite and a host of services including managed SOC, IEC 62443-based risk and\ngap assessment, managed incident response, managed compliance for a range of security mandates and\nOT security maturity assessment services.\n\nWe are one of the first security vendors to integrate agentic AI as a compliance, posture\nmanagement, threat intelligence ingestion and asset management layer that simplifies OT\ncybersecurity and minimises your risk and threat exposure. When threat surfaces shrink and security\ndecision making becomes easier, you get to do a lot more with your infrastructure. That\u2019s why we are\nhere.\n\nEvery Shieldworkz service is built on a deep understanding of an organization\u2019s specific cyber\nrisks. This is made possible through the industry\u2019s most extensive OT and IoT cyber threat\nintelligence hub, supported by a worldwide research team.\n\nShieldworkz is just a call or a mail away. Don\u2019t forget to think of us when you think of OT\nsecurity.\n\nAt Shieldworkz, we look forward to hearing from you about your unique OT security journey.\n\nCore Values\n\n## The integrated\n## OT security solutions company\n\nShieldworkz was founded by top OT security experts with a mission to protect critical infrastructure\nthrough unmatched expertise and innovative solutions. Just like OT means a lot to you, it means the\nworld to us. We started our journey as an OT security company with an unmatched set of products and\nservices and evolved on the way to tackle emerging threats, risks and compliance challenges.\n\nShieldworkz OT security offerings include an NDR and vulnerability management product, an agentic\nAI-based OT Security suite and a host of services including managed SOC, IEC 62443-based risk and\ngap assessment, managed incident response, managed compliance for a range of security mandates and\nOT security maturity assessment services.\n\nWe are one of the first security vendors to integrate agentic AI as a compliance, posture\nmanagement, threat intelligence ingestion, asset management layer in our [OT security platform][9].\nThis simplifies OT cybersecurity monitoring and management and minimises your risk and threat\nexposure. When threat surfaces shrink and security decision making becomes easier, you get to do a\nlot more with your infrastructure. That\u2019s why we are here.\n\nEvery Shieldworkz service is built on a deep understanding of an organization\u2019s specific cyber risk\nexposure. This is made possible through the industry\u2019s most extensive OT and IoT cyber threat\nintelligence hub, supported by a worldwide research team.\n\nShieldworkz is just a call or a mail away. Don\u2019t forget to think of us when you think of OT\nsecurity.\n\nAt Shieldworkz, we look forward to hearing from you about your unique OT security journey.\n\n## Why [Shieldworkz][10]\n\n## Why [Shieldworkz][11]\n\n**Cutting-edge OT cyber security solutions**. AI-powered detection and response technologies\ndeveloped by OT professionals for OT professionals\n\n**Unmatched OT security expertise**. Across products and services built on the shop floor for OT.\n\n**Cutting-edge OT cyber security solutions**. AI-powered detection and response technologies\ndeveloped by OT professionals for OT professionals\n\n**Meet compliance mandates**. Trusted, on-demand access to the advice you need, when you need it\n\n**Meet compliance mandates**. Full spectrum compliance assistance across NIS2, IEC 62443, NIST CSF\nand SP 800 series, OTCC, CERT-In and more\n\n**Rapid OT visibility and risk reduction**. Cut through complexity and supply chain dependencies\nwith tailored professional services\n\n**Global SOC Network. **Stay protected 24/7/365 with continuous monitoring backed by an\nindustry-leading threat intelligence capability.\n\n[Shieldworkz OT cybersecurity solutions]\n[Shieldworkz OT cybersecurity solutions]\n\n## Why [Shieldworkz][12]\n\n**Cutting-edge OT cyber security solutions**. AI-powered detection and response technologies\ndeveloped by OT professionals for OT professionals\n\n**Cutting-edge OT cyber security solutions**. AI-powered detection and response technologies\ndeveloped by OT professionals for OT professionals\n\n**Meet compliance mandates**. Trusted, on-demand access to the advice you need, when you need it\n\n**Rapid OT visibility and risk reduction**. Cut through complexity and supply chain dependencies\nwith tailored professional services\n\n**Global SOC Network. **Stay protected 24/7/365 with continuous monitoring backed by an\nindustry-leading threat intelligence capability.\n\n[Shieldworkz OT cybersecurity solutions]\n[BG image]\n\nGet Started Now\n\n# Scale your CPS security posture\n\nGet in touch with our CPS security experts for a free consultation.\n\nRequest a Demo\n\n][13]\n[BG image]\n\nGet Started Now\n\n# Scale your CPS security posture\n\nGet in touch with our CPS security experts for a free consultation.\n\nRequest a Demo\n\n][14]\n[BG image]\n\nGet Started Now\n\n# Scale your CPS security posture\n\nGet in touch with our CPS security experts for a free consultation.\n\nRequest a Demo\n\n][15]\n[Cybersecurity website footer]\n\n### About Us\n\nWe secure Operational Technology environments and protect businesses with best-in-class professional\nservices and cyber securit