            "text": "[site-logo]\n][1]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][2]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[site-logo]\n][3]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][4]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[site-logo]\n][5]\n[Hero bg]\n\n# **Case Studies**\n\n# **Case Studies**\n\n# **Case Studies**\n\n[OT Cybersecurity and Resilience for a Leading Utility Provider ]\n\n#### **Enhancing OT Cybersecurity and Resilience for a Leading Utility Provider**\n\nUtilities run the services societies cannot live without, power, water, distribution networks. That\ncriticality makes them high-value targets.\n\nLearn more\n\n][6][\n[OT-ICS Security Assessment and Penetration Testing ]\n\n#### **OT-ICS Security Assessment ****\n#### ****and Penetration Testing**\n\nOperational Technology and Industrial Control Systems power critical services - from generation and\ntransmission to pipelines and process plants. But legacy controllers\n\nLearn more\n\n][7][\n[Securing a Large Airport Risk & Gap Analysis + Solution Deployment ]\n\n#### **Securing a Large Airport****\n#### ****Risk & Gap Analysis + Solution Deployment**\n\nAirports are among the most complex and safety-critical OT environments on earth. They run\nair-traffic systems, baggage\u2026\n\nLearn more\n\n][8]\n[OT Cybersecurity and Resilience for a Leading Utility Provider ]\n\n#### **Enhancing OT Cybersecurity and Resilience for a Leading Utility Provider**\n\nUtilities run the services societies cannot live without, power, water, distribution networks. That\ncriticality makes them high-value targets.\n\nLearn more\n\n][9][\n[OT-ICS Security Assessment and Penetration Testing ]\n\n#### **OT-ICS Security Assessment ****\n#### ****and Penetration Testing**\n\nOperational Technology and Industrial Control Systems power critical services - from generation and\ntransmission to pipelines and process plants. But legacy controllers\n\nLearn more\n\n][10][\n[Securing a Large Airport Risk & Gap Analysis + Solution Deployment ]\n\n#### **Securing a Large Airport****\n#### ****Risk & Gap Analysis + Solution Deployment**\n\nAirports are among the most complex and safety-critical OT environments on earth. They run\nair-traffic systems, baggage\u2026\n\nLearn more\n\n][11]\n[Securing the Digital Factory Resilience & Integrity in Food & Beverage]\n\n#### **Securing the Digital Factory****\n#### ****Resilience & Integrity in Food & Beverage**\n\nFood & Beverage manufacturers operate continuous-production environments where hygiene, cold-chain\nintegrity, and uninterrupted throughput are non\u2026\n\nLearn more\n\n][12][\n[Cybersecurity, Vulnerability & Threat Assessment And Gap Analysis]\n\n#### **Cybersecurity, Vulnerability & Threat Assessment And Gap Analysis: A large rail company in\n#### the Middle East**\n\nCritical transportation systems are a prime target for modern cyber adversaries. A single undetected\nintrusion in rail networks can\u2026\n\nLearn more\n\n][13][\n[Securing Data Centers OT & IoT Cybersecurity for Modern Facilities ]\n\n#### **Securing Data Centers****\n#### ****OT & IoT Cybersecurity for Modern Facilities**\n\nModern data centers are not just racks and virtual machines. They are living, instrumented\nfacilities - cooling plants, PDUs, UPS, fire systems, access control and..\n\nLearn more\n\n][14][\n[Malware analysis report FrostyGoop]\n\n#### **Europe Airports Cyberattack Comprehensive Incident Report**\n\nA concise, technical briefing for OT/ICS decision-makers on the recent ransomware event that\ndisrupted check-in systems at multiple European airports. This report reconstructs the attack\u2026\n\nLearn more\n\n][15]\n[Securing the Digital Factory Resilience & Integrity in Food & Beverage]\n\n#### **Securing the Digital Factory****\n#### ****Resilience & Integrity in Food & Beverage**\n\nFood & Beverage manufacturers operate continuous-production environments where hygiene, cold-chain\nintegrity, and uninterrupted throughput are non\u2026\n\nLearn more\n\n][16][\n[Cybersecurity, Vulnerability & Threat Assessment And Gap Analysis]\n\n#### **Cybersecurity, Vulnerability & Threat Assessment And Gap Analysis: A large rail company in\n#### the Middle East**\n\nCritical transportation systems are a prime target for modern cyber adversaries. A single undetected\nintrusion in rail networks can\u2026\n\nLearn more\n\n][17][\n[Securing Data Centers OT & IoT Cybersecurity for Modern Facilities ]\n\n#### **Securing Data Centers****\n#### ****OT & IoT Cybersecurity for Modern Facilities**\n\nModern data centers are not just racks and virtual machines. They are living, instrumented\nfacilities - cooling plants, PDUs, UPS, fire systems, access control and..\n\nLearn more\n\n][18][\n[Malware analysis report FrostyGoop]\n\n#### **Europe Airports Cyberattack Comprehensive Incident Report**\n\nA concise, technical briefing for OT/ICS decision-makers on the recent ransomware event that\ndisrupted check-in systems at multiple European airports. This report reconstructs the attack\u2026\n\nLearn more\n\n][19]\n[Cybersecurity website footer]\n\n### About Us\n\nWe secure Operational Technology environments and protect businesses with best-in-class professional\nservices and cyber security solutions.\n\n[Shieldworkz logo footer]\n][20]\n\n#### Company\n\nAbout Us\n\n][21][\n\nContact Us\n\n][22][\n\nPartner Program\n\n][23][\n\nCareers\n\n][24][\n\nEvents\n\n][25][\n\nFAQs\n\n][26]\n\n#### Resources\n\nBlog\n\n][27][\n\nRegulatory Playbooks\n\n][28][\n\nRemediation Guides\n\n][29][\n\nReports\n\n][30][\n\nE-Books\n\n][31][\n\nCase Studies\n\n][32][\n\nUse Cases\n\n][33][\n\nNewsroom\n\n][34][\n\nWebinars\n\n][35][\n\nGlossary\n\n][36]\n\n#### Products\n\nOT Security Platform\n\n][37][\n\nMedia Scan Solution\n\n][38][\n\nPatch Management Solution\n\n][39]\n\n#### Services\n\nOT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis\n\n][40][\n\nManaged SOC Service\n\n][41][\n