            "url": "https://shieldworkz.com/products/ot-security-platform",
            "text": "[site-logo]\n][1]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][2]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[site-logo]\n][3]\n[site-logo]\n][4]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][5]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n\n# Shieldworkz OT Security Platform\n\nHome\n\n][6]\n\nProducts\n\nOur built for OT security platform delivers best of industry asset detection , visibility and\ninventory, threat management, vulnerability management and enterprise posture calibration and\ngranular control. This means that your shop floor gets enriched with actionable data on the security\nstatus of your infrastructure across locations, asset classes, threats and risks and more.\n\n[video image]\n\n## [Shieldworkz][7] OT Security Platform Delivers\n\nEnterprise OT asset visibility across asset classes: Automated and most in-depth asset inventory\n(46-78 percent more than competition) with behavior analysis that covers end-of-life, asset security\nstatus, past and current behaviors of interest, protocols, IP, communications and vulnerable assets.\n\nAgentic AI-based adaptive posture management: Think of it as an experienced security analyst that\ndoesn\u2019t just monitor your OT environment for threats and vulnerabilities but also intervenes, when\nrequired, to respond to events, offer inputs for compliance and governance on-the-go.\n\nNetwork Detection and Remediation: Non-intrusive network monitoring to enable threat discovery\npowered by our OT focused global threat intelligence that uncovers up-to-the-minute threats and\nrisky actions (including firing of high-risk commands), asset and network level threats and\nanomalies of interest with low false positives\n\nComprehensive vulnerability management: Including global CVEs from across databases and Zero Days\ndiscovered by our research team. The vulnerabilities are ranked as per business impact, risk and\nother parameters to help you focus your remediation attention. It also highlights open attack paths.\n\nProtocol-Aware Deep Packet Inspection: Understands industrial control system (ICS) protocols to\ndetect and fingerprint assets beyond what traditional IT tools can detect.\n\nIncident Response Enablement: Playbook-based remediation and extensive forensics capabilities with\npacket capture and historical data to investigate incidents and correlates events across OT and IT\nnetworks, supporting root-cause analysis.\n\nCompliance and Audit Readiness: Supports regulatory frameworks like IEC 62443, NIST CSF, NERC CIP,\nNIS2 by maintaining detailed logs and asset inventories and provides evidence of continuous\nmonitoring for audits.\n\nScalability across devices, sites and roles: Gives insights based on roles, processes with\nmulti-site visibility and risk management.\n\nBuilt for OT: Our Shield Sensor can be deployed on all types of OT networks to scan traffic. The\nsolution works in passive mode to detect threats and report anomalies.\n\n[Shieldworkz OT security]\n[Shield image]\n\n## **Why **[**Shieldworkz**][8]**? **\n\nProven best-in-industry asset visibility and inventory across classes and behaviors. Shieldworkz\ndetects and reports more assets than competition\n\nDetects and reports breach paths; Prioritises vulnerabilities for remediation\n\nPrioritized asset vulnerabilities for remediation without straining resources\n\nDeployment in days, not weeks, with the shortest deployment time\n\nLesser false positives and lesser time-to-compliance\n\nPowered by OT contextual threat intelligence from the largest OT-specific honeypot network\n\nInterested in learning more? Let\u2019s set up a [**demo** ][9]for you.\n\n## **Build resilience and keep threats at bay**\n\n###### Protect your Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS) with Shieldworkz\n\nRequest a Demo\n\n][10]\n[Cybersecurity website footer]\n\n### About Us\n\nWe secure Operational Technology environments and protect businesses with best-in-class professional\nservices and cyber security solutions.\n\n[Shieldworkz logo footer]\n][11]\n\n#### Company\n\nAbout Us\n\n][12][\n\nContact Us\n\n][13][\n\nPartner Program\n\n][14][\n\nCareers\n\n][15][\n\nEvents\n\n][16][\n\nFAQs\n\n][17]\n\n#### Resources\n\nBlog\n\n][18][\n\nRegulatory Playbooks\n\n][19][\n\nRemediation Guides\n\n][20][\n\nReports\n\n][21][\n\nE-Books\n\n][22][\n\nCase Studies\n\n][23][\n\nUse Cases\n\n][24][\n\nNewsroom\n\n][25][\n\nWebinars\n\n][26][\n\nGlossary\n\n][27]\n\n#### Products\n\nOT Security Platform\n\n][28][\n\nMedia Scan Solution\n\n][29][\n\nPatch Management Solution\n\n][30]\n\n#### Services\n\nOT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis\n\n][31][\n\nManaged SOC Service\n\n][32][\n\nOT Incident Response Retainer Service\n\n][33][\n\nOT Vulnerability Assessment / Penetration Testing Service\n\n][34][\n\nAll Services\n\n][35]\n\n#### Useful Links\n\nOT Security\n\n][36][\n\nNIS2 Compliance\n\n][37][\n\nNERC CIP Framework\n\n][38][\n\nNetwork Detection and Response\n\n][39][\n\nCPS Protection\n\n][40][\n\nSOC as a Service\n\n][41][\n\nIEC 62443\n\n][42]\n][43][\n][44][\n][45][\n][46][\n][47]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, Shieldworkz - All Rights Reserved.\n\nTerms & Conditions\n\n][48][\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\n][49]\n[Cybersecurity website footer]\n\n### About Us\n\nWe secure Operational Technology environments and protect businesses with best-in-class professional\nservices and cyber security solutions.\n\n[Shieldworkz logo footer]\n][50]\n\n#### Company\n\nAbout Us\n\n][51][\n\nContact Us\n\n][52][\n\nPartner Program\n\n][53][\n\nCareers\n\n][54][\n\nEvents\n\n][55]\n\n#### Resources\n\nBlog\n\n][56][\n\nRegulatory Playbooks\n\n][57][\n\nRemediation Guides\n\n][58][\n\nReports\n\n][59][\n\nE-Books\n\n][60][\n\nCase Studies\n\n][61][\n\nUse Cases\n\n][62][\n\nNewsroom\n\n][63][\n\nWebinars\n\n][64]\n\n#### Services\n\nOT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis\n\n][65][\n\nManaged SOC Service\n\n][66][\n\nOT Incident Response Retai