            "text": "[site-logo]\n][1]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][2]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[site-logo]\n][3]\n[site-logo]\n][4]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][5]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n\n# Patch Management Solution\n\nHome\n\n][6]\n\nProducts\n\n## Manage threats, reduce risk exposure due to vulnerabilities, and deter cyber adversaries\n\nChallenges\n\nIncomplete asset inventories make it difficult to track which systems require updates\n\nDelayed patching leading to enterprise-wide risks\n\nDetection and management of sophisticated threats\n\nHandle all stages of cyber threats and manage updates on one easy-to-use platform.\n\n[video image]\n\n[Shieldworkz][7] solution offers fully automated and agentless monitoring of connected assets to\nuncover vulnerabilities and threats and eliminate them. The solution detects unpatched systems,\nidentifies attack paths, and recommends updates while offering status updates on the application of\npatches.\n\nThe tool uses a unique technology that deeply examines data packets, designed to work with IT, OT,\nand IoT systems for spotting threats. The incident management feature provides information based on\nthe MITRE ATT&CK framework classifying adversary tactics, techniques, and procedures (TTPs) through\na multi-tier detection approach and real-world observations.\n\n[video image]\n\n## **Comprehensive threat management is the key**\n\nFor mixed networks like IT-OT or connected setups like IoT, having accurate and relevant threat\ninformation is essential. While there are several generic threat intelligence sources, our threat\nintelligence is derived from our global IoT and OT-specific honeypot repositories deployed across\nover 90 global locations, monitors over 12 million IoT and OT security incidents, covering more than\n6,000 devices and over 400 different system designs. This threat intelligence is combined with\nexternal syndicated sources to create a feed that regularly updates installations with the latest\nthreat information. This ensures that your threat management strategy manages to stay well ahead of\nnew and emergent threats.\n\n## Do more with the industry\u2019s most trusted patch and threat management product\n\nKeep a current list of all systems and their vulnerability status.\n\nThreat detection \u2013 discover and respond to cyber threats before they impact operations.\n\nAutomate patch management: Reduce risk exposure due to unpatched systems\n\nDiscover and fix attack paths\n\nComply with standards such as IEC 62443, NIST SP 800 and NIS2\n\n## **Build resilience and keep threats at bay**\n\n###### Protect your Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS) with [Shieldworkz][8]\n\nRequest a Demo\n\n][9]\n[Cybersecurity website footer]\n\n### About Us\n\nWe secure Operational Technology environments and protect businesses with best-in-class professional\nservices and cyber security solutions.\n\n[Shieldworkz logo footer]\n][10]\n\n#### Company\n\nAbout Us\n\n][11][\n\nContact Us\n\n][12][\n\nPartner Program\n\n][13][\n\nCareers\n\n][14][\n\nEvents\n\n][15][\n\nFAQs\n\n][16]\n\n#### Resources\n\nBlog\n\n][17][\n\nRegulatory Playbooks\n\n][18][\n\nRemediation Guides\n\n][19][\n\nReports\n\n][20][\n\nE-Books\n\n][21][\n\nCase Studies\n\n][22][\n\nUse Cases\n\n][23][\n\nNewsroom\n\n][24][\n\nWebinars\n\n][25][\n\nGlossary\n\n][26]\n\n#### Products\n\nOT Security Platform\n\n][27][\n\nMedia Scan Solution\n\n][28][\n\nPatch Management Solution\n\n][29]\n\n#### Services\n\nOT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis\n\n][30][\n\nManaged SOC Service\n\n][31][\n\nOT Incident Response Retainer Service\n\n][32][\n\nOT Vulnerability Assessment / Penetration Testing Service\n\n][33][\n\nAll Services\n\n][34]\n\n#### Useful Links\n\nOT Security\n\n][35][\n\nNIS2 Compliance\n\n][36][\n\nNERC CIP Framework\n\n][37][\n\nNetwork Detection and Response\n\n][38][\n\n