            "text": "[site-logo]\n][1]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][2]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[site-logo]\n][3]\n[site-logo]\n][4]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][5]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[Hero bg-image]\n\n# OT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis\n\nHome\n\n][6]\n\nServices\n\n## OT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis\n\nOur OT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis (RAGA) service helps organizations discover and\nprioritize vulnerabilities, assess specific cyber risks, understand their Security and Maturity\nLevels as per IEC 62443 and NIST CSF, and build robust strategies to safeguard OT infrastructure.\nEach assessment exercise is supported by agentic AI Copilots trained on global standards, cyber\nrisks, attack paths, compliance frameworks, and best practices.\n\n### [Shieldworkz][7] offers the industry\u2019s first and only agentic AI-powered RAGA service.\n\n#### Our OT security risk and gap assessment services cover:\n\nPre-Consultation: Understand your operational environment, objectives, security awareness levels of\nemployees, contextual risks, and key concerns.\n\nAssistance from agentic AI at all stages to improve accuracy of the exercise, validate findings and\nrecommendations and ensure alignment with global standards\n\nAsset Discovery and Mapping: Identify and document all critical OT assets, behaviours,\ncommunications, protocols, networks, and connections.\n\nThreat and Vulnerability Analysis: Evaluate full spectrum threats and system vulnerabilities through\nin-depth assessments across systems and sites.\n\nGap Analysis: Compare the current security posture including practices and documentation against\nindustry benchmarks such as IEC 62443 and NIST CSF and global best practices.\n\nRisk Assessment: Identify security gaps, short and long term cyber risks and analyze the likelihood\nof an event and potential impact of the identified vulnerabilities.\n\nReporting, Recommendations and Roadmap: we provide a comprehensive and actionable report outlining\nprioritized actions to address security issues and close gaps.\n\nSecurity and Maturity Level: Detailed information on the current Security Level and the recommended\nSecurity Level. Shieldworkz will also provide a roadmap to attain the recommended level with\ntimelines.\n\n[Shieldworkz OT Security Risk Assessment]\n[Shield image]\n\n### [Shieldworkz][8] offers the industry\u2019s first and only agentic AI-powered RAGA service.\n\n#### Our OT security risk and gap assessment services cover:\n\nPre-Consultation: Understand your operational environment, objectives, security awareness levels of\nemployees, contextual risks, and key concerns.\n\nAssistance from agentic AI at all stages to improve accuracy of the exercise, validate findings and\nrecommendations and ensure alignment with global standards\n\nAsset Discovery and Mapping: Identify and document all critical OT assets, behaviours,\ncommunications, protocols, networks, and connections.\n\nThreat and Vulnerability Analysis: Evaluate full spectrum threats and system vulnerabilities through\nin-depth assessments across systems and sites.\n\nGap Analysis: Compare the current security posture including practices and documentation against\nindustry benchmarks such as IEC 62443 and NIST CSF and global best practices.\n\nRisk Assessment: Identify security gaps, short and long term cyber risks and analyze the likelihood\nof an event and potential impact of the identified vulnerabilities.\n\nReporting, Recommendations and Roadmap: we provide a comprehensive and actionable report outlining\nprioritized actions to address security issues and close gaps.\n\nSecurity and Maturity Level: Detailed information on the current Security Level and the recommended\nSecurity Level. Shieldworkz will also provide a roadmap to attain the recommended level with\ntimelines.\n\n[Shieldworkz OT Security Risk Assessment]\n[Shield image]\n\n# Why Us\n\n[Depth of Expertise]\n\nDepth of Expertise\n\nOur risk assessment teams have extensive experience working with diverse OT environments including\nthose with legacy systems across industries.\n\n[Custom Practices]\n\nCustom Practices\n\nWe customize each assessment to align with the unique business and security goals of a business.\nValidation by agentic AI makes the exercise more accurate.\n\n[Proven Track Record]\n\nProven Track Record\n\nTrusted globally by organizations to deliver reliable, contextual and actionable security insights\nthrough the report.\n\n[Cutting-Edge Tools]\n\nCutting-Edge Tools\n\nLeverage proprietary tools and methodologies to offer a comprehensive assessment.\n\n## Take the Next Step\n\nSecure your OT environment from emerging risks, cyber threats, insider activity and operational\nrisks now.\n\n[Shieldworkz bg image]\n[Shieldworkz bg image]\n[Shieldworkz OT security]\n[Shieldworkz shield image]\n\n## Take the Next Step\n\nSecure your OT environment from emerging risks, cyber threats, insider activity and operational\nrisks now.\n\n[Shieldworkz bg image]\n[Shieldworkz OT security]\n[Shieldworkz shield image]\n[CTA-section bg image]\n\n### **Reach out to us today to learn more about our OT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis\n### services.**\n\n### **Reach out to us today to learn more about our OT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis\n### services.**\n\nGet Started Now\n\n][9]\n[Cybersecurity website footer]\n\n### About Us\n\nWe secure Operational Technology environments and protect businesses with best-in-class professional\nservices and cyber security solutions.\n\n[Shieldworkz logo footer]\n][10]\n\n#### Company\n\nAbout Us\n\n][11][\n\nContact Us\n\n][12][\n\nPartner Program\n\n][13][\n\nCareers\n\n][14][\n\nEvents\n\n][15][\n\nFAQs\n\n][16]\n\n#### Resources\n\nBlog\n\n][17][\n\nRegulatory Playbooks\n\n][18][\n\nRemediation Guides\n\n][19][\n\nReports\n\n][20]