            "text": "[site-logo]\n][1]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][2]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[site-logo]\n][3]\n[site-logo]\n][4]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][5]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[shieldworkz hero bg image]\n\n# Managed SOC Service\n\nHome\n\n][6]\n\nServices\n\n## Managed SOC Service\n\n[Shieldworkz ][7]Managed OT Security Operations Center (SOC) Service powered by agentici AI delivers\nround-the-clock threat monitoring, detection, management, and response through our global SOC\nfacilities. All managed OT SOC services are rendered through the SOC closest to your business with\ndedicated or shared SecOps teams.\n\nThis is a unique solution for OT operators that do not wish to invest in building an on-premise SOC\nground-up without compromising on their security needs.\n\n### Key components of [Shieldworkz ][8]Managed SOC Service\n\nReal-Time Threat Detection\n\nContinuous analysis using NIDS and other tools\n\nContinuous analysis using NIDS and other tools\n\nIncident Handling and Response\n\nFaster triage, containment, analysis, and mitigation of threats with AI.\n\nFaster triage, containment, analysis, and mitigation of threats with AI.\n\nSecurity Log Management\n\nCollection, correlation, and analysis of security logs.\n\nCollection, correlation, and analysis of security logs.\n\nAsset Visibility\n\nKnow what your assets are up to at all times.\n\nKnow what your assets are up to at all times.\n\nAI-based Operation\n\nWith assistance from a trained OT Co-pilot to aid in faster response to an incident.\n\nWith assistance from a trained OT Co-pilot to aid in faster response to an incident.\n\nPatch Management\n\nIdentify and remediate vulnerabilities early to reduce risk exposure.\n\nIdentify and remediate vulnerabilities early to reduce risk exposure.\n\nThreat Hunting and Intelligence\n\nEarly identification and neutralization of emerging threats targeting your network and assets.\n\nEarly identification and neutralization of emerging threats targeting your network and assets.\n\nReporting and Compliance Support\n\nCustom reports and dashboards for transparency and audit readiness.\n\nCustom reports and dashboards for transparency and audit readiness.\n\nModels Aligned with Business Priorities\n\nFlexible options include captive SOC or a shared SOC.\n\nFlexible options include captive SOC or a shared SOC.\n\nScale SecOps\n\nWith** **qualified and experienced resources and operating models.\n\n[Shieldworkz Manages SOC Service]\n[Shieldworkz logo]\n\n### Key components of [Shieldworkz ][9]Managed SOC Service\n\nReal-Time Threat Detection\n\nContinuous analysis using NIDS and other tools\n\nIncident Handling and Response\n\nFaster triage, containment, analysis, and mitigation of threats with AI.\n\nSecurity Log Management\n\nCollection, correlation, and analysis of security logs.\n\nAsset Visibility\n\nKnow what your assets are up to at all times.\n\nAI-based Operation\n\nWith assistance from a trained OT Co-pilot to aid in faster response to an incident.\n\nPatch Management\n\nIdentify and remediate vulnerabilities early to reduce risk exposure.\n\nThreat Hunting and Intelligence\n\nEarly identification and neutralization of emerging threats targeting your network and assets.\n\nReporting and Compliance Support\n\nCustom reports and dashboards for transparency and audit readiness.\n\nModels Aligned with Business Priorities\n\nFlexible options include captive SOC or a shared SOC.\n\nScale SecOps\n\nWith** **qualified and experienced resources and operating models.\n\n[Shieldworkz Manages SOC Service]\n[Shieldworkz logo]\n\n# Why Us\n\n[Depth of Expertise]\n\nUnmatched SOC Expertise\n\nWe have extensive experience in establishing and running OT SOCs based on varied models with high\nlevels of customisation. Globally, we operate three OT-managed SOCs.\n\n[Proven Models]\n\nProven Models\n\nWe work to evolve and deploy a custom SOC aligned to your unique security requirements while\nfurthering compliance goals.\n\n[Proven Track Record]\n\nProven Track Record\n\nTrusted globally by organizations to deliver a mature, context bound and efficient SOC.\n\n## Take the Next Step\n\nReach out to us today to learn more about our **Managed SOC Service **offering\n\n[Shieldworkz Managed SOC service]\n[Shieldworkz Managed SOC service]\n[Shieldworkz Managed SOC service]\n[Shieldworkz Shield image]\n\n## Take the Next Step\n\nReach out to us today to learn more about our **Managed SOC Service **offering\n\n[Shieldworkz Managed SOC service]\n[Shieldworkz Managed SOC service]\n[Shieldworkz Shield image]\n[CTA Section]\n\n### **Reach out to us today to learn more about our Managed SOC Services.**\n\n### **Reach out to us today to learn more about our Managed SOC Services.**\n\nGet Started Now\n\n][10]\n[Cybersecurity website footer]\n\n### About Us\n\nWe secure Operational Technology environments and protect businesses with best-in-class professional\nservices and cyber security solutions.\n\n[Shieldworkz logo footer]\n][11]\n\n#### Company\n\nAbout Us\n\n][12][\n\nContact Us\n\n][13][\n\nPartner Program\n\n][14][\n\nCareers\n\n][15][\n\nEvents\n\n][16][\n\nFAQs\n\n][17]\n\n#### Resources\n\nBlog\n\n][18][\n\nRegulatory Playbooks\n\n][19][\n\nRemediation Guides\n\n][20][\n\nReports\n\n][21][\n\nE-Books\n\n][22][\n\nCase Studies\n\n][23][\n\nUse Cases\n\n][24][\n\nNewsroom\n\n][25][\n\nWebinars\n\n][26][\n\nGlossary\n\n][27]\n\n#### Products\n\nOT Security Platform\n\n][28][\n\nMedia Scan Solution\n\n][29][\n\nPatch Management Solution\n\n][30]\n\n#### Services\n\nOT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis\n\n][31][\n\nManaged SOC Service\n\n][32][\n\nOT Incident Response Retainer Service\n\n][33][\n\nOT Vulnerability Assessment / Penetration Testing Service\n\n][34][\n\nAll Services\n\n][35]\n\n#### Useful Links\n\nOT Security\n\n][36][\n\nNIS2 Compliance\n\n][3