.com/shieldworkz\n[46]: https://www.youtube.com/@Shieldworkz\n[47]: ../cyber-resilience-facility-incident-response-plan-template/terms\n[48]: ../privacy\n[49]: ../\n[50]: ../about-us\n[51]: ../contact-us\n[52]: ../shieldworkz-partner-program\n[53]: ../careers\n[54]: ../events\n[55]: ../industrial-ot-cybersecurity-faqs\n[56]: ../blog\n[57]: ../regulatory-playbooks\n[58]: ../remediation-guides\n[59]: ../reports\n[60]: ../ebooks\n[61]: ../case-studies\n[62]: ../use-cases\n[63]: ../newsroom\n[64]: ../webinars\n[65]: ../industrial-cybersecurity-glossary\n[66]: ../products/ot-security-platform\n[67]: ../products/media-scan-solution\n[68]: ../products/patch-management-solution\n[69]: ./ot-security-risk-assessment-and-gap-analysis\n[70]: ./managed-soc-service\n[71]: ./ot-incident-response-retainer-service\n[72]: ./ot-vulnerability-assess"
