            "url": "https://shieldworkz.com/case-studies/securing-the-digital-factory-resilience-integrity-in-food-and-beverage",
            "text": "[site-logo]\n][1]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][2]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[site-logo]\n][3]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][4]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[site-logo]\n][5]\n\n### **Case Study**\n\n# **Securing the Digital Factory****\n# ****Resilience & Integrity in Food & Beverage**\n\n### **The evolving OT risk in Food & Beverage manufacturing**\n\nFood & Beverage manufacturers operate continuous-production environments where hygiene, cold-chain\nintegrity, and uninterrupted throughput are non-negotiable. Connecting factory floors to enterprise\nsystems and the cloud brings productivity and compliance benefits - but also expands the attack\nsurface. Legacy PLCs, vendor remote access, and converged IT/OT networks increase exposure to\nincidents that can halt production, compromise product integrity, or trigger recalls.\n\nWhen one leading national Food & Beverage manufacturer began a rapid Industry 4.0 push, their core\nproblem was simple but dangerous: they didn\u2019t fully know what was on their plant floors, how those\nassets communicated, or whether hidden compromises could already exist. Regulators and commercial\nleaders demanded demonstrable data integrity and uninterrupted production. [**Shieldworkz**][6]\ndelivered a safety-first program that moved the organisation from fragile connectivity to\npredictable resilience.\n\n### **About the Shieldworkz case study: what you\u2019ll learn**\n\nThis case study describes Shieldworkz end-to-end engagement with a large Food & Beverage\nmanufacturer operating 12 plants and export distribution hubs across India. The client needed to\neliminate OT blind spots, ensure tamper-proof hygiene and temperature logs (CIP/SIP), and secure\ncloud connectivity for analytics - without disrupting continuous production.\n\nShieldworkz delivered a multi-phased, safety-first program combining passive discovery, network\nsegmentation, OT-aware monitoring, and operational integration. Download this case study to see the\nstep-by-step approach, measurable outcomes, and the board-ready evidence package that supported the\nclient\u2019s shift from reactive firefighting to resilient, audit-ready operations.\n\n**Why download the full case study**\n\nDownload this case study to see the **step-by-step, safety-first approach** Shieldworkz used to\nsecure a connected Food & Beverage manufacturing environment.\n\nGained full visibility into previously unknown OT assets and vendor access paths\n\nSecured food-safety-critical systems without interrupting production\n\nAchieved audit-ready data integrity aligned with regulatory expectations\n\nReduced operational risk while enabling Industry 4.0 and cloud analytics\n\nThe case study also includes **measurable outcomes and executive-ready evidence** that supported\nleadership decisions and long-term resilience planning.\n\n### **Key takeaways from the case study**\n\n**Visibility first:** A living, accurate asset inventory is the foundation of OT security.\n\n**Safety-first discovery:** Start passive and use active queries only in approved maintenance\nwindows.\n\n**Prioritise by business impact:** Map technical gaps to downtime, food-safety and regulatory\nexposure to secure funding.\n\n**Hunt proactively:** Regular compromise assessments reveal threats that routine scanners miss.\n\n**Make remediation auditable:** Tie fixes to tickets and validation evidence so leadership can\nclearly see progress.\n\n### **How Shieldworkz supports Food & Beverage manufacturers end-to-end**\n\nShieldworkz supports Food & Beverage enterprises across the **entire OT security lifecycle**, from\ndiscovery to continuous resilience:\n\n**Visibility & asset intelligence** across legacy and modern production lines\n\n**Protection of food safety systems** (CIP/SIP, pasteurization, sterilization, cold-chain)\n\n**Secure Industry 4.0 enablement**, including cloud and analytics integrations\n\n**Secure Industry 4.0 enablement**, including cloud and analytics integrations\n\n**Operationally safe deployments** designed specifically for sensitive production environments\n\n**Executive-ready reporting** that ties cyber risk to uptime, safety, and compliance impact\n\nThis end-to-end model ensures security becomes an **enabler of productivity and compliance**, not a\nblocker.\n\n### **Ready to move from reactive to resilient?**\n\nIf your organisation runs distributed production lines, cold-chain systems, or cloud-connected\nmanufacturing, request the Shieldworkz case study and schedule a complimentary rapid assessment.\nWe\u2019ll show how a safety-first discovery and remediation program delivers measurable business\nvalue-and prepare a pilot plan tailored to your environment.\n\n**Fill out the form to download the full case study and claim a complimentary 30-minute discovery\ncall with a Shieldworkz OT specialist.**\n\n#### Schedule a Consultation to Secure\n#### Digital Factory Operations in Food & Beverage\n\n[Cybersecurity website footer]\n\n### About Us\n\nWe secure Operational Technology environments and protect businesses with best-in-class professional\nservices and cyber security solutions.\n\n[Shieldworkz logo footer]\n][7]\n\n#### Company\n\nAbout Us\n\n][8][\n\nContact Us\n\n][9][\n\nPartner Program\n\n][10][\n\nCareers\n\n][11][\n\nEvents\n\n][12][\n\nFAQs\n\n][13]\n\n#### Resources\n\nBlog\n\n][14][\n\nRegulatory Playbooks\n\n][15][\n\nRemediation Guides\n\n][16][\n\nReports\n\n][17][\n\nE-Books\n\n][18][\n\nCase Studies\n\n][19][\n\nUse Cases\n\n][20][\n\nNewsroom\n\n][21][\n\nWebinars\n\n][22][\n\nGlossary\n\n][23]\n\n#### Products\n\nOT Security Platform\n\n][24][\n\nMedia Scan Solution\n\n][25][\n\nPatch Management Solution\n\n][26]\n\n#### Services\n\nOT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis\n\n][27][\n\nManaged SOC Service\n\n][28][\n\nOT Incident Response Retainer Service\n\n][29][\n\nOT Vulnerability Assessment / Penetration Testing Service\n\n][30][\n\nAll Services\n\n][31]\n\n#### Useful Links\n\nOT Security\n\n][32][\n\nNIS2 Compliance\n\n][33][\n\nNERC CIP Framework\n\n][34][\n\nNetwork Detection and Response\n\n][35][\n\nCPS Protection\n\n][36][\n\nSOC as a Service\n\n][37][\n\nIEC 62443\n\n][38]\n][39][\n][40][\n][41][\n][42][\n][43]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, Shieldworkz - All Rights Reserved.\n\nTerms & Conditions\n\n][44][\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\n][45]\n[Cybersecurity website footer]\n\n### About Us\n\nWe secure Operational Technology environments and protect businesses with best-in-class professional\nservices and cyber security solutions.\n\n[Shieldworkz logo footer]\n][46]\n\n#### Company\n\nAbout Us\n\n][47][\n\nContact Us\n\n][48][\n\nPartner Program\n\n][49][\n\nCareers\n\n][50][\n\nEvents\n\n][51][\n\nFAQs\n\n][52]\n\n#### Resources\n\nBlog\n\n][53][\n\nRegulatory Playbooks\n\n][54][\n\nRemediation Guides\n\n][55][\n\nReports\n\n][56][\n\nE-Books\n\n][57][\n\nCase Studies\n\n][58][\n\nUse Cases\n\n][59][\n\nNewsroom\n\n][60][\n\nWebinars\n\n][61][\n\nGlossary\n\n][62]\n\n#### Products\n\nOT Security Platform\n\n][63][\n\nMedia Scan Solution\n\n][64][\n\nPatch Management Solution\n\n][65]\n\n#### Services\n\nOT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis\n\n][66][\n\nManaged SOC Service\n\n][67][\n\nOT Incident Response Retainer Service\n\n][68][\n\nOT Vulnerability Assessment / Penetration Testing Service\n\n][69][\n\nAll Services\n\n][70]\n\n#### Useful Links\n\nOT Security\n\n][71][\n\nNIS2 Compliance\n\n][72][\n\nNERC CIP Framework\n\n][73][\n\nNetwork Detection and Response\n\n][74][\n\nCPS Protection\n\n][75][\n\nSOC as a Service\n\n][76][\n\nIEC 62443\n\n][77]\n][78][\n][79][\n][80][\n][81][\n][82]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, Shieldworkz - All Rights Reserved.\n\nTerms & Conditions\n\n][83][\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\n][84]\n[Cybersecurity website footer]\n\n### About Us\n\nWe secure Operational Technology environments and protect businesses with best-in-class professional\nservices and cyber security solutions.\n\n[Shieldworkz logo footer]\n][85]\n\n#### Company\n\nAbout Us\n\n][86][\n\nContact Us\n\n][87][\n\nPartner Program\n\n][88][\n\nCareers\n\n][89][\n\nEvents\n\n][90]\n\n#### Resources\n\nBlog\n\n][91][\n\nRegulatory Playbooks\n\n][92][\n\nRemediation Guides\n\n][93][\n\nReports\n\n][94][\n\nE-Books\n\n][95][\n\nCase Studies\n\n][96][\n\nUse Cases\n\n][97][\n\nNewsroom\n\n][98][\n\nWebinars\n\n][99]\n\n#### Services\n\nOT Security Risk Assessment and Gap Analysis\n\n][100][\n\nManaged SOC Service\n\n][101][\n\nOT Incident Response Retainer Service\n\n][102][\n\nOT Vulnerability Assessment / Penetration Testing Service\n\n][103][\n\nAll Services\n\n][104]\n\n#### Products\n\nOT Security Platform\n\n][105][\n\nMedia Scanning Solution\n\n][106][\n\nPatch Management Solution\n\n][107]\n\n#### Useful Links\n\nOT Security\n\n][108][\n\nNIS2 Compliance\n\n][109][\n\nNERC CIP Framework\n\n][110][\n\nNetwork Detection and Response\n\n][111][\n\nCyber-Physical System\n\n][112][\n\nSOC as a Service\n\n][113][\n\nIEC 62443\n\n][114]\n][115][\n][116][\n][117][\n][118][\n][119]\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2026, Shieldworkz - All Rights Reserved.\n\nTerms & Conditions\n\n][120][\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\n][121]\n\u2039 \u203a \u00d7\n\n[1]: ../\n[2]: ../request-a-demo\n[3]: ../\n[4]: ../request-a-demo\n[5]: ../\n[6]: ../\n[7]: ../\n[8]: ../about-us\n[9]: ../contact-us\n[10]: ../shieldworkz-partner-program\n[11]: ../careers\n[12]: ../events\n[13]: ../industrial-ot-cybersecurity-faqs\n[14]: ../blog\n[15]: ../regulatory-playbooks\n[16]: ../remediation-guides\n[17]: ../reports\n[18]: ../ebooks\n[19]: ../case-studies\n[20]: ../use-cases\n[21]: ../newsroom\n[22]: ../webinars\n[23]: ../industrial-cybersecurity-glossary\n[24]: ../products/ot-security-platform\n[25]: ../products/media-scan-solution\n[26]: ../products/patch-management-solution\n[27]: ../services/ot-security-risk-assessment-and-gap-analysis\n[28]: ../services/managed-soc-service\n[29]: ../services/ot-incident-response-retainer-service\n[30]: ../services/ot-vulnerability-assessment-penetration-testing-service\n[31]: ../services\n[32]: ../ot-security-best-practices\n[33]: ../nis2-compliance-framework\n[34]: ../nerc-cip-standards-compliance-framework-overview\n[35]: ../comprehensive-guide-to-network-detection-and-response-ndr-in-2026\n[36]: ../cyber-physical-system-cps-protection-complete-guide-best-practices\n[37]: ../soc-as-a-service-your-shield-against-cyber-threat-24-7\n[38]: ../iec-62443-practical-guide-for-ot-ics-iiot-security\n[39]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/shieldworkz/\n[40]: https://www.facebook.com/Shieldworkzz/\n[41]: https://www.instagram.com/shieldworkz/\n[42]: https://x.com/shieldworkz\n[43]: https://www.youtube.com/@Shieldworkz\n[44]: ../cyber-resilience-facility-incident-response-plan-template/terms\n[45]: ../privacy\n[46]: ../\n[47]: ../about-us\n[48]: ../contact-us\n[49]: ../shieldworkz-partner-program\n[50]: ../careers\n[51]: ../events\n[52]: ../industrial-ot-cybersecurity-faqs\n[53]: ../blog\n[54]: ../regulatory-playbooks\n[55]: ../remediation-guides\n[56]: ../reports\n[57]: ../ebooks\n[58]: ../case-studies\n[59]: ../use-cases\n[60]: ../newsroom\n[61]: ../webinars\n[62]: ../industrial-cybersecurity-glossary\n[63]: ../products/ot-security-platform\n[64]: ../products/media-scan-solution\n[65]: ../products/patch-management-solution\n[66]: ../services/ot-security-risk-assessment-and-gap-analysis\n[67]: ../services/managed-soc-service\n[68]: ../services/ot-incident-response-retainer-service\n[69]: ../services/ot-vulnerability-assessment-penetration-testing-service\n[70]: ../services\n[71]: ../ot-security-best-practices\n[72]: ../nis2-compliance-framework\n[73]: ../nerc-cip-standards-compliance-framework-overview\n[74]: ../comprehensive-guide-to-network-detection-and-response-ndr-in-2026\n[75]: ../cyber-physical-system-cps-protection-complete-guide-best-practices\n[76]: ../soc-as-a-service-your-shield-against-cyber-threat-24-7\n[77]: ../iec-62443-practical-guide-for-ot-ics-iiot-security\n[78]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/shieldworkz/\n[79]: https://www.facebook.com/Shieldworkzz/\n[80]: https://www.instagram.com/shieldworkz/\n[81]: https://x.com/shieldworkz\n[82]: https://www.youtube.com/@Shieldworkz\n[83]: ../cyber-resilience-facility-incident-response-plan-template/terms\n[84]: ../privacy\n[85]: ../\n[86]: ../about-us\n[87]: ../contact-us\n[88]: ../shieldworkz-partner-program\n[89]: ../careers\n[90]: ../events\n[91]: ../blog\n[92]: ../regulatory-playbooks\n[93]: ../remediation-guides\n[94]: ../reports\n[95]: ../ebooks\n[96]: ../case-studies\n[97]: ../use-cases\n[98]: ../newsroom\n[99]: ../webinars\n[100]: ../services/ot-security-risk-assessment-and-g"
