Accessibility Testing Services\n\nProducts\n\nCYQER\n\nGRC360\n\nIndustries\n\nGovernment Industry\n\nBanking &#038; Finance\n\nIT, ITes &#038; Retail Industry\n\nManufacturing &#038; Telecom\n\nHealthcare\n\nHigher Education\n\nResources\n\nBlog\n\nCase Studies\n\nContact Us\n\nHave any questions?\n\nCall: 09668200222\n\nSearch for:\n\nEradicating Threats\n\nWith Innovative\n\nSecurity Solutions\nLet's Find your cyber security solutions\n\nWhile we take care of your Cyber Security needs\n\nLet's Validate Security Defences against real-world\n\nFocus on\n\nYour Business\n\nExpanding Globally with\nMake IT Stress Free for your Cyber Needs\n\nPrestigious\n\nTestimonials\n\nThreatsys Technologies Pvt. Ltd.\n\nStrengthen your Cyber Defence &amp; Protect Against Tomorrow\u2019s Attacks.\n\nThreatsys is a leading and trusted cyber security Consulting Partner that specializes in securing the IT infrastructure and assets of the leading enterprises globally. #EradicatingThreatsGlobally\n\nThreatsys protects $1Billions transactions every year.\n\nLosing productivity because of Cyber Security issues? Let&#8217;s Fix it.\n\nSchedule a Meeting\n\n360\u00b0 Cybersecurity Testing Services\n\nOur 360\u00b0 Cyber Security Services &amp; Solutions\n\nStay Up, Stay Running, Stay Protected\n\nCyber Security Consulting\n\nWe have deep experience in cybersecurity Consulting. We build a complete picture of your cybersecurity status &amp; provide a clear vision of how to secure your business.\n\nStay up and running\n\nCyber Security Testing\n\nOur Security testing services address mission-critical security challenges faced by enterprises. Our experience enables us to ensure that your business is hack-proof with threatsys.\n\nDefend your data\n\nCyber Security Compliances\n\nOur Cyber Security Compliance Services help companies put an end to regulatory confusion, respond to business threats, pinpoint operational inefficiencies &amp; focus on the business.\n\nCompliant your business\n\nCyber Forensic &amp; Investigation\n\nOur Cyber Forensics &amp; Investigation solutions will give you attack context, infrastructure-wide visibility, codified expertise, rich intelligence, insights gained from front-line experience.\n\nFind out the truth\n\nManaged Cyber Security Solutions\n\nLooking to outsource your managed cyber security solutions? Our Evaluation Checklist shows the right questions to ask &amp; achieve the best results as per Business Requirements.\n\nManage your Security\n\n360\u00b0 Cyber Security as a Services\n\nThreatsys Designed Flexible Cyber Security as a Service without the need for continuous investment in new hardware &amp; software products that require time and resources to deploy.\n\nProtect your business 360\u00b0\n\nYour Shield Against Cyber Threats, Ensuring Secure and Resilient Digital Operations\n\nIndia\u2019s Premier Cybersecurity Firm Protecting Businesses, Data, and Digital Infrastructure Worldwide\n\nThreatsys is India\u2019s leading cybersecurity firm, dedicated to securing businesses, enterprises, and government organizations from evolving cyber threats. Backed by a team of ethical hackers, security researchers, and compliance experts, Threatsys has established itself as a trusted partner for organizations seeking robust cybersecurity defenses. From securing financial institutions to protecting national-level initiatives, we deliver end-to-end security solutions that empower businesses to operate fearlessly in the digital world.\n\nPowering Secure Digital Transformations for Enterprises, Governments, and Global Brands\n\nThreatsys Technologies \u2013 Your Trusted 360\u00b0 Cyber Security Partner\n\nThreatsys is a trusted cybersecurity services provider , delivering comprehensive security solutions to protect businesses from evolving cyber threats. We specialize in penetration testing, security audits, compliance consulting, incident response, and managed security services. Serving industries like banking, government, IT, healthcare, and telecom, we help organizations strengthen their security posture. Recognized as the Best Cyber Security Company of India , Threatsys ensures enterprise-level protection with innovative cybersecurity strategies.\n\nThreatsys is trusted by our prestigious clientele since 2014\n\nGLOBAL EXPANSION &amp; STRATEGIC INTERNATIONAL ENGAGEMENTS\n\nRepresented India in France as part of an official Business Delegation led by the Government of India.\n\nRepresented India in the India\u2013South Korea Business Delegation organized by the Government of India.\n\nAwarded &#8220;Best Cybersecurity Company of India&#8221; and the prestigious &#8220;Atal Samman&#8221; at Bharat Mandapam, New Delhi.\n\nHonored with the &#8220;Excellence in Cyber Security 2026&#8221; Award by Kanak News.\n\nDownload our CEO&#8217;s Portfolio\n\nUNMATCHED SUCCESS AND UNPARALLELED ACHIEVEMENTS\n\nEmerging Entrepreneur in Cyber Security award from Lt. Gen. K. T. Parnaik (PVSM, UYSM, YSM), Governor of Arunachal Pradesh at ETNow Business Conclave 2025\n\nHonored with this prestigious Best Cyber Security Company of India award by the Honourable Minister, Nitin Gadkari , Government of India, at New Delhi\n\nOur CEO honored as Best Cyber Security Entrepreneur of India by Insight Success Magazine in 2024\n\nOur CEO Honored as the Youngest Entrepreneur of Odisha by the Director of IIT Bhubaneswar.\n\nCheck our Corporate Deck\n\nA VISIONARY INFOSEC COMPANY REDEFINING CYBERSECURITY NARRATIVES\n\nTedX Speaker at IIIT Bhubaneswar, 2017\n\nKeynote Speaker, Nextgen ICT Conclave 2019 Bangalore organised by CISCO\n\nKeynote Speaker, Odisha Tourism Conclave 2023 organised by HRAO\n\nKeynote Speaker, Tech Bhubaneswar 2.0 organised by Mindfire\n\nDownload our CEO&#8217;s Portfolio\n\nINDIA\u2019S CYBERSECURITY PIONEER: A DECADE OF EXCELLENCE\n\nBrand Ambassador for Cyber Safety Campaign Odisha 2023 organised by Odisha Police , Government of Odisha\n\nAdvisor to Law Enforcement Agencies , providing expert guidance in combating cybercrime.\n\nRead his Magazine\n\nTHE BEST CYBERSECURITY COMPANY EVERYONE TRUSTS BLINDLY!\n\nHonored with the &#8220;Excellence in Cyber Security&#8221; award by Entrepreneur Magazine at Bangalore\n\nHonored with the &#8220;Best Cyber Security Personality of the Year 2025&#8221; award by a leading magazine\n\nPartner with the Government of Odisha to showcase the state\u2019s growth and potential to the world at the Utkarsh Odisha \u2013 Make in Odisha 2025 Conclave .\n\nLet&#8217;s Know about Threatsys\n\nTHREATSYS PROTECTS $1BILLIONS TRANSACTIONS EVERY YEAR.\n\nOur Proven Global Expertise Helps you Transform Securely with Integrated Cyber Security Services\n\nOur cyber security services with latest hacking trends discover the point of danger, analyse the condition and respond appropriately. Threatsys analyse the organizations assessment &amp; testing needs, extensive testing of internal network and external network and application layers to provide remedies for risks and vulnerabilities. Based on market standards and referential (ISO, PCI, CoBIT, CIS, etc.) we help our clients to increase risk control throughout proper change management process.\n\nExpertise in 360 Degree Cyber Security Services\n\nWe Accelerate Cyber Security transformation with innovation and trust with global brands.\n\nCERT-IN Security Audit Our Cyber Security Testing Projects Security Consulting &amp; Compliances UIDAI AUA/KAU Audit\n\nCERT-IN Security Audit Our Cyber Security Testing Projects Security Consulting &amp; Compliances UIDAI AUA/KAU Audit\n\nEnsuring Data Security for One Crore Women Under Subhadra Yojana\n\nOverview Subhadra Yojana, launched by Prime Minister\n\nRead More\n\n#bbf900\n\nCERT-IN Security Audit Cyber Security Audits Managed Cyber Security Services Our Cyber Security Testing Projects Security Consulting &amp; Compliances\n\n#bbf900\n\nCERT-IN Security Audit Cyber Security Audits Managed Cyber Security Services Our Cyber Security Testing Projects Security Consulting &amp; Compliances\n\nProtecting 1.7M+ Users along with SEBI Compliance for Marketwolf\n\nOverview MarketWolf Securities Private Limited is a\n\nRead More\n\n#00e807\n\nCERT-IN Security Audit Cyber Security Audits Our Cyber Security Testing Projects\n\n#00e807\n\nCERT-IN Security Audit Cyber Security Audits Our Cyber Security Testing Projects\n\nPenetration Testing &#038; CERT-IN Audit for FSCW Dept,Govt of Odisha\n\nOverview Food, Supplies and Consumer Welfare Departm\n\nRead More\n\n#fc07aa\n\nManaged Cyber Security Services Our Cyber Security Testing Projects Security Consulting &amp; Compliances\n\n#fc07aa\n\nMan"
