      "key_products": "CYQER, GRC360, Cyber Security Testing, Managed Security Services, Cyber Forensics and Incident Response",
      "polished_summary": "Threatsys is a trusted cyber security consulting partner specializing in securing IT infrastructure and assets for enterprises globally. The company offers a range of comprehensive solutions, including the CYQER cybersecurity platform and GRC360 governance software, designed to protect businesses from evolving cyber threats while ensuring compliance with regulatory standards. Targeting diverse industries such as government, banking, healthcare, and education, Threatsys provides services like managed security, security consulting, and rigorous testing to enhance organizations' cybersecurity posture.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Threatsys specializes in cybersecurity consulting and offers a wide range of services including security testing, compliance audits, and managed security services, which are directly relevant to the Cyber-Physical Systems Security market.",
