      "company_summary": "Trginternational is a global market leader specializing in cloud financial management solutions and HR assessments, dedicated to delivering technical excellence that empowers businesses. Their diverse product offerings include advanced financial management systems, business intelligence tools, and talent management solutions, catering to organizations seeking to enhance their financial operations, streamline procurement processes, and develop talent. With a focus on innovation and integration, Trginternational serves a wide range of industries, helping clients achieve operational efficiency and strategic growth.",
