        "products": "Infor SunSystems; Infor Q&A; Infor EPM; Yooz; Great People Inside; Infor OS; Yooz; UniFi; Sysynkt; CS Lucas; Great People Inside; Hospitality Suite; SunSystems; Ad Hoc Services for SunSystems; Infor Birst; GR8 Wellbeing; GR8 Values; GR8 Sales; GR8 Remote Teams; GR8 Remote Manager; GR8 Remote Employee; GR8 Productivity Gap; GR8 Managers; GR8 Leader in a VUCA World; GR8 Interests; GR8 Full Spectrum Plus; GR8 Engagement; GR8 Customer Service; GR8 Customised; GR8 Cognitive Plus; GR8 Customized Assessment",
