        "crawl_text": "TRG International Asia North America Europe Vietnam APAC Global Microsoft Silver Certified Partner Microsoft Gold Certified Partner Microsoft Certified Solution Provider FY25 APAC Net New Partner of the Year FY25 APAC Cloud Upgrade Partner of the Year FY25 APAC Partner of the Year Most Inspiring Entrepreneur from Vietnam 2024 Green Office Diploma Award \u2014 WWF Vietnam Most Inspiring Entrepreneur from Vietnam in 2024 Vietnam\u2019s Top 50 Best Employers Strong client relationships Expertise in hospitality and financial services Global reach with local insights Customizable assessment solutions Extensive assessment library Experience with over 1,000 clients in 80+ countries Customizable solutions for various industries Experience with over 1,000 clients District 2, Thu Duc City, Vietnam Vietnam Vietnam Singapore Global APAC 80+ countries TRG International has over 30 years of experience in providing innovative tech solutions. The company serves more than 1,000 clients in over 80 countries. TRG International has over 1,000 clients in 80+ countries. The company has been operational since 1994, indicating over 25 years of experience in the industry. The company has thrived since 1994, showcasing extensive experience in the industry. The company has been operational since 1994. TRG International has been operational since 1994, serving over 1,000 clients in 80+ countries. TRG International has been operational since 1994, providing extensive experience in talent management solutions. The company serves over 1,000 clients across more than 80 countries, indicating a strong global presence. TRG International has been operational since 1994, providing extensive experience in talent management assessments. Expanding cloud financial management solutions Enhancing customer experience through technology Expanding service offerings in hospitality and financial management. Enhancing technology solutions for clients. Enhancing organizational growth through tailored assessment solutions. Focusing on cognitive and behavioral assessments to improve job performance. Competition in the IT services market. Adapting to changing technology trends. Growing demand for cloud-based financial solutions Expansion into new markets Growing demand for cloud-based solutions in hospitality and finance. Expansion into new geographic markets. A leading provider of cloud financial management solutions in the Asia-Pacific region. Increasing digital transformation in businesses Rising need for compliance and financial reporting solutions Increasing client base in the hospitality industry. Expansion of service offerings to meet diverse client needs. Increasing demand for customized assessment solutions in talent management. Expansion into new markets and industries. TRG International - Helping you and your business shine\n\nSolutions\n\nResources\n\nStories\n\nEvents\n\nAbout us\n\nCareers\nWatch Demo Get in Touch\nEnglish\n\nINDUSTRY-FOCUSED INNOVATION\nModern Cloud Finance Solutions for Modern Enterprises\nTransform your finance function with cloud-driven solutions that comply with the latest regulations, seamlessly integrate data, automate workflows, and accelerate decision-making.\n\nInvoice Processing Cost Calculator\nCalculate how much your business can save when automating invoice processing.\nHow to Calculate\n\nABOUT US\nTRG International Is A Global Market-Leading Solutions Provider, Focused on Delivering Technical Excellence\n\nTRG partners with global organisations to deliver innovative cloud financial management solutions and HR assessments to 1,000+ customers worldwide. Our goal is to help modernise and automate your core business processes, thus reducing your reliance on manual spreadsheets.\n\nYears in Business\n\nHappy Clients\n\nImplementation Man-hours a Year\n\nCountries Global Footprint\nMore About Us TRG 101 Brochure\n\nWHAT WE DO\nTransforming Your Business with Tailored Solutions\n\nInfor SunSystems Cloud\nA flexible, multi-currency, multi-accounting financial management solution that simplifies complex finance processes.\nLearn More\n\nInfor Q&amp;A\nA powerful ad-hoc query and BI tool with Excel integration, purpose-built to drill down for deeper analysis.\nLearn More\n\nInfor EPM\nA robust solution suite for financial budgeting, forecasting, and planning, with built-in scenario modeling, what-if analysis, and more.\nLearn More\n\nInfor OS\nUnify TRG and Infor&#x27;s ecosystem, orchestrating workflows, enabling single sign-on, AI insights, and seamless data flow.\nLearn More\n\nYooz\nCloud-native and AI-driven P2P automation that streamlines invoice capture all the way to payments.\nLearn More\n\nUnifi\nUnified process automation platform that connects your finance, TMS, WMS, procurement, and operations.\nLearn More\n\nSySynkt\nExtend your financial core further with automated expenses management and bank connectivity.\nLearn More\n\nCS Lucas\nEffectively manage treasury, liquidity, cash flow, risks, hedging, and asset financing oversight.\nLearn More\n\nEnd-User Training\nRecall and certification and training platform specifically developed for end-users.\nLearn More\n\nGreat People Inside\nNo-nonsense certification and training platform for talent with customisable psychometric assessments, packed with data-driven behavioural insights.\nLearn More\n\nView All Solutions\n\nINDUSTRIES WE SERVE\nSolving Business Challenges In Every Industry, Every Day\n\nInsurance\nSimplify claims, improve compliance, and optimize financial reporting.\nExplore\n\nHealthcare\nConnect clinical, financial, and operational data to improve patient experiences, lower costs, and enable value-based care.\nExplore\n\nManufacturing\nStreamline order-to-report process, optimize costs and inventory for greater efficiency.\nExplore\n\nReal Estate\nStreamline property finances, manage investments, and maximize portfolios.\nExplore\n\nEnergy\nTrack, manage asset lifecycle and ensure financial sustainability in a dynamic market.\nExplore\n\nConstruction\nStay on top of construction projects and gain full visibility into cash flows.\nExplore\n\nHospitality\nSolutions for hotels, restaurants, F&amp;B services, and casinos. Evolve at the pace of hospitality with an advanced, integrated, cloud-based platform.\nExplore\n\nEducation\nGain visibility and transparency into every funding and revenue stream so you can optimize costs and report to relevant stakeholders with ease.\nExplore\n\nFinancial Services\nOptimize compliance, reporting, and profitability with streamlined finances.\nExplore\n\nLogistics\nOptimize every link in your supply chain with integrated intelligence and real-time financial clarity.\nExplore\n\nHear from our customers about how TRG International is helping them achieve their business goals.\n\nAll\n\nLATEST EVENTS\nUpcoming Events &amp; Webinars\nJoin our latest webinars, workshops, and live sessions to stay ahead of finance and digital transformation trends.\n\nMay 28, 2026\n\nOn-demand Webinar SunSystems\n\u0110\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu li\u00ean c\u00f4ng ty: T\u1ed1i \u01b0u giao d\u1ecbch \u2013 Ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n\nTrong b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh kinh t\u1ebf s\u1ed1, vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd d\u00f2ng ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0 d\u1eef li\u1ec7u li\u00ean c\u00f4ng ty \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i v\u00e0 t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 x\u1eed l\u00fd nhanh ch\u00f3ng. \u0110\u1eebng b\u1ecf l\u1ee1 webinar s\u1eafp t\u1edbi c\u1ee7a TRG, \u0110\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu li\u00ean c\u00f4ng ty: T\u1ed1i \u01b0u giao d\u1ecbch \u2013 \u0110\u00f3ng s\u1ed5 nhanh h\u01a1n \u2013 Ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n. Read more\n\nDigital Transformation Finance Process Automation\nStop Closing the Books the Hard Way\nJoin TRG International Webinar to master the modern Record\u2011to\u2011Report (R2R) process and reclaim control over your data. Modern Record\u2011to\u2011Report: Automating Finance for Better Control, Planning, and Forecasting. Read more\n\nOn-demand Webinar\nS\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 Th\u00f4ng t\u01b0 99/2025/TT-BTC c\u00f9ng TRG\nH\u00e3y bi\u1ebfn th\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c th\u00e0nh c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i s\u1ed1. C\u00f9ng TRG International kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 c\u00e1ch gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u00e0m ch\u1ee7 Th\u00f4ng t\u01b0 99/2025/TT-BTC v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng quy \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ebf to\u00e1n m\u1edbi qua bu\u1ed5i webinar chuy\u00ean s\u00e2u n\u00e0y. Read more\nView All Events\n\nWe&#x27;ve thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to more than 1,000 clients\nin 80+ countries.\nFollow us on Social Media\n\nSolutions\nTRG Solutions Business Challenges Industries\nResources\nPodcasts Blog FAQ Research Portal TRG End-User Training\nStories\nCase Studies CEO Letters\nAbout us\nOur People Awards TRG Cares Testimonials\nEvents\nBecome our Speaker Events Gallery Hire our venue\nCareers\nInternships Internships Partners\nFollow us on Social Media\n\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International Terms and Conditions Privacy Policy Cookie Preferences \u00a9 2026 TRG International [[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n# Transforming Your Business with Tailored Solutions\n\nWith over 30 years of experience, TRG IT provides innovative tech, HR, and energy solutions tailored\nto propel your business. Our expertise ensures customized strategies for efficiency and growth,\nelevating your company to new heights.\n\n[Transforming Your Business with Tailored Solutions hero image]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\nWe partnered with selected leading business software and service providers around the world\n\n[[Award image 1]\n][11]\n[[Award image 2]\n][12]\n[[Award image 3]\n][13]\n[[Award image 4]\n][14]\n[[Award image 5]\n][15]\n[[Award image 6]\n][16]\n[[Award image 7]\n][17]\n[[Award image 8]\n][18]\n\n## BUSINESS CHALLENGES\n\nTRG offers solutions that tackle a broad spectrum of business challenges, from streamlining\noperations and boosting supply chain efficiency to enhancing customer experiences and optimizing\nfinancial performance across diverse industries.\n\n#### Accounting & Financials\n\nOur financial management and solutions streamline compliance, complex tasks, and data consolidation\nto support your business needs. \u2026\n\n#### Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP)\n\nOur ERP solutions simplify implementation and streamline processes, ensuring your business gains\nmaximum benefits.\n\n#### Cloud Delivered Transformation\n\nCloud Delivered Transformation demands top-tier security, ensuring compliance with industry\nstandards for critical infrastructure and data.\n\n#### Asset Management\n\nMaximizes asset lifespan, minimizes downtime, and ensures safety and compliance for continuous\nenergy production.\n\n#### Data Security & Management\n\nSecurity is paramount, requiring high levels of data protection and compliance with industry\nstandards for critical infrastructure.\n\n#### Enterprise Performance Management (EPM)\n\nOur EPM suite integrates financial management, analytics, and compliance tools to streamline\nplanning, budgeting, and reporting.\n\n[View All][19]\n\n## TRG SOLUTIONS\n\nTRG addresses these business challenges with industry-specific cloud solutions that integrate\nadvanced analytics, automation, and AI, empowering businesses to make data-driven decisions and\nswiftly adapt to evolving market demands.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor SunSystems\n\nStreamline global financial operations and multi-currency transactions while ensuring seamless\nreporting.\n\nInfor SunSystems\n\n][20][\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor Q&A\n\nAnalyze financial data with powerful reporting tools, streamline query management, and gain insights\nacross multiple business units.\n\nInfor Q&A\n\n][21][\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor EPM\n\nEnhance business planning, budgeting, and reporting with integrated performance management tools.\n\nInfor EPM\n\n][22][\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor Syteline\n\nStreamline manufacturing operations, optimize supply chains, and manage production with precision.\n\nInfor Syteline\n\n][23][\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor Birst\n\nUnlock insights with advanced analytics, data visualization, and intuitive reporting across your\norganization.\n\nInfor Birst\n\n][24][\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor OS\n\nIntegrate business processes, ensure seamless data flow, and enhance collaboration across all\ndepartments.\n\nInfor OS\n\n][25][\n[icon]\n\n#### Yooz\n\nYooz offers a comprehensive suite of features to automate your entire Procure-to-Pay process, from\nintelligent data capture and real-time processing to seamless ERP integration and advanced security\nmeasures.\n\n][26][\n[icon]\n\n#### Great People Inside\n\nCustomize talent as"
