          {
            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n# Transforming Your Business with Tailored Solutions\n\nWith over 30 years of experience, TRG IT provides innovative tech, HR, and energy solutions tailored\nto propel your business. Our expertise ensures customized strategies for efficiency and growth,\nelevating your company to new heights.\n\n[Transforming Your Business with Tailored Solutions hero image]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\nWe partnered with selected leading business software and service providers around the world\n\n[[Award image 1]\n][11]\n[[Award image 2]\n][12]\n[[Award image 3]\n][13]\n[[Award image 4]\n][14]\n[[Award image 5]\n][15]\n[[Award image 6]\n][16]\n[[Award image 7]\n][17]\n[[Award image 8]\n][18]\n\n## BUSINESS CHALLENGES\n\nTRG offers solutions that tackle a broad spectrum of business challenges, from streamlining\noperations and boosting supply chain efficiency to enhancing customer experiences and optimizing\nfinancial performance across diverse industries.\n\n#### Accounting & Financials\n\nOur financial management and solutions streamline compliance, complex tasks, and data consolidation\nto support your business needs. \u2026\n\n#### Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP)\n\nOur ERP solutions simplify implementation and streamline processes, ensuring your business gains\nmaximum benefits.\n\n#### Cloud Delivered Transformation\n\nCloud Delivered Transformation demands top-tier security, ensuring compliance with industry\nstandards for critical infrastructure and data.\n\n#### Asset Management\n\nMaximizes asset lifespan, minimizes downtime, and ensures safety and compliance for continuous\nenergy production.\n\n#### Data Security & Management\n\nSecurity is paramount, requiring high levels of data protection and compliance with industry\nstandards for critical infrastructure.\n\n#### Enterprise Performance Management (EPM)\n\nOur EPM suite integrates financial management, analytics, and compliance tools to streamline\nplanning, budgeting, and reporting.\n\n[View All][19]\n\n## TRG SOLUTIONS\n\nTRG addresses these business challenges with industry-specific cloud solutions that integrate\nadvanced analytics, automation, and AI, empowering businesses to make data-driven decisions and\nswiftly adapt to evolving market demands.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor SunSystems\n\nStreamline global financial operations and multi-currency transactions while ensuring seamless\nreporting.\n\nInfor SunSystems\n\n][20][\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor Q&A\n\nAnalyze financial data with powerful reporting tools, streamline query management, and gain insights\nacross multiple business units.\n\nInfor Q&A\n\n][21][\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor EPM\n\nEnhance business planning, budgeting, and reporting with integrated performance management tools.\n\nInfor EPM\n\n][22][\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor Syteline\n\nStreamline manufacturing operations, optimize supply chains, and manage production with precision.\n\nInfor Syteline\n\n][23][\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor Birst\n\nUnlock insights with advanced analytics, data visualization, and intuitive reporting across your\norganization.\n\nInfor Birst\n\n][24][\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor OS\n\nIntegrate business processes, ensure seamless data flow, and enhance collaboration across all\ndepartments.\n\nInfor OS\n\n][25][\n[icon]\n\n#### Yooz\n\nYooz offers a comprehensive suite of features to automate your entire Procure-to-Pay process, from\nintelligent data capture and real-time processing to seamless ERP integration and advanced security\nmeasures.\n\n][26][\n[icon]\n\n#### Great People Inside\n\nCustomize talent assessments and performance management to align with your organization\u2019s specific\nneeds.\n\nGreat People Inside\n\n][27][\n[icon]\n\n#### HubSpot\n\nStreamline marketing, sales, and customer service with an all-in-one CRM platform.\n\nHubSpot\n\n][28]\n\n### INDUSTRIES FOCUS\n\nTRG has implemented accounting solutions in industries like financial services, not-for-profit, and\nenergy, oil, and gas. Our adaptable configurations suit various markets, making us a trusted choice\nfor diverse industries.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial\nServices][29][Hospitality][30][Manufacturing][31][Insurance][32][Energy][33][Healthcare][34][Educati\non][35][Real Estate][36][Construction][37]\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T11:28:09.244Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][38][[facebook]][39][[youtube]][40]\n[Solutions][41]\n[TRG Solutions][42][Business Challenges][43][Industries][44]\n[Resources][45]\n[Podcasts][46][Blog][47][FAQ][48][Research Portal][49][TRG End-User Training][50]\n[Stories][51]\n[Case Studies][52][CEO Letters][53]\n[About us][54]\n[Our People][55][Awards][56][TRG Cares][57][Testimonials][58]\n[Events][59]\n[Become our Speaker][60][Events Gallery][61][Hire our venue][62]\n[Careers][63]\n[Internships][64][Internships Partners][65]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][66][[facebook]][67][[Youtube Play Button]][68]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][69][Privacy Policy][70]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: /solutions/#\n[12]: /solutions/#\n[13]: /solutions/#\n[14]: /solutions/#\n[15]: /solutions/#\n[16]: /solutions/#\n[17]: /solutions/#\n[18]: /solutions/#\n[19]: /business-challenges/\n[20]: /solutions/infor-sunsystems/\n[21]: /solutions/infor-qa/\n[22]: /solutions/infor-epm/\n[23]: /solutions/infor-syteline/\n[24]: /solutions/infor-birst/\n[25]: /solutions/infor-os/\n[26]: /solutions/yooz/\n[27]: /solutions/great-people-inside/\n[28]: /solutions/hubspot/\n[29]: /industries/financial-services/\n[30]: /industries/hospitality/\n[31]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[32]: /industries/insurance/\n[33]: /industries/energy/\n[34]: /industries/healthcare/\n[35]: /solutions/education/\n[36]: /industries/real-estate/\n[37]: /industries/construction/\n[38]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[39]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[40]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[41]: /solutions/\n[42]: /solutions/\n[43]: /business-challenges/\n[44]: /industries/\n[45]: /resources/\n[46]: /podcasts/\n[47]: /blog/\n[48]: /faq/\n[49]: /research/\n[50]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[51]: /stories/\n[52]: /stories/case-studies/\n[53]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[54]: /about-us/\n[55]: /about-us/our-people/\n[56]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[57]: /about-us/csr/\n[58]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[59]: /events/\n[60]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[61]: /events/events-gallery/\n[62]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[63]: /careers/\n[64]: /careers/internships/\n[65]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[66]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[67]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[68]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[69]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[70]: /privacy-policy/"
