            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/infor-sunsystems/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n#### TRG SOLUTION\n\n# Infor SunSystems\n\nInfor SunSystems brings unparalleled adaptability and user-friendliness to make accounting and\nfinance management hassle-free. Infor SunSystems version 6.4 is one of Infor\u2019s first solutions to be\nhosted in the cloud.\n\n[Infor SunSystems hero image]\n[Schedule a Call][11]\n[Download Brochure][12]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n## SunSystems Core Features\n\nSunSystems is a preferred choice for accounting software due to its comprehensive financial\nmanagement capabilities, flexible deployment options (including cloud-based solutions), and its\nability to seamlessly integrate with existing business systems.\n\n#### Financial Management\n\nCentralizes and streamlines financial operations, such as general ledger accounting and financial\nreporting.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Corporate Allocations\n\nCreate, split, assign, or reassign ledger transactions across business units, accounts, or analysis\ncodes, based on static ratios or recorded data.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Advanced Reporting\n\nOffers comprehensive reporting capabilities for financial data analysis and decision-making.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Fixed Assets Management\n\nThis module provides an extensive solution for managing fixed assets lifecycle, from acquisition to\ndisposal.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Sales Management\n\nSupports sales processes, including order management and customer relationship management.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Purchase Management\n\nStreamlines procurement processes, from purchase order creation to supplier management.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Inventory Management\n\nTrack inventory movements in and out of different warehouse locations, thus gaining an up-to-date\nview of the financial position driven by inventory activity.\n\nTell us a bit about you and your challenge\n\npre-render CSS\n\n### TRG SOLUTIONS\n\nWe tailor processes to meet each company's needs, achieving the best results. Our approach ensures\npersonalized solutions for optimal outcomes\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Robust Financial Data Control\n\nInfor SunSystems 6.4 provides organizations with complete control over their financial data,\nallowing for highly customizable configurations and ensuring that all sensitive information remains\nsecurely managed within the company\u2019s own infrastructure.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Custom configurations\n\n#### Data sovereignty\n\n#### Enhanced security\n\n#### On-premise control\n\n#### Compliance management\n\n#### Custom configurations\n\n#### Data sovereignty\n\n#### Enhanced security\n\n#### On-premise control\n\n#### Compliance management\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## High-Performance Financial Processing\n\nInfor SunSystems 6.4 is optimized for high-performance financial processing, capable of handling\nlarge volumes of transactions efficiently. It ensures quick, reliable financial operations with\nminimal latency, making it ideal for businesses with intensive financial workloads.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### High-speed processing\n\n#### Transaction efficiency\n\n#### Low latency\n\n#### Reliable operations\n\n#### System optimization\n\n#### High-speed processing\n\n#### Transaction efficiency\n\n#### Low latency\n\n#### Reliable operations\n\n#### System optimization\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Integration with Legacy Systems\n\nInfor SunSystems 6.4 integrates seamlessly with existing legacy systems, allowing businesses to\nmaintain their current IT environment while enhancing their financial management capabilities. This\nreduces the need for extensive system overhauls and supports a smoother transition.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Legacy integration\n\n#### System compatibility\n\n#### Smooth transition\n\n#### Reduced overhaul\n\n#### IT environment continuity\n\n#### Legacy integration\n\n#### System compatibility\n\n#### Smooth transition\n\n#### Reduced overhaul\n\n#### IT environment continuity\n\n### SEEK PROFESSIONAL HELP\n\nOur Solution Bundle provides tailored tech solutions to meet your business needs. Combining\ncutting-edge software, expert support, and seamless integration, it ensures your company runs\nsmoothly and efficiently.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Ad hoc services for SunSystems\n\nView Detail\n\n][13][\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor OS\n\nView Detail\n\n][14][\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor Query & Analysis\n\nView Detail\n\n][15][\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor EPM\n\nView Detail\n\n][16][\n[icon]\n\n#### Yooz\n\nView Detail\n\n][17][\n[icon]\n\n#### Unifi\n\nView Detail\n\n][18][\n[icon]\n\n#### CS Lucas\n\nView Detail\n\n][19]\n[View All[icon]][20]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\nLatest resources for **SunSystems**\n\nWatch on-demand now[icon]\n\n#### ON-DEMAND WEBINAR Infor OS Workflow\n\nDocument Approval Integrating with SunSystems Ledger Entry Infor OS helps you automate document\napprovals, eliminate manual steps, and integrate seamlessly with SunSystems Ledger Entry - all\nwithin one smart, cloud-based platform.\n][21][\nStart learning today[icon]\n\n#### TRG Academy\n\nGet unlimited access to the complete on-demand training library on Infor SunSystems, designed\nspecifically with YOU, the end-user, in mind!\n][22][\nLearn more[icon]\n\n#### Here's What You're Missing Out If Still Using Infor SunSystems 5\n\nThe time has come to embrace progress and transition to the more feature-rich Infor SunSystems.\n][23]\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nTRG has implemented accounting solutions for industries like financial services, not-for-profit, and\nenergy, oil, and gas, our custom configuration makes it well-suited for many other vertical markets\nas well. This adaptability is one of the key reasons why various industries choose us for their\nsolution requirements.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial\nServices][24][Hospitality][25][Manufacturing][26][Insurance][27][Energy][28][Healthcare][29][Educati\non][30][Real Estate][31][Construction][32]\n\n### OUR CLIENT\n\nSome of our satisfied customers utilising our Financial Management Solutions\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T11:30:46.997Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][33][[facebook]][34][[youtube]][35]\n[Solutions][36]\n[TRG Solutions][37][Business Challenges][38][Industries][39]\n[Resources][40]\n[Podcasts][41][Blog][42][FAQ][43][Research Portal][44][TRG End-User Training][45]\n[Stories][46]\n[Case Studies][47][CEO Letters][48]\n[About us][49]\n[Our People][50][Awards][51][TRG Cares][52][Testimonials][53]\n[Events][54]\n[Become our Speaker][55][Events Gallery][56][Hire our venue][57]\n[Careers][58]\n[Internships][59][Internships Partners][60]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][61][[facebook]][62][[Youtube Play Button]][63]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][64][Privacy Policy][65]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: https://calendly.com/mai-nguyen3-trginternational/30min\n[12]: https://blog.trginternational.com/sunsystems\n[13]: /solutions/infor-sunsystems-cloud/ad-hoc-services-for-sunsytems/\n[14]: /solutions/infor-os/\n[15]: /solutions/infor-qa/\n[16]: /solutions/infor-epm/\n[17]: /solutions/yooz/\n[18]: /solutions/unifi/\n[19]: /solutions/cs-lucas/\n[20]: /solutions/\n[21]: https://blog.trginternational.com/on-demand-webinar-document-approval-integrating-with-sunsyst\nems-ledger-entry\n[22]: https://academy.trginternational.com/collections/SunSystems-V6-4\n[23]: https://blog.trginternational.com/what-you-are-missing-if-still-using-infor-sunsystems-5\n[24]: /industries/financial-services/\n[25]: /industries/hospitality/\n[26]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[27]: /industries/insurance/\n[28]: /industries/energy/\n[29]: /industries/healthcare/\n[30]: /solutions/education/\n[31]: /industries/real-estate/\n[32]: /industries/construction/\n[33]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[34]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[35]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[36]: /solutions/\n[37]: /solutions/\n[38]: /business-challenges/\n[39]: /industries/\n[40]: /resources/\n[41]: /podcasts/\n[42]: /blog/\n[43]: /faq/\n[44]: /research/\n[45]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[46]: /stories/\n[47]: /stories/case-studies/\n[48]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[49]: /about-us/\n[50]: /about-us/our-people/\n[51]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[52]: /about-us/csr/\n[53]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[54]: /events/\n[55]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[56]: /events/events-gallery/\n[57]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[58]: /careers/\n[59]: /careers/internships/\n[60]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[61]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[62]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[63]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[64]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[65]: /privacy-policy/"
