            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/infor-qa/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n#### TRG SOLUTION\n\n# Infor Q&A\n\nAcquire 24/7 access to real-time information to make the right decisions at the right time.\n\n[Infor Q&A hero image]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n## Core Features\n\nThe Infor SunSystems Query & Analysis family of ad-hoc query and reporting tools includes:\n\nInfor Query & Analysis (Q & A) is a dynamic, multi-language, multi-currency set of business\nintelligence tools that is powerful, flexible, secure, and easy to use.\n\n#### Ad-Hoc Reporting\n\nCreate on-demand reports with real-time data, customizable to specific needs.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Excel Integration\n\nSeamlessly integrates with Microsoft Excel, allowing users to perform advanced data analysis within\na familiar interface.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Drill-Down Analysis\n\nEnables deep data exploration, letting users drill down into detailed data directly from summary\nreports.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Flexible Querying\n\nBuild complex queries without needing SQL knowledge, using an intuitive interface.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Real-Time Data Access\n\nProvides instant access to up-to-date data from various sources for accurate reporting.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Secure Data Handling\n\nEnsures data security with user-specific access controls and encryption.\n\n[icon]\n\n### TRG SOLUTIONS\n\nWe tailor processes to meet each company's needs, achieving the best results. Our approach ensures\npersonalized solutions for optimal outcomes\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Optimised Financial Reporting\n\nWe help you leverage Infor Q&A to create accurate and detailed financial reports, tailored to your\nspecific business needs.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Customise reports\n\n#### Automate data extraction\n\n#### Improve accuracy\n\n#### Enhance financial insights\n\n#### Streamline reporting\n\n#### Customise reports\n\n#### Automate data extraction\n\n#### Improve accuracy\n\n#### Enhance financial insights\n\n#### Streamline reporting\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Seamless Data Integration\n\nWe ensure Infor Q&A integrates smoothly with your existing systems, providing unified and reliable\ndata for reporting and analysis.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Connect to multiple data sources\n\n#### Simplify integration\n\n#### Enhance data reliability\n\n#### Support seamless reporting\n\n#### Ensure data consistency\n\n#### Connect to multiple data sources\n\n#### Simplify integration\n\n#### Enhance data reliability\n\n#### Support seamless reporting\n\n#### Ensure data consistency\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Comprehensive Training & Support\n\nWe provide extensive training and ongoing support to ensure your team fully utilises Infor Q&A for\nbetter decision-making.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Deliver training\n\n#### Create documentation\n\n#### Offer support\n\n#### Troubleshoot effectively\n\n#### Facilitate ongoing learning\n\n#### Deliver training\n\n#### Create documentation\n\n#### Offer support\n\n#### Troubleshoot effectively\n\n#### Facilitate ongoing learning\n\n### RESOURCES\n\nLatest resources for **Infor Q&A**\n\n[View All Resources[icon]][11]\nSun, Feb 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][12][\nSun, Feb 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][13][\nMon, Mar 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][14]\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nTRG has implemented hotel management solutions for hospitality industry. This adaptability is one of\nthe key reasons why large scale hospitality groups choose us for their solution requirements.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial\nServices][15][Hospitality][16][Manufacturing][17][Insurance][18][Energy][19][Healthcare][20][Educati\non][21][Real Estate][22][Construction][23]\n\n### OUR CLIENT\n\nSome of our satisfied customers utilising our Financial Management Solutions\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T10:33:54.154Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][24][[facebook]][25][[youtube]][26]\n[Solutions][27]\n[TRG Solutions][28][Business Challenges][29][Industries][30]\n[Resources][31]\n[Podcasts][32][Blog][33][FAQ][34][Research Portal][35][TRG End-User Training][36]\n[Stories][37]\n[Case Studies][38][CEO Letters][39]\n[About us][40]\n[Our People][41][Awards][42][TRG Cares][43][Testimonials][44]\n[Events][45]\n[Become our Speaker][46][Events Gallery][47][Hire our venue][48]\n[Careers][49]\n[Internships][50][Internships Partners][51]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][52][[facebook]][53][[Youtube Play Button]][54]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][55][Privacy Policy][56]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: /resources/\n[12]: /\n[13]: /\n[14]: /\n[15]: /industries/financial-services/\n[16]: /industries/hospitality/\n[17]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[18]: /industries/insurance/\n[19]: /industries/energy/\n[20]: /industries/healthcare/\n[21]: /solutions/education/\n[22]: /industries/real-estate/\n[23]: /industries/construction/\n[24]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[25]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[26]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[27]: /solutions/\n[28]: /solutions/\n[29]: /business-challenges/\n[30]: /industries/\n[31]: /resources/\n[32]: /podcasts/\n[33]: /blog/\n[34]: /faq/\n[35]: /research/\n[36]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[37]: /stories/\n[38]: /stories/case-studies/\n[39]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[40]: /about-us/\n[41]: /about-us/our-people/\n[42]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[43]: /about-us/csr/\n[44]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[45]: /events/\n[46]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[47]: /events/events-gallery/\n[48]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[49]: /careers/\n[50]: /careers/internships/\n[51]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[52]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[53]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[54]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[55]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[56]: /privacy-policy/"
