          {
            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/infor-epm/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n#### TRG SOLUTION\n\n# Infor EPM\n\nMeasure past performance and forecast activities with modern dynamic EPM software. Experience\nreal-time insights with a centralized data repository so you can make more informed and perceptive\ndecisions across your enterprise. EPM provides you with a holistic view of your business\nperformance, so your insights can offer more accurate and actionable future predictions.\n\n[Infor EPM hero image]\n[Schedule a Call][11]\n[Download Your Free Guide to Infor EPM][12]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n## Expand your competitive edge\n\nTransform your finance department by equipping your team members with tools that enable them to gain\ncomplete, real-time visibility into the entire business performance with Infor Enterprise\nPerformance Management (Infor EPM).\n\nWith Infor EPM, you gain not just a holistic view of your business\u2019 numbers and figures but also the\nconfidence to plan, budget, and forecast for the future.\n\n#### Time to value\n\nImprove visibility into financial processes\nInfor EPM integrates data from all sources within your business (ERP, CRM, operations, etc.) into a\nsingle, centralized platform, providing you with a reliable single version of the truth. With this\nunified portal, you can improve data accuracy, avoid closing delays, improve auditability, and\ncomply with regulations.\n[icon]\n\n#### Financial Consolidation\n\nVisualize data how you want\nVisibility truly comes alive with Infor EPM\u2019s powerful, interactive dashboards and data\nvisualization features. The solution not only allows you to personalize dashboards to reflect your\nneeds but also supports your data discovery journey to uncover insights through role-based analytics\nand reports.\n[icon]\n\n#### Organization Empowerment\n\nAccelerated analysis for unmatched clarity\nInfor EPM is built on an in-memory analytics platform that provides instant data consolidation and\nimmediate feedback on the impact of plans and forecasts. Moreover, you can drill down from\nhigh-level summaries on dashboards and reports directly into the underlying transactional details in\nyour source systems (like the general ledger or ERP) for more granular analysis.\n[icon]\n\n#### Workforce Planning\n\nPlan for any future with \u201cwhat-if\u201d modellling\nYou can run multiple financial scenarios in seconds to simulate potential outcomes. This helps you\nassess the financial impact of various decisions, market changes, or supply chain shifts, allowing\nfor proactive risk management and opportunity identification.\n[icon]\n\nTell us a bit about you and your challenge\n\npre-render CSS\n\n### TRG SOLUTIONS\n\nWe tailor processes to meet each company's needs, achieving the best results. Our approach ensures\npersonalized solutions for optimal outcomes\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Planning & Budgeting\n\nCreate deep plan hierarchies, compare plans to forecasts, and adjust plans on the fly. Task\nmanagement, decision packages, workflow, and versioning capabilities bring a new level of discipline\nand flexibility to your budgeting processes.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Real-Time Financial Planning\n\n#### Real-Time Financial Planning\n\n#### User-Friendly Budgeting Interface\n\n#### Cloud-Based Flexibility\n\n#### Analytics\n\n#### Real-Time Financial Planning\n\n#### Real-Time Financial Planning\n\n#### User-Friendly Budgeting Interface\n\n#### Cloud-Based Flexibility\n\n#### Analytics\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Consolidation\n\nConsolidate multiple sets of books quickly and seamlessly from each of your legal entities, process\nelimination entries, and generate a single set of financial statements.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Automated Data Consolidatio\n\n#### Real-Time\n\n#### Multi-Currency and Multi-GAAP\n\n#### Intercompany Reconciliation\n\n#### Customisation\n\n#### Automated Data Consolidatio\n\n#### Real-Time\n\n#### Multi-Currency and Multi-GAAP\n\n#### Intercompany Reconciliation\n\n#### Customisation\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Reporting\n\nImprove predictive modelling and operational planning, workforce budgeting, sales estimates, and\ncorporate performance management with EPM software; built for planning, budgeting, and forecasting.\nMonitor against actual performance and consolidate your holdings for complete financial reporting.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Cross-Departmental Reporting\n\n#### Real-Time\n\n#### Automated Report Distribution\n\n#### Compliance and Regulatory Reporting\n\n#### Customisation\n\n#### Cross-Departmental Reporting\n\n#### Real-Time\n\n#### Automated Report Distribution\n\n#### Compliance and Regulatory Reporting\n\n#### Customisation\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Standard & Ad Hoc Reporting\n\nYou can generate a wide range of standard reports (e.g., income statements, balance sheets, etc.)\nand also create flexible, ad hoc reports to explore specific queries without relying on IT\nassistance.\n\n#### Customizable dashboards\n\n#### Up-to-the-minute data\n\n#### Intuitive for all users\n\n#### Customizable dashboards\n\n#### Up-to-the-minute data\n\n#### Intuitive for all users\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## TRG Additional Services\n\nLooking for tailored solutions beyond Infor EPM\u2019s standard features? Check out TRG\u2019s additional\nservices to tailor your Infor EPM implementation, ensuring your project meets your unique business\nrequirements.\n\n#### Risk management\n\n#### CAPEX Planning & Allocation\n\n#### SOXBOX\n\n#### Risk management\n\n#### CAPEX Planning & Allocation\n\n#### SOXBOX\n\n### RESOURCES\n\nLatest resources for **Infor EPM**\n\n[View All Resources[icon]][13]\nSun, Feb 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### An Overview of Infor EPM (Enterprise Performance Management)\n\nInfor Enterprise Performance Management (EPM) is a comprehensive solution suite designed to enhance\nthe financial planning, budgeting, forecasting, and performance analysis processes, thereby\neliminating spreadsheets.\n][14][\nSun, Feb 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Enterprise Performance Management (EPM)\n\nEnterprise Performance Management (EPM) software is a comprehensive solution designed to help\norganizations manage and monitor their performance across various business functions.\n][15][\nMon, Mar 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Enabling Accurate Forecasting Through Agile EPM\n\nAgile EPM refers to a performance management framework that integrates flexibility into traditional\nEPM systems. Unlike conventional models that follow rigid cycles, Agile EPM encourages continuous\nplanning, adaptation, and adjustment of forecasts in response to evolving business conditions.\n][16]\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nTRG has implemented Infor EPM for industries like hospitality, financial services, energy, oil, and\ngas, and more. Our custom configuration makes it well-suited for a variety of verticals. This\nadaptability is one of the key reasons why various industries choose us for their solution\nrequirements.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial\nServices][17][Hospitality][18][Manufacturing][19][Insurance][20][Energy][21][Healthcare][22][Educati\non][23][Real Estate][24][Construction][25]\n\n### OUR CLIENT\n\nSome of our satisfied customers utilising our Financial Management Solutions\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T10:32:16.458Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][26][[facebook]][27][[youtube]][28]\n[Solutions][29]\n[TRG Solutions][30][Business Challenges][31][Industries][32]\n[Resources][33]\n[Podcasts][34][Blog][35][FAQ][36][Research Portal][37][TRG End-User Training][38]\n[Stories][39]\n[Case Studies][40][CEO Letters][41]\n[About us][42]\n[Our People][43][Awards][44][TRG Cares][45][Testimonials][46]\n[Events][47]\n[Become our Speaker][48][Events Gallery][49][Hire our venue][50]\n[Careers][51]\n[Internships][52][Internships Partners][53]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][54][[facebook]][55][[Youtube Play Button]][56]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][57][Privacy Policy][58]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: https://calendly.com/mai-nguyen3-trginternational/30min\n[12]: https://blog.trginternational.com/infor-depm\n[13]: /resources/\n[14]: /resources/an-overview-of-infor-epm-enterprise-performance-management/\n[15]: /resources/enterprise-performance-management/\n[16]: /resources/enabling-accurate-forecasting/\n[17]: /industries/financial-services/\n[18]: /industries/hospitality/\n[19]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[20]: /industries/insurance/\n[21]: /industries/energy/\n[22]: /industries/healthcare/\n[23]: /solutions/education/\n[24]: /industries/real-estate/\n[25]: /industries/construction/\n[26]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[27]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[28]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[29]: /solutions/\n[30]: /solutions/\n[31]: /business-challenges/\n[32]: /industries/\n[33]: /resources/\n[34]: /podcasts/\n[35]: /blog/\n[36]: /faq/\n[37]: /research/\n[38]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[39]: /stories/\n[40]: /stories/case-studies/\n[41]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[42]: /about-us/\n[43]: /about-us/our-people/\n[44]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[45]: /about-us/csr/\n[46]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[47]: /events/\n[48]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[49]: /events/events-gallery/\n[50]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[51]: /careers/\n[52]: /careers/internships/\n[53]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[54]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[55]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[56]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[57]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[58]: /privacy-policy/"
