            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/infor-os/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n#### TRG SOLUTION\n\n# Infor OS\n\nUnlock the full potential of enterprise technology with Infor OS Cloud. This cloud-only platform\nintegrates Infor Data Lake, Coleman AI, Infor Mongoose, and Infor ION to deliver seamless\nautomation, intelligent insights, and robust connectivity for modern businesses.\n\n[Infor OS hero image]\n[Schedule a Call][11]\n[Unlock the Power of Cloud][12]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n## Infor OS Core Features\n\nInfor OS is a comprehensive cloud-based operating system that connects enterprise applications,\ndata, and AI-driven insights. With powerful automation, seamless integration, and intelligent data\nprocessing, it empowers businesses to drive efficiency, innovation, and scalability.\n\n#### Infor Data Lake\n\nStore, manage, and analyse vast amounts of structured and unstructured data in real-time.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Coleman AI\n\nLeverage advanced machine learning and AI-driven insights to automate tasks and enhance\ndecision-making.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor Mongoose\n\nBuild and deploy custom enterprise applications with a low-code development environment.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Infor ION\n\nEnable seamless data integration and workflow automation across all enterprise systems.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Scalability & Security\n\nA cloud-native platform with enterprise-grade security and high availability for mission-critical\noperations.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Intelligent Automation\n\nStreamline business processes with AI-powered automation and predictive analytics.\n\n[icon]\n\nTell us a bit about you and your challenge\n\npre-render CSS\n\n### TRG SOLUTIONS\n\nTRG delivers fully integrated cloud platform for intelligent business operations.\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Connected Enterprise Ecosystem\n\nInfor OS connects various enterprise applications, systems, and data sources, allowing for seamless\ndata flow and improved interoperability.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Connect disparate systems\n\n#### Ensure smooth data flow\n\n#### Unify operations\n\n#### Enhanced System interoperability\n\n#### Future-Proofing\n\n#### Connect disparate systems\n\n#### Ensure smooth data flow\n\n#### Unify operations\n\n#### Enhanced System interoperability\n\n#### Future-Proofing\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## AI-Powered Decision Making\n\nColeman AI enhances business intelligence with real-time insights and automation.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Tailor user interface\n\n#### Simplify navegation\n\n#### Improve Accesibility\n\n#### Enhance Productivity\n\n#### Boost user satisfaction\n\n#### Tailor user interface\n\n#### Simplify navegation\n\n#### Improve Accesibility\n\n#### Enhance Productivity\n\n#### Boost user satisfaction\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Effortless Customisation with Mongoose\n\nBuild, extend, and deploy enterprise applications with ease.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Provide training\n\n#### Develop guides\n\n#### Offer support\n\n#### Troubleshoot issues\n\n#### Ensure continuous improvement\n\n#### Provide training\n\n#### Develop guides\n\n#### Offer support\n\n#### Troubleshoot issues\n\n#### Ensure continuous improvement\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Robust Data Management\n\nInfor Data Lake centralises enterprise data for enhanced analytics and reporting.\n\n[thumbnail]\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Seamless Integration with Infor ION\n\nAutomate workflows and data exchanges across business applications.\n\n[thumbnail]\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Improved Collaboration\n\nA unified platform where different teams and departments can collaborate more effectively through\nshared applications and communication tools.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\nLearn more about **Infor OS**\n\n[View All Resources[icon]][13]\nHow it works?[icon]\n\n#### RESOURCES HUB | On-demand Webinar | Unlocking the Power of Infor OS\n\nThink of it as the \"central nervous system\" for your business applications, ensuring everything runs\nsmoothly and securely in the cloud. That's the role Infor OS playing.\n][14][\nStart now[icon]\n\n#### RESOURCES HUB | Online Course: Infor OS Basic\n\nYou'll learn everything there is to know about Infor OS, the cloud operating platform that has been\ndesigned, with the user experience in mind, to bring productivity, business processes and Artificial\nIntelligence altogether.\n][15]\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nInfor OS revolutionizes enterprise connectivity with AI, automation, and deep data integration. By\nleveraging Infor Data Lake, Coleman AI, Infor Mongoose, and Infor ION, businesses can enhance\nefficiency, scalability, and innovation in a secure cloud environment.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial\nServices][16][Hospitality][17][Manufacturing][18][Insurance][19][Energy][20][Healthcare][21][Educati\non][22][Real Estate][23][Construction][24]\n\n### OUR CLIENT\n\nSome of our satisfied customers utilising our Financial Management Solutions\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T10:32:18.507Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][25][[facebook]][26][[youtube]][27]\n[Solutions][28]\n[TRG Solutions][29][Business Challenges][30][Industries][31]\n[Resources][32]\n[Podcasts][33][Blog][34][FAQ][35][Research Portal][36][TRG End-User Training][37]\n[Stories][38]\n[Case Studies][39][CEO Letters][40]\n[About us][41]\n[Our People][42][Awards][43][TRG Cares][44][Testimonials][45]\n[Events][46]\n[Become our Speaker][47][Events Gallery][48][Hire our venue][49]\n[Careers][50]\n[Internships][51][Internships Partners][52]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][53][[facebook]][54][[Youtube Play Button]][55]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][56][Privacy Policy][57]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: https://calendly.com/mai-nguyen3-trginternational/30min\n[12]: https://blog.trginternational.com/request-infor-os-brochure\n[13]: /resources/\n[14]: https://blog.trginternational.com/webinar-unlock-infor-os-benefits\n[15]: https://academy.trginternational.com/courses/ios-01-infor-os-basic\n[16]: /industries/financial-services/\n[17]: /industries/hospitality/\n[18]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[19]: /industries/insurance/\n[20]: /industries/energy/\n[21]: /industries/healthcare/\n[22]: /solutions/education/\n[23]: /industries/real-estate/\n[24]: /industries/construction/\n[25]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[26]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[27]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[28]: /solutions/\n[29]: /solutions/\n[30]: /business-challenges/\n[31]: /industries/\n[32]: /resources/\n[33]: /podcasts/\n[34]: /blog/\n[35]: /faq/\n[36]: /research/\n[37]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[38]: /stories/\n[39]: /stories/case-studies/\n[40]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[41]: /about-us/\n[42]: /about-us/our-people/\n[43]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[44]: /about-us/csr/\n[45]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[46]: /events/\n[47]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[48]: /events/events-gallery/\n[49]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[50]: /careers/\n[51]: /careers/internships/\n[52]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[53]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[54]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[55]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[56]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[57]: /privacy-policy/"
