            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/yooz/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n#### TRG SOLUTION\n\n# Yooz\n\nTransform your procurement process with Yooz's cutting-edge automation solutions, designed to\nstreamline your Procure-to-Pay workflow, reduce costs, and enhance efficiency.\n\n[Yooz hero image]\n[Schedule a Call][11]\n[Experience Procurement Automation Today][12]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n## Yooz Core Features\n\nYooz offers a comprehensive suite of features to automate your entire Procure-to-Pay process, from\nintelligent data capture and real-time processing to seamless ERP integration and advanced security\nmeasures.\n\n#### Intelligent Data Capture\n\nUtilize AI-driven technology to automatically extract and process data from invoices and procurement\ndocuments, reducing manual entry and errors.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Real-Time Processing\n\nAccelerate your procurement cycle with real-time automation, enabling same-day invoice approvals and\nimproved cash flow management.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Seamless ERP Integration\n\nEffortlessly integrate with over 250 ERP systems, ensuring smooth data flow and synchronization\nacross your financial platforms.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Advanced Security & Compliance\n\nBenefit from robust security features, including fraud detection, traceability, and regulatory\ncompliance, safeguarding your financial data.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Mobile Accessibility\n\nManage procurement tasks on-the-go with mobile access, allowing for invoice approvals and document\nretrieval anytime, anywhere.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Comprehensive Reporting & Analytics\n\nGain insights into your procurement process with customizable dashboards and reports, facilitating\ninformed decision-making.\n\n[icon]\n\nTell us a bit about you and your challenge\n\npre-render CSS\n\n### TRG SOLUTIONS\n\nNo two companies are alike. Your procure-to-pay process should reflect your specific needs. At TRG\nInternational, we offer Yooz as a standalone solution or connect it with other applications to make\na robust, powerful financial suite optimized for your business operations.\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## End-to-End Automation\n\nStreamline the entire procurement lifecycle, from purchase requests to supplier payments, and expand\nyour capabilities to manage the entire financial management cycle and workflows.\nLet the software do all the manual hard work for you!\n\n#### Consolidate data\n\n#### Inventory items matching\n\n#### Invoice matching\n\n#### Reconcile bank payments\n\n#### Allocating funds\n\n#### Generating reports\n\n#### Forecasting\n\n#### And more\n\n#### Consolidate data\n\n#### Inventory items matching\n\n#### Invoice matching\n\n#### Reconcile bank payments\n\n#### Allocating funds\n\n#### Generating reports\n\n#### Forecasting\n\n#### And more\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Enhanced Security & Compliance\n\nMeet global financial regulations with built-in security, audit trails, and compliance frameworks.\n\n#### High-availability architecture\n\n#### Regular external security audits\n\n#### Automated vulnerability tests\n\n#### ISO 27001-certified hosting centers\n\n#### 2 replicated sites in real-time for disaster recovery\n\n#### TLS protocol for in-transit data\n\n#### Compliant with ISAE 3402 Type I\n\n#### High-availability architecture\n\n#### Regular external security audits\n\n#### Automated vulnerability tests\n\n#### ISO 27001-certified hosting centers\n\n#### 2 replicated sites in real-time for disaster recovery\n\n#### TLS protocol for in-transit data\n\n#### Compliant with ISAE 3402 Type I\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Integration\n\nExpand your IT ecosystem even further, beyond financial management capabilities, and gain complete\nvisibility into your entire business by connecting Yooz with your existing solutions, including but\nnot limited to:\n\n#### Customer Relationship Management (CRM)\n\n#### Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP)\n\n#### Dealer Management System (DMS)\n\n#### Customer Relationship Management (CRM)\n\n#### Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP)\n\n#### Dealer Management System (DMS)\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Comprehensive Training and Support\n\nTRG provides extensive training for your staff, ensuring they are fully equipped to utilize all the\nfeatures of Yooz. Our ongoing support guarantees that you continue to get the most out of your\ninvestment, with our team available to assist whenever needed.\n\n#### Expert Guidance\n\n#### Staff Empowerment\n\n#### Continuous Support\n\n#### Quick Issue Resolution\n\n#### Knowledge Transfer\n\n#### Expert Guidance\n\n#### Staff Empowerment\n\n#### Continuous Support\n\n#### Quick Issue Resolution\n\n#### Knowledge Transfer\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Enhanced Supplier Relationships\n\nImprove supplier satisfaction with timely payments and transparent communication facilitated by\nYooz\u2019s automated workflows.\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Environmental Sustainability\n\nContribute to eco-friendly practices by transitioning to a paperless procurement process, reducing\nyour organization\u2019s carbon footprint.\n\n### RESOURCES\n\nLatest resources for **Yooz**\n\n[View All Resources[icon]][13]\nLearn more[icon]\n\n#### RESOURCE HUB | The Ultimate Guide to Purchase-to-Pay (P2P) Automation: Most Common Questions\n#### Answered\n\nDid you know that by automating the procure-to-pay cycle, your organization can reduce invoice\nprocessing costs by up to 80%? Welcome to the world of P2P automation!\n][14][\nDownload now[icon]\n\n#### WHITEPAPER | How to Choose IT Automation Software: A Practical Buyer's Guide\n\nIT automation can be a great solution to many of today's challenges, but choosing the right software\nis crucial. Download your free whitepaper and start your journey towards a more automated and\nproductive future.\n][15][\nWatch on-demand today[icon]\n\n#### ON-DEMAND WEBINAR | Procure-to-Pay: From Cost-Cutting to Value Creation\n\nProcurement teams today are no longer seen as a transactional, cost-conscious back office function\nbut a strategic powerhouse for the business. And with this new power come new challenges.\n][16]\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nBy leveraging Yooz's advanced automation features, businesses can achieve greater efficiency,\naccuracy, and control over their procurement processes, leading to significant cost savings and\nstrategic advantages.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial\nServices][17][Hospitality][18][Manufacturing][19][Insurance][20][Energy][21][Healthcare][22][Educati\non][23][Real Estate][24][Construction][25]\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T10:02:28.409Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][26][[facebook]][27][[youtube]][28]\n[Solutions][29]\n[TRG Solutions][30][Business Challenges][31][Industries][32]\n[Resources][33]\n[Podcasts][34][Blog][35][FAQ][36][Research Portal][37][TRG End-User Training][38]\n[Stories][39]\n[Case Studies][40][CEO Letters][41]\n[About us][42]\n[Our People][43][Awards][44][TRG Cares][45][Testimonials][46]\n[Events][47]\n[Become our Speaker][48][Events Gallery][49][Hire our venue][50]\n[Careers][51]\n[Internships][52][Internships Partners][53]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][54][[facebook]][55][[Youtube Play Button]][56]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][57][Privacy Policy][58]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: https://calendly.com/mai-nguyen3-trginternational/30min\n[12]: https://blog.trginternational.com/procure-to-pay-p2p-yooz-brochure\n[13]: /resources/\n[14]: https://blog.trginternational.com/purchase-to-pay-p2p-automation\n[15]: https://blog.trginternational.com/it-automation-software-buyer-guide\n[16]: https://blog.trginternational.com/procure-to-pay-2025-outlook-webinar\n[17]: /industries/financial-services/\n[18]: /industries/hospitality/\n[19]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[20]: /industries/insurance/\n[21]: /industries/energy/\n[22]: /industries/healthcare/\n[23]: /solutions/education/\n[24]: /industries/real-estate/\n[25]: /industries/construction/\n[26]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[27]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[28]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[29]: /solutions/\n[30]: /solutions/\n[31]: /business-challenges/\n[32]: /industries/\n[33]: /resources/\n[34]: /podcasts/\n[35]: /blog/\n[36]: /faq/\n[37]: /research/\n[38]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[39]: /stories/\n[40]: /stories/case-studies/\n[41]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[42]: /about-us/\n[43]: /about-us/our-people/\n[44]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[45]: /about-us/csr/\n[46]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[47]: /events/\n[48]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[49]: /events/events-gallery/\n[50]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[51]: /careers/\n[52]: /careers/internships/\n[53]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[54]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[55]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[56]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[57]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[58]: /privacy-policy/"
