            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/unifi/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n#### TRG SOLUTION\n\n# UniFi\n\nUnify your financial operations with UniFi, the all-in-one automation platform for accounting,\nbusiness intelligence, integrations, and enterprise asset management. Reduce manual work, gain\nreal-time insights, and optimise financial performance with ease.\n\n[UniFi hero image]\n[Schedule a Call][11]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n## UniFi Core Features\n\nUniFi offers a wide range of features, empowering you to automate workflows, analyse and report on\ndata, or create any use cases that fit your business\u2019 specific needs from within a single, unified\nplatform.\nFrom accounting to enterprise asset management, UniFi \u2018s flexibility reduces the need for multiple\nthird-party tools, streamlines processes, and drives greater productivity across your business.\n\n#### No-Code Application Builder\n\nWith a straightforward drag-and-drop interface and powerful process engine, UniFi allows you to\nbuild business applications with its intuitive no-code builder. You or anyone, regardless of coding\nexperience, can now create fully functional solutions.\nAdd to that the ability to customise your newly built apps using Unifi\u2019s rich suite of additional\nfeatures to make them truly fit your needs. Every workflow, process, and automation can be designed\nto meet the latest compliance standards.\n\n#### Accounting Automation\n\nUniFi comes with a flexible data connector builder that allows you to connect to your existing\nfinancial management solution, ERP, CRM, HR and other business systems. The integration with UniFi\nallows you to achieve 100% automation for key processes like sales invoices, credit notes, revenue\nreleases, revenue recognition, and bank receipts/refunds, leading to annual savings equivalent to\ntwo full-time employees (FTE).\nUltimately, the automation enables you to achieve a faster close, significantly fewer human errors,\nand a more timely decision process.\n\n#### Business Intelligence\n\nBusiness Intelligence is a standard application that comes with UniFi. The tool allows you to\nretrieve, visualize, consolidate, analyze, and report on data from multiple sources within a single\nplatform.\nWith an intuitive drag-and-drop report creator, you can easily create interactive dashboards and\nbuild custom reports while drilling down to transaction-level data for detailed analysis in just a\nfew clicks. This provides a real-time view of your business performance, identifies trends and\nopportunities, and empowers you to make informed decisions based on actionable insights.\n\n#### Middleware & Integration\n\nMany organisations rely on separate systems for different functions, but business processes often\ncross departmental lines.\nWith powerful middleware, integration capabilities, and advanced APIs, UniFi automatically syncs\nupdates (like new or modified customer records) from your CRM to all relevant systems, eliminating\nduplicate entry and ensuring data consistency. Additionally, UniFi helps you streamline workflows,\nautomate processes, support e-invoicing and PEPPOL, and keep your information consistent and\naccurate.\n\n#### Business Process Management (BPM)\n\nUniFi comes with a powerful Business Process Management (BPM) feature that lets you map out process\nflows, streamline, automate, monitor, and optimize them to boost efficiency and reduce costs.\nAutomating and standardizing workflows means tasks reach the right people at the right time,\nallowing your team to focus on more valuable work.\n\n#### Work Operating System\n\nUniFi Work Operating System (Work OS) is a cloud-based platform, accessible anywhere on any device.\nIt is also where you will find all of UniFi features. UniFi Work OS seamlessly integrates with your\nexisting systems, capturing data and automating processes while providing an intuitive, no-code,\ndrag-and-drop interface building any adaptable use case to solve any business need.\n\n### Autonomous Processes\n\nUniFi\u2019s bots (powered by advanced Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning) execute tasks\nwithout human intervention, streamlining operations across diverse use cases. They can handle\nroutine tasks, from email extraction and OCR data capture to scheduled transactions and integration\nwith APIs and webhooks, etc., freeing up your team for more strategic work and improving efficiency\nacross a wide range of business processes.\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## End-to-End Finance Automation\n\nEliminate repetitive tasks and streamline finance operations with AI-powered automation.\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Seamless System Integration\n\nConnect effortlessly with ERP, CRM, and financial platforms for a unified data ecosystem.\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Real-Time Business Insights\n\nMake informed decisions with live dashboards, forecasting tools, and predictive analytics.\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Secure & Compliant Platform\n\nEnsure data security with ISO 27001 certification and SOC 2 Type 2 compliance.\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Scalable & Customizable\n\nAdapt UniFi to your unique business needs with a no-code application builder and modular solutions.\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Future-Proof Financial Solution\n\nStay ahead with continuous updates, AI-driven automation, and cutting-edge finance technology.\n\n### BLOG\n\nWed, Jan 1, 2025\nRead more[icon]\n\n#### TRG Partners with UniFi to Deliver Next-Gen Business Process Automation\n\nThis partnership brings together TRG's expertise in delivering and implementing business solutions\nwith UniFi\u2019s innovative platform.\n][12]\n\n### WHITE PAPER\n\n### HOW-TO GUIDE\n\nWed, Jan 1, 2025\nDownload now[icon]\n\n#### How to Choose IT Automation Software: A Practical Buyer's Guide\n\nIT automation can be the solution, but choosing the right software is crucial. Download your free\ncopy of \"How to Choose an IT Automation Software\" and start your journey towards a higher\nproductivity future today!\n][13]\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nUniFi brings together finance automation, real-time analytics, and seamless integrations to help\nbusinesses modernize and optimize their financial operations. With its no-code configurability,\nsecurity-first approach, and AI-powered insights, UniFi empowers organizations to work smarter and\nmore efficiently in the digital era.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial\nServices][14][Hospitality][15][Manufacturing][16][Insurance][17][Energy][18][Healthcare][19][Educati\non][20][Real Estate][21][Construction][22]\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T10:02:06.409Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][23][[facebook]][24][[youtube]][25]\n[Solutions][26]\n[TRG Solutions][27][Business Challenges][28][Industries][29]\n[Resources][30]\n[Podcasts][31][Blog][32][FAQ][33][Research Portal][34][TRG End-User Training][35]\n[Stories][36]\n[Case Studies][37][CEO Letters][38]\n[About us][39]\n[Our People][40][Awards][41][TRG Cares][42][Testimonials][43]\n[Events][44]\n[Become our Speaker][45][Events Gallery][46][Hire our venue][47]\n[Careers][48]\n[Internships][49][Internships Partners][50]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][51][[facebook]][52][[Youtube Play Button]][53]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][54][Privacy Policy][55]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: https://calendly.com/mai-nguyen3-trginternational/30min\n[12]: /vi/blog/trg-unifi-partnership/\n[13]: https://blog.trginternational.com/it-automation-software-buyer-guide\n[14]: /industries/financial-services/\n[15]: /industries/hospitality/\n[16]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[17]: /industries/insurance/\n[18]: /industries/energy/\n[19]: /industries/healthcare/\n[20]: /solutions/education/\n[21]: /industries/real-estate/\n[22]: /industries/construction/\n[23]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[24]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[25]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[26]: /solutions/\n[27]: /solutions/\n[28]: /business-challenges/\n[29]: /industries/\n[30]: /resources/\n[31]: /podcasts/\n[32]: /blog/\n[33]: /faq/\n[34]: /research/\n[35]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[36]: /stories/\n[37]: /stories/case-studies/\n[38]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[39]: /about-us/\n[40]: /about-us/our-people/\n[41]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[42]: /about-us/csr/\n[43]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[44]: /events/\n[45]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[46]: /events/events-gallery/\n[47]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[48]: /careers/\n[49]: /careers/internships/\n[50]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[51]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[52]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[53]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[54]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[55]: /privacy-policy/"
