            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/sysynkt/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n#### TRG SOLUTION\n\n# Sysynkt\n\nTransform your financial workflows with Sysynkt, the cloud-based extension for Infor SunSystems.\nStreamline procurement, expense management, banking integration, and more with an intelligent,\nuser-friendly platform built for modern finance teams.\n\n[Sysynkt hero image]\n[Schedule a Call][11]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\nWe partnered with selected leading business software and service providers around the world\n\n## Sysynkt Core Features That Stand Out\n\nSysynkt enhances Infor SunSystems with intelligent modules for procurement, expense management, open\nbanking, and automation. Improve efficiency, reduce manual tasks, and gain complete financial\ncontrol with seamless cloud-based integration.\n\n#### Open Banking Connectivity\n\nSecurely connect with banks (2000+ finanical institutions) for real-time balance checks, payment\nprocessing, and automated reconciliations. Send remittances via email with an embedded \u2018pay now\u2019\nbutton\n\n#### Procure-to-Pay (P2P) Automation\n\nOffer a supplier portal (where orders are automatically sent to suppliers and optionally receipted),\nand streamline procurement with automated invoice matching and AI-powered document processing for\ndiverse invoice formats.\n\n#### Sales and Service\n\nProvide a customizable customer portal (showing customers their invoices, statements, and payments\ndrawn from integrated systems) with options to impose mandatory data fields or schedule billing for\nongoing services.\n\n#### Expense Management\n\nSimplify expense tracking with receipt scanning, batch submissions, and an intuitive approval\nprocess. Enable auto or manual matching to credit card data from Open Banking.\n\n#### Automated Bank Reconciliation\n\nGenerate account sweeping and payment instructions. Reduce errors and manual effort with automated\ntransaction matching and future-ready open banking API integration.\n\n#### AIDRE - Assisted Document Recognition Engine\n\nCapable of reading multiple languages, handwriting, and photos. Improve invoice scanning efficiency\nand save time on manual tasks.\n\n### TRG SOLUTIONS\n\nModernizing financial workflows with cloud-powered automation and seamless integration with TRG and\nSysynkt\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Smart Financial Automation\n\nEliminate manual tasks with AI-powered automation, invoice matching, accurate allocation and\ndistribution, along with expense tracking\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Seamless Integration\n\nNot with SunSystems only, but also includes ERP and CRM systems (Azure, Office 365, Hubspot, etc)to\nenhance overall operations.\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Enhanced SunSystems Functionality\n\nExtend and modernize Infor SunSystems without disrupting existing financial processes.\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Strong Bond With Suppliers And Customers\n\nDedicated portals for each, with customizable dashboards and fields, help streamline operations and\nsave time through automated end-to-end workflows.\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Financial Health Optimization\n\nConnect with banks, process payments, and reconcile transactions effortlessly for better financial\ncontrol\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Future-Proof Financial Solution\n\nMaintain a full audit trail with version history, stay updated with AI-driven enhancements, and\nensure compliance.\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nSysynkt brings the power of cloud automation and intelligent financial management to Infor\nSunSystems. With streamlined procurement, seamless banking integration, and AI-powered automation,\nSysynkt empowers businesses to operate smarter, faster, and more securely in a digital-first world.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial\nServices][12][Hospitality][13][Manufacturing][14][Insurance][15][Energy][16][Healthcare][17][Educati\non][18][Real Estate][19][Construction][20]\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T10:03:00.159Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][21][[facebook]][22][[youtube]][23]\n[Solutions][24]\n[TRG Solutions][25][Business Challenges][26][Industries][27]\n[Resources][28]\n[Podcasts][29][Blog][30][FAQ][31][Research Portal][32][TRG End-User Training][33]\n[Stories][34]\n[Case Studies][35][CEO Letters][36]\n[About us][37]\n[Our People][38][Awards][39][TRG Cares][40][Testimonials][41]\n[Events][42]\n[Become our Speaker][43][Events Gallery][44][Hire our venue][45]\n[Careers][46]\n[Internships][47][Internships Partners][48]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][49][[facebook]][50][[Youtube Play Button]][51]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][52][Privacy Policy][53]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: https://calendly.com/mai-nguyen3-trginternational/30min\n[12]: /industries/financial-services/\n[13]: /industries/hospitality/\n[14]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[15]: /industries/insurance/\n[16]: /industries/energy/\n[17]: /industries/healthcare/\n[18]: /solutions/education/\n[19]: /industries/real-estate/\n[20]: /industries/construction/\n[21]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[22]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[23]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[24]: /solutions/\n[25]: /solutions/\n[26]: /business-challenges/\n[27]: /industries/\n[28]: /resources/\n[29]: /podcasts/\n[30]: /blog/\n[31]: /faq/\n[32]: /research/\n[33]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[34]: /stories/\n[35]: /stories/case-studies/\n[36]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[37]: /about-us/\n[38]: /about-us/our-people/\n[39]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[40]: /about-us/csr/\n[41]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[42]: /events/\n[43]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[44]: /events/events-gallery/\n[45]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[46]: /careers/\n[47]: /careers/internships/\n[48]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[49]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[50]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[51]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[52]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[53]: /privacy-policy/"
