            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n#### TRG SOLUTION\n\n# Great People Inside\n\nOnline platform for the assessment of candidates, employees, managers and teams Great People Inside\n(GR8PI) empowers you to embrace the complete life cycle of employees and executives; from talent\nacquisition and onboarding to talent growth and development, employee assessment and performance\nmanagement.\n\n[Great People Inside hero banner]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n## Core Features\n\nGreat People Inside (GR8PI) \u2013 our product suite \u2013 enable you to embrace all stages of employees and\nexecutives life cycle; from acquisition to development and more through extensive psychometric\nmeasurement of what\u2019s behind people\u2019s thinking, behaviour and emotion.\n\n#### Recruitment\n\nWe match job applicants to positions using an assessment platform that evaluates their values,\nmotivation, skills, and potential.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Leadership\n\nHelp you easily identify leadership potential by selecting key metrics and providing instant reports\non employees\u2019 traits and styles for informed decision-making.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Training & Development\n\nHelp you identify employees\u2019 strengths, weaknesses, and interests, enabling you to design effective\ntraining and development plans.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Sales & Customer Service\n\nInvest in these two front-line teams by enhancing productivity, minimizing sales mistakes, and\nincreasing job satisfaction for the highest ROI.\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Retention & Engagement\n\nEmployees are more satisfied, engaged, and likely to stay when they own their work\u2019s results and\nfeel appreciated, making it a long-term business strategy.\n\n[icon]\n[icon]\n\n### TRG SOLUTIONS\n\nOur dedicated team will create your online account and will walk you through the process of building\noccupational profiles and sending participation invitations to your candidates.\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Tailored Talent Management\n\nWe help you leverage Great People Inside to create customised talent management solutions that align\nwith your organisational goals and culture.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Personalise assessments\n\n#### Culture alignment\n\n#### Identify top talent\n\n#### Enhance recruitment\n\n#### Support employee development\n\n#### Personalise assessments\n\n#### Culture alignment\n\n#### Identify top talent\n\n#### Enhance recruitment\n\n#### Support employee development\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Data-Driven Insights\n\nWe provide data-driven insights through Great People Inside, enabling informed decision-making in\nhiring and talent management.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Analyse employee data\n\n#### Inform hiring decisions\n\n#### Track performance metrics\n\n#### Identify development needs\n\n#### Improve retention\n\n#### Analyse employee data\n\n#### Inform hiring decisions\n\n#### Track performance metrics\n\n#### Identify development needs\n\n#### Improve retention\n\n[circle chape][circle chape]\n\n## Continuous Support and Optimisation\n\nWe offer ongoing support to ensure your organisation fully utilises Great People Inside,\ncontinuously optimising your talent management processes.\n\n[thumbnail]\n\n#### Provide support\n\n#### Offer training\n\n#### Troubleshoot issues\n\n#### Monitor effectiveness\n\n#### Ensure optimisation\n\n#### Provide support\n\n#### Offer training\n\n#### Troubleshoot issues\n\n#### Monitor effectiveness\n\n#### Ensure optimisation\n\n### RESOURCES\n\nLatest resources for **Great People Inside**\n\nThu, Jan 1, 1970\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][11][\nThu, Jan 1, 1970\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][12][\nThu, Jan 1, 1970\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][13]\n\n### Digital Solutions\n\nOnline platform for the assessment of candidates, employees, managers and teams\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Remote Employee\n\nRead more\n\n][14][\n[icon]\n\n#### Remote Manager\n\nRead more\n\n][15][\n[icon]\n\n#### Remote Teams\n\nRead more\n\n][16][\n[icon]\n\n#### Leader in a VUCA World\n\nRead more\n\n][17]\n\n### Assessments\n\nGreat People Inside Assessments\n\n[icon]\n\n#### GR8 360\u00b0\n\nRead more\n\n][18][\n[icon]\n\n#### GR8 Customised\n\nRead more\n\n][19][\n[icon]\n\n#### GR8 Full Spectrum\n\nRead more\n\n][20][\n[icon]\n\n#### GR8 Cognitive\n\nRead more\n\n][21][\n[icon]\n\n#### GR8 Big5 Behaviours\n\nRead more\n\n][22][\n[icon]\n\n#### GR8 Values\n\nRead more\n\n][23][\n[icon]\n\n#### GR8 Interests\n\nRead more\n\n][24][\n[icon]\n\n#### GR8 Sales\n\nRead more\n\n][25][\n[icon]\n\n#### Customer Service\n\nRead more\n\n][26][\n[icon]\n\n#### GR8 Wellbeing\n\nRead more\n\n][27][\n[icon]\n\n#### GR8 Managers\n\nRead more\n\n][28]\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nTRG has provided assessments for industries like financial services, not-for-profit, and energy,\noil, and gas, our custom configuration makes it well-suited for many other vertical markets as well.\nThis adaptability is one of the key reasons why various industries choose us for their solution\nrequirements.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial\nServices][29][Hospitality][30][Manufacturing][31][Insurance][32][Energy][33][Healthcare][34][Educati\non][35][Real Estate][36][Construction][37]\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T11:12:48.940Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][38][[facebook]][39][[youtube]][40]\n[Solutions][41]\n[TRG Solutions][42][Business Challenges][43][Industries][44]\n[Resources][45]\n[Podcasts][46][Blog][47][FAQ][48][Research Portal][49][TRG End-User Training][50]\n[Stories][51]\n[Case Studies][52][CEO Letters][53]\n[About us][54]\n[Our People][55][Awards][56][TRG Cares][57][Testimonials][58]\n[Events][59]\n[Become our Speaker][60][Events Gallery][61][Hire our venue][62]\n[Careers][63]\n[Internships][64][Internships Partners][65]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][66][[facebook]][67][[Youtube Play Button]][68]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][69][Privacy Policy][70]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: /\n[12]: /\n[13]: /\n[14]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-remote-employee/\n[15]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-remote-manager/\n[16]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-remote-teams/\n[17]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-leaders-of-vuca-world/\n[18]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-360-feedback-solution/\n[19]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-customised/\n[20]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-full-spectrum/\n[21]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-cognitive/\n[22]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-big5-behaviours/\n[23]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-values/\n[24]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-interests/\n[25]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-remote-sales/\n[26]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-customer-service/\n[27]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-wellbeing/\n[28]: /solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-managers/\n[29]: /industries/financial-services/\n[30]: /industries/hospitality/\n[31]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[32]: /industries/insurance/\n[33]: /industries/energy/\n[34]: /industries/healthcare/\n[35]: /solutions/education/\n[36]: /industries/real-estate/\n[37]: /industries/construction/\n[38]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[39]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[40]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[41]: /solutions/\n[42]: /solutions/\n[43]: /business-challenges/\n[44]: /industries/\n[45]: /resources/\n[46]: /podcasts/\n[47]: /blog/\n[48]: /faq/\n[49]: /research/\n[50]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[51]: /stories/\n[52]: /stories/case-studies/\n[53]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[54]: /about-us/\n[55]: /about-us/our-people/\n[56]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[57]: /about-us/csr/\n[58]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[59]: /events/\n[60]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[61]: /events/events-gallery/\n[62]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[63]: /careers/\n[64]: /careers/internships/\n[65]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[66]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[67]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[68]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[69]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[70]: /privacy-policy/"
