          {
            "url": "https://trginternational.com/about-us/our-people/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n[The TRG International team together at a company gathering]\n\n# Our People\n\nAt TRG International, our people are our greatest asset. Their dedication, expertise, and diverse\ntalents drive our success. Meet the team that makes TRG exceptional.\n\n[Congratulations to TRG's Employee of the Month]\n\n## Our Culture & Values\n\nEqual OpportunityInclusion & DiversitySocial Impact\n\nSeveral teams have ended up being predominantly 90%+ women and we co-incidentally have always had\nabout a 50:50 split which swings +/- 10% from time to time.\n\n[Equal Opportunity at TRG]\n[Equal Opportunity at TRG]\n[Equal Opportunity at TRG]\n[Equal Opportunity at TRG]\n[Equal Opportunity at TRG]\n[Equal Opportunity at TRG]\n[Equal Opportunity at TRG]\n[Equal Opportunity at TRG]\n[See Our Activities][11]\n\n## Meet Our Team\n\nFounder & CEO\n\n### Rick Yvanovich\n\nRick, a CEO, CFO, and Executive Coach, excels in driving business performance through intervention\ncoaching and systematic processes. With over 40 years of experience across various industries and\ncountries, he has made significant contributions globally.\n\nCurrently, Rick is the Vietnam Master Franchisor for PJ\u2019s Coffee and Co-Founder and CFO of Great\nPeople Inside. He has founded multiple start-ups, with one achieving a US IPO exit. An active CIMA\npromoter and frequent speaker on various business topics, Rick has been a key figure in Vietnam\nsince 1990, making him one of the most experienced British expats in the country.\n\n[Learn More About Rick][12]\n[Rick Yvanovich]\nOur PeopleDepartmentNationality\n[Luong Ngoc Thuy Tien, HR Assistant Manager]\n\n### Luong Ngoc Thuy Tien\n\nHR Assistant Manager\n\n][13][\n[Tran Son Giang, Technical Manager]\n\n### Tran Son Giang\n\nTechnical Manager\n\n][14][\n[Dinh Pham Doan Tram, Marketing Manager]\n\n### Dinh Pham Doan Tram\n\nMarketing Manager\n\n][15][\n[Viktor Nagradic, Head of Marketing]\n\n### Viktor Nagradic\n\nHead of Marketing\n\n][16][\n[Huynh Kim Lien, Academy Manager]\n\n### Huynh Kim Lien\n\nAcademy Manager\n\n][17][\n[Nguyen Van Phung, Senior Project Manager]\n\n### Nguyen Van Phung\n\nSenior Project Manager\n\n][18][\n[Hoang Thi Minh Tam, Administration Manager]\n\n### Hoang Thi Minh Tam\n\nAdministration Manager\n\n][19][\n[Le Thi Hong Nhung, Sales Manager]\n\n### Le Thi Hong Nhung\n\nSales Manager\n\n][20]\n123\n\n## Let's Hear From Our Talents\n\nWe value transparent connections over polished brochures. Meet the real faces of TRG through their\ndaily schedules, team milestones, and personal growth stories.\n\n## Our Star Interns\n\nGrowth is a team sport, and our interns are a big part of the family. These rising stars handle\nactual projects, support their teams, and build practical skills for their careers. Let's see what\nTRG life looks like through their eyes.\n\n[Tran Huy Hoang, Software Development Intern]\n\nSoftware Development Intern\n\n### Tran Huy Hoang\n\n> \u201cWorking on real projects and debugging with senior developers helped me move beyond coding\n> practices to build a real problem-solving mindset. I've become more proactive and confident in\n> adapting to real world challenges.\u201d\n\n[More about his journey][21]\n[Luu Cong Thuan, Talent Acquisition Intern]\n\nTalent Acquisition Intern\n\n### Luu Cong Thuan\n\n> \u201cMy internship at TRG as a Recruitment Intern has been one of the most meaningful experiences in\n> my early career. From the beginning, I was trusted to support real recruitment tasks - from\n> screening candidates to learning how the hiring process works.\u201d\n\n[More about his journey][22]\n[Long Du, Business Development Intern]\n\nBusiness Development Intern\n\n### Long Du\n\n> \u201cFrom working in a truly professional environment to being trusted with real responsibilities and\n> real outcomes, his internship journey went far beyond learning tasks.\u201d\n\n[More about his journey][23]\n\n## We Are Always Saving Seats For New Talent!\n\nWhether you're seeking a permanent or internship position, you'll be amazed to see that as the\nbusiness grows, you grow too.\n\n[Join Our Team][24]\n[The whole TRG International team together at a company gathering]\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][25][[facebook]][26][[youtube]][27]\n[Solutions][28]\n[TRG Solutions][29][Business Challenges][30][Industries][31]\n[Resources][32]\n[Podcasts][33][Blog][34][FAQ][35][Research Portal][36][TRG End-User Training][37]\n[Stories][38]\n[Case Studies][39][CEO Letters][40]\n[About us][41]\n[Our People][42][Awards][43][TRG Cares][44][Testimonials][45]\n[Events][46]\n[Become our Speaker][47][Events Gallery][48][Hire our venue][49]\n[Careers][50]\n[Internships][51][Internships Partners][52]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][53][[facebook]][54][[Youtube Play Button]][55]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][56][Privacy Policy][57]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: /about-us/csr/\n[12]: https://www.rickyvanovich.com/\n[13]: /our-people/learning-development-specialist/\n[14]: /our-people/tran-son-giang/\n[15]: /our-people/tram-dinh-pham-doan/\n[16]: /our-people/viktor-nagradic/\n[17]: /our-people/huynh-kim-lien/\n[18]: /our-people/nguyen-van-phung/\n[19]: /our-people/hoang-thi-minh-tam/\n[20]: /our-people/le-thi-hong-nhung/\n[21]: https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trginternational-internshipjourney-lifeattrg-ugcPost-7460545175\n254126592-evL-/\n[22]: https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trginternational-internshipjourney-lifeattrg-ugcPost-7437544222\n104260609-VltF/?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAAD-MjKUBHvnX88GLTfqMFy0-jvwzVM3px\n[23]: https://www.linkedin.com/posts/trginternational-internship-salesintern-ugcPost-742428517775493\n5297-ReiK/?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAAD-MjKUBHvnX88GLTfqMFy0-jvwzVM3pxF4\n[24]: /careers/\n[25]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[26]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[27]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[28]: /solutions/\n[29]: /solutions/\n[30]: /business-challenges/\n[31]: /industries/\n[32]: /resources/\n[33]: /podcasts/\n[34]: /blog/\n[35]: /faq/\n[36]: /research/\n[37]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[38]: /stories/\n[39]: /stories/case-studies/\n[40]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[41]: /about-us/\n[42]: /about-us/our-people/\n[43]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[44]: /about-us/csr/\n[45]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[46]: /events/\n[47]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[48]: /events/events-gallery/\n[49]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[50]: /careers/\n[51]: /careers/internships/\n[52]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[53]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[54]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[55]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[56]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[57]: /privacy-policy/"
