          {
            "url": "https://trginternational.com/about-us/our-awards/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n# Our Awards\n\nAs a market-leading global professional services company, TRG International has received numerous\nawards for our business services and contributions to society. We thank our stakeholders for their\ngenerous acknowledgment.\n\n[Our Awards hero image]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\nOur Awards And Recognition, Honoring Our Excellence In Business And Industry And Our Contributions\nTo Society.\n\n[FY25 APAC Net New Partner of the Year]\n\nFY25 APAC Net New Partner of the Year\n\nRead more][11][\n[FY25 APAC Cloud Upgrade Partner of the Year]\n\nFY25 APAC Cloud Upgrade Partner of the Year\n\nRead more][12][\n[FY25 APAC Partner of the Year]\n\nFY25 APAC Partner of the Year\n\nRead more][13]\n[Guided ASEAN Internship Programme]\n\nGuided ASEAN Internship Programme\n\n[Most Inspiring Entrepreneur from Vietnam in 2024]\n\nMost Inspiring Entrepreneur from Vietnam in 2024\n\n[Exhibitor of Biztech Vietnam 2024]\n\nExhibitor of Biztech Vietnam 2024\n\n[Great People Inside Top Sales Award 2019]\n\nGreat People Inside Top Sales Award 2019\n\n[Green Office Diploma Award - WWF Vietnam]\n\nGreen Office Diploma Award - WWF Vietnam\n\n[Microsoft Silver Certified Partner ]\n\nMicrosoft Silver Certified Partner\n\n[Microsoft Gold Certified Partner]\n\nMicrosoft Gold Certified Partner\n\n[Microsoft Certified Solution Provider]\n\nMicrosoft Certified Solution Provider\n\n[Vietnam\u2019s Top 50 Best Employers]\n\nVietnam\u2019s Top 50 Best Employers\n\n[Most Promising Partner, Emerging Markets 2015]\n\nMost Promising Partner, Emerging Markets 2015\n\n[Shortlisted for Top 100 Business Style Awards]\n\nShortlisted for Top 100 Business Style Awards\n\n[Asia Pacific Best Performance Award 2009]\n\nAsia Pacific Best Performance Award 2009\n\n[Asia Pacific Best Performance Award 2008]\n\nAsia Pacific Best Performance Award 2008\n\n[Asia Pacific Best Performance Award 2007]\n\nAsia Pacific Best Performance Award 2007\n\n[Outstanding Channel Partner Award 2001]\n\nOutstanding Channel Partner Award 2001\n\n[SunSystems Revenue Growth Award 1997 - 1998]\n\nSunSystems Revenue Growth Award 1997 - 1998\n\nPeople Behind TRG's Success\n\nOperating in demanding and dynamic markets, the challenge on delivering the right solution can be\npretty tough.\n\nHowever, with a motivated team, the right skills and an understanding of the customers\u2019 business,\nTRG is always ready to go the extra mile to deliver the solution that works.\n\nFor this, TRG has earned the Leading IT Outsourcing Enterprise Award and the Retail Pro Service\nExcellence Award.\n\n[image]\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][14][[facebook]][15][[youtube]][16]\n[Solutions][17]\n[TRG Solutions][18][Business Challenges][19][Industries][20]\n[Resources][21]\n[Podcasts][22][Blog][23][FAQ][24][Research Portal][25][TRG End-User Training][26]\n[Stories][27]\n[Case Studies][28][CEO Letters][29]\n[About us][30]\n[Our People][31][Awards][32][TRG Cares][33][Testimonials][34]\n[Events][35]\n[Become our Speaker][36][Events Gallery][37][Hire our venue][38]\n[Careers][39]\n[Internships][40][Internships Partners][41]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][42][[facebook]][43][[Youtube Play Button]][44]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][45][Privacy Policy][46]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: https://trginternational.com/blog/sunsystems-cloud-channel-partner-conference-2026-awards/\n[12]: https://trginternational.com/blog/sunsystems-cloud-channel-partner-conference-2026-awards/\n[13]: https://trginternational.com/blog/sunsystems-cloud-channel-partner-conference-2026-awards/\n[14]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[15]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[16]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[17]: /solutions/\n[18]: /solutions/\n[19]: /business-challenges/\n[20]: /industries/\n[21]: /resources/\n[22]: /podcasts/\n[23]: /blog/\n[24]: /faq/\n[25]: /research/\n[26]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[27]: /stories/\n[28]: /stories/case-studies/\n[29]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[30]: /about-us/\n[31]: /about-us/our-people/\n[32]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[33]: /about-us/csr/\n[34]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[35]: /events/\n[36]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[37]: /events/events-gallery/\n[38]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[39]: /careers/\n[40]: /careers/internships/\n[41]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[42]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[43]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[44]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[45]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[46]: /privacy-policy/"
