          {
            "url": "https://trginternational.com/about-us/csr/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n# TRG Cares\n\nAs we are part of the community, we provide CSR opportunities for ourselves too. Blood Donations,\nTree Planting and Charity are favourite recurring themes. Painting was recently introduced to help\nwith work-life balance.\n\n[TRG Cares hero image]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\nOverview\n\n## Helping where we can to those in need.\n\nTRG has always felt it important to give our people multiple opportunities throughout the year\n(ideally monthly) to give back, in a way they feel they want to, to the community in which we\u2019re\noperating in and a part of. We have several recurring CSR events over the years, both internal and\nexternal such that if you miss one opportunity, it comes around again.\n\n#### Charity\n\nTRG International is a company who takes charity close to its heart. TRG\u2019s mindset is, \u201cwe help\nwhere we can\u201d.\n[Read more[icon]][11]\n\n#### Blood Donation\n\nTRG arranges four blood donations a year as part of our ongoing community support initiatives. These\nquarterly blood drives are organized independently by our team, demonstrating our commitment to\npublic health and wellbeing.\n[Read more[icon]][12]\n\n#### Tree Planting\n\nAs we experience the erosion of coastal areas, the intrusion of saltwater and the decline in air\nquality its not surprising that our annual \u201cTree planting\u201d activity sees active participation!\n[Read more[icon]][13]\n\n#### Recent Activities\n\nLatest news from TRG's sustainability actions\n\nSee All Stories\n\n[icon]][14]\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][15][[facebook]][16][[youtube]][17]\n[Solutions][18]\n[TRG Solutions][19][Business Challenges][20][Industries][21]\n[Resources][22]\n[Podcasts][23][Blog][24][FAQ][25][Research Portal][26][TRG End-User Training][27]\n[Stories][28]\n[Case Studies][29][CEO Letters][30]\n[About us][31]\n[Our People][32][Awards][33][TRG Cares][34][Testimonials][35]\n[Events][36]\n[Become our Speaker][37][Events Gallery][38][Hire our venue][39]\n[Careers][40]\n[Internships][41][Internships Partners][42]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][43][[facebook]][44][[Youtube Play Button]][45]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][46][Privacy Policy][47]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: /about-us/csr/charity/\n[12]: /about-us/csr/blood-donations/\n[13]: /about-us/csr/tree-planting/\n[14]: /stories/\n[15]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[16]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[17]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[18]: /solutions/\n[19]: /solutions/\n[20]: /business-challenges/\n[21]: /industries/\n[22]: /resources/\n[23]: /podcasts/\n[24]: /blog/\n[25]: /faq/\n[26]: /research/\n[27]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[28]: /stories/\n[29]: /stories/case-studies/\n[30]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[31]: /about-us/\n[32]: /about-us/our-people/\n[33]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[34]: /about-us/csr/\n[35]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[36]: /events/\n[37]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[38]: /events/events-gallery/\n[39]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[40]: /careers/\n[41]: /careers/internships/\n[42]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[43]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[44]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[45]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[46]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[47]: /privacy-policy/"
