            "url": "https://trginternational.com/about-us/client-testimonials/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n# Client Testimonials\n\nStay updated with the latest events happening around you. Explore, register, and be a part of\nexperiences that matter.\n\n[Client Testimonials hero banner]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n## Find out how leading organisations across industries use our mission-critical applications and\n## technology to achieve sustainable, operational advantages. See how our customers use our deep\n## industry expertise to gain value faster with greater agility, critical business insights, and\n## improved productivity.\n\nAll\n\n#### More Testimonials From People Who Worked With TRG\n\nFormat\nOrganization\nCountry\nHang tight, we're getting things ready!\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][11][[facebook]][12][[youtube]][13]\n[Solutions][14]\n[TRG Solutions][15][Business Challenges][16][Industries][17]\n[Resources][18]\n[Podcasts][19][Blog][20][FAQ][21][Research Portal][22][TRG End-User Training][23]\n[Stories][24]\n[Case Studies][25][CEO Letters][26]\n[About us][27]\n[Our People][28][Awards][29][TRG Cares][30][Testimonials][31]\n[Events][32]\n[Become our Speaker][33][Events Gallery][34][Hire our venue][35]\n[Careers][36]\n[Internships][37][Internships Partners][38]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][39][[facebook]][40][[Youtube Play Button]][41]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][42][Privacy Policy][43]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[12]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[13]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[14]: /solutions/\n[15]: /solutions/\n[16]: /business-challenges/\n[17]: /industries/\n[18]: /resources/\n[19]: /podcasts/\n[20]: /blog/\n[21]: /faq/\n[22]: /research/\n[23]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[24]: /stories/\n[25]: /stories/case-studies/\n[26]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[27]: /about-us/\n[28]: /about-us/our-people/\n[29]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[30]: /about-us/csr/\n[31]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[32]: /events/\n[33]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[34]: /events/events-gallery/\n[35]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[36]: /careers/\n[37]: /careers/internships/\n[38]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[39]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[40]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[41]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[42]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[43]: /privacy-policy/"
