            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n\n# Clients & Partners\n\nAs a global leader in professional services, TRG International values our strong client and partner\nrelationships. We are grateful for their support, which inspires us to achieve new heights and\npositively impact the business landscape and society.\n\n[Clients & Partners hero image]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n## CLIENTS WE ARE PROUD OF\n\nDiscover the clients who have entrusted us with their vision and goals. Learn about our shared\nsuccesses and the meaningful partnerships that propel our work forward.\n\n## Hospitality Industry Clients\n\nDelivering excellent IT solutions to 1000 clients from budget hotels to 6-star luxury\nresorts.\n\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1664.svg]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1663-1.png]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1662.svg]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1659.svg]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1660.svg]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1661.svg]\n\n## Financial Industry Clients\n\nSome of our satisfied customers utilising our Financial Management Solutions\n\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1689.svg]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Asset-1-2.svg]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Asset-1-3-1.png]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1688-1.png]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1690-1.png]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1691.svg]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Group-6.png]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1692.svg]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1699.svg]\n[https://wpengine.trginternational.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Frame-1693.svg]\n[logo]\n\n### Hilton Windhoek\n\n\u201cA million thanks to the TRG Team for the prompt and efficient support. A special vote of thanks and\nappreciation goes to Toan, Dam Vi - Senior Support Consultant, for quickly and efficiently resolving\nan issue that would otherwise hav made my month-end a nightmare. Thank you for also going out of\nyour way to resolve 3 more issues that were not initially raised on the ticket. Pro-activeness\u201d\n\nRonny Shampumba\n\n[logo]\n\n### Hilton Windhoek\n\n\u201cA million thanks to the TRG Team for the prompt and efficient support. A special vote of thanks and\nappreciation goes to Toan, Dam Vi - Senior Support Consultant, for quickly and efficiently resolving\nan issue that would otherwise hav made my month-end a nightmare. Thank you for also going out of\nyour way to resolve 3 more issues that were not initially raised on the ticket. Pro-activeness\u201d\n\nRonny Shampumba\n\n[logo]\n\n### Mobifone\n\n\u201cTRG\u2019s support team is excellent. Usually, when we send support requests to TRG, responses arrive\nwithin 30-60 minutes only. I am very happy with the services of TRG!\u201d\n\nMr. Hoang Dinh Thong\n\n[logo]\n\n### Mobifone\n\n\u201cTRG\u2019s support team is excellent. Usually, when we send support requests to TRG, responses arrive\nwithin 30-60 minutes only. I am very happy with the services of TRG!\u201d\n\nMr. Hoang Dinh Thong\n\n[logo]\n\n### Hilton Windhoek\n\n\u201cA million thanks to the TRG Team for the prompt and efficient support. A special vote of thanks and\nappreciation goes to Toan, Dam Vi - Senior Support Consultant, for quickly and efficiently resolving\nan issue that would otherwise hav made my month-end a nightmare. Thank you for also going out of\nyour way to resolve 3 more issues that were not initially raised on the ticket. Pro-activeness\u201d\n\nRonny Shampumba\n\n[logo]\n\n### Hilton Windhoek\n\n\u201cA million thanks to the TRG Team for the prompt and efficient support. A special vote of thanks and\nappreciation goes to Toan, Dam Vi - Senior Support Consultant, for quickly and efficiently resolving\nan issue that would otherwise hav made my month-end a nightmare. Thank you for also going out of\nyour way to resolve 3 more issues that were not initially raised on the ticket. Pro-activeness\u201d\n\nRonny Shampumba\n\n[logo]\n\n### Mobifone\n\n\u201cTRG\u2019s support team is excellent. Usually, when we send support requests to TRG, responses arrive\nwithin 30-60 minutes only. I am very happy with the services of TRG!\u201d\n\nMr. Hoang Dinh Thong\n\n[logo]\n\n### Mobifone\n\n\u201cTRG\u2019s support team is excellent. Usually, when we send support requests to TRG, responses arrive\nwithin 30-60 minutes only. I am very happy with the services of TRG!\u201d\n\nMr. Hoang Dinh Thong\n\n[hero shape]\n\n## OUR PARTNERS\n\nWe partnered with leading business software and service providers around the world\n\n[Become our partner][11]\n[logo]\n\nVNG Cloud\n\n[logo]\n\nAmazon Web Services\n\n[logo]\n\nProfessional Advantage\n\n[logo]\n\nZoom\n\n[logo]\n\nBizfly Cloud\n\n[logo]\n\nGreat People Inside\n\n[logo]\n\nSleek Sign\n\n[logo]\n\nHubspot\n\n[thumbnail]\n[thumbnail]\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T06:58:44.630Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][12][[facebook]][13][[youtube]][14]\n[Solutions][15]\n[TRG Solutions][16][Business Challenges][17][Industries][18]\n[Resources][19]\n[Podcasts][20][Blog][21][FAQ][22][Research Portal][23][TRG End-User Training][24]\n[Stories][25]\n[Case Studies][26][CEO Letters][27]\n[About us][28]\n[Our People][29][Awards][30][TRG Cares][31][Testimonials][32]\n[Events][33]\n[Become our Speaker][34][Events Gallery][35][Hire our venue][36]\n[Careers][37]\n[Internships][38][Internships Partners][39]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][40][[facebook]][41][[Youtube Play Button]][42]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][43][Privacy Policy][44]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: /careers/\n[12]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[13]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[14]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[15]: /solutions/\n[16]: /solutions/\n[17]: /business-challenges/\n[18]: /industries/\n[19]: /resources/\n[20]: /podcasts/\n[21]: /blog/\n[22]: /faq/\n[23]: /research/\n[24]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[25]: /stories/\n[26]: /stories/case-studies/\n[27]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[28]: /about-us/\n[29]: /about-us/our-people/\n[30]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[31]: /about-us/csr/\n[32]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[33]: /events/\n[34]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[35]: /events/events-gallery/\n[36]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[37]: /careers/\n[38]: /careers/internships/\n[39]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[40]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[41]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[42]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[43]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[44]: /privacy-policy/"
