          {
            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/infor-sunsystems-cloud/i-need-something-else/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n[hero-bg]\n\n#### SunSystems Ad Hoc Services\n\n# Tailored Service\n\nTRG provides a customised service option where users can manually request services, ensuring their\nneeds are fully addressed.\n\n### Overview\n\nTRG provides continuous support for all manually requested services, ensuring they are delivered to\nthe highest standard.\n\nCustomised Service Requests\n\n[Customised Service Requests]\n\nSometimes, the specific service you need may not be readily available or listed. To address this,\nTRG offers a flexible option where users can manually message their requests, ensuring that their\nunique needs are met.\n\nDirect Communication with Experts\n\n[Direct Communication with Experts]\n\nWhen users manually request a service, they have the opportunity to communicate directly with TRG\u2019s\nexperts. This ensures that their needs are clearly understood and that the service provided is\ntailored to their specific requirements.\n\nFlexible and Responsive Service Offering\n\n[Flexible and Responsive Service Offering]\n\nTRG\u2019s approach is designed to be flexible and responsive, accommodating unique or specialised\nservice requests that may not fit into predefined categories. This flexibility ensures that no need\ngoes unmet, regardless of how specific it may be.\n\nContinuous Support for SunSytems Services\n\n[Continuous Support for SunSytems Services]\n\nEven if the service isn\u2019t initially listed, TRG\u2019s support doesn\u2019t stop once the request is made.\nContinuous assistance is provided to ensure that the requested service is delivered effectively and\nmeets the user\u2019s expectations.\n\nAD HOC SERVICES\n\nWe offer a wide range of ad hoc services for SunSystems and other valuable tools to boost your\norganisation\u2019s productivity, no matter what your business\u2019 specific needs are.\n\n### OUR CLIENT\n\nSome of our satisfied customers we helped with their SunSystems ad hoc needs.\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T02:16:07.116Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][11][[facebook]][12][[youtube]][13]\n[Solutions][14]\n[TRG Solutions][15][Business Challenges][16][Industries][17]\n[Resources][18]\n[Podcasts][19][Blog][20][FAQ][21][Research Portal][22][TRG End-User Training][23]\n[Stories][24]\n[Case Studies][25][CEO Letters][26]\n[About us][27]\n[Our People][28][Awards][29][TRG Cares][30][Testimonials][31]\n[Events][32]\n[Become our Speaker][33][Events Gallery][34][Hire our venue][35]\n[Careers][36]\n[Internships][37][Internships Partners][38]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][39][[facebook]][40][[Youtube Play Button]][41]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][42][Privacy Policy][43]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[12]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[13]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[14]: /solutions/\n[15]: /solutions/\n[16]: /business-challenges/\n[17]: /industries/\n[18]: /resources/\n[19]: /podcasts/\n[20]: /blog/\n[21]: /faq/\n[22]: /research/\n[23]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[24]: /stories/\n[25]: /stories/case-studies/\n[26]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[27]: /about-us/\n[28]: /about-us/our-people/\n[29]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[30]: /about-us/csr/\n[31]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[32]: /events/\n[33]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[34]: /events/events-gallery/\n[35]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[36]: /careers/\n[37]: /careers/internships/\n[38]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[39]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[40]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[41]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[42]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[43]: /privacy-policy/"
