            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-values/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n[bg-decor]\nGreat People Inside Assessments\n\n# GR8 Values\n\nGR8 Values - the ultimate assessment tool you will ever need to help you to select and employ\ncandidates for the recruitment and on-boarding processes.\n[icon]\n\nSelf-assessment: A person will rate himself/herself.\n\n[icon]\n\nAverage 15 minutes to complete the assessment\n\n[hero image]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n#### Assessment Dimensions\n\nSolutions for:\n\n#### Assessment Dimensions\n\nIn addition to GR8 Values, TRG provides an extensive assessment library with hundreds of dimensions\nthat can be leveraged in creating a custom skills-based assessment that supports your organisation\u2019s\nspecific competencies and unique vision. Whatever the challenge you are facing, we aim to provide a\ngreat experience to help you in the best way we can.\n\nTo use this assessment tool, simply fill out the form on the right and request a demo to know how we\noffer you a total-person view of a candidate/employee.\n\nSolutions for:\nTraining & Development\n][11][\nRecruitment\n][12][\nRetention & Engagement\n][13]\n\n#### Dimensions:\n\nCooperation | Courage | Tolerance | Generosity | Humble character | Fairness | Flexibility |\nAmbition | Discipline | Caution | Patience | Respect | Sincerity | Responsibility | Friendliness\n\n[icon]\n[icon]\n[icon]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\nLatest resources for **GR8 Values**\n\n[View All Resources[icon]][14]\nThu, Jan 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][15][\nThu, Jul 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][16][\nTue, Jun 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][17]\n\n#### Try The Assessment\n\nOne of the pre-selected assessments which has been effectively grouped to address specific common\nissues. It consists of easy-to-use tools and processes to assess, select, manage and develop your\nemployees.\n\nAn underrated aspect of [matching candidates with potential jobs ][18]lies in identifying the ones\nthat share the same principles as you. The assessment contains dimensions such as sincerity,\npatience and responsibility, which can be customised to match your company\u2019s own system of values.\nThen, you can use these attributes to select and employ the candidates who best match your company\u2019s\ncore values.\n\n[Finding a perfect fit for a job role ][19]is crucial and effect the overall business in a long run.\nWith thousands of applicants applying for jobs each year, it becomes important to recognise and\nchoose the talent that fits the job role and the overall values of the organisation.\n\nGR8 Values is an excellent solution to this. GR8 Values provides a list of pre-selected assessments\nthat are effectively grouped to address specific common issues faced by your business. Many\ncompanies today face a point of realisation when they realise that their employees were not the\ncorrect fit for their roles. In such a situation, companies often give cash to their employees to\nquit, if they feel that they are not the correct fit for the job. However, this solves only a part\nof the problem. Finding a perfect fit for the role can be difficult, but it is not impossible.\nTalent is everywhere and our duty is to find the talent that works and fits best for us.\n\nIn order to find a perfect talent for the role, hiring managers is required to look beyond just the\ntechnical qualifications. Employees who align with the organisational goals go a long way in\nachieving greater productivity and team harmony. Employers who realise the importance of the same\nare also able to bring a bunch of positive hires into the business!\nGR8 values helps the individuals and the companies to rate the employees with respect to their job\nrole. Individuals can rate their suitability and satisfaction of being in a job role and the\ncompanies can focus on improving their hires by understanding and identifying the correct job match\nfor the role. Having a perfect match is underrated but important at the same time and can bring in\nhuge changes to your business.\n\n#### GR8 Values is recommended for:\n* Identifying the performance potential\n* Recruitment, selection and Job Match\n* Engagement and retention\n* Induction and onboarding\n* Performance prediction\n* Assessing cultural fit\n* Improving team dynamics\n* Creating and maintaining a healthy work-life balance strategy for employees\n\n## GR8 Customised\n\n### Provides a unique assessment for your company; You can create one through a simple\n### choose-and-pick exercise in our library of 100+ dimensions. The GR8PI platform is so extensive\n### that you will be impressed by the number of aspects we can measure.\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nTRG has implemented technology solutions for industries like financial services, not-for-profit, and\nenergy, oil, and gas, our custom configuration makes it well-suited for many other vertical markets\nas well. This adaptability is one of the key reasons why various industries choose us for their\nsolution requirements.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial Services][20][Manufacturing][21][Insurance][22][Energy][23][Real\nEstate][24][Healthcare][25][Education][26]\n\n### OUR CLIENT\n\nSome of our satisfied customers we helped with their Talent Management assessments needs.\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T02:07:18.628Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][27][[facebook]][28][[youtube]][29]\n[Solutions][30]\n[TRG Solutions][31][Business Challenges][32][Industries][33]\n[Resources][34]\n[Podcasts][35][Blog][36][FAQ][37][Research Portal][38][TRG End-User Training][39]\n[Stories][40]\n[Case Studies][41][CEO Letters][42]\n[About us][43]\n[Our People][44][Awards][45][TRG Cares][46][Testimonials][47]\n[Events][48]\n[Become our Speaker][49][Events Gallery][50][Hire our venue][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Internships][53][Internships Partners][54]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][55][[facebook]][56][[Youtube Play Button]][57]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][58][Privacy Policy][59]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: /business-challenges/talent-management/training-development/\n[12]: /business-challenges/talent-management/recruitment/\n[13]: /business-challenges/talent-management/retention-engagement/\n[14]: /\n[15]: /\n[16]: /\n[17]: /\n[18]: https://www.pagepersonnel.com.au/advice/career-and-management/success/matching-candidate-and-c\nompany-values-ensure-success\n[19]: https://blog.trginternational.com/pre-hire-assessments-definition-and-factors-to-consider\n[20]: /industries/financial-services/\n[21]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[22]: /industries/insurance/\n[23]: /industries/energy/\n[24]: /industries/real-estate/\n[25]: /industries/healthcare/\n[26]: /solutions/education/\n[27]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[28]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[29]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[30]: /solutions/\n[31]: /solutions/\n[32]: /business-challenges/\n[33]: /industries/\n[34]: /resources/\n[35]: /podcasts/\n[36]: /blog/\n[37]: /faq/\n[38]: /research/\n[39]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[40]: /stories/\n[41]: /stories/case-studies/\n[42]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[43]: /about-us/\n[44]: /about-us/our-people/\n[45]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[46]: /about-us/csr/\n[47]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[48]: /events/\n[49]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[50]: /events/events-gallery/\n[51]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[52]: /careers/\n[53]: /careers/internships/\n[54]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[55]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[56]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[57]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[58]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[59]: /privacy-policy/"
