            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-remote-manager/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n[bg-decor]\nGreat People Inside Assessments\n\n# GR8 Remote Manager\n\nFor managers looking to better understand how well they lead a remote team, GR8 Remote Manager is a\npsychometric assessment featuring various dimensions to draw actionable insights into remote\nmanagers' behaviour and cognitive thinking.\n[icon]\n\nSelf-assessment: A person will rate himself/herself.\n\n[icon]\n\nAverage 30 - 35 minutes to complete the assessment\n\n[hero image]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n#### Assessment Dimensions\n\nSolutions for:\n\n#### Assessment Dimensions\n\nPrimary foci of GR8 Remote Manager Assessment are managerial behavioural and cognitive tendencies\nnamed above.\n\nTRG also provides a comprehensive assessment library with hundreds of dimensions that can be\nleveraged in creating a custom skills-based assessment that supports your organisation\u2019s specific\ncompetencies and unique vision.\n\nIn the assessment of remote managers, if current tasks involve constructive thinking and drawing\nconclusions based on existing data, Cognitive Skills should be assessed as a priority.\n\nSolutions for:\nTraining & Development\n][11][\nRecruitment\n][12][\nRetention & Engagement\n][13]\n\n#### Behaviours:\n\nStability | Curiosity and Self-Awareness | Tenacity | Resilience | Cooperation | Assertiveness |\nResponsibility | Flexibility | Objectivity | Fairness | Stress and Resilience | Leadership\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Cognitive traits:\n\nWorking with Numbers Plus | Working with Words Plus | Reasoning Plus\n\n[icon]\n[icon]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\nLatest resources for **GR8 Remote Manager**\n\n[View All Resources[icon]][14]\nThu, Jan 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][15][\nThu, Jul 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][16][\nTue, Jun 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][17]\n\n#### Try The Assessment\n\nIn the modern working environment full of changes and uncertainty, working from home has become a\nnew normal and that requires a remote manager to adapt and adjust their managing approach. The\neffective manager who leads remotely will have concerns on team communication and motivation,\ntrust-building, which together impact the accomplishment of goals set out.\n\nThe GR8 Remote Manager tool provides key information on the efficiency of the manager in leading a\nremote team, assesses their ability to manage different work styles and create vision, motivation\nand momentum in a remote team. The assessment provides development suggestions and coaching for\nmaximizing the results of managerial work.\n\n#### Use GR8 360\u00b0 when your organisation is\n* Selection and Job Match\n* Identifying performance potential\n* Identifying leadership strengths and development needs\n* Development of management competencies, aptitudes and behaviours.\n* Improving employee engagement and retention\n* Improving the dynamics of teams\n* Succession planning programs\n* Self-development and coaching\n\n[icon]\n\nEnglish\n\n## GR8 Customised\n\n### Provides a unique assessment for your company; You can create one through a simple\n### choose-and-pick exercise in our library of 100+ dimensions. The GR8PI platform is so extensive\n### that you will be impressed by the number of aspects we can measure.\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nTRG has implemented technology solutions for industries like financial services, not-for-profit, and\nenergy, oil, and gas, our custom configuration makes it well-suited for many other vertical markets\nas well. This adaptability is one of the key reasons why various industries choose us for their\nsolution requirements.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial Services][18][Manufacturing][19][Insurance][20][Energy][21][Real\nEstate][22][Healthcare][23][Education][24]\n\n### OUR CLIENT\n\nSome of our satisfied customers we helped with their Talent Management assessments needs.\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T02:07:24.689Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][25][[facebook]][26][[youtube]][27]\n[Solutions][28]\n[TRG Solutions][29][Business Challenges][30][Industries][31]\n[Resources][32]\n[Podcasts][33][Blog][34][FAQ][35][Research Portal][36][TRG End-User Training][37]\n[Stories][38]\n[Case Studies][39][CEO Letters][40]\n[About us][41]\n[Our People][42][Awards][43][TRG Cares][44][Testimonials][45]\n[Events][46]\n[Become our Speaker][47][Events Gallery][48][Hire our venue][49]\n[Careers][50]\n[Internships][51][Internships Partners][52]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][53][[facebook]][54][[Youtube Play Button]][55]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][56][Privacy Policy][57]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: /business-challenges/talent-management/training-development/\n[12]: /business-challenges/talent-management/recruitment/\n[13]: /business-challenges/talent-management/retention-engagement/\n[14]: /\n[15]: /\n[16]: /\n[17]: /\n[18]: /industries/financial-services/\n[19]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[20]: /industries/insurance/\n[21]: /industries/energy/\n[22]: /industries/real-estate/\n[23]: /industries/healthcare/\n[24]: /solutions/education/\n[25]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[26]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[27]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[28]: /solutions/\n[29]: /solutions/\n[30]: /business-challenges/\n[31]: /industries/\n[32]: /resources/\n[33]: /podcasts/\n[34]: /blog/\n[35]: /faq/\n[36]: /research/\n[37]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[38]: /stories/\n[39]: /stories/case-studies/\n[40]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[41]: /about-us/\n[42]: /about-us/our-people/\n[43]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[44]: /about-us/csr/\n[45]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[46]: /events/\n[47]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[48]: /events/events-gallery/\n[49]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[50]: /careers/\n[51]: /careers/internships/\n[52]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[53]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[54]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[55]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[56]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[57]: /privacy-policy/"
