          {
            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-remote-employee/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n[bg-decor]\nGreat People Inside Assessments\n\n# GR8 Remote Employee\n\nFor managers looking to select, develop and manage talent in the distance, GR8 Remote Employee is a\npsychometric assessment that features various dimensions to help gain actionable insights into\nremote employees' behaviour and cognitive thinking.\n[icon]\n\nSelf-assessment: A person will rate himself/herself.\n\n[icon]\n\nAverage 30 - 35 minutes to complete the assessment\n\n[hero image]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n#### Assessment Dimensions\n\nSolutions for:\n\n#### Assessment Dimensions\n\nThere are two main focuses of GR8 Remote Employee assessment. These are behavioural and cognitive\ntraits such as willingness to perform at best capacity, discipline, resilience or numerical and\nlogical reasoning.\n\nTRG also provides an extensive assessment library with hundreds of dimensions that can be leveraged\nin creating a custom skills-based assessment that supports your organisation\u2019s specific competencies\nand unique vision. Whatever the challenge you are facing, we aim to provide a great experience to\nhelp you in the best way we can.\n\nSolutions for:\nTraining & Development\n][11][\nRecruitment\n][12][\nRetention & Engagement\n][13]\n\n#### Behaviours:\n\nConscientiousness | Stability | Openness to experience | Resilience | Discipline | Engagement |\nResponsibility\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Cognitive:\n\nWorking with Numbers | Working with Words | Reasoning | Analytical thinking\n\n[icon]\n[icon]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\nLatest resources for **GR8 Remote Employee**\n\n[View All Resources[icon]][14]\nThu, Jan 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][15][\nThu, Jul 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][16][\nTue, Jun 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][17]\n\n#### Try The Assessment\n\nAs working from home is now the new normal for most people, a new set of challenges arises. Not\neveryone works in the same way or enjoy working from home. Therefore ensuring a high level of\nproductivity and motivation from remote employees is a huge challenge for many business managers.\n\nThere is less supervision and surveillance to make sure that employees are working and doing what\nthey are supposed to. The lack of face-to-face interaction has caused this. So more than ever, we\nrely on a more in-depth talent assessment. Finding employees that can work in the way that will\nvirtually fit in well with the company and has the skills to do so.\n\nNoticeably, the activities and work patterns of a work-from-home employee, as well as their\nchallenges, are not at all similar to those working in the offices daily. In fact, it was found that\nhigh-performing remote employees possess different personality traits and sets of abilities that\nhelp them prosper, be effective and achieve results.\n\nThe GR8 Remote Employee assessment tool that helps with talent assessment. It enables Human\nResources managers to get an overview of the potential of candidates in selection processes, who are\nabout to work remotely. Also, it helps you discover if your current employees have the skills needed\nin becoming productive and motivated when working remotely. In addition the assessment provides\nsuggestions for future development and the opportunity to create your own content.\n\nOverall giving you a better overview of what you can do better to adapt to this new way of working,\nso that it benefits you and your employees.\n\n#### GR8 Remote Employee is recommended for:\n* Recruitment, selection and Job Match\n* Improving employee engagement and retention\n* Improving the dynamics of teams\n* Identifying performance potential\n* Induction and onboarding\n* Developing and maintaining a strategy for a healthy work-life balance for employees\n\n[icon]\n\nEnglish\n\n## GR8 Customised\n\n### Provides a unique assessment for your company; You can create one through a simple\n### choose-and-pick exercise in our library of 100+ dimensions. The GR8PI platform is so extensive\n### that you will be impressed by the number of aspects we can measure.\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nTRG has implemented technology solutions for industries like financial services, not-for-profit, and\nenergy, oil, and gas, our custom configuration makes it well-suited for many other vertical markets\nas well. This adaptability is one of the key reasons why various industries choose us for their\nsolution requirements.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial Services][18][Manufacturing][19][Insurance][20][Energy][21][Real\nEstate][22][Healthcare][23][Education][24]\n\n### OUR CLIENT\n\nSome of our satisfied customers we helped with their Talent Management assessments needs.\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T02:07:26.640Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][25][[facebook]][26][[youtube]][27]\n[Solutions][28]\n[TRG Solutions][29][Business Challenges][30][Industries][31]\n[Resources][32]\n[Podcasts][33][Blog][34][FAQ][35][Research Portal][36][TRG End-User Training][37]\n[Stories][38]\n[Case Studies][39][CEO Letters][40]\n[About us][41]\n[Our People][42][Awards][43][TRG Cares][44][Testimonials][45]\n[Events][46]\n[Become our Speaker][47][Events Gallery][48][Hire our venue][49]\n[Careers][50]\n[Internships][51][Internships Partners][52]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][53][[facebook]][54][[Youtube Play Button]][55]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][56][Privacy Policy][57]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: /business-challenges/talent-management/training-development/\n[12]: /business-challenges/talent-management/recruitment/\n[13]: /business-challenges/talent-management/retention-engagement/\n[14]: /\n[15]: /\n[16]: /\n[17]: /\n[18]: /industries/financial-services/\n[19]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[20]: /industries/insurance/\n[21]: /industries/energy/\n[22]: /industries/real-estate/\n[23]: /industries/healthcare/\n[24]: /solutions/education/\n[25]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[26]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[27]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[28]: /solutions/\n[29]: /solutions/\n[30]: /business-challenges/\n[31]: /industries/\n[32]: /resources/\n[33]: /podcasts/\n[34]: /blog/\n[35]: /faq/\n[36]: /research/\n[37]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[38]: /stories/\n[39]: /stories/case-studies/\n[40]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[41]: /about-us/\n[42]: /about-us/our-people/\n[43]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[44]: /about-us/csr/\n[45]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[46]: /events/\n[47]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[48]: /events/events-gallery/\n[49]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[50]: /careers/\n[51]: /careers/internships/\n[52]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[53]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[54]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[55]: ht