            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-managers/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n[bg-decor]\nGreat People Inside Assessments\n\n# GR8 Managers\n\nGR8 Managers - the ultimate assessment tool you would ever need to identify employees with competent\nleadership potential, thereby supporting selection, development & talent management decisions.\n[icon]\n\nSelf-assessment: A person will rate himself/herself.\n\n[icon]\n\nAverage 35 minutes to complete the assessment\n\n[hero image]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n#### Assessment Dimensions\n\nSolutions for:\n\n#### Assessment Dimensions\n\nThere are 2 main focuses of the GR8 Managers assessment. These are Behaviour and Cognitive\ncharacteristics. In terms of behavioural testing, dimensions include the ability to navigate through\nuncertainty, inter-relationship management, assertiveness and so on. The cognitive criteria utilised\nincluded, not limitedly though, logical reasoning, working with words and numbers as well as\nproblem-solving.\n\nIn addition, TRG provides an extensive assessment library with hundreds of dimensions that can be\nleveraged in creating a custom skills-based assessment that supports your organisation\u2019s specific\ncompetencies and unique vision. Whatever the challenge you are facing, we aim to provide a great\nexperience to help you in the best way we can.\n\nSolutions for:\nTraining & Development\n][11][\nRecruitment\n][12][\nLeadership\n][13][\nRetention & Engagement\n][14]\n\n#### Behaviours:\n\nVUCA Approach | Managing Generations | Engagement | Assertiveness | Initiative | Vision | Strategy |\nLeadership\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Cognitive traits:\n\nNumeracy skills | Literacy skills | Analytical and Critical thinking | Reasoning | Problem solving\n\n[icon]\n[icon]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\nLatest resources for **GR8 Managers**\n\n[View All Resources[icon]][15]\nThu, Jan 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][16][\nThu, Jul 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][17][\nTue, Jun 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][18]\n\n#### Try the assessment\n\nEntrusted with a high level of responsibility and decision making that has substantial\norganisational implications, managers hold a great level of authority and responsibility around the\nworkplace. This is why all managers would massively benefit from a thorough assessment of their\npersonality traits and skills.\n\nIn other words, as the managers become more self-aware of their strengths and weaknesses, they\nbecome more capable of managing self and others in a more efficient and effective manner. This is\nadvantageous as this in turn influences the workplace environment and employee relationship.\nUltimately improving the overall organisational performance to reach the desired goals and\nobjectives.\n\nA higher level of self-awareness can be obtained via comprehensive psychometric testing where\nnumerous leadership and manager attributes, such as emotional intelligence, vision and goal setting,\nare benchmarked against. This creates a profile of the ways that you prefer to work and ways that\nyou tend to avoid. This benefits you and your employees as they get an understanding of your\nmanagement style. This consequently could lead to hiring the right employees to work under you to\nensure better teamwork and communication.\n\nGR8 Managers tool can help with selection, development and talent management. The in-depth analysis\nwill breakdown your characteristics and personality so that you can get a better understanding of\nyourself and apply this in whatever setting you are placed in.\n\nThe assessment tool focuses on identifying management potential from several different perspectives.\nThese include the three main managerial qualities of fairness, foresight and inspiration, as well as\nthe ability to work with generation diversity and in a [VUCA ][19](Volatile, Uncertain, Complex,\nAmbiguous) environment.\n\nThe assessment report and result analysis will help managers understand themselves in a better way\nwhile seeing through the potentials in other employees to optimise them for the organisational\ngrowth.\n\n#### GR8 Managers is recommended for:\n* Identifying the performance potential\n* Selection and Job Match\n* Identifying leadership strengths and weaknesses\n* Development of management competencies, skills and behaviours\n* Employee retention\n* Succession planning programs\n* Coaching and personal development\n\n## GR8 Customised\n\n### Provides a unique assessment for your company; You can create one through a simple\n### choose-and-pick exercise in our library of 100+ dimensions. The GR8PI platform is so extensive\n### that you will be impressed by the number of aspects we can measure.\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nTRG has implemented technology solutions for industries like financial services, not-for-profit, and\nenergy, oil, and gas, our custom configuration makes it well-suited for many other vertical markets\nas well. This adaptability is one of the key reasons why various industries choose us for their\nsolution requirements.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial Services][20][Manufacturing][21][Insurance][22][Energy][23][Real\nEstate][24][Healthcare][25][Education][26]\n\n### OUR CLIENT\n\nSome of our satisfied customers we helped with their Talent Management assessments needs.\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T02:07:31.267Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][27][[facebook]][28][[youtube]][29]\n[Solutions][30]\n[TRG Solutions][31][Business Challenges][32][Industries][33]\n[Resources][34]\n[Podcasts][35][Blog][36][FAQ][37][Research Portal][38][TRG End-User Training][39]\n[Stories][40]\n[Case Studies][41][CEO Letters][42]\n[About us][43]\n[Our People][44][Awards][45][TRG Cares][46][Testimonials][47]\n[Events][48]\n[Become our Speaker][49][Events Gallery][50][Hire our venue][51]\n[Careers][52]\n[Internships][53][Internships Partners][54]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][55][[facebook]][56][[Youtube Play Button]][57]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][58][Privacy Policy][59]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: /business-challenges/talent-management/training-development/\n[12]: /business-challenges/talent-management/recruitment/\n[13]: /business-challenges/talent-management/leadership-development/\n[14]: /business-challenges/talent-management/retention-engagement/\n[15]: /\n[16]: /\n[17]: /\n[18]: /\n[19]: https://blog.trginternational.com/enhance-the-employee-engagement-in-the-vuca-environment\n[20]: /industries/financial-services/\n[21]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[22]: /industries/insurance/\n[23]: /industries/energy/\n[24]: /industries/real-estate/\n[25]: /industries/healthcare/\n[26]: /solutions/education/\n[27]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[28]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[29]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[30]: /solutions/\n[31]: /solutions/\n[32]: /business-challenges/\n[33]: /industries/\n[34]: /resources/\n[35]: /podcasts/\n[36]: /blog/\n[37]: /faq/\n[38]: /research/\n[39]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[40]: /stories/\n[41]: /stories/case-studies/\n[42]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[43]: /about-us/\n[44]: /about-us/our-people/\n[45]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[46]: /about-us/csr/\n[47]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[48]: /events/\n[49]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[50]: /events/events-gallery/\n[51]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[52]: /careers/\n[53]: /careers/internships/\n[54]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[55]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[56]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[57]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[58]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[59]: /privacy-policy/"
