          {
            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-leaders-of-vuca-world/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n[bg-decor]\nGreat People Inside Assessments\n\n# GR8 Leader in a VUCA World\n\nGR8 Leader in a VUCA world - the assessment tool for talent the selection, development and\nmanagement.\n[icon]\n\nSelf-assessment: A person will rate himself/herself.\n\n[icon]\n\nAverage 30 - 35 minutes to complete the assessment\n\n[hero image]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n#### Assessment Dimensions\n\nSolutions for:\n\n#### Assessment Dimensions\n\nMajor focuses of GR8 Leader in a VUCA World assessment are behavioural and cognitive dimensions\nunderlying their ability to navigate through and manage changes.\n\nTRG also provides an assessment library with hundreds of dimensions that can be leveraged in\ncreating a custom skills-based assessment that supports your organisation\u2019s specific competencies\nand unique vision.\n\nSolutions for:\nTraining & Development\n][11][\nRecruitment\n][12][\nRetention & Engagement\n][13]\n\n#### Behaviours:\n\nVUCA Approach | Managing Generations | Strategy | Openness to Experience | Connection to Others |\nStress and resilience | Results-orientation | Building Vision and Purpose | Leadership | Courage |\nFlexibility | Curiosity and Self-awareness\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Cognitive:\n\nWorking with Numbers Plus | Working with Words Plus | Reasoning Plus\n\n[icon]\n[icon]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\nLatest resources for **GR8 Leaders of the VUCA World**\n\n[View All Resources[icon]][14]\nThu, Jan 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][15][\nThu, Jul 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][16][\nTue, Jun 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][17]\n\n#### Try the assessment\n\nIn an ever-changing world, business managers are constantly bombarded with challenges, problems and\nalso opportunities. Formerly, leaders needed a standardised skill set to lead their organisation to\nsuccess, now they need to champion adaptability and innovation.\n\nGR8 Leader in a VUCA World is an assessment tool that is based around identifying leadership\npotential in a VUCA (volatile, uncertain, complex, ambiguous) environment. By measuring capacity and\npotential, we can highlight the individual strengths and development gaps corresponding to the\nleadership needs of the organization, providing strong perspectives for the future of the business.\n\n#### GR8 Leader in a VUCA World is recommended for:\n* Identifying performance potential\n* Selection and job match\n* Identifying leadership strengths and development needs\n* Developing leadership competencies, aptitudes and behaviours\n* Employee retention\n* Succession planning programs\n* Self-development and coaching\n\n[icon]\n\nEnglish\n\n## GR8 Customised\n\n### Provides a unique assessment for your company; You can create one through a simple\n### choose-and-pick exercise in our library of 100+ dimensions. The GR8PI platform is so extensive\n### that you will be impressed by the number of aspects we can measure.\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nTRG has implemented technology solutions for industries like financial services, not-for-profit, and\nenergy, oil, and gas, our custom configuration makes it well-suited for many other vertical markets\nas well. This adaptability is one of the key reasons why various industries choose us for their\nsolution requirements.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial Services][18][Manufacturing][19][Retail][20][insurance][21][Energy][22][Real\nEstate][23][Healthcare][24][Education][25]\n\n### OUR CLIENT\n\nSome of our satisfied customers we helped with their Talent Management assessments needs.\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T08:09:59.780Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][26][[facebook]][27][[youtube]][28]\n[Solutions][29]\n[TRG Solutions][30][Business Challenges][31][Industries][32]\n[Resources][33]\n[Podcasts][34][Blog][35][FAQ][36][Research Portal][37][TRG End-User Training][38]\n[Stories][39]\n[Case Studies][40][CEO Letters][41]\n[About us][42]\n[Our People][43][Awards][44][TRG Cares][45][Testimonials][46]\n[Events][47]\n[Become our Speaker][48][Events Gallery][49][Hire our venue][50]\n[Careers][51]\n[Internships][52][Internships Partners][53]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][54][[facebook]][55][[Youtube Play Button]][56]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][57][Privacy Policy][58]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: /business-challenges/talent-management/training-development/\n[12]: /business-challenges/talent-management/recruitment/\n[13]: /business-challenges/talent-management/retention-engagement/\n[14]: /\n[15]: /\n[16]: /\n[17]: /\n[18]: /industries/financial-services/\n[19]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[20]: /business-challenges/retail-management/\n[21]: /industries/insurance/\n[22]: /industries/energy/\n[23]: /industries/real-estate/\n[24]: /industries/healthcare/\n[25]: /solutions/education/\n[26]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[27]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[28]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[29]: /solutions/\n[30]: /solutions/\n[31]: /business-challenges/\n[32]: /industries/\n[33]: /resources/\n[34]: /podcasts/\n[35]: /blog/\n[36]: /faq/\n[37]: /research/\n[38]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[39]: /stories/\n[40]: /stories/case-studies/\n[41]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[42]: /about-us/\n[43]: /about-us/our-people/\n[44]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[45]: /about-us/csr/\n[46]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[47]: /events/\n[48]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[49]: /events/events-gallery/\n[50]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[51]: /careers/\n[52]: /careers/internships/\n[53]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[54]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[55]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[56]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[57]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[58]: /privacy-policy/"
