            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-full-spectrum-plus/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n[bg-decor]\nGreat People Inside Assessments\n\n# GR8 Full Spectrum Plus\n\nGR8 Full Spectrum Plus - the ultimate tool to support you through the selection and induction\nprocess. This helps with finding talent management and career management programmes.\n[icon]\n\nSurvey Type: Many people will be asked to give feedback for an individual.\n\n[icon]\n\nAverage 30 minutes to complete the survey\n\n[hero image]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n#### Available Dimensions\n\nSolutions for:\n\n#### Available Dimensions\n\nThere are many dimensions to the GR8 Full Spectrum Plus assessment, as shown below. It gives you the\nflexibility to select, add or remove dimensions, tailoring it to your specific needs. This provides\na better insight in to the cognitive and behavioural aspects of a person, giving you a better\noverview of the individual.\n\nTRG has an extensive assessment library with hundreds of dimensions that can be leveraged in\ncreating a custom skills-based assessment that supports your organisation\u2019s specific competencies\nand unique vision. Whatever the challenge you are facing, we aim to provide a great experience to\nhelp you in the best way we can.\nTo use this assessment solution, just simply fill out the form on the right and request a demo to\nknow how we offer you a total-person view of a candidate/employee.\n\nSolutions for:\nTraining & Development\n][11][\nRecruitment\n][12]\n\n#### Coaching:\n\nDevelopment | Team Motivation\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Flexibility:\n\nSituational Adaptability | Innovation\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Organisational Connectivity:\n\nWork Relationships | Teamwork\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Leadership:\n\nIntegrity | Guidance | Task Delegation\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Process Management:\n\nResource Use Efficiency | Professionalism\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Performance:\n\nInitiative and Problem Solving | Goal Orientation\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Communications:\n\nActive Listening | Information Analysis | Straightforward Communication\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Self-development:\n\nCommitment | Continuous Development\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Engagement and Vision:\n\nVision | Power of Example | Empathy | Succession Planning\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Team Spirit:\n\nInterdisciplinary Approach | Cooperation | Open Communication | Conflict Management\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Openness to change:\n\nCreative Thinking | New Technology | Focus on the Essentials | Change Management\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Responsibility:\n\nCourage | Responsibility and Empowerment | Risk Prevention | Performance Management\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Commercial Strategy:\n\nCreative Marketing | Client Orientation | Adapting to Client Needs | Risk Management\n\n[icon]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\nLatest resources for **Full Spectrum Plus**\n\n[View All Resources[icon]][13]\nThu, Jan 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][14][\nThu, Jul 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][15][\nTue, Jun 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][16]\n\n#### Try the assessment\n\nEmpowered by Great People Inside\n\nSimilar to the GR8 Full Spectrum assessment, the GR8 Full Spectrum Plus is an all-encompassing tool\nfor identifying the current abilities of a candidate, as well as their potential match for any given\njob position.\n\nThe difference between the two instruments lies in the fact that, whereas GR8 Full Spectrum only\nincludes the exercises found in the Cognitive assessment, GR8 Full Spectrum Plus utilises the ones\nassociated with the Cognitive Plus instrument.\n\n#### Use GR8 360\u00b0 when your organisation is\n* Candidate selection and Job Match\n* Employee retention\n* Development of management competencies, skills and behaviours\n* Strategic workforce planning\n* Induction and succession programmes\n* Coaching and personal development\n\n## GR8 Customised\n\n### Provides a unique assessment for your company; You can create one through a simple\n### choose-and-pick exercise in our library of 100+ dimensions. The GR8PI platform is so extensive\n### that you will be impressed by the number of aspects we can measure.\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nTRG has implemented technology solutions for industries like financial services, not-for-profit, and\nenergy, oil, and gas, our custom configuration makes it well-suited for many other vertical markets\nas well. This adaptability is one of the key reasons why various industries choose us for their\nsolution requirements.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial Services][17][Manufacturing][18][insurance][19][Energy][20][Real\nEstate][21][Healthcare][22][Education][23]\n\n### OUR CLIENT\n\nSome of our satisfied customers we helped with their Talent Management assessments needs.\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T07:34:48.512Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][24][[facebook]][25][[youtube]][26]\n[Solutions][27]\n[TRG Solutions][28][Business Challenges][29][Industries][30]\n[Resources][31]\n[Podcasts][32][Blog][33][FAQ][34][Research Portal][35][TRG End-User Training][36]\n[Stories][37]\n[Case Studies][38][CEO Letters][39]\n[About us][40]\n[Our People][41][Awards][42][TRG Cares][43][Testimonials][44]\n[Events][45]\n[Become our Speaker][46][Events Gallery][47][Hire our venue][48]\n[Careers][49]\n[Internships][50][Internships Partners][51]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][52][[facebook]][53][[Youtube Play Button]][54]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][55][Privacy Policy][56]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: /business-challenges/talent-management/training-development/\n[12]: /business-challenges/talent-management/recruitment/\n[13]: /\n[14]: /\n[15]: /\n[16]: /\n[17]: /industries/financial-services/\n[18]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[19]: /industries/insurance/\n[20]: /industries/energy/\n[21]: /industries/real-estate/\n[22]: /industries/healthcare/\n[23]: /solutions/education/\n[24]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[25]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[26]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[27]: /solutions/\n[28]: /solutions/\n[29]: /business-challenges/\n[30]: /industries/\n[31]: /resources/\n[32]: /podcasts/\n[33]: /blog/\n[34]: /faq/\n[35]: /research/\n[36]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[37]: /stories/\n[38]: /stories/case-studies/\n[39]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[40]: /about-us/\n[41]: /about-us/our-people/\n[42]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[43]: /about-us/csr/\n[44]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[45]: /events/\n[46]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[47]: /events/events-gallery/\n[48]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[49]: /careers/\n[50]: /careers/internships/\n[51]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[52]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[53]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[54]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[55]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[56]: /privacy-policy/"
