            "url": "https://trginternational.com/solutions/great-people-inside/gr8-engagement/",
            "text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\n[bg-decor]\nGreat People Inside Assessments\n\n# GR8 Engagement\n\nGR8 Engagement - the ultimate tool you will ever need for development, talent management, retention,\nhigh performance and engagement\n[icon]\n\nSurvey Type: Many people will be asked to give feedback for an individual.\n\n[icon]\n\nAverage 30 minutes to complete the survey\n\n[hero image]\n[Hero section featured image]\n\n#### Available Dimensions\n\nSolutions for:\n\n#### Available Dimensions\n\nTRG has an extensive assessment library with hundreds of dimensions that can be leveraged in\ncreating a custom skills-based assessment that supports your organisation\u2019s specific competencies\nand unique vision. Whatever the challenge you are facing, we aim to provide a great experience to\nhelp you in the best way we can.\n\nTo use this assessment solution, just simply fill out the form on the right and request a demo to\nknow how we offer you a total-person view of a candidate/employee.\n\nSolutions for:\nTraining & Development\n][11][\nRecruitment\n][12][\nRetention & Engagement\n][13]\n\n#### Coaching:\n\nDevelopment | Team Motivation\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Flexibility:\n\nSituational Adaptability | Innovation\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Organisational Connectivity:\n\nWork Relationships | Teamwork\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Leadership:\n\nIntegrity | Guidance | Task Delegation\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Process Management:\n\nResource Use Efficiency | Professionalism\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Performance:\n\nInitiative and Problem Solving | Goal Orientation\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Communications:\n\nActive Listening | Information Analysis | Straightforward Communication\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Self-development:\n\nCommitment | Continuous Development\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Engagement and Vision:\n\nVision | Power of Example | Empathy | Succession Planning\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Team Spirit:\n\nInterdisciplinary Approach | Cooperation | Open Communication | Conflict Management\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Openness to change:\n\nCreative Thinking | New Technology | Focus on the Essentials | Change Management\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Responsibility:\n\nCourage | Responsibility and Empowerment | Risk Prevention | Performance Management\n\n[icon]\n\n#### Commercial Strategy:\n\nCreative Marketing | Client Orientation | Adapting to Client Needs | Risk Management\n\n[icon]\n\n### RESOURCES\n\nLatest resources for **GR8 Engagement**\n\n[View All Resources[icon]][14]\nThu, Jan 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][15][\nThu, Jul 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][16][\nTue, Jun 11, 2024\nDownload[icon]\n\n#### Compare On-premises vs. Multi-tenant Cloud for CFO\n\nDiscover how cloud-based financial applications compare to on-premises solutions\n][17]\n\n#### Try The Assessment\n\nThe relationship between engagement and professional performance has been explored at length by\nwell-known experts such as Wilmar Schaufeli and Dale Carnegie. Their research clearly shows that the\nmore people care about what they\u2019re doing, the better they will perform at their respective jobs.\nThis is due to the fact that when employees are more engaged in their work, they tend to be more\ncommitted in their job and to the company\u2019s goals. Thus, a better financial performance for the\ncompany. As well as, allowing for a better employee retention.\n\nHowever, employee engagement could be difficult to maintain. Not knowing which ways are the most\neffective in capturing the attention of your employees could be a waste of time and money. GR8\nEngagement provides a solution for this. With GR8 Engagement, you can identify and measure specific\nvalues such as emotional attachment, enthusiasm and dedication, all of which factor in a person\u2019s\nlevel of involvement at work.\n\n#### Benefits of using GR8 Engagement assessment:\n* High performance\n* Improved engagement\n* Achievement of business goals\n* Employee retention\n* Stronger employer brand\n* Talent management and development\n* Increased wellbeing at work\n\n## GR8 Customised\n\n### Provides a unique assessment for your company; You can create one through a simple\n### choose-and-pick exercise in our library of 100+ dimensions. The GR8PI platform is so extensive\n### that you will be impressed by the number of aspects we can measure.\n\n### INDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\nTRG has implemented technology solutions for industries like financial services, not-for-profit, and\nenergy, oil, and gas, our custom configuration makes it well-suited for many other vertical markets\nas well. This adaptability is one of the key reasons why various industries choose us for their\nsolution requirements.\n\n[icon][image]\n[Financial Services][18][Manufacturing][19][insurance][20][Energy][21][Real\nEstate][22][Healthcare][23][Education][24]\n\n### OUR CLIENT\n\nSome of our satisfied customers we helped with their Talent Management assessments needs.\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n* [logo]\n\nbuild at: 2026-06-28T02:07:40.626Z\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][25][[facebook]][26][[youtube]][27]\n[Solutions][28]\n[TRG Solutions][29][Business Challenges][30][Industries][31]\n[Resources][32]\n[Podcasts][33][Blog][34][FAQ][35][Research Portal][36][TRG End-User Training][37]\n[Stories][38]\n[Case Studies][39][CEO Letters][40]\n[About us][41]\n[Our People][42][Awards][43][TRG Cares][44][Testimonials][45]\n[Events][46]\n[Become our Speaker][47][Events Gallery][48][Hire our venue][49]\n[Careers][50]\n[Internships][51][Internships Partners][52]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][53][[facebook]][54][[Youtube Play Button]][55]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][56][Privacy Policy][57]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /about-us/\n[8]: /careers/\n[9]: /watch-demo/\n[10]: /contacts-and-locations/\n[11]: /business-challenges/talent-management/training-development/\n[12]: /business-challenges/talent-management/recruitment/\n[13]: /business-challenges/talent-management/retention-engagement/\n[14]: /\n[15]: /\n[16]: /\n[17]: /\n[18]: /industries/financial-services/\n[19]: /industries/manufacturing/\n[20]: /industries/insurance/\n[21]: /industries/energy/\n[22]: /industries/real-estate/\n[23]: /industries/healthcare/\n[24]: /solutions/education/\n[25]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[26]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[27]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational_official\n[28]: /solutions/\n[29]: /solutions/\n[30]: /business-challenges/\n[31]: /industries/\n[32]: /resources/\n[33]: /podcasts/\n[34]: /blog/\n[35]: /faq/\n[36]: /research/\n[37]: /trg-end-user-training/\n[38]: /stories/\n[39]: /stories/case-studies/\n[40]: /stories/business-as-unusual/\n[41]: /about-us/\n[42]: /about-us/our-people/\n[43]: /about-us/our-awards/\n[44]: /about-us/csr/\n[45]: /about-us/client-testimonials/\n[46]: /events/\n[47]: /events/become-our-speaker/\n[48]: /events/events-gallery/\n[49]: https://pjscoffeevietnam.com/catering\n[50]: /careers/\n[51]: /careers/internships/\n[52]: /careers/internship-partners/\n[53]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/trg-international/?originalSubdomain=sg\n[54]: https://www.facebook.com/TRGInternational/?locale=vi_VN\n[55]: https://www.youtube.com/@trginternational3812\n[56]: /terms-and-conditions/\n[57]: /privacy-policy/"
