ions.\n\n10+ Industry Verticals\nExpertise in BFSI, Pharma &amp; Healthcare, Government, ITES, Manufacturing, Real Estate, Media, and Mid-Market Businesses.\n\n35+ Comprehensive IT Solutions\nA diverse portfolio covering everything from cloud computing to cybersecurity, addressing every IT need.\n\n300+ years of combined leadership expertise\nA leadership team that brings unparalleled insights and experience to drive success.\n\n25+ Years of Excellence\nMore than 25 years of expertise in delivering innovative IT solutions that empower businesses to thrive.\n\n2500+ Happy Clients\nTrusted by thousands of clients across diverse industries, ensuring reliable partnerships and lasting relationships.\n\n12+ Offices\n10 offices in India and 32 franchises globally. Offices in Singapore and Dubai serve APAC and EMEA regions.\n\n10+ Industry Verticals\nExpertise in BFSI, Pharma &amp; Healthcare, Government, ITES, Manufacturing, Real Estate, Media, and Mid-Market Businesses.\n\n35+ Comprehensive IT Solutions\nA diverse portfolio covering everything from cloud computing to cybersecurity, addressing every IT need.\n\n300+ years of combined leadership expertise\nA leadership team that brings unparalleled insights and experience to drive success.\n\nOrient Edge, Your Competitive Edge in IT\nStay ahead with the latest trends, innovations, and expert perspectives.\n\nRead Story\n\nOverengineered IT, Oversized Carbon Footprint\n\nRead Story\n\nGreen Cloud: The Next Frontier of Optimization\n\nRead More\n\nIT Infrastructure &amp; Application Services\n\nCloud &amp; DevOps\nUnlock the full potential of the cloud for scalability, flexibility, and security.\n\nLearn More\n\nDigital Transformation\nTransforming your business with AI, RPA, and cutting-edge digital solutions.\n\nLearn More\n\nInfrastructure Managed Services (IMS)\nDelivering optimized managed services to enhance business operations.\n\nLearn More\n\nToss\nOutcome-focused IT services delivered end-to-end under a unified SLA model.\n\nLearn More\n\nIT Infrastructure Solutions\n\nCyber Security\nProtect your organization with scalable, resilient, and future-ready security systems.\n\nLearn More\n\nData Centre Solutions\nTransform your IT infrastructure with tailored, high-performance solutions that ensure resilience, scalability, and cost efficiency.\n\nLearn More\n\nEnd User Computing\nUnlock seamless productivity and secure collaboration with customizable end-user devices and centralized management platforms.\n\nLearn More\n\nBuild trust with real-world results\n\nEnergy Enterprise Endpoint Modernization &amp; Digital Workplace Transformation\nLearn how Orient Technologies modernized endpoint infrastructure for a leading energy enterprise, enabling secure mobility, hybrid work, standardized device management, and digital workplace transformation.\nView Case Study\n\nHow a Leading Energy Enterprise Modernized Endpoint Management\nSee how Orient Technologies helped a large energy enterprise modernize 3,000+ endpoints with a scalable DaaS model, reducing CAPEX pressure and improving lifecycle governance.\nView Case Study\n\nTransforming Housing Finance Operations with Secure, Scalable AWS Managed Services\nDelivering 24x7 operational excellence, compliance-ready security, and continuous cost optimization for a high-growth NBFC\nView Case Study\n\nPrism Johnson Group Partners with Orient Technologies\nAccelerate Secure Cloud Transformation, SAP Modernization &amp; 24\u00d77 Managed Operations\nView Case Study\n\nSBM Bank India successfully modernized its digital platform\nThe transformation enabled the bank to deliver secure, scalable, and high-performance digital banking services, while maintaining strict regulatory compliance and improving operational efficiency.\nView Case Study\n\nAwards &amp; Recognition\n\nBest System Integrator\nVarindia\n\nPartner Advisory Board\nNutanix\n\nRegional Partner of the Year WEST\nNutanix\n\nData Center Partner\nlenevo\n\nAccelerate Partnership\nhpe\n\nBest Coverage Performance FY&#x27;22\nHPE / Intel / Microsoft\n\nBest Performance FY&#x27;21\nHPE &amp; Nutanix\n\nBest Performance FY&#x27;22\nHPE &amp; Nutanix\n\nFlying Ace Partner (SMB Customers)\n\nHCL Premier Partner\nHCL\n\nBest Customer Retention &amp; Satisfaction Award\nFortinet\n\nQ2 2021 Elite Partner Connect (Forging Partnership)\nFortinet\n\nBest Partner Cloud Business West India\nFortinet\n\nTop IT Solution Provide of India Award 2022\nDell Technologies &amp; Iris Global\n\nAWS APN Excellence Award\nAWS\n\nAWS APN Excellense Award\nAWS\n\nOur Clients\n\nFAQ\nYou ask, we answer\n\nCloud Services\nCyber Security\nData Center Solutions\nDigital Transformation\nEnd User Computing\nIMS\n\nWhat kind of networking and content delivery solutions does Orient Technologies Limited offer?\n\nOrient Technologies Limited offers a range of networking and content delivery network solutions.\n\nWhat industries do you cater to?\n\nWe provide Cloud services to a wide range of industries, including Pharmaceutical, Healthcare, BFSI, ITeS, Government-PSU and more.\n\nHow can a company prepare for cloud to cloud migration?\n\nA company can prepare for cloud to cloud migration by performing a comprehensive inventory of its current infrastructure, data, and applications, identifying potential compatibility issues or data migration challenges, selecting a compatible cloud provider, and developing a migration plan that includes testing and risk management measures\n\nHow can a company ensure data security during cloud to cloud migration?\n\nA company can ensure data security during cloud to cloud migration by using encryption and secure transfer protocols, implementing access controls and user authentication measures, and performing regular security audits and risk assessments.\n\nHow can Orient Technologies Limited help us migrate our existing applications and data to the cloud?\n\nOur team of experts can assist you with the planning, execution, and testing of your migration to the cloud. We also offer automated tools and services to help you migrate your applications and data quickly and ef [[Orient blue logo][Orient white logo]][1]\nOfferings\nIT Infrastructure & Application Services\nCloud & DevOps\n][2]\nDigital Transformation\n][3]\nInfrastructure Managed Services (IMS)\n][4]\nToss\n][5]\nIT Infrastructure solutions\nCyber Security\n][6]\nData Centre Solutions\n][7]\nEnd User Computing\n][8]\n[About Us][9][Partners][10][Orient Edge][11][Careers][12][Investor Relations][13]\nContact Us\n][14]\n[[Orient blue logo]][15]\nOfferings\nIT Infrastructure & Application Services\nCloud & DevOps\n][16]\nDigital Transformation\n][17]\nInfrastructure Managed Services (IMS)\n][18]\nToss\n][19]\nIT Infrastructure solutions\nCyber Security\n][20]\nData Centre Solutions\n][21]\nEnd User Computing\n][22]\n[About Us][23][Partners][24][Orient Edge][25][Careers][26][Investor Relation][27]\nContact us\n][28]\n[Mission img]\nMission\n\n# Empowering businesses through innovative, customer-focused and tailored solutions\n\nVision\n\n## To be the global leader in transformative IT solutions\n\n[Vision image]\nKey Milestones\n1997\nIncorporation of Orient Technologies.\n2000\nFormation of DCS as a business unit.\n2001-02\nStrengthened presence in the Western region with Pune office and expanded to the South with\nBangalore office.\n2003\nFormation of ITeS as a business unit.\n2004\nExpanded to the North (Delhi) and further in the West (Ahmedabad).\n2005\nStarted Virtualization as a practice.\n2007\nOpened office in Chennai.\n2009\nIntroduced Cybersecurity Solutions.\n2011\nEstablished Cloud Practice.\n2013\nTransitioned towards Digital Transformation.\n2016\nBecame one of the pioneering partners for Nutanix in India for HCI solutions.\n2018\nMarked international expansion with an office in Singapore.\n2024\nListed on BSE & NSE.\n\n#### Phase zero\n\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Donec id placerat ipsum, in placerat dui.\nVestibulum a