se interdum finibus maximus.\n\n#### Phase 3\n\n[Vertical divider]\nLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Donec id placerat ipsum, in placerat dui.\nVestibulum ante ipsum primis in faucibus orci luctus et ultrices posuere cubilia curae; Fusce mattis\nlaoreet enim, id convallis felis volutpat et. Phasellus feugiat molestie lorem, et bibendum risus\nfringilla vitae. Aliquam feugiat vitae ante vitae sodales. In finibus semper tristique. Nunc luctus\nest ipsum, eget ultricies lectus rutrum in. Suspendisse interdum finibus maximus.\nTEAM\n\n### Founders\n\n[Ajay sawant sir img]\nAjay Baliram Sawant\nChairman & Managing Director\n[Jayesh Shah sir img]\nJayesh Manharlal Shah\nWhole-Time Director\n[Ujjwal Mhatre sir img]\nUjjwal Arvind Mhatre\nWhole-Time Director\n[Umesh shah sir img]\nUmesh Navnitlal Shah\nWhole-Time Director\n\n### Leaders\n\n[Shri hari sir img]\nShrihari Bhat\nChief Executive Officer\n[Yash maan img]\nYashashree Parab\nChief Sales Officer\n[suresh sir img]\nSuresh Bachwani\nChief Technology Officer\n[Gourav sir img]\nGourav Modi\nChief Finance Officer\n[ridhima maam img]\nRidhima Sawant\nChief Transformation Officer\n\n### Operational Team\n\n[Alkesh sir img]\nAlkesh Wandre\nHead: Finance\n[shailesh sir img]\nShailesh Mandani\nFinancial Controller\n[rajendra sir img]\nRajendra Karad\nSr. AGM: Services\n[manasi maam img ]\nMansi Sawant\nHead: People & Culture\n[smita maam img]\nSmita Shinde\nAlliance Manager\n[vishal sir img]\nVishal Hendre\nHead: Projects\n\n### Advisory Team\n\n[Jagdish sir img]\nJagdish Vartak\nVice President Sales\n[Vaibhav sir img]\nVaibhav Patkar\nChief Info. Security Officer\n\n### Driving Innovation Across Sectors\n\nBFSI\nRobust systems enabling seamless financial operations.\nPharma & Healthcare\nIntelligent tools enhancing patient outcomes.\nGovernment\nAgile platforms powering public service delivery.\nMid-Market Businesses\nReliable uptime to keep your message accessible\nMedia & Communications\nDynamic platforms driving audience reach.\nReal Estate\nDigital solutions optimizing property transactions.\nManufacturing\nInnovative systems transforming production cycles.\nITeS\nSmart integrations boosting operational efficiency.\nFAQ\n\n## You ask, we answer\n\nCloud Services\nCyber Security\nData Center Solutions\nDigital Transformation\nEnd User Computing\nIMS\nWhat kind of networking and content delivery solutions does Orient Technologies Limited offer?\n\nOrient Technologies Limited offers a range of networking and content delivery network solutions.\n\nWhat industries do you cater to?\n\nWe provide Cloud services to a wide range of industries, including Pharmaceutical, Healthcare, BFSI,\nITeS, Government-PSU and more.\n\nHow can a company prepare for cloud to cloud migration?\n\nA company can prepare for cloud to cloud migration by performing a comprehensive inventory of its\ncurrent infrastructure, data, and applications, identifying potential compatibility issues or data\nmigration challenges, selecting a compatible cloud provider, and developing a migration plan that\nincludes testing and risk management measures\n\nHow can a company ensure data security during cloud to cloud migration?\n\nA company can ensure data security during cloud to cloud migration by using encryption and secure\ntransfer protocols, implementing access controls and user authentication measures, and performing\nregular security audits and risk assessments.\n\nHow can Orient Technologies Limited help us migrate our existing applications and data to the cloud?\n\nOur team of experts can assist you with the planning, execution, and testing of your migration to\nthe cloud. We also offer automated tools and services to help you migrate your applications and data\nquickly and efficiently.\n\nWhat sets your cybersecurity solutions apart from competitors?\n\nFull-spectrum Cybersecurity Solutions - From Cybersecurity Awareness, endpoint security to Cloud\nSecurity and everything in between, Proactive threat intelligence, reducing vulnerabilities before\nthey escalate, Customizable security layers based on your unique business needs, Strategic\nconsulting through vCISO services, ensuring leadership-driven security frameworks, Cost-effective\nscalability, offering enterprise-level security to businesses of all sizes.\n\nWhat\u2019s the ROI of inv"
