            "url": "https://orientindia.in/case-studies/prism-johnson-group-partners",
            "text": "[[Orient blue logo][Orient white logo]][1]\nOfferings\nIT Infrastructure & Application Services\nCloud & DevOps\n][2]\nDigital Transformation\n][3]\nInfrastructure Managed Services (IMS)\n][4]\nToss\n][5]\nIT Infrastructure solutions\nCyber Security\n][6]\nData Centre Solutions\n][7]\nEnd User Computing\n][8]\n[About Us][9][Partners][10][Orient Edge][11][Careers][12][Investor Relations][13]\nContact Us\n][14]\n[[Orient blue logo]][15]\nOfferings\nIT Infrastructure & Application Services\nCloud & DevOps\n][16]\nDigital Transformation\n][17]\nInfrastructure Managed Services (IMS)\n][18]\nToss\n][19]\nIT Infrastructure solutions\nCyber Security\n][20]\nData Centre Solutions\n][21]\nEnd User Computing\n][22]\n[About Us][23][Partners][24][Orient Edge][25][Careers][26][Investor Relation][27]\nContact us\n][28]\nDiversified enterprise (Building Materials / Construction-related businesses)\n\n# Prism Johnson Group Partners with Orient Technologies to Accelerate Secure Cloud Transformation,\n# SAP Modernization & 24\u00d77 Managed Operations\n\nAccelerate Secure Cloud Transformation, SAP Modernization & 24\u00d77 Managed Operations\n\nBusiness Overview\nPrism Johnson Group, a diversified enterprise with complex IT and ERP landscapes, embarked on a\nmulti-year transformation journey\u2014migrating from on-premises environments to cloud, modernizing SAP\nworkloads, strengthening cybersecurity posture, and institutionalizing operational governance.\n\nOver the last five years, Orient Technologies Ltd. has served as a strategic and execution-focused\ntransformation partner, delivering:\n* On-prem to Cloud migration & ongoing Cloud Managed Services\n* Infrastructure & OS-level 24\u00d77 operations\n* Cybersecurity services aligned to governance and best practices\n* SAP Basis support ensuring continuity and performance\n* FinOps for cost governance and cloud optimization\n* Database management across Oracle and Microsoft SQL Server\n* Support for group companies:\n* HR Johnson: On-prem SAP migration to Cloud SAP\n* RMC & Prism Cement: SAP migration to RAMCO\n\nAs Prism Johnson\u2019s technology landscape expanded across business units, Orient\u2019s outcome-driven\nmodel helped ensure stability, security, and measurable operational maturity\u2014without overstatement\nand with a strong emphasis on accountability.\n\n## The Challenges\n\nPrism Johnson\u2019s transformation required balancing innovation with continuity. The core challenges\nincluded:\n\n**1) Cloud Transformation Without Disruption**\n\nMigrating from on-premises infrastructure to cloud required disciplined planning, security controls,\nand governance\u2014while ensuring business-critical services stayed available.\n\n**2) SAP & ERP Continuity at Enterprise Scale**\n\nERP environments are highly sensitive to downtime and performance degradation. Prism needed:\n* Reliable **SAP Basis** support\n* Strong orchestration across multiple workloads and group company transitions\n* Predictable service delivery during migrations and steady-state operations\n\n**3) Strengthening Cybersecurity & Resilience**\n\nAs workloads moved to the cloud and infrastructure became more distributed, Prism required a\nsecurity-first approach aligned to best practices, with measurable operational maturity.\n\n**4) Cost Governance and Optimization (FinOps)**\n\nCloud adoption can increase agility\u2014yet unmanaged cloud spend can escalate. Prism required\nstructured **FinOps** governance, visibility, and optimization.\n\n**5) 24\u00d77 Operations for Business Continuity**\n\nPrism required a dependable 24\u00d77 model to ensure:\n* Infrastructure stability\n* Timely incident response\n* Controlled change management\n* Performance and availability outcomes\n\n## Why Prism Johnson Chose Orient Technologies\n\nPrism needed more than a vendor; they needed a partner who could deliver under real-world enterprise\nconditions\u2014with consistency, accountability, and structured execution.\n\nOrient brought together:\n* A disciplined managed services framework\n* Strong governance and security alignment\n* SAP + infrastructure delivery depth\n* Outcome-driven engagement model\n* Leadership involvement and transparency\n\n## The Solutions\n\n**A) Cloud Migration & Cloud Managed Services**\n\nOrient supported Prism\u2019s transition from on-premises infrastructure to cloud with a structured\napproach covering planning, migration execution, and steady-state operations.\n\n**Key capabilities delivered:**\n* Cloud operations and governance\n* Security-first cloud practices\n* Ongoing operational stability and continuous improvement\n\nPrism specifically highlighted Orient\u2019s \u201cstructured, disciplined and security-conscious approach to\ncloud operations\u2026 aligned with established best practices and governance models.\u201d\n\n**B) Infrastructure & 24\u00d77 OS-Level Operations**\n\nOrient provided round-the-clock operational support to ensure platform resilience and uninterrupted\nbusiness services.\n\n**Coverage included:**\n* 24\u00d77 monitoring & incident response\n* OS-level support and reliability engineering\n* Operational rigor supporting business continuity\n\n**C) Cybersecurity Services**\n\nOrient supported Prism\u2019s cybersecurity and resilience objectives through security-conscious\noperations and governance alignment.\n\n**Focus areas included:**\n* Security operational alignment to best practices\n* Ongoing security posture support as workloads evolved\n* Resilience-focused operational maturity\n\n**D) SAP Basis Support & ERP Continuity**\n\nOrient ensured SAP environments remained stable, available, and performant across transformation and\nsteady-state operations.\n\n**Delivered outcomes:**\n* Reliable SAP Basis support\n* Predictable delivery and service oversight\n* Business continuity enablement through operational readiness\n\n**E) Database Management (Oracle + SQL)**\n\nOrient managed databases across **Oracle** and **Microsoft SQL Server**, ensuring performance\nstability and reliable operations at scale.\n\n**F) FinOps (Cloud Financial Operations)**\n\nOrient enabled governance and optimization mechanisms to align cloud spend with business value.\n\n**FinOps outcomes typically include:**\n* Visibility into cost drivers\n* Optimization recommendations and guardrails\n* Governance mechanisms that evolve with adoption\n\n## The Solutions\n\nOrient Technologies designed and executed a phased engagement spanning transformation and ongoing\noperations across Prism Johnson Group.\n\n## Group Company Transformations Supported\n\nOrient\u2019s engagement extended beyond Prism Johnson Limited to group companies\u2014amplifying\ntransformation impact across the organization.\n\n1) HR Johnson: On-Prem SAP to Cloud SAP\n\nOrient supported HR Johnson with the migration of on-prem SAP workloads to Cloud SAP, ensuring\ncontinuity and a structured modernization approach.\n\n2) RMC & Prism Cement: SAP Migration to RAMCO\n\nOrient supported RMC and Prism Cement in migrating SAP to RAMCO, enabling the group to advance ERP\nmodernization objectives in line with business needs.\n\n## Operating Model\n\nA key differentiator highlighted by Prism was Orient\u2019s approach:\n* Outcome-driven execution over tool-centric delivery\n* Disciplined governance and structured operating rhythm\n* Operational maturity demonstrated through 24\u00d77 readiness and responsiveness\n* Leadership visibility and customer trust-building engagement\n\n## The Results\n\nWhile exact metrics weren\u2019t provided, this engagement clearly delivered enterprise-grade outcomes\nacross these value themes:\n\n1) Stronger Operational Stability\n* Reliable managed services across cloud, infrastructure, SAP, and databases\n* Reduced risk of downtime through structured service operations\n\n2) Improved Security and Governance Alignment\n* Security-conscious operations aligned to governance best practices\n* Resilience-focused engagement model\n\n3) Sustained Business Continuity\n* 24\u00d77 support model supporting uninterrupted operations\n* Mature incident response and service oversight\n\n4) Cloud Optimization and Cost Governance\n* FinOps structure for cost management and optimization\n* Ongoing roadmap for evolving cloud capabilities\n\n## Customer Voice (LinkedIn Excerpt Provided by Customer)\n\nThe Group CIO publicly acknowledged Orient Technologies\u2019 performance over five years, emphasizing\noperational rigor, security-conscious delivery, and leadership engagement:\n\n\u201cFrom the perspective of a long-standing customer, the true measure of a technology partner lies in\nconsistency, accountability and the ability to deliver under real-world enterprise conditions. Over\nthe last five years, Orient Technologies Ltd. has demonstrated these qualities while supporting\nPrism Johnson Limited across critical technology domains.\u201d\n\n\u201cWorking with Orient Technologies as an AWS Advanced Tier Services Partner, we have experienced a\nstructured, disciplined and security-conscious approach to cloud operations\u2026 aligned with\nestablished best practices and governance models.\u201d\n\n\u201cIn addition to cloud initiatives, Orient Technologies has provided reliable ERP support and\nround-the-clock OS-level infrastructure operations, enabling uninterrupted business continuity.\u201d\n\n\u201cTheir 24\u00d77 support model, responsiveness and operational maturity have contributed meaningfully to\nplatform resilience and performance.\u201d\n\nThe CIO further recognized leadership interactions and key contributors, citing clarity of\ndirection, execution discipline, and a strong emphasis on long-term customer trust.\n\n## What Made This Partnership Work\n\nKey Success Factors\n1. Consistency over time (multi-year delivery stability)\n2. Operational rigor (structured governance + 24\u00d77 model)\n3. Security-first mindset (disciplined and conscious approach)\n4. Outcome orientation (business results prioritized over tools)\n5. Leadership engagement (visibility, accountability, and trust)\n\n## Looking Ahead\n\nAs enterprise environments continue to evolve, Prism and Orient\u2019s partnership is positioned to drive\nfurther modernization across:\n* Cloud capability maturity and standardization\n* Security and cyber resilience strengthening\n* Continuous performance and optimization improvements\n* FinOps maturity and governance automation\n* Ongoing modernization of ERP and adjacent workloads\n\nFAQ\n\n## You ask, we answer\n\nCloud Services\nCyber Security\nData Center Solutions\nDigital Transformation\nEnd User Computing\nIMS\nWhat kind of networking and content delivery solutions does Orient Technologies Limited offer?\n\nOrient Technologies Limited offers a range of networking and content delivery network solutions.\n\nWhat industries do you cater to?\n\nWe provide Cloud services to a wide range of industries, including Pharmaceutical, Healthcare, BFSI,\nITeS, Government-PSU and more.\n\nHow can a company prepare for cloud to cloud migration?\n\nA company can prepare for cloud to cloud migration by performing a comprehensive inventory of its\ncurrent infrastructure, data, and applications, identifying potential compatibility issues or data\nmigration challenges, selecting a compatible cloud provider, and developing a migration plan that\nincludes testing and risk management measures\n\nHow can a company ensure data security during cloud to cloud migration?\n\nA company can ensure data security during cloud to cloud migration by using encryption and secure\ntransfer protocols, implementing access controls and user authentication measures, and performing\nregular security audits and risk assessments.\n\nHow can Orient Technologies Limited help us migrate our existing applications and data to the cloud?\n\nOur team of experts can assist you with the planning, execution, and testing of your migration to\nthe cloud. We also offer automated tools and services to help you migrate your applications and data\nquickly and efficiently.\n\nWhat sets your cybersecurity solutions apart from competitors?\n\nFull-spectrum Cybersecurity Solutions - From Cybersecurity Awareness, endpoint security to Cloud\nSecurity and everything in between, Proactive threat intelligence, reducing vulnerabilities before\nthey escalate, Customizable security layers based on your unique business needs, Strategic\nconsulting through vCISO services, ensuring leadership-driven security frameworks, Cost-effe"
