            "url": "https://orientindia.in/case-studies/sbm-bank-india",
            "text": "[[Orient blue logo][Orient white logo]][1]\nOfferings\nIT Infrastructure & Application Services\nCloud & DevOps\n][2]\nDigital Transformation\n][3]\nInfrastructure Managed Services (IMS)\n][4]\nToss\n][5]\nIT Infrastructure solutions\nCyber Security\n][6]\nData Centre Solutions\n][7]\nEnd User Computing\n][8]\n[About Us][9][Partners][10][Orient Edge][11][Careers][12][Investor Relations][13]\nContact Us\n][14]\n[[Orient blue logo]][15]\nOfferings\nIT Infrastructure & Application Services\nCloud & DevOps\n][16]\nDigital Transformation\n][17]\nInfrastructure Managed Services (IMS)\n][18]\nToss\n][19]\nIT Infrastructure solutions\nCyber Security\n][20]\nData Centre Solutions\n][21]\nEnd User Computing\n][22]\n[About Us][23][Partners][24][Orient Edge][25][Careers][26][Investor Relation][27]\nContact us\n][28]\nBanking & Financial Services (BFSI)\n\n# SBM Bank India successfully modernized its digital banking platform by partnering with Orient\n# Technologies as its AWS Cloud Managed Service Provider.\n\nThe transformation enabled the bank to deliver secure, scalable, and high-performance digital\nbanking services, while maintaining strict regulatory compliance and improving operational\nefficiency.\n\nBusiness Overview\nSBM Bank India, a fast-growing universal bank, required a robust, scalable, and compliant cloud\nenvironment to support both regulatory and non-regulatory workloads. With increasing digital\nadoption and cross-border banking operations, the bank needed to modernize its infrastructure while\nensuring high availability, security, and cost transparency.\nOrient Technologies, as an AWS Managed Service Provider (MSP), implemented a secure AWS Landing\nZone, 24x7 managed operations, and governance frameworks, enabling SBM to scale efficiently while\nmaintaining compliance with BFSI regulations.\n\nThrough AWS adoption and managed services, SBM achieved:\n\u2022 Enhanced application availability and uptime\n\u2022 Improved customer digital experience\n\u2022 Centralized security and compliance controls\n\u2022 Optimized cloud cost governance\n\n## The Challenges\n\nAs AWS Cloud adoption grew, SBM needed a mature operating model to ensure reliability and governance\nat scale. Key challenges included:\n\n1. Operational Stability at Scale\n* Rapid growth in digital banking transactions required high availability architecture\n* Need for auto-scaling infrastructure to handle peak loads\n* Legacy systems limiting agility and performance\n\n2. Security and ComplianceAlignment\n* Enforcing security best practices across AWS services\n* Continuous monitoring for risks and misconfigurations\n* Strict regulatory requirements from RBI and global banking standards\n* Need for:\n\n- Data protection and encryption\n\n- Continuous monitoring and auditreadiness\n\n- Centralized security governance\n\n3. Cost Visibility andOptimization\n* Managing cloud costs as workloads expanded\n* Identifying optimization opportunities without impacting performance\n* Establishing governance around consumption and usage patterns\n* Lack of granular visibility into cloud consumption\n* Over-provisioning risks leading to cost inefficiencies\n* Need for FinOps practices and cost allocation models\n\n4. 24x7 Support and Reliability\n* Always-on operations to support business-critical lending systems\n* Predictable management change and controlled releases\n* Banking workloads require zero downtime tolerance\n* Need for:\n\n- Continuous monitoring\n\n- Incident management andresponse\n\n- Proactive issue resolution\n\n## Why State Bank of Mauritius Chose Orient Technologies\n\nSBM required more than reactive support they needed a structured, accountable managed services\npartner with strong AWS expertise and operational discipline.\n\nOrient Technologies was selected for:\n* Proven AWS managed services capability\n* Strong experience in banking and financial services workloads\n* Understanding of regulatory compliance (RBI, PCI-DSS, etc.)\n* Security first and compliance-aware operating approach\n* Strong governance and service management framework\n* Outcome-driven engagement model\n* Leadership involvement and transparent communication\n\n## The Solutions\n\nA) AWS Infrastructure & Application Operations\n* 24x7 monitoring of AWS workloads\n* Proactive Incident, problem and event management and resolution\n* Performance tuning and capacity planning\n\nB) Security & Governance\n* Implementation of AWS Landing Zone and governance\n\n- AWS Organizations \u2013Multi-account governance (25+ accounts)\n\n- AWS Control Tower \u2013 Landing zone orchestration and guardrails\n\n- AWS IAM / IAM Identity Center \u2013Role-based access and SSO\n\n- AWS Config \u2013 Continuous compliance monitoring\n\n- AWS Cloud Trail \u2013 Centralized audit logging\n\n- Amazon Cloud Watch \u2013 Monitoring and alerting\n* Network & Security Architecture\n\n- Amazon VPC \u2013 Segmented network architecture\n\n- AWS Transit Gateway \u2013Hub-and-spoke connectivity model\n\n- AWS Direct Connect /Site-to-Site VPN \u2013 Hybrid connectivity\n\n- AWS WAF \u2013 Web application firewall\n\n- Fortinet FortiGate (NGFW on EC2)\n\n- Deep packet inspection\n\n- IPS/IDS, URL filtering\n\n- North-South & East-West traffic control\n\n- Security Groups & NACLs \u2013Network-level access control\n* Continuous security monitoring and alerting\n* Best-practice configuration baselines\n* Ongoing posture reviews aligned to financial services expectations\n* Integration with AWS security services (WAF, Guard Duty, Security Hub)\n\nC) Backup, Resilience & Availability\n* Managed backup policies and validation\n* Periodic backup drills and testing\n* HA and failover readiness across critical components\n* Operational readiness to support business continuity\n\nD) Cost Governance (FinOps)\n* Visibility into AWS cost drivers\n* Rightsizing and utilization optimization\n* Savings Plans / Reserved Instances strategy\n* Governance mechanisms as workloads evolve\n\nE) Change, Patch & Release Management\n* Controlled change processes\n* OS and platform-level patching\n* Predictable maintenance windows\n\n## The Solutions\n\nOrient designed and operates a comprehensive AWS Managed Services model tailored to SBM needs.\n\n## The Results\n\nWhile specific metrics are confidential, the managed services engagement has delivered clear value\nacross key dimensions:\n\n1. Improved Platform Stability\n* Increased uptime and availability\n* Reduced production incidents\n* Faster incident resolution through proactive monitoring\n\n2. Strengthened Security & Compliance Posture\n* Consistent enforcement of security best practices\n* Improved readiness for audits and regulatory review\n* Centralized security controls\n* Reduced risk exposure\n\n3. Operational Confidence\n* 24x7 support enabling uninterrupted business operations\n* Reduced dependency on internal teams for routine ops\n* Faster incident resolution\n\n4. Cost Awareness and Optimization\n* Transparent cost visibility on AWS Consumption and spend\n* Ongoing optimization without compromising performance\n\nFAQ\n\n## You ask, we answer\n\nCloud Services\nCyber Security\nData Center Solutions\nDigital Transformation\nEnd User Computing\nIMS\nWhat kind of networking and content delivery solutions does Orient Technologies Limited offer?\n\nOrient Technologies Limited offers a range of networking and content delivery network solutions.\n\nWhat industries do you cater to?\n\nWe provide Cloud services to a wide range of industries, including Pharmaceutical, Healthcare, BFSI,\nITeS, Government-PSU and more.\n\nHow can a company prepare for cloud to cloud migration?\n\nA company can prepare for cloud to cloud migration by performing a comprehensive inventory of its\ncurrent infrastructure, data, and applications, identifying potential compatibility issues or data\nmigration challenges, selecting a compatible cloud provider, and developing a migration plan that\nincludes testing and risk management measures\n\nHow can a company ensure data security during cloud to cloud migration?\n\nA company can ensure data security during cloud to cloud migration by using encryption and secure\ntransfer protocols, implementing access controls and user authentication measures, and performing\nregular security audits and risk assessments.\n\nHow can Orient Technologies Limited help us migrate our existing applications and data to the cloud?\n\nOur team of experts can assist you with the planning, execution, and testing of your migration to\nthe cloud. We also offer automated tools and services to help you migrate your applications and data\nquickly and efficiently.\n\nWhat sets your cybersecurity solutions apart from competitors?\n\nFull-spectrum Cybersecurity Solutions - From Cybersecurity Awareness, endpoint security to Cloud\nSecurity and everything in between, Proactive threat intelligence, reducing vulnerabilities before\nthey escalate, Customizable security layers based on your unique business needs, Strategic\nconsulting through vCISO services, ensuring leadership-driven security frameworks, Cost-effective\nscalability, offering enterprise-level security to businesses of all sizes.\n\nWhat\u2019s the ROI of investing in cybersecurity with Cyber Solutions?\n\nBusinesses that invest in proactive cybersecurity measures reduce breach costs by an average of 70%.\n\nWhat industries benefit the most from your cybersecurity solutions?\n\nHealthcare (PHI - protecting personal health information), Finance (Aligning with regulatory\ncompliances; safeguarding critical information assets), Retail & E-commerce (preventing data theft\nand securing payment systems), Technology (safeguarding intellectual property), SMBs and enterprises\nfacing evolving digital threats.\n\nHow do your solutions ensure compliance with regulations like GDPR, HIPAA, or PCI DSS?\n\nOur solutions are designed with compliance at their core. We offer frameworks and automated tools to\nensure your security practices align with industry regulations, minimizing risk and preventing\ncostly breaches.\n\nHow do you protect remote workforces and endpoints?\n\nThrough advanced Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR) solutions, we secure devices across remote\nenvironments.\n\nHow do I know which cybersecurity service is right for my business?\n\nWe offer a cyber risk assessment and an initial consultation to evaluate your current security\nposture.\n\nCan your solutions integrate with our existing security infrastructure?\n\nYes! Our services are designed to integrate seamlessly with your existing technology stack.\n\nWhat\u2019s the difference between active and passive networking?\n\nActive networking includes powered components like routers and switches. Passive includes cabling\nand non-powered physical elements.\n\nWhat kind of active networking solutions does Orient Technologies Limited offer?\n\nOrient Technologies Limited offers a range of active networking components such as, switches,\nrouters, SD-WAN, and WI-FI.\n\nWhat kind of compute and storage solutions does Orient Technologies Limited offer?\n\nOrient Technologies Limited offers a wide range of compute and storage solutions, including\nvirtualization, servers, storage, HCI, Backup and more.\n\nWhat industries do you cater to?\n\nWe provide Data Center Solutions to a wide range of industries, including Pharmaceutical,\nHealthcare, BFSI, ITeS, Government-PSU and more.\n\nHow can Orient Technologies Limited help us optimize our compute and storage infrastructure?\n\nOur team of experts can analyze your current infrastructure and provide recommendations on how to\noptimize it for better performance, scalability, and cost-effectiveness. We also offer migration\nservices to help you move to a more advanced and efficient infrastructure.\n\nHow can Orient Technologies Limited help us improve our collaboration capabilities?\n\nOur team of experts can analyze your current collaboration infrastructure and provide\nrecommendations on how to improve it for better productivity and efficiency. We also offer training\nand support services to ensure that your team is using the collaboration tools effectively.\n\nWhat types of applications can be created using Power Apps?\n\nPower Apps can be used to create a wide range of applications, including data entry forms,\ndashboards, workflows, and mobile applications.\n\nWhat industries d"
