            "url": "https://orientindia.in/case-studies/insurance-digital-public-infrastructure",
            "text": "[[Orient blue logo][Orient white logo]][1]\nOfferings\nIT Infrastructure & Application Services\nCloud & DevOps\n][2]\nDigital Transformation\n][3]\nInfrastructure Managed Services (IMS)\n][4]\nToss\n][5]\nIT Infrastructure solutions\nCyber Security\n][6]\nData Centre Solutions\n][7]\nEnd User Computing\n][8]\n[About Us][9][Partners][10][Orient Edge][11][Careers][12][Investor Relations][13]\nContact Us\n][14]\n[[Orient blue logo]][15]\nOfferings\nIT Infrastructure & Application Services\nCloud & DevOps\n][16]\nDigital Transformation\n][17]\nInfrastructure Managed Services (IMS)\n][18]\nToss\n][19]\nIT Infrastructure solutions\nCyber Security\n][20]\nData Centre Solutions\n][21]\nEnd User Computing\n][22]\n[About Us][23][Partners][24][Orient Edge][25][Careers][26][Investor Relation][27]\nContact us\n][28]\nInsurance Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI)\n\n# Insurance Digital Public Infrastructure Partners with Orient Technologies to Build Secure,\n# Scalable AWS Cloud Infrastructure\n\nAWS Managed Services and 24x7 Operational Excellence for India\u2019s Unified Digital Insurance Ecosystem\n\nBusiness Overview\nA leading Insurance Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI) initiative, established under regulatory\nguidelines, is building a unified digital insurance ecosystem to deliver seamless, secure, and\naccessible insurance services nationwide.\nAs a large-scale DPI initiative supporting policy issuance, claims servicing, digital policy\nrepositories, e-KYC, consent management, and grievance redressal, the platform requires a highly\nsecure, scalable, resilient, and compliance-driven cloud foundation.\n\nOrient Technologies was engaged to architect and support a robust AWS cloud foundation and landing\nzone. The engagement focuses on enabling a secure multi-account AWS environment, advanced network\nand security frameworks, governance controls, hybrid connectivity, and a resilient Primary and\nDisaster Recovery (PR/DR) architecture\u2014ensuring long-term scalability, high availability, and\nregulatory compliance.\nBusiness Context\n\nA national digital insurance ecosystem designed to connect policyholders, insurers, intermediaries,\nand agents through a unified platform enabling:\n\n\u2022 Insurance purchase and servicing\n\n\u2022 Digital policy repository\n\n\u2022 Real-time claims processing\n\n\u2022 e-KYC and consent management\n\n\u2022 Grievance redressal\n\n\u2022 Interoperable insurance services\n\nTechnology Footprint (High Level)\n\n\u2022 Modernize legacy IT infrastructure\n\n\u2022 Enhance system performance and reliability\n\n\u2022 Strengthen cybersecurity posture\n\n\u2022 Enable scalable and flexible IT architecture\n\n\u2022 Ensure business continuity and disaster recovery\n\n\u2022 Improve visibility across IT systems and operations\n\n\u2022 Support future digital transformation initiatives\n\n## The Challenges\n\nAs a national-scale DPI initiative, the organization required a cloud foundation capable of\nsupporting enterprise-grade security, scalability, resilience, and compliance.\n\n**Key Requirements:**\n\n\u2022 Establish a secure and governed AWS landing zone\n\n\u2022 Support distributed microservices at scale with full observability\n\n\u2022 Enable resilient PR/DR architecture for uninterrupted operations\n\n\u2022 Manage rapid growth while maintaining performance and cost efficiency\n\n**1. Operational Stability at Scale**\n\n\u2022 Ensuring high availability of digital insurance services\n\n\u2022 Handling large transaction volumes across multiple stakeholders\n\n\u2022 Enabling proactive monitoring and rapid incident response\n\n\u2022 Reducing complexity in distributed environments\n\n**2. Security and Compliance Alignment**\n\n\u2022 Enforcing security controls across multi-account AWS environments\n\n\u2022 Meeting regulatory and audit requirements\n\n\u2022 Continuous monitoring for vulnerabilities and misconfigurations\n\n\u2022 Safeguarding sensitive insurance and policyholder data\n\n**3. Application Observability and Microservices Complexity**\n\n\u2022 Achieving end-to-end visibility across distributed systems\n\n\u2022 Monitoring service dependencies and interactions\n\n\u2022 Accelerating root cause analysis\n\n\u2022 Maintaining consistent observability across environments\n\n**4. Cost Visibility and Optimization**\n\n\u2022 Managing cloud costs at scale\n\n\u2022 Establishing governance over resource consumption\n\n\u2022 Optimizing infrastructure without impacting performance\n\n**5. 24x7 Reliability and Business Continuity**\n\n\u2022 Supporting always-on digital services\n\n\u2022 Ensuring resilient DC/DR architecture\n\n\u2022 Maintaining predictable and controlled operations\n\n## Why This Insurance DPI Chose Orient Technologies\n\n\u2022 Proven expertise in AWS cloud and landing zone architecture\n\n\u2022 Security-first and compliance-driven approach\n\n\u2022 Strong governance and operational excellence framework\n\n\u2022 Deep capabilities in observability and microservices enablement\n\n\u2022 DevOps-led delivery model with automation focus\n\n\u2022 Transparent communication and leadership engagement\n\n## The Solutions\n\n**AWS Cloud Foundation**\n\n**A) AWS Infrastructure & Application Operations**\n\n\u2022 24x7 monitoring of cloud workloads\n\n\u2022 Proactive incident detection and resolution\n\n\u2022 Performance and availability management\n\n\u2022 Multi-account landing zone operations\n\n**B) Security & Governance**\n\n\u2022 Centralized security monitoring and alerting\n\n\u2022 AWS Control Tower implementation with governance guardrails\n\n\u2022 Security baseline enforcement\n\n\u2022 Continuous compliance posture assessments\n\n**C) Application Observability**\n\n\u2022 End-to-end application monitoring\n\n\u2022 Distributed tracing across microservices\n\n\u2022 Centralized logging and metrics visibility\n\n\u2022 Proactive performance insights\n\n**D) AWS DevOps & Microservices Enablement**\n\n\u2022 CI/CD pipeline automation\n\n\u2022 Infrastructure as Code (IaC)\n\n\u2022 Containerization and microservices support\n\n\u2022 Automated deployment workflows\n\n**E) Resilience, Backup & Availability**\n\n\u2022 PR/DR architecture design\n\n\u2022 Backup and recovery strategy\n\n\u2022 High availability and failover readiness\n\n\u2022 Business continuity enablement\n\n**F) Cost Governance (FinOps)**\n\n\u2022 Cloud cost visibility and tracking\n\n\u2022 Continuous optimization recommendations\n\n\u2022 Governance frameworks for scalable consumption\n\n## The Solutions\n\nOrient Technologies implemented a comprehensive AWS cloud foundation tailored to the needs of a\nnational-scale Insurance DPI.\n\n## Operating Model\n\n**Outcome-Driven, Not Tool-Driven**\n\n\u2022 Service reliability and accountability\n\n\u2022 Structured governance and reporting\n\n\u2022 Clear ownership and escalation mechanisms\n\n\u2022 Continuous improvement approach\n\n\u2022 Alignment with long-term business growth\n\n## The Results\n\nThe engagement delivered measurable improvements across reliability, security, observability, and\noperational efficiency.\n\n**Measurable Business Impact**\n\n**Improved Platform Stability**\n\n\u2022 Enhanced service availability\n\n\u2022 Faster incident detection and resolution\n\n\u2022 Improved operational resilience\n\n**Strengthened Security & Compliance**\n\n\u2022 Consistent enforcement of security controls\n\n\u2022 Improved regulatory readiness\n\n\u2022 Stronger governance posture\n\n**Enhanced Observability & Operational Confidence**\n\n\u2022 Greater visibility across applications\n\n\u2022 Faster troubleshooting and issue resolution\n\n\u2022 Reduced operational overhead\n\n**Cost Awareness and Optimization**\n\n\u2022 Improved visibility into cloud spending\n\n\u2022 Continuous cost optimization without performance trade-offs\n\n## What Makes This Partnership Work\n\n\u2022 Consistent execution and operational discipline\n\n\u2022 Security-first approach aligned with regulations\n\n\u2022 Strong governance and transparency\n\n\u2022 Focus on business outcomes over tools\n\n\u2022 Automation, DevOps, and observability-led strategy\n\n\u2022 Active leadership involvement\n\n## Looking Ahead\n\nAs the Insurance Digital Public Infrastructure evolves, the partnership continues to enable:\n\n\u2022 Advanced AWS scalability and modernization\n\n\u2022 Enhanced observability and resilience\n\n\u2022 Expansion of microservices and DevOps maturity\n\n\u2022 Continuous improvements in security and governance\n\n\u2022 Ongoing cost optimization and operational excellence\n\nOrient Technologies remains a strategic partner in enabling a secure, resilient, and scalable\ndigital insurance ecosystem, supporting the broader vision of universal insurance accessibility.\n\nFAQ\n\n## You ask, we answer\n\nCloud Services\nCyber Security\nData Center Solutions\nDigital Transformation\nEnd User Computing\nIMS\nWhat kind of networking and content delivery solutions does Orient Technologies Limited offer?\n\nOrient Technologies Limited offers a range of networking and content delivery network solutions.\n\nWhat industries do you cater to?\n\nWe provide Cloud services to a wide range of industries, including Pharmaceutical, Healthcare, BFSI,\nITeS, Government-PSU and more.\n\nHow can a company prepare for cloud to cloud migration?\n\nA company can prepare for cloud to cloud migration by performing a comprehensive inventory of its\ncurrent infrastructure, data, and applications, identifying potential compatibility issues or data\nmigration challenges, selecting a compatible cloud provider, and developing a migration plan that\nincludes testing and risk management measures\n\nHow can a company ensure data security during cloud to cloud migration?\n\nA company can ensure data security during cloud to cloud migration by using encryption and secure\ntransfer protocols, implementing access controls and user authentication measures, and performing\nregular security audits and risk assessments.\n\nHow can Orient Technologies Limited help us migrate our existing applications and data to the cloud?\n\nOur team of experts can assist you with the planning, execution, and testing of your migration to\nthe cloud. We also offer automated tools and services to help you migrate your applications and data\nquickly and efficiently.\n\nWhat sets your cybersecurity solutions apart from competitors?\n\nFull-spectrum Cybersecurity Solutions - From Cybersecurity Awareness, endpoint security to Cloud\nSecurity and everything in between, Proactive threat intelligence, reducing vulnerabilities before\nthey escalate, Customizable security layers based on your unique business needs, Strategic\nconsulting through vCISO services, ensuring leadership-driven security frameworks, Cost-effective\nscalability, offering enterprise-level security to businesses of all sizes.\n\nWhat\u2019s the ROI of investing in cybersecurity with Cyber Solutions?\n\nBusinesses that invest in proactive cybersecurity measures reduce breach costs by an average of 70%.\n\nWhat industries benefit the most from your cybersecurity solutions?\n\nHealthcare (PHI - protecting personal health information), Finance (Aligning with regulatory\ncompliances; safeguarding critical information assets), Retail & E-commerce (preventing data theft\nand securing payment systems), Technology (safeguarding intellectual property), SMBs and enterprises\nfacing evolving digital threats.\n\nHow do your solutions ensure compliance with regulations like GDPR, HIPAA, or PCI DSS?\n\nOur solutions are designed with compliance at their core. We offer frameworks and automated tools to\nensure your security practices align with industry regulations, minimizing risk and preventing\ncostly breaches.\n\nHow do you protect remote workforces and endpoints?\n\nThrough advanced Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR) solutions, we secure devices across remote\nenvironments.\n\nHow do I know which cybersecurity service is right for my business?\n\nWe offer a cyber risk assessment and an initial consultation to evaluate your current security\nposture.\n\nCan your solutions integrate with our existing security infrastructure?\n\nYes! Our services are designed to integrate seamlessly with your existing technology stack.\n\nWhat\u2019s the difference between active and passive networking?\n\nActive networking includes powered components like routers and switches. Passive includes cabling\nand non-powered physical elements.\n\nWhat kind of active networking solutions does Orient Technologies Limited offer?\n\nOrient Technologies Limited offers a range of active networking components such as, switches,\nrouters, SD-WAN, and WI-FI.\n\nWhat kind of compute and storage solutions does Orient Technologies Limited offer?\n\nOrient Technologies Limited offers a wide range of compute a"
