            "text": "* Product\nOverview\n[our data logo]\nOur Data\n][1] [\n[clients logo]\nClients\n][2]\nUse Cases\n[sales logo]\nSales\n][3] [\n[recruiters logo]\nRecruiters\n][4]\nFeatures\n[Search Portal Logo]\nSearch Portal\n][5] [\n[Chrome Logo]\nChrome Extension\n][6] [\n[Email Campaigns Logo]\nEmail Campaigns\n][7] [\n[Gmail Enrichment Logo]\nGmail Enrichment\n][8] [\n[Cloud Phone Dialer logo]\nCloud Phone Dialer\n][9] [\n[Integrations Logo]\nIntegrations\n][10] [\n[Data Enrichment Logo]\nData Enrichment\n][11] [\n[API logo]\nAPI\n][12] [\n[ContactSheets Logo]\nContactSheets\n][13]\nOverview\n[our data logo]\nOur Data\nLearn more about our data\n][14] [\n[clients logo]\nClients\nSee how companies succeed\nwith ContactOut\n][15]\nUse Cases\n[sales logo]\nSales\nUnlimited sales users for $299\n][16] [\n[recruiters logo]\nRecruiters\nSpeed up hiring of top talent\n][17]\nFeatures\n[Search Portal Logo]\nSearch Portal\n][18] [\n[Chrome Logo]\nChrome Extension\n][19] [\n[Email Campaigns Logo]\nEmail Campaigns\n][20] [\n[Gmail Enrichment Logo]\nGmail Enrichment\n][21] [\n[Cloud Phone Dialer logo]\nCloud Phone Dialer\n][22]\nFeatures\n[Integrations Logo]\nIntegrations\n][23] [\n[Data Enrichment Logo]\nData Enrichment\n][24] [\n[API logo]\nAPI\n][25] [\n[ContactSheets Logo]\nContactSheets\n][26]\n* [Pricing][27]\n* Knowledge\n[Product Tutorials Logo]\nHow to use ContactOut\n][28] [\n[How to Start a Startup]\nHow to Start a Startup\n][29] [\n[50+ Sales Call Recording]\n50+ Sales Call Recordings\n][30] [\n[Recruitment Mastery Hub]\nRecruitment Mastery Hub\n][31] [\n[Sales Mastery Hub]\nSales Mastery Hub\n][32] [\n[Founder's Blog]\nFounder's Blog\n][33] [\n[Startup Curriculum]\nStartup Curriculum\n][34]\n[how to use contactout]\nHow to use ContactOut\nWatch & learn on how to get started with ContactOut\n][35]\n[How to Start a Startup]\nHow to Start a Startup\nHow we built ContactOut to 8 figures in revenue. Video series with screen shares.\n][36] [\n[50+ Sales Call Recording]\n50+ Sales Call Recordings\nReal life call recordings of top companies (Hubspot, Shopify, Paypal, Zoom, and many more)\n][37]\n[recruitment mastery hub]\nRecruitment Mastery Hub\nA comprehensive collection of 250+ recruiting resources\n][38] [\n[sales mastery hub]\nSales Mastery Hub\nOur collection of 300+ sales articles, videos, guides, and more - all in one place!\n][39]\n[Founder's Blog]\nFounder's Blog\nOur CEO's reflections on life, productivity, and personal development\n][40] [\n[Startup Curriculum]\nStartup Curriculum\nThe most actionable curriculum featuring 100+ resources and a step by step guide.\n][41]\n* [Get a demo][42]\n* [Log in][43]\n* [Sign up for free][44]\n* [Sign up for free][45]\n* [Log in][46]\n\n# Contact us\n\n### Remove my data\n\nNeed to opt-out or revise the information about me in ContactOut?\n[Opt-out request][47]\n\n**Support:** [[email protected]][48]\n\n**Sales inquiries:** [[email protected]][49]\n\n934 Howard St San Francisco, CA 94103 United States\n\n## FAQ\n\n### Does ContactOut work on multiple browsers?\n\nAt this time ContactOut works exclusively with Google Chrome.\n\n### How can I reset my password?\n\nTo reset your password select \u201cForgot Your Password\u201d on the login screen. Enter your email and you\nwill be sent a link to reset your password.\n\n### I am having trouble using ContactOut.\n\nEmail [[email protected]][50] and tell us what errors you are experiencing. Please be as specific as\npossible and include a screenshot.\n\n### How do I verify my account?\n\nAfter you use 5 credits you will be sent a verification email. Simply follow the directions to click\nthe link included in the email and your account will be verified. If you encounter any issues please\nlet us know.\n\n### Can I be certain that I am given accurate contact information?\n\nAll emails in our database were triple verified. This means that each contact has passed three\ntests:\n* Does the email match the correct individual's social media profiles?\n* Is the email associated with the correct LinkedIn profile?\n* Can the email pass a bounce test to ensure delivery?\n\n### How do I opt-out or revise the information about me in ContactOut?\n\nSimply fill out this [ opt-out form][51] and your submission will be processed within one week.\n\n### Does ContactOut have an API?\n\nWe are only able to offer API at the Enterprise level. If you are currently negotiating an\nEnterprise plan please let us know you are interested in API. We are happy to discuss options!\n\n### How much does ContactOut cost?\n\nContactOut is priced per user at a rate competitive with other high-value recruiting products.\nPlease contact [[email protected]][52]\n\n### How can I cancel my subscription?\n\nCancellations and Refunds\n* MONTHLY: You can cancel your paid monthly plan at any time prior to your next billing date. When\nyou cancel your plan, you still retain your remaining lookups until your next billing date. To\ncancel your plan click the MANAGE SUBSCRIPTION button on your [account page][53] Or you can email\n[[email protected]][54]\n* ANNUAL: You can cancel your annual subscription within the first 30 days of purchase provided that\nyou have used less than 100 credits. You will be refunded the annual price less the one month\nprice. To cancel your annual subscription email: [[email protected]][55]\n\n### I am an existing customer, how can I get help?\n\nIf you are an existing customer and have questions on getting set up or how to use the product,\nplease contact [[email protected]][56]\n\n[ContactOut]\n\u00a9 2026 ContactOut. All rights reserved.\nDirectory\n[Top 200 Famous People Directory][57] [F1][58] [F2][59] [F3][60] [F4][61] [F5][62] [F6][63] [F7][64]\n[F8][65] [F9][66] [F10][67] [F11][68] [F12][69] [F13][70] [F14][71] [F15][72] [F16][73] [F17][74]\n[F18][75] [F19][76] [F20][77] [F21][78] [F22][79] [F23][80] [F24][81] [F25][82] [F26][83] [F27][84]\n[F28][85] [F29][86] [F30][87] [F31][88] [F32][89] [F33][90] [F3