p/overview-of-ieee-xplore/accessibility-statement\n[14]: /Xplorehelp/overview-of-ieee-xplore/terms-of-use\n[15]: http://www.ieee.org/web/aboutus/whatis/policies/p9-26.html\n[16]: /xpl/sitemap.jsp\n[17]: http://www.ieee.org/about/help/security_privacy.html"
          }
        ]
      },
      "polished_summary": "IEEE Xplore is a leading digital library and research platform that provides access to a vast collection of scientific and technical content, including journals, conference papers, and standards. As part of the IEEE, the world's largest technical professional organization, it serves a diverse audience of researchers, engineers, and professionals dedicated to advancing technology for the benefit of humanity. The platform offers various services, including account management, purchase history, and support resources to enhance user experience and facilitate access to valuable research materials.",
      "audit_reasoning": "IEEE Xplore is a digital library and research platform that provides access to scientific and technical content, but it does not manufacture, design, or develop products or systems specifically for Cyber-Physical Systems Security. It serves as a repository for research papers and articles rather than a company that directly participates in the market.",
      "audit_score": 0,
      "audit_completed": true,
      "audit_timestamp": "2026-06-28T13:14:28Z"
