atment and desalination technologies. The journal will publish\ninnovative research on the design, synthesis, and performance evaluation of various photothermal...\n\n*Submission deadline*\n  23 June 2025\n[ See all calls for papers ][25]\n\n## Trending research\n\n[The Iceman\u2019s microbiome: unveiling millennia of microbial diversity and continuity]\n\nResearch\n\n### [The Iceman\u2019s microbiome: unveiling millennia of microbial diversity and continuity][26]\n\n[Microbiome][27]\n\n[Open access][28]\n\n[A direct black-hole mass measurement in a little red dot at high redshift]\n\nArticle\n\n### [A direct black-hole mass measurement in a little red dot at high redshift][29]\n\n[Nature][30]\n\n[Open access][31]\n\n[Architectural and geotechnical aspects affecting earthquake resilience for the antique Egyptian\nKhufu pyramid]\n\nArticle\n\n### [Architectural and geotechnical aspects affecting earthquake resilience for the antique Egyptian\n### Khufu pyramid][32]\n\n[Scientific Reports][33]\n\n[Open access][34]\n\n[Induction of cortical on/off periods in awake mice fulfills sleep functions]\n\nArticle\n\n### [Induction of cortical on/off periods in awake mice fulfills sleep functions][35]\n\n[Nature Neuroscience][36]\n\n[Open access][37]\n\n[Individual locomotor bias drives counterclockwise motion in pedestrian crowds]\n\nArticle\n\n### [Individual locomotor bias drives counterclockwise motion in pedestrian crowds][38]\n\n[Nature Communications][39]\n\n[Open access][40]\n\n## Featured journals\n* [Artificial Intelligence Review]\n  \n  ### [Artificial Intelligence Review][41]\n  \n  Artificial Intelligence Review is a fully open access journal publishing state-of-the-art research\n  in artificial intelligence and cognitive science.\n  \n* [Discover Sustainability]\n  \n  ### [Discover Sustainability][42]\n  \n  Discover Sustainability is an open access journal publishing research across all fields relevant\n  to sustainability.\n  \n* [Journal of Epidemiology and G