        "crawl_text": "ZipDo, Inc. Compliant with GDPR Global GDPR Compliant SSL/TLS Encrypted AI-verified data Human-led research process Full source traceability GDPR Not specified 100+ countries Global ZipDo has been cited in over 3,000 articles and by more than 500 publications globally. The company operates in over 50 industry sectors, providing tailored insights and reports. Expanding AI-verified research capabilities Enhancing software advisory services Competition from established market research firms Maintaining data accuracy and verification processes Growing demand for AI-verified data in market research Expansion into new geographic markets Emerging leader in AI-verified market research Increasing reliance on data-driven decision making Expansion of digital services in various industries Independent Research, AI-Validated\n\nServices\n\nAll Services Custom Market Research Industry Reports Software Advisory\nMarket Data\n\nAll Market Data All Categories\nAI In Industry ( 740 ) Technology Digital Media ( 605 ) Safety Accidents ( 479 ) Entertainment Events ( 476 ) Medical Conditions Disorders ( 476 ) Mental Health Psychology ( 402 ) Social Issues Societal Trends ( 358 ) Manufacturing Engineering ( 353 ) Marketing Advertising ( 347 ) Education Learning ( 345 )\nSoftware Advice\n\nAll Software Advice\nAerospace Aviation Space ( 204 ) Aerospace Defense ( 43 ) Agriculture Farming ( 288 ) AI In Industry ( 573 ) Art Design ( 2119 ) Arts Creative Expression ( 518 ) Automotive Services ( 822 ) Beverages Alcohol ( 29 )\nEditorial Process\n\nCompany\n\nAbout Us Blog Careers As Seen In Partners\nContact Us \u2630\n\nHome\nServices\nAll Services\nCustom Market Research\nIndustry Reports\nSoftware Advisory\nMarket Data\nAll Market Data\nAll Categories\nAI In Industry ( 740 )\nTechnology Digital Media ( 605 )\nSafety Accidents ( 479 )\nEntertainment Events ( 476 )\nMedical Conditions Disorders ( 476 )\nMental Health Psychology ( 402 )\nSocial Issues Societal Trends ( 35