 [Partners][68]\n* [Contact Us][69]\n\nFor decision-makers\n\n# Research That Stands Up to Scrutiny\n\nFrom bespoke studies to instant-download reports \u2014 one standard: every number traces back to a\nprimary source and passes our verification pipeline.\n\nWhat we offer\n\n## Tailored Research and Ready-Made Reports\n\nCustom projects when you need depth, industry reports when you need speed, software advisory when\nyou need vendor selection \u2014 all backed by verified data.\n\n### Custom Market Research\n\nDesigned around your strategic questions. We map markets, benchmark competitors, and deliver\ninsights in 2\u20136 weeks.\n* \u2713Market sizing and forecasting\n* \u2713Competitor analysis\n* \u2713Customer segmentation\n* \u2713Market entry strategy\n\nFrom \u20ac5,000Learn more \u2192\n][70][\n\n### Industry Reports\n\nPre-built intelligence you can use today. 50+ sectors, five-year outlooks, competitive snapshots.\n* \u2713Instant download\n* \u271350+ industries\n* \u27135-year forecasts\n* \u2713Competitive analysis\n\nFrom \u20ac499Browse reports \u2192\n][71][\n\n### Software Advisory\n\nStop guessing. Our analysts use verified Best Lists and hands-on testing to recommend the right\nsoftware for your needs.\n* \u2713Vendor shortlisting\n* \u2713Feature comparison\n* \u2713Pricing & TCO analysis\n* \u2713Final recommendation report\n\nFrom \u20ac2,500Learn more \u2192\n][72]\n\nMarket data\n\n## Explore Our Data by Topic\n\nThousands of statistics and reports across sectors. Every figure is verified before it reaches you.\n\n[AI In Industry]\n\n### AI In Industry\n\n740 reports\n][73][\n[Technology Digital Media]\n\n### Technology Digital Media\n\n605 reports\n][74][\n[Safety Accidents]\n\n### Safety Accidents\n\n479 reports\n][75][\n[Entertainment Events]\n\n### Entertainment Events\n\n476 reports\n][76]\n[View all topics \u2192][77]\n\nOur Commitments\n\n## Trust & Transparency\n\nSelf-declared standards. Third-party certifications noted where applicable.\n\nPrivacy & securityEditorial standardsSustainability & access\n\n### GDPR Compliant\n\nEU data protection\n\n### SSL/TLS Encrypted\n\n256-bit encryption\n\n### Data by Design\n\nPrivacy-first\n\n### Secure Payments\n\nPCI-compliant\n\n### Human-Verified\n\nEditorial review\n\n### Independent Research\n\nNo pay-for-placement\n\n### Climate Conscious\n\nSustainable hosting\n\n### Accessibility Committed\n\nWCAG 2.1 goal\n\n[Editorial process \u2192][78]\n\nOur Process\n\n## How Our AI Verification Works\n\nEvery statistic and product recommendation goes through this process before publication.\n\n### Human-Led Research\n\nOur analysts pull data from primary sources \u2014 studies, official databases, industry reports. Humans\ndecide what enters the pipeline and what doesn't.\n\n### AI-Powered Verification\n\nInternal AI reproduces results, cross-checks claims across the web, and validates primary sources so\nonly verified data moves forward.\n\n### Human Editorial Decision\n\nOnly AI-verified data gets published. An editor reviews every result and makes the final call. AI\nverifies \u2014 humans decide.\n\n[Read our full editorial process \u2192][79]\n\nTrusted Worldwide\n\nOur AI-verified market data has been referenced by hundreds of publications\n\nThe New York Times\nWall Street Journal\nThe Washington Post\nLos Angeles Times\nUSA Today\nReuters\nAssociated Press\nBloomberg\nThe New York Times\nWall Street Journal\nThe Washington Post\nLos Angeles Times\nUSA Today\nReuters\nAssociated Press\nBloomberg\nThe Guardian\nForbes\nCNBC\nNBC News\nABC News\nCBS News\nMicrosoft\nAdobe\nThe Guardian\nForbes\nCNBC\nNBC News\nABC News\nCBS News\nMicrosoft\nAdobe\n3,000+Articles citing ZipDo\n500+Publications\n100+Countries\n\n## Get in Touch\n\nQuestions about our data, methodology, or research services? We'd love to hear from you.\n\n[Contact us][80]\n\n[[email protected]][81] \u00b7 We typically respond within 1\u20132 business days.\n\n## Our Most Popular Data\n\n[All Categories][82][AI In Industry][83][Technology Digital Media][84][Safety\nAccidents][85][Entertainment Events][86][Medical Conditions Disorders][87][Mental Health\nPsychology][88][Social Issues Societal Trends][89][Manufacturing Engineering][90][Marketing\nAdvertising][91][Education Learning][92]\n\n### Social Media\n* [LinkedIn][93]\n* [X (Twitter)][94]\n* [YouTube][95]\n* [Product Hunt][96]\n\n### Rating Platforms\n* [Clutch][97]\n* [Crunchbase][98]\n* [G2][99]\n* [DesignRush][100]\n\n### Press & Media\n* [Digg][101]\n* [LinkedIn Article][102]\n* [Medium][103]\n* [SlideShare \u2013 Company][104]\n* [SlideShare \u2013 Team][105]\n\n[[ZipDo Inverted Logo]][106]\n* [Home][107]\n* [Privacy Policy][108]\n* [Company][109]\n* [Contact Us][110]\n* [Editorial Process][111]\n* [As Seen In][112]\n* [Partners][113]\n* [Careers][114]\n* [Custom Research][115]\n* [Industry Reports][116]\n* [Software Advisory][117]\n* [Software Alternatives][118]\n* [All Articles][119]\n\n### Disclaimer: How We Earn Money\n\nOur data and research articles are available to our readers free of charge. We currently monetize\nour website through display advertising and cooperations with individual companies.\n\n\u00a9 2026 ZipDo.co. All rights reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /services/\n[3]: /services/custom-research/\n[4]: /services/industry-reports/\n[5]: /services/software-advisory/\n[6]: /topics/\n[7]: /best/\n[8]: /topic/ai-in-industry/\n[9]: /topic/technology-digital-media/\n[10]: /topic/safety-accidents/\n[11]: /topic/entertainment-events/\n[12]: /topic/medical-conditions-disorders/\n[13]: /topic/mental-health-psychology/\n[14]: /topic/social-issues-societal-trends/\n[15]: /topic/manufacturing-engineering/\n[16]: /topic/marketing-advertising/\n[17]: /topic/education-learning/\n[18]: /best/\n[19]: /best/\n[20]: /best/category/aerospace-aviation-space/\n[21]: /best/category/aerospace-defense/\n[22]: /best/category/agriculture-farming/\n[23]: /best/category/ai-in-industry/\n[24]: /best/category/art-design/\n[25]: /best/category/arts-creative-expression/\n[26]: /best/category/automotive-services/\n[27]: /best/category/beverages-alcohol/\n[28]: /how-we-work/\n[29]: /about/\n[30]: /blog/\n[31]: /careers/\n[32]: /as-seen-in/\n[33]: /partners/\n[34]: /contact-us/\n[35]: /\n[36]: /\n[37]: /services/\n[38]: /services/custom-research/\n[39]: /services/industry-reports/\n[40]: /services/software-advisory/\n[41]: /topics/\n[42]: /best/\n[43]: /topic/ai-in-industry/\n[44]: /topic/technology-digital-media/\n[45]: /topic/safety-accidents/\n[46]: /topic/entertainment-events/\n[47]: /topic/medical-conditions-disorders/\n[48]: /topic/mental-health-psychology/\n[49]: /topic/social-issues-societal-trends/\n[50]: /topic/manufacturing-engineering/\n[51]: /topic/marketing-advertising/\n[52]: /topic/education-learning/\n[53]: /best/\n[54]: /best/category/aerospace-aviation-space/\n[55]: /best/category/aerospace-defense/\n[56]: /best/category/agriculture-farming/\n[57]: /best/category/ai-in-industry/\n[58]: /best/category/art-design/\n[59]: /best/category/arts-creative-expression/\n[60]: /best/category/automotive-services/\n[61]: /best/category/beverages-alcohol/\n[62]: /best/category/biotechnology-pharmaceuticals/\n[63]: /best/category/business-finance/\n[64]: /how-we-work/\n[65]: /about/\n[66]: /careers/\n[67]: /as-seen-in/\n[68]: /partners/\n[69]: /contact-us/\n[70]: /services/custom-research/\n[71]: /services/industry-reports/\n[72]: /services/software-advisory/\n[73]: /topic/ai-in-industry/\n[74]: /topic/technology-digital-media/\n[75]: /topic/safety-accidents/\n[76]: /topic/entertainment-events/\n[77]: /topics/\n[78]: /how-we-work/\n[79]: /how-we-work/\n[80]: /contact-us/\n[81]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[82]: /best/\n[83]: /topic/ai-in-industry/\n[84]: /topic/technology-digital-media/\n[85]: /topic/safety-accidents/\n[86]: /topic/entertainment-events/\n[87]: /topic/medical-conditions-disorders/\n[88]: /topic/mental-health-psychology/\n[89]: /topic/social-issues-societal-trends/\n[90]: /topic/manufacturing-engineering/\n[91]: /topic/marketing-advertising/\n[92]: /topic/education-learning/\n[93]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/zipdo/about/?viewAsMember=true\n[94]: https://x.com/i/communities/2024839078873628780\n[95]: https://www.youtube.com/@zipdo_market_research\n[96]: https://www.producthunt.com/products/zipdo-market-research-services-data\n[97]: https://clutch.co/profile/zipdo-market-research\n[98]: https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/zipdo-market-research-service-data\n[99]: https://www.g2.com/products/zipdo-market-research/reviews?source=search\n[100]: https://www.designrush.com/agency/profile/zipdo-market-research\n[101]: https://digg.com/demandgeneration/Mqq3yFY/the-5-data-sources-that-wont\n[102]: https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/top-5-most-trustworthy-data-sources-internet-alexander-eser-vj\nwif/\n[103]: https://medium.com/p/86a798df536a?postPublishedType=initial\n[104]: https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/zipdo-market-research-company-presentation/286147771\n[105]: https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/meet-the-team-behind-zipdo-team-presentation/286184861\n[106]: /\n[107]: /\n[108]: /privacy-policy/\n[109]: /about/\n[110]: /contact-us/\n[111]: /how-we-work/\n[112]: /as-seen-in/\n[113]: /partners/\n[114]: /careers/\n[115]: /services/custom-research/\n[116]: /services/industry-reports/\n[117]: /services/software-advisory/\n[118]: /alternative/\n[119]: /articles/"
