            "url": "https://zipdo.co/services/custom-research/",
            "text": "[[ZipDo.co Logo]][1]\n* Services\n[All Services][2][Custom Market Research][3][Industry Reports][4][Software Advisory][5]\n* Market Data\n[All Market Data][6][All Categories][7][AI In Industry(740)][8][Technology Digital\nMedia(605)][9][Safety Accidents(479)][10][Entertainment Events(476)][11][Medical Conditions\nDisorders(476)][12][Mental Health Psychology(402)][13][Social Issues Societal\nTrends(358)][14][Manufacturing Engineering(353)][15][Marketing Advertising(347)][16][Education\nLearning(345)][17]\n* [Software Advice][18]\n[All Software Advice][19][Aerospace Aviation Space(204)][20][Aerospace\nDefense(43)][21][Agriculture Farming(288)][22][AI In Industry(573)][23][Art Design(2119)][24][Arts\nCreative Expression(518)][25][Automotive Services(822)][26][Beverages Alcohol(29)][27]\n* [Editorial Process][28]\n* Company\n[About Us][29][Blog][30][Careers][31][As Seen In][32][Partners][33]\n* [Contact Us][34]\n[[ZipDo Mobile Logo]][35]\u2630\n* [Home][36]\n* Services\n* [All Services][37]\n* [Custom Market Research][38]\n* [Industry Reports][39]\n* [Software Advisory][40]\n* Market Data\n* [All Market Data][41]\n* [All Categories][42]\n* [AI In Industry(740)][43]\n* [Technology Digital Media(605)][44]\n* [Safety Accidents(479)][45]\n* [Entertainment Events(476)][46]\n* [Medical Conditions Disorders(476)][47]\n* [Mental Health Psychology(402)][48]\n* [Social Issues Societal Trends(358)][49]\n* [Manufacturing Engineering(353)][50]\n* [Marketing Advertising(347)][51]\n* [Education Learning(345)][52]\n* [Software Advice][53]\n* [Aerospace Aviation Space(204)][54]\n* [Aerospace Defense(43)][55]\n* [Agriculture Farming(288)][56]\n* [AI In Industry(573)][57]\n* [Art Design(2119)][58]\n* [Arts Creative Expression(518)][59]\n* [Automotive Services(822)][60]\n* [Beverages Alcohol(29)][61]\n* [Biotechnology Pharmaceuticals(192)][62]\n* [Business Finance(5273)][63]\n* [Editorial Process][64]\n* Company\n* [About Us][65]\n* [Careers][66]\n* [As Seen In][67]\n* [Partners][68]\n* [Contact Us][69]\n\nFor decision-makers\n\n# Custom Market Research\n\nTailored analyses for your strategic questions. Market sizing, competitor analysis, customer\nsegmentation, and more. From 5,000 \u20ac \u2013 typically delivered in 2\u20134 weeks.\n\n[Request a discovery call][70]\n[The ZipDo research team]\n\nWhat we deliver\n\n## Core research services\n\nFrom market sizing to customer journey mapping \u2013 we design each project around your goals.\n\n### Market Sizing & Forecasting\n\nDefine and quantify your addressable market with reliable data and projections.\n\n### Customer Segmentation\n\nIdentify and profile your ideal customer segments for targeted strategy.\n\n### Competitor Analysis\n\nDeep dives into competitive landscape, positioning, and differentiation.\n\n### Market Entry Strategy\n\nData-backed recommendations for entering new markets or regions.\n\n### Brand & Perception Studies\n\nUnderstand how your brand is perceived and where to improve.\n\n### Product Research\n\nValidate product ideas and feature priorities with real user and market data.\n\n### Trend Analysis\n\nStay ahead with trend identification and impact assessment.\n\n### Customer Journey Mapping\n\nMap touchpoints and pain points to optimize conversion and retention.\n\nEditorial Process\n\n## From brief to insights in 4 steps\n\nA clear process so you know what to expect at every stage.\n\nStep 01\n\n### Discovery Call\n\nWe align on your strategic questions, scope, and timeline in a focused kickoff.\n\nStep 02\n\n### Research Design\n\nWe define methodology, data sources, and deliverables tailored to your needs.\n\nStep 03\n\n### Data Collection\n\nPrimary and secondary research: surveys, interviews, and verified market data.\n\nStep 04\n\n### Analysis & Insights\n\nSynthesis, recommendations, and clear deliverables ready for decision-making.\n\n## Satisfaction guarantee & clear turnaround\n\nWe stand behind our work. Typical delivery is 2\u20134 weeks depending on scope. Your project is led by\nour research team with experience in data and strategy.\n\n2\u20134 weeks typicalSatisfaction guaranteeFrom 5,000 \u20ac\n\nOur Commitments\n\n## Trust & Transparency\n\nSelf-declared standards. Third-party certifications noted where applicable.\n\nPrivacy & securityEditorial standardsSustainability & access\n\n### GDPR Compliant\n\nEU data protection\n\n### SSL/TLS Encrypted\n\n256-bit encryption\n\n### Data by Design\n\nPrivacy-first\n\n### Secure Payments\n\nPCI-compliant\n\n### Human-Verified\n\nEditorial review\n\n### Independent Research\n\nNo pay-for-placement\n\n### Climate Conscious\n\nSustainable hosting\n\n### Accessibility Committed\n\nWCAG 2.1 goal\n\n[Editorial process \u2192][71]\n\n## Who delivers your research\n\nOur research and editorial team brings rigor and clarity to every project.\n\n[Adrian Szabo]\n\n### [Adrian Szabo][72]\n\nData Analyst\n\nAdrian holds a Master's in Computer Science from Budapest University of Technology and a Bachelor's\nin Digital Media from E\u00f6tv\u00f6s Lor\u00e1nd University. He spent four years at a digital entertainment\nresearch firm in Berlin before freelancing as a gaming market analyst. At ZipDo, he specializes in\ngaming industry analytics, game engine technology, and interactive entertainment.\n\n[Amara Williams]\n\n### [Amara Williams][73]\n\nResearch Analyst\n\nAmara holds a Master's in Law from Howard University School of Law and a Bachelor's in Business\nAdministration from Spelman College. She spent five years as a legal technology researcher at an\nindependent legal industry advisory firm in Washington, D.C.. She later worked as a freelance legal\noperations analyst. At ZipDo, she covers legal operations technology, contract intelligence\nplatforms, and legal spend management market trends.\n\n[Andr\u00e9 Laurent]\n\n### [Andr\u00e9 Laurent][74]\n\nMarket Intelligence\n\nAndr\u00e9 holds a Master's in Building Engineering from \u00c9cole des Ponts ParisTech and a Bachelor's in\nComputer Science from T\u00e9l\u00e9com Paris. He spent five years as a smart buildings researcher at an\nindependent property technology advisory firm in Paris. He later worked as a freelance proptech\nanalyst. At ZipDo, he covers smart building technology, building management systems, and commercial\nreal estate IoT market trends.\n\n[Andrew Morrison]\n\n### [Andrew Morrison][75]\n\nResearch Analyst\n\nAndrew holds a Master's in Finance from University of Edinburgh and a Bachelor's in Engineering from\nHeriot-Watt University. He spent six years as a clean energy finance researcher at an independent\ninfrastructure investment advisory firm in Edinburgh. He later worked as a freelance clean energy\nanalyst. At ZipDo, he covers renewable energy project finance, green infrastructure bonds, and clean\nenergy investment data.\n\n[Anja Petersen]\n\n### [Anja Petersen][76]\n\nMarket Intelligence\n\nAnja holds a Master's in Organizational Psychology from University of Copenhagen and a Bachelor's in\nHealth Science from University of Southern Denmark. She spent four years as a workplace health\nresearcher at an independent corporate wellness advisory firm in Copenhagen. She later worked as a\nfreelance workplace wellness analyst. At ZipDo, she covers employee wellness platforms, corporate\nfitness technology, and workplace health market trends.\n\n[Annika Holm]\n\n### [Annika Holm][77]\n\nData Analyst\n\nAnnika holds a Master's in Environmental Economics from the University of Gothenburg and a\nBachelor's in Natural Sciences from the University of Helsinki. She spent four years at a Nordic\nclimate finance advisory firm before freelancing as a climate technology analyst. At ZipDo, she\nfocuses on renewable energy markets, carbon credit trading, and climate technology investment.\n\n## Get in Touch\n\nQuestions about our data, methodology, or research services? We'd love to hear from you.\n\n[Contact us][78]\n\n[[email protected]][79] \u00b7 We typically respond within 1\u20132 business days.\n\n## Our Most Popular Data\n\n[All Categories][80][AI In Industry][81][Technology Digital Media][82][Safety\nAccidents][83][Entertainment Events][84][Medical Conditions Disorders][85][Mental Health\nPsychology][86][Social Issues Societal Trends][87][Manufacturing Engineering][88][Marketing\nAdvertising][89][Education Learning][90]\n\n### Social Media\n* [LinkedIn][91]\n* [X (Twitter)][92]\n* [YouTube][93]\n* [Product Hunt][94]\n\n### Rating Platforms\n* [Clutch][95]\n* [Crunchbase][96]\n* [G2][97]\n* [DesignRush][98]\n\n### Press & Media\n* [Digg][99]\n* [LinkedIn Article][100]\n* [Medium][101]\n* [SlideShare \u2013 Company][102]\n* [SlideShare \u2013 Team][103]\n\n[[ZipDo Inverted Logo]][104]\n* [Home][105]\n* [Privacy Policy][106]\n* [Company][107]\n* [Contact Us][108]\n* [Editorial Process][109]\n* [As Seen In][110]\n* [Partners][111]\n* [Careers][112]\n* [Custom Research][113]\n* [Industry Reports][114]\n* [Software Advisory][115]\n* [Software Alternatives][116]\n* [All Articles][117]\n\n### Disclaimer: How We Earn Money\n\nOur data and research articles are available to our readers free of charge. We currently monetize\nour website through display advertising and cooperations with individual companies.\n\n\u00a9 2026 ZipDo.co. All rights reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /services/\n[3]: /services/custom-research/\n[4]: /services/industry-reports/\n[5]: /services/software-advisory/\n[6]: /topics/\n[7]: /best/\n[8]: /topic/ai-in-industry/\n[9]: /topic/technology-digital-media/\n[10]: /topic/safety-accidents/\n[11]: /topic/entertainment-events/\n[12]: /topic/medical-conditions-disorders/\n[13]: /topic/mental-health-psychology/\n[14]: /topic/social-issues-societal-trends/\n[15]: /topic/manufacturing-engineering/\n[16]: /topic/marketing-advertising/\n[17]: /topic/education-learning/\n[18]: /best/\n[19]: /best/\n[20]: /best/category/aerospace-aviation-space/\n[21]: /best/category/aerospace-defense/\n[22]: /best/category/agriculture-farming/\n[23]: /best/category/ai-in-industry/\n[24]: /best/category/art-design/\n[25]: /best/category/arts-creative-expression/\n[26]: /best/category/automotive-services/\n[27]: /best/category/beverages-alcohol/\n[28]: /how-we-work/\n[29]: /about/\n[30]: /blog/\n[31]: /careers/\n[32]: /as-seen-in/\n[33]: /partners/\n[34]: /contact-us/\n[35]: /\n[36]: /\n[37]: /services/\n[38]: /services/custom-research/\n[39]: /services/industry-reports/\n[40]: /services/software-advisory/\n[41]: /topics/\n[42]: /best/\n[43]: /topic/ai-in-industry/\n[44]: /topic/technology-digital-media/\n[45]: /topic/safety-accidents/\n[46]: /topic/entertainment-events/\n[47]: /topic/medical-conditions-disorders/\n[48]: /topic/mental-health-psychology/\n[49]: /topic/social-issues-societal-trends/\n[50]: /topic/manufacturing-engineering/\n[51]: /topic/marketing-advertising/\n[52]: /topic/education-learning/\n[53]: /best/\n[54]: /best/category/aerospace-aviation-space/\n[55]: /best/category/aerospace-defense/\n[56]: /best/category/agriculture-farming/\n[57]: /best/category/ai-in-industry/\n[58]: /best/category/art-design/\n[59]: /best/category/arts-creative-expression/\n[60]: /best/category/automotive-services/\n[61]: /best/category/beverages-alcohol/\n[62]: /best/category/biotechnology-pharmaceuticals/\n[63]: /best/category/business-finance/\n[64]: /how-we-work/\n[65]: /about/\n[66]: /careers/\n[67]: /as-seen-in/\n[68]: /partners/\n[69]: /contact-us/\n[70]: /contact-us/\n[71]: /how-we-work/\n[72]: /about/adrian-szabo/\n[73]: /about/amara-williams/\n[74]: /about/andr\u00e9-laurent/\n[75]: /about/andrew-morrison/\n[76]: /about/anja-petersen/\n[77]: /about/annika-holm/\n[78]: /contact-us/\n[79]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[80]: /best/\n[81]: /topic/ai-in-industry/\n[82]: /topic/technology-digital-media/\n[83]: /topic/safety-accidents/\n[84]: /topic/entertainment-events/\n[85]: /topic/medical-conditions-disorders/\n[86]: /topic/mental-health-psychology/\n[87]: /topic/social-issues-societal-trends/\n[88]: /topic/manufacturing-engineering/\n[89]: /topic/marketing-advertising/\n[90]: /topic/education-learning/\n[91]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/zipdo/about/?viewAsMember=true\n[92]: https://x.com/i/communities/2024839078873628780\n[93]: https://www.youtube.com/@zipdo_market_research\n[94]: https://www.producthunt.com/products/zipdo-market-research-services-data\n[95]: https://clutch.co/profile/zipdo-market-research\n[96]: https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/zipdo-market-research-service-data\n[97]: https://www.g2.com/products/zipdo-market-"
