            "text": "[[ZipDo.co Logo]][1]\n* Services\n[All Services][2][Custom Market Research][3][Industry Reports][4][Software Advisory][5]\n* Market Data\n[All Market Data][6][All Categories][7][AI In Industry(740)][8][Technology Digital\nMedia(605)][9][Safety Accidents(479)][10][Entertainment Events(476)][11][Medical Conditions\nDisorders(476)][12][Mental Health Psychology(402)][13][Social Issues Societal\nTrends(358)][14][Manufacturing Engineering(353)][15][Marketing Advertising(347)][16][Education\nLearning(345)][17]\n* [Software Advice][18]\n[All Software Advice][19][Aerospace Aviation Space(204)][20][Aerospace\nDefense(43)][21][Agriculture Farming(288)][22][AI In Industry(573)][23][Art Design(2119)][24][Arts\nCreative Expression(518)][25][Automotive Services(822)][26][Beverages Alcohol(29)][27]\n* [Editorial Process][28]\n* Company\n[About Us][29][Blog][30][Careers][31][As Seen In][32][Partners][33]\n* [Contact Us][34]\n[[ZipDo Mobile Logo]][35]\u2630\n* [Home][36]\n* Services\n* [All Services][37]\n* [Custom Market Research][38]\n* [Industry Reports][39]\n* [Software Advisory][40]\n* Market Data\n* [All Market Data][41]\n* [All Categories][42]\n* [AI In Industry(740)][43]\n* [Technology Digital Media(605)][44]\n* [Safety Accidents(479)][45]\n* [Entertainment Events(476)][46]\n* [Medical Conditions Disorders(476)][47]\n* [Mental Health Psychology(402)][48]\n* [Social Issues Societal Trends(358)][49]\n* [Manufacturing Engineering(353)][50]\n* [Marketing Advertising(347)][51]\n* [Education Learning(345)][52]\n* [Software Advice][53]\n* [Aerospace Aviation Space(204)][54]\n* [Aerospace Defense(43)][55]\n* [Agriculture Farming(288)][56]\n* [AI In Industry(573)][57]\n* [Art Design(2119)][58]\n* [Arts Creative Expression(518)][59]\n* [Automotive Services(822)][60]\n* [Beverages Alcohol(29)][61]\n* [Biotechnology Pharmaceuticals(192)][62]\n* [Business Finance(5273)][63]\n* [Editorial Process][64]\n* Company\n* [About Us][65]\n* [Careers][66]\n* [As Seen In][67]\n* [Partners][68]\n* [Contact Us][69]\n\nProfessional Services\n\n# Software Advisory\n\nStop wasting months evaluating vendors. Our analysts leverage our Best Lists and verified market\ndata to recommend the right tool \u2014 faster and with confidence.\n\n[Request a proposal][70][Browse Best Lists][71]\n\nWhat we deliver\n\n## End-to-end software selection\n\nFrom requirements to final recommendation \u2014 we handle the evaluation so you can focus on the\nbusiness.\n\n### Needs Assessment\n\nWe map your workflows, pain points, and requirements into a structured document that drives the\nselection process.\n\n### Vendor Shortlisting\n\nDrawing from our Best Lists and market data, we identify the 3\u20135 vendors most aligned with your\nrequirements.\n\n### Feature Comparison\n\nFeature-by-feature comparison using verified data, hands-on testing, and user review analysis.\n\n### Pricing & TCO Analysis\n\nLicensing, implementation, and ongoing costs \u2014 including hidden fees \u2014 for true total cost of\nownership.\n\n### Migration Review\n\nCompatibility with your stack, data migration complexity, and integration effort assessment.\n\n### Final Recommendation\n\nClear recommendation with ranked shortlist, implementation roadmap, and stakeholder-ready report.\n\nHow it works\n\n## From brief to recommendation in 2\u20134 weeks\n\n### Discovery Call\n\nDay 1\n\n30-minute consultation to understand your business, budget, and success criteria.\n\n### Requirements Mapping\n\nDay 2\u20133\n\nStructured requirements framework with weighted evaluation criteria.\n\n### Vendor Research\n\nDay 4\u20138\n\nShortlist from our Best Lists. No pay-for-placement.\n\n### Deep Evaluation\n\nDay 9\u201314\n\nScoring across your criteria, pricing analysis, hands-on testing.\n\n### Report & Recommendation\n\nDay 15\u201320\n\nSoftware Selection Report with recommendation and roadmap.\n\nPowered by our research\n\n## Best Lists & verified data\n\nUnlike firms that start from zero, we draw from ZipDo's independently ranked software lists. Faster\nturnaround, deeper vendor knowledge, recommendations backed by data.\n\n[Explore Best Lists \u2192][72]\n\nExample categories\n* [Project Management][73]\n* [CRM][74]\n* [HR Software][75]\n* [Accounting][76]\n* [ERP][77]\n\nPricing\n\n## Transparent, fixed-fee\n\n### Essential\n\n\u20ac2,500\n\nDelivery: 2 weeks\n* \u2713Discovery call\n* \u27133 vendors shortlist\n* \u2713Comparison scorecard\n* \u2713Written recommendation\n\n[Get started][78]\nMost popular\n\n### Professional\n\n\u20ac5,000\n\nDelivery: 3 weeks\n* \u2713Everything in Essential\n* \u27135 vendors\n* \u2713Hands-on testing\n* \u2713TCO analysis\n* \u2713Negotiation guidance\n\n[Get started][79]\n\n### Enterprise\n\nCustom\n\nDelivery: 4\u20136 weeks\n* \u2713RFP support\n* \u2713Vendor demos\n* \u2713Security review\n* \u2713Unlimited revisions\n\n[Get started][80]\n\nOur Commitments\n\n## Trust & Transparency\n\nSelf-declared standards. Third-party certifications noted where applicable.\n\nPrivacy & securityEditorial standardsSustainability & access\n\n### GDPR Compliant\n\nEU data protection\n\n### SSL/TLS Encrypted\n\n256-bit encryption\n\n### Data by Design\n\nPrivacy-first\n\n### Secure Payments\n\nPCI-compliant\n\n### Human-Verified\n\nEditorial review\n\n### Independent Research\n\nNo pay-for-placement\n\n### Climate Conscious\n\nSustainable hosting\n\n### Accessibility Committed\n\nWCAG 2.1 goal\n\n[Editorial process \u2192][81]\n\n## Get in Touch\n\nQuestions about our data, methodology, or research services? We'd love to hear from you.\n\n[Contact us][82]\n\n[[email protected]][83] \u00b7 We typically respond within 1\u20132 business days.\n\n## Our Most Popular Data\n\n[All Categories][84][AI In Industry][85][Technology Digital Media][86][Safety\nAccidents][87][Entertainment Events][88][Medical Conditions Disorders][89][Mental Health\nPsychology][90][Social Issues Societal Trends][91][Manufacturing Engineering][92][Marketing\nAdvertising][93][Education Learning][94]\n\n### Social Media\n* [LinkedIn][95]\n* [X (Twitter)][96]\n* [YouTube][97]\n* [Product Hunt][98]\n\n### Rating Platforms\n* [Clutch][99]\n* [Crunchbase][100]\n* [G2][101]\n* [DesignRush][102]\n\n### Press & Media\n* [Digg][103]\n* [LinkedIn Article][104]\n* [Medium][105]\n* [SlideShare \u2013 Company][106]\n* [SlideShare \u2013 Team][107]\n\n[[ZipDo Inverted Logo]][108]\n* [Home][109]\n* [Privacy Policy][110]\n* [Company][111]\n* [Contact Us][112]\n* [Editorial Process][113]\n* [As Seen In][114]\n* [Partners][115]\n* [Careers][116]\n* [Custom Research][117]\n* [Industry Reports][118]\n* [Software Advisory][119]\n* [Software Alternatives][120]\n* [All Articles][121]\n\n### Disclaimer: How We Earn Money\n\nOur data and research articles are available to our readers free of charge. We currently monetize\nour website through display advertising and cooperations with individual companies.\n\n\u00a9 2026 ZipDo.co. All rights reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /services/\n[3]: /services/custom-research/\n[4]: /services/industry-reports/\n[5]: /services/software-advisory/\n[6]: /topics/\n[7]: /best/\n[8]: /topic/ai-in-industry/\n[9]: /topic/technology-digital-media/\n[10]: /topic/safety-accidents/\n[11]: /topic/entertainment-events/\n[12]: /topic/medical-conditions-disorders/\n[13]: /topic/mental-health-psychology/\n[14]: /topic/social-issues-societal-trends/\n[15]: /topic/manufacturing-engineering/\n[16]: /topic/marketing-advertising/\n[17]: /topic/education-learning/\n[18]: /best/\n[19]: /best/\n[20]: /best/category/aerospace-aviation-space/\n[21]: /best/category/aerospace-defense/\n[22]: /best/category/agriculture-farming/\n[23]: /best/category/ai-in-industry/\n[24]: /best/category/art-design/\n[25]: /best/category/arts-creative-expression/\n[26]: /best/category/automotive-services/\n[27]: /best/category/beverages-alcohol/\n[28]: /how-we-work/\n[29]: /about/\n[30]: /blog/\n[31]: /careers/\n[32]: /as-seen-in/\n[33]: /partners/\n[34]: /cont