            "text": "[[ZipDo.co Logo]][1]\n* Services\n[All Services][2][Custom Market Research][3][Industry Reports][4][Software Advisory][5]\n* Market Data\n[All Market Data][6][All Categories][7][AI In Industry(740)][8][Technology Digital\nMedia(605)][9][Safety Accidents(479)][10][Entertainment Events(476)][11][Medical Conditions\nDisorders(476)][12][Mental Health Psychology(402)][13][Social Issues Societal\nTrends(358)][14][Manufacturing Engineering(353)][15][Marketing Advertising(347)][16][Education\nLearning(345)][17]\n* [Software Advice][18]\n[All Software Advice][19][Aerospace Aviation Space(204)][20][Aerospace\nDefense(43)][21][Agriculture Farming(288)][22][AI In Industry(573)][23][Art Design(2119)][24][Arts\nCreative Expression(518)][25][Automotive Services(822)][26][Beverages Alcohol(29)][27]\n* [Editorial Process][28]\n* Company\n[About Us][29][Blog][30][Careers][31][As Seen In][32][Partners][33]\n* [Contact Us][34]\n[[ZipDo Mobile Logo]][35]\u2630\n* [Home][36]\n* Services\n* [All Services][37]\n* [Custom Market Research][38]\n* [Industry Reports][39]\n* [Software Advisory][40]\n* Market Data\n* [All Market Data][41]\n* [All Categories][42]\n* [AI In Industry(740)][43]\n* [Technology Digital Media(605)][44]\n* [Safety Accidents(479)][45]\n* [Entertainment Events(476)][46]\n* [Medical Conditions Disorders(476)][47]\n* [Mental Health Psychology(402)][48]\n* [Social Issues Societal Trends(358)][49]\n* [Manufacturing Engineering(353)][50]\n* [Marketing Advertising(347)][51]\n* [Education Learning(345)][52]\n* [Software Advice][53]\n* [Aerospace Aviation Space(204)][54]\n* [Aerospace Defense(43)][55]\n* [Agriculture Farming(288)][56]\n* [AI In Industry(573)][57]\n* [Art Design(2119)][58]\n* [Arts Creative Expression(518)][59]\n* [Automotive Services(822)][60]\n* [Beverages Alcohol(29)][61]\n* [Biotechnology Pharmaceuticals(192)][62]\n* [Business Finance(5273)][63]\n* [Editorial Process][64]\n* Company\n* [About Us][65]\n* [Careers][66]\n* [As Seen In][67]\n* [Partners][68]\n* [Contact Us][69]\n\nWork with ZipDo\n\n# Let's Collaborate on Data, Content & Research\n\nWhether you want to feature our data, explore content or media partnerships, or discuss custom\nresearch, our team is happy to hear from you and learn more about your project.\n\nTeam, ZipDo\n\n## Talk directly to our team\n\n\"Share a few lines about your website, audience, and what you're planning. My team and I will get\nback to you with ideas on how we can work together \u2013 from featuring our research to exploring\nlong-term collaborations.\"\n\nTypical use cases include media and PR requests, content collaborations, research partnerships, and\nstrategic data projects.\n\n## Email Our Team\n\nFor all collaboration, research, media, and general inquiries, please contact us at:\n\n[[email protected]][70]\n\nWe typically respond within 1\u20132 business days. To help us respond faster, include your website URL,\nindustry, and what you'd like to achieve.\n\nPopular reasons to reach out\n* Featuring ZipDo data or research in your content\n* Joint content, media, or audience partnerships\n* Custom market research and data projects\n\nFAQ\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### What is ZipDo?\n\nZipDo is a comprehensive platform providing data-driven reports focused on education and careers. We\ncompile various data points and studies across a wide range of topics, presenting them in an\naccessible, edited format. Our primary audience includes students, professionals, journalists, and\nresearchers seeking reliable educational insights.\n\n### Is ZipDo a trustworthy source?\n\nYes! Our statistical reports have been referenced in high-quality magazines, newspapers, and blogs\nworldwide. We maintain rigorous standards for our data collection and content creation process, with\nall statistics vetted against strict quality criteria before inclusion.\n\n### How do you create your content?\n\nOur content follows a four-step process: 1) Research Collection from reputable public domains, 2)\nThematic Organization using advanced algorithms, 3) Content Creation combining human expertise with\nAI assistance, 4) Quality Assurance with editorial review. We aim to update our articles annually\nwith the latest data.\n\n### Can I cite ZipDo content in my work?\n\nAbsolutely! Our content has been cited by major publications and organizations. When citing, please\ninclude the article title, ZipDo as the source, and the URL.\n\n### How can I suggest corrections, improvements, or collaboration ideas?\n\nWe're committed to accuracy and welcome your feedback and partnership ideas. If you find incorrect\ndata, have suggestions for improvement, or want to explore working together, please contact us at\n[[email protected]][71].\n\nWant to learn more about our editorial process?\n\n[View Editorial Process][72]\n\n## Get in Touch\n\nQuestions about our data, methodology, or research services? We'd love to hear from you.\n\n[Contact us][73]\n\n[[email protected]][74] \u00b7 We typically respond within 1\u20132 business days.\n\n## Our Most Popular Data\n\n[All Categories][75][AI In Industry][76][Technology Digital Media][77][Safety\nAccidents][78][Entertainment Events][79][Medical Conditions Disorders][80][Mental Health\nPsychology][81][Social Issues Societal Trends][82][Manufacturing Engineering][83][Marketing\nAdvertising][84][Education Learning][85]\n\n### Social Media\n* [LinkedIn][86]\n* [X (Twitter)][87]\n* [YouTube][88]\n* [Product Hunt][89]\n\n### Rating Platforms\n* [Clutch][90]\n* [Crunchbase][91]\n* [G2][92]\n* [DesignRush][93]\n\n### Press & Media\n* [Digg][94]\n* [LinkedIn Article][95]\n* [Medium][96]\n* [SlideShare \u2013 Company][97]\n* [SlideShare \u2013 Team][98]\n\n[[ZipDo Inverted Logo]][99]\n* [Home][100]\n* [Privacy Policy][101]\n* [Company][102]\n* [Contact Us][103]\n* [Editorial Process][104]\n* [As Seen In][105]\n* [Partners][106]\n* [Careers][107]\n* [Custom Research][108]\n* [Industry Reports][109]\n* [Software Advisory][110]\n* [Software Alternatives][111]\n* [All Articles][112]\n\n### Disclaimer: How We Earn Money\n\nOur data and research articles are available to our readers free of charge. We currently monetize\nour website through display advertising and cooperations with individual companies.\n\n\u00a9 2026 ZipDo.co. All rights reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /services/\n[3]: /services/custom-research/\n[4]: /services/industry-reports/\n[5]: /services/software-advisory/\n[6]: /topics/\n[7]: /best/\n[8]: /topic/ai-in-industry/\n[9]: /topic/technology-digital-media/\n[10]: /topic/safety-accidents/\n[11]: /topic/entertainment-events/\n[12]: /topic/medical-conditions-disorders/\n[13]: /topic/mental-health-psychology/\n[14]: /topic/social-issues-societal-trends/\n[15]: /topic/manufacturing-engineering/\n[16]: /topic/marketing-advertising/\n[17]: /topic/education-learning/\n[18]: /best/\n[19]: /best/\n[20]: /best/category/aerospace-aviation-space/\n[21]: /best/category/aerospace-defense/\n[22]: /best/category/agriculture-farming/\n[23]: /best/category/ai-in-industry/\n[24]: /best/category/art-design/\n[25]: /best/category/arts-creative-expression/\n[26]: /best/category/automotive-services/\n[27]: /best/category/beverages-alcohol/\n[28]: /how-we-work/\n[29]: /about/\n[30]: /blog/\n[31]: /careers/\n[32]: /as-seen-in/\n[33]: /partners/\n[34]: /contact-us/\n[35]: /\n[36]: /\n[37]: /services/\n[38]: /services/custom-research/\n[39]: /services/industry-reports/\n[40]: /services/software-advisory/\n[41]: /topics/\n[42]: /best/\n[43]: /topic/ai-in-industry/\n[44]: /topic/technology-digital-media/\n[45]: /topic/safety-accidents/\n[46]: /topic/entertainment-events/\n[47]: /topic/medical-conditions-disorders/\n[48]: /topic/mental-health-psychology/\n[49]: /topic/social-issues-societal-trends/\n[50]: /topic/manufacturing-engineering/\n[51]: /topic/marketing-advertising/\n[52]: /topic/education-learning/\n[53]: /best/\n[54]: /best/category/aerospace-aviation-space/\n[55]: /best/category/aerospace-defense/\n[56]: /best/category/agriculture-farming/\n[57]: /best/category/ai-in-industry/\n[58]: /best/category/art-design/\n[59]: /best/category/arts-creative-expression/\n[60]: /best/category/automotive-services/\n[61]: /best/category/beverages-alcohol/\n[62]: /best/category/biotechnology-pharmaceuticals/\n[63]: /best/category/business-finance/\n[64]: /how-we-work/\n[65]: /about/\n[66]: /careers/\n[67]: /as-seen-in/\n[68]: /partners/\n[69]: /contact-us/\n[70]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#89e0e7efe6c9f3e0f9ede6a7eae6\n[71]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[72]: /how-we-work/\n[73]: /contact-us/\n[74]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\n[75]: /best/\n[76]: /topic/ai-in-industry/\n[77]: /topic/technology-digital-media/\n[78]: /topic/safety-accidents/\n[79]: /topic/entertainment-events/\n[80]: /topic/medical-conditions-disorders/\n[81]: /topic/mental-health-psychology/\n[82]: /topic/social-issues-societal-trends/\n[83]: /topic/manufacturing-engineering/\n[84]: /topic/marketing-advertising/\n[85]: /topic/education-learning/\n[86]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/zipdo/about/?viewAsMember=true\n[87]: https://x.com/i/communities/2024839078873628780\n[88]: https://www.youtube.com/@zipdo_market_research\n[89]: https://www.producthunt.com/products/zipdo-market-research-services-data\n[90]: https://clutch.co/profile/zipdo-market-research\n[91]: https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/zipdo-market-research-service-data\n[92]: https://www.g2.com/products/zipdo-market-research/reviews?source=search\n[93]: https://www.designrush.com/agency/profile/zipdo-market-research\n[94]: https://digg.com/demandgeneration/Mqq3yFY/the-5-data-sources-that-wont\n[95]: https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/top-5-most-trustworthy-data-sources-internet-alexander-eser-vjw\nif/\n[96]: https://medium.com/p/86a798df536a?postPublishedType=initial\n[97]: https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/zipdo-market-research-company-presentation/286147771\n[98]: https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/meet-the-team-behind-zipdo-team-presentation/286184861\n[99]: /\n[100]: /\n[101]: /privacy-policy/\n[102]: /about/\n[103]: /contact-us/\n[104]: /how-we-work/\n[105]: /as-seen-in/\n[106]: /partners/\n[107]: /careers/\n[108]: /services/custom-research/\n[109]: /services/industry-reports/\n[110]: /services/software-advisory/\n[111]: /alternative/\n[112]: /articles/"
