 [Partners][68]\n* [Contact Us][69]\n[Home][70]\u203a[Company][71]\u203aAmara Williams\n[Amara Williams]\n\n# Amara Williams\n\nResearch Analyst at ZipDo\n\nAmara holds a Master's in Law from Howard University School of Law and a Bachelor's in Business\nAdministration from Spelman College. She spent five years as a legal technology researcher at an\nindependent legal industry advisory firm in Washington, D.C.. She later worked as a freelance legal\noperations analyst. At ZipDo, she covers legal operations technology, contract intelligence\nplatforms, and legal spend management market trends.\n\n[Email Amara][72]\n\n## About Amara\n\nAmara Williams is a Research Analyst at ZipDo, specializing in legal operations technology, contract\nintelligence platforms, and legal spend management market trends. She holds a Master's degree in Law\nfrom Howard University School of Law and a Bachelor's degree in Business Administration from Spelman\nCollege. Amara spent five years as a legal technology researcher at an independent legal industry\nadvisory firm in Washington, D.C., where she produced annual reports on legal operations platform\nadoption, contract analytics tool benchmarking, and corporate legal department technology spending.\nShe later worked as a freelance legal operations analyst for corporate legal departments and legal\ntechnology vendors. At ZipDo, Amara applies her research expertise and analytical rigor to produce\nwell-sourced, data-driven reports on legal operations technology, contract intelligence platforms,\nand legal spend management market trends.\n\n## Articles by Amara\n\nReports written or fact-checked by Amara Williams\n* [Top 10 Best Remote Network Management Software of 2026][73](AUTHOR)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Business Broker Software of 2026][74](AUTHOR)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Client Tracking Software of 2026][75](AUTHOR)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Data Synchronization Software of 2026][76](AUTHOR)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best In House