            "text": "[[ZipDo.co Logo]][1]\n* Services\n[All Services][2][Custom Market Research][3][Industry Reports][4][Software Advisory][5]\n* Market Data\n[All Market Data][6][All Categories][7][AI In Industry(740)][8][Technology Digital\nMedia(605)][9][Safety Accidents(479)][10][Entertainment Events(476)][11][Medical Conditions\nDisorders(476)][12][Mental Health Psychology(402)][13][Social Issues Societal\nTrends(358)][14][Manufacturing Engineering(353)][15][Marketing Advertising(347)][16][Education\nLearning(345)][17]\n* [Software Advice][18]\n[All Software Advice][19][Aerospace Aviation Space(204)][20][Aerospace\nDefense(43)][21][Agriculture Farming(288)][22][AI In Industry(573)][23][Art Design(2119)][24][Arts\nCreative Expression(518)][25][Automotive Services(822)][26][Beverages Alcohol(29)][27]\n* [Editorial Process][28]\n* Company\n[About Us][29][Blog][30][Careers][31][As Seen In][32][Partners][33]\n* [Contact Us][34]\n[[ZipDo Mobile Logo]][35]\u2630\n* [Home][36]\n* Services\n* [All Services][37]\n* [Custom Market Research][38]\n* [Industry Reports][39]\n* [Software Advisory][40]\n* Market Data\n* [All Market Data][41]\n* [All Categories][42]\n* [AI In Industry(740)][43]\n* [Technology Digital Media(605)][44]\n* [Safety Accidents(479)][45]\n* [Entertainment Events(476)][46]\n* [Medical Conditions Disorders(476)][47]\n* [Mental Health Psychology(402)][48]\n* [Social Issues Societal Trends(358)][49]\n* [Manufacturing Engineering(353)][50]\n* [Marketing Advertising(347)][51]\n* [Education Learning(345)][52]\n* [Software Advice][53]\n* [Aerospace Aviation Space(204)][54]\n* [Aerospace Defense(43)][55]\n* [Agriculture Farming(288)][56]\n* [AI In Industry(573)][57]\n* [Art Design(2119)][58]\n* [Arts Creative Expression(518)][59]\n* [Automotive Services(822)][60]\n* [Beverages Alcohol(29)][61]\n* [Biotechnology Pharmaceuticals(192)][62]\n* [Business Finance(5273)][63]\n* [Editorial Process][64]\n* Company\n* [About Us][65]\n* [Careers][66]\n* [As Seen In][67]\n* [Partners][68]\n* [Contact Us][69]\n[Home][70]\u203a[Company][71]\u203aAndrew Morrison\n[Andrew Morrison]\n\n# Andrew Morrison\n\nResearch Analyst at ZipDo\n\nAndrew holds a Master's in Finance from University of Edinburgh and a Bachelor's in Engineering from\nHeriot-Watt University. He spent six years as a clean energy finance researcher at an independent\ninfrastructure investment advisory firm in Edinburgh. He later worked as a freelance clean energy\nanalyst. At ZipDo, he covers renewable energy project finance, green infrastructure bonds, and clean\nenergy investment data.\n\n[Email Andrew][72]\n\n## About Andrew\n\nAndrew Morrison is a Research Analyst at ZipDo, specializing in renewable energy project finance,\ngreen infrastructure bonds, and clean energy investment data. He holds a Master's degree in Finance\nfrom University of Edinburgh and a Bachelor's degree in Engineering from Heriot-Watt University.\nAndrew spent six years as a clean energy finance researcher at an independent infrastructure\ninvestment advisory firm in Edinburgh, where he produced annual reports on renewable energy project\nfinance deal flow, green bond issuance, and clean energy infrastructure ROI benchmarking. He later\nworked as a freelance clean energy analyst for infrastructure funds and renewable energy development\nfirms. At ZipDo, Andrew applies his research expertise and analytical rigor to produce well-sourced,\ndata-driven reports on renewable energy project finance, green infrastructure bonds, and clean\nenergy investment data.\n\n## Articles by Andrew\n\nReports written or fact-checked by Andrew Morrison\n* [Top 10 Best Japanese Language Translation Services of 2026][73](AUTHOR)Jun 28, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Medical Billing Management Software of 2026][74](AUTHOR)Jun 28, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Medical Billing Hipaa Compliant Software of 2026][75](AUTHOR)Jun 28, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Japanese Interpreting Services of 2026][76](AUTHOR)Jun 28, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Medical Billing