 [Partners][68]\n* [Contact Us][69]\n[Home][70]\u203a[Company][71]\u203aAnnika Holm\n[Annika Holm]\n\n# Annika Holm\n\nData Analyst at ZipDo\n\nAnnika holds a Master's in Environmental Economics from the University of Gothenburg and a\nBachelor's in Natural Sciences from the University of Helsinki. She spent four years at a Nordic\nclimate finance advisory firm before freelancing as a climate technology analyst. At ZipDo, she\nfocuses on renewable energy markets, carbon credit trading, and climate technology investment.\n\n[Email Annika][72]\n\n## About Annika\n\nAnnika Holm is a Data Analyst at ZipDo, focused on renewable energy markets, carbon credit trading\nplatforms, and climate technology investment trends. She holds a Master's degree in Environmental\nEconomics from the University of Gothenburg and a Bachelor's degree in Natural Sciences from the\nUniversity of Helsinki. Annika spent four years as a clean energy research analyst at an independent\nNordic climate finance advisory firm, where she contributed to annual assessments of renewable\nenergy project economics, carbon market liquidity, and green bond issuance trends. She later worked\nas a freelance climate technology analyst producing market landscape reports for impact investors\nand energy transition funds. At ZipDo, Annika ensures that all renewable energy and carbon market\ndata is sourced from verified exchange records, regulatory filings, and institutional energy\ndatabases.\n\n## Articles by Annika\n\nReports written or fact-checked by Annika Holm\n* [Odd Statistics][73](AUTHOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Middle East Events Industry Statistics][74](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Sustainability In The Publishing Industry Statistics][75](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Customer Experience In The Healthcare Industry Statistics][76](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Bail Bond Industry Statistics][77](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Dog Breeding Statistics][78](AUTHOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Diversity Equity And Inclusion In The Gambling Industry Sta