            "text": "[[ZipDo.co Logo]][1]\n* Services\n[All Services][2][Custom Market Research][3][Industry Reports][4][Software Advisory][5]\n* Market Data\n[All Market Data][6][All Categories][7][AI In Industry(740)][8][Technology Digital\nMedia(605)][9][Safety Accidents(479)][10][Entertainment Events(476)][11][Medical Conditions\nDisorders(476)][12][Mental Health Psychology(402)][13][Social Issues Societal\nTrends(358)][14][Manufacturing Engineering(353)][15][Marketing Advertising(347)][16][Education\nLearning(345)][17]\n* [Software Advice][18]\n[All Software Advice][19][Aerospace Aviation Space(204)][20][Aerospace\nDefense(43)][21][Agriculture Farming(288)][22][AI In Industry(573)][23][Art Design(2119)][24][Arts\nCreative Expression(518)][25][Automotive Services(822)][26][Beverages Alcohol(29)][27]\n* [Editorial Process][28]\n* Company\n[About Us][29][Blog][30][Careers][31][As Seen In][32][Partners][33]\n* [Contact Us][34]\n[[ZipDo Mobile Logo]][35]\u2630\n* [Home][36]\n* Services\n* [All Services][37]\n* [Custom Market Research][38]\n* [Industry Reports][39]\n* [Software Advisory][40]\n* Market Data\n* [All Market Data][41]\n* [All Categories][42]\n* [AI In Industry(740)][43]\n* [Technology Digital Media(605)][44]\n* [Safety Accidents(479)][45]\n* [Entertainment Events(476)][46]\n* [Medical Conditions Disorders(476)][47]\n* [Mental Health Psychology(402)][48]\n* [Social Issues Societal Trends(358)][49]\n* [Manufacturing Engineering(353)][50]\n* [Marketing Advertising(347)][51]\n* [Education Learning(345)][52]\n* [Software Advice][53]\n* [Aerospace Aviation Space(204)][54]\n* [Aerospace Defense(43)][55]\n* [Agriculture Farming(288)][56]\n* [AI In Industry(573)][57]\n* [Art Design(2119)][58]\n* [Arts Creative Expression(518)][59]\n* [Automotive Services(822)][60]\n* [Beverages Alcohol(29)][61]\n* [Biotechnology Pharmaceuticals(192)][62]\n* [Business Finance(5273)][63]\n* [Editorial Process][64]\n* Company\n* [About Us][65]\n* [Careers][66]\n* [As Seen In][67]\n* [Partners][68]\n* [Contact Us][69]\n[Home][70]\u203a[Company][71]\u203aAstrid Johansson\n[Astrid Johansson]\n\n# Astrid Johansson\n\nSenior Data Analyst at ZipDo\n\nAstrid holds a Master's in Information Security from KTH Royal Institute of Technology and a\nBachelor's in Computer Science from Link\u00f6ping University. She spent four years as a digital identity\nresearcher at an independent cybersecurity advisory firm in Stockholm. She later worked as a\nfreelance identity technology analyst. At ZipDo, she covers digital identity platforms,\nauthentication technology, and privacy management market trends.\n\n[Email Astrid][72]\n\n## About Astrid\n\nAstrid Johansson is a Senior Data Analyst at ZipDo, specializing in digital identity platforms,\nauthentication technology, and privacy management market trends. She holds a Master's degree in\nInformation Security from KTH Royal Institute of Technology and a Bachelor's degree in Computer\nScience from Link\u00f6ping University. Astrid spent four years as a digital identity researcher at an\nindependent cybersecurity advisory firm in Stockholm, where she contributed to annual reports on\nidentity verification platform adoption, biometric authentication trends, and privacy management\ntechnology market sizing. She later worked as a freelance identity technology analyst for\ncybersecurity vendors and digital identity industry associations. At ZipDo, Astrid applies her\nresearch expertise and analytical rigor to produce well-sourced, data-driven reports on digital\nidentity platforms, authentication technology, and privacy management market trends.\n\n## Articles by Astrid\n\nReports written or fact-checked by Astrid Johansson\n* [Top 10 Best Window Cleaning Service Software of 2026][73](FACT CHECKER)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Quality And Compliance Management Software of 2026][74](FACT CHECKER)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Payroll Attendance Software of 2026][75](FACT CHECKER)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Computational Fl