            "text": "[[ZipDo.co Logo]][1]\n* Services\n[All Services][2][Custom Market Research][3][Industry Reports][4][Software Advisory][5]\n* Market Data\n[All Market Data][6][All Categories][7][AI In Industry(740)][8][Technology Digital\nMedia(605)][9][Safety Accidents(479)][10][Entertainment Events(476)][11][Medical Conditions\nDisorders(476)][12][Mental Health Psychology(402)][13][Social Issues Societal\nTrends(358)][14][Manufacturing Engineering(353)][15][Marketing Advertising(347)][16][Education\nLearning(345)][17]\n* [Software Advice][18]\n[All Software Advice][19][Aerospace Aviation Space(204)][20][Aerospace\nDefense(43)][21][Agriculture Farming(288)][22][AI In Industry(573)][23][Art Design(2119)][24][Arts\nCreative Expression(518)][25][Automotive Services(822)][26][Beverages Alcohol(29)][27]\n* [Editorial Process][28]\n* Company\n[About Us][29][Blog][30][Careers][31][As Seen In][32][Partners][33]\n* [Contact Us][34]\n[[ZipDo Mobile Logo]][35]\u2630\n* [Home][36]\n* Services\n* [All Services][37]\n* [Custom Market Research][38]\n* [Industry Reports][39]\n* [Software Advisory][40]\n* Market Data\n* [All Market Data][41]\n* [All Categories][42]\n* [AI In Industry(740)][43]\n* [Technology Digital Media(605)][44]\n* [Safety Accidents(479)][45]\n* [Entertainment Events(476)][46]\n* [Medical Conditions Disorders(476)][47]\n* [Mental Health Psychology(402)][48]\n* [Social Issues Societal Trends(358)][49]\n* [Manufacturing Engineering(353)][50]\n* [Marketing Advertising(347)][51]\n* [Education Learning(345)][52]\n* [Software Advice][53]\n* [Aerospace Aviation Space(204)][54]\n* [Aerospace Defense(43)][55]\n* [Agriculture Farming(288)][56]\n* [AI In Industry(573)][57]\n* [Art Design(2119)][58]\n* [Arts Creative Expression(518)][59]\n* [Automotive Services(822)][60]\n* [Beverages Alcohol(29)][61]\n* [Biotechnology Pharmaceuticals(193)][62]\n* [Business Finance(5273)][63]\n* [Editorial Process][64]\n* Company\n* [About Us][65]\n* [Careers][66]\n* [As Seen In][67]\n* [Partners][68]\n* [Contact Us][69]\n[Home][70]\u203a[Company][71]\u203aCatherine Hale\n[Catherine Hale]\n\n# Catherine Hale\n\nSenior Market Analyst at ZipDo\n\nCatherine holds a Master's in Sustainability Management from the University of Cambridge and a\nBachelor's in Environmental Studies from Middlebury College. She spent six years at an ESG advisory\nfirm in London producing corporate climate disclosure benchmarks. She later advised asset managers\non ESG reporting standards. At ZipDo, she focuses on sustainability, ESG reporting, and corporate\nresponsibility.\n\n[Email Catherine][72]\n\n## About Catherine\n\nCatherine Hale is a Senior Market Analyst at ZipDo, focused on sustainability, ESG reporting, and\ncorporate responsibility market trends. She holds a Master's degree in Sustainability Management\nfrom the University of Cambridge and a Bachelor's degree in Environmental Studies from Middlebury\nCollege. Catherine spent six years as a sustainability research analyst at an independent ESG\nadvisory firm in London, where she produced annual benchmarking reports on corporate climate\ndisclosure, sustainable supply chain practices, and ESG investor sentiment. She subsequently worked\nas a freelance sustainability analyst advising institutional asset managers and corporate\nsustainability teams on reporting standards and peer benchmarking. At ZipDo, Catherine ensures that\nall ESG and sustainability data is grounded in verified regulatory filings, internationally\nrecognized reporting frameworks, and auditable corporate disclosures.\n\n## Articles by Catherine\n\nReports written or fact-checked by Catherine Hale\n* [Top 10 Best Order Flow Software of 2026][73](EDITOR)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Algo Trading Software of 2026][74](EDITOR)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Newest SEO Software of 2026][75](FACT CHECKER)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Finance Manager Software of 2026][76](FACT CHECKER)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Personal Medical Record Software of 2026][77](FACT CHECKER)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Redact Software of 2026][78](FACT CHECKER)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Top 10 Best Compounding Pharmacy Software of 2026][79](EDITOR)Feb 18, 2026\n* [Surprising Statistics][80](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Baccarat Statistics][81](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Snap Statistics][82](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Employment Industry Statistics][83](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Oxycodone Abuse Statistics][84](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [German Construction Industry Statistics][85](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [State Vital Statistics][86](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Hvacr Industry Statistics][87](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Non Profit Statistics][88](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Germany AI Industry Statistics][89](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Baseball Betting Statistics][90](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Chef Industry Statistics][91](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Telework Statistics][92](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Dyeing Industry Statistics][93](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [New York City Construction Industry Statistics][94](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Penis Statistics][95](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Guanajuato Industry Statistics][96](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [AI In The Power Industry Statistics][97](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Padel Statistics][98](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [AI In The Building Materials Industry Statistics][99](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Home Automation Industry Statistics][100](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Sic Industry Statistics][101](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Uae Pet Industry Statistics][102](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [AI In The Convenience Store Industry Statistics][103](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Wire And Cable Industry Statistics][104](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Marketing In The Retail Industry Statistics][105](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Remote And Hybrid Work In The Cosmetics Industry Statistics][106](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Veterans Suicide Statistics][107](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [AI In The Cyber Security Industry Statistics][108](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Roundabout Accident Statistics][109](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Catcalling Statistics][110](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Call To Action Statistics][111](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Diversity Equity And Inclusion In The Chemical Industry Statistics][112](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12,\n2026\n* [Marketing In The Art Industry Statistics][113](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Religious Sexual Abuse Statistics][114](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Millennial Travel Statistics][115](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Motorcycle Injuries Statistics][116](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Vaccine Refusal Statistics][117](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Digital Transformation In The Furniture Industry Statistics][118](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Welfare Statistics][119](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Bullying Statistics][120](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Phone Number For Vital Statistics][121](FACT CHECKER)Feb 12, 2026\n* [Linguistic Cultural Studies Industry Statistics][122](EDITOR)Feb 12, 2026\n\n## Contact Catherine\n\nFor questions about research methodology, data quality, or custom research, reach out to Catherine\nHale at [[email protected]][123].\n\nFor general inquiries, use our [contact page][124].\n\n\u00a9 2026 ZipDo. Independent market research platform. [zipdo.co][125]\n\n## Get in Touch\n\nQuestions about our data, methodology, or research services? We'd love to hear from you.\n\n[Contact us][126]\n\n[[email protected]][127] \u00b7 We typically respond within 1\u20132 business days.\n\n## Our Most Popular Data\n\n[All Categories][128][AI In Industry][129][Technology Digital Media][130][Safety\nAccidents][131][Entertainment Events][132][Medical Conditions Disorders][133][Mental Health\nPsychology][134][Social Issues Societal Trends][135][Manufacturing Engineering][136][Marketing\nAdvertising][137][Education Learning][138]\n\n### Social Media\n* [LinkedIn][139]\n* [X (Twitter)][140]\n* [YouTube][141]\n* [Product Hunt][142]\n\n### Rating Platforms\n* [Clutch][143]\n* [Crunchbase][144]\n* [G2][145]\n* [DesignRush][146]\n\n### Press & Media\n* [Digg][147]\n* [LinkedIn Article][148]\n* [Medium][149]\n* [SlideShare \u2013 Company][150]\n* [SlideShare \u2013 Team][151]\n\n[[ZipDo Inverted Logo]][152]\n* [Home][153]\n* [Privacy Policy][154]\n* [Company][155]\n* [Contact Us][156]\n* [Editorial Process][157]\n* [As Seen In][158]\n* [Partners][159]\n* [Careers][160]\n* [Custom Research][161]\n* [Industry Reports][162]\n* [Software Advisory][163]\n* [Software Alternatives][164]\n* [All Articles][165]\n\n### Disclaimer: How We Earn Money\n\nOur data and research articles are available to our readers free of charge. We currently monetize\nour website through display advertising and cooperations with individual companies.\n\n\u00a9 2026 ZipDo.co. All rights reserved.\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /services/\n[3]: /services/custom-research/\n[4]: /services/industry-reports/\n[5]: /services/software-advisory/\n[6]: /topics/\n[7]: /best/\n[8]: /topic/ai-in-industry/\n[9]: /topic/technology-digital-media/\n[10]: /topic/safety-accidents/\n[11]: /topic/entertainment-events/\n[12]: /topic/medical-conditions-disorders/\n[13]: /topic/mental-health-psychology/\n[14]: /topic/social-issues-societal-trends/\n[15]: /topic/manufacturing-engineering/\n[16]: /topic/marketing-advertising/\n[17]: /topic/education-learning/\n[18]: /best/\n[19]: /best/\n[20]: /best/category/aerospace-aviation-space/\n[21]: /best/category/aerospace-defense/\n[22]: /best/category/agriculture-farming/\n[23]: /best/category/ai-in-industry/\n[24]: /best/category/art-design/\n[25]: /best/category/arts-creative-expression/\n[26]: /best/category/automotive-services/\n[27]: /best/category/beverages-alcohol/\n[28]: /how-we-work/\n[29]: /about/\n[30]: /blog/\n[31]: /careers/\n[32]: /as-seen-in/\n[33]: /partners/\n[34]: /contact-us/\n[35]: /\n[36]: /\n[37]: /services/\n[38]: /services/custom-research/\n[39]: /services/industry-reports/\n[40]: /services/software-advisory/\n[41]: /topics/