              {
                "name": "Catherine Hale",
                "title": "Senior Market Analyst",
                "bio": "Catherine Hale is a Senior Market Analyst at ZipDo, focused on sustainability, ESG reporting, and corporate responsibility market trends. She holds a Master's degree in Sustainability Management from the University of Cambridge and a Bachelor's degree in Environmental Studies from Middlebury College. Catherine spent six years as a sustainability research analyst at an independent ESG advisory firm in London, where she produced annual benchmarking reports on corporate climate disclosure, sustainable supply chain practices, and ESG investor sentiment. She subsequently worked as a freelance sustainability analyst advising institutional asset managers and corporate sustainability teams on reporting standards and peer benchmarking. At ZipDo, Catherine ensures that all ESG and sustainability data is grounded in verified regulatory filings, internationally recognized reporting frameworks, and auditable corporate disclosures.",
