      "company_summary": "KPMG is a global leader in professional services, specializing in audit, tax, and advisory solutions. The firm leverages deep industry expertise and innovative technology to help organizations navigate complex challenges, enhance operational efficiency, and drive value creation across various sectors, including financial services, healthcare, and government. With a commitment to fostering human connections, KPMG empowers clients to transform their businesses and seize new opportunities in an ever-evolving landscape.",
