            "text": "[ person\nLogin\n][1] person close\n* [\n  Preferences\n  ][2]\n* [\n  Profile\n  ][3]\n* Logout\n[ article\nSubmit RFP\n][4]\nGlobal (EN)\nexpand_more\nclose\nSearch cancel\nmenu\n[ [KPMG Logo] ][5]\nclose\n* Our Insights\n  Back\n  * [\n    All Insights\n    ][6]\n  * [\n    AI and Technology\n    ][7]\n  * [\n    ESG\n    ][8]\n  * [\n    Operations\n    ][9]\n  * [\n    Risk and Regulation\n    ][10]\n  * [\n    Transformation\n    ][11]\n  * [\n    Value Creation\n    ][12]\n  * [\n    Workforce\n    ][13]\n* What we do\n  Back\n  [\n  Industries\n  ][14]\n  * [\n    Consumer, Retail & Leisure\n    ][15]\n  * [\n    Energy, Natural Resources & Chemicals\n    ][16]\n  * [\n    Financial Services\n    ][17]\n  * [\n    Healthcare\n    ][18]\n  * [\n    Government & Public Sector\n    ][19]\n  * [\n    Private Enterprise\n    ][20]\n  [\n  Services\n  ][21]\n  * [\n    Advisory\n    ][22]\n  * [\n    AI\n    ][23]\n  * [\n    Audit and Assurance\n    ][24]\n  * [\n    ESG\n    ][25]\n  * [\n    Law\n    ][26]\n  * [\n    Tax\n    ][27]\n  [\n  Global Alliances & Ecosystems\n  ][28]\n  * [\n    Microsoft\n    ][29]\n  * [\n    Oracle\n    ][30]\n  * [\n    Salesforce\n    ][31]\n  * [\n    SAP\n    ][32]\n  * [\n    ServiceNow\n    ][33]\n  * [\n    Workday\n    ][34]\n* [\n  About KPMG\n  ][35]\n* Careers\n  Back\n  * [\n    KPMG Careers\n    ][36]\n  * [\n    Who we are\n    ][37]\n  * [\n    What we do\n    ][38]\n  * [\n    Working at KPMG\n    ][39]\n  * [\n    Job search\n    ][40]\n\n\n\n[ person\nLogin\n][41] person close\n* [\n  Preferences\n  ][42]\n* [\n  Profile\n  ][43]\n* Logout\n[ article\nSubmit RFP\n][44]\nGlobal (EN)\nexpand_more\n\n\n\n[ person\nLogin\n][45] person close\n* [\n  Preferences\n  ][46]\n* [\n  Profile\n  ][47]\n* Logout\nsearch\nSearch\nsearch\n\nYour search term was too short.\n\nSearch terms must include 3 or more characters.\n\nPrevious search terms\nclose\nCancel\n\n# The tax readiness dividend\n\nUncover how leading tax functions are creating enterprise value.\n\n[Explore more][48]\n\n## Our tax insights\n\n### [Making tax compliance agile][49]\n\nDiscover how Amadeus worked with KPMG Spain to simplify tax complexity, accelerate reporting and\nnavigate regulatory change.\n\n[Explore more ][50]\n[ ][51]\n\n### [Turning tax complexity in M&A into lasting deal value][52]\n\nLearn how evolving tax rules, cross\u2011border structuring and rising tax transparency are shaping\nglobal M&A activity, valuations and deal execution.\u00a0\n\n[Explore more ][53]\n[ ][54]\n\n### [Moving AI in finance from adoption to advantage][55]\n\nUnderstand how financial institutions are using AI to enhance tax governance, streamline compliance\nand manage tax risk.\n\n[Explore more ][56]\n[ ][57]\n\n#### The world is shifting. Is your strategy ready?\n\nJoin our Global Economic & Geopolitical Outlook webcast on 25 June for insight on the forces\nreshaping business.\n\n[Register now][58]\n\n## Make the Difference with KPMG\n\nAt KPMG, what sets us apart isn't just what we do, it's how we do it.\n\nWe\u2019re leveraging deep expertise and innovative technology to turn insights into opportunity and move\nbusiness and innovation forward, placing human connections at the center.\n\nTogether, we make the difference.\n\n[ Learn more ][59]\n[ Explore our Client Stories ][60]\n\n## Discover our perspectives across key areas\n\ncall_made\n\n### [Value creation][61]\n\nWhether you are transacting or transforming, you need to ensure you are capturing all the value you\ncan from your assets and investments.\u00a0\n\n[Explore ][62]\ntransform\n\n### [Transformation][63]\n\nThe world is rapidly changing. And change can create significant opportunities. Yet, from our\nperspective, seizing those opportunities requires vision, insights and capabilities.\n\n[Explore ][64]\npeople\n\n### [Workforce][65]\n\nThe way people work is changing.\u00a0Creating and sustaining the right workforce to achieve your\norganization\u2019s objectives has never been more challenging.\u00a0\n\n[Explore ][66]\nworkspaces\n\n### [Operations][67]\n\nMany organizations are under pressure to do things better, more efficiently, more effectively, at a\nlower cost, at a higher quality, using fewer resources and at a faster pace.\n\n[Explore ][68]\ndevices_other\n\n### [AI and Technology][69]\n\nThe technology landscape is complicated. Hype fills the air. And you are under growing pressure to\nmodernize and digitalize.\u00a0\n\n[Explore ][70]\nforest\n\n### [ESG][71]\n\nESG and Sustainability are broad topics. And they're rapidly evolving. Staying on top of the issues\ncan require leaders to stay informed, engaged and open-minded.\n\n[Explore ][72]\nbar_chart\n\n### [Risk and Regulation][73]\n\nIn a complex world where finance, trade, technology and environment intersect in different and\nevolving ways, we believe conventional approaches to risk and regulatory compliance are no longer\nfit for purpose.\n\n[Explore ][74]\n\n#### Subscribe to KPMG Insights\n\nAccess personalized content based on your interests by signing up today.\n\n[Create an account][75]\n\n#### Interested in a career at KPMG?\n\nWe want to support you on your journey to create an impactful career. Join us and you too can do\nwork that matters.\n\n[Find your next opportunity][76]\n\n## Welcome to KPMG. Looks like you are visiting from .\n\nDiscover Global perspectives or visit your local firm site for regional services and insights.\n[ Remain on KPMG Global ][77]\n[ [Logo] ][78]\n\n###### Contact\n* [ Contact Us ][79]\n* [ Submit RFP ][80]\n\n###### Contact\n* [ Contact Us ][81]\n* [ Submit RFP ][82]\n\n###### Media\n* [ Newsroom ][83]\n* [ Press Releases ][84]\n\n###### Media\n* [ Newsroom ][85]\n* [ Press Releases ][86]\n\n###### Company\n* [ Careers ][87]\n* [ About Us ][88]\n\n###### Company\n* [ Careers ][89]\n* [ About Us ][90]\n* [ Legal ][91]\n* [ Privacy ][92]\n* [ Accessibility ][93]\n* [ Help ][94]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Copyright owned by one or more of the KPMG International entities. KPMG International\nentities provide no services to clients. All rights reserved.\n\nKPMG refers to the global organization or to one or more of the member firms of KPMG International\nLimited (\u201cKPMG International\u201d), each of which is a separate legal entity. KPMG International Limited\nis a private English company limited by guarantee and does not provide services to clients. For more\ndetail about our structure please visit\u00a0[https://kpmg.com/governance][95].\n\nMember firms of the KPMG network of independent firms are affiliated with KPMG International. KPMG\nInternational provides no client services. No member firm has any authority to obligate or bind KPMG\nInternational or any other member firm vis-\u00e0-vis third parties, nor does KPMG International have any\nsuch authority to obligate or bind any member firm.\n\nThroughout this website, \u201cwe\u201d, \u201cKPMG\u201d, \u201cus\u201d and \u201cour\u201d refers to the KPMG global organization, to\nKPMG International Limited (\u201cKPMG International\u201d), and/or to one or more of the member firms of KPMG\nInternational, each of which is a separate legal entity.\n\n[1]: https://kpmg.com/xx/en/account/login.html\n[2]: https://kpmg.com/xx/en/account/preference-management.html\n[3]: https://kpmg.com/xx/en/account/profile.html\n[4]: /content/experience-fragments/kpmgpublic/xx/en/site/rfp-form-location-selector-overlay/master.h\ntml\n[5]: /xx/en.html\n[6]: /xx/en/our-insights.html\n[7]: /xx/en/our-insights/ai-and-technology.html\n[8]: /xx/en/our-insights/esg.html\n[9]: /xx/en/our-insights/operations.html\n[10]: /xx/en/our-insights/risk-and-regulation.html\n[11]: /xx/en/our-insights/transformation.html\n[12]: /xx/en/our-insights/value-creation.html\n[13]: /xx/en/our-insights/workforce.html\n[14]: /xx/en/what-we-do/industries.html\n[15]: /xx/en/what-we-do/industries/consumer-retail-and-leisure.html\n[16]: /xx/en/what-we-do/industries/energy-natural-resources-chemicals.html\n[17]: /xx/en/what-we-do/industries/financial-services.html\n[18]: /xx/en/what-we-do/industries/healthcare.html\n[19]: /xx/en/what-we-do/industries/government.html\n[20]: /xx/en/what-we-do/industries/private-enterprise.html\n[21]: /xx/en/what-we-do/services.html\n[22]: /xx/en/what-we-do/services/advisory.html\n[23]: /xx/en/what-we-do/services/ai.html\n[24]: /xx/en/what-we-do/services/audit.html\n[25]: /xx/en/what-we-do/ESG.html\n[26]: /xx/en/what-we-do/services/law.html\n[27]: /xx/en/what-we-do/services/tax.html\n[28]: /xx/en/what-we-do/alliances.html\n[29]: /xx/en/what-we-do/alliances/microsoft.html\n[30]: /xx/en/what-we-do/alliances/oracle.html\n[31]: /xx/en/what-we-do/alliances/salesforce.html\n[32]: /xx/en/what-we-do/alliances/kpmg-and-sap.html\n[33]: /xx/en/what-we-do/alliances/service-now.html\n[34]: /xx/en/what-we-do/alliances/workday.html\n[35]: /xx/en/about.html\n[36]: /xx/en/careers.html\n[37]: /xx/en/careers/who-we-are.html\n[38]: /xx/en/careers/what-we-do.html\n[39]: /xx/en/careers/working-at-kpmg.html\n[40]: /xx/en/careers/job-search.html\n[41]: https://kpmg.com/xx/en/account/login.html\n[42]: https://kpmg.com/xx/en/account/preference-management.html\n[43]: https://kpmg.com/xx/en/account/profile.html\n[44]: /content/experience-fragments/kpmgpublic/xx/en/site/rfp-form-location-selector-overlay/master.\nhtml\n[45]: https://kpmg.com/xx/en/account/login.html\n[46]: https://kpmg.com/xx/en/account/preference-management.html\n[47]: https://kpmg.com/xx/en/account/profile.html\n[48]: /xx/en/our-insights/transformation/global-tax-readiness-dividend.html\n[49]: /xx/en/client-stories/make-tax-compliance-again.html\n[50]: /xx/en/client-stories/make-tax-compliance-again.html\n[51]: /xx/en/client-stories/make-tax-compliance-again.html\n[52]: /xx/en/our-insights/value-creation/global-m-and-a-outlook.html\n[53]: /xx/en/our-insights/value-creation/global-m-and-a-outlook.html\n[54]: /xx/en/our-insights/value-creation/global-m-and-a-outlook.