      "company_summary": "Cisecurity is an independent nonprofit organization dedicated to enhancing cybersecurity in the connected world through the development of the CIS Controls and CIS Benchmarks. The company offers a range of products and services, including CIS Hardened Images\u00ae, CIS Critical Security Controls\u00ae, and managed detection and response services, targeting organizations across various sectors such as government, education, healthcare, finance, and retail. By providing best practices and integrated tools, Cisecurity aims to help organizations improve their cybersecurity posture and protect their IT systems and data.",
