      "polished_summary": "CPS Vo is dedicated to fostering collaboration among professionals in academia, government, and industry within the field of Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS). The organization serves as a platform for knowledge sharing and partnership development, aiming to advance the understanding and application of CPS technologies across various sectors.",
      "audit_reasoning": "CPS Vo is a non-profit organization focused on fostering collaboration and knowledge sharing among professionals in the Cyber-Physical Systems field. It does not manufacture, design, or develop products, nor does it provide specialized services directly related to Cyber-Physical Systems Security.",
