      "company_summary": "Giac is a leading provider of cybersecurity certifications, offering a range of credentials that validate hands-on skills across various roles and disciplines in the cybersecurity field. Their core products include practitioner certifications, micro credentials, and applied knowledge certifications, all designed to demonstrate real-world abilities and advanced expertise. Targeting industry professionals, organizations, and government entities, Giac aims to enhance cybersecurity knowledge and skills globally through rigorous certification standards and training resources.",
