        "crawl_text": "Milwaukee, WI [Skip to main content][1]\n[[logo]][2]\nSearch\nCredentialsGetting CertifiedRenewalFor OrganizationsResourcesAbout\n[Login][3]\n[Login][4]\nCredentials\n* [\n  Practitioner Certifications\n  Validate hands-on cybersecurity skills across core roles and disciplines.][5]\n* [\n  Micro Credentials\n  Demonstrate real-world ability through performance-based assessments.][6]\n* [\n  Applied Knowledge Certifications\n  Showcase advanced expertise across a specialized security domain.][7]\n* [\n  CyberLive\u00ae: Hands-On Testing\n  Prove your real-world cybersecurity skills with virtual machine testing.][8]\n* [\n  Portfolio certifications\n  Prove skills in live, hands-on exam environments.][9]\n* [\n  Focus Areas\n  Browse certifications by domain to find your ideal path.][10]\nFeatured[View All Certifications][11]\nNEW\n[GASAE]\nGIAC AI Security Automation Engineer (GASAE)\n[Learn More][12]\nGetting Certified\n* [\n  Why Certify?\n  Prove your cybersecurity skills with globally recognized, real-world certifications.][13]\n* [\n  How to Prepare\n  Prepare with SANS-aligned training, practice tests, and proven study resources.][14]\n* [\n  Get Started\n  Choose your exam, register, and begin your GIAC certification journey.][15]\n* [\n  Proctoring\n  Learn how GIAC exams are securely proctored for a reliable testing experience.][16]\nRenewal\n* [\n  Renewing Your GIAC Certification\n  Stay certified by meeting renewal requirements and keeping skills current.][17]\n* [\n  Why Renew?\n  Maintain your credential and demonstrate ongoing cybersecurity expertise.][18]\n* [\n  CPE Information\n  Learn how to earn, track, and submit CPE credits for renewal.][19]\n* [\n  How to Renew\n  Follow simple steps to renew your certification and earn required CPEs.][20]\n* [\n  Earn CPEs at Events\n  Earn CPE credits through SANS training, conferences, and approved events.][21]\nFor Organizations\n* [\n  Workforce Development\n  Strengthen teams with GIAC-certified cybersecurity professionals.][22]\n* [\n  Cybersecurity Frameworks\n  See how GIAC certifications align with today\u2019s most recognized cybersecurity skills\n  frameworks.][23]\n* [\n  Cybersecurity Directives\n  See how GIAC certifications align with today\u2019s most recognized cybersecurity directives.][24]\n* [\n  Enterprise Customers\n  Build validated cybersecurity expertise across your organization.][25]\n* [\n  Workforce Study Reports\n  Research on building high-performing cybersecurity teams.][26]\nResources\n* Insights\n  * [Blogs][27][Blogs\n    ][28]\n  * [Research Papers][29][Research Papers\n    ][30]\n  * [Newsletter][31][Newsletter\n    ][32]\n* Resources\n  * [Certification Holder Directory][33][Certification Holder Directory\n    ][34]\n  * [Digital Catalog (PDF)][35][Digital Catalog (PDF)\n    ][36]\n  * [Policies and Guidelines][37][Policies and Guidelines\n    ][38]\n  * [FAQs][39][FAQs\n    ][40]\n  * [Community][41][Community\n    ][42]\n[\n2026 Cybersecurity Workforce Research Report\nLeaders gain workforce insight. Practitioners gain career insight.][43]\nAbout\n* [\n  GIAC Company Info\n  Learn about GIAC\u2019s mission and certification standards.][44]\n* [\n  ANAB Accreditation\n  GIAC is an active accredited ISO/IEC 17024 Personnel Certification Body through ANAB.][45]\n* [\n  Press\n  Explore GIAC news, updates, and media coverage.][46]\n* [\n  Contact\n  Reach GIAC for support, questions, or assistance.][47]\n* [\n  Frequently Asked Questions\n  Find answers to common certification and exam questions.][48]\nSearch\nSearch\n[Login][49]\n[Login][50]\n\n# The Highest Standard In Cybersecurity Certifications\n\nGIAC Certifications provide the highest and most rigorous assurance of cyber security knowledge and\nskill available to industry, government, and military clients across the world.\n\n[Explore Certifications][51][Renew Certification][52]\n[Two men studying on a laptop]\n[The Highest Standard In Cybersecurity Certifications]\nJump to:\nSelectCertification CategoriesCareer StoriesFeatured ContentWhy GIAC\n* [Certification Categories][53]\n* [Career Stories][54]\n* [Featured Content][55]\n* [Why GIAC][56 [Skip to main content][1]\n[[logo]][2]\nSearch\nCredentialsGetting CertifiedRenewalFor OrganizationsResourcesAbout\n[Login][3]\n[Login][4]\nCredentials\n* [\n  Practitioner Certifications\n  Validate hands-on cybersecurity skills across core roles and disciplines.][5]\n* [\n  Micro Credentials\n  Demonstrate real-world ability through performance-based assessments.][6]\n* [\n  Applied Knowledge Certifications\n  Showcase advanced expertise across a specialized security domain.][7]\n* [\n  CyberLive\u00ae: Hands-On Testing\n  Prove your real-world cybersecurity skills with virtual machine testing.][8]\n* [\n  Portfolio certifications\n  Prove skills in live, hands-on exam environments.][9]\n* [\n  Focus Areas\n  Browse certifications by domain to find your ideal path.][10]\nFeatured[View All Certifications][11]\nNEW\n[GASAE]\nGIAC AI Security Automation Engineer (GASAE)\n[Learn More][12]\nGetting Certified\n* [\n  Why Certify?\n  Prove your cybersecurity skills with globally recognized, real-world certifications.][13]\n* [\n  How to Prepare\n  Prepare with SANS-aligned training, practice tests, and proven study resources.][14]\n* [\n  Get Started\n  Choose your exam, register, and begin your GIAC certification journey.][15]\n* [\n  Proctoring\n  Learn how GIAC exams are securely proctored for a reliable testing experience.][16]\nRenewal\n* [\n  Renewing Your GIAC Certification\n  Stay certified by meeting renewal requirements and keeping skills current.][17]\n* [\n  Why Renew?\n  Maintain your credential and demonstrate ongoing cybersecurity expertise.][18]\n* [\n  CPE Information\n  Learn how to earn, track, and submit CPE credits for renewal.][19]\n* [\n  How to Renew\n  Follow simple steps to renew your certification and earn required CPEs.][20]\n* [\n  Earn CPEs at Events\n  Earn CPE credits through SANS training, conferences, and approved events.][21]\nFor Organizations\n* [\n  Workforce Development\n  Strengthen teams with GIAC-certified cybersecurity professionals.][22]\n* [\n  Cybersecurity Frameworks\n  See how GIAC certifications align with today\u2019s most recognized cybersecurity skills\n  frameworks.][23]\n* [\n  Cybersecurity Directives\n  See how GIAC certifications align with today\u2019s most recognized cybersecurity directives.][24]\n* [\n  Enterprise Customers\n  Build validated cybersecurity expertise across your organization.][25]\n* [\n  Workforce Study Reports\n  Research on building high-performing cybersecurity teams.][26]\nResources\n* Insights\n  * [Blogs][27][Blogs\n    ][28]\n  * [Research Papers][29][Research Papers\n    ][30]\n  * [Newsletter][31][Newsletter\n    ][32]\n* Resources\n  * [Certification Holder Directory][33][Certification Holder Directory\n    ][34]\n  * [Digital Catalog (PDF)][35][Digital Catalog (PDF)\n    ][36]\n  * [Policies and Guidelines][37][Policies and Guidelines\n    ][38]\n  * [FAQs][39][FAQs\n    ][40]\n  * [Community][41][Community\n    ][42]\n[\n2026 Cybersecurity Workforce Research Report\nLeaders gain workforce insight. Practitioners gain career insight.][43]\nAbout\n* [\n  GIAC Company Info\n  Learn about GIAC\u2019s mission and certification standards.][44]\n* [\n  ANAB Accreditation\n  GIAC is an active accredited ISO/IEC 17024 Personnel Certification Body through ANAB.][45]\n* [\n  Press\n  Explore GIAC news, updates, and media coverage.][46]\n* [\n  Contact\n  Reach GIAC for support, questions, or assistance.][47]\n* [\n  Frequently Asked Questions\n  Find answers to common certification and exam questions.][48]\nSearch\nSearch\n[Login][49]\n[Login][50]\n\n# The Highest Standard In Cybersecurity Certifications\n\nGIAC Certifications provide the highest and most rigorous assurance of cyber security knowledge and\nskill available to industry, government, and military clients across the world.\n\n[Explore Certifications][51][Renew Certification][52]\n[Two men studying on a laptop]\n[The Highest Standard In Cybersecurity Certifications]\nJump to:\nSelectCertification CategoriesCareer StoriesFeatured ContentWhy GIAC\n* [Certification Categories][53]\n* [Career Stories][54]\n* [Featured Content][55]\n* [Why GIAC][56]\n\n## Featured Certifications\n\nContinue building skills to take the next step in your career with GIAC certifications.\n\n[View All Certifications][57]\n* Slide 1 of 3\n  [GIAC AI Security Automation Engineer (GASAE) Logo]\n  Offensive Operations\n  \n  ### GIAC AI Security Automation Engineer (GASAE)\n  \n  The GIAC AI Security Automation Engineer (GASAE) certification validates ability to apply\n  practical, real-world automation and artificial intelligence across offensive, defensive and cloud\n  security operations.\n  \n  CyberLiveTM: Hands-on Testing\n  Affiliated Training: SEC598: AI and Security Automation for Red, Blue, and Purple Teams\n  * AI-Focused\n  * New\n  [View certification][58]\n  Offensive Operations\n  [GIAC AI Security Automation Engineer (GASAE) Logo]\n  * AI-Focused\n  * New\n  \n  ### GIAC AI Security Automation Engineer (GASAE)\n  \n  CyberLiveTM: Hands-on Testing\n  Affiliated Training: SEC598: AI and Security Automation for Red, Blue, and Purple Teams\n  Quick View\n  \n  The GIAC AI Security Automation Engineer (GASAE) certification validates ability to apply\n  practical, real-world automation and artificial intelligence across offensive, defensive and cloud\n  security operations.\n  \n  [View certification][59]\n* Slide 2 of 3\n  [GIAC AI Platform Security (GAIPS) Logo]\n  Cloud Security\n  \n  ### GIAC AI Platform Security (GAIPS)\n  \n  The GIAC AI Platform Security (GAIPS) certification validates a practitioner\u2019s ability to audit\n  and secure Generative AI applications and large language model (LLM) development pipelines.\n  \n  CyberLiveTM: Hands-on Testing\n  Affiliated Training: SEC545: GenAI and LLM Application Security\n  * AI-Focused\n  * Presale\n  [View certification][60]\n  Cloud Security\n  [GIAC AI Platform Security (GAIPS) Logo]\n  * AI-Focused\n  * Presale\n  \n  ### GIAC AI Platform Security (GAIPS)\n  \n  CyberLiveTM: Hands-on Testing\n  Affiliated Training: SEC545: GenAI and LLM Application Security\n  Quick View\n  \n  The GIAC AI Platform Security (GAIPS) certification validates a practitioner\u2019s ability to audit\n  and secure Generative AI applications and large language model (LLM) development pipelines.\n  \n  [View certification][61]\n* Slide 3 of 3\n  [GIAC Information Security Fundamentals (GISF) Logo]\n  Cybersecurity and IT Essentials, Cyber Defense\n  \n  ### GIAC Information Security Fundamentals (GISF)\n  \n  Establish capability in the essential security skills and knowledge in demand at every\n  organization.\n  \n  Affiliated Training: SEC301: Introduction to Cyber Security\n  * AI-Focused\n  * New\n  [View certification][62]\n  Cybersecurity and IT Essentials, Cyber Defense\n  [GIAC Information Security Fundamentals (GISF) Logo]\n  * AI-Focused\n  * New\n  \n  ### GIAC Information Security Fundamentals (GISF)\n  \n  Affiliated Training: SEC301: Introduction to Cyber Security\n  Quick View\n  \n  Establish capability in the essential security skills and knowledge in demand at every\n  organization.\n  \n  [View certification][63]\nResource\n\n### GIAC Insider Webcast: Preview GIAC\u2019s Hands-On Exam Experience\n\nForget memorizing, GIAC\u2019s CyberLive exam questions put you inside realistic lab environments where\nyou prove you can do the work, not just recognize the right answer. Want a glimpse of what it\u2019s\nlike? Join the walk-through to see the environment, question types and what to expect before exam\nday\n\nJuly 7, 2025 | 11 AM EST\n* [Save Your Seat][64]\n\n[Man Taking CyberLive Test]\nFeatured\n\n### 2026 Cybersecurity Workforce Research Report\n\nAI, Regulation, and Skills Redefining Careers and Teams. The 2026 Cybersecurity Workforce Research\nReport helps leaders make informed decisions and shows practitioners where skills and careers are\nheading. Here\u2019s a sneak peek at some of the key findings:\n* **74%** say AI has impacted cybersecurity team size or role structure\n* **64%** use certification to validate cybersecurity skills\n* **81%** of organizations report gaps in required cybersecurity skills\n* [Download the full report][65]\n\n[Person Reading "
