      "polished_summary": "Giac is a leading provider of cybersecurity certifications, offering a range of credentials that validate hands-on skills across various roles and disciplines in the cybersecurity field. Their core products include practitioner certifications, micro credentials, and applied knowledge certifications, all designed to demonstrate real-world abilities and advanced expertise. Targeting industry professionals, organizations, and government entities, Giac aims to enhance cybersecurity knowledge and skills globally through rigorous certification standards and training resources.",
      "audit_reasoning": "Giac primarily provides cybersecurity certifications and training resources, which do not directly manufacture, design, or develop products or systems for Cyber-Physical Systems Security. Their offerings focus on validating skills rather than providing specific products or services in the target market.",
      "audit_score": 1,
      "audit_completed": true,
