            "text": "IISc RBCCPS &#8211; Robert Bosch Centre for Cyber-Physical Systems\n\nResearch\n\nResearch Clusters\n\nControl and Optimization\n\nRobotics\n\nAI and ML\n\nSocio Technical Systems\n\nLabs and Centers\n\nCenter for Networked Intelligence\n\nCiSTUP\n\nFOCAS Lab\n\nHiRO Lab\n\nIISc-Nokia CoE for Networked Robotics\n\nStochastic Robotics Lab\n\nVISTA Lab\n\nResearch Facilities\n\nProjects\n\nPublications\n\nPeople\n\nFaculty\n\nStaff\n\nResearch Students\n\nMTech Students\n\nPostdocs\n\nAlumni\n\nAcademics\n\nCourses\n\nAdmissions\n\nMtech RAS\n\nMTech AI\n\nResearch Programmes\n\nResults\n\nCurriculum\n\nMtech RAS\n\nResearch Programmes\n\nFellowships\n\nOpportunities\n\nCurrent Openings\n\nUpdates\n\nEvents\n\nNews\n\nPlacements\n\nTenders\n\nCyPhySS\n\nCyPhySS 2023\n\nCyPhySS 2024\n\nAbout\n\nAbout Us\n\nCollaborations\n\nIISc\n\nARTPARK\n\nGallery\n\nContact Us\n\nMenu\n\nResearch\n\nResearch Clusters\n\nControl and Optimization\n\nRobotics\n\nAI and ML\n\nSocio Technical Systems\n\nLabs and Centers\n\nCenter for Networked Intelligence\n\nCiSTUP\n\nFOCAS Lab\n\nHiRO Lab\n\nIISc-Nokia CoE for Networked Robotics\n\nStochastic Robotics Lab\n\nVISTA Lab\n\nResearch Facilities\n\nProjects\n\nPublications\n\nPeople\n\nFaculty\n\nStaff\n\nResearch Students\n\nMTech Students\n\nPostdocs\n\nAlumni\n\nAcademics\n\nCourses\n\nAdmissions\n\nMtech RAS\n\nMTech AI\n\nResearch Programmes\n\nResults\n\nCurriculum\n\nMtech RAS\n\nResearch Programmes\n\nFellowships\n\nOpportunities\n\nCurrent Openings\n\nUpdates\n\nEvents\n\nNews\n\nPlacements\n\nTenders\n\nCyPhySS\n\nCyPhySS 2023\n\nCyPhySS 2024\n\nAbout\n\nAbout Us\n\nCollaborations\n\nIISc\n\nARTPARK\n\nGallery\n\nContact Us\n\ncps_group_photo_2024Jul\n\nSlide 2\n\nRBCCPS\n\nLegged Robots\n\nSlide 3\n\nRBCCPS\n\nMobile Robots\n\nAbout RBCCPS\n\nMission is to advance the field of cyber-physical systems\n\nThrough research, innovation, and collaboration we strive to advance the field of cyber-physical systems. W