            "url": "https://cps.iisc.ac.in/about",
            "text": "* Research\n* Research Clusters\n* [Control and Optimization][1]\n* [Robotics][2]\n* [AI and ML][3]\n* [Socio Technical Systems][4]\n* Labs and Centers\n* [Center for Networked Intelligence][5]\n* [CiSTUP][6]\n* [FOCAS Lab][7]\n* [HiRO Lab][8]\n* [IISc-Nokia CoE for Networked Robotics][9]\n* [Stochastic Robotics Lab][10]\n* [VISTA Lab][11]\n* [Research Facilities][12]\n* [Projects][13]\n* [Publications][14]\n* People\n* [Faculty][15]\n* [Staff][16]\n* [Research Students][17]\n* [MTech Students][18]\n* [Postdocs][19]\n* [Alumni][20]\n* Academics\n* [Courses][21]\n* Admissions\n* [Mtech RAS][22]\n* [MTech AI][23]\n* [Research Programmes][24]\n* [Results][25]\n* Curriculum\n* [Mtech RAS][26]\n* [Research Programmes][27]\n* [Fellowships][28]\n* [Opportunities][29]\n* [Current Openings][30]\n* Updates\n* [Events][31]\n* [News][32]\n* [Placements][33]\n* [Tenders][34]\n* CyPhySS\n* [CyPhySS 2023][35]\n* [CyPhySS 2024][36]\n* About\n* [About Us][37]\n* [Collaborations][38]\n* [IISc][39]\n* [ARTPARK][40]\n* [Gallery][41]\n* [Contact Us][42]\nMenu\n* Research\n* Research Clusters\n* [Control and Optimization][43]\n* [Robotics][44]\n* [AI and ML][45]\n* [Socio Technical Systems][46]\n* Labs and Centers\n* [Center for Networked Intelligence][47]\n* [CiSTUP][48]\n* [FOCAS Lab][49]\n* [HiRO Lab][50]\n* [IISc-Nokia CoE for Networked Robotics][51]\n* [Stochastic Robotics Lab][52]\n* [VISTA Lab][53]\n* [Research Facilities][54]\n* [Projects][55]\n* [Publications][56]\n* People\n* [Faculty][57]\n* [Staff][58]\n* [Research Students][59]\n* [MTech Students][60]\n* [Postdocs][61]\n* [Alumni][62]\n* Academics\n* [Courses][63]\n* Admissions\n* [Mtech RAS][64]\n* [MTech AI][65]\n* [Research Programmes][66]\n* [Results][67]\n* Curriculum\n* [Mtech RAS][68]\n* [Research Programmes][69]\n* [Fellowships][70]\n* [Opportunities][71]\n* [Current Openings][72]\n* Updates\n* [Events][73]\n* [News][74]\n* [Placements][75]\n* [Tenders][76]\n* CyPhySS\n* [CyPhySS 2023][77]\n* [CyPhySS 2024][78]\n* About\n* [About Us][79]\n* [Collaborations][80]\n* [IISc][81]\n* [ARTPARK][82]\n* [Gallery][83]\n* [Contact Us][84]\n\n# About 03\n* [Home ][85]\n* About 03\n\n[Awesome Image] [[Awesome Image]][86]\n\nAbout Us\n\n## Mission is to bring the power of AI to every business\n\nThe Robert Bosch Centre for Cyber-Physical Systems (RBCCPS) @ IISc is a research and academic\ncentre, under the Division of Interdisciplinary Research in Indian Institute of Science (IISc). The\ncentre focuses on foundational and applied research to solve cutting edge problems in **Robotics**\ninvolving advanced machine learning techniques, **Connected Autonomous Systems** like drones and\n5G-enabled autonomous vehicles, and **Socio-Technical Systems** like urban transportation systems\nand Smart Cities.\n\nThe centre faculty are drawn from various departments in the divisions of EECS and Mechanical\nSciences. In addition, it has a strong research and technical staff, who drive the experimental\ncomponents of the centre\u2019s research. The centre also hosts several young INSPIRE faculty fellows,\npost-doctoral researchers as well as visiting scientists and professors from academia and industry.\n\nThe Centre runs an interdisciplinary PhD program in Cyber-Physical Systems and offers various short\nand semester long courses.\n\nThe centre hosts a state-of-the-art CPS laboratory called the **Makery**. It is also involved in\ncreating and running the **Drone Research Park** and a **5G-V2X Testbed** for connected autonomous\nvehicles research. It has established strong collaborations with many major technology companies and\nengages with many startups. It also works closely with government bodies and participates in\nspecific standardisation activities.\n\nA major component of the Centre\u2019s budget comes from a philanthropic grant as a part of CSR\n(Corporate Social Responsibility) activity, by Robert Bosch Engineering and Business Solutions,\nIndia.\n\n[Read More][87]\n* [ About ][88]\n* [ IISc ][89]\n* [ ARTPARK ][90]\n* [ Facilities ][91]\n* [ People ][92]\n* [ Courses ][93]\nFacebook-f Twitter Instagram\n\n[1]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/control-and-optimization/\n[2]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/robotics/\n[3]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/ai-machine-learning/\n[4]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/socio-technical-systems/\n[5]: https://cni.iisc.ac.in/\n[6]: https://cistup.iisc.ac.in/\n[7]: https://www.focaslab.com/\n[8]: https://iisc-hiro.github.io/\n[9]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/researchlab/iisc-nokia-coe/\n[10]: https://www.stochlab.com/\n[11]: https://www.vistalabiisc.com/\n[12]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/facilities/\n[13]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/research/projects/\n[14]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/research/publications/\n[15]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/faculty/\n[16]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/staff/\n[17]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/research-students\n[18]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/mtech-students\n[19]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/postdocs\n[20]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/alumni/\n[21]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/courses/\n[22]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/mtech-admission/\n[23]: https://ai.iisc.ac.in/mtechai/\n[24]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/research-programmes-admission/\n[25]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/results/\n[26]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/curriculum/mtechras/\n[27]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/researchprogrammes/\n[28]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/fellowships/\n[29]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/opportunities/\n[30]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/current-openings/\n[31]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/events/\n[32]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/rbccpsnews/\n[33]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/placements/\n[34]: https://iisc.ac.in/all-tenders/\n[35]: https://cyphyss.in/\n[36]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/cyphyss2024/\n[37]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/about-rbccps/\n[38]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/collaboration\n[39]: https://iisc.ac.in/\n[40]: https://www.artpark.in/\n[41]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/gallery\n[42]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/contact/\n[43]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/control-and-optimization/\n[44]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/robotics/\n[45]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/ai-machine-learning/\n[46]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/socio-technical-systems/\n[47]: https://cni.iisc.ac.in/\n[48]: https://cistup.iisc.ac.in/\n[49]: https://www.focaslab.com/\n[50]: https://iisc-hiro.github.io/\n[51]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/researchlab/iisc-nokia-coe/\n[52]: https://www.stochlab.com/\n[53]: https://www.vistalabiisc.com/\n[54]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/facilities/\n[55]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/research/projects/\n[56]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/research/publications/\n[57]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/faculty/\n[58]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/staff/\n[59]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/research-students\n[60]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/mtech-students\n[61]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/postdocs\n[62]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/alumni/\n[63]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/courses/\n[64]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/mtech-admission/\n[65]: https://ai.iisc.ac.in/mtechai/\n[66]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/research-programmes-admission/\n[67]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/results/\n[68]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/curriculum/mtechras/\n[69]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/researchprogrammes/\n[70]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/fellowships/\n[71]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/opportunities/\n[72]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/current-openings/\n[73]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/events/\n[74]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/rbccpsnews/\n[75]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/placements/\n[76]: https://iisc.ac.in/all-tenders/\n[77]: https://cyphyss.in/\n[78]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/cyphyss2024/\n[79]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/about-rbccps/\n[80]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/collaboration\n[81]: https://iisc.ac.in/\n[82]: https://www.artpark.in/\n[83]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/gallery\n[84]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/contact/\n[85]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/\n[86]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/dashbord-1.jpg\n[87]: http://el.commonsupport.com/newwp/naxly/about-company/\n[88]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/about-rbccps/\n[89]: https://iisc.ac.in/\n[90]: https://artpark.in/\n[91]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/facilities/\n[92]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/faculty/\n[93]: https://cps.iisc.ac.in/courses/"
