      "key_products": "PhD programs, short courses, research projects in CPS, robotics solutions, AI applications in CPS",
      "polished_summary": "IISc RBCCPS is a leading research and academic center dedicated to advancing the field of Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS) through foundational and applied research. The center offers an interdisciplinary PhD program and a variety of short and semester-long courses aimed at graduate students, researchers, and professionals in technology and engineering. Its focus areas include Robotics, Connected Autonomous Systems, and Smart Cities, catering to industries such as urban transportation systems and socio-technical systems.",
      "audit_reasoning": "IISc RBCCPS is a research and academic center focused on Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS), conducting foundational and applied research in areas such as Robotics and Connected Autonomous Systems. Their activities directly contribute to the advancement of CPS technologies, making them a relevant participant in the target market.",
