ybersecurity Remediation Service][58]\n* [Virtual CISO (vCISO)][59]\n* [Vendor cyber risk assessment][60]\n* Industrial Cybersecurity\n* [Cybersecurity for OT & Critical Infrastructures][61]\n* [IOT/Embedded Systems Security][62]\n* Products\n* [SBOMApp \u2013 An Enterprise SBOM Tool][63]\n* [SieMMax \u2013 The AI-Powered SIEM Solution][64]\n* [PhishPrep \u2013 Phishing Simulation Solution][65]\n* [Vyuh \u2013 CISO Dashboard][66]\n* Insights\n* [Blogs][67]\n* [Success Stories][68]\n[Let's Talk][69]\n* Who We Are\n* [About IARM][70]\n* [Our Locations][71]\n* [Partners][72]\n* [Careers][73]\n* [Newsroom][74]\n* Services\n* Consulting Services\n* [ISO 27001][75]\n* [SOC 2 Type 2][76]\n* [ISO 42001][77]\n* [Compromise Assessment][78]\n* [HITRUST Readiness][79]\n* Professional Services\n* [Penetration Testing][80]\n* [Vulnerability Assessment][81]\n* [Cloud Security][82]\n* [LLM Penetration Testing][83]\n* [Threat Modeling Services][84]\n* [Source Code Review][85]\n* [Staffing Services][86]\n* Managed Security Services\n* [Managed Security Service Provider (MSSP)][87]\n* [24/7 SOC Operation][88]\n* [SIEM][89]\n* [Cybersecurity Remediation Service][90]\n* [Virtual CISO (vCISO)][91]\n* [Vendor cyber risk assessment][92]\n* Industrial Cybersecurity\n* [Cybersecurity for OT & Critical Infrastructures][93]\n* [IOT/Embedded Systems Security][94]\n* Products\n* [SBOMApp \u2013 An Enterprise SBOM Tool][95]\n* [SieMMax \u2013 The AI-Powered SIEM Solution][96]\n* [PhishPrep \u2013 Phishing Simulation Solution][97]\n* [Vyuh \u2013 CISO Dashboard][98]\n* Insights\n* [Blogs][99]\n* [Success Stories][100]\n\n# Cybersecurity Services in Chennai\n\n# IARM Information Security\n\nProviding Top-Notch Cyber Security Solutions to Protect Your Digital Assets\n\nAt IARM Information Security, we specialize in providing comprehensive cybersecurity solutions to\nbusinesses in Thiruvanmiyur, Velachery, SRP, and surrounding areas of Chennai. With a focus on\ncompliance-based services and advanced security solutions, we help businesses meet regulatory\nstandards while safeguarding their critical digital assets.Our services range from achieving top\nindustry certifications like ISO 27001, SOC 2 Type 2, and HIPAA Compliance, to offering expert\npenetration testing, vulnerability assessments, and 24/7 security monitoring through our SIEM and\nSOC services.Whether you\u2019re a startup or a large enterprise, we have the expertise to help you meet\nyour security needs, ensuring full protection against modern cyber threats.\n\n## Our Core [Cybersecurity Services][101] in Chennai\n\nAt **IARM Information Security**, we offer a wide array of services to help businesses secure their\ndigital environments and comply with industry standards. Here\u2019s a look at our main services:\n* **ISO 27001 Compliance**:\nAchieve and maintain **ISO 27001** certification to ensure your information security management\nsystem (ISMS) is up to global standards.\n* **SOC 2 Type 2 Compliance**:\nAchieve **SOC 2 Type 2** certification to demonstrate that your business meets stringent security,\navailability, processing integrity, confidentiality, and privacy requirements.\n* **HITRUST Certification**:\nAchieve **HITRUST** certification, a widely recognized standard in healthcare and other\nindustries, to demonstrate your commitment to protecting sensitive information.\n* **HIPAA Compliance**:\nEnsure your organization complies with **HIPAA** regulations to protect patient health information\nin line with U.S. healthcare laws.\n* **Penetration Testing**:\nIdentify vulnerabilities and weaknesses in your systems through controlled, ethical hacking\nexercises, ensuring proactive protection against potential cyberattacks.\n* **Vulnerability Assessments**:\nPerform in-depth scans and analyses to uncover weaknesses in your network, applications, and\nsystems, helping you take corrective actions before breaches occur.\n* **Managed Security Services (MSS)**:\nLet us manage your security infrastructure to detect, respond, and mitigate threats 24/7, so you\ncan focus on growing your business without worrying about cyber threats.\n* **IoT/Embedded Security**:\nSecure your **Internet of Things (IoT)** devices and **embedded systems** from cyber threats. We\nprovide tailored security measures to protect connected devices from vulnerabilities.\n* **SIEM and SOC 24/7**:\nOur **Security Information and Event Management (SIEM)** solution and **Security Operations Center\n(SOC)** provide real-time monitoring, threat detection, and rapid response to minimize the risk of\ncyber threats and data breaches.\n\n## Contact Us for a Consultation\n\nAre you ready to take control of your cybersecurity and compliance needs? Contact **IARM Information\nSecurity** today for a [**consultation**][102]. We\u2019ll discuss how we can tailor our services to fit\nyour specific business requirements and ensure you stay compliant with industry standards.\n* **Address:** T1A, 7th W St, VSI Estate, Phase II, Thiruvanmiyur, Chennai, Tamil Nadu 600041\n* **Phone:** [1800 102 1532][103]\n* **Hours:** Open 24 hours\n* **Email:** [info@iarminfo.com][104]\n\nOur team of cybersecurity experts is available to assist you with everything from achieving\ncompliance certifications to full-scale security management.\n\n### Best-Selling Services\n* [PhishPrep \u2013 Phishing Simulation Solution][105]\n* [LLM Penetration Testing Services][106]\n* [Vulnerability Assessment][107]\n* [CREST Accredited Pentesting Services][108]\n* [IOT/Embedded Systems Security][109]\n* [ISO 27001][110]\n* [24/7 SOC Operation][111]\n* [AI Model Risk Assessment][112]\n* [Managed SOC Services][113]\n* [SOC2 Compliance][114]\n* [HITRUST Readiness][115]\n* [Staffing Services][116]\n* [Virtual CISO][117]\n\n### Top-Clicked Blog Posts\n* [Importance of Cyber Security in Healthcare Industry][118]\n* [FAQs for CREST Accredited Penetration Testing Services][119]\n* [Top 5 SOC Success Criteria for Measuring the Effectiveness][120]\n* [100 Tips from Expert Penetration Testers for Software Developers][121]\n* [Why SOC2 compliance is essential for your business][122]\n* [10 Steps to Identify the Right Implementation Vendor for ISMS][123]\n\n[[Singapore Website]][124]\n\n###### **Expert guidance, just a step away!**\n\n[Click here to Read our Privacy Policy! ][125]\nI agree to my contact details being used for marketing. See IARM Privacy Policy for details and\nopt-out options.\n\nCopyright \u00a9 2024 IARM Information Security Pvt Ltd | [ SiteMap][126] | [ Privacy Policy][127]\nWe are using cookies to give you the best experience. You can find out more about which cookies we\nare using or switch them off in [privacy settings][128].\n[Accept][129][Privacy Settings][130]\n\n### [Iarmlogo]\n* We Value your Privacy\n* Necessary\n* Functional\n* Analytics\n* Performance\n* Advertisement\n\n### We Value your Privacy\n\n\u201cWe use cookies to help you navigate efficiently and perform certain functions. You will find\ndetailed information about all cookies under each consent category below.\n\nThe cookies that are categorized as \u201cNecessary\u201d are stored on your browser as they are essential for\nenabling the basic functionalities of the site.\n\nWe also use third-party cookies that help us analyze how you use this website, store your\npreferences, and provide the content and advertisements that are relevant to you. These cookies will\nonly be stored in your browser with your prior consent.\n\nYou can choose to enable or disable some or all of these cookies but disabling some of them may\naffect your browsing experience.\u201d\n\n### Necessary\n\nNecessary cookies are required to enable the basic features of this site, such as providing secure\nlog-in or adjusting your consent preferences. These cookies do not store any personally identifiable\ndata.\n\nEnableEnable (Required)Disable\n\n### Functional\n\nFunctional cookies help perform certain functionalities like sharing the content of the website on\nsocial media platforms, collecting feedback, and other third-party features.\n\nEnableEnable (Required)Disable\n\n### Analytics\n\nAnalytical cookies are used to understand how visitors interact with the website. These cookies help\nprovide information on metrics such as the number of visitors, bounce rate, traffic source, etc.\n\nEnableEnable (Required)Disable\n\n### Performance\n\nPerformance cookies are used to understand and analyze the key performance indexes of the website\nwhich helps in delivering a better user experience for the visitors.\n\nEnableEnable (Required)Disable\n\n### Advertisement\n\nAdvertisement cookies are used to provide visitors with customized advertisements based on the pages\nyou visited previously and to analyze the effectiveness of the ad campaigns.\n\nEnableEnable (Required)Disable\n\n[1]: https://iarminfo.com/\n[2]: https://iarminfo.com/about-us/\n[3]: https://iarminfo.com/contact/\n[4]: https://iarminfo.com/partners/\n[5]: https://iarminfo.com/career/\n[6]: https://iarminfo.com/newsroom/\n[7]: https://iarminfo.com/iso-27001/\n[8]: https://iarminfo.com/soc2-compliance/\n[9]: https://iarminfo.com/iso-42001/\n[10]: https://iarminfo.com/cybersecurity-compromise-assessment-service/\n[11]: https://iarminfo.com/hitrust/\n[12]: https://iarminfo.com/penetration-testing/\n[13]: https://iarminfo.com/vulnerability-assessment/\n[14]: https://iarminfo.com/cloud-security/\n[15]: https://iarminfo.com/llm-penetration-testing/\n[16]: https://iarminfo.com/threat-modeling-services/\n[17]: https://iarminfo.com/source-code-review-service/\n[18]: https://iarminfo.com/staffing-services/\n[19]: https://iarminfo.com/managed-security-service-provider/\n[20]: https://iarminfo.com/soc-service/\n[21]: https://iarminfo.com/siem-service/\n[22]: https://iarminfo.com/cybersecurity-remediation-services/\n[23]: https://iarminfo.com/virtual-ciso-services/\n[24]: https://iarminfo.com/vendor-cyber-risk-assessment/\n[25]: https://iarminfo.com/iacs-security-assessment