      "company_summary": "Roboticstomorrow is an online trade magazine dedicated to the fields of industrial automation, robotics, and unmanned vehicles. The company offers a range of innovative products, including advanced software solutions like Palladyne IQ for closed-loop autonomy, measurement solutions such as the Model TR1 Tru-Trac, and various industrial robots including the SCARA range, targeting manufacturers and businesses seeking to enhance efficiency and automation in their operations.",
