nPerspective\nAI agents are rewriting the platform playbook\n\nWhy agentic commerce changes how consumer and advertising platforms create value\n\n[\nExpand\n][126]\nClose\nResearch Report\nThe reinvention imperative in the chemical industry\n\nChemical companies must move beyond cost cutting to AI-enabled reinvention that drives growth,\ninnovation, operational performance and competitive advantage.\n\n[\nExpand\n][127]\nClose\nResearch Report\nAI agents are changing how consumers choose\n\nConsumers are open to delegating decisions to AI agents. See how this shift reshapes value, loyalty\nand what it takes for brands to stay chosen.\n\n[\nExpand\n][128]\nClose\nResearch Report\nWhy today\u2019s cyber talent model is broken\u2014and how to fix it\n\nCybersecurity needs hybrid technical and strategic skills, but the workforce hasn\u2019t kept pace. Learn\nhow three moves\u2014building, redesigning and augmenting talent\u2014help organizations build resilience from\nwithin.\n\n[\nExpand\n][129]\nClose\nResearch Report\nReinventing for Human + AI Engineering\n\nIs your engineering function a cost center or a growth engine? Our research shows what leading\ncompanies are doing differently to compress cycle times, improve launch reliability and bui [Skip to main content][1] [Skip to footer][2]\nMenu\n[ [Accenture] ][3] [\n[Accenture]\n][4]\nClose Menu\n* What we do\n  Back\n  [\n  What we do\n  ][5]\n  Capabilities Capabilities\n  * [Artificial Intelligence and Data ][6]\n  * [Cloud ][7]\n  * [Customer Service ][8]\n  * [Cybersecurity ][9]\n  * [Digital Engineering and Manufacturing ][10]\n  * [Ecosystem Partners ][11]\n  * [Emerging Technology ][12]\n  * [Finance and Risk Management ][13]\n  * [Infrastructure and Capital Projects ][14]\n  * [Learning ][15]\n  * [Managed Services ][16]\n  * [Marketing and Experience ][17]\n  * [Metaverse ][18]\n  * [Sales and Commerce ][19]\n  * [Strategy ][20]\n  * [Supply Chain ][21]\n  * [Sustainability ][22]\n  * [Talent and Organiza