[China/Mainland (Chinese)][84]\n* [China/Mainland (English)][85]\n* [Colombia (Spanish)][86]\n* [Costa Rica (English)][87]\n* [Czech Republic (English)][88]\n* [Denmark (English)][89]\n* [Finland (English)][90]\n* [France (French)][91]\n* [Germany (German)][92]\n* [Greece (English)][93]\n* [Hungary (English)][94]\n* [India (English)][95]\n* [Indonesia (English)][96]\n* [Ireland (English)][97]\n* [Israel (English)][98]\n* [Italy (Italian)][99]\n* [Japan (Japanese)][100]\n* [Latvia (English)][101]\n* [Luxembourg (English)][102]\n* [Malaysia (English)][103]\n* [Mauritius (English)][104]\n* [Mexico (Spanish)][105]\n* [Morocco (English)][106]\n* [Netherlands (English)][107]\n* [New Zealand (English)][108]\n* [Norway (English)][109]\n* [Philippines (English)][110]\n* [Poland (English)][111]\n* [Poland (Polish)][112]\n* [Portugal (Portuguese)][113]\n* [Romania (English)][114]\n* [Saudi Arabia (English)][115]\n* [Singapore (English)][116]\n* [Slovakia (English)][117]\n* [South Africa (English)][118]\n* [Spain (Spanish)][119]\n* [Sweden (English)][120]\n* [Switzerland (English)][121]\n* [Thailand (English)][122]\n* [UAE (English)][123]\n* [United Kingdom (English)][124]\n* [USA (English)][125]\n\n# Together We Reinvented\n\nClose\nPerspective\nAI agents are rewriting the platform playbook\n\nWhy agentic commerce changes how consumer and advertising platforms create value\n\n[\nExpand\n][126]\nClose\nResearch Report\nThe reinvention imperative in the chemical industry\n\nChemical companies must move beyond cost cutting to AI-enabled reinvention that drives growth,\ninnovation, operational performance and competitive advantage.\n\n[\nExpand\n][127]\nClose\nResearch Report\nAI agents are changing how consumers choose\n\nConsumers are open to delegating decisions to AI agents. See how this shift reshapes value, loyalty\nand what it takes for brands to stay chosen.\n\n[\nExpand\n][128]\nClose\nResearch Report\nWhy today\u2019s cyber talent model is broken\u2014and how to fix it\n\nCybersecurity needs hybrid technical and strategic skills, but the workforce hasn\u2019t kept pace. Learn\nhow three moves\u2014building, redesigning and augmenting talent\u2014help organizations build resilience from\nwithin.\n\n[\nExpand\n][129]\nClose\nResearch Report\nReinventing for Human + AI Engineering\n\nIs your engineering function a cost center or a growth engine? Our research shows what leading\ncompanies are doing differently to compress cycle times, improve launch reliability and build\ncompounding advantage.\n\n[\nExpand\n][130]\nClose\nResearch Report\nTurning the supply chain talent shortage into strength\n\nDemand for core US supply chain roles could rise 19% by 2035, while the labor pool is expected to\nincrease by just 3.2%. To close the projected 1.1-million job gap, leaders need to treat talent\nredesign as a strategic priority.\n\n[\nExpand\n][131]\nClose\nCase Study\nFrom Philipstown\u2019s streets to screens worldwide\n\nTurning a local tradition into a shared experience that reaches far beyond the town itself.\n\n[\nExpand\n][132]\nClose\nResearch Report\nIs your company ready for agentic commerce?\n\nAI agents now sit between brands and consumers, comparing products, evaluating warranties, choosing\na winner and completing purchases\u2014autonomously, in seconds. It\u2019s a generational reset of the rules\nof commerce.\n\n[\nExpand\n][133]\nCarousel slider control\n\n#### \u201cCompanies will have a greater technology landscape, but we need to completely change the\n#### narrative to inspire people to paint the future. It is human in the lead, not human in the\n#### loop.\u201d\n\nJulie Sweet\n\n## 360\u00b0 VALUE\n\n### Every day, we embrace change and create value for all our stakeholders around the world.\n\n[\nSee the report\n][134]\nplay automatic slide show\npause automatic slide show\nshow previous slide\nslideText 1 ofText / 1\nshow next slide\n\n### WWF Germany hunts ghost nets using the power of AI\n\nEach year, 50,000 tons of fishing nets vanish into the ocean, silently killing marine life.\nGhostNetZero uses AI to analyze sonar data and pinpoint these hidden threats with 94% accuracy.\n\n[\nRead more\n][135]\n\n### \u0160koda reimagines customer care as a growth driver\n\n\u0160koda is scaling global customer care with AI\u2014resolving up to 40% of routine queries across 14\nlanguages while freeing human agents to focus on more complex, high-value interactions.\n\n[\nRead more\n][136]\n\n### Siemens Energy sets a new benchmark for future-ready finance\n\nSpinning off from Siemens AG left Siemens Energy with a fragmented finance landscape"
