the R&D team is able to work with third\n### party or us directly to help find quick solves. Having that immediate contact with Check Point\n### really is a life saver.\u201d\n\nGreg Smith\nDirector of Cyber Security, Hallmark\n\n[View Customer Story][156]\n[Alkem case study]\n[[Alkem logo]][157]\n\n### \u201cCheck Point gives me peace of mind, knowing that we have the best security solution to protect\n### Alkem. We can stay ahead of the threat landscape while meeting our productivity expectations.\n### That\u2019s what I expect from an industry-leading vendor, and that\u2019s what we receive.\u201d\n\nBijender Mishra\nChief Information Security Off"
