 Studies\n  [ [Featured image for our Case Study: Claroty xDome Drives Business Value and Enhanced Exposure\n  Management at Ohio State University Wexner Medical Center]\n  \n  #### Claroty xDome Drives Business Value and Enhanced Exposure Management at Ohio State University\n  #### Wexner Medical Center\n  \n  ][73] [ [By partnering with Claroty and implementing its purpose-built healthcare solution,\n  Claroty xDome for Healthcare, PHSA and FHA were able to quickly fill the immediate gaps in device\n  discovery, tracking, and risk management.]\n  \n  #### Provincial Health Services Authority and Fraser Health Authority Boost Cybersecurity\n  #### Processes and Compliance with Claroty xDome\n  \n  ][74] [ [In partnership with Claroty, Phlow implemented a tailored CPS security infrastructure.\n  Phlow now has a robust security layout, providing rigorous network visibility, real-time\n  monitoring, and instantaneous threat detection.]\n  \n  #### Phlow Leverages Claroty Technologies for Unparalleled Cyber-Physical System Protection\n  \n  ][75]\n* [Partners][76]\n  [\n  Technology Alliance Partners\n  ][77] [\n  Channel Partners\n  ][78] [\n  Partner Login\n  ][79]\n* [Threat Research][80]\n  [\n  Team82 Home\n  ][81] [\n  Threat Intelligence\n  ][82] [\n  Vulnerability Disclosure Dashboard\n  ][83] [\n  Research\n  ][84] [\n  Talks\n  ][85] [\n  PGP Key\n  ][86]\n* [Resources][87]\n  Resources\n  [\n  Resource Library\n  ][88]\n  [ Blog ][89] [ Reports ][90] [ White Papers ][91] [ Datasheets & Solution Overviews ][92] [\n  Integration Briefs ][93] [ Case Studies ][94] [ On-Demand Webinars ][95] [ Videos ][96] [ Glossary\n  ][97]\n  Podcasts, Articles, & Videos\n  [ [Nexus Connect X logo]\n  Visit our Nexus Website\n  ][98]\n  Featured Content\n  [\n  \n  #### Life, uninterrupted.\n  \n  ][99] [\n  \n  #### Claroty Named a Leader in 2026 Gartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for CPS Protection Platforms\n  \n  ][100] [ [Featured image for our Guide: The Guide to Building Operational Resilience in Healthcare\n  Environments]\n  \n  #### The Guide to Building Operational Resilience in Healthcare Environments\n  \n  ][101] [ [Featured image for our report: Resolving the CPS Identity Crisis]\n  \n  #### Resolving the CPS Identity Crisis\n  \n  ][102]\n* [Company][103]\n  [\n  About Us\n  ][104] [\n  Careers\n  ][105] [\n  Leadership\n  ][106] [\n  Newsroom\n  ][107] [\n  xCel Enablement & Training\n  ][108] [\n  Trust Center\n  ][109] [\n  Events\n  ][110] [\n  Environmental, Social, and Governance Policies\n  ][111] [\n  Contact Us\n  ][112]\n[ Toggle Search ][113] Menu\n\n# The AI-Powered Cyber-Physical Systems Protection Platform\n\nClaroty has been named a Leader for the second consecutive year in the 2026 Gartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122\nfor CPS Protection Platform.\n\n[ Read the Gartner\u00ae Report ][114] [ Request a Demo ][115]\n\n## **CPS Expertise. Zero Downtime.**\n\n10+ years of trusted CPS data powers AI insights that keep life uninterrupted.\n\n[An icon of a purple gradient gear overlapping a matching purple gradient warning triangle with an\nexclamation mark inside.]\n\n### **Stop Downtime\n### Before it Starts**\n\nStay up and running, even during a cyber attack. Our AI-powered solutions spot risks early so your\nmost important operations never skip a beat.\n\n[A purple gradient checklist icon featuring a checkmark and two bullet points next to three\nhorizontal lines.]\n\n### **Compliance**\n### **Without Headaches**\n\nBe ahead of regulatory and insurance needs. Our AI-automated reporting proves you\u2019re protected\nwithout the manual paperwork.\n\n[A purple-to-pink gradient magnifying glass icon with a stylized reflection mark inside the lens.]\n\n### **Show Value**\n### **That Matters**\n\nGet everyone on the same page. We connect your security teams with your site operators, giving you\nclear insights that make sense to the board.\n\n## Claire, the industry\u2019s first CPS-Native\n## AI Security Agent\n\nEnsuring operational resilience and trust in an AI-powered world with Claroty Claire^{TM}.\n\n[ Learn more about Claire ][116]\n\n## Leverage CPS-Native, AI-Powered Solutions\n\n### 24\n### Fortune 100\n\n### 22k+\n### Deployed Sites\n\n### 60+\n### Countries\n\n### 1.3k+\n### Customers\n\n## What Customers Say About Us\n\nPrevious\n\n> \u201cWe needed an OT tool that complements Claroty CTD\u2019s real-time monitoring to reveal the\n> unreachable blind spots in Pfizer\u2019s main manufacturing environments. With Claroty Edge, we\n> attained this faster than ever imagined.\u201d\n> \n> Jim LaBonty\n> Head of Global Automation Engineering at Pfizer\n\n> \u201cWith Claroty, we\u2019re getting info"
