        "crawl_text": "# 1. Serving insights\n\nSee how Wimbledon powers richer fan experiences, with AI-powered analysis that gets fans closer to\nevery game, set and match\n\n[ Discover more ][1] [ Read the Wimbledon case study ][2]\n[Bob wearing a hard hat, standing between a code window and an open laptop with tech icons around.]\nLive training session | Thu, Jul 9, 2026 2:30 PM IST\nIBM Bob in Action: Get Better Code with Context, Rules & MCP. Learn directly from the developers and\nmaster how to unlock real value like a pro.\n[ Reserve your spot ][3]\n\n##### Recommended for you\n\n[watsonx icon]\nSee watsonx Orchestrate in action\nMaximize ROI from agentic AI at scale\nBook a live demo\n[ Get free trial ][4]\n[Abstract 3D render of cloud network system]\nPower AI with real-time context\nStream, connect, process and govern data in real time with modern data streaming\ncapabilities\u2014fueling AI agents, analytics and applications\nModernize data streaming\n[ Explore more ][5]\n[Close-up of a person's hands holding a padlock symbol connected to neural pathways]\nGuardium Data Protection\nSimplify compliance and protect sensitive data across your hybrid cloud with real-time monitoring\nand automated security controls\nBook a live demo\n[ Know more ][6]\n[Abstract isometric 3D render of stacked blocks]\nWatch the video\nDiscover why the sovereignty decisions made today will define who leads the AI-driven, autonomous\nenterprise of tomorrow.\n[ Watch the video ][7]\n\n## Top enterprise technology\n\nRecognized among [Top Enterprise Software Providers][8] in 2026 G2 Best Software Awards, IBM\nadvances smarter business transformation through industry-leading AI, hybrid cloud, automation and\ndata solutions.\n\nIBM Bob\u2122\n\n\"We achieved 100% refactored code. Everything I thought would be a problem, Bob solved.\"\u2014APIS IT\n\n[ ][9] IBM watsonx Orchestrate\u00ae\n\nwatsonx Orchestrate powers AI agents that cut HR costs by 40% and resolve 94% of employee requests\nautomatically\n\n[ ][10] IBM Confluent\n\n\"Since we built Horus on top of Confluent, we\u2019ve been able to save over a million dollars in what we\nwere paying other vendors for.\"\u2014SecurityScorecard\n\n[ ][11] IBM FlashSystem\u00ae\n\nRun smarter storage: zero downtime, AI optimization and at least 40% lower costs with FlashSystem\n\n[ ][12] IBM Vault\u00ae\n\n\"Vault has ... lowered how much effort it takes to meet regulatory compliance goals and reduced our\nrisk of both a breach and unplanned downtime.\"\u2014NORD/LB\n\n[ ][13] IBM Maximo\u00ae\n\nReduce unplanned downtime by 47% and extend asset lifespan by 17% with IBM Maximo\n\n[ ][14] IBM Planning Analytics\n\nVolkswagen Group Services reduced monthly reporting time from 7 days to just seconds and increased\nHR productivity by 85% with IBM Planning Analytics\n\n[ ][15] IBM Consulting\u00ae\n\nPartner with 150,000+ experts in IBM Consulting, the only global consultancy within a major\ntechnology company\n\n[ ][16]\n\n## Smarter impact powered by IBM\n\n[\n[Blue Pearl logo]\nExplore how Blue Pearl turned weeks of work into days with IBM Bob\n~90%\nfaster delivery, completing a full Java uplift in ~3 days as compared to the earlier ~30 days\n][17] [\n[riverty logo]\nSee how Riverty speeds development with built-in security from IBM Vault\n10x\nfaster infrastructure deployment: from days to hours\n][18] [\n[citadelle logo]\nDiscover how Citadelle enables trusted recovery with IBM FlashSystem\n90%\nfaster data validation\n][19] [\n[IBM logo]\nLearn how IBM scaled AI-powered productivity with IBM watsonx Orchestrate\nUSD 4.5 billion\nproductivity gains unlocked over three years\n][20]\n[Abstract 3D render of the THINK logo on a cube-like surface]\nJoin us at Think on Tour Singapore, July 21\nDiscover how visionary leaders are charting the path to win the AI race.\n[ Register Today ][21]\nTraining for what's next\n[Two people looking at a laptop and talking next to illustrated pictograms]\nStudent pathways\n\nElevate your career readiness with learning paths and courses on the skills shaping tomorrow\u2019s jobs.\n\n[ Begin your success journey ][22]\n[Woman interacting with robotic arm next to illustrated pictograms]\nFoundational skills\n\nDevelop essential skills, unlock new possibilities\u00a0and get ready for the next stage of your career.\n\n[ Start shaping tomorrow ][23]\n[Two colleagues interacting with robotic arm next to illustrated pictograms]\nProfessional training\n\nExplore flexible courses and certifications to deepen your skills and prepare for new challenges.\n\n[ Strengthen your expertise ][24]\nInside IBM Our company\n\nExplore IBM history and culture of putting technology to work in the real world.\n\n[ About IBM ][25] [ Our events ][26] Our innovations\n\nVisit the IBM lab and see what's in store for the future of\u00a0computing.\n\n[ IBM Research\u00ae ][27] [ Quantum computing ][28] Our people\n\nSee what it takes to become an IBMer or build your skills with our educational courses.\n\n[ Become an IBMer ][29] [ Start learning ][30]\n\n## Stay connected\n\n[Illustration of an eye with connecting lines to data]\nLatest News\n\nSDB Bank Modernizes its Digital Banking Infrastructure with IBM to Deliver Faster, S # 1. Serving insights\n\nSee how Wimbledon powers richer fan experiences, with AI-powered analysis that gets fans closer to\nevery game, set and match\n\n[ Discover more ][1] [ Read the Wimbledon case study ][2]\n[Bob wearing a hard hat, standing between a code window and an open laptop with tech icons around.]\nLive training session | Thu, Jul 9, 2026 2:30 PM IST\nIBM Bob in Action: Get Better Code with Context, Rules & MCP. Learn directly from the developers and\nmaster how to unlock real value like a pro.\n[ Reserve your spot ][3]\n\n##### Recommended for you\n\n[watsonx icon]\nSee watsonx Orchestrate in action\nMaximize ROI from agentic AI at scale\nBook a live demo\n[ Get free trial ][4]\n[Abstract 3D render of cloud network system]\nPower AI with real-time context\nStream, connect, process and govern data in real time with modern data streaming\ncapabilities\u2014fueling AI agents, analytics and applications\nModernize data streaming\n[ Explore more ][5]\n[Close-up of a person's hands holding a padlock symbol connected to neural pathways]\nGuardium Data Protection\nSimplify compliance and protect sensitive data across your hybrid cloud with real-time monitoring\nand automated security controls\nBook a live demo\n[ Know more ][6]\n[Abstract isometric 3D render of stacked blocks]\nWatch the video\nDiscover why the sovereignty decisions made today will define who leads the AI-driven, autonomous\nenterprise of tomorrow.\n[ Watch the video ][7]\n\n## Top enterprise technology\n\nRecognized among [Top Enterprise Software Providers][8] in 2026 G2 Best Software Awards, IBM\nadvances smarter business transformation through industry-leading AI, hybrid cloud, automation and\ndata solutions.\n\nIBM Bob\u2122\n\n\"We achieved 100% refactored code. Everything I thought would be a problem, Bob solved.\"\u2014APIS IT\n\n[ ][9] IBM watsonx Orchestrate\u00ae\n\nwatsonx Orchestrate powers AI agents that cut HR costs by 40% and resolve 94% of employee requests\nautomatically\n\n[ ][10] IBM Confluent\n\n\"Since we built Horus on top of Confluent, we\u2019ve been able to save over a million dollars in what we\nwere paying other vendors for.\"\u2014SecurityScorecard\n\n[ ][11] IBM FlashSystem\u00ae\n\nRun smarter storage: zero downtime, AI optimization and at least 40% lower costs with FlashSystem\n\n[ ][12] IBM Vault\u00ae\n\n\"Vault has ... lowered how much effort it takes to meet regulatory compliance goals and reduced our\nrisk of both a breach and unplanned downtime.\"\u2014NORD/LB\n\n[ ][13] IBM Maximo\u00ae\n\nReduce unplanned downtime by 47% and extend asset lifespan by 17% with IBM Maximo\n\n[ ][14] IBM Planning Analytics\n\nVolkswagen Group Services reduced monthly reporting time from 7 days to just seconds and increased\nHR productivity by 85% with IBM Planning Analytics\n\n[ ][15] IBM Consulting\u00ae\n\nPartner with 150,000+ experts in IBM Consulting, the only global consultancy within a major\ntechnology company\n\n[ ][16]\n\n## Smarter impact powered by IBM\n\n[\n[Blue Pearl logo]\nExplore how Blue Pearl turned weeks of work into days with IBM Bob\n~90%\nfaster delivery, completing a full Java uplift in ~3 days as compared to the earlier ~30 days\n][17] [\n[riverty logo]\nSee how Riverty speeds development with built-in security from IBM Vault\n10x\nfaster infrastructure deployment: from days to hours\n][18] [\n[citadelle logo]\nDiscover how Citadelle enables trusted recovery with IBM FlashSystem\n90%\nfaster data validation\n][19] [\n[IBM logo]\nLearn how IBM scaled AI-powered productivity with IBM watsonx Orchestrate\nUSD 4.5 billion\nproductivity gains unlocked over three years\n][20]\n[Abstract 3D render of the THINK logo on a cube-like surface]\nJoin us at Think on Tour Singapore, July 21\nDiscover how visionary leaders are charting the path to win the AI race.\n[ Register Today ][21]\nTraining for what's next\n[Two people looking at a laptop and talking next to illustrated pictograms]\nStudent pathways\n\nElevate your career readiness with learning paths and courses on the skills shaping tomorrow\u2019s jobs.\n\n[ Begin your success journey ][22]\n[Woman interacting with robotic arm next to illustrated pictograms]\nFoundational skills\n\nDevelop essential skills, unlock new possibilities\u00a0and get ready for the next stage of your career.\n\n[ Start shaping tomorrow ][23]\n[Two colleagues interacting with robotic arm next to illustrated pictograms]\nProfessional training\n\nExplore flexible courses and certifications to deepen your skills and prepare for new challenges.\n\n[ Strengthen your expertise ][24]\nInside IBM Our company\n\nExplore IBM history and culture of putting technology to work in the real world.\n\n[ About IBM ][25] [ Our events ][26] Our innovations\n\nVisit the IBM lab and see what's in store for the future of\u00a0computing.\n\n[ IBM Research\u00ae ][27] [ Quantum computing ][28] Our people\n\nSee what it takes to become an IBMer or build your skills with our educational courses.\n\n[ Become an IBMer ][29] [ Start learning ][30]\n\n## Stay connected\n\n[Illustration of an eye with connecting lines to data]\nLatest News\n\nSDB Bank Modernizes its Digital Banking Infrastructure with IBM to Deliver Faster, Smarter Customer\nExperiences\n\n[ ][31]\n\nAI to Power India\u2019s Next Economic Leap: IBM-IndiaAI Study Finds AI Could Add Over $500 Billion to\nIndia\u2019s Economy by 2030\n\n[ ][32]\n\nIBM and Yotta Announce Plans to Deliver Agentic AI Platform for Indian Enterprises\n\n[ ][33]\n\nTata Play Fiber Works with IBM to Build an AI-Ready Data Infrastructure\n\n[ ][34]\n\nIBM Launches Its First Infrastructure Innovation Center in India to Accelerate Enterprise-Scale AI\n\n[ ][35]\n\nIBM Launches AI GovTech Innovation Center to Accelerate the Future of Digital Governance\n\n[ ][36]\n\nGovernment of Andhra Pradesh collaborates with IBM, BharatGen and NxtGen to scale impact from\nIndia\u2019s AI\n\n[ ][37]\n\nIBM commits to skill 5 million Indian youth in AI, Cybersecurity & Quantum by 2030\n\n[ ][38]\n\n[1]: https://www.ibm.com/sports/wimbledon?lnk=hpls1in\n[2]: https://www.ibm.com/case-studies/all-england-lawn-tennis-club-ibm-ix?lnk=hpls2in\n[3]: https://ibm.webcasts.com/starthere.jsp?ei=1768070&tp_key=40a04384c0?utm_medium=organicweb&utm_s\nource=web\n[4]: https://www.ibm.com/products/watsonx-orchestrate?lnk=hprc1in\n[5]: https://www.ibm.com/products/confluent/kafka-migration?lnk=hpls2in\n[6]: https://www.ibm.com/products/guardium-data-protection?lnk=hprc3in\n[7]: 1_zznbl4r6\n[8]: https://www.ibm.com/new/announcements/clients-rank-ibm-among-top-enterprise-software-providers-\nin-2026-g2-best-software-awards?lnk=hpfp1au\n[9]: https://bob.ibm.com?lnk=hpfpin\n[10]: https://www.ibm.com/products/watson