        "crawl_text": "A Note to our Customers and Partners in the Middle East\n[More Information][1]\n[\nAcademy\n][2][\nLabs\n][3][\nCareers\n][4][\nPartner Login\n][5][\nSupport\n][6]\n[[Nozomi logo]][7]\nPlatform\n\n### Platform Overview\n\nOur industrial cybersecurity solutions deliver unmatched asset intelligence, threat detection and\nAI-driven insights.\n\n[\nLearn more\n][8]\nMANAGERS\n[\nVantage\nCloud\n][9][\nCentral Management Console\nOn-prem\n][10]\nSENSORS\n[\nGuardian\nNetwork\n][11][\nGuardian Air\nWireless\n][12][\nArc\nEndpoint\n][13][\nArc Embedded\nEndpoint\n][14]\nENHANCEMENTS\n[\nVantage IQ\n][15][\nAsset Intelligence\n][16][\nThreat Intelligence\n][17][\nSmart Polling\n][18][\nTI Expansion\u00a0Pack\nPowered by Mandiant\n][19][\nIntegrations\n][20]\n\n### Professional Services\n\nOT and IoT security expertise that speeds solution deployment and maximizes value\n\n[\nLearn more\n][21]\nSolutions\nBUSINESS\u00a0NEED\n[\nAsset Inventory Management\n][22][\nThreat Detection\u00a0& Response\n][23][\nContinuous Network Monitoring\n][24][\nVulnerability Management\n][25][\nRisk Management\n][26][\nIoT Security\n][27][\nData Center Cybersecurity\n][28][\nBuilding Automation System\nCybersecurity\n][29]\nINDUSTRY\n[\nAirports\n][30][\nElectric Utilities\n][31][\nHealthcare\n][32][\nManufacturing\n][33][\nMaritime\n][34][\nMining\n][35][\nOil & Gas\n][36]\n[\nPharmaceutical\n][37][\nRail\n][38][\nRetail\n][39][\nSmart Cities\n][40][\nStadiums & Arenas\n][41][\nWater &\nWastewater\n][42]\n[Icon of a government building with three columns, a triangular roof, and a blue flag on top.]\nPUBLIC\u00a0SECTOR\n[\nFederal Government\n][43]\n[\nState &\u00a0Local\n][44]\nCOMPLIANCE\n[\nDoW ZT for OT\n][45][\nISA/IEC 62443 Standards\n][46][\nNERC CIP\n][47][\nNERC CIP-015\n][48][\nNIS2 Directive\n][49][\nSEC Cybersecurity Rules\n][50][\nTSA Security Directives\n][51]\nPartners\n\n### Why Partner with Us\n\nOur global partner network deploys OT & IoT cybersecurity solutions for customers around the world.\n\n[\nLearn more\n][52]\n\n### Our Partners\n\nExplore all Nozomi Networks partners\n\n[\nLearn more\n][53]\n\n### Find a Partner\n\nFind a certified Nozomi Networks partner in your country.\n\n[\nLearn more\n][54]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nLog into the Nozomi Networks partner portal.\n\n[\nLog In\n][55]\nResources\n\n### Resource Library\n\nBrowse OT & IoT security research, guides, videos and more from the Nozomi Networks team.\n\n[\nView Resources\n][56]\nRESOURCES\n[\nCase Studies\n][57][\nContent Packs\n][58][\nData Sheets\n][59][\nOT Cyber FAQs\n][60][\nGuides\n][61][\nResearch Reports\n][62]\n[\nSolution Briefs\n][63][\nVideos\n][64][\nWebinars\n][65][\nWhite Papers\n][66][\nTrust Center\n][67]\n\n### Customer Hub\n\nExplore our latest customer resources, including webinars, how-to videos, content packs and more.\n\n[\nView Hub\n][68]\n[\nBlog\n][69]\nCompany\n\n### About Nozomi Networks\n\nWe keep critical infrastructure and operational technology cyber resilient.\n\n[\nLearn more\n][70]\n[\nLeadership Team\n][71][\nEvents\n][72][\nNewsroom\n][73]\n[\nCareers\n][74][\nCustomer Stories\n][75][\nContact Us\n][76]\n[Request Demo][77]\nGARTNER**^{\u00ae}**\u00a0REPORT\u00a0\n\n# **A Leader.\u00a0Again.**\n\n### 2026 Gartner^{\u00ae} Magic Quadrant^{\u2122} for CPS Protection Platforms\n\n[Read the Report][78]\n[Gartner Magic Quadrant for CPS Protection Platforms as of March 2026 showing Leaders Nozomi\nNetworks, Claroty, Armis; Challengers Forescout Technologies, Tenable, Fortinet; Visionaries\nDarktrace; and Niche Players Microsoft, Cisco, Palo Alto Networks, Honeywell, TXOne Networks, and\nDragos.][Gartner logo]\n[\n[Two IT professionals with badges working inside a server room with digital network overlay\ngraphics.]\nWEBINAR\nHow to Finetune Asset Inventory Management for OT/IoT Environments\n][79]\n[\n[Forrester Wave Leader 2025 badge for IoT Security Solutions on a blue background.]\nANALYST REPORT\nThe Forrester Wave\u2122\ufe0f: IoT Security Solutions, Q3 2025\n][80]\n[\n[Blue circular digital radar screen with concentric rings and data points segmented by white\ndiagonal lines.]\nEBOOK\nHow to Evaluate AI-driven Security Solutions for OT/ICS and IoT\n][81]\n[\n[Graphic with the text 'IoT' in the center, surrounded by a globe and digital lines connecting\nvarious technology icons.]\nWEBINAR\nEvaluating & Implementing the Right IoT Security Solution\n][82]\n[\n[Person holding a magnifying glass over a shield icon with a checkmark surrounded by risk management\nicons.]\nEBOOK\nCybersecurity Risk Management for Complex OT/IoT Environments\n][83]\n[\n[Industrial automation production line with robotic arms and motion blur effect showing fast\nmovement.]\nGUIDE\nBuyer\u2019s Guide to OT & IoT Asset Inventory Solutions\n][84]\n[\n[Nozomi Networks webinar titled Uncertainty, Undone: A 2026 OT/IoT Cybersecurity Strategy for\nConverged Environments.]\nWEBINAR\nHow to Finetune Asset Inventory Management for OT/IoT Environments\n][85]\n[\n[Forrester Wave Leader 2026 on blue background]\nANALYST REPORT\nThe Forrester Wave\u2122\ufe0f: IoT Security Solutions, Q3 2025\n][86]\n[\n[Two people in a ]\nEBOOK\nHow to Evaluate AI-driven Security Solutions for OT/ICS and IoT\n][87]\n\n## We Protect the Toughest OT & IoT Environments\n\nContinuous monitoring combined with AI-powered analysis give you asset visibility and A Note to our Customers and Partners in the Middle East\n[More Information][1]\n[\nAcademy\n][2][\nLabs\n][3][\nCareers\n][4][\nPartner Login\n][5][\nSupport\n][6]\n[[Nozomi logo]][7]\nPlatform\n\n### Platform Overview\n\nOur industrial cybersecurity solutions deliver unmatched asset intelligence, threat detection and\nAI-driven insights.\n\n[\nLearn more\n][8]\nMANAGERS\n[\nVantage\nCloud\n][9][\nCentral Management Console\nOn-prem\n][10]\nSENSORS\n[\nGuardian\nNetwork\n][11][\nGuardian Air\nWireless\n][12][\nArc\nEndpoint\n][13][\nArc Embedded\nEndpoint\n][14]\nENHANCEMENTS\n[\nVantage IQ\n][15][\nAsset Intelligence\n][16][\nThreat Intelligence\n][17][\nSmart Polling\n][18][\nTI Expansion\u00a0Pack\nPowered by Mandiant\n][19][\nIntegrations\n][20]\n\n### Professional Services\n\nOT and IoT security expertise that speeds solution deployment and maximizes value\n\n[\nLearn more\n][21]\nSolutions\nBUSINESS\u00a0NEED\n[\nAsset Inventory Management\n][22][\nThreat Detection\u00a0& Response\n][23][\nContinuous Network Monitoring\n][24][\nVulnerability Management\n][25][\nRisk Management\n][26][\nIoT Security\n][27][\nData Center Cybersecurity\n][28][\nBuilding Automation System\nCybersecurity\n][29]\nINDUSTRY\n[\nAirports\n][30][\nElectric Utilities\n][31][\nHealthcare\n][32][\nManufacturing\n][33][\nMaritime\n][34][\nMining\n][35][\nOil & Gas\n][36]\n[\nPharmaceutical\n][37][\nRail\n][38][\nRetail\n][39][\nSmart Cities\n][40][\nStadiums & Arenas\n][41][\nWater &\nWastewater\n][42]\n[Icon of a government building with three columns, a triangular roof, and a blue flag on top.]\nPUBLIC\u00a0SECTOR\n[\nFederal Government\n][43]\n[\nState &\u00a0Local\n][44]\nCOMPLIANCE\n[\nDoW ZT for OT\n][45][\nISA/IEC 62443 Standards\n][46][\nNERC CIP\n][47][\nNERC CIP-015\n][48][\nNIS2 Directive\n][49][\nSEC Cybersecurity Rules\n][50][\nTSA Security Directives\n][51]\nPartners\n\n### Why Partner with Us\n\nOur global partner network deploys OT & IoT cybersecurity solutions for customers around the world.\n\n[\nLearn more\n][52]\n\n### Our Partners\n\nExplore all Nozomi Networks partners\n\n[\nLearn more\n][53]\n\n### Find a Partner\n\nFind a certified Nozomi Networks partner in your country.\n\n[\nLearn more\n][54]\n\n### Partner Portal\n\nLog into the Nozomi Networks partner portal.\n\n[\nLog In\n][55]\nResources\n\n### Resource Library\n\nBrowse OT & IoT security research, guides, videos and more from the Nozomi Networks team.\n\n[\nView Resources\n][56]\nRESOURCES\n[\nCase Studies\n][57][\nContent Packs\n][58][\nData Sheets\n][59][\nOT Cyber FAQs\n][60][\nGuides\n][61][\nResearch Reports\n][62]\n[\nSolution Briefs\n][63][\nVideos\n][64][\nWebinars\n][65][\nWhite Papers\n][66][\nTrust Center\n][67]\n\n### Customer Hub\n\nExplore our latest customer resources, including webinars, how-to videos, content packs and more.\n\n[\nView Hub\n][68]\n[\nBlog\n][69]\nCompany\n\n### About Nozomi Networks\n\nWe keep critical infrastructure and operational technology cyber resilient.\n\n[\nLearn more\n][70]\n[\nLeadership Team\n][71][\nEvents\n][72][\nNewsroom\n][73]\n[\nCareers\n][74][\nCustomer Stories\n][75][\nContact Us\n][76]\n[Request Demo][77]\nGARTNER**^{\u00ae}**\u00a0REPORT\u00a0\n\n# **A Leader.\u00a0Again.**\n\n### 2026 Gartner^{\u00ae} Magic Quadrant^{\u2122} for CPS Protection Platforms\n\n[Read the Report][78]\n[Gartner Magic Quadrant for CPS Protection Platforms as of March 2026 showing Leaders Nozomi\nNetworks, Claroty, Armis; Challengers Forescout Technologies, Tenable, Fortinet; Visionaries\nDarktrace; and Niche Players Microsoft, Cisco, Palo Alto Networks, Honeywell, TXOne Networks, and\nDragos.][Gartner logo]\n[\n[Two IT professionals with badges working inside a server room with digital network overlay\ngraphics.]\nWEBINAR\nHow to Finetune Asset Inventory Management for OT/IoT Environments\n][79]\n[\n[Forrester Wave Leader 2025 badge for IoT Security Solutions on a blue background.]\nANALYST REPORT\nThe Forrester Wave\u2122\ufe0f: IoT Security Solutions, Q3 2025\n][80]\n[\n[Blue circular digital radar screen with concentric rings and data points segmented by white\ndiagonal lines.]\nEBOOK\nHow to Evaluate AI-driven Security Solutions for OT/ICS and IoT\n][81]\n[\n[Graphic with the text 'IoT' in the center, surrounded by a globe and digital lines connecting\nvarious technology icons.]\nWEBINAR\nEvaluating & Implementing the Right IoT Security Solution\n][82]\n[\n[Person holding a magnifying glass over a shield icon with a checkmark surrounded by risk management\nicons.]\nEBOOK\nCybersecurity Risk Management for Complex OT/IoT Environments\n][83]\n[\n[Industrial automation production line with robotic arms and motion blur effect showing fast\nmovement.]\nGUIDE\nBuyer\u2019s Guide to OT & IoT Asset Inventory Solutions\n][84]\n[\n[Nozomi Networks webinar titled Uncertainty, Undone: A 2026 OT/IoT Cybersecurity Strategy for\nConverged Environments.]\nWEBINAR\nHow to Finetune Asset Inventory Management for OT/IoT Environments\n][85]\n[\n[Forrester Wave Leader 2026 on blue background]\nANALYST REPORT\nThe Forrester Wave\u2122\ufe0f: IoT Security Solutions, Q3 2025\n][86]\n[\n[Two people in a ]\nEBOOK\nHow to Evaluate AI-driven Security Solutions for OT/ICS and IoT\n][87]\n\n## We Protect the Toughest OT & IoT Environments\n\nContinuous monitoring combined with AI-powered analysis give you asset visibility and management\nfrom the endpoint to the air.\n\n[[Dashboard interface showing vulnerability remediation statistics divided into software,\ncommunication, and hardware categories with counts and percentage changes.]\nIdentify mission-critical assets & vulnerabilities \u2192\nIdentify every asset, its normal behavior and context in real-time - the foundation for managing\nrisk in your environment.\n][88]\n[[Dashboard displaying vulnerabilities with sections for software, communication, and hardware\nremediation details and statistics.]\nDetect security threats & process anomalies \u2192\nDetect the security threats and process anomalies that matter, without the tedious tasks of sorting\nand correlating alerts.\n][89]\n[[Dashboard screenshot showing vulnerabilities categorized into software, communication, and\nhardware remediations with counts and action items.]\nRespond quickly to emerging cyber risks \u2192\nRespond quickly based on prioritized remediations that show you how to increase resilience and most\nefficiently reduce risk.\n][90]\n[Nozomi Networks large logo]\n\n## **#1 for the 4th Year in a Row: **Gartner Peer Insights Operational Technology Security\n\n[Learn More][91]\n102M+\nOT, IoT and IT Devices Monitored\n11K+\nInstallations Worldwide\n100%\nCustomer Retention\n\n## Trusted Partners\n\nOur partners help you deploy world-class cybersecurity solutions that meet your unique needs.\nWhether you\u2019re protecting OT, IT and/or IoT networks, you get a solution that\u2019s tailored to fit your\nspecific use cases and environment.\n\nOur global ecosystem of partners has been Nozomi Networks certified to deploy on-prem, as part of a\nhybrid network, with cloud resources, or manage it all for you.\n\n[See our partners][92]\n[Schneider Electric Logo]\n[ABS logo]\n[Accenture logo]\n[Atos logo]\n[BT logo]\n[Emerson logo]\n[Mandiant logo]\n[GE logo]\n[Mitsubishi Electric logo.]\n[Siemens logo]\n[EY logo]\n[Hitachi logo]\n[ABB logo]\n[IBM logo]\n[JCI logo]\n[Telefonica logo]\n[Blue abstract gradient background with diagonal light blue streaks.]\n\n#"
