ee][24]\n  * [Login to download][25]\n  * [Join us to become a member][26]\n* [EN][27]\n  Language\n* [Contact Us][28]\n* [What's New][29]\n* [Get support][30]\n* [Under Attack?][31]\n* [Demos and Trials][32]\nSearch\nAll\n* [Tech Docs][33]\n[Close search modal]\n\n# Control the chaos.\n# Secure every identity.\n\n## Introducing Idira^{\u00ae}, the next-generation identity security\n## platform that secures every identity for the AI enterprise.\n* [ Discover Idira][34]\n* [ Read the launch blog][35]\n\n## RECOMMENDED\n\n[\n[Gartner for EPP]\n\n### A 4X Gartner^{\u00ae} Magic Quadrant^{\u2122} Leader in EPP\n\nSee the AI edge\n][36]\n[\n[Acquisition of Portkey]\n\n### Palo Alto Networks Completes Acquisition of Portkey to Secure AI Agents\n\nRead the Press Release\n][37]\n[\n\n### Combat Risks from Frontier AI Models\n\nWatch on demand\n][38]\n[\n\n### Fight AI with AI\n\nSee what's possible\n][39]\n[\n\n### Introducing Prisma AIRS 3.0\n\nRead the blog\n][40]\n[\n\n### Defining the future of AI and quantum\n\nWatch now\n][41]\n[\n\n### Attacks are happening 4x faster. Are you ready?\n\nGet the Unit 42 IR Report\n][42]\n[\n\n### Unit 42 MSIAM 2.0 is here: The 24/7 managed SOC.\n\nSee what's new\n][43]\nWhy Palo Alto Networks?PlatformsSolutionsProven SuccessEngage with Us\n[ Why Palo Alto Networks? ][44]\n[ Platforms ][45]\n[ Solutions ][46]\n[ Proven Success ][47]\n[ Engage with Us ][48]\n[ Demos and trials ][49]\nYour browser does not support HTML5 video.\n\n## A new AI world is here\n\nTHE GOOD NEWS\n\n### AI is rapidly\n### transforming your\n### organization\n\n78 %\n\n### ~1.5X growth\n\nin usage in last\n12 months\n94 %\n\n### development\n\nenterprises using gen AI\nsoftware\n* ### INCREASE IN EXPLOITED ZERO DAYS (YoY, 2023)\n  \n  56%\n* ### INCREASE IN RANSOMWARE ATTACKS (YoY, 2023)\n  \n  73%\n* ### INCREASE IN DATA BREACHES AND LEAKS (YoY, 2023)\n  \n  56%\nTHE BAD NEWS\n\n### Attackers are supercharging their speed and scale.\n\nYour browser does not support HTML5 video.\nWHY PALO ALTO NETWORKS\n\n## Platformization empowers you to harness AI-ready infrastructure.\n## And leverage services powered by Precision AI^{\u00ae} to keep everything secure.\n\n[See our platform approach ][50]\n\n### 90 % reduction in MTTR\n\nDrive innovation and digital transformation with AI.\n\n### up to\u00a0 30.9 B inline attacks blocked per day\n\nProactively monitor, analyze and prevent sophisticated threats in real time with less complexity,\nenabling secure growth and innovation for your organization.\n\n### 480 B endpoints scanned daily\n\nEnable better, faster security with an integrated suite of battle-tested, AI-driven products.\n\n## Introducing the Platforms, powered by Precision AI\n\n[ AI-Powered Network Security ][51][ AI-Driven Security Operations ][52][ Real-Time Cloud Security\n][53][ Next-Generation Identity Security ][54]\n\n### AI-powered Network Security\n\nSecuring everyone and everything from the latest threats in every location. Built for Zero Trust\nand\u00a0powered by AI, the Strata\u2122 Network Security Platform\u00a0proactively monitors, analyzes and prevents\nsophisticated threats in real time with less complexity, enabling secure growth and innovation for\nyour organization.\n95%\nof the Fortune 100\n70 K\nCustomers\n[ Explore Network Security ][55]\n13x\nnetwork security leader\nSee all\n2025 Gartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for Hybrid Mesh Firewall\n2025 Gartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for SASE Platforms\nThe Forrester Wave\u2122: Enterprise Firewall Solutions\nGartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for Single-Vendor SASE\nGartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for Network Firewalls\nGartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for SD-WAN\nABI Research Industrial FW Competitive Assessment\nGartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for Security Service Edge\nForrester Wave\u2122: Operational Technology Security Solutions\nForrester New Wave\u2122: ZTNA\nForrester New Wave\u2122: Zero Trust Platform Providers\nFrost Radar\u2122 for Zero Trust Browser Security\nFrost & Sullivan Healthcare IoMT Radar\nTrusted by the best\n\n### AI-Driven Security Operations\n\nTransform the SOC and enable better, faster security with the #1 AI-driven SecOps platform powered\nby unified data, artificial intelligence and automation.\n700+\npartner integrations\n480 B\nEndpoints scanned daily\n[ Explore SecOps ][56]\n15x\nLeader from Code to Cloud to SOC\nSee all\n2026 Gartner\u00ae Magic Quadrant\u2122 for Endpoint Protection Platforms\nForrester Cybersecurity IR Services Wave\nFrost & Sullivan MDR Radar\nForrester Wave\u2122: Extended Detection And Response Platforms, Q2 2024\nTrusted by the best\n\n### Real-Time Cloud Security\n\nSee more, remediate faster, and prevent what others miss with independent, multi-cloud protection on\nthe only platform that merges the industry\u2019s leading CNAPP with best-in-class CDR.\n90%\nrisk reduction with shift left\n25x\nreduction in alerts & remediation workflows\n[ Explore Cloud Security ][57]\nSee all\nA Leader and Outperformer in the GigaOm Radar for CIEM\nPalo Alto Networks: Cloud Security Leader in First-Ever CNAPP Report\nThe Forrester Wave\u2122: Cloud Workload Security, Q1 2024\nFrost Radar\u2122: Cloud Security Posture Management, 2024\nFrostRadar\u2122 names Palo Alto Networks a CNAPP Leader\nOverall leader : 2024 Leadership Compass: Security Orchestration, Automation and Response\nKuppingerCole Leadership Compass Report for Attack Surface Management\nA Supply Chain Security Leader in the GigaOm Radar 2024 report\n\n### Next-Generation Identity Security\n\nIdira secures every identity for the enterprise - human, machine and agentic - with a unified\ncontrol plane that discovers risk, applies privilege dynamically, and governs the full lifecycle\nfrom first access to final session.\n10 K\nCustomers\n55%\nOF THE FORTUNE 500\n[ Explore Identity Security ][58]\nSee all\n[\nMagic Quadrant ^{\u00ae} for Privileged Access Management, 2025\n][59]\nThe Forrester Wave\u2122: Privileged Identity Management, 2025\nLeadership Compass: Access Management, 2025\nLeadership Compass: Identity Threat Detection & Response, 2025\n2025 Frost Radar\u2122. Key & Secrets Management\nLeadership Compass: Passwordless Authentication for Enterprises, 2026\nLeadership Compass: Passwordless Authentication B2C, 2026\nLeadership Compass: Enterprise Secrets Management, 2025\nLeadership Compass: Privileged Access Management, 2025\nRadar for Privileged Access Management, 2025\nTrusted by the best\n\n## Intelligence-driven.\n## Response-ready.\n\n[ Threat Intel & Incident Response ][60]\nSERVICES\nThreat Intel &\nIncident Response\nUnit 42\u2019s world-renowned threat researchers, elite incident responders and expert security\nconsultants will guide you with a threat-informed approach before, during and after"
