        "crawl_text": "# Advancing Energy Tech\n\n* [Named World's Most Sustainable Company 2026 by TIME Magazine and Statista]\n  \n  ### [Named World's Most Sustainable Company 2026 by TIME Magazine and Statista][1]\n  \n  Learn more on this milestone\n  \n  [Named World's Most Sustainable Company 2026 by TIME Magazine and Statista]\n  \n  ### [Named World's Most Sustainable Company 2026 by TIME Magazine and Statista][2]\n  \n  Learn more on this milestone\n* [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [A Blueprint for Energy-Efficient Buildings][3]\n  \n  Overcoming barriers to cut energy costs 5x\n  \n  [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [A Blueprint for Energy-Efficient Buildings][4]\n  \n  Overcoming barriers to cut energy costs 5x\n* [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [McLaren Racing: Where data meets drive][5]\n  \n  Turning raw data into competitive advantage and unleashed performance\n  \n  [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [McLaren Racing: Where data meets drive][6]\n  \n  Turning raw data into competitive advantage and unleashed performance\n* [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [2026 Q1 Revenues][7]\n  \n  The report is available\n  \n  [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [2026 Q1 Revenues][8]\n  \n  The report is available\n\n[ZZ_Alt text 3]\n\n## [2026 Global energy outlook: Securing resilience in the energy transition][9]\n\nExplore the 2026 energy outlook and build resilient, future-ready energy operations amid rising\nrisks and costs.\n[ZZ_Alt text 2]\n\n## [How to power your AI factory with smarter energy and automation integration][10]\n\nSoftware-defined automation and digital twins position hyperscalers to scale AI capacity sustainably\nand profitably.\n[ZZ_Alt text 1]\n\n## [How smart buildings unlock 60% more grid capacity][11]\n\nNew research maps how building-level investments today can defer years of costly grid\ninfrastructure.\nFrom our CEO\n\n### How to turn demand-side data into energy you don't have to build\n\nEnergy transition\n\n### Why the energy transition can't wait for the grid \u2014 and what's working now\n\nAI Infrastructure\n\n### How 800VDC eliminates the power bottleneck in high-density AI racks\n\nAI for Reliability\n\n### How AI-driven maintenance catches data center failures before they happen\n\n\n### About Schneider Electric\n\nWith 160,000 employees worldwide, we electrify, automate, and digitalize industries, businesses, and\nhomes.\n\n### Our history\n\nExplore our 190-year journey of defining innovations and transformation.\n\n### Global Innovation Hubs\n\nEngage with our advanced energy management and industrial automation technologies through over 100\nhubs worldwide.\n\n### Sustainability\n\nLearn how we lead the way, turning sustainability commitments into impact.\n\n### Vancouver International Airport (YVR)\n\nDiscover how Vancouver International Airport (YVR) is transforming into a leading sustainable\naviation hub in North America through its bold net-zero ambition.\n\n### Henkel optimizes energy efficiency for a net-zero future\n\nPartnership powers Henkel to drive innovation and sustainability in its production sites through\nSchneider Electric\u2019s energy technology, including monitoring software and advisory services.\n* Our Mission\n* Company Profile\n* Report a misconduct\n* Accessibility\n* Newsroom\n* Financial Results\n* Annual Reports\n* Share Price\n* Investor Events\n* Sustainability\n* New Energy Landscape\n* Next-generation Automation\n* AI and Technology\n* Reports\n* Foundation\n* Consulting\n* Global - FR\n* Legal Information\n* Privacy Policy\n* Cookie Notice\n* Change your cookie settings\n\n[1]: /ww/en/about-us/newsroom/news/press-releases/Schneider-Electric-named-World27s-Most-Sustainable\n-Company-for-the-third-consecutive-year-by-TIME-Magazine-and-Statista-6a3a827795dc4e8f1f09a8e3/?utm_\nsource=advocacy&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=2026_jun_ww_allbu_etech&campaign_objective=aw\nareness&mcl_name=etech\n[2]: /ww/en/about-us/newsroom/news/press-releases/Schneider-Electric-named-World27s-Most-Sustainable\n-Company-for-the-third-consecutive-year-by-TIME-Magazine-and-Statista-6a3a827795dc4e8f1f09a8e3/?utm_\nsource=advocacy&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=2026_jun_ww_allbu_etech&campaign_objective=aw\nareness&mcl_name=etech\n[3]: https://www.bloombergneweconomy.com/a-blueprint-for-energy-efficient-buildings/?utm_source=bloo\nmberg&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=2026_jun_ww_allbu_etech_bloomberg_awareness_directmedia-banner\nbuy_global_gmc26&utm_content=coalition_casestudy_1_vivatech_amplification&utm_term=na&campaign_objec\ntive=awareness&mcl_name=etech\n[4]: https://www.bloombergneweconomy.com/a-blueprint-for-energy-efficient-buildings/?utm_source=bloo\nmberg&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=2026_jun_ww_allbu_etech_bloomberg_awareness_directmedia-banner\nbuy_global_gmc26&utm_content=coalition_casestudy_1_vivatech_amplification&utm_term=na&campaign_objec\ntive=awareness&mcl_name=etech\n[5]: /ww/en/work/campaign/customer-stories/mclaren-racing/\n[6]: /ww/en/work/campaign/customer-stories/mclaren-racing/\n[7]: /ww/en/about-us/investor-relations/financial-results\n[8]: /ww/en/about-us/in # Advancing Energy Tech\n\n* [Named World's Most Sustainable Company 2026 by TIME Magazine and Statista]\n  \n  ### [Named World's Most Sustainable Company 2026 by TIME Magazine and Statista][1]\n  \n  Learn more on this milestone\n  \n  [Named World's Most Sustainable Company 2026 by TIME Magazine and Statista]\n  \n  ### [Named World's Most Sustainable Company 2026 by TIME Magazine and Statista][2]\n  \n  Learn more on this milestone\n* [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [A Blueprint for Energy-Efficient Buildings][3]\n  \n  Overcoming barriers to cut energy costs 5x\n  \n  [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [A Blueprint for Energy-Efficient Buildings][4]\n  \n  Overcoming barriers to cut energy costs 5x\n* [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [McLaren Racing: Where data meets drive][5]\n  \n  Turning raw data into competitive advantage and unleashed performance\n  \n  [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [McLaren Racing: Where data meets drive][6]\n  \n  Turning raw data into competitive advantage and unleashed performance\n* [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [2026 Q1 Revenues][7]\n  \n  The report is available\n  \n  [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [2026 Q1 Revenues][8]\n  \n  The report is available\n\n[ZZ_Alt text 3]\n\n## [2026 Global energy outlook: Securing resilience in the energy transition][9]\n\nExplore the 2026 energy outlook and build resilient, future-ready energy operations amid rising\nrisks and costs.\n[ZZ_Alt text 2]\n\n## [How to power your AI factory with smarter energy and automation integration][10]\n\nSoftware-defined automation and digital twins position hyperscalers to scale AI capacity sustainably\nand profitably.\n[ZZ_Alt text 1]\n\n## [How smart buildings unlock 60% more grid capacity][11]\n\nNew research maps how building-level investments today can defer years of costly grid\ninfrastructure.\nFrom our CEO\n\n### How to turn demand-side data into energy you don't have to build\n\nEnergy transition\n\n### Why the energy transition can't wait for the grid \u2014 and what's working now\n\nAI Infrastructure\n\n### How 800VDC eliminates the power bottleneck in high-density AI racks\n\nAI for Reliability\n\n### How AI-driven maintenance catches data center failures before they happen\n\n\n### About Schneider Electric\n\nWith 160,000 employees worldwide, we electrify, automate, and digitalize industries, businesses, and\nhomes.\n\n### Our history\n\nExplore our 190-year journey of defining innovations and transformation.\n\n### Global Innovation Hubs\n\nEngage with our advanced energy management and industrial automation technologies through over 100\nhubs worldwide.\n\n### Sustainability\n\nLearn how we lead the way, turning sustainability commitments into impact.\n\n### Vancouver International Airport (YVR)\n\nDiscover how Vancouver International Airport (YVR) is transforming into a leading sustainable\naviation hub in North America through its bold net-zero ambition.\n\n### Henkel optimizes energy efficiency for a net-zero future\n\nPartnership powers Henkel to drive innovation and sustainability in its production sites through\nSchneider Electric\u2019s energy technology, including monitoring software and advisory services.\n* Our Mission\n* Company Profile\n* Report a misconduct\n* Accessibility\n* Newsroom\n* Financial Results\n* Annual Reports\n* Share Price\n* Investor Events\n* Sustainability\n* New Energy Landscape\n* Next-generation Automation\n* AI and Technology\n* Reports\n* Foundation\n* Consulting\n* Global - FR\n* Legal Information\n* Privacy Policy\n* Cookie Notice\n* Change your cookie settings\n\n[1]: /ww/en/about-us/newsroom/news/press-releases/Schneider-Electric-named-World27s-Most-Sustainable\n-Company-for-the-third-consecutive-year-by-TIME-Magazine-and-Statista-6a3a827795dc4e8f1f09a8e3/?utm_\nsource=advocacy&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=2026_jun_ww_allbu_etech&campaign_objective=aw\nareness&mcl_name=etech\n[2]: /ww/en/about-us/newsroom/news/press-releases/Schneider-Electric-named-World27s-Most-Sustainable\n-Company-for-the-third-consecutive-year-by-TIME-Magazine-and-Statista-6a3a827795dc4e8f1f09a8e3/?utm_\nsource=advocacy&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=2026_jun_ww_allbu_etech&campaign_objective=aw\nareness&mcl_name=etech\n[3]: https://www.bloombergneweconomy.com/a-blueprint-for-energy-efficient-buildings/?utm_source=bloo\nmberg&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=2026_jun_ww_allbu_etech_bloomberg_awareness_directmedia-banner\nbuy_global_gmc26&utm_content=coalition_casestudy_1_vivatech_amplification&utm_term=na&campaign_objec\ntive=awareness&mcl_name=etech\n[4]: https://www.bloombergneweconomy.com/a-blueprint-for-energy-efficient-buildings/?utm_source=bloo\nmberg&utm_medium=display&utm_campaign=2026_jun_ww_allbu_etech_bloomberg_awareness_directmedia-banner\nbuy_global_gmc26&utm_content=coalition_casestudy_1_vivatech_amplification&utm_term=na&campaign_objec\ntive=awareness&mcl_name=etech\n[5]: /ww/en/work/campaign/customer-stories/mclaren-racing/\n[6]: /ww/en/work/campaign/customer-stories/mclaren-racing/\n[7]: /ww/en/about-us/investor-relations/financial-results\n[8]: /ww/en/about-us/investor-relations/financial-results\n[9]: /ww/en/insights/electricity-4-0/digitalization/2026-global-energy-outlook-securing-resilience-i\nn-the-energy-transition/\n[10]: /ww/en/insights/next-generation-automation/universal-automation/energy-intelligence-meets-auto\nmation-building-ai-factories/\n[11]: /ww/en/insights/sustainability/sustainability-research-institute/grid-relief-smart-buildings/ schneider-electric.com # Advancing Energy Tech\n\n* [Named World's Most Sustainable Company 2026 by TIME Magazine and Statista]\n  \n  ### [Named World's Most Sustainable Company 2026 by TIME Magazine and Statista][1]\n  \n  Learn more on this milestone\n  \n  [Named World's Most Sustainable Company 2026 by TIME Magazine and Statista]\n  \n  ### [Named World's Most Sustainable Company 2026 by TIME Magazine and Statista][2]\n  \n  Learn more on this milestone\n* [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [A Blueprint for Energy-Efficient Buildings][3]\n  \n  Overcoming barriers to cut energy costs 5x\n  \n  [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [A Blueprint for Energy-Efficient Buildings][4]\n  \n  Overcoming barriers to cut energy costs 5x\n* [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [McLaren Racing: Where data meets drive][5]\n  \n  Turning raw data into competitive advantage and unleashed performance\n  \n  [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [McLaren Racing: Where data meets drive][6]\n  \n  Turning raw data into competitive advantage and unleashed performance\n* [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [2026 Q1 Revenues][7]\n  \n  The report is available\n  \n  [ZZ_aprimo image alt text]\n  \n  ### [2026 Q1 Revenues][8]\n  \n  The report is avai