rom bots or unsafe placements. Every\nimpression is authentic.\n\nEngagement\n\nInteractive Ad Format\n\nYour campaigns appear as immersive, interactive stories while users set up their app protection -\nnot intrusive, but memorable.\n\n### How It Works\n\nLaunch your interactive ad campaigns in minutes \u2014 create, manage, and scale with Sentryo Ads.\n\nCreate Your Account\n\nSign up in seconds and get access to your personal advertiser dashboard. All your campaigns,\nanalytics, and billing \u2014 in one secure place.\n\nBuild Interactive Campaigns\n\nUse our intuitive constructor to design engaging, interactive ad experiences. You can even create a\ncustom mascot or character to represent your brand.\n\nSet Your Targeting & Budget\n\nDefine your audience, choose regions, and set flexible daily or total budgets. Sentryo automatically\noptimizes delivery for the best results.\n\nLaunch and Go Live\n\nYour ads seamlessly integrate into the Sentryo app flow \u2014 shown to users while they set up their app\nprotection. Completely non-intrusive, yet highly engaging.\n\nTrack Performance in Real Time\n\nAccess detailed dashboards that show clicks, impressions, and conversions. Analyze data and\nfine-tune your campaigns instantly.\n\nGet Instant Support Anytime\n\nOur real-time support team is always ready to assist you. Whether you need setup help or performance\nadvice \u2014 we\u2019re here 24/7.\n\n### Advertise your business\n\nYour Audience Is Already Here \u2014 Join Them.\nCreate your first campaign in minutes.\n\n[\nTry It Free Now\n][17]\n[app dashboard image]\n\n### One App \u2014 Total Control of Your Privacy\n\nApp Control\n\nManage all protected apps and security settings in one intuitive interface.\n\nCustomization\n\nTailor protection methods to fit your personal security style.\n\n3 Methods of Secure\n\nChoose from multiple ways to lock and protect your data.\n\nScale and Support\n\nGet real-time assistance and seamless updates to keep your device protected.\n\n[phone]\n\nObject Selection\n\nSelect specific apps you want to protect \u2014 full control over what stays private and what stays open.\n\nGesture Combination\n\nCreate a unique gesture unlock pattern \u2014 fast, intuitive, and impossible to guess.\n\nSuper Key\n\nUse a combined digital key for your most sensitive apps \u2014 the highest level of protection.\n\nLocal-Only Key Storage\n\nYour protection keys are stored only on your device. No cloud, no sync, no external access.\n\n### FAQ\u2019s\n\nHow does Sentryo protect my apps?\n\nSentryo lets you lock any app using three unique protection methods \u2014 Object Selection, Gesture\nCombination, and the Super Key. Each one adds an extra layer of privacy, ensuring only you can\naccess your sensitive apps and data.\n\nWhere are my protection keys stored?\n\nAll keys are stored locally on your device. Sentryo does not use cloud storage or external servers,\nguaranteeing complete decentralization and true data ownership\n\nCan I use Sentryo to protect any app on my phone?\n\nYes. You can secure any app \u2014 messengers, banking, photos, work tools, or anything else you choose.\nBut right only Sentryo available only on Android devices. You decide what stays private and what\nstays open.\n\nWhat is Sentryo Ads and how does it work for advertisers?\n\nSentryo Ads is a dedicated web platform where advertisers can create and manage interactive ad\ncampaigns. Their ads appear natively inside the Sentryo app during key creation moments \u2014 reaching\nusers in a natural, high-attention environment.\n\nHow do I create a campaign as an advertiser?\n\nSimply register in the Sentryo Ads dashboard, design your ad using our interactive builder, set\ntargeting and budget, then launch. You\u2019ll track performance in real time with detailed analytics and\nlive support.\n\nIs Sentryo safe for both users and advertisers?\n\nSentryo was built around security and transparency \u2014 users\u2019 data never leaves their device, and\nadvertisers operate within a fully verified, brand-safe ecosystem.\n\n[WhatsApp]\n[Messenger]\n[Spotify]\n[Pinterest]\n[Gmail]\n[Instagram]\n[WhatsApp]\n[Twitter]\n[Pinterest]\n\n# Secure your apps with Unlox\n\nTry now\n[[logo]\n\nSentryo\n\n][18]\n* Links\n* [Project][19]\n* [Our Benefits][20]\n* [How It Works][21]\n* [Application][22]\n* [Why Unlox][23]\n* [FAQ\u2019s][24]\n* Pages\n* [Privacy Policy ][25]\n* [Terms Of Use ][26]\n\nDownload app\n\n[[Google play]][27]\n\nCopyright \u00a92026 Unlox. All rights reserved\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: #project\n[3]: #our-benefits\n[4]: #advertiser-conditions\n[5]: #application\n[6]: #why-unlox\n[7]: #faq\n[8]: https://forms.gle/VzUWn9XtvQBVx7Hm7\n[9]: #project\n[10]: #our-benefits\n[11]: #advertiser-conditions\n[12]: #application\n[13]: #why-unlox\n[14]: #faq\n[15]: https://forms.gle/VzUWn9XtvQBVx7Hm7\n[16]: https://forms.gl"
