ily farm helps a robot pick strawberries\n\nMeet Fravebot. It monitors plant health, spots pests early and predicts harvests two weeks out. It\nlearned how in a digital twin first.\n\n][11]\n[Read customer story][12]\n[\n[A person wearing a VR headset is looking at a water efficiency solution illustration.]\n][13]\n[**E-book**\nall\n\n### E-book: Industrial AI across the value chain\n\nHow industrial AI is transforming every step, from product design and engineering to production and\noperations.\n\n][14]\n[Download the e-book][15]\n[\n[A person stands in front of a large screen displaying a graph with a rising line, likely\nrepresenting data or statistics.]\n][16]\n[**Product spotlight **\nall\n\n### Eigen Engineering Agent for TIA Portal\n\nPurpose-built AI that autonomously plans, codes, configures and validates automation engineering\ntasks. Now generally available.\n\n][17]\n[Start free trial][18]\n[\n[Farma R\u00e1je\u010dek Jahody.]\n][19]\n[**Customer story**\nall\n\n### AI on the family farm helps a robot pick strawberries\n\nMeet Fravebot. It monitors plant health, spots pests early and predicts harvests two weeks out. It\nlearned how in a digital twin first.\n\n][20]\n[Read customer story][21]\n[\n[A person wearing a VR headset is looking at a water efficiency solution illustration.]\n][22]\n[**E-book**\nall\n\n### E-book: Industrial AI across the value chain\n\nHow industrial AI is transforming every step, from product design and engineering to production and\noperations.\n\n][23]\n[Download the e-book][24]\n[\n[A person stands in front of a large screen displaying a graph with a rising line, likely\nrepresenting data or statistics.]\n][25]\n[**Product spotlight **\nall\n\n### Eigen Engineering Agent for TIA Portal\n\nPurpose-built AI that autonomously plans, codes, configures and validates automation engineering\ntasks. Now generally available.\n\n][26]\n[Start free trial][27]\n[Person using laptop with holographic display of data charts and graphs floating above]\n\n### Unlock smarter solutions with our AI offerings\n\n[Discover more][28]\n**Marketplace**\n\n## Discover products and services\n\nExplore a wide range of modular and interoperable products, services and solutions to scale your\nbusiness\u2019s innovation and fuel your digital transformation.\n\n[Go to marketplace][29]\n[Panoramic city skyline. ]\nSiemens Xcelerator\n\n### Building X\n\nThe Building X platform helps you manage and optimize building operations\u2014from energy use and tenant\ncomfort to maintenance, security, safety and more.\n\n[Learn more][30]\n[An illustration representing electric power.]\nSiemens Xcelerator\n\n### Electrification X\n\nElectrification X combines the real and digital worlds in the Xcelerator Internet of Things (IoT)\nsoftware as a service (SaaS) offering for electrification and automation to tackle the challenges of\nenergy transition.\n\n[Learn more][31]\n[A woman in a blue shirt is standing in front of a white wall, holding a blue object in her hand.]\nSiemens Xcelerator\n\n### Femap\n\nCreate, edit and evaluate finite element models of complex products and systems using advanced\ncomputer-aided engineering (CAE) pre- and postprocessors to model components, assemblies or systems.\n\n[Learn more][32]\n[A promotional image for Gridscale X Marketplace featuring a grid of icons and a blue background.]\nSiemens Xcelerator\n\n### Gridscale X\n\nAccelerate and secure the energy transition in a sustainable and profitable way.\n\n[Learn more][33]\n[A promotional image for a cloud marketplace featuring a modern, sleek design with a focus on\ntechnology and innovation.]\nSiemens Xcelerator\n\n### Movilitas Cloud\n\nAchieve end-to-end traceability with our powerful serialization software, automating serial number\nmanagement and streamlining your manufacturing processes to ensure compliance and build a robust\nsupply chain.\n\n[Learn more][34]\n[A person is standing in front of a white wall with a blue and white sign on it.]\