        "crawl_text": "[\nSkip to main content\n][1]\n* PRODUCTS\n  Agentic SOC Platform Overview\n  Unifies threat intelligence, security data, and agentic AI into a single platform, enabling SOC\n  and CTI teams to collaborate seamlessly. Teams gain context and AI-guided workflows to detect\n  hidden threats, prioritize high-risk incidents, and respond faster.\n  [Agentic SOC Platform Overview][2]\n  Agentic SOC Platform Overview\n  Products\n  * Unified Security Data Lake\n    Complete visibility, AI-guided insights, and unified workflows to detect, investigate, and\n    respond at machine speed.\n    [Unified Security Data Lake][3]\n    Unified Security Data Lake\n  * ThreatStream Next-Gen\n    The industry\u2019s leading threat intelligence platform (TIP) that provides curated access to the\n    world\u2019s largest repository of curated threat intelligence.\n    [ThreatStream Next-Gen][4]\n    ThreatStream Next-Gen\n  * Agentic AI\n    Advanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\n    threats in their tracks.\n    [Agentic AI][5]\n    Agentic AI\n  Use Cases\n  * Compliance\n    All-in-one ETL, SIEM, XDR, UEBA, and SOAR for blazing fast threat detection, investigation, and\n    response.\n    [Compliance][6]\n    Compliance\n  * Threat Detection\n    The industry\u2019s leading threat intelligence platform (TIP) that provides curated access to the\n    world\u2019s largest repository of curated threat intelligence.\n    [Threat Detection][7]\n    Threat Detection\n  * Investigation and Response\n    Advanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\n    threats in their tracks.\n    [Investigation and Response][8]\n    Investigation and Response\n  * Threat Hunting\n    Advanced AI and natural language processing to simplify and speed up analysis so you can stop\n    threats in their tracks.\n    [Threat Hunting][9]\n    Threat Hunting\n  * Threat Analysis\n    Advance