        "crawl_text": "### Welcome To Base Automation\n\nToggle navigation\n[ [Base Automation] ][1]\n* **Call Us**\n  [++91 8056273540][2]\nToggle navigation\n* [Home][3]\n* [Services][4]\n  * [Control Automation][5]\n  * [Weighing & Batching Systems][6]\n  * [MES][7]\n    * [Traceability][8]\n    * [Production Operations][9]\n    * [Quality Operations][10]\n    * [Inventory Operations][11]\n    * [Maintenance Operations][12]\n  * [ERP Integration][13]\n  * [Unified Namespace][14]\n  * [Business Intelligence][15]\n  * [Cloud Data Enablement][16]\n  * [Industry 4.0 Assessments][17]\n* [Industries][18]\n  * [Tyre & Rubber][19]\n  * [Automotive][20]\n  * [Auto Components][21]\n  * [EV Battery][22]\n  * [Life Science \u2013 Pharma][23]\n  * [Food and Beverages][24]\n  * [Consumer Goods][25]\n  * [Data Centers][26]\n  * [Metals][27]\n  * [Chemicals & Petrochemicals][28]\n* [About Us][29]\n  * [Culture][30]\n  * [Team][31]\n  * [Partners][32]\n* [Resources][33]\n  * [Careers][34]\n  * [Enquiry][35]\n  * [Case Studies][36]\n* [Download our brochures][37]\n[Get In Touch][38]\n[\u00d7][39]\n[ [Base Automation] ][40]\n\n\nSuccessfully transforming the Industrial Manufacturing Business to achieve excellence for over 25\nyears!\n\n##### 276, 2nd Main Road, Nehru Nagar,\n\nKottivakkam, OMR, Chennai \u2013 600096, India.\n\n##### : +91 8056273540\n\n( 91 8056273540)\n\n##### Monday - Friday\n\nSystems Integration\n\nInformation Solutions\n\nDigitally Transform, Thrive!\n\nI4.0 Consulting\n\nDriving Innovation for\nManufacturers Worldwide\n\nIndustrial Automation\n\nFOR SMARTER\nBUSINESS\nDECISIONS FUTURE-PROOF\nSOLUTIONS Automated SCADA, MES, and\nIIoT solutions that collect\nand present real-time data Energizing Automation \u2013 safely delivering\ndigitally-enabled solutions that optimize\nand sustain your operations.\nTECHNICAL\nINNOVATORS PROCESS\nEXPERTS,\n\n# 5\n\n#### Offices Across the Globe\n\n# 30\n\n#### Years of Automation Business\n\n# 120+\n\n#### Trained Engineers\n\n# 400+\n\n#### Customers in India\n\n# 4000+\n\n#### Successful Projects Executed\n\n### 5\n\nOffices Across the Globe\n\n### 30\n\nYears of Automation Business\n\n### 120+\n\nTrained Engineers\n\n### 400+\n\nCustomers in India\n\n### 4000+\n\nSuccessful Projects Executed\n\n# WHAT WE DO\n\n##### CONTROL AUTOMATION\n\nRegardless of the technology platform of your machine, or lack thereof.\n\n##### INFORMATION SYSTEMS\n\nCombining decades of our experience working on different OT and IT Technology platforms.\n\n##### INDUSTRY 4.0 CONSULTING\n\nWe help you with the digital maturity assessment of your factory and define an Industry 4.0\nstrategic roadmap.\n\n#### India | UAE | USA | UK\n\nWe are working together with our clients and partners to maintain production and delivery of\nproducts and medicines needed to keep our communities healthy.\nLike you, we are committed to keeping our employees safe.\nWe use advanced technologies to remotely deliver projects to ensure employee health & safety, with\nincreased efficiencies and lower costs.\n[ Read More ][41]\n\n## About us\n\n# Our Company Mission\n\nBASE Automation Technologies Pvt. Ltd. (BATPL) is an ISO 9001:2015 company, incorporated in the year\n1995 in Chennai, India with a primary focus on providing Industrial Solutions to manufacturing\nindustries through our Automation and Software services.\n\nBASE aims to be the best technology service provider and to be the catalyst in solving various\nchallenges faced by the manufacturing industries through our technical and conceptual system\nintegration expertise.\n\n\u00a0\n\n[ Read More ][42]\nProfessional Team\n1 +\nGroup Companies\n1\n\n# Challenge Accepted!\n\nOne of the common challenges faced by the manufacturers is keeping up with the fast-changing\ntechnology. Due to constant changes in hardware and software, the deployed control platforms and\nsoftware elements become obsolete, or sometimes lead to compatibility issues. Those technologies\nneed to be upgraded to ensure maintenance support, which in turn reduces the cost of downtime and\ninventory.\n\nAgility\n\nWe have a relentless focus on delivering valuable output each week. Instead of long processes, we\nconsistently find and solve immediate problems, test, and adjust along the way.\n\nOut-of-the-box thinking\n\nStay ahead of the ever-changing customer requirements and business needs with flexible, intuitive,\nand scalable features that evolve alongside you.\n\nEliminating risks\n\nYou get a stable solution built using varied platform and tested in your own company!\n\n# Technology Expertise\n\n[barnd-1-01.png]\n[barnd-2-01.png]\n[barnd-7-01.png]\n[barnd-5-01.png]\n[barnd-6-01.png]\n[barnd-4-01.png]\n[barnd-3-01.png]\n[canary-labs-1.png]\n[logo-1-01.png]\n[highbyte-1.png]\n\n### 120 +\n\nCertified Engineers\n\n### 12 +\n\nCountries\n\n### 40 +\n\nHappy Clients\n\n### 40 +\n\nProject Completed\n\nCertified Engineers\n1 +\nCountries\n1 +\nHappy Clients\n1 +\nCompleted\n1 +\nCertified Engineers\n1 +\nCountries\n1 +\nHappy Clients\n1 +\nCompleted\n1 +\n\n### what you get\n\n# Avid Capabilities\n* End-User to Enterprise Strategic Integration\n* Process Controls System Design\n* Industrial Processes and Process Control\n* Batch Process Design and Implementation\n* IIoT Integra ### Welcome To Base Automation\n\nToggle navigation\n[ [Base Automation] ][1]\n* **Call Us**\n  [++91 8056273540][2]\nToggle navigation\n* [Home][3]\n* [Services][4]\n  * [Control Automation][5]\n  * [Weighing & Batching Systems][6]\n  * [MES][7]\n    * [Traceability][8]\n    * [Production Operations][9]\n    * [Quality Operations][10]\n    * [Inventory Operations][11]\n    * [Maintenance Operations][12]\n  * [ERP Integration][13]\n  * [Unified Namespace][14]\n  * [Business Intelligence][15]\n  * [Cloud Data Enablement][16]\n  * [Industry 4.0 Assessments][17]\n* [Industries][18]\n  * [Tyre & Rubber][19]\n  * [Automotive][20]\n  * [Auto Components][21]\n  * [EV Battery][22]\n  * [Life Science \u2013