        "crawl_text": "## Careers Form\n\n\"\u00a0\" indicates required fields\n\nFirst name*\u00a0\nFirst\nLast name*\u00a0\nFirst\nEmail*\u00a0\nCell Phone*\u00a0\nLinkedIn profile*\u00a0\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPosition*\nAttach resume*\u00a0\nMax. file size: 256 MB.\nAttach Cover letter\nMax. file size: 256 MB.\nUntitled\nI would like to receive updates from C2A Security. I can unsubscribe at any time.\nUsing your personal data\u00a0\nI consent to the use of my personal information.\n\nWe're committed to protect your privacy. C2A Security uses the information you provide to us to\ncontact you about our products and services. You may unsubscribe from these communications at any\ntime. For information on how to unsubscribe, as well as our privacy practices and commitment to\nprotecting your privacy, please review our [Privacy Policy ][1].\n\n## Office Administrator\n* Products\n  * [EVSec Platform][2]\n  * [EVSec Analysis][3]\n  * [EVSec BOM & Vulnerability Management][4]\n  * [EVSec Attacker][5]\n  * [EVSec Network & Endpoint Protection][6]\n  * [EVSec SOC Enrichment & Analytics][7]\n  * [EVSec AutoSynth AI][8]\n* [Use Cases][9]\n  * [Medical and Healthcare][10]\n* [Integrations][11]\n* [Blog][12]\n* Company\n  * [About][13]\n  * [Events][14]\n  * [Careers][15]\n* [Contact][16]\n* [Schedule a Demo][17]\n* Products\n  * [EVSec Platform][18]\n  * [EVSec Analysis][19]\n  * [EVSec BOM & Vulnerability Management][20]\n  * [EVSec Attacker][21]\n  * [EVSec Network & Endpoint Protection][22]\n  * [EVSec SOC Enrichment & Analytics][23]\n  * [EVSec AutoSynth AI][24]\n* [Use Cases][25]\n  * [Medical and Healthcare][26]\n* [Integrations][27]\n* [Blog][28]\n* Company\n  * [About][29]\n  * [Events][30]\n  * [Careers][31]\n* [Contact][32]\n* [Schedule a Demo][33]\n\n### Transforming Product Security from\n### a Limitation to a Business Value Multiplier\n\n# The Only Context-based Product Security Orchestration Platform\n\n[ Watch our Webinar: From CVE Alert to Patient Risk ][34]\n\n### Automated Cybersecurity DevOps Platform\u00a0\n\n## Fortify the Future of Cyber-Physical Systems & Software Defined Products\n\n## Fortify the Future of Cyber-Physical Systems & Software Defined Products\n\nAccelerate innovation while strengthening product security \u2013 transforming cybersecurity into a\ncompetitive advantage and unlocking greater business value.\n\n**From embedded systems to cloud-connected devices \u2013**\nEnsure robust cybersecurity from design through deployment across sectors such as healthcare,\nmanufacturing, critical infrastructure, mobility and more.\n\n**Meet evolving regulations and manage software complexity \u2013** With enterprise-grade DevSecOps\nworkflows that unify fragmented supply chains, reduce risk, and accelerate time to compliance.\n\n## One Platform for True Dynamic Risk Management\n\n**Context can be achieved only via a holistic platform.**\nThe complexity of managing software at scale and releasing secure and compliant products faster\nrequires a comprehensive, risk-driven approach to balance between product security and the need to\ndevelop and operate software.\n\nAs industries increasingly deploy cyber-physical systems (CPS), security must be architected in from\nthe very beginning to protect digital and physical assets across complex supply chains.\n\nC2A Security enables product security teams to embed Security-by-Design principles and scale\ncybersecurity across the entire software development lifecycle \u2013 from design to deployment \u2013 with\nautomation, compliance, and complete visibility built in.\n\n**EVSec is the only true, continuous, context-driven risk management platform across the entire\nproduct lifecycle.**\n\nEnsure Regulatory Compliance\n\nMeet global cybersecurity standards such as the FDA premarket & postmarket guidelines, ISA/IEC\n62443, ISO/SAE 21434, UN R155 and more, while maintaining a full audit trail for seamless\ncertification.\n\nAutomate Threat Modeling\u00a0\n\nAutomatically, and continuously identify, prioritize and mitigate security vulnerabilities for every\nsoftware product.\u00a0\n\nStreamline Supply Chain Collaboration\n\nFoster collaboration between internal teams and vendors, delegate tasks with the click of a button,\nand break down communication silos for productive cybersecurity processes.\n\nEmpower Developers\n\nFree developers to focus on what matters - releasing new features via increased process efficiencies\nand integrating complementing products in the toolchain.\n\nLeverage Generative AI\n\nUnleash the power of Generative AI to expedite threat intelligence and risk management with a\ndedicated infrastructure layer.\n\n## Flooring the Pedal on Compliance and Software Innovation\n\n## 80%\n\nReduction of development costs\n\n## 200%\n\nIncrease in new product innovation\n\n## 75%\n\nFaster TARA process\n\n## Our partners\n\n\u201cAt Elekta, we\u2019re committed to providing safe, resilient solutions to our customers. Our\ncollaboration with C2A Security will enable us to integrate cybersecurity throughout our product\nportfolio, helping us meet compliance requirements while keeping our systems secure.\u201d\n\n###### John Chenoweth\n\nChief Product Security Officer, Elekta\n\u201cWe believe ## Careers Form\n\n\"\u00a0\" indicates required fields\n\nFirst name*\u00a0\nFirst\nLast name*\u00a0\nFirst\nEmail*\u00a0\nCell Phone*\u00a0\nLinkedIn profile*\u00a0\nThis field is hidden when viewing the form\nPosition*\nAttach resume*\u00a0\nMax. file size: 256 MB.\nAttach Cover letter\nMax. file size: 256 MB.\nUntitled\nI would like to receive updates from C2A Security. I can unsubscribe at any time.\nUsing your personal data\u00a0\nI consent to the use of my personal information.\n\nWe're committed to protect your privacy. C2A Security uses the information you provide to us to\ncontact you about our products and services. You may unsubscribe from these communications at any\ntime. For information on how to unsubscribe, as well as our privacy practices and commitment to\nprotecting your privacy, please review our [Privacy Policy ][1].\n\n## Office Administrator\n* Products\n  * [EVSec Platform][2]\n  * [EVSec Analysis][3]\n  * [EVSec BOM & Vulnerability Management][4]\n  * [EVSec Attacker][5]\n  * [EVSec Network & Endpoint Protection][6]\n  * [EVSec SOC Enrichment & Analytics][7]\n  * [EVSec AutoSynth AI][8]\n* [Use Cases][9]\n  * [Medical and Healthcare][10]\n* [Integrations][11]\n* [Blog][12]\n* Company\n  * [About][13]\n  * [Events][14]\n  * [Careers][15]\n* [Contact][16]\n* [Schedule a Demo][17]\n* Products\n  * [EVSec Platform][18]\n  * [EVSec Analysis][19]\n  * [EVSec BOM & Vulnerability Management][20]\n  * [EVSec Attacker][21]\n  * [EVSec Network & Endpoint Protection][22]\n  * [EVSec SOC Enrichment & Analytics][23]\n  * [EVSec AutoSynth AI][24]\n* [Use Cases][25]\n  * [Medical and Healthcare][26]\n* [Integrations][27]\n* [Blog][28]\n* Company\n  * [About][29]\n  * [Events][30]\n  * [Careers][31]\n* [Contact][32]\n* [Schedule a Demo][33]\n\n### Transforming Product Security from\n### a Limitation to a Business Value Multiplier\n\n# The Only Context-based Product Security Orchestration Platform\n\n[ Watch our Webinar: From CVE Alert to Patient Risk ][34]\n\n### Automated Cybersecurity DevOps Platform\u00a0\n\n## Fortify the Future of Cyber-Physical Systems & Software Defined Products\n\n## Fortify the Future of Cyber-Physical Systems & Software Defined Products\n\nAccelerate innovation while strengthening product security \u2013 transforming cybersecurity into a\ncompetitive advantage and unlocking greater business value.\n\n**From embedded systems to cloud-connected devices \u2013**\nEnsure robust cybersecurity from design through deployment across sectors such as healthcare,\nmanufacturing, critical infrastructure, mobility and more.\n\n**Meet evolving regulations and manage software complexity \u2013** With enterprise-grade DevSecOps\nworkflows that unify fragmented supply chains, reduce risk, and accelerate time to compliance.\n\n## One Platform for True Dynamic Risk Management\n\n**Context can be achieved only via a holistic platform.**\nThe complexity of managing software at scale and releasing secure and compliant products faster\nrequires a comprehensive, risk-driven approach to balance between product security and the need to\ndevelop and operate software.\n\nAs industries increasingly deploy cyber-physical systems (CPS), security must be architected in from\nthe very beginning to protect digital and physical assets across complex supply chains.\n\nC2A Security enables product security teams to embed Security-by-Design principles and scale\ncybersecurity across the entire software development lifecycle \u2013 from design to deployment \u2013 with\nautomation, compliance, and complete visibility built in.\n\n**EVSec is the only true, continuous, context-driven risk management platform across the entire\nproduct lifecycle.**\n\nEnsure Regulatory Compliance\n\nMeet global cybersecurity standards such as the FDA premarket & postmarket guidelines, ISA/IEC\n62443, ISO/SAE 21434, UN R155 and more, while maintaining a full audit trail for seamless\ncertification.\n\nAutomate Threat Modeling\u00a0\n\nAutomatically, and continuously identify, prioritize and mitigate security vulnerabilities for every\nsoftware product.\u00a0\n\nStreamline Supply Chain Collaboration\n\nFoster collaboration between internal teams and vendors, delegate tasks with the click of a button,\nand break down communication silos for productive cybersecurity processes.\n\nEmpower Developers\n\nFree developers to focus on what matters - releasing new features via increased process efficiencies\nand integrating complementing products in the toolchain.\n\nLeverage Generative AI\n\nUnleash the power of Generative AI to expedite threat intelligence and risk management with a\ndedicated infrastructure layer.\n\n## Flooring the Pedal on Compliance and Software Innovation\n\n## 80%\n\nReduction of development costs\n\n## 200%\n\nIncrease in new product innovation\n\n## 75%\n\nFaster TARA process\n\n## Our partners\n\n\u201cAt Elekta, we\u2019re committed to providing safe, resilient solutions to our customers. Our\ncollaboration with C2A Security will enable us to integrate cybersecurity throughout our product\nportfolio, helping us meet compliance requirements while keeping our systems secure.\u201d\n\n###### John Chenoweth\n\nChief Product Security Officer, Elekta\n\u201cWe believe this integration with C2A Security will be a milestone in product cybersecurity\nautomation and vulnerability management, aiming to better comply with UN Regulation No. 155, ISO/SAE\n21434 standards, among others.\u201d\n\n###### Tin N.\n\nDirector\n\u201cThank you for this great product and your work!\u201d\n\n###### Joachim Bozler\n\nSenior Security Expert\n\u201cThat\u2019s a very cool risk management product you\u2019ve got there, exactly what we need, and I haven\u2019t\nseen that before.\u201d\n\n###### Anonymous\n\n\u201cThis is a powerful tool for any company to have, and we\u2019re excited about the collaboration with C2A\nSecurity and the value it can bring to our customers.\u201d\n\n###### Piyush Karkare\n\nGlobal Director, Automotive Solutions\n\u201cC2A Security shares the same vision as MIH, in offering a seamless and holistic approach to\nautomotive cybersecurity over the entire lifecycle.\u201d\n\n###### Jack Cheng\n\nCEO\n\u201cFuzz testing, with C2A Security\u2019s solution, enables early discovery of vulnerabilities hence\nreducing the time needed to deliver SW and products.\u201d\n\n###### Cosimo Senni Guidotti Magnani\n\nGlobal Product Cyber Security Manager\n\u201cWe want to apply our expertise in cybersecurity to the connected car sector, thanks to our global\nAutomotive Security Test Center and to our collaboration with C2A Security, NTT DATA will be an\ninternational reference point to protect connected cars from cyber-attacks and ensure the drivers\u2019\nsafety.\u201d\n\n###### Marco Garelli\n\nHead of Automotive\n\u201cWe have deeply felt the growth of the intelligent connected vehicle business and cybersecurity is\nan indispensable part of the intelligent connected vehicle. The cooperation with C2A Security\nprovides cybersecurity solutions for the whole lifecycle of connected vehicles in China. We look\nforward to expanding the cooperation globally and bringing the vehicle industry to a safer future.\u201d\n\n###### Wenguang Wu\n\nExecutive President\nC2A Security is the future of cybersecurity, and with their technologies to automate security,\ntogether, we will go further in monitoring, p"
