        "crawl_text": "[Meta tracking pixel] Competitive Intelligence & Monitoring | ChampSignal\n[\n[ChampSignal logo] [ChampSignal logo]\n][1]\n\nNavigation\n* [Home][2]\n* Product\n  * [Competitor Monitoring][3]\n  * [Champ: AI Agent][4]\n  * [Intelligence Report][5]\n  * [Competitor Finder API][6]\n* [Pricing][7]\n\n[\n[ChampSignal logo] [ChampSignal logo] [ChampSignal logo] [ChampSignal logo]\n][8]\n\n[ Home ][9]\n\nProduct\n* [ Competitor Monitoring Track competitors across websites, emails, news, ads, and SEO. Get alerted\n  only when it matters.][10]\n* [ Champ: AI Agent Ask any question about your competitors. Get instant answers backed by real\n  data.][11]\n* [ Intelligence Report 22-page competitive analysis with pricing, features, SEO, ads, and\n  reviews.][12]\n* [ Competitor Finder API Find competitors for any company with a simple API call.][13]\n\n[ Pricing ][14]\n* Light\n* Dark\n* System\n\n[Get Started For Free][15]\n[ChampSignal hero gradient]\n[\nNEW Introducing Champ AI Agent\n][16]\n\n# Get the insights\n# your competitors\n# don't want you to have\n\n## ChampSignal is a competitive intelligence suite for early-stage B2B SaaS founders. **Make sharper\n## calls on pricing, positioning, and GTM.**\n\n[ Start For Free Today ][17]\nFree 14-day trial\n1-minute setup\nInstant insights at signup\n[Eugene, Founder of Chainstack]\n\nThe alerts and summaries are genuinely useful and help us respond to our competitors only when it\nmatters.\n\nEugene, Founder & CTO at Chainstack\n\nTracked across all platforms\n\n[siGoogleads] [siMeta] [siReddit] [siX]\n\nWhy\n\nYou're Busy Building. Competitors Keep Moving.\n\nYou are busy building, selling, and talking to users. ChampSignal keeps you close to the market\nwithout manual tracking.\n\n### Sound familiar?\n\nAlerts everywhere, but 95% is noise\n\nCompetitors launch things before you even hear about it\n\nCan't afford a competitive intelligence analyst\n\nCompetitors you never heard of are stealing your customers\n\nAll the competitor context lives in your head\n\n### ChampSignal solves this\n\nOnly get notified when it actually matters\n\nSame-day alerts on important moves\n\nChamp AI does the analysis for you\n\nAutomatic competitor discovery\n\nOne place to check before you make the call\n\n### The Cost of Missing Competitor Moves\n\nLost Customers\n\nCompetitors undercut you on price while you weren't looking\n\nWasted Time\n\nHours spent manually checking websites and reading news\n\nReactive Strategy\n\nAlways playing catch-up instead of staying ahead\n\nMissed Opportunities\n\nFail to capitalize when competitors make mistakes\n\n### Who ChampSignal Is Built For\n\nSolo Founders\n\nNeed competitor intel without losing a build day\n\nFounders Repositioning\n\nNeed help sharpening pricing, positioning, and launches\n\nFounders Running Sales\n\nNeed clear answers before demos and follow-ups\n\nSeed-Stage Founders\n\nNeed better market context without hiring an analyst\n\nHow It Works\n\nGet Started in 3 Simple Steps\n\nSet up once, then let ChampSignal watch your market while you keep building\n\n[Add Your Competitors] [Add Your Competitors]\n\nStep 1\n\nAdd Your Competitors\n\nEnter your website, or let us find the competitors you should watch.\n\nAuto-discover competitors you didn't know about\n\nSet up in under 60 seconds\n\nGet instant insights at signup\n\n[We Monitor and Analyze Everything] [We Monitor and Analyze Everything]\n\nStep 2\n\nWe Monitor and Analyze Everything\n\nWe track the moves that change pricing, messaging, launches, demand, and search visibility.\nMeanwhile, Champ learns the market around you.\n\n24/7 automated monitoring\n\nTrack websites, emails, news, socials, ads, and SEO\n\nChamp AI builds deep knowledge of each competitor\n\nHistorical data stored and searchable\n\n[Get Alerts and Ask Champ Anything] [Get Alerts and Ask Champ Anything]\n\nStep 3\n\nGet Alerts and Ask Champ Anything\n\nGet notified when competitors make important moves. Need deeper analysis? Ask Champ what it means\nbefore your next call, launch, or pricing decision.\n\nAI-filtered alerts, no noise\n\nEmail and Slack notifications\n\nCustomizable alert sensitivity\n\nAsk Champ for analysis, comparisons, or briefings\n\nShare insights with a cofounder or advisor\n\nGet Started\n\nCompetitive Intel for SaaS Founders\n\nSet up in 1 minute. See competitor moves before they hit your pricing, positioning, or pipeline.\n\nJoin hundreds of founders at early-stage SaaS companies who stay ahead of their competition without\nthe busywork.\n\n[Start a 14-day free trial][18] [Visit Live Demo][19]\n\nBenefits\n\nEverything You Need to Stay Ahead\n\nFour tools built for founders who need clarity without the busywork\n\n[Never Miss an Important Competitor Move] [Never Miss an Important Competitor Move]\n\nCompetitor Monitoring\n\nNever Miss an Important Competitor Move\n\nWe track the competitors in your market across websites, emails, news, X, Reddit, ads, and SEO. When\nsomething changes that could hit your pricing, positioning, or pipeline, you'll know fast.\n\nWebsite changes: pricing, features, messaging\n\nNews, X, and Reddit mentions\n\nCompetitor newsletters and email campaigns\n\nSEO rankin [Meta tracking pixel] Competitive Intelligence & Monitoring | ChampSignal\n[\n[ChampSignal logo] [ChampSignal logo]\n][1]\n\nNavigation\n* [Home][2]\n* Product\n  * [Competitor Monitoring][3]\n  * [Champ: AI Agent][4]\n  * [Intelligence Report][5]\n  * [Competitor Finder API][6]\n* [Pricing][7]\n\n[\n[ChampSignal logo] [ChampSignal logo] [ChampSignal logo] [ChampSignal logo]\n][8]\n\n[ Home ][9]\n\nProduct\n* [ Competitor Monitoring Track competitors across websites, emails, news, ads, and SEO. Get alerted\n  only when it matters.][10]\n* [ Champ: AI Agent Ask any question about your competitors. Get instant answers backed by real\n  data.][11]\n* [ Intelligence Report 22-page competitive analysis with pricing, features, SEO, ads, and\n  reviews.][1