        "crawl_text": "You need to enable JavaScript to run this app.\n[[CIS - Center for Internet Security\u00ae]][1]\n[CIS Portal Login][2][CIS Hardened Images^{\u00ae}][3][Support][4][CIS WorkBench Sign In][5]\nAlert Level: guarded\n[Company][6]\nBack\nCompany\nWho We AreCIS is an independent, nonprofit organization with a mission to create confidence in the\nconnected world.\n[About Us][7]\n[Leadership Principles][8]\n[Leadership Team][9]\n[Testimonials][10]\n[Media][11]\n[Events][12]\n[Contact Us][13]\n[Solutions][14]\nBack\nSolutions\n[Icon]Secure Your Organization\n[CIS Critical Security Controls\u00ae][15]Prioritized & simplified best practices\n[CIS Controls Community][16]Help develop and maintain the Controls\n[CIS RAM][17]Information security risk assessment method\n[CIS CSAT][18]Assess & measure Controls implementation\n[ThreatWA\u2122][19]Insights into emerging cyber & physical threats\n[CIS SecureSuite\u00ae Platform][20]Assess and measure CIS Controls implementation and conformance to the\nCIS Benchmarks\n[Icon]Secure Specific Platforms\n[CIS Benchmarks\u2122][21]100+ vendor-neutral configuration guides\n[CIS Benchmarks Community][22]Develop & update secure configuration guides\n[CIS-CAT\u00aePro Assessor][23]Assess system conformance to CIS Benchmarks\n[CIS Hardened Images\u00ae][24]Virtual images hardened to CIS Benchmarks on cloud service provider\nmarketplaces\n[Situation]Track Specific Threats\n[Industries][25]Your industry's specific threats & needs\n[Topics][26]Dive deeper into specific cybersecurity topics\n[Secure Cyber City\u2122][27]Expertise for cybersecurity resilience and community empowerment\n[SecureSuite\u00ae]\n[CIS SecureSuite\u00ae (Multi-Year Discounts Available)][28]Start secure and stay secure with integrated\ncybersecurity tools and resources designed to help you implement CIS Benchmarks and CIS Controls\n[Learn More][29][Apply Now][30]\n[U.S. State, Local, Tribal & Territorial Governments]U.S. State, Local, Tribal & Territorial\nGovernments\nMemberships\n[MS-ISAC\u00ae][31]Cybersecurity resource for SLTT Governments\n[EI-ISAC\u00ae][32]Critical cybersecurity resource for the nation's SLTT election offices\nState Resources\n[Whole-of-State Security][33]Enabling collaboration and shared responsibility across all levels of\ngovernment\nServices for Members\n[Albert Network Monitoring\u00ae][34]Cost-effective Intrusion Detection System\n[CIS Managed Detection and Response\u2122 (CIS MDR)][35]Device-level protection and response\n[Malicious Code Analysis Platform (MCAP)][36]Web-based sandbox for analyzing suspicious files and\nURLs\n[CIS CyberMarket\u00ae][37]Savings on training and software\n[Malicious Domain Blocking and Reporting Plus][38]Prevent connection to harmful web domains\n[View All CIS Services][39]\n[View All Products & Services][40]\n[Insights][41]\nBack\nInsights\nInsightsExplore trending articles, expert perspectives, real-world applications, and more from the\nbest minds in cybersecurity and IT.\n[Advisories][42]\n[Blog][43]\n[Case Studies][44]\n[Spotlights][45]\n[Newsletters][46]\n[Podcasts][47]\n[Webinars][48]\n[White papers][49]\n[View All Insights][50]\n[Join CIS][51]\nBack\nJoin CIS\nGet InvolvedJoin us on our mission to secure online experiences for all. Become a CIS member,\npartner, or volunteer\u2014and explore our career opportunities.\n[CIS SecureSuite\u00ae Membership][52]\n[Multi-State ISAC (MS-ISAC\u00ae)][53]\n[CIS CyberMarket\u00ae Vendors][54]\n[CIS Communities][55]\n[Our Partners][56]\n[Careers][57]\n* [FT_Banner_Globe]\n  \n  #### [WEBINAR] CIS Community Defense Model v3.0\n  \n  #### Join us June 30 to discuss CDM v3.0 and how the CIS Controls are stopping today's most\n  #### dangerous cyber threats.\n  \n  [Register Now][58]\n* [Whitepaper Cybersecurity Incident]\n  \n  #### White Paper: You Have a Cybersecurity Incident.\n  \n  #### Cyber incidents move fast, but outcomes depend on coordinated defense.\n  \n  [Download Now][59]\n* [Background with Lock and tech icons]\n  \n  #### Webinar: Implement CIS Controls and CIS Benchmarks\n  \n  #### Strengthen your security program to meet regulatory and compliance frameworks.\n  \n  [REGISTER NOW][60]\n\n# Creating Confidence in the Connected World^{\u00ae}\n\n## At CIS^{\u00ae}, we\u2019re harnessing the power of the global IT community to safeguard public and private\n## organizations against cyber and cyber-enabled threats. Join us.\n\n[MS-ISAC]\n\n## Join Our Trusted Community of Cyber Defenders, Built by SLTTs, for SLTTs\n\nSecurity isn't a solo fight. The MS-ISAC connects SLTTs to a nationwide community defense network\nthat keeps everyone safer.\n[Learn More Join Our Trusted Community of Cyber Defenders, Built by SLTTs, for SLTTs][61]\nReal-time threat intelligence24x7x365 support from the U.S.-based CIS Security Operations\nCenterMember-exclusive tools, resources, and collaboration\n\n## World-Renowned Best Practices and Expert Communities\n\n[CIS Hardened Images]\nSecure cloud workloads with pre-configured VMs aligned to CIS Benchmarks for compliance and\nprotection.\u00a0\n[Learn More CIS Hardened Images\u00ae][62]\n[CIS Controls]\nProtect your organization from cyber-attacks with globally recognized CIS Controls^{\u00ae}, companion\nguides, and mappings.\n[ You need to enable JavaScript to run this app.\n[[CIS - Center for Internet Security\u00ae]][1]\n[CIS Portal Login][2][CIS Hardened Images^{\u00ae}][3][Support][4][CIS WorkBench Sign In][5]\nAlert Level: guarded\n[Company][6]\nBack\nCompany\nWho We AreCIS is an independent, nonprofit organization with a mission to create confidence in the\nconnected world.\n[About Us][7]\n[Leadership Principles][8]\n[Leadership Team][9]\n[Testimonials][10]\n[Media][11]\n[Events][12]\n[Contact Us][13]\n[Solutions][14]\nBack\nSolutions\n[Icon]Secure Your Organization\n[CIS Critical Security Controls\u00ae][15]Prioritized & simplified best practices\n[CIS Controls Community][16]Help develop and maintain the Controls\n[CIS RAM][17]Information security risk assessment method\n[CIS CSAT][18]Assess & measure Controls implementation\n[ThreatWA\u2122][19]Insights into emerging cyber & physical threats\n[CIS SecureSuite\u00ae Platform][20]Assess and measure CIS Controls implementation and conformance to the\nCIS Benchmarks\n[Icon]Secure Specific Platforms\n[CIS Benchmarks\u2122][21]100+ vendor-neutral configuration guides\n[CIS Benchmarks Community][22]Develop & update secure configuration guides\n[CIS-CAT\u00aePro Assessor][23]Assess system conformance to CIS Benchmarks\n[CIS Hardened Images\u00ae][24]Virtual images hardened to CIS Benchmarks on cloud service provider\nmarketplaces\n[Situation]Track Specific Threats\n[Industries][25]Your industry's specific threats & needs\n[Topics][26]Dive deeper into specific cybersecurity topics\n[Secure Cyber City\u2122][27]Expertise for cybersecurity resilience and community empowerment\n[SecureSuite\u00ae]\n[CIS SecureSuite\u00ae (Multi-Year Discounts Available)][28]Start secure and stay secure with integrated\ncybersecurity tools and resources designed to help you implement CIS Benchmarks and CIS Controls\n[Learn More][29][Apply Now][30]\n[U.S. State, Local, Tribal & Territorial Governments]U.S. State, Local, Tribal & Territorial\nGovernments\nMemberships\n[MS-ISAC\u00ae][31]Cybersecurity resource for SLTT Governments\n[EI-ISAC\u00ae][32]Critical cybersecurity resource for the nation's SLTT election offices\nState Resources\n[Whole-of-State Security][33]Enabling collaboration and shared responsibility across all levels of\ngovernment\nServices for Members\n[Albert Network Monitoring\u00ae][34]Cost-effective Intrusion Detection System\n[CIS Managed Detection and Response\u2122 (CIS MDR)][35]Device-level protection and response\n[Malicious Code Analysis Platform (MCAP)][36]Web-based sandbox for analyzing suspicious files and\nURLs\n[CIS CyberMarket\u00ae][37]Savings on training and software\n[Malicious Domain Blocking and Reporting Plus][38]Prevent connection to harmful web domains\n[View All CIS Services][39]\n[View All Products & Services][40]\n[Insights][41]\nBack\nInsights\nInsightsExplore trending articles, expert perspectives, real-world applications, and more from the\nbest minds in cybersecurity and IT.\n[Advisories][42]\n[Blog][43]\n[Case Studies][44]\n[Spotlights][45]\n[Newsletters][46]\n[Podcasts][47]\n[Webinars][48]\n[White papers][49]\n[View All Insights][50]\n[Join CIS][51]\nBack\nJoin CIS\nGet InvolvedJoin us on our mission to secure online experiences for all. Become a CIS member,\npartner, or volunteer\u2014and explore our career opportunities.\n[CIS SecureSuite\u00ae Membership][52]\n[Multi-State ISAC (MS-ISAC\u00ae)][53]\n[CIS CyberMarket\u00ae Vendors][54]\n[CIS Communities][55]\n[Our Partners][56]\n[Careers][57]\n* [FT_Banner_Globe]\n  \n  #### [WEBINAR] CIS Community Defense Model v3.0\n  \n  #### Join us June 30 to discuss CDM v3.0 and how the CIS Controls are stopping today's most\n  #### dangerous cyber threats.\n  \n  [Register Now][58]\n* [Whitepaper Cybersecurity Incident]\n  \n  #### White Paper: You Have a Cybersecurity Incident.\n  \n  #### Cyber incidents move fast, but outcomes depend on coordinated defense.\n  \n  [Download Now][59]\n* [Background with Lock and tech icons]\n  \n  #### Webinar: Implement CIS Controls and CIS Benchmarks\n  \n  #### Strengthen your security program to meet regulatory and compliance frameworks.\n  \n  [REGISTER NOW][60]\n\n# Creating Confidence in the Connected World^{\u00ae}\n\n## At CIS^{\u00ae}, we\u2019re harnessing the power of the global IT community to safeguard public and private\n## organizations against cyber and cyber-enabled threats. Join us.\n\n[MS-ISAC]\n\n## Join Our Trusted Community of Cyber Defenders, Built by SLTTs, for SLTTs\n\nSecurity isn't a solo fight. The MS-ISAC connects SLTTs to a nationwide community defense network\nthat keeps everyone safer.\n[Learn More Join Our Trusted Community of Cyber Defenders, Built by SLTTs, for SLTTs][61]\nReal-time threat intelligence24x7x365 support from the U.S.-based CIS Security Operations\nCenterMember-exclusive tools, resources, and collaboration\n\n## World-Renowned Best Practices and Expert Communities\n\n[CIS Hardened Images]\nSecure cloud workloads with pre-configured VMs aligned to CIS Benchmarks for compliance and\nprotection.\u00a0\n[Learn More CIS Hardened Images\u00ae][62]\n[CIS Controls]\nProtect your organization from cyber-attacks with globally recognized CIS Controls^{\u00ae}, companion\nguides, and mappings.\n[Download & Explore CIS Controls][63]\n[CIS Benchmarks]\nSafeguard IT systems against cyber threats with more than 100 configuration guidelines across more\nthan 25 vendor product families.\n[Download Latest CIS Benchmarks][64]\n[CIS SecureSuite]\nSecure your organization with resources and tools designed to harness the power of CIS Benchmarks\nand CIS Controls.\n[Learn More CIS SecureSuite][65]\n\n## What The Experts Are Saying\n* The CIS Controls^{\u00ae} take the background and knowledge of cybersecurity experts literally around\n  the world and help focus efforts on things that are of most value. Directly impacting the\n  adversaries and challenges we face today on our networks.\n  Harley Parkes\n  Director, ACD (Integrated Adaptive Cyber Defense)\n* Without this resource, the hardening of our devices would have taken a lot longer and required\n  many meetings between IT and Security to debate which configuration settings to change and the\n  impact they could have. The CIS Benchmarks^{\u2122} provided the necessary information to alleviate\n  many of the fears IT may have had with changing specific settings.\n  Adam\n  Banking Information Security Engineer\n* We work with sensitive information on a daily basis. The CIS Controls^{\u00ae} along with CIS-CAT^{\u00ae}\n  Pro, a proven and indispensable tool, helps us to evaluate and maintain a security baseline for\n  our IT infrastructure.\n  Sasawat Malaivongs\n  Business Director, ACinfotec\n\n[[CIS Controls Community]][66][[CIS Benchmarks Community]][67]\n\n## Together, We Can Make a Difference\n\nOur CIS Controls and CIS Benchmarks communities connect IT security practitioners from around the\nglobe to help secure our ever-changing world. Our Ambassadors champion the CIS best practices,\nmaking it easier for enterprises everywhere to strengthen their cyber defenses and streamline their\ncompliance efforts. We hope you\u2019ll add your voice.\n[Learn More Together, We Can Make a Difference][68]\n\n## Our Commitment\u00a0\n\nCIS operates as a mission driven, nonprofit organization"
