il Campaigns\n\n### Automate &\n### accelerate your\n### outreach\n\nRun multi-stage email campaigns. Import prospects in one click. Personalize emails at scale. Measure\nperformance. Hit your goals.\n\n[Learn more ][53]\n\n## Discover prospects beyond\n## traditional channels\n\n[Iceberg Illustration] [Iceberg Illustration]\n[Iceberg Illustration] [Iceberg Illustration]\n[Data Prospecting Illustration] [Data Prospecting Illustration]\n\n## Prospect faster\n## with the most\n## accurate data ever\n\nHourly Data Updates\nCCPA & GDPR Compliant\nSOC 2 Certified\nTriple-verified with 99% Confidence\n[New Users] 800M People Profiles\n[Mail] 150M Personal Emails\n[Briefcase] 200M Work Emails\n[Phone] 100M Direct Dials\n[Building] 40M Company Profiles\nData Attributes\n\n## Find the right\n## prospects with\n## laser precision\n\nSearch across 20+ data points to\npinpoint the right people and\ncompanies more effectively and\nefficiently.\n\n[Learn more ][54]\n[Job Titles] Job Titles\n[Companies] Companies\n[Revenue] Revenue\n[Skills] Skills\n[Locations] Locations\n[Company Size] Company Size\n[Departments] Departments\n[Technologies Used] Technologies\nUsed\n\nTestimonials\n\nHear what\nour customers\nhave to say\n\n[Google]\n\u201cThis is such a great and simple tool to use.\u201d\n[Tobia St Germain]\nTobia St Germain\nGoogle\n[Tenstorrent]\n\"Find personal mails seamlessly. Thanks for this tool!\"\n[Ekin Bayildiran]\nEkin Bayildiran\nTenstorrent\n[Societe Generale]\n\u201cVery easy to use, and it gives contact details that are not available on others I have used.\u201d\n[Barbara Ball]\nBarbara Ball\nSociete Generale\n[CNN]\n\u201cLove it! I use it every day.\u201d\n[Camille Verdier]\nCamille Verdier\nCNN\n[Robert Half]\n\u201cGreat email tool. I've used a few other services and ContactOut is the easiest one to use.\u201d\n[Jon Nowakowski]\nJon Nowakowski\nRobert Half\n[HSBC]\n\u201cExcellent product, very small chance of error.\u201d\n[Farida Charania]\nFarida Charania\nHSBC\n[Yelp]\n\u201cLove this extension and would recommend it to anyone looking for a tool to find email addresses.\u201d\n[Evan M. Wolfson]\nEvan M. Wolfson\nYelp\n[WarnerMedia]\n\"Great product! ContactOut has tripled the yield of our InMail strategy on LinkedIn.\"\n[Ryan Brogan]\nRyan Brogan\nWarnerMedia\nRead more customer success stories\n[Star] [Star] [Star] [Star] [Star]\nTop-ranked\nLead Intelligence\nsolution on G2 Crowd\n[g2-icons-all]\n[g2-icon-1]\n[g2-icon-2]\n[g2-icon-1]\n[g2-icon-2]\nG2 Crowd Ratings Comparison for\nLead Intelligence\nContactOut vs. Zoominfo ContactOut vs. Apollo ContactOut vs. Lusha\n[contactout]\n9.2 Lead Validation\n9.2 Lead E"
