        "crawl_text": "[ [Your logo] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Services][4]\n* [Case Studies][5]\n* [Contact Us][6]\n[ Previous ][7] [ Next ][8]\n\n### 20+ Years Of Operational & Manufacturing Consulting Experience.\n\n\n### A Team Of LEAN\u00ae Practioners.\n\nAs **lean manufacturing and productivity consultants,** we help clients leverage operational\nexcellence, enabling technologies, and lean processes to **enhance process efficiency.** We build\nagile companies that can solve problems and respond to opportunities faster than their peers,\n**paving the way for sustainable, profitable growth.**\n\nIn addition, many **Lean trainings** are provided to client employees for their **holistic growth.**\nIn addition, many **Lean trainings** are provided to client employees for their holistic growth.\n**We foster engagement from day one.**\n\nAt CPS, **Lean is in our DNA.** We use lean tools like - **IT, 5S, SMED, ECRS, MUDA analysis, WCM\nconcept for conversion cost reduction.** Complete transformation and continuous improvement are\nessential enablers to be competitive. We collaborate with our client and handhold implementing lean\nsolutions to make them **Fit, fast and flexible for industry 4.0 readiness.** Because we believe in\n**collaborative growth.** We provide sustainable solutions and work on close loop mechanism.\n\n### Our Services\n\n###### [Operational Excellence][9]\n\nOperational excellence is a mindset that embraces certain principles and tools to create a culture\nof excellence within an organization. It means every employee can see, deliver and improve the flow\nof value to a customer.\n\n###### [Business Process Management][10]\n\nBusiness Process Management (BPM) is a discipline that uses various methods to discover, model,\nanalyze, measure, improve and optimize business processes.\n\n###### [Continuous Improvement][11]\n\nContinuous improvement, sometimes called continual improvement, is the ongoing improvement of\nproducts, services or processes through incremental and breakthrough improvements.\n\n###### [Lean Training][12]\n\nLean is a systematic approach to reduce or eliminate activities that don't add value to the process.\nIt emphasizes removing wasteful steps in a process and taking the only value-added steps. The Lean\nmethod ensures high quality and customer satisfaction.\n\n###### [Digitization][13]\n\nDigitization is the process of converting information into a digital (i.e. computer-readable)\nformat. The result is called digital representation or, more specifically, a digital image, for the\nobject, and digital form, for the signal.\n\n\n\n### Testimonials.\n\n#### Daimler India Commercial Vehicles Pvt. Ltd.\n\nLean implementation in the warehouse was very well conceptualized. The 'As Is' state of operations\nwas well captured. 'To be' Processes were also tested and implemented. CPS team has achieved the\nproject deliverables.\n\n#### Kellogg India Pvt. Ltd.\n\nCPS team came on site, had detailed 1:1 with each person and understood the job profile and\nperspective of all levels , which gave people also clarity and they supported CPS team to get right\nout put, so i will say the credit goes to CPS team for explaining context in right manner for\ngetting brilliant outputs\n\n### Our Clients.\n\n\n###### About\n\nOperational Excellence is an indispensable aspect for gaining and sustaining competitive advantage\nin today's dynamic market conditions \u2014 but it\u2019s also more challenging than ever.\n\n###### Quick links\n* [Home][14]\n* [About Us][15]\n* [Services][16]\n* [Case Studies][17]\n* [Contact Us][18]\n\n###### Subscribe Now!\n\nSubscribe\n\nDeveloped by [Byte Warp][19]\n\n[1]: #home\n[2]: home\n[3]: about\n[4]: services\n[5]: casestudies\n[6]: contact\n[7]: #carousel-2\n[8]: #carousel-2\n[9]: #\n[10]: #\n[11]: #\n[12]: #\n[13]: #\n[14]: home\n[15]: about\n[16]: services\n[17]: casestudies\n[18]: contact\n[19]: https://bytewarp.in/ [ [Your logo] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Services][4]\n* [Case Studies][5]\n* [Contact Us][6]\n[ Previous ][7] [ Next ][8]\n\n### 20+ Years Of Operational & Manufacturing Consulting Experience.\n\n\n### A Team Of LEAN\u00ae Practioners.\n\nAs **lean manufacturing and productivity consultants,** we help clients leverage operational\nexcellence, enabling technologies, and lean processes to **enhance process efficiency.** We build\nagile companies that can solve problems and respond to opportunities faster than their peers,\n**paving the way for sustainable, profitable growth.**\n\nIn addition, many **Lean trainings** are provided to client employees for their **holistic growth.**\nIn addition, many **Lean trainings** are provided to client employees for their holistic growth.\n**We foster engagement from day one.**\n\nAt CPS, **Lean is in our DNA.** We use lean tools like - **IT, 5S, SMED, ECRS, MUDA analysis, WCM\nconcept for conversion cost reduction.** Complete transformation and continuous improvement are\nessential enablers to be competitive. We collaborate with our client and handhold implementing lean\nsolutions to make them **Fit, fast and flexible for industry 4.0 readiness.** Because we believe in\n**collaborative growth.** We provide sustainable solutions and work on close loop mechanism.\n\n### Our Services\n\n###### [Operational Excellence][9]\n\nOperational excellence is a mindset that embraces certain principles and tools to create a culture\nof excellence within an organization. It means every employee can see, deliver and improve the flow\nof value to a customer.\n\n###### [Business Process Management][10]\n\nBusiness Process Management (BPM) is a discipline that uses various methods to discover, model,\nanalyze, measure, improve and optimize business processes.\n\n###### [Continuous Improvement][11]\n\nContinuous improvement, sometimes called continual improvement, is the ongoing improvement of\nproducts, services or processes through incremental and breakthrough improvements.\n\n###### [Lean Training][12]\n\nLean is a systematic approach to reduce or eliminate activities that don't add value to the process.\nIt emphasizes removing wasteful steps in a process and taking the only value-added steps. The Lean\nmethod ensures high quality and customer satisfaction.\n\n###### [Digitization][13]\n\nDigitization is the process of converting information into a digital (i.e. computer-readable)\nformat. The result is called digital representation or, more specifically, a digital image, for the\nobject, and digital form, for the signal.\n\n\n\n### Testimonials.\n\n#### Daimler India Commercial Vehicles Pvt. Ltd.\n\nLean implementation in the warehouse was very well conceptualized. The 'As Is' state of operations\nwas well captured. 'To be' Processes were also tested and implemented. CPS team has achieved the\nproject deliverables.\n\n#### Kellogg India Pvt. Ltd.\n\nCPS team came on site, had detailed 1:1 with each person and understood the job profile and\nperspective of all levels , which gave people also clarity and they supported CPS team to get right\nout put, so i will say the credit goes to CPS team for explaining context in right manner for\ngetting brilliant outputs\n\n### Our Clients.\n\n\n###### About\n\nOperational Excellence is an indispensable aspect for gaining and sustaining competitive advantage\nin today's dynamic market conditions \u2014 but it\u2019s also more challenging than ever.\n\n###### Quick links\n* [Home][14]\n* [About Us][15]\n* [Services][16]\n* [Case Studies][17]\n* [Contact Us][18]\n\n###### Subscribe Now!\n\nSubscribe\n\nDeveloped by [Byte Warp][19]\n\n[1]: #home\n[2]: home\n[3]: about\n[4]: services\n[5]: casestudies\n[6]: contact\n[7]: #carousel-2\n[8]: #carousel-2\n[9]: #\n[10]: #\n[11]: #\n[12]: #\n[13]: #\n[14]: home\n[15]: about\n[16]: services\n[17]: casestudies\n[18]: contact\n[19]: https://bytewarp.in/ cpsprivatelimited.com [ [Your logo] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Services][4]\n* [Case Studies][5]\n* [Contact Us][6]\n[ Previous ][7] [ Next ][8]\n\n### 20+ Years Of Operational & Manufacturing Consulting Experience.\n\n\n### A Team Of LEAN\u00ae Practioners.\n\nAs **lean manufacturing and productivity consultants,** we help clients leverage operational\nexcellence, enabling technologies, and lean processes to **enhance process efficiency.** We build\nagile companies that can solve problems and respond to opportunities faster than their peers,\n**paving the way for sustainable, profitable growth.**\n\nIn addition, many **Lean trainings** are provided to client employees for their **holistic growth.**\nIn addition, many **Lean trainings** are provided to client employees for their holistic growth.\n**We foster engagement from day one.**\n\nAt CPS, **Lean is in our DNA.** We use lean tools like - **IT, 5S, SMED, ECRS, MUDA analysis, WCM\nconcept for conversion cost reduction.** Complete transformation and continuous improvement are\nessential enablers to be competitive. We collaborate with our client and handhold implementing lean\nsolutions to make them **Fit, fast and flexible for industry 4.0 readiness.** Because we believe in\n**collaborative growth.** We provide sustainable solutions and work on close loop mechanism.\n\n### Our Services\n\n###### [Operational Excellence][9]\n\nOperational excellence is a mindset that embraces certain principles and tools to create a culture\nof excellence within an organization. It means every employee can see, deliver and improve the flow\nof value to a customer.\n\n###### [Business Process Management][10]\n\nBusiness Process Management (BPM) is a discipline that uses various methods to discover, model,\nanalyze, measure, improve and optimize business processes.\n\n###### [Continuous Improvement][11]\n\nContinuous improvement, sometimes called continual improvement, is the ongoing improvement of\nproducts, services or processes through incremental and breakthrough improvements.\n\n###### [Lean Training][12]\n\nLean is a systematic approach to reduce or eliminate activities that don't add value to the process.\nIt emphasizes removing wasteful steps in a process and taking the only value-added steps. The Lean\nmethod ensures high quality and customer satisfaction.\n\n###### [Digitization][13]\n\nDigitization is the process of converting information into a digital (i.e. computer-readable)\nformat. The result is called digital representation or, more specifically, a digital image, for the\nobject, and digital form, for the signal.\n\n\n\n### Testimonials.\n\n#### Daimler India Commercial Vehicles Pvt. Ltd.\n\nLean implementation in the warehouse was very well conceptualized. The 'As Is' state of operations\nwas well captured. 'To be' Processes were also tested and implemented. CPS team has achieved the\nproject deliverables.\n\n#### Kellogg India Pvt. Ltd.\n\nCPS team came on site, had detailed 1:1 with each person and understood the job profile and\nperspective of all levels , which gave people also clarity and they supported CPS team to get right\nout put, so i will say the credit goes to CPS team for explaining context in right manner for\ngetting brilliant outputs\n\n### Our Clients.\n\n\n###### About\n\nOperational Excellence is an indispensable aspect for gaining and sustaining competitive advantage\nin today's dynamic market conditions \u2014 but it\u2019s also more challenging than ever.\n\n###### Quick links\n* [Home][14]\n* [About Us][15]\n* [Services][16]\n* [Case Studies][17]\n* [Contact Us][18]\n\n###### Subscribe Now!\n\nSubscribe\n\nDeveloped by [Byte Warp][19]\n\n[1]: #home\n[2]: home\n[3]: about\n[4]: services\n[5]: casestudies\n[6]: contact\n[7]: #carousel-2\n[8]: #carousel-2\n[9]: #\n[10]: #\n[11]: #\n[12]: #\n[13]: #\n[14]: home\n[15]: about\n[16]: services\n[17]: casestudies\n[18]: contact\n[19]: https://bytewarp.in/ [ [Your logo] ][1]\n* [Home][2]\n* [About Us][3]\n* [Services][4]\n* [Case Studies][5]\n* [Contact Us][6]\n[ Previous ][7] [ Next ][8]\n\n### 20+ Years Of O