        "crawl_text": "CyberDB is a premium intelligence platform used by security leaders, venture capital firms, system integrators, and technology consultants to research and map the global cybersecurity and AI landscape. Our database covers 5,000+ vendors across 150 security technology categories, from endpoint detection and response (EDR) and SIEM to OT/ICS security, zero trust, and AI-powered threat intelligence. Each vendor profile includes product details, funding status, geographic presence, technology partners, and direct contact data.\nAI vendors are categorized by foundation models, industry applications, technology, and purpose. Whether you're evaluating a new security solution, scouting M&A targets, or building a competitive landscape for a client, CyberDB gives you the structured data to move from research to decision faster. CyberDB is a premium intelligence platform used by security leaders, venture capital firms, system integrators, and technology consultants to research and map the global cybersecurity and AI landscape. Our database covers 5,000+ vendors across 150 security technology categories, from endpoint detection and response (EDR) and SIEM to OT/ICS security, zero trust, and AI-powered threat intelligence. Each vendor profile includes product details, funding status, geographic presence, technology partners, and direct contact data.\nAI vendors are categorized by foundation models, industry applications, technology, and purpose. Whether you're evaluating a new security solution, scouting M&A targets, or building a competitive landscape for a client, CyberDB gives you the structured data to move from research to decision faster. cyberdb.co CyberDB is a premium intelligence platform used by security leaders, venture capital firms, system integrators, and technology consultants to research and map the global cybersecurity and AI landscape. Our database covers 5,000+ vendors across 150 security technology categories, from endpoint detection an