        "crawl_text": "Gartner\u00ae releases first-ever Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access -\n[ Get the guide ][1]\n[ Product ][2]\n[ Solutions ][3]\n\n### By Challenge\n\n[\nRemote Privileged Access for OT/ICS\n][4] [\nSecure Third-Party Access\n][5] [\nIT/OT Alignment\n][6] [\nRegulatory Compliance\n][7]\n\n### By Industry\n\n[\nManufacturing\n][8] [\nEnergy & Utilities\n][9] [\nAI Data Centers\n][10] [\nAll Industries\n][11]\n[ Partners ][12]\n[\nPartner Program\n][13] [\nPartner Ecosystem\n][14] [\nTechnology Integrations\n][15] [\nBecome a Partner\n][16]\n[ Resources ][17]\n\n### Resources\n\n[ See All Resources ][18]\n[\nNews\n][19] [\nPress Releases\n][20] [\nUpcoming Events\n][21] [\nThird Party Reports\n][22] [\nCase Studies\n][23] [\nAt a Glances\n][24] [\nDatasheet\n][25] [\nWhite Papers\n][26] [\nVideos\n][27]\n\n### Featured content\n\n[\nPress Release\n\n#### Cyolo Releases Powerful New Capabilities to Redefine Secure Remote Access for OT\n\n][28] [\nBlog\n\n#### Why VPNs Are a Poor Fit for Vendor Access in OT Manufacturing Environments\n\n][29] [\nWhite Paper\n\n#### The Paradox of Third-Party OT Access: The Surprising Benefits of Trusting Vendors Less\n\n][30] [\nThird Party Report\n\n#### 2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\n][31]\n[ Blog ][32]\n[ Company ][33]\n[\nAbout Us\n][34] [\nCareers\n][35]\n[ Support ][36]\n[ Toggle Search ][37]\n[united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng\n[germany-flag.svg flag] De\n[spain-flag.svg flag] Spa\n[france-flag.svg flag] Fre\n[italy-flag.svg flag] Ita\n[ [united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng ][38] [ [germany-flag.svg flag] De ][39] [ [spain-flag.svg flag]\nSpa ][40] [ [france-flag.svg flag] Fre ][41] [ [italy-flag.svg flag] Ita ][42]\n[ Get a Demo ][43]\nClose Menu\n[ Product ][44]\n[ Solutions ][45]\n[ Remote Privileged Access for OT/ICS ][46] [ Third-Party Secure Access ][47] [ IT/OT Alignment\n][48] [ Regulatory Compliance ][49] [ Manufacturing ][50] [ Energy & Utilities ][51] [ Data Centers\n][52] [ All Industries ][53]\n[ Partners ][54]\n[ Partner Program ][55] [ Partner Ecosystem ][56] [ Technology Integrations ][57] [ Become a Partner\n][58]\n[ Resources ][59]\n[ News ][60] [ Press Releases ][61] [ Third-Party Reports ][62] [ Case Studies ][63] [ At a Glances\n][64] [ Datasheets ][65] [ White Papers ][66] [ Videos ][67]\n[ Blog ][68]\n[ Company ][69]\n[ About Us ][70] [ Careers ][71]\n[ Support ][72] [ Search Toggle Search ][73]\n\n# Take Control of Remote OT Access Without Disrupting Operations\n\nConnect third-party vendors, remote workers, and privileged employees to critical assets in a way\nthat\u2019s secure, safe, and surprisingly simple.\n\n[ See product overview ][74] [ Get a demo ][75]\n\n## Cyolo provides secure remote access with full visibility and control over every connection \u2014 from\n## start to finish.\n\n#### Maximize uptime and efficiency with an easy-to-use access solution that can be deployed in any\n#### environment and integrates seamlessly with both modern and legacy infrastructure.\n\n###### Facilitate agentless third-party remote access\n\nSafely connect third-party vendors to OT environments for enhanced productivity without needing to\nuse VPNs or jump boxes.\u00a0\n\n###### Provide OEM access for fast, secure support\n\nEnsure rapid, secure, and safe support and maintenance of diagnostics (M&D) for OT systems.\u00a0\n\n###### Control privileged access to critical systems\n\nSecure, monitor, and control privileged connections to mission-critical assets, whether on-prem or\nremote.\u00a0\n\n###### Achieve regulatory compliance\n\nImplement access control, supervision, session recording, segmentation, and other requirements of\nindustry and/or regional compliance mandates.\u00a0\n\n[ See how Cyolo secures OT access ][76]\n\n## Discover the remote access solution that changes the equation.\n\nMost traditional access solutions force organizations to choose between stronger security, user\nproductivity, and operational agility. Cyolo rewrites the equation by improving all three.\n\n### Greater operational agility\n* Get up and running quickly without infrastructure changes, operational disruptions, or downtime\n* Deploy in any environment, from cloud-connected to fully offline\n* Scale across sites, teams, and vendors without added complexity\n\n#### Greater productivity\n* Connect employees and third-party vendors fast \u2014 no agents needed\n* Simplify secure access without changing how people work\n* Enable remote collaboration, troubleshooting, and training from anywhere\n\n#### Greater security\n* Reduce risk with identity-based, Zero-Trust access \u2014 including to legacy systems\n* Track, control, and audit every session with complete accountability\n* Eliminate the risks of shared accounts and exposed credentials\n\n### Cyolo delivers the only secure remote access solution that\u2019s built for OT and backed by IT.\n\n**Just because it\u2019s made for OT doesn\u2019t mean IT won\u2019t love it.**\n\nCyolo delivers secure remote access that maximizes uptime and boosts efficiency \u2014 while giving IT\nunmatched visibility, control, and zero-trust protection.\n\n[ Why OT & IT agree on Cyolo ][77]\n\n##### Case Study\n\n### Tata Chemicals provides secure remote access Gartner\u00ae releases first-ever Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access -\n[ Get the guide ][1]\n[ Product ][2]\n[ Solutions ][3]\n\n### By Challenge\n\n[\nRemote Privileged Access for OT/ICS\n][4] [\nSecure Third-Party Access\n][5] [\nIT/OT Alignment\n][6] [\nRegulatory Compliance\n][7]\n\n### By Industry\n\n[\nManufacturing\n][8] [\nEnergy & Utilities\n][9] [\nAI Data Centers\n][10] [\nAll Industries\n][11]\n[ Partners ][12]\n[\nPartner Program\n][13] [\nPartner Ecosystem\n][14] [\nTechnology Integrations\n][15] [\nBecome a Partner\n][16]\n[ Resources ][17]\n\n### Resources\n\n[ See All Resources ][18]\n[\nNews\n][19] [\nPress Releases\n][20] [\nUpcoming Events\n][21] [\nThird Party Reports\n][22] [\nCase Studies\n][23] [\nAt a Glances\n][24] [\nDatasheet\n][25] [\nWhite Papers\n][26] [\nVideos\n][27]\n\n### Featured content\n\n[\nPress Release\n\n#### Cyolo Releases Powerful New Capabilities to Redefine Secure Remote Access for OT\n\n][28] [\nBlog\n\n#### Why VPNs Are a Poor Fit for Vendor Access in OT Manufacturing Environments\n\n][29] [\nWhite Paper\n\n#### The Paradox of Third-Party OT Access: The Surprising Benefits of Trusting Vendors Less\n\n][30] [\nThird Party Report\n\n#### 2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote Access\n\n][31]\n[ Blog ][32]\n[ Company ][33]\n[\nAbout Us\n][34] [\nCareers\n][35]\n[ Support ][36]\n[ Toggle Search ][37]\n[united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng\n[germany-flag.svg flag] De\n[spain-flag.svg flag] Spa\n[france-flag.svg flag] Fre\n[italy-flag.svg flag] Ita\n[ [united-states-flag.svg flag] Eng ][38] [ [germany-flag.svg flag] De ][39] [ [spain-flag.svg flag]\nSpa ][40] [ [france-flag.svg flag] Fre ][41] [ [italy-flag.svg flag] Ita ][42]\n[ Get a Demo ][43]\nClose Menu\n[ Product ][44]\n[ Solutions ][45]\n[ Remote Privileged Access for OT/ICS ][46] [ Third-Party Secure Access ][47] [ IT/OT Alignment\n][48] [ Regulatory Compliance ][49] [ Manufacturing ][50] [ Energy & Utilities ][51] [ Data Centers\n][52] [ All Industries ][53]\n[ Partners ][54]\n[ Partner Program ][55] [ Partner Ecosystem ][56] [ Technology Integrations ][57] [ Become a Partner\n][58]\n[ Resources ][59]\n[ News ][60] [ Press Releases ][61] [ Third-Party Reports ][62] [ Case Studies ][63] [ At a Glances\n][64] [ Datasheets ][65] [ White Papers ][66] [ Videos ][67]\n[ Blog ][68]\n[ Company ][69]\n[ About Us ][70] [ Careers ][71]\n[ Support ][72] [ Search Toggle Search ][73]\n\n# Take Control of Remote OT Access Without Disrupting Operations\n\nConnect third-party vendors, remote workers, and privileged employees to critical assets in a way\nthat\u2019s secure, safe, and surprisingly simple.\n\n[ See product overview ][74] [ Get a demo ][75]\n\n## Cyolo provides secure remote access with full visibility and control over every connection \u2014 from\n## start to finish.\n\n#### Maximize uptime and efficiency with an easy-to-use access solution that can be deployed in any\n#### environment and integrates seamlessly with both modern and legacy infrastructure.\n\n###### Facilitate agentless third-party remote access\n\nSafely connect third-party vendors to OT environments for enhanced productivity without needing to\nuse VPNs or jump boxes.\u00a0\n\n###### Provide OEM access for fast, secure support\n\nEnsure rapid, secure, and safe support and maintenance of diagnostics (M&D) for OT systems.\u00a0\n\n###### Control privileged access to critical systems\n\nSecure, monitor, and control privileged connections to mission-critical assets, whether on-prem or\nremote.\u00a0\n\n###### Achieve regulatory compliance\n\nImplement access control, supervision, session recording, segmentation, and other requirements of\nindustry and/or regional compliance mandates.\u00a0\n\n[ See how Cyolo secures OT access ][76]\n\n## Discover the remote access solution that changes the equation.\n\nMost traditional access solutions force organizations to choose between stronger security, user\nproductivity, and operational agility. Cyolo rewrites the equation by improving all three.\n\n### Greater operational agility\n* Get up and running quickly without infrastructure changes, operational disruptions, or downtime\n* Deploy in any environment, from cloud-connected to fully offline\n* Scale across sites, teams, and vendors without added complexity\n\n#### Greater productivity\n* Connect employees and third-party vendors fast \u2014 no agents needed\n* Simplify secure access without changing how people work\n* Enable remote collaboration, troubleshooting, and training from anywhere\n\n#### Greater security\n* Reduce risk with identity-based, Zero-Trust access \u2014 including to legacy systems\n* Track, control, and audit every session with complete accountability\n* Eliminate the risks of shared accounts and exposed credentials\n\n### Cyolo delivers the only secure remote access solution that\u2019s built for OT and backed by IT.\n\n**Just because it\u2019s made for OT doesn\u2019t mean IT won\u2019t love it.**\n\nCyolo delivers secure remote access that maximizes uptime and boosts efficiency \u2014 while giving IT\nunmatched visibility, control, and zero-trust protection.\n\n[ Why OT & IT agree on Cyolo ][77]\n\n##### Case Study\n\n### Tata Chemicals provides secure remote access for employees, contractors, and vendors with Cyolo\n\n\"We use Cyolo to grant and to monitor vendor/contractor access to our internal systems, data, PLCs,\nall those kind of things that they need to access. One of the nice things about Cyolo is that we can\nrecord sessions, [and] we can ask for manager approval in order to allow those people in. Everyone\nknows when they're accessing any of our resources, and it's all approved. Those features have made\nCyolo a gamechanger for us.\"\n\n**McKay Smith, IT Manager, Tata Chemicals**\n\n[ See all case studies ][78]\n\n## Cyolo is Recognized by Industry Experts\n\n##### May 2026\n\nCyolo Named a Sample Vendor for CPS Secure Remote Access in the 2026 Gartner\u00ae Hype Cycle for CPS\nSecurity\n\n##### March 2026\n\nCyolo Named Winner of the Global InfoSec Award for \"Most Innovative Secure Remote Access\"\n\n##### March 2026\n\nCyolo Named Winner of the Global InfoSec Award for \"Publisher's Choice OT Security\"\n\n##### February 2026\n\nCyolo Listed as a Representative Vendor in the 2026 Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for CPS Secure Remote\nAccess\n\n##### August 2025\n\nCyolo Named by Gartner\u00ae in the 'How to Implement Secure Remote Access in the CPS Environment' report\n\n##### August 2025\n\nCyolo Recognized as a Sample Vendor in the 2025 Gartner\u00ae Hype Cycle\u2122 for Zero-Trust Technology\n\n##### July 2025\n\nCyolo Listed as a Sample Vendor in the 2025 Gartner\u00ae Hype Cycle\u2122 for Cyber-Physical Systems Security\n\n##### June 2025\n\nCyolo Named by Gartner\u00ae in the 'How to Secure Remote Privileged Access With RPAM Tools' report\n\n##### July 2024\n\nCyolo Listed as a Sample Vendor in the 2024 Gartner\u00ae Hype Cycle\u2122 for Cyber-Physical Systems Security\n\n##### April 2024\n\nCyolo Recognized in the Gartner\u00ae Innovation Insight: CPS Secure Remote Access Solutions\n\n##### Dec 2023\n\nCyolo Named by Gartner\u00ae in the \u2018Securing Remote Privileged Access Management Through RPAM Tools'\nreport\n\n##### Aug 2023\n\nCyolo Listed as a Representative Vendor in the Gartner\u00ae Market Guide for Zero Trust Network Access\n\nPreviou"
