        "crawl_text": "<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" style=\"display:none;\" alt=\"\"\nsrc=\"https://px.ads.linkedin.com/collect/?pid=2849132&amp;fmt=gif\">\n[\n\n**New Omdia Research **\u00a0\u2022 The State of Microsegmentation\u00a0\u2022\u00a0 **Read the Report**\n\n][1]\n[[elisity_logo]][2]\n* [ Platform ][3]\n* [ Solutions\n  ][4]\n  \n  [Materials_fill] Use Case\n  * [ Network Asset Discovery ][5]\n  * [ Network Visibility ][6]\n  * [ IoT Segmentation ][7]\n  * [ OT Segmentation ][8]\n  * [ IoMT Security ][9]\n  * [ Agentic AI Security ][10]\n  * [ Zero Trust Microsegmentation ][11]\n  * [ Network Segmentation Compliance ][12]\n  * [ Block Lateral Movement - Ransomware & Malware ][13]\n  \n  Industry\n  * [ Healthcare Institutions ][14]\n  * [ Manufacturing & Industrial Organizations ][15]\n  * [ BioTech + Pharmaceuticals ][16]\n  * [ Commercial Enterprise ][17]\n  \n  [Resource-Icon]\n  \n  Omdia Survey: 90% of Organizations Are Falling Behind on Microsegmentation. Are You?\n  \n  [Elisity-Omdia-Report-2026-Featured-NewsThumbail (1)]\n  [banner-BG-main]\n  [Learn More ][18]\n* [ Resources\n  ][19]\n  \n  [Mortarboard_fill] Resources\n  * [ Blog ][20]\n  * [ Solution Briefs ][21]\n  * [ Video ][22]\n  * [ White Papers ][23]\n  * [ Case Studies ][24]\n  * [ Integrations ][25]\n  * [ Support ][26]\n  * [ Elisity Academy ][27]\n  * [ Partners ][28]\n  \n  [Frame 2147216567] Featured Resource\n  * [ Access the Gartner\u00ae Cool Vendors\u2122 in Cyber-Physical Systems Security 2025 Report ][29]\n  \n  [Resource-Icon]\n  \n  Omdia Survey: 90% of Organizations Are Falling Behind on Microsegmentation. Are You?\n  \n  [Elisity-Omdia-Report-2026-Featured-NewsThumbail (1)]\n  [banner-BG-main]\n  [Learn More ][30]\n* [ Company\n  ][31]\n  \n  [Chat_search_fill] Company\n  * [ About Us ][32]\n  * [ Leadership Team ][33]\n  * [ Partners ][34]\n  * [ Press Coverage ][35]\n  * [ News ][36]\n  * [ Awards ][37]\n  * [ Events ][38]\n  * [ SOC 2 Compliance ][39]\n  * [ Careers ][40]\n  * [ Contact Us ][41]\n  \n  [Resource-Icon]\n  \n  Omdia Survey: 90% of Organizations Are Falling Behind on Microsegmentation. Are You?\n  \n  [Elisity-Omdia-Report-2026-Featured-NewsThumbail (1)]\n  [banner-BG-main]\n  [Learn More ][42]\n[close search]\n\n## Elisity Site Search\n\n[search icon]\n[ Schedule Demo ][43]\n[Mythos broke the patch race.][44]\n\n# The next vulnerability already has an answer.\n\nIdentity-based microsegmentation contains what you can\u2019t patch and can\u2019t predict, across the network\nyou already run.\n\n[Learn more ][45]\n[Elisity_Overview_Product_Dashboard]\n[ [Elisity-Omdia-Report-2026-Featured-News-Thumbail] ][46]\n\nNew\n\nTrending\n\nSurvey: 90% of Organizations Are Falling Behind on Microsegmentation. Are You?\n\n[Read the Analysis by Omdia][47]\n\n#### Trusted by Industry Leaders\n\n[shaw-floors-logo]\n[Main_Line_Health_logo-stacked]\n[GSK-Logo-Small]\n\n## While the industry rewrites its playbook, the architecture stays the same.\n\nPatching was built for human\u2011speed threats. Identity\u2011based microsegmentation was built for the ones\nyou can\u2019t see coming, so a device reaches only what its identity allows, compromised or not, with no\nrip and replace and no outages.\n[image 35]\n[Star Rating]\n\n## Transform Network Security with Enterprise Scale Microsegmentation\n\nPrevent lateral movement across all users, workloads, and devices without agents, hardware, or\nnetwork changes.\n\n[Discover_Icon]\n\n### Discover every device, everywhere\n\nGain full visibility and context of all users, workloads and devices with Elisity IdentityGraph\u2122\nintelligence.\n\n[See How It Works][48]\n[DCM - Discover-Devices - Card Reveal]\n[Control_Icon]\n\n### Create and control least privilege access policies\n\nGain full visibility and context of all users, workloads and devices with Elisity IdentityGraph\u2122\nintelligence.\n\n[See How It Works][49]\n[DCM - Control-Policies 3]\n[Manage_Icon]\n\n### Fast implementation and easy scaling\n\nStreamline operations, align IT, Security and IoT teams. Answer audits quickly.\n\n[See How It Works][50]\n[DCM - Manage-Integrations]\n\nCase Studies\n\n[David Finklestein St. Lukes University Health Network]\n[thumb (2)]\n[Jason-Elrod-CISO-Profile-Elisity-2]\n[ELS007_03b_DSC08169 2]\n[sluhn-logo-white] [haleon-logo] [MultiCare Logo] [GSK-logo-white-svg-1]\n\n\u201cWe deployed Elisity across 15 hospitals, 350 practices, and 85,000 devices. In two months.\u201d\n\nDavid Finkelstein, CISO, St. Luke\u2019s University Health Network\n\n[ Read More ][51]\n[David Finklestein St. Lukes University Health Network]\n\n\u201cOur ability to scale policy deployment across the business enables the business to expand and scale\nat speed.\u201d\n\nEdmond Mack, CISO, Haleon\n\n[ Read More ][52]\n[thumb (2)]\n\n\u201cWith Elisity, we protect our unpatchable medical equipment from ransomware, without disrupting\ncare.\u201d\n\nJason Elrod, CISO, MultiCare\n\n[ Read More ][53]\n[Jason-Elrod-CISO-Profile-Elisity-2]\n\n\u201cElisity\u2019s deployment at GSK is nothing short of revolutionary, making every other solution pale in\ncomparison.\u201d\n\nMichael Elmore, CISO, GSK\n\n[ Read More ][54]\n[ELS007_03b_DSC08169 2]\n\n## See Elisity\u2019s Deep Domain Expertise Across Industries\n\nGet enterprise-wide protection and simplified m <img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" style=\"display:none;\" alt=\"\"\nsrc=\"https://px.ads.linkedin.com/collect/?pid=2849132&amp;fmt=gif\">\n[\n\n**New Omdia Research **\u00a0\u2022 The State of Microsegmentation\u00a0\u2022\u00a0 **Read the Report**\n\n][1]\n[[elisity_logo]][2]\n* [ Platform ][3]\n* [ Solutions\n  ][4]\n  \n  [Materials_fill] Use Case\n  * [ Network Asset Discovery ][5]\n  * [ Network Visibility ][6]\n  * [ IoT Segmentation ][7]\n  * [ OT Segmentation ][8]\n  * [ IoMT Security ][9]\n  * [ Agentic AI Security ][10]\n  * [ Zero Trust Microsegmentation ][11]\n  * [ Network Segmentation Compliance ][12]\n  * [ Block Lateral Movemen