        "crawl_text": "[[Inter-Con Security]][1]\n* [Security Services][2]\n  * [Security Guards][3]\n  * [Executive Protection][4]\n  * [K-9 Security][5]\n  * [Off-Duty Officers][6]\n  * [Event Security][7]\n  * [Fire Life Safety & Emergency Response][8]\n  * [High-Value Asset Protection][9]\n  * [Intelligence and Investigatory Solutions][10]\n  * [Screening & Access Controls][11]\n  * [Security Operations Center][12]\n  * [Technology][13]\n  * [Value Added Training][14]\n  * [Parking Enforcement][15]\n  * [International Operations][16]\n* [Industries][17]\n  * [Aviation][18]\n  * [Commercial Real Estate & Facilities][19]\n  * [Construction / Infrastructure][20]\n  * [Education][21]\n  * [Energy and Utilities][22]\n  * [Entertainment][23]\n  * [Faith-Based Organizations][24]\n  * [Family Business / High Net Worth Individuals][25]\n  * [Financial Services / Banking / Insurance][26]\n  * [Government (Local, State and Federal)][27]\n  * [Healthcare][28]\n  * [Logistics][29]\n  * [Manufacturing][30]\n  * [Mass Transit][31]\n  * [Museums / Galleries / Libraries][32]\n  * [Non-Profit Organizations][33]\n  * [Residential / HOA][34]\n  * [Retail][35]\n  * [Technology][36]\n* [About Us][37]\n  * [Core Values][38]\n  * [Corporate Team][39]\n  * [Global Footprint][40]\n* [News & Media][41]\n  * [Blog][42]\n  * [News][43]\n  * [Press Release][44]\n* [Careers][45]\n  * [Join Us][46]\n  * [Apply Now][47]\n* [Contact us][48]\n* [Apply Now][49]\nMenu\n[Los Angeles Skyline]\n\nPress Release\n\n# Henry and Rick Hernandez Honored with 2026 Latino Leaders Index 500 Award\n\n[Learn more ][50]\n[OSPAs]\n\nPress Release\n\n# Inter-Con Named the Outstanding Contract Security Company at the 2025 GSX OSPAs\u00a0\n\n[Learn more ][51]\n\nPress Release\n\n# Inc. Names Inter-Con one of the Fastest Growing Companies in America\n\n[Learn more ][52]\n\nPress Release\n\n# Inter-Con and MTS Set Benchmark for Transit Safety with TSA Gold Standard Award\n\n[Learn more ][53]\n[General Motors]\n\nPress Release\n\n# Inter-Con Security Awarded Entire U.S. Security Contract for General Motors\n\n[Learn more ][54]\n\nKey Services\n\n# Experts in an Extensive Array of Security Services\n\n[Learn more ][55]\n\nCareers\n\n# Interested in Joining Our Team?\n\n[Learn more ][56]\n\n## Inter-Con is recognized as one of the fastest-growing companies\n\nInter-Con has nearly tripled in size over the past several years to become one of the largest and\nfastest-growing physical security companies in the world. Inter-Con is a family-owned, certified\nMinority Business Enterprise and employs over 40,000 employees across North and South America, and\nAfrica.\u00a0\n\nOur dedicated services model places high-caliber security directly within our clients\u2019 environments,\ndelivering unmatched precision in building, enhancing, and sustaining robust security programs. We\nfurther provide:\n* Scalable, customizable, and comprehensive security solutions delivered at cost-effective rates.\n* Enhanced employee engagement, which drives industry-leading retention rates.\n* Best-in-class technology serving as a force multiplier for our security teams.\n* Proven transition expertise that mitigates risk and ensures seamless implementation of new\n  security programs.\n\n[Learn More ][57]\n\n## Security Careers \u2013 Join Our Team!\n\nWe offer a wide variety of exciting security jobs across the United States and abroad. We offer\ncandidates:\n* A winning, inclusive culture.\n* Extremely competitive compensation.\n* For full-time positions, we offer medical, dental, and vision coverage, life insurance, and 401K.\n* For part-time positions, we offer benefits including vision, dental, and additional options such\n  as life insurance, legal plans, SoFi financial loans, and an employer-sponsored retirement plan\n  (may vary by contract and post).\u00a0\n* Part-time and flexible schedules (through our IConIQ Security Management System).\n* Daily Pay solutions.\n* Empowering career development and training programs.\n\n[Apply Now ][58]\n\nCareers\n\n## The Inter-Con Path\n\nSeeking a career in security?\u00a0 Explore our many security job openings.\n\n[Begin Here ][59]\n\n## Our Security Services\n\nInter-Con provides a wide array of exceptional security solutions to meet client needs.\n\nWhether you are seeking unarmed or armed guards, surveillance, executive protection, or other\nspecialty services, we will tailor a security program that\u2019s right for your business.\n\n[Learn More ][60]\n\n## Industry Expertise\n\nInter-Con is proud to provide security solutions to clients in both the public and private security\nsectors, delivering tailored expertise that safeguards people, property, and critical\ninfrastructure.\u00a0\n\n[Learn More ][61]\n\n## Security Training\u00a0\n\nAt Inter-Con, we leverage the market\u2019s best trainers, tools, expertise, and technology to craft\nhighly effective security training programs that reduce costs for our clients. Our expansive\nPeacemaker National Training Center facility boasts some of the best training and shooting ranges in\nthe world as well as hosts numerous nationally recognized skill-based competitions.\n\n[Learn More ][62]\n\n## How Can Inter-Con Serve You?\n\n[Wor [[Inter-Con Security]][1]\n* [Security Services][2]\n  * [Security Guards][3]\n  * [Executive Protection][4]\n  * [K-9 Security][5]\n  * [Off-Duty Officers][6]\n  * [Event Security][7]\n  * [Fire Life Safety & Emergency Response][8]\n  * [High-Value Asset Protection][9]\n  * [Intelligence and Investigatory Solutions][10]\n  * [Screening & Access Controls][11]\n  * [Security Operations Center][12]\n  * [Technology][13]\n  * [Value Added Training][14]\n  * [Parking Enforcement][15]\n  * [International Operations][16]\n* [Industries][17]\n  * [Aviation][18]\n  * [Commercial Real Estate & Facilities][19]\n  * [Construction / Infrastructure][20]\n  * [Education][21]\n  * [Energy and Utilities][22]\n  * [Entertainment][23]\n  * [Faith-Based Organizations][24]\n  * [Family Business / High Net Worth Individuals][25]\n  * [Financial Services / Banking / Insurance][26]\n  * [Government (Local, State and Federal)][27]\n  * [Healthcare][28]\n  * [Logistics][29]\n  * [Manufacturing][30]\n  * [Mass Transit][31]\n  * [Museums / Galleries / Libraries][32]\n  * [Non-Profit Organizations][33]\n  * [Residential / HOA][34]\n  * [Retail][35]\n  * [Technology][36]\n* [About Us][37]\n  * [Core Values][38]\n  * [Corporate Team][39]\n  * [Global Footprint][40]\n* [News & Media][41]\n  * [Blog][42]\n  * [News][43]\n  * [Press Release][44]\n* [Careers][45]\n  * [Join Us][46]\n  * [Apply Now][47]\n* [Contact us][48]\n* [Apply Now][49]\nMenu\n[Los Angeles Skyline]\n\nPress Release\n\n# Henry and Rick Hernandez Honored with 2026 Latino Leaders Index 500 Award\n\n[Learn more ][50]\n[OSPAs]\n\nPress Release\n\n# Inter-Con Named the Outstanding Contract Security Company at the 2025 GSX OSPAs\u00a0\n\n[Learn more ][51]\n\nPress Release\n\n# Inc. Names Inter-Con one of the Fastest Growing Companies in America\n\n[Learn more ][52]\n\nPress Release\n\n# Inter-Con and MTS Set Benchmark for Transit Safety with TSA Gold Standard Award\n\n[Learn more ][53]\n[General Motors]\n\nPress Release\n\n# Inter-Con Security Awarded Entire U.S. Security Contract for General Motors\n\n[Learn more ][54]\n\nKey Services\n\n# Experts in an Extensive Array of Security Services\n\n[Learn more ][55]\n\nCareers\n\n# Interested in Joining Our Team?\n\n[Learn more ][56]\n\n## Inter-Con is recognized as one of the fastest-growing companies\n\nInter-Con has nearly tripled in size over the past several years to become one of the largest and\nfastest-growing physical security companies in the world. Inter-Con is a family-owned, certified\nMinority Business Enterprise and employs over 40,000 employees across North and South America, and\nAfrica.\u00a0\n\nOur dedicated services model places high-caliber security directly within our clients\u2019 environments,\ndelivering unmatched precision in building, enhancing, and sustaining robust security programs. We\nfurther provide:\n* Scalable, customizable, and comprehensive security solutions delivered at cost-effective rates.\n* Enhanced employee engagement, which drives industry-leading retention rates.\n* Best-in-class technology serving as a force multiplier for our security teams.\n* Proven transition expertise that mitigates risk and ensures seamless implementation of new\n  security programs.\n\n[Learn More ][57]\n\n## Security Careers \u2013 Join Our Team!\n\nWe offer a wide variety of exciting security jobs across the United States and abroad. We offer\ncandidates:\n* A winning, inclusive culture.\n* Extremely competitive compensation.\n* For full-time positions, we offer medical, dental, and vision coverage, life insurance, and 401K.\n* For part-time positions, we offer benefits including vision, dental, and additional options such\n  as life insurance, legal plans, SoFi financial loans, and an employer-sponsored retirement plan\n  (may vary by contract and post).\u00a0\n* Part-time and flexible schedules (through our IConIQ Security Management System).\n* Daily Pay solutions.\n* Empowering career development and training programs.\n\n[Apply Now ][58]\n\nCareers\n\n## The Inter-Con Path\n\nSeeking a career in security?\u00a0 Explore our many security job openings.\n\n[Begin Here ][59]\n\n## Our Security Services\n\nInter-Con provides a wide array of exceptional security solutions to meet client needs.\n\nWhether you are seeking unarmed or armed guards, surveillance, executive protection, or other\nspecialty services, we will tailor a security program that\u2019s right for your business.\n\n[Learn More ][60]\n\n## Industry Expertise\n\nInter-Con is proud to provide security solutions to clients in both the public and private security\nsectors, delivering tailored expertise that safeguards people, property, and critical\ninfrastructure.\u00a0\n\n[Learn More ][61]\n\n## Security Training\u00a0\n\nAt Inter-Con, we leverage the market\u2019s best trainers, tools, expertise, and technology to craft\nhighly effective security training programs that reduce costs for our clients. Our expansive\nPeacemaker National Training Center facility boasts some of the best training and shooting ranges in\nthe world as well as hosts numerous nationally recognized skill-based competitions.\n\n[Learn More ][62]\n\n## How Can Inter-Con Serve You?\n\n[Work With Us ][63]\n\n## Are You Interested in Joining the Inter-Con Family?\n\n[Join Our Team ][64]\n* [ Share Icon][65]\n* [ Share Icon][66]\n* [ Share Icon][67]\n* [Security Services][68]\n* [Industries][69]\n* [Innovation][70]\n* [Company][71]\n* [News & Media][72]\n* [Careers][73]\n* [Privacy][74]\n* [Climate Risk Assessment][75]\n\n\u00a9 2026 Inter-Con Security Systems, Inc (\u201cInter-Con\u201d). All rights reserved. INTER-CON SECURITY\u00ae and\nINTER-CON SECURITY\u00ae Logo are registered trademarks of Inter-Con. ICONIQ\u2122 is a trademark of\nInter-Con.\n\n[1]: https://icsecurity.com/\n[2]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/\n[3]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/security-guards/\n[4]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/executive-protection/\n[5]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/k9/\n[6]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/off-duty-officers/\n[7]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/event-security/\n[8]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/fire-life-safety-emergency-response/\n[9]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/high-value-asset-hva/\n[10]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/intelligence-and-investigatory-solutions/\n[11]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/screening-access-controls/\n[12]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/security-operation-centers/\n[13]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/technology/\n[14]: https://icsecurity.com/security-services/value-added-training/\n[15]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/parking-enforcement/\n[16]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/international-operations/\n[17]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/\n[18]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/aviation/\n[19]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/commercial-real-estate/\n[20]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/infrastructure-construction/\n[21]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/education/\n[22]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/energy-and-utilities/\n[23]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/entertainment/\n[24]: https://icsecurity.com/industries/faith-based-organ"
