[ Latest Engineering Research ][26]\n\n## Supporting Research and Innovation\n\nEngineering Journal: IJOER encourages submissions from researchers working in various branches of\nengineering, including (but not limited to): [View all research areas \u2192][27]\n\n### Computer & IT\n* Information Technology\n* Computer Science Engineering\n* Software Engineering\n* Data Science & AI\n* Network Security\n* Cloud Computing\n\n### Electronics & Electrical\n* Electronics & Communication\n* Electrical Engineering\n* VLSI Design\n* Power Electronics\n* Embedded Systems\n* Signal Processing\n\n### Mechanical & Civil\n* Mechanical Engineering\n* Civil Engineering\n* Chemical Engineering\n* Thermal Engineering\n* Structural Engineering\n* Fluid Mechanics\n\n### Sciences & Interdisciplinary\n* Physics\n* Chemistry\n* Mathematics\n* Biomedical Engineering\n* Nanotechnology\n* Environmental Engineering\n\n### Specialized Domains\n* Plastics Engineering\n* Food Technology\n* Textile Engineering\n* Aerospace Engineering\n* Agricultural Engineering\n* Automobile Engineering\n\n### Management & Others\n* Engineering Management\n* Project Management\n* Operations Research\n* Supply Chain\n* Quality Engineering\n* Industrial Engineering\n\n[ View Complete Research Areas ][28]\n\n## Advantages of Publishing in IJOER\n\n### Global Research Impact\n\nAs an [open-access journal][29], your research receives immediate worldwide visibility without\nsubscription barriers. Articles are accessible to researchers, engineers, and policymakers across\n150+ countries, significantly increasing citation potential and research impact.\n\n[Permanent DOI assignment][30]\nCrossRef metadata deposit\n[Indexing in major databases][31]\n\n### Efficient Publication Process\n\nOur efficient editorial workflow ensures timely publication. Average time from submission to first\ndecision is 2-3 weeks, with 12 issues published annually. We maintain rigorous peer review while\nminimizing publication delays. [Learn more \u2192][32]\n\n[Double-blind peer review][33]\n2-3 week initial decision\nMonthly publication schedule\n\n### Expert Editorial Oversight\n\nOur international [editorial board][34] and [reviewer board][35] comprise distinguished engineering\nresearchers and professionals from leading institutions worldwide. They ensure rigorous scientific\nstandards and maintain the journal's commitment to publishing high-quality engineering research.\n\nInternational editorial board\nSubject-specific handling editors\n[Technical review when required][36]\n\n### Ethical Publishing Standards\n\nIJOER adheres to the highest ethical standards in engineering publishing. We follow [COPE\nguidelines][37], employ [plagiarism detection software][38], and ensure compliance with\ninternational publication ethics.\n\nCOPE member journal\nPlagiarism screening\n[Ethical compliance check][39]\n\n## Ready to Publish Your Engineering Research?\n\nJoin thousands of engineering researchers from 50+ countries who trust IJOER for quality publication\nand global visibility.\n\n[ Submit Manuscript Now ][40] [ Author Guidelines ][41] [ Why Publish with Us? ][42]\n\nAverage decision time: 2-3 weeks \u2022 [APC information][43] \u2022 [Fee waiver available][44] [ Skip to main content ][1]\n[ [Engineering Journal IJOER Logo] ][2]\n\nInternational Journal of\nEngineering Research and Science\n\nISSN No.: 2395-6992 | R Impact Factor 4.12\n* [ Home ][3]\n* [ Guidelines for Authors ][4]\n* [ Board Members ][5]\n* [ Archives ][6]\n* [ Submit Article ][7]\n* [ Related forms ][8]\n* [ Contact Us ][9]\n\n# International Journal of Engineering Research and Science\n\n## (Engineering Journal IJOER)\n\n**DOI:** 10.25125/engineering-journal\n\n### Journal is Indexed in\n\n[WorldCat][10] | [Neilit][11] | [Scilit][12] | MDPI | [Tyndale University][13] | [Publons][14] |\n[Indiana University][15] | [Index Copernicus][16] | [View all indexing \u2192][17]\n\n[Engineering Journal IJOER Cover Page]\n\n**Engineering Journal: IJOER [ISSN: 2395-6992(O)]:** is a peer-reviewed, open-access international\njournal. We uphold a strict [plagiarism policy][18] and are dedicated to publishing high-quality,\ninnovative research in engineering. The journal serves as a platform for scientists, professors,\nengineers, and research scholars to share their research and innovations.\n\nAs a member of CrossRef USA, IJOER provides DOIs for published papers, facilitating better\ndiscoverability and citation. The journal is [indexed by several prestigious databases][19],\nenhancing its visibility and influence in the scientific community.\n\n**Frequency**: Monthly (12 issues per year) \u2013 [View current issue][20]\n**Language of Publication**: English\n**Nature:** Refereed/Peer-Reviewed Engineering Journal \u2013 [Review policy][21]\n**Year of Commencement:** 2015\n\n**Journal Mission:** To accelerate the dissemination of high-quality engineering research, foster\ninterdisciplinary collaboration, and contribute to technological innovation worldwide through\nrigorous peer review and open access publishing.\n[\ud83d\udcd6 Aim & Scope][22] [\u2696\ufe0f Ethics Policy][23] [\ud83d\udcdc Publication Ethics][24]\n[ Submit Research Article ][25]\n[ Latest Engineering Research ][26]\n\n## Supporting Research and Innovation\n\nEngineering Journal: IJOER encourages submissions from researchers working in various branches of\nengineering, including (but not limited to): [View all research areas \u2192][27]\n\n### Computer & IT\n* Information Technology\n* Computer Science Engineering\n* Software Engineering\n* Data Science & AI\n* Network Security\n* Cloud Computing\n\n### Electronics & Electrical\n* Electronics & Communication\n* Electrical Engineering\n* VLSI Design\n* Power Electronics\n* Embedded Systems\n* Signal Processing\n\n### Mechanical & Civil\n* Mechanical Engineering\n* Civil Engineering\n* Chemical Engineering\n* Thermal Engineering\n* Structural Engineering\n* Fluid Mechanics\n\n### Sciences & Interdisciplinary\n* Physics\n* Chemistry\n* Mathematics\n* Biomedical Engineering\n* Nanotechnology\n* Environmental Engineering\n\n### Specialized Domains\n* Plastics Engineering\n* Food Technology\n* Textile Engineering\n* Aerospace Engineering\n* Agricultural Engineering\n* Automobile Engineering\n\n### Management & Others\n* Engineering Management\n* Project Management\n* Operations Research\n* Supply Chain\n* Quality Engineering\n* Industrial Engineering\n\n[ View Complete Research Areas ][28]\n\n## Advantages of Publishing in IJOER\n\n### Global Research Impact\n\nAs an [open-access journal][29], your research receives immediate worldwide visibility without\nsubscription barriers. Articles are accessible to researchers, engineers, and policymakers across\n150+ countries, significantly increasing citation potential and research impact.\n\n[Permanent DOI assignment][30]\nCrossRef metadata deposit\n[Indexing in major databases][31]\n\n### Efficient Publication Process\n\nOur efficient editorial workflow ensures timely publication. Average time from submission to first\ndecision is 2-3 weeks, with 12 issues published annually. We maintain rigorous peer review while\nminimizing publication delays. [Learn more \u2192][32]\n\n[Double-blind peer review][33]\n2-3 week initial decision\nMonthly publication schedule\n\n### Expert Editorial Oversight\n\nOur international [editorial board][34] and [reviewer board][35] comprise distinguished engineering\nresearchers and professionals from leading institutions worldwide. They ensure rigorous scientific\nstandards and maintain the journal's commitment to publishing high-quality engineering research.\n\nInternational editorial board\nSubject-specific handling editors\n[Technical review when required][36]\n\n### Ethical Publishing Standards\n\nIJOER adheres to the highest ethical standards in engineering publishing. We follow [COPE\nguidelines][37], employ [plagiarism detection software][38], and ensure compliance with\ninternational publication ethics.\n\nCOPE member journal\nPlagiarism screening\n[Ethical compliance check][39]\n\n## Ready to Publish Your Engineering Research?\n\nJoin thousands of engineering researchers from 50+ countries who trust IJOER for quality publication\nand global visibility.\n\n[ Submit Manuscript Now ][40] [ Author Guidelines ][41] [ Why Publish with Us? ][42]\n\nAverage decision time: 2-3 weeks \u2022 [APC information][43] \u2022 [Fee waiver available][44]\n\n## International Journal of Engineering Research and Science: Advancing Engineering Research\n\n### About Our Engineering Journal\n\nThe **International Journal of Engineering Research and Science (IJOER)** stands as a premier\nplatform for disseminating high-quality engineering research across diverse disciplines. Established\nin 2015 and published by AD Publications, our journal has quickly become a trusted resource for\nengineers, researchers, and academicians worldwide.\n\nAs a multidisciplinary engineering journal, IJOER bridges the gap between theoretical research and\npractical applications, facilitating the translation of scientific discoveries into technological\ninnovations. Our commitment to [open access][45] ensures that vital engineering knowledge reaches\npractitioners, researchers, and policymakers without financial barriers.\n\n### Scope and Coverage\n\nIJOER publishes original research articles, comprehensive reviews, technical notes, and short\ncommunications across the entire spectrum of engineering and applied sciences. Our broad scope\nincludes but is not limited to:\n* **Engineering Research:** Novel findings from empirical studies\n* **Applied Sciences:** Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics applications\n* **Technical Innovations:** New methods and technological advancements\n* **Interdisciplinary Research:** Cross-domain engineering applications\n\n[View full aim and scope \u2192][46]\n\n### Editorial Process\n\nIJOER maintains a rigorous editorial process to ensure the publication of scientifically valid and\nethically sound research:\n1. **Initial Screening:** Editorial check for scope, format, and ethical compliance\n2. **Peer Review:** [Double-blind review][47] by at least two independent experts\n3. **Technical Review:** Additional review for specialized content\n4. **Editorial Decision:** Final decision based on reviewer comments\n5. **Production:** Professional copyediting, typesetting, and proofreading\n\n[Detailed publication process \u2192][48]\n\n## Journal Information at a Glance\n"
