n[Request a Demo][68][Sign In][69]\n[\n][70]\nWhat are you looking for?\n[\n\nImmersive One\n\n][71][\n\nAppSec\n\n][72][\n\nHands-On Labs\n\n][73][\n\nCyber Drills\n\n][74]\n[Sign In][75][Request a Demo][76]\n\n# Prove your business can move at AI speed.\n\nImmersive is the cyber proving ground for the AI enterprise. We help organizations prove their\npeople, AI agents and leadership decisions are ready for a world where AI is used inside the\nbusiness \u2014 and against it.\n\n[\nExplore AI at Immersive\n][77][Request a Demo][78]\nWave Leader 2026\n[\nReport\n\n### Immersive Named a Leader - The Forrester Wave\u2122 2026\n\nRead the Report\n][79]\n[\nWhats new blog\n\n### Goal-Aligned Resilience Pathways: The Fastest Path to Provable Cyber Readiness\n\nLearn More\n][80]\n[\ntei report\n\n### The Forrester Total Economic Impact for Immersive One\n\nLearn More\n][81]\n\n## Prove the capabilities behind AI transformation with our Immersive Labs.\n\nStart with hands-on scenarios that show where people, teams and agents are ready, and where the\nbusiness needs evidence before AI risk reaches the boardroom.\n\n[\n45 mins\n\n### AI: Prompt Injection\n### Attacks\n\nTry Lab\n][82]\n[\n30 mins\n\n### Threat Actors:\n### Salt Typhoon\n\nTry Lab\n][83]\n[\n20 mins\n\n### Introduction to Incident\n### Response: Ep.5\n\nTry Lab\n][84]\n[\n20 mins\n\n### CTI First Principles:\n### Ep.4\n\nTry Lab\n][85]\n[\nnew\nThe resilience room\n\n### It's Software, Not Magic: Navigating the Vulnerability Speed Wave and Shadow AI\n\nJun 16, 2026\n50 min\nListen Now\n][86]\nImmersive one\n\n## Strengthen Cyber Resilience\n\nCompare readiness across frameworks, peers, and business units \u2014 and turn your data into board-ready\nreports that prove resilience and guide investment.\n\n[\nExplore Immersive One\n][87][Request a Demo][88]\n[\n\n### Prove AI-era readiness\n\nRun lifelike drills that validate your detection, response, and leadership under pressure, cutting\nMTTD/MTTR.\n\nExplore Prove\n][89][\n\n### Close exposed gaps\n\nRoute weak points into targeted practice, technical scenarios and role-specific programs.\n\nExplore Improve\n][90][\n\n### Evidence progress\n\nMeasure performance against peers and frameworks, then translate it into board-ready evidence of\nresilience.\n\nExplore Benchmark & Report\n][91]\n\n## Measure What Matters. Readiness You Can Prove.\n\nTrack performance across every stage of an attack lifecycle, benchmark teams to MITRE ATT&CK, and\nreport resilience with confidence.\n\n[\nExplore Hands-on-Labs\n][92]\nTake a Product Tour\n\u2715\n[Key for coverage levels with colors: Higher, Medium, Lower, Not started, No labs mapped.][Smiling\nman with short hair and beard wearing a grey sweater over a white shirt.]\ncontainer 7\n\n## Respond to emerging threats at market-leading speed.\n\nContainer 7 keeps labs current with attacker tradecraft and vulnerability shifts so your teams\npractice what matters now.\n\n[Explore Container 7][93]\n[Large blue stylized letter C spray-painted on dark vertical wooden planks.]\n\n## Proving Readiness in the Real World\n\nExplore how CISOs and their teams use Immersive One to simulate real cyber attacks, benchmark\nperformance, and report measurable resilience to boards and regulators.\n\n[\nExplore Case Studies\n][94]\n[\ncase study\n\n### How Elastic Transformed Incident Readiness with Measurable, Multi-Team Cyber Drills\n\nRead more\n][95]\n[\n[Night view of illuminated London financial district skyscrapers behind historic stone buildings.]\ncase study\n\n### How a UK Government Agency Proved & Improved Readiness\n\nRead more\n][96]\n[\n[The Shard skyscraper in London lit up at dusk with an orange and purple sky background.]\ncase study\n\n### How a Law Enforcement Agency Builds Elite Skills with Immersive\n\nRead more\n][97]\n[\n[Tall modern building rising above dense fog with a city skyline in the background during sunrise.]\ncase study\n\n### How a Large Public Service Entity Built Stronger Cyber Resilience\n\nRead more\n][98]\n[\n[Sunlit forested mountain peak with a small building, surrounded by mist and a purple sky.]\ncase study\n\n### How a Large European Charity Upskilled ItsGrowing Security Team\n\nRead more\n][99]\n[\n[Suspension bridge disappearing into dense lavender fog with soft city lights in background.]\ncase study\n\n### How a Top Auto Giant Scaled Developer-Led Security\n\nRead more\n][100]\n[Vertical gradient lines in red and black with large white numbers 2025 on the right.]\n\n### Cyber Workforce\n### Benchmark Report\n\nSee how your organization stacks up against industry peers\n\n[\nDownload the Whitepaper\n][101]\n[Side-by-side profile of a man and a humanoid robot with mechanical details on a dark background.]\n\n### Be Ready For\n### Artificial Intelligence\n\nAI-Driven Cyber Resilience from Immersive Labs\n\n[\nExplore AI at Immersive\n][102]\n\n### Test Your Defences.\n### Pr"
