        "crawl_text": "[\nWebinar: Kuwait NCSC Compliance Roadmap \u00a0Register Today\n][1]\n[Support][2]\n[\n\n### SOLUTIONS\n\n][3]\n[\nOT Asset Management\n][4][\nConfiguration\u00a0& Change Management\n][5][\nPolicy\u00a0Compliance\n][6][\nVulnerability Management\n][7]\n[\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n][8]\n[\nIndustrial\u00a0Defender Platform\n][9][\nServices\n][10][\nPartners\n][11]\n[\n\n### INDUSTRIES\n\n][12]\n[\nPower\n][13][\nOil & Gas\n][14][\nWater\n][15][\nManufacturing\n][16][\nUS Government\n][17][\nSee all\n][18]\n[\n\n### RESOURCES\n\n][19]\n[\nBlog\n][20][\nPodcast\n][21][\nResource Library\n][22][\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][23][\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][24][\nFAQ\n][25]\n[\n\n### COMPANY\n\n][26]\n[\nAbout Us\n][27][\nHow We Compare\n][28][\nTeam\n][29][\nEvents\n][30][\nPress\n][31][\nCareers\n][32][\nContact Us\n][33]\n[\n\n### SUPPORT\n\n][34]\n[\n\n### REQUEST\u00a0DEMO\n\n][35]\n[\nSOLUTIONS\n][36]\n[\nOT Asset Management\n][37]\n[\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][38]\n[\nPolicy\u00a0Compliance\n][39]\n[\nVulnerability Management\n][40]\n[\nPLATFORM\n][41]\n[\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][42]\n[\nServices\n][43]\n[\nPartners\n][44]\n[\nINDUSTRIES\n][45]\n[\nPower\n][46]\n[\nOil & Gas\n][47]\n[\nWater\n][48]\n[\nManufacturing\n][49]\n[\nUS Government\n][50]\n[\nSee all\n][51]\n[\nRESOURCES\n][52]\n[\nBlog\n][53]\n[\nPodcast\n][54]\n[\nResource Library\n][55]\n[\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][56]\n[\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][57]\n[\nDeployment\n][58]\n[\nFAQ\n][59]\n[\nCOMPANY\n][60]\n[\nAbout Us\n][61]\n[\nDeployment\n][62]\n[\nHow We Compare\n][63]\n[\nTeam\n][64]\n[\nEvents\n][65]\n[\nPress\n][66]\n[\nCareers\n][67]\n[\nContact Us\n][68]\n[Request Demo][69]\n\n# Trustworthy OT\u00a0Asset Data Is The Bedrock of Security &\u00a0Compliance\n\n[[Learn How]][70]\nThe #1 Name in OT Cybersecurity\n[Learn more][71]\nWEBINAR\n\n## **Gulf Region OT Cybersecurity Requirements Are Tightening. **Is Your Operation Ready?\n\nGovernments across the Middle East and Gulf region are mandating continuous OT visibility, asset\ninventory, and operational risk management \u2014 moving from periodic audits to always-on compliance.\nIndustrial Defender helps operators meet these requirements today.\n\nJuly 1st , 2026 | 9:00AM EDT\n\n[Register Now][72]\nIn this webinar:\n**Gulf governments are raising the bar.** Kuwait's National Cybersecurity Center Decision No. 2 of\n2026 establishes mandatory baseline controls for critical infrastructure \u2014 with an 18-month\ncompliance window. Saudi Arabia's OTCC is already in force. More frameworks are coming.\n**Continuous visibility is the new minimum standard. Regional frameworks now require persistent\nawareness of OT assets, configurations, vulnerabilities, and network dependencies \u2014 not annual\nsnapshots.**\n**Compliance starts with knowing what you have. Asset inventory is the foundation every other\ncontrol is built on. Industrial Defender delivers it through active OT device communication, not\npassive observation.**\n**Built for the operational realities of the Gulf. Industrial Defender is deployed across oil & gas,\npower generation, and critical infrastructure in the Middle East \u2014 with regional expertise on the\nground.**\n[\nNERC CIP Bootcamp Giveaway \u2013 Enter to Win!\n][73]\n[Support][74]\n[\n\n### SOLUTIONS\n\n][75]\n[\nOT Asset Management\n][76][\nConfiguration\u00a0& Change Management\n][77][\nPolicy\u00a0Compliance\n][78][\nVulnerability Management\n][79]\n[\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n][80]\n[\nIndustrial\u00a0Defender Platform\n][81][\nPhoenix for SMBs\n][82][\nServices\n][83][\nPartners\n][84]\n[\n\n### INDUSTRIES\n\n][85]\n[\nPower\n][86][\nOil & Gas\n][87][\nWater\n][88][\nManufacturing\n][89][\nUS Government\n][90][\nSee all\n][91]\n[\n\n### RESOURCES\n\n][92]\n[\nBlog\n][93][\nPodcast\n][94][\nResource Library\n][95][\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][96][\nInnovations by Industr