l Cybersecurity Center Decision No. 2 of\n2026 establishes mandatory baseline controls for critical infrastructure \u2014 with an 18-month\ncompliance window. Saudi Arabia's OTCC is already in force. More frameworks are coming.\n**Continuous visibility is the new minimum standard. Regional frameworks now require persistent\nawareness of OT assets, configurations, vulnerabilities, and network dependencies \u2014 not annual\nsnapshots.**\n**Compliance starts with knowing what you have. Asset inventory is the foundation every other\ncontrol is built on. Industrial Defender delivers it through active OT device communication, not\npassive observation.**\n**Built for the operational realities of the Gulf. Industrial Defender is deployed across oil & gas,\npower generation, and critical infrastructure in the Middle East \u2014 with regional expertise on the\nground.**\n[\nNERC CIP Bootcamp Giveaway \u2013 Enter to Win!\n][73]\n[Support][74]\n[\n\n### SOLUTIONS\n\n][75]\n[\nOT Asset Management\n][76][\nConfiguration\u00a0& Change Management\n][77][\nPolicy\u00a0Compliance\n][78][\nVulnerability Management\n][79]\n[\n\n### PLATFORM\n\n][80]\n[\nIndustrial\u00a0Defender Platform\n][81][\nPhoenix for SMBs\n][82][\nServices\n][83][\nPartners\n][84]\n[\n\n### INDUSTRIES\n\n][85]\n[\nPower\n][86][\nOil & Gas\n][87][\nWater\n][88][\nManufacturing\n][89][\nUS Government\n][90][\nSee all\n][91]\n[\n\n### RESOURCES\n\n][92]\n[\nBlog\n][93][\nPodcast\n][94][\nResource Library\n][95][\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][96][\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][97][\nFAQ\n][98]\n[\n\n### COMPANY\n\n][99]\n[\nAbout Us\n][100][\nHow We Compare\n][101][\nTeam\n][102][\nEvents\n][103][\nPress\n][104][\nCareers\n][105][\nContact Us\n][106]\n[\n\n### SUPPORT\n\n][107]\n[\n\n### REQUEST\u00a0DEMO\n\n][108]\n[\nSOLUTIONS\n][109]\n[\nOT Asset Management\n][110]\n[\nConfiguration & Change Management\n][111]\n[\nPolicy\u00a0Compliance\n][112]\n[\nVulnerability Management\n][113]\n[\nPLATFORM\n][114]\n[\nIndustrial Defender Platform\n][115]\n[\nPhoenix for SMBs\n][116]\n[\nServices\n][117]\n[\nPartners\n][118]\n[\nINDUSTRIES\n][119]\n[\nPower\n][120]\n[\nOil & Gas\n][121]\n[\nWater\n][122]\n[\nManufacturing\n][123]\n[\nUS Government\n][124]\n[\nSee all\n][125]\n[\nRESOURCES\n][126]\n[\nBlog\n][127]\n[\nPodcast\n][128]\n[\nResource Library\n][129]\n[\nOT Cybersecurity Risk Assessment Calculator\n][130]\n[\nInnovations by Industrial Defender\n][131]\n[\nFAQ\n][132]\n[\nCOMPANY\n][133]\n[\nAbout Us\n][134]\n[\nHow We Compare\n][135]\n[\nTeam\n][136]\n[\nEvents\n][137]\n[\nPress\n][138]\n[\nCareers\n][139]\n[\nContact Us\n][140]\n[[REQUEST DEMO]][141]\n\n# Secure. Monitor.\u00a0Defend.\n\n# Security &\u00a0Compliance For Your ICS/OT\u00a0Enviornment\n\n[See Why][142]\n\n# Risk Based Vulnerability Management for OT\n\n[\n\n### Learn more\n\n][143]\n\n# Achieving NERC CIP Compliance Efficiently\n\n[\n\n### Learn more\n\n][144]\n\n# Meeting Australia\u2019s SOCI/CIRMP Deadlines\n\n[\n\n### Learn more\n\n][145]\nWho we are\n\n## Your Partner in OT Cyber Risk & Compliance\n\nIndustrial Defender has pioneered OT cybersecurity innovations since 2006. In that time, we have\nbecome the cybersecurity partner of choice for critical industries around the world.\n\nHeadquartered outside of Boston, MA, we are a US-based company.\n\n[Learn More About Us][146]\nWho we protect\n\n## We secure the world\u2019s critical industrial assets, including 10 of the top 25 power utilities in\n## North America.\n\nOur stable, cutting-edge platform greatly reduces the risk of a successful cyberattack, something\nthat is more important than ever in today\u2019s world.\n\n[Read customer success stories][147]\nIndustries we serve\n[Building Automation][148][Chemical][149][Critical Manufacturing][150][Electric][151][Federal\nGovernment][152][Food & Agriculture][153][Maritime][154][Metals & Mining][155][Oil &\nGas][156][Pharmaceuticals][157][Rail][158][Water][159]\nWhat our clients say\n\n### \"Since 2012, Industrial Defender has been instrumental in bolstering Xcel Energy's cybersecurity\n### efforts, managing OT assets, and ensuring compliance with NERC CIP, TSA Directive, and internal\n### policies, thereby supporting our delivery of reliable electric and natural gas services to\n### millions of customers.\"\n\nJamey W. Sample\n\u200d**Xcel Energy\n\u200d**Chief Security Officer\nWhat our clients say\n\n### \"We\u2019ve reclaimed 85% of our time switching to Industrial Defender for NERC CIP compliance.\n### Reporting really does work out of the box \u2013 no need for custom coding or messy workarounds to\n### work in our environment.\n### \n### What used to take 5 hours now takes 45 minutes with Industrial Defender\u2019s platform. \"\n\nManager, NERC CIP Compliance at Top US Renewables Company\nWhat customers say\n\n## 99% of our customers stay with us\n\nBecause Industrial Defender is more than just a point solution, customers continue to renew and\nexpand our stable, scalable platform.\n\n\"Other vendors claim they do OT asset management, but Industrial Defender actually IS an asset\nmanagement platform.\"\n\n\u2013 Director of Security at Fortune 500 Oil & Gas Company\n\n\"Industrial Defender\u2019s built"
