        "crawl_text": "[Skip to main content][1]\n[ [Springer Nature Link] ][2]\n[Log in][3]\n[ Menu ][4]\n[ Find a journal ][5] [ Publish with us ][6] [ Track your research ][7]\n[ Search ][8]\n[ Saved research ][9]\n[ Cart ][10]\n\n# Home for all research\n\nSearch for articles, journals, books, authors\nSearch\n[Advanced search][11]\n\n185 million monthly downloads\n\n24 million monthly readers\n\n3 million authors submit annually\n\n## [Discover open access][12]\n\n## [Publish with us][13]\n\n## [Track your research][14]\n\n## Our brands\n* [ [Springer] ][15]\n* [ [Nature Portfolio] ][16]\n* [ [BMC] ][17]\n* [ [Palgrave Macmillan] ][18]\n* [ [Discover] ][19]\n* [ [Apress] ][20]\n\n## Call for papers\n\n[Log in][21] for personalised recommendations.\n\nCollection\n\n### [ Edge-Computing AI for Medical Devices ][22]\n\nElectronic medical devices can be implantables, wearables, and remote. These devices can collect\nvarioius multimodal and multigrain bio-signals invasively or non-invasively. This large\nheterogeneous data from medical devices contains tremendous information that can be analyzed with\nartificial...\n\n*Submission deadline*\n  31 October 2025\n\nCollection\n\n### [ Interruption of Amino Acids Supply as Anti-Tumor Strategy ][23]\n\nThe interruption of amino acids supply has emerged as a promising anti-tumor strategy, with research\nfocusing on the metabolic vulnerabilities of cancer cells. Depletion of essential amino acids\nnecessary for tumor growth has shown potential in inhibiting cancer cell proliferation and inducing\ncell...\n\n*Submission deadline*\n  31 December 2025\n\nCollection\n\n### [ Photothermal Membranes for Water Treatment ][24]\n\nThis topical collection aims to showcase the latest developments in photothermal materials and their\napplications in solar-driven water treatment and desalination technologies. The journal will publish\ninnovative research on the design, synthesis, and performance evaluation of various photothermal...\n\n*Submission deadline*\n  23 June 2025\n[ See all calls for papers ][25]\n\n## Trending research\n\n[The Iceman\u2019s microbiome: unveiling millennia of microbial diversity and continuity]\n\nResearch\n\n### [The Iceman\u2019s microbiome: unveiling millennia of microbial diversity and continuity][26]\n\n[Microbiome][27]\n\n[Open access][28]\n\n[A direct black-hole mass measurement in a little red dot at high redshift]\n\nArticle\n\n### [A direct black-hole mass measurement in a little red dot at high redshift][29]\n\n[Nature][30]\n\n[Open access][31]\n\n[Architectural and geotechnical aspects affecting earthquake resilience for the antique Egyptian\nKhufu pyramid]\n\nArticle\n\n### [Architectural and geotechnical aspects affecting earthquake resilience for the antique Egyptian\n### Khufu pyramid][32]\n\n[Scientific Reports][33]\n\n[Open access][34]\n\n[Induction of cortical on/off periods in awake mice fulfills sleep functions]\n\nArticle\n\n### [Induction of cortical on/off periods in awake mice fulfills sleep functions][35]\n\n[Nature Neuroscience][36]\n\n[Open access][37]\n\n[Individual locomotor bias drives counterclockwise motion in pedestrian crowds]\n\nArticle\n\n### [Individual locomotor bias drives counterclockwise motion in pedestrian crowds][38]\n\n[Nature Communications][39]\n\n[Open access][40]\n\n## Featured journals\n* [Artificial Intelligence Review]\n  \n  ### [Artificial Intelligence Review][41]\n  \n  Artificial Intelligence Review is a fully open access journal publishing state-of-the-art research\n  in artificial intelligence and cognitive science.\n  \n* [Discover Sustainability]\n  \n  ### [Discover Sustainability][42]\n  \n  Discover Sustainability is an open access journal publishing research across all fields relevant\n  to sustainability.\n  \n* [Journal of Epidemiology and Global Health]\n  \n  ### [Journal of Epidemiology and Global Health][43]\n  \n  The Journal of Epidemiology and Global Health is an international peer reviewed journal