        "crawl_text": "* [Q360][1]\n* [GSA Advantage][2]\n* [VAHMS Portal][3]\n* [Service Requests][4]\n* [1-855-790-0638][5]\n[ [M3T Corporation logo] ][6]\n* [ About M3T ][7]\n  [Mission & Values][8] [M3T Insight][9] [Join Our Team][10] [Warranty][11]\n* [Products & Solutions][12]\n* [Industries][13]\n* [ Contact Us ][14]\n  [Contact Us][15] [Service Requests][16]\n* [Securing government facilities]\n* [Smart security for safer hospitals]\n* [Keeping students safe]\n\n## Who We Are\n\nAt M3T Corporation, we are dedicated to providing innovative and reliable physical security\nsolutions that safeguard what matters most\u2014your people, assets, and operations. Since our founding,\nwe have been at the forefront of security technology, delivering customized systems that integrate\nseamlessly into your environment while meeting the unique challenges of healthcare, education,\ngovernment, and corporate sectors.\n\nWe specialize in advanced security cameras, access control systems, turnstiles, and door controls,\ncreating comprehensive solutions that provide peace of mind and operational efficiency.\n\nOur team of experts is committed to understanding your specific needs, designing, and implementing\nsystems that go beyond protection to enhance productivity and compliance.\n\nAt M3T Corporation, security isn\u2019t just a service\u2014it\u2019s our mission. By combining cutting-edge\ntechnology with unparalleled expertise, we empower organizations to stay ahead of evolving security\nthreats and build trust within their communities.\n\nChoose M3T Corporation as your security partner and experience the difference in safety, innovation,\nand reliability.\n\n[Star icon]\n\n## Our Expertise\n\n**We\u2019re leading security experts.**\n\nWe specialize in providing world-class integrated security and technology solutions customized to\nfit your needs. Our systems save valuable resources and maximize your time and investments.\n\n[Arrow icon]\n\n## Our Approach\n\n**We\u2019re dedicated to serving our customers.**\n\nWe prioritize a deep understanding of our clients\u2019 unique needs, ensuring optimal solutions without\ncompromising quality. We deliver value driven solutions, every time.\n\n[Bullseye icon]\n\n## Our Commitment\n\n**We\u2019re committed to securing our clients\u2019 security.**\n\nWe secure our clients\u2019 personnel, property, and assets while fostering an environment of safety and\nprotection. We focus on cost reduction, enhancing profitability, and risk mitigation for our\nclients.\n\n### Our Expertise, Approach, and Commitment Adds up to\u2026\n\n## Your Assurance\n\n### Comprehensive security, expertly managed through our Managed Services.\n\nWith our expert team we provide a comprehensive, proactive approach to security. We take full\nresponsibility for your security infrastructure, ensuring it\u2019s continuously optimized, resilient,\nand always up to date. By entrusting us with the complexities of security management, you can focus\non driving your business forward while enjoying the peace of mind that comes with a robust, fully\nprotected environment.\n\n**With 24/7 monitoring, rapid response, and strategic insights, our Managed Services give you an\nunparalleled edge in safeguarding your critical assets.**\n\n### Products & Solutions\n\n[RFID card reader]\n[ **Access Control** ][17]\n\nDigital gatekeepers for your business.\n\n[Barrier arm]\n[ **Entry Systems** ][18]\n\nControl and security at every entry point.\n\n[Intercom]\n[ **Intercom Technology** ][19]\n\nRevolutionize communication and security with IP intercom technology.\n\n[Security system controller]\n[ **Intrusion Detection** ][20]\n\nProactive protection for your property.\n\n[Surveillance camera in parking garage]\n[ **Visual Intelligence** ][21]\n\nHarness the power of video surveillance for ultimate business security.\n\n### Benefits of the Edge\n\nAct instantly to protect people and property and make the right decisions about your operations.\nAxis analytics solutions give you easy access to actionable insights based on video, audio, and\nother data. How? With the widest range of flexible, scalable analytics on the market \u2013 with a focus\non the edge.\n\nAnalyzing video on the edge (in the camera) has many benefits. It makes systems with many cameras\neasier to scale because you don\u2019t have to add servers when you add cameras. In smaller systems,\nanalytics on the edge can eliminate the need for an on-site server all together.\n\n## On-Premises vs. Cloud-Hosted: Understanding the True Cost\n\nWhen evaluating on-premises versus cloud-hosted solutions, it\u2019s crucial to assess both visible and\nhidden costs. This includes labor, power, server maintenance, software licenses, upgrades, unplanned\noutages, and the physical space for on-premises infrastructure. By quantifying both fixed and\nvariable costs, you can make a more informed decision that reflects the full financial impact of\neach option.\n\n[Lenel S2 info graphic]\n\n## Our Technology Partners\n\n[Loader Image]\n[Acre]\n[Allegion]\n[Arcules]\n[Assa Abloy]\n[Avigilon]\n[Axis]\n[Bosch]\n[DAQ]\n[DMP]\n[HID]\n[Honeywell]\n[Lenel]\n[Milestone]\n[Salto]\n[Vahms]\n* [Home |][22]\n* [Products & Solutions * [Q360][1]\n* [GSA Advantage][2]\n* [VAHMS Portal][3]\n* [Service Requests][4]\n* [1-855-790-0638][5]\n[ [M3T Corporation logo] ][6]\n* [ About M3T ][7]\n  [Mission & Values][8] [M3T Insight][9] [Join Our Team][10] [Warranty][11]\n* [Products & Solutions][12]\n* [Industries][13]\n* [ Contact Us ][14]\n  [Contact Us][15] [Service Requests][16]\n* [Securing government facilities]\n* [Smart security for safer hospitals]\n* [Keeping students safe]\n\n## Who We Are\n\nAt M3T Corporation, we are dedicated to providing innovative and reliable physical security\nsolutions that safeguard what matters most\u2014your people, assets, and operations. Since our founding,\nwe have been at the forefront of security technology, delivering customized systems that integrate\nseamlessly into your environment while meeting the unique challenges of healthcare, education,\ngovernment, and corporate sectors.\n\nWe specialize in advanced security cameras, access control systems, turnstiles, and door controls,\ncreating comprehensive solutions that provide peace of mind and operational efficiency.\n\nOur team of experts is committed to understanding your specific needs, designing, and implementing\nsystems that go beyond protection to enhance productivity and compliance.\n\nAt M3T Corporation, security isn\u2019t just a service\u2014it\u2019s our mission. By combining cutting-edge\ntechnology with unparalleled expertise, we empower organizations to stay ahead of evolving security\nthreats and build trust within their communities.\n\nChoose M3T Corporation as your security partner and experience the difference in safety, innovation,\nand reliability.\n\n[Star icon]\n\n## Our Expertise\n\n**We\u2019re leading security experts.**\n\nWe specialize in providing world-class integrated security and technology solutions customized to\nfit your needs. Our systems save valuable resources and maximize your time and investments.\n\n[Arrow icon]\n\n## Our Approach\n\n**We\u2019re dedicated to serving our customers.**\n\nWe prioritize a deep understanding of our clients\u2019 unique needs, ensuring optimal solutions without\ncompromising quality. We deliver value driven solutions, every time.\n\n[Bullseye icon]\n\n## Our Commitment\n\n**We\u2019re committed to securing our clients\u2019 security.**\n\nWe secure our clients\u2019 personnel, property, and assets while fostering an environment of safety and\nprotection. We focus on cost reduction, enhancing profitability, and risk mitigation for our\nclients.\n\n### Our Expertise, Approach, and Commitment Adds up to\u2026\n\n## Your Assurance\n\n### Comprehensive security, expertly managed through our Managed Services.\n\nWith our expert team we provide a comprehensive, proactive approach to security. We take full\nresponsibility for your security infrastructure, ensuring it\u2019s continuously optimized, resilient,\nand always up to date. By entrusting us with the complexities of security management, you can focus\non driving your business forward while enjoying the peace of mind that comes with a robust, fully\nprotected environment.\n\n**With 24/7 monitoring, rapid response, and strategic insights, our Managed Services give you an\nunparalleled edge in safeguarding your critical assets.**\n\n### Products & Solutions\n\n[RFID card reader]\n[ **Access Control** ][17]\n\nDigital gatekeepers for your business.\n\n[Barrier arm]\n[ **Entry Systems** ][18]\n\nControl and security at every entry point.\n\n[Intercom]\n[ **Intercom Technology** ][19]\n\nRevolutionize communication and security with IP intercom technology.\n\n[Security system controller]\n[ **Intrusion Detection** ][20]\n\nProactive protection for your property.\n\n[Surveillance camera in parking garage]\n[ **Visual Intelligence** ][21]\n\nHarness the power of video surveillance for ultimate business security.\n\n### Benefits of the Edge\n\nAct instantly to protect people and property and make the right decisions about your operations.\nAxis analytics solutions give you easy access to actionable insights based on video, audio, and\nother data. How? With the widest range of flexible, scalable analytics on the market \u2013 with a focus\non the edge.\n\nAnalyzing video on the edge (in the camera) has many benefits. It makes systems with many cameras\neasier to scale because you don\u2019t have to add servers when you add cameras. In smaller systems,\nanalytics on the edge can eliminate the need for an on-site server all together.\n\n## On-Premises vs. Cloud-Hosted: Understanding the True Cost\n\nWhen evaluating on-premises versus cloud-hosted solutions, it\u2019s crucial to assess both visible and\nhidden costs. This includes labor, power, server maintenance, software licenses, upgrades, unplanned\noutages, and the physical space for on-premises infrastructure. By quantifying both fixed and\nvariable costs, you can make a more informed decision that reflects the full financial impact of\neach option.\n\n[Lenel S2 info graphic]\n\n## Our Technology Partners\n\n[Loader Image]\n[Acre]\n[Allegion]\n[Arcules]\n[Assa Abloy]\n[Avigilon]\n[Axis]\n[Bosch]\n[DAQ]\n[DMP]\n[HID]\n[Honeywell]\n[Lenel]\n[Milestone]\n[Salto]\n[Vahms]\n* [Home |][22]\n* [Products & Solutions |][23]\n* [Industries |][24]\n* [Contact Us][25]\n[M3T Corporation logo]\n\nM3T Corporation is a veteran-owned small business focused on providing our clients with professional\nsecurity consulting, solution design, and implementation both in the physical and cyber security\nrealms.\n\n## State Licenses\n* Pennsylvania HIC #PA051743\n* Virginia DCJS #11-7409\n* Delaware #2012605899\n* Maryland #107-1870\n* West Virginia #9A0M2\n* Washington DC #400324802816\n\n## Teamviewer\n* [Teamviewer Host][26]\n* [Teamviewer Quick Support][27]\n\n## Get In Touch\n* [1-855-790-0638][28]\n* [connect@m3tcorporation.com][29]\n* Branches Located in PA and VA\n\n## Social Media\n\n## JOIN OUR MAILING LIST\n\nEMAIL ADDRESS *\nFIRST NAME\nLAST NAME\n\n## Professional Certifications and Licenses\n* ACP: Axis Certified Professional\n* CPP: Certified Protection Professional\n* PSP: Physical Security Professional\n* PMP: Project Manager Professional\n* PASS: Certified Partner Alliance for Safer Schools\n* CSEIP: Certified System Engineer ICAM PACS\n* Security+: CompTIA Security+ Certification\n\n[ [VOSB Logo] ][30]\n[ [GSA Logo] ][31]\n* \u00a9 2026 M3T Corporation\n* [Privacy Policy & Terms of Use][32]\n* [Sitemap][33]\n\n[1]: https://q360.m3tcorporation.com/controller.php?action=login\n[2]: https://www.gsaelibrary.gsa.gov/ElibMain/contractorInfo.do?contractNumber=GS-07F-5494R&contract\norName=M3T+CORPORATION&executeQuery=YES\n[3]: https://www.m3tcorporation.com/vahms/mym3tcorp/\n[4]: https://www.m3tcorporation.com/service-reque