 Frost Radar\u2122 for Managed Detection & Response\n\nLearn more\n][83]\n\nCustomer stories\n\n## Helping 11k+ global companies take command of their attack surface\n\n[arcadis.svg]Arcadis\n[evri.svg]EVRi\n[aaa-logo.svg]AAA Northeast\n[chemung.svg]Chemung Canal Trust Company\n[lake-city-bank-black-and-white.png]Lake City Bank\n\nServices\n\n### Goodbye downtime, blind spots, and black boxes: Inside Arcadis' journey\n\n24/7\n\nMDR support\n\n[Read Arcadis' story][84]\n[Play Video]\n[Vidyard video]\n\nServices\n\n### How Rapid7 partnered with EVRi to transform their workflows\n\n100%\n\nautomated malicious domain takedown\n\n[Read EVRi's story][85]\n[Play Video]\n[Vidyard video]\n\nfinance\n\n### How AAA Northeast wins the 24/7 battle to protect its members\n\n24/7\n\nMDR Support\n\n[Read AAA Northeast's story][86]\n[Play Video]\n[Vidyard video]\n\nfinance\n\n### Banking on trust: How Chemung Canal Trust Company fortifies security with Rapid7\n\n24/7\n\nMDR Support\n\n[Read Chemung Canal Trust's story][87]\n[Play Video]\n[Vidyard video]\n\nfinance\n\n### Rapid7 helps Lake City Bank stay one step ahead of attackers\n\nEnd-to-End visibility of the attack surface\n\n[Read Lake City Bank's story][88]\n[Play Video]\n[Vidyard video]\n[Play Video]\n[Vidyard video]\n\nServices\n\n[Company Logo]\n\n### Goodbye downtime, blind spots, and black boxes: Inside Arcadis' journey\n\n24/7\n\nMDR support\n\n[Read Arcadis' story][89]\n[Play Video]\n[Vidyard video]\n\nServices\n\n[Company Logo]\n\n### How Rapid7 partnered with EVRi to transform their workflows\n\n100%\n\nautomated malicious domain takedown\n\n[Read EVRi's story][90]\n[Play Video]\n[Vidyard video]\n\nfinance\n\n[Company Logo]\n\n### How AAA Northeast wins the 24/7 battle to protect its members\n\n24/7\n\nMDR Support\n\n[Read AAA Northeast's story][91]\n[Play Video]\n[Vidyard video]\n\nfinance\n\n[Company Logo]\n\n### Banking on trust: How Chemung Canal Trust Company fortifies security with Rapid7\n\n24/7\n\nMDR Support\n\n[Read Chemung Canal Trust's story][92]\n[Play Video]\n[Vidyard video]\n\nfinance\n\n[Company Logo]\n\n### Rapid7 helps Lake City Bank stay one step ahead of attackers\n\nEnd-to-End visibility of the attack surface\n\n[Read Lake City Bank's story][93]\n[Go to Customer Stories][94]\n\n## Rapid7 security and research expertise\n\nRapid7 Labs\n\n### Threat intelligence and research\n\nImprove your security program with emergent threat response, proprietary intelligence, research, and\nadversary insights - all curated by Rapid7 Labs and deployed across our portfolio of solutions and\nservices.\n\n[GET INSIGHTS][95]\n[promo-rapid"
