        "crawl_text": "[\n[site-logo]\n][1]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\n[\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][2]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[\n[site-logo]\n][3]\n[\n[site-logo]\n][4]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\n[\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][5]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n\nWelcome to Shieldworkz, experts in OT Security for critical infrastructure\n\n# Delivering Holistic\n# Cyber-Physical System (CPS) Security Solutions & Services\n\n# Delivering Holistic\n# Cyber-Physical System (CPS) Security Solutions & Services\n\nWe deliver agentic-AI powered infrastructure protection through OT security solutions such as\nNetwork Detection and Response, backed by managed security services including in-depth risk\nassessments, compliance services, incident response, and expert consulting. When it comes to\nmanaging threats, lowering risk exposure, building new Security Operations Centers or offering\nSOC-as-a-Service, Shieldworkz delivers unmatched OT security value to your business.\n\nWe deliver agentic-AI powered infrastructure protection through OT security solutions such as\nNetwork Detection and Response, backed by managed security services including in-depth risk\nassessments, compliance services, incident response, and expert consulting. When it comes to\nmanaging threats, lowering risk exposure, building new Security Operations Centers or offering\nSOC-as-a-Service, Shieldworkz delivers unmatched OT security value to your business.\n\n[\n\nGet Started\n\n][6]\n[Cybersecurity logo]\n[\n[Shieldworkz - threat report]\n[Shieldworkz - threat report]\n[Shieldworkz - threat report]\n][7]\n\n## Shieldworkz enhances your OT security defenses against\n## the most sophisticated threats\n\n## Shieldworkz enhances your OT security defenses against\n## the most sophisticated threats\n\n**Comprehensive ICS, OT & IoT protection**\nWe safeguard your cyber-physical systems with end-to-end security solutions and consulting services\nthat reduce risk and ensure compliance with regulatory mandates, empowering you to run operations\nwith confidence and control.\n\n## Shieldworkz enhances your OT security defenses against\n## the most sophisticated threats\n\n**Comprehensive ICS, OT & IoT protection**\nWe safeguard your cyber-physical systems with end-to-end security solutions and consulting services\nthat reduce risk and ensure compliance with regulatory mandates, empowering you to run operations\nwith confidence and control.\n\n## Shieldworkz enhances your OT security defenses against\n## the most sophisticated threats\n\n**Comprehensive ICS, OT & IoT protection**\nWe safeguard your cyber-physical systems with end-to-end security solutions and consulting services\nthat reduce risk and ensure compliance with regulatory mandates, empowering you to run operations\nwith confidence and control.\n\n[\n[Strategic advisory services]\n\n#### Consulting Services\n\nOur IEC 62443, NIS2, NIST SP 800-82 and CISA-aligned OT security consulting offerings are designed\nto maximize uptime, boost asset visibility and strengthen infrastructure resilience.\n\nLearn More\n\n][8][\n[IoT security products]\n\n#### CPS Security Products\n\nOur OT security platform and other security solutions are uniquely engineered to defend your\ncyber-physical systems from external and internal threats and to keep operations running safely.\n\nLearn More\n\n][9]\n[\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][10]\n[Shieldworkz icon]\n\n## Why Shieldworkz\n\n###### Secure your operations with leading-edge Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS) security.\n\nAgentic AI-powered OT/ICS NDR platform that adapts to evolving threats\n\nAccurate asset inventory with highest level of visibility across classes\n\nContextual managed incident response services to neutralize threats\n\nRegulatory confidence to meet compliance mandates without guesswork\n\nScalable architecture that grows with your expanding OT footprint\n\n24/7 real-time monitoring and incident response for uninterrupted operations\n\n[Shieldworkz icon]\n\n## Why Shieldworkz\n\n###### Secure your operations with leading-edge Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS) security.\n\nAgentic AI-powered OT/ICS NDR platform that adapts to evolving threats\n\nAccurate asset inventory with highest level of visibility across classes\n\nContextual managed incident response services to neutralize threats\n\nRegulatory confidence to meet compliance mandates without guesswork\n\nScalable architecture that grows with your expanding OT footprint\n\n24/7 real-time monitoring and incident response for uninterrupted operations\n\n[Monitor ICS traffic]\n\n### Widest OT Security Coverage\n\n#### Widest OT Security Coverage\n\nShieldworkz\u2019s NDR platform maps and monitors every bit of your operational landscape, from legacy\nPLCs, Distributed Control Systems, HMIs\u00a0and SCADA networks to modern IoT sensors and industrial\nrouters. We continuously discover and fingerprint new assets, inspect traffic patterns, and flag\nanomalies, ensuring your entire OT infrastructure remains resilient against cyberattacks, hidden\nvulnerabilities, and insider risks.\n\n[Strengthen OT threat defenses]\n\n### AI-Based Industrial Sec [\n[site-logo]\n][1]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\n[\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][2]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n[\n[site-logo]\n][3]\n[\n[site-logo]\n][4]\n\nOThello\n\nServices\n\nProducts\n\nIndustries\n\nResources\n\nCompany\n\n[\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][5]\nSelect LanguageEnglish\n\nWelcome to Shieldworkz, experts in OT Security for critical infrastructure\n\n# Delivering Holistic\n# Cyber-Physical System (CPS) Security Solutions & Services\n\n# Delivering Holistic\n# Cyber-Physical System (CPS) Security Solutions & Services\n\nWe deliver agentic-AI powered infrastructure protection through OT security solutions such as\nNetwork Detection and Response, backed by managed security services including in-depth risk\nassessments, compliance services, incident response, and expert consulting. When it comes to\nmanaging threats, lowering risk exposure, building new Security Operations Centers or offering\nSOC-as-a-Service, Shieldworkz delivers unmatched OT security value to your business.\n\nWe deliver agentic-AI powered infrastructure protection through OT security solutions such as\nNetwork Detection and Response, backed by managed security services including in-depth risk\nassessments, compliance services, incident response, and expert consulting. When it comes to\nmanaging threats, lowering risk exposure, building new Security Operations Centers or offering\nSOC-as-a-Service, Shieldworkz delivers unmatched OT security value to your business.\n\n[\n\nGet Started\n\n][6]\n[Cybersecurity logo]\n[\n[Shieldworkz - threat report]\n[Shieldworkz - threat report]\n[Shieldworkz - threat report]\n][7]\n\n## Shieldworkz enhances your OT security defenses against\n## the most sophisticated threats\n\n## Shieldworkz enhances your OT security defenses against\n## the most sophisticated threats\n\n**Comprehensive ICS, OT & IoT protection**\nWe safeguard your cyber-physical systems with end-to-end security solutions and consulting services\nthat reduce risk and ensure compliance with regulatory mandates, empowering you to run operations\nwith confidence and control.\n\n## Shieldworkz enhances your OT security defenses against\n## the most sophisticated threats\n\n**Comprehensive ICS, OT & IoT protection**\nWe safeguard your cyber-physical systems with end-to-end security solutions and consulting services\nthat reduce risk and ensure compliance with regulatory mandates, empowering you to run operations\nwith confidence and control.\n\n## Shieldworkz enhances your OT security defenses against\n## the most sophisticated threats\n\n**Comprehensive ICS, OT & IoT protection**\nWe safeguard your cyber-physical systems with end-to-end security solutions and consulting services\nthat reduce risk and ensure compliance with regulatory mandates, empowering you to run operations\nwith confidence and control.\n\n[\n[Strategic advisory services]\n\n#### Consulting Services\n\nOur IEC 62443, NIS2, NIST SP 800-82 and CISA-aligned OT security consulting offerings are designed\nto maximize uptime, boost asset visibility and strengthen infrastructure resilience.\n\nLearn More\n\n][8][\n[IoT security products]\n\n#### CPS Security Products\n\nOur OT security platform and other security solutions are uniquely engineered to defend your\ncyber-physical systems from external and internal threats and to keep operations running safely.\n\nLearn More\n\n][9]\n[\n\nRequest a demo\n\n][10]\n[Shieldworkz icon]\n\n## Why Shieldworkz\n\n###### Secure your operations with leading-edge Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS) security.\n\nAgentic AI-powered OT/ICS NDR platform that adapts to evolving threats\n\nAccurate asset inventory with highest level of visibility across classes\n\nContextual managed incident response services to neutralize threats\n\nRegulatory confidence to meet compliance mandates without guesswork\n\nScalable architecture that grows with your expanding OT footprint\n\n24/7 real-time monitoring and incident response for uninterrupted operations\n\n[Shieldworkz icon]\n\n## Why Shieldworkz\n\n###### Secure your operations with leading-edge Cyber-Physical Systems (CPS) security.\n\nAgentic AI-powered OT/ICS NDR platform that adapts to evolving threats\n\nAccurate asset inventory with highest level of visibility across classes\n\nContextual managed incident response services to neutralize threats\n\nRegulatory confidence to meet compliance mandates without guesswork\n\nScalable architecture that grows with your expanding OT footprint\n\n24/7 real-time monitoring and incident response for uninterrupted operations\n\n[Monitor ICS traffic]\n\n### Widest OT Security Coverage\n\n#### Widest OT Security Coverage\n\nShieldworkz\u2019s NDR platform maps and monitors every bit of your operational landscape, from legacy\nPLCs, Distributed Control Systems, HMIs\u00a0and SCADA networks to modern IoT sensors and industrial\nrouters. We continuously discover and fingerprint new assets, inspect traffic patterns, and flag\nanomalies, ensuring your entire OT infrastructure remains resilient against cyberattacks, hidden\nvulnerabilities, and insider risks.\n\n[Strengthen OT threat defenses]\n\n### AI-Based Industrial Security\n\n#### AI-Based Industrial Security\n\nOur advanced machine learning models learn what \u201cnormal\u201d looks like in your facility, spotting\nsubtle deviations accurately well before they escalate. By ingesting live data from PLCs, RTUs, and\nedge devices, Shieldworkz delivers predictive IEC 62443 and NIS2\u2013aligned risk assessments. Automated\nincident response and smart threat hunting keep your industrial environment secure and risk free.\n\n[Defend operational devices proactively]\n\n### Lowest Deployment Time\n\n#### Lowest Deployment Time\n\nGo from zero to protected in hours, not weeks. Shieldworkz installs lightweight agents and passive\nsensors faster without interrupting operations. Automated asset discovery, agents AI supervision and\nprebuilt security profiles let you begin monitoring immediately, delivering faster time-to-value and\nensuring your OT and IoT assets stay safe from day one.\n\n## Shieldworkz secures every layer of your\n## industrial ecosystem\n\n## Shieldworkz secures every bit of your industrial operations\n\nFrom legacy PLCs and SCADA systems to remote sites, sensors, controllers, assembly lines, and\nnetworking gear, we safeguard both physical and digital processes. No matter how complex your\nenvironment, whether you run edge IIoT deployments or traditional OT infrastructure, Shieldworkz\ndelivers end-to-end protection to keep operations reliable and uninterrupted.\n* Physical and industrial processes\u00a0\n* Industrial networking equipment\n* Remote sites\u00a0\n* Legacy systems\u00a0\n* SCADA architectures\n* Industrial IoT Devices\n* Industrial Protocols\n* ICS Workstations\n\n[CPS threat-mitigation products BG]\n\nProtecting OT environments globally\n\n## Built for the biggest OT operators across verticals\n\n### Built for the biggest OT operators across verticals\n\nAirports\n\nOil & Gas\n\nManufacturing\n\n[big-logo]\n\nUtilities\n\nTransportation\n\nSmart Cities\n\nAirports\n\nOil & Gas\n\nManufacturing\n\n[big-logo]\n\nUtilities\n\nTransportation\n\nSmart Cities\n\n# Industry Use Cases\n\n[Energy Sector]\n\nPower & Uti"
