ship][89] Leadership\n    * [Careers][90] Careers\n  * PROMOTIONS\n    * [SonicWall Promotions][91]SonicWall Promotions\n    * [Customer Loyalty Program][92]Customer Loyalty Program\n  * MANAGED SERVICES\n    * [Managed Security Services][93]Managed Security Services\n    * [Security as a Service][94]Security as a Service\n    * [Professional Services][95]Professional Services\n[Contact Sales][96]\nSonicWall 2026 Cyber Protect Report is Here!\nDiscover the Seven Deadly Sins of Cybersecurity\n[Download Now!][97]\n\n# Delivering security outcomes\n# that matter.\n\nAt\u00a0SonicWall, we believe cybersecurity should be measured by business outcomes, not just by the\nlength of a feature list.\u00a0\n\nBecause here\u2019s the hard truth: businesses don\u2019t fail because they lacked technology. They fail\nbecause technology wasn\u2019t configured, managed or aligned to real-world outcomes.\n\nIt\u2019s time to move beyond the feature arms race. We are.\u00a0\n\n[Become a Partner][98][Read the Blog][99]\n\n## SonicWall powers the next era of outcome-driven security.\n\nSecure\n\n##### Security that delivers real protection, for SMBs and beyond.\n\nNext generation firewalls and Cloud Secure Edge (CSE) deliver advanced, policy-driven protection for\ndistributed networks. The new Managed Protection Security Suite (MPSS) bundle, backed by\nSonicSentry, ensures firewalls are properly configured, deployed, and updated for maximum threat\nprotection.\n\nSecure\n\n[Network Security][100]\n[ Managed Protection Security Suite (MPSS)][101]\n[Cloud Secure Edge (CSE)][102]\n[Network Security][103]\n\nScalable\n\n##### Security that thinks ahead, so your business doesn\u2019t fall behind.\n\nA multi-tenant architecture and flexible deployment options allow businesses and MSPs to efficiently\nexpand while managing multiple environments from a single dashboard.\n\nScalable\n\n[Network Security Manager][104]\n[Network Security Manager][105]\n\nSmart\n\n##### Protection that grows with your business, while eliminating complexity.\n\nSonicWall Unified Management is your smart, cloud-native hub for unified management, and we proudly\nintroduce SAMI, our embedded AI to simplify operations, resolve issues faster, and silence the\nnoise.\n\nSmart\n\n[SonicWall Unified Management][106]\n[SonicWall AI for Monitoring & Insight (SAMI)][107]\n[SonicWall Unified Management][108]\n\nSecu"
