        "crawl_text": "[[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n[\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\nINDUSTRY-FOCUSED INNOVATION\n\n# Modern Cloud Finance Solutions for Modern Enterprises\n\nTransform your finance function with cloud-driven solutions that comply with the latest regulations,\nseamlessly integrate data, automate workflows, and accelerate decision-making.\n\n[TRG Solutions: Harmonizing Your Business]\n[[On-demand webinar \u2014 Stop closing books the hard way]][11]\n[[Driving financial efficiency in logistics \u2014 research paper]][12]\n\n# Invoice Processing Cost Calculator\n\nCalculate how much your business can save when automating invoice processing.\n\n[How to Calculate][13]\n[Invoice processing automation]\nABOUT US\n\n## TRG International Is A Global Market-Leading Solutions Provider, Focused on Delivering Technical\n## Excellence\n\nTRG partners with global organisations to deliver innovative cloud financial management solutions\nand HR assessments to 1,000+ customers worldwide. Our goal is to help modernise and automate your\ncore business processes, thus reducing your reliance on manual spreadsheets.\n\n### +\n\nYears in Business\n\n### +\n\nHappy Clients\n\n### +\n\nImplementation Man-hours a Year\n\n### +\n\nCountries Global Footprint\n\n[More About Us][14][TRG 101 Brochure][15]\nWHAT WE DO\n\n## Transforming Your Business with Tailored Solutions\n\n[\n[Infor SunSystems Cloud]\n\n### Infor SunSystems Cloud\n\nA flexible, multi-currency, multi-accounting financial management solution that simplifies complex\nfinance processes.\n\nLearn More\n][16]\n[\n[Infor Q&A]\n\n### Infor Q&A\n\nA powerful ad-hoc query and BI tool with Excel integration, purpose-built to drill down for deeper\nanalysis.\n\nLearn More\n][17]\n[\n[Infor EPM]\n\n### Infor EPM\n\nA robust solution suite for financial budgeting, forecasting, and planning, with built-in scenario\nmodeling, what-if analysis, and more.\n\nLearn More\n][18]\n[\n[Infor OS]\n\n### Infor OS\n\nUnify TRG and Infor's ecosystem, orchestrating workflows, enabling single sign-on, AI insights, and\nseamless data flow.\n\nLearn More\n][19]\n[\n[Yooz]\n\n### Yooz\n\nCloud-native and AI-driven P2P automation that streamlines invoice capture all the way to payments.\n\nLearn More\n][20]\n[\n[Unifi]\n\n### Unifi\n\nUnified process automation platform that connects your finance, TMS, WMS, procurement, and\noperations.\n\nLearn More\n][21]\n[\n[SySynkt]\n\n### SySynkt\n\nExtend your financial core further with automated expenses management and bank connectivity.\n\nLearn More\n][22]\n[\n[CS Lucas]\n\n### CS Lucas\n\nEffectively manage treasury, liquidity, cash flow, risks, hedging, and asset financing oversight.\n\nLearn More\n][23]\n[\n[End-User Training]\n\n### End-User Training\n\nRecall and certification and training platform specifically developed for end-users.\n\nLearn More\n][24]\n[\n[Great People Inside]\n\n### Great People Inside\n\nNo-nonsense certification and training platform for talent with customisable psychometric\nassessments, packed with data-driven behavioural insights.\n\nLearn More\n][25]\n[View All Solutions][26]\n[Industries we serve]\nINDUSTRIES WE SERVE\n\n## Solving Business Challenges In Every Industry, Every Day\n\n[\n\n### Insurance\n\nSimplify claims, improve compliance, and optimize financial reporting.\n\nExplore\n][27]\n[\n\n### Healthcare\n\nConnect clinical, financial, and operational data to improve patient experiences, lower costs, and\nenable value-based care.\n\nExplore\n][28]\n[\n\n### Manufacturing\n\nStreamline order-to-report process, optimize costs and inventory for greater efficiency.\n\nExplore\n][29]\n[\n\n### Real Estate\n\nStreamline property finances, manage investments, and maximize portfolios.\n\nExplore\n][30]\n[\n\n### Energy\n\nTrack, manage asset lifecycle and ensure financial sustainability in a dynamic market.\n\nExplore\n][31]\n[\n\n### Construction\n\nStay on top of construction projects and gain full visibility into cash flows.\n\nExplore\n][32]\n[\n\n### Hospitality\n\nSolutions for hotels, restaurants, F&B services, and casinos. Evolve at the pace of hospitality with\nan advanced, integrated, cloud-based platform.\n\nExplore\n][33]\n[\n\n### Education\n\nGain visibility and transparency into every funding and revenue stream so you can optimize costs and\nreport to relevant stakeholders with ease.\n\nExplore\n][34]\n[\n\n### Financial Services\n\nOptimize compliance, reporting, and profitability with streamlined finances.\n\nExplore\n][35]\n[\n\n### Logistics\n\nOptimize every link in your supply chain with integrated intelligence and real-time financial\nclarity.\n\nExplore\n][36]\n\n## Hear from our customers about how TRG International is helping them achieve their business goals.\n\nAll\nLATEST EVENTS\n\n## Upcoming Events & Webinars\n\nJoin our latest webinars, workshops, and live sessions to stay ahead of finance and digital\ntransformation trends.\n* [\n  [\u0110\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu li\u00ean c\u00f4ng ty: T\u1ed1i \u01b0u giao d\u1ecbch \u2013 Ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n]May 28, 2026\n  On-demand WebinarSunSystems\n  \n  ### \u0110\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu li\u00ean c\u00f4ng ty: T\u1ed1i \u01b0u giao d\u1ecbch \u2013 Ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n\n  \n  Trong b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh [[TRG International Logo]][1]\n[[TRG International Logo]][2]\n[\n\nSolutions\n\n][3]\n[Resources][4]\n[Stories][5]\n[Events][6]\n[About us][7]\n[Careers][8]\n[Watch Demo][9][Get in Touch][10]\nEnglish\nINDUSTRY-FOCUSED INNOVATION\n\n# Modern Cloud Finance Solutions for Modern Enterprises\n\nTransform your finance function with cloud-driven solutions that comply with the latest regulations,\nseamlessly integrate data, automate workflows, and accelerate decision-making.\n\n[TRG Solutions: Harmonizing Your Business]\n[[On-demand webinar \u2014 Stop closing book