ce, reporting, and profitability with streamlined finances.\n\nExplore\n][35]\n[\n\n### Logistics\n\nOptimize every link in your supply chain with integrated intelligence and real-time financial\nclarity.\n\nExplore\n][36]\n\n## Hear from our customers about how TRG International is helping them achieve their business goals.\n\nAll\nLATEST EVENTS\n\n## Upcoming Events & Webinars\n\nJoin our latest webinars, workshops, and live sessions to stay ahead of finance and digital\ntransformation trends.\n* [\n  [\u0110\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu li\u00ean c\u00f4ng ty: T\u1ed1i \u01b0u giao d\u1ecbch \u2013 Ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n]May 28, 2026\n  On-demand WebinarSunSystems\n  \n  ### \u0110\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu li\u00ean c\u00f4ng ty: T\u1ed1i \u01b0u giao d\u1ecbch \u2013 Ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n\n  \n  Trong b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh kinh t\u1ebf s\u1ed1, vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd d\u00f2ng ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0 d\u1eef li\u1ec7u li\u00ean c\u00f4ng ty \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c\n  tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i v\u00e0 t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 x\u1eed l\u00fd nhanh ch\u00f3ng. \u0110\u1eebng b\u1ecf l\u1ee1 webinar s\u1eafp t\u1edbi c\u1ee7a TRG, \u0110\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu li\u00ean c\u00f4ng ty:\n  T\u1ed1i \u01b0u giao d\u1ecbch \u2013 \u0110\u00f3ng s\u1ed5 nhanh h\u01a1n \u2013 Ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n.\n  \n  Read more\n  ][37]\n* [\n  [Stop Closing The Book The Hard Way]\n  Digital TransformationFinance Process Automation\n  \n  ### Stop Closing the Books the Hard Way\n  \n  Join TRG International Webinar to master the modern Record\u2011to\u2011Report (R2R) process and reclaim\n  control over your data. Modern Record\u2011to\u2011Report: Automating Finance for Better Control, Planning,\n  and Forecasting.\n  \n  Read more\n  ][38]\n* [\n  [S\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 Th\u00f4ng t\u01b0 99/2025/TT-BTC c\u00f9ng TRG]\n  On-demand Webinar\n  \n  ### S\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 Th\u00f4ng t\u01b0 99/2025/TT-BTC c\u00f9ng TRG\n  \n  H\u00e3y bi\u1ebfn th\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c th\u00e0nh c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i s\u1ed1. C\u00f9ng TRG International kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 c\u00e1ch gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p\n  gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u00e0m ch\u1ee7 Th\u00f4ng t\u01b0 99/2025/TT-BTC v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng quy \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ebf to\u00e1n m\u1edbi qua bu\u1ed5i\n  webinar chuy\u00ean s\u00e2u n\u00e0y.\n  \n  Read more\n  ][39]\n\n[View All Events][40]\n[logo]\n\nWe've thrived since 1994 resulting in lots of experience to share, we are beyond a companion, to\nmore than 1,000 clients in 80+ countries.\n\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][41][[facebook]][42][[youtube]][43]\n[Solutions][44]\n[TRG Solutions][45][Business Challenges][46][Industries][47]\n[Resources][48]\n[Podcasts][49][Blog][50][FAQ][51][Research Portal][52][TRG End-User Training][53]\n[Stories][54]\n[Case Studies][55][CEO Letters][56]\n[About us][57]\n[Our People][58][Awards][59][TRG Cares][60][Testimonials][61]\n[Events][62]\n[Become our Speaker][63][Events Gallery][64][Hire our venue][65]\n[Careers][66]\n[Internships][67][Internships Partners][68]\nFollow us on Social Media\n[[linkedn]][69][[facebook]][70][[Youtube Play Button]][71]\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International[Terms and Conditions][72][Privacy Policy][73]Cookie Preferences\n\u00a9 2026 TRG International\n\n[1]: /\n[2]: /\n[3]: /solutions/\n[4]: /resources/\n[5]: /stories/\n[6]: /events/\n[7]: /ab"
